em is what they used to invent.', 'এরা সেই লোক যারা নিজেদেরকে নিজেরাই ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত করেছে, আর তারা যা কিছু রচনা করেছিল তা তাদের কাছ থেকে উধাও হয়ে গেছে।', 'Those are the ones who will have lost themselves, and lost from them is what they used to invent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011021.mp3', now()),
  (11, 22, '', '[{"id":25032,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":25033,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَرَمَ","transliteration":"jarama","translation_bn":"কোন সন্দেহ","root":"جرم","lemma":"جَرَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25034,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"annahum","translation_bn":"যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":25035,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25036,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","translation_bn":"পরকালের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":25037,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":25038,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَخْسَرُونَ","transliteration":"l-akhsarūna","translation_bn":"সর্বাধিক ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত (হবে)","root":"خسر","lemma":"أَخْسَرِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":25039,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٢٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২২)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lā jarama annahum fī l-ākhirati humu l-akhsarūna', 'এতে কোন সন্দেহ নেই যে আখেরাতে এরাই সবচেয়ে ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত।', 'Assuredly, it is they in the Hereafter who will be the greatest losers.', 'এতে কোন সন্দেহ নেই যে আখেরাতে এরাই সবচেয়ে ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত।', 'Assuredly, it is they in the Hereafter who will be the greatest losers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011022.mp3', now()),
  (11, 23, '', '[{"id":26102,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":26103,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":26104,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26105,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"waʿamilū","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":26106,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26107,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَأَخْبَتُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wa-akhbatū","translation_bn":"ও তারা বিনয়াবনত হয়েছে","root":"خبت","lemma":"أَخْبَتُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":26108,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26109,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِمْ","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"তাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26110,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":26111,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَصْحَـٰبُ","transliteration":"aṣḥābu","translation_bn":"অধিবাসী হবে","root":"صحب","lemma":"أَصْحَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26112,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَنَّةِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-janati","translation_bn":"জান্নাতের","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26114,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":26115,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26116,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدُونَ","transliteration":"khālidūna","translation_bn":"চিরস্থায়ী হবে","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26117,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٢٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna āmanū waʿamilū l-ṣāliḥāti wa-akhbatū ilā rabbihim ulāika aṣḥābu l-janati hum fīhā khālidūna', 'নিশ্চয় যারা ঈমান আনে, সৎকর্ম করে আর তাদের রবেবর কাছে বিনীত, তারাই জান্নাতের অধিবাসী, তারা সেখানে স্থায়ী হবে।', 'Indeed, they who have believed and done righteous deeds and humbled themselves to their Lord - those are the companions of Paradise; they will abide eternally therein.', 'নিশ্চয় যারা ঈমান আনে, সৎকর্ম করে আর তাদের রবেবর কাছে বিনীত, তারাই জান্নাতের অধিবাসী, তারা সেখানে স্থায়ী হবে।', 'Indeed, they who have believed and done righteous deeds and humbled themselves to their Lord - those are the companions of Paradise; they will abide eternally therein.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011023.mp3', now()),
  (11, 24, '', '[{"id":27164,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ مَثَلُ","transliteration":"mathalu","translation_bn":"উপমা","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27165,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَرِيقَيْنِ","transliteration":"l-farīqayni","translation_bn":"দলের","root":"فرق","lemma":"فَرِيق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":27166,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَٱلْأَعْمَىٰ","transliteration":"kal-aʿmā","translation_bn":"যেমন একজন অন্ধ","root":"عمي","lemma":"أَعْمَىٰ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27167,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَصَمِّ","transliteration":"wal-aṣami","translation_bn":"ও বধির","root":"صمم","lemma":"أَصَمّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":27168,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْبَصِيرِ","transliteration":"wal-baṣīri","translation_bn":"এবং (অপরজন) দৃষ্টিসম্পন্ন","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِير","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":27169,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلسَّمِيعِ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-samīʿi","translation_bn":"ও শ্রবণশীল","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِيع","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":27171,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":27172,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَوِيَانِ","transliteration":"yastawiyāni","translation_bn":"দু''টো সমান হয়","root":"سوي","lemma":"ٱسْتَوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27173,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَثَلًا ۚ","transliteration":"mathalan","translation_bn":"তুলনায়","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27175,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَا","transliteration":"afalā","translation_bn":"তবুও কি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":27176,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَذَكَّرُونَ","transliteration":"tadhakkarūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা শিক্ষা গ্রহণ করবে","root":"ذكر","lemma":"تَذَكَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27177,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٢٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'mathalu l-farīqayni kal-aʿmā wal-aṣami wal-baṣīri wal-samīʿi hal yastawiyāni mathalan afalā tadhakkarūna', 'দু’শ্রেণীর লোকের দৃষ্টান্ত হল যেমন একজন হল অন্ধ ও বধির, অন্যজন চক্ষুষ্মান ও শ্রবণশীল, এ দু’জন কি তুলনায় সমান হতে পারে? এরপরও কি তোমরা শিক্ষা গ্রহণ করবে না।', 'The example of the two parties is like the blind and deaf, and the seeing and hearing. Are they equal in comparison? Then, will you not remember?', 'দু’শ্রেণীর লোকের দৃষ্টান্ত হল যেমন একজন হল অন্ধ ও বধির, অন্যজন চক্ষুষ্মান ও শ্রবণশীল, এ দু’জন কি তুলনায় সমান হতে পারে? এরপরও কি তোমরা শিক্ষা গ্রহণ করবে না।', 'The example of the two parties is like the blind and deaf, and the seeing and hearing. Are they equal in comparison? Then, will you not remember?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011024.mp3', now()),
  (11, 25, '', '[{"id":28185,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28186,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَا","transliteration":"arsalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা পাঠিয়েছি","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28187,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نُوحًا","transliteration":"nūḥan","translation_bn":"নূহকে","root":"—","lemma":"نُوح","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":28188,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28189,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"qawmihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর জাতির","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28190,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّى","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"\"(সে বলেছিলো) আমি নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":28191,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28192,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"نَذِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"nadhīrun","translation_bn":"সতর্ককারী","root":"نذر","lemma":"نَذِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28193,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٌ","transliteration":"mubīnun","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28194,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٢٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad arsalnā nūḥan ilā qawmihi innī lakum nadhīrun mubīnun', 'আমি নূহকে তার কাওমের কাছে পাঠিয়েছিলাম। (সে বলেছিল) আমি তোমাদের জন্য একজন স্পষ্ট সতর্ককারী,', 'And We had certainly sent Noah to his people, [saying], "Indeed, I am to you a clear warner', 'আমি নূহকে তার কাওমের কাছে পাঠিয়েছিলাম। (সে বলেছিল) আমি তোমাদের জন্য একজন স্পষ্ট সতর্ককারী,', 'And We had certainly sent Noah to his people, [saying], "Indeed, I am to you a clear warner', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011025.mp3', now()),
  (11, 26, '', '[{"id":29149,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"(সে বলেছিলো) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যবাচক (Intention)"},{"id":29150,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":29151,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَعْبُدُوٓا۟","transliteration":"taʿbudū","translation_bn":"তোমরা উপাসনা করো","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29152,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":29153,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ ۖ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":29155,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":29156,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَخَافُ","transliteration":"akhāfu","translation_bn":"আমি আশঙ্কা করি","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29157,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29158,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابَ","transliteration":"ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29159,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمٍ","transliteration":"yawmin","translation_bn":"দিনের","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29160,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"alīmin","translation_bn":"যন্ত্রণাদায়ক\"","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":29161,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٢٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'an lā taʿbudū illā l-laha innī akhāfu ʿalaykum ʿadhāba yawmin alīmin', 'যে, তোমরা আল্লাহ ছাড়া কারো ‘ইবাদাত করো না, অন্যথায় আমি আশঙ্কা করছি যে, তোমাদের উপর একদিন বেদনাদায়ক ‘আযাব আসবে।', 'That you not worship except Allah. Indeed, I fear for you the punishment of a painful day."', 'যে, তোমরা আল্লাহ ছাড়া কারো ‘ইবাদাত করো না, অন্যথায় আমি আশঙ্কা করছি যে, তোমাদের উপর একদিন বেদনাদায়ক ‘আযাব আসবে।', 'That you not worship except Allah. Indeed, I fear for you the punishment of a painful day."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011026.mp3', now()),
  (11, 27, '', '[{"id":30042,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَقَالَ","transliteration":"faqāla","translation_bn":"অতঃপর বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30043,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَلَأُ","transliteration":"l-mala-u","translation_bn":"(তার জাতির) প্রধানরা","root":"ملا","lemma":"مَلَأ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30044,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":30045,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছিলো","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30046,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30047,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمِهِۦ","transliteration":"qawmihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর জাতির","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30048,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":30049,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"نَرَىٰكَ","transliteration":"narāka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে আমরা দেখছি","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30050,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":30051,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بَشَرًۭا","transliteration":"basharan","translation_bn":"একজন মানুষ","root":"بشر","lemma":"بَشَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30052,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِّثْلَنَا","transliteration":"mith''lanā","translation_bn":"আমাদেরই মতো","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30053,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30054,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"نَرَىٰكَ","transliteration":"narāka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে আমরা দেখছি","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30055,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّبَعَكَ","transliteration":"ittabaʿaka","translation_bn":"অনুসরণ করতে","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30056,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":30057,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":30058,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা (আমাদের মধ্যে)","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":30059,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَرَاذِلُنَا","transliteration":"arādhilunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের মধ্যে ছোটলোক","root":"رذل","lemma":"أَرْذَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30060,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"بَادِىَ","transliteration":"bādiya","translation_bn":"অপরিপক্ক","root":"بدو","lemma":"بَادِى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30061,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّأْىِ","transliteration":"l-rayi","translation_bn":"মতের","root":"راي","lemma":"رَأْى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30062,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30063,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"نَرَىٰ","transliteration":"narā","translation_bn":"দেখছি আমরা","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30064,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30065,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْنَا","transliteration":"ʿalaynā","translation_bn":"আমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30066,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোন","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30067,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلٍۭ","transliteration":"faḍlin","translation_bn":"শ্রেষ্ঠত্ব","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30068,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":30069,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"نَظُنُّكُمْ","transliteration":"naẓunnukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের আমরা মনে করি","root":"ظنن","lemma":"ظَنَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30070,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"كَـٰذِبِينَ","transliteration":"kādhibīna","translation_bn":"মিথ্যাবাদী\"","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَٰذِب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30071,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'faqāla l-mala-u alladhīna kafarū min qawmihi mā narāka illā basharan mith''lanā wamā narāka ittabaʿaka illā alladhīna hum arādhilunā bādiya l-rayi wamā narā lakum ʿalaynā min faḍlin bal naẓunnukum kādhibīna', 'জওয়াবে তার জাতির প্রধানগণ- যারা অবিশ্বাসী ছিল তারা বলল, ‘আমরা তোমাকে আমাদের মত মানুষ ছাড়া অন্য কিছু দেখছি না, আর প্রকাশ্যতঃ আমাদের হীন অধম লোকগুলো ছাড়া তোমার পথ অবলম্বন করতে দেখছি না, আমাদের উপর তোমার কোন প্রাধান্যও দেখছি না, বরং আমরা তোমাদেরক মিথ্যুক বলেই মনে করি।’', 'So the eminent among those who disbelieved from his people said, "We do not see you but as a man like ourselves, and we do not see you followed except by those who are the lowest of us [and] at first suggestion. And we do not see in you over us any merit; rather, we think you are liars."', 'জওয়াবে তার জাতির প্রধানগণ- যারা অবিশ্বাসী ছিল তারা বলল, ‘আমরা তোমাকে আমাদের মত মানুষ ছাড়া অন্য কিছু দেখছি না, আর প্রকাশ্যতঃ আমাদের হীন অধম লোকগুলো ছাড়া তোমার পথ অবলম্বন করতে দেখছি না, আমাদের উপর তোমার কোন প্রাধান্যও দেখছি না, বরং আমরা তোমাদেরক মিথ্যুক বলেই মনে করি।’', 'So the eminent among those who disbelieved from his people said, "We do not see you but as a man like ourselves, and we do not see you followed except by those who are the lowest of us [and] at first suggestion. And we do not see in you over us any merit; rather, we think you are liars."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011027.mp3', now()),
  (11, 28, '', '[{"id":31109,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31110,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"yāqawmi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার সম্প্রদায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":31111,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَرَءَيْتُمْ","transliteration":"ara-aytum","translation_bn":"তোমরা কি (ভেবে) দেখেছো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":31112,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":31113,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُ","transliteration":"kuntu","translation_bn":"আমি হই (প্রতিষ্ঠিত)","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31114,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31115,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَيِّنَةٍۢ","transliteration":"bayyinatin","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট নির্দশনের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31116,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31117,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31118,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَءَاتَىٰنِى","transliteration":"waātānī","translation_bn":"ও আমাকে দিয়ে থাকেন","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":31119,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"رَحْمَةًۭ","transliteration":"raḥmatan","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31120,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31121,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عِندِهِۦ","transliteration":"ʿindihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর নিকট","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31122,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فَعُمِّيَتْ","transliteration":"faʿummiyat","translation_bn":"অথচ তা গোপন রাখা হয়েছে","root":"عمي","lemma":"عُمِّيَتْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31123,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"কাছে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31124,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَنُلْزِمُكُمُوهَا","transliteration":"anul''zimukumūhā","translation_bn":"তা তোমাদের আমরা কি বাধ্য করতে পারি","root":"لزم","lemma":"أَلْزَمَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":31125,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنتُمْ","transliteration":"wa-antum","translation_bn":"যখন তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"وَأَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":31126,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"لَهَا","transliteration":"lahā","translation_bn":"তা","root":"—","lemma":"لَهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31127,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"كَـٰرِهُونَ","transliteration":"kārihūna","translation_bn":"অপছন্দ করছো","root":"كره","lemma":"كَٰرِهُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31128,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla yāqawmi ara-aytum in kuntu ʿalā bayyinatin min rabbī waātānī raḥmatan min ʿindihi faʿummiyat ʿalaykum anul''zimukumūhā wa-antum lahā kārihūna', 'সে বলল, ‘‘হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা চিন্তা-ভাবনা করে দেখ, আমি যদি আমার প্রতিপালকের নিকট হতে প্রাপ্ত সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণের উপর প্রতিষ্ঠিত থাকি আর তিনি তাঁর পক্ষ থেকে আমাকে অনুগ্রহ প্রদান করে থাকেন যা তোমাদের দৃষ্টি থেকে গোপনে রাখা হয়েছে, এমতাবস্থায় তা গ্রহণ করার ব্যাপারে আমি কি তোমাদেরকে বাধ্য করতে পারি যখন তোমরা তা অপছন্দ কর?', 'He said, "O my people have you considered: if I should be upon clear evidence from my Lord while He has given me mercy from Himself but it has been made unapparent to you, should we force it upon you while you are averse to it?', 'সে বলল, ‘‘হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা চিন্তা-ভাবনা করে দেখ, আমি যদি আমার প্রতিপালকের নিকট হতে প্রাপ্ত সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণের উপর প্রতিষ্ঠিত থাকি আর তিনি তাঁর পক্ষ থেকে আমাকে অনুগ্রহ প্রদান করে থাকেন যা তোমাদের দৃষ্টি থেকে গোপনে রাখা হয়েছে, এমতাবস্থায় তা গ্রহণ করার ব্যাপারে আমি কি তোমাদেরকে বাধ্য করতে পারি যখন তোমরা তা অপছন্দ কর?', 'He said, "O my people have you considered: if I should be upon clear evidence from my Lord while He has given me mercy from Himself but it has been made unapparent to you, should we force it upon you while you are averse to it?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011028.mp3', now()),
  (11, 29, '', '[{"id":32093,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"wayāqawmi","translation_bn":"এবং হে আমার সম্প্রদায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32094,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَآ","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":32095,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَسْـَٔلُكُمْ","transliteration":"asalukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে আমি চাই","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32096,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"এর বিনিময়ে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32097,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَالًا ۖ","transliteration":"mālan","translation_bn":"কোন ধন-সম্পদ","root":"مول","lemma":"مَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32099,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"নয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":32100,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرِىَ","transliteration":"ajriya","translation_bn":"আমার পারিশ্রমিক","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32101,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":32102,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32103,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":32105,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32106,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَنَا۠","transliteration":"anā","translation_bn":"আমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":32107,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِطَارِدِ","transliteration":"biṭāridi","translation_bn":"বিতাড়নকারী","root":"طرد","lemma":"طَارِد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32108,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":32109,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32111,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُم","transliteration":"innahum","translation_bn":"তারা নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":32112,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مُّلَـٰقُوا۟","transliteration":"mulāqū","translation_bn":"সাক্ষাত করবে","root":"لقي","lemma":"مُّلَٰقُوا","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32113,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِمْ","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"তাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32114,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"walākinnī","translation_bn":"কিন্তু আমি","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32115,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَرَىٰكُمْ","transliteration":"arākum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে দেখছি","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32116,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمًۭا","transliteration":"qawman","translation_bn":"(এমন) সম্প্রদায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32117,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"تَجْهَلُونَ","transliteration":"tajhalūna","translation_bn":"(যারা তোমরা) মূর্খতা করছো","root":"جهل","lemma":"يَجْهَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32118,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayāqawmi lā asalukum ʿalayhi mālan in ajriya illā ʿalā l-lahi wamā anā biṭāridi alladhīna āmanū innahum mulāqū rabbihim walākinnī arākum qawman tajhalūna', 'হে আমার জাতির লোকেরা! আমি এ কাজে তোমাদের কাছে কোন ধন-সম্পদ চাই না, আমার পারিশ্রমিক আছে কেবল আল্লাহর কাছে। আর মু’মিনদের তাড়িয়ে দেয়া আমার জন্য শোভনীয় নয়, তারা তাদের প্রতিপালকের সাক্ষাৎ অবশ্যই লাভ করবে, কিন্তু আমি দেখছি তোমরা এমন এক জাতি যারা মূর্খের আচরণ করছ।', 'And O my people, I ask not of you for it any wealth. My reward is not but from Allah. And I am not one to drive away those who have believed. Indeed, they will meet their Lord, but I see that you are a people behaving ignorantly.', 'হে আমার জাতির লোকেরা! আমি এ কাজে তোমাদের কাছে কোন ধন-সম্পদ চাই না, আমার পারিশ্রমিক আছে কেবল আল্লাহর কাছে। আর মু’মিনদের তাড়িয়ে দেয়া আমার জন্য শোভনীয় নয়, তারা তাদের প্রতিপালকের সাক্ষাৎ অবশ্যই লাভ করবে, কিন্তু আমি দেখছি তোমরা এমন এক জাতি যারা মূর্খের আচরণ করছ।', 'And O my people, I ask not of you for it any wealth. My reward is not but from Allah. And I am not one to drive away those who have believed. Indeed, they will meet their Lord, but I see that you are a people behaving ignorantly.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011029.mp3', now()),
  (11, 30, '', '[{"id":32943,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"wayāqawmi","translation_bn":"আর হে আমার সম্প্রদায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32944,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":32945,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَنصُرُنِى","transliteration":"yanṣurunī","translation_bn":"সাহায্য করবে আমাকে","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32946,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32947,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":32948,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":32949,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"طَرَدتُّهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"ṭaradttuhum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে আমি তাড়িয়ে দিই","root":"طرد","lemma":"طَرَد","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32951,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَا","transliteration":"afalā","translation_bn":"তবে কি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":32952,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَذَكَّرُونَ","transliteration":"tadhakkarūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা শিক্ষা গ্রহণ করবে","root":"ذكر","lemma":"تَذَكَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32953,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٣٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩০)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayāqawmi man yanṣurunī mina l-lahi in ṭaradttuhum afalā tadhakkarūna', 'হে আমার জাতির লোকেরা! আমি যদি এই লোকদেরকে তাড়িয়ে দেই তাহলে আমাকে আল্লাহর পাকড়াও থেকে কে বাঁচাবে? তবুও কি তোমরা উপদেশ নিবে না?', 'And O my people, who would protect me from Allah if I drove them away? Then will you not be reminded?', 'হে আমার জাতির লোকেরা! আমি যদি এই লোকদেরকে তাড়িয়ে দেই তাহলে আমাকে আল্লাহর পাকড়াও থেকে কে বাঁচাবে? তবুও কি তোমরা উপদেশ নিবে না?', 'And O my people, who would protect me from Allah if I drove them away? Then will you not be reminded?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011030.mp3', now()),
  (11, 31, '', '[{"id":33815,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33816,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَقُولُ","transliteration":"aqūlu","translation_bn":"আমি বলছি","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33817,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে (এ কথা যে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33818,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عِندِى","transliteration":"ʿindī","translation_bn":"আমার কাছে (আছে)","root":"عند\r","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":33819,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"خَزَآئِنُ","transliteration":"khazāinu","translation_bn":"ধনভান্ডার","root":"خزن","lemma":"خَزَا^ئِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33820,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":33821,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33822,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"aʿlamu","translation_bn":"আমি জানি","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33823,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَيْبَ","transliteration":"l-ghayba","translation_bn":"অদৃশ্য (সম্বন্ধে)","root":"غيب","lemma":"غَيْب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33824,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33825,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَقُولُ","transliteration":"aqūlu","translation_bn":"আমি বলছি (এ কথা যে)","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33826,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّى","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":33827,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَلَكٌۭ","transliteration":"malakun","translation_bn":"ফেরেশতা","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33828,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33829,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَقُولُ","transliteration":"aqūlu","translation_bn":"আমি বলছি","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33830,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"যাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33831,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"تَزْدَرِىٓ","transliteration":"tazdarī","translation_bn":"নিতান্ত হীন মনে করে","root":"زري","lemma":"تَزْدَرِى^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33832,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَعْيُنُكُمْ","transliteration":"aʿyunukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের চোখগুলো","root":"عين","lemma":"عَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33833,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"لَن","transliteration":"lan","translation_bn":"কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":33834,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْتِيَهُمُ","transliteration":"yu''tiyahumu","translation_bn":"তাদের দিবেন","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33835,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":33836,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرًا ۖ","transliteration":"khayran","translation_bn":"কোন কল্যাণ","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":33838,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":33839,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"أَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"aʿlamu","translation_bn":"সম্যক অবগত","root":"علم","lemma":"أَعْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":33840,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33841,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33842,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسِهِمْ  ۖ","transliteration":"anfusihim","translation_bn":"তাদের মনের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33844,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"(এমন বললে) আমি নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":33845,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"إِذًۭا","transliteration":"idhan","translation_bn":"তখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذًا\r","grammar_bn":"আশ্চর্যসূচক (Surprise)"},{"id":33846,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"لَّمِنَ","transliteration":"lamina","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই অন্তর্ভুক্ত হবো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":33847,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদের\"","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33848,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"٣١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩১)","root":"—","lemma":"٣١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā aqūlu lakum ʿindī khazāinu l-lahi walā aʿlamu l-ghayba walā aqūlu innī malakun walā aqūlu lilladhīna tazdarī aʿyunukum lan yu''tiyahumu l-lahu khayran l-lahu aʿlamu bimā fī anfusihim innī idhan lamina l-ẓālimīna', 'আমি তো তোমাদেরকে এ কথা বলছি না যে, আমার কাছে আল্লাহর ধন-ভান্ডারসমূহ আছে। আর আমি অদৃশ্যের খবরও জানি না। আর আমি এ কথাও বলি না যে, আমি ফেরেশতা। আমি এ কথাও বলি না যে, তোমাদের চোখ যে সব লোককে অবজ্ঞা করে, আল্লাহ কক্ষনো তাদের কল্যাণ করবেন না। তাদের অন্তরে কী আছে আল্লাহ্ই তা বেশী জানেন। (এ রকম কথা বললে) আমি তো যালিমদের শামিল হয়ে যাবো।', 'And I do not tell you that I have the depositories [containing the provision] of Allah or that I know the unseen, nor do I tell you that I am an angel, nor do I say of those upon whom your eyes look down that Allah will never grant them any good. Allah is most knowing of what is within their souls. Indeed, I would then be among the wrongdoers."', 'আমি তো তোমাদেরকে এ কথা বলছি না যে, আমার কাছে আল্লাহর ধন-ভান্ডারসমূহ আছে। আর আমি অদৃশ্যের খবরও জানি না। আর আমি এ কথাও বলি না যে, আমি ফেরেশতা। আমি এ কথাও বলি না যে, তোমাদের চোখ যে সব লোককে অবজ্ঞা করে, আল্লাহ কক্ষনো তাদের কল্যাণ করবেন না। তাদের অন্তরে কী আছে আল্লাহ্ই তা বেশী জানেন। (এ রকম কথা বললে) আমি তো যালিমদের শামিল হয়ে যাবো।', 'And I do not tell you that I have the depositories [containing the provision] of Allah or that I know the unseen, nor do I tell you that I am an angel, nor do I say of those upon whom your eyes look down that Allah will never grant them any good. Allah is most knowing of what is within their souls. Indeed, I would then be among the wrongdoers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011031.mp3', now()),
  (11, 32, '', '[{"id":34795,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"(শেষ পর্যন্ত) তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34796,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰنُوحُ","transliteration":"yānūḥu","translation_bn":"\"হে নূহ","root":"—","lemma":"نُوح","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":34797,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":34798,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"جَـٰدَلْتَنَا","transliteration":"jādaltanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের সাথে তুমি তর্ক করেছো","root":"جدل","lemma":"جَٰدَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34799,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَأَكْثَرْتَ","transliteration":"fa-aktharta","translation_bn":"অতঃপর করেছো তুমি বড় বেশী","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَرُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34800,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"جِدَٰلَنَا","transliteration":"jidālanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের সাথে তর্ক","root":"جدل","lemma":"جِدَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34801,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَأْتِنَا","transliteration":"fatinā","translation_bn":"অতএব আস আমাদের কাছে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34802,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"নিয়ে ঐ বিষয় যার","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34803,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَعِدُنَآ","transliteration":"taʿidunā","translation_bn":"আমাদেরকে ভয় দেখাচ্ছো","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34804,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":34805,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كُنتَ","transliteration":"kunta","translation_bn":"তুমি হও","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34806,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34807,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰدِقِينَ","transliteration":"l-ṣādiqīna","translation_bn":"সত্যবাদীদের\"","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَادِق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34808,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū yānūḥu qad jādaltanā fa-aktharta jidālanā fatinā bimā taʿidunā in kunta mina l-ṣādiqīna', 'তারা বলল, ‘হে নূহ! তুমি আমাদের সাথে ঝগড়া করেছ, খুব বেশি বেশি ঝগড়া করেছ, এখন যার ভয় আমাদেরকে দেখাচ্ছ তা আমাদের কাছে নিয়ে এসো, যদি তুমি সত্যবাদী হও।’', 'They said, "O Noah, you have disputed us and been frequent in dispute of us. So bring us what you threaten us, if you should be of the truthful."', 'তারা বলল, ‘হে নূহ! তুমি আমাদের সাথে ঝগড়া করেছ, খুব বেশি বেশি ঝগড়া করেছ, এখন যার ভয় আমাদেরকে দেখাচ্ছ তা আমাদের কাছে নিয়ে এসো, যদি তুমি সত্যবাদী হও।’', 'They said, "O Noah, you have disputed us and been frequent in dispute of us. So bring us what you threaten us, if you should be of the truthful."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011032.mp3', now()),
  (11, 33, '', '[{"id":35615,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35616,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"\"প্রকৃতপক্ষে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":35617,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِيكُم","transliteration":"yatīkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে আসবেন","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35618,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِهِ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"নিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35619,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":35620,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":35621,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"شَآءَ","transliteration":"shāa","translation_bn":"তিনি ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35622,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নও","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35623,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُم","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُم","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":35624,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِمُعْجِزِينَ","transliteration":"bimuʿ''jizīna","translation_bn":"ব্যর্থ করতে সক্ষম (আল্লাহকে)","root":"عجز","lemma":"مُعْجِز","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35625,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٣٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla innamā yatīkum bihi l-lahu in shāa wamā antum bimuʿ''jizīna', 'নূহ বলল, ‘‘আল্লাহই তা তোমাদের কাছে নিয়ে আসবেন যদি তিনি চান, তোমরা ব্যর্থ করতে পারবে না।', 'He said, "Allah will only bring it to you if He wills, and you will not cause [Him] failure.', 'নূহ বলল, ‘‘আল্লাহই তা তোমাদের কাছে নিয়ে আসবেন যদি তিনি চান, তোমরা ব্যর্থ করতে পারবে না।', 'He said, "Allah will only bring it to you if He wills, and you will not cause [Him] failure.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011033.mp3', now()),
  (11, 34, '', '[{"id":36554,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36555,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَنفَعُكُمْ","transliteration":"yanfaʿukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপকার দিবে","root":"نفع","lemma":"نَفَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36556,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نُصْحِىٓ","transliteration":"nuṣ''ḥī","translation_bn":"আমার সদুপদেশ","root":"نصح","lemma":"نُصْح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36557,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":36558,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَرَدتُّ","transliteration":"aradttu","translation_bn":"আমি চাইও","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36559,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":36560,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَنصَحَ","transliteration":"anṣaḥa","translation_bn":"সদুপদেশ দিবো আমি","root":"نصح","lemma":"نَصَحُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36561,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36562,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":36563,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"(এমন) হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36564,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":36565,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يُرِيدُ","transliteration":"yurīdu","translation_bn":"চান","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36566,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":36567,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يُغْوِيَكُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"yugh''wiyakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের বিভ্রান্ত করতে","root":"غوي","lemma":"أَغْوَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36569,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":36570,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكُمْ","transliteration":"rabbukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36571,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَإِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"wa-ilayhi","translation_bn":"এবং তাঁরই দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36572,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"تُرْجَعُونَ","transliteration":"tur''jaʿūna","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাবর্তিত হবে তোমরা\"","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36573,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā yanfaʿukum nuṣ''ḥī in aradttu an anṣaḥa lakum in kāna l-lahu yurīdu an yugh''wiyakum huwa rabbukum wa-ilayhi tur''jaʿūna', 'আমি তোমাদের কোন কল্যাণ করতে চাইলেও আমার কল্যাণ কামনা তোমাদের কোন উপকারে আসবে না যদি আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে পথহারা করতে চান। তিনিই তোমাদের রবব, আর তাঁর কাছেই তোমরা ফিরে যাবে।’’', 'And my advice will not benefit you - although I wished to advise you - If Allah should intend to put you in error. He is your Lord, and to Him you will be returned."', 'আমি তোমাদের কোন কল্যাণ করতে চাইলেও আমার কল্যাণ কামনা তোমাদের কোন উপকারে আসবে না যদি আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে পথহারা করতে চান। তিনিই তোমাদের রবব, আর তাঁর কাছেই তোমরা ফিরে যাবে।’’', 'And my advice will not benefit you - although I wished to advise you - If Allah should intend to put you in error. He is your Lord, and to Him you will be returned."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011034.mp3', now()),
  (11, 35, '', '[{"id":37411,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَمْ","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"অথবা কি","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37412,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","translation_bn":"তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37413,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱفْتَرَىٰهُ ۖ","transliteration":"if''tarāhu","translation_bn":"\"তা সে রচনা করেছে\"","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37415,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"(হে নাবী) বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37416,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِنِ","transliteration":"ini","translation_bn":"\"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":37417,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱفْتَرَيْتُهُۥ","transliteration":"if''taraytuhu","translation_bn":"তা আমি রচনা করে থাকি","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37418,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَعَلَىَّ","transliteration":"faʿalayya","translation_bn":"তবে আমার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37419,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِجْرَامِى","transliteration":"ij''rāmī","translation_bn":"আমার অপরাধ","root":"جرم","lemma":"إِجْرَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37420,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَا۠","transliteration":"wa-anā","translation_bn":"এবং আমি","root":"—","lemma":"وَأَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37421,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بَرِىٓءٌۭ","transliteration":"barīon","translation_bn":"দায়মুক্ত","root":"برا","lemma":"بَرِى^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37422,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37423,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"تُجْرِمُونَ","transliteration":"tuj''rimūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা অপরাধ করছো\"","root":"جرم","lemma":"أَجْرَمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37424,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٣٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'am yaqūlūna if''tarāhu qul ini if''taraytuhu faʿalayya ij''rāmī wa-anā barīon mimmā tuj''rimūna', 'তারা কি বলে যে, এ লোকই এ সব রচনা করেছে? বল, আমি যদি তা রচনা করে থাকি, তাহলে আমার অপরাধের দায়িত্ব আমার উপর। তোমরা যে অপরাধ করেছ তাত্থেকে আমি মুক্ত।', 'Or do they say [about Prophet Muhammad], "He invented it"? Say, "If I have invented it, then upon me is [the consequence of] my crime; but I am innocent of what [crimes] you commit."', 'তারা কি বলে যে, এ লোকই এ সব রচনা করেছে? বল, আমি যদি তা রচনা করে থাকি, তাহলে আমার অপরাধের দায়িত্ব আমার উপর। তোমরা যে অপরাধ করেছ তাত্থেকে আমি মুক্ত।', 'Or do they say [about Prophet Muhammad], "He invented it"? Say, "If I have invented it, then upon me is [the consequence of] my crime; but I am innocent of what [crimes] you commit."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011035.mp3', now()),
  (11, 36, '', '[{"id":38283,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأُوحِىَ","transliteration":"waūḥiya","translation_bn":"এবং ওহী করা হলো","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38284,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38285,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نُوحٍ","transliteration":"nūḥin","translation_bn":"নূহের","root":"—","lemma":"نُوح","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":38286,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"annahu","translation_bn":"\"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":38287,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَن","transliteration":"lan","translation_bn":"কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":38288,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنَ","transliteration":"yu''mina","translation_bn":"কেউ ঈমান আনবে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38289,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38290,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمِكَ","transliteration":"qawmika","translation_bn":"তোমার জাতির","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38291,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":38292,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":38293,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":38294,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنَ","transliteration":"āmana","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38295,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"অতএব না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38296,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"تَبْتَئِسْ","transliteration":"tabta-is","translation_bn":"তুমি বিমর্ষ হয়ো","root":"باس","lemma":"تَبْتَئِسْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38297,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38298,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38299,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يَفْعَلُونَ","transliteration":"yafʿalūna","translation_bn":"তারা করে যাচ্ছে","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38300,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٣٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waūḥiya ilā nūḥin annahu lan yu''mina min qawmika illā man qad āmana falā tabta-is bimā kānū yafʿalūna', 'নূহের কাছে ওয়াহী পাঠানো হয়েছিল যে, যারা ঈমান এনেছে তারা ছাড়া তোমার সম্প্রদায়ের আর কোন লোক কক্ষনো ঈমান আনবে না, কাজেই তারা যা করছে তার জন্য তুমি হা-হুতাশ করো না।', 'And it was revealed to Noah that, "No one will believe from your people except those who have already believed, so do not be distressed by what they have been doing.', 'নূহের কাছে ওয়াহী পাঠানো হয়েছিল যে, যারা ঈমান এনেছে তারা ছাড়া তোমার সম্প্রদায়ের আর কোন লোক কক্ষনো ঈমান আনবে না, কাজেই তারা যা করছে তার জন্য তুমি হা-হুতাশ করো না।', 'And it was revealed to Noah that, "No one will believe from your people except those who have already believed, so do not be distressed by what they have been doing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011036.mp3', now()),
  (11, 37, '', '[{"id":39133,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱصْنَعِ","transliteration":"wa-iṣ''naʿi","translation_bn":"এবং নির্মাণ করো","root":"صنع","lemma":"صَنَعُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39134,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفُلْكَ","transliteration":"l-ful''ka","translation_bn":"একটি নৌযান","root":"فلك","lemma":"فُلْك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39135,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِأَعْيُنِنَا","transliteration":"bi-aʿyuninā","translation_bn":"আমাদের পর্যবেক্ষণে","root":"عين","lemma":"عَيْن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39136,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَوَحْيِنَا","transliteration":"wawaḥyinā","translation_bn":"ও আমাদের ওহী অনুসারে","root":"وحي","lemma":"وَحْى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39137,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39138,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تُخَـٰطِبْنِى","transliteration":"tukhāṭib''nī","translation_bn":"আমাকে কিছু বলবে","root":"خطب","lemma":"خَاطَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39139,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39140,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":39141,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَمُوٓا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"ẓalamū","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘন করেছে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39143,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُم","transliteration":"innahum","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তারা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":39144,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مُّغْرَقُونَ","transliteration":"mugh''raqūna","translation_bn":"ডুবে যাবে\"","root":"غرق","lemma":"مُّغْرَقُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39145,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٣٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-iṣ''naʿi l-ful''ka bi-aʿyuninā wawaḥyinā walā tukhāṭib''nī fī alladhīna ẓalamū innahum mugh''raqūna', 'অতএব আমার পর্যবেক্ষণের অধীনে আর আমার ওয়াহী অনুসারে তুমি নৌকা তৈরি কর, আর যারা বাড়াবাড়ি করেছে তাদের ব্যাপারে আমার কাছে কোন আবেদন করো না, তারা অবশ্যই ডুববে।', 'And construct the ship under Our observation and Our inspiration and do not address Me concerning those who have wronged; indeed, they are [to be] drowned."', 'অতএব আমার পর্যবেক্ষণের অধীনে আর আমার ওয়াহী অনুসারে তুমি নৌকা তৈরি কর, আর যারা বাড়াবাড়ি করেছে তাদের ব্যাপারে আমার কাছে কোন আবেদন করো না, তারা অবশ্যই ডুববে।', 'And construct the ship under Our observation and Our inspiration and do not address Me concerning those who have wronged; indeed, they are [to be] drowned."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011037.mp3', now()),
  (11, 38, '', '[{"id":39939,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَصْنَعُ","transliteration":"wayaṣnaʿu","translation_bn":"এবং সে নির্মাণ করতে লাগলো","root":"صنع","lemma":"صَنَعُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39940,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفُلْكَ","transliteration":"l-ful''ka","translation_bn":"একটি নৌযান","root":"فلك","lemma":"فُلْك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39941,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَكُلَّمَا","transliteration":"wakullamā","translation_bn":"এবং যখনই","root":"كلل\r","lemma":"كُلَّمَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39942,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَرَّ","transliteration":"marra","translation_bn":"অতিক্রম করতো","root":"مرر","lemma":"مَرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39943,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"তার পাশ দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39944,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَلَأٌۭ","transliteration":"mala-on","translation_bn":"প্রধানেরা","root":"ملا","lemma":"مَلَأ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39945,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্যকার","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39946,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمِهِۦ","transliteration":"qawmihi","translation_bn":"তার জাতির","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39947,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"سَخِرُوا۟","transliteration":"sakhirū","translation_bn":"ঠাট্টা করতো","root":"سخر","lemma":"سَخِرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39948,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُ ۚ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"তার সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39950,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বলতো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39951,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"\"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":39952,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَسْخَرُوا۟","transliteration":"taskharū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ঠাট্টা করো","root":"سخر","lemma":"سَخِرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39953,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِنَّا","transliteration":"minnā","translation_bn":"আমাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39954,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّا","transliteration":"fa-innā","translation_bn":"তবে নিশ্চয়ই আমরাও","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39955,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"نَسْخَرُ","transliteration":"naskharu","translation_bn":"আমরা ঠাট্টা করবো","root":"سخر","lemma":"سَخِرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39956,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِنكُمْ","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39957,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"كَمَا","transliteration":"kamā","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39958,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"تَسْخَرُونَ","transliteration":"taskharūna","translation_bn":"ঠাট্টা করছো তোমরা","root":"سخر","lemma":"سَخِرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39959,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٣٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayaṣnaʿu l-ful''ka wakullamā marra ʿalayhi mala-on min qawmihi sakhirū min''hu qāla in taskharū minnā fa-innā naskharu minkum kamā taskharūna', 'নূহ নৌকা তৈরি করছিল, আর যখনই তার জাতির প্রধান ব্যক্তিরা তার নিকট দিয়ে যাচ্ছিল, তারা তাকে ঠাট্টা করছিল। সে বলল, ‘তোমরা যদি আমাদেরকে ঠাট্টা কর, তাহলে আমরাও তোমাদেরকে (ভবিষ্যতে) ঠাট্টা করব যেমনভাবে তোমরা (এখন) ঠাট্টা করছ,', 'And he constructed the ship, and whenever an assembly of the eminent of his people passed by him, they ridiculed him. He said, "If you ridicule us, then we will ridicule you just as you ridicule.', 'নূহ নৌকা তৈরি করছিল, আর যখনই তার জাতির প্রধান ব্যক্তিরা তার নিকট দিয়ে যাচ্ছিল, তারা তাকে ঠাট্টা করছিল। সে বলল, ‘তোমরা যদি আমাদেরকে ঠাট্টা কর, তাহলে আমরাও তোমাদেরকে (ভবিষ্যতে) ঠাট্টা করব যেমনভাবে তোমরা (এখন) ঠাট্টা করছ,', 'And he constructed the ship, and whenever an assembly of the eminent of his people passed by him, they ridiculed him. He said, "If you ridicule us, then we will ridicule you just as you ridicule.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011038.mp3', now()),
  (11, 39, '', '[{"id":40419,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَسَوْفَ","transliteration":"fasawfa","translation_bn":"অতঃপর শীঘ্রই","root":"—","lemma":"سَوْف\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40420,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা জানবে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40421,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কে (সেই)","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":40422,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِيهِ","transliteration":"yatīhi","translation_bn":"তার উপর আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40423,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40424,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يُخْزِيهِ","transliteration":"yukh''zīhi","translation_bn":"যা তাকে লাঞ্ছিত করবে","root":"خزي","lemma":"أَخْزَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40425,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَيَحِلُّ","transliteration":"wayaḥillu","translation_bn":"ও অবশ্যম্ভাবী","root":"حلل","lemma":"حَلَلْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40426,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40427,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40428,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مُّقِيمٌ","transliteration":"muqīmun","translation_bn":"স্থায়ী\"","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40429,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٣٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fasawfa taʿlamūna man yatīhi ʿadhābun yukh''zīhi wayaḥillu ʿalayhi ʿadhābun muqīmun', 'তোমরা (শীঘ্রই) জানতে পারবে কার উপর লাঞ্ছনাকর ‘আযাব আসে আর কার উপর আসে স্থায়ী ‘আযাব।', 'And you are going to know who will get a punishment that will disgrace him [on earth] and upon whom will descend an enduring punishment [in the Hereafter]."', 'তোমরা (শীঘ্রই) জানতে পারবে কার উপর লাঞ্ছনাকর ‘আযাব আসে আর কার উপর আসে স্থায়ী ‘আযাব।', 'And you are going to know who will get a punishment that will disgrace him [on earth] and upon whom will descend an enduring punishment [in the Hereafter]."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011039.mp3', now()),
  (11, 40, '', '[{"id":41567,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"অবশেষে","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":41568,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":41569,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"আসলো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41570,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرُنَا","transliteration":"amrunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের নির্দেশ","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41571,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَفَارَ","transliteration":"wafāra","translation_bn":"এবং উথলে উঠলো","root":"فور","lemma":"فَارَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41572,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلتَّنُّورُ","transliteration":"l-tanūru","translation_bn":"চুলা","root":"—","lemma":"تَّنُّور","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41573,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قُلْنَا","transliteration":"qul''nā","translation_bn":"আমরা বললাম","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41574,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱحْمِلْ","transliteration":"iḥ''mil","translation_bn":"\"তুলে নাও","root":"حمل","lemma":"حَمَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41575,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে (নৌযানে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41576,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41577,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كُلٍّۢ","transliteration":"kullin","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41578,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"زَوْجَيْنِ","transliteration":"zawjayni","translation_bn":"প্রকারের (জীব-জন্তু)","root":"زوج","lemma":"زَوْج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41579,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱثْنَيْنِ","transliteration":"ith''nayni","translation_bn":"দুইটি (অর্থাৎ নর ও নারী)","root":"ثني","lemma":"ٱثْنَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41580,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَأَهْلَكَ","transliteration":"wa-ahlaka","translation_bn":"এবং তোমার পরিবারকে","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41581,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":41582,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যার (সম্পর্কে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":41583,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"سَبَقَ","transliteration":"sabaqa","translation_bn":"পূর্বে হয়েছে","root":"سبق","lemma":"سَبَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41584,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"তার বিরুদ্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41585,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْلُ","transliteration":"l-qawlu","translation_bn":"(হুঁশিয়ারী) সিদ্ধান্ত","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41586,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَمَنْ","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং (তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41587,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنَ ۚ","transliteration":"āmana","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে\"","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41589,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41590,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنَ","transliteration":"āmana","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছিলো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41591,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مَعَهُۥٓ","transliteration":"maʿahu","translation_bn":"তার সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":41592,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":41593,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"قَلِيلٌۭ","transliteration":"qalīlun","translation_bn":"অল্প সংখ্যক লোক","root":"قلل","lemma":"قَلِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41594,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"٤٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪০)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ḥattā idhā jāa amrunā wafāra l-tanūru qul''nā iḥ''mil fīhā min kullin zawjayni ith''nayni wa-ahlaka illā man sabaqa ʿalayhi l-qawlu waman āmana wamā āmana maʿahu illā qalīlun', 'শেষে যখন আমার নির্দেশ এসে গেল, আর তন্দুর (পানিতে) উথলে উঠল, আমি বললাম, ‘প্রত্যেক শ্রেণীর যুগলের দু’টি তাতে তুলে নাও আর তোমার পরিবার পরিজনকে, তাদের ছাড়া যাদের ব্যাপারে আগেই ঘোষণা দেয়া হয়েছে। আর যারা ঈমান এনেছে তাদেরকেও (তুলে নাও)। তার সঙ্গে ঈমান এনেছিল খুব অল্প কয়েকজনই।', '[So it was], until when Our command came and the oven overflowed, We said, "Load upon the ship of each [creature] two mates and your family, except those about whom the word has preceded, and [include] whoever has believed." But none had believed with him, except a few.', 'শেষে যখন আমার নির্দেশ এসে গেল, আর তন্দুর (পানিতে) উথলে উঠল, আমি বললাম, ‘প্রত্যেক শ্রেণীর যুগলের দু’টি তাতে তুলে নাও আর তোমার পরিবার পরিজনকে, তাদের ছাড়া যাদের ব্যাপারে আগেই ঘোষণা দেয়া হয়েছে। আর যারা ঈমান এনেছে তাদেরকেও (তুলে নাও)। তার সঙ্গে ঈমান এনেছিল খুব অল্প কয়েকজনই।', '[So it was], until when Our command came and the oven overflowed, We said, "Load upon the ship of each [creature] two mates and your family, except those about whom the word has preceded, and [include] whoever has believed." But none had believed with him, except a few.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011040.mp3', now()),
  (11, 41, '', '[{"id":42425,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَقَالَ","transliteration":"waqāla","translation_bn":"এবং (নূহ) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42426,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱرْكَبُوا۟","transliteration":"ir''kabū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা আরোহণ করো","root":"ركب","lemma":"رَكِبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42427,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42428,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِسْمِ","transliteration":"bis''mi","translation_bn":"সহ নাম","root":"سمو","lemma":"ٱسْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42429,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":42430,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَجْر۪ىٰهَا","transliteration":"majrahā","translation_bn":"তার গতি","root":"جري","lemma":"مَجْرىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42431,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَمُرْسَىٰهَآ ۚ","transliteration":"wamur''sāhā","translation_bn":"ও তার স্থিতি","root":"رسو","lemma":"مُرْسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42433,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":42434,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42435,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَغَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"laghafūrun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":42436,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু\"","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":42437,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٤١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪১)","root":"—","lemma":"٤١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqāla ir''kabū fīhā bis''mi l-lahi majrahā wamur''sāhā inna rabbī laghafūrun raḥīmun', 'নূহ বলল, ‘এতে আরোহণ কর, আল্লাহর নামে এর গতি ও এর স্থিতি, আমার প্রতিপালক অবশ্যই বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, বড়ই দয়ালু।’', 'And [Noah] said, "Embark therein; in the name of Allah is its course and its anchorage. Indeed, my Lord is Forgiving and Merciful."', 'নূহ বলল, ‘এতে আরোহণ কর, আল্লাহর নামে এর গতি ও এর স্থিতি, আমার প্রতিপালক অবশ্যই বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, বড়ই দয়ালু।’', 'And [Noah] said, "Embark therein; in the name of Allah is its course and its anchorage. Indeed, my Lord is Forgiving and Merciful."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011041.mp3', now()),
  (11, 42, '', '[{"id":43113,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَهِىَ","transliteration":"wahiya","translation_bn":"এবং তা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهِىَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43114,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَجْرِى","transliteration":"tajrī","translation_bn":"বয়ে চলে","root":"جري","lemma":"جَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43115,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِهِمْ","transliteration":"bihim","translation_bn":"তাদের নিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43116,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43117,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَوْجٍۢ","transliteration":"mawjin","translation_bn":"ঢেউয়ের","root":"موج","lemma":"مَوْج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43118,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَٱلْجِبَالِ","transliteration":"kal-jibāli","translation_bn":"পাহাড়ের মতো","root":"جبل","lemma":"جَبَل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43119,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَنَادَىٰ","transliteration":"wanādā","translation_bn":"এবং ডাকলো","root":"ندو","lemma":"نَادَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43120,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"نُوحٌ","transliteration":"nūḥun","translation_bn":"নূহ","root":"—","lemma":"نُوح","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":43121,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱبْنَهُۥ","transliteration":"ib''nahu","translation_bn":"তাঁর ছেলেকে","root":"بني","lemma":"ٱبْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43122,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং সে ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43123,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43124,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَعْزِلٍۢ","transliteration":"maʿzilin","translation_bn":"দূরবর্তী স্থানের","root":"عزل","lemma":"مَعْزِل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43125,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰبُنَىَّ","transliteration":"yābunayya","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার পুত্র","root":"بني","lemma":"بُنَىّ","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":43126,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱرْكَب","transliteration":"ir''kab","translation_bn":"আরোহণ করো","root":"ركب","lemma":"رَكِبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43127,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مَّعَنَا","transliteration":"maʿanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":43128,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43129,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"تَكُن","transliteration":"takun","translation_bn":"তুমি থেকো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43130,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مَّعَ","transliteration":"maʿa","translation_bn":"সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":43131,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","translation_bn":"কাফিরদের\"","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43132,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٤٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪২)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahiya tajrī bihim fī mawjin kal-jibāli wanādā nūḥun ib''nahu wakāna fī maʿzilin yābunayya ir''kab maʿanā walā takun maʿa l-kāfirīna', 'পর্বত সদৃশ তরঙ্গমালার মধ্য দিয়ে তা তাদেরকে নিয়ে বয়ে চলল। তখন নূহ তার পুত্রকে- যে তাদের থেকে আলাদা হয়ে গিয়েছিল- ডাক দিয়ে বলল, ‘হে আমার পুত্র! আমাদের সঙ্গে আরোহণ কর, কাফিরদের সঙ্গে থেক না।', 'And it sailed with them through waves like mountains, and Noah called to his son who was apart [from them], "O my son, come aboard with us and be not with the disbelievers."', 'পর্বত সদৃশ তরঙ্গমালার মধ্য দিয়ে তা তাদেরকে নিয়ে বয়ে চলল। তখন নূহ তার পুত্রকে- যে তাদের থেকে আলাদা হয়ে গিয়েছিল- ডাক দিয়ে বলল, ‘হে আমার পুত্র! আমাদের সঙ্গে আরোহণ কর, কাফিরদের সঙ্গে থেক না।', 'And it sailed with them through waves like mountains, and Noah called to his son who was apart [from them], "O my son, come aboard with us and be not with the disbelievers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011042.mp3', now()),
  (11, 43, '', '[{"id":43793,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43794,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"سَـَٔاوِىٓ","transliteration":"saāwī","translation_bn":"\"আমি শীঘ্রই আশ্রয় নিবো","root":"اوي","lemma":"أَوَى","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":43795,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43796,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"جَبَلٍۢ","transliteration":"jabalin","translation_bn":"এমন এক পাহাড়ের","root":"جبل","lemma":"جَبَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43797,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَعْصِمُنِى","transliteration":"yaʿṣimunī","translation_bn":"যা আমাকে রক্ষা করবে","root":"عصم","lemma":"يَعْصِمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43798,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43799,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَآءِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-māi","translation_bn":"প্লাবন\"","root":"موه","lemma":"مَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43801,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(নূহ) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43802,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":43803,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَاصِمَ","transliteration":"ʿāṣima","translation_bn":"কোন রক্ষাকারী","root":"عصم","lemma":"عَاصِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43804,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْيَوْمَ","transliteration":"l-yawma","translation_bn":"আজ","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43805,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43806,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرِ","transliteration":"amri","translation_bn":"নির্দেশ","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43807,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":43808,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":43809,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":43810,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِمَ ۚ","transliteration":"raḥima","translation_bn":"তিনি দয়া করবেন\"","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43812,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَحَالَ","transliteration":"waḥāla","translation_bn":"এ সময়ে আড়াল হয়ে দাড়ালো","root":"حول","lemma":"حَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43813,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُمَا","transliteration":"baynahumā","translation_bn":"তাদে্র দু''জনের মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":43814,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَوْجُ","transliteration":"l-mawju","translation_bn":"ঢেউ","root":"موج","lemma":"مَوْج","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43815,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"فَكَانَ","transliteration":"fakāna","translation_bn":"অতঃপর সে হলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43816,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43817,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُغْرَقِينَ","transliteration":"l-mugh''raqīna","translation_bn":"নিমজ্জিতদের","root":"غرق","lemma":"مُّغْرَقُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43818,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"٤٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla saāwī ilā jabalin yaʿṣimunī mina l-māi qāla lā ʿāṣima l-yawma min amri l-lahi illā man raḥima waḥāla baynahumā l-mawju fakāna mina l-mugh''raqīna', 'সে (অর্থাৎ নূহের পুত্র) বলল, ‘আমি এক্ষুণি পাহাড়ে আশ্রয় নেব যা আমাকে পানি থেকে রক্ষা করবে।’ নূহ বলল, ‘আজ আল্লাহর হুকুম থেকে কোন কিছুই রক্ষা করতে পারবে না, অবশ্য আল্লাহ যার প্রতি দয়া করবেন সে রক্ষা পাবে।’ অতঃপর ঢেউ তাদের দু’জনার মাঝে আড়াল করল আর সে ডুবে যাওয়া লোকেদের মধ্যে শামিল হয়ে গেল।', '[But] he said, "I will take refuge on a mountain to protect me from the water." [Noah] said, "There is no protector today from the decree of Allah, except for whom He gives mercy." And the waves came between them, and he was among the drowned.', 'সে (অর্থাৎ নূহের পুত্র) বলল, ‘আমি এক্ষুণি পাহাড়ে আশ্রয় নেব যা আমাকে পানি থেকে রক্ষা করবে।’ নূহ বলল, ‘আজ আল্লাহর হুকুম থেকে কোন কিছুই রক্ষা করতে পারবে না, অবশ্য আল্লাহ যার প্রতি দয়া করবেন সে রক্ষা পাবে।’ অতঃপর ঢেউ তাদের দু’জনার মাঝে আড়াল করল আর সে ডুবে যাওয়া লোকেদের মধ্যে শামিল হয়ে গেল।', '[But] he said, "I will take refuge on a mountain to protect me from the water." [Noah] said, "There is no protector today from the decree of Allah, except for whom He gives mercy." And the waves came between them, and he was among the drowned.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011043.mp3', now()),
  (11, 44, '', '[{"id":44607,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقِيلَ","transliteration":"waqīla","translation_bn":"এবং বলা হলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44608,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَرْضُ","transliteration":"yāarḍu","translation_bn":"\"হে পৃথিবী","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":44609,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱبْلَعِى","transliteration":"ib''laʿī","translation_bn":"শুষে দাও","root":"بلع","lemma":"ٱبْلَعِ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44610,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَآءَكِ","transliteration":"māaki","translation_bn":"তোমার পানি","root":"موه","lemma":"مَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44611,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَيَـٰسَمَآءُ","transliteration":"wayāsamāu","translation_bn":"এবং হে আকাশ","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44612,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَقْلِعِى","transliteration":"aqliʿī","translation_bn":"ক্ষান্ত হও\"","root":"قلع","lemma":"أَقْلِعِ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44613,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَغِيضَ","transliteration":"waghīḍa","translation_bn":"এবং শুষে নেয়া হলো","root":"غيض","lemma":"غِيضَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44614,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَآءُ","transliteration":"l-māu","translation_bn":"পানি","root":"موه","lemma":"مَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44615,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَقُضِىَ","transliteration":"waquḍiya","translation_bn":"এবং শেষ হয়ে গেলো","root":"قضي","lemma":"قَضَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44616,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَمْرُ","transliteration":"l-amru","translation_bn":"(যা হওয়ার) বিষয়","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44617,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱسْتَوَتْ","transliteration":"wa-is''tawat","translation_bn":"এবং স্থির হলো (নৌযান)","root":"سوي","lemma":"ٱسْتَوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44618,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44619,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجُودِىِّ ۖ","transliteration":"l-jūdiyi","translation_bn":"জুদী (পাহাড়ের)","root":"—","lemma":"جُودِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44621,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَقِيلَ","transliteration":"waqīla","translation_bn":"এবং বলা হলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44622,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بُعْدًۭا","transliteration":"buʿ''dan","translation_bn":"\"দূর হোক (ধ্বংস আসুক)","root":"بعد","lemma":"بُعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44623,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لِّلْقَوْمِ","transliteration":"lil''qawmi","translation_bn":"জাতির জন্যে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44624,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদের\"","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44625,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٤٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqīla yāarḍu ib''laʿī māaki wayāsamāu aqliʿī waghīḍa l-māu waquḍiya l-amru wa-is''tawat ʿalā l-jūdiyi waqīla buʿ''dan lil''qawmi l-ẓālimīna', 'অতঃপর বলা হল, ‘হে যমীন! তোমার পানি গিলে ফেল, আর হে আকাশ, থাম।’ অতঃপর পানি যমীনে বসে গেল, কার্য সমাপ্ত হল, নৌকা জুদী পর্বতে এসে ভিড়ল, আর বলা হল- ‘যালিম লোকেরা ধ্বংস হোক!’', 'And it was said, "O earth, swallow your water, and O sky, withhold [your rain]." And the water subsided, and the matter was accomplished, and the ship came to rest on the [mountain of] Judiyy. And it was said, "Away with the wrongdoing people."', 'অতঃপর বলা হল, ‘হে যমীন! তোমার পানি গিলে ফেল, আর হে আকাশ, থাম।’ অতঃপর পানি যমীনে বসে গেল, কার্য সমাপ্ত হল, নৌকা জুদী পর্বতে এসে ভিড়ল, আর বলা হল- ‘যালিম লোকেরা ধ্বংস হোক!’', 'And it was said, "O earth, swallow your water, and O sky, withhold [your rain]." And the water subsided, and the matter was accomplished, and the ship came to rest on the [mountain of] Judiyy. And it was said, "Away with the wrongdoing people."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011044.mp3', now()),
  (11, 45, '', '[{"id":45298,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَنَادَىٰ","transliteration":"wanādā","translation_bn":"এবং ডাকলো","root":"ندو","lemma":"نَادَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45299,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نُوحٌۭ","transliteration":"nūḥun","translation_bn":"নূহ","root":"—","lemma":"نُوح","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":45300,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَّبَّهُۥ","transliteration":"rabbahu","translation_bn":"তাঁর রবকে","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45301,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَقَالَ","transliteration":"faqāla","translation_bn":"অতঃপর সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45302,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّ","transliteration":"rabbi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45303,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":45304,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱبْنِى","transliteration":"ib''nī","translation_bn":"আমার ছেলে","root":"بني","lemma":"ٱبْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45305,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45306,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلِى","transliteration":"ahlī","translation_bn":"আমার পরিবারের","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45307,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ","transliteration":"wa-inna","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45308,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَعْدَكَ","transliteration":"waʿdaka","translation_bn":"তোমার প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45309,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقُّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","translation_bn":"সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45310,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنتَ","transliteration":"wa-anta","translation_bn":"এবং তুমিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَأَنتَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45311,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَحْكَمُ","transliteration":"aḥkamu","translation_bn":"উত্তম বিচারক","root":"حكم","lemma":"أَحْكَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45312,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَـٰكِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ḥākimīna","translation_bn":"(সব) বিচারকদের\"","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَٰكِمِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45313,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٤٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wanādā nūḥun rabbahu faqāla rabbi inna ib''nī min ahlī wa-inna waʿdaka l-ḥaqu wa-anta aḥkamu l-ḥākimīna', 'নূহ তার প্রতিপালককে আহবান জানাল। সে বলল, ‘হে আমার প্রতিপালক! আমার পুত্র তো আমার পরিবারভুক্ত, আর তোমার ও‘য়াদা সত্য আর তুমি বিচারকদের সর্বশ্রেষ্ঠ বিচারক।’', 'And Noah called to his Lord and said, "My Lord, indeed my son is of my family; and indeed, Your promise is true; and You are the most just of judges!"', 'নূহ তার প্রতিপালককে আহবান জানাল। সে বলল, ‘হে আমার প্রতিপালক! আমার পুত্র তো আমার পরিবারভুক্ত, আর তোমার ও‘য়াদা সত্য আর তুমি বিচারকদের সর্বশ্রেষ্ঠ বিচারক।’', 'And Noah called to his Lord and said, "My Lord, indeed my son is of my family; and indeed, Your promise is true; and You are the most just of judges!"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011045.mp3', now()),
  (11, 46, '', '[{"id":46029,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(আল্লাহ) বললেন","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46030,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰنُوحُ","transliteration":"yānūḥu","translation_bn":"\"হে নূহ","root":"—","lemma":"نُوح","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":46031,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"সে নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":46032,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَيْسَ","transliteration":"laysa","translation_bn":"নয়","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46033,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46034,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلِكَ ۖ","transliteration":"ahlika","translation_bn":"তোমার পরিবারের","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46036,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":46037,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَمَلٌ","transliteration":"ʿamalun","translation_bn":"কাজ","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46038,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرُ","transliteration":"ghayru","translation_bn":"নয়/অ","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46039,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰلِحٍۢ ۖ","transliteration":"ṣāliḥin","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46041,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"অতএব না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46042,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"تَسْـَٔلْنِ","transliteration":"tasalni","translation_bn":"আমার কাছে অনুরোধ করো","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46043,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যার","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":46044,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَيْسَ","transliteration":"laysa","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46045,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَكَ","transliteration":"laka","translation_bn":"তোমার","root":"—","lemma":"لَكَ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46046,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সে সম্বন্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46047,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمٌ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿil''mun","translation_bn":"কোন জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46049,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":46050,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَعِظُكَ","transliteration":"aʿiẓuka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে উপদেশ দিচ্ছি","root":"وعظ","lemma":"وَعَظْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46051,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে (না)","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":46052,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"تَكُونَ","transliteration":"takūna","translation_bn":"তুমি হয়ো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46053,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46054,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَـٰهِلِينَ","transliteration":"l-jāhilīna","translation_bn":"মূর্খদের\"","root":"جهل","lemma":"جَاهِل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46055,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"٤٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla yānūḥu innahu laysa min ahlika innahu ʿamalun ghayru ṣāliḥin falā tasalni mā laysa laka bihi ʿil''mun innī aʿiẓuka an takūna mina l-jāhilīna', 'তিনি বললেন, ‘ওহে নূহ! সে তো তোমার পরিবারের লোক নয়, তার আচার আচরণ অসৎ, কাজেই যে বিষয়ে তোমার কোন জ্ঞান নেই সে বিষয়ে আমার কাছে আবেদন করো না, আমি তোমাকে উপদেশ দিচ্ছি, তুমি যেন মূর্খদের মধ্যে শামিল না হও।', 'He said, "O Noah, indeed he is not of your family; indeed, he is [one whose] work was other than righteous, so ask Me not for that about which you have no knowledge. Indeed, I advise you, lest you be among the ignorant."', 'তিনি বললেন, ‘ওহে নূহ! সে তো তোমার পরিবারের লোক নয়, তার আচার আচরণ অসৎ, কাজেই যে বিষয়ে তোমার কোন জ্ঞান নেই সে বিষয়ে আমার কাছে আবেদন করো না, আমি তোমাকে উপদেশ দিচ্ছি, তুমি যেন মূর্খদের মধ্যে শামিল না হও।', 'He said, "O Noah, indeed he is not of your family; indeed, he is [one whose] work was other than righteous, so ask Me not for that about which you have no knowledge. Indeed, I advise you, lest you be among the ignorant."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011046.mp3', now()),
  (11, 47, '', '[{"id":46671,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46672,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّ","transliteration":"rabbi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46673,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":46674,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَعُوذُ","transliteration":"aʿūdhu","translation_bn":"আশ্রয় চাচ্ছি","root":"عوذ","lemma":"عُذْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46675,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِكَ","transliteration":"bika","translation_bn":"কাছে তোমার","root":"—","lemma":"بِكَ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46676,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":46677,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَسْـَٔلَكَ","transliteration":"asalaka","translation_bn":"তোমার কাছে আমি অনুরোধ করবো","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46678,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যার","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":46679,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَيْسَ","transliteration":"laysa","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46680,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِى","transliteration":"lī","translation_bn":"আমার","root":"—","lemma":"لِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46681,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তা সম্বন্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46682,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمٌۭ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿil''mun","translation_bn":"কোন জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46684,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَإِلَّا","transliteration":"wa-illā","translation_bn":"এবং যদি না","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46685,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"تَغْفِرْ","transliteration":"taghfir","translation_bn":"মাফ করো তুমি","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46686,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لِى","transliteration":"lī","translation_bn":"আমাকে","root":"—","lemma":"لِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46687,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَتَرْحَمْنِىٓ","transliteration":"watarḥamnī","translation_bn":"এবং (না) আমাকে তুমি দয়া করো","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46688,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَكُن","transliteration":"akun","translation_bn":"আমি হয়ে যাবো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46689,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46690,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخَـٰسِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-khāsirīna","translation_bn":"ক্ষতিগ্রস্তদের\"","root":"خسر","lemma":"خَٰسِرِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46691,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٤٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla rabbi innī aʿūdhu bika an asalaka mā laysa lī bihi ʿil''mun wa-illā taghfir lī watarḥamnī akun mina l-khāsirīna', 'সে বলল, ‘হে আমার প্রতিপালক! যে বিষয়ে আমার কোন জ্ঞান নেই সে বিষয়ে প্রশ্ন করা হতে আমি তোমার কাছে আশ্রয় চাচ্ছি। যদি তুমি আমাকে ক্ষমা না কর আর আমার প্রতি দয়া না কর তাহলে আমি ক্ষতিগ্রস্তদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত হয়ে যাব।’', '[Noah] said, "My Lord, I seek refuge in You from asking that of which I have no knowledge. And unless You forgive me and have mercy upon me, I will be among the losers."', 'সে বলল, ‘হে আমার প্রতিপালক! যে বিষয়ে আমার কোন জ্ঞান নেই সে বিষয়ে প্রশ্ন করা হতে আমি তোমার কাছে আশ্রয় চাচ্ছি। যদি তুমি আমাকে ক্ষমা না কর আর আমার প্রতি দয়া না কর তাহলে আমি ক্ষতিগ্রস্তদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত হয়ে যাব।’', '[Noah] said, "My Lord, I seek refuge in You from asking that of which I have no knowledge. And unless You forgive me and have mercy upon me, I will be among the losers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011047.mp3', now()),
  (11, 48, '', '[{"id":47425,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قِيلَ","transliteration":"qīla","translation_bn":"বলা হলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47426,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰنُوحُ","transliteration":"yānūḥu","translation_bn":"\"হে নূহ","root":"—","lemma":"نُوح","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":47427,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱهْبِطْ","transliteration":"ih''biṭ","translation_bn":"অবতরণ করো","root":"هبط","lemma":"يَهْبِطُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47428,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِسَلَـٰمٍۢ","transliteration":"bisalāmin","translation_bn":"শান্তিসহ","root":"سلم","lemma":"سَلَٰم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47429,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَّا","transliteration":"minnā","translation_bn":"আমাদের পক্ষ হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47430,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَبَرَكَـٰتٍ","transliteration":"wabarakātin","translation_bn":"ও কল্যাণ (সহ)","root":"برك","lemma":"بَرَكَٰت","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47431,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ʿalayka","translation_bn":"তোমার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47432,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَعَلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"waʿalā","translation_bn":"এবং উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47433,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أُمَمٍۢ","transliteration":"umamin","translation_bn":"(সে সব) সম্প্রদায়ের","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47434,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّن","transliteration":"mimman","translation_bn":"তাদের মধ্যে যারা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47435,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَّعَكَ ۚ","transliteration":"maʿaka","translation_bn":"তোমার সাথে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":47437,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَأُمَمٌۭ","transliteration":"wa-umamun","translation_bn":"ও অন্য কিছু সম্প্রদায়","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47438,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"سَنُمَتِّعُهُمْ","transliteration":"sanumattiʿuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের আমরা জীবনোপকরণ দিবো","root":"متع","lemma":"مَّتَّعْ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":47439,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47440,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَمَسُّهُم","transliteration":"yamassuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের স্পর্শ করবে","root":"مسس","lemma":"مَسَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47441,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَّا","transliteration":"minnā","translation_bn":"আমাদের পক্ষ হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47442,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47443,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"alīmun","translation_bn":"নিদারুণ\"","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":47444,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٤٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qīla yānūḥu ih''biṭ bisalāmin minnā wabarakātin ʿalayka waʿalā umamin mimman maʿaka wa-umamun sanumattiʿuhum thumma yamassuhum minnā ʿadhābun alīmun', 'বলা হল, ‘হে নূহ! তুমি নেমে পড়, আমার পক্ষ হতে শান্তি ও বরকত তোমার প্রতি আর তোমার সঙ্গীদের মধ্যে অনেক দলের প্রতি, আর এ ছাড়া অন্য লোকেদের আমি জীবন উপভোগ করতে দেব, (কিন্তু) পরে আমার নিকট হতে মর্মান্তিক ‘আযাব তাদেরকে স্পর্শ করবে।’', 'It was said, "O Noah, disembark in security from Us and blessings upon you and upon nations [descending] from those with you. But other nations [of them] We will grant enjoyment; then there will touch them from Us a painful punishment."', 'বলা হল, ‘হে নূহ! তুমি নেমে পড়, আমার পক্ষ হতে শান্তি ও বরকত তোমার প্রতি আর তোমার সঙ্গীদের মধ্যে অনেক দলের প্রতি, আর এ ছাড়া অন্য লোকেদের আমি জীবন উপভোগ করতে দেব, (কিন্তু) পরে আমার নিকট হতে মর্মান্তিক ‘আযাব তাদেরকে স্পর্শ করবে।’', 'It was said, "O Noah, disembark in security from Us and blessings upon you and upon nations [descending] from those with you. But other nations [of them] We will grant enjoyment; then there will touch them from Us a painful punishment."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011048.mp3', now()),
  (11, 49, '', '[{"id":48119,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"تِلْكَ","transliteration":"til''ka","translation_bn":"(হে নাবী) এই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":48120,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48121,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنۢبَآءِ","transliteration":"anbāi","translation_bn":"সংবাদ সমূহ","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَأ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48122,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَيْبِ","transliteration":"l-ghaybi","translation_bn":"অদৃশ্যের","root":"غيب","lemma":"غَيْب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48123,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نُوحِيهَآ","transliteration":"nūḥīhā","translation_bn":"যা ওহী করছি আমরা","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48124,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ ۖ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"তোমার প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48126,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":48127,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كُنتَ","transliteration":"kunta","translation_bn":"তুমি ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48128,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمُهَآ","transliteration":"taʿlamuhā","translation_bn":"তা জানতে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48129,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَنتَ","transliteration":"anta","translation_bn":"তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":48130,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48131,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمُكَ","transliteration":"qawmuka","translation_bn":"তোমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48132,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48133,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِ","transliteration":"qabli","translation_bn":"পূর্বে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48134,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا ۖ","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটার","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":48136,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَٱصْبِرْ ۖ","transliteration":"fa-iṣ''bir","translation_bn":"অতএব ধৈর্য ধরো","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48138,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":48139,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَـٰقِبَةَ","transliteration":"l-ʿāqibata","translation_bn":"(শুভ) পরিণাম","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَٰقِبَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48140,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"لِلْمُتَّقِينَ","transliteration":"lil''muttaqīna","translation_bn":"মুত্তাকীদের জন্যে\"","root":"وقي","lemma":"مُتَّقِين","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48141,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'til''ka min anbāi l-ghaybi nūḥīhā ilayka mā kunta taʿlamuhā anta walā qawmuka min qabli hādhā fa-iṣ''bir inna l-ʿāqibata lil''muttaqīna', 'এ সব হল অদৃশ্যের খবর যা তোমাকে ওয়াহী দ্বারা জানিয়ে দিচ্ছি, যা এর পূর্বে না তুমি জানতে, না তোমার জাতির লোকেরা জানত। কাজেই ধৈর্য ধর, শুভ পরিণতি মুত্তাকীদের জন্যই নির্দিষ্ট।', 'That is from the news of the unseen which We reveal to you, [O Muhammad]. You knew it not, neither you nor your people, before this. So be patient; indeed, the [best] outcome is for the righteous.', 'এ সব হল অদৃশ্যের খবর যা তোমাকে ওয়াহী দ্বারা জানিয়ে দিচ্ছি, যা এর পূর্বে না তুমি জানতে, না তোমার জাতির লোকেরা জানত। কাজেই ধৈর্য ধর, শুভ পরিণতি মুত্তাকীদের জন্যই নির্দিষ্ট।', 'That is from the news of the unseen which We reveal to you, [O Muhammad]. You knew it not, neither you nor your people, before this. So be patient; indeed, the [best] outcome is for the righteous.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011049.mp3', now()),
  (11, 50, '', '[{"id":48806,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِلَىٰ","transliteration":"wa-ilā","translation_bn":"এবং প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48807,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَادٍ","transliteration":"ʿādin","translation_bn":"আদ-এর","root":"عود","lemma":"عَاد2","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":48808,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَخَاهُمْ","transliteration":"akhāhum","translation_bn":"তাদের ভাই","root":"اخو","lemma":"أَخ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48809,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"هُودًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"hūdan","translation_bn":"হূদকে (পাঠিয়েছিলাম)","root":"هود","lemma":"هُود","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":48811,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48812,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"yāqawmi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":48813,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱعْبُدُوا۟","transliteration":"uʿ''budū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ইবাদত করো","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48814,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":48815,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":48816,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48817,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোন","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48818,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهٍ","transliteration":"ilāhin","translation_bn":"ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48819,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرُهُۥٓ ۖ","transliteration":"ghayruhu","translation_bn":"তিনি ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48821,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"নও","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":48822,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُمْ","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":48823,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":48824,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مُفْتَرُونَ","transliteration":"muf''tarūna","translation_bn":"মিথ্যারচনাকারী","root":"فري","lemma":"مُفْتَرُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48825,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٥٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫০)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-ilā ʿādin akhāhum hūdan qāla yāqawmi uʿ''budū l-laha mā lakum min ilāhin ghayruhu in antum illā muf''tarūna', 'আর ‘আদ জাতির নিকট তাদের ভাই হূদকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম। সে বলেছিল, ‘হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা আল্লাহর ‘ইবাদাত কর, তিনি ছাড়া তোমাদের আর কোন ইলাহ নেই। তোমরা তো শুধু মিথ্যে বানিয়ে নিয়েছ।', 'And to ''Aad [We sent] their brother Hud. He said, "O my people, worship Allah; you have no deity other than Him. You are not but inventors [of falsehood].', 'আর ‘আদ জাতির নিকট তাদের ভাই হূদকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম। সে বলেছিল, ‘হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা আল্লাহর ‘ইবাদাত কর, তিনি ছাড়া তোমাদের আর কোন ইলাহ নেই। তোমরা তো শুধু মিথ্যে বানিয়ে নিয়েছ।', 'And to ''Aad [We sent] their brother Hud. He said, "O my people, worship Allah; you have no deity other than Him. You are not but inventors [of falsehood].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011050.mp3', now()),
  (11, 51, '', '[{"id":49363,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"yāqawmi","translation_bn":"হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":49364,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَآ","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":49365,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَسْـَٔلُكُمْ","transliteration":"asalukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে আমি চাই","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49366,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"এর বিনিময়ে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49367,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرًا ۖ","transliteration":"ajran","translation_bn":"কোন পারিশ্রামিক","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49369,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":49370,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرِىَ","transliteration":"ajriya","translation_bn":"আমার পারিশ্রমিক","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49371,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":49372,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49373,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"(তাঁর) যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":49374,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَطَرَنِىٓ ۚ","transliteration":"faṭaranī","translation_bn":"আমাকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"فطر","lemma":"فَطَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49376,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَا","transliteration":"afalā","translation_bn":"তবুও কি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":49377,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَعْقِلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿqilūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা বুদ্ধি কাজে লাগাবে","root":"عقل","lemma":"عَقَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49378,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٥١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫১)","root":"—","lemma":"٥١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāqawmi lā asalukum ʿalayhi ajran in ajriya illā ʿalā alladhī faṭaranī afalā taʿqilūna', 'হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! এর বিনিময়ে আমি তোমাদের কাছে কোন পারিশ্রমিক চাই না। আমার পারিশ্রমিক তো তাঁর জিম্মায় যিনি আমাকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন, তবুও কি তোমরা জ্ঞান-বুদ্ধি খাটাবে না?', 'O my people, I do not ask you for it any reward. My reward is only from the one who created me. Then will you not reason?', 'হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! এর বিনিময়ে আমি তোমাদের কাছে কোন পারিশ্রমিক চাই না। আমার পারিশ্রমিক তো তাঁর জিম্মায় যিনি আমাকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন, তবুও কি তোমরা জ্ঞান-বুদ্ধি খাটাবে না?', 'O my people, I do not ask you for it any reward. My reward is only from the one who created me. Then will you not reason?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011051.mp3', now()),
  (11, 52, '', '[{"id":50103,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"wayāqawmi","translation_bn":"এবং হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50104,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَغْفِرُوا۟","transliteration":"is''taghfirū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ক্ষমা চাও","root":"غفر","lemma":"ٱسْتَغْفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50105,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّكُمْ","transliteration":"rabbakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রবের (কাছে)","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50106,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50107,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تُوبُوٓا۟","transliteration":"tūbū","translation_bn":"ফিরে এসো তোমরা","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50108,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"তাঁরই দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50109,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يُرْسِلِ","transliteration":"yur''sili","translation_bn":"তিনি প্রেরণ করবেন","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50110,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَآءَ","transliteration":"l-samāa","translation_bn":"আকাশ থেকে (বৃষ্টি)","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50111,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُم","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50112,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِّدْرَارًۭا","transliteration":"mid''rāran","translation_bn":"মুষলধারে","root":"درر","lemma":"مِّدْرَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50113,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَيَزِدْكُمْ","transliteration":"wayazid''kum","translation_bn":"এবং তোমাদের বৃদ্ধি করবেন","root":"زيد","lemma":"زَادَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50114,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"قُوَّةً","transliteration":"quwwatan","translation_bn":"শক্তি","root":"قوي","lemma":"قُوَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50115,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50116,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"قُوَّتِكُمْ","transliteration":"quwwatikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের শক্তির","root":"قوي","lemma":"قُوَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50117,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50118,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"تَتَوَلَّوْا۟","transliteration":"tatawallaw","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মুখ ফিরিয়ে নিও","root":"ولي","lemma":"تَوَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50119,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مُجْرِمِينَ","transliteration":"muj''rimīna","translation_bn":"অপরাধী হয়ে\"","root":"جرم","lemma":"مُجْرِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50120,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٥٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫২)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayāqawmi is''taghfirū rabbakum thumma tūbū ilayhi yur''sili l-samāa ʿalaykum mid''rāran wayazid''kum quwwatan ilā quwwatikum walā tatawallaw muj''rimīna', 'হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা তোমাদের রবেবর কাছে ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা কর, অতঃপর অনুশোচনাভরে তাঁর দিকেই ফিরে যাও, তিনি তোমাদের জন্য প্রচুর বৃষ্টি বর্ষণ করবেন, তোমাদের শক্তিকে আরো শক্তি দিয়ে বাড়িয়ে দিবেন, আর অপরাধী হয়ে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নিও না।', 'And O my people, ask forgiveness of your Lord and then repent to Him. He will send [rain from] the sky upon you in showers and increase you in strength [added] to your strength. And do not turn away, [being] criminals."', 'হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা তোমাদের রবেবর কাছে ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা কর, অতঃপর অনুশোচনাভরে তাঁর দিকেই ফিরে যাও, তিনি তোমাদের জন্য প্রচুর বৃষ্টি বর্ষণ করবেন, তোমাদের শক্তিকে আরো শক্তি দিয়ে বাড়িয়ে দিবেন, আর অপরাধী হয়ে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নিও না।', 'And O my people, ask forgiveness of your Lord and then repent to Him. He will send [rain from] the sky upon you in showers and increase you in strength [added] to your strength. And do not turn away, [being] criminals."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011052.mp3', now()),
  (11, 53, '', '[{"id":50661,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50662,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰهُودُ","transliteration":"yāhūdu","translation_bn":"\"হে হুদ","root":"هود","lemma":"هُود","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":50663,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":50664,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"جِئْتَنَا","transliteration":"ji''tanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের কাছে তুমি এসেছো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50665,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِبَيِّنَةٍۢ","transliteration":"bibayyinatin","translation_bn":"নিয়ে সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণ","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50666,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50667,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نَحْنُ","transliteration":"naḥnu","translation_bn":"আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"نَحْنُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":50668,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِتَارِكِىٓ","transliteration":"bitārikī","translation_bn":"পরিত্যাগকারী","root":"ترك","lemma":"تَارِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50669,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ءَالِهَتِنَا","transliteration":"ālihatinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের উপাস্যদেরকে","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50670,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"কারণে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50671,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَوْلِكَ","transliteration":"qawlika","translation_bn":"তোমার কথার","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50672,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50673,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"نَحْنُ","transliteration":"naḥnu","translation_bn":"আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"نَحْنُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":50674,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَكَ","transliteration":"laka","translation_bn":"তোমার প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"لَكَ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50675,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بِمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"bimu''minīna","translation_bn":"বিশ্বাসী","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50676,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٥٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū yāhūdu mā ji''tanā bibayyinatin wamā naḥnu bitārikī ālihatinā ʿan qawlika wamā naḥnu laka bimu''minīna', 'তারা বলল, ‘হে হূদ! তুমি আমাদের কাছে কোন সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণ নিয়ে আসনি, আর তোমার কথায় আমরা আমাদের উপাস্যগুলোকে ত্যাগ করতে পারি না, আমরা তোমাতে বিশ্বাসী নই।', 'They said, "O Hud, you have not brought us clear evidence, and we are not ones to leave our gods on your say-so. Nor are we believers in you.', 'তারা বলল, ‘হে হূদ! তুমি আমাদের কাছে কোন সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণ নিয়ে আসনি, আর তোমার কথায় আমরা আমাদের উপাস্যগুলোকে ত্যাগ করতে পারি না, আমরা তোমাতে বিশ্বাসী নই।', 'They said, "O Hud, you have not brought us clear evidence, and we are not ones to leave our gods on your say-so. Nor are we believers in you.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011053.mp3', now()),
  (11, 54, '', '[{"id":51304,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":51305,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَّقُولُ","transliteration":"naqūlu","translation_bn":"আমরা বলি","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51306,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":51307,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱعْتَرَىٰكَ","transliteration":"iʿ''tarāka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে আচ্ছন্ন করেছে","root":"عرو","lemma":"ٱعْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51308,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضُ","transliteration":"baʿḍu","translation_bn":"কেউ","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51309,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ءَالِهَتِنَا","transliteration":"ālihatinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের উপাস্যদের","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51310,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِسُوٓءٍۢ ۗ","transliteration":"bisūin","translation_bn":"দিয়ে মন্দ\"","root":"سوا","lemma":"سُو^ء","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51312,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51313,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":51314,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أُشْهِدُ","transliteration":"ush''hidu","translation_bn":"সাক্ষী করছি","root":"شهد","lemma":"أَشْهَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51315,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":51316,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَٱشْهَدُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wa-ish''hadū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরাও সাক্ষী থাকো","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِدَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51317,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَنِّى","transliteration":"annī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":51318,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بَرِىٓءٌۭ","transliteration":"barīon","translation_bn":"সম্পর্ক মুক্ত","root":"برا","lemma":"بَرِى^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51319,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51320,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"تُشْرِكُونَ","transliteration":"tush''rikūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা শরিক করছো","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51321,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٥٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'in naqūlu illā iʿ''tarāka baʿḍu ālihatinā bisūin qāla innī ush''hidu l-laha wa-ish''hadū annī barīon mimmā tush''rikūna', 'আমরা এ কথাই বলি যে, তোমার উপর আমাদের কোন উপাস্যের অশুভ ছায়া পড়েছে।’ সে বলল, ‘আমি আল্লাহকে সাক্ষী রাখছি আর তোমরাও সাক্ষী হও যে, তোমরা আল্লাহ ছাড়া যাকে তাঁর শরীক কর তার সাথে আমি পুরোপুরি সম্পর্কহীন।', 'We only say that some of our gods have possessed you with evil." He said, "Indeed, I call Allah to witness, and witness [yourselves] that I am free from whatever you associate with Allah', 'আমরা এ কথাই বলি যে, তোমার উপর আমাদের কোন উপাস্যের অশুভ ছায়া পড়েছে।’ সে বলল, ‘আমি আল্লাহকে সাক্ষী রাখছি আর তোমরাও সাক্ষী হও যে, তোমরা আল্লাহ ছাড়া যাকে তাঁর শরীক কর তার সাথে আমি পুরোপুরি সম্পর্কহীন।', 'We only say that some of our gods have possessed you with evil." He said, "Indeed, I call Allah to witness, and witness [yourselves] that I am free from whatever you associate with Allah', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011054.mp3', now()),
  (11, 55, '', '[{"id":51919,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51920,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"دُونِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"dūnihi","translation_bn":"তাঁকে","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51922,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَكِيدُونِى","transliteration":"fakīdūnī","translation_bn":"আমার বিরুদ্ধে এখন তোমরা ষড়যন্ত্র করো","root":"كيد","lemma":"كِيدُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51923,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"جَمِيعًۭا","transliteration":"jamīʿan","translation_bn":"সকলে (মিলে)","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51924,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51925,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":51926,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تُنظِرُونِ","transliteration":"tunẓirūni","translation_bn":"আমাকে তোমরা অবকাশ দিও","root":"نظر","lemma":"يُنظَرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51927,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٥٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'min dūnihi fakīdūnī jamīʿan thumma lā tunẓirūni', 'তাঁকে (আল্লাহ) ব্যতীত তোমরা সবাই মিলে আমার বিরুদ্ধে ষড়যন্ত্র কর আর আমাকে একটুও অবকাশ দিও না।', 'Other than Him. So plot against me all together; then do not give me respite.', 'তাঁকে (আল্লাহ) ব্যতীত তোমরা সবাই মিলে আমার বিরুদ্ধে ষড়যন্ত্র কর আর আমাকে একটুও অবকাশ দিও না।', 'Other than Him. So plot against me all together; then do not give me respite.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011055.mp3', now()),
  (11, 56, '', '[{"id":52346,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّى","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":52347,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَوَكَّلْتُ","transliteration":"tawakkaltu","translation_bn":"নির্ভর করছি","root":"وكل","lemma":"تَوَكَّلْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52348,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52349,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":52350,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"(যিনি) আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52351,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَرَبِّكُم ۚ","transliteration":"warabbikum","translation_bn":"ও তোমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52353,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":52354,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোন","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52355,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"دَآبَّةٍ","transliteration":"dābbatin","translation_bn":"বিচরণশীল প্রণী","root":"دبب","lemma":"دَا^بَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52356,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":52357,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":52358,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ءَاخِذٌۢ","transliteration":"ākhidhun","translation_bn":"ধারণকারী","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ا^خِذ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52359,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِنَاصِيَتِهَآ ۚ","transliteration":"bināṣiyatihā","translation_bn":"তার সামনের কেশগুচ্ছকে","root":"نصي","lemma":"نَاصِيَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52361,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":52362,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52363,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52364,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"صِرَٰطٍۢ","transliteration":"ṣirāṭin","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"صرط","lemma":"صِرَٰط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52365,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"mus''taqīmin","translation_bn":"সরল-সঠিক (অর্থাৎ এই পথেই তাঁকে পাবে)","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّسْتَقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52366,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٥٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innī tawakkaltu ʿalā l-lahi rabbī warabbikum mā min dābbatin illā huwa ākhidhun bināṣiyatihā inna rabbī ʿalā ṣirāṭin mus''taqīmin', 'আমি নির্ভর করি আল্লাহর উপর যিনি আমার আর তোমাদের রব, এমন কোন জীব নেই যার কতৃত্ব তাঁর হাতে নয়, নিশ্চয়ই আমার রব সরল পথের উপর প্রতিষ্ঠিত।', 'Indeed, I have relied upon Allah, my Lord and your Lord. There is no creature but that He holds its forelock. Indeed, my Lord is on a path [that is] straight."', 'আমি নির্ভর করি আল্লাহর উপর যিনি আমার আর তোমাদের রব, এমন কোন জীব নেই যার কতৃত্ব তাঁর হাতে নয়, নিশ্চয়ই আমার রব সরল পথের উপর প্রতিষ্ঠিত।', 'Indeed, I have relied upon Allah, my Lord and your Lord. There is no creature but that He holds its forelock. Indeed, my Lord is on a path [that is] straight."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011056.mp3', now()),
  (11, 57, '', '[{"id":52886,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَإِن","transliteration":"fa-in","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52887,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَوَلَّوْا۟","transliteration":"tawallaw","translation_bn":"মুখ ফিরিয়ে নাও","root":"ولي","lemma":"تَوَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52888,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَقَدْ","transliteration":"faqad","translation_bn":"তবে নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52889,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَبْلَغْتُكُم","transliteration":"ablaghtukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে আমি পৌঁছিয়েছি","root":"بلغ","lemma":"أَبْلَغُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52890,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَّآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"তাই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":52891,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أُرْسِلْتُ","transliteration":"ur''sil''tu","translation_bn":"আমি প্রেরিত হয়েছি","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52892,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"নিয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦٓ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52893,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"ilaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52895,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَيَسْتَخْلِفُ","transliteration":"wayastakhlifu","translation_bn":"স্থলাভিষিক্ত করবেন","root":"خلف","lemma":"ٱسْتَخْلَفَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52896,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52897,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمًا","transliteration":"qawman","translation_bn":"(অন্য) সম্প্ররদায়কে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52898,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرَكُمْ","transliteration":"ghayrakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52899,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52900,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"تَضُرُّونَهُۥ","transliteration":"taḍurrūnahu","translation_bn":"তাঁকে তোমরা ক্ষতি করতে পারবে","root":"ضرر","lemma":"يَضُرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52901,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًٔا ۚ","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কিছুমাত্র","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52903,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":52904,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52905,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52906,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52907,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52908,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"حَفِيظٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥafīẓun","translation_bn":"রক্ষণাবেক্ষণকারী (নিয়ন্ত্রনকারী)\"","root":"حفظ","lemma":"حَفِيظ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":52909,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"٥٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-in tawallaw faqad ablaghtukum mā ur''sil''tu bihi ilaykum wayastakhlifu rabbī qawman ghayrakum walā taḍurrūnahu shayan inna rabbī ʿalā kulli shayin ḥafīẓun', 'এরপরও যদি তোমরা মুখ ফিরিয়ে লও (তবে জেনে রেখ), আমাকে যা দিয়ে তোমাদের কাছে পাঠানো হয়েছে আমি তো তোমাদের কাছে তা পৌঁছে দিয়েছি, এখন আমার প্রতিপালক তোমাদের স্থলে অন্য সম্প্রদায়কে নিয়ে আসবেন আর তোমরা তাঁর কোনই ক্ষতি করতে পারবে না। আমার প্রতিপালক সব কিছুর রক্ষণাবেক্ষণকারী।', 'But if they turn away, [say], "I have already conveyed that with which I was sent to you. My Lord will give succession to a people other than you, and you will not harm Him at all. Indeed my Lord is, over all things, Guardian."', 'এরপরও যদি তোমরা মুখ ফিরিয়ে লও (তবে জেনে রেখ), আমাকে যা দিয়ে তোমাদের কাছে পাঠানো হয়েছে আমি তো তোমাদের কাছে তা পৌঁছে দিয়েছি, এখন আমার প্রতিপালক তোমাদের স্থলে অন্য সম্প্রদায়কে নিয়ে আসবেন আর তোমরা তাঁর কোনই ক্ষতি করতে পারবে না। আমার প্রতিপালক সব কিছুর রক্ষণাবেক্ষণকারী।', 'But if they turn away, [say], "I have already conveyed that with which I was sent to you. My Lord will give succession to a people other than you, and you will not harm Him at all. Indeed my Lord is, over all things, Guardian."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011057.mp3', now()),
  (11, 58, '', '[{"id":53422,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمَّا","transliteration":"walammā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53423,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"আসলো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53424,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرُنَا","transliteration":"amrunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের নির্দেশ","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53425,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"نَجَّيْنَا","transliteration":"najjaynā","translation_bn":"আমরা রক্ষা করলাম","root":"نجو","lemma":"نَجَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53426,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هُودًۭا","transliteration":"hūdan","translation_bn":"হূদকে","root":"هود","lemma":"هُود","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":53427,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"ও যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53428,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছিলো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53429,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَعَهُۥ","transliteration":"maʿahu","translation_bn":"তার সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":53430,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِرَحْمَةٍۢ","transliteration":"biraḥmatin","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ দিয়ে","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53431,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَّا","transliteration":"minnā","translation_bn":"আমাদের পক্ষ থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53432,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَنَجَّيْنَـٰهُم","transliteration":"wanajjaynāhum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদেরকে আমরা রক্ষা করলাম","root":"نجو","lemma":"نَجَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53433,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53434,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٍ","transliteration":"ʿadhābin","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53435,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"غَلِيظٍۢ","transliteration":"ghalīẓin","translation_bn":"কঠিন","root":"غلظ","lemma":"غَلِيظ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":53436,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٥٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walammā jāa amrunā najjaynā hūdan wa-alladhīna āmanū maʿahu biraḥmatin minnā wanajjaynāhum min ʿadhābin ghalīẓin', 'আমার নির্দেশ যখন এসে গেল, তখন আমি হূদকে আর তার সঙ্গে যারা ঈমান এনেছিল তাদেরকে আমার দয়ায় রক্ষা করলাম, আর তাদেরকে বাঁচিয়ে নিলাম এক কঠিন ‘আযাব হতে।', 'And when Our command came, We saved Hud and those who believed with him, by mercy from Us; and We saved them from a harsh punishment.', 'আমার নির্দেশ যখন এসে গেল, তখন আমি হূদকে আর তার সঙ্গে যারা ঈমান এনেছিল তাদেরকে আমার দয়ায় রক্ষা করলাম, আর তাদেরকে বাঁচিয়ে নিলাম এক কঠিন ‘আযাব হতে।', 'And when Our command came, We saved Hud and those who believed with him, by mercy from Us; and We saved them from a harsh punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011058.mp3', now()),
  (11, 59, '', '[{"id":53908,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَتِلْكَ","transliteration":"watil''ka","translation_bn":"এবং এই (ছিলো)","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53909,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَادٌۭ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿādun","translation_bn":"আদ জাতি","root":"عود","lemma":"عَاد2","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":53911,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَحَدُوا۟","transliteration":"jaḥadū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছিল","root":"جحد","lemma":"جَحَدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53912,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"biāyāti","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনাবলীকে","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53913,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِمْ","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"তাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53914,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَعَصَوْا۟","transliteration":"waʿaṣaw","translation_bn":"এবং তারা অমান্য করেছিলো","root":"عصي","lemma":"عَصَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53915,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رُسُلَهُۥ","transliteration":"rusulahu","translation_bn":"তাঁর রাসূলদেরকে","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53916,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّبَعُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wa-ittabaʿū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা অনুসরণ করেছিলো","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53917,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرَ","transliteration":"amra","translation_bn":"নির্দেশের","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53918,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53919,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"جَبَّارٍ","transliteration":"jabbārin","translation_bn":"উদ্ধত","root":"جبر","lemma":"جَبَّار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":53920,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَنِيدٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿanīdin","translation_bn":"স্বৈরাচারীর","root":"عند","lemma":"عَنِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":53921,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٥٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'watil''ka ʿādun jaḥadū biāyāti rabbihim waʿaṣaw rusulahu wa-ittabaʿū amra kulli jabbārin ʿanīdin', 'এই হল ‘আদ, তারা তাদের প্রতিপালকের আয়াতসমূহকে অস্বীকার করেছিল, আর তাদের রসূলদেরকে অমান্য করেছিল, প্রত্যেক প্রবল পরাক্রান্ত, সত্য-দ্বীনের দুশমনের নির্দেশের তারা অনুসরণ করেছিল।', 'And that was ''Aad, who rejected the signs of their Lord and disobeyed His messengers and followed the order of every obstinate tyrant.', 'এই হল ‘আদ, তারা তাদের প্রতিপালকের আয়াতসমূহকে অস্বীকার করেছিল, আর তাদের রসূলদেরকে অমান্য করেছিল, প্রত্যেক প্রবল পরাক্রান্ত, সত্য-দ্বীনের দুশমনের নির্দেশের তারা অনুসরণ করেছিল।', 'And that was ''Aad, who rejected the signs of their Lord and disobeyed His messengers and followed the order of every obstinate tyrant.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011059.mp3', now()),
  (11, 60, '', '[{"id":54565,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأُتْبِعُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-ut''biʿū","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের পিছনে লাগিয়ে দেয়া হলো","root":"تبع","lemma":"أَتْبَعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54566,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54567,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذِهِ","transliteration":"hādhihi","translation_bn":"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":54568,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54569,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَعْنَةًۭ","transliteration":"laʿnatan","translation_bn":"অভিশাপ","root":"لعن","lemma":"لَعْنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54570,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"এবং দিনেও","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54571,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54573,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَلَآ","transliteration":"alā","translation_bn":"সাবধান (জেনে রাখো)","root":"—","lemma":"أَلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":54574,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":54575,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَادًۭا","transliteration":"ʿādan","translation_bn":"আদ জাতি","root":"عود","lemma":"عَاد2","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":54576,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছিলো","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54577,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّهُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"rabbahum","translation_bn":"তাদের রবকে","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54579,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَلَا","transliteration":"alā","translation_bn":"সাবধান (জেনে রাখো)","root":"—","lemma":"أَلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":54580,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بُعْدًۭا","transliteration":"buʿ''dan","translation_bn":"ধ্বংসই (করা হলো)","root":"بعد","lemma":"بُعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54581,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لِّعَادٍۢ","transliteration":"liʿādin","translation_bn":"জন্য আদের","root":"عود","lemma":"عَاد2","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54582,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمِ","transliteration":"qawmi","translation_bn":"(যা ছিলো) জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54583,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"هُودٍۢ","transliteration":"hūdin","translation_bn":"হূদ (নাবীর)","root":"هود","lemma":"هُود","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":54584,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٦٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬০)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-ut''biʿū fī hādhihi l-dun''yā laʿnatan wayawma l-qiyāmati alā inna ʿādan kafarū rabbahum alā buʿ''dan liʿādin qawmi hūdin', 'এ দুনিয়াতে তাদের পিছনে লা‘নত রয়েছে, আর কিয়ামাতের দিনেও। জেনে রেখ, ‘আদ জাতি তাদের প্রতিপালককে অস্বীকার করেছিল। জেনে রেখ! ধ্বংস করা হয়েছিল ‘আদকে যারা ছিল হূদের সম্প্রদায়।', 'And they were [therefore] followed in this world with a curse and [as well] on the Day of Resurrection. Unquestionably, ''Aad denied their Lord; then away with ''Aad, the people of Hud.', 'এ দুনিয়াতে তাদের পিছনে লা‘নত রয়েছে, আর কিয়ামাতের দিনেও। জেনে রেখ, ‘আদ জাতি তাদের প্রতিপালককে অস্বীকার করেছিল। জেনে রেখ! ধ্বংস করা হয়েছিল ‘আদকে যারা ছিল হূদের সম্প্রদায়।', 'And they were [therefore] followed in this world with a curse and [as well] on the Day of Resurrection. Unquestionably, ''Aad denied their Lord; then away with ''Aad, the people of Hud.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011060.mp3', now()),
  (11, 61, '', '[{"id":55163,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَإِلَىٰ","transliteration":"wa-ilā","translation_bn":"এবং প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55164,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ثَمُودَ","transliteration":"thamūda","translation_bn":"সামূদ জাতির","root":"—","lemma":"ثَمُود","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":55165,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَخَاهُمْ","transliteration":"akhāhum","translation_bn":"তাদের ভাই","root":"اخو","lemma":"أَخ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55166,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰلِحًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","translation_bn":"সালিহকে (পাঠিয়েছিলাম)","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح2","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":55168,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55169,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"yāqawmi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":55170,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱعْبُدُوا۟","transliteration":"uʿ''budū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ইবাদত করো","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55171,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":55172,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":55173,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55174,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"অন্য কোন","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55175,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهٍ","trans