","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55189,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":55190,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55191,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"قَرِيبٌۭ","transliteration":"qarībun","translation_bn":"নিকটেই (আছেন)","root":"قرب","lemma":"قَرِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":55192,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"مُّجِيبٌۭ","transliteration":"mujībun","translation_bn":"যিনি ডাকের সাড়া দেন\"","root":"جوب","lemma":"مُّجِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55193,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٦١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬১)","root":"—","lemma":"٦١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-ilā thamūda akhāhum ṣāliḥan qāla yāqawmi uʿ''budū l-laha mā lakum min ilāhin ghayruhu huwa ansha-akum mina l-arḍi wa-is''taʿmarakum fīhā fa-is''taghfirūhu thumma tūbū ilayhi inna rabbī qarībun mujībun', 'আমি সামূদ জাতির কাছে তাদের ভাই সালিহকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম। সে বলল, ‘হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা আল্লাহর ‘ইবাদাত কর, তিনি ছাড়া তোমাদের আর কোন ইলাহ নেই, তিনিই তোমাদেরকে মাটি থেকে পয়দা করেছেন, আর তাতেই তোমাদেরকে প্রতিষ্ঠিত করেছেন, কাজেই তাঁর কাছে তোমরা ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা কর, আর তাঁর পানেই ফিরে এসো, আমার প্রতিপালক তো অতি নিকটে, আর তিনি আহবানে সাড়াদানকারী।’', 'And to Thamud [We sent] their brother Salih. He said, "O my people, worship Allah; you have no deity other than Him. He has produced you from the earth and settled you in it, so ask forgiveness of Him and then repent to Him. Indeed, my Lord is near and responsive."', 'আমি সামূদ জাতির কাছে তাদের ভাই সালিহকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম। সে বলল, ‘হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা আল্লাহর ‘ইবাদাত কর, তিনি ছাড়া তোমাদের আর কোন ইলাহ নেই, তিনিই তোমাদেরকে মাটি থেকে পয়দা করেছেন, আর তাতেই তোমাদেরকে প্রতিষ্ঠিত করেছেন, কাজেই তাঁর কাছে তোমরা ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা কর, আর তাঁর পানেই ফিরে এসো, আমার প্রতিপালক তো অতি নিকটে, আর তিনি আহবানে সাড়াদানকারী।’', 'And to Thamud [We sent] their brother Salih. He said, "O my people, worship Allah; you have no deity other than Him. He has produced you from the earth and settled you in it, so ask forgiveness of Him and then repent to Him. Indeed, my Lord is near and responsive."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011061.mp3', now()),
  (11, 62, '', '[{"id":55738,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55739,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰصَـٰلِحُ","transliteration":"yāṣāliḥu","translation_bn":"হে সালিহ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح2","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":55740,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":55741,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كُنتَ","transliteration":"kunta","translation_bn":"তুমি ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55742,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِينَا","transliteration":"fīnā","translation_bn":"আমাদের মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55743,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَرْجُوًّۭا","transliteration":"marjuwwan","translation_bn":"ভরসা","root":"رجو","lemma":"مَرْجُوّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55744,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلَ","transliteration":"qabla","translation_bn":"পূর্বে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":55745,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَآ ۖ","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":55747,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَتَنْهَىٰنَآ","transliteration":"atanhānā","translation_bn":"আমাদেরকে কি নিষেধ করছো","root":"نهي","lemma":"نَهَىٰ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":55748,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":55749,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"نَّعْبُدَ","transliteration":"naʿbuda","translation_bn":"আমরা উপাসনা করি","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55750,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যার","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":55751,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَعْبُدُ","transliteration":"yaʿbudu","translation_bn":"ইবাদাত করেছে","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55752,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ءَابَآؤُنَا","transliteration":"ābāunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের পূর্বপুরুষেরা","root":"ابو","lemma":"ا^بَاء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55753,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّنَا","transliteration":"wa-innanā","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55754,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَفِى","transliteration":"lafī","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই মধ্যে আছি","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":55755,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"شَكٍّۢ","transliteration":"shakkin","translation_bn":"সন্দেহের","root":"شكك","lemma":"شَكّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55756,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55757,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"تَدْعُونَآ","transliteration":"tadʿūnā","translation_bn":"আমাদের তুমি আহ্বান করছো","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55758,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"যার দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55759,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مُرِيبٍۢ","transliteration":"murībin","translation_bn":"বিভ্রান্তিকর\"","root":"ريب","lemma":"مُرِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55760,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"٦٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬২)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū yāṣāliḥu qad kunta fīnā marjuwwan qabla hādhā atanhānā an naʿbuda mā yaʿbudu ābāunā wa-innanā lafī shakkin mimmā tadʿūnā ilayhi murībin', 'তারা বলল, ‘‘হে সালিহ! এর পূর্বে তুমি তো আমাদের মাঝে ছিলে আশা-আকাঙ্ক্ষার পাত্র, তুমি কি আমাদেরকে সেই মা‘বূদদের ‘ইবাদাত করতে নিষেধ করছ আমাদের পিতৃ পুরুষরা যার ‘ইবাদাত করত? তুমি আমাদেরকে যে দিকে ডাকছ সে সম্পর্কে আমরা বিভ্রান্তিকর সংশয়ে পড়ে আছি।', 'They said, "O Salih, you were among us a man of promise before this. Do you forbid us to worship what our fathers worshipped? And indeed we are, about that to which you invite us, in disquieting doubt."', 'তারা বলল, ‘‘হে সালিহ! এর পূর্বে তুমি তো আমাদের মাঝে ছিলে আশা-আকাঙ্ক্ষার পাত্র, তুমি কি আমাদেরকে সেই মা‘বূদদের ‘ইবাদাত করতে নিষেধ করছ আমাদের পিতৃ পুরুষরা যার ‘ইবাদাত করত? তুমি আমাদেরকে যে দিকে ডাকছ সে সম্পর্কে আমরা বিভ্রান্তিকর সংশয়ে পড়ে আছি।', 'They said, "O Salih, you were among us a man of promise before this. Do you forbid us to worship what our fathers worshipped? And indeed we are, about that to which you invite us, in disquieting doubt."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011062.mp3', now()),
  (11, 63, '', '[{"id":56240,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56241,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"yāqawmi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":56242,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَرَءَيْتُمْ","transliteration":"ara-aytum","translation_bn":"তোমরা (ভেবে) দেখেছো কি","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":56243,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":56244,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُ","transliteration":"kuntu","translation_bn":"আমি থাকি","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56245,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56246,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَيِّنَةٍۢ","transliteration":"bayyinatin","translation_bn":"স্পষ্ট প্রমাণের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56247,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56248,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56249,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَءَاتَىٰنِى","transliteration":"waātānī","translation_bn":"এবং তিনি আমাকে দান করে থাকেন","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56250,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"তাঁর পক্ষ হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56251,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"رَحْمَةًۭ","transliteration":"raḥmatan","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56252,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَمَن","transliteration":"faman","translation_bn":"তবে কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56253,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَنصُرُنِى","transliteration":"yanṣurunī","translation_bn":"আমাকে সাহায্য করবে","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56254,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56255,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":56256,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":56257,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"عَصَيْتُهُۥ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿaṣaytuhu","translation_bn":"তার আমি অবাধ্য হই","root":"عصي","lemma":"عَصَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56259,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"فَمَا","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"অতএব না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56260,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"تَزِيدُونَنِى","transliteration":"tazīdūnanī","translation_bn":"আমাকে বৃদ্ধি করবে তোমরা","root":"زيد","lemma":"زَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56261,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرَ","transliteration":"ghayra","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56262,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"تَخْسِيرٍۢ","transliteration":"takhsīrin","translation_bn":"ক্ষতি","root":"خسر","lemma":"تَخْسِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56263,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٦٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla yāqawmi ara-aytum in kuntu ʿalā bayyinatin min rabbī waātānī min''hu raḥmatan faman yanṣurunī mina l-lahi in ʿaṣaytuhu famā tazīdūnanī ghayra takhsīrin', 'সালিহ বলল, ‘‘হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা কি চিন্তা করে দেখেছ, যদি আমি আমার প্রতপালকের সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণের উপর থাকি আর তাঁর পক্ষ থেকে আমাকে অনুগ্রহ করা হয়, এমতাবস্থায় আমি যদি তার অবাধ্য হই তাহলে আল্লাহর (‘আযাব) থেকে আমাকে কে রক্ষা করবে? তোমরা তো কেবল আমার ক্ষতিই বাড়িয়ে দিতে চাও।', 'He said, "O my people, have you considered: if I should be upon clear evidence from my Lord and He has given me mercy from Himself, who would protect me from Allah if I disobeyed Him? So you would not increase me except in loss.', 'সালিহ বলল, ‘‘হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা কি চিন্তা করে দেখেছ, যদি আমি আমার প্রতপালকের সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণের উপর থাকি আর তাঁর পক্ষ থেকে আমাকে অনুগ্রহ করা হয়, এমতাবস্থায় আমি যদি তার অবাধ্য হই তাহলে আল্লাহর (‘আযাব) থেকে আমাকে কে রক্ষা করবে? তোমরা তো কেবল আমার ক্ষতিই বাড়িয়ে দিতে চাও।', 'He said, "O my people, have you considered: if I should be upon clear evidence from my Lord and He has given me mercy from Himself, who would protect me from Allah if I disobeyed Him? So you would not increase me except in loss.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011063.mp3', now()),
  (11, 64, '', '[{"id":56741,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"wayāqawmi","translation_bn":"এবং হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56742,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذِهِۦ","transliteration":"hādhihi","translation_bn":"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":56743,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نَاقَةُ","transliteration":"nāqatu","translation_bn":"উষ্ট্রী","root":"نوق","lemma":"نَاقَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56744,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর (পক্ষ হ''তে)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":56745,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56746,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَةًۭ","transliteration":"āyatan","translation_bn":"একটি নিদর্শন","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56747,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَذَرُوهَا","transliteration":"fadharūhā","translation_bn":"অতএব তাকে ছেড়ে দাও","root":"وذر","lemma":"يَذَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56748,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَأْكُلْ","transliteration":"takul","translation_bn":"সে খাবে","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56749,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56750,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَرْضِ","transliteration":"arḍi","translation_bn":"জমির","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56751,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":56752,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56753,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَمَسُّوهَا","transliteration":"tamassūhā","translation_bn":"তাকে স্পর্শ করবে","root":"مسس","lemma":"مَسَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56754,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِسُوٓءٍۢ","transliteration":"bisūin","translation_bn":"নিয়ে খারাপ উদ্দেশ্যে","root":"سوا","lemma":"سُو^ء","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56755,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَيَأْخُذَكُمْ","transliteration":"fayakhudhakum","translation_bn":"তাহ''লে তোমাদেরকে ধরবে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":56756,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56757,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"قَرِيبٌۭ","transliteration":"qarībun","translation_bn":"শীঘ্রই\"","root":"قرب","lemma":"قَرِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":56758,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٦٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayāqawmi hādhihi nāqatu l-lahi lakum āyatan fadharūhā takul fī arḍi l-lahi walā tamassūhā bisūin fayakhudhakum ʿadhābun qarībun', 'হে আমার জাতির লোকেরা! এটা আল্লাহর উষ্ট্রী, তোমাদের জন্য একটা নিদর্শন। একে আল্লাহর যমীনে চলে ফিরে খেয়ে বেড়াতে দাও, একে কোন প্রকার কষ্ট দিও না, নচেৎ শীঘ্রই তোমাদেরকে ‘আযাব পাকড়াও করবে।’', 'And O my people, this is the she-camel of Allah - [she is] to you a sign. So let her feed upon Allah ''s earth and do not touch her with harm, or you will be taken by an impending punishment."', 'হে আমার জাতির লোকেরা! এটা আল্লাহর উষ্ট্রী, তোমাদের জন্য একটা নিদর্শন। একে আল্লাহর যমীনে চলে ফিরে খেয়ে বেড়াতে দাও, একে কোন প্রকার কষ্ট দিও না, নচেৎ শীঘ্রই তোমাদেরকে ‘আযাব পাকড়াও করবে।’', 'And O my people, this is the she-camel of Allah - [she is] to you a sign. So let her feed upon Allah ''s earth and do not touch her with harm, or you will be taken by an impending punishment."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011064.mp3', now()),
  (11, 65, '', '[{"id":57280,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَعَقَرُوهَا","transliteration":"faʿaqarūhā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তাকে তারা হত্যা করলো","root":"عقر","lemma":"عَقَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57281,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فَقَالَ","transliteration":"faqāla","translation_bn":"তখন সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57282,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَمَتَّعُوا۟","transliteration":"tamattaʿū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা জীবন উপভোগ করো","root":"متع","lemma":"تَمَتَّعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57283,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57284,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"دَارِكُمْ","transliteration":"dārikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের ঘরের","root":"دور","lemma":"دَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57285,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ثَلَـٰثَةَ","transliteration":"thalāthata","translation_bn":"তিন","root":"ثلث","lemma":"ثَلَٰثَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57286,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَيَّامٍۢ ۖ","transliteration":"ayyāmin","translation_bn":"দিন (পর্যন্ত)","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57288,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":57289,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَعْدٌ","transliteration":"waʿdun","translation_bn":"একটি প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57290,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرُ","transliteration":"ghayru","translation_bn":"নয়","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57291,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَكْذُوبٍۢ","transliteration":"makdhūbin","translation_bn":"মিথ্যা হওয়ার\"","root":"كذب","lemma":"مَكْذُوب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57292,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٦٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'faʿaqarūhā faqāla tamattaʿū fī dārikum thalāthata ayyāmin dhālika waʿdun ghayru makdhūbin', 'কিন্তু তারা উষ্ট্রীটির পাগুলো কেটে ফেলল। তখন সে তাদেরকে বলল, ‘তোমরা তোমাদের ঘরে তিনটি দিন জীবন উপভোগ করে নাও, এটা এমন এক ও‘য়াদা যা মিথ্যে হতে পারে না।’', 'But they hamstrung her, so he said, "Enjoy yourselves in your homes for three days. That is a promise not to be denied."', 'কিন্তু তারা উষ্ট্রীটির পাগুলো কেটে ফেলল। তখন সে তাদেরকে বলল, ‘তোমরা তোমাদের ঘরে তিনটি দিন জীবন উপভোগ করে নাও, এটা এমন এক ও‘য়াদা যা মিথ্যে হতে পারে না।’', 'But they hamstrung her, so he said, "Enjoy yourselves in your homes for three days. That is a promise not to be denied."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011065.mp3', now()),
  (11, 66, '', '[{"id":57801,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57802,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"আসলো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57803,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرُنَا","transliteration":"amrunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের নির্দেশ (শাস্তি দেয়ার)","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57804,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"نَجَّيْنَا","transliteration":"najjaynā","translation_bn":"আমরা রক্ষা করলাম","root":"نجو","lemma":"نَجَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57805,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","translation_bn":"সালিহকে","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح2","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":57806,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"ও যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57807,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছিলো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57808,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَعَهُۥ","transliteration":"maʿahu","translation_bn":"তার সাথে (তাদেরকেও)","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":57809,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِرَحْمَةٍۢ","transliteration":"biraḥmatin","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ দিয়ে","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57810,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَّا","transliteration":"minnā","translation_bn":"আমাদের পক্ষ থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57811,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنْ","transliteration":"wamin","translation_bn":"এবং হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57812,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"خِزْىِ","transliteration":"khiz''yi","translation_bn":"লাঞ্ছনা","root":"خزي","lemma":"خِزْى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57813,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمِئِذٍ ۗ","transliteration":"yawmi-idhin","translation_bn":"সেদিনের","root":"—","lemma":"يَوْمَئِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":57815,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":57816,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّكَ","transliteration":"rabbaka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57817,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":57818,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوِىُّ","transliteration":"l-qawiyu","translation_bn":"শক্তিমান","root":"قوي","lemma":"قَوِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57819,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَزِيزُ","transliteration":"l-ʿazīzu","translation_bn":"পরাক্রমশালী","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57820,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٦٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā jāa amrunā najjaynā ṣāliḥan wa-alladhīna āmanū maʿahu biraḥmatin minnā wamin khiz''yi yawmi-idhin inna rabbaka huwa l-qawiyu l-ʿazīzu', 'অতঃপর আমার হুকুম যখন আসল তখন আমি সালিহ আর তার সঙ্গে যারা ঈমান এনেছিল তাদেরকে আমার দয়ায় বাঁচিয়ে নিলাম আর সে দিনের লাঞ্ছনা হতে রক্ষা করলাম। তোমার প্রতিপালক তিনিই তো শক্তিশালী, প্রতাপশালী।', 'So when Our command came, We saved Salih and those who believed with him, by mercy from Us, and [saved them] from the disgrace of that day. Indeed, it is your Lord who is the Powerful, the Exalted in Might.', 'অতঃপর আমার হুকুম যখন আসল তখন আমি সালিহ আর তার সঙ্গে যারা ঈমান এনেছিল তাদেরকে আমার দয়ায় বাঁচিয়ে নিলাম আর সে দিনের লাঞ্ছনা হতে রক্ষা করলাম। তোমার প্রতিপালক তিনিই তো শক্তিশালী, প্রতাপশালী।', 'So when Our command came, We saved Salih and those who believed with him, by mercy from Us, and [saved them] from the disgrace of that day. Indeed, it is your Lord who is the Powerful, the Exalted in Might.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011066.mp3', now()),
  (11, 67, '', '[{"id":58291,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَخَذَ","transliteration":"wa-akhadha","translation_bn":"এবং ধরলো","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58292,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":58293,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَمُوا۟","transliteration":"ẓalamū","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘন করেছিলো","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58294,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّيْحَةُ","transliteration":"l-ṣayḥatu","translation_bn":"প্রচন্ড শব্দে","root":"صيح","lemma":"صَيْحَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58295,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَأَصْبَحُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-aṣbaḥū","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তা হয়ে গেলো","root":"صبح","lemma":"أَصْبَحَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58296,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58297,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"دِيَـٰرِهِمْ","transliteration":"diyārihim","translation_bn":"তাদের ঘরসমূহের","root":"دور","lemma":"دَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58298,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"جَـٰثِمِينَ","transliteration":"jāthimīna","translation_bn":"উপুড় হয়ে পড়া (নিস্পন্দ-নির্জীব)","root":"جثم","lemma":"جَٰثِمِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58299,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٦٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-akhadha alladhīna ẓalamū l-ṣayḥatu fa-aṣbaḥū fī diyārihim jāthimīna', 'যারা যুলম করেছিল এক প্রচন্ড শব্দ তাদেরকে আঘাত হানল, আর তারা নিজ নিজ গৃহে নতজানু হয়ে পড়ে রইল-', 'And the shriek seized those who had wronged, and they became within their homes [corpses] fallen prone', 'যারা যুলম করেছিল এক প্রচন্ড শব্দ তাদেরকে আঘাত হানল, আর তারা নিজ নিজ গৃহে নতজানু হয়ে পড়ে রইল-', 'And the shriek seized those who had wronged, and they became within their homes [corpses] fallen prone', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011067.mp3', now()),
  (11, 68, '', '[{"id":58688,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"كَأَن","transliteration":"ka-an","translation_bn":"যেন","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58689,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَّمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"করেনি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":58690,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَغْنَوْا۟","transliteration":"yaghnaw","translation_bn":"তারা বসবাস","root":"غني","lemma":"أَغْنَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58691,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَآ ۗ","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58693,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَلَآ","transliteration":"alā","translation_bn":"সাবধান","root":"—","lemma":"أَلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":58694,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":58695,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ثَمُودَا۟","transliteration":"thamūdā","translation_bn":"সামূদ জাতি","root":"—","lemma":"ثَمُود","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":58696,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছিলো","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58697,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّهُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"rabbahum","translation_bn":"তাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58699,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَلَا","transliteration":"alā","translation_bn":"জেনে রাখো","root":"—","lemma":"أَلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":58700,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بُعْدًۭا","transliteration":"buʿ''dan","translation_bn":"ধ্বংস (করা হয়েছিলো)","root":"بعد","lemma":"بُعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58701,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِّثَمُودَ","transliteration":"lithamūda","translation_bn":"সামুদ জাতির জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"ثَمُود","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58702,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٦٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ka-an lam yaghnaw fīhā alā inna thamūdā kafarū rabbahum alā buʿ''dan lithamūda', 'যেন তারা সেখানে কোন দিনই বাস করেনি। জেনে রেখ, সামুদজাতি তাদের প্রতিপালককে অমান্য করেছিল। জেনে রেখ, সামূদকে (রহমাত থেকে) দূরে নিক্ষেপ করা হয়েছিল।', 'As if they had never prospered therein. Unquestionably, Thamud denied their Lord; then, away with Thamud.', 'যেন তারা সেখানে কোন দিনই বাস করেনি। জেনে রেখ, সামুদজাতি তাদের প্রতিপালককে অমান্য করেছিল। জেনে রেখ, সামূদকে (রহমাত থেকে) দূরে নিক্ষেপ করা হয়েছিল।', 'As if they had never prospered therein. Unquestionably, Thamud denied their Lord; then, away with Thamud.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011068.mp3', now()),
  (11, 69, '', '[{"id":59256,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"মধ্যে নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59257,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَتْ","transliteration":"jāat","translation_bn":"এসেছিলো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59258,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رُسُلُنَآ","transliteration":"rusulunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের ফেরেশতারা","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59259,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","transliteration":"ib''rāhīma","translation_bn":"ইবরাহীমের কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":59260,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْبُشْرَىٰ","transliteration":"bil-bush''rā","translation_bn":"নিয়ে সুসংবাদ","root":"بشر","lemma":"بُشْرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59261,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59262,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"سَلَـٰمًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"salāman","translation_bn":"\"সালাম (বর্ষিত হোক)\"","root":"سلم","lemma":"سَلَٰم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59264,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(ইবরাহীম) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59265,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"سَلَـٰمٌۭ ۖ","transliteration":"salāmun","translation_bn":"\"সালাম (বর্ষিত হোক)\"","root":"سلم","lemma":"سَلَٰم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59267,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَمَا","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59268,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَبِثَ","transliteration":"labitha","translation_bn":"সে বিলম্ব করলো","root":"لبث","lemma":"لَبِثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59269,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":59270,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"সে আসলো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59271,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِعِجْلٍ","transliteration":"biʿij''lin","translation_bn":"নিয়ে এক বাছুর","root":"عجل","lemma":"عِجْل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59272,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"حَنِيذٍۢ","transliteration":"ḥanīdhin","translation_bn":"ভুনা (মেহমানদারীর জন্যে)","root":"حنذ","lemma":"حَنِيذ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":59273,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٦٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad jāat rusulunā ib''rāhīma bil-bush''rā qālū salāman qāla salāmun famā labitha an jāa biʿij''lin ḥanīdhin', 'আমার প্রেরিত ফেরেশতাগণ ইবরাহীমের কাছে সুসংবাদ নিয়ে এসেছিল। তারা এসে বলল ‘‘তোমার প্রতি সালাম! সেও বলল, ‘তোমাদের প্রতিও সালাম!’ অনতিবিলম্বে সে ভুনা করা বাছুর নিয়ে আসলো।', 'And certainly did Our messengers come to Abraham with good tidings; they said, "Peace." He said, "Peace," and did not delay in bringing [them] a roasted calf.', 'আমার প্রেরিত ফেরেশতাগণ ইবরাহীমের কাছে সুসংবাদ নিয়ে এসেছিল। তারা এসে বলল ‘‘তোমার প্রতি সালাম! সেও বলল, ‘তোমাদের প্রতিও সালাম!’ অনতিবিলম্বে সে ভুনা করা বাছুর নিয়ে আসলো।', 'And certainly did Our messengers come to Abraham with good tidings; they said, "Peace." He said, "Peace," and did not delay in bringing [them] a roasted calf.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011069.mp3', now()),
  (11, 70, '', '[{"id":59625,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59626,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَءَآ","transliteration":"raā","translation_bn":"সে দেখলো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59627,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَيْدِيَهُمْ","transliteration":"aydiyahum","translation_bn":"তাদের হাতগুলো","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59628,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":59629,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَصِلُ","transliteration":"taṣilu","translation_bn":"প্রসারিত হচ্ছে","root":"وصل","lemma":"يَصِلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59630,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"তার দিকে (খানা খেতে)","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59631,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نَكِرَهُمْ","transliteration":"nakirahum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে সে সন্দেহ করলো","root":"نكر","lemma":"نَكِرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59632,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَأَوْجَسَ","transliteration":"wa-awjasa","translation_bn":"ও মনে সঞ্চার হলো","root":"وجس","lemma":"أَوْجَسَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59633,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59634,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"خِيفَةًۭ ۚ","transliteration":"khīfatan","translation_bn":"ভয়","root":"خوف","lemma":"خِيفَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59636,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59637,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":59638,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَخَفْ","transliteration":"takhaf","translation_bn":"ভয় করো","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59639,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّآ","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":59640,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أُرْسِلْنَآ","transliteration":"ur''sil''nā","translation_bn":"আমরা প্রেরিত হয়েছি","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59641,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59642,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمِ","transliteration":"qawmi","translation_bn":"জাতির","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59643,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"لُوطٍۢ","transliteration":"lūṭin","translation_bn":"লুতের\"","root":"—","lemma":"لُوط","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":59644,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٧٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭০)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā raā aydiyahum lā taṣilu ilayhi nakirahum wa-awjasa min''hum khīfatan qālū lā takhaf innā ur''sil''nā ilā qawmi lūṭin', 'যখন সে দেখল তাদের হাত তার (অর্থাৎ খাবারের) দিকে পৌঁছতেছে না, সে তাদের সম্পর্কে সন্দিগ্ধ হল আর তাদের ব্যাপারে ভীতি অনুভব করল। তারা বলল, ‘ভয় পেয়ো না, আমাদেরকে পাঠানো হয়েছে লূতের সম্প্রদায়ের প্রতি।’', 'But when he saw their hands not reaching for it, he distrusted them and felt from them apprehension. They said, "Fear not. We have been sent to the people of Lot."', 'যখন সে দেখল তাদের হাত তার (অর্থাৎ খাবারের) দিকে পৌঁছতেছে না, সে তাদের সম্পর্কে সন্দিগ্ধ হল আর তাদের ব্যাপারে ভীতি অনুভব করল। তারা বলল, ‘ভয় পেয়ো না, আমাদেরকে পাঠানো হয়েছে লূতের সম্প্রদায়ের প্রতি।’', 'But when he saw their hands not reaching for it, he distrusted them and felt from them apprehension. They said, "Fear not. We have been sent to the people of Lot."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011070.mp3', now()),
  (11, 71, '', '[{"id":60217,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱمْرَأَتُهُۥ","transliteration":"wa-im''ra-atuhu","translation_bn":"এবং তার স্ত্রীও (সেখানে)","root":"مرا","lemma":"ٱمْرَأَت","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60218,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَآئِمَةٌۭ","transliteration":"qāimatun","translation_bn":"দন্ডায়মান ছিলো","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَا^ئِمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60219,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَضَحِكَتْ","transliteration":"faḍaḥikat","translation_bn":"তখন সে হাসলো (কারণ ভয় দূর হলো)","root":"ضحك","lemma":"ضَحِكَتْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60220,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَبَشَّرْنَـٰهَا","transliteration":"fabasharnāhā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তাকে আমরা সুসংবাদ দিলাম","root":"بشر","lemma":"بُشِّرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60221,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِإِسْحَـٰقَ","transliteration":"bi-is''ḥāqa","translation_bn":"ইসহাক সম্বন্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"إِسْحَاق","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60222,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمِن","transliteration":"wamin","translation_bn":"ও থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60223,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَرَآءِ","transliteration":"warāi","translation_bn":"পিছন","root":"وري","lemma":"وَرَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60224,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِسْحَـٰقَ","transliteration":"is''ḥāqa","translation_bn":"ইসহাকের","root":"—","lemma":"إِسْحَاق","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":60225,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَعْقُوبَ","transliteration":"yaʿqūba","translation_bn":"ইয়াকুবের","root":"—","lemma":"يَعْقُوب","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":60226,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٧١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭১)","root":"—","lemma":"٧١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-im''ra-atuhu qāimatun faḍaḥikat fabasharnāhā bi-is''ḥāqa wamin warāi is''ḥāqa yaʿqūba', '(ইবরাহীমের) স্ত্রী দাঁড়িয়েছিল, সে হেসে ফেলল। তখন আমি তাকে ইসহাকের আর ইসহাকের পর ইয়া‘কূবের সুসংবাদ দিলাম।', 'And his Wife was standing, and she smiled. Then We gave her good tidings of Isaac and after Isaac, Jacob.', '(ইবরাহীমের) স্ত্রী দাঁড়িয়েছিল, সে হেসে ফেলল। তখন আমি তাকে ইসহাকের আর ইসহাকের পর ইয়া‘কূবের সুসংবাদ দিলাম।', 'And his Wife was standing, and she smiled. Then We gave her good tidings of Isaac and after Isaac, Jacob.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011071.mp3', now()),
  (11, 72, '', '[{"id":60388,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَتْ","transliteration":"qālat","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60389,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰوَيْلَتَىٰٓ","transliteration":"yāwaylatā","translation_bn":"\"হায়, কি আশ্চর্য!","root":"—","lemma":"وَيْل","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":60390,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَأَلِدُ","transliteration":"a-alidu","translation_bn":"আমি কি সন্তান প্রসব করবো","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَلَدَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":60391,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَا۠","transliteration":"wa-anā","translation_bn":"অথচ আমি","root":"—","lemma":"وَأَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":60392,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَجُوزٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿajūzun","translation_bn":"বৃদ্ধা","root":"عجز","lemma":"عَجُوز","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60393,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَهَـٰذَا","transliteration":"wahādhā","translation_bn":"এবং এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60394,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَعْلِى","transliteration":"baʿlī","translation_bn":"আমার স্বামী","root":"بعل","lemma":"بَعْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60395,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"شَيْخًا ۖ","transliteration":"shaykhan","translation_bn":"বৃদ্ধ","root":"شيخ","lemma":"شَيْخ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":60397,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":60398,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":60399,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَشَىْءٌ","transliteration":"lashayon","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই ব্যাপার","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":60400,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَجِيبٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿajībun","translation_bn":"অদ্ভুত\"","root":"عجب","lemma":"عَجِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":60401,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٧٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭২)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālat yāwaylatā a-alidu wa-anā ʿajūzun wahādhā baʿlī shaykhan inna hādhā lashayon ʿajībun', 'সে বলল, ‘হায় আমার কপাল! সন্তান হবে আমার, আমি তো অতি বুড়ি আর আমার এই স্বামীও বৃদ্ধ, এতো এক আশ্চর্য ব্যাপার।’', 'She said, "Woe to me! Shall I give birth while I am an old woman and this, my husband, is an old man? Indeed, this is an amazing thing!"', 'সে বলল, ‘হায় আমার কপাল! সন্তান হবে আমার, আমি তো অতি বুড়ি আর আমার এই স্বামীও বৃদ্ধ, এতো এক আশ্চর্য ব্যাপার।’', 'She said, "Woe to me! Shall I give birth while I am an old woman and this, my husband, is an old man? Indeed, this is an amazing thing!"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011072.mp3', now()),
  (11, 73, '', '[{"id":61176,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61177,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَتَعْجَبِينَ","transliteration":"ataʿjabīna","translation_bn":"\"তুমি বিস্মিত হচ্ছো কি","root":"عجب","lemma":"عَجِبُ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":61178,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61179,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرِ","transliteration":"amri","translation_bn":"নির্দেশ","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61180,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61182,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَحْمَتُ","transliteration":"raḥmatu","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61183,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61184,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَبَرَكَـٰتُهُۥ","transliteration":"wabarakātuhu","translation_bn":"এবং তার কল্যাণসমূহ (হ''তেও)","root":"برك","lemma":"بَرَكَٰت","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61185,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61186,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلَ","transliteration":"ahla","translation_bn":"বাসিন্দারা","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61187,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَيْتِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-bayti","translation_bn":"ঘরের","root":"بيت","lemma":"بَيْت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61189,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"তিনি নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":61190,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"حَمِيدٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥamīdun","translation_bn":"প্রশংসিত","root":"حمد","lemma":"حَمِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61191,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مَّجِيدٌۭ","transliteration":"majīdun","translation_bn":"মহান মহিমাময়\"","root":"مجد","lemma":"مَّجِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":61192,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٧٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū ataʿjabīna min amri l-lahi raḥmatu l-lahi wabarakātuhu ʿalaykum ahla l-bayti innahu ḥamīdun majīdun', 'তারা বলল, ‘আল্লাহর কাজে তুমি আশ্চর্য হচ্ছ, ওহে (ইবরাহীমের) পরিবারবর্গ! তোমাদের উপর রয়েছে আল্লাহর দয়া ও বরকতসমূহ, তিনি বড়ই প্রশংসিত, বড়ই মহান।’', 'They said, "Are you amazed at the decree of Allah? May the mercy of Allah and His blessings be upon you, people of the house. Indeed, He is Praiseworthy and Honorable."', 'তারা বলল, ‘আল্লাহর কাজে তুমি আশ্চর্য হচ্ছ, ওহে (ইবরাহীমের) পরিবারবর্গ! তোমাদের উপর রয়েছে আল্লাহর দয়া ও বরকতসমূহ, তিনি বড়ই প্রশংসিত, বড়ই মহান।’', 'They said, "Are you amazed at the decree of Allah? May the mercy of Allah and His blessings be upon you, people of the house. Indeed, He is Praiseworthy and Honorable."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011073.mp3', now()),
  (11, 74, '', '[{"id":61623,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61624,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ذَهَبَ","transliteration":"dhahaba","translation_bn":"দূর হলো","root":"ذهب","lemma":"ذَهَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61625,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَنْ","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61626,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","transliteration":"ib''rāhīma","translation_bn":"ইবরাহীম","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61627,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّوْعُ","transliteration":"l-rawʿu","translation_bn":"ভয়","root":"روع","lemma":"رَّوْع","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61628,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَجَآءَتْهُ","transliteration":"wajāathu","translation_bn":"এবং তার কাছে আসলো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61629,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبُشْرَىٰ","transliteration":"l-bush''rā","translation_bn":"সুসংবাদ","root":"بشر","lemma":"بُشْرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61630,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يُجَـٰدِلُنَا","transliteration":"yujādilunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের সাথে সে তর্ক করতে লাগলো","root":"جدل","lemma":"جَٰدَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61631,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61632,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمِ","transliteration":"qawmi","translation_bn":"জাতির","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61633,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لُوطٍ","transliteration":"lūṭin","translation_bn":"লুতের","root":"—","lemma":"لُوط","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61634,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٧٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā dhahaba ʿan ib''rāhīma l-rawʿu wajāathu l-bush''rā yujādilunā fī qawmi lūṭin', 'পরে যখন ইবরাহীমের আতঙ্ক দূর হল, আর তার কাছে সুসংবাদ আসল, তখন সে লূত জাতির ব্যাপারে আমার সাথে ঝগড়া করল।', 'And when the fright had left Abraham and the good tidings had reached him, he began to argue with Us concerning the people of Lot.', 'পরে যখন ইবরাহীমের আতঙ্ক দূর হল, আর তার কাছে সুসংবাদ আসল, তখন সে লূত জাতির ব্যাপারে আমার সাথে ঝগড়া করল।', 'And when the fright had left Abraham and the good tidings had reached him, he began to argue with Us concerning the people of Lot.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011074.mp3', now()),
  (11, 75, '', '[{"id":62271,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":62272,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","transliteration":"ib''rāhīma","translation_bn":"ইবরাহীম (ছিলো)","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":62273,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَحَلِيمٌ","transliteration":"laḥalīmun","translation_bn":"সহনশীল অবশ্যই","root":"حلم","lemma":"حَلِيم","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":62274,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَوَّٰهٌۭ","transliteration":"awwāhun","translation_bn":"কোমল হৃদয়ের","root":"اوه","lemma":"أَوَّٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62275,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مُّنِيبٌۭ","transliteration":"munībun","translation_bn":"(আল্লাহ) অভিমূখী","root":"نوب","lemma":"مُّنِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62276,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٧٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna ib''rāhīma laḥalīmun awwāhun munībun', 'অবশ্যই ইবরাহীম ছিল বড়ই সহিষ্ণু, কোমল হৃদয় আর আল্লাহমুখী।', 'Indeed, Abraham was forbearing, grieving and [frequently] returning [to Allah].', 'অবশ্যই ইবরাহীম ছিল বড়ই সহিষ্ণু, কোমল হৃদয় আর আল্লাহমুখী।', 'Indeed, Abraham was forbearing, grieving and [frequently] returning [to Allah].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011075.mp3', now()),
  (11, 76, '', '[{"id":62551,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓإِبْرَٰهِيمُ","transliteration":"yāib''rāhīmu","translation_bn":"(বলা হলো) হে ইবরাহীম","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":62552,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَعْرِضْ","transliteration":"aʿriḍ","translation_bn":"বিরত হও","root":"عرض","lemma":"أَعْرَضَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62553,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَنْ","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62554,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَآ ۖ","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":62556,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":62557,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":62558,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"এসে গেছে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62559,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرُ","transliteration":"amru","translation_bn":"নির্দেশ","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62560,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ ۖ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62562,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"wa-innahum","translation_bn":"এবং তারা নিশ্চয়ই (এমন যে)","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62563,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتِيهِمْ","transliteration":"ātīhim","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর অাসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تِي","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62564,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62565,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرُ","transliteration":"ghayru","translation_bn":"নয়","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62566,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مَرْدُودٍۢ","transliteration":"mardūdin","translation_bn":"প্রতিহত হবার","root":"ردد","lemma":"مَرْدُود","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62567,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٧٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāib''rāhīmu aʿriḍ ʿan hādhā innahu qad jāa amru rabbika wa-innahum ātīhim ʿadhābun ghayru mardūdin', '‘হে ইবরাহীম! এথেকে তুমি নিবৃত্ত হও, তোমার প্রতিপালকের নির্দেশ এসে গেছে, তাদের প্রতি শাস্তি আসবেই যা রদ হবার নয়।', '[The angels said], "O Abraham, give up this [plea]. Indeed, the command of your Lord has come, and indeed, there will reach them a punishment that cannot be repelled."', '‘হে ইবরাহীম! এথেকে তুমি নিবৃত্ত হও, তোমার প্রতিপালকের নির্দেশ এসে গেছে, তাদের প্রতি শাস্তি আসবেই যা রদ হবার নয়।', '[The angels said], "O Abraham, give up this [plea]. Indeed, the command of your Lord has come, and indeed, there will reach them a punishment that cannot be repelled."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011076.mp3', now()),
  (11, 77, '', '[{"id":63108,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمَّا","transliteration":"walammā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63109,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَتْ","transliteration":"jāat","translation_bn":"আসলো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63110,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رُسُلُنَا","transliteration":"rusulunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের ফেরেশতারা","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63111,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لُوطًۭا","transliteration":"lūṭan","translation_bn":"লুতের কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"لُوط","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":63112,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"سِىٓءَ","transliteration":"sīa","translation_bn":"সে মন খারাপ করলো","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63113,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِهِمْ","transliteration":"bihim","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63114,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَضَاقَ","transliteration":"waḍāqa","translation_bn":"ও সে অসমর্থ মনে করলো","root":"ضيق","lemma":"ضَاقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63115,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِهِمْ","transliteration":"bihim","translation_bn":"তাদের ব্যাপারে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63116,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ذَرْعًۭا","transliteration":"dharʿan","translation_bn":"রক্ষা করতে","root":"ذرع","lemma":"ذَرْع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63117,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالَ","transliteration":"waqāla","translation_bn":"এবং বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63118,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"\"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":63119,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمٌ","transliteration":"yawmun","translation_bn":"দিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63120,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَصِيبٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿaṣībun","translation_bn":"ভয়ানক\"","root":"عصب","lemma":"عَصِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":63121,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٧٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walammā jāat rusulunā lūṭan sīa bihim waḍāqa bihim dharʿan waqāla hādhā yawmun ʿaṣībun', 'আমার প্রেরিত বার্তাবাহকগণ যখন লূতের কাছে আসলো, তাদের আগমনে সে ঘাবড়ে গেল। (তাদেরকে রক্ষায়) নিজেকে অসমর্থ মনে করল, আর বলল, ‘আজ বড়ই বিপদের দিন।', 'And when Our messengers, [the angels], came to Lot, he was anguished for them and felt for them great discomfort and said, "This is a trying day."', 'আমার প্রেরিত বার্তাবাহকগণ যখন লূতের কাছে আসলো, তাদের আগমনে সে ঘাবড়ে গেল। (তাদেরকে রক্ষায়) নিজেকে অসমর্থ মনে করল, আর বলল, ‘আজ বড়ই বিপদের দিন।', 'And when Our messengers, [the angels], came to Lot, he was anguished for them and felt for them great discomfort and said, "This is a trying day."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011077.mp3', now()),
