a":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":63574,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مِنكُمْ","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63575,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"رَجُلٌۭ","transliteration":"rajulun","translation_bn":"কোন মানুষ","root":"رجل","lemma":"رَجُل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63576,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"رَّشِيدٌۭ","transliteration":"rashīdun","translation_bn":"সবোধ\"","root":"رشد","lemma":"رَّشِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":63577,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"٧٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wajāahu qawmuhu yuh''raʿūna ilayhi wamin qablu kānū yaʿmalūna l-sayiāti qāla yāqawmi hāulāi banātī hunna aṭharu lakum fa-ittaqū l-laha walā tukh''zūni fī ḍayfī alaysa minkum rajulun rashīdun', 'তার কওমের লোকেরা হুড়মুড় করে তার কাছে ছুটে আসলো, আগে থেকেই তারা এ রকম অসৎ কাজে অভ্যস্ত ছিল। সে বলল, ‘হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! এই আমার (নিজের বা জাতির) কন্যারা আছে, তারা তোমাদের জন্য অধিক পবিত্র (যদি তোমরা বিয়ে কর), কাজেই তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর, আমার মেহমানদের ব্যাপারে আমাকে লজ্জিত করো না, তোমাদের মধ্যে কি ভাল মানুষ একটিও নেই?’', 'And his people came hastening to him, and before [this] they had been doing evil deeds. He said, "O my people, these are my daughters; they are purer for you. So fear Allah and do not disgrace me concerning my guests. Is there not among you a man of reason?"', 'তার কওমের লোকেরা হুড়মুড় করে তার কাছে ছুটে আসলো, আগে থেকেই তারা এ রকম অসৎ কাজে অভ্যস্ত ছিল। সে বলল, ‘হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! এই আমার (নিজের বা জাতির) কন্যারা আছে, তারা তোমাদের জন্য অধিক পবিত্র (যদি তোমরা বিয়ে কর), কাজেই তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর, আমার মেহমানদের ব্যাপারে আমাকে লজ্জিত করো না, তোমাদের মধ্যে কি ভাল মানুষ একটিও নেই?’', 'And his people came hastening to him, and before [this] they had been doing evil deeds. He said, "O my people, these are my daughters; they are purer for you. So fear Allah and do not disgrace me concerning my guests. Is there not among you a man of reason?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011078.mp3', now()),
  (11, 79, '', '[{"id":63990,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63991,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَقَدْ","transliteration":"laqad","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই অবশ্য","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":63992,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلِمْتَ","transliteration":"ʿalim''ta","translation_bn":"তুমি জেনেছো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63993,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":63994,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَنَا","transliteration":"lanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَنَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63995,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63996,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَنَاتِكَ","transliteration":"banātika","translation_bn":"তোমার (জাতির) মেয়েদের","root":"بني","lemma":"بَنَات","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63997,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোন","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63998,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"حَقٍّۢ","transliteration":"ḥaqqin","translation_bn":"আগ্রহ","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63999,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّكَ","transliteration":"wa-innaka","translation_bn":"এবং তুমি নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64000,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَتَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"lataʿlamu","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই জানো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":64001,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"কি","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":64002,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"نُرِيدُ","transliteration":"nurīdu","translation_bn":"চাই আমরা\"","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64003,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٧٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū laqad ʿalim''ta mā lanā fī banātika min ḥaqqin wa-innaka lataʿlamu mā nurīdu', 'তারা বলল, ‘তোমার তো জানাই আছে যে, তোমার (নিজের বা জাতির) কন্যাদের আমাদের কোন দরকার নেই, আমরা কী চাই তাতো তুমি অবশ্যই জান।’', 'They said, "You have already known that we have not concerning your daughters any claim, and indeed, you know what we want."', 'তারা বলল, ‘তোমার তো জানাই আছে যে, তোমার (নিজের বা জাতির) কন্যাদের আমাদের কোন দরকার নেই, আমরা কী চাই তাতো তুমি অবশ্যই জান।’', 'They said, "You have already known that we have not concerning your daughters any claim, and indeed, you know what we want."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011079.mp3', now()),
  (11, 80, '', '[{"id":64192,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64193,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَوْ","transliteration":"law","translation_bn":"\"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":64194,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চিত","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":64195,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِى","transliteration":"lī","translation_bn":"আমার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64196,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِكُمْ","transliteration":"bikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"بِكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64197,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قُوَّةً","transliteration":"quwwatan","translation_bn":"কোন শক্তি","root":"قوي","lemma":"قُوَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64198,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64199,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ءَاوِىٓ","transliteration":"āwī","translation_bn":"আমি আশ্রয় পেতাম","root":"اوي","lemma":"أَوَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64200,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64201,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رُكْنٍۢ","transliteration":"ruk''nin","translation_bn":"কোন (আশ্রয়ের) স্তম্ভের","root":"ركن","lemma":"رُكْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64202,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"شَدِيدٍۢ","transliteration":"shadīdin","translation_bn":"শক্তিশালী\"","root":"شدد","lemma":"شَدِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":64203,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٨٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮০)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla law anna lī bikum quwwatan aw āwī ilā ruk''nin shadīdin', 'সে বলল, ‘তোমাদেরকে দমন করার ক্ষমতা আমার যদি থাকত! অথবা কোন মজবুত আশ্রয়ে যদি আশ্রয় নিতে পারতাম!’', 'He said, "If only I had against you some power or could take refuge in a strong support."', 'সে বলল, ‘তোমাদেরকে দমন করার ক্ষমতা আমার যদি থাকত! অথবা কোন মজবুত আশ্রয়ে যদি আশ্রয় নিতে পারতাম!’', 'He said, "If only I had against you some power or could take refuge in a strong support."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011080.mp3', now()),
  (11, 81, '', '[{"id":64810,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"(আগন্তুকরা) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64811,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰلُوطُ","transliteration":"yālūṭu","translation_bn":"\"হে লুত","root":"—","lemma":"لُوط","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":64812,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":64813,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رُسُلُ","transliteration":"rusulu","translation_bn":"(সবাই) ফেরেশতা","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64814,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64815,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَن","transliteration":"lan","translation_bn":"কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":64816,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَصِلُوٓا۟","transliteration":"yaṣilū","translation_bn":"তারা পৌঁছতে পারবে","root":"وصل","lemma":"يَصِلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64817,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ ۖ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"তোমার কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64819,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَأَسْرِ","transliteration":"fa-asri","translation_bn":"অতএব তুমি বেরিয়ে পড়ো","root":"سري","lemma":"أَسْرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64820,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِأَهْلِكَ","transliteration":"bi-ahlika","translation_bn":"নিয়ে তোমার পরিবার","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64821,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِقِطْعٍۢ","transliteration":"biqiṭ''ʿin","translation_bn":"এক অংশে","root":"قطع","lemma":"قِطْع","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64822,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"কোন","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64823,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلِ","transliteration":"al-layli","translation_bn":"রাতের","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64824,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64825,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَلْتَفِتْ","transliteration":"yaltafit","translation_bn":"ফিরে তাকাবে","root":"لفت","lemma":"يَلْتَفِتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64826,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مِنكُمْ","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64827,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَحَدٌ","transliteration":"aḥadun","translation_bn":"কেউ","root":"احد","lemma":"أَحَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64828,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":64829,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱمْرَأَتَكَ ۖ","transliteration":"im''ra-ataka","translation_bn":"তোমার স্ত্রী (সঙ্গে যাবে না)","root":"مرا","lemma":"ٱمْرَأَت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64831,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"তা নিশ্চয়ই (সিদ্ধান্ত)","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":64832,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مُصِيبُهَا","transliteration":"muṣībuhā","translation_bn":"তার পৌঁছবে (সেই শাস্তি)","root":"صوب","lemma":"مُصِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64833,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":64834,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"أَصَابَهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"aṣābahum","translation_bn":"তাদের পৌঁছবে","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64836,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":64837,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"مَوْعِدَهُمُ","transliteration":"mawʿidahumu","translation_bn":"তাদের নির্ধারিত সময়","root":"وعد","lemma":"مَّوْعِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64838,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصُّبْحُ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ṣub''ḥu","translation_bn":"সকাল","root":"صبح","lemma":"صُبْح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64840,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"أَلَيْسَ","transliteration":"alaysa","translation_bn":"নয় কি","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":64841,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصُّبْحُ","transliteration":"l-ṣub''ḥu","translation_bn":"সকাল","root":"صبح","lemma":"صُبْح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64842,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"بِقَرِيبٍۢ","transliteration":"biqarībin","translation_bn":"নিকটবর্তী\"","root":"قرب","lemma":"قَرِيب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64843,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"٨١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮১)","root":"—","lemma":"٨١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū yālūṭu innā rusulu rabbika lan yaṣilū ilayka fa-asri bi-ahlika biqiṭ''ʿin mina al-layli walā yaltafit minkum aḥadun illā im''ra-ataka innahu muṣībuhā mā aṣābahum inna mawʿidahumu l-ṣub''ḥu alaysa l-ṣub''ḥu biqarībin', 'আগুন্তুকরা বলল, ‘হে লূত! আমরা তোমার প্রতিপালক প্রেরিত বার্তাবাহক, তারা তোমার কাছে কক্ষনো পৌঁছতে পারবে না, কাজেই কিছুটা রাত বাকী থাকতে তুমি তোমার পরিবার-পরিজন নিয়ে বেরিয়ে পড়, তোমাদের কেউ যেন পিছনের দিকে না তাকায়। কিন্তু তোমার স্ত্রী (তোমাদের সঙ্গী হতে পারবে না) তারও তাই ঘটবে, অন্যদের যা ঘটবে। সকাল হল তাদের (শাস্তি আসার) নির্ধারিত সময়, সকাল কি নিকটবর্তী নয়?’', 'The angels said, "O Lot, indeed we are messengers of your Lord; [therefore], they will never reach you. So set out with your family during a portion of the night and let not any among you look back - except your wife; indeed, she will be struck by that which strikes them. Indeed, their appointment is [for] the morning. Is not the morning near?"', 'আগুন্তুকরা বলল, ‘হে লূত! আমরা তোমার প্রতিপালক প্রেরিত বার্তাবাহক, তারা তোমার কাছে কক্ষনো পৌঁছতে পারবে না, কাজেই কিছুটা রাত বাকী থাকতে তুমি তোমার পরিবার-পরিজন নিয়ে বেরিয়ে পড়, তোমাদের কেউ যেন পিছনের দিকে না তাকায়। কিন্তু তোমার স্ত্রী (তোমাদের সঙ্গী হতে পারবে না) তারও তাই ঘটবে, অন্যদের যা ঘটবে। সকাল হল তাদের (শাস্তি আসার) নির্ধারিত সময়, সকাল কি নিকটবর্তী নয়?’', 'The angels said, "O Lot, indeed we are messengers of your Lord; [therefore], they will never reach you. So set out with your family during a portion of the night and let not any among you look back - except your wife; indeed, she will be struck by that which strikes them. Indeed, their appointment is [for] the morning. Is not the morning near?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011081.mp3', now()),
  (11, 82, '', '[{"id":65174,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65175,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"আসলো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65176,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرُنَا","transliteration":"amrunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের নির্দেশ","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65177,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلْنَا","transliteration":"jaʿalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা করলাম","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65178,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰلِيَهَا","transliteration":"ʿāliyahā","translation_bn":"তার উপর দিককে","root":"علو","lemma":"عَالِي","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65179,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سَافِلَهَا","transliteration":"sāfilahā","translation_bn":"তার নিচের দিকে","root":"سفل","lemma":"سَافِل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65180,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَأَمْطَرْنَا","transliteration":"wa-amṭarnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা বর্ষণ করলাম","root":"مطر","lemma":"أُمْطِرَتْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65181,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهَا","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65182,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"حِجَارَةًۭ","transliteration":"ḥijāratan","translation_bn":"পাথর","root":"حجر","lemma":"حِجَارَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65183,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"তৈরি","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65184,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"سِجِّيلٍۢ","transliteration":"sijjīlin","translation_bn":"শুকনো মাটির","root":"سجل","lemma":"سِجِّيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65185,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَّنضُودٍۢ","transliteration":"manḍūdin","translation_bn":"একটানা","root":"نضد","lemma":"مَّنضُود","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65186,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٨٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮২)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā jāa amrunā jaʿalnā ʿāliyahā sāfilahā wa-amṭarnā ʿalayhā ḥijāratan min sijjīlin manḍūdin', 'তারপর আমার নির্দেশ যখন এসে গেল, তখন আমি সেই জনপদকে উপর নীচ করে উল্টে দিলাম, আর তাদের উপর স্তরে স্তরে পাকানো মাটির প্রস্তর বর্ষণ করলাম।', 'So when Our command came, We made the highest part [of the city] its lowest and rained upon them stones of layered hard clay, [which were]', 'তারপর আমার নির্দেশ যখন এসে গেল, তখন আমি সেই জনপদকে উপর নীচ করে উল্টে দিলাম, আর তাদের উপর স্তরে স্তরে পাকানো মাটির প্রস্তর বর্ষণ করলাম।', 'So when Our command came, We made the highest part [of the city] its lowest and rained upon them stones of layered hard clay, [which were]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011082.mp3', now()),
  (11, 83, '', '[{"id":65470,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مُّسَوَّمَةً","transliteration":"musawwamatan","translation_bn":"(প্রত্যেকের জন্যে) চিহ্নিত","root":"سوم","lemma":"مُّسَوَّمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65471,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":65472,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ ۖ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65474,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নয়","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65475,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هِىَ","transliteration":"hiya","translation_bn":"তা","root":"—","lemma":"هِىَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":65476,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65477,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদের","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65478,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِبَعِيدٍۢ","transliteration":"bibaʿīdin","translation_bn":"বহুদূরে","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعِيد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65479,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٨٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'musawwamatan ʿinda rabbika wamā hiya mina l-ẓālimīna bibaʿīdin', 'যে প্রস্তর খন্ডের প্রতিটিই তোমার প্রতিপালকের নিকট চিহ্নিত ছিল। যালিমদের জন্য এ শাস্তি বেশী দূরের ব্যাপার নয়।', 'Marked from your Lord. And Allah ''s punishment is not from the wrongdoers [very] far.', 'যে প্রস্তর খন্ডের প্রতিটিই তোমার প্রতিপালকের নিকট চিহ্নিত ছিল। যালিমদের জন্য এ শাস্তি বেশী দূরের ব্যাপার নয়।', 'Marked from your Lord. And Allah ''s punishment is not from the wrongdoers [very] far.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011083.mp3', now()),
  (11, 84, '', '[{"id":65803,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَإِلَىٰ","transliteration":"wa-ilā","translation_bn":"এবং প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65804,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَدْيَنَ","transliteration":"madyana","translation_bn":"মাদইয়ানের","root":"—","lemma":"مَدْيَن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":65805,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَخَاهُمْ","transliteration":"akhāhum","translation_bn":"তাদের ভাই","root":"اخو","lemma":"أَخ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65806,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"شُعَيْبًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"shuʿayban","translation_bn":"শুআয়বকে (পাঠিয়েছিলাম)","root":"—","lemma":"شُعَيْب","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":65808,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65809,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"yāqawmi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":65810,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱعْبُدُوا۟","transliteration":"uʿ''budū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ইবাদাত করো","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65811,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":65812,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":65813,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65814,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোন","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65815,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهٍ","transliteration":"ilāhin","translation_bn":"ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65816,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرُهُۥ ۖ","transliteration":"ghayruhu","translation_bn":"তিনি ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65818,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65819,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تَنقُصُوا۟","transliteration":"tanquṣū","translation_bn":"তোমরা কম করো","root":"نقص","lemma":"يُنقَصُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65820,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمِكْيَالَ","transliteration":"l-mik''yāla","translation_bn":"মাপে","root":"كيل","lemma":"مِكْيَال","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65821,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمِيزَانَ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-mīzāna","translation_bn":"আর (না) ওজনে","root":"وزن","lemma":"مِيزَان","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65823,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":65824,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَرَىٰكُم","transliteration":"arākum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের দেখছি","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65825,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"بِخَيْرٍۢ","transliteration":"bikhayrin","translation_bn":"ভালো অবস্থায়","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65826,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"wa-innī","translation_bn":"কিন্তু আমি নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65827,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"أَخَافُ","transliteration":"akhāfu","translation_bn":"আমি আশঙ্কা করছি","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65828,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65829,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابَ","transliteration":"ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65830,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"yawmin","translation_bn":"দিনের","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65831,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"مُّحِيطٍۢ","transliteration":"muḥīṭin","translation_bn":"পরিবেষ্টনকারী","root":"حوط","lemma":"مُحِيط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65832,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"٨٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-ilā madyana akhāhum shuʿayban qāla yāqawmi uʿ''budū l-laha mā lakum min ilāhin ghayruhu walā tanquṣū l-mik''yāla wal-mīzāna innī arākum bikhayrin wa-innī akhāfu ʿalaykum ʿadhāba yawmin muḥīṭin', 'আর মাদইয়ানবাসীদের কাছে আমি তাদের ভাই শু‘আয়বকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম। সে বলেছিল, ‘হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা আল্লাহর ‘ইবাদাত কর, তিনি ছাড়া তোমাদের কোন সত্য ইলাহ নেই, আর মাপে ও ওজনে কম দিও না, আমি তোমাদেরকে ভাল অবস্থাতেই দেখছি। কিন্তু আমি তোমাদের জন্য শাস্তির আশঙ্কা করছি সে দিনের যেদিন তোমাদেরকে চতুর্দিক থেকে ঘিরে ধরবে।', 'And to Madyan [We sent] their brother Shu''ayb. He said, "O my people, worship Allah; you have no deity other than Him. And do not decrease from the measure and the scale. Indeed, I see you in prosperity, but indeed, I fear for you the punishment of an all-encompassing Day.', 'আর মাদইয়ানবাসীদের কাছে আমি তাদের ভাই শু‘আয়বকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম। সে বলেছিল, ‘হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা আল্লাহর ‘ইবাদাত কর, তিনি ছাড়া তোমাদের কোন সত্য ইলাহ নেই, আর মাপে ও ওজনে কম দিও না, আমি তোমাদেরকে ভাল অবস্থাতেই দেখছি। কিন্তু আমি তোমাদের জন্য শাস্তির আশঙ্কা করছি সে দিনের যেদিন তোমাদেরকে চতুর্দিক থেকে ঘিরে ধরবে।', 'And to Madyan [We sent] their brother Shu''ayb. He said, "O my people, worship Allah; you have no deity other than Him. And do not decrease from the measure and the scale. Indeed, I see you in prosperity, but indeed, I fear for you the punishment of an all-encompassing Day.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011084.mp3', now()),
  (11, 85, '', '[{"id":66070,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"wayāqawmi","translation_bn":"এবং হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66071,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَوْفُوا۟","transliteration":"awfū","translation_bn":"তোমরা পূর্ণ করো","root":"وفي","lemma":"أَوْفَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66072,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمِكْيَالَ","transliteration":"l-mik''yāla","translation_bn":"মাপ","root":"كيل","lemma":"مِكْيَال","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66073,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمِيزَانَ","transliteration":"wal-mīzāna","translation_bn":"ও ওজন","root":"وزن","lemma":"مِيزَان","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66074,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْقِسْطِ ۖ","transliteration":"bil-qis''ṭi","translation_bn":"ভাবে ন্যায়সংগত","root":"قسط","lemma":"قِسْط","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66076,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66077,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَبْخَسُوا۟","transliteration":"tabkhasū","translation_bn":"তোমরা কম করো","root":"بخس","lemma":"يَبْخَسْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66078,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسَ","transliteration":"l-nāsa","translation_bn":"লোকদেরকে","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66079,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَشْيَآءَهُمْ","transliteration":"ashyāahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জিনিসগুলোকে","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66080,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66081,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَعْثَوْا۟","transliteration":"taʿthaw","translation_bn":"তোমরা বিপর্যয় ঘটিয়ো","root":"عثو","lemma":"تَعْثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66082,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66083,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66084,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مُفْسِدِينَ","transliteration":"muf''sidīna","translation_bn":"বিপর্যয় সৃষ্টিকারী (হয়ে)","root":"فسد","lemma":"مُفْسِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66085,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٨٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayāqawmi awfū l-mik''yāla wal-mīzāna bil-qis''ṭi walā tabkhasū l-nāsa ashyāahum walā taʿthaw fī l-arḍi muf''sidīna', 'হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! মাপ ও ওজন ইনসাফের সঙ্গে পূর্ণ করো, লোকদেরকে তাদের প্রাপ্য কম দিও না, আর যমীনে ফাসাদ সৃষ্টি করে বেড়িও না।', 'And O my people, give full measure and weight in justice and do not deprive the people of their due and do not commit abuse on the earth, spreading corruption.', 'হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! মাপ ও ওজন ইনসাফের সঙ্গে পূর্ণ করো, লোকদেরকে তাদের প্রাপ্য কম দিও না, আর যমীনে ফাসাদ সৃষ্টি করে বেড়িও না।', 'And O my people, give full measure and weight in justice and do not deprive the people of their due and do not commit abuse on the earth, spreading corruption.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011085.mp3', now()),
  (11, 86, '', '[{"id":66608,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"بَقِيَّتُ","transliteration":"baqiyyatu","translation_bn":"অবশিষ্টই","root":"بقي","lemma":"بَقِيَّت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66609,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর অনুমোদিত","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":66610,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":66611,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَّكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَّكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66612,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":66613,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُم","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা হও","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66614,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُّؤْمِنِينَ ۚ","transliteration":"mu''minīna","translation_bn":"ঈমানদার","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66616,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66617,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَنَا۠","transliteration":"anā","translation_bn":"আমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":66618,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُم","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66619,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِحَفِيظٍۢ","transliteration":"biḥafīẓin","translation_bn":"কোন তত্ত্বাবধায়ক\"","root":"حفظ","lemma":"حَفِيظ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66620,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٨٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'baqiyyatu l-lahi khayrun lakum in kuntum mu''minīna wamā anā ʿalaykum biḥafīẓin', 'আল্লাহর অনুমোদিত উদ্বৃত্ত (অর্থাৎ লাভ) তোমাদের জন্য উত্তম, যদি তোমরা মু’মিন হও, আমি তোমাদের পর্যবেক্ষক নই।’', 'What remains [lawful] from Allah is best for you, if you would be believers. But I am not a guardian over you."', 'আল্লাহর অনুমোদিত উদ্বৃত্ত (অর্থাৎ লাভ) তোমাদের জন্য উত্তম, যদি তোমরা মু’মিন হও, আমি তোমাদের পর্যবেক্ষক নই।’', 'What remains [lawful] from Allah is best for you, if you would be believers. But I am not a guardian over you."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011086.mp3', now()),
  (11, 87, '', '[{"id":66751,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66752,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰشُعَيْبُ","transliteration":"yāshuʿaybu","translation_bn":"\"হে শুআইব","root":"—","lemma":"شُعَيْب","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":66753,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَصَلَوٰتُكَ","transliteration":"aṣalatuka","translation_bn":"কি তোমার সালাত","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":66754,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَأْمُرُكَ","transliteration":"tamuruka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে নির্দেশ দেয়","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66755,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":66756,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نَّتْرُكَ","transliteration":"natruka","translation_bn":"ছেড়ে দিবো আমরা","root":"ترك","lemma":"تَرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66757,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(তা) যার","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":66758,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَعْبُدُ","transliteration":"yaʿbudu","translation_bn":"উপাসনা করতো","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66759,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ءَابَآؤُنَآ","transliteration":"ābāunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের পূর্ব পুরুষেরা","root":"ابو","lemma":"ا^بَاء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66760,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66761,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যেন (না)","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":66762,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"نَّفْعَلَ","transliteration":"nafʿala","translation_bn":"আমরা করি","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66763,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66764,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَمْوَٰلِنَا","transliteration":"amwālinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের ধন-সম্পদের","root":"مول","lemma":"مَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66765,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":66766,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"نَشَـٰٓؤُا۟ ۖ","transliteration":"nashāu","translation_bn":"আমরা চাই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66768,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكَ","transliteration":"innaka","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":66769,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"لَأَنتَ","transliteration":"la-anta","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"لَأَنتَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":66770,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَلِيمُ","transliteration":"l-ḥalīmu","translation_bn":"ধৈর্যধারী","root":"حلم","lemma":"حَلِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66771,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّشِيدُ","transliteration":"l-rashīdu","translation_bn":"সদাচারী\"","root":"رشد","lemma":"رَّشِيد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66772,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"٨٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū yāshuʿaybu aṣalatuka tamuruka an natruka mā yaʿbudu ābāunā aw an nafʿala fī amwālinā mā nashāu innaka la-anta l-ḥalīmu l-rashīdu', 'তারা বলল, ‘হে শু‘আয়ব! তোমার ইবাদত কি তোমাকে এই হুকুম দেয় যে, আমাদের পিতৃপুরুষ যার ‘ইবাদাত করত আমরা তা পরিত্যাগ করি বা আমাদের ধন-সম্পদের ব্যাপারে আমাদের ইচ্ছে (মাফিক ব্যয় করা) বর্জন করি, তুমি তো দেখছি বড়ই ধৈর্যশীল, ভাল মানুষ।’', 'They said, "O Shu''ayb, does your prayer command you that we should leave what our fathers worship or not do with our wealth what we please? Indeed, you are the forbearing, the discerning!"', 'তারা বলল, ‘হে শু‘আয়ব! তোমার ইবাদত কি তোমাকে এই হুকুম দেয় যে, আমাদের পিতৃপুরুষ যার ‘ইবাদাত করত আমরা তা পরিত্যাগ করি বা আমাদের ধন-সম্পদের ব্যাপারে আমাদের ইচ্ছে (মাফিক ব্যয় করা) বর্জন করি, তুমি তো দেখছি বড়ই ধৈর্যশীল, ভাল মানুষ।’', 'They said, "O Shu''ayb, does your prayer command you that we should leave what our fathers worship or not do with our wealth what we please? Indeed, you are the forbearing, the discerning!"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011087.mp3', now()),
  (11, 88, '', '[{"id":67268,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67269,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"yāqawmi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":67270,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَرَءَيْتُمْ","transliteration":"ara-aytum","translation_bn":"তোমরা কি (ভেবে) দেখেছো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":67271,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":67272,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُ","transliteration":"kuntu","translation_bn":"আমি হই","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67273,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67274,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَيِّنَةٍۢ","transliteration":"bayyinatin","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67275,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কাছ থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67276,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67277,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَرَزَقَنِى","transliteration":"warazaqanī","translation_bn":"এবং আমাকে জীবিকা‌ দিয়েছেন","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67278,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"তাঁর নিকট হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67279,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"رِزْقًا","transliteration":"riz''qan","translation_bn":"জীবিকা","root":"رزق","lemma":"رِزْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67280,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"حَسَنًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"ḥasanan","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"حسن","lemma":"حَسَن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":67282,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67283,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أُرِيدُ","transliteration":"urīdu","translation_bn":"আমি চাই","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67284,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":67285,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أُخَالِفَكُمْ","transliteration":"ukhālifakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের বিরুদ্ধাচারণ করি","root":"خلف","lemma":"يُخَالِفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67286,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"(তার) প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67287,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":67288,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَنْهَىٰكُمْ","transliteration":"anhākum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের আমি নিষেধ করি","root":"نهي","lemma":"نَهَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67289,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُ ۚ","transliteration":"ʿanhu","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67291,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":67292,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"أُرِيدُ","transliteration":"urīdu","translation_bn":"আমি চাই","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67293,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":67294,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِصْلَـٰحَ","transliteration":"l-iṣ''lāḥa","translation_bn":"সংশোধন","root":"صلح","lemma":"إِصْلَٰح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67295,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যতটুকু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":67296,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَطَعْتُ ۚ","transliteration":"is''taṭaʿtu","translation_bn":"আমি করতে পারি","root":"طوع","lemma":"ٱسْتَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67298,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67299,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"تَوْفِيقِىٓ","transliteration":"tawfīqī","translation_bn":"আমার সামর্থ","root":"وفق","lemma":"تَوْفِيق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67300,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া (যা)","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":67301,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"(সংঘটিত হয়) সাহায্যে আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67303,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"তাঁরই উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67304,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"تَوَكَّلْتُ","transliteration":"tawakkaltu","translation_bn":"আমি ভরসা করেছি","root":"وكل","lemma":"تَوَكَّلْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67305,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"وَإِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"wa-ilayhi","translation_bn":"ও তাঁরই দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67306,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"أُنِيبُ","transliteration":"unību","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাবর্তন আমি করছি","root":"نوب","lemma":"أَنَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67307,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"٨٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla yāqawmi ara-aytum in kuntu ʿalā bayyinatin min rabbī warazaqanī min''hu riz''qan ḥasanan wamā urīdu an ukhālifakum ilā mā anhākum ʿanhu in urīdu illā l-iṣ''lāḥa mā is''taṭaʿtu wamā tawfīqī illā bil-lahi ʿalayhi tawakkaltu wa-ilayhi unību', 'সে বলল, ‘হে আমার জাতির লোকেরা! তোমরা কি ভেবে দেখেছ যদি আমি আমার প্রতিপালকের স্পষ্ট প্রমাণের উপর প্রতিষ্ঠিত হয়ে থাকি আর তিনি আমাকে তাঁর পক্ষ থেকে উত্তম রিযক দিয়ে থাকেন (তাহলে আমি কীভাবে তোমাদের অন্যায় কাজের সঙ্গী হতে পারি?), আমি তোমাদেরকে যে কাজ করতে নিষেধ করি সেটা তোমাদের প্রতি বিরুদ্ধাচরণ করার ইচ্ছায় নয়, আমি তো সাধ্যমত সংশোধন করতে চাই, আমার কাজের সাফল্য তো আল্লাহরই পক্ষ হতে, আমি তাঁর উপরই নির্ভর করি, আর তাঁর দিকেই মুখ করি।', 'He said, "O my people, have you considered: if I am upon clear evidence from my Lord and He has provided me with a good provision from Him...? And I do not intend to differ from you in that which I have forbidden you; I only intend reform as much as I am able. And my success is not but through Allah. Upon him I have relied, and to Him I return.', 'সে বলল, ‘হে আমার জাতির লোকেরা! তোমরা কি ভেবে দেখেছ যদি আমি আমার প্রতিপালকের স্পষ্ট প্রমাণের উপর প্রতিষ্ঠিত হয়ে থাকি আর তিনি আমাকে তাঁর পক্ষ থেকে উত্তম রিযক দিয়ে থাকেন (তাহলে আমি কীভাবে তোমাদের অন্যায় কাজের সঙ্গী হতে পারি?), আমি তোমাদেরকে যে কাজ করতে নিষেধ করি সেটা তোমাদের প্রতি বিরুদ্ধাচরণ করার ইচ্ছায় নয়, আমি তো সাধ্যমত সংশোধন করতে চাই, আমার কাজের সাফল্য তো আল্লাহরই পক্ষ হতে, আমি তাঁর উপরই নির্ভর করি, আর তাঁর দিকেই মুখ করি।', 'He said, "O my people, have you considered: if I am upon clear evidence from my Lord and He has provided me with a good provision from Him...? And I do not intend to differ from you in that which I have forbidden you; I only intend reform as much as I am able. And my success is not but through Allah. Upon him I have relied, and to Him I return.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011088.mp3', now()),
  (11, 89, '', '[{"id":67737,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"wayāqawmi","translation_bn":"এবং হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67738,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না (যেন)","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":67739,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَجْرِمَنَّكُمْ","transliteration":"yajrimannakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে অপরাধ করতে (উদ্বুদ্ধ করে)","root":"جرم","lemma":"يَجْرِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67740,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"شِقَاقِىٓ","transliteration":"shiqāqī","translation_bn":"আমার (সাথে) বিরোধ","root":"شقق","lemma":"شِقَاق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67741,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"(এতদূর) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":67742,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يُصِيبَكُم","transliteration":"yuṣībakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর আপতিত হয়","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67743,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِّثْلُ","transliteration":"mith''lu","translation_bn":"তেমনি (শাস্তি)","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67744,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":67745,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَصَابَ","transliteration":"aṣāba","translation_bn":"আপতিত হয়েছিলো","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67746,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمَ","transliteration":"qawma","translation_bn":"জাতির (উপর)","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67747,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"نُوحٍ","transliteration":"nūḥin","translation_bn":"নূহের","root":"—","lemma":"نُوح","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":67748,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67749,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمَ","transliteration":"qawma","translation_bn":"জাতির (উপর)","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67750,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"هُودٍ","transliteration":"hūdin","translation_bn":"হূদের","root":"هود","lemma":"هُود","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":67751,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67752,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمَ","transliteration":"qawma","translation_bn":"জাতির (উপর)","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67753,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰلِحٍۢ ۚ","transliteration":"ṣāliḥin","translation_bn":"সালিহর","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح2","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":67755,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নয়","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67756,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمُ","transliteration":"qawmu","translation_bn":"জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67757,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"لُوطٍۢ","transliteration":"lūṭin","translation_bn":"লুতের","root":"—","lemma":"لُوط","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":67758,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مِّنكُم","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67759,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"بِبَعِيدٍۢ","transliteration":"bibaʿīdin","translation_bn":"বহুদূরে","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعِيد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67760,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٨٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayāqawmi lā yajrimannakum shiqāqī an yuṣībakum mith''lu mā aṣāba qawma nūḥin aw qawma hūdin aw qawma ṣāliḥin wamā qawmu lūṭin minkum bibaʿīdin', 'হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! আমার সঙ্গে বিরোধ তোমাদেরকে যেন কিছুতেই এমন কাজে উদ্বুদ্ধ না করে যাতে তোমাদের উপর এমন বিপদ আসে যেমন বিপদ এসেছিল নূহের জাতির কিংবা হূদের জাতির কিংবা সালিহর জাতির উপর। আর লূতের জাতির অবস্থান তো তোমাদের থেকে মোটেই দূরে নয়।', 'And O my people, let not [your] dissension from me cause you to be struck by that similar to what struck the people of Noah or the people of Hud or the people of Salih. And the people of Lot are not from you far away.', 'হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! আমার সঙ্গে বিরোধ তোমাদেরকে যেন কিছুতেই এমন কাজে উদ্বুদ্ধ না করে যাতে তোমাদের উপর এমন বিপদ আসে যেমন বিপদ এসেছিল নূহের জাতির কিংবা হূদের জাতির কিংবা সালিহর জাতির উপর। আর লূতের জাতির অবস্থান তো তোমাদের থেকে মোটেই দূরে নয়।', 'And O my people, let not [your] dissension from me cause you to be struck by that similar to what struck the people of Noah or the people of Hud or the people of Salih. And the people of Lot are not from you far away.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011089.mp3', now()),
  (11, 90, '', '[{"id":68205,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱسْتَغْفِرُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-is''taghfirū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা ক্ষমা চাও","root":"غفر","lemma":"ٱسْتَغْفَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68206,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّكُمْ","transliteration":"rabbakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রবের কাছে","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68207,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68208,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تُوبُوٓا۟","transliteration":"tūbū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ফিরে এসো","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68209,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ ۚ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"তাঁর দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68211,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":68212,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68213,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَحِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":68214,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَدُودٌۭ","transliteration":"wadūdun","translation_bn":"প্রেমময়\"","root":"ودد","lemma":"وَدُود","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":68215,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٩٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯০)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-is''taghfirū rabbakum thumma tūbū ilayhi inna rabbī raḥīmun wadūdun', 'তোমরা তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা কর, অতঃপর তাঁরই নিকট তাওবাহ কর। আমার প্রতিপালক তো পরম দয়ালু, বড়ই ভালবাসা পোষণকারী।’', 'And ask forgiveness of your Lord and then repent to Him. Indeed, my Lord is Merciful and Affectionate."', 'তোমরা তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা কর, অতঃপর তাঁরই নিকট তাওবাহ কর। আমার প্রতিপালক তো পরম দয়ালু, বড়ই ভালবাসা পোষণকারী।’', 'And ask forgiveness of your Lord and then repent to Him. Indeed, my Lord is Merciful and Affectionate."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011090.mp3', now()),
  (11, 91, '', '[{"id":68506,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68507,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰشُعَيْبُ","transliteration":"yāshuʿaybu","translation_bn":"\"হে শুআইব","root":"—","lemma":"شُعَيْب","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":68508,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":68509,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"نَفْقَهُ","transliteration":"nafqahu","translation_bn":"আমরা বুঝি","root":"فقه","lemma":"يَفْقَهُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68510,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كَثِيرًۭا","transliteration":"kathīran","translation_bn":"অনেক (কথাই)","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68511,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68512,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَقُولُ","transliteration":"taqūlu","translation_bn":"বলো তুমি","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68513,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّا","transliteration":"wa-innā","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68514,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَنَرَىٰكَ","transliteration":"lanarāka","translation_bn":"আমরা অবশ্যই তোমাকে দেখছি","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":68515,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِينَا","transliteration":"fīnā","translation_bn":"আমাদের মাঝে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68516,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ضَعِيفًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"ḍaʿīfan","translation_bn":"দুর্বল হিসেবে","root":"ضعف","lemma":"ضَعِيف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68518,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْلَا","transliteration":"walawlā","translation_bn":"এবং যদি থাকত না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68519,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رَهْطُكَ","transliteration":"rahṭuka","translation_bn":"তোমার স্বজনবর্গ","root":"رهط","lemma":"رَهْط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68520,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَرَجَمْنَـٰكَ ۖ","transliteration":"larajamnāka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে আমরা পাথর ছুড়ে মেরে ফেলতাম","root":"رجم","lemma":"رَجَمْ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":68522,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নও","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68523,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَنتَ","transliteration":"anta","translation_bn":"তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":68524,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْنَا","transliteration":"ʿalaynā","translation_bn":"আমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68525,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"بِعَزِيزٍۢ","transliteration":"biʿazīzin","translation_bn":"শক্তিশালী\"","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68526,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٩١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯১)","root":"—","lemma":"٩١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū yāshuʿaybu mā nafqahu kathīran mimmā taqūlu wa-innā lanarāka fīnā ḍaʿīfan walawlā rahṭuka larajamnāka wamā anta ʿalaynā biʿazīzin', 'তারা বলল, ‘হে শু‘আয়ব! তুমি যা বল তার অনেক কথাই আমরা বুঝি না, আমরা আমাদের মধ্যে তোমাকে অবশ্যই দুর্বল দেখছি, তোমার গোত্র না থাকলে আমরা তোমাকে অবশ্যই পাথর নিক্ষেপ ক’রে মেরে ফেলতাম, আমাদের উপর তোমার কোন ক্ষমতাই নেই।', 'They said, "O Shu''ayb, we do not understand much of what you say, and indeed, we consider you among us as weak. And if not for your family, we would have stoned you [to death]; and you are not to us one respected."', 'তারা বলল, ‘হে শু‘আয়ব! তুমি যা বল তার অনেক কথাই আমরা বুঝি না, আমরা আমাদের মধ্যে তোমাকে অবশ্যই দুর্বল দেখছি, তোমার গোত্র না থাকলে আমরা তোমাকে অবশ্যই পাথর নিক্ষেপ ক’রে মেরে ফেলতাম, আমাদের উপর তোমার কোন ক্ষমতাই নেই।', 'They said, "O Shu''ayb, we do not understand much of what you say, and indeed, we consider you among us as weak. And if not for your family, we would have stoned you [to death]; and you are not to us one respected."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011091.mp3', now()),
  (11, 92, '', '[{"id":68913,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68914,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"yāqawmi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":68915,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَرَهْطِىٓ","transliteration":"arahṭī","translation_bn":"আমার স্বজনবর্গ কি","root":"رهط","lemma":"رَهْط","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":68916,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَعَزُّ","transliteration":"aʿazzu","translation_bn":"অধিক শক্তিশালী","root":"عزز","lemma":"أَعَزّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68917,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُم","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68918,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"চেয়েও","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68919,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":68920,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّخَذْتُمُوهُ","transliteration":"wa-ittakhadhtumūhu","translation_bn":"অথচ তাঁকে তোমরা রেখে দিয়েছো","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68921,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَرَآءَكُمْ","transliteration":"warāakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের পিছনে","root":"وري","lemma":"وَرَا^ء","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":68922,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ظِهْرِيًّا ۖ","transliteration":"ẓih''riyyan","translation_bn":"অবহেলা ভরে","root":"ظهر","lemma":"ظِهْرِيّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68924,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":68925,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68926,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"সে সম্বন্ধে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68927,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা করছো","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68928,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مُحِيطٌۭ","transliteration":"muḥīṭun","translation_bn":"পরিবেষ্টন করে আছেন","root":"حوط","lemma":"مُحِيط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68929,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٩٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯২)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla yāqawmi arahṭī aʿazzu ʿalaykum mina l-lahi wa-ittakhadhtumūhu warāakum ẓih''riyyan inna rabbī bimā taʿmalūna muḥīṭun', 'সে বলল, ‘হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! আমার স্বজনরা কি তোমাদের কাছে আল্লাহর চেয়েও প্রবল! তোমরা তো তাঁকে সম্পূর্ণতঃ পেছনে ফেলে রেখেছ, তোমরা যা করছ আমার প্রতিপালক তা সব কিছুই অবগত।’', 'He said, "O my people, is my family more respected for power by you than Allah? But you put Him behind your backs [in neglect]. Indeed, my Lord is encompassing of what you do.', 'সে বলল, ‘হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! আমার স্বজনরা কি তোমাদের কাছে আল্লাহর চেয়েও প্রবল! তোমরা তো তাঁকে সম্পূর্ণতঃ পেছনে ফেলে রেখেছ, তোমরা যা করছ আমার প্রতিপালক তা সব কিছুই অবগত।’', 'He said, "O my people, is my family more respected for power by you than Allah? But you put Him behind your backs [in neglect]. Indeed, my Lord is encompassing of what you do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011092.mp3', now()),
  (11, 93, '', '[{"id":69244,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"wayāqawmi","translation_bn":"এবং হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69245,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱعْمَلُوا۟","transliteration":"iʿ''malū","translation_bn":"তোমরা কাজ করো","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69246,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69247,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَكَانَتِكُمْ","transliteration":"makānatikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের নিজ নিজ অবস্থানের","root":"كون","lemma":"مَكَانَت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69248,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّى","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমিও","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":69249,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰمِلٌۭ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿāmilun","translation_bn":"কাজ করছি (আমার অবস্থানে)","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَٰمِل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69251,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"سَوْفَ","transliteration":"sawfa","translation_bn":"শীঘ্রই","root":"—","lemma":"سَوْف\r","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":69252,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা জানবে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69253,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"(যে) কে সেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":69254,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِيهِ","transliteration":"yatīhi","translation_bn":"যার উপর আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69255,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69256,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يُخْزِيهِ","transliteration":"yukh''zīhi","translation_bn":"তাকে লাঞ্ছিত করে ছাড়বে","root":"خزي","lemma":"أَخْزَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69257,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَمَنْ","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69258,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"সে","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":69259,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كَـٰذِبٌۭ ۖ","transliteration":"kādhibun","translation_bn":"মিথ্যাবাদী","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَٰذِب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69261,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَٱرْتَقِبُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wa-ir''taqibū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা প্রতীক্ষা করো","root":"رقب","lemma":"ٱرْتَقِبْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69262,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّى","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":69263,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مَعَكُمْ","transliteration":"maʿakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":69264,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"رَقِيبٌۭ","transliteration":"raqībun","translation_bn":"প্রতীক্ষাকারী\"","root":"رقب","lemma":"رَقِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69265,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٩٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayāqawmi iʿ''malū ʿalā makānatikum innī ʿāmilun sawfa taʿlamūna man yatīhi ʿadhābun yukh''zīhi waman huwa kādhibun wa-ir''taqibū innī maʿakum raqībun', 'হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! ‘তোমরা নিজ নিজ অবস্থানে থেকে কাজ করতে থাক, আমিও আমার কাজ করতে থাকি, তোমরা অচিরেই জানতে পারবে কার উপর আসবে লাঞ্ছনাদায়ক শাস্তি আর কে মিথ্যেবাদী। কাজেই তোমরা অপেক্ষায় থাক, আমিও তোমাদের সাথে অপেক্ষায় থাকলাম।’', 'And O my people, work according to your position; indeed, I am working. You are going to know to whom will come a punishment that will disgrace him and who is a liar. So watch; indeed, I am with you a watcher, [awaiting the outcome]."', 'হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! ‘তোমরা নিজ নিজ অবস্থানে থেকে কাজ করতে থাক, আমিও আমার কাজ করতে থাকি, তোমরা অচিরেই জানতে পারবে কার উপর আসবে লাঞ্ছনাদায়ক শাস্তি আর কে মিথ্যেবাদী। কাজেই তোমরা অপেক্ষায় থাক, আমিও তোমাদের সাথে অপেক্ষায় থাকলাম।’', 'And O my people, work according to your position; indeed, I am working. You are going to know to whom will come a punishment that will disgrace him and who is a liar. So watch; indeed, I am with you a watcher, [awaiting the outcome]."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011093.mp3', now()),
  (11, 94, '', '[{"id":69462,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمَّا","transliteration":"walammā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69463,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"আসলো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69464,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرُنَا","transliteration":"amrunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের নির্দেশ","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69465,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"نَجَّيْنَا","transliteration":"najjaynā","translation_bn":"আমরা রক্ষা করলাম","root":"نجو","lemma":"نَجَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69466,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"شُعَيْبًۭا","transliteration":"shuʿayban","translation_bn":"শুআইবকে","root":"—","lemma":"شُعَيْب","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69467,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"ও যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69468,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছিলো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69469,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَعَهُۥ","transliteration":"maʿahu","translation_bn":"তার সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":69470,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِرَحْمَةٍۢ","transliteration":"biraḥmatin","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ দিয়ে","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69471,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَّا","transliteration":"minnā","translation_bn":"আমাদের পক্ষ থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69472,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَأَخَذَتِ","transliteration":"wa-akhadhati","translation_bn":"এবং ধরলো","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69473,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":69474,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَمُوا۟","transliteration":"ẓalamū","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘন করেছিলো","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69475,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّيْحَةُ","transliteration":"l-ṣayḥatu","translation_bn":"মহাগর্জন","root":"صيح","lemma":"صَيْحَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69476,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَأَصْبَحُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-aṣbaḥū","translation_bn":"তারা অতঃপর হয়ে গেলো","root":"صبح","lemma":"أَصْبَحَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69477,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69478,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"دِيَـٰرِهِمْ","transliteration":"diyārihim","translation_bn":"তাদের ঘরগুলোর","root":"دور","lemma":"دَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69479,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"جَـٰثِمِينَ","transliteration":"jāthimīna","translation_bn":"উপুড় হয়ে পড়া (নির্জীব নিস্পন্দ)","root":"جثم","lemma":"جَٰثِمِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69480,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٩٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walammā jāa amrunā najjaynā shuʿayban wa-alladhīna āmanū maʿahu biraḥmatin minnā wa-akhadhati alladhīna ẓalamū l-ṣayḥatu fa-aṣbaḥū fī diyārihim jāthimīna', 'আমার হুকুম যখন আসলো, তখন আমি আমার দয়ায় শু‘আয়ব আর তার সঙ্গে যারা ঈমান এনেছিল তাদেরকে বাঁচিয়ে দিলাম। আর যারা যুলম করেছিল তাদেরকে এক প্রচন্ড শব্দ আঘাত হানল যার ফলে তারা নিজেদের গৃহে নতজানু হয়ে পড়ে রইল।', 'And when Our command came, We saved Shu''ayb and those who believed with him, by mercy from Us. And the shriek seized those who had wronged, and they became within their homes [corpses] fallen prone', 'আমার হুকুম যখন আসলো, তখন আমি আমার দয়ায় শু‘আয়ব আর তার সঙ্গে যারা ঈমান এনেছিল তাদেরকে বাঁচিয়ে দিলাম। আর যারা যুলম করেছিল তাদেরকে এক প্রচন্ড শব্দ আঘাত হানল যার ফলে তারা নিজেদের গৃহে নতজানু হয়ে পড়ে রইল।', 'And when Our command came, We saved Shu''ayb and those who believed with him, by mercy from Us. And the shriek seized those who had wronged, and they became within their homes [corpses] fallen prone', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011094.mp3', now()),
  (11, 95, '', '[{"id":69916,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"كَأَن","transliteration":"ka-an","translation_bn":"যেন","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69917,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَّمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":69918,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَغْنَوْا۟","transliteration":"yaghnaw","translation_bn":"তারা বসবাস করেই","root":"غني","lemma":"أَغْنَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69919,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَآ ۗ","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69921,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَلَا","transliteration":"alā","translation_bn":"জেনে রাখো","root":"—","lemma":"أَلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":69922,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بُعْدًۭا","transliteration":"buʿ''dan","translation_bn":"ধ্বংস হলো","root":"بعد","lemma":"بُعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69923,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِّمَدْيَنَ","transliteration":"limadyana","translation_bn":"জন্যে মাদয়ানবাসীদের","root":"—","lemma":"مَدْيَن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69924,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَمَا","transliteration":"kamā","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69925,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بَعِدَتْ","transliteration":"baʿidat","translation_bn":"ধ্বংস করা হয়েছিলো","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعُدَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69926,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ثَمُودُ","transliteration":"thamūdu","translation_bn":"সামূদ জাতিকে","root":"—","lemma":"ثَمُود","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69927,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٩٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ka-an lam yaghnaw fīhā alā buʿ''dan limadyana kamā baʿidat thamūdu', '(এমনভাবে) যেন তারা সেখানে কোনদিনই বসবাস করেনি। জেনে রেখ, মাদইয়ানবাসীদেরকে দূরে নিক্ষেপ করা হল, যেমনভাবে দূরে নিক্ষেপ করা হয়েছিল সামূদজাতিকে।', 'As if they had never prospered therein. Then, away with Madyan as Thamud was taken away.', '(এমনভাবে) যেন তারা সেখানে কোনদিনই বসবাস করেনি। জেনে রেখ, মাদইয়ানবাসীদেরকে দূরে নিক্ষেপ করা হল, যেমনভাবে দূরে নিক্ষেপ করা হয়েছিল সামূদজাতিকে।', 'As if they had never prospered therein. Then, away with Madyan as Thamud was taken away.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011095.mp3', now()),
  (11, 96, '', '[{"id":70200,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70201,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَا","transliteration":"arsalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা পাঠিয়েছিলাম","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70202,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":70203,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"দিয়ে আমাদের নিদর্শনাবলী","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70204,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَسُلْطَـٰنٍۢ","transliteration":"wasul''ṭānin","translation_bn":"এবং প্রমাণ (দিয়ে)","root":"سلط","lemma":"سُلْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70205,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٍ","transliteration":"mubīnin","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70206,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٩٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad arsalnā mūsā biāyātinā wasul''ṭānin mubīnin', 'আমি মূসাকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম আমার নিদর্শন আর স্পষ্ট প্রমাণ সহকারে', 'And We did certainly send Moses with Our signs and a clear authority', 'আমি মূসাকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম আমার নিদর্শন আর স্পষ্ট প্রমাণ সহকারে', 'And We did certainly send Moses with Our signs and a clear authority', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011096.mp3', now()),
  (11, 97, '', '[{"id":70512,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70513,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِرْعَوْنَ","transliteration":"fir''ʿawna","translation_bn":"ফিরআউনের","root":"—","lemma":"فِرْعَوْن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":70514,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَمَلَإِي۟هِۦ","transliteration":"wamala-ihi","translation_bn":"এবং তার প্রধানব্যক্তিবর্গের (প্রতি)","root":"ملا","lemma":"مَلَأ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70515,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَٱتَّبَعُوٓا۟","transliteration":"fa-ittabaʿū","translation_bn":"তারা অতঃপর অনুসরণ করলো","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70516,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرَ","transliteration":"amra","translation_bn":"কাজকর্মের","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70517,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِرْعَوْنَ ۖ","transliteration":"fir''ʿawna","translation_bn":"ফিরআউনের","root":"—","lemma":"فِرْعَوْن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":70519,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70520,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرُ","transliteration":"amru","translation_bn":"কাজকর্ম (ছিলো)","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70521,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِرْعَوْنَ","transliteration":"fir''ʿawna","translation_bn":"ফিরআউনের","root":"—","lemma":"فِرْعَوْن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":70522,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِرَشِيدٍۢ","transliteration":"birashīdin","translation_bn":"ন্যায়সঙ্গত","root":"رشد","lemma":"رَّشِيد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70523,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٩٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ilā fir''ʿawna wamala-ihi fa-ittabaʿū amra fir''ʿawna wamā amru fir''ʿawna birashīdin', 'ফির‘আওন আর তার প্রধানদের কাছে, কিন্তু তারা ফির‘আওনের হুকুমই মেনে নিল, আর ফির‘আওনের হুকুম সত্য নির্ভর ছিল না।', 'To Pharaoh and his establishment, but they followed the command of Pharaoh, and the command of Pharaoh was not [at all] discerning.', 'ফির‘আওন আর তার প্রধানদের কাছে, কিন্তু তারা ফির‘আওনের হুকুমই মেনে নিল, আর ফির‘আওনের হুকুম সত্য নির্ভর ছিল না।', 'To Pharaoh and his establishment, but they followed the command of Pharaoh, and the command of Pharaoh was not [at all] discerning.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011097.mp3', now()),
  (11, 98, '', '[{"id":70598,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَقْدُمُ","transliteration":"yaqdumu","translation_bn":"সে সামনে থাকবে","root":"قدم","lemma":"قَدِمْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70599,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمَهُۥ","transliteration":"qawmahu","translation_bn":"তার জাতির লোকদের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70600,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70601,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70602,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَأَوْرَدَهُمُ","transliteration":"fa-awradahumu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তাদের উপস্থিত করবে","root":"ورد","lemma":"أَوْرَدَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70603,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارَ ۖ","transliteration":"l-nāra","translation_bn":"(জাহান্নামের) আগুনে","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70605,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَبِئْسَ","transliteration":"wabi''sa","translation_bn":"এবং অতি জঘন্য","root":"باس","lemma":"بِئْسَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70606,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْوِرْدُ","transliteration":"l-wir''du","translation_bn":"উপস্থিত স্থান","root":"ورد","lemma":"وِرْد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70607,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَوْرُودُ","transliteration":"l-mawrūdu","translation_bn":"যেখানে তারা উপস্থিত  হবে","root":"ورد","lemma":"مَوْرُود","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70608,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٩٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yaqdumu qawmahu yawma l-qiyāmati fa-awradahumu l-nāra wabi''sa l-wir''du l-mawrūdu', 'ক্বিয়ামাতের দিন সে তার সম্প্রদায়ের পুরোভাগে থাকবে আর তাদেরকে জাহান্নামে নিয়ে যেতে নেতৃত্ব দেবে, কতই না নিকৃষ্ট এ অবতরণ স্থল যাতে তারা উপনীত হবে।', 'He will precede his people on the Day of Resurrection and lead them into the Fire; and wretched is the place to which they are led.', 'ক্বিয়ামাতের দিন সে তার সম্প্রদায়ের পুরোভাগে থাকবে আর তাদেরকে জাহান্নামে নিয়ে যেতে নেতৃত্ব দেবে, কতই না নিকৃষ্ট এ অবতরণ স্থল যাতে তারা উপনীত হবে।', 'He will precede his people on the Day of Resurrection and lead them into the Fire; and wretched is the place to which they are led.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011098.mp3', now()),
  (11, 99, '', '[{"id":70948,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأُتْبِعُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-ut''biʿū","translation_bn":"এবং তাদেরকে অনুসরণ করলো","root":"تبع","lemma":"أَتْبَعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70949,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70950,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذِهِۦ","transliteration":"hādhihi","translation_bn":"এই (পৃথিবীর)","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":70951,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَعْنَةًۭ","transliteration":"laʿnatan","translation_bn":"অভিশাপ","root":"لعن","lemma":"لَعْنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70952,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"এবং (অভিশাপ) দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70953,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70955,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِئْسَ","transliteration":"bi''sa","translation_bn":"অতি জঘন্য","root":"باس","lemma":"بِئْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70956,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرِّفْدُ","transliteration":"l-rif''du","translation_bn":"পুরস্কার","root":"رفد","lemma":"رِّفْد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70957,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَرْفُودُ","transliteration":"l-marfūdu","translation_bn":"(যা তাদেরকে) পুরস্কার দেয়া হবে","root":"رفد","lemma":"مَرْفُود","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70958,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٩٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-ut''biʿū fī hādhihi laʿnatan wayawma l-qiyāmati bi''sa l-rif''du l-marfūdu', 'এ দুনিয়াতেও অভিশাপ তাদের পেছনে ছুটছে আর ক্বিয়ামাতের দিনেও। কত নিকৃষ্টই না সে পুরস্কার যা তাদেরকে দেয়া হবে।', 'And they were followed in this [world] with a curse and on the Day of Resurrection. And wretched is the gift which is given.', 'এ দুনিয়াতেও অভিশাপ তাদের পেছনে ছুটছে আর ক্বিয়ামাতের দিনেও। কত নিকৃষ্টই না সে পুরস্কার যা তাদেরকে দেয়া হবে।', 'And they were followed in this [world] with a curse and on the Day of Resurrection. And wretched is the gift which is given.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011099.mp3', now()),
  (11, 100, '', '[{"id":71301,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এই (খবর)","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":71302,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71303,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنۢبَآءِ","transliteration":"anbāi","translation_bn":"সংবাদ","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَأ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71304,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرَىٰ","transliteration":"l-qurā","translation_bn":"জনপদসমূহের","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71305,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نَقُصُّهُۥ","transliteration":"naquṣṣuhu","translation_bn":"তা আমরা বর্ণনা করছি","root":"قصص","lemma":"قَصَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71306,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكَ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿalayka","translation_bn":"তোমার কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71308,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهَا","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71309,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَآئِمٌۭ","transliteration":"qāimun","translation_bn":"(কিছু) বিদ্যমান আছে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَا^ئِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71310,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَحَصِيدٌۭ","transliteration":"waḥaṣīdun","translation_bn":"আবার (কিছু) নির্মূল হয়েছে","root":"حصد","lemma":"حَصِيد","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71311,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١٠٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dhālika min anbāi l-qurā naquṣṣuhu ʿalayka min''hā qāimun waḥaṣīdun', 'এ হল জনপদসমূহের কিছু খবরাদি যা আমি তোমার নিকট বর্ণনা করলাম, তাদের কতক এখনও দাঁড়িয়ে আছে আর কতক কর্তিত ফসলের দশা প্রাপ্ত হয়েছে।', 'That is from the news of the cities, which We relate to you; of them, some are [still] standing and some are [as] a harvest [mowed down].', 'এ হল জনপদসমূহের কিছু খবরাদি যা আমি তোমার নিকট বর্ণনা করলাম, তাদের কতক এখনও দাঁড়িয়ে আছে আর কতক কর্তিত ফসলের দশা প্রাপ্ত হয়েছে।', 'That is from the news of the cities, which We relate to you; of them, some are [still] standing and some are [as] a harvest [mowed down].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011100.mp3', now()),
  (11, 101, '', '[{"id":71612,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71613,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَمْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"ẓalamnāhum","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর আমরা অত্যাচার করেছি","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71614,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِن","transliteration":"walākin","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71615,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَمُوٓا۟","transliteration":"ẓalamū","translation_bn":"তারা অত্যাচার করেছিলো","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71616,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسَهُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"anfusahum","translation_bn":"তাদের নিজেদের (উপর)","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71618,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَمَآ","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71619,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَغْنَتْ","transliteration":"aghnat","translation_bn":"কাজে লাগলো","root":"غني","lemma":"أَغْنَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71620,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُمْ","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71621,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ءَالِهَتُهُمُ","transliteration":"ālihatuhumu","translation_bn":"তাদের উপাস্যরা","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71622,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّتِى","transliteration":"allatī","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":71623,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَدْعُونَ","transliteration":"yadʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা ডাকত","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71624,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71625,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71626,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌কে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":71627,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোন","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71628,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71629,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لَّمَّا","transliteration":"lammā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":71630,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"আসলো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71631,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرُ","transliteration":"amru","translation_bn":"নির্দেশ","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71632,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ ۖ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71634,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71635,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"زَادُوهُمْ","transliteration":"zādūhum","translation_bn":"তাদের তারা বৃদ্ধি করলো","root":"زيد","lemma":"زَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71636,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرَ","transliteration":"ghayra","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71637,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"تَتْبِيبٍۢ","transliteration":"tatbībin","translation_bn":"ধ্বংস","root":"تبب","lemma":"تَتْبِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71638,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"١٠١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā ẓalamnāhum walākin ẓalamū anfusahum famā aghnat ʿanhum ālihatuhumu allatī yadʿūna min dūni l-lahi min shayin lammā jāa amru rabbika wamā zādūhum ghayra tatbībin', 'আমি তাদের উপর যুলম করিনি বরং তারাই নিজেদের উপর যুলম করেছিল, কিন্তু তোমার প্রতিপালকের হুকুম যখন এসে গেল, তখন আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে তারা যেসব ইলাহকে ডাকত ওগুলো তাদের কোনই কাজে আসল না, তারা ধ্বংস ছাড়া কিছুই বৃদ্ধি করতে পারল না।', 'And We did not wrong them, but they wronged themselves. And they were not availed at all by their gods which they invoked other than Allah when there came the command of your Lord. And they did not increase them in other than ruin.', 'আমি তাদের উপর যুলম করিনি বরং তারাই নিজেদের উপর যুলম করেছিল, কিন্তু তোমার প্রতিপালকের হুকুম যখন এসে গেল, তখন আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে তারা যেসব ইলাহকে ডাকত ওগুলো তাদের কোনই কাজে আসল না, তারা ধ্বংস ছাড়া কিছুই বৃদ্ধি করতে পারল না।', 'And We did not wrong them, but they wronged themselves. And they were not availed at all by their gods which they invoked other than Allah when there came the command of your Lord. And they did not increase them in other than ruin.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011101.mp3', now()),
  (11, 102, '', '[{"id":71861,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wakadhālika","translation_bn":"এবং এভাবেই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71862,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَخْذُ","transliteration":"akhdhu","translation_bn":"পাকড়াও (আসে)","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخْذ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71863,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71864,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِذَآ","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":71865,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَخَذَ","transliteration":"akhadha","translation_bn":"তিনি পাকড়াও করেন","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71866,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرَىٰ","transliteration":"l-qurā","translation_bn":"জনবসতিকে","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71867,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَهِىَ","transliteration":"wahiya","translation_bn":"এমতাবস্হায় তা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهِىَ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":71868,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ظَـٰلِمَةٌ ۚ","transliteration":"ẓālimatun","translation_bn":"(ছিল) অত্যাচারী","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71870,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":71871,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَخْذَهُۥٓ","transliteration":"akhdhahu","translation_bn":"তাঁর পাকড়াও","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخْذ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71872,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"alīmun","translation_bn":"যন্ত্রণাদায়ক","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":71873,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"شَدِيدٌ","transliteration":"shadīdun","translation_bn":"কঠোর","root":"شدد","lemma":"شَدِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":71874,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١٠٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakadhālika akhdhu rabbika idhā akhadha l-qurā wahiya ẓālimatun inna akhdhahu alīmun shadīdun', 'তোমার প্রতিপালকের পাকড়াও এ রকমই হয়ে থাকে যখন তিনি পাকড়াও করেন কোন জনপদকে যখন তারা যুলমে লিপ্ত থাকে। অবশ্যই তাঁর পাকড়াও ভয়াবহ, বড়ই কঠিন।', 'And thus is the seizure of your Lord when He seizes the cities while they are committing wrong. Indeed, His seizure is painful and severe.', 'তোমার প্রতিপালকের পাকড়াও এ রকমই হয়ে থাকে যখন তিনি পাকড়াও করেন কোন জনপদকে যখন তারা যুলমে লিপ্ত থাকে। অবশ্যই তাঁর পাকড়াও ভয়াবহ, বড়ই কঠিন।', 'And thus is the seizure of your Lord when He seizes the cities while they are committing wrong. Indeed, His seizure is painful and severe.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011102.mp3', now()),
  (11, 103, '', '[{"id":72304,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":72305,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72306,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":72307,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَـَٔايَةًۭ","transliteration":"laāyatan","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই নিদর্শন","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":72308,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لِّمَنْ","transliteration":"liman","translation_bn":"তার জন্য যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72309,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"خَافَ","transliteration":"khāfa","translation_bn":"ভয় করে","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72310,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابَ","transliteration":"ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72311,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","translation_bn":"আখিরাতের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72313,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":72314,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمٌۭ","transliteration":"yawmun","translation_bn":"দিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72315,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَّجْمُوعٌۭ","transliteration":"majmūʿun","translation_bn":"একত্র করার","root":"جمع","lemma":"مَّجْمُوع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72316,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার (মধ্যে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72317,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسُ","transliteration":"l-nāsu","translation_bn":"(সকল) মানুষকে","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72318,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wadhālika","translation_bn":"এবং এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72319,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمٌۭ","transliteration":"yawmun","translation_bn":"দিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72320,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مَّشْهُودٌۭ","transliteration":"mashhūdun","translation_bn":"সবার উপস্হিতির","root":"شهد","lemma":"مَشْهُود","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72321,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٠٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna fī dhālika laāyatan liman khāfa ʿadhāba l-ākhirati dhālika yawmun majmūʿun lahu l-nāsu wadhālika yawmun mashhūdun', 'এতে অবশ্যই নিদর্শন আছে তার জন্য যে আখেরাতের শাস্তিকে ভয় করে। এটা এমন দিন, যে দিনের জন্য সব মানুষকে একত্রিত করা হবে, এটা হাযির হওয়ার দিন।', 'Indeed in that is a sign for those who fear the punishment of the Hereafter. That is a Day for which the people will be collected, and that is a Day [which will be] witnessed.', 'এতে অবশ্যই নিদর্শন আছে তার জন্য যে আখেরাতের শাস্তিকে ভয় করে। এটা এমন দিন, যে দিনের জন্য সব মানুষকে একত্রিত করা হবে, এটা হাযির হওয়ার দিন।', 'Indeed in that is a sign for those who fear the punishment of the Hereafter. That is a Day for which the people will be collected, and that is a Day [which will be] witnessed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011103.mp3', now()),
  (11, 104, '', '[{"id":72662,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72663,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نُؤَخِّرُهُۥٓ","transliteration":"nu-akhiruhu","translation_bn":"তা আমরা স্হগিত করবো","root":"اخر","lemma":"أَخَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72664,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":72665,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِأَجَلٍۢ","transliteration":"li-ajalin","translation_bn":"জন্যে একটি সময়ের","root":"اجل","lemma":"أَجَل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72666,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَّعْدُودٍۢ","transliteration":"maʿdūdin","translation_bn":"নির্দিষ্ট","root":"عدد","lemma":"مَّعْدُود","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72667,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"١٠٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā nu-akhiruhu illā li-ajalin maʿdūdin', 'আমি একটা নির্দিষ্ট সময়ের জন্য তাকে বিলম্বিত করি মাত্র।', 'And We do not delay it except for a limited term.', 'আমি একটা নির্দিষ্ট সময়ের জন্য তাকে বিলম্বিত করি মাত্র।', 'And We do not delay it except for a limited term.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011104.mp3', now()),
  (11, 105, '', '[{"id":72714,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"সেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72715,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِ","transliteration":"yati","translation_bn":"(যখন) আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72716,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":72717,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَكَلَّمُ","transliteration":"takallamu","translation_bn":"কথা বলতে পারবে","root":"كلم","lemma":"يَتَكَلَّمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72718,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسٌ","transliteration":"nafsun","translation_bn":"কোন ব্যক্তি","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72719,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":72720,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِإِذْنِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"bi-idh''nihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর অনুমতির মাধ্যমে","root":"اذن","lemma":"إِذْن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72722,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَمِنْهُمْ","transliteration":"famin''hum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তাদের মধ্যে কেউ","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72723,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"شَقِىٌّۭ","transliteration":"shaqiyyun","translation_bn":"হতভাগ্য (হবে)","root":"شقو","lemma":"شَقِيّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72724,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَسَعِيدٌۭ","transliteration":"wasaʿīdun","translation_bn":"আর সৌভাগ্যবান (হবে কেউ)","root":"سعد","lemma":"سَعِيد","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72725,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"١٠٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yawma yati lā takallamu nafsun illā bi-idh''nihi famin''hum shaqiyyun wasaʿīdun', 'সে দিন যখন আসবে তখন তাঁর অনুমতি ছাড়া কেউ মুখ খুলতে পারবে না, তাদের কেউ হবে হতভাগা, আর কেউ হবে সৌভাগ্যবান।', 'The Day it comes no soul will speak except by His permission. And among them will be the wretched and the prosperous.', 'সে দিন যখন আসবে তখন তাঁর অনুমতি ছাড়া কেউ মুখ খুলতে পারবে না, তাদের কেউ হবে হতভাগা, আর কেউ হবে সৌভাগ্যবান।', 'The Day it comes no soul will speak except by His permission. And among them will be the wretched and the prosperous.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011105.mp3', now()),
  (11, 106, '', '[{"id":73039,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَأَمَّا","transliteration":"fa-ammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর","root":"—","lemma":"أَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73040,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":73041,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"شَقُوا۟","transliteration":"shaqū","translation_bn":"হতভাগ্য হবে","root":"شقو","lemma":"شَقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73042,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَفِى","transliteration":"fafī","translation_bn":"তখন মধ্যে (হবে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73043,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"(জাহান্নামের) আগুনের","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73044,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73045,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে (থাকবে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73046,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"زَفِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"zafīrun","translation_bn":"আর্তনাদ","root":"زفر","lemma":"زَفِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73047,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَشَهِيقٌ","transliteration":"washahīqun","translation_bn":"ও চিৎকার","root":"شهق","lemma":"شَهِيق","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73048,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١٠٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-ammā alladhīna shaqū fafī l-nāri lahum fīhā zafīrun washahīqun', 'যারা হতভাগা হবে তারা জাহান্নামে যাবে, সেখানে তাদের জন্য আছে হা-হুতাশ আর আর্ত চীৎকার।', 'As for those who were [destined to be] wretched, they will be in the Fire. For them therein is [violent] exhaling and inhaling.', 'যারা হতভাগা হবে তারা জাহান্নামে যাবে, সেখানে তাদের জন্য আছে হা-হুতাশ আর আর্ত চীৎকার।', 'As for those who were [destined to be] wretched, they will be in the Fire. For them therein is [violent] exhaling and inhaling.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011106.mp3', now()),
  (11, 107, '', '[{"id":73304,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","transliteration":"khālidīna","translation_bn":"তারা স্থায়ী হবে","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73305,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73306,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যতক্ষণ","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":73307,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"دَامَتِ","transliteration":"dāmati","translation_bn":"বিদ্যমান থাকবে","root":"دوم","lemma":"دَامُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73308,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتُ","transliteration":"l-samāwātu","translation_bn":"আকাশসমূহ","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73309,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضُ","transliteration":"wal-arḍu","translation_bn":"এবং পৃথিবী","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73310,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"তবে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":73311,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":73312,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"شَآءَ","transliteration":"shāa","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73313,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكَ ۚ","transliteration":"rabbuka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব (সেটা ভিন্ন কথা)","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73315,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":73316,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّكَ","transliteration":"rabbaka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73317,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَعَّالٌۭ","transliteration":"faʿʿālun","translation_bn":"নিশ্চিতভাবে সম্পাদনকারী","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَّال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73318,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لِّمَا","transliteration":"limā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73319,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يُرِيدُ","transliteration":"yurīdu","translation_bn":"তিনি চান","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73320,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"١٠٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'khālidīna fīhā mā dāmati l-samāwātu wal-arḍu illā mā shāa rabbuka inna rabbaka faʿʿālun limā yurīdu', 'সেখানে তারা স্থায়ী হবে চিরকালের জন্য যে পর্যন্ত আকাশসমূহ ও পৃথিবী বিদ্যমান থাকবে যদি না তোমার প্রতিপালক অন্য কিছু ইচ্ছে করেন। তোমার প্রতিপালক অবশ্যই করতে সক্ষম যা তিনি করতে চান।', '[They will be] abiding therein as long as the heavens and the earth endure, except what your Lord should will. Indeed, your Lord is an effecter of what He intends.', 'সেখানে তারা স্থায়ী হবে চিরকালের জন্য যে পর্যন্ত আকাশসমূহ ও পৃথিবী বিদ্যমান থাকবে যদি না তোমার প্রতিপালক অন্য কিছু ইচ্ছে করেন। তোমার প্রতিপালক অবশ্যই করতে সক্ষম যা তিনি করতে চান।', '[They will be] abiding therein as long as the heavens and the earth endure, except what your Lord should will. Indeed, your Lord is an effecter of what He intends.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011107.mp3', now()),
  (11, 108, '', '[{"id":73632,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَأَمَّا","transliteration":"wa-ammā","translation_bn":"আর","root":"—","lemma":"أَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73633,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":73634,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"سُعِدُوا۟","transliteration":"suʿidū","translation_bn":"সৌভাগ্যবান হবে","root":"سعد","lemma":"سُعِدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73635,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَفِى","transliteration":"fafī","translation_bn":"তখন মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73636,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَنَّةِ","transliteration":"l-janati","translation_bn":"জান্নাতের","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73637,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","transliteration":"khālidīna","translation_bn":"স্থায়ী বসবাসকারী","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73638,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে (তারা থাকবে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73639,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যতক্ষণ","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":73640,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"دَامَتِ","transliteration":"dāmati","translation_bn":"বিদ্যমান থাকবে","root":"دوم","lemma":"دَامُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73641,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتُ","transliteration":"l-samāwātu","translation_bn":"আকাশসমূহ","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73642,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضُ","transliteration":"wal-arḍu","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবী","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73643,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":73644,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":73645,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"شَآءَ","transliteration":"shāa","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73646,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكَ ۖ","transliteration":"rabbuka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73648,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَطَآءً","transliteration":"ʿaṭāan","translation_bn":"(তারা পাবে) পুরস্কার","root":"عطو","lemma":"عَطَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73649,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرَ","transliteration":"ghayra","translation_bn":"নয়","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73650,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مَجْذُوذٍۢ","transliteration":"majdhūdhin","translation_bn":"বিছিন্ন হওয়ার","root":"جذذ","lemma":"مَجْذُوذ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73651,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"١٠٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-ammā alladhīna suʿidū fafī l-janati khālidīna fīhā mā dāmati l-samāwātu wal-arḍu illā mā shāa rabbuka ʿaṭāan ghayra majdhūdhin', 'আর যারা সৌভাগ্যবান হবে, তারা জান্নাতে স্থায়ী হবে যে পর্যন্ত আকাশসমূহ ও পৃথিবী বিদ্যমান থাকবে, যদি না তোমার প্রতিপালক অন্য রকম ইচ্ছে করেন। এ হল এক অব্যাহত পুরস্কার।', 'And as for those who were [destined to be] prosperous, they will be in Paradise, abiding therein as long as the heavens and the earth endure, except what your Lord should will - a bestowal uninterrupted.', 'আর যারা সৌভাগ্যবান হবে, তারা জান্নাতে স্থায়ী হবে যে পর্যন্ত আকাশসমূহ ও পৃথিবী বিদ্যমান থাকবে, যদি না তোমার প্রতিপালক অন্য রকম ইচ্ছে করেন। এ হল এক অব্যাহত পুরস্কার।', 'And as for those who were [destined to be] prosperous, they will be in Paradise, abiding therein as long as the heavens and the earth endure, except what your Lord should will - a bestowal uninterrupted.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011108.mp3', now()),
  (11, 109, '', '[{"id":74009,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"অতএব না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74010,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَكُ","transliteration":"taku","translation_bn":"তুমি থাকবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74011,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74012,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِرْيَةٍۢ","transliteration":"mir''yatin","translation_bn":"সংশয়ের","root":"مري","lemma":"مِرْيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74013,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে যার","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74014,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَعْبُدُ","transliteration":"yaʿbudu","translation_bn":"উপাসনা করে","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74015,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ ۚ","transliteration":"hāulāi","translation_bn":"এসব (মুশরিকরা)","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":74017,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":74018,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَعْبُدُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿbudūna","translation_bn":"তারা উপাসনা করে","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74019,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":74020,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كَمَا","transliteration":"kamā","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74021,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَعْبُدُ","transliteration":"yaʿbudu","translation_bn":"উপাসনা করতো","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74022,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ءَابَآؤُهُم","transliteration":"ābāuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের পূর্বপুরুষেরা","root":"ابو","lemma":"ا^بَاء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74023,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74024,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ ۚ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74026,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّا","transliteration":"wa-innā","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74027,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لَمُوَفُّوهُمْ","transliteration":"lamuwaffūhum","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তাদের পুরোপুরি দিবো","root":"وفي","lemma":"مُوَفُّو","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":74028,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"نَصِيبَهُمْ","transliteration":"naṣībahum","translation_bn":"তাদের অংশ","root":"نصب","lemma":"نَصِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74029,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرَ","transliteration":"ghayra","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74030,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مَنقُوصٍۢ","transliteration":"manqūṣin","translation_bn":"কম করা","root":"نقص","lemma":"مَنقُوص","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74031,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"١٠٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falā taku fī mir''yatin mimmā yaʿbudu hāulāi mā yaʿbudūna illā kamā yaʿbudu ābāuhum min qablu wa-innā lamuwaffūhum naṣībahum ghayra manqūṣin', 'কাজেই তারা যেগুলোর ‘ইবাদাত করে সেগুলোর ব্যাপারে সন্দেহে পতিত হয়ো না। তারা যেগুলোর ‘ইবাদাত করে সেগুলো তা ছাড়া আর কিছুই নয় যেগুলোর ‘ইবাদাত পূর্বে তাদের পিতৃপুরুষরা করত, আমি অবশ্যই তাদের প্রাপ্য অংশ তাদেরকে পূর্ণ মাত্রাতেই দেব, কোনই কমতি করা হবে না।', 'So do not be in doubt, [O Muhammad], as to what these [polytheists] are worshipping. They worship not except as their fathers worshipped before. And indeed, We will give them their share undiminished.', 'কাজেই তারা যেগুলোর ‘ইবাদাত করে সেগুলোর ব্যাপারে সন্দেহে পতিত হয়ো না। তারা যেগুলোর ‘ইবাদাত করে সেগুলো তা ছাড়া আর কিছুই নয় যেগুলোর ‘ইবাদাত পূর্বে তাদের পিতৃপুরুষরা করত, আমি অবশ্যই তাদের প্রাপ্য অংশ তাদেরকে পূর্ণ মাত্রাতেই দেব, কোনই কমতি করা হবে না।', 'So do not be in doubt, [O Muhammad], as to what these [polytheists] are worshipping. They worship not except as their fathers worshipped before. And indeed, We will give them their share undiminished.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011109.mp3', now()),
  (11, 110, '', '[{"id":74120,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74121,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْنَا","transliteration":"ātaynā","translation_bn":"আমরা দিয়েছিলাম","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74122,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَى","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":74123,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","transliteration":"l-kitāba","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74124,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَٱخْتُلِفَ","transliteration":"fa-ukh''tulifa","translation_bn":"অতঃপর মতবিরোধ ঘটেছিলো","root":"خلف","lemma":"ٱخْتَلَفَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74125,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ ۚ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74127,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْلَا","transliteration":"walawlā","translation_bn":"এবং যদি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74128,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَلِمَةٌۭ","transliteration":"kalimatun","translation_bn":"একটি বাণী","root":"كلم","lemma":"كَلِمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74129,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"سَبَقَتْ","transliteration":"sabaqat","translation_bn":"পূর্বে নির্ধারিত হতো","root":"سبق","lemma":"سَبَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74130,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74131,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74132,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَقُضِىَ","transliteration":"laquḍiya","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই মীমাংসা করে দেয়া হতো","root":"قضي","lemma":"قَضَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":74133,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"baynahum","translation_bn":"তাদের মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":74135,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"wa-innahum","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই তারা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74136,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَفِى","transliteration":"lafī","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":74137,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"شَكٍّۢ","transliteration":"shakkin","translation_bn":"সন্দেহের","root":"شكك","lemma":"شَكّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74138,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74139,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مُرِيبٍۢ","transliteration":"murībin","translation_bn":"বিভ্রান্তিকর (সন্দেহে)","root":"ريب","lemma":"مُرِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74140,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"١١٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১০)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad ātaynā mūsā l-kitāba fa-ukh''tulifa fīhi walawlā kalimatun sabaqat min rabbika laquḍiya baynahum wa-innahum lafī shakkin min''hu murībin', 'ইতোপূর্বে আমি মূসাকেও কিতাব দিয়েছিলাম, কিন্তু তাতেও মতবিরোধ করা হয়েছিল। তোমার প্রতিপালকের পক্ষ থেকে একটি কথা যদি আগেই বলে দেয়া না হত, তাহলে তাদের মাঝে অবশ্যই ফায়সালাই ক’রে দেয়া হত, এ ব্যাপারে তারা অবশ্য সন্দেহপূর্ণ সংশয়ে পড়ে আছে।', 'And We had certainly given Moses the Scripture, but it came under disagreement. And if not for a word that preceded from your Lord, it would have been judged between them. And indeed they are, concerning the Qur''an, in disquieting doubt.', 'ইতোপূর্বে আমি মূসাকেও কিতাব দিয়েছিলাম, কিন্তু তাতেও মতবিরোধ করা হয়েছিল। তোমার প্রতিপালকের পক্ষ থেকে একটি কথা যদি আগেই বলে দেয়া না হত, তাহলে তাদের মাঝে অবশ্যই ফায়সালাই ক’রে দেয়া হত, এ ব্যাপারে তারা অবশ্য সন্দেহপূর্ণ সংশয়ে পড়ে আছে।', 'And We had certainly given Moses the Scripture, but it came under disagreement. And if not for a word that preceded from your Lord, it would have been judged between them. And indeed they are, concerning the Qur''an, in disquieting doubt.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011110.mp3', now()),
  (11, 111, '', '[{"id":74373,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ","transliteration":"wa-inna","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74374,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كُلًّۭا","transliteration":"kullan","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেককে (ব্যক্তিকে)","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74375,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَّمَّا","transliteration":"lammā","translation_bn":"যখন (সময় আসবে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":74376,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَيُوَفِّيَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"layuwaffiyannahum","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তাদের পুরোপুরি দিবেন","root":"وفي","lemma":"وَفَّىٰ^","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":74377,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكَ","transliteration":"rabbuka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74378,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَـٰلَهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"aʿmālahum","translation_bn":"তাদের কাজগুলোর (প্রতিফল)","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74380,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":74381,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74382,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74383,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"خَبِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"khabīrun","translation_bn":"খুব অবহিত","root":"خبر","lemma":"خَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74384,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"١١١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১১)","root":"—","lemma":"١١١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-inna kullan lammā layuwaffiyannahum rabbuka aʿmālahum innahu bimā yaʿmalūna khabīrun', 'এতে সন্দেহ নেই যে, তোমার প্রতিপালক প্রত্যেককেই তাদের ‘আমালের প্রতিফল অবশ্য অবশ্যই পুরোপুরি দান করবেন, তারা যা করে সে বিষয়ে তিনি পূর্ণ ওয়াকিফহাল।', 'And indeed, each [of the believers and disbelievers] - your Lord will fully compensate them for their deeds. Indeed, He is Acquainted with what they do.', 'এতে সন্দেহ নেই যে, তোমার প্রতিপালক প্রত্যেককেই তাদের ‘আমালের প্রতিফল অবশ্য অবশ্যই পুরোপুরি দান করবেন, তারা যা করে সে বিষয়ে তিনি পূর্ণ ওয়াকিফহাল।', 'And indeed, each [of the believers and disbelievers] - your Lord will fully compensate them for their deeds. Indeed, He is Acquainted with what they do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011111.mp3', now()),
  (11, 112, '', '[{"id":74606,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱسْتَقِمْ","transliteration":"fa-is''taqim","translation_bn":"অতএব সুদৃঢ় থাকো","root":"قوم","lemma":"ٱسْتَقَٰمُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74607,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَمَآ","transliteration":"kamā","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74608,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أُمِرْتَ","transliteration":"umir''ta","translation_bn":"তোমাকে আদেশ করা হয়েছে","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74609,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74610,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَابَ","transliteration":"tāba","translation_bn":"ফিরে এসেছে (ঈমান ও আনুগত্যে)","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74611,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَعَكَ","transliteration":"maʿaka","translation_bn":"তোমার সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":74612,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74613,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَطْغَوْا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"taṭghaw","translation_bn":"তোমরা সীমালঙ্ঘন করো","root":"طغي","lemma":"طَغَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74615,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":74616,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74617,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কাজ করছো","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74618,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بَصِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"baṣīrun","translation_bn":"পূর্ণ দৃষ্টি রাখেন","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74619,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١١٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১২)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-is''taqim kamā umir''ta waman tāba maʿaka walā taṭghaw innahu bimā taʿmalūna baṣīrun', 'কাজেই তুমি ও তোমার সাথে যারা (আল্লাহর দিকে) তাওবা করেছে সুদৃঢ় হয়ে থাক আল্লাহ যেভাবে তোমাকে আদেশ দিয়েছেন, আর সীমালঙ্ঘন করো না। তোমরা যা কিছু কর তিনি তা ভালভাবেই দেখেন।', 'So remain on a right course as you have been commanded, [you] and those who have turned back with you [to Allah], and do not transgress. Indeed, He is Seeing of what you do.', 'কাজেই তুমি ও তোমার সাথে যারা (আল্লাহর দিকে) তাওবা করেছে সুদৃঢ় হয়ে থাক আল্লাহ যেভাবে তোমাকে আদেশ দিয়েছেন, আর সীমালঙ্ঘন করো না। তোমরা যা কিছু কর তিনি তা ভালভাবেই দেখেন।', 'So remain on a right course as you have been commanded, [you] and those who have turned back with you [to Allah], and do not transgress. Indeed, He is Seeing of what you do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011112.mp3', now()),
  (11, 113, '', '[{"id":75004,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75005,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَرْكَنُوٓا۟","transliteration":"tarkanū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ঝুঁকো","root":"ركن","lemma":"تَرْكَنُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75006,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75007,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":75008,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَمُوا۟","transliteration":"ẓalamū","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘন করেছে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75009,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَتَمَسَّكُمُ","transliteration":"fatamassakumu","translation_bn":"তাহ''লে স্পর্শ করবে তোমাদের","root":"مسس","lemma":"مَسَّ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":75010,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارُ","transliteration":"l-nāru","translation_bn":"(জাহান্নামের) আগুন","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75011,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না (হবে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75012,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75013,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75014,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75015,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":75016,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোন","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75017,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَوْلِيَآءَ","transliteration":"awliyāa","translation_bn":"অভিভাবক","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75018,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75019,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":75020,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"تُنصَرُونَ","transliteration":"tunṣarūna","translation_bn":"তোমাদের সাহায্য করা হবে","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75021,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"١١٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā tarkanū ilā alladhīna ẓalamū fatamassakumu l-nāru wamā lakum min dūni l-lahi min awliyāa thumma lā tunṣarūna', 'তোমরা যালিমদের প্রতি ঝুঁকে পড়ো না, তাহলে আগুন তোমাদেরকে স্পর্শ করবে, আর তখন আল্লাহ ছাড়া কেউ তোমাদের অভিভাবক থাকবে না, অত:পর তোমাদেরকে সাহায্যও করা হবে না।', 'And do not incline toward those who do wrong, lest you be touched by the Fire, and you would not have other than Allah any protectors; then you would not be helped.', 'তোমরা যালিমদের প্রতি ঝুঁকে পড়ো না, তাহলে আগুন তোমাদেরকে স্পর্শ করবে, আর তখন আল্লাহ ছাড়া কেউ তোমাদের অভিভাবক থাকবে না, অত:পর তোমাদেরকে সাহায্যও করা হবে না।', 'And do not incline toward those who do wrong, lest you be touched by the Fire, and you would not have other than Allah any protectors; then you would not be helped.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011113.mp3', now()),
  (11, 114, '', '[{"id":75056,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَقِمِ","transliteration":"wa-aqimi","translation_bn":"এবং প্রতিষ্ঠা করো","root":"قوم","lemma":"أَقَامَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75057,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","translation_bn":"সালাত","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75058,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"طَرَفَىِ","transliteration":"ṭarafayi","translation_bn":"দুই প্রান্তে","root":"طرف","lemma":"طَرَف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75059,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّهَارِ","transliteration":"l-nahāri","translation_bn":"দিনের","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75060,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَزُلَفًۭا","transliteration":"wazulafan","translation_bn":"এবং (প্রথম) অংশে","root":"زلف","lemma":"زُلْفَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75061,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75062,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلِ ۚ","transliteration":"al-layli","translation_bn":"রাতের","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75064,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":75065,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَسَنَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ḥasanāti","translation_bn":"সৎকাজগুলো","root":"حسن","lemma":"حَسَنَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75066,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يُذْهِبْنَ","transliteration":"yudh''hib''na","translation_bn":"দূর করে দেয়","root":"ذهب","lemma":"أَذْهَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75067,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّيِّـَٔاتِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-sayiāti","translation_bn":"মন্দকাজগুলোকে","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَيِّـ#َات","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75069,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":75070,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ذِكْرَىٰ","transliteration":"dhik''rā","translation_bn":"উপদেশ","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75071,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لِلذَّٰكِرِينَ","transliteration":"lildhākirīna","translation_bn":"উপদেশগ্রহণকারীদের জন্যে","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَّٰكِرِين","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75072,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١١٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-aqimi l-ṣalata ṭarafayi l-nahāri wazulafan mina al-layli inna l-ḥasanāti yudh''hib''na l-sayiāti dhālika dhik''rā lildhākirīna', 'তুমি নামায প্রতিষ্ঠা কর দিনের দু’ প্রান্ত সময়ে আর কিছুটা রাত অতিবাহিত হওয়ার পর, পূণ্যরাজি অবশ্যই পাপরাশিকে দূর করে দেয়, এটা তাদের জন্য উপদেশ যারা উপদেশ গ্রহণ করে।', 'And establish prayer at the two ends of the day and at the approach of the night. Indeed, good deeds do away with misdeeds. That is a reminder for those who remember.', 'তুমি নামায প্রতিষ্ঠা কর দিনের দু’ প্রান্ত সময়ে আর কিছুটা রাত অতিবাহিত হওয়ার পর, পূণ্যরাজি অবশ্যই পাপরাশিকে দূর করে দেয়, এটা তাদের জন্য উপদেশ যারা উপদেশ গ্রহণ করে।', 'And establish prayer at the two ends of the day and at the approach of the night. Indeed, good deeds do away with misdeeds. That is a reminder for those who remember.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011114.mp3', now()),
  (11, 115, '', '[{"id":75287,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱصْبِرْ","transliteration":"wa-iṣ''bir","translation_bn":"এবং ধৈর্য ধরো","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75288,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّ","transliteration":"fa-inna","translation_bn":"কারণ নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75289,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":75290,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":75291,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يُضِيعُ","transliteration":"yuḍīʿu","translation_bn":"নষ্ট করেন","root":"ضيع","lemma":"أَضَاعُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75292,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرَ","transliteration":"ajra","translation_bn":"কর্মফল","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75293,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-muḥ''sinīna","translation_bn":"সৎকর্মশীলদের","root":"حسن","lemma":"مُحْسِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75294,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"١١٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-iṣ''bir fa-inna l-laha lā yuḍīʿu ajra l-muḥ''sinīna', 'তুমি ধৈর্য ধর, কারণ আল্লাহ সৎকর্মশীল লোকদের কর্মফল কখনও বিনষ্ট করেন না।', 'And be patient, for indeed, Allah does not allow to be lost the reward of those who do good.', 'তুমি ধৈর্য ধর, কারণ আল্লাহ সৎকর্মশীল লোকদের কর্মফল কখনও বিনষ্ট করেন না।', 'And be patient, for indeed, Allah does not allow to be lost the reward of those who do good.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011115.mp3', now()),
  (11, 116, '', '[{"id":75495,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَوْلَا","transliteration":"falawlā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর কেন না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75496,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"(বর্তমান) ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75497,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75498,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرُونِ","transliteration":"l-qurūni","translation_bn":"জাতিসমূহের","root":"قرن","lemma":"قَرْن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75499,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75500,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِكُمْ","transliteration":"qablikum","translation_bn":"পূর্ব তোমাদের","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75501,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لُوا۟","transliteration":"ulū","translation_bn":"সম্পন্নরা","root":"اول","lemma":"أُولِى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75502,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بَقِيَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"baqiyyatin","translation_bn":"অবশিষ্ট","root":"بقي","lemma":"بَقِيَّت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75503,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَنْهَوْنَ","transliteration":"yanhawna","translation_bn":"(যারা) নিষেধ করতো","root":"نهي","lemma":"نَهَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75504,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَنِ","transliteration":"ʿani","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75505,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَسَادِ","transliteration":"l-fasādi","translation_bn":"বিপর্যয়","root":"فسد","lemma":"فَسَاد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75506,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75507,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75508,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"তবে ব্যতিক্রম","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":75509,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"قَلِيلًۭا","transliteration":"qalīlan","translation_bn":"স্বল্প সংখ্যক লোক","root":"قلل","lemma":"قَلِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75510,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّنْ","transliteration":"mimman","translation_bn":"মধ্যকার তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75511,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَنجَيْنَا","transliteration":"anjaynā","translation_bn":"আমরা রক্ষা করেছিলাম (যাদেরকে)","root":"نجو","lemma":"أَنجَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75512,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের মধ্যে হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75514,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّبَعَ","transliteration":"wa-ittabaʿa","translation_bn":"এবং অনুসরণ করতো","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75515,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":75516,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَمُوا۟","transliteration":"ẓalamū","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘন করেছিলো","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75517,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(তারই) যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":75518,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"أُتْرِفُوا۟","transliteration":"ut''rifū","translation_bn":"তাদের সুখ-সুবিধা দেয়া হয়েছিলো","root":"ترف","lemma":"أُتْرِفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75519,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75520,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانُوا۟","transliteration":"wakānū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75521,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"مُجْرِمِينَ","transliteration":"muj''rimīna","translation_bn":"অপরাধী","root":"جرم","lemma":"مُجْرِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75522,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"١١٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falawlā kāna mina l-qurūni min qablikum ulū baqiyyatin yanhawna ʿani l-fasādi fī l-arḍi illā qalīlan mimman anjaynā min''hum wa-ittabaʿa alladhīna ẓalamū mā ut''rifū fīhi wakānū muj''rimīna', 'তাহলে তোমাদের পূর্ব যুগের লোকদের মধ্যে এমন সৎকর্মশীল কেন হয়নি যারা যমীনে বিপর্যয় সৃষ্টি করা হতে বাধা দিত? এমন লোক কমই ছিল আর তাদেরকে আমি বাঁচিয়ে নিয়েছিলাম। যালিমরা তো তাদেরকে দেয়া সামগ্রীর সুখ স্বাচ্ছন্দ্যেই লিপ্ত থাকতো আর তারা ছিল অপরাধী।', 'So why were there not among the generations before you those of enduring discrimination forbidding corruption on earth - except a few of those We saved from among them? But those who wronged pursued what luxury they were given therein, and they were criminals.', 'তাহলে তোমাদের পূর্ব যুগের লোকদের মধ্যে এমন সৎকর্মশীল কেন হয়নি যারা যমীনে বিপর্যয় সৃষ্টি করা হতে বাধা দিত? এমন লোক কমই ছিল আর তাদেরকে আমি বাঁচিয়ে নিয়েছিলাম। যালিমরা তো তাদেরকে দেয়া সামগ্রীর সুখ স্বাচ্ছন্দ্যেই লিপ্ত থাকতো আর তারা ছিল অপরাধী।', 'So why were there not among the generations before you those of enduring discrimination forbidding corruption on earth - except a few of those We saved from among them? But those who wronged pursued what luxury they were given therein, and they were criminals.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011116.mp3', now()),
  (11, 117, '', '[{"id":75871,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75872,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75873,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكَ","transliteration":"rabbuka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব (এমন যে)","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75874,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِيُهْلِكَ","transliteration":"liyuh''lika","translation_bn":"যাতে তিনি ধ্বংস করবেন","root":"هلك","lemma":"أَهْلَكَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75875,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرَىٰ","transliteration":"l-qurā","translation_bn":"জনবসতিগুলোকে","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75876,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِظُلْمٍۢ","transliteration":"biẓul''min","translation_bn":"ভাবে অন্যায়","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظُلْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75877,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَأَهْلُهَا","transliteration":"wa-ahluhā","translation_bn":"অথচ তার অধিবাসীরা (ছিলো)","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":75878,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مُصْلِحُونَ","transliteration":"muṣ''liḥūna","translation_bn":"সংশোধনকারী","root":"صلح","lemma":"مُصْلِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75879,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"١١٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā kāna rabbuka liyuh''lika l-qurā biẓul''min wa-ahluhā muṣ''liḥūna', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক এমন নন যে, তিনি অন্যায়ভাবে কোন জনপদ ধ্বংস করবেন এমতাবস্থায় যে, তার অধিবাসীরা সদাচারী।', 'And your Lord would not have destroyed the cities unjustly while their people were reformers.', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক এমন নন যে, তিনি অন্যায়ভাবে কোন জনপদ ধ্বংস করবেন এমতাবস্থায় যে, তার অধিবাসীরা সদাচারী।', 'And your Lord would not have destroyed the cities unjustly while their people were reformers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011117.mp3', now()),
  (11, 118, '', '[{"id":76070,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76071,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"شَآءَ","transliteration":"shāa","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করতেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76072,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكَ","transliteration":"rabbuka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76073,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَجَعَلَ","transliteration":"lajaʿala","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই বানাতে পারতেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":76074,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسَ","transliteration":"l-nāsa","translation_bn":"সব মানুষকে","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76075,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أُمَّةًۭ","transliteration":"ummatan","translation_bn":"জাতি","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76076,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٰحِدَةًۭ ۖ","transliteration":"wāḥidatan","translation_bn":"একই","root":"وحد","lemma":"وَٰحِدَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76078,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু (তবুও) না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76079,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَزَالُونَ","transliteration":"yazālūna","translation_bn":"তারা সর্বদা হতো","root":"زيل","lemma":"زَالَت","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76080,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مُخْتَلِفِينَ","transliteration":"mukh''talifīna","translation_bn":"মতবিরোধকারী","root":"خلف","lemma":"مُّخْتَلِف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76081,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"١١٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaw shāa rabbuka lajaʿala l-nāsa ummatan wāḥidatan walā yazālūna mukh''talifīna', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক চাইলে মানুষকে অবশ্যই এক জাতি করতে পারতেন, কিন্তু তারা মতভেদ করতেই থাকবে।', 'And if your Lord had willed, He could have made mankind one community; but they will not cease to differ.', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক চাইলে মানুষকে অবশ্যই এক জাতি করতে পারতেন, কিন্তু তারা মতভেদ করতেই থাকবে।', 'And if your Lord had willed, He could have made mankind one community; but they will not cease to differ.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011118.mp3', now()),
  (11, 119, '', '[{"id":76286,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"তবে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":76287,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":76288,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِمَ","transliteration":"raḥima","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ করতেন","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76289,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكَ ۚ","transliteration":"rabbuka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব (সেটা ভিন্ন কথা)","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76291,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلِذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"walidhālika","translation_bn":"এবং এ কারণে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76292,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقَهُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"khalaqahum","translation_bn":"তাদের সৃষ্টি করেছেন (স্বাধীনতা দিয়ে)","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76294,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَتَمَّتْ","transliteration":"watammat","translation_bn":"এবং (এভাবে) সম্পূর্ণ হলো","root":"تمم","lemma":"تَمَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76295,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَلِمَةُ","transliteration":"kalimatu","translation_bn":"একটি বাণী","root":"كلم","lemma":"كَلِمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76296,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের (যে)","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76297,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَأَمْلَأَنَّ","transliteration":"la-amla-anna","translation_bn":"\"অবশ্যই ভরে দিবো আমি","root":"ملا","lemma":"مُلِئَتْ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":76298,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمَ","transliteration":"jahannama","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামকে","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":76299,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76300,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجِنَّةِ","transliteration":"l-jinati","translation_bn":"জিন","root":"جنن","lemma":"جِنَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76301,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"wal-nāsi","translation_bn":"এবং মানুষ","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76302,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَجْمَعِينَ","transliteration":"ajmaʿīna","translation_bn":"একত্রেই\"","root":"جمع","lemma":"أَجْمَعِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76303,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"١١٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'illā man raḥima rabbuka walidhālika khalaqahum watammat kalimatu rabbika la-amla-anna jahannama mina l-jinati wal-nāsi ajmaʿīna', 'তবে তোমার প্রতিপালক যাদের প্রতি দয়া করেন তারা (মতবিরোধ করবে) না। এই উদ্দেশ্যেই তিনি তাদেরকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন, আর তোমার প্রতিপালকের এ বাণী পূর্ণ হবেই যে, আমি জাহান্নামকে জ্বিন আর মানুষ দিয়ে অবশ্য অবশ্যই ভরে দেব।', 'Except whom your Lord has given mercy, and for that He created them. But the word of your Lord is to be fulfilled that, "I will surely fill Hell with jinn and men all together."', 'তবে তোমার প্রতিপালক যাদের প্রতি দয়া করেন তারা (মতবিরোধ করবে) না। এই উদ্দেশ্যেই তিনি তাদেরকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন, আর তোমার প্রতিপালকের এ বাণী পূর্ণ হবেই যে, আমি জাহান্নামকে জ্বিন আর মানুষ দিয়ে অবশ্য অবশ্যই ভরে দেব।', 'Except whom your Lord has given mercy, and for that He created them. But the word of your Lord is to be fulfilled that, "I will surely fill Hell with jinn and men all together."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011119.mp3', now()),
  (11, 120, '', '[{"id":76356,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكُلًّۭا","transliteration":"wakullan","translation_bn":"এবং সব (কিছুই)","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76357,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَّقُصُّ","transliteration":"naquṣṣu","translation_bn":"আমরা বর্ণনা করছি","root":"قصص","lemma":"قَصَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76358,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ʿalayka","translation_bn":"তোমার কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76359,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76360,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنۢبَآءِ","transliteration":"anbāi","translation_bn":"সংবাদ","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَأ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76361,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرُّسُلِ","transliteration":"l-rusuli","translation_bn":"রাসূলদের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76362,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":76363,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"نُثَبِّتُ","transliteration":"nuthabbitu","translation_bn":"আমরা সুদৃঢ় করছি","root":"ثبت","lemma":"ثَبَّتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76364,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তা দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76365,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فُؤَادَكَ ۚ","transliteration":"fuādaka","translation_bn":"তোমার হৃদয়কে","root":"فاد","lemma":"فُؤَاد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76367,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَجَآءَكَ","transliteration":"wajāaka","translation_bn":"এবং তোমার কাছে এসেছে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76368,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76369,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذِهِ","transliteration":"hādhihi","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":76370,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقُّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","translation_bn":"প্রকৃত সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76371,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَمَوْعِظَةٌۭ","transliteration":"wamawʿiẓatun","translation_bn":"এবং উপদেশ","root":"وعظ","lemma":"مَّوْعِظَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76372,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَذِكْرَىٰ","transliteration":"wadhik''rā","translation_bn":"ও সাবধান বাণী","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76373,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لِلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"lil''mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু''মিনদের জন্যে","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76374,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"١٢٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakullan naquṣṣu ʿalayka min anbāi l-rusuli mā nuthabbitu bihi fuādaka wajāaka fī hādhihi l-ḥaqu wamawʿiẓatun wadhik''rā lil''mu''minīna', 'রসূলদের যে সব সংবাদসমূহ আমি তোমার কাছে বর্ণনা করলাম, এর দ্বারা আমি তোমার দিলকে মযবুত করছি, এতে তুমি প্রকৃত সত্যের জ্ঞান লাভ করবে আর মু’মিনদের জন্য এটা উপদেশ ও স্মারক।', 'And each [story] We relate to you from the news of the messengers is that by which We make firm your heart. And there has come to you, in this, the truth and an instruction and a reminder for the believers.', 'রসূলদের যে সব সংবাদসমূহ আমি তোমার কাছে বর্ণনা করলাম, এর দ্বারা আমি তোমার দিলকে মযবুত করছি, এতে তুমি প্রকৃত সত্যের জ্ঞান লাভ করবে আর মু’মিনদের জন্য এটা উপদেশ ও স্মারক।', 'And each [story] We relate to you from the news of the messengers is that by which We make firm your heart. And there has come to you, in this, the truth and an instruction and a reminder for the believers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011120.mp3', now()),
  (11, 121, '', '[{"id":76610,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقُل","transliteration":"waqul","translation_bn":"এবং বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76611,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لِّلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের জন্যে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76612,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":76613,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76614,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱعْمَلُوا۟","transliteration":"iʿ''malū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা কাজ করো","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76615,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76616,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَكَانَتِكُمْ","transliteration":"makānatikum","translation_bn":"তোমদের জায়গার","root":"كون","lemma":"مَكَانَت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76617,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরাও","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":76618,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰمِلُونَ","transliteration":"ʿāmilūna","translation_bn":"কাজ করে যাচ্ছি","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَٰمِل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76619,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١٢١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqul lilladhīna lā yu''minūna iʿ''malū ʿalā makānatikum innā ʿāmilūna', 'যারা ঈমান আনে না তাদেরকে বল, ‘তোমরা নিজেদের মত ও পথে থেকে কাজ করে যাও, আমরা (আমাদের) কাজ করছি।', 'And say to those who do not believe, "Work according to your position; indeed, we are working.', 'যারা ঈমান আনে না তাদেরকে বল, ‘তোমরা নিজেদের মত ও পথে থেকে কাজ করে যাও, আমরা (আমাদের) কাজ করছি।', 'And say to those who do not believe, "Work according to your position; indeed, we are working.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011121.mp3', now()),
  (11, 122, '', '[{"id":76728,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱنتَظِرُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wa-intaẓirū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা অপেক্ষা করো","root":"نظر","lemma":"يَنتَظِرُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76729,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরাও","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":76730,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُنتَظِرُونَ","transliteration":"muntaẓirūna","translation_bn":"প্রতীক্ষাকারী\"","root":"نظر","lemma":"مُنتَظِرُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76731,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"١٢٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-intaẓirū innā muntaẓirūna', 'আর তোমরা অপেক্ষা কর, আমরাও অপেক্ষায় থাকলাম।’', 'And wait, indeed, we are waiting."', 'আর তোমরা অপেক্ষা কর, আমরাও অপেক্ষায় থাকলাম।’', 'And wait, indeed, we are waiting."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011122.mp3', now()),
  (11, 123, '', '[{"id":76919,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلِلَّهِ","transliteration":"walillahi","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহর (আছে জ্ঞান)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76920,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"غَيْبُ","transliteration":"ghaybu","translation_bn":"অদৃশ্যের","root":"غيب","lemma":"غَيْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76921,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশসমূহের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76922,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76923,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَإِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"wa-ilayhi","translation_bn":"এবং তাঁরই দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76924,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يُرْجَعُ","transliteration":"yur''jaʿu","translation_bn":"ফিরিয়ে আনা হবে","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76925,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَمْرُ","transliteration":"l-amru","translation_bn":"ব্যাপার","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76926,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كُلُّهُۥ","transliteration":"kulluhu","translation_bn":"সবই","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76927,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَٱعْبُدْهُ","transliteration":"fa-uʿ''bud''hu","translation_bn":"অতএব তাঁরই ইবাদত করো","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76928,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَتَوَكَّلْ","transliteration":"watawakkal","translation_bn":"ভরসা করো","root":"وكل","lemma":"تَوَكَّلْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76929,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ ۚ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"তাঁরই উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76931,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76932,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكَ","transliteration":"rabbuka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76933,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِغَـٰفِلٍ","transliteration":"bighāfilin","translation_bn":"অনবহিত","root":"غفل","lemma":"غَٰفِل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76934,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عَمَّا","transliteration":"ʿammā","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে যা","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76935,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কাজ করছো","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76936,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٢٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walillahi ghaybu l-samāwāti wal-arḍi wa-ilayhi yur''jaʿu l-amru kulluhu fa-uʿ''bud''hu watawakkal ʿalayhi wamā rabbuka bighāfilin ʿammā taʿmalūna', 'আসমানসমূহ ও যমীনের অদৃশ্যের জ্ঞান কেবল আল্লাহরই রয়েছে। সকল বিষয়ই (চূড়ান্ত সিদ্ধান্তের জন্য) তাঁর কাছে ফিরে যায়, কাজেই তুমি তাঁরই ‘ইবাদাত কর, আর তাঁর উপরই নির্ভর কর, তোমরা যা কিছু করছ, সে সম্পর্কে তোমার প্রতিপালক মোটেই বে-খবর নন।', 'And to Allah belong the unseen [aspects] of the heavens and the earth and to Him will be returned the matter, all of it, so worship Him and rely upon Him. And your Lord is not unaware of that which you do.', 'আসমানসমূহ ও যমীনের অদৃশ্যের জ্ঞান কেবল আল্লাহরই রয়েছে। সকল বিষয়ই (চূড়ান্ত সিদ্ধান্তের জন্য) তাঁর কাছে ফিরে যায়, কাজেই তুমি তাঁরই ‘ইবাদাত কর, আর তাঁর উপরই নির্ভর কর, তোমরা যা কিছু করছ, সে সম্পর্কে তোমার প্রতিপালক মোটেই বে-খবর নন।', 'And to Allah belong the unseen [aspects] of the heavens and the earth and to Him will be returned the matter, all of it, so worship Him and rely upon Him. And your Lord is not unaware of that which you do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/011123.mp3', now())
