"id":71337,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71338,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسِّجْنِ","transliteration":"l-sij''ni","translation_bn":"কারাগার","root":"سجن","lemma":"سِّجْن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71339,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"وَجَآءَ","transliteration":"wajāa","translation_bn":"এবং নিয়ে এনেছেন","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71340,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"بِكُم","transliteration":"bikum","translation_bn":"আপনাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"بِكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71341,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71342,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَدْوِ","transliteration":"l-badwi","translation_bn":"মরুভূমি","root":"بدو","lemma":"بَدْو","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71343,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71344,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِ","transliteration":"baʿdi","translation_bn":"পর","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71345,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":71346,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"نَّزَغَ","transliteration":"nazagha","translation_bn":"বিরোধ সৃষ্টি করেছে","root":"نزغ","lemma":"نَّزَغَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71347,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","translation_bn":"শয়তান","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71348,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنِى","transliteration":"baynī","translation_bn":"আমার মাঝে","root":"بين\r","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":71349,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"وَبَيْنَ","transliteration":"wabayna","translation_bn":"ও মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71350,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"إِخْوَتِىٓ ۚ","transliteration":"ikh''watī","translation_bn":"আমার ভাইদের","root":"اخو","lemma":"إِخْوَةٌ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71352,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":71353,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71354,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"لَطِيفٌۭ","transliteration":"laṭīfun","translation_bn":"সুক্ষ্মদর্শী","root":"لطف","lemma":"لَطِيف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":71355,"position":41,"text_uthmani":"لِّمَا","transliteration":"limā","translation_bn":"তার যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71356,"position":42,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ ۚ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি চান","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71358,"position":43,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":71359,"position":44,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":71360,"position":45,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَلِيمُ","transliteration":"l-ʿalīmu","translation_bn":"মহাবিজ্ঞ","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71361,"position":46,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَكِيمُ","transliteration":"l-ḥakīmu","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞাময়","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71362,"position":47,"text_uthmani":"١٠٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'warafaʿa abawayhi ʿalā l-ʿarshi wakharrū lahu sujjadan waqāla yāabati hādhā tawīlu ru''yāya min qablu qad jaʿalahā rabbī ḥaqqan waqad aḥsana bī idh akhrajanī mina l-sij''ni wajāa bikum mina l-badwi min baʿdi an nazagha l-shayṭānu baynī wabayna ikh''watī inna rabbī laṭīfun limā yashāu innahu huwa l-ʿalīmu l-ḥakīmu', 'সে তার পিতা-মাতাকে সিংহাসনে উঠিয়ে নিল আর সকলে তার সম্মানে সাজদাহয় ঝুঁকে পড়ল। ইউসুফ বলল, ‘হে পিতা! এ-ই হচ্ছে আমার সে আগের দেখা স্বপ্নের ব্যাখ্যা। আমার রব্ব একে সত্যে পরিণত করেছেন, তিনি আমার প্রতি অনুগ্রহ করেছেন যে, তিনি আমাকে কয়েদখানা থেকে বের করে এনেছেন। আর শাইত্বান আমার আর আমার ভাইদের মধ্যে বিভেদ সৃষ্টি করার পরও তিনি আপনাদেরকে মরু অঞ্চল থেকে এখানে (মিসরে) এনে দিয়েছেন। আমার রব্ব যা করতে ইচ্ছে করেন তা সূক্ষ্ণ উপায়ে বাস্তবায়িত করে থাকেন, তিনি বড়ই বিজ্ঞ, বড়ই প্রজ্ঞাময়।', 'And he raised his parents upon the throne, and they bowed to him in prostration. And he said, "O my father, this is the explanation of my vision of before. My Lord has made it reality. And He was certainly good to me when He took me out of prison and brought you [here] from bedouin life after Satan had induced [estrangement] between me and my brothers. Indeed, my Lord is Subtle in what He wills. Indeed, it is He who is the Knowing, the Wise.', 'সে তার পিতা-মাতাকে সিংহাসনে উঠিয়ে নিল আর সকলে তার সম্মানে সাজদাহয় ঝুঁকে পড়ল। ইউসুফ বলল, ‘হে পিতা! এ-ই হচ্ছে আমার সে আগের দেখা স্বপ্নের ব্যাখ্যা। আমার রব্ব একে সত্যে পরিণত করেছেন, তিনি আমার প্রতি অনুগ্রহ করেছেন যে, তিনি আমাকে কয়েদখানা থেকে বের করে এনেছেন। আর শাইত্বান আমার আর আমার ভাইদের মধ্যে বিভেদ সৃষ্টি করার পরও তিনি আপনাদেরকে মরু অঞ্চল থেকে এখানে (মিসরে) এনে দিয়েছেন। আমার রব্ব যা করতে ইচ্ছে করেন তা সূক্ষ্ণ উপায়ে বাস্তবায়িত করে থাকেন, তিনি বড়ই বিজ্ঞ, বড়ই প্রজ্ঞাময়।', 'And he raised his parents upon the throne, and they bowed to him in prostration. And he said, "O my father, this is the explanation of my vision of before. My Lord has made it reality. And He was certainly good to me when He took me out of prison and brought you [here] from bedouin life after Satan had induced [estrangement] between me and my brothers. Indeed, my Lord is Subtle in what He wills. Indeed, it is He who is the Knowing, the Wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/012100.mp3', now()),
  (12, 101, '', '[{"id":71702,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ رَبِّ","transliteration":"rabbi","translation_bn":"হে আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71703,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":71704,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْتَنِى","transliteration":"ātaytanī","translation_bn":"আমাকে দিয়েছো ‍তুমি","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71705,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71706,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُلْكِ","transliteration":"l-mul''ki","translation_bn":"রাষ্ট্রক্ষমতার","root":"ملك","lemma":"مُلْك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71707,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَعَلَّمْتَنِى","transliteration":"waʿallamtanī","translation_bn":"ও আমাকে তুমি শিখিয়েছো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلَّمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71708,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"করা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71709,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَأْوِيلِ","transliteration":"tawīli","translation_bn":"ব্যাখ্যা","root":"اول","lemma":"تَأْوِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71710,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَحَادِيثِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-aḥādīthi","translation_bn":"স্বপ্নের","root":"حدث","lemma":"حَدِيث","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71712,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَاطِرَ","transliteration":"fāṭira","translation_bn":"(তুমিই) স্রষ্টা","root":"فطر","lemma":"فَاطِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71713,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71714,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71715,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَنتَ","transliteration":"anta","translation_bn":"তুমিই","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":71716,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَلِىِّۦ","transliteration":"waliyyī","translation_bn":"আমার অভিভাবক","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71717,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71718,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71719,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۖ","transliteration":"wal-ākhirati","translation_bn":"এবং আখিরাতেও","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71721,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"تَوَفَّنِى","transliteration":"tawaffanī","translation_bn":"আমাকে মৃত্যু দিও","root":"وفي","lemma":"تَوَفَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71722,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"مُسْلِمًۭا","transliteration":"mus''liman","translation_bn":"মুসলিম হিসেবে","root":"سلم","lemma":"مُسْلِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71723,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَأَلْحِقْنِى","transliteration":"wa-alḥiq''nī","translation_bn":"ও আমাকে মিলিত করো","root":"لحق","lemma":"أَلْحَقْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71724,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","transliteration":"bil-ṣāliḥīna","translation_bn":"সাথে ভালো লোকদের\"","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71725,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"١٠١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'rabbi qad ātaytanī mina l-mul''ki waʿallamtanī min tawīli l-aḥādīthi fāṭira l-samāwāti wal-arḍi anta waliyyī fī l-dun''yā wal-ākhirati tawaffanī mus''liman wa-alḥiq''nī bil-ṣāliḥīna', '‘হে আমার প্রতিপালক! তুমি আমাকে রাজত্ব দান করেছ, আর আমাকে স্বপ্নের ব্যাখ্যা শিখিয়েছ। আসমান যমীনের সৃষ্টিকর্তা! তুমিই দুনিয়ায় আর আখেরাতে আমার অভিভাবক, তুমি মুসলিম অবস্থায় আমার মৃত্যু দান করো এবং আমাকে সৎকর্মশীলদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত করো।’', 'My Lord, You have given me [something] of sovereignty and taught me of the interpretation of dreams. Creator of the heavens and earth, You are my protector in this world and in the Hereafter. Cause me to die a Muslim and join me with the righteous."', '‘হে আমার প্রতিপালক! তুমি আমাকে রাজত্ব দান করেছ, আর আমাকে স্বপ্নের ব্যাখ্যা শিখিয়েছ। আসমান যমীনের সৃষ্টিকর্তা! তুমিই দুনিয়ায় আর আখেরাতে আমার অভিভাবক, তুমি মুসলিম অবস্থায় আমার মৃত্যু দান করো এবং আমাকে সৎকর্মশীলদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত করো।’', 'My Lord, You have given me [something] of sovereignty and taught me of the interpretation of dreams. Creator of the heavens and earth, You are my protector in this world and in the Hereafter. Cause me to die a Muslim and join me with the righteous."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/012101.mp3', now()),
  (12, 102, '', '[{"id":71837,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"(হে নাবী) এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":71838,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"একটি","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71839,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنۢبَآءِ","transliteration":"anbāi","translation_bn":"সংবাদ সমূহের","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَأ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71840,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَيْبِ","transliteration":"l-ghaybi","translation_bn":"অদৃশ্যের","root":"غيب","lemma":"غَيْب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71841,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نُوحِيهِ","transliteration":"nūḥīhi","translation_bn":"তা আমরা ওহী করছি","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71842,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ ۖ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"তোমার প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71844,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71845,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كُنتَ","transliteration":"kunta","translation_bn":"তুমি ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71846,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَدَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ladayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের সঙ্গে","root":"—","lemma":"لَدَي\r","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":71847,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":71848,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَجْمَعُوٓا۟","transliteration":"ajmaʿū","translation_bn":"তারা একজোট হয়েছিলো","root":"جمع","lemma":"أَجْمَعُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71849,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرَهُمْ","transliteration":"amrahum","translation_bn":"তাদের কাজে","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71850,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এমতাবস্হায় যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":71851,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَمْكُرُونَ","transliteration":"yamkurūna","translation_bn":"ষড়যন্ত্র করছিলো","root":"مكر","lemma":"مَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71852,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٠٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dhālika min anbāi l-ghaybi nūḥīhi ilayka wamā kunta ladayhim idh ajmaʿū amrahum wahum yamkurūna', 'অদৃশ্য জগতের খবর থেকে এটা তোমাকে ওয়াহী করে জানালাম। ষড়যন্ত্র করার সময় যখন তারা তাদের কাজে জোটবদ্ধ হয়েছিল তখন তুমি তো তাদের কাছে ছিলে না।', 'That is from the news of the unseen which We reveal, [O Muhammad], to you. And you were not with them when they put together their plan while they conspired.', 'অদৃশ্য জগতের খবর থেকে এটা তোমাকে ওয়াহী করে জানালাম। ষড়যন্ত্র করার সময় যখন তারা তাদের কাজে জোটবদ্ধ হয়েছিল তখন তুমি তো তাদের কাছে ছিলে না।', 'That is from the news of the unseen which We reveal, [O Muhammad], to you. And you were not with them when they put together their plan while they conspired.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/012102.mp3', now()),
  (12, 103, '', '[{"id":72254,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নয়","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72255,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرُ","transliteration":"aktharu","translation_bn":"অধিকাংশ","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72256,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষ","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72257,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদিও","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72258,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"حَرَصْتَ","transliteration":"ḥaraṣta","translation_bn":"তুমি আকাঙ্ক্ষা করো","root":"حرص","lemma":"حَرَصْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72259,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"bimu''minīna","translation_bn":"বিশ্বাসী (হবে)","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72260,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"١٠٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā aktharu l-nāsi walaw ḥaraṣta bimu''minīna', 'তুমি যত প্রবল আগ্রহ ভরেই চাও না কেন, মানুষদের অধিকাংশই ঈমান আনবে না।', 'And most of the people, although you strive [for it], are not believers.', 'তুমি যত প্রবল আগ্রহ ভরেই চাও না কেন, মানুষদের অধিকাংশই ঈমান আনবে না।', 'And most of the people, although you strive [for it], are not believers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/012103.mp3', now()),
  (12, 104, '', '[{"id":72558,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72559,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَسْـَٔلُهُمْ","transliteration":"tasaluhum","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে তুমি চাচ্ছো","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72560,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"এ জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72561,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোন","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72562,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرٍ ۚ","transliteration":"ajrin","translation_bn":"পারিশ্রমিক","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72564,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"নয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":72565,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তা","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":72566,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":72567,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ذِكْرٌۭ","transliteration":"dhik''run","translation_bn":"উপদেশ","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72568,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِّلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"lil''ʿālamīna","translation_bn":"বিশ্বজগতের জন্যে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلَمِين","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72569,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"١٠٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā tasaluhum ʿalayhi min ajrin in huwa illā dhik''run lil''ʿālamīna', 'তুমি তার জন্য তাদের কাছে কোন পারিশ্রমিক চাচ্ছ না, এটা তো বিশ্বজগতের সকলের জন্য উপদেশ মাত্র।', 'And you do not ask of them for it any payment. It is not except a reminder to the worlds.', 'তুমি তার জন্য তাদের কাছে কোন পারিশ্রমিক চাচ্ছ না, এটা তো বিশ্বজগতের সকলের জন্য উপদেশ মাত্র।', 'And you do not ask of them for it any payment. It is not except a reminder to the worlds.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/012104.mp3', now()),
  (12, 105, '', '[{"id":72800,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَأَيِّن","transliteration":"waka-ayyin","translation_bn":"এবং কতইনা","root":"—","lemma":"كَأَيِّن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72801,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72802,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَةٍۢ","transliteration":"āyatin","translation_bn":"নিদর্শন (রয়েছে)","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72803,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72804,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72805,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"এবং পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72806,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَمُرُّونَ","transliteration":"yamurrūna","translation_bn":"তারা অতিক্রম করে","root":"مرر","lemma":"مَرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72807,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهَا","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","translation_bn":"তার উপর (দিয়ে)","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72808,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"অথচ তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":72809,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهَا","transliteration":"ʿanhā","translation_bn":"তা থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72810,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مُعْرِضُونَ","transliteration":"muʿ''riḍūna","translation_bn":"উপেক্ষাকারী","root":"عرض","lemma":"مُّعْرِضُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72811,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١٠٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waka-ayyin min āyatin fī l-samāwāti wal-arḍi yamurrūna ʿalayhā wahum ʿanhā muʿ''riḍūna', 'আসমানে আর যমীনে বহু নিদর্শন আছে যেগুলোর উপর দিয়ে তারা (প্রতিনিয়ত) অতিক্রম করে কিন্তু এসব কিছু থেকে তারা অবজ্ঞা করছে।', 'And how many a sign within the heavens and earth do they pass over while they, therefrom, are turning away.', 'আসমানে আর যমীনে বহু নিদর্শন আছে যেগুলোর উপর দিয়ে তারা (প্রতিনিয়ত) অতিক্রম করে কিন্তু এসব কিছু থেকে তারা অবজ্ঞা করছে।', 'And how many a sign within the heavens and earth do they pass over while they, therefrom, are turning away.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/012105.mp3', now()),
  (12, 106, '', '[{"id":72933,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72934,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُ","transliteration":"yu''minu","translation_bn":"বিশ্বাস করে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72935,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرُهُم","transliteration":"aktharuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের অধিকাংশ","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72936,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"উপর আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72937,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া যে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":72938,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَهُم","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"তখন তারা (বিশ্বাস করলেও)","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُم","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":72939,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُّشْرِكُونَ","transliteration":"mush''rikūna","translation_bn":"শিরক করে","root":"شرك","lemma":"مُشْرِك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72940,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"١٠٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā yu''minu aktharuhum bil-lahi illā wahum mush''rikūna', 'অধিকাংশ মানুষ আল্লাহতে বিশ্বাস করে, কিন্তু সাথে সাথে শিরকও করে।', 'And most of them believe not in Allah except while they associate others with Him.', 'অধিকাংশ মানুষ আল্লাহতে বিশ্বাস করে, কিন্তু সাথে সাথে শিরকও করে।', 'And most of them believe not in Allah except while they associate others with Him.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/012106.mp3', now()),
  (12, 107, '', '[{"id":73321,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَفَأَمِنُوٓا۟","transliteration":"afa-aminū","translation_bn":"তবে কি তারা নিরাপদ হয়েছে","root":"امن","lemma":"أَمِنَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":73322,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":73323,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَأْتِيَهُمْ","transliteration":"tatiyahum","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73324,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"غَـٰشِيَةٌۭ","transliteration":"ghāshiyatun","translation_bn":"আচ্ছন্নকারী","root":"غشو","lemma":"غَٰشِيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73325,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোন","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73326,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابِ","transliteration":"ʿadhābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73327,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":73328,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73329,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَأْتِيَهُمُ","transliteration":"tatiyahumu","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73330,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّاعَةُ","transliteration":"l-sāʿatu","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাত","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73331,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَغْتَةًۭ","transliteration":"baghtatan","translation_bn":"হঠাৎ করে","root":"بغت","lemma":"بَغْتَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73332,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এমতাবস্হায় যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":73333,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":73334,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَشْعُرُونَ","transliteration":"yashʿurūna","translation_bn":"টেরও পাবে","root":"شعر","lemma":"يَشْعُرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73335,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٠٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'afa-aminū an tatiyahum ghāshiyatun min ʿadhābi l-lahi aw tatiyahumu l-sāʿatu baghtatan wahum lā yashʿurūna', 'তারা কি নিশ্চিন্ত যে, আল্লাহর সর্বগ্রাসী ‘আযাব তাদের উপর এসে পড়বে না? কিংবা হঠাৎ ক্বিয়ামাত তাদের উপর এসে পড়বে না যা তারা টেরও পাবে না?', 'Then do they feel secure that there will not come to them an overwhelming [aspect] of the punishment of Allah or that the Hour will not come upon them suddenly while they do not perceive?', 'তারা কি নিশ্চিন্ত যে, আল্লাহর সর্বগ্রাসী ‘আযাব তাদের উপর এসে পড়বে না? কিংবা হঠাৎ ক্বিয়ামাত তাদের উপর এসে পড়বে না যা তারা টেরও পাবে না?', 'Then do they feel secure that there will not come to them an overwhelming [aspect] of the punishment of Allah or that the Hour will not come upon them suddenly while they do not perceive?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/012107.mp3', now()),
  (12, 108, '', '[{"id":73535,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"(হে নাবী) বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73536,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذِهِۦ","transliteration":"hādhihi","translation_bn":"\"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":73537,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِىٓ","transliteration":"sabīlī","translation_bn":"আমার পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73538,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَدْعُوٓا۟","transliteration":"adʿū","translation_bn":"ডাকি আমি","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73539,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73540,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":73542,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"ভিত্তিতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73543,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بَصِيرَةٍ","transliteration":"baṣīratin","translation_bn":"জ্ঞানের","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِيرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73544,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَنَا۠","transliteration":"anā","translation_bn":"আমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":73545,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَنِ","transliteration":"wamani","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73546,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّبَعَنِى ۖ","transliteration":"ittabaʿanī","translation_bn":"আমার অনুসরণ করে","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73548,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَسُبْحَـٰنَ","transliteration":"wasub''ḥāna","translation_bn":"এবং মহান পবিত্র","root":"سبح","lemma":"سُبْحَٰن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73549,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":73550,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73551,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَنَا۠","transliteration":"anā","translation_bn":"আমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":73552,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73553,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","transliteration":"l-mush''rikīna","translation_bn":"মুশরিকদের\"","root":"شرك","lemma":"مُشْرِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73554,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"١٠٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul hādhihi sabīlī adʿū ilā l-lahi ʿalā baṣīratin anā wamani ittabaʿanī wasub''ḥāna l-lahi wamā anā mina l-mush''rikīna', 'বল, ‘এটাই আমার পথ, আল্লাহর পথে আহবান জানাচ্ছি, আমি ও আমার অনুসারীরা, স্পষ্ট জ্ঞানের মাধ্যমে। আল্লাহ মহান, পবিত্র; আমি কক্ষনো মুশরিকদের মধ্যে শামিল হব না।', 'Say, "This is my way; I invite to Allah with insight, I and those who follow me. And exalted is Allah; and I am not of those who associate others with Him."', 'বল, ‘এটাই আমার পথ, আল্লাহর পথে আহবান জানাচ্ছি, আমি ও আমার অনুসারীরা, স্পষ্ট জ্ঞানের মাধ্যমে। আল্লাহ মহান, পবিত্র; আমি কক্ষনো মুশরিকদের মধ্যে শামিল হব না।', 'Say, "This is my way; I invite to Allah with insight, I and those who follow me. And exalted is Allah; and I am not of those who associate others with Him."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/012108.mp3', now()),
  (12, 109, '', '[{"id":73812,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73813,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَا","transliteration":"arsalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা পাঠিয়েছি","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73814,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73815,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِكَ","transliteration":"qablika","translation_bn":"আগে তোমার (রাসূলদেরকে)","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73816,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":73817,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رِجَالًۭا","transliteration":"rijālan","translation_bn":"পুরুষদেরকে","root":"رجل","lemma":"رِجَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73818,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نُّوحِىٓ","transliteration":"nūḥī","translation_bn":"আমরা ওহী করেছি","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73819,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِم","transliteration":"ilayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73820,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73821,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلِ","transliteration":"ahli","translation_bn":"অধিবাসীদের","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73822,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرَىٰٓ ۗ","transliteration":"l-qurā","translation_bn":"জনপদের","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73824,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَمْ","transliteration":"afalam","translation_bn":"নি তবে কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":73825,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَسِيرُوا۟","transliteration":"yasīrū","translation_bn":"তারা ভ্রমণ করে","root":"سير","lemma":"سَارَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73826,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73827,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73828,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَيَنظُرُوا۟","transliteration":"fayanẓurū","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তারা দেখেনি","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73829,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كَيْفَ","transliteration":"kayfa","translation_bn":"কেমন","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":73830,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73831,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","translation_bn":"পরিণতি (তাদের)","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَٰقِبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73832,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা (ছিলো)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":73833,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73834,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِمْ ۗ","transliteration":"qablihim","translation_bn":"পূর্ব তাদের","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73836,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَلَدَارُ","transliteration":"waladāru","translation_bn":"এবং অবশ্যই ঘর","root":"دور","lemma":"دَار","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73837,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","translation_bn":"পরকালের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73838,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":73839,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"لِّلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে (যারা)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73840,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّقَوْا۟ ۗ","transliteration":"ittaqaw","translation_bn":"ভয় করে চলে","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73842,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَا","transliteration":"afalā","translation_bn":"তবে কি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":73843,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"تَعْقِلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿqilūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা বুঝবে","root":"عقل","lemma":"عَقَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73844,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"١٠٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā arsalnā min qablika illā rijālan nūḥī ilayhim min ahli l-qurā afalam yasīrū fī l-arḍi fayanẓurū kayfa kāna ʿāqibatu alladhīna min qablihim waladāru l-ākhirati khayrun lilladhīna ittaqaw afalā taʿqilūna', 'তোমার পূর্বে জনপদবাসীদের মধ্যে যাদের কাছে ওয়াহী করতাম তারা পুরুষ মানুষ ব্যতীত ছিল না। তারা কি পৃথিবীতে ভ্রমণ করতঃ দেখে না যে, তাদের পূর্ববর্তী লোকেদের পরিণাম কী হয়েছিল? যারা তাকওয়া অবলম্বন করে, নিশ্চিতই পরলোকের ঘর তাদের আরো উত্তম, তবুও কি তোমরা বুঝবে না?', 'And We sent not before you [as messengers] except men to whom We revealed from among the people of cities. So have they not traveled through the earth and observed how was the end of those before them? And the home of the Hereafter is best for those who fear Allah; then will you not reason?', 'তোমার পূর্বে জনপদবাসীদের মধ্যে যাদের কাছে ওয়াহী করতাম তারা পুরুষ মানুষ ব্যতীত ছিল না। তারা কি পৃথিবীতে ভ্রমণ করতঃ দেখে না যে, তাদের পূর্ববর্তী লোকেদের পরিণাম কী হয়েছিল? যারা তাকওয়া অবলম্বন করে, নিশ্চিতই পরলোকের ঘর তাদের আরো উত্তম, তবুও কি তোমরা বুঝবে না?', 'And We sent not before you [as messengers] except men to whom We revealed from among the people of cities. So have they not traveled through the earth and observed how was the end of those before them? And the home of the Hereafter is best for those who fear Allah; then will you not reason?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/012109.mp3', now()),
  (12, 110, '', '[{"id":74176,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"এমনকি","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":74177,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":74178,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَيْـَٔسَ","transliteration":"is''tayasa","translation_bn":"নিরাশ হলো","root":"ياس","lemma":"ٱسْتَيْـ#َسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74179,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرُّسُلُ","transliteration":"l-rusulu","translation_bn":"রাসূলরা","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74180,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَظَنُّوٓا۟","transliteration":"waẓannū","translation_bn":"এবং (লোকেরা) ভাবলো","root":"ظنن","lemma":"ظَنَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74181,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"annahum","translation_bn":"যে তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":74182,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":74183,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كُذِبُوا۟","transliteration":"kudhibū","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে মিথ্যা আশ্বাস দেয়া হয়েছে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74184,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَهُمْ","transliteration":"jāahum","translation_bn":"তাদের (রাসূলদের) কাছে আসলো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74185,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"نَصْرُنَا","transliteration":"naṣrunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের সাহায্য","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74186,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَنُجِّىَ","transliteration":"fanujjiya","translation_bn":"অতঃপর উদ্ধার করা হলো","root":"نجو","lemma":"نَجَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74187,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":74188,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"نَّشَآءُ ۖ","transliteration":"nashāu","translation_bn":"আমরা চেয়েছি","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74190,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74191,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يُرَدُّ","transliteration":"yuraddu","translation_bn":"প্রতিরোধ করা হয়","root":"ردد","lemma":"رَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74192,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بَأْسُنَا","transliteration":"basunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের শাস্তি","root":"باس","lemma":"بَأْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74193,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"عَنِ","transliteration":"ʿani","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74194,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمِ","transliteration":"l-qawmi","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74195,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-muj''rimīna","translation_bn":"অপরাধী","root":"جرم","lemma":"مُجْرِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74196,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"١١٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১০)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ḥattā idhā is''tayasa l-rusulu waẓannū annahum qad kudhibū jāahum naṣrunā fanujjiya man nashāu walā yuraddu basunā ʿani l-qawmi l-muj''rimīna', '(হে নাবী! তোমার পূর্বেও এমন ঘটেছে যে,) শেষ পর্যন্ত রসূলগণ নিরাশ হয়েছে, আর লোকেরা মনে করেছে যে, তাদেরকে মিথ্যে কথা বলা হয়েছে, তখন তাদের (রাসূলদের) কাছে আমার সাহায্য এসে পৌঁছেছে, এভাবেই আমি যাকে ইচ্ছে রক্ষা করি। অপরাধী সম্প্রদায় থেকে আমার শাস্তি কক্ষনো ফিরিয়ে নেয়া হয় না।', '[They continued] until, when the messengers despaired and were certain that they had been denied, there came to them Our victory, and whoever We willed was saved. And Our punishment cannot be repelled from the people who are criminals.', '(হে নাবী! তোমার পূর্বেও এমন ঘটেছে যে,) শেষ পর্যন্ত রসূলগণ নিরাশ হয়েছে, আর লোকেরা মনে করেছে যে, তাদেরকে মিথ্যে কথা বলা হয়েছে, তখন তাদের (রাসূলদের) কাছে আমার সাহায্য এসে পৌঁছেছে, এভাবেই আমি যাকে ইচ্ছে রক্ষা করি। অপরাধী সম্প্রদায় থেকে আমার শাস্তি কক্ষনো ফিরিয়ে নেয়া হয় না।', '[They continued] until, when the messengers despaired and were certain that they had been denied, there came to them Our victory, and whoever We willed was saved. And Our punishment cannot be repelled from the people who are criminals.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/012110.mp3', now()),
  (12, 111, '', '[{"id":74557,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَقَدْ","transliteration":"laqad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":74558,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"রয়েছে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74559,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74560,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَصَصِهِمْ","transliteration":"qaṣaṣihim","translation_bn":"তাদের কাহিনীগুলোর","root":"قصص","lemma":"قَصَص","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74561,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عِبْرَةٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿib''ratun","translation_bn":"শিক্ষা","root":"عبر","lemma":"عِبْرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74562,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِّأُو۟لِى","transliteration":"li-ulī","translation_bn":"জন্যে সম্পন্নদের","root":"اول","lemma":"أُولِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74563,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَلْبَـٰبِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-albābi","translation_bn":"জ্ঞানবুদ্ধি","root":"لبب","lemma":"أَلْبَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74565,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":74566,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74567,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"حَدِيثًۭا","transliteration":"ḥadīthan","translation_bn":"এ কথা","root":"حدث","lemma":"حَدِيث","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74568,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُفْتَرَىٰ","transliteration":"yuf''tarā","translation_bn":"মনগড়া","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74569,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِن","transliteration":"walākin","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74570,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَصْدِيقَ","transliteration":"taṣdīqa","translation_bn":"সত্যায়নকারী","root":"صدق","lemma":"تَصْدِيق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74571,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":74572,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَ","transliteration":"bayna","translation_bn":"বিদ্যমান","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":74573,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَدَيْهِ","transliteration":"yadayhi","translation_bn":"তার সামনে","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74574,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَتَفْصِيلَ","transliteration":"watafṣīla","translation_bn":"এবং বিশদ ব্যাখ্যা","root":"فصل","lemma":"تَفْصِيل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74575,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74576,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74577,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَهُدًۭى","transliteration":"wahudan","translation_bn":"এবং দিশা","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74578,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَرَحْمَةًۭ","transliteration":"waraḥmatan","translation_bn":"ও অনুগ্রহ","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74579,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"liqawmin","translation_bn":"লোকদের জন্যে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74580,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"(যারা) ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74581,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"١١١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১১)","root":"—","lemma":"١١١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'laqad kāna fī qaṣaṣihim ʿib''ratun li-ulī l-albābi mā kāna ḥadīthan yuf''tarā walākin taṣdīqa alladhī bayna yadayhi watafṣīla kulli shayin wahudan waraḥmatan liqawmin yu''minūna', 'এদের কাহিনীসমূহে বোধশক্তিসম্পন্ন মানুষদের জন্য শিক্ষণীয় বিষয় আছে। এ কুরআন কোন মিথ্যে রচনা নয়, বরং তাদের পূর্বে আগত কিতাবের প্রত্যয়নকারী আর যাবতীয় বিষয়ের বিস্তারিত বিররণে সমৃদ্ধ, আর মু’মিন সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য পথের দিশারী ও রহমাত।', 'There was certainly in their stories a lesson for those of understanding. Never was the Qur''an a narration invented, but a confirmation of what was before it and a detailed explanation of all things and guidance and mercy for a people who believe.', 'এদের কাহিনীসমূহে বোধশক্তিসম্পন্ন মানুষদের জন্য শিক্ষণীয় বিষয় আছে। এ কুরআন কোন মিথ্যে রচনা নয়, বরং তাদের পূর্বে আগত কিতাবের প্রত্যয়নকারী আর যাবতীয় বিষয়ের বিস্তারিত বিররণে সমৃদ্ধ, আর মু’মিন সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য পথের দিশারী ও রহমাত।', 'There was certainly in their stories a lesson for those of understanding. Never was the Qur''an a narration invented, but a confirmation of what was before it and a detailed explanation of all things and guidance and mercy for a people who believe.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/012111.mp3', now())
