reposition)"},{"id":34051,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"صَنَعُوا۟","transliteration":"ṣanaʿū","translation_bn":"তারা করেছে","root":"صنع","lemma":"صَنَعُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34052,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"قَارِعَةٌ","transliteration":"qāriʿatun","translation_bn":"বিপর্যয়","root":"قرع","lemma":"قَارِعَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34053,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34054,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"تَحُلُّ","transliteration":"taḥullu","translation_bn":"আপতিত হবে","root":"حلل","lemma":"حَلَلْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34055,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"قَرِيبًۭا","transliteration":"qarīban","translation_bn":"নিকটে","root":"قرب","lemma":"قَرِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34056,"position":41,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34057,"position":42,"text_uthmani":"دَارِهِمْ","transliteration":"dārihim","translation_bn":"তাদের ঘরের","root":"دور","lemma":"دَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34058,"position":43,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"যতক্ষণ না","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34059,"position":44,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِىَ","transliteration":"yatiya","translation_bn":"আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34060,"position":45,"text_uthmani":"وَعْدُ","transliteration":"waʿdu","translation_bn":"অঙ্গীকার","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34061,"position":46,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":34063,"position":47,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":34064,"position":48,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":34065,"position":49,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":34066,"position":50,"text_uthmani":"يُخْلِفُ","transliteration":"yukh''lifu","translation_bn":"ভঙ্গ করেন","root":"خلف","lemma":"أَخْلَفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34067,"position":51,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمِيعَادَ","transliteration":"l-mīʿāda","translation_bn":"অঙ্গীকার","root":"وعد","lemma":"مِّيعَاد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34068,"position":52,"text_uthmani":"٣١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩১)","root":"—","lemma":"٣١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaw anna qur''ānan suyyirat bihi l-jibālu aw quṭṭiʿat bihi l-arḍu aw kullima bihi l-mawtā bal lillahi l-amru jamīʿan afalam yāy''asi alladhīna āmanū an law yashāu l-lahu lahadā l-nāsa jamīʿan walā yazālu alladhīna kafarū tuṣībuhum bimā ṣanaʿū qāriʿatun aw taḥullu qarīban min dārihim ḥattā yatiya waʿdu l-lahi inna l-laha lā yukh''lifu l-mīʿāda', 'কুরআন দিয়ে পর্বতকে যদি গতিশীল করা যেত, কিংবা যমীনকে দীর্ণ করা যেত কিংবা তা দিয়ে মৃত মানুষকে কথা বলানো যেত (তবুও তারা তাতে বিশ্বাস করত না)। (আলৌকিক কিছু করা মানুষের সাধ্যাতীত) বরং সমস্ত কিছুই আল্লাহর ক্ষমতাভুক্ত। যারা ঈমান এনেছে তারা কি জানে না যে, আল্লাহ ইচ্ছে করলে সকল মানুষকে সৎ পথে পরিচালিত করতে পারতেন। যারা কুফুরী করে তাদের কার্যকলাপের কারণে তাদের উপর কোন না কোন বিপদ আসতেই থাকে কিংবা তাদের ঘরের আশেপাশেই নাযিল হতে থাকে, যতক্ষণ না আল্লাহর ও‘য়াদা পূর্ণ হয়। নিশ্চয়ই আল্লাহ ওয়াদার ব্যতিক্রম করেন না।', 'And if there was any qur''an by which the mountains would be removed or the earth would be broken apart or the dead would be made to speak, [it would be this Qur''an], but to Allah belongs the affair entirely. Then have those who believed not accepted that had Allah willed, He would have guided the people, all of them? And those who disbelieve do not cease to be struck, for what they have done, by calamity - or it will descend near their home - until there comes the promise of Allah. Indeed, Allah does not fail in [His] promise.', 'কুরআন দিয়ে পর্বতকে যদি গতিশীল করা যেত, কিংবা যমীনকে দীর্ণ করা যেত কিংবা তা দিয়ে মৃত মানুষকে কথা বলানো যেত (তবুও তারা তাতে বিশ্বাস করত না)। (আলৌকিক কিছু করা মানুষের সাধ্যাতীত) বরং সমস্ত কিছুই আল্লাহর ক্ষমতাভুক্ত। যারা ঈমান এনেছে তারা কি জানে না যে, আল্লাহ ইচ্ছে করলে সকল মানুষকে সৎ পথে পরিচালিত করতে পারতেন। যারা কুফুরী করে তাদের কার্যকলাপের কারণে তাদের উপর কোন না কোন বিপদ আসতেই থাকে কিংবা তাদের ঘরের আশেপাশেই নাযিল হতে থাকে, যতক্ষণ না আল্লাহর ও‘য়াদা পূর্ণ হয়। নিশ্চয়ই আল্লাহ ওয়াদার ব্যতিক্রম করেন না।', 'And if there was any qur''an by which the mountains would be removed or the earth would be broken apart or the dead would be made to speak, [it would be this Qur''an], but to Allah belongs the affair entirely. Then have those who believed not accepted that had Allah willed, He would have guided the people, all of them? And those who disbelieve do not cease to be struck, for what they have done, by calamity - or it will descend near their home - until there comes the promise of Allah. Indeed, Allah does not fail in [His] promise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/013031.mp3', now()),
  (13, 32, '', '[{"id":34981,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدِ","transliteration":"walaqadi","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34982,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتُهْزِئَ","transliteration":"us''tuh''zi-a","translation_bn":"বিদ্রুপ করা হয়েছে","root":"هزا","lemma":"ٱسْتُهْزِئَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34983,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِرُسُلٍۢ","transliteration":"birusulin","translation_bn":"সাথে রাসূলদের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34984,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকেই","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34985,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِكَ","transliteration":"qablika","translation_bn":"তোমার পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34986,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَأَمْلَيْتُ","transliteration":"fa-amlaytu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর আমি অবকাশ দিয়েছি","root":"ملو","lemma":"أَمْلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34987,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) জন্যে যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34988,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34989,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34990,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَخَذْتُهُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"akhadhtuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের আমি পাকড়াও করেছি","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34992,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَكَيْفَ","transliteration":"fakayfa","translation_bn":"অতঃপর (দেখো) কেমন","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34993,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34994,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عِقَابِ","transliteration":"ʿiqābi","translation_bn":"আমার শাস্তি","root":"عقب","lemma":"عِقَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34995,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqadi us''tuh''zi-a birusulin min qablika fa-amlaytu lilladhīna kafarū thumma akhadhtuhum fakayfa kāna ʿiqābi', 'তোমার আগেও বহু রসূলকে ঠাট্টা-বিদ্রূপ করা হয়েছিল, তখন আমি কাফিরদেরকে (ইচ্ছেমত কাজ চালিয়ে যাওয়ার) অবকাশ দিয়েছিলাম, অবশেষে তাদেরকে পাকড়াও করেছিলাম। কেমন (ভয়াবহ) ছিল আমার শাস্তি!', 'And already were [other] messengers ridiculed before you, and I extended the time of those who disbelieved; then I seized them, and how [terrible] was My penalty.', 'তোমার আগেও বহু রসূলকে ঠাট্টা-বিদ্রূপ করা হয়েছিল, তখন আমি কাফিরদেরকে (ইচ্ছেমত কাজ চালিয়ে যাওয়ার) অবকাশ দিয়েছিলাম, অবশেষে তাদেরকে পাকড়াও করেছিলাম। কেমন (ভয়াবহ) ছিল আমার শাস্তি!', 'And already were [other] messengers ridiculed before you, and I extended the time of those who disbelieved; then I seized them, and how [terrible] was My penalty.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/013032.mp3', now()),
  (13, 33, '', '[{"id":35825,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَفَمَنْ","transliteration":"afaman","translation_bn":"তবে কি সেই (সত্ত্বা)","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":35826,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":35827,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَآئِمٌ","transliteration":"qāimun","translation_bn":"দন্ডায়মান (পর্যবেক্ষক)","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَا^ئِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35828,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35829,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35830,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسٍۭ","transliteration":"nafsin","translation_bn":"মানুষ","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35831,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ সম্পর্কে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35832,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَسَبَتْ ۗ","transliteration":"kasabat","translation_bn":"সে উপার্জন করেছে","root":"كسب","lemma":"كَسَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35834,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلُوا۟","transliteration":"wajaʿalū","translation_bn":"এ অবস্হায়ও তারা বানিয়েছে","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35835,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর জন্যে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35836,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"شُرَكَآءَ","transliteration":"shurakāa","translation_bn":"বহু শরীক","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35837,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35838,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"سَمُّوهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"sammūhum","translation_bn":"\"তাদের নাম বলো","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35840,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَمْ","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"কি","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35841,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تُنَبِّـُٔونَهُۥ","transliteration":"tunabbiūnahu","translation_bn":"তাঁকে তোমরা সংবাদ দিচ্ছো","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَّأَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35842,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ সম্পর্কে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35843,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":35844,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","translation_bn":"তিনি জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35845,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35846,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35847,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَم","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35848,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"بِظَـٰهِرٍۢ","transliteration":"biẓāhirin","translation_bn":"বাহ্যিক দিক","root":"ظهر","lemma":"ظَٰهِر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35849,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35850,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْلِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-qawli","translation_bn":"(অর্থহীন) কথার\"","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35852,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":35853,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"زُيِّنَ","transliteration":"zuyyina","translation_bn":"শোভনীয় করা হয়েছে","root":"زين","lemma":"زَيَّنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35854,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) জন্যে যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35855,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35856,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"مَكْرُهُمْ","transliteration":"makruhum","translation_bn":"তাদের ছলনা","root":"مكر","lemma":"مَكْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35857,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"وَصُدُّوا۟","transliteration":"waṣuddū","translation_bn":"এবং নিবৃত্ত করা হয়েছে","root":"صدد","lemma":"صُدُّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35858,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"عَنِ","transliteration":"ʿani","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35859,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّبِيلِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-sabīli","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35861,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35862,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"يُضْلِلِ","transliteration":"yuḍ''lili","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্ট করেন","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35863,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":35864,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"فَمَا","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35865,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35866,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35867,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"هَادٍۢ","transliteration":"hādin","translation_bn":"পথ প্রদর্শক","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَاد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35868,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"٣٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'afaman huwa qāimun ʿalā kulli nafsin bimā kasabat wajaʿalū lillahi shurakāa qul sammūhum am tunabbiūnahu bimā lā yaʿlamu fī l-arḍi am biẓāhirin mina l-qawli bal zuyyina lilladhīna kafarū makruhum waṣuddū ʿani l-sabīli waman yuḍ''lili l-lahu famā lahu min hādin', 'প্রত্যেক প্রাণীর উপার্জনের প্রতি যিনি দৃষ্টি রাখেন (তিনি কি তাদের অক্ষম ইলাহদের মত?) অথচ তারা আল্লাহর শরীক নির্দিষ্ট করে রেখেছে। বল, ‘তাদের নাম বল (যাদেরকে তোমরা আল্লাহর অংশীদার মনে কর), তোমরা কি পৃথিবীর এমন কোন সংবাদ তাঁকে দিতে চাও যা তিনি জানেন না। নাকি এগুলো কেবল কথার প্রদর্শনী? প্রকৃত ব্যাপার হল, কাফিরদের নিকট তাদের কলা কৌশলকে আকর্ষণীয় করে দেয়া হয়েছে আর তাদেরকে সৎ পথ থেকে বিরত রাখা হয়েছে। আল্লাহ যাকে গুমরাহ করেন তাঁকে পথ দেখানোর কেউ নেই।', 'Then is He who is a maintainer of every soul, [knowing] what it has earned, [like any other]? But to Allah they have attributed partners. Say, "Name them. Or do you inform Him of that which He knows not upon the earth or of what is apparent of speech?" Rather, their [own] plan has been made attractive to those who disbelieve, and they have been averted from the way. And whomever Allah leaves astray - there will be for him no guide.', 'প্রত্যেক প্রাণীর উপার্জনের প্রতি যিনি দৃষ্টি রাখেন (তিনি কি তাদের অক্ষম ইলাহদের মত?) অথচ তারা আল্লাহর শরীক নির্দিষ্ট করে রেখেছে। বল, ‘তাদের নাম বল (যাদেরকে তোমরা আল্লাহর অংশীদার মনে কর), তোমরা কি পৃথিবীর এমন কোন সংবাদ তাঁকে দিতে চাও যা তিনি জানেন না। নাকি এগুলো কেবল কথার প্রদর্শনী? প্রকৃত ব্যাপার হল, কাফিরদের নিকট তাদের কলা কৌশলকে আকর্ষণীয় করে দেয়া হয়েছে আর তাদেরকে সৎ পথ থেকে বিরত রাখা হয়েছে। আল্লাহ যাকে গুমরাহ করেন তাঁকে পথ দেখানোর কেউ নেই।', 'Then is He who is a maintainer of every soul, [knowing] what it has earned, [like any other]? But to Allah they have attributed partners. Say, "Name them. Or do you inform Him of that which He knows not upon the earth or of what is apparent of speech?" Rather, their [own] plan has been made attractive to those who disbelieve, and they have been averted from the way. And whomever Allah leaves astray - there will be for him no guide.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/013033.mp3', now()),
  (13, 34, '', '[{"id":36694,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36695,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি (রয়েছে)","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36696,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36697,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","translation_bn":"জীবনের","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36698,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا ۖ","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"পার্থিব","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36700,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَعَذَابُ","transliteration":"walaʿadhābu","translation_bn":"এবং অবশ্যই শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36701,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","translation_bn":"আখিরাতের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36702,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَشَقُّ ۖ","transliteration":"ashaqqu","translation_bn":"কঠোরতর","root":"شقق","lemma":"أَشَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":36704,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36705,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَهُم","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36706,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36707,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":36708,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36709,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَاقٍۢ","transliteration":"wāqin","translation_bn":"রক্ষাকারী","root":"وقي","lemma":"وَاق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36710,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lahum ʿadhābun fī l-ḥayati l-dun''yā walaʿadhābu l-ākhirati ashaqqu wamā lahum mina l-lahi min wāqin', 'দুনিয়ার জীবনে তাদের জন্য আছে শাস্তি, আর আখেরাতের শাস্তি অবশ্যই আরো বেশি কঠিন। আল্লাহর শাস্তি থেকে বাঁচানোর তাদের কেউ নেই।', 'For them will be punishment in the life of [this] world, and the punishment of the Hereafter is more severe. And they will not have from Allah any protector.', 'দুনিয়ার জীবনে তাদের জন্য আছে শাস্তি, আর আখেরাতের শাস্তি অবশ্যই আরো বেশি কঠিন। আল্লাহর শাস্তি থেকে বাঁচানোর তাদের কেউ নেই।', 'For them will be punishment in the life of [this] world, and the punishment of the Hereafter is more severe. And they will not have from Allah any protector.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/013034.mp3', now()),
  (13, 35, '', '[{"id":37539,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ مَّثَلُ","transliteration":"mathalu","translation_bn":"দৃষ্টান্ত (পরিচয়)","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37540,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَنَّةِ","transliteration":"l-janati","translation_bn":"জান্নাতের","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37541,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّتِى","transliteration":"allatī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":37542,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وُعِدَ","transliteration":"wuʿida","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি দেয়া হয়েছে","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37543,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُتَّقُونَ ۖ","transliteration":"l-mutaqūna","translation_bn":"মুত্তাকীদের (এমন যে)","root":"وقي","lemma":"مُتَّقِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37545,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَجْرِى","transliteration":"tajrī","translation_bn":"প্রবাহিত হয়","root":"جري","lemma":"جَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37546,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37547,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَحْتِهَا","transliteration":"taḥtihā","translation_bn":"তার নিচ","root":"تحت","lemma":"تَحْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37548,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ ۖ","transliteration":"l-anhāru","translation_bn":"ঝর্ণাসমূহ","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37550,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أُكُلُهَا","transliteration":"ukuluhā","translation_bn":"তার ফলসমূহ","root":"اكل","lemma":"أُكُل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37551,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"دَآئِمٌۭ","transliteration":"dāimun","translation_bn":"চিরস্হায়ী","root":"دوم","lemma":"دَا^ئِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37552,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَظِلُّهَا ۚ","transliteration":"waẓilluhā","translation_bn":"এবং তার ছায়াও (অবিনশ্বর)","root":"ظلل","lemma":"ظِلّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37554,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تِلْكَ","transliteration":"til''ka","translation_bn":"এসব","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":37555,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عُقْبَى","transliteration":"ʿuq''bā","translation_bn":"পরিণাম","root":"عقب","lemma":"عُقْبَى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37556,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":37557,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّقَوا۟ ۖ","transliteration":"ittaqaw","translation_bn":"(আল্লাহকে) ভয় করে","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37559,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَّعُقْبَى","transliteration":"waʿuq''bā","translation_bn":"ও পরিণাম","root":"عقب","lemma":"عُقْبَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37560,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","translation_bn":"কাফেরদের","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37561,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارُ","transliteration":"l-nāru","translation_bn":"(জাহান্নামের) আগুন","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37562,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٣٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'mathalu l-janati allatī wuʿida l-mutaqūna tajrī min taḥtihā l-anhāru ukuluhā dāimun waẓilluhā til''ka ʿuq''bā alladhīna ittaqaw waʿuq''bā l-kāfirīna l-nāru', 'মুত্তাকীদেরকে যে জান্নাতের ওয়া‘দা দেয়া হয়েছে তার দৃষ্টান্ত এই যে, তার তলদেশ দিয়ে ঝর্ণাধারা প্রবাহিত, তার ফলফলাদি চিরস্থায়ী আর তার ছায়াও। যারা তাক্ওয়া অবলম্বন করে তাদের পরিণাম হবে এই। আর কাফিরদের পরিণতি হবে জাহান্নামের আগুন।', 'The example of Paradise, which the righteous have been promised, is [that] beneath it rivers flow. Its fruit is lasting, and its shade. That is the consequence for the righteous, and the consequence for the disbelievers is the Fire.', 'মুত্তাকীদেরকে যে জান্নাতের ওয়া‘দা দেয়া হয়েছে তার দৃষ্টান্ত এই যে, তার তলদেশ দিয়ে ঝর্ণাধারা প্রবাহিত, তার ফলফলাদি চিরস্থায়ী আর তার ছায়াও। যারা তাক্ওয়া অবলম্বন করে তাদের পরিণাম হবে এই। আর কাফিরদের পরিণতি হবে জাহান্নামের আগুন।', 'The example of Paradise, which the righteous have been promised, is [that] beneath it rivers flow. Its fruit is lasting, and its shade. That is the consequence for the righteous, and the consequence for the disbelievers is the Fire.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/013035.mp3', now()),
  (13, 36, '', '[{"id":38420,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38421,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمُ","transliteration":"ātaynāhumu","translation_bn":"আমরা দিয়েছি তাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38422,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","transliteration":"l-kitāba","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38423,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَفْرَحُونَ","transliteration":"yafraḥūna","translation_bn":"তারা আনন্দ পায়","root":"فرح","lemma":"فَرِحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38424,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِمَآ","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38425,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أُنزِلَ","transliteration":"unzila","translation_bn":"অবতরণ করা হয়েছে","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38426,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ ۖ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"তোমার প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38428,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنَ","transliteration":"wamina","translation_bn":"আবার কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38429,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَحْزَابِ","transliteration":"l-aḥzābi","translation_bn":"বিভিন্ন দলের","root":"حزب","lemma":"حِزْب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38430,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কেউ কেউ","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":38431,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُنكِرُ","transliteration":"yunkiru","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করে","root":"نكر","lemma":"يُنكِرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38432,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضَهُۥ ۚ","transliteration":"baʿḍahu","translation_bn":"তার কিছু অংশ","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38434,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38435,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَآ","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"\"শুধুমাত্র","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":38436,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أُمِرْتُ","transliteration":"umir''tu","translation_bn":"আমাকে আদেশ করা হয়েছে","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38437,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":38438,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَعْبُدَ","transliteration":"aʿbuda","translation_bn":"আমি (যেন) ইবাদত করি","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38439,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":38440,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না (যেন)","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38441,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أُشْرِكَ","transliteration":"ush''rika","translation_bn":"আমি শরীক করি","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38442,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦٓ ۚ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর সাথে (অন্য কাউকে)","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦٓ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38444,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"তাঁরই দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38445,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"أَدْعُوا۟","transliteration":"adʿū","translation_bn":"আমি ডাকি","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38446,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"وَإِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"wa-ilayhi","translation_bn":"ও তাঁরই দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38447,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"مَـَٔابِ","transliteration":"maābi","translation_bn":"আমার গন্তব্যস্থান\"","root":"اوب","lemma":"مَـ#َاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38448,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٣٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna ātaynāhumu l-kitāba yafraḥūna bimā unzila ilayka wamina l-aḥzābi man yunkiru baʿḍahu qul innamā umir''tu an aʿbuda l-laha walā ush''rika bihi ilayhi adʿū wa-ilayhi maābi', 'আমি যাদেরকে কিতাব দিয়েছিলাম তারা তোমার প্রতি যা অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে তাতে উৎফুল্ল, কিন্তু কতক দল তার কোন কোন কথা মানে না। বল, ‘আমি আল্লাহর ‘ইবাদাত করার জন্য এবং তাঁর সাথে কোন কিছু শারীক না করার জন্য নির্দেশপ্রাপ্ত হয়েছি, আমি তাঁর দিকেই আহবান জানাই, আর আমার প্রত্যাবর্তন তাঁর দিকেই।', 'And [the believers among] those to whom We have given the [previous] Scripture rejoice at what has been revealed to you, [O Muhammad], but among the [opposing] factions are those who deny part of it. Say, "I have only been commanded to worship Allah and not associate [anything] with Him. To Him I invite, and to Him is my return."', 'আমি যাদেরকে কিতাব দিয়েছিলাম তারা তোমার প্রতি যা অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে তাতে উৎফুল্ল, কিন্তু কতক দল তার কোন কোন কথা মানে না। বল, ‘আমি আল্লাহর ‘ইবাদাত করার জন্য এবং তাঁর সাথে কোন কিছু শারীক না করার জন্য নির্দেশপ্রাপ্ত হয়েছি, আমি তাঁর দিকেই আহবান জানাই, আর আমার প্রত্যাবর্তন তাঁর দিকেই।', 'And [the believers among] those to whom We have given the [previous] Scripture rejoice at what has been revealed to you, [O Muhammad], but among the [opposing] factions are those who deny part of it. Say, "I have only been commanded to worship Allah and not associate [anything] with Him. To Him I invite, and to Him is my return."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/013036.mp3', now()),
  (13, 37, '', '[{"id":39271,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wakadhālika","translation_bn":"এবং এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39272,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"anzalnāhu","translation_bn":"তা আমরা অবতীর্ণ করেছি","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39273,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"حُكْمًا","transliteration":"ḥuk''man","translation_bn":"বিধানরূপে","root":"حكم","lemma":"حُكْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39274,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَرَبِيًّۭا ۚ","transliteration":"ʿarabiyyan","translation_bn":"আরবী ভাষায়","root":"عرب","lemma":"عَرَبِيّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":39276,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلَئِنِ","transliteration":"wala-ini","translation_bn":"এবং অবশ্যই যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39277,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّبَعْتَ","transliteration":"ittabaʿta","translation_bn":"তুমি অনুসরণ করো","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39278,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَهْوَآءَهُم","transliteration":"ahwāahum","translation_bn":"তাদের খেয়ালখুশীর","root":"هوي","lemma":"أَهْوَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39279,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدَ مَا","transliteration":"baʿdamā","translation_bn":"পরেও যা","root":"بعد\r","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":39280,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَكَ","transliteration":"jāaka","translation_bn":"তোমার কাছে এসেছে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39281,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39282,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعِلْمِ","transliteration":"l-ʿil''mi","translation_bn":"জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39283,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":39284,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَكَ","transliteration":"laka","translation_bn":"তোমার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكَ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39285,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"বিরুদ্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39286,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":39287,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39288,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَلِىٍّۢ","transliteration":"waliyyin","translation_bn":"অভিভাবক (বাঁচাতে)","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39289,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39290,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَاقٍۢ","transliteration":"wāqin","translation_bn":"কোনো রক্ষাকারী","root":"وقي","lemma":"وَاق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39291,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٣٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakadhālika anzalnāhu ḥuk''man ʿarabiyyan wala-ini ittabaʿta ahwāahum baʿdamā jāaka mina l-ʿil''mi mā laka mina l-lahi min waliyyin walā wāqin', 'এভাবে আমি একে বিধানরূপে নাযিল করেছি আরবী ভাষায়। তোমার কাছে জ্ঞান আসার পরেও তুমি যদি তাদের খাহেশের অনুসরণ কর, তবে আল্লাহর মোকাবালায় তোমার কোন অভিভাবক থাকবে না, থাকবে না কোন রক্ষাকারী।', 'And thus We have revealed it as an Arabic legislation. And if you should follow their inclinations after what has come to you of knowledge, you would not have against Allah any ally or any protector.', 'এভাবে আমি একে বিধানরূপে নাযিল করেছি আরবী ভাষায়। তোমার কাছে জ্ঞান আসার পরেও তুমি যদি তাদের খাহেশের অনুসরণ কর, তবে আল্লাহর মোকাবালায় তোমার কোন অভিভাবক থাকবে না, থাকবে না কোন রক্ষাকারী।', 'And thus We have revealed it as an Arabic legislation. And if you should follow their inclinations after what has come to you of knowledge, you would not have against Allah any ally or any protector.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/013037.mp3', now()),
  (13, 38, '', '[{"id":40100,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40101,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَا","transliteration":"arsalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা প্রেরণ করেছি","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40102,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رُسُلًۭا","transliteration":"rusulan","translation_bn":"রাসূলদেরকে","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40103,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকেই","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40104,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِكَ","transliteration":"qablika","translation_bn":"তোমার পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40105,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلْنَا","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা দিয়েছিলাম","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40106,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40107,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَزْوَٰجًۭا","transliteration":"azwājan","translation_bn":"স্ত্রীসমূহ","root":"زوج","lemma":"زَوْج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40108,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَذُرِّيَّةًۭ ۚ","transliteration":"wadhurriyyatan","translation_bn":"ও সন্তান-সন্ততি","root":"ذرر","lemma":"ذُرِّيَّة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40110,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40111,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো (সম্ভব)","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40112,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِرَسُولٍ","transliteration":"lirasūlin","translation_bn":"কোনো রাসূলের জন্যে","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40113,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":40114,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِىَ","transliteration":"yatiya","translation_bn":"সে আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40115,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَةٍ","transliteration":"biāyatin","translation_bn":"নিয়ে কোনো নিদর্শন","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40116,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":40117,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بِإِذْنِ","transliteration":"bi-idh''ni","translation_bn":"নিয়ে অনুমতি","root":"اذن","lemma":"إِذْن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40118,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":40120,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"لِكُلِّ","transliteration":"likulli","translation_bn":"জন্যে প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40121,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَجَلٍۢ","transliteration":"ajalin","translation_bn":"নির্ধারিত যুগের","root":"اجل","lemma":"أَجَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40122,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"كِتَابٌۭ","transliteration":"kitābun","translation_bn":"একটি কিতাব (আছে)","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40123,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"٣٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad arsalnā rusulan min qablika wajaʿalnā lahum azwājan wadhurriyyatan wamā kāna lirasūlin an yatiya biāyatin illā bi-idh''ni l-lahi likulli ajalin kitābun', 'আমি তোমার পূর্বেও রসূলগণকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম, আর তাদেরকে দিয়েছিলাম স্ত্রী ও সন্তানাদি, আল্লাহর হুকুম ব্যতীত নিদর্শন হাজির করার শক্তি কোন রসূলের নেই। যাবতীয় বিষয়ের নির্দিষ্ট সময় লিপিবদ্ধ আছে।', 'And We have already sent messengers before you and assigned to them wives and descendants. And it was not for a messenger to come with a sign except by permission of Allah. For every term is a decree.', 'আমি তোমার পূর্বেও রসূলগণকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম, আর তাদেরকে দিয়েছিলাম স্ত্রী ও সন্তানাদি, আল্লাহর হুকুম ব্যতীত নিদর্শন হাজির করার শক্তি কোন রসূলের নেই। যাবতীয় বিষয়ের নির্দিষ্ট সময় লিপিবদ্ধ আছে।', 'And We have already sent messengers before you and assigned to them wives and descendants. And it was not for a messenger to come with a sign except by permission of Allah. For every term is a decree.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/013038.mp3', now()),
  (13, 39, '', '[{"id":40870,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَمْحُوا۟","transliteration":"yamḥū","translation_bn":"নিশ্চিহ্ন করেন","root":"محو","lemma":"مَحَوْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40871,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":40872,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":40873,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40874,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَيُثْبِتُ ۖ","transliteration":"wayuth''bitu","translation_bn":"ও বহাল রাখেন (যা চান)","root":"ثبت","lemma":"يُثْبِتُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40876,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَعِندَهُۥٓ","transliteration":"waʿindahu","translation_bn":"এবং তাঁর কাছে আছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40877,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أُمُّ","transliteration":"ummu","translation_bn":"মূল","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40878,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-kitābi","translation_bn":"কিতাবের","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40879,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٣٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yamḥū l-lahu mā yashāu wayuth''bitu waʿindahu ummu l-kitābi', 'আল্লাহ যা ইচ্ছে করেন নিশ্চিহ্ন করে দেন আর যা ইচ্ছে প্রতিষ্ঠিত রাখেন, উম্মুল কিতাব তাঁর নিকটই রক্ষিত।', 'Allah eliminates what He wills or confirms, and with Him is the Mother of the Book.', 'আল্লাহ যা ইচ্ছে করেন নিশ্চিহ্ন করে দেন আর যা ইচ্ছে প্রতিষ্ঠিত রাখেন, উম্মুল কিতাব তাঁর নিকটই রক্ষিত।', 'Allah eliminates what He wills or confirms, and with Him is the Mother of the Book.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/013039.mp3', now()),
  (13, 40, '', '[{"id":41762,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41763,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সম্পূরক পদ (Supplemental)"},{"id":41764,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نُرِيَنَّكَ","transliteration":"nuriyannaka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে আমরা দেখাই","root":"راي","lemma":"أَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41765,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضَ","transliteration":"baʿḍa","translation_bn":"কিছুটা","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41766,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":41767,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نَعِدُهُمْ","transliteration":"naʿiduhum","translation_bn":"তাদের প্রতিশ্রুতি দিচ্ছি আমরা","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41768,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41769,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"نَتَوَفَّيَنَّكَ","transliteration":"natawaffayannaka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে মৃত্যু দিই আমরা (যাই হউক)","root":"وفي","lemma":"تَوَفَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41770,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّمَا","transliteration":"fa-innamā","translation_bn":"প্রকৃতপক্ষে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41771,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ʿalayka","translation_bn":"তোমার দায়িত্ব","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41772,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَلَـٰغُ","transliteration":"l-balāghu","translation_bn":"প্রচার করা","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَلَٰغ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41773,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَعَلَيْنَا","transliteration":"waʿalaynā","translation_bn":"এবং আমাদের দায়িত্ব","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41774,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحِسَابُ","transliteration":"l-ḥisābu","translation_bn":"হিসাব-নিকাশের","root":"حسب","lemma":"حِسَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41775,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٤٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪০)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-in mā nuriyannaka baʿḍa alladhī naʿiduhum aw natawaffayannaka fa-innamā ʿalayka l-balāghu waʿalaynā l-ḥisābu', 'আমি তাদেরকে যে শাস্তি দেয়ার ওয়া‘দা করেছি তার কিছু যদি তোমাকে দেখাই কিংবা (দেখানোর পূর্বেই) তোমার মৃত্যু ঘটাই, (উভয় অবস্থাতেই) তোমার দায়িত্ব হল প্রচার করে দেয়া, আর হিসেব নেয়ার কাজ হল আমার।', 'And whether We show you part of what We promise them or take you in death, upon you is only the [duty of] notification, and upon Us is the account.', 'আমি তাদেরকে যে শাস্তি দেয়ার ওয়া‘দা করেছি তার কিছু যদি তোমাকে দেখাই কিংবা (দেখানোর পূর্বেই) তোমার মৃত্যু ঘটাই, (উভয় অবস্থাতেই) তোমার দায়িত্ব হল প্রচার করে দেয়া, আর হিসেব নেয়ার কাজ হল আমার।', 'And whether We show you part of what We promise them or take you in death, upon you is only the [duty of] notification, and upon Us is the account.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/013040.mp3', now()),
  (13, 41, '', '[{"id":42533,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ","transliteration":"awalam","translation_bn":"কি নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":42534,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَرَوْا۟","transliteration":"yaraw","translation_bn":"তারা দেখে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42535,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّا","transliteration":"annā","translation_bn":"যে আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":42536,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"نَأْتِى","transliteration":"natī","translation_bn":"আমরা চলে আসছি","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42537,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","transliteration":"l-arḍa","translation_bn":"জমিনের (উপর)","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42538,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نَنقُصُهَا","transliteration":"nanquṣuhā","translation_bn":"তা সংকুচিত করছি আমরা","root":"نقص","lemma":"يُنقَصُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42539,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42540,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَطْرَافِهَا ۚ","transliteration":"aṭrāfihā","translation_bn":"তার চারপাশ","root":"طرف","lemma":"طَرَف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42542,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42543,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَحْكُمُ","transliteration":"yaḥkumu","translation_bn":"আদেশ করেন","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42544,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":42545,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مُعَقِّبَ","transliteration":"muʿaqqiba","translation_bn":"কোনো প্রতিহতকারী","root":"عقب","lemma":"مُعَقِّب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42546,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لِحُكْمِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"liḥuk''mihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর আদেশের","root":"حكم","lemma":"حُكْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42548,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42549,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"سَرِيعُ","transliteration":"sarīʿu","translation_bn":"দ্রুত","root":"سرع","lemma":"سَرِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42550,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحِسَابِ","transliteration":"l-ḥisābi","translation_bn":"হিসাব-নিকাশে","root":"حسب","lemma":"حِسَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42551,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٤١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪১)","root":"—","lemma":"٤١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'awalam yaraw annā natī l-arḍa nanquṣuhā min aṭrāfihā wal-lahu yaḥkumu lā muʿaqqiba liḥuk''mihi wahuwa sarīʿu l-ḥisābi', 'তারা কি দেখে না আমি তাদের জন্য যমীনকে চার দিক থেকে সংকীর্ণ করে আনছি? আল্লাহ হুকুম দেন, তাঁর হুকুম পেছনে ঠেলে দেবে এমন কেউ নেই। হিসেব গ্রহণের ব্যাপারে তিনি খুবই দ্রুতগতি।', 'Have they not seen that We set upon the land, reducing it from its borders? And Allah decides; there is no adjuster of His decision. And He is swift in account.', 'তারা কি দেখে না আমি তাদের জন্য যমীনকে চার দিক থেকে সংকীর্ণ করে আনছি? আল্লাহ হুকুম দেন, তাঁর হুকুম পেছনে ঠেলে দেবে এমন কেউ নেই। হিসেব গ্রহণের ব্যাপারে তিনি খুবই দ্রুতগতি।', 'Have they not seen that We set upon the land, reducing it from its borders? And Allah decides; there is no adjuster of His decision. And He is swift in account.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/013041.mp3', now()),
  (13, 42, '', '[{"id":43232,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَدْ","transliteration":"waqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43233,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَكَرَ","transliteration":"makara","translation_bn":"চক্রান্ত করেছিলো","root":"مكر","lemma":"مَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43234,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":43235,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43236,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِمْ","transliteration":"qablihim","translation_bn":"পূর্ব তাদের (ছিলো)","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43237,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَلِلَّهِ","transliteration":"falillahi","translation_bn":"অতএব অধীনে আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43238,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَكْرُ","transliteration":"l-makru","translation_bn":"চক্রান্ত","root":"مكر","lemma":"مَكْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43239,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"جَمِيعًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"jamīʿan","translation_bn":"সমস্তই","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43241,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","translation_bn":"তিনি জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43242,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":43243,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَكْسِبُ","transliteration":"taksibu","translation_bn":"অর্জন করে","root":"كسب","lemma":"كَسَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43244,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كُلُّ","transliteration":"kullu","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43245,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسٍۢ ۗ","transliteration":"nafsin","translation_bn":"ব্যক্তি","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43247,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَسَيَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"wasayaʿlamu","translation_bn":"এবং শীঘ্রই জানবে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43248,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكُفَّـٰرُ","transliteration":"l-kufāru","translation_bn":"কাফেররা","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَافِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43249,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لِمَنْ","transliteration":"liman","translation_bn":"কার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43250,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"عُقْبَى","transliteration":"ʿuq''bā","translation_bn":"পরকালের","root":"عقب","lemma":"عُقْبَى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43251,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدَّارِ","transliteration":"l-dāri","translation_bn":"ঘর","root":"دور","lemma":"دَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43252,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٤٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪২)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqad makara alladhīna min qablihim falillahi l-makru jamīʿan yaʿlamu mā taksibu kullu nafsin wasayaʿlamu l-kufāru liman ʿuq''bā l-dāri', 'ওদের আগে যারা ছিল তারাও চক্রান্ত করেছিল, যাবতীয় চক্রান্ত আল্লাহর আয়ত্তাধীন। তিনি জানেন প্রত্যেক ব্যক্তি কী কামাই করছে। আর কাফিরগণ অচিরেই জানতে পারবে ভাল পরিণাম কাদের জন্য।', 'And those before them had plotted, but to Allah belongs the plan entirely. He knows what every soul earns, and the disbelievers will know for whom is the final home.', 'ওদের আগে যারা ছিল তারাও চক্রান্ত করেছিল, যাবতীয় চক্রান্ত আল্লাহর আয়ত্তাধীন। তিনি জানেন প্রত্যেক ব্যক্তি কী কামাই করছে। আর কাফিরগণ অচিরেই জানতে পারবে ভাল পরিণাম কাদের জন্য।', 'And those before them had plotted, but to Allah belongs the plan entirely. He knows what every soul earns, and the disbelievers will know for whom is the final home.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/013042.mp3', now()),
  (13, 43, '', '[{"id":43974,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَقُولُ","transliteration":"wayaqūlu","translation_bn":"এবং বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43975,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":43976,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43977,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَسْتَ","transliteration":"lasta","translation_bn":"\"তুমি নও","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43978,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مُرْسَلًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"mur''salan","translation_bn":"প্রেরিত (নাবী)\"","root":"رسل","lemma":"مُّرْسَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43980,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43981,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَفَىٰ","transliteration":"kafā","translation_bn":"\"যথেষ্ট","root":"كفي","lemma":"كَفَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43982,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ তা''লা-ই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43983,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"شَهِيدًۢا","transliteration":"shahīdan","translation_bn":"সাক্ষী হিসেবে","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":43984,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنِى","transliteration":"baynī","translation_bn":"আমার মাঝে","root":"بين\r","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":43985,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَبَيْنَكُمْ","transliteration":"wabaynakum","translation_bn":"ও তোমাদের মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43986,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَمَنْ","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং (সাক্ষ্য) যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43987,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عِندَهُۥ","transliteration":"ʿindahu","translation_bn":"তার কাছে আছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":43988,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمُ","transliteration":"ʿil''mu","translation_bn":"জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43989,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-kitābi","translation_bn":"(আসমানী) কিতাবের\"","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43990,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٤٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayaqūlu alladhīna kafarū lasta mur''salan qul kafā bil-lahi shahīdan baynī wabaynakum waman ʿindahu ʿil''mu l-kitābi', 'কাফিররা বলে, ‘তুমি আল্লাহর প্রেরিত নও।’ বল, ‘আমার ও তোমাদের মাঝে সাক্ষী হিসেবে আল্লাহই যথেষ্ট এবং যাদের কিতাবের জ্ঞান আছে তারাও।’', 'And those who have disbelieved say, "You are not a messenger." Say, [O Muhammad], "Sufficient is Allah as Witness between me and you, and [the witness of] whoever has knowledge of the Scripture."', 'কাফিররা বলে, ‘তুমি আল্লাহর প্রেরিত নও।’ বল, ‘আমার ও তোমাদের মাঝে সাক্ষী হিসেবে আল্লাহই যথেষ্ট এবং যাদের কিতাবের জ্ঞান আছে তারাও।’', 'And those who have disbelieved say, "You are not a messenger." Say, [O Muhammad], "Sufficient is Allah as Witness between me and you, and [the witness of] whoever has knowledge of the Scripture."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/013043.mp3', now())
