lā yaqdirūna mimmā kasabū ʿalā shayin dhālika huwa l-ḍalālu l-baʿīdu', 'যারা তাদের প্রতিপালককে অস্বীকার করে তাদের ‘আমালের দৃষ্টান্ত হল সেই ছাইয়ের মত যা ঝড়ের দিনে বাতাস প্রচন্ড বেগে উড়িয়ে নিয়ে যায়। নিজেদের উপার্জনের কিছুই তারা কাজে লাগাতে পারে না। এটাই ঘোর গুমরাহী।', 'The example of those who disbelieve in their Lord is [that] their deeds are like ashes which the wind blows forcefully on a stormy day; they are unable [to keep] from what they earned a [single] thing. That is what is extreme error.', 'যারা তাদের প্রতিপালককে অস্বীকার করে তাদের ‘আমালের দৃষ্টান্ত হল সেই ছাইয়ের মত যা ঝড়ের দিনে বাতাস প্রচন্ড বেগে উড়িয়ে নিয়ে যায়। নিজেদের উপার্জনের কিছুই তারা কাজে লাগাতে পারে না। এটাই ঘোর গুমরাহী।', 'The example of those who disbelieve in their Lord is [that] their deeds are like ashes which the wind blows forcefully on a stormy day; they are unable [to keep] from what they earned a [single] thing. That is what is extreme error.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014018.mp3', now()),
  (14, 19, '', '[{"id":22169,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"নি কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":22170,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَرَ","transliteration":"tara","translation_bn":"তুমি দেখো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22171,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":22172,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":22173,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقَ","transliteration":"khalaqa","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22174,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশমন্ডলী","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22175,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবী","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":22176,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْحَقِّ ۚ","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"সাথে যথার্থতার","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":22178,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":22179,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَشَأْ","transliteration":"yasha","translation_bn":"তিনি ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22180,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُذْهِبْكُمْ","transliteration":"yudh''hib''kum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের নিয়ে যাবেন","root":"ذهب","lemma":"أَذْهَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22181,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَيَأْتِ","transliteration":"wayati","translation_bn":"ও আসবেন","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":22182,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِخَلْقٍۢ","transliteration":"bikhalqin","translation_bn":"নিয়ে সৃষ্টি","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلْق","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":22183,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"جَدِيدٍۢ","transliteration":"jadīdin","translation_bn":"নয়া","root":"جدد","lemma":"جَدِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":22184,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alam tara anna l-laha khalaqa l-samāwāti wal-arḍa bil-ḥaqi in yasha yudh''hib''kum wayati bikhalqin jadīdin', 'তুমি কি দেখ না যে, আল্লাহ যথাযথ নিয়ম বিধানসহ আসমানসমূহ ও যমীন সৃষ্টি করেছেন, তিনি চাইলে তোমাদেরকে সরিয়ে দিবেন আর এক নতুন সৃষ্টি নিয়ে আসবেন।', 'Have you not seen that Allah created the heavens and the earth in truth? If He wills, He can do away with you and produce a new creation.', 'তুমি কি দেখ না যে, আল্লাহ যথাযথ নিয়ম বিধানসহ আসমানসমূহ ও যমীন সৃষ্টি করেছেন, তিনি চাইলে তোমাদেরকে সরিয়ে দিবেন আর এক নতুন সৃষ্টি নিয়ে আসবেন।', 'Have you not seen that Allah created the heavens and the earth in truth? If He wills, He can do away with you and produce a new creation.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014019.mp3', now()),
  (14, 20, '', '[{"id":23222,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নয়","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23223,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":23224,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23225,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":23226,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِعَزِيزٍۢ","transliteration":"biʿazīzin","translation_bn":"কঠিন","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23227,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٢٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২০)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā dhālika ʿalā l-lahi biʿazīzin', 'এটা আল্লাহর জন্য কঠিন কিছু নয়।', 'And that is not difficult for Allah.', 'এটা আল্লাহর জন্য কঠিন কিছু নয়।', 'And that is not difficult for Allah.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014020.mp3', now()),
