:25249,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرْتُ","transliteration":"kafartu","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করছি","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25250,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"بِمَآ","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25251,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"أَشْرَكْتُمُونِ","transliteration":"ashraktumūni","translation_bn":"আমাকেে তোমরা শরীক করেছো","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25252,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25253,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ ۗ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25255,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":25256,"position":41,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদের","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":25257,"position":42,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে আছে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25258,"position":43,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25259,"position":44,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"alīmun","translation_bn":"নিদারুণ\"","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":25260,"position":45,"text_uthmani":"٢٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২২)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqāla l-shayṭānu lammā quḍiya l-amru inna l-laha waʿadakum waʿda l-ḥaqi wawaʿadttukum fa-akhlaftukum wamā kāna liya ʿalaykum min sul''ṭānin illā an daʿawtukum fa-is''tajabtum lī falā talūmūnī walūmū anfusakum mā anā bimuṣ''rikhikum wamā antum bimuṣ''rikhiyya innī kafartu bimā ashraktumūni min qablu inna l-ẓālimīna lahum ʿadhābun alīmun', 'বিচার-ফায়সালা সম্পন্ন হলে শয়ত্বান বলবে, ‘আল্লাহ তোমাদের জন্য যে ওয়া‘দা করেছিলেন তা ছিল সত্য ওয়া‘দা। আর আমিও তোমাদেরকে ওয়া‘দা দিয়েছিলাম, কিন্তু আমি তার খেলাপ করেছি, তোমাদের উপর আমার কোনই প্রভাব ছিল না, আমি কেবল তোমাদেরকে আহবান জানিয়েছিলাম আর তোমরা আমার আহবানে সাড়া দিয়েছিলে। কাজেই তোমরা আমাকে তিরস্কার করো না, বরং নিজেদেরকেই তিরস্কার কর, এখানে না আমি তোমাদের ফরিয়াদ শুনতে পারি, না তোমরা আমার ফরিয়াদ শুনতে পার। ইতোপূর্বে তোমরা যে আমাকে (আল্লাহর) শরীক করেছিলে আমি তা অস্বীকার করছি। যালিমদের জন্য আছে ভয়াবহ শাস্তি।’', 'And Satan will say when the matter has been concluded, "Indeed, Allah had promised you the promise of truth. And I promised you, but I betrayed you. But I had no authority over you except that I invited you, and you responded to me. So do not blame me; but blame yourselves. I cannot be called to your aid, nor can you be called to my aid. Indeed, I deny your association of me [with Allah] before. Indeed, for the wrongdoers is a painful punishment."', 'বিচার-ফায়সালা সম্পন্ন হলে শয়ত্বান বলবে, ‘আল্লাহ তোমাদের জন্য যে ওয়া‘দা করেছিলেন তা ছিল সত্য ওয়া‘দা। আর আমিও তোমাদেরকে ওয়া‘দা দিয়েছিলাম, কিন্তু আমি তার খেলাপ করেছি, তোমাদের উপর আমার কোনই প্রভাব ছিল না, আমি কেবল তোমাদেরকে আহবান জানিয়েছিলাম আর তোমরা আমার আহবানে সাড়া দিয়েছিলে। কাজেই তোমরা আমাকে তিরস্কার করো না, বরং নিজেদেরকেই তিরস্কার কর, এখানে না আমি তোমাদের ফরিয়াদ শুনতে পারি, না তোমরা আমার ফরিয়াদ শুনতে পার। ইতোপূর্বে তোমরা যে আমাকে (আল্লাহর) শরীক করেছিলে আমি তা অস্বীকার করছি। যালিমদের জন্য আছে ভয়াবহ শাস্তি।’', 'And Satan will say when the matter has been concluded, "Indeed, Allah had promised you the promise of truth. And I promised you, but I betrayed you. But I had no authority over you except that I invited you, and you responded to me. So do not blame me; but blame yourselves. I cannot be called to your aid, nor can you be called to my aid. Indeed, I deny your association of me [with Allah] before. Indeed, for the wrongdoers is a painful punishment."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014022.mp3', now()),
  (14, 23, '', '[{"id":26323,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأُدْخِلَ","transliteration":"wa-ud''khila","translation_bn":"এবং প্রবেশ করানো হবে","root":"دخل","lemma":"أُدْخِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":26324,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":26325,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26326,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"waʿamilū","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":26327,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26328,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"جَنَّـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"jannātin","translation_bn":"জান্নাতে","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26329,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَجْرِى","transliteration":"tajrī","translation_bn":"প্রবাহিত হয়","root":"جري","lemma":"جَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26330,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26331,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَحْتِهَا","transliteration":"taḥtihā","translation_bn":"তার নিচ","root":"تحت","lemma":"تَحْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26332,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ","transliteration":"l-anhāru","translation_bn":"ঝর্ণাসমূহ","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26333,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","transliteration":"khālidīna","translation_bn":"তারা স্থায়ী হবে","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26334,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26335,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِإِذْنِ","transliteration":"bi-idh''ni","translation_bn":"অনুমতিক্রমে","root":"اذن","lemma":"إِذْن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26336,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِمْ ۖ","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"তাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26338,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تَحِيَّتُهُمْ","transliteration":"taḥiyyatuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের অভিবাদন হবে","root":"حيي","lemma":"تَحِيَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26339,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26340,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"سَلَـٰمٌ","transliteration":"salāmun","translation_bn":"সালাম","root":"سلم","lemma":"سَلَٰم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26341,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٢٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-ud''khila alladhīna āmanū waʿamilū l-ṣāliḥāti jannātin tajrī min taḥtihā l-anhāru khālidīna fīhā bi-idh''ni rabbihim taḥiyyatuhum fīhā salāmun', 'যারা ঈমান আনে আর সৎ কাজ করে তাদেরকে জান্নাতে দাখিল করা হবে যার তলদেশে ঝর্ণাধারা প্রবাহিত। সেখানে তারা তাদের প্রতিপালকের অনুমতিক্রমে চিরকাল থাকবে। সেখানে তাদেরকে শান্তির বার্তা দিয়ে সংবর্ধনা জ্ঞাপন করা হবে।', 'And those who believed and did righteous deeds will be admitted to gardens beneath which rivers flow, abiding eternally therein by permission of their Lord; and their greeting therein will be, "Peace!"', 'যারা ঈমান আনে আর সৎ কাজ করে তাদেরকে জান্নাতে দাখিল করা হবে যার তলদেশে ঝর্ণাধারা প্রবাহিত। সেখানে তারা তাদের প্রতিপালকের অনুমতিক্রমে চিরকাল থাকবে। সেখানে তাদেরকে শান্তির বার্তা দিয়ে সংবর্ধনা জ্ঞাপন করা হবে।', 'And those who believed and did righteous deeds will be admitted to gardens beneath which rivers flow, abiding eternally therein by permission of their Lord; and their greeting therein will be, "Peace!"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014023.mp3', now()),
  (14, 24, '', '[{"id":27349,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"নি কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":27350,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَرَ","transliteration":"tara","translation_bn":"তুমি লক্ষ্য করো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27351,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَيْفَ","transliteration":"kayfa","translation_bn":"কিভাবে","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":27352,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ضَرَبَ","transliteration":"ḍaraba","translation_bn":"বর্ণনা করেছেন","root":"ضرب","lemma":"ضَرَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27353,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":27354,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَثَلًۭا","transliteration":"mathalan","translation_bn":"উপমা","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27355,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَلِمَةًۭ","transliteration":"kalimatan","translation_bn":"বাক্য (কালেমা তাইয়েবা)","root":"كلم","lemma":"كَلِمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27356,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"طَيِّبَةًۭ","transliteration":"ṭayyibatan","translation_bn":"পবিত্র","root":"طيب","lemma":"طَيِّبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":27357,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَشَجَرَةٍۢ","transliteration":"kashajaratin","translation_bn":"(তা) একটি গাছের মতো","root":"شجر","lemma":"شَجَرَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27358,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"طَيِّبَةٍ","transliteration":"ṭayyibatin","translation_bn":"(যা) পবিত্র","root":"طيب","lemma":"طَيِّبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":27359,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَصْلُهَا","transliteration":"aṣluhā","translation_bn":"তার মূল (শেকড়)","root":"اصل","lemma":"أَصْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27360,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ثَابِتٌۭ","transliteration":"thābitun","translation_bn":"সুদৃঢ়","root":"ثبت","lemma":"ثَابِت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27361,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَفَرْعُهَا","transliteration":"wafarʿuhā","translation_bn":"ও তার শাখাগুলো (ডালপালা)","root":"فرع","lemma":"فَرْع","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":27362,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"থাকে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27363,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","transliteration":"l-samāi","translation_bn":"উপরে (বিস্তৃত)","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":27364,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٢٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alam tara kayfa ḍaraba l-lahu mathalan kalimatan ṭayyibatan kashajaratin ṭayyibatin aṣluhā thābitun wafarʿuhā fī l-samāi', 'তুমি কি দেখ না কীভাবে আল্লাহ দৃষ্টান্ত উপস্থাপন করেন? উৎকৃষ্ট বাক্যের তুলনা উৎকৃষ্ট গাছের ন্যায় যার মূল সুদৃঢ়ভাবে স্থাপিত আর শাখা-প্রশাখা আকাশপানে বিস্তৃত।', 'Have you not considered how Allah presents an example, [making] a good word like a good tree, whose root is firmly fixed and its branches [high] in the sky?', 'তুমি কি দেখ না কীভাবে আল্লাহ দৃষ্টান্ত উপস্থাপন করেন? উৎকৃষ্ট বাক্যের তুলনা উৎকৃষ্ট গাছের ন্যায় যার মূল সুদৃঢ়ভাবে স্থাপিত আর শাখা-প্রশাখা আকাশপানে বিস্তৃত।', 'Have you not considered how Allah presents an example, [making] a good word like a good tree, whose root is firmly fixed and its branches [high] in the sky?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014024.mp3', now()),
  (14, 25, '', '[{"id":28421,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"تُؤْتِىٓ","transliteration":"tu''tī","translation_bn":"দেয়","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28422,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أُكُلَهَا","transliteration":"ukulahā","translation_bn":"তার ফল","root":"اكل","lemma":"أُكُل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28423,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كُلَّ","transliteration":"kulla","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28424,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"حِينٍۭ","transliteration":"ḥīnin","translation_bn":"মুহূর্তে (মৌসুমে)","root":"حين","lemma":"حِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28425,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِإِذْنِ","transliteration":"bi-idh''ni","translation_bn":"অনুমতিক্রমে","root":"اذن","lemma":"إِذْن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28426,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهَا ۗ","transliteration":"rabbihā","translation_bn":"রবের তার","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28428,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَيَضْرِبُ","transliteration":"wayaḍribu","translation_bn":"এবং বর্ণনা করেন","root":"ضرب","lemma":"ضَرَبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28429,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":28430,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَمْثَالَ","transliteration":"l-amthāla","translation_bn":"দৃষ্টান্তসমূহ","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28431,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষের জন্যে","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28432,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"তারা যাতে","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":28433,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَتَذَكَّرُونَ","transliteration":"yatadhakkarūna","translation_bn":"শিক্ষা গ্রহণ করে","root":"ذكر","lemma":"تَذَكَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28434,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٢٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'tu''tī ukulahā kulla ḥīnin bi-idh''ni rabbihā wayaḍribu l-lahu l-amthāla lilnnāsi laʿallahum yatadhakkarūna', 'তার প্রতিপালকের হুকুমে তা সব সময় ফল দান করে। মানুষদের জন্য আল্লাহ দৃষ্টান্ত বর্ণনা করেন যাতে তারা শিক্ষা গ্রহণ করে।', 'It produces its fruit all the time, by permission of its Lord. And Allah presents examples for the people that perhaps they will be reminded.', 'তার প্রতিপালকের হুকুমে তা সব সময় ফল দান করে। মানুষদের জন্য আল্লাহ দৃষ্টান্ত বর্ণনা করেন যাতে তারা শিক্ষা গ্রহণ করে।', 'It produces its fruit all the time, by permission of its Lord. And Allah presents examples for the people that perhaps they will be reminded.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014025.mp3', now()),
  (14, 26, '', '[{"id":29337,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَثَلُ","transliteration":"wamathalu","translation_bn":"এবং উপমা","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29338,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَلِمَةٍ","transliteration":"kalimatin","translation_bn":"বাক্যের","root":"كلم","lemma":"كَلِمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29339,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"خَبِيثَةٍۢ","transliteration":"khabīthatin","translation_bn":"নোংরা (অসার)","root":"خبث","lemma":"خَبِيثَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29340,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَشَجَرَةٍ","transliteration":"kashajaratin","translation_bn":"মতো (তা) একটি গাছের","root":"شجر","lemma":"شَجَرَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29341,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"خَبِيثَةٍ","transliteration":"khabīthatin","translation_bn":"নোংরা (অসার)","root":"خبث","lemma":"خَبِيثَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29342,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱجْتُثَّتْ","transliteration":"uj''tuthat","translation_bn":"উপড়ে নেয়া হয়েছে","root":"جثث","lemma":"ٱجْتُثَّتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29343,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29344,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَوْقِ","transliteration":"fawqi","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"فوق","lemma":"فَوْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29345,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"মাটির","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29346,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":29347,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَهَا","transliteration":"lahā","translation_bn":"তার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29348,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29349,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"قَرَارٍۢ","transliteration":"qarārin","translation_bn":"স্থিতি","root":"قرر","lemma":"قَرَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29350,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٢٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamathalu kalimatin khabīthatin kashajaratin khabīthatin uj''tuthat min fawqi l-arḍi mā lahā min qarārin', 'মন্দ বাক্য মন্দ বৃক্ষের সঙ্গে তুলনীয়, ভূপৃষ্ঠের উপরিভাগেই যাকে মূল থেকে উপড়ে ফেলা হয়েছে, যার কোন স্থায়িত্ব নেই।', 'And the example of a bad word is like a bad tree, uprooted from the surface of the earth, not having any stability.', 'মন্দ বাক্য মন্দ বৃক্ষের সঙ্গে তুলনীয়, ভূপৃষ্ঠের উপরিভাগেই যাকে মূল থেকে উপড়ে ফেলা হয়েছে, যার কোন স্থায়িত্ব নেই।', 'And the example of a bad word is like a bad tree, uprooted from the surface of the earth, not having any stability.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014026.mp3', now()),
  (14, 27, '', '[{"id":30303,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يُثَبِّتُ","transliteration":"yuthabbitu","translation_bn":"প্রতিষ্ঠিত করেন","root":"ثبت","lemma":"ثَبَّتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30304,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":30305,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":30306,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30307,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْقَوْلِ","transliteration":"bil-qawli","translation_bn":"দিয়ে বাণী","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30308,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلثَّابِتِ","transliteration":"l-thābiti","translation_bn":"সুদৃঢ়","root":"ثبت","lemma":"ثَابِت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30309,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30310,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","translation_bn":"জীবনের","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30311,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"পার্থিব","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30312,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَفِى","transliteration":"wafī","translation_bn":"এবং মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30313,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","translation_bn":"আখিরাতের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30315,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَيُضِلُّ","transliteration":"wayuḍillu","translation_bn":"এবং পথভ্রষ্ট করেন","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30316,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":30317,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদের","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30319,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَيَفْعَلُ","transliteration":"wayafʿalu","translation_bn":"ও করেন","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30320,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":30321,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":30322,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30323,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yuthabbitu l-lahu alladhīna āmanū bil-qawli l-thābiti fī l-ḥayati l-dun''yā wafī l-ākhirati wayuḍillu l-lahu l-ẓālimīna wayafʿalu l-lahu mā yashāu', 'যারা ঈমান এনেছে তাদেরকে আল্লাহ সুপ্রতিষ্ঠিত বাণীর অবলম্বনে দুনিয়ার জীবনে ও আখেরাতে প্রতিষ্ঠিত রাখবেন আর যালিমদেরকে আল্লাহ ধ্বংস করে দেবেন। তিনি যা ইচ্ছে করেন তাই করেন।', 'Allah keeps firm those who believe, with the firm word, in worldly life and in the Hereafter. And Allah sends astray the wrongdoers. And Allah does what He wills.', 'যারা ঈমান এনেছে তাদেরকে আল্লাহ সুপ্রতিষ্ঠিত বাণীর অবলম্বনে দুনিয়ার জীবনে ও আখেরাতে প্রতিষ্ঠিত রাখবেন আর যালিমদেরকে আল্লাহ ধ্বংস করে দেবেন। তিনি যা ইচ্ছে করেন তাই করেন।', 'Allah keeps firm those who believe, with the firm word, in worldly life and in the Hereafter. And Allah sends astray the wrongdoers. And Allah does what He wills.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014027.mp3', now()),
  (14, 28, '', '[{"id":31299,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"নি কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":31300,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَرَ","transliteration":"tara","translation_bn":"তুমি লক্ষ্য করো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31301,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31302,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":31303,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بَدَّلُوا۟","transliteration":"baddalū","translation_bn":"বদলে দিয়েছে","root":"بدل","lemma":"بَدَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31304,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نِعْمَتَ","transliteration":"niʿ''mata","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ","root":"نعم","lemma":"نِعْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31305,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":31306,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كُفْرًۭا","transliteration":"kuf''ran","translation_bn":"অকৃতজ্ঞতায়","root":"كفر","lemma":"كُفْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31307,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَأَحَلُّوا۟","transliteration":"wa-aḥallū","translation_bn":"এবং নামিয়ে এনেছে","root":"حلل","lemma":"أَحَلَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31308,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمَهُمْ","transliteration":"qawmahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জাতিকে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31309,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"دَارَ","transliteration":"dāra","translation_bn":"ঘরে","root":"دور","lemma":"دَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31310,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَوَارِ","transliteration":"l-bawāri","translation_bn":"ধ্বংসের","root":"بور","lemma":"بَوَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31311,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alam tara ilā alladhīna baddalū niʿ''mata l-lahi kuf''ran wa-aḥallū qawmahum dāra l-bawāri', 'তুমি কি তাদের ব্যাপারে চিন্তা কর না যারা আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহের বিনিময়ে অকৃতজ্ঞতার নীতি অবলম্বন করে আর তাদের জাতিকে ধ্বংসের ঘরে নামিয়ে আনে।', 'Have you not considered those who exchanged the favor of Allah for disbelief and settled their people [in] the home of ruin?', 'তুমি কি তাদের ব্যাপারে চিন্তা কর না যারা আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহের বিনিময়ে অকৃতজ্ঞতার নীতি অবলম্বন করে আর তাদের জাতিকে ধ্বংসের ঘরে নামিয়ে আনে।', 'Have you not considered those who exchanged the favor of Allah for disbelief and settled their people [in] the home of ruin?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014028.mp3', now()),
  (14, 29, '', '[{"id":32286,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمَ","transliteration":"jahannama","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামে","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":32287,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَصْلَوْنَهَا ۖ","transliteration":"yaṣlawnahā","translation_bn":"তাতে তারা প্রবেশ করবে","root":"صلي","lemma":"يَصْلَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32289,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَبِئْسَ","transliteration":"wabi''sa","translation_bn":"এবং অতি নিকৃষ্ট","root":"باس","lemma":"بِئْسَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32290,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَرَارُ","transliteration":"l-qarāru","translation_bn":"আশ্রয়স্থল","root":"قرر","lemma":"قَرَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32291,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'jahannama yaṣlawnahā wabi''sa l-qarāru', '(তা হল) জাহান্নাম, তাতে তারা প্রবেশ করবে, বসবাসের এ জায়গা কতই না নিকৃষ্ট!', '[It is] Hell, which they will [enter to] burn, and wretched is the settlement.', '(তা হল) জাহান্নাম, তাতে তারা প্রবেশ করবে, বসবাসের এ জায়গা কতই না নিকৃষ্ট!', '[It is] Hell, which they will [enter to] burn, and wretched is the settlement.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014029.mp3', now()),
  (14, 30, '', '[{"id":33161,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلُوا۟","transliteration":"wajaʿalū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বানিয়েছে","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33162,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33163,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَندَادًۭا","transliteration":"andādan","translation_bn":"সমকক্ষসমূহ","root":"ندد","lemma":"أَندَاد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33164,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِّيُضِلُّوا۟","transliteration":"liyuḍillū","translation_bn":"যেন তারা পথভ্রষ্ট করে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33165,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33166,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِهِۦ ۗ","transliteration":"sabīlihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর পথ (মানুষকে)","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33168,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33169,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَمَتَّعُوا۟","transliteration":"tamattaʿū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা ভোগ করো","root":"متع","lemma":"تَمَتَّعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33170,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّ","transliteration":"fa-inna","translation_bn":"অতঃপর নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33171,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَصِيرَكُمْ","transliteration":"maṣīrakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের ফেরার জায়গা","root":"صير","lemma":"مَصِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33172,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33173,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"(জাহান্নামের) আগুনের\"","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33174,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٣٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩০)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wajaʿalū lillahi andādan liyuḍillū ʿan sabīlihi qul tamattaʿū fa-inna maṣīrakum ilā l-nāri', 'আর তারা (অন্যকে) আল্লাহর সমকক্ষ স্থির করে তাঁর পথ থেকে বিপথগামী করার উদ্দেশ্যে। বল, ‘ভোগ করে নাও, শেষ পর্যন্ত জাহান্নামেই তোমাদেরকে ফিরে যেতে হবে।', 'And they have attributed to Allah equals to mislead [people] from His way. Say, "Enjoy yourselves, for indeed, your destination is the Fire."', 'আর তারা (অন্যকে) আল্লাহর সমকক্ষ স্থির করে তাঁর পথ থেকে বিপথগামী করার উদ্দেশ্যে। বল, ‘ভোগ করে নাও, শেষ পর্যন্ত জাহান্নামেই তোমাদেরকে ফিরে যেতে হবে।', 'And they have attributed to Allah equals to mislead [people] from His way. Say, "Enjoy yourselves, for indeed, your destination is the Fire."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014030.mp3', now()),
  (14, 31, '', '[{"id":34085,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُل","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো (হে নাবী)","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34086,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لِّعِبَادِىَ","transliteration":"liʿibādiya","translation_bn":"আমার দাসদেরকে","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34087,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":34088,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34089,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يُقِيمُوا۟","transliteration":"yuqīmū","translation_bn":"তারা যেন প্রতিষ্ঠা করে","root":"قوم","lemma":"أَقَامَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34090,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","translation_bn":"সালাত","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34091,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَيُنفِقُوا۟","transliteration":"wayunfiqū","translation_bn":"ও তারা ব্যয় করে","root":"نفق","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34092,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34093,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَزَقْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"razaqnāhum","translation_bn":"আমরা জীবিকা দিয়েছি তাদের","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34094,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"سِرًّۭا","transliteration":"sirran","translation_bn":"গোপনে","root":"سرر","lemma":"سِرّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34095,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَعَلَانِيَةًۭ","transliteration":"waʿalāniyatan","translation_bn":"ও প্রকাশ্যে","root":"علن","lemma":"عَلَانِيَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34096,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকেই","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34097,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِ","transliteration":"qabli","translation_bn":"পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34098,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":34099,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِىَ","transliteration":"yatiya","translation_bn":"আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34100,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمٌۭ","transliteration":"yawmun","translation_bn":"সেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34101,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":34102,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"بَيْعٌۭ","transliteration":"bayʿun","translation_bn":"কেনা-বেচা হবে","root":"بيع","lemma":"بَيْع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34103,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34104,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34105,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"خِلَـٰلٌ","transliteration":"khilālun","translation_bn":"বন্ধুত্ব (কাজে আসবে)","root":"خلل","lemma":"خِلَٰل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34106,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"٣١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩১)","root":"—","lemma":"٣١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul liʿibādiya alladhīna āmanū yuqīmū l-ṣalata wayunfiqū mimmā razaqnāhum sirran waʿalāniyatan min qabli an yatiya yawmun lā bayʿun fīhi walā khilālun', 'আমার বান্দাদের মধ্যে যারা ঈমান এনেছে তাদেরকে বল নামায প্রতিষ্ঠা করতে আর যে জীবিকা আমি তাদেরকে দিয়েছি তাত্থেকে গোপনে ও প্রকাশ্যে ব্যয় করতে- সেদিন আসার পূর্বে যেদিন না চলবে কোন কেনা-বেচা আর না কোন বন্ধুত্ব।', '[O Muhammad], tell My servants who have believed to establish prayer and spend from what We have provided them, secretly and publicly, before a Day comes in which there will be no exchange, nor any friendships.', 'আমার বান্দাদের মধ্যে যারা ঈমান এনেছে তাদেরকে বল নামায প্রতিষ্ঠা করতে আর যে জীবিকা আমি তাদেরকে দিয়েছি তাত্থেকে গোপনে ও প্রকাশ্যে ব্যয় করতে- সেদিন আসার পূর্বে যেদিন না চলবে কোন কেনা-বেচা আর না কোন বন্ধুত্ব।', '[O Muhammad], tell My servants who have believed to establish prayer and spend from what We have provided them, secretly and publicly, before a Day comes in which there will be no exchange, nor any friendships.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014031.mp3', now()),
  (14, 32, '', '[{"id":35035,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"al-lahu","translation_bn":"(তিনিই) আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":35036,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":35037,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقَ","transliteration":"khalaqa","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35038,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশ","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35039,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবী","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35040,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنزَلَ","transliteration":"wa-anzala","translation_bn":"এবং বর্ষণ করেছেন","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35041,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35042,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","transliteration":"l-samāi","translation_bn":"আকাশ","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35043,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَآءًۭ","transliteration":"māan","translation_bn":"পানি","root":"موه","lemma":"مَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35044,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَأَخْرَجَ","transliteration":"fa-akhraja","translation_bn":"অতঃপর বের করেছেন","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35045,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"দিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35046,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"(বিভিন্ন) ধরণের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35047,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-thamarāti","translation_bn":"ফল-মূলসমূহ","root":"ثمر","lemma":"ثَمَرَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35048,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"رِزْقًۭا","transliteration":"riz''qan","translation_bn":"জীবিকার জন্যে","root":"رزق","lemma":"رِزْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35049,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَّكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَّكُمْ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35051,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَسَخَّرَ","transliteration":"wasakhara","translation_bn":"এবং অধীন করে দিয়েছেন","root":"سخر","lemma":"سَخَّرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35052,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمُ","transliteration":"lakumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35053,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفُلْكَ","transliteration":"l-ful''ka","translation_bn":"নৌযান","root":"فلك","lemma":"فُلْك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35054,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"لِتَجْرِىَ","transliteration":"litajriya","translation_bn":"যেন চলাচল করে","root":"جري","lemma":"جَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35055,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35056,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَحْرِ","transliteration":"l-baḥri","translation_bn":"সাগরের","root":"بحر","lemma":"بَحْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35057,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"بِأَمْرِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"bi-amrihi","translation_bn":"নির্দেশক্রমে তার","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35059,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَسَخَّرَ","transliteration":"wasakhara","translation_bn":"এবং অধীন করেছেন","root":"سخر","lemma":"سَخَّرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35060,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمُ","transliteration":"lakumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35061,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرَ","transliteration":"l-anhāra","translation_bn":"নদীসমূহকে","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35062,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'al-lahu alladhī khalaqa l-samāwāti wal-arḍa wa-anzala mina l-samāi māan fa-akhraja bihi mina l-thamarāti riz''qan lakum wasakhara lakumu l-ful''ka litajriya fī l-baḥri bi-amrihi wasakhara lakumu l-anhāra', 'তিনিই আল্লাহ যিনি আসমানসমূহ ও যমীন সৃষ্টি করেছেন, তিনি আকাশ হতে পানি বর্ষণ করেন যা দিয়ে নানা প্রকার ফলফলাদি জন্মে তোমাদের জীবিকার জন্য। তিনি নৌযানগুলোকে তোমাদের নিয়ন্ত্রণাধীন করে দিয়েছেন, যাতে সেগুলো তাঁর নির্দেশে সমুদ্রে চলাচল করে আর তিনি নদীগুলোকে তোমাদের অধীন করে দিয়েছেন।', 'It is Allah who created the heavens and the earth and sent down rain from the sky and produced thereby some fruits as provision for you and subjected for you the ships to sail through the sea by His command and subjected for you the rivers.', 'তিনিই আল্লাহ যিনি আসমানসমূহ ও যমীন সৃষ্টি করেছেন, তিনি আকাশ হতে পানি বর্ষণ করেন যা দিয়ে নানা প্রকার ফলফলাদি জন্মে তোমাদের জীবিকার জন্য। তিনি নৌযানগুলোকে তোমাদের নিয়ন্ত্রণাধীন করে দিয়েছেন, যাতে সেগুলো তাঁর নির্দেশে সমুদ্রে চলাচল করে আর তিনি নদীগুলোকে তোমাদের অধীন করে দিয়েছেন।', 'It is Allah who created the heavens and the earth and sent down rain from the sky and produced thereby some fruits as provision for you and subjected for you the ships to sail through the sea by His command and subjected for you the rivers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014032.mp3', now()),
  (14, 33, '', '[{"id":35897,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَسَخَّرَ","transliteration":"wasakhara","translation_bn":"এবং অধীন করেছেন","root":"سخر","lemma":"سَخَّرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35898,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمُ","transliteration":"lakumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35899,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّمْسَ","transliteration":"l-shamsa","translation_bn":"সূর্যকে","root":"شمس","lemma":"شَمْس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35900,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْقَمَرَ","transliteration":"wal-qamara","translation_bn":"ও চাঁদকে","root":"قمر","lemma":"قَمَر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35901,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"دَآئِبَيْنِ ۖ","transliteration":"dāibayni","translation_bn":"যারা প্রতিনিয়ত একই নিয়মের অনুবর্তী","root":"داب","lemma":"دَا^ئِبَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35903,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَسَخَّرَ","transliteration":"wasakhara","translation_bn":"এবং অধীন করেছেন","root":"سخر","lemma":"سَخَّرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35904,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمُ","transliteration":"lakumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35905,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلَ","transliteration":"al-layla","translation_bn":"রাতকে","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35906,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلنَّهَارَ","transliteration":"wal-nahāra","translation_bn":"ও দিনকে","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35907,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٣٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wasakhara lakumu l-shamsa wal-qamara dāibayni wasakhara lakumu al-layla wal-nahāra', 'তিনি সূর্য ও চন্দ্রকে তোমাদের কাজে লাগিয়ে রেখেছেন, তারা অনুগত হয়ে নিজ পথে চলছে। আর তিনি রাত ও দিনকে তোমাদের কাজে লাগিয়ে রেখেছেন।', 'And He subjected for you the sun and the moon, continuous [in orbit], and subjected for you the night and the day.', 'তিনি সূর্য ও চন্দ্রকে তোমাদের কাজে লাগিয়ে রেখেছেন, তারা অনুগত হয়ে নিজ পথে চলছে। আর তিনি রাত ও দিনকে তোমাদের কাজে লাগিয়ে রেখেছেন।', 'And He subjected for you the sun and the moon, continuous [in orbit], and subjected for you the night and the day.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014033.mp3', now()),
  (14, 34, '', '[{"id":36790,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَءَاتَىٰكُم","transliteration":"waātākum","translation_bn":"এবং তোমাদের দিয়েছেন","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36791,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36792,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সবকিছু","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36793,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":36794,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"سَأَلْتُمُوهُ ۚ","transliteration":"sa-altumūhu","translation_bn":"তাঁর কাছে তোমরা চেয়েছো","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36796,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36797,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَعُدُّوا۟","transliteration":"taʿuddū","translation_bn":"তোমরা গণনা করো","root":"عدد","lemma":"عَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36798,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"نِعْمَتَ","transliteration":"niʿ''mata","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহসমূহ","root":"نعم","lemma":"نِعْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36799,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":36800,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":36801,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تُحْصُوهَآ ۗ","transliteration":"tuḥ''ṣūhā","translation_bn":"তার তোমরা সংখ্যা নির্ণয় করতে পারবে","root":"حصي","lemma":"أَحْصَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36803,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":36804,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ","transliteration":"l-insāna","translation_bn":"মানুষ","root":"انس","lemma":"إِنسَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36805,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَظَلُومٌۭ","transliteration":"laẓalūmun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই অতিমাত্রায় সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلُوم","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":36806,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كَفَّارٌۭ","transliteration":"kaffārun","translation_bn":"বড় অকৃতজ্ঞ","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَّار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":36807,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waātākum min kulli mā sa-altumūhu wa-in taʿuddū niʿ''mata l-lahi lā tuḥ''ṣūhā inna l-insāna laẓalūmun kaffārun', 'তিনি তোমাদেরকে সে সব কিছুই দিয়েছেন যা তোমরা চেয়েছ (তোমরা তোমাদের প্রয়োজনীয় সব কিছুই পেয়েছ) আর তোমরা আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহ গণনা করতে চাইলে কক্ষনো তার সংখ্যা নির্ধারণ করতে পারবে না। মানুষ অবশ্যই বড়ই যালিম, বড়ই অকৃতজ্ঞ।', 'And He gave you from all you asked of Him. And if you should count the favor of Allah, you could not enumerate them. Indeed, mankind is [generally] most unjust and ungrateful.', 'তিনি তোমাদেরকে সে সব কিছুই দিয়েছেন যা তোমরা চেয়েছ (তোমরা তোমাদের প্রয়োজনীয় সব কিছুই পেয়েছ) আর তোমরা আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহ গণনা করতে চাইলে কক্ষনো তার সংখ্যা নির্ধারণ করতে পারবে না। মানুষ অবশ্যই বড়ই যালিম, বড়ই অকৃতজ্ঞ।', 'And He gave you from all you asked of Him. And if you should count the favor of Allah, you could not enumerate them. Indeed, mankind is [generally] most unjust and ungrateful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014034.mp3', now()),
  (14, 35, '', '[{"id":37603,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذْ","transliteration":"wa-idh","translation_bn":"এবং (স্মরণ করো) যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37604,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37605,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِبْرَٰهِيمُ","transliteration":"ib''rāhīmu","translation_bn":"ইবরাহীম","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":37606,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّ","transliteration":"rabbi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37607,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱجْعَلْ","transliteration":"ij''ʿal","translation_bn":"বানাও","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37608,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":37609,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَلَدَ","transliteration":"l-balada","translation_bn":"নগরীকে","root":"بلد","lemma":"بَلَد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37610,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ءَامِنًۭا","transliteration":"āminan","translation_bn":"নিরাপদ","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37611,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَٱجْنُبْنِى","transliteration":"wa-uj''nub''nī","translation_bn":"এবং আমাকে দূরে রাখো","root":"جنب","lemma":"ٱجْنُبْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37612,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَبَنِىَّ","transliteration":"wabaniyya","translation_bn":"ও আমার সন্তানদেরকে","root":"بني","lemma":"بُنَىّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37613,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"(এ হ''তে) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":37614,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"نَّعْبُدَ","transliteration":"naʿbuda","translation_bn":"আমরা উপাসনা করি","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37615,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَصْنَامَ","transliteration":"l-aṣnāma","translation_bn":"মূর্তিদেরকে","root":"صنم","lemma":"أَصْنَام","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37616,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٣٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idh qāla ib''rāhīmu rabbi ij''ʿal hādhā l-balada āminan wa-uj''nub''nī wabaniyya an naʿbuda l-aṣnāma', 'স্মরণ কর, ইবরাহীম যখন বলেছিল, ‘হে আমার রব্ব! তুমি এ নগরীকে নিরাপদ কর আর আমাকে আর আমার সন্তানদেরকে প্রতিমা পূজা থেকে রক্ষা কর।', 'And [mention, O Muhammad], when Abraham said, "My Lord, make this city [Makkah] secure and keep me and my sons away from worshipping idols.', 'স্মরণ কর, ইবরাহীম যখন বলেছিল, ‘হে আমার রব্ব! তুমি এ নগরীকে নিরাপদ কর আর আমাকে আর আমার সন্তানদেরকে প্রতিমা পূজা থেকে রক্ষা কর।', 'And [mention, O Muhammad], when Abraham said, "My Lord, make this city [Makkah] secure and keep me and my sons away from worshipping idols.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014035.mp3', now()),
  (14, 36, '', '[{"id":38475,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّ","transliteration":"rabbi","translation_bn":"হে আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38476,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُنَّ","transliteration":"innahunna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তারা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":38477,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَضْلَلْنَ","transliteration":"aḍlalna","translation_bn":"বিভ্রান্ত করেছে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38478,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَثِيرًۭا","transliteration":"kathīran","translation_bn":"অনেককে","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38479,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38480,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38482,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَمَن","transliteration":"faman","translation_bn":"সুতরাং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38483,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَبِعَنِى","transliteration":"tabiʿanī","translation_bn":"আমার অনুসরন করবে","root":"تبع","lemma":"تَبِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38484,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"fa-innahu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর নিশ্চয়ই সে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38485,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنِّى ۖ","transliteration":"minnī","translation_bn":"আমার অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38487,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَمَنْ","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38488,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَصَانِى","transliteration":"ʿaṣānī","translation_bn":"আমার অবাধ্য হবে","root":"عصي","lemma":"عَصَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38489,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّكَ","transliteration":"fa-innaka","translation_bn":"অতঃপর নিশ্চয়ই তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38490,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38491,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":38492,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٣٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'rabbi innahunna aḍlalna kathīran mina l-nāsi faman tabiʿanī fa-innahu minnī waman ʿaṣānī fa-innaka ghafūrun raḥīmun', 'হে আমার প্রতিপালক! এ (প্রতিমা)-গুলো বহু সংখ্যক মানুষকে পথভ্রষ্ট করেছে। কাজেই (প্রতিমাগুলোকে বাদ দিয়ে) যারা আমাকে অনুসরণ করবে তারা আমার দলভুক্ত। আর যে আমার অবাধ্য হবে সেক্ষেত্রে তুমি তো বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, বড়ই দয়ালু।', 'My Lord, indeed they have led astray many among the people. So whoever follows me - then he is of me; and whoever disobeys me - indeed, You are [yet] Forgiving and Merciful.', 'হে আমার প্রতিপালক! এ (প্রতিমা)-গুলো বহু সংখ্যক মানুষকে পথভ্রষ্ট করেছে। কাজেই (প্রতিমাগুলোকে বাদ দিয়ে) যারা আমাকে অনুসরণ করবে তারা আমার দলভুক্ত। আর যে আমার অবাধ্য হবে সেক্ষেত্রে তুমি তো বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, বড়ই দয়ালু।', 'My Lord, indeed they have led astray many among the people. So whoever follows me - then he is of me; and whoever disobeys me - indeed, You are [yet] Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014036.mp3', now()),
  (14, 37, '', '[{"id":39299,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"رَّبَّنَآ","transliteration":"rabbanā","translation_bn":"হে আমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39300,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":39301,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَسْكَنتُ","transliteration":"askantu","translation_bn":"বসবাস করিয়েছি","root":"سكن","lemma":"أَسْكَن","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39302,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে (কতককে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39303,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ذُرِّيَّتِى","transliteration":"dhurriyyatī","translation_bn":"আমার বংশধরদের","root":"ذرر","lemma":"ذُرِّيَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39304,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِوَادٍ","transliteration":"biwādin","translation_bn":"উপত্যকায়","root":"ودي","lemma":"وَاد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39305,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرِ","transliteration":"ghayri","translation_bn":"নয়","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":39306,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ذِى","transliteration":"dhī","translation_bn":"যোগ্য","root":"—","lemma":"ذُو","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39307,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"زَرْعٍ","transliteration":"zarʿin","translation_bn":"চাষাবাদ","root":"زرع","lemma":"زَرْع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39308,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":39309,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَيْتِكَ","transliteration":"baytika","translation_bn":"তোমার ঘরের","root":"بيت","lemma":"بَيْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39310,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُحَرَّمِ","transliteration":"l-muḥarami","translation_bn":"(যা) মহান সম্মানিত","root":"حرم","lemma":"مُحَرَّم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39311,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّنَا","transliteration":"rabbanā","translation_bn":"হে আমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39312,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لِيُقِيمُوا۟","transliteration":"liyuqīmū","translation_bn":"যেন তারা প্রতিষ্ঠা করে","root":"قوم","lemma":"أَقَامَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39313,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","translation_bn":"সালাত","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39314,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَٱجْعَلْ","transliteration":"fa-ij''ʿal","translation_bn":"অতএব বানাও","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39315,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَفْـِٔدَةًۭ","transliteration":"afidatan","translation_bn":"অন্তরসমূহ","root":"فاد","lemma":"فُؤَاد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39316,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39317,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39318,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"تَهْوِىٓ","transliteration":"tahwī","translation_bn":"অনুরক্ত হয় (যেন)","root":"هوي","lemma":"هَوَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39319,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ilayhim","translation_bn":"দিকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39320,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَٱرْزُقْهُم","transliteration":"wa-ur''zuq''hum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদেরকে জীবিকা দাও","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39321,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39322,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-thamarāti","translation_bn":"ফল-মূলসমূহ","root":"ثمر","lemma":"ثَمَرَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39323,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"তারা যাতে","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":39324,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"يَشْكُرُونَ","transliteration":"yashkurūna","translation_bn":"কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করে","root":"شكر","lemma":"شَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39325,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"٣٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'rabbanā innī askantu min dhurriyyatī biwādin ghayri dhī zarʿin ʿinda baytika l-muḥarami rabbanā liyuqīmū l-ṣalata fa-ij''ʿal afidatan mina l-nāsi tahwī ilayhim wa-ur''zuq''hum mina l-thamarāti laʿallahum yashkurūna', 'হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! আমি আমার সন্তানদের একাংশকে শস্যক্ষেতহীন উপত্যকায় তোমার সম্মানিত ঘরের নিকট পুনর্বাসিত করলাম। হে আমার প্রতিপালক! তারা যাতে নামায কায়িম করে। কাজেই তুমি মানুষের অন্তরকে তাদের প্রতি অনুরাগী করে দাও আর ফল-ফলাদি দিয়ে তাদের জীবিকার ব্যবস্থা কর যাতে তারা শুকরিয়া আদায় করে।', 'Our Lord, I have settled some of my descendants in an uncultivated valley near Your sacred House, our Lord, that they may establish prayer. So make hearts among the people incline toward them and provide for them from the fruits that they might be grateful.', 'হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! আমি আমার সন্তানদের একাংশকে শস্যক্ষেতহীন উপত্যকায় তোমার সম্মানিত ঘরের নিকট পুনর্বাসিত করলাম। হে আমার প্রতিপালক! তারা যাতে নামায কায়িম করে। কাজেই তুমি মানুষের অন্তরকে তাদের প্রতি অনুরাগী করে দাও আর ফল-ফলাদি দিয়ে তাদের জীবিকার ব্যবস্থা কর যাতে তারা শুকরিয়া আদায় করে।', 'Our Lord, I have settled some of my descendants in an uncultivated valley near Your sacred House, our Lord, that they may establish prayer. So make hearts among the people incline toward them and provide for them from the fruits that they might be grateful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014037.mp3', now()),
  (14, 38, '', '[{"id":40165,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّنَآ","transliteration":"rabbanā","translation_bn":"হে আমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40166,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكَ","transliteration":"innaka","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":40167,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"taʿlamu","translation_bn":"জানো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40168,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":40169,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نُخْفِى","transliteration":"nukh''fī","translation_bn":"আমরা গোপন করি","root":"خفي","lemma":"أُخْفِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40170,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"ও যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40171,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نُعْلِنُ ۗ","transliteration":"nuʿ''linu","translation_bn":"আমরা প্রকাশ করি","root":"علن","lemma":"أَعْلَن","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40173,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40174,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَخْفَىٰ","transliteration":"yakhfā","translation_bn":"গোপন থাকে","root":"خفي","lemma":"يَخْفَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40175,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40176,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":40177,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40178,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40179,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40180,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40181,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40182,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40183,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","transliteration":"l-samāi","translation_bn":"আকাশের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40184,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٣٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'rabbanā innaka taʿlamu mā nukh''fī wamā nuʿ''linu wamā yakhfā ʿalā l-lahi min shayin fī l-arḍi walā fī l-samāi', 'হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! তুমি তো জান যা আমরা গোপন করি আর যা প্রকাশ করি, আসমান ও যমীনের কোন বস্তুই আল্লাহ হতে গোপন নেই।', 'Our Lord, indeed You know what we conceal and what we declare, and nothing is hidden from Allah on the earth or in the heaven.', 'হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! তুমি তো জান যা আমরা গোপন করি আর যা প্রকাশ করি, আসমান ও যমীনের কোন বস্তুই আল্লাহ হতে গোপন নেই।', 'Our Lord, indeed You know what we conceal and what we declare, and nothing is hidden from Allah on the earth or in the heaven.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014038.mp3', now()),
  (14, 39, '', '[{"id":40888,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَمْدُ","transliteration":"al-ḥamdu","translation_bn":"প্রশংসা মাত্রই","root":"حمد","lemma":"حَمْد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40889,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40890,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":40891,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَهَبَ","transliteration":"wahaba","translation_bn":"দান করেছেন","root":"وهب","lemma":"وَهَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40892,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لِى","transliteration":"lī","translation_bn":"আমাকে","root":"—","lemma":"لِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40893,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"অবস্হায়","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40894,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِبَرِ","transliteration":"l-kibari","translation_bn":"বার্ধক্যের","root":"كبر","lemma":"كِبَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40895,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِسْمَـٰعِيلَ","transliteration":"is''māʿīla","translation_bn":"ইসমাঈলকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِسْمَاعِيل","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":40896,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَإِسْحَـٰقَ ۚ","transliteration":"wa-is''ḥāqa","translation_bn":"ও ইসহাককে","root":"—","lemma":"إِسْحَاق","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40898,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":40899,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40900,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَسَمِيعُ","transliteration":"lasamīʿu","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই শ্রবণকারী","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِيع","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":40901,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّعَآءِ","transliteration":"l-duʿāi","translation_bn":"দোয়ার","root":"دعو","lemma":"دُعَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40902,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٣٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'al-ḥamdu lillahi alladhī wahaba lī ʿalā l-kibari is''māʿīla wa-is''ḥāqa inna rabbī lasamīʿu l-duʿāi', 'যাবতীয় প্রশংসা আল্লাহর যিনি আমার বার্ধক্য অবস্থায় আমাকে ইসমাঈল ও ইসহাককে দান করেছেন, আমার প্রতিপালক অবশ্যই আহবান শ্রবণকারী।', 'Praise to Allah, who has granted to me in old age Ishmael and Isaac. Indeed, my Lord is the Hearer of supplication.', 'যাবতীয় প্রশংসা আল্লাহর যিনি আমার বার্ধক্য অবস্থায় আমাকে ইসমাঈল ও ইসহাককে দান করেছেন, আমার প্রতিপালক অবশ্যই আহবান শ্রবণকারী।', 'Praise to Allah, who has granted to me in old age Ishmael and Isaac. Indeed, my Lord is the Hearer of supplication.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014039.mp3', now()),
  (14, 40, '', '[{"id":41255,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّ","transliteration":"rabbi","translation_bn":"হে আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41256,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱجْعَلْنِى","transliteration":"ij''ʿalnī","translation_bn":"আমাকে বানাও","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41257,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُقِيمَ","transliteration":"muqīma","translation_bn":"প্রতিষ্ঠাকারী","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41258,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةِ","transliteration":"l-ṣalati","translation_bn":"সালাত","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41259,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَمِن","transliteration":"wamin","translation_bn":"এবং থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41260,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ذُرِّيَّتِى ۚ","transliteration":"dhurriyyatī","translation_bn":"আমার বংশধরদের","root":"ذرر","lemma":"ذُرِّيَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41262,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّنَا","transliteration":"rabbanā","translation_bn":"হে আমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41263,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَتَقَبَّلْ","transliteration":"wataqabbal","translation_bn":"এবং তুমি কবুল করো","root":"قبل","lemma":"تَقَبَّلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41264,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"دُعَآءِ","transliteration":"duʿāi","translation_bn":"আমার দোয়া","root":"دعو","lemma":"دُعَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41265,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٤٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪০)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'rabbi ij''ʿalnī muqīma l-ṣalati wamin dhurriyyatī rabbanā wataqabbal duʿāi', 'হে আমার প্রতিপালক! আমাকে নামায প্রতিষ্ঠাকারী বানাও আর আমার সন্তানদেরকেও, হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! তুমি আমার প্রার্থনা কবূল কর।', 'My Lord, make me an establisher of prayer, and [many] from my descendants. Our Lord, and accept my supplication.', 'হে আমার প্রতিপালক! আমাকে নামায প্রতিষ্ঠাকারী বানাও আর আমার সন্তানদেরকেও, হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! তুমি আমার প্রার্থনা কবূল কর।', 'My Lord, make me an establisher of prayer, and [many] from my descendants. Our Lord, and accept my supplication.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014040.mp3', now()),
  (14, 41, '', '[{"id":42046,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّنَا","transliteration":"rabbanā","translation_bn":"হে আমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42047,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱغْفِرْ","transliteration":"igh''fir","translation_bn":"মাফ করো","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42048,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِى","transliteration":"lī","translation_bn":"আমাকে","root":"—","lemma":"لِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42049,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَلِوَٰلِدَىَّ","transliteration":"waliwālidayya","translation_bn":"ও আমার পিতামাতাকে","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَٰلِدَي","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42050,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلِلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"walil''mu''minīna","translation_bn":"ও মু''মিনদেরকে","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42051,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"যে দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42052,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَقُومُ","transliteration":"yaqūmu","translation_bn":"প্রতিষ্ঠিত হবে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَامَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42053,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحِسَابُ","transliteration":"l-ḥisābu","translation_bn":"হিসেব\"","root":"حسب","lemma":"حِسَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42054,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٤١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪১)","root":"—","lemma":"٤١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'rabbanā igh''fir lī waliwālidayya walil''mu''minīna yawma yaqūmu l-ḥisābu', 'হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! হিসাব গ্রহণের দিন আমাকে, আমার পিতা-মাতাকে আর মু’মিনদেরকে ক্ষমা করে দিও,', 'Our Lord, forgive me and my parents and the believers the Day the account is established."', 'হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! হিসাব গ্রহণের দিন আমাকে, আমার পিতা-মাতাকে আর মু’মিনদেরকে ক্ষমা করে দিও,', 'Our Lord, forgive me and my parents and the believers the Day the account is established."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014041.mp3', now()),
  (14, 42, '', '[{"id":42820,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42821,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَحْسَبَنَّ","transliteration":"taḥsabanna","translation_bn":"কখনই তুমি মনে করো (যেন)","root":"حسب","lemma":"حَسِبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42822,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":42823,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"غَـٰفِلًا","transliteration":"ghāfilan","translation_bn":"উদাসীন","root":"غفل","lemma":"غَٰفِل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42824,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَمَّا","transliteration":"ʿammā","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে যা","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42825,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُ","transliteration":"yaʿmalu","translation_bn":"করছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42826,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimūna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীরা","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42828,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"শুধুমাত্র","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":42829,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُؤَخِّرُهُمْ","transliteration":"yu-akhiruhum","translation_bn":"তিনি অবকাশ দিচ্ছেন তাদেরকে","root":"اخر","lemma":"أَخَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42830,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِيَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"liyawmin","translation_bn":"পর্যন্ত দিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42831,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَشْخَصُ","transliteration":"tashkhaṣu","translation_bn":"স্থির হবে","root":"شخص","lemma":"تَشْخَصُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42832,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42833,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَبْصَـٰرُ","transliteration":"l-abṣāru","translation_bn":"দৃষ্টিসমূহ","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42834,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٤٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪২)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā taḥsabanna l-laha ghāfilan ʿammā yaʿmalu l-ẓālimūna innamā yu-akhiruhum liyawmin tashkhaṣu fīhi l-abṣāru', 'যালিমরা যা করছে সে ব্যাপারে তোমরা আল্লাহকে কক্ষনো উদাসীন মনে কর না। তিনি তাদেরকে সেদিন পর্যন্ত ঢিল দিচ্ছেন যেদিন ভয়ে আতঙ্কে চক্ষু স্থির হয়ে যাবে।', 'And never think that Allah is unaware of what the wrongdoers do. He only delays them for a Day when eyes will stare [in horror].', 'যালিমরা যা করছে সে ব্যাপারে তোমরা আল্লাহকে কক্ষনো উদাসীন মনে কর না। তিনি তাদেরকে সেদিন পর্যন্ত ঢিল দিচ্ছেন যেদিন ভয়ে আতঙ্কে চক্ষু স্থির হয়ে যাবে।', 'And never think that Allah is unaware of what the wrongdoers do. He only delays them for a Day when eyes will stare [in horror].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014042.mp3', now()),
  (14, 43, '', '[{"id":44061,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مُهْطِعِينَ","transliteration":"muh''ṭiʿīna","translation_bn":"ছুটোছুটি করবে","root":"هطع","lemma":"مُهْطِعِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44062,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مُقْنِعِى","transliteration":"muq''niʿī","translation_bn":"উত্তোলনকারী হয়ে","root":"قنع","lemma":"مُقْنِعِى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44063,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رُءُوسِهِمْ","transliteration":"ruūsihim","translation_bn":"তাদের মাথাগুলো","root":"راس","lemma":"رَأْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44064,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":44065,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَرْتَدُّ","transliteration":"yartaddu","translation_bn":"ফিরবে","root":"ردد","lemma":"ٱرْتَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44066,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ilayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44067,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"طَرْفُهُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"ṭarfuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের পলক","root":"طرف","lemma":"طَرْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44069,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَأَفْـِٔدَتُهُمْ","transliteration":"wa-afidatuhum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের অন্তরগুলো (হবে)","root":"فاد","lemma":"فُؤَاد","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44070,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"هَوَآءٌۭ","transliteration":"hawāon","translation_bn":"(আশা) শূন্য","root":"هوي","lemma":"هَوَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44071,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٤٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'muh''ṭiʿīna muq''niʿī ruūsihim lā yartaddu ilayhim ṭarfuhum wa-afidatuhum hawāon', 'আতঙ্কিত হয়ে মাথা তুলে পালাতে থাকবে, দৃষ্টি তাদের নিজেদের পানে ফিরে আসবে না, আর তাদের দিল উড়ে যাবে।', 'Racing ahead, their heads raised up, their glance does not come back to them, and their hearts are void.', 'আতঙ্কিত হয়ে মাথা তুলে পালাতে থাকবে, দৃষ্টি তাদের নিজেদের পানে ফিরে আসবে না, আর তাদের দিল উড়ে যাবে।', 'Racing ahead, their heads raised up, their glance does not come back to them, and their hearts are void.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014043.mp3', now()),
  (14, 44, '', '[{"id":44346,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنذِرِ","transliteration":"wa-andhiri","translation_bn":"এবং সতর্ক করো","root":"نذر","lemma":"أَنذَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44347,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسَ","transliteration":"l-nāsa","translation_bn":"মানুষকে","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44348,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"সেদিনের","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44349,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِيهِمُ","transliteration":"yatīhimu","translation_bn":"তাদের আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44350,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابُ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābu","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44351,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَيَقُولُ","transliteration":"fayaqūlu","translation_bn":"তখন বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44352,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":44353,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَمُوا۟","transliteration":"ẓalamū","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘন করেছিলো","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44354,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّنَآ","transliteration":"rabbanā","translation_bn":"\"হে আমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44355,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَخِّرْنَآ","transliteration":"akhir''nā","translation_bn":"আমাদের অবকাশ দিন","root":"اخر","lemma":"أَخَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44356,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"পর্যন্ত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44357,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَجَلٍۢ","transliteration":"ajalin","translation_bn":"(কিছু) কাল","root":"اجل","lemma":"أَجَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44358,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"قَرِيبٍۢ","transliteration":"qarībin","translation_bn":"নিকটবর্তী","root":"قرب","lemma":"قَرِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":44359,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"نُّجِبْ","transliteration":"nujib","translation_bn":"আমরা সাড়া দিবো","root":"جوب","lemma":"أُجِيبَت","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44360,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"دَعْوَتَكَ","transliteration":"daʿwataka","translation_bn":"তোমার ডাকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعْوَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44361,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَنَتَّبِعِ","transliteration":"wanattabiʿi","translation_bn":"ও আমরা অনুসরণ করবো","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44362,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرُّسُلَ ۗ","transliteration":"l-rusula","translation_bn":"রাসূলদের\"","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44364,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ","transliteration":"awalam","translation_bn":"\"কি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":44365,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"تَكُونُوٓا۟","transliteration":"takūnū","translation_bn":"করতে তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44366,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَقْسَمْتُم","transliteration":"aqsamtum","translation_bn":"তোমরা শপথ","root":"قسم","lemma":"أَقْسَمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44367,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44368,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"আগে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44369,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":44370,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44371,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44372,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"زَوَالٍۢ","transliteration":"zawālin","translation_bn":"পতন","root":"زول","lemma":"زَوَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44373,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"٤٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-andhiri l-nāsa yawma yatīhimu l-ʿadhābu fayaqūlu alladhīna ẓalamū rabbanā akhir''nā ilā ajalin qarībin nujib daʿwataka wanattabiʿi l-rusula awalam takūnū aqsamtum min qablu mā lakum min zawālin', 'কাজেই মানুষকে সতর্ক কর সেদিনের ব্যাপারে যেদিন তাদের উপর ‘আযাব আসবে। যারা যুলম করেছিল তারা তখন বলবে, ‘হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! আমাদেরকে অল্পদিনের জন্য সময় দাও, আমরা তোমার আহবানে সাড়া দিব আর রসূলদের কথা মেনে চলব।’ (তখন তাদেরকে বলা হবে) তোমরা কি পূর্বে শপথ করে বলনি যে, তোমাদের কক্ষনো পতন ঘটবে না?', 'And, [O Muhammad], warn the people of a Day when the punishment will come to them and those who did wrong will say, "Our Lord, delay us for a short term; we will answer Your call and follow the messengers." [But it will be said], "Had you not sworn, before, that for you there would be no cessation?', 'কাজেই মানুষকে সতর্ক কর সেদিনের ব্যাপারে যেদিন তাদের উপর ‘আযাব আসবে। যারা যুলম করেছিল তারা তখন বলবে, ‘হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! আমাদেরকে অল্পদিনের জন্য সময় দাও, আমরা তোমার আহবানে সাড়া দিব আর রসূলদের কথা মেনে চলব।’ (তখন তাদেরকে বলা হবে) তোমরা কি পূর্বে শপথ করে বলনি যে, তোমাদের কক্ষনো পতন ঘটবে না?', 'And, [O Muhammad], warn the people of a Day when the punishment will come to them and those who did wrong will say, "Our Lord, delay us for a short term; we will answer Your call and follow the messengers." [But it will be said], "Had you not sworn, before, that for you there would be no cessation?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014044.mp3', now()),
  (14, 45, '', '[{"id":45508,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَسَكَنتُمْ","transliteration":"wasakantum","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা বসবাস করছিলে","root":"سكن","lemma":"سَكَنَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45509,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45510,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَسَـٰكِنِ","transliteration":"masākini","translation_bn":"বাসভূমিসমূহের","root":"سكن","lemma":"مَسْكَن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45511,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":45512,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَمُوٓا۟","transliteration":"ẓalamū","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘন করেছিলো","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45513,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسَهُمْ","transliteration":"anfusahum","translation_bn":"তাদের নিজেদের উপর","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45514,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَتَبَيَّنَ","transliteration":"watabayyana","translation_bn":"অথচ  স্পষ্ট ছিলো","root":"بين","lemma":"تَبَيَّنَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45515,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"কাছে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45516,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَيْفَ","transliteration":"kayfa","translation_bn":"কেমন (আচরণ)","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":45517,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَعَلْنَا","transliteration":"faʿalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা করেছিলাম","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45518,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِهِمْ","transliteration":"bihim","translation_bn":"সাথে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45519,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَضَرَبْنَا","transliteration":"waḍarabnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা বর্ণনা করেছি","root":"ضرب","lemma":"ضَرَبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45520,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمُ","transliteration":"lakumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45521,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَمْثَالَ","transliteration":"l-amthāla","translation_bn":"দৃষ্টান্তসমূহ\"","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45522,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٤٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wasakantum fī masākini alladhīna ẓalamū anfusahum watabayyana lakum kayfa faʿalnā bihim waḍarabnā lakumu l-amthāla', 'অথচ তোমরা সেই লোকগুলোর বাসভূমিতে বসবাস করছিলে যারা নিজেদের প্রতি যুলম করেছিল আর তোমাদেরকে স্পষ্ট করে দেখিয়ে দেয়া হয়েছিল আমি তাদের সঙ্গে কেমন ব্যবহার করেছিলাম। আর আমি বহু উদাহরণ টেনে তোমাদেরকে বুঝিয়েও দিয়েছিলাম।', 'And you lived among the dwellings of those who wronged themselves, and it had become clear to you how We dealt with them. And We presented for you [many] examples."', 'অথচ তোমরা সেই লোকগুলোর বাসভূমিতে বসবাস করছিলে যারা নিজেদের প্রতি যুলম করেছিল আর তোমাদেরকে স্পষ্ট করে দেখিয়ে দেয়া হয়েছিল আমি তাদের সঙ্গে কেমন ব্যবহার করেছিলাম। আর আমি বহু উদাহরণ টেনে তোমাদেরকে বুঝিয়েও দিয়েছিলাম।', 'And you lived among the dwellings of those who wronged themselves, and it had become clear to you how We dealt with them. And We presented for you [many] examples."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014045.mp3', now()),
  (14, 46, '', '[{"id":46229,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَدْ","transliteration":"waqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46230,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَكَرُوا۟","transliteration":"makarū","translation_bn":"তারা চক্রান্ত করেছিলো","root":"مكر","lemma":"مَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46231,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَكْرَهُمْ","transliteration":"makrahum","translation_bn":"তাদের চক্রান্ত","root":"مكر","lemma":"مَكْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46232,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَعِندَ","transliteration":"waʿinda","translation_bn":"কিন্তু কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46233,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর (ছিলো)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":46234,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَكْرُهُمْ","transliteration":"makruhum","translation_bn":"তাদের চক্রান্ত","root":"مكر","lemma":"مَكْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46235,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদিও","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46236,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46237,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَكْرُهُمْ","transliteration":"makruhum","translation_bn":"তাদের চক্রান্ত (এমন ভয়ানক)","root":"مكر","lemma":"مَكْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46238,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِتَزُولَ","transliteration":"litazūla","translation_bn":"যেন টলে যেতো","root":"زول","lemma":"زَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46239,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"তা থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46240,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجِبَالُ","transliteration":"l-jibālu","translation_bn":"পর্বতসমূহ","root":"جبل","lemma":"جَبَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46241,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٤٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqad makarū makrahum waʿinda l-lahi makruhum wa-in kāna makruhum litazūla min''hu l-jibālu', 'তারা যে চক্রান্ত করেছিল তা ছিল সত্যিই ভয়ানক, কিন্তু তাদের চক্রান্ত আল্লাহর দৃষ্টির ভিতরেই ছিল, যদিও তাদের চক্রান্তগুলো এমন ছিল না যে, তাতে পর্বতও টলে যেত।', 'And they had planned their plan, but with Allah is [recorded] their plan, even if their plan had been [sufficient] to do away with the mountains.', 'তারা যে চক্রান্ত করেছিল তা ছিল সত্যিই ভয়ানক, কিন্তু তাদের চক্রান্ত আল্লাহর দৃষ্টির ভিতরেই ছিল, যদিও তাদের চক্রান্তগুলো এমন ছিল না যে, তাতে পর্বতও টলে যেত।', 'And they had planned their plan, but with Allah is [recorded] their plan, even if their plan had been [sufficient] to do away with the mountains.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014046.mp3', now()),
  (14, 47, '', '[{"id":46898,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"অতএব না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46899,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَحْسَبَنَّ","transliteration":"taḥsabanna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তুমি মনে করবে","root":"حسب","lemma":"حَسِبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46900,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":46901,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مُخْلِفَ","transliteration":"mukh''lifa","translation_bn":"ভঙ্গকারী","root":"خلف","lemma":"مُخْلِف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46902,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَعْدِهِۦ","transliteration":"waʿdihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46903,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رُسُلَهُۥٓ ۗ","transliteration":"rusulahu","translation_bn":"তাঁর রাসূলদের (কাছে)","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46905,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":46906,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":46907,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَزِيزٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿazīzun","translation_bn":"পরাক্রমশালী","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":46908,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ذُو","transliteration":"dhū","translation_bn":"সমর্থ","root":"—","lemma":"ذُو","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46909,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱنتِقَامٍۢ","transliteration":"intiqāmin","translation_bn":"প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণে","root":"نقم","lemma":"ٱنتِقَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46910,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٤٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falā taḥsabanna l-laha mukh''lifa waʿdihi rusulahu inna l-laha ʿazīzun dhū intiqāmin', '(অবস্থা যতই প্রতিকূল হোক না কেন) তুমি কক্ষনো মনে কর না যে, আল্লাহ তাঁর রসূলগণকে দেয়া ওয়া‘দা খেলাপ করবেন, আল্লাহ মহা প্রতাপশালী, প্রবল প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণকারী।', 'So never think that Allah will fail in His promise to His messengers. Indeed, Allah is Exalted in Might and Owner of Retribution.', '(অবস্থা যতই প্রতিকূল হোক না কেন) তুমি কক্ষনো মনে কর না যে, আল্লাহ তাঁর রসূলগণকে দেয়া ওয়া‘দা খেলাপ করবেন, আল্লাহ মহা প্রতাপশালী, প্রবল প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণকারী।', 'So never think that Allah will fail in His promise to His messengers. Indeed, Allah is Exalted in Might and Owner of Retribution.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014047.mp3', now()),
  (14, 48, '', '[{"id":47634,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"সেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47635,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تُبَدَّلُ","transliteration":"tubaddalu","translation_bn":"পরিবর্তিত হবে","root":"بدل","lemma":"بَدَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47636,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضُ","transliteration":"l-arḍu","translation_bn":"(এই) পৃথিবী","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47637,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرَ","transliteration":"ghayra","translation_bn":"অন্য","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47638,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃৃথিবীতে","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47639,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتُ ۖ","transliteration":"wal-samāwātu","translation_bn":"এবং আকাশমন্ডলী","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47641,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَبَرَزُوا۟","transliteration":"wabarazū","translation_bn":"এবং উপস্থিত হবে (উন্মোচিত হবে)","root":"برز","lemma":"بَرَزَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47642,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর কাছে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47643,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْوَٰحِدِ","transliteration":"l-wāḥidi","translation_bn":"(যিনি) এক","root":"وحد","lemma":"وَٰحِد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47644,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَهَّارِ","transliteration":"l-qahāri","translation_bn":"পরাক্রমশালী","root":"قهر","lemma":"قَهَّار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47645,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٤٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yawma tubaddalu l-arḍu ghayra l-arḍi wal-samāwātu wabarazū lillahi l-wāḥidi l-qahāri', 'যেদিন এ পৃথিবী বদলে গিয়ে অন্য এক পৃথিবীতে রূপান্তরিত হবে আর আসমানসমূহও (বদলে যাবে), আর মানুষ সমুস্থাপিত হবে এক ও অপ্রতিরোধ্য আল্লাহর সম্মুখে।', '[It will be] on the Day the earth will be replaced by another earth, and the heavens [as well], and all creatures will come out before Allah, the One, the Prevailing.', 'যেদিন এ পৃথিবী বদলে গিয়ে অন্য এক পৃথিবীতে রূপান্তরিত হবে আর আসমানসমূহও (বদলে যাবে), আর মানুষ সমুস্থাপিত হবে এক ও অপ্রতিরোধ্য আল্লাহর সম্মুখে।', '[It will be] on the Day the earth will be replaced by another earth, and the heavens [as well], and all creatures will come out before Allah, the One, the Prevailing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014048.mp3', now()),
  (14, 49, '', '[{"id":48290,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَتَرَى","transliteration":"watarā","translation_bn":"এবং তুমি দেখবে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48291,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-muj''rimīna","translation_bn":"অপরাধীদেরকে","root":"جرم","lemma":"مُجْرِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48292,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","transliteration":"yawma-idhin","translation_bn":"সেদিন","root":"—","lemma":"يَوْمَئِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":48293,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مُّقَرَّنِينَ","transliteration":"muqarranīna","translation_bn":"কঠোরভাবে বাঁধা","root":"قرن","lemma":"مُّقَرَّنِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48294,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48295,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَصْفَادِ","transliteration":"l-aṣfādi","translation_bn":"শেকলসমূহের","root":"صفد","lemma":"أَصْفَاد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48296,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'watarā l-muj''rimīna yawma-idhin muqarranīna fī l-aṣfādi', 'সেদিন তুমি অপরাধীদেরকে দেখবে শৃঙ্খলে তাদের হাত পা শক্ত করে বাঁধা।', 'And you will see the criminals that Day bound together in shackles,', 'সেদিন তুমি অপরাধীদেরকে দেখবে শৃঙ্খলে তাদের হাত পা শক্ত করে বাঁধা।', 'And you will see the criminals that Day bound together in shackles,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014049.mp3', now()),
  (14, 50, '', '[{"id":48436,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"سَرَابِيلُهُم","transliteration":"sarābīluhum","translation_bn":"তাদের জামাসমূহ (হবে)","root":"سربل","lemma":"سَرَٰبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48437,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"তৈরি","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48438,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَطِرَانٍۢ","transliteration":"qaṭirānin","translation_bn":"আলকাতরার","root":"قطر","lemma":"قَطِرَان","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48439,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَتَغْشَىٰ","transliteration":"wataghshā","translation_bn":"ও ছেয়ে ফেলবে","root":"غشو","lemma":"غَشِيَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48440,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وُجُوهَهُمُ","transliteration":"wujūhahumu","translation_bn":"তাদের মুখসমূহকে","root":"وجه","lemma":"وَجْه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48441,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارُ","transliteration":"l-nāru","translation_bn":"আগুন","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48442,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٥٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫০)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'sarābīluhum min qaṭirānin wataghshā wujūhahumu l-nāru', 'তাদের পোশাক হবে আলকাতরার আর আগুন তাদের মুখমন্ডল আচ্ছন্ন করবে।', 'Their garments of liquid pitch and their faces covered by the Fire.', 'তাদের পোশাক হবে আলকাতরার আর আগুন তাদের মুখমন্ডল আচ্ছন্ন করবে।', 'Their garments of liquid pitch and their faces covered by the Fire.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014050.mp3', now()),
  (14, 51, '', '[{"id":49564,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لِيَجْزِىَ","transliteration":"liyajziya","translation_bn":"যেন প্রতিফল দেন","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49565,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":49566,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كُلَّ","transliteration":"kulla","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49567,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسٍۢ","transliteration":"nafsin","translation_bn":"ব্যক্তিকে","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49568,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":49569,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَسَبَتْ ۚ","transliteration":"kasabat","translation_bn":"সে উপার্জন করেছে","root":"كسب","lemma":"كَسَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49571,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":49572,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":49573,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"سَرِيعُ","transliteration":"sarīʿu","translation_bn":"দ্রুত","root":"سرع","lemma":"سَرِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":49574,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحِسَابِ","transliteration":"l-ḥisābi","translation_bn":"হিসেব গ্রহণে","root":"حسب","lemma":"حِسَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49575,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٥١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫১)","root":"—","lemma":"٥١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'liyajziya l-lahu kulla nafsin mā kasabat inna l-laha sarīʿu l-ḥisābi', '(এটা করা হবে এজন্য) যাতে আল্লাহ প্রত্যেক ব্যক্তিকে তার কৃতকর্মের প্রতিফল দিতে পারেন। আল্লাহ তো হিসাব গ্রহণে খুবই দ্রুতগতি।', 'So that Allah will recompense every soul for what it earned. Indeed, Allah is swift in account.', '(এটা করা হবে এজন্য) যাতে আল্লাহ প্রত্যেক ব্যক্তিকে তার কৃতকর্মের প্রতিফল দিতে পারেন। আল্লাহ তো হিসাব গ্রহণে খুবই দ্রুতগতি।', 'So that Allah will recompense every soul for what it earned. Indeed, Allah is swift in account.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014051.mp3', now()),
  (14, 52, '', '[{"id":50238,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":50239,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بَلَـٰغٌۭ","transliteration":"balāghun","translation_bn":"এক বার্তা","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَلَٰغ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50240,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِّلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষের জন্যে","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50241,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَلِيُنذَرُوا۟","transliteration":"waliyundharū","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের যেন সতর্ক করা হয়","root":"نذر","lemma":"أَنذَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50242,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"দিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50243,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلِيَعْلَمُوٓا۟","transliteration":"waliyaʿlamū","translation_bn":"এবং যেন তারা জানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50244,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّمَا","transliteration":"annamā","translation_bn":"প্রকৃতপক্ষে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":50245,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":50246,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهٌۭ","transliteration":"ilāhun","translation_bn":"ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50247,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٰحِدٌۭ","transliteration":"wāḥidun","translation_bn":"একমাত্র","root":"وحد","lemma":"وَٰحِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":50248,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَلِيَذَّكَّرَ","transliteration":"waliyadhakkara","translation_bn":"ও যেন শিক্ষা গ্রহণ করে","root":"ذكر","lemma":"تَذَكَّرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50249,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لُوا۟","transliteration":"ulū","translation_bn":"সম্পন্নরা","root":"اول","lemma":"أُولِى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50250,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَلْبَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-albābi","translation_bn":"বোধ (লোকেরা)","root":"لبب","lemma":"أَلْبَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50251,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٥٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫২)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'hādhā balāghun lilnnāsi waliyundharū bihi waliyaʿlamū annamā huwa ilāhun wāḥidun waliyadhakkara ulū l-albābi', 'এটা মানুষদের জন্য একটা বার্তা যার দ্বারা তাদেরকে সতর্ক করা হচ্ছে আর যাতে তারা জানতে পারে যে, তিনি এক ইলাহ আর যাতে বুদ্ধিমান মানুষেরা উপদেশ লাভ করে।', 'This [Qur''an] is notification for the people that they may be warned thereby and that they may know that He is but one God and that those of understanding will be reminded.', 'এটা মানুষদের জন্য একটা বার্তা যার দ্বারা তাদেরকে সতর্ক করা হচ্ছে আর যাতে তারা জানতে পারে যে, তিনি এক ইলাহ আর যাতে বুদ্ধিমান মানুষেরা উপদেশ লাভ করে।', 'This [Qur''an] is notification for the people that they may be warned thereby and that they may know that He is but one God and that those of understanding will be reminded.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/014052.mp3', now())
INSERT INTO public.quran_verses (surah, ayah, text_uthmani, words, transliteration, bn_text, en_text, conventional_bn, conventional_en, modern_translation_bn, modern_translation_en, meta_bn, meta_en, lexicon_modern_notes, audio_url, updated_at)
VALUES
  (15, 1, '', '[{"id":833,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"الٓر ۚ","transliteration":"alif-lam-ra","translation_bn":"আলিফ লা-ম রা-","root":"—","lemma":"الٓر ۚ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":835,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تِلْكَ","transliteration":"til''ka","translation_bn":"এগুলো","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":836,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتُ","transliteration":"āyātu","translation_bn":"আয়াত","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":837,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-kitābi","translation_bn":"কিতাবের","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":838,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَقُرْءَانٍۢ","transliteration":"waqur''ānin","translation_bn":"এবং কুরআনের","root":"قرا","lemma":"قُرْءَان","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":839,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٍۢ","transliteration":"mubīnin","translation_bn":"(যা) সুষ্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":840,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১)","root":"—","lemma":"١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alif-lam-ra til''ka āyātu l-kitābi waqur''ānin mubīnin', 'আলিফ-লাম-র, এগুলো কিতাবের এবং সুস্পষ্ট কুরআনে আয়াতসমূহ।', 'Alif, Lam, Ra. These are the verses of the Book and a clear Qur''an.', 'আলিফ-লাম-র, এগুলো কিতাবের এবং সুস্পষ্ট কুরআনে আয়াতসমূহ।', 'Alif, Lam, Ra. These are the verses of the Book and a clear Qur''an.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015001.mp3', now()),
  (15, 2, '', '[{"id":1944,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"رُّبَمَا","transliteration":"rubamā","translation_bn":"কখনও কখনও","root":"—","lemma":"رُّب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":1945,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَوَدُّ","transliteration":"yawaddu","translation_bn":"আকাঙ্ক্ষা করবে","root":"ودد","lemma":"وَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":1946,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":1947,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":1948,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَوْ","transliteration":"law","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":1949,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা হতো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":1950,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُسْلِمِينَ","transliteration":"mus''limīna","translation_bn":"(আত্মসমর্পণকারী) মুসলমান","root":"سلم","lemma":"مُسْلِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":1951,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২)","root":"—","lemma":"٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'rubamā yawaddu alladhīna kafarū law kānū mus''limīna', 'এমন একটা সময় আসবে যখন কাফিরগণ আক্ষেপ করে বলবে, ‘হায়, আমরা যদি মুসলিম হয়ে যেতাম!’', 'Perhaps those who disbelieve will wish that they had been Muslims.', 'এমন একটা সময় আসবে যখন কাফিরগণ আক্ষেপ করে বলবে, ‘হায়, আমরা যদি মুসলিম হয়ে যেতাম!’', 'Perhaps those who disbelieve will wish that they had been Muslims.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015002.mp3', now()),
  (15, 3, '', '[{"id":3132,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ذَرْهُمْ","transliteration":"dharhum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে ছেড়ে দাও","root":"وذر","lemma":"يَذَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":3133,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَأْكُلُوا۟","transliteration":"yakulū","translation_bn":"তারা খেতে থাকুক","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":3134,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَيَتَمَتَّعُوا۟","transliteration":"wayatamattaʿū","translation_bn":"ও তারা ভোগ করুক","root":"متع","lemma":"تَمَتَّعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":3135,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَيُلْهِهِمُ","transliteration":"wayul''hihimu","translation_bn":"এবং তাদেরকে মোহাচ্ছন্ন রাখুক","root":"لهو","lemma":"أَلْهَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":3136,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَمَلُ ۖ","transliteration":"l-amalu","translation_bn":"আশা আকাঙ্ক্ষা","root":"امل","lemma":"أَمَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":3138,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَسَوْفَ","transliteration":"fasawfa","translation_bn":"অতঃপর শীঘ্রই","root":"—","lemma":"سَوْف\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":3139,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তারা জানবে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":3140,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dharhum yakulū wayatamattaʿū wayul''hihimu l-amalu fasawfa yaʿlamūna', 'ছেড়ে দাও ওদেরকে, ওরা খেতে থাক আর ভোগ করতে থাক, আর (মিথ্যে) আশা ওদেরকে উদাসীনতায় ডুবিয়ে রাখুক, শীঘ্রই ওরা (ওদের ‘আমালের পরিণতি) জানতে পারবে।', 'Let them eat and enjoy themselves and be diverted by [false] hope, for they are going to know.', 'ছেড়ে দাও ওদেরকে, ওরা খেতে থাক আর ভোগ করতে থাক, আর (মিথ্যে) আশা ওদেরকে উদাসীনতায় ডুবিয়ে রাখুক, শীঘ্রই ওরা (ওদের ‘আমালের পরিণতি) জানতে পারবে।', 'Let them eat and enjoy themselves and be diverted by [false] hope, for they are going to know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015003.mp3', now()),
  (15, 4, '', '[{"id":3605,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":3606,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلَكْنَا","transliteration":"ahlaknā","translation_bn":"আমরা ধ্বংস করি","root":"هلك","lemma":"أَهْلَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":3607,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":3608,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَرْيَةٍ","transliteration":"qaryatin","translation_bn":"জনবসতিকে","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":3609,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া যে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":3610,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهَا","transliteration":"walahā","translation_bn":"এবং তার জন্যে ছিলো","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":3611,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كِتَابٌۭ","transliteration":"kitābun","translation_bn":"লিখিত মেয়াদ","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":3612,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَّعْلُومٌۭ","transliteration":"maʿlūmun","translation_bn":"নির্দিষ্ট","root":"علم","lemma":"مَّعْلُوم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":3613,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā ahlaknā min qaryatin illā walahā kitābun maʿlūmun', 'আমি যে জনপদকেই ধ্বংস করেছি তাদের জন্য ছিল লিখিত একটা নির্দিষ্ট সময়।', 'And We did not destroy any city but that for it was a known decree.', 'আমি যে জনপদকেই ধ্বংস করেছি তাদের জন্য ছিল লিখিত একটা নির্দিষ্ট সময়।', 'And We did not destroy any city but that for it was a known decree.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015004.mp3', now()),
  (15, 5, '', '[{"id":5180,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":5181,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَسْبِقُ","transliteration":"tasbiqu","translation_bn":"এগিয়ে আনতে পারে","root":"سبق","lemma":"سَبَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":5182,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":5183,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أُمَّةٍ","transliteration":"ummatin","translation_bn":"জাতি","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":5184,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَجَلَهَا","transliteration":"ajalahā","translation_bn":"তার কালকে","root":"اجل","lemma":"أَجَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":5185,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":5186,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَـْٔخِرُونَ","transliteration":"yastakhirūna","translation_bn":"দেরি করতে পারে","root":"اخر","lemma":"يَسْتَأْخِرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":5187,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'mā tasbiqu min ummatin ajalahā wamā yastakhirūna', 'কোন জাতিই তাদের নির্দিষ্ট কালকে অগ্র-পশ্চাৎ করতে পারে না।', 'No nation will precede its term, nor will they remain thereafter.', 'কোন জাতিই তাদের নির্দিষ্ট কালকে অগ্র-পশ্চাৎ করতে পারে না।', 'No nation will precede its term, nor will they remain thereafter.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015005.mp3', now()),
  (15, 6, '', '[{"id":6937,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":6938,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"\"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":6939,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":6940,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"نُزِّلَ","transliteration":"nuzzila","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে","root":"نزل","lemma":"نَزَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":6941,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":6942,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلذِّكْرُ","transliteration":"l-dhik''ru","translation_bn":"উপদেশ বাণী(কুরআন)","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":6943,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكَ","transliteration":"innaka","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":6944,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَمَجْنُونٌۭ","transliteration":"lamajnūnun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই পাগল","root":"جنن","lemma":"مَجْنُون","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":6945,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqālū yāayyuhā alladhī nuzzila ʿalayhi l-dhik''ru innaka lamajnūnun', 'তারা বলে, ‘ওহে ঐ ব্যক্তি যার প্রতি কুরআন অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে! তুমি তো অবশ্যই পাগল।', 'And they say, "O you upon whom the message has been sent down, indeed you are mad.', 'তারা বলে, ‘ওহে ঐ ব্যক্তি যার প্রতি কুরআন অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে! তুমি তো অবশ্যই পাগল।', 'And they say, "O you upon whom the message has been sent down, indeed you are mad.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015006.mp3', now()),
  (15, 7, '', '[{"id":8233,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّوْ","transliteration":"law","translation_bn":"কেন","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":8234,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":8235,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَأْتِينَا","transliteration":"tatīnā","translation_bn":"আমাদের কাছে আসো","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":8236,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةِ","transliteration":"bil-malāikati","translation_bn":"নিয়ে ফেরেশতাদের","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":8237,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":8238,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كُنتَ","transliteration":"kunta","translation_bn":"তুমি হয়ে থাকো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":8239,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":8240,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰدِقِينَ","transliteration":"l-ṣādiqīna","translation_bn":"সত্যবাদীদের\"","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَادِق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":8241,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'law mā tatīnā bil-malāikati in kunta mina l-ṣādiqīna', 'তুমি সত্যবাদী হলে আমাদের নিকট ফেরেশতাদের হাজির করছ না কেন?’', 'Why do you not bring us the angels, if you should be among the truthful?"', 'তুমি সত্যবাদী হলে আমাদের নিকট ফেরেশতাদের হাজির করছ না কেন?’', 'Why do you not bring us the angels, if you should be among the truthful?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015007.mp3', now()),
  (15, 8, '', '[{"id":9493,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":9494,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نُنَزِّلُ","transliteration":"nunazzilu","translation_bn":"আমরা অবতীর্ণ করি","root":"نزل","lemma":"نَزَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":9495,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةَ","transliteration":"l-malāikata","translation_bn":"ফেরেশতাদেরকে","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":9496,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":9497,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"দিয়ে সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":9498,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":9499,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوٓا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":9500,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِذًۭا","transliteration":"idhan","translation_bn":"তখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذًا\r","grammar_bn":"আশ্চর্যসূচক (Surprise)"},{"id":9501,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مُّنظَرِينَ","transliteration":"munẓarīna","translation_bn":"অবকাশপ্রাপ্ত","root":"نظر","lemma":"مُنظَرُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":9502,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'mā nunazzilu l-malāikata illā bil-ḥaqi wamā kānū idhan munẓarīna', 'যথাযথ কারণ ছাড়া আমি ফেরেশতা পাঠাই না, পাঠালে কাফিরদেরকে আর কোন অবকাশ দেয়া হবে না।', 'We do not send down the angels except with truth; and the disbelievers would not then be reprieved.', 'যথাযথ কারণ ছাড়া আমি ফেরেশতা পাঠাই না, পাঠালে কাফিরদেরকে আর কোন অবকাশ দেয়া হবে না।', 'We do not send down the angels except with truth; and the disbelievers would not then be reprieved.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015008.mp3', now()),
  (15, 9, '', '[{"id":10575,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":10576,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَحْنُ","transliteration":"naḥnu","translation_bn":"আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"نَحْنُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":10577,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نَزَّلْنَا","transliteration":"nazzalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা অবতীর্ণ করেছি","root":"نزل","lemma":"نَزَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":10578,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلذِّكْرَ","transliteration":"l-dhik''ra","translation_bn":"উপদেশ বাণী (কুরআন)","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":10579,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّا","transliteration":"wa-innā","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10580,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":10581,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَحَـٰفِظُونَ","transliteration":"laḥāfiẓūna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই সংরক্ষক","root":"حفظ","lemma":"حَٰفِظ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":10582,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innā naḥnu nazzalnā l-dhik''ra wa-innā lahu laḥāfiẓūna', 'নিশ্চয় আমিই কুরআন নাযিল করেছি আর অবশ্যই আমি তার সংরক্ষক।', 'Indeed, it is We who sent down the Qur''an and indeed, We will be its guardian.', 'নিশ্চয় আমিই কুরআন নাযিল করেছি আর অবশ্যই আমি তার সংরক্ষক।', 'Indeed, it is We who sent down the Qur''an and indeed, We will be its guardian.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015009.mp3', now()),
  (15, 10, '', '[{"id":11721,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":11722,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَا","transliteration":"arsalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা পাঠিয়েছি","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11723,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11724,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِكَ","transliteration":"qablika","translation_bn":"তোমার পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11725,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"কাছে (রাসূলদেরকে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11726,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"شِيَعِ","transliteration":"shiyaʿi","translation_bn":"জাতিগুলোর","root":"شيع","lemma":"شِيعَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11727,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","transliteration":"l-awalīna","translation_bn":"পূর্ববর্তী","root":"اول","lemma":"أَوَّل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":11728,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"١٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad arsalnā min qablika fī shiyaʿi l-awalīna', 'তোমার পূর্ববর্তী জাতিগুলোর কাছেও আমি রসূল পাঠিয়েছিলাম।', 'And We had certainly sent [messengers] before you, [O Muhammad], among the sects of the former peoples.', 'তোমার পূর্ববর্তী জাতিগুলোর কাছেও আমি রসূল পাঠিয়েছিলাম।', 'And We had certainly sent [messengers] before you, [O Muhammad], among the sects of the former peoples.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015010.mp3', now()),
  (15, 11, '', '[{"id":13206,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নি","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":13207,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِيهِم","transliteration":"yatīhim","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে আসে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13208,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13209,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَّسُولٍ","transliteration":"rasūlin","translation_bn":"রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13210,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া যে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":13211,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13212,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সাথে তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13213,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ","transliteration":"yastahziūna","translation_bn":"তারা বিদ্রুপ করতো","root":"هزا","lemma":"ٱسْتُهْزِئَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13214,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"١١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১)","root":"—","lemma":"١١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā yatīhim min rasūlin illā kānū bihi yastahziūna', 'তাদের কাছে এমন কোন রসূল আসেনি যাকে তারা ঠাট্টা-বিদ্রূপ করেনি।', 'And no messenger would come to them except that they ridiculed him.', 'তাদের কাছে এমন কোন রসূল আসেনি যাকে তারা ঠাট্টা-বিদ্রূপ করেনি।', 'And no messenger would come to them except that they ridiculed him.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015011.mp3', now()),
  (15, 12, '', '[{"id":13537,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13538,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَسْلُكُهُۥ","transliteration":"naslukuhu","translation_bn":"তা প্রবেশ করাই আমরা","root":"سلك","lemma":"سَلَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13539,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13540,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِ","transliteration":"qulūbi","translation_bn":"অন্তরসমূহের","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13541,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-muj''rimīna","translation_bn":"অপরাধীদের","root":"جرم","lemma":"مُجْرِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13542,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"١٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'kadhālika naslukuhu fī qulūbi l-muj''rimīna', 'এভাবে আমি এ রকম আচরণ পাপীদের অন্তরে বদ্ধমূল করে দেই।', 'Thus do We insert denial into the hearts of the criminals.', 'এভাবে আমি এ রকম আচরণ পাপীদের অন্তরে বদ্ধমূল করে দেই।', 'Thus do We insert denial into the hearts of the criminals.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015012.mp3', now()),
  (15, 13, '', '[{"id":14925,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":14926,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"তারা ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14927,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":14929,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَقَدْ","transliteration":"waqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":14930,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"خَلَتْ","transliteration":"khalat","translation_bn":"চলে গেছে","root":"خلو","lemma":"خَلَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14931,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سُنَّةُ","transliteration":"sunnatu","translation_bn":"রীতি","root":"سنن","lemma":"سُنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14932,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","transliteration":"l-awalīna","translation_bn":"পূর্ববর্তীদের","root":"اول","lemma":"أَوَّل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":14933,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"١٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lā yu''minūna bihi waqad khalat sunnatu l-awalīna', 'তারা এর প্রতি ঈমান আনবে না, পূর্ববর্তী লোকেদেরও এ নিয়ম-নীতি চলে এসেছে।', 'They will not believe in it, while there has already occurred the precedent of the former peoples.', 'তারা এর প্রতি ঈমান আনবে না, পূর্ববর্তী লোকেদেরও এ নিয়ম-নীতি চলে এসেছে।', 'They will not believe in it, while there has already occurred the precedent of the former peoples.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015013.mp3', now()),
