 তার কাছে উপস্থিত হল তখন তারা বলল, ‘তোমার প্রতি সালাম।’ তখন সে বলল, ‘তোমাদের দেখে আমরা শংকিত।’', 'When they entered upon him and said, "Peace." [Abraham] said, "Indeed, we are fearful of you."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015052.mp3', now()),
  (15, 53, '', '[{"id":50870,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50871,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":50872,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَوْجَلْ","transliteration":"tawjal","translation_bn":"আতঙ্কিত হয়ো","root":"وجل","lemma":"وَجِلَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50873,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":50874,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نُبَشِّرُكَ","transliteration":"nubashiruka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে সুসংবাদ দিচ্ছি","root":"بشر","lemma":"بُشِّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50875,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِغُلَـٰمٍ","transliteration":"bighulāmin","translation_bn":"একটি ছেলের","root":"غلم","lemma":"غُلَٰم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50876,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿalīmin","translation_bn":"বড় জ্ঞানী\"","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":50877,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٥٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū lā tawjal innā nubashiruka bighulāmin ʿalīmin', 'তারা বলল, ‘শংকা করো না, আমরা তোমাকে এক জ্ঞানী পুত্রের সুখবর দিচ্ছি।’', '[The angels] said, "Fear not. Indeed, we give you good tidings of a learned boy."', 'তারা বলল, ‘শংকা করো না, আমরা তোমাকে এক জ্ঞানী পুত্রের সুখবর দিচ্ছি।’', '[The angels] said, "Fear not. Indeed, we give you good tidings of a learned boy."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015053.mp3', now()),
  (15, 54, '', '[{"id":51322,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51323,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَبَشَّرْتُمُونِى","transliteration":"abashartumūnī","translation_bn":"\"কি আমাকে তোমরা সুসংবাদ দিচ্ছো","root":"بشر","lemma":"بُشِّرَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":51324,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"\"এ অবস্থায়","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51325,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":51326,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَّسَّنِىَ","transliteration":"massaniya","translation_bn":"আমাকে পেয়েছে","root":"مسس","lemma":"مَسَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51327,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِبَرُ","transliteration":"l-kibaru","translation_bn":"বার্ধক্য","root":"كبر","lemma":"كِبَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51328,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَبِمَ","transliteration":"fabima","translation_bn":"অতএব কি ধরণের","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51329,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تُبَشِّرُونَ","transliteration":"tubashirūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা সুসংবাদ দিচ্ছো\"","root":"بشر","lemma":"بُشِّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51330,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٥٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla abashartumūnī ʿalā an massaniya l-kibaru fabima tubashirūna', 'সে বলল, ‘বার্ধক্য যখন আমাকে স্পর্শ করেছে তখন তোমরা আমাকে সুখবর দিচ্ছ। আচ্ছা, তোমাদের সুখবরটা কী?’', 'He said, "Have you given me good tidings although old age has come upon me? Then of what [wonder] do you inform?"', 'সে বলল, ‘বার্ধক্য যখন আমাকে স্পর্শ করেছে তখন তোমরা আমাকে সুখবর দিচ্ছ। আচ্ছা, তোমাদের সুখবরটা কী?’', 'He said, "Have you given me good tidings although old age has come upon me? Then of what [wonder] do you inform?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015054.mp3', now()),
  (15, 55, '', '[{"id":51782,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51783,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بَشَّرْنَـٰكَ","transliteration":"basharnāka","translation_bn":"\"তোমাকে সুসংবাদ দিচ্ছি আমরা","root":"بشر","lemma":"بُشِّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51784,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"সহকারে সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51785,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"অতএব না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51786,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَكُن","transliteration":"takun","translation_bn":"তুমি হয়ো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51787,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51788,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَـٰنِطِينَ","transliteration":"l-qāniṭīna","translation_bn":"হতাশদের\"","root":"قنط","lemma":"قَٰنِطِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51789,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٥٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū basharnāka bil-ḥaqi falā takun mina l-qāniṭīna', 'তারা বলল, ‘তোমাকে আমরা প্রকৃতই সুসংবাদ দিচ্ছি। কাজেই তুমি নিরাশদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত হয়ো না।’', 'They said, "We have given you good tidings in truth, so do not be of the despairing."', 'তারা বলল, ‘তোমাকে আমরা প্রকৃতই সুসংবাদ দিচ্ছি। কাজেই তুমি নিরাশদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত হয়ো না।’', 'They said, "We have given you good tidings in truth, so do not be of the despairing."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015055.mp3', now()),
  (15, 56, '', '[{"id":52314,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52315,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"\"এবং কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52316,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَقْنَطُ","transliteration":"yaqnaṭu","translation_bn":"নিরাশ হয়","root":"قنط","lemma":"قَنَطُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52317,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52318,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَّحْمَةِ","transliteration":"raḥmati","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52319,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِۦٓ","transliteration":"rabbihi","translation_bn":"তার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52320,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":52321,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلضَّآلُّونَ","transliteration":"l-ḍālūna","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্টরা","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَا^لّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52322,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٥٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla waman yaqnaṭu min raḥmati rabbihi illā l-ḍālūna', 'সে বলল, ‘পথভ্রষ্টরা ছাড়া আর কে তার প্রতিপালকের রহমাত থেকে নিরাশ হয়?’', 'He said, "And who despairs of the mercy of his Lord except for those astray?"', 'সে বলল, ‘পথভ্রষ্টরা ছাড়া আর কে তার প্রতিপালকের রহমাত থেকে নিরাশ হয়?’', 'He said, "And who despairs of the mercy of his Lord except for those astray?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015056.mp3', now()),
  (15, 57, '', '[{"id":52875,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52876,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فَمَا","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"\"অতএব কি","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52877,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"خَطْبُكُمْ","transliteration":"khaṭbukum","translation_bn":"আপনাদের উদ্দেশ্য","root":"خطب","lemma":"خَطْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52878,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَيُّهَا","transliteration":"ayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে\"","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52879,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُرْسَلُونَ","transliteration":"l-mur''salūna","translation_bn":"প্রেরিত (ফেরেশতারা)\"","root":"رسل","lemma":"مُّرْسَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52880,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٥٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla famā khaṭbukum ayyuhā l-mur''salūna', 'সে বলল, ‘হে আল্লাহর প্রেরিতরা! তোমরা কোন্ কাজে আগমন করেছ?’', '[Abraham] said, "Then what is your business [here], O messengers?"', 'সে বলল, ‘হে আল্লাহর প্রেরিতরা! তোমরা কোন্ কাজে আগমন করেছ?’', '[Abraham] said, "Then what is your business [here], O messengers?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015057.mp3', now()),
