y early morning.', 'আমি লূতকে এ সিদ্ধান্ত জানিয়ে দিলাম যে, সকাল হতে না হতেই সমূলে ধ্বংস করা হবে।', 'And We conveyed to him [the decree] of that matter: that those [sinners] would be eliminated by early morning.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015066.mp3', now()),
  (15, 67, '', '[{"id":58345,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَجَآءَ","transliteration":"wajāa","translation_bn":"এবং আসলো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58346,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلُ","transliteration":"ahlu","translation_bn":"অধিবাসীরা","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58347,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَدِينَةِ","transliteration":"l-madīnati","translation_bn":"শহরের","root":"مدن","lemma":"مَدِينَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58348,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَبْشِرُونَ","transliteration":"yastabshirūna","translation_bn":"উল্লসিত","root":"بشر","lemma":"يَسْتَبْشِرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58349,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٦٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wajāa ahlu l-madīnati yastabshirūna', 'শহরের লোকেরা আনন্দ সহকারে (লূতের ঘরে) উপস্থিত হল।', 'And the people of the city came rejoicing.', 'শহরের লোকেরা আনন্দ সহকারে (লূতের ঘরে) উপস্থিত হল।', 'And the people of the city came rejoicing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015067.mp3', now()),
  (15, 68, '', '[{"id":58825,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(লূত) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58826,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":58827,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","transliteration":"hāulāi","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":58828,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ضَيْفِى","transliteration":"ḍayfī","translation_bn":"আমার অতিথি","root":"ضيف","lemma":"ضَيْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58829,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"অতএব না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58830,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَفْضَحُونِ","transliteration":"tafḍaḥūni","translation_bn":"আমাকে তোমরা অপমান করো","root":"فضح","lemma":"تَفْضَحُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58831,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٦٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla inna hāulāi ḍayfī falā tafḍaḥūni', 'লূত বলল, ‘এরা আমার মেহমান, কাজেই তোমরা আমাকে লাঞ্ছিত করো না।', '[Lot] said, "Indeed, these are my guests, so do not shame me.', 'লূত বলল, ‘এরা আমার মেহমান, কাজেই তোমরা আমাকে লাঞ্ছিত করো না।', '[Lot] said, "Indeed, these are my guests, so do not shame me.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015068.mp3', now()),
  (15, 69, '', '[{"id":59329,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-ittaqū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা ভয় করো","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59330,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":59331,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59332,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تُخْزُونِ","transliteration":"tukh''zūni","translation_bn":"আমাকে তোমরা লাঞ্ছিত করো\"","root":"خزي","lemma":"أَخْزَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59333,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٦٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-ittaqū l-laha walā tukh''zūni', 'তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর, আমাকে লজ্জিত করো না।’', 'And fear Allah and do not disgrace me."', 'তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর, আমাকে লজ্জিত করো না।’', 'And fear Allah and do not disgrace me."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015069.mp3', now()),
  (15, 70, '', '[{"id":59762,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59763,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ","transliteration":"awalam","translation_bn":"\"কি নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":59764,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نَنْهَكَ","transliteration":"nanhaka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে আমরা নিষেধ করি","root":"نهي","lemma":"نَهَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59765,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَنِ","transliteration":"ʿani","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59766,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ʿālamīna","translation_bn":"সারা দুনিয়ার (দায়িত্ব নেয়া)\"","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلَمِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59767,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٧٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭০)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū awalam nanhaka ʿani l-ʿālamīna', 'তারা বলল, দুনিয়াব্যাপী বিষয় নিয়ে কথা বলতে আমরা কি তোমাকে নিষেধ করিনি?’', 'They said, "Have we not forbidden you from [protecting] people?"', 'তারা বলল, দুনিয়াব্যাপী বিষয় নিয়ে কথা বলতে আমরা কি তোমাকে নিষেধ করিনি?’', 'They said, "Have we not forbidden you from [protecting] people?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015070.mp3', now()),
  (15, 71, '', '[{"id":60243,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60244,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","transliteration":"hāulāi","translation_bn":"\"এইসব","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":60245,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بَنَاتِىٓ","transliteration":"banātī","translation_bn":"আমার মেয়েরা","root":"بني","lemma":"بَنَات","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60246,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":60247,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা হও","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60248,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَـٰعِلِينَ","transliteration":"fāʿilīna","translation_bn":"সম্পাদনকারী\"","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَاعِل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60249,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٧١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭১)","root":"—","lemma":"٧١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla hāulāi banātī in kuntum fāʿilīna', '(লূত (আ.)) বলল, ‘তোমরা যদি কিছু করতেই চাও তাহলে এই আমার (জাতির) কন্যারা আছে।’', '[Lot] said, "These are my daughters - if you would be doers [of lawful marriage]."', '(লূত (আ.)) বলল, ‘তোমরা যদি কিছু করতেই চাও তাহলে এই আমার (জাতির) কন্যারা আছে।’', '[Lot] said, "These are my daughters - if you would be doers [of lawful marriage]."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015071.mp3', now()),
  (15, 72, '', '[{"id":60516,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَعَمْرُكَ","transliteration":"laʿamruka","translation_bn":"শপথ তোমার জীবনের","root":"عمر","lemma":"عَمْر","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":60517,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"innahum","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তারা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":60518,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَفِى","transliteration":"lafī","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই মধ্যে (ছিলো)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":60519,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"سَكْرَتِهِمْ","transliteration":"sakratihim","translation_bn":"তাদের নেশার","root":"سكر","lemma":"سَكْرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60520,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَهُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmahūna","translation_bn":"উদভ্রান্ত হয়ে ফিরছিলো","root":"عمه","lemma":"يَعْمَهُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60521,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٧٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭২)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'laʿamruka innahum lafī sakratihim yaʿmahūna', 'তোমার জীবনের শপথ হে নাবী! তারা উন্মত্ত নেশায় আত্মহারা হয়ে পড়েছিল।', 'By your life, [O Muhammad], indeed they were, in their intoxication, wandering blindly.', 'তোমার জীবনের শপথ হে নাবী! তারা উন্মত্ত নেশায় আত্মহারা হয়ে পড়েছিল।', 'By your life, [O Muhammad], indeed they were, in their intoxication, wandering blindly.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015072.mp3', now()),
  (15, 73, '', '[{"id":61109,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَأَخَذَتْهُمُ","transliteration":"fa-akhadhathumu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তাদের ধরলো","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61110,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّيْحَةُ","transliteration":"l-ṣayḥatu","translation_bn":"বিরাট আওয়াজ","root":"صيح","lemma":"صَيْحَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61111,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُشْرِقِينَ","transliteration":"mush''riqīna","translation_bn":"সূর্যোদয় হ''তেই","root":"شرق","lemma":"مُّشْرِقِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61112,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"٧٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-akhadhathumu l-ṣayḥatu mush''riqīna', 'সূর্যোদয়ের সময়ে এক প্রচন্ড ধ্বনি তাদের উপর আঘাত হানল।', 'So the shriek seized them at sunrise.', 'সূর্যোদয়ের সময়ে এক প্রচন্ড ধ্বনি তাদের উপর আঘাত হানল।', 'So the shriek seized them at sunrise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015073.mp3', now()),
  (15, 74, '', '[{"id":61822,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَجَعَلْنَا","transliteration":"fajaʿalnā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর আমরা রাখলাম","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61823,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰلِيَهَا","transliteration":"ʿāliyahā","translation_bn":"তার উপরভাগকে","root":"علو","lemma":"عَالِي","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61824,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"سَافِلَهَا","transliteration":"sāfilahā","translation_bn":"তার নীচেরভাগে","root":"سفل","lemma":"سَافِل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61825,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَأَمْطَرْنَا","transliteration":"wa-amṭarnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা বর্ষণ করলাম","root":"مطر","lemma":"أُمْطِرَتْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61826,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61827,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"حِجَارَةًۭ","transliteration":"ḥijāratan","translation_bn":"পাথরসমূহ","root":"حجر","lemma":"حِجَارَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61828,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"তৈরী","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61829,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"سِجِّيلٍ","transliteration":"sijjīlin","translation_bn":"পোড়া মাটির","root":"سجل","lemma":"سِجِّيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61830,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٧٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fajaʿalnā ʿāliyahā sāfilahā wa-amṭarnā ʿalayhim ḥijāratan min sijjīlin', 'আর আমি সে জনপদকে উল্টে (উপর-নীচ) করে দিলাম আর তাদের উপর পাকানো মাটির প্রস্তর বর্ষণ করলাম।', 'And We made the highest part [of the city] its lowest and rained upon them stones of hard clay.', 'আর আমি সে জনপদকে উল্টে (উপর-নীচ) করে দিলাম আর তাদের উপর পাকানো মাটির প্রস্তর বর্ষণ করলাম।', 'And We made the highest part [of the city] its lowest and rained upon them stones of hard clay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/015074.mp3', now()),
