দিনে তিনি তাদেরকে অপমানিত করবেন আর বলবেন, ‘আমার অংশীদাররা কোথায় যাদের সম্পর্কে তোমরা (ঈমানদারদের সঙ্গে) বাক-বিতন্ডা করতে?’ যাদেরকে (দুনিয়ায়) জ্ঞান দেয়া হয়েছিল তারা বলবে, ‘আজ অপমান আর দুর্ভাগ্য তো কাফিরদের জন্য', 'Then on the Day of Resurrection He will disgrace them and say, "Where are My ''partners'' for whom you used to oppose [the believers]?" Those who were given knowledge will say, "Indeed disgrace, this Day, and evil are upon the disbelievers" -', 'অতঃপর ক্বিয়ামাত দিনে তিনি তাদেরকে অপমানিত করবেন আর বলবেন, ‘আমার অংশীদাররা কোথায় যাদের সম্পর্কে তোমরা (ঈমানদারদের সঙ্গে) বাক-বিতন্ডা করতে?’ যাদেরকে (দুনিয়ায়) জ্ঞান দেয়া হয়েছিল তারা বলবে, ‘আজ অপমান আর দুর্ভাগ্য তো কাফিরদের জন্য', 'Then on the Day of Resurrection He will disgrace them and say, "Where are My ''partners'' for whom you used to oppose [the believers]?" Those who were given knowledge will say, "Indeed disgrace, this Day, and evil are upon the disbelievers" -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016027.mp3', now()),
  (16, 28, '', '[{"id":31402,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যাদের (অবস্থান হলো এই)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":31403,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَتَوَفَّىٰهُمُ","transliteration":"tatawaffāhumu","translation_bn":"তাদের মৃত্যু ঘটায়","root":"وفي","lemma":"تَوَفَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31404,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","transliteration":"l-malāikatu","translation_bn":"ফেরেশতারা","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31405,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ظَالِمِىٓ","transliteration":"ẓālimī","translation_bn":"অত্যাচারী অবস্থায়","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِمِى^","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31406,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسِهِمْ ۖ","transliteration":"anfusihim","translation_bn":"নিজেদের উপর তাদের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31408,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَأَلْقَوُا۟","transliteration":"fa-alqawū","translation_bn":"তারা যখন আত্নসমর্পন করবে (এবং বলবে)","root":"لقي","lemma":"أَلْقَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":31409,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّلَمَ","transliteration":"l-salama","translation_bn":"শান্তি","root":"سلم","lemma":"سَلَم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31410,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":31411,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كُنَّا","transliteration":"kunnā","translation_bn":"আমরা ছিলাম","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31412,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"نَعْمَلُ","transliteration":"naʿmalu","translation_bn":"আমরা কাজ করতে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31413,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31414,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"سُوٓءٍۭ ۚ","transliteration":"sūin","translation_bn":"মন্দ\"","root":"سوا","lemma":"سُو^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31416,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بَلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"balā","translation_bn":"হ্যাঁ","root":"—","lemma":"بَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"উত্তর পদ (Answer)"},{"id":31417,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":31418,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":31419,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌۢ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"খুব জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":31420,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ সম্পর্কে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31421,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31422,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কাজ করতে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31423,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna tatawaffāhumu l-malāikatu ẓālimī anfusihim fa-alqawū l-salama mā kunnā naʿmalu min sūin balā inna l-laha ʿalīmun bimā kuntum taʿmalūna', 'ফেরেশতারা যাদের মৃত্যু ঘটায় নিজেদের প্রতি যুলম করা অবস্থায়।’ অতঃপর তারা আত্মসমর্পণ ক’রে বলবে, ‘আমরা তো কোন খারাপ কাজ করতাম না।’ (ফেরেশতারা জবাব দিবে) ‘বরং, তোমরা যা করছিলে আল্লাহ সে বিষয়ে খুব ভালভাবেই অবগত।', 'The ones whom the angels take in death [while] wronging themselves, and [who] then offer submission, [saying], "We were not doing any evil." But, yes! Indeed, Allah is Knowing of what you used to do.', 'ফেরেশতারা যাদের মৃত্যু ঘটায় নিজেদের প্রতি যুলম করা অবস্থায়।’ অতঃপর তারা আত্মসমর্পণ ক’রে বলবে, ‘আমরা তো কোন খারাপ কাজ করতাম না।’ (ফেরেশতারা জবাব দিবে) ‘বরং, তোমরা যা করছিলে আল্লাহ সে বিষয়ে খুব ভালভাবেই অবগত।', 'The ones whom the angels take in death [while] wronging themselves, and [who] then offer submission, [saying], "We were not doing any evil." But, yes! Indeed, Allah is Knowing of what you used to do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016028.mp3', now()),
  (16, 29, '', '[{"id":32386,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱدْخُلُوٓا۟","transliteration":"fa-ud''khulū","translation_bn":"সুতরাং তোমরা প্রবেশ করো","root":"دخل","lemma":"دَخَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32387,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَبْوَٰبَ","transliteration":"abwāba","translation_bn":"দরজাসমূহে","root":"بوب","lemma":"بَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32388,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمَ","transliteration":"jahannama","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামের","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":32389,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","transliteration":"khālidīna","translation_bn":"স্থায়ী বসবাসকারী হবে","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32390,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا ۖ","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32392,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَلَبِئْسَ","transliteration":"falabi''sa","translation_bn":"অতএব অবশ্যই নিকৃষ্ট","root":"باس","lemma":"بِئْسَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32393,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَثْوَى","transliteration":"mathwā","translation_bn":"আবাসস্থল","root":"ثوي","lemma":"مَثْوًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32394,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُتَكَبِّرِينَ","transliteration":"l-mutakabirīna","translation_bn":"অহংকারীদের","root":"كبر","lemma":"مُتَكَبِّر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32395,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-ud''khulū abwāba jahannama khālidīna fīhā falabi''sa mathwā l-mutakabirīna', 'কাজেই জাহান্নামের দরজায় প্রবেশ কর, সেখানে তোমাদেরকে চিরকাল থাকতে হবে, দাম্ভিকদের অবাসস্থল কতই না মন্দ!’', 'So enter the gates of Hell to abide eternally therein, and how wretched is the residence of the arrogant.', 'কাজেই জাহান্নামের দরজায় প্রবেশ কর, সেখানে তোমাদেরকে চিরকাল থাকতে হবে, দাম্ভিকদের অবাসস্থল কতই না মন্দ!’', 'So enter the gates of Hell to abide eternally therein, and how wretched is the residence of the arrogant.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016029.mp3', now()),
  (16, 30, '', '[{"id":33216,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَقِيلَ","transliteration":"waqīla","translation_bn":"এবং বলা হবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33217,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা (তাদেরকে)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33218,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّقَوْا۟","transliteration":"ittaqaw","translation_bn":"তাকওয়া অবলম্বন করতো","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33219,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَاذَآ","transliteration":"mādhā","translation_bn":"\"কি","root":"—","lemma":"مَاذَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":33220,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلَ","transliteration":"anzala","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করেছিলেন\"","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33221,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"rabbukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রব\"","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33223,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33224,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرًۭا ۗ","transliteration":"khayran","translation_bn":"\"মহাকল্যাণ\"","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33226,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لِّلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"তাদের (জন্যে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33227,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَحْسَنُوا۟","transliteration":"aḥsanū","translation_bn":"সৎকাজ করে","root":"حسن","lemma":"أَحْسَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33228,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33229,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذِهِ","transliteration":"hādhihi","translation_bn":"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":33230,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"দুনিয়ায়","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33231,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"حَسَنَةٌۭ ۚ","transliteration":"ḥasanatun","translation_bn":"কল্যাণ","root":"حسن","lemma":"حَسَنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33233,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَلَدَارُ","transliteration":"waladāru","translation_bn":"এবং অবশ্যই ঘর","root":"دور","lemma":"دَار","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33234,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","translation_bn":"আখেরাতের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33235,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ ۚ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":33237,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَلَنِعْمَ","transliteration":"walaniʿ''ma","translation_bn":"এবং অবশ্যই চমৎকার","root":"نعم","lemma":"نِعْمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33238,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"دَارُ","transliteration":"dāru","translation_bn":"ঘর","root":"دور","lemma":"دَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33239,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ","transliteration":"l-mutaqīna","translation_bn":"মুত্তাকীদের","root":"وقي","lemma":"مُتَّقِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33240,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"٣٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩০)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqīla lilladhīna ittaqaw mādhā anzala rabbukum qālū khayran lilladhīna aḥsanū fī hādhihi l-dun''yā ḥasanatun waladāru l-ākhirati khayrun walaniʿ''ma dāru l-mutaqīna', 'মুত্তাকীদের যখন বলা হয়, ‘তোমাদের প্রতিপালক কী অবতীর্ণ করেছেন?’ তারা বলে, ‘যা কিছু উৎকৃষ্ট (তা-ই অবতীর্ণ করেছেন)।’ যারা সৎকর্ম করে তাদের জন্য এ দুনিয়াতে আছে কল্যাণ, আর তাদের পরকালের ঘর তো নিশ্চিতই কল্যাণকর। মুত্তাকীদের আবাসস্থল কতই না উত্তম!', 'And it will be said to those who feared Allah, "What did your Lord send down?" They will say, "[That which is] good." For those who do good in this world is good; and the home of the Hereafter is better. And how excellent is the home of the righteous -', 'মুত্তাকীদের যখন বলা হয়, ‘তোমাদের প্রতিপালক কী অবতীর্ণ করেছেন?’ তারা বলে, ‘যা কিছু উৎকৃষ্ট (তা-ই অবতীর্ণ করেছেন)।’ যারা সৎকর্ম করে তাদের জন্য এ দুনিয়াতে আছে কল্যাণ, আর তাদের পরকালের ঘর তো নিশ্চিতই কল্যাণকর। মুত্তাকীদের আবাসস্থল কতই না উত্তম!', 'And it will be said to those who feared Allah, "What did your Lord send down?" They will say, "[That which is] good." For those who do good in this world is good; and the home of the Hereafter is better. And how excellent is the home of the righteous -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016030.mp3', now()),
  (16, 31, '', '[{"id":34270,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"جَنَّـٰتُ","transliteration":"jannātu","translation_bn":"জান্নাত","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34271,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَدْنٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿadnin","translation_bn":"স্থায়ী","root":"—","lemma":"عَدْن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":34272,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَدْخُلُونَهَا","transliteration":"yadkhulūnahā","translation_bn":"তাতে তারা প্রবেশ করবে","root":"دخل","lemma":"دَخَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34273,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَجْرِى","transliteration":"tajrī","translation_bn":"প্রবাহিত হয়","root":"جري","lemma":"جَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34274,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34275,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَحْتِهَا","transliteration":"taḥtihā","translation_bn":"তার নিচ","root":"تحت","lemma":"تَحْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34276,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ ۖ","transliteration":"l-anhāru","translation_bn":"ঝর্ণাধারাসমূহ","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34278,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34279,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34280,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":34281,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُونَ ۚ","transliteration":"yashāūna","translation_bn":"তারা চাইবে","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34283,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34284,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَجْزِى","transliteration":"yajzī","translation_bn":"পুরস্কৃত করেন","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34285,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":34286,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ","transliteration":"l-mutaqīna","translation_bn":"মুত্তাকীদেরকে","root":"وقي","lemma":"مُتَّقِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34287,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٣١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩১)","root":"—","lemma":"٣١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'jannātu ʿadnin yadkhulūnahā tajrī min taḥtihā l-anhāru lahum fīhā mā yashāūna kadhālika yajzī l-lahu l-mutaqīna', '(তা হল) স্থায়ী জান্নাত যাতে তারা প্রবেশ করবে, তার নিম্নদেশ দিয়ে ঝর্ণাধারা প্রবাহিত, তারা যা ইচ্ছে করবে সেখানে তাদের জন্য তা-ই আছে- আল্লাহ মুত্তাকীদেরকে এভাবেই পুরস্কৃত করেন।', 'Gardens of perpetual residence, which they will enter, beneath which rivers flow. They will have therein whatever they wish. Thus does Allah reward the righteous -', '(তা হল) স্থায়ী জান্নাত যাতে তারা প্রবেশ করবে, তার নিম্নদেশ দিয়ে ঝর্ণাধারা প্রবাহিত, তারা যা ইচ্ছে করবে সেখানে তাদের জন্য তা-ই আছে- আল্লাহ মুত্তাকীদেরকে এভাবেই পুরস্কৃত করেন।', 'Gardens of perpetual residence, which they will enter, beneath which rivers flow. They will have therein whatever they wish. Thus does Allah reward the righteous -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016031.mp3', now()),
  (16, 32, '', '[{"id":35125,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":35126,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَتَوَفَّىٰهُمُ","transliteration":"tatawaffāhumu","translation_bn":"তাদের মৃত্যু ঘটায়","root":"وفي","lemma":"تَوَفَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35127,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","transliteration":"l-malāikatu","translation_bn":"ফেরেশতারা","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35128,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"طَيِّبِينَ ۙ","transliteration":"ṭayyibīna","translation_bn":"পবিত্র থাকা অবস্থায়","root":"طيب","lemma":"طَيِّب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35130,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","translation_bn":"তারা বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35131,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سَلَـٰمٌ","transliteration":"salāmun","translation_bn":"\"শান্তি","root":"سلم","lemma":"سَلَٰم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35132,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمُ","transliteration":"ʿalaykumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35133,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱدْخُلُوا۟","transliteration":"ud''khulū","translation_bn":"তোমরা প্রবেশ করো","root":"دخل","lemma":"دَخَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35134,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَنَّةَ","transliteration":"l-janata","translation_bn":"জান্নাতে","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35135,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"বিনিময়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35136,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35137,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কাজ করতে\"","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35138,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna tatawaffāhumu l-malāikatu ṭayyibīna yaqūlūna salāmun ʿalaykumu ud''khulū l-janata bimā kuntum taʿmalūna', 'ফেরেশতা যাদের মৃত্যু ঘটায় পবিত্র অবস্থায় এই ব’লে যে, ‘তোমাদের উপর শান্তি বর্ষিত হোক, তোমরা যে ‘আমাল করতে তার ফল হিসেবে জান্নাতে প্রবেশ কর।’', 'The ones whom the angels take in death, [being] good and pure; [the angels] will say, "Peace be upon you. Enter Paradise for what you used to do."', 'ফেরেশতা যাদের মৃত্যু ঘটায় পবিত্র অবস্থায় এই ব’লে যে, ‘তোমাদের উপর শান্তি বর্ষিত হোক, তোমরা যে ‘আমাল করতে তার ফল হিসেবে জান্নাতে প্রবেশ কর।’', 'The ones whom the angels take in death, [being] good and pure; [the angels] will say, "Peace be upon you. Enter Paradise for what you used to do."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016032.mp3', now()),
  (16, 33, '', '[{"id":36041,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"তবে কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":36042,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَنظُرُونَ","transliteration":"yanẓurūna","translation_bn":"তারা অপেক্ষা করছে","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36043,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّآ","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":36044,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":36045,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَأْتِيَهُمُ","transliteration":"tatiyahumu","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36046,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","transliteration":"l-malāikatu","translation_bn":"ফেরেশতারা","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36047,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36048,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِىَ","transliteration":"yatiya","translation_bn":"আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36049,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرُ","transliteration":"amru","translation_bn":"নির্দেশ","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36050,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ ۚ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36052,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এরূপ","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36053,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَعَلَ","transliteration":"faʿala","translation_bn":"করেছিলো","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36054,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":36055,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36056,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِمْ ۚ","transliteration":"qablihim","translation_bn":"তাদের পূর্ব (ছিলো)","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36058,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36059,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَمَهُمُ","transliteration":"ẓalamahumu","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর অত্যাচার করেছেন","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36060,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":36061,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِن","transliteration":"walākin","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36062,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوٓا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36063,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسَهُمْ","transliteration":"anfusahum","translation_bn":"তাদের নিজেদের উপর","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36064,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"يَظْلِمُونَ","transliteration":"yaẓlimūna","translation_bn":"অত্যাচার করতে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36065,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٣٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'hal yanẓurūna illā an tatiyahumu l-malāikatu aw yatiya amru rabbika kadhālika faʿala alladhīna min qablihim wamā ẓalamahumu l-lahu walākin kānū anfusahum yaẓlimūna', 'তারা কি এই অপেক্ষায় আছে যে, ফেরেশতারা তাদের কাছে আসবে কিংবা তোমার প্রতিপালকের ফায়সালা এসে পড়বে? তাদের পূর্ববর্তীরাও এ রকমই করত। আল্লাহ তাদের প্রতি কোন যুলম করেননি বরং তারা নিজেরাই নিজেদের প্রতি যুলম করত।', 'Do the disbelievers await [anything] except that the angels should come to them or there comes the command of your Lord? Thus did those do before them. And Allah wronged them not, but they had been wronging themselves.', 'তারা কি এই অপেক্ষায় আছে যে, ফেরেশতারা তাদের কাছে আসবে কিংবা তোমার প্রতিপালকের ফায়সালা এসে পড়বে? তাদের পূর্ববর্তীরাও এ রকমই করত। আল্লাহ তাদের প্রতি কোন যুলম করেননি বরং তারা নিজেরাই নিজেদের প্রতি যুলম করত।', 'Do the disbelievers await [anything] except that the angels should come to them or there comes the command of your Lord? Thus did those do before them. And Allah wronged them not, but they had been wronging themselves.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016033.mp3', now()),
  (16, 34, '', '[{"id":36847,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَأَصَابَهُمْ","transliteration":"fa-aṣābahum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তাদের উপর পড়েছিলো","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36848,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"سَيِّـَٔاتُ","transliteration":"sayyiātu","translation_bn":"মন্দসমূহ (অর্থাৎ শাস্তি)","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَيِّـ#َات","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36849,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":36850,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"ʿamilū","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করেছিলো","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36851,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَحَاقَ","transliteration":"waḥāqa","translation_bn":"এবং ঘিরে ফেলেছিলো","root":"حيق","lemma":"حَاقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36852,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِهِم","transliteration":"bihim","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36853,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"তা-ই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":36854,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36855,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"নিয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36856,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ","transliteration":"yastahziūna","translation_bn":"তারা ঠাট্টাবিদ্রূপ করতো","root":"هزا","lemma":"ٱسْتُهْزِئَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36857,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-aṣābahum sayyiātu mā ʿamilū waḥāqa bihim mā kānū bihi yastahziūna', 'কাজেই তাদের ‘আমালের মন্দ পরিণতি তাদের উপর আপতিত হল আর যে বিষয়কে তারা ঠাট্টা-বিদ্রূপ করত তা-ই তাদেরকে ঘিরে ফেলল।', 'So they were struck by the evil consequences of what they did and were enveloped by what they used to ridicule.', 'কাজেই তাদের ‘আমালের মন্দ পরিণতি তাদের উপর আপতিত হল আর যে বিষয়কে তারা ঠাট্টা-বিদ্রূপ করত তা-ই তাদেরকে ঘিরে ফেলল।', 'So they were struck by the evil consequences of what they did and were enveloped by what they used to ridicule.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016034.mp3', now()),
  (16, 35, '', '[{"id":37660,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالَ","transliteration":"waqāla","translation_bn":"এবং বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37661,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":37662,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَشْرَكُوا۟","transliteration":"ashrakū","translation_bn":"শিরক করেছে","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37663,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَوْ","transliteration":"law","translation_bn":"\"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":37664,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"شَآءَ","transliteration":"shāa","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করতেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37665,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":37666,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":37667,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَبَدْنَا","transliteration":"ʿabadnā","translation_bn":"আমরা ইবাদাত করতাম","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37668,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37669,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"دُونِهِۦ","transliteration":"dūnihi","translation_bn":"তাঁকে","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37670,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"(অন্য) কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37671,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুকে","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37672,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"نَّحْنُ","transliteration":"naḥnu","translation_bn":"আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"نَّحْنُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":37673,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37674,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ءَابَآؤُنَا","transliteration":"ābāunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের বাপ-দাদারা","root":"ابو","lemma":"ا^بَاء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37675,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37676,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"حَرَّمْنَا","transliteration":"ḥarramnā","translation_bn":"আমরা নিষিদ্ধ করতাম","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37677,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37678,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"دُونِهِۦ","transliteration":"dūnihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর (হুকুম)","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37679,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো\"","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37680,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ ۚ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছু\"","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37682,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এরূপ","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37683,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"فَعَلَ","transliteration":"faʿala","translation_bn":"করেছিলো","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37684,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা (ছিলো)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":37685,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37686,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِمْ ۚ","transliteration":"qablihim","translation_bn":"তাদের পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37688,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"فَهَلْ","transliteration":"fahal","translation_bn":"সুতরাং কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37689,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37690,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرُّسُلِ","transliteration":"l-rusuli","translation_bn":"(দায়িত্ব আছে) রাসূলদের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37691,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া যে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":37692,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَلَـٰغُ","transliteration":"l-balāghu","translation_bn":"পৌঁছানো (দীনের দাওয়াত)","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَلَٰغ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37693,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُبِينُ","transliteration":"l-mubīnu","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট ভাবে","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37694,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"٣٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqāla alladhīna ashrakū law shāa l-lahu mā ʿabadnā min dūnihi min shayin naḥnu walā ābāunā walā ḥarramnā min dūnihi min shayin kadhālika faʿala alladhīna min qablihim fahal ʿalā l-rusuli illā l-balāghu l-mubīnu', 'মুশরিকরা বলে, ‘আল্লাহ ইচ্ছে করলে তাঁকে বাদ দিয়ে অন্য কোন কিছুর ‘ইবাদাত আমরাও করতাম না, আর আমাদের পিতৃপুরুষরাও না, আর তাঁর হুকুম ছাড়া কোন কিছুকে হারাম গণ্যও করতাম না। তাদের পূর্ববর্তীরাও এ রকমই করত। (তারা রসূলদের কথা অমান্য করলে রসূলদের তো আর কিছুই করার নেই, কারণ) স্পষ্টভাবে পৌঁছে দেয়া ছাড়া রসূলদের উপর কি কোন দায়িত্ব আছে?', 'And those who associate others with Allah say, "If Allah had willed, we would not have worshipped anything other than Him, neither we nor our fathers, nor would we have forbidden anything through other than Him." Thus did those do before them. So is there upon the messengers except [the duty of] clear notification?', 'মুশরিকরা বলে, ‘আল্লাহ ইচ্ছে করলে তাঁকে বাদ দিয়ে অন্য কোন কিছুর ‘ইবাদাত আমরাও করতাম না, আর আমাদের পিতৃপুরুষরাও না, আর তাঁর হুকুম ছাড়া কোন কিছুকে হারাম গণ্যও করতাম না। তাদের পূর্ববর্তীরাও এ রকমই করত। (তারা রসূলদের কথা অমান্য করলে রসূলদের তো আর কিছুই করার নেই, কারণ) স্পষ্টভাবে পৌঁছে দেয়া ছাড়া রসূলদের উপর কি কোন দায়িত্ব আছে?', 'And those who associate others with Allah say, "If Allah had willed, we would not have worshipped anything other than Him, neither we nor our fathers, nor would we have forbidden anything through other than Him." Thus did those do before them. So is there upon the messengers except [the duty of] clear notification?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016035.mp3', now()),
  (16, 36, '', '[{"id":38541,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38542,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بَعَثْنَا","transliteration":"baʿathnā","translation_bn":"আমরা পাঠিয়েছি","root":"بعث","lemma":"بَعَثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38543,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38544,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38545,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أُمَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"ummatin","translation_bn":"জাতির","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38546,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَّسُولًا","transliteration":"rasūlan","translation_bn":"রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38547,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَنِ","transliteration":"ani","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যবাচক (Intention)"},{"id":38548,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱعْبُدُوا۟","transliteration":"uʿ''budū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা ইবাদাত করো","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38549,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":38550,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱجْتَنِبُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-ij''tanibū","translation_bn":"ও দূরে থাকো","root":"جنب","lemma":"ٱجْتَنَبُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38551,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلطَّـٰغُوتَ ۖ","transliteration":"l-ṭāghūta","translation_bn":"তাগুত (হ''তে)\"","root":"طغي","lemma":"طَّٰغُوت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38553,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَمِنْهُم","transliteration":"famin''hum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তাদের মধ্য থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38554,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَّنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কাউকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":38555,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"هَدَى","transliteration":"hadā","translation_bn":"সৎপথে পরিচালনা করেন","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38556,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":38557,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنْهُم","transliteration":"wamin''hum","translation_bn":"আর তাদের মধ্য থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38558,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مَّنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কারো","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":38559,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"حَقَّتْ","transliteration":"ḥaqqat","translation_bn":"অবধারিত হয়েছে","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38560,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38561,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلضَّلَـٰلَةُ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ḍalālatu","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্টতা","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَٰلَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38563,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"فَسِيرُوا۟","transliteration":"fasīrū","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তোমরা ভ্রমন করো","root":"سير","lemma":"سَارَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38564,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38565,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38566,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"فَٱنظُرُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-unẓurū","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তোমরা দেখো","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38567,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"كَيْفَ","transliteration":"kayfa","translation_bn":"কেমন","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":38568,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হয়েছে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38569,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","translation_bn":"পরিণাম","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَٰقِبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38570,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","transliteration":"l-mukadhibīna","translation_bn":"মিথ্যাবাদীদের","root":"كذب","lemma":"مُّكَذِّبِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38571,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"٣٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad baʿathnā fī kulli ummatin rasūlan ani uʿ''budū l-laha wa-ij''tanibū l-ṭāghūta famin''hum man hadā l-lahu wamin''hum man ḥaqqat ʿalayhi l-ḍalālatu fasīrū fī l-arḍi fa-unẓurū kayfa kāna ʿāqibatu l-mukadhibīna', 'প্রত্যেক জাতির কাছে আমি রসূল পাঠিয়েছি (এ সংবাদ দিয়ে) যে, আল্লাহর ‘ইবাদাত কর আর তাগুতকে বর্জন কর। অতঃপর আল্লাহ তাদের মধ্যে কতককে সৎপথ দেখিয়েছেন, আর কতকের উপর অবধারিত হয়েছে গুমরাহী, অতএব যমীনে ভ্রমণ করে দেখ, সত্য প্রত্যাখ্যানকারীদের পরিণতি কী ঘটেছিল!', 'And We certainly sent into every nation a messenger, [saying], "Worship Allah and avoid Taghut." And among them were those whom Allah guided, and among them were those upon whom error was [deservedly] decreed. So proceed through the earth and observe how was the end of the deniers.', 'প্রত্যেক জাতির কাছে আমি রসূল পাঠিয়েছি (এ সংবাদ দিয়ে) যে, আল্লাহর ‘ইবাদাত কর আর তাগুতকে বর্জন কর। অতঃপর আল্লাহ তাদের মধ্যে কতককে সৎপথ দেখিয়েছেন, আর কতকের উপর অবধারিত হয়েছে গুমরাহী, অতএব যমীনে ভ্রমণ করে দেখ, সত্য প্রত্যাখ্যানকারীদের পরিণতি কী ঘটেছিল!', 'And We certainly sent into every nation a messenger, [saying], "Worship Allah and avoid Taghut." And among them were those whom Allah guided, and among them were those upon whom error was [deservedly] decreed. So proceed through the earth and observe how was the end of the deniers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016036.mp3', now()),
  (16, 37, '', '[{"id":39414,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":39415,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَحْرِصْ","transliteration":"taḥriṣ","translation_bn":"আগ্রহী হও","root":"حرص","lemma":"حَرَصْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39416,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39417,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"هُدَىٰهُمْ","transliteration":"hudāhum","translation_bn":"তাদের পথ প্রদর্শনের তুমি","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39418,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّ","transliteration":"fa-inna","translation_bn":"তবুও নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39419,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":39420,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":39421,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِى","transliteration":"yahdī","translation_bn":"সৎপথে পরিচালনা করেন","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39422,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":39423,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يُضِلُّ ۖ","transliteration":"yuḍillu","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্ট করেন","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39425,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39426,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَهُم","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39427,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39428,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"نَّـٰصِرِينَ","transliteration":"nāṣirīna","translation_bn":"সাহায্যকারী","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَاصِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39429,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٣٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'in taḥriṣ ʿalā hudāhum fa-inna l-laha lā yahdī man yuḍillu wamā lahum min nāṣirīna', 'তুমি যদি তাদের হিদায়াতের জন্য লালায়িত হও তবে (জেনে রেখে যে) আল্লাহ তাকে সৎপথ দেখান না যাকে তিনি বিপথগামী হতে ছেড়ে দেন আর তাদের কোন সাহায্যকারী নেই।', '[Even] if you should strive for their guidance, [O Muhammad], indeed, Allah does not guide those He sends astray, and they will have no helpers.', 'তুমি যদি তাদের হিদায়াতের জন্য লালায়িত হও তবে (জেনে রেখে যে) আল্লাহ তাকে সৎপথ দেখান না যাকে তিনি বিপথগামী হতে ছেড়ে দেন আর তাদের কোন সাহায্যকারী নেই।', '[Even] if you should strive for their guidance, [O Muhammad], indeed, Allah does not guide those He sends astray, and they will have no helpers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016037.mp3', now()),
  (16, 38, '', '[{"id":40226,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَقْسَمُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-aqsamū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা শপথ করে","root":"قسم","lemma":"أَقْسَمُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40227,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"নামে আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40228,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَهْدَ","transliteration":"jahda","translation_bn":"সাধ্য অনুসারে","root":"جهد","lemma":"جَهْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40229,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَيْمَـٰنِهِمْ ۙ","transliteration":"aymānihim","translation_bn":"তাদের শপথের","root":"يمن","lemma":"يَمِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40231,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":40232,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَبْعَثُ","transliteration":"yabʿathu","translation_bn":"উঠাবেন","root":"بعث","lemma":"بَعَثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40233,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":40234,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"(তাকে) যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":40235,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَمُوتُ ۚ","transliteration":"yamūtu","translation_bn":"মারা যায়","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّاتَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40237,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بَلَىٰ","transliteration":"balā","translation_bn":"হ্যাঁ (নিশ্চয়ই)","root":"—","lemma":"بَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"উত্তর পদ (Answer)"},{"id":40238,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَعْدًا","transliteration":"waʿdan","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40239,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40240,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"حَقًّۭا","transliteration":"ḥaqqan","translation_bn":"অবধারিত","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40241,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","transliteration":"walākinna","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40242,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرَ","transliteration":"akthara","translation_bn":"অধিকাংশ","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40243,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষ","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40244,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":40245,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তারা জানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40246,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٣٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-aqsamū bil-lahi jahda aymānihim lā yabʿathu l-lahu man yamūtu balā waʿdan ʿalayhi ḥaqqan walākinna akthara l-nāsi lā yaʿlamūna', 'তারা আল্লাহর নামে শক্ত কসম খেয়ে বলে, ‘যার মুত্যৃ ঘটে আল্লাহ তাকে পুনরায় জীবিত করবেন না।’ অবশ্যই করবেন, এটা তো একটা প্রতিশ্রুতি যা পূরণ করা তাঁর দায়িত্ব, কিন্তু অধিকাংশ মানুষই তা জানে না।', 'And they swear by Allah their strongest oaths [that] Allah will not resurrect one who dies. But yes - [it is] a true promise [binding] upon Him, but most of the people do not know.', 'তারা আল্লাহর নামে শক্ত কসম খেয়ে বলে, ‘যার মুত্যৃ ঘটে আল্লাহ তাকে পুনরায় জীবিত করবেন না।’ অবশ্যই করবেন, এটা তো একটা প্রতিশ্রুতি যা পূরণ করা তাঁর দায়িত্ব, কিন্তু অধিকাংশ মানুষই তা জানে না।', 'And they swear by Allah their strongest oaths [that] Allah will not resurrect one who dies. But yes - [it is] a true promise [binding] upon Him, but most of the people do not know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016038.mp3', now()),
  (16, 39, '', '[{"id":40966,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لِيُبَيِّنَ","transliteration":"liyubayyina","translation_bn":"জন্যে প্রকাশ করার","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيَّنُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40967,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40968,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যে বিষয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":40969,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَخْتَلِفُونَ","transliteration":"yakhtalifūna","translation_bn":"তারা মতানৈক্য করে","root":"خلف","lemma":"ٱخْتَلَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40970,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40971,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلِيَعْلَمَ","transliteration":"waliyaʿlama","translation_bn":"এবং জানে যেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40972,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারা) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":40973,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوٓا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40974,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"annahum","translation_bn":"যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":40975,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"(তারা) ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40976,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كَـٰذِبِينَ","transliteration":"kādhibīna","translation_bn":"মিথ্যাবাদী","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَٰذِب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40977,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٣٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'liyubayyina lahumu alladhī yakhtalifūna fīhi waliyaʿlama alladhīna kafarū annahum kānū kādhibīna', '(তাদেরকে পুনর্জীবিত করা হবে) যারা এ ব্যাপারে মতভেদ করেছিল তাদের কাছে স্পষ্ট করে দেয়ার জন্য, আর কাফিরগণ যাতে জানতে পারে যে, তারা ছিল মিথ্যেবাদী।', '[It is] so He will make clear to them [the truth of] that wherein they differ and so those who have disbelieved may know that they were liars.', '(তাদেরকে পুনর্জীবিত করা হবে) যারা এ ব্যাপারে মতভেদ করেছিল তাদের কাছে স্পষ্ট করে দেয়ার জন্য, আর কাফিরগণ যাতে জানতে পারে যে, তারা ছিল মিথ্যেবাদী।', '[It is] so He will make clear to them [the truth of] that wherein they differ and so those who have disbelieved may know that they were liars.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016039.mp3', now()),
  (16, 40, '', '[{"id":41879,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"শুধু এতটুকুই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":41880,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَوْلُنَا","transliteration":"qawlunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের কথা","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41881,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِشَىْءٍ","transliteration":"lishayin","translation_bn":"জন্যে কোন কিছুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41882,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِذَآ","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":41883,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَرَدْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"aradnāhu","translation_bn":"আমরা তা করতে চাই","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41884,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":41885,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نَّقُولَ","transliteration":"naqūla","translation_bn":"আমরা বলি","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41886,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তাকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41887,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كُن","transliteration":"kun","translation_bn":"\"হও\"","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41888,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَيَكُونُ","transliteration":"fayakūnu","translation_bn":"ফলে তা হয়ে যায়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41889,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٤٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪০)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innamā qawlunā lishayin idhā aradnāhu an naqūla lahu kun fayakūnu', 'কোন বিষয়ে আমি ইচ্ছে করলে বলি, ‘হয়ে যাও’, ফলে তা হয়ে যায়।', 'Indeed, Our word to a thing when We intend it is but that We say to it, "Be," and it is.', 'কোন বিষয়ে আমি ইচ্ছে করলে বলি, ‘হয়ে যাও’, ফলে তা হয়ে যায়।', 'Indeed, Our word to a thing when We intend it is but that We say to it, "Be," and it is.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016040.mp3', now()),
  (16, 41, '', '[{"id":42611,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42612,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هَاجَرُوا۟","transliteration":"hājarū","translation_bn":"হিজরত করেছে","root":"هجر","lemma":"هَاجَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42613,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42614,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":42615,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42616,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِ","transliteration":"baʿdi","translation_bn":"পর","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42617,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":42618,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ظُلِمُوا۟","transliteration":"ẓulimū","translation_bn":"তারা নির্যাতিত হয়েছে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42619,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَنُبَوِّئَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"lanubawwi-annahum","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই আমরা আবাস দিবো তাদের","root":"بوا","lemma":"بَوَّأَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":42620,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42621,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"দুনিয়ার","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42622,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"حَسَنَةًۭ ۖ","transliteration":"ḥasanatan","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"حسن","lemma":"حَسَنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42624,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَلَأَجْرُ","transliteration":"wala-ajru","translation_bn":"এবং অবশ্যই পুরস্কার","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42625,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","translation_bn":"আখেরাতের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42626,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَكْبَرُ ۚ","transliteration":"akbaru","translation_bn":"সর্বাধিক","root":"كبر","lemma":"أَكْبَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":42628,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَوْ","transliteration":"law","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":42629,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42630,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তারা জানতো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42631,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٤١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪১)","root":"—","lemma":"٤١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna hājarū fī l-lahi min baʿdi mā ẓulimū lanubawwi-annahum fī l-dun''yā ḥasanatan wala-ajru l-ākhirati akbaru law kānū yaʿlamūna', 'যারা অত্যাচারিত হওয়ার পরও আল্লাহর পথে হিজরাত করেছে, আমি তাদেরকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই এ দুনিয়াতে উত্তম আবাস দান করব, আর আখেরাতের পুরস্কার তো অবশ্যই সবচেয়ে বড়। হায়, তারা যদি জানত!', 'And those who emigrated for [the cause of] Allah after they had been wronged - We will surely settle them in this world in a good place; but the reward of the Hereafter is greater, if only they could know.', 'যারা অত্যাচারিত হওয়ার পরও আল্লাহর পথে হিজরাত করেছে, আমি তাদেরকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই এ দুনিয়াতে উত্তম আবাস দান করব, আর আখেরাতের পুরস্কার তো অবশ্যই সবচেয়ে বড়। হায়, তারা যদি জানত!', 'And those who emigrated for [the cause of] Allah after they had been wronged - We will surely settle them in this world in a good place; but the reward of the Hereafter is greater, if only they could know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016041.mp3', now()),
  (16, 42, '', '[{"id":43334,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":43335,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"صَبَرُوا۟","transliteration":"ṣabarū","translation_bn":"ধৈর্য ধরেছে","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43336,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَعَلَىٰ","transliteration":"waʿalā","translation_bn":"ও উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43337,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِمْ","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"তাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43338,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَتَوَكَّلُونَ","transliteration":"yatawakkalūna","translation_bn":"তারা নির্ভর করে","root":"وكل","lemma":"تَوَكَّلْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43339,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٤٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪২)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna ṣabarū waʿalā rabbihim yatawakkalūna', '(আখেরাতের ঐ পুরস্কার তাদের জন্য) যারা ধৈর্যধারণ করে আর তাদের প্রতিপালকের উপর নির্ভর করে।', '[They are] those who endured patiently and upon their Lord relied.', '(আখেরাতের ঐ পুরস্কার তাদের জন্য) যারা ধৈর্যধারণ করে আর তাদের প্রতিপালকের উপর নির্ভর করে।', '[They are] those who endured patiently and upon their Lord relied.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016042.mp3', now()),
  (16, 43, '', '[{"id":44099,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44100,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَا","transliteration":"arsalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা পাঠিয়েছি","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44101,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44102,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِكَ","transliteration":"qablika","translation_bn":"তোমার পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44103,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":44104,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رِجَالًۭا","transliteration":"rijālan","translation_bn":"মানুষদেরকে","root":"رجل","lemma":"رِجَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44105,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نُّوحِىٓ","transliteration":"nūḥī","translation_bn":"আমরা ওহী করি","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44106,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِمْ ۚ","transliteration":"ilayhim","translation_bn":"প্রতি তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44108,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَسْـَٔلُوٓا۟","transliteration":"fasalū","translation_bn":"অতএব তোমরা জিজ্ঞেস করো","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44109,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلَ","transliteration":"ahla","translation_bn":"সম্পন্নদের","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44110,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلذِّكْرِ","transliteration":"l-dhik''ri","translation_bn":"(ঐশী)জ্ঞান","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44111,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":44112,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44113,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":44114,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা জানো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44115,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٤٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā arsalnā min qablika illā rijālan nūḥī ilayhim fasalū ahla l-dhik''ri in kuntum lā taʿlamūna', 'আমি তোমার পূর্বে পুরুষ মানুষ ব্যতীত পাঠাইনি যাদের কাছে আমি ওয়াহী করতাম। তোমরা যদি না জান তাহলে তোমরা আল্লাহর কিতাব সম্পর্কে যারা অবগত তাদেরকে জিজ্ঞেস কর', 'And We sent not before you except men to whom We revealed [Our message]. So ask the people of the message if you do not know.', 'আমি তোমার পূর্বে পুরুষ মানুষ ব্যতীত পাঠাইনি যাদের কাছে আমি ওয়াহী করতাম। তোমরা যদি না জান তাহলে তোমরা আল্লাহর কিতাব সম্পর্কে যারা অবগত তাদেরকে জিজ্ঞেস কর', 'And We sent not before you except men to whom We revealed [Our message]. So ask the people of the message if you do not know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016043.mp3', now()),
  (16, 44, '', '[{"id":44887,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ","transliteration":"bil-bayināti","translation_bn":"সহ উজ্জ্বল নিদর্শনাবলী","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44888,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلزُّبُرِ ۗ","transliteration":"wal-zuburi","translation_bn":"ও কিতাবসমূহ","root":"زبر","lemma":"زُبُر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44890,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنزَلْنَآ","transliteration":"wa-anzalnā","translation_bn":"ও আমরা অবতীর্ণ করেছি","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44891,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"তোমার প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44892,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلذِّكْرَ","transliteration":"l-dhik''ra","translation_bn":"উপদেশবাণী (কুরআন)","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44893,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِتُبَيِّنَ","transliteration":"litubayyina","translation_bn":"যেন সুস্পস্টভাবে বর্ণনা করো তুমি","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيَّنُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44894,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","translation_bn":"জন্যে মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44895,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":44896,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"نُزِّلَ","transliteration":"nuzzila","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করা হয়েছে","root":"نزل","lemma":"نَزَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44897,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ilayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44898,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَلَعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"walaʿallahum","translation_bn":"এবং সম্ভবত তারা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44899,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَتَفَكَّرُونَ","transliteration":"yatafakkarūna","translation_bn":"চিন্তা-ভাবনা করে","root":"فكر","lemma":"يَتَفَكَّرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44900,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٤٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'bil-bayināti wal-zuburi wa-anzalnā ilayka l-dhik''ra litubayyina lilnnāsi mā nuzzila ilayhim walaʿallahum yatafakkarūna', '(অতীতের রসূলদেরকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম) স্পষ্ট প্রমাণাদি আর কিতাব দিয়ে; আর এখন তোমার প্রতি কুরআন অবতীর্ণ করছি মানুষকে স্পষ্টভাবে বুঝিয়ে দেয়ার জন্য যা তাদের প্রতি অবতীর্ণ করা হয়েছে আর যাতে তারা চিন্তা-ভাবনা করে।', '[We sent them] with clear proofs and written ordinances. And We revealed to you the message that you may make clear to the people what was sent down to them and that they might give thought.', '(অতীতের রসূলদেরকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম) স্পষ্ট প্রমাণাদি আর কিতাব দিয়ে; আর এখন তোমার প্রতি কুরআন অবতীর্ণ করছি মানুষকে স্পষ্টভাবে বুঝিয়ে দেয়ার জন্য যা তাদের প্রতি অবতীর্ণ করা হয়েছে আর যাতে তারা চিন্তা-ভাবনা করে।', '[We sent them] with clear proofs and written ordinances. And We revealed to you the message that you may make clear to the people what was sent down to them and that they might give thought.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016044.mp3', now()),
  (16, 45, '', '[{"id":45580,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَفَأَمِنَ","transliteration":"afa-amina","translation_bn":"তবে কি নির্ভয় হয়েছে","root":"امن","lemma":"أَمِنَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":45581,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারা) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":45582,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَكَرُوا۟","transliteration":"makarū","translation_bn":"চক্রান্ত করে","root":"مكر","lemma":"مَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45583,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّيِّـَٔاتِ","transliteration":"l-sayiāti","translation_bn":"কুকর্মের","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَيِّـ#َات","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45584,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":45585,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَخْسِفَ","transliteration":"yakhsifa","translation_bn":"ধসিয়ে দিবেন","root":"خسف","lemma":"خَسَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45586,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":45587,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِهِمُ","transliteration":"bihimu","translation_bn":"সহ তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45588,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","transliteration":"l-arḍa","translation_bn":"মাটিকে","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45589,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45590,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِيَهُمُ","transliteration":"yatiyahumu","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45591,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابُ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābu","translation_bn":"আযাব","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45592,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45593,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"حَيْثُ","transliteration":"ḥaythu","translation_bn":"যেখান","root":"حيث","lemma":"حَيْث","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45594,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":45595,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَشْعُرُونَ","transliteration":"yashʿurūna","translation_bn":"তারা ধারণাও করে","root":"شعر","lemma":"يَشْعُرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45596,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٤٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'afa-amina alladhīna makarū l-sayiāti an yakhsifa l-lahu bihimu l-arḍa aw yatiyahumu l-ʿadhābu min ḥaythu lā yashʿurūna', 'যারা (ইসলামের বিরুদ্ধে) কূট-কৌশল করছে তারা কি নির্ভয় হয়ে গেছে যে, আল্লাহ তাদেরকে যমীনে ধ্বসিয়ে দিবেন না, অথবা তাদের কাছে শাস্তি এসে পড়বে না এমন দিক থেকে যা তারা এতটুকুও টের পাবে না', 'Then, do those who have planned evil deeds feel secure that Allah will not cause the earth to swallow them or that the punishment will not come upon them from where they do not perceive?', 'যারা (ইসলামের বিরুদ্ধে) কূট-কৌশল করছে তারা কি নির্ভয় হয়ে গেছে যে, আল্লাহ তাদেরকে যমীনে ধ্বসিয়ে দিবেন না, অথবা তাদের কাছে শাস্তি এসে পড়বে না এমন দিক থেকে যা তারা এতটুকুও টের পাবে না', 'Then, do those who have planned evil deeds feel secure that Allah will not cause the earth to swallow them or that the punishment will not come upon them from where they do not perceive?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016045.mp3', now()),
  (16, 46, '', '[{"id":46274,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46275,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَأْخُذَهُمْ","transliteration":"yakhudhahum","translation_bn":"তাদের ধরবেন","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46276,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46277,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَقَلُّبِهِمْ","transliteration":"taqallubihim","translation_bn":"তাদের চলাফেরার","root":"قلب","lemma":"تَقَلُّب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46278,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَمَا","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46279,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هُم","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা (হ''তে পারবে)","root":"—","lemma":"هُم","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":46280,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِمُعْجِزِينَ","transliteration":"bimuʿ''jizīna","translation_bn":"(তাঁকে) অক্ষমকারী","root":"عجز","lemma":"مُعْجِز","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46281,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٤٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'aw yakhudhahum fī taqallubihim famā hum bimuʿ''jizīna', 'কিংবা তাদের চলাফেরার ভিতরেই তিনি তাদেরকে পাকড়াও করবেন না, অতঃপর তারা তো তা ব্যর্থ করে দিতে পারবে না।', 'Or that He would not seize them during their [usual] activity, and they could not cause failure?', 'কিংবা তাদের চলাফেরার ভিতরেই তিনি তাদেরকে পাকড়াও করবেন না, অতঃপর তারা তো তা ব্যর্থ করে দিতে পারবে না।', 'Or that He would not seize them during their [usual] activity, and they could not cause failure?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016046.mp3', now()),
  (16, 47, '', '[{"id":46967,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46968,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَأْخُذَهُمْ","transliteration":"yakhudhahum","translation_bn":"তাদের ধরবেন","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46969,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"অবস্হায়","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46970,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَخَوُّفٍۢ","transliteration":"takhawwufin","translation_bn":"ভীত সন্ত্রস্ত","root":"خوف","lemma":"تَخَوُّف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46971,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّ","transliteration":"fa-inna","translation_bn":"তবে নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46972,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّكُمْ","transliteration":"rabbakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46973,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَرَءُوفٌۭ","transliteration":"laraūfun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই দয়াপরবশ","root":"راف","lemma":"رَءُوف","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":46974,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":46975,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٤٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'aw yakhudhahum ʿalā takhawwufin fa-inna rabbakum laraūfun raḥīmun', 'অথবা তিনি তাদেরকে পাকড়াও করবেন না যখন তারা আসন্ন মুসীবাতের চিন্তায় ভীত-সন্ত্রস্ত হয়ে থাকবে, (আসল কথা হল আল্লাহ মানুষকে খুবই অবকাশ দিয়ে থাকেন) কেননা তোমাদের প্রতিপালক অবশ্যই অতি দয়ার্দ্র, বড়ই দয়ালু।', 'Or that He would not seize them gradually [in a state of dread]? But indeed, your Lord is Kind and Merciful.', 'অথবা তিনি তাদেরকে পাকড়াও করবেন না যখন তারা আসন্ন মুসীবাতের চিন্তায় ভীত-সন্ত্রস্ত হয়ে থাকবে, (আসল কথা হল আল্লাহ মানুষকে খুবই অবকাশ দিয়ে থাকেন) কেননা তোমাদের প্রতিপালক অবশ্যই অতি দয়ার্দ্র, বড়ই দয়ালু।', 'Or that He would not seize them gradually [in a state of dread]? But indeed, your Lord is Kind and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016047.mp3', now()),
  (16, 48, '', '[{"id":47660,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ","transliteration":"awalam","translation_bn":"কি নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":47661,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَرَوْا۟","transliteration":"yaraw","translation_bn":"তারা দেখে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47662,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47663,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":47664,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقَ","transliteration":"khalaqa","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47665,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":47666,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47667,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"বস্তুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47668,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَتَفَيَّؤُا۟","transliteration":"yatafayya-u","translation_bn":"ঝুঁকে পড়ে","root":"فيا","lemma":"يَتَفَيَّؤُا@","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47669,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ظِلَـٰلُهُۥ","transliteration":"ẓilāluhu","translation_bn":"তার ছায়াগুলো","root":"ظلل","lemma":"ظِلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47670,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَنِ","transliteration":"ʿani","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47671,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْيَمِينِ","transliteration":"l-yamīni","translation_bn":"ডান","root":"يمن","lemma":"يَمِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47672,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلشَّمَآئِلِ","transliteration":"wal-shamāili","translation_bn":"ও বাম (থেকে)","root":"شمل","lemma":"شَمَا^ئِل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47673,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"سُجَّدًۭا","transliteration":"sujjadan","translation_bn":"সিজদাবনত হয়ে","root":"سجد","lemma":"سَاجِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":47674,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لِّلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর জন্যে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47675,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এমতাবস্হায় যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":47676,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"دَٰخِرُونَ","transliteration":"dākhirūna","translation_bn":"বিনয়ী","root":"دخر","lemma":"دَٰخِرُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47677,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٤٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'awalam yaraw ilā mā khalaqa l-lahu min shayin yatafayya-u ẓilāluhu ʿani l-yamīni wal-shamāili sujjadan lillahi wahum dākhirūna', 'তারা কি আল্লাহর সৃষ্টি করা জিনিসের দিকে লক্ষ্য করে না, যার ছায়া আল্লাহর প্রতি সাজদার অবস্থায় ডানে-বামে পতিত হয়, আর তারা বিনয় প্রকাশ করে?', 'Have they not considered what things Allah has created? Their shadows incline to the right and to the left, prostrating to Allah, while they are humble.', 'তারা কি আল্লাহর সৃষ্টি করা জিনিসের দিকে লক্ষ্য করে না, যার ছায়া আল্লাহর প্রতি সাজদার অবস্থায় ডানে-বামে পতিত হয়, আর তারা বিনয় প্রকাশ করে?', 'Have they not considered what things Allah has created? Their shadows incline to the right and to the left, prostrating to Allah, while they are humble.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016048.mp3', now()),
  (16, 49, '', '[{"id":48319,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلِلَّهِ","transliteration":"walillahi","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহর জন্যে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48320,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَسْجُدُ","transliteration":"yasjudu","translation_bn":"সিজদা করে","root":"سجد","lemma":"سَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48321,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":48322,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48323,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশসমূহের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48324,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48325,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48326,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48327,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48328,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"دَآبَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"dābbatin","translation_bn":"জীবজন্তু","root":"دبب","lemma":"دَا^بَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48329,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","transliteration":"wal-malāikatu","translation_bn":"এবং ফেরেশতারা","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48330,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এবং তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48331,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":48332,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَكْبِرُونَ","transliteration":"yastakbirūna","translation_bn":"অহংকার করে","root":"كبر","lemma":"ٱسْتَكْبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48333,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walillahi yasjudu mā fī l-samāwāti wamā fī l-arḍi min dābbatin wal-malāikatu wahum lā yastakbirūna', 'আকাশসমূহ ও পৃথিবীতে যত জীব-জন্তু ফেরেশতারা, সমস্তই আল্লাহকে সাজদাহ করে; তারা অহঙ্কার করে না।', 'And to Allah prostrates whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth of creatures, and the angels [as well], and they are not arrogant.', 'আকাশসমূহ ও পৃথিবীতে যত জীব-জন্তু ফেরেশতারা, সমস্তই আল্লাহকে সাজদাহ করে; তারা অহঙ্কার করে না।', 'And to Allah prostrates whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth of creatures, and the angels [as well], and they are not arrogant.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016049.mp3', now()),
  (16, 50, '', '[{"id":48997,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَخَافُونَ","transliteration":"yakhāfūna","translation_bn":"তারা ভয় করে","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48998,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّهُم","transliteration":"rabbahum","translation_bn":"তাদের রবকে","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48999,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"অবস্থানরত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49000,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَوْقِهِمْ","transliteration":"fawqihim","translation_bn":"উপরে তাদের","root":"فوق","lemma":"فَوْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49001,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَيَفْعَلُونَ","transliteration":"wayafʿalūna","translation_bn":"এবং তারা করে","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49002,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":49003,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمَرُونَ ۩","transliteration":"yu''marūna","translation_bn":"তাদের নির্দেশ দেয়া হয়","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49005,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٥٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫০)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yakhāfūna rabbahum min fawqihim wayafʿalūna mā yu''marūna', 'তারা তাদের উপরে আল্লাহকে ভয় করে আর তারা তা-ই করে যা তাদেরকে আদেশ দেয়া হয়। [সাজদাহ]', 'They fear their Lord above them, and they do what they are commanded.', 'তারা তাদের উপরে আল্লাহকে ভয় করে আর তারা তা-ই করে যা তাদেরকে আদেশ দেয়া হয়। [সাজদাহ]', 'They fear their Lord above them, and they do what they are commanded.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016050.mp3', now()),
  (16, 51, '', '[{"id":49613,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَقَالَ","transliteration":"waqāla","translation_bn":"এবং বলেন","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49614,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":49615,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":49616,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَتَّخِذُوٓا۟","transliteration":"tattakhidhū","translation_bn":"তোমরা গ্রহণ করো","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49617,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهَيْنِ","transliteration":"ilāhayni","translation_bn":"ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49618,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱثْنَيْنِ ۖ","transliteration":"ith''nayni","translation_bn":"দুই","root":"ثني","lemma":"ٱثْنَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49620,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"প্রকৃতপক্ষে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":49621,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":49622,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهٌۭ","transliteration":"ilāhun","translation_bn":"ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49623,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٰحِدٌۭ ۖ","transliteration":"wāḥidun","translation_bn":"এক","root":"وحد","lemma":"وَٰحِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":49625,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَإِيَّـٰىَ","transliteration":"fa-iyyāya","translation_bn":"সুতরাং শুধু আমাকেই","root":"—","lemma":"إِيَّا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49626,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَٱرْهَبُونِ","transliteration":"fa-ir''habūni","translation_bn":"তাই আমাকেই তোমরা ভয় করো\"","root":"رهب","lemma":"يَرْهَبُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49627,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٥١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫১)","root":"—","lemma":"٥١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqāla l-lahu lā tattakhidhū ilāhayni ith''nayni innamā huwa ilāhun wāḥidun fa-iyyāya fa-ir''habūni', 'আল্লাহ বললেন, ‘তোমরা দু’ ইলাহ গ্রহণ করো না, তিনি তো এক ইলাহ; কাজেই আমাকে- কেবল আমাকেই ভয় কর।’', 'And Allah has said, "Do not take for yourselves two deities. He is but one God, so fear only Me."', 'আল্লাহ বললেন, ‘তোমরা দু’ ইলাহ গ্রহণ করো না, তিনি তো এক ইলাহ; কাজেই আমাকে- কেবল আমাকেই ভয় কর।’', 'And Allah has said, "Do not take for yourselves two deities. He is but one God, so fear only Me."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016051.mp3', now()),
  (16, 52, '', '[{"id":50261,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهُۥ","transliteration":"walahu","translation_bn":"এবং তাঁরই জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50262,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":50263,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50264,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশসমূহের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50265,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50266,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهُ","transliteration":"walahu","translation_bn":"এবং তাঁরই জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50267,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدِّينُ","transliteration":"l-dīnu","translation_bn":"অানুগত্য","root":"دين","lemma":"دِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50268,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَاصِبًا ۚ","transliteration":"wāṣiban","translation_bn":"সার্বক্ষণিক","root":"وصب","lemma":"وَاصِب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50270,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَفَغَيْرَ","transliteration":"afaghayra","translation_bn":"তবে কি ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":50271,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":50272,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَتَّقُونَ","transliteration":"tattaqūna","translation_bn":"(অপরকে) তোমরা ভয় করবে","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50273,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٥٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫২)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walahu mā fī l-samāwāti wal-arḍi walahu l-dīnu wāṣiban afaghayra l-lahi tattaqūna', 'আকাশসমূহ আর যমীনে যা কিছু আছে তা তাঁরই, আর দ্বীন সদা-সর্বদা একান্তভাবে তাঁরই জন্য। তাহলে তোমরা কি আল্লাহ ছাড়া অন্য কাউকে ভয় করবে?', 'And to Him belongs whatever is in the heavens and the earth, and to Him is [due] worship constantly. Then is it other than Allah that you fear?', 'আকাশসমূহ আর যমীনে যা কিছু আছে তা তাঁরই, আর দ্বীন সদা-সর্বদা একান্তভাবে তাঁরই জন্য। তাহলে তোমরা কি আল্লাহ ছাড়া অন্য কাউকে ভয় করবে?', 'And to Him belongs whatever is in the heavens and the earth, and to Him is [due] worship constantly. Then is it other than Allah that you fear?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016052.mp3', now()),
  (16, 53, '', '[{"id":50905,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"অথচ যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50906,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِكُم","transliteration":"bikum","translation_bn":"সাথে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"بِكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50907,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50908,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"نِّعْمَةٍۢ","transliteration":"niʿ''matin","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ (আছে)","root":"نعم","lemma":"نِعْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50909,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَمِنَ","transliteration":"famina","translation_bn":"তা (এসেছে) হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50910,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":50912,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50913,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":50914,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَسَّكُمُ","transliteration":"massakumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের স্পর্শ করে","root":"مسس","lemma":"مَسَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50915,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلضُّرُّ","transliteration":"l-ḍuru","translation_bn":"দুঃখ-দৈন্য","root":"ضرر","lemma":"ضُرّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50916,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَإِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"fa-ilayhi","translation_bn":"তখন তার কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50917,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"تَجْـَٔرُونَ","transliteration":"tajarūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা নম্র হয়ে ডাকো","root":"جار","lemma":"يَجْـ#َرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50918,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٥٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā bikum min niʿ''matin famina l-lahi thumma idhā massakumu l-ḍuru fa-ilayhi tajarūna', 'যে নি‘মাতই তোমরা পেয়েছ তাতো আল্লাহর নিকট হতেই। আর যখন দুঃখ-কষ্ট তোমাদেরকে স্পর্শ করে, তখন তাঁর কাছেই তোমরা আকুল আবেদন জানাতে থাক।', 'And whatever you have of favor - it is from Allah. Then when adversity touches you, to Him you cry for help.', 'যে নি‘মাতই তোমরা পেয়েছ তাতো আল্লাহর নিকট হতেই। আর যখন দুঃখ-কষ্ট তোমাদেরকে স্পর্শ করে, তখন তাঁর কাছেই তোমরা আকুল আবেদন জানাতে থাক।', 'And whatever you have of favor - it is from Allah. Then when adversity touches you, to Him you cry for help.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016053.mp3', now()),
  (16, 54, '', '[{"id":51524,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51525,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":51526,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَشَفَ","transliteration":"kashafa","translation_bn":"দূর করে দেন","root":"كشف","lemma":"كَشَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51527,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلضُّرَّ","transliteration":"l-ḍura","translation_bn":"দুঃখ-দৈন্য","root":"ضرر","lemma":"ضُرّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51528,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَنكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿankum","translation_bn":"থেকে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51529,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"তখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":51530,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَرِيقٌۭ","transliteration":"farīqun","translation_bn":"একদল","root":"فرق","lemma":"فَرِيق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51531,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِّنكُم","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51532,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِرَبِّهِمْ","transliteration":"birabbihim","translation_bn":"সাথে তাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51533,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يُشْرِكُونَ","transliteration":"yush''rikūna","translation_bn":"(অন্যদেরকে) শরীক করে","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51534,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٥٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma idhā kashafa l-ḍura ʿankum idhā farīqun minkum birabbihim yush''rikūna', 'অতঃপর যখন তিনি তোমাদের থেকে দুঃখ-কষ্ট দূর করে দেন, তখন তোমাদের একদল তাদের প্রতিপালকের সঙ্গে অন্যকে শরীক করে বসে', 'Then when He removes the adversity from you, at once a party of you associates others with their Lord', 'অতঃপর যখন তিনি তোমাদের থেকে দুঃখ-কষ্ট দূর করে দেন, তখন তোমাদের একদল তাদের প্রতিপালকের সঙ্গে অন্যকে শরীক করে বসে', 'Then when He removes the adversity from you, at once a party of you associates others with their Lord', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016054.mp3', now()),
  (16, 55, '', '[{"id":52000,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لِيَكْفُرُوا۟","transliteration":"liyakfurū","translation_bn":"জন্যে অস্বীকার করার","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52001,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِمَآ","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52002,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"ātaynāhum","translation_bn":"আমরা তাদের দিয়েছি","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52004,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَتَمَتَّعُوا۟ ۖ","transliteration":"fatamattaʿū","translation_bn":"তাই তোমরা ভোগ করো","root":"متع","lemma":"تَمَتَّعَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52006,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَسَوْفَ","transliteration":"fasawfa","translation_bn":"অতঃপর শীঘ্রই","root":"—","lemma":"سَوْف\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52007,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা জানবে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52008,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٥٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'liyakfurū bimā ātaynāhum fatamattaʿū fasawfa taʿlamūna', 'আমি তাদেরকে যা দিয়েছি তাদের না-শোকরি করা জন্য। অতএব তোমরা ভোগ করে নাও, শীঘ্রই তোমরা জানতে পারবে।', 'So they will deny what We have given them. Then enjoy yourselves, for you are going to know.', 'আমি তাদেরকে যা দিয়েছি তাদের না-শোকরি করা জন্য। অতএব তোমরা ভোগ করে নাও, শীঘ্রই তোমরা জানতে পারবে।', 'So they will deny what We have given them. Then enjoy yourselves, for you are going to know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016055.mp3', now()),
  (16, 56, '', '[{"id":52536,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَجْعَلُونَ","transliteration":"wayajʿalūna","translation_bn":"এবং তারা নির্ধারণ করে","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52537,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لِمَا","transliteration":"limā","translation_bn":"সে বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52538,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":52539,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তারা জানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52540,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نَصِيبًۭا","transliteration":"naṣīban","translation_bn":"এক অংশ","root":"نصب","lemma":"نَصِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52541,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52542,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رَزَقْنَـٰهُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"razaqnāhum","translation_bn":"আমরা জীবিকা দিয়েছি তাদের","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52544,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"tal-lahi","translation_bn":"শপথ আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52545,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَتُسْـَٔلُنَّ","transliteration":"latus''alunna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তোমাদের জিজ্ঞেস করা হবে","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":52546,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَمَّا","transliteration":"ʿammā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52547,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52548,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"تَفْتَرُونَ","transliteration":"taftarūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা রচনা করতে","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52549,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٥٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayajʿalūna limā lā yaʿlamūna naṣīban mimmā razaqnāhum tal-lahi latus''alunna ʿammā kuntum taftarūna', 'আর আমি তাদেরকে যে রিযক দিয়েছি তার একাংশ তারা ঐ সবের জন্য নির্ধারিত করে যাদের সম্পর্কে তারা কিছুই জানে না। আল্লাহর শপথ! তোমাদের এই মিথ্যে উদ্ভাবন সম্পর্কে তোমাদেরকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই জিজ্ঞেস করা হবে', 'And they assign to what they do not know a portion of that which We have provided them. By Allah, you will surely be questioned about what you used to invent.', 'আর আমি তাদেরকে যে রিযক দিয়েছি তার একাংশ তারা ঐ সবের জন্য নির্ধারিত করে যাদের সম্পর্কে তারা কিছুই জানে না। আল্লাহর শপথ! তোমাদের এই মিথ্যে উদ্ভাবন সম্পর্কে তোমাদেরকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই জিজ্ঞেস করা হবে', 'And they assign to what they do not know a portion of that which We have provided them. By Allah, you will surely be questioned about what you used to invent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016056.mp3', now()),
  (16, 57, '', '[{"id":53046,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَجْعَلُونَ","transliteration":"wayajʿalūna","translation_bn":"এবং তারা নির্ধারণ করে","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53047,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53048,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَنَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-banāti","translation_bn":"কন্যা-সন্তানসমূহ","root":"بني","lemma":"بَنَات","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53049,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"سُبْحَـٰنَهُۥ ۙ","transliteration":"sub''ḥānahu","translation_bn":"তিনি পবিত্র ও মহান","root":"سبح","lemma":"سُبْحَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53051,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهُم","transliteration":"walahum","translation_bn":"এবং জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهُم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53052,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(তাই) যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":53053,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَشْتَهُونَ","transliteration":"yashtahūna","translation_bn":"তারা কামনা করে","root":"شهو","lemma":"ٱشْتَهَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53054,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٥٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayajʿalūna lillahi l-banāti sub''ḥānahu walahum mā yashtahūna', 'আর তারা কন্যা সন্তানগুলোকে আল্লাহর জন্য নির্ধারিত করে, তিনি (তাত্থেকে) পবিত্র মহান, আর তারা নিজেদের জন্য (নির্ধারিত করে) যা তাদের আকাঙ্ক্ষা হয়।', 'And they attribute to Allah daughters - exalted is He - and for them is what they desire.', 'আর তারা কন্যা সন্তানগুলোকে আল্লাহর জন্য নির্ধারিত করে, তিনি (তাত্থেকে) পবিত্র মহান, আর তারা নিজেদের জন্য (নির্ধারিত করে) যা তাদের আকাঙ্ক্ষা হয়।', 'And they attribute to Allah daughters - exalted is He - and for them is what they desire.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016057.mp3', now()),
  (16, 58, '', '[{"id":53609,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"অথচ যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53610,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بُشِّرَ","transliteration":"bushira","translation_bn":"সুখবর দেয়া হয়","root":"بشر","lemma":"بُشِّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53611,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَحَدُهُم","transliteration":"aḥaduhum","translation_bn":"তাদের কাউকে","root":"احد","lemma":"أَحَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53612,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْأُنثَىٰ","transliteration":"bil-unthā","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে কন্যা-সন্তানের","root":"انث","lemma":"أُنثَىٰ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53613,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَّ","transliteration":"ẓalla","translation_bn":"হয়ে যায়","root":"ظلل","lemma":"ظَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53614,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَجْهُهُۥ","transliteration":"wajhuhu","translation_bn":"তার মুখ","root":"وجه","lemma":"وَجْه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53615,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُسْوَدًّۭا","transliteration":"mus''waddan","translation_bn":"কালো","root":"سود","lemma":"مُسْوَدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53616,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং সে (হয়)","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53617,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَظِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"kaẓīmun","translation_bn":"উত্তেজনা প্রশমনকারী","root":"كظم","lemma":"كَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53618,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٥٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā bushira aḥaduhum bil-unthā ẓalla wajhuhu mus''waddan wahuwa kaẓīmun', 'তাদের কাউকে যখন কন্যা সন্তানের সুসংবাদ দেয়া হয়, তখন তার মুখ কালো হয়ে যায় আর সে অন্তর্জ্বালায় পুড়তে থাকে।', 'And when one of them is informed of [the birth of] a female, his face becomes dark, and he suppresses grief.', 'তাদের কাউকে যখন কন্যা সন্তানের সুসংবাদ দেয়া হয়, তখন তার মুখ কালো হয়ে যায় আর সে অন্তর্জ্বালায় পুড়তে থাকে।', 'And when one of them is informed of [the birth of] a female, his face becomes dark, and he suppresses grief.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016058.mp3', now()),
  (16, 59, '', '[{"id":54072,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَتَوَٰرَىٰ","transliteration":"yatawārā","translation_bn":"আত্ন গোপন করে","root":"وري","lemma":"تَوَارَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54073,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54074,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمِ","transliteration":"l-qawmi","translation_bn":"লোকদের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54075,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কারণে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54076,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"سُوٓءِ","transliteration":"sūi","translation_bn":"লজ্জার","root":"سوا","lemma":"سُو^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54077,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":54078,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بُشِّرَ","transliteration":"bushira","translation_bn":"সুসংবাদ দেয়া হয়","root":"بشر","lemma":"بُشِّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54079,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦٓ ۚ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে সে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦٓ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54081,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَيُمْسِكُهُۥ","transliteration":"ayum''sikuhu","translation_bn":"কি তাকে রেখে দিবে","root":"مسك","lemma":"أَمْسَكَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":54082,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"সত্ত্বেও উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54083,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"هُونٍ","transliteration":"hūnin","translation_bn":"হীনতা (লাঞ্ছনা সহ্য করে)","root":"هون","lemma":"هُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54084,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَمْ","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54085,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَدُسُّهُۥ","transliteration":"yadussuhu","translation_bn":"তাকে পুঁতে ফেলবে","root":"دسس","lemma":"يَدُسُّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54086,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54087,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلتُّرَابِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-turābi","translation_bn":"মাটির","root":"ترب","lemma":"تُرَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54089,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَلَا","transliteration":"alā","translation_bn":"সাবধান (লক্ষ্য করো)","root":"—","lemma":"أَلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":54090,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"سَآءَ","transliteration":"sāa","translation_bn":"কত নিকৃষ্ট","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54091,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":54092,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يَحْكُمُونَ","transliteration":"yaḥkumūna","translation_bn":"তারা সিদ্ধান্ত নেয়","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54093,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٥٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yatawārā mina l-qawmi min sūi mā bushira bihi ayum''sikuhu ʿalā hūnin am yadussuhu fī l-turābi alā sāa mā yaḥkumūna', 'লজ্জায় সে মানুষ থেকে মুখ লুকায় খারাপ সংবাদ পাওয়ার কারণে। সে চিন্তা করে যে অপমান মাথায় করে তাকে রেখে দেবে, না তাকে মাটিতে পুঁতে ফেলবে। হায়, তারা যা সিদ্ধান্ত করে তা কতই না জঘন্য!', 'He hides himself from the people because of the ill of which he has been informed. Should he keep it in humiliation or bury it in the ground? Unquestionably, evil is what they decide.', 'লজ্জায় সে মানুষ থেকে মুখ লুকায় খারাপ সংবাদ পাওয়ার কারণে। সে চিন্তা করে যে অপমান মাথায় করে তাকে রেখে দেবে, না তাকে মাটিতে পুঁতে ফেলবে। হায়, তারা যা সিদ্ধান্ত করে তা কতই না জঘন্য!', 'He hides himself from the people because of the ill of which he has been informed. Should he keep it in humiliation or bury it in the ground? Unquestionably, evil is what they decide.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016059.mp3', now()),
  (16, 60, '', '[{"id":54770,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"জন্যে যারা তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54771,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":54772,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"বিশ্বাস করে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54773,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","transliteration":"bil-ākhirati","translation_bn":"আখেরাতের উপর","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54774,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَثَلُ","transliteration":"mathalu","translation_bn":"দৃষ্টান্ত","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54775,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّوْءِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-sawi","translation_bn":"বড় নিকৃষ্ট","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَوْء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54777,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلِلَّهِ","transliteration":"walillahi","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহর জন্যে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54778,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَثَلُ","transliteration":"l-mathalu","translation_bn":"দৃষ্টান্ত (গুণাবলী)","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54779,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَعْلَىٰ ۚ","transliteration":"l-aʿlā","translation_bn":"সর্বোচ্চ","root":"علو","lemma":"أَعْلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54781,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54782,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَزِيزُ","transliteration":"l-ʿazīzu","translation_bn":"পরাক্রমশালী","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54783,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَكِيمُ","transliteration":"l-ḥakīmu","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞাময়","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54784,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٦٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬০)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lilladhīna lā yu''minūna bil-ākhirati mathalu l-sawi walillahi l-mathalu l-aʿlā wahuwa l-ʿazīzu l-ḥakīmu', 'যারা আখেরাতে বিশ্বাস করে না, খারাপ উপমা তাদের জন্য। মহোত্তম উপমা সব আল্লাহর জন্য, তিনি হলেন প্রতাপান্বিত, প্রজ্ঞাময়।', 'For those who do not believe in the Hereafter is the description of evil; and for Allah is the highest attribute. And He is Exalted in Might, the Wise.', 'যারা আখেরাতে বিশ্বাস করে না, খারাপ উপমা তাদের জন্য। মহোত্তম উপমা সব আল্লাহর জন্য, তিনি হলেন প্রতাপান্বিত, প্রজ্ঞাময়।', 'For those who do not believe in the Hereafter is the description of evil; and for Allah is the highest attribute. And He is Exalted in Might, the Wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016060.mp3', now()),
  (16, 61, '', '[{"id":55372,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55373,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُؤَاخِذُ","transliteration":"yuākhidhu","translation_bn":"ধরতেন","root":"اخذ","lemma":"يُؤَاخِذُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55374,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":55375,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسَ","transliteration":"l-nāsa","translation_bn":"মানুষদেরকে","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55376,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِظُلْمِهِم","transliteration":"biẓul''mihim","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের বাড়াবাড়ির","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظُلْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55377,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":55378,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَرَكَ","transliteration":"taraka","translation_bn":"ছাড়তেন","root":"ترك","lemma":"تَرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55379,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهَا","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55380,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55381,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"دَآبَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"dābbatin","translation_bn":"প্রানীকেও","root":"دبب","lemma":"دَا^بَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55382,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِن","transliteration":"walākin","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55383,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يُؤَخِّرُهُمْ","transliteration":"yu-akhiruhum","translation_bn":"তাদের অবকাশ দেন","root":"اخر","lemma":"أَخَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55384,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"পর্যন্ত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55385,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَجَلٍۢ","transliteration":"ajalin","translation_bn":"কাল","root":"اجل","lemma":"أَجَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55386,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مُّسَمًّۭى ۖ","transliteration":"musamman","translation_bn":"নির্দিষ্ট","root":"سمو","lemma":"مُّسَمًّى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55388,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَإِذَا","transliteration":"fa-idhā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55389,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"আসবে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55390,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَجَلُهُمْ","transliteration":"ajaluhum","translation_bn":"তাদের সময়","root":"اجل","lemma":"أَجَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55391,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":55392,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَـْٔخِرُونَ","transliteration":"yastakhirūna","translation_bn":"তারা দেরি করতে পারবে","root":"اخر","lemma":"يَسْتَأْخِرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55393,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"سَاعَةًۭ ۖ","transliteration":"sāʿatan","translation_bn":"এক মুহূর্ত","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55395,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55396,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَقْدِمُونَ","transliteration":"yastaqdimūna","translation_bn":"তারা তাড়াহুড়ো করতে পারবে","root":"قدم","lemma":"يَسْتَقْدِمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55397,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"٦١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬১)","root":"—","lemma":"٦١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaw yuākhidhu l-lahu l-nāsa biẓul''mihim mā taraka ʿalayhā min dābbatin walākin yu-akhiruhum ilā ajalin musamman fa-idhā jāa ajaluhum lā yastakhirūna sāʿatan walā yastaqdimūna', 'আল্লাহ যদি মানুষকে তাদের সীমালঙ্ঘনের জন্য পাকড়াও করতেন, তাহলে যমীনের উপর কোন প্রাণীকেই তিনি রেহাই দিতেন না। কিন্তু তিনি একটা নির্দিষ্ট কাল পর্যন্ত তাদেরকে সময় দেন। তাদের সময় এসে গেলে এক মুহূর্তও অগ্র-পশ্চাৎ করা হয় না।', 'And if Allah were to impose blame on the people for their wrongdoing, He would not have left upon the earth any creature, but He defers them for a specified term. And when their term has come, they will not remain behind an hour, nor will they precede [it].', 'আল্লাহ যদি মানুষকে তাদের সীমালঙ্ঘনের জন্য পাকড়াও করতেন, তাহলে যমীনের উপর কোন প্রাণীকেই তিনি রেহাই দিতেন না। কিন্তু তিনি একটা নির্দিষ্ট কাল পর্যন্ত তাদেরকে সময় দেন। তাদের সময় এসে গেলে এক মুহূর্তও অগ্র-পশ্চাৎ করা হয় না।', 'And if Allah were to impose blame on the people for their wrongdoing, He would not have left upon the earth any creature, but He defers them for a specified term. And when their term has come, they will not remain behind an hour, nor will they precede [it].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016061.mp3', now()),
  (16, 62, '', '[{"id":55902,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَجْعَلُونَ","transliteration":"wayajʿalūna","translation_bn":"এবং তারা সাব্যস্ত করে","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55903,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55904,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":55905,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَكْرَهُونَ","transliteration":"yakrahūna","translation_bn":"তারা অপছন্দ করে","root":"كره","lemma":"كَرِهَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55906,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَتَصِفُ","transliteration":"wataṣifu","translation_bn":"এবং বর্ণনা করে","root":"وصف","lemma":"يَصِفُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55907,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَلْسِنَتُهُمُ","transliteration":"alsinatuhumu","translation_bn":"তাদের জিহবাগুলো","root":"لسن","lemma":"لِسَان","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55908,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَذِبَ","transliteration":"l-kadhiba","translation_bn":"মিথ্যা","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذِب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55909,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":55910,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদেরই","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55911,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ ۖ","transliteration":"l-ḥus''nā","translation_bn":"কল্যাণ","root":"حسن","lemma":"حُسْنَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55913,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":55914,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"جَرَمَ","transliteration":"jarama","translation_bn":"সন্দেহ","root":"جرم","lemma":"جَرَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55915,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":55916,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55917,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارَ","transliteration":"l-nāra","translation_bn":"আগুন","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55918,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّهُم","transliteration":"wa-annahum","translation_bn":"এবং (এও) যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55919,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مُّفْرَطُونَ","transliteration":"muf''raṭūna","translation_bn":"সবার আগে তারা নিক্ষিপ্ত হবে","root":"فرط","lemma":"مُّفْرَطُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55920,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٦٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬২)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayajʿalūna lillahi mā yakrahūna wataṣifu alsinatuhumu l-kadhiba anna lahumu l-ḥus''nā lā jarama anna lahumu l-nāra wa-annahum muf''raṭūna', 'তারা আল্লাহর জন্য তা-ই নির্ধারণ করে যা (নিজেদের জন্য) অপছন্দ করে, আর তাদের জিহবা মিথ্যা বলে যে, কল্যাণ তাদেরই জন্য। কোন সন্দেহ নেই যে, তাদের জন্য আছে আগুন আর সর্বপ্রথম তাদেরকেই সেখানে জলদি পৌঁছে দেয়া হবে।', 'And they attribute to Allah that which they dislike, and their tongues assert the lie that they will have the best [from Him]. Assuredly, they will have the Fire, and they will be [therein] neglected.', 'তারা আল্লাহর জন্য তা-ই নির্ধারণ করে যা (নিজেদের জন্য) অপছন্দ করে, আর তাদের জিহবা মিথ্যা বলে যে, কল্যাণ তাদেরই জন্য। কোন সন্দেহ নেই যে, তাদের জন্য আছে আগুন আর সর্বপ্রথম তাদেরকেই সেখানে জলদি পৌঁছে দেয়া হবে।', 'And they attribute to Allah that which they dislike, and their tongues assert the lie that they will have the best [from Him]. Assuredly, they will have the Fire, and they will be [therein] neglected.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016062.mp3', now()),
  (16, 63, '', '[{"id":56187,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"تَٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"tal-lahi","translation_bn":"শপথ আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56188,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَقَدْ","transliteration":"laqad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":56189,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَآ","transliteration":"arsalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা পাঠিয়েছি","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56190,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56191,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أُمَمٍۢ","transliteration":"umamin","translation_bn":"জাতিসমূহের","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56192,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56193,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِكَ","transliteration":"qablika","translation_bn":"তোমার পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56194,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَزَيَّنَ","transliteration":"fazayyana","translation_bn":"অতঃপর শোভন করেছিলো","root":"زين","lemma":"زَيَّنَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56195,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56196,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","translation_bn":"শয়তান","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56197,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَـٰلَهُمْ","transliteration":"aʿmālahum","translation_bn":"তাদের কাজগুলোকে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56198,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَهُوَ","transliteration":"fahuwa","translation_bn":"অতঃপর সেই","root":"—","lemma":"فَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56199,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَلِيُّهُمُ","transliteration":"waliyyuhumu","translation_bn":"তাদের অভিভাবক","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56200,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْيَوْمَ","transliteration":"l-yawma","translation_bn":"আজ","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56201,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهُمْ","transliteration":"walahum","translation_bn":"এবং জন্যে তাদের (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56202,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56203,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"alīmun","translation_bn":"নিদারুণ","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":56204,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٦٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'tal-lahi laqad arsalnā ilā umamin min qablika fazayyana lahumu l-shayṭānu aʿmālahum fahuwa waliyyuhumu l-yawma walahum ʿadhābun alīmun', 'আল্লাহর কসম! তোমার পূর্বে আমি বহু জাতির কাছে রসূল পাঠিয়েছিলাম, কিন্তু শয়ত্বান তাদের কাছে তাদের কার্যকলাপকে শোভনীয় করে দিয়েছিল, আর আজ সে-ই তাদের অভিভাবক, তাদের জন্য রয়েছে ভয়াবহ শাস্তি।', 'By Allah, We did certainly send [messengers] to nations before you, but Satan made their deeds attractive to them. And he is the disbelievers'' ally today [as well], and they will have a painful punishment.', 'আল্লাহর কসম! তোমার পূর্বে আমি বহু জাতির কাছে রসূল পাঠিয়েছিলাম, কিন্তু শয়ত্বান তাদের কাছে তাদের কার্যকলাপকে শোভনীয় করে দিয়েছিল, আর আজ সে-ই তাদের অভিভাবক, তাদের জন্য রয়েছে ভয়াবহ শাস্তি।', 'By Allah, We did certainly send [messengers] to nations before you, but Satan made their deeds attractive to them. And he is the disbelievers'' ally today [as well], and they will have a painful punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016063.mp3', now()),
  (16, 64, '', '[{"id":56945,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56946,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلْنَا","transliteration":"anzalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা অবতীর্ণ করেছি","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56947,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ʿalayka","translation_bn":"তোমার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56948,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","transliteration":"l-kitāba","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56949,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":56950,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِتُبَيِّنَ","transliteration":"litubayyina","translation_bn":"যেন তুমি প্রকাশ করো","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيَّنُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56951,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56952,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"সে বিষয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":56953,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱخْتَلَفُوا۟","transliteration":"ikh''talafū","translation_bn":"তারা মত-বিরোধ করেছে","root":"خلف","lemma":"ٱخْتَلَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56954,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ ۙ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"মধ্যে যার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56956,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَهُدًۭى","transliteration":"wahudan","translation_bn":"এবং পথনির্দেশ","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56957,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَرَحْمَةًۭ","transliteration":"waraḥmatan","translation_bn":"ও দয়াস্বরূপ","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56958,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"liqawmin","translation_bn":"জন্যে লোকদের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56959,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"(যারা) বিশ্বাস করে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56960,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٦٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā anzalnā ʿalayka l-kitāba illā litubayyina lahumu alladhī ikh''talafū fīhi wahudan waraḥmatan liqawmin yu''minūna', 'আমি তোমার প্রতি কিতাব এজন্য নাযিল করেছি যাতে তুমি সে সকল বিষয় স্পষ্ট করে দিতে পার যে বিষয়ে তারা মতভেদ করেছিল, আর (এ কিতাব) বিশ্বাসী সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য পথপ্রদর্শক ও রহমাত স্বরূপ।', 'And We have not revealed to you the Book, [O Muhammad], except for you to make clear to them that wherein they have differed and as guidance and mercy for a people who believe.', 'আমি তোমার প্রতি কিতাব এজন্য নাযিল করেছি যাতে তুমি সে সকল বিষয় স্পষ্ট করে দিতে পার যে বিষয়ে তারা মতভেদ করেছিল, আর (এ কিতাব) বিশ্বাসী সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য পথপ্রদর্শক ও রহমাত স্বরূপ।', 'And We have not revealed to you the Book, [O Muhammad], except for you to make clear to them that wherein they have differed and as guidance and mercy for a people who believe.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016064.mp3', now()),
  (16, 65, '', '[{"id":57447,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57448,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلَ","transliteration":"anzala","translation_bn":"বর্ষণ করেন","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57449,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57450,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","transliteration":"l-samāi","translation_bn":"আকাশ","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57451,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَآءًۭ","transliteration":"māan","translation_bn":"পানি","root":"موه","lemma":"مَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57452,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَأَحْيَا","transliteration":"fa-aḥyā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর প্রাণ দেন","root":"حيي","lemma":"أَحْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57453,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِهِ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"দিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57454,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","transliteration":"l-arḍa","translation_bn":"জমিকে","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57455,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدَ","transliteration":"baʿda","translation_bn":"পর","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":57456,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَوْتِهَآ ۚ","transliteration":"mawtihā","translation_bn":"তার মৃত্যুর","root":"موت","lemma":"مَوْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57458,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":57459,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57460,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":57461,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَـَٔايَةًۭ","transliteration":"laāyatan","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই নিদর্শন","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":57462,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"liqawmin","translation_bn":"জন্যে লোকদের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57463,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَسْمَعُونَ","transliteration":"yasmaʿūna","translation_bn":"(যারা) শুনে","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57464,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٦٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wal-lahu anzala mina l-samāi māan fa-aḥyā bihi l-arḍa baʿda mawtihā inna fī dhālika laāyatan liqawmin yasmaʿūna', 'আল্লাহ আকাশ থেকে পানি বর্ষণ করেন, অতঃপর তার দ্বারা যমীনকে তার মৃত্যুর পর পুনরায় জীবিত করেন। এতে ঐ সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য বহু নিদর্শন আছে যারা লক্ষ্য করে শুনে।', 'And Allah has sent down rain from the sky and given life thereby to the earth after its lifelessness. Indeed in that is a sign for a people who listen.', 'আল্লাহ আকাশ থেকে পানি বর্ষণ করেন, অতঃপর তার দ্বারা যমীনকে তার মৃত্যুর পর পুনরায় জীবিত করেন। এতে ঐ সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য বহু নিদর্শন আছে যারা লক্ষ্য করে শুনে।', 'And Allah has sent down rain from the sky and given life thereby to the earth after its lifelessness. Indeed in that is a sign for a people who listen.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016065.mp3', now()),
  (16, 66, '', '[{"id":57913,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ","transliteration":"wa-inna","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57914,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57915,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে রয়েছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57916,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ","transliteration":"l-anʿāmi","translation_bn":"গবাদিপশুর","root":"نعم","lemma":"نَّعَم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57917,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَعِبْرَةًۭ ۖ","transliteration":"laʿib''ratan","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই শিক্ষা","root":"عبر","lemma":"عِبْرَة","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":57919,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نُّسْقِيكُم","transliteration":"nus''qīkum","translation_bn":"আমরা পান করাই তোমাদের","root":"سقي","lemma":"أَسْقَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57920,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57921,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57922,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بُطُونِهِۦ","transliteration":"buṭūnihi","translation_bn":"তার পেটগুলোর","root":"بطن","lemma":"بَطْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57923,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57924,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنِ","transliteration":"bayni","translation_bn":"মধ্য","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57925,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَرْثٍۢ","transliteration":"farthin","translation_bn":"গোবর","root":"فرث","lemma":"فَرْث","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57926,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَدَمٍۢ","transliteration":"wadamin","translation_bn":"ও রক্তের","root":"دمو","lemma":"دَم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57927,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَّبَنًا","transliteration":"labanan","translation_bn":"(তা হলো) দুধ","root":"لبن","lemma":"لَّبَن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57928,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"خَالِصًۭا","transliteration":"khāliṣan","translation_bn":"বিশুদ্ধ","root":"خلص","lemma":"خَالِص","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57929,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"سَآئِغًۭا","transliteration":"sāighan","translation_bn":"উপাদেয়","root":"سوغ","lemma":"سَا^ئِغ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57930,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لِّلشَّـٰرِبِينَ","transliteration":"lilshāribīna","translation_bn":"জন্যে পানকারীদের","root":"شرب","lemma":"شَّٰرِبِين","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57931,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٦٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-inna lakum fī l-anʿāmi laʿib''ratan nus''qīkum mimmā fī buṭūnihi min bayni farthin wadamin labanan khāliṣan sāighan lilshāribīna', 'তোমাদের জন্য গবাদি পশুতেও অবশ্যই শিক্ষা নিহিত আছে। তোমাদেরকে পান করাই ওদের পেটের গোবর আর রক্তের মাঝ থেকে বিশুদ্ধ দুগ্ধ যা পানকারীদের জন্য খুবই উপাদেয়।', 'And indeed, for you in grazing livestock is a lesson. We give you drink from what is in their bellies - between excretion and blood - pure milk, palatable to drinkers.', 'তোমাদের জন্য গবাদি পশুতেও অবশ্যই শিক্ষা নিহিত আছে। তোমাদেরকে পান করাই ওদের পেটের গোবর আর রক্তের মাঝ থেকে বিশুদ্ধ দুগ্ধ যা পানকারীদের জন্য খুবই উপাদেয়।', 'And indeed, for you in grazing livestock is a lesson. We give you drink from what is in their bellies - between excretion and blood - pure milk, palatable to drinkers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016066.mp3', now()),
  (16, 67, '', '[{"id":58381,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمِن","transliteration":"wamin","translation_bn":"এবং থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58382,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ثَمَرَٰتِ","transliteration":"thamarāti","translation_bn":"ফলগুলো","root":"ثمر","lemma":"ثَمَرَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58383,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّخِيلِ","transliteration":"l-nakhīli","translation_bn":"খেজুর গাছের","root":"نخل","lemma":"نَّخِيل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58384,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَعْنَـٰبِ","transliteration":"wal-aʿnābi","translation_bn":"ও আঙ্গুরগুলো","root":"عنب","lemma":"عِنَب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58385,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَتَّخِذُونَ","transliteration":"tattakhidhūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা গ্রহণ করো","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58386,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"তা থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58387,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"سَكَرًۭا","transliteration":"sakaran","translation_bn":"মাদকদ্রব্য","root":"سكر","lemma":"سَكَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58388,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَرِزْقًا","transliteration":"wariz''qan","translation_bn":"ও জীবিকা","root":"رزق","lemma":"رِزْق","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58389,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"حَسَنًا ۗ","transliteration":"ḥasanan","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"حسن","lemma":"حَسَن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":58391,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":58392,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58393,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":58394,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَـَٔايَةًۭ","transliteration":"laāyatan","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই নিদর্শন","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":58395,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"liqawmin","translation_bn":"জন্যে লোকদের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58396,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَعْقِلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿqilūna","translation_bn":"(যারা) জ্ঞান রাখে","root":"عقل","lemma":"عَقَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58397,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٦٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamin thamarāti l-nakhīli wal-aʿnābi tattakhidhūna min''hu sakaran wariz''qan ḥasanan inna fī dhālika laāyatan liqawmin yaʿqilūna', 'আর খেজুর ও আঙ্গুর ফল থেকে তোমরা মদ ও উত্তম খাদ্য প্রস্তুত কর, জ্ঞানী সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য এতে অবশ্যই বহু নিদর্শন রয়েছে।', 'And from the fruits of the palm trees and grapevines you take intoxicant and good provision. Indeed in that is a sign for a people who reason.', 'আর খেজুর ও আঙ্গুর ফল থেকে তোমরা মদ ও উত্তম খাদ্য প্রস্তুত কর, জ্ঞানী সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য এতে অবশ্যই বহু নিদর্শন রয়েছে।', 'And from the fruits of the palm trees and grapevines you take intoxicant and good provision. Indeed in that is a sign for a people who reason.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016067.mp3', now()),
  (16, 68, '', '[{"id":58858,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَوْحَىٰ","transliteration":"wa-awḥā","translation_bn":"এবং ওহী করেন","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58859,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكَ","transliteration":"rabbuka","translation_bn":"তার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58860,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58861,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّحْلِ","transliteration":"l-naḥli","translation_bn":"মৌমাছির","root":"نحل","lemma":"نَّحْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58862,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنِ","transliteration":"ani","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যবাচক (Intention)"},{"id":58863,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّخِذِى","transliteration":"ittakhidhī","translation_bn":"\"গ্রহণ করো (বানাও)","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58864,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58865,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجِبَالِ","transliteration":"l-jibāli","translation_bn":"পাহাড়গুলোর","root":"جبل","lemma":"جَبَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58866,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بُيُوتًۭا","transliteration":"buyūtan","translation_bn":"ঘরসমূহ (অর্থাৎ চাক)","root":"بيت","lemma":"بَيْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58867,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنَ","transliteration":"wamina","translation_bn":"ও মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58868,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّجَرِ","transliteration":"l-shajari","translation_bn":"গাছের","root":"شجر","lemma":"شَجَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58869,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَمِمَّا","transliteration":"wamimmā","translation_bn":"এবং ঐ বস্তুর মধ্যে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58870,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَعْرِشُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿrishūna","translation_bn":"তারা উঁচু করে (দালান বা মাচা)","root":"عرش","lemma":"يَعْرِشُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58871,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٦٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-awḥā rabbuka ilā l-naḥli ani ittakhidhī mina l-jibāli buyūtan wamina l-shajari wamimmā yaʿrishūna', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক মৌমাছির প্রতি এলহাম করেছেন যে, পাহাড়ে, বৃক্ষে আর উঁচু চালে বাসা তৈরি কর।', 'And your Lord inspired to the bee, "Take for yourself among the mountains, houses, and among the trees and [in] that which they construct.', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক মৌমাছির প্রতি এলহাম করেছেন যে, পাহাড়ে, বৃক্ষে আর উঁচু চালে বাসা তৈরি কর।', 'And your Lord inspired to the bee, "Take for yourself among the mountains, houses, and among the trees and [in] that which they construct.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016068.mp3', now()),
  (16, 69, '', '[{"id":59192,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59193,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كُلِى","transliteration":"kulī","translation_bn":"খাও","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59194,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59195,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59196,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-thamarāti","translation_bn":"ফলসমূহ","root":"ثمر","lemma":"ثَمَرَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59197,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَٱسْلُكِى","transliteration":"fa-us''lukī","translation_bn":"অতঃপর চলো","root":"سلك","lemma":"سَلَكَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59198,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"سُبُلَ","transliteration":"subula","translation_bn":"পথসমূহে","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59199,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكِ","transliteration":"rabbiki","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59200,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ذُلُلًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"dhululan","translation_bn":"সহজ\"","root":"ذلل","lemma":"ذُلُل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59202,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَخْرُجُ","transliteration":"yakhruju","translation_bn":"বের হয়","root":"خرج","lemma":"خَرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59203,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59204,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بُطُونِهَا","transliteration":"buṭūnihā","translation_bn":"তাদের পেটসমূহ","root":"بطن","lemma":"بَطْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59205,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"شَرَابٌۭ","transliteration":"sharābun","translation_bn":"পানীয়","root":"شرب","lemma":"شَرَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59206,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مُّخْتَلِفٌ","transliteration":"mukh''talifun","translation_bn":"নানা রকম","root":"خلف","lemma":"مُّخْتَلِف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59207,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَلْوَٰنُهُۥ","transliteration":"alwānuhu","translation_bn":"তার রংসমূহ","root":"لون","lemma":"لَوْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59208,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59209,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"شِفَآءٌۭ","transliteration":"shifāon","translation_bn":"আরোগ্য (আছে)","root":"شفي","lemma":"شِفَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59210,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"لِّلنَّاسِ ۗ","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষের জন্যে","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59212,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":59213,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59214,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এর (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":59215,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"لَـَٔايَةًۭ","transliteration":"laāyatan","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই নিদর্শন","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":59216,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"liqawmin","translation_bn":"জন্যে লোকদের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59217,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"يَتَفَكَّرُونَ","transliteration":"yatafakkarūna","translation_bn":"(যারা) চিন্তা ভাবনা করে","root":"فكر","lemma":"يَتَفَكَّرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59218,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"٦٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma kulī min kulli l-thamarāti fa-us''lukī subula rabbiki dhululan yakhruju min buṭūnihā sharābun mukh''talifun alwānuhu fīhi shifāon lilnnāsi inna fī dhālika laāyatan liqawmin yatafakkarūna', 'অতঃপর প্রত্যেক ফল থেকে আহার কর, অতঃপর তোমার প্রতিপালকের (শিখানো) সহজ পদ্ধতি অনুসরণ কর। এর পেট থেকে রং-বেরং এর পানীয় বের হয়। এতে মানুষের জন্য আছে আরোগ্য। চিন্তাশীল মানুষের জন্য এতে অবশ্যই নিদর্শন আছে।', 'Then eat from all the fruits and follow the ways of your Lord laid down [for you]." There emerges from their bellies a drink, varying in colors, in which there is healing for people. Indeed in that is a sign for a people who give thought.', 'অতঃপর প্রত্যেক ফল থেকে আহার কর, অতঃপর তোমার প্রতিপালকের (শিখানো) সহজ পদ্ধতি অনুসরণ কর। এর পেট থেকে রং-বেরং এর পানীয় বের হয়। এতে মানুষের জন্য আছে আরোগ্য। চিন্তাশীল মানুষের জন্য এতে অবশ্যই নিদর্শন আছে।', 'Then eat from all the fruits and follow the ways of your Lord laid down [for you]." There emerges from their bellies a drink, varying in colors, in which there is healing for people. Indeed in that is a sign for a people who give thought.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016069.mp3', now()),
  (16, 70, '', '[{"id":59518,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59519,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقَكُمْ","transliteration":"khalaqakum","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন তোমাদের","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59520,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59521,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَتَوَفَّىٰكُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"yatawaffākum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে মৃত্যু দিবেন","root":"وفي","lemma":"تَوَفَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59523,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنكُم","transliteration":"waminkum","translation_bn":"এবং তোমাদের মধ্যে থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59524,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَّن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কাউকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":59525,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يُرَدُّ","transliteration":"yuraddu","translation_bn":"ফিরিয়ে নেয়া হয়","root":"ردد","lemma":"رَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59526,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59527,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَرْذَلِ","transliteration":"ardhali","translation_bn":"নিকৃষ্টতার","root":"رذل","lemma":"أَرْذَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59528,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعُمُرِ","transliteration":"l-ʿumuri","translation_bn":"বয়সের","root":"عمر","lemma":"عُمُر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59529,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لِكَىْ","transliteration":"likay","translation_bn":"যেন","root":"—","lemma":"كَى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59530,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":59531,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمَ","transliteration":"yaʿlama","translation_bn":"জানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59532,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدَ","transliteration":"baʿda","translation_bn":"পরেও","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":59533,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿil''min","translation_bn":"সবকিছু জানার","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59534,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًٔا ۚ","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কিছুই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59536,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":59537,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":59538,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"মহাজ্ঞানী","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":59539,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"قَدِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"qadīrun","translation_bn":"সর্বশক্তিমান","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59540,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"٧٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭০)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wal-lahu khalaqakum thumma yatawaffākum waminkum man yuraddu ilā ardhali l-ʿumuri likay lā yaʿlama baʿda ʿil''min shayan inna l-laha ʿalīmun qadīrun', 'আল্লাহ্ই তোমাদেরকে পয়দা করেছেন, অতঃপর তিনি তোমাদের মৃত্যু ঘটাবেন। তোমাদের কাউকে অকর্মণ্য বয়সে ফিরিয়ে দেয়া হয়, যাতে জ্ঞান লাভ করার পরেও আর কোন কিছুর জ্ঞান থাকে না। আল্লাহ সর্বশ্রেষ্ঠ জ্ঞানী, সর্বাপেক্ষা শক্তিমান।', 'And Allah created you; then He will take you in death. And among you is he who is reversed to the most decrepit [old] age so that he will not know, after [having had] knowledge, a thing. Indeed, Allah is Knowing and Competent.', 'আল্লাহ্ই তোমাদেরকে পয়দা করেছেন, অতঃপর তিনি তোমাদের মৃত্যু ঘটাবেন। তোমাদের কাউকে অকর্মণ্য বয়সে ফিরিয়ে দেয়া হয়, যাতে জ্ঞান লাভ করার পরেও আর কোন কিছুর জ্ঞান থাকে না। আল্লাহ সর্বশ্রেষ্ঠ জ্ঞানী, সর্বাপেক্ষা শক্তিমান।', 'And Allah created you; then He will take you in death. And among you is he who is reversed to the most decrepit [old] age so that he will not know, after [having had] knowledge, a thing. Indeed, Allah is Knowing and Competent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016070.mp3', now()),
  (16, 71, '', '[{"id":60033,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60034,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فَضَّلَ","transliteration":"faḍḍala","translation_bn":"শ্রেষ্ঠত্ব দিয়েছেন","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60035,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضَكُمْ","transliteration":"baʿḍakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাউকে","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60036,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপরে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60037,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضٍۢ","transliteration":"baʿḍin","translation_bn":"কারও","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60038,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"বেলায়","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60039,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرِّزْقِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-riz''qi","translation_bn":"জীবনের উপকরণের","root":"رزق","lemma":"رِزْق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60041,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَمَا","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60042,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":60043,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فُضِّلُوا۟","transliteration":"fuḍḍilū","translation_bn":"শ্রেষ্ঠত্ব দেয়া হয়েছে","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60044,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِرَآدِّى","transliteration":"birāddī","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাবর্তনকারী","root":"ردد","lemma":"رَا^دِّى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60045,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"رِزْقِهِمْ","transliteration":"riz''qihim","translation_bn":"জীবিকা তাদের","root":"رزق","lemma":"رِزْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60046,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60047,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(গোলামদের) যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":60048,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مَلَكَتْ","transliteration":"malakat","translation_bn":"মালিক (হয়েছে)","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَكَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60049,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَيْمَـٰنُهُمْ","transliteration":"aymānuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের ডানহাতসমূহ","root":"يمن","lemma":"يَمِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60050,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فَهُمْ","transliteration":"fahum","translation_bn":"যেন তারা","root":"—","lemma":"فَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60051,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"সে বিষয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60052,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"سَوَآءٌ ۚ","transliteration":"sawāon","translation_bn":"(হ''তে পারে) সমান","root":"سوي","lemma":"سَوَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60054,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَفَبِنِعْمَةِ","transliteration":"afabiniʿ''mati","translation_bn":"তবে কি অনুগ্রহকে","root":"نعم","lemma":"نِعْمَة","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":60055,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":60056,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"يَجْحَدُونَ","transliteration":"yajḥadūna","translation_bn":"তারা অস্বীকার করে","root":"جحد","lemma":"جَحَدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60057,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٧١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭১)","root":"—","lemma":"٧١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wal-lahu faḍḍala baʿḍakum ʿalā baʿḍin fī l-riz''qi famā alladhīna fuḍḍilū birāddī riz''qihim ʿalā mā malakat aymānuhum fahum fīhi sawāon afabiniʿ''mati l-lahi yajḥadūna', 'রিযকের ব্যাপারে আল্লাহ তোমাদের মধ্যে কাউকে কারো উপর প্রাধান্য দিয়েছেন। যাদেরকে প্রাধান্য দেয়া হয়েছে তারা তাদের রিযক থেকে তাদের অধীনস্থ চাকর- গোলামদেরকে এমনভাবে ফিরিয়ে দেয় না, যাতে এক্ষেত্রে তারা সমান হয়ে যায়। (অথচ তারা নানান কিছুকে আল্লাহর অংশীদার বানিয়ে ওগুলোকে আল্লাহর সমান করে ফেলছে) তাহলে কি তারা আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহ অস্বীকার করে?', 'And Allah has favored some of you over others in provision. But those who were favored would not hand over their provision to those whom their right hands possess so they would be equal to them therein. Then is it the favor of Allah they reject?', 'রিযকের ব্যাপারে আল্লাহ তোমাদের মধ্যে কাউকে কারো উপর প্রাধান্য দিয়েছেন। যাদেরকে প্রাধান্য দেয়া হয়েছে তারা তাদের রিযক থেকে তাদের অধীনস্থ চাকর- গোলামদেরকে এমনভাবে ফিরিয়ে দেয় না, যাতে এক্ষেত্রে তারা সমান হয়ে যায়। (অথচ তারা নানান কিছুকে আল্লাহর অংশীদার বানিয়ে ওগুলোকে আল্লাহর সমান করে ফেলছে) তাহলে কি তারা আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহ অস্বীকার করে?', 'And Allah has favored some of you over others in provision. But those who were favored would not hand over their provision to those whom their right hands possess so they would be equal to them therein. Then is it the favor of Allah they reject?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016071.mp3', now()),
  (16, 72, '', '[{"id":60562,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60563,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَ","transliteration":"jaʿala","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60564,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60565,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60566,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسِكُمْ","transliteration":"anfusikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের স্বজাতীয়দের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60567,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَزْوَٰجًۭا","transliteration":"azwājan","translation_bn":"জোড়াসমূহ","root":"زوج","lemma":"زَوْج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60568,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلَ","transliteration":"wajaʿala","translation_bn":"এবং সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60569,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60570,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60571,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَزْوَٰجِكُم","transliteration":"azwājikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের যুগলগুলো","root":"زوج","lemma":"زَوْج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60572,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَنِينَ","transliteration":"banīna","translation_bn":"পুত্রসমূহ","root":"بني","lemma":"بُنَىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60573,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَحَفَدَةًۭ","transliteration":"waḥafadatan","translation_bn":"ও পৌত্রসমূহ","root":"حفد","lemma":"حَفَدَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60574,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَرَزَقَكُم","transliteration":"warazaqakum","translation_bn":"এবং তোমাদের জীবিকা দিয়েছেন","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60575,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60576,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلطَّيِّبَـٰتِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ṭayibāti","translation_bn":"উত্তম বস্তু","root":"طيب","lemma":"طَيِّبَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60578,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَفَبِٱلْبَـٰطِلِ","transliteration":"afabil-bāṭili","translation_bn":"কি তবে উপর বাতিলের","root":"بطل","lemma":"بَٰطِل","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":60579,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"তারা ঈমান আনবে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60580,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَبِنِعْمَتِ","transliteration":"wabiniʿ''mati","translation_bn":"এবং অনুগ্রহসমূহকে","root":"نعم","lemma":"نِعْمَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60581,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":60582,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":60583,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يَكْفُرُونَ","transliteration":"yakfurūna","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করবে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60584,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"٧٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭২)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wal-lahu jaʿala lakum min anfusikum azwājan wajaʿala lakum min azwājikum banīna waḥafadatan warazaqakum mina l-ṭayibāti afabil-bāṭili yu''minūna wabiniʿ''mati l-lahi hum yakfurūna', 'আল্লাহ তোমাদের স্বজাতির মধ্য হতেই তোমাদের জোড়া সৃষ্টি করেছেন আর তোমাদের জন্য তোমাদের জোড়া থেকে পুত্র-পৌত্রাদি বানিয়েছেন আর তোমাদেরকে উৎকৃষ্ট রিযক দিয়েছেন। তবুও কি তারা ভিত্তিহীন বাতিল জিনিসের উপর ঈমান পোষণ করবে আর আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহকে তারা অস্বীকার করবে?', 'And Allah has made for you from yourselves mates and has made for you from your mates sons and grandchildren and has provided for you from the good things. Then in falsehood do they believe and in the favor of Allah they disbelieve?', 'আল্লাহ তোমাদের স্বজাতির মধ্য হতেই তোমাদের জোড়া সৃষ্টি করেছেন আর তোমাদের জন্য তোমাদের জোড়া থেকে পুত্র-পৌত্রাদি বানিয়েছেন আর তোমাদেরকে উৎকৃষ্ট রিযক দিয়েছেন। তবুও কি তারা ভিত্তিহীন বাতিল জিনিসের উপর ঈমান পোষণ করবে আর আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহকে তারা অস্বীকার করবে?', 'And Allah has made for you from yourselves mates and has made for you from your mates sons and grandchildren and has provided for you from the good things. Then in falsehood do they believe and in the favor of Allah they disbelieve?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016072.mp3', now()),
  (16, 73, '', '[{"id":60951,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَعْبُدُونَ","transliteration":"wayaʿbudūna","translation_bn":"এবং তারা উপাসনা করবে (কি)","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60952,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60953,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60954,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর (অন্য কিছুকে)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":60955,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":60956,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":60957,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَمْلِكُ","transliteration":"yamliku","translation_bn":"ক্ষমতা রাখে","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَكَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60958,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদেন","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60959,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رِزْقًۭا","transliteration":"riz''qan","translation_bn":"জীবিকার","root":"رزق","lemma":"رِزْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60960,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60961,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশমন্ডলী","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60962,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"অথবা পৃথিবী (থেকে)","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60963,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًۭٔا","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কিছুমাত্র","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60964,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60965,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَطِيعُونَ","transliteration":"yastaṭīʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা (কিছুই) করতে সক্ষম","root":"طوع","lemma":"ٱسْتَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60966,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٧٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayaʿbudūna min dūni l-lahi mā lā yamliku lahum riz''qan mina l-samāwāti wal-arḍi shayan walā yastaṭīʿūna', 'আর আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে ‘ইবাদাত করবে অন্যের যারা আকাশ ও যমীন থেকে তাদের জন্য রিযক দেয়ার মালিক নয়, আর তারা এ কাজে সক্ষমও নয়।', 'And they worship besides Allah that which does not possess for them [the power of] provision from the heavens and the earth at all, and [in fact], they are unable.', 'আর আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে ‘ইবাদাত করবে অন্যের যারা আকাশ ও যমীন থেকে তাদের জন্য রিযক দেয়ার মালিক নয়, আর তারা এ কাজে সক্ষমও নয়।', 'And they worship besides Allah that which does not possess for them [the power of] provision from the heavens and the earth at all, and [in fact], they are unable.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016073.mp3', now()),
  (16, 74, '', '[{"id":61382,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"সুতরাং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61383,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَضْرِبُوا۟","transliteration":"taḍribū","translation_bn":"তোমরা বর্ণনা করো","root":"ضرب","lemma":"ضَرَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61384,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61385,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَمْثَالَ ۚ","transliteration":"l-amthāla","translation_bn":"(কাউকে) সদৃশ","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61387,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":61388,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61389,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","translation_bn":"জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61390,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنتُمْ","transliteration":"wa-antum","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"وَأَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61391,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":61392,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","translation_bn":"জানো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61393,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٧٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falā taḍribū lillahi l-amthāla inna l-laha yaʿlamu wa-antum lā taʿlamūna', 'কাজেই কারো সাথে আল্লাহর তুলনা দিও না। আল্লাহ জানেন, আর তোমরা জান না।', 'So do not assert similarities to Allah. Indeed, Allah knows and you do not know.', 'কাজেই কারো সাথে আল্লাহর তুলনা দিও না। আল্লাহ জানেন, আর তোমরা জান না।', 'So do not assert similarities to Allah. Indeed, Allah knows and you do not know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016074.mp3', now()),
  (16, 75, '', '[{"id":61920,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ ضَرَبَ","transliteration":"ḍaraba","translation_bn":"বর্ণনা করছেন","root":"ضرب","lemma":"ضَرَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61921,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61922,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَثَلًا","transliteration":"mathalan","translation_bn":"উপমা","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61923,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَبْدًۭا","transliteration":"ʿabdan","translation_bn":"একজন দাসের","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61924,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَّمْلُوكًۭا","transliteration":"mamlūkan","translation_bn":"অপরের অধিকারভুক্ত","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَّمْلُوك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61925,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":61926,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَقْدِرُ","transliteration":"yaqdiru","translation_bn":"সে ক্ষমতা রাখে","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61927,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61928,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কোনো কিছু (খরচ করতে)","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61929,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং (এমন এক ব্যক্তির) যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61930,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"رَّزَقْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"razaqnāhu","translation_bn":"তাকে আমরা জীবিকা দিয়েছি","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61931,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِنَّا","transliteration":"minnā","translation_bn":"আমাদের থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61932,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رِزْقًا","transliteration":"riz''qan","translation_bn":"জীবিকা","root":"رزق","lemma":"رِزْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61933,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"حَسَنًۭا","transliteration":"ḥasanan","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"حسن","lemma":"حَسَن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":61934,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَهُوَ","transliteration":"fahuwa","translation_bn":"অতঃপর সে","root":"—","lemma":"فَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61935,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يُنفِقُ","transliteration":"yunfiqu","translation_bn":"ব্যয় করে","root":"نفق","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61936,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"থেকে তা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61937,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"سِرًّۭا","transliteration":"sirran","translation_bn":"গোপনে","root":"سرر","lemma":"سِرّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61938,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَجَهْرًا ۖ","transliteration":"wajahran","translation_bn":"ও প্রকাশ্যে","root":"جهر","lemma":"جَهْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61940,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":61941,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَوُۥنَ ۚ","transliteration":"yastawūna","translation_bn":"তারা সমান হয়","root":"سوي","lemma":"ٱسْتَوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61943,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَمْدُ","transliteration":"l-ḥamdu","translation_bn":"প্রশংসা মাত্রই","root":"حمد","lemma":"حَمْد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61944,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61946,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":61947,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرُهُمْ","transliteration":"aktharuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের অধিকাংশই","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61948,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":61949,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"জানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61950,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٧٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ḍaraba l-lahu mathalan ʿabdan mamlūkan lā yaqdiru ʿalā shayin waman razaqnāhu minnā riz''qan ḥasanan fahuwa yunfiqu min''hu sirran wajahran hal yastawūna l-ḥamdu lillahi bal aktharuhum lā yaʿlamūna', 'আল্লাহ দৃষ্টান্ত দিচ্ছেনঃ অন্যের মালিকানাভুক্ত এক দাস যে কোন কিছু করারই ক্ষমতা রাখে না। আর এক লোক যাকে আমি আমার পক্ষ হতে উত্তম জীবিকা দান করেছি আর তাত্থেকে সে গোপনে প্রকাশ্যে দান করে, (এ) দু’জন কি সমান? সমস্ত প্রশংসা আল্লাহরই জন্য, কিন্তু তাদের অধিকাংশই জানে না।', 'Allah presents an example: a slave [who is] owned and unable to do a thing and he to whom We have provided from Us good provision, so he spends from it secretly and publicly. Can they be equal? Praise to Allah! But most of them do not know.', 'আল্লাহ দৃষ্টান্ত দিচ্ছেনঃ অন্যের মালিকানাভুক্ত এক দাস যে কোন কিছু করারই ক্ষমতা রাখে না। আর এক লোক যাকে আমি আমার পক্ষ হতে উত্তম জীবিকা দান করেছি আর তাত্থেকে সে গোপনে প্রকাশ্যে দান করে, (এ) দু’জন কি সমান? সমস্ত প্রশংসা আল্লাহরই জন্য, কিন্তু তাদের অধিকাংশই জানে না।', 'Allah presents an example: a slave [who is] owned and unable to do a thing and he to whom We have provided from Us good provision, so he spends from it secretly and publicly. Can they be equal? Praise to Allah! But most of them do not know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016075.mp3', now()),
  (16, 76, '', '[{"id":62394,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَضَرَبَ","transliteration":"waḍaraba","translation_bn":"এবং বর্ণনা করেন","root":"ضرب","lemma":"ضَرَبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62395,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":62396,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَثَلًۭا","transliteration":"mathalan","translation_bn":"উপমা","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62397,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَّجُلَيْنِ","transliteration":"rajulayni","translation_bn":"দু''ব্যক্তির","root":"رجل","lemma":"رَجُل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62398,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَحَدُهُمَآ","transliteration":"aḥaduhumā","translation_bn":"তাদের দু''জনের একজন","root":"احد","lemma":"أَحَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62399,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَبْكَمُ","transliteration":"abkamu","translation_bn":"বোবা","root":"بكم","lemma":"أَبْكَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62400,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":62401,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَقْدِرُ","transliteration":"yaqdiru","translation_bn":"ক্ষমতা রাখে","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62402,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62403,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কোনো কিছুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62404,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং সে","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":62405,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كَلٌّ","transliteration":"kallun","translation_bn":"বোঝা","root":"كلل","lemma":"كَلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62406,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62407,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مَوْلَىٰهُ","transliteration":"mawlāhu","translation_bn":"তার প্রভুর","root":"ولي","lemma":"مَوْلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62408,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَيْنَمَا","transliteration":"aynamā","translation_bn":"যেদিকেই","root":"—","lemma":"أَيْن\r","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":62409,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يُوَجِّههُّ","transliteration":"yuwajjihhu","translation_bn":"তাকে পাঠায়","root":"وجه","lemma":"وَجَّهْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62410,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":62411,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِ","transliteration":"yati","translation_bn":"আসে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62412,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"بِخَيْرٍ ۖ","transliteration":"bikhayrin","translation_bn":"নিয়ে ভালো (কিছুই)","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62414,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":62415,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَوِى","transliteration":"yastawī","translation_bn":"সমান হয়","root":"سوي","lemma":"ٱسْتَوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62416,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"সে","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":62417,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"ও যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62418,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"يَأْمُرُ","transliteration":"yamuru","translation_bn":"নির্দেশ দেয়","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62419,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْعَدْلِ ۙ","transliteration":"bil-ʿadli","translation_bn":"ন্যায়ের","root":"عدل","lemma":"عَدْل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62421,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং সে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62422,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62423,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"صِرَٰطٍۢ","transliteration":"ṣirāṭin","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"صرط","lemma":"صِرَٰط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62424,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"mus''taqīmin","translation_bn":"সরল-সঠিক","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّسْتَقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62425,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"٧٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waḍaraba l-lahu mathalan rajulayni aḥaduhumā abkamu lā yaqdiru ʿalā shayin wahuwa kallun ʿalā mawlāhu aynamā yuwajjihhu lā yati bikhayrin hal yastawī huwa waman yamuru bil-ʿadli wahuwa ʿalā ṣirāṭin mus''taqīmin', 'আল্লাহ আরো দৃষ্টান্ত দিচ্ছেন দু’ব্যক্তির তাদের একজন হল বোবা, কোন কিছুই করতে সক্ষম নয়। তার মনিবের উপর সে একটা বোঝা, তাকে যেখানেই পাঠানো হোক না কেন, কোন কল্যাণই সে নিয়ে আসবে না। সে কি ঐ ব্যক্তির সমান যে ইনসাফের নির্দেশ দেয় আর সরল সুদৃঢ় পথে প্রতিষ্ঠিত?', 'And Allah presents an example of two men, one of them dumb and unable to do a thing, while he is a burden to his guardian. Wherever he directs him, he brings no good. Is he equal to one who commands justice, while he is on a straight path?', 'আল্লাহ আরো দৃষ্টান্ত দিচ্ছেন দু’ব্যক্তির তাদের একজন হল বোবা, কোন কিছুই করতে সক্ষম নয়। তার মনিবের উপর সে একটা বোঝা, তাকে যেখানেই পাঠানো হোক না কেন, কোন কল্যাণই সে নিয়ে আসবে না। সে কি ঐ ব্যক্তির সমান যে ইনসাফের নির্দেশ দেয় আর সরল সুদৃঢ় পথে প্রতিষ্ঠিত?', 'And Allah presents an example of two men, one of them dumb and unable to do a thing, while he is a burden to his guardian. Wherever he directs him, he brings no good. Is he equal to one who commands justice, while he is on a straight path?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016076.mp3', now()),
  (16, 77, '', '[{"id":63197,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلِلَّهِ","transliteration":"walillahi","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহরই আছে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63198,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"غَيْبُ","transliteration":"ghaybu","translation_bn":"অদৃশ্যের (জ্ঞান)","root":"غيب","lemma":"غَيْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63199,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশমন্ডলীর","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63200,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63202,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নয়","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63203,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرُ","transliteration":"amru","translation_bn":"ব্যাপার","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63204,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّاعَةِ","transliteration":"l-sāʿati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63205,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া (যে)","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":63206,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَلَمْحِ","transliteration":"kalamḥi","translation_bn":"মতো পলকের","root":"لمح","lemma":"لَمْح","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63207,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَصَرِ","transliteration":"l-baṣari","translation_bn":"চোখের","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63208,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63209,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তা","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":63210,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَقْرَبُ ۚ","transliteration":"aqrabu","translation_bn":"তারও চেয়ে নিকটতর","root":"قرب","lemma":"أَقْرَب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63212,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":63213,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":63214,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63215,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63216,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63217,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"قَدِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"qadīrun","translation_bn":"সর্বশক্তিমান","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63218,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٧٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walillahi ghaybu l-samāwāti wal-arḍi wamā amru l-sāʿati illā kalamḥi l-baṣari aw huwa aqrabu inna l-laha ʿalā kulli shayin qadīrun', 'আকাশসমূহ ও যমীনের অদৃশ্যের জ্ঞান কেবল আল্লাহরই আছে। ক্বিয়ামাতের ব্যাপার তো চোখের পলকের মত বরং তাত্থেকেও দ্রুত। আল্লাহ সব কিছু করতেই সক্ষম।', 'And to Allah belongs the unseen [aspects] of the heavens and the earth. And the command for the Hour is not but as a glance of the eye or even nearer. Indeed, Allah is over all things competent.', 'আকাশসমূহ ও যমীনের অদৃশ্যের জ্ঞান কেবল আল্লাহরই আছে। ক্বিয়ামাতের ব্যাপার তো চোখের পলকের মত বরং তাত্থেকেও দ্রুত। আল্লাহ সব কিছু করতেই সক্ষম।', 'And to Allah belongs the unseen [aspects] of the heavens and the earth. And the command for the Hour is not but as a glance of the eye or even nearer. Indeed, Allah is over all things competent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016077.mp3', now()),
  (16, 78, '', '[{"id":63382,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63383,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَخْرَجَكُم","transliteration":"akhrajakum","translation_bn":"বের করেন তোমাদের","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63384,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63385,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بُطُونِ","transliteration":"buṭūni","translation_bn":"পেটসমূহ","root":"بطن","lemma":"بَطْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63386,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أُمَّهَـٰتِكُمْ","transliteration":"ummahātikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মায়ের (এ অবস্থায় যে)","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63387,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":63388,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা জানো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63389,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًۭٔا","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কিছুই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63390,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلَ","transliteration":"wajaʿala","translation_bn":"এবং দিয়েছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63391,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمُ","transliteration":"lakumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63392,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمْعَ","transliteration":"l-samʿa","translation_bn":"শ্রবণশক্তিসমূহ","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمْع","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63393,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَبْصَـٰرَ","transliteration":"wal-abṣāra","translation_bn":"এবং দৃষ্টিশক্তিসমূহ","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصَر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63394,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَفْـِٔدَةَ ۙ","transliteration":"wal-afidata","translation_bn":"এবং হৃদয়সমূহ","root":"فاد","lemma":"فُؤَاد","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63396,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallakum","translation_bn":"সম্ভবত তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":63397,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تَشْكُرُونَ","transliteration":"tashkurūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করো","root":"شكر","lemma":"شَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63398,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٧٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wal-lahu akhrajakum min buṭūni ummahātikum lā taʿlamūna shayan wajaʿala lakumu l-samʿa wal-abṣāra wal-afidata laʿallakum tashkurūna', 'আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে তোমাদের মায়ের পেট থেকে বের করেন, তোমরা কিছুই জানতে না। তিনি তোমাদেরকে শোনার শক্তি, দেখার শক্তি আর অন্তর দান করেছেন যাতে তোমরা শোকর আদায় করতে পার।', 'And Allah has extracted you from the wombs of your mothers not knowing a thing, and He made for you hearing and vision and intellect that perhaps you would be grateful.', 'আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে তোমাদের মায়ের পেট থেকে বের করেন, তোমরা কিছুই জানতে না। তিনি তোমাদেরকে শোনার শক্তি, দেখার শক্তি আর অন্তর দান করেছেন যাতে তোমরা শোকর আদায় করতে পার।', 'And Allah has extracted you from the wombs of your mothers not knowing a thing, and He made for you hearing and vision and intellect that perhaps you would be grateful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016078.mp3', now()),
  (16, 79, '', '[{"id":63713,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"নি কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":63714,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَرَوْا۟","transliteration":"yaraw","translation_bn":"তারা লক্ষ্য করে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63715,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63716,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلطَّيْرِ","transliteration":"l-ṭayri","translation_bn":"(উড়ন্ত) পাখীগুলোর","root":"طير","lemma":"طَيْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63717,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مُسَخَّرَٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"musakharātin","translation_bn":"নিয়মের অধীন","root":"سخر","lemma":"مُسَخَّرَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63718,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63719,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"جَوِّ","transliteration":"jawwi","translation_bn":"শূণ্যের","root":"جوو","lemma":"جَوّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63720,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","transliteration":"l-samāi","translation_bn":"আকাশের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63721,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":63722,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يُمْسِكُهُنَّ","transliteration":"yum''sikuhunna","translation_bn":"তাদের কেউ ধরে রাখে","root":"مسك","lemma":"أَمْسَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63723,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":63724,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ۗ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":63726,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":63727,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে রয়েছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63728,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":63729,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَـَٔايَـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"laāyātin","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই নিদর্শনসমূহ","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":63730,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"liqawmin","translation_bn":"জন্যে লোকদের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63731,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"(যারা) ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63732,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٧٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alam yaraw ilā l-ṭayri musakharātin fī jawwi l-samāi mā yum''sikuhunna illā l-lahu inna fī dhālika laāyātin liqawmin yu''minūna', 'আকাশের শূন্যলোকে নিয়ন্ত্রিত পাখীগুলোর প্রতি কি তারা লক্ষ্য করে না? আল্লাহ ছাড়া কেউ তাদেরকে স্থির রাখে না, এতে মু’মিন সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য অবশ্যই বহু নিদর্শন রয়েছে।', 'Do they not see the birds controlled in the atmosphere of the sky? None holds them up except Allah. Indeed in that are signs for a people who believe.', 'আকাশের শূন্যলোকে নিয়ন্ত্রিত পাখীগুলোর প্রতি কি তারা লক্ষ্য করে না? আল্লাহ ছাড়া কেউ তাদেরকে স্থির রাখে না, এতে মু’মিন সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য অবশ্যই বহু নিদর্শন রয়েছে।', 'Do they not see the birds controlled in the atmosphere of the sky? None holds them up except Allah. Indeed in that are signs for a people who believe.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016079.mp3', now()),
  (16, 80, '', '[{"id":64080,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64081,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَ","transliteration":"jaʿala","translation_bn":"বানিয়েছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64082,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64083,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64084,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بُيُوتِكُمْ","transliteration":"buyūtikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের ঘরগুলো","root":"بيت","lemma":"بَيْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64085,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سَكَنًۭا","transliteration":"sakanan","translation_bn":"আবাসস্থল","root":"سكن","lemma":"سَكَن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64086,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلَ","transliteration":"wajaʿala","translation_bn":"ও বানিয়েছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64087,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64088,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64089,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"جُلُودِ","transliteration":"julūdi","translation_bn":"চামড়াগুলোকে","root":"جلد","lemma":"جُلُود","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64090,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ","transliteration":"l-anʿāmi","translation_bn":"গবাদিপশুর","root":"نعم","lemma":"نَّعَم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64091,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بُيُوتًۭا","transliteration":"buyūtan","translation_bn":"এমন ঘর","root":"بيت","lemma":"بَيْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64092,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَسْتَخِفُّونَهَا","transliteration":"tastakhiffūnahā","translation_bn":"তা তোমরা হালকা মনে করো","root":"خفف","lemma":"ٱسْتَخَفَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64093,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64094,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ظَعْنِكُمْ","transliteration":"ẓaʿnikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের ভ্রমনের","root":"ظعن","lemma":"ظَعْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64095,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"ও দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64096,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِقَامَتِكُمْ ۙ","transliteration":"iqāmatikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের অবস্থানের","root":"قوم","lemma":"إِقَامَت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64098,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنْ","transliteration":"wamin","translation_bn":"এবং থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64099,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَصْوَافِهَا","transliteration":"aṣwāfihā","translation_bn":"তার পশমগুলো","root":"صوف","lemma":"أَصْوَاف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64100,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَأَوْبَارِهَا","transliteration":"wa-awbārihā","translation_bn":"ও তার লোমগুলো","root":"وبر","lemma":"أَوْبَار","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64101,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَأَشْعَارِهَآ","transliteration":"wa-ashʿārihā","translation_bn":"ও তার চুলগুলো","root":"شعر","lemma":"شِّعْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64102,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"أَثَـٰثًۭا","transliteration":"athāthan","translation_bn":"গৃহসামগ্রী","root":"اثث","lemma":"أَثَٰث","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64103,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَمَتَـٰعًا","transliteration":"wamatāʿan","translation_bn":"ও ব্যবহার উপকরণ","root":"متع","lemma":"مَتَٰع","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64104,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"পর্যন্ত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64105,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"حِينٍۢ","transliteration":"ḥīnin","translation_bn":"নির্দিষ্ট সময়","root":"حين","lemma":"حِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64106,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٨٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮০)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wal-lahu jaʿala lakum min buyūtikum sakanan wajaʿala lakum min julūdi l-anʿāmi buyūtan tastakhiffūnahā yawma ẓaʿnikum wayawma iqāmatikum wamin aṣwāfihā wa-awbārihā wa-ashʿārihā athāthan wamatāʿan ilā ḥīnin', 'আল্লাহ তোমাদের গৃহগুলোকে তোমাদের আরাম শান্তির জায়গা বানিয়ে দিয়েছেন। তিনি পশুর চামড়া থেকে তোমাদের জন্য এমন গৃহের ব্যবস্থা করেছেন যা তোমরা হালকাবোধ কর তোমাদের ভ্রমণকালে কিংবা অবস্থানকালে। তিনি ওগুলোর পশম, লোম আর চুল থেকে তোমাদের পরিধেয় ও ব্যবহার্য সামগ্রীর ব্যবস্থা করেছেন যা তোমরা কিছুকাল পর্যন্ত কাজে লাগাও।', 'And Allah has made for you from your homes a place of rest and made for you from the hides of the animals tents which you find light on your day of travel and your day of encampment; and from their wool, fur and hair is furnishing and enjoyment for a time.', 'আল্লাহ তোমাদের গৃহগুলোকে তোমাদের আরাম শান্তির জায়গা বানিয়ে দিয়েছেন। তিনি পশুর চামড়া থেকে তোমাদের জন্য এমন গৃহের ব্যবস্থা করেছেন যা তোমরা হালকাবোধ কর তোমাদের ভ্রমণকালে কিংবা অবস্থানকালে। তিনি ওগুলোর পশম, লোম আর চুল থেকে তোমাদের পরিধেয় ও ব্যবহার্য সামগ্রীর ব্যবস্থা করেছেন যা তোমরা কিছুকাল পর্যন্ত কাজে লাগাও।', 'And Allah has made for you from your homes a place of rest and made for you from the hides of the animals tents which you find light on your day of travel and your day of encampment; and from their wool, fur and hair is furnishing and enjoyment for a time.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016080.mp3', now()),
  (16, 81, '', '[{"id":64568,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64569,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَ","transliteration":"jaʿala","translation_bn":"ব্যবস্থা করেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64570,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64571,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64572,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقَ","transliteration":"khalaqa","translation_bn":"তিনি সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64573,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ظِلَـٰلًۭا","transliteration":"ẓilālan","translation_bn":"ছায়াসমূহের","root":"ظلل","lemma":"ظِلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64574,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلَ","transliteration":"wajaʿala","translation_bn":"এবং বানিয়েছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64575,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64576,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64577,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجِبَالِ","transliteration":"l-jibāli","translation_bn":"পাহাড়সমূহের","root":"جبل","lemma":"جَبَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64578,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَكْنَـٰنًۭا","transliteration":"aknānan","translation_bn":"আশ্রয়স্থলসমূহ","root":"كنن","lemma":"أَكْنَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64579,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلَ","transliteration":"wajaʿala","translation_bn":"এবং ব্যবস্থা করেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64580,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64581,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"سَرَٰبِيلَ","transliteration":"sarābīla","translation_bn":"পোশাকসমূহের","root":"سربل","lemma":"سَرَٰبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64582,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تَقِيكُمُ","transliteration":"taqīkumu","translation_bn":"রক্ষা করে তোমাদের","root":"وقي","lemma":"وَقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64583,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَرَّ","transliteration":"l-ḥara","translation_bn":"গরমে","root":"حرر","lemma":"حَرّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64584,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَسَرَٰبِيلَ","transliteration":"wasarābīla","translation_bn":"ও পোশাকসমূহ (বর্ম)","root":"سربل","lemma":"سَرَٰبِيل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64585,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"تَقِيكُم","transliteration":"taqīkum","translation_bn":"রক্ষা করে তোমাদের","root":"وقي","lemma":"وَقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64586,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"بَأْسَكُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"basakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের যুদ্ধে","root":"باس","lemma":"بَأْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64588,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64589,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يُتِمُّ","transliteration":"yutimmu","translation_bn":"তিনি পূর্ণ করেন","root":"تمم","lemma":"أَتَمَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64590,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"نِعْمَتَهُۥ","transliteration":"niʿ''matahu","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ তাঁর","root":"نعم","lemma":"نِعْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64591,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"ওপর তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64592,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallakum","translation_bn":"সম্ভবত তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":64593,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"تُسْلِمُونَ","transliteration":"tus''limūna","translation_bn":"আত্নসমর্পণ করবে","root":"سلم","lemma":"أَسْلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64594,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٨١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮১)","root":"—","lemma":"٨١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wal-lahu jaʿala lakum mimmā khalaqa ẓilālan wajaʿala lakum mina l-jibāli aknānan wajaʿala lakum sarābīla taqīkumu l-ḥara wasarābīla taqīkum basakum kadhālika yutimmu niʿ''matahu ʿalaykum laʿallakum tus''limūna', 'আল্লাহ যা সৃষ্টি করেছেন তাত্থেকে তোমাদের জন্য ছায়ার ব্যবস্থা করেছেন, পাহাড়-পর্বতে তোমাদের আত্মগোপনের জায়গা বানিয়েছেন। তিনি তোমাদের জন্য পোশাক দিয়েছেন যা তোমাদেরকে তাপ থেকে রক্ষা করে। আর দিয়েছেন এমন পোশাক যা তোমাদেরকে সংঘাতের সময় রক্ষা করে। এভাবে তিনি তোমাদের জন্য তাঁর নি‘মাতসমূহ পূর্ণ করেন যাতে তোমরা তাঁর প্রতি আত্মসমর্পণ কর।', 'And Allah has made for you, from that which He has created, shadows and has made for you from the mountains, shelters and has made for you garments which protect you from the heat and garments which protect you from your [enemy in] battle. Thus does He complete His favor upon you that you might submit [to Him].', 'আল্লাহ যা সৃষ্টি করেছেন তাত্থেকে তোমাদের জন্য ছায়ার ব্যবস্থা করেছেন, পাহাড়-পর্বতে তোমাদের আত্মগোপনের জায়গা বানিয়েছেন। তিনি তোমাদের জন্য পোশাক দিয়েছেন যা তোমাদেরকে তাপ থেকে রক্ষা করে। আর দিয়েছেন এমন পোশাক যা তোমাদেরকে সংঘাতের সময় রক্ষা করে। এভাবে তিনি তোমাদের জন্য তাঁর নি‘মাতসমূহ পূর্ণ করেন যাতে তোমরা তাঁর প্রতি আত্মসমর্পণ কর।', 'And Allah has made for you, from that which He has created, shadows and has made for you from the mountains, shelters and has made for you garments which protect you from the heat and garments which protect you from your [enemy in] battle. Thus does He complete His favor upon you that you might submit [to Him].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016081.mp3', now()),
  (16, 82, '', '[{"id":65015,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَإِن","transliteration":"fa-in","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65016,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَوَلَّوْا۟","transliteration":"tawallaw","translation_bn":"তারা মুখ ফিরায়","root":"ولي","lemma":"تَوَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65017,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّمَا","transliteration":"fa-innamā","translation_bn":"তবে কেবল","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65018,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ʿalayka","translation_bn":"তোমার উপর দায়িত্ব","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65019,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَلَـٰغُ","transliteration":"l-balāghu","translation_bn":"(দীনের দাওয়াত) পৌঁছানো","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَلَٰغ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65020,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُبِينُ","transliteration":"l-mubīnu","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্টভাবে","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65021,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٨٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮২)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-in tawallaw fa-innamā ʿalayka l-balāghu l-mubīnu', 'এরপরও যদি তারা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয় তবে (জোরপূর্বক তাদেরকে সঠিক পথে আনা তোমার দায়িত্ব নয়) তোমার দায়িত্ব কেবল স্পষ্টভাবে বাণী পৌঁছে দেয়া।', 'But if they turn away, [O Muhammad] - then only upon you is [responsibility for] clear notification.', 'এরপরও যদি তারা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয় তবে (জোরপূর্বক তাদেরকে সঠিক পথে আনা তোমার দায়িত্ব নয়) তোমার দায়িত্ব কেবল স্পষ্টভাবে বাণী পৌঁছে দেয়া।', 'But if they turn away, [O Muhammad] - then only upon you is [responsibility for] clear notification.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016082.mp3', now()),
  (16, 83, '', '[{"id":65286,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَعْرِفُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿrifūna","translation_bn":"তারা জানে","root":"عرف","lemma":"عَرَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65287,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نِعْمَتَ","transliteration":"niʿ''mata","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহসমূহকে","root":"نعم","lemma":"نِعْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65288,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":65289,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65290,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يُنكِرُونَهَا","transliteration":"yunkirūnahā","translation_bn":"তা তারা অস্বীকার করে","root":"نكر","lemma":"يُنكِرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65291,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَأَكْثَرُهُمُ","transliteration":"wa-aktharuhumu","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের অধিকাংশ","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65292,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ","transliteration":"l-kāfirūna","translation_bn":"কাফের","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65293,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٨٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yaʿrifūna niʿ''mata l-lahi thumma yunkirūnahā wa-aktharuhumu l-kāfirūna', 'তারা আল্লাহর নি‘মাতকে চিনতে পারে, কিন্তু তা সত্ত্বেও সেগুলো অগ্রাহ্য করে, তাদের অধিকাংশই অকৃতজ্ঞ।', 'They recognize the favor of Allah; then they deny it. And most of them are disbelievers.', 'তারা আল্লাহর নি‘মাতকে চিনতে পারে, কিন্তু তা সত্ত্বেও সেগুলো অগ্রাহ্য করে, তাদের অধিকাংশই অকৃতজ্ঞ।', 'They recognize the favor of Allah; then they deny it. And most of them are disbelievers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016083.mp3', now()),
  (16, 84, '', '[{"id":65634,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"এবং যেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65635,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَبْعَثُ","transliteration":"nabʿathu","translation_bn":"উত্থিত করবো আমরা","root":"بعث","lemma":"بَعَثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65636,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65637,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65638,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أُمَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"ummatin","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65639,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"شَهِيدًۭا","transliteration":"shahīdan","translation_bn":"সাক্ষী","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":65640,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65641,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":65642,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْذَنُ","transliteration":"yu''dhanu","translation_bn":"অনুমতি দেয়া হবে","root":"اذن","lemma":"أَذِنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65643,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65644,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65645,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65646,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":65647,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يُسْتَعْتَبُونَ","transliteration":"yus''taʿtabūna","translation_bn":"সন্তুষ্টি লাভের সুযোগ দেয়া হবে","root":"عتب","lemma":"يَسْتَعْتِبُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65648,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٨٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayawma nabʿathu min kulli ummatin shahīdan thumma lā yu''dhanu lilladhīna kafarū walā hum yus''taʿtabūna', '(সেদিন কী অবস্থা হবে) যেদিন আমি প্রত্যেক সম্প্রদায় থেকে একজন সাক্ষী দাঁড় করাব আর কাফিরদেরকে (কোন অযুহাত পেশ করার) অনুমতি দেয়া হবে না, আর ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা করারও সুযোগ দেয়া হবে না।', 'And [mention] the Day when We will resurrect from every nation a witness. Then it will not be permitted to the disbelievers [to apologize or make excuses], nor will they be asked to appease [Allah].', '(সেদিন কী অবস্থা হবে) যেদিন আমি প্রত্যেক সম্প্রদায় থেকে একজন সাক্ষী দাঁড় করাব আর কাফিরদেরকে (কোন অযুহাত পেশ করার) অনুমতি দেয়া হবে না, আর ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা করারও সুযোগ দেয়া হবে না।', 'And [mention] the Day when We will resurrect from every nation a witness. Then it will not be permitted to the disbelievers [to apologize or make excuses], nor will they be asked to appease [Allah].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016084.mp3', now()),
  (16, 85, '', '[{"id":66000,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66001,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَءَا","transliteration":"raā","translation_bn":"দেখবে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66002,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":66003,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَمُوا۟","transliteration":"ẓalamū","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘন করেছে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66004,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابَ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66005,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"তখন না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66006,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يُخَفَّفُ","transliteration":"yukhaffafu","translation_bn":"লাঘব করা হবে","root":"خفف","lemma":"خَفَّفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66007,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُمْ","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"তাদের থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66008,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66009,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":66010,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُنظَرُونَ","transliteration":"yunẓarūna","translation_bn":"অবকাশ দেয়া হবে","root":"نظر","lemma":"يُنظَرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66011,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٨٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā raā alladhīna ẓalamū l-ʿadhāba falā yukhaffafu ʿanhum walā hum yunẓarūna', 'সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীরা যখন ‘আযাব প্রত্যক্ষ করবে তাদের থেকে তখন তা কমানো হবে না, আর তাদেরকে সময়-সুযোগও দেয়া হবে না।', 'And when those who wronged see the punishment, it will not be lightened for them, nor will they be reprieved.', 'সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীরা যখন ‘আযাব প্রত্যক্ষ করবে তাদের থেকে তখন তা কমানো হবে না, আর তাদেরকে সময়-সুযোগও দেয়া হবে না।', 'And when those who wronged see the punishment, it will not be lightened for them, nor will they be reprieved.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016085.mp3', now()),
  (16, 86, '', '[{"id":66382,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66383,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَءَا","transliteration":"raā","translation_bn":"দেখবে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66384,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":66385,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَشْرَكُوا۟","transliteration":"ashrakū","translation_bn":"শিরক করেছে","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66386,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"شُرَكَآءَهُمْ","transliteration":"shurakāahum","translation_bn":"তাদের শরীকদেরকে","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66387,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66388,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّنَا","transliteration":"rabbanā","translation_bn":"\"হে আমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66389,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","transliteration":"hāulāi","translation_bn":"এসব","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":66390,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"شُرَكَآؤُنَا","transliteration":"shurakāunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের শরীকরা","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66391,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":66392,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كُنَّا","transliteration":"kunnā","translation_bn":"আমরা ছিলাম","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66393,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"نَدْعُوا۟","transliteration":"nadʿū","translation_bn":"আমরা ডাকতাম","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66394,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"ছাড়া\"","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66395,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"دُونِكَ ۖ","transliteration":"dūnika","translation_bn":"আপনাকে\"","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66397,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَأَلْقَوْا۟","transliteration":"fa-alqaw","translation_bn":"তখন ফিরিয়ে দিবে","root":"لقي","lemma":"أَلْقَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66398,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِمُ","transliteration":"ilayhimu","translation_bn":"দিকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66399,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْلَ","transliteration":"l-qawla","translation_bn":"কথা","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66400,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكُمْ","transliteration":"innakum","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":66401,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"لَكَـٰذِبُونَ","transliteration":"lakādhibūna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই মিথ্যাবাদী\"","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَٰذِب","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":66402,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٨٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā raā alladhīna ashrakū shurakāahum qālū rabbanā hāulāi shurakāunā alladhīna kunnā nadʿū min dūnika fa-alqaw ilayhimu l-qawla innakum lakādhibūna', 'মুশরিকরা যাদেরকে আল্লাহর শারীক বানিয়েছিল তাদেরকে যখন দেখবে তখন তারা বলবে, ‘হে আমাদের রব্ব! এরাই হল আমাদের শারীক মা‘বূদ তোমাকে বাদ দিয়ে যাদেরকে আমরা ডাকতাম।’ তখন এ কথাকে তাদের দিকেই ছুঁড়ে ফেলে দিয়ে তাদের সেই মা‘বূদরা বলবে, ‘তোমরা অবশ্যই মিথ্যেবাদী।’', 'And when those who associated others with Allah see their "partners," they will say," Our Lord, these are our partners [to You] whom we used to invoke besides You." But they will throw at them the statement, "Indeed, you are liars."', 'মুশরিকরা যাদেরকে আল্লাহর শারীক বানিয়েছিল তাদেরকে যখন দেখবে তখন তারা বলবে, ‘হে আমাদের রব্ব! এরাই হল আমাদের শারীক মা‘বূদ তোমাকে বাদ দিয়ে যাদেরকে আমরা ডাকতাম।’ তখন এ কথাকে তাদের দিকেই ছুঁড়ে ফেলে দিয়ে তাদের সেই মা‘বূদরা বলবে, ‘তোমরা অবশ্যই মিথ্যেবাদী।’', 'And when those who associated others with Allah see their "partners," they will say," Our Lord, these are our partners [to You] whom we used to invoke besides You." But they will throw at them the statement, "Indeed, you are liars."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016086.mp3', now()),
  (16, 87, '', '[{"id":67015,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَلْقَوْا۟","transliteration":"wa-alqaw","translation_bn":"এবং নিজেদেরকে সমর্পণ করবে","root":"لقي","lemma":"أَلْقَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67016,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67017,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":67018,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","transliteration":"yawma-idhin","translation_bn":"সেদিন","root":"—","lemma":"يَوْمَئِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":67019,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّلَمَ ۖ","transliteration":"l-salama","translation_bn":"বশ্যতা স্বীকার করে","root":"سلم","lemma":"سَلَم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67021,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَضَلَّ","transliteration":"waḍalla","translation_bn":"এবং হারিয়ে যাবে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67022,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُم","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"থেকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67023,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":67024,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67025,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَفْتَرُونَ","transliteration":"yaftarūna","translation_bn":"উদ্ভাবন করে","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67026,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٨٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alqaw ilā l-lahi yawma-idhin l-salama waḍalla ʿanhum mā kānū yaftarūna', 'সেদিন তারা আল্লাহর নিকট খোলাখুলি আত্মসমর্পণ করবে, আর তারা যে সব মিথ্যে উদ্ভাবন করেছিল তা তাদের নিকট হতে হারিয়ে যাবে।', 'And they will impart to Allah that Day [their] submission, and lost from them is what they used to invent.', 'সেদিন তারা আল্লাহর নিকট খোলাখুলি আত্মসমর্পণ করবে, আর তারা যে সব মিথ্যে উদ্ভাবন করেছিল তা তাদের নিকট হতে হারিয়ে যাবে।', 'And they will impart to Allah that Day [their] submission, and lost from them is what they used to invent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016087.mp3', now()),
  (16, 88, '', '[{"id":67230,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":67231,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67232,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَصَدُّوا۟","transliteration":"waṣaddū","translation_bn":"ও বাঁধা দিয়েছে","root":"صدد","lemma":"صَدَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67233,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67234,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67235,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":67236,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"زِدْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"zid''nāhum","translation_bn":"আমরা বাড়াবো তাদের","root":"زيد","lemma":"زَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67237,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابًۭا","transliteration":"ʿadhāban","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67238,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَوْقَ","transliteration":"fawqa","translation_bn":"উপরে","root":"فوق","lemma":"فَوْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67239,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67240,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67241,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67242,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يُفْسِدُونَ","transliteration":"yuf''sidūna","translation_bn":"তারা অশান্তি সৃষ্টি করে","root":"فسد","lemma":"أَفْسَدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67243,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٨٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna kafarū waṣaddū ʿan sabīli l-lahi zid''nāhum ʿadhāban fawqa l-ʿadhābi bimā kānū yuf''sidūna', 'যারা আল্লাহকে অস্বীকার করে আর আল্লাহর পথে বাধা সৃষ্টি করে, আমি তাদের শাস্তির উপর শাস্তি বৃদ্ধি করব, কারণ তারা ফাসাদ সৃষ্টি করত।', 'Those who disbelieved and averted [others] from the way of Allah - We will increase them in punishment over [their] punishment for what corruption they were causing.', 'যারা আল্লাহকে অস্বীকার করে আর আল্লাহর পথে বাধা সৃষ্টি করে, আমি তাদের শাস্তির উপর শাস্তি বৃদ্ধি করব, কারণ তারা ফাসাদ সৃষ্টি করত।', 'Those who disbelieved and averted [others] from the way of Allah - We will increase them in punishment over [their] punishment for what corruption they were causing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016088.mp3', now()),
  (16, 89, '', '[{"id":67518,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"এবং সেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67519,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَبْعَثُ","transliteration":"nabʿathu","translation_bn":"আমরা উঠাবো","root":"بعث","lemma":"بَعَثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67520,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67521,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67522,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أُمَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"ummatin","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়ের","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67523,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"شَهِيدًا","transliteration":"shahīdan","translation_bn":"একজন সাক্ষী","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":67524,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِم","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"বিরুদ্ধে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67525,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67526,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسِهِمْ ۖ","transliteration":"anfusihim","translation_bn":"নিজেদের তাদের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67528,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَجِئْنَا","transliteration":"waji''nā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা আসবো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67529,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِكَ","transliteration":"bika","translation_bn":"নিয়ে তোমাকে","root":"—","lemma":"بِكَ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67530,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"شَهِيدًا","transliteration":"shahīdan","translation_bn":"সাক্ষী (স্বরূপ)","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67531,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"বিরুদ্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67532,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ ۚ","transliteration":"hāulāi","translation_bn":"এদের","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":67534,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَنَزَّلْنَا","transliteration":"wanazzalnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা অবতীর্ণ করেছি","root":"نزل","lemma":"نَزَّلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67535,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ʿalayka","translation_bn":"তোমার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67536,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","transliteration":"l-kitāba","translation_bn":"(এই) কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67537,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"تِبْيَـٰنًۭا","transliteration":"tib''yānan","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট বর্ণনা করা","root":"بين","lemma":"تِبْيَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67538,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"لِّكُلِّ","transliteration":"likulli","translation_bn":"জন্যে প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67539,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"বস্তুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67540,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَهُدًۭى","transliteration":"wahudan","translation_bn":"ও পথ নির্দেশ","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67541,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَرَحْمَةًۭ","transliteration":"waraḥmatan","translation_bn":"ও অনুগ্রহ","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67542,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَبُشْرَىٰ","transliteration":"wabush''rā","translation_bn":"এবং সুসংবাদ","root":"بشر","lemma":"بُشْرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67543,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"لِلْمُسْلِمِينَ","transliteration":"lil''mus''limīna","translation_bn":"জন্যে আত্নসমর্পণকারীদের","root":"سلم","lemma":"مُسْلِم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67544,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"٨٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayawma nabʿathu fī kulli ummatin shahīdan ʿalayhim min anfusihim waji''nā bika shahīdan ʿalā hāulāi wanazzalnā ʿalayka l-kitāba tib''yānan likulli shayin wahudan waraḥmatan wabush''rā lil''mus''limīna', 'সেদিন আমি প্রত্যেক উম্মাত থেকে তাদের নিজেদেরই মধ্য হতে একজন সাক্ষী দাঁড় করাব, আর (তোমার) এই লোকদের ব্যাপারে সাক্ষ্যদাতা হিসেবে (হে মুহাম্মাদ!) আমি তোমাকে আনব। আমি তোমার প্রতি এ কিতাব নাযিল করেছি যা প্রত্যেকটি বিষয়ের সুস্পষ্ট ব্যাখ্যা, সত্য পথের নির্দেশ, রহমাত আর আত্মসমর্পণকারীদের জন্য সুসংবাদ স্বরূপ।', 'And [mention] the Day when We will resurrect among every nation a witness over them from themselves. And We will bring you, [O Muhammad], as a witness over your nation. And We have sent down to you the Book as clarification for all things and as guidance and mercy and good tidings for the Muslims.', 'সেদিন আমি প্রত্যেক উম্মাত থেকে তাদের নিজেদেরই মধ্য হতে একজন সাক্ষী দাঁড় করাব, আর (তোমার) এই লোকদের ব্যাপারে সাক্ষ্যদাতা হিসেবে (হে মুহাম্মাদ!) আমি তোমাকে আনব। আমি তোমার প্রতি এ কিতাব নাযিল করেছি যা প্রত্যেকটি বিষয়ের সুস্পষ্ট ব্যাখ্যা, সত্য পথের নির্দেশ, রহমাত আর আত্মসমর্পণকারীদের জন্য সুসংবাদ স্বরূপ।', 'And [mention] the Day when We will resurrect among every nation a witness over them from themselves. And We will bring you, [O Muhammad], as a witness over your nation. And We have sent down to you the Book as clarification for all things and as guidance and mercy and good tidings for the Muslims.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016089.mp3', now()),
  (16, 90, '', '[{"id":67999,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":68000,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":68001,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَأْمُرُ","transliteration":"yamuru","translation_bn":"নির্দেশ দেন","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68002,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْعَدْلِ","transliteration":"bil-ʿadli","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে ন্যায়ের","root":"عدل","lemma":"عَدْل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68003,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْإِحْسَـٰنِ","transliteration":"wal-iḥ''sāni","translation_bn":"সদাচরণ","root":"حسن","lemma":"إِحْسَٰن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68004,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَإِيتَآئِ","transliteration":"waītāi","translation_bn":"ও দান করার","root":"اتي","lemma":"إِيتَاءٌ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68005,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ذِى","transliteration":"dhī","translation_bn":"সম্পন্ন","root":"—","lemma":"ذُو","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68006,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرْبَىٰ","transliteration":"l-qur''bā","translation_bn":"নৈকট্য (আত্নীয়-স্বজনকে)","root":"قرب","lemma":"قُرْبَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68007,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَيَنْهَىٰ","transliteration":"wayanhā","translation_bn":"এবং নিষেধ করেন","root":"نهي","lemma":"نَهَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68008,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَنِ","transliteration":"ʿani","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68009,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَحْشَآءِ","transliteration":"l-faḥshāi","translation_bn":"অশ্লীলতা","root":"فحش","lemma":"فَحْشَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68010,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمُنكَرِ","transliteration":"wal-munkari","translation_bn":"ও অসৎ কাজ","root":"نكر","lemma":"مُنكَر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68011,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْبَغْىِ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-baghyi","translation_bn":"ও সীমালঙ্ঘন","root":"بغي","lemma":"بَغْي","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68013,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَعِظُكُمْ","transliteration":"yaʿiẓukum","translation_bn":"তিনি উপদেশ দিচ্ছেন তোমাদের","root":"وعظ","lemma":"وَعَظْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68014,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallakum","translation_bn":"যাতে তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":68015,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"تَذَكَّرُونَ","transliteration":"tadhakkarūna","translation_bn":"শিক্ষা গ্রহণ করো","root":"ذكر","lemma":"تَذَكَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68016,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٩٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯০)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna l-laha yamuru bil-ʿadli wal-iḥ''sāni waītāi dhī l-qur''bā wayanhā ʿani l-faḥshāi wal-munkari wal-baghyi yaʿiẓukum laʿallakum tadhakkarūna', 'আল্লাহ ন্যায়-বিচার, সদাচরণ ও আত্মীয়দেরকে দেয়ার হুকুম দিচ্ছেন, আর তিনি নিষেধ করছেন অশ্লীলতা, অপকর্ম আর বিদ্রোহ থেকে। তিনি তোমাদেরকে উপদেশ দিয়েছেন যাতে তোমরা শিক্ষা গ্রহণ কর।', 'Indeed, Allah orders justice and good conduct and giving to relatives and forbids immorality and bad conduct and oppression. He admonishes you that perhaps you will be reminded.', 'আল্লাহ ন্যায়-বিচার, সদাচরণ ও আত্মীয়দেরকে দেয়ার হুকুম দিচ্ছেন, আর তিনি নিষেধ করছেন অশ্লীলতা, অপকর্ম আর বিদ্রোহ থেকে। তিনি তোমাদেরকে উপদেশ দিয়েছেন যাতে তোমরা শিক্ষা গ্রহণ কর।', 'Indeed, Allah orders justice and good conduct and giving to relatives and forbids immorality and bad conduct and oppression. He admonishes you that perhaps you will be reminded.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016090.mp3', now()),
  (16, 91, '', '[{"id":68244,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَوْفُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-awfū","translation_bn":"তোমরা পূর্ণ করো","root":"وفي","lemma":"أَوْفَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68245,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِعَهْدِ","transliteration":"biʿahdi","translation_bn":"অঙ্গীকার","root":"عهد","lemma":"عَهْد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68246,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":68247,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":68248,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰهَدتُّمْ","transliteration":"ʿāhadttum","translation_bn":"তোমরা অঙ্গীকার করেছো","root":"عهد","lemma":"عَٰهَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68249,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68250,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَنقُضُوا۟","transliteration":"tanquḍū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ভঙ্গ করো","root":"نقض","lemma":"نَقَضَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68251,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَيْمَـٰنَ","transliteration":"l-aymāna","translation_bn":"শপথসমূহকে","root":"يمن","lemma":"يَمِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68252,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدَ","transliteration":"baʿda","translation_bn":"পরে","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":68253,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"تَوْكِيدِهَا","transliteration":"tawkīdihā","translation_bn":"দৃঢ় করার তা","root":"وكد","lemma":"تَوْكِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68254,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَقَدْ","transliteration":"waqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":68255,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلْتُمُ","transliteration":"jaʿaltumu","translation_bn":"তোমরা করেছো","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68256,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":68257,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"উপর তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68258,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كَفِيلًا ۚ","transliteration":"kafīlan","translation_bn":"অভিভাবক","root":"كفل","lemma":"كَفِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68260,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":68261,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":68262,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","translation_bn":"জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68263,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":68264,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"تَفْعَلُونَ","transliteration":"tafʿalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কাজ কর্ম করছো","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68265,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"٩١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯১)","root":"—","lemma":"٩١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-awfū biʿahdi l-lahi idhā ʿāhadttum walā tanquḍū l-aymāna baʿda tawkīdihā waqad jaʿaltumu l-laha ʿalaykum kafīlan inna l-laha yaʿlamu mā tafʿalūna', 'তোমরা পরস্পর অঙ্গীকারে আবদ্ধ হলে আল্লাহর অঙ্গীকার পূর্ণ করবে, নিজেদের অঙ্গীকার পাকা-পোখত করার পর তা ভঙ্গ করো না, যেহেতু তোমরা আল্লাহকে নিজেদের উপর সাক্ষী বানিয়ে নিয়েছ, তোমরা যা কর আল্লাহ সে সম্পর্কে ওয়াকেফহাল।', 'And fulfill the covenant of Allah when you have taken it, [O believers], and do not break oaths after their confirmation while you have made Allah, over you, a witness. Indeed, Allah knows what you do.', 'তোমরা পরস্পর অঙ্গীকারে আবদ্ধ হলে আল্লাহর অঙ্গীকার পূর্ণ করবে, নিজেদের অঙ্গীকার পাকা-পোখত করার পর তা ভঙ্গ করো না, যেহেতু তোমরা আল্লাহকে নিজেদের উপর সাক্ষী বানিয়ে নিয়েছ, তোমরা যা কর আল্লাহ সে সম্পর্কে ওয়াকেফহাল।', 'And fulfill the covenant of Allah when you have taken it, [O believers], and do not break oaths after their confirmation while you have made Allah, over you, a witness. Indeed, Allah knows what you do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016091.mp3', now()),
