rb)"},{"id":74767,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"يَصْنَعُونَ","transliteration":"yaṣnaʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা করতে","root":"صنع","lemma":"صَنَعُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74768,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"١١٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১২)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waḍaraba l-lahu mathalan qaryatan kānat āminatan muṭ''ma-innatan yatīhā riz''quhā raghadan min kulli makānin fakafarat bi-anʿumi l-lahi fa-adhāqahā l-lahu libāsa l-jūʿi wal-khawfi bimā kānū yaṣnaʿūna', 'আল্লাহ এক জনবসতির দৃষ্টান্ত পেশ করছেন যা ছিল নিরাপদ, চিন্তা-ভাবনাহীন। সবখান থেকে সেখানে আসত জীবন ধারণের পর্যাপ্ত উপকরণ। অতঃপর সে জনপদ আল্লাহর নি‘মাতরাজির কুফুরী করল, অতঃপর আল্লাহ তাদের কৃতকর্মের কারণে ক্ষুধা ও ভয়-ভীতির মুসীবাত তাদেরকে আস্বাদন করালেন।', 'And Allah presents an example: a city which was safe and secure, its provision coming to it in abundance from every location, but it denied the favors of Allah. So Allah made it taste the envelopment of hunger and fear for what they had been doing.', 'আল্লাহ এক জনবসতির দৃষ্টান্ত পেশ করছেন যা ছিল নিরাপদ, চিন্তা-ভাবনাহীন। সবখান থেকে সেখানে আসত জীবন ধারণের পর্যাপ্ত উপকরণ। অতঃপর সে জনপদ আল্লাহর নি‘মাতরাজির কুফুরী করল, অতঃপর আল্লাহ তাদের কৃতকর্মের কারণে ক্ষুধা ও ভয়-ভীতির মুসীবাত তাদেরকে আস্বাদন করালেন।', 'And Allah presents an example: a city which was safe and secure, its provision coming to it in abundance from every location, but it denied the favors of Allah. So Allah made it taste the envelopment of hunger and fear for what they had been doing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016112.mp3', now()),
  (16, 113, '', '[{"id":74903,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74904,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَهُمْ","transliteration":"jāahum","translation_bn":"কাছে এসেছিলো তাদের","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74905,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولٌۭ","transliteration":"rasūlun","translation_bn":"একজন রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74906,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"মধ্য থেকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74907,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَكَذَّبُوهُ","transliteration":"fakadhabūhu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তাকে তারা মিথ্যারোপ করলো","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74908,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَأَخَذَهُمُ","transliteration":"fa-akhadhahumu","translation_bn":"তখন তাদেরকে ধরলো","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74909,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابُ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābu","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74910,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এমতাবস্হায় (যখন) তারা ছিলো","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":74911,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ظَـٰلِمُونَ","transliteration":"ẓālimūna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74912,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١١٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad jāahum rasūlun min''hum fakadhabūhu fa-akhadhahumu l-ʿadhābu wahum ẓālimūna', 'তাদের কাছে তাদের মধ্য হতেই রসূল এসেছিল কিন্তু তারা তাকে মিথ্যা মনে ক’রে প্রত্যাখ্যান করল, তখন শাস্তি তাদেরকে পাকড়াও করল যখন তারা ছিল সীমালঙ্ঘনে লিপ্ত।', 'And there had certainly come to them a Messenger from among themselves, but they denied him; so punishment overtook them while they were wrongdoers.', 'তাদের কাছে তাদের মধ্য হতেই রসূল এসেছিল কিন্তু তারা তাকে মিথ্যা মনে ক’রে প্রত্যাখ্যান করল, তখন শাস্তি তাদেরকে পাকড়াও করল যখন তারা ছিল সীমালঙ্ঘনে লিপ্ত।', 'And there had certainly come to them a Messenger from among themselves, but they denied him; so punishment overtook them while they were wrongdoers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016113.mp3', now()),
  (16, 114, '', '[{"id":75073,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَكُلُوا۟","transliteration":"fakulū","translation_bn":"সুতরাং তোমরা খাও","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75074,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75075,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَزَقَكُمُ","transliteration":"razaqakumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জীবিকা দিয়েছেন","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75076,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":75077,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"حَلَـٰلًۭا","transliteration":"ḥalālan","translation_bn":"হালাল","root":"حلل","lemma":"حَلَٰل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75078,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"طَيِّبًۭا","transliteration":"ṭayyiban","translation_bn":"পবিত্র","root":"طيب","lemma":"طَيِّب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":75079,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱشْكُرُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-ush''kurū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করো","root":"شكر","lemma":"شَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75080,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"نِعْمَتَ","transliteration":"niʿ''mata","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহসমূহের","root":"نعم","lemma":"نِعْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75081,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":75082,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":75083,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা হও","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75084,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِيَّاهُ","transliteration":"iyyāhu","translation_bn":"তাঁরই শুধু","root":"—","lemma":"إِيَّا","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":75085,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَعْبُدُونَ","transliteration":"taʿbudūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা ইবাদাত করে থাকো","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75086,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"١١٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fakulū mimmā razaqakumu l-lahu ḥalālan ṭayyiban wa-ush''kurū niʿ''mata l-lahi in kuntum iyyāhu taʿbudūna', 'কাজেই আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে যে সকল বৈধ পবিত্র রিযক দিয়েছেন তা তোমরা খাও আর আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহের শুকরিয়া আদায় কর যদি তোমরা প্রকৃতই তাঁর বন্দেগী করতে ইচ্ছুক হও।', 'Then eat of what Allah has provided for you [which is] lawful and good. And be grateful for the favor of Allah, if it is [indeed] Him that you worship.', 'কাজেই আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে যে সকল বৈধ পবিত্র রিযক দিয়েছেন তা তোমরা খাও আর আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহের শুকরিয়া আদায় কর যদি তোমরা প্রকৃতই তাঁর বন্দেগী করতে ইচ্ছুক হও।', 'Then eat of what Allah has provided for you [which is] lawful and good. And be grateful for the favor of Allah, if it is [indeed] Him that you worship.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016114.mp3', now()),
  (16, 115, '', '[{"id":75440,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"(আল্লাহ্‌) মূলতঃ","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":75441,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"حَرَّمَ","transliteration":"ḥarrama","translation_bn":"হারাম করেছেন","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75442,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمُ","transliteration":"ʿalaykumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75443,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَيْتَةَ","transliteration":"l-maytata","translation_bn":"মৃত (জন্তু)","root":"موت","lemma":"مَيْتَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75444,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلدَّمَ","transliteration":"wal-dama","translation_bn":"ও রক্ত","root":"دمو","lemma":"دَم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75445,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَحْمَ","transliteration":"walaḥma","translation_bn":"ও গোশতকে","root":"لحم","lemma":"لَحْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75446,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخِنزِيرِ","transliteration":"l-khinzīri","translation_bn":"শুকরের","root":"خنزر","lemma":"خِنزِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75447,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75448,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أُهِلَّ","transliteration":"uhilla","translation_bn":"নাম নেয়া হয়েছে","root":"هلل","lemma":"أُهِلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75449,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"lighayri","translation_bn":"জন্যে অন্যের","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75450,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌ ছাড়া","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":75451,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75453,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَمَنِ","transliteration":"famani","translation_bn":"তবে কেউ","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75454,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱضْطُرَّ","transliteration":"uḍ''ṭurra","translation_bn":"নিরুপায় হ''লে (খেতে)","root":"ضرر","lemma":"ٱضْطُرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75455,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرَ","transliteration":"ghayra","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75456,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بَاغٍۢ","transliteration":"bāghin","translation_bn":"বিদ্রোহী হওয়া","root":"بغي","lemma":"بَاغ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75457,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"কিংবা না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75458,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"عَادٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿādin","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী হয়ে","root":"عدو","lemma":"عَاد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75459,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّ","transliteration":"fa-inna","translation_bn":"তবে নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75460,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":75461,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":75462,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":75463,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"١١٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innamā ḥarrama ʿalaykumu l-maytata wal-dama walaḥma l-khinzīri wamā uhilla lighayri l-lahi bihi famani uḍ''ṭurra ghayra bāghin walā ʿādin fa-inna l-laha ghafūrun raḥīmun', 'আল্লাহ তোমাদের জন্য হারাম করেছেন মৃত জীব, রক্ত, শূকরের মাংস আর যা যবেহ করার সময় আল্লাহ ছাড়া অন্যের নাম নেয়া হয়েছে। কিন্তু কেউ ইচ্ছাকৃতভাবে অবাধ্য না হয়ে ও সীমালঙ্ঘন না ক’রে নিতান্ত নিরুপায় (হয়ে এসব খেতে বাধ্য) হলে আল্লাহ তো বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, বড়ই দয়ালু।', 'He has only forbidden to you dead animals, blood, the flesh of swine, and that which has been dedicated to other than Allah. But whoever is forced [by necessity], neither desiring [it] nor transgressing [its limit] - then indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', 'আল্লাহ তোমাদের জন্য হারাম করেছেন মৃত জীব, রক্ত, শূকরের মাংস আর যা যবেহ করার সময় আল্লাহ ছাড়া অন্যের নাম নেয়া হয়েছে। কিন্তু কেউ ইচ্ছাকৃতভাবে অবাধ্য না হয়ে ও সীমালঙ্ঘন না ক’রে নিতান্ত নিরুপায় (হয়ে এসব খেতে বাধ্য) হলে আল্লাহ তো বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, বড়ই দয়ালু।', 'He has only forbidden to you dead animals, blood, the flesh of swine, and that which has been dedicated to other than Allah. But whoever is forced [by necessity], neither desiring [it] nor transgressing [its limit] - then indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016115.mp3', now()),
  (16, 116, '', '[{"id":75692,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75693,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَقُولُوا۟","transliteration":"taqūlū","translation_bn":"তোমরা বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75694,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِمَا","transliteration":"limā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75695,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَصِفُ","transliteration":"taṣifu","translation_bn":"বর্ণনা করে","root":"وصف","lemma":"يَصِفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75696,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَلْسِنَتُكُمُ","transliteration":"alsinatukumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জিহবাসমূহ","root":"لسن","lemma":"لِسَان","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75697,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَذِبَ","transliteration":"l-kadhiba","translation_bn":"মিথ্যা","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذِب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75698,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"\"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":75699,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"حَلَـٰلٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥalālun","translation_bn":"হালাল","root":"حلل","lemma":"حَلَٰل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75700,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَهَـٰذَا","transliteration":"wahādhā","translation_bn":"এবং এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75701,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"حَرَامٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥarāmun","translation_bn":"হারাম\"","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75702,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لِّتَفْتَرُوا۟","transliteration":"litaftarū","translation_bn":"যাতে তোমরা রটাবে","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75703,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75704,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":75705,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَذِبَ ۚ","transliteration":"l-kadhiba","translation_bn":"মিথ্যা","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذِب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75707,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":75708,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":75709,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يَفْتَرُونَ","transliteration":"yaftarūna","translation_bn":"আরোপ করেছে","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75710,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75711,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":75712,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَذِبَ","transliteration":"l-kadhiba","translation_bn":"মিথ্যা","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذِب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75713,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":75714,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"يُفْلِحُونَ","transliteration":"yuf''liḥūna","translation_bn":"তারা সফলকাম হয়","root":"فلح","lemma":"أَفْلَحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75715,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"١١٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā taqūlū limā taṣifu alsinatukumu l-kadhiba hādhā ḥalālun wahādhā ḥarāmun litaftarū ʿalā l-lahi l-kadhiba inna alladhīna yaftarūna ʿalā l-lahi l-kadhiba lā yuf''liḥūna', 'তোমাদের জিহবা থেকে মিথ্যে কথা বেরোয় বলেই তোমরা আল্লাহর প্রতি মিথ্যারোপ করার জন্য এমন কথা বলো না যে, এটা হালাল, আর এটা হারাম। যারা আল্লাহ সম্পর্কে মিথ্যে উদ্ভাবন করে, তারা কক্ষনো কল্যাণ লাভ করতে পারে না।', 'And do not say about what your tongues assert of untruth, "This is lawful and this is unlawful," to invent falsehood about Allah. Indeed, those who invent falsehood about Allah will not succeed.', 'তোমাদের জিহবা থেকে মিথ্যে কথা বেরোয় বলেই তোমরা আল্লাহর প্রতি মিথ্যারোপ করার জন্য এমন কথা বলো না যে, এটা হালাল, আর এটা হারাম। যারা আল্লাহ সম্পর্কে মিথ্যে উদ্ভাবন করে, তারা কক্ষনো কল্যাণ লাভ করতে পারে না।', 'And do not say about what your tongues assert of untruth, "This is lawful and this is unlawful," to invent falsehood about Allah. Indeed, those who invent falsehood about Allah will not succeed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016116.mp3', now()),
  (16, 117, '', '[{"id":75729,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَتَـٰعٌۭ","transliteration":"matāʿun","translation_bn":"(দুনিয়ার) সুখ সম্ভোগ","root":"متع","lemma":"مَتَٰع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75730,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَلِيلٌۭ","transliteration":"qalīlun","translation_bn":"সামান্য","root":"قلل","lemma":"قَلِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":75731,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهُمْ","transliteration":"walahum","translation_bn":"এবং জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75732,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি (রয়েছে)","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75733,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"alīmun","translation_bn":"নিদারুণ","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":75734,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"١١٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'matāʿun qalīlun walahum ʿadhābun alīmun', '(এসব মিথ্যাচারে লাভ হয়) সামান্য ভোগের বস্তু, অতঃপর তাদের জন্য আছে ভয়াবহ শাস্তি।', '[It is but] a brief enjoyment, and they will have a painful punishment.', '(এসব মিথ্যাচারে লাভ হয়) সামান্য ভোগের বস্তু, অতঃপর তাদের জন্য আছে ভয়াবহ শাস্তি।', '[It is but] a brief enjoyment, and they will have a painful punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016117.mp3', now()),
  (16, 118, '', '[{"id":75920,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَعَلَى","transliteration":"waʿalā","translation_bn":"এবং উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75921,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":75922,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"هَادُوا۟","transliteration":"hādū","translation_bn":"ইহুদী হয়েছে","root":"هود","lemma":"هَادُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75923,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"حَرَّمْنَا","transliteration":"ḥarramnā","translation_bn":"আমরা হারাম করেছিলাম","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75924,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":75925,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَصَصْنَا","transliteration":"qaṣaṣnā","translation_bn":"আমরা উল্লেখ করেছি","root":"قصص","lemma":"قَصَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75926,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ʿalayka","translation_bn":"তোমার নিকট","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75927,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75928,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ ۖ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75930,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75931,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَمْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"ẓalamnāhum","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর আমরা নির্যাতন করেছি","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75932,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِن","transliteration":"walākin","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75933,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوٓا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75934,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسَهُمْ","transliteration":"anfusahum","translation_bn":"নিজেদের উপর তাদের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75935,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَظْلِمُونَ","transliteration":"yaẓlimūna","translation_bn":"অত্যাচার করতো","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75936,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"١١٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waʿalā alladhīna hādū ḥarramnā mā qaṣaṣnā ʿalayka min qablu wamā ẓalamnāhum walākin kānū anfusahum yaẓlimūna', 'আর যারা ইয়াহূদী হয়েছিল আমি তাদের প্রতি হারাম করেছিলাম যা আমি তোমার কাছে পূর্বেই উল্লেখ করেছি। আমি তাদের উপর কোন যুলম করিনি, কিন্তু তারা নিজেরাই নিজেদের প্রতি যুলম করত।', 'And to those who are Jews We have prohibited that which We related to you before. And We did not wrong them [thereby], but they were wronging themselves.', 'আর যারা ইয়াহূদী হয়েছিল আমি তাদের প্রতি হারাম করেছিলাম যা আমি তোমার কাছে পূর্বেই উল্লেখ করেছি। আমি তাদের উপর কোন যুলম করিনি, কিন্তু তারা নিজেরাই নিজেদের প্রতি যুলম করত।', 'And to those who are Jews We have prohibited that which We related to you before. And We did not wrong them [thereby], but they were wronging themselves.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016118.mp3', now()),
  (16, 119, '', '[{"id":76227,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76228,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":76229,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّكَ","transliteration":"rabbaka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76230,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) জন্য যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76231,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"ʿamilū","translation_bn":"কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76232,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسُّوٓءَ","transliteration":"l-sūa","translation_bn":"মন্দ","root":"سوا","lemma":"سُو^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76233,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِجَهَـٰلَةٍۢ","transliteration":"bijahālatin","translation_bn":"বশতঃ অজ্ঞতা","root":"جهل","lemma":"جَهَٰلَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76234,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76235,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَابُوا۟","transliteration":"tābū","translation_bn":"তারা তওবা করেছে","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76236,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76237,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِ","transliteration":"baʿdi","translation_bn":"পর","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76238,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":76239,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَأَصْلَحُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wa-aṣlaḥū","translation_bn":"ও সংশোধন করেছে","root":"صلح","lemma":"أَصْلَحَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76240,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":76241,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّكَ","transliteration":"rabbaka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76242,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76243,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِهَا","transliteration":"baʿdihā","translation_bn":"এর পর","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76244,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"لَغَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"laghafūrun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":76245,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":76246,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"١١٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma inna rabbaka lilladhīna ʿamilū l-sūa bijahālatin thumma tābū min baʿdi dhālika wa-aṣlaḥū inna rabbaka min baʿdihā laghafūrun raḥīmun', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক তাদের জন্য যারা অজ্ঞতার কারণে খারাপ কাজ করে, অতঃপর তাওবাহ করে ও নিজেদের ‘আমাল সংশোধন করে, তোমার প্রতিপালক তাদের জন্য অবশ্যই বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, বড়ই দয়ালু।', 'Then, indeed your Lord, to those who have done wrong out of ignorance and then repent after that and correct themselves - indeed, your Lord, thereafter, is Forgiving and Merciful.', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক তাদের জন্য যারা অজ্ঞতার কারণে খারাপ কাজ করে, অতঃপর তাওবাহ করে ও নিজেদের ‘আমাল সংশোধন করে, তোমার প্রতিপালক তাদের জন্য অবশ্যই বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, বড়ই দয়ালু।', 'Then, indeed your Lord, to those who have done wrong out of ignorance and then repent after that and correct themselves - indeed, your Lord, thereafter, is Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016119.mp3', now()),
  (16, 120, '', '[{"id":76339,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":76340,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","transliteration":"ib''rāhīma","translation_bn":"ইবরাহীম","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":76341,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76342,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أُمَّةًۭ","transliteration":"ummatan","translation_bn":"এক সম্প্রদায় (প্রতীক)","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76343,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَانِتًۭا","transliteration":"qānitan","translation_bn":"অনুগত","root":"قنت","lemma":"قَانِت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76344,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِّلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76345,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"حَنِيفًۭا","transliteration":"ḥanīfan","translation_bn":"একনিষ্ঠ","root":"حنف","lemma":"حَنِيف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76346,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمْ","transliteration":"walam","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76347,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَكُ","transliteration":"yaku","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76348,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76349,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","transliteration":"l-mush''rikīna","translation_bn":"মুশরিকদের","root":"شرك","lemma":"مُشْرِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76350,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١٢٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna ib''rāhīma kāna ummatan qānitan lillahi ḥanīfan walam yaku mina l-mush''rikīna', 'ইবরাহীম ছিল আল্লাহর প্রতি বিনয়াবনত একনিষ্ঠ এক উম্মাত, আর সে মুশরিকদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত ছিল না।', 'Indeed, Abraham was a [comprehensive] leader, devoutly obedient to Allah, inclining toward truth, and he was not of those who associate others with Allah.', 'ইবরাহীম ছিল আল্লাহর প্রতি বিনয়াবনত একনিষ্ঠ এক উম্মাত, আর সে মুশরিকদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত ছিল না।', 'Indeed, Abraham was a [comprehensive] leader, devoutly obedient to Allah, inclining toward truth, and he was not of those who associate others with Allah.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016120.mp3', now()),
  (16, 121, '', '[{"id":76601,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"شَاكِرًۭا","transliteration":"shākiran","translation_bn":"কৃতজ্ঞ","root":"شكر","lemma":"شَاكِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76602,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لِّأَنْعُمِهِ ۚ","transliteration":"li-anʿumihi","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাঁর অনুগ্রহসমূহের","root":"نعم","lemma":"نِعْمَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76604,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱجْتَبَىٰهُ","transliteration":"ij''tabāhu","translation_bn":"(আল্লাহ্‌) তাকে মনোনীত করেছিলেন","root":"جبي","lemma":"ٱجْتَبَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76605,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَهَدَىٰهُ","transliteration":"wahadāhu","translation_bn":"ও তাকে পরিচালিত করেছিলেন","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76606,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76607,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"صِرَٰطٍۢ","transliteration":"ṣirāṭin","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"صرط","lemma":"صِرَٰط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76608,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"mus''taqīmin","translation_bn":"সরল সঠিক","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّسْتَقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76609,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"١٢١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'shākiran li-anʿumihi ij''tabāhu wahadāhu ilā ṣirāṭin mus''taqīmin', 'সে ছিল আল্লাহর নি‘মাতরাজির জন্য শোকরগুযার। আল্লাহ তাকে বেছে নিয়েছিলেন আর তাকে সরল সঠিক পথ দেখিয়েছিলেন।', '[He was] grateful for His favors. Allah chose him and guided him to a straight path.', 'সে ছিল আল্লাহর নি‘মাতরাজির জন্য শোকরগুযার। আল্লাহ তাকে বেছে নিয়েছিলেন আর তাকে সরল সঠিক পথ দেখিয়েছিলেন।', '[He was] grateful for His favors. Allah chose him and guided him to a straight path.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016121.mp3', now()),
  (16, 122, '', '[{"id":76762,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَءَاتَيْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"waātaynāhu","translation_bn":"এবং তাকে আমরা দিয়েছিলাম","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76763,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76764,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"দুনিয়ার","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76765,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"حَسَنَةًۭ ۖ","transliteration":"ḥasanatan","translation_bn":"কল্যাণ","root":"حسن","lemma":"حَسَنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76767,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"wa-innahu","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই সে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76768,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76769,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","translation_bn":"আখেরাতে (হবে)","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76770,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَمِنَ","transliteration":"lamina","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":76771,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥīna","translation_bn":"সৎকর্মশীলদের","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76772,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١٢٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waātaynāhu fī l-dun''yā ḥasanatan wa-innahu fī l-ākhirati lamina l-ṣāliḥīna', 'আমি তাকে দুনিয়াতে কল্যাণ দান করেছিলাম, আর আখেরাতেও সে অবশ্যই সৎকর্মশীলদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত।', 'And We gave him good in this world, and indeed, in the Hereafter he will be among the righteous.', 'আমি তাকে দুনিয়াতে কল্যাণ দান করেছিলাম, আর আখেরাতেও সে অবশ্যই সৎকর্মশীলদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত।', 'And We gave him good in this world, and indeed, in the Hereafter he will be among the righteous.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016122.mp3', now()),
  (16, 123, '', '[{"id":76849,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76850,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَوْحَيْنَآ","transliteration":"awḥaynā","translation_bn":"আমরা ওহী করেছি","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76851,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"তোমার প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76852,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَنِ","transliteration":"ani","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":76853,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّبِعْ","transliteration":"ittabiʿ","translation_bn":"\"অনুসরণ করো","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76854,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِلَّةَ","transliteration":"millata","translation_bn":"মিল্লাতের (আদর্শের)","root":"ملل","lemma":"مِلَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76855,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","transliteration":"ib''rāhīma","translation_bn":"ইবরাহীমের","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":76856,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"حَنِيفًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"ḥanīfan","translation_bn":"একনিষ্ঠভাবে","root":"حنف","lemma":"حَنِيف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76858,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76859,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"সে ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76860,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76861,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","transliteration":"l-mush''rikīna","translation_bn":"মুশরিকদের\"","root":"شرك","lemma":"مُشْرِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76862,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١٢٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma awḥaynā ilayka ani ittabiʿ millata ib''rāhīma ḥanīfan wamā kāna mina l-mush''rikīna', 'অতঃপর তোমার প্রতি ওয়াহী করছি যে, তুমি একনিষ্ঠ ইবরাহীমের মতাদর্শ অনুসরণ কর; আর সে তো মুশরিকদের দলভুক্ত ছিল না।', 'Then We revealed to you, [O Muhammad], to follow the religion of Abraham, inclining toward truth; and he was not of those who associate with Allah.', 'অতঃপর তোমার প্রতি ওয়াহী করছি যে, তুমি একনিষ্ঠ ইবরাহীমের মতাদর্শ অনুসরণ কর; আর সে তো মুশরিকদের দলভুক্ত ছিল না।', 'Then We revealed to you, [O Muhammad], to follow the religion of Abraham, inclining toward truth; and he was not of those who associate with Allah.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016123.mp3', now()),
  (16, 124, '', '[{"id":77082,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"প্রকৃতপক্ষে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":77083,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جُعِلَ","transliteration":"juʿila","translation_bn":"বাধ্যতামূলক করা হয়েছিলো","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77084,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّبْتُ","transliteration":"l-sabtu","translation_bn":"শনিবার","root":"سبت","lemma":"سَّبْت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77085,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77086,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":77087,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱخْتَلَفُوا۟","transliteration":"ikh''talafū","translation_bn":"মতভেদ করেছিলো","root":"خلف","lemma":"ٱخْتَلَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77088,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ ۚ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77090,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ","transliteration":"wa-inna","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77091,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّكَ","transliteration":"rabbaka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77092,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَيَحْكُمُ","transliteration":"layaḥkumu","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই মীমাংসা করে দিবেন","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكَمَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":77093,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُمْ","transliteration":"baynahum","translation_bn":"তাদের মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":77094,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77095,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77096,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فِيمَا","transliteration":"fīmā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77097,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77098,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77099,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يَخْتَلِفُونَ","transliteration":"yakhtalifūna","translation_bn":"মতভেদ করতো","root":"خلف","lemma":"ٱخْتَلَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77100,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"١٢٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innamā juʿila l-sabtu ʿalā alladhīna ikh''talafū fīhi wa-inna rabbaka layaḥkumu baynahum yawma l-qiyāmati fīmā kānū fīhi yakhtalifūna', '‘শনিবার পালন’ তো তাদের উপর চাপিয়ে দেয়া হয়েছিল যারা এর নিয়ম পালনে মতভেদ করেছিল। যে বিষয়ে তারা মতভেদ করত তোমার প্রতিপালক ক্বিয়ামাতের দিন সে বিষয়ে অবশ্যই তাদের মধ্যে ফায়সালা করে দেবেন।', 'The sabbath was only appointed for those who differed over it. And indeed, your Lord will judge between them on the Day of Resurrection concerning that over which they used to differ.', '‘শনিবার পালন’ তো তাদের উপর চাপিয়ে দেয়া হয়েছিল যারা এর নিয়ম পালনে মতভেদ করেছিল। যে বিষয়ে তারা মতভেদ করত তোমার প্রতিপালক ক্বিয়ামাতের দিন সে বিষয়ে অবশ্যই তাদের মধ্যে ফায়সালা করে দেবেন।', 'The sabbath was only appointed for those who differed over it. And indeed, your Lord will judge between them on the Day of Resurrection concerning that over which they used to differ.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016124.mp3', now()),
  (16, 125, '', '[{"id":77245,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱدْعُ","transliteration":"ud''ʿu","translation_bn":"তুমি আহবান করো","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77246,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77247,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77248,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77249,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْحِكْمَةِ","transliteration":"bil-ḥik''mati","translation_bn":"সাথে প্রজ্ঞার","root":"حكم","lemma":"حِكْمَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77250,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمَوْعِظَةِ","transliteration":"wal-mawʿiẓati","translation_bn":"ও উপদেশ","root":"وعظ","lemma":"مَّوْعِظَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77251,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَسَنَةِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-ḥasanati","translation_bn":"উত্তম (দ্বারা)","root":"حسن","lemma":"حَسَنَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77253,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَجَـٰدِلْهُم","transliteration":"wajādil''hum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের যুক্তি দাও","root":"جدل","lemma":"جَٰدَلُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77254,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلَّتِى","transliteration":"bi-allatī","translation_bn":"উপায়ে এমন","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77255,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"هِىَ","transliteration":"hiya","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"هِىَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":77256,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَحْسَنُ ۚ","transliteration":"aḥsanu","translation_bn":"অতি উত্তম","root":"حسن","lemma":"أَحْسَن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77258,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":77259,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّكَ","transliteration":"rabbaka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77260,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":77261,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"aʿlamu","translation_bn":"খুব জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"أَعْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77262,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بِمَن","transliteration":"biman","translation_bn":"সম্বন্ধে (তার) যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77263,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ضَلَّ","transliteration":"ḍalla","translation_bn":"ভ্রষ্ট হয়েছে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77264,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77265,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"sabīlihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77267,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77268,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"aʿlamu","translation_bn":"খুব জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"أَعْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77269,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْمُهْتَدِينَ","transliteration":"bil-muh''tadīna","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে সৎপথপ্রাপ্তদের","root":"هدي","lemma":"مُّهْتَدُون","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77270,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"١٢٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ud''ʿu ilā sabīli rabbika bil-ḥik''mati wal-mawʿiẓati l-ḥasanati wajādil''hum bi-allatī hiya aḥsanu inna rabbaka huwa aʿlamu biman ḍalla ʿan sabīlihi wahuwa aʿlamu bil-muh''tadīna', 'জ্ঞান-বুদ্ধি আর উত্তম উপদেশের মাধ্যমে তুমি (মানুষকে) তোমার প্রতিপালকের পথে আহবান জানাও আর লোকেদের সাথে বিতর্ক কর এমন পন্থায় যা অতি উত্তম। তোমার প্রতিপালক ভালভাবেই জানেন কে তাঁর পথ ছেড়ে গুমরাহ হয়ে গেছে। আর কে সঠিক পথে আছে তাও তিনি বেশি জানেন।', 'Invite to the way of your Lord with wisdom and good instruction, and argue with them in a way that is best. Indeed, your Lord is most knowing of who has strayed from His way, and He is most knowing of who is [rightly] guided.', 'জ্ঞান-বুদ্ধি আর উত্তম উপদেশের মাধ্যমে তুমি (মানুষকে) তোমার প্রতিপালকের পথে আহবান জানাও আর লোকেদের সাথে বিতর্ক কর এমন পন্থায় যা অতি উত্তম। তোমার প্রতিপালক ভালভাবেই জানেন কে তাঁর পথ ছেড়ে গুমরাহ হয়ে গেছে। আর কে সঠিক পথে আছে তাও তিনি বেশি জানেন।', 'Invite to the way of your Lord with wisdom and good instruction, and argue with them in a way that is best. Indeed, your Lord is most knowing of who has strayed from His way, and He is most knowing of who is [rightly] guided.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016125.mp3', now()),
  (16, 126, '', '[{"id":77390,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنْ","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77391,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَاقَبْتُمْ","transliteration":"ʿāqabtum","translation_bn":"তোমরা প্রতিশোধ নাও","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَاقَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77392,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَعَاقِبُوا۟","transliteration":"faʿāqibū","translation_bn":"তবে তোমরা প্রতিশোধ নিবে","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَاقَبَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77393,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِمِثْلِ","transliteration":"bimith''li","translation_bn":"সমান","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77394,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(তার) যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":77395,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عُوقِبْتُم","transliteration":"ʿūqib''tum","translation_bn":"কষ্ট দেয়া হয়েছে তোমাদের","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَاقَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77396,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তার সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77398,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَئِن","transliteration":"wala-in","translation_bn":"কিন্তু অবশ্যই যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77399,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"صَبَرْتُمْ","transliteration":"ṣabartum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ধৈর্য ধরো","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77400,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَهُوَ","transliteration":"lahuwa","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তা","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":77401,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77402,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِّلصَّـٰبِرِينَ","transliteration":"lilṣṣābirīna","translation_bn":"জন্যে ধৈর্যশীলদের","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَابِر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77403,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١٢٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-in ʿāqabtum faʿāqibū bimith''li mā ʿūqib''tum bihi wala-in ṣabartum lahuwa khayrun lilṣṣābirīna', 'যদি তোমরা প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণ করতে চাও তবে ততটুকু প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণ কর যতটুকু অন্যায় তোমাদের উপর করা হয়েছে। আর যদি তোমরা ধৈর্য ধারণ কর তবে ধৈর্যধারণকারীদের জন্য অবশ্যই তা উত্তম।', 'And if you punish [an enemy, O believers], punish with an equivalent of that with which you were harmed. But if you are patient - it is better for those who are patient.', 'যদি তোমরা প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণ করতে চাও তবে ততটুকু প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণ কর যতটুকু অন্যায় তোমাদের উপর করা হয়েছে। আর যদি তোমরা ধৈর্য ধারণ কর তবে ধৈর্যধারণকারীদের জন্য অবশ্যই তা উত্তম।', 'And if you punish [an enemy, O believers], punish with an equivalent of that with which you were harmed. But if you are patient - it is better for those who are patient.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016126.mp3', now()),
  (16, 127, '', '[{"id":77569,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱصْبِرْ","transliteration":"wa-iṣ''bir","translation_bn":"আর তুমি ধৈর্য ধরো","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77570,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77571,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"صَبْرُكَ","transliteration":"ṣabruka","translation_bn":"তোমার ধৈর্য (সম্ভব)","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77572,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":77573,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"সাহায্য আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77575,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77576,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَحْزَنْ","transliteration":"taḥzan","translation_bn":"দুঃখ করো","root":"حزن","lemma":"يَحْزُن","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77577,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"কারণে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77578,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77579,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"تَكُ","transliteration":"taku","translation_bn":"তুমি হয়ো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77580,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77581,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ضَيْقٍۢ","transliteration":"ḍayqin","translation_bn":"সংকীর্ণতার","root":"ضيق","lemma":"ضَيْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77582,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা থেকে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77583,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَمْكُرُونَ","transliteration":"yamkurūna","translation_bn":"তারা ষড়যন্ত্র করছে","root":"مكر","lemma":"مَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77584,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-iṣ''bir wamā ṣabruka illā bil-lahi walā taḥzan ʿalayhim walā taku fī ḍayqin mimmā yamkurūna', 'তুমি ধৈর্য ধারণ কর, তোমার ধৈর্য তো কেবল আল্লাহ ব্যতীত নয়, ওদের কার্যকলাপে তুমি দুঃখিত হয়ো না, আর ওদের ষড়যন্ত্র করার কারণে অন্তরে কুণ্ঠাবোধ করো না।', 'And be patient, [O Muhammad], and your patience is not but through Allah. And do not grieve over them and do not be in distress over what they conspire.', 'তুমি ধৈর্য ধারণ কর, তোমার ধৈর্য তো কেবল আল্লাহ ব্যতীত নয়, ওদের কার্যকলাপে তুমি দুঃখিত হয়ো না, আর ওদের ষড়যন্ত্র করার কারণে অন্তরে কুণ্ঠাবোধ করো না।', 'And be patient, [O Muhammad], and your patience is not but through Allah. And do not grieve over them and do not be in distress over what they conspire.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016127.mp3', now()),
  (16, 128, '', '[{"id":77674,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":77675,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":77676,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَعَ","transliteration":"maʿa","translation_bn":"সাথে (আছেন)","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":77677,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":77678,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّقَوا۟","transliteration":"ittaqaw","translation_bn":"তাকওয়া অবলম্বন করে","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77679,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَّٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77680,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هُم","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُم","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":77681,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مُّحْسِنُونَ","transliteration":"muḥ''sinūna","translation_bn":"সৎকর্মপরায়ণ","root":"حسن","lemma":"مُحْسِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77682,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"١٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna l-laha maʿa alladhīna ittaqaw wa-alladhīna hum muḥ''sinūna', 'যারা তাক্বওয়া অবলম্বন করে আর সৎকর্মশীল, আল্লাহ তো তাদেরই সঙ্গে আছেন।', 'Indeed, Allah is with those who fear Him and those who are doers of good.', 'যারা তাক্বওয়া অবলম্বন করে আর সৎকর্মশীল, আল্লাহ তো তাদেরই সঙ্গে আছেন।', 'Indeed, Allah is with those who fear Him and those who are doers of good.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/016128.mp3', now())
