:"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":70329,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"كُلَّمَا","transliteration":"kullamā","translation_bn":"যখনই","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلَّمَا","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":70330,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"خَبَتْ","transliteration":"khabat","translation_bn":"তেজ কমে আসবে","root":"خبو","lemma":"خَبَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70331,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"زِدْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"zid''nāhum","translation_bn":"আমরা বাড়িয়ে দিবো তাদের","root":"زيد","lemma":"زَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70332,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"سَعِيرًۭا","transliteration":"saʿīran","translation_bn":"আগুন","root":"سعر","lemma":"سَعِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70333,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٩٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waman yahdi l-lahu fahuwa l-muh''tadi waman yuḍ''lil falan tajida lahum awliyāa min dūnihi wanaḥshuruhum yawma l-qiyāmati ʿalā wujūhihim ʿum''yan wabuk''man waṣumman mawāhum jahannamu kullamā khabat zid''nāhum saʿīran', 'আল্লাহ যাকে সঠিক পথে পরিচালিত করেন সে পথপ্রাপ্ত আর যাদেরকে তিনি পথভ্রষ্ট করেন, তুমি কক্ষনো তাদের জন্য তাঁকে ছাড়া অন্য কাউকে অভিভাবক পাবে না। ক্বিয়ামাতের দিন আমি তাদেরকে একত্রিত করব তাদের মুখের ভরে অন্ধ, বোবা ও বধির অবস্থায়। তাদের আবাস হচ্ছে জাহান্নাম। যখনই তার আগুন নিস্তেজ হয়ে আসবে, আমি তাদের জন্য অগ্নির দহন শক্তি বৃদ্ধি করে দেব।', 'And whoever Allah guides - he is the [rightly] guided; and whoever He sends astray - you will never find for them protectors besides Him, and We will gather them on the Day of Resurrection [fallen] on their faces - blind, dumb and deaf. Their refuge is Hell; every time it subsides We increase them in blazing fire.', 'আল্লাহ যাকে সঠিক পথে পরিচালিত করেন সে পথপ্রাপ্ত আর যাদেরকে তিনি পথভ্রষ্ট করেন, তুমি কক্ষনো তাদের জন্য তাঁকে ছাড়া অন্য কাউকে অভিভাবক পাবে না। ক্বিয়ামাতের দিন আমি তাদেরকে একত্রিত করব তাদের মুখের ভরে অন্ধ, বোবা ও বধির অবস্থায়। তাদের আবাস হচ্ছে জাহান্নাম। যখনই তার আগুন নিস্তেজ হয়ে আসবে, আমি তাদের জন্য অগ্নির দহন শক্তি বৃদ্ধি করে দেব।', 'And whoever Allah guides - he is the [rightly] guided; and whoever He sends astray - you will never find for them protectors besides Him, and We will gather them on the Day of Resurrection [fallen] on their faces - blind, dumb and deaf. Their refuge is Hell; every time it subsides We increase them in blazing fire.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/017097.mp3', now()),
  (17, 98, '', '[{"id":70777,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটাই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":70778,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَزَآؤُهُم","transliteration":"jazāuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের প্রতিফল","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70779,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِأَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"bi-annahum","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70780,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70781,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"সহ আমাদের নিদর্শনাদি","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70782,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলেছে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70783,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَءِذَا","transliteration":"a-idhā","translation_bn":"\"কি যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":70784,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كُنَّا","transliteration":"kunnā","translation_bn":"আমরা হবো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70785,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عِظَـٰمًۭا","transliteration":"ʿiẓāman","translation_bn":"হাড়","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70786,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَرُفَـٰتًا","transliteration":"warufātan","translation_bn":"ও চূর্ণ-বিচূর্ণ","root":"رفت","lemma":"رُفَٰت","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70787,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَءِنَّا","transliteration":"a-innā","translation_bn":"কি নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":70788,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَمَبْعُوثُونَ","transliteration":"lamabʿūthūna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই উত্থিত হবো","root":"بعث","lemma":"مَّبْعُوثُون","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":70789,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"خَلْقًۭا","transliteration":"khalqan","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টিতে","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70790,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"جَدِيدًا","transliteration":"jadīdan","translation_bn":"নতুন\"","root":"جدد","lemma":"جَدِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":70791,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٩٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dhālika jazāuhum bi-annahum kafarū biāyātinā waqālū a-idhā kunnā ʿiẓāman warufātan a-innā lamabʿūthūna khalqan jadīdan', 'এটাই তাদের প্রতিফল, কেননা তারা আমার নিদর্শনসমূহ প্রত্যাখ্যান করেছিল আর বলেছিল, ‘যখন আমরা হাড্ডি ও চূর্ণ ধূলায় পরিণত হব তখনও কি আমাদেরকে নতুন এক সৃষ্টির আকারে আবার উঠানো হবে?’', 'That is their recompense because they disbelieved in Our verses and said, "When we are bones and crumbled particles, will we [truly] be resurrected [in] a new creation?"', 'এটাই তাদের প্রতিফল, কেননা তারা আমার নিদর্শনসমূহ প্রত্যাখ্যান করেছিল আর বলেছিল, ‘যখন আমরা হাড্ডি ও চূর্ণ ধূলায় পরিণত হব তখনও কি আমাদেরকে নতুন এক সৃষ্টির আকারে আবার উঠানো হবে?’', 'That is their recompense because they disbelieved in Our verses and said, "When we are bones and crumbled particles, will we [truly] be resurrected [in] a new creation?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/017098.mp3', now()),
  (17, 99, '', '[{"id":70886,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ أَوَلَمْ","transliteration":"awalam","translation_bn":"কি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":70887,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَرَوْا۟","transliteration":"yaraw","translation_bn":"তারা লক্ষ্য করে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70888,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":70889,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":70890,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"(তিনি) যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":70891,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقَ","transliteration":"khalaqa","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70892,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশসমূহকে","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70893,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীকে","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70894,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قَادِرٌ","transliteration":"qādirun","translation_bn":"সক্ষম (নন কি)","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَادِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70895,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70896,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":70897,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَخْلُقَ","transliteration":"yakhluqa","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করবেন","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70898,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِثْلَهُمْ","transliteration":"mith''lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের অনুরূপ","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70899,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلَ","transliteration":"wajaʿala","translation_bn":"এবং স্থির করে রেখেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70900,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70901,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَجَلًۭا","transliteration":"ajalan","translation_bn":"নির্দিষ্টকাল","root":"اجل","lemma":"أَجَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70902,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":70903,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"رَيْبَ","transliteration":"rayba","translation_bn":"কোনো সন্দেহ","root":"ريب","lemma":"رَيْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70904,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70905,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"فَأَبَى","transliteration":"fa-abā","translation_bn":"তবুও অস্বীকার করলো","root":"ابي","lemma":"أَبَى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70906,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimūna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীরা","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70907,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":70908,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"كُفُورًۭا","transliteration":"kufūran","translation_bn":"অস্বীকৃতি","root":"كفر","lemma":"كُفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70909,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"٩٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'awalam yaraw anna l-laha alladhī khalaqa l-samāwāti wal-arḍa qādirun ʿalā an yakhluqa mith''lahum wajaʿala lahum ajalan lā rayba fīhi fa-abā l-ẓālimūna illā kufūran', 'তারা কি লক্ষ্য করে না যে আল্লাহ- যিনি আসমানসমূহ ও যমীন সৃষ্টি করেছেন- তিনি তাদের মত মানুষ (পুনরায়) সৃষ্টি করতে সক্ষম। তিনি তাদের জন্য একটা সুনির্দিষ্ট সময় স্থির করেছেন, যাতে কোনই সন্দেহ নেই। কিন্তু যালিমরা অমান্য করে কেবল কুফরিই করল।', 'Do they not see that Allah, who created the heavens and earth, is [the one] Able to create the likes of them? And He has appointed for them a term, about which there is no doubt. But the wrongdoers refuse [anything] except disbelief.', 'তারা কি লক্ষ্য করে না যে আল্লাহ- যিনি আসমানসমূহ ও যমীন সৃষ্টি করেছেন- তিনি তাদের মত মানুষ (পুনরায়) সৃষ্টি করতে সক্ষম। তিনি তাদের জন্য একটা সুনির্দিষ্ট সময় স্থির করেছেন, যাতে কোনই সন্দেহ নেই। কিন্তু যালিমরা অমান্য করে কেবল কুফরিই করল।', 'Do they not see that Allah, who created the heavens and earth, is [the one] Able to create the likes of them? And He has appointed for them a term, about which there is no doubt. But the wrongdoers refuse [anything] except disbelief.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/017099.mp3', now()),
  (17, 100, '', '[{"id":71151,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُل","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71152,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَّوْ","transliteration":"law","translation_bn":"\"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":71153,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُمْ","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":71154,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَمْلِكُونَ","transliteration":"tamlikūna","translation_bn":"অধিকারী হ''তে","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَكَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71155,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"خَزَآئِنَ","transliteration":"khazāina","translation_bn":"ভান্ডারসমূহের","root":"خزن","lemma":"خَزَا^ئِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71156,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَحْمَةِ","transliteration":"raḥmati","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহের","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71157,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّىٓ","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71158,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِذًۭا","transliteration":"idhan","translation_bn":"তাহ''লে","root":"—","lemma":"إِذًا\r","grammar_bn":"আশ্চর্যসূচক (Surprise)"},{"id":71159,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَّأَمْسَكْتُمْ","transliteration":"la-amsaktum","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তোমরা ধরে রাখতে","root":"مسك","lemma":"أَمْسَكَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":71160,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"خَشْيَةَ","transliteration":"khashyata","translation_bn":"ভয়ে","root":"خشي","lemma":"خَشْيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71161,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِنفَاقِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-infāqi","translation_bn":"খরচ হওয়ার\"","root":"نفق","lemma":"إِنفَاق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71163,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং হলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71164,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-insānu","translation_bn":"মানুষ","root":"انس","lemma":"إِنسَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71165,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"قَتُورًۭا","transliteration":"qatūran","translation_bn":"বড়ই কৃপণ","root":"قتر","lemma":"قَتُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":71166,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٠٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul law antum tamlikūna khazāina raḥmati rabbī idhan la-amsaktum khashyata l-infāqi wakāna l-insānu qatūran', 'বল, ‘তোমরা যদি আমার প্রতিপালকের রাহমাতের ভান্ডারের মালিক হয়ে যেতে, তবুও খরচ হয়ে যাবার ভয়ে তোমরা তা অবশ্যই ধরে রাখতে।’ বাস্তবিকই মানুষ বড়ই সংকীর্ণ-চিত্ত।', 'Say [to them], "If you possessed the depositories of the mercy of my Lord, then you would withhold out of fear of spending." And ever has man been stingy.', 'বল, ‘তোমরা যদি আমার প্রতিপালকের রাহমাতের ভান্ডারের মালিক হয়ে যেতে, তবুও খরচ হয়ে যাবার ভয়ে তোমরা তা অবশ্যই ধরে রাখতে।’ বাস্তবিকই মানুষ বড়ই সংকীর্ণ-চিত্ত।', 'Say [to them], "If you possessed the depositories of the mercy of my Lord, then you would withhold out of fear of spending." And ever has man been stingy.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/017100.mp3', now()),
  (17, 101, '', '[{"id":71500,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71501,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْنَا","transliteration":"ātaynā","translation_bn":"আমরা দিয়েছিলাম","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71502,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":71503,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تِسْعَ","transliteration":"tis''ʿa","translation_bn":"নয়টি","root":"تسع","lemma":"تِسْع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71504,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتٍۭ","transliteration":"āyātin","translation_bn":"নিদর্শন","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71505,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ ۖ","transliteration":"bayyinātin","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":71507,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَسْـَٔلْ","transliteration":"fasal","translation_bn":"অতএব জিজ্ঞেস করো","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71508,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بَنِىٓ","transliteration":"banī","translation_bn":"বনী","root":"بني","lemma":"بُنَىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71509,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","transliteration":"is''rāīla","translation_bn":"ইসরাঈলকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِسْرَائِيل","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":71510,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":71511,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَهُمْ","transliteration":"jāahum","translation_bn":"কাছে সে এসেছিলো তাদের","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71512,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَقَالَ","transliteration":"faqāla","translation_bn":"তখন বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71513,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তাকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71514,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فِرْعَوْنُ","transliteration":"fir''ʿawnu","translation_bn":"ফিরআউন","root":"—","lemma":"فِرْعَوْن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":71515,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّى","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":71516,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَأَظُنُّكَ","transliteration":"la-aẓunnuka","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই আমি মনে করি তোমাকে","root":"ظنن","lemma":"ظَنَّ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":71517,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰمُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"yāmūsā","translation_bn":"হে মূসা","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":71518,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مَسْحُورًۭا","transliteration":"masḥūran","translation_bn":"জাদুগ্রস্ত\"","root":"سحر","lemma":"مَّسْحُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71519,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"١٠١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad ātaynā mūsā tis''ʿa āyātin bayyinātin fasal banī is''rāīla idh jāahum faqāla lahu fir''ʿawnu innī la-aẓunnuka yāmūsā masḥūran', 'আমি মূসাকে নয়টি স্পষ্ট নিদর্শন দিয়েছিলাম। বানী ইসরাঈলকে জিজ্ঞেস করে দেখ, যখন সে তাদের (অর্থাৎ ফির‘আওন ও তার প্রধানদের) নিকট আসল তখন ফির‘আওন তাকে বলল, ‘ওহে মূসা! আমি তোমাকে অবশ্যই যাদুগ্রস্ত মনে করি।’', 'And We had certainly given Moses nine evident signs, so ask the Children of Israel [about] when he came to them and Pharaoh said to him, "Indeed I think, O Moses, that you are affected by magic."', 'আমি মূসাকে নয়টি স্পষ্ট নিদর্শন দিয়েছিলাম। বানী ইসরাঈলকে জিজ্ঞেস করে দেখ, যখন সে তাদের (অর্থাৎ ফির‘আওন ও তার প্রধানদের) নিকট আসল তখন ফির‘আওন তাকে বলল, ‘ওহে মূসা! আমি তোমাকে অবশ্যই যাদুগ্রস্ত মনে করি।’', 'And We had certainly given Moses nine evident signs, so ask the Children of Israel [about] when he came to them and Pharaoh said to him, "Indeed I think, O Moses, that you are affected by magic."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/017101.mp3', now()),
  (17, 102, '', '[{"id":71894,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71895,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَقَدْ","transliteration":"laqad","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":71896,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلِمْتَ","transliteration":"ʿalim''ta","translation_bn":"তুমি জেনেছো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71897,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":71898,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلَ","transliteration":"anzala","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করেছেন","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71899,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","transliteration":"hāulāi","translation_bn":"(অন্য কেউ) এসব","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":71900,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":71901,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّ","transliteration":"rabbu","translation_bn":"রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71902,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশসমূহের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71903,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71904,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَصَآئِرَ","transliteration":"baṣāira","translation_bn":"প্রত্যক্ষ প্রমাণ হিসেবে","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِيرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71905,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنِّى","transliteration":"wa-innī","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71906,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَأَظُنُّكَ","transliteration":"la-aẓunnuka","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই মনে করি আমি তোমাকে","root":"ظنن","lemma":"ظَنَّ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":71907,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰفِرْعَوْنُ","transliteration":"yāfir''ʿawnu","translation_bn":"হে ফিরআউন","root":"—","lemma":"فِرْعَوْن","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":71908,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مَثْبُورًۭا","transliteration":"mathbūran","translation_bn":"(ধ্বংসকৃত) হতভাগ্য\"","root":"ثبر","lemma":"مَثْبُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71909,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"١٠٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla laqad ʿalim''ta mā anzala hāulāi illā rabbu l-samāwāti wal-arḍi baṣāira wa-innī la-aẓunnuka yāfir''ʿawnu mathbūran', 'মূসা বলল, ‘তুমি তো জান যে, এসব চোখ-খুলে-দেয়া নিদর্শন আসমানসমূহ ও যমীনের প্রতিপালক ছাড়া অন্য কেউ অবতীর্ণ করেনি, হে ফির‘আওন! আমি তো তোমাকে মনে করি এক ধ্বংসপ্রাপ্ত লোক।’', '[Moses] said, "You have already known that none has sent down these [signs] except the Lord of the heavens and the earth as evidence, and indeed I think, O Pharaoh, that you are destroyed."', 'মূসা বলল, ‘তুমি তো জান যে, এসব চোখ-খুলে-দেয়া নিদর্শন আসমানসমূহ ও যমীনের প্রতিপালক ছাড়া অন্য কেউ অবতীর্ণ করেনি, হে ফির‘আওন! আমি তো তোমাকে মনে করি এক ধ্বংসপ্রাপ্ত লোক।’', '[Moses] said, "You have already known that none has sent down these [signs] except the Lord of the heavens and the earth as evidence, and indeed I think, O Pharaoh, that you are destroyed."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/017102.mp3', now()),
  (17, 103, '', '[{"id":72399,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَأَرَادَ","transliteration":"fa-arāda","translation_bn":"অতঃপর সে চাইলো","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72400,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":72401,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَفِزَّهُم","transliteration":"yastafizzahum","translation_bn":"উচ্ছেদ করবে তাদেরকে","root":"فزز","lemma":"يَسْتَفِزَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72402,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72403,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"দেশ","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72404,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَأَغْرَقْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"fa-aghraqnāhu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর আমরা ডুবিয়েছিলাম তাকে","root":"غرق","lemma":"أُغْرِقُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72405,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যারা (ছিলো)","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72406,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَّعَهُۥ","transliteration":"maʿahu","translation_bn":"সাথে তার","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":72407,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"جَمِيعًۭا","transliteration":"jamīʿan","translation_bn":"সকলকে","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72408,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١٠٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-arāda an yastafizzahum mina l-arḍi fa-aghraqnāhu waman maʿahu jamīʿan', 'অতঃপর ফিরআউন তাদেরকে দুনিয়া থেকে সরিয়ে দিতে চাইল। তখন আমি তাকে আর তার সঙ্গী-সাথীদের সব্বাইকে ডুবিয়ে মারলাম।', 'So he intended to drive them from the land, but We drowned him and those with him all together.', 'অতঃপর ফিরআউন তাদেরকে দুনিয়া থেকে সরিয়ে দিতে চাইল। তখন আমি তাকে আর তার সঙ্গী-সাথীদের সব্বাইকে ডুবিয়ে মারলাম।', 'So he intended to drive them from the land, but We drowned him and those with him all together.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/017103.mp3', now()),
  (17, 104, '', '[{"id":72630,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقُلْنَا","transliteration":"waqul''nā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা বলেছিলাম","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72631,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72632,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِهِۦ","transliteration":"baʿdihi","translation_bn":"তারপর","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72633,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِبَنِىٓ","transliteration":"libanī","translation_bn":"জন্যে বনী","root":"بني","lemma":"بُنَىّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72634,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","transliteration":"is''rāīla","translation_bn":"ইসরাঈলের","root":"—","lemma":"إِسْرَائِيل","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":72635,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْكُنُوا۟","transliteration":"us''kunū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা বসবাস করো","root":"سكن","lemma":"سَكَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72636,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","transliteration":"l-arḍa","translation_bn":"এ দেশে","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72637,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَإِذَا","transliteration":"fa-idhā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72638,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"আসবে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72639,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَعْدُ","transliteration":"waʿdu","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72640,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","translation_bn":"আখিরাতের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72641,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"جِئْنَا","transliteration":"ji''nā","translation_bn":"আমরা আসবো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72642,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِكُمْ","transliteration":"bikum","translation_bn":"নিয়ে তোমাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"بِكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72643,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَفِيفًۭا","transliteration":"lafīfan","translation_bn":"সমবেত করে\"","root":"لفف","lemma":"لَفِيف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72644,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٠٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqul''nā min baʿdihi libanī is''rāīla us''kunū l-arḍa fa-idhā jāa waʿdu l-ākhirati ji''nā bikum lafīfan', 'এরপর আমি বানী ইসরাঈলকে বললাম, ‘তোমরা যমীনের উপর বসবাস কর, অতঃপর যখন প্রতিশ্রুত ক্বিয়ামাত আসবে তখন আমি তোমাদেরকে সংমিশ্রিত দলবলে হাজির করব।’', 'And We said after Pharaoh to the Children of Israel, "Dwell in the land, and when there comes the promise of the Hereafter, We will bring you forth in [one] gathering."', 'এরপর আমি বানী ইসরাঈলকে বললাম, ‘তোমরা যমীনের উপর বসবাস কর, অতঃপর যখন প্রতিশ্রুত ক্বিয়ামাত আসবে তখন আমি তোমাদেরকে সংমিশ্রিত দলবলে হাজির করব।’', 'And We said after Pharaoh to the Children of Israel, "Dwell in the land, and when there comes the promise of the Hereafter, We will bring you forth in [one] gathering."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/017104.mp3', now()),
  (17, 105, '', '[{"id":72726,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَبِٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"wabil-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"এবং সহ সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72727,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"anzalnāhu","translation_bn":"তা আমরা অবতীর্ণ করেছি","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72728,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَبِٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"wabil-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"এবং সহ সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72729,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"نَزَلَ ۗ","transliteration":"nazala","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে","root":"نزل","lemma":"نَزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72731,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নি","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72732,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَـٰكَ","transliteration":"arsalnāka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে আমরা পাঠিয়েছি","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72733,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":72734,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مُبَشِّرًۭا","transliteration":"mubashiran","translation_bn":"সুসংবাদদাতা হিসেবে","root":"بشر","lemma":"مُبَشِّر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72735,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَنَذِيرًۭا","transliteration":"wanadhīran","translation_bn":"ও সতর্ককারী হিসেবে","root":"نذر","lemma":"نَذِير","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72736,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١٠٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wabil-ḥaqi anzalnāhu wabil-ḥaqi nazala wamā arsalnāka illā mubashiran wanadhīran', 'এ কুরআনকে আমি সত্যতা সহকারে নাযিল করেছি আর সত্যতা সহকারেই তা নাযিল হয়েছে। আমি তোমাকে শুধু সুসংবাদদাতা ও সতর্ককারী হিসেবে পাঠিয়েছি।', 'And with the truth We have sent the Qur''an down, and with the truth it has descended. And We have not sent you, [O Muhammad], except as a bringer of good tidings and a warner.', 'এ কুরআনকে আমি সত্যতা সহকারে নাযিল করেছি আর সত্যতা সহকারেই তা নাযিল হয়েছে। আমি তোমাকে শুধু সুসংবাদদাতা ও সতর্ককারী হিসেবে পাঠিয়েছি।', 'And with the truth We have sent the Qur''an down, and with the truth it has descended. And We have not sent you, [O Muhammad], except as a bringer of good tidings and a warner.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/017105.mp3', now()),
  (17, 106, '', '[{"id":73004,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقُرْءَانًۭا","transliteration":"waqur''ānan","translation_bn":"এবং (এই) কুরআন","root":"قرا","lemma":"قُرْءَان","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73005,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فَرَقْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"faraqnāhu","translation_bn":"আমরা খন্ড খন্ড করেছি তাকে","root":"فرق","lemma":"فَرَقْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73006,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِتَقْرَأَهُۥ","transliteration":"litaqra-ahu","translation_bn":"যেন তুমি পাঠ করো তা","root":"قرا","lemma":"قَرَأَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73007,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"নিকট","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73008,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73009,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73010,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُكْثٍۢ","transliteration":"muk''thin","translation_bn":"অল্প অল্প করে","root":"مكث","lemma":"مُكْث","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73011,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَنَزَّلْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"wanazzalnāhu","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা অবতীর্ণ করেছি তা","root":"نزل","lemma":"نَزَّلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73012,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَنزِيلًۭا","transliteration":"tanzīlan","translation_bn":"(ক্রমশঃ) অবতরণ","root":"نزل","lemma":"تَنزِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73013,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١٠٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqur''ānan faraqnāhu litaqra-ahu ʿalā l-nāsi ʿalā muk''thin wanazzalnāhu tanzīlan', 'আমি এ কুরআনকে ভাগে ভাগে বিভক্ত করেছি যাতে তুমি থেমে থেমে মানুষকে তা পাঠ করে শুনাতে পার, কাজেই আমি তা ক্রমশঃ নাযিল করেছি।', 'And [it is] a Qur''an which We have separated [by intervals] that you might recite it to the people over a prolonged period. And We have sent it down progressively.', 'আমি এ কুরআনকে ভাগে ভাগে বিভক্ত করেছি যাতে তুমি থেমে থেমে মানুষকে তা পাঠ করে শুনাতে পার, কাজেই আমি তা ক্রমশঃ নাযিল করেছি।', 'And [it is] a Qur''an which We have separated [by intervals] that you might recite it to the people over a prolonged period. And We have sent it down progressively.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/017106.mp3', now()),
  (17, 107, '', '[{"id":73393,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73394,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَامِنُوا۟","transliteration":"āminū","translation_bn":"\"ঈমান আনো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73395,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"উপর এর","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦٓ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73396,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73397,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":73398,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تُؤْمِنُوٓا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"tu''minū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ঈমান আনো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73400,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":73401,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":73402,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أُوتُوا۟","transliteration":"ūtū","translation_bn":"দেয়া হয়েছে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73403,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعِلْمَ","transliteration":"l-ʿil''ma","translation_bn":"জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73404,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73405,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"qablihi","translation_bn":"পূর্ব এর","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73406,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":73407,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يُتْلَىٰ","transliteration":"yut''lā","translation_bn":"পাঠ করা হয়","root":"تلو","lemma":"تَلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73408,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"কাছে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73409,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَخِرُّونَ","transliteration":"yakhirrūna","translation_bn":"তারা লুটিয়ে পড়ে যায়","root":"خرر","lemma":"خَرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73410,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لِلْأَذْقَانِ","transliteration":"lil''adhqāni","translation_bn":"উপর চিবুকসমূহের","root":"ذقن","lemma":"أَذْقَان","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73411,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"سُجَّدًۭا","transliteration":"sujjadan","translation_bn":"সিজদা অবস্থায়\"","root":"سجد","lemma":"سَاجِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":73412,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"١٠٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul āminū bihi aw lā tu''minū inna alladhīna ūtū l-ʿil''ma min qablihi idhā yut''lā ʿalayhim yakhirrūna lil''adhqāni sujjadan', 'বল, ‘তোমরা কুরআনে বিশ্বাস কর কিংবা বিশ্বাস না কর, ইতোপূর্বে যাদেরকে জ্ঞান দেয়া হয়েছে তাদেরকে যখন কুরআন পাঠ করে শুনানো হয়, তখন তারা অধোমুখে সাজদাহয় লুটিয়ে পড়ে।’', 'Say, "Believe in it or do not believe. Indeed, those who were given knowledge before it - when it is recited to them, they fall upon their faces in prostration,', 'বল, ‘তোমরা কুরআনে বিশ্বাস কর কিংবা বিশ্বাস না কর, ইতোপূর্বে যাদেরকে জ্ঞান দেয়া হয়েছে তাদেরকে যখন কুরআন পাঠ করে শুনানো হয়, তখন তারা অধোমুখে সাজদাহয় লুটিয়ে পড়ে।’', 'Say, "Believe in it or do not believe. Indeed, those who were given knowledge before it - when it is recited to them, they fall upon their faces in prostration,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/017107.mp3', now()),
  (17, 108, '', '[{"id":73526,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"wayaqūlūna","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73527,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"سُبْحَـٰنَ","transliteration":"sub''ḥāna","translation_bn":"\"পবিত্র মহান","root":"سبح","lemma":"سُبْحَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73528,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّنَآ","transliteration":"rabbinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73529,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":73530,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73531,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَعْدُ","transliteration":"waʿdu","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73532,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّنَا","transliteration":"rabbinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73533,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَمَفْعُولًۭا","transliteration":"lamafʿūlan","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই কার্যকরী\"","root":"فعل","lemma":"مَفْعُول","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":73534,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"١٠٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayaqūlūna sub''ḥāna rabbinā in kāna waʿdu rabbinā lamafʿūlan', 'আর তারা বলে, ‘আমাদের রব্ব মহান, পবিত্র; আমাদের রব্বের ও‘য়াদা অবশ্যই পূর্ণ হবে।', 'And they say, "Exalted is our Lord! Indeed, the promise of our Lord has been fulfilled."', 'আর তারা বলে, ‘আমাদের রব্ব মহান, পবিত্র; আমাদের রব্বের ও‘য়াদা অবশ্যই পূর্ণ হবে।', 'And they say, "Exalted is our Lord! Indeed, the promise of our Lord has been fulfilled."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/017108.mp3', now()),
  (17, 109, '', '[{"id":73941,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَخِرُّونَ","transliteration":"wayakhirrūna","translation_bn":"এবং তারা লুটিয়ে পড়ে যায়","root":"خرر","lemma":"خَرَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73942,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لِلْأَذْقَانِ","transliteration":"lil''adhqāni","translation_bn":"(সিজদায়) উপর চিবুকসমূহের","root":"ذقن","lemma":"أَذْقَان","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73943,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَبْكُونَ","transliteration":"yabkūna","translation_bn":"তারা কাঁদতে থাকে","root":"بكي","lemma":"بَكَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73944,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَيَزِيدُهُمْ","transliteration":"wayazīduhum","translation_bn":"ও তাদের বৃদ্ধি করে","root":"زيد","lemma":"زَادَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73945,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"خُشُوعًۭا ۩","transliteration":"khushūʿan","translation_bn":"বিনয় অবস্থা (নিবিড় আনুগত্য)","root":"خشع","lemma":"خُشُوع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73947,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"١٠٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayakhirrūna lil''adhqāni yabkūna wayazīduhum khushūʿan', 'তারা কাঁদতে কাঁদতে অধোমুখে সাজদাহয় লুটিয়ে পড়ে আর তা তাদের বিনয় ও নম্রতা বাড়িয়ে দেয়।[সাজদাহ]', 'And they fall upon their faces weeping, and the Qur''an increases them in humble submission.', 'তারা কাঁদতে কাঁদতে অধোমুখে সাজদাহয় লুটিয়ে পড়ে আর তা তাদের বিনয় ও নম্রতা বাড়িয়ে দেয়।[সাজদাহ]', 'And they fall upon their faces weeping, and the Qur''an increases them in humble submission.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/017109.mp3', now()),
  (17, 110, '', '[{"id":74325,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلِ","transliteration":"quli","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74326,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱدْعُوا۟","transliteration":"id''ʿū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা ডাকো","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74327,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ (বলে)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":74328,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَوِ","transliteration":"awi","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74329,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱدْعُوا۟","transliteration":"id''ʿū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ডাক","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74330,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنَ ۖ","transliteration":"l-raḥmāna","translation_bn":"রহমান (বলে)","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74332,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَيًّۭا","transliteration":"ayyan","translation_bn":"যেই (নামেই)","root":"—","lemma":"أَىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74333,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যেই (নামেই)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":74334,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَدْعُوا۟","transliteration":"tadʿū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ডাকো","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74335,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَلَهُ","transliteration":"falahu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তাঁর আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فَلَهُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74336,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَسْمَآءُ","transliteration":"l-asmāu","translation_bn":"নামসমূহ","root":"سمو","lemma":"ٱسْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74337,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ḥus''nā","translation_bn":"সুন্দর","root":"حسن","lemma":"حُسْنَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74339,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74340,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"تَجْهَرْ","transliteration":"tajhar","translation_bn":"খুব উঁচু স্বর করো","root":"جهر","lemma":"جَهَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74341,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بِصَلَاتِكَ","transliteration":"biṣalātika","translation_bn":"তোমার সালাতে","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74342,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74343,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"تُخَافِتْ","transliteration":"tukhāfit","translation_bn":"খুব নিচু স্বর করো","root":"خفت","lemma":"تُخَافِتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74344,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"তাতে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74345,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَٱبْتَغِ","transliteration":"wa-ib''taghi","translation_bn":"এবং অবলম্বন করো","root":"بغي","lemma":"ٱبْتَغَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74346,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَ","transliteration":"bayna","translation_bn":"মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":74347,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":74348,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلًۭا","transliteration":"sabīlan","translation_bn":"মধ্য পথ\"","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74349,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"١١٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১০)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'quli id''ʿū l-laha awi id''ʿū l-raḥmāna ayyan mā tadʿū falahu l-asmāu l-ḥus''nā walā tajhar biṣalātika walā tukhāfit bihā wa-ib''taghi bayna dhālika sabīlan', 'বল, ‘তোমরা আল্লাহ নামে ডাকো বা রহমান নামে ডাকো, যে নামেই তাঁকে ডাকো না কেন (সবই ভাল) কেননা সকল সুন্দর নামই তো তাঁর।’ তোমার সলাতে স্বর উচ্চ করো না, আর তা খুব নীচুও করো না, এ দু’য়ের মধ্যবর্তী পথ অবলম্বন কর।', 'Say, "Call upon Allah or call upon the Most Merciful. Whichever [name] you call - to Him belong the best names." And do not recite [too] loudly in your prayer or [too] quietly but seek between that an [intermediate] way.', 'বল, ‘তোমরা আল্লাহ নামে ডাকো বা রহমান নামে ডাকো, যে নামেই তাঁকে ডাকো না কেন (সবই ভাল) কেননা সকল সুন্দর নামই তো তাঁর।’ তোমার সলাতে স্বর উচ্চ করো না, আর তা খুব নীচুও করো না, এ দু’য়ের মধ্যবর্তী পথ অবলম্বন কর।', 'Say, "Call upon Allah or call upon the Most Merciful. Whichever [name] you call - to Him belong the best names." And do not recite [too] loudly in your prayer or [too] quietly but seek between that an [intermediate] way.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/017110.mp3', now()),
  (17, 111, '', '[{"id":74490,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقُلِ","transliteration":"waquli","translation_bn":"এবং বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74491,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَمْدُ","transliteration":"l-ḥamdu","translation_bn":"\"সব প্রশংসাই","root":"حمد","lemma":"حَمْد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74492,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহ তা''লার","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74493,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":74494,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":74495,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّخِذْ","transliteration":"yattakhidh","translation_bn":"গ্রহণ করেন","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74496,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَدًۭا","transliteration":"waladan","translation_bn":"পুত্রসন্তান","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَلَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74497,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمْ","transliteration":"walam","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74498,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَكُن","transliteration":"yakun","translation_bn":"আছে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74499,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাঁর","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74500,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"شَرِيكٌۭ","transliteration":"sharīkun","translation_bn":"কোনো অংশীদার","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74501,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74502,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُلْكِ","transliteration":"l-mul''ki","translation_bn":"সার্বভৌমত্বে","root":"ملك","lemma":"مُلْك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74503,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمْ","transliteration":"walam","translation_bn":"এবং না (প্রয়োজন)","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74504,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَكُن","transliteration":"yakun","translation_bn":"আছে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74505,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাঁর","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74506,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَلِىٌّۭ","transliteration":"waliyyun","translation_bn":"কোনো অভিভাবক","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74507,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74508,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلذُّلِّ ۖ","transliteration":"l-dhuli","translation_bn":"(এমন কোন) দুর্বলতা","root":"ذلل","lemma":"ذُّلّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74510,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَكَبِّرْهُ","transliteration":"wakabbir''hu","translation_bn":"এবং তাঁর মাহাত্ম্য  ঘোষণা করো","root":"كبر","lemma":"كَبِّرْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74511,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"تَكْبِيرًۢا","transliteration":"takbīran","translation_bn":"(পূর্ণভাবে) মাহাত্ম্য\"","root":"كبر","lemma":"تَكْبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74512,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"١١١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১১)","root":"—","lemma":"١١١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waquli l-ḥamdu lillahi alladhī lam yattakhidh waladan walam yakun lahu sharīkun fī l-mul''ki walam yakun lahu waliyyun mina l-dhuli wakabbir''hu takbīran', 'বল, ‘সকল প্রশংসাই আল্লাহর যিনি সন্তান গ্রহণ করেন না, যাঁর শাসন-কর্তৃত্বে কোন অংশীদার নেই, দুর্দশাগ্রস্ত হওয়া থেকে বাঁচার জন্য যাঁর কোন অভিভাবকের প্রয়োজন হয় না। অতএব পূর্ণ শ্রেষ্ঠত্বে তাঁর শ্রেষ্ঠত্ব ঘোষণা কর।', 'And say, "Praise to Allah, who has not taken a son and has had no partner in [His] dominion and has no [need of a] protector out of weakness; and glorify Him with [great] glorification."', 'বল, ‘সকল প্রশংসাই আল্লাহর যিনি সন্তান গ্রহণ করেন না, যাঁর শাসন-কর্তৃত্বে কোন অংশীদার নেই, দুর্দশাগ্রস্ত হওয়া থেকে বাঁচার জন্য যাঁর কোন অভিভাবকের প্রয়োজন হয় না। অতএব পূর্ণ শ্রেষ্ঠত্বে তাঁর শ্রেষ্ঠত্ব ঘোষণা কর।', 'And say, "Praise to Allah, who has not taken a son and has had no partner in [His] dominion and has no [need of a] protector out of weakness; and glorify Him with [great] glorification."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/017111.mp3', now())
