,"grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59386,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٧٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭০)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla fa-ini ittabaʿtanī falā tasalnī ʿan shayin ḥattā uḥ''ditha laka min''hu dhik''ran', 'সে বলল, ‘আপনি যেহেতু আমার অনুসরণ করতেই চান, তাহলে আপনি আমাকে কোন ব্যাপারেই প্রশ্ন করবেন না যতক্ষণ না আমি নিজেই সে সম্পর্কে আপনাকে বলি।’', 'He said, "Then if you follow me, do not ask me about anything until I make to you about it mention."', 'সে বলল, ‘আপনি যেহেতু আমার অনুসরণ করতেই চান, তাহলে আপনি আমাকে কোন ব্যাপারেই প্রশ্ন করবেন না যতক্ষণ না আমি নিজেই সে সম্পর্কে আপনাকে বলি।’', 'He said, "Then if you follow me, do not ask me about anything until I make to you about it mention."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018070.mp3', now()),
  (18, 71, '', '[{"id":59848,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱنطَلَقَا","transliteration":"fa-inṭalaqā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর দু''জন চললো","root":"طلق","lemma":"ٱنطَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59849,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"এমনকি","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":59850,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":59851,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَكِبَا","transliteration":"rakibā","translation_bn":"দু''জন চড়লো","root":"ركب","lemma":"رَكِبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59852,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59853,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّفِينَةِ","transliteration":"l-safīnati","translation_bn":"একটি নৌকার","root":"سفن","lemma":"سَفِينَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59854,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"خَرَقَهَا ۖ","transliteration":"kharaqahā","translation_bn":"তা সে ফুটো করে দিলো","root":"خرق","lemma":"خَرَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59856,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(মূসা) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59857,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَخَرَقْتَهَا","transliteration":"akharaqtahā","translation_bn":"\"তা আপনি কি ফুটো করে দিলেন","root":"خرق","lemma":"خَرَقَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":59858,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِتُغْرِقَ","transliteration":"litugh''riqa","translation_bn":"জন্যে ডুবানোর","root":"غرق","lemma":"أُغْرِقُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59859,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلَهَا","transliteration":"ahlahā","translation_bn":"তার আরোহীদেরকে","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59860,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَقَدْ","transliteration":"laqad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":59861,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"جِئْتَ","transliteration":"ji''ta","translation_bn":"আপনি করে এসেছেন","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59862,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًٔا","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কাজ","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59863,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِمْرًۭا","transliteration":"im''ran","translation_bn":"গুরুতর\"","root":"امر","lemma":"إِمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":59864,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٧١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭১)","root":"—","lemma":"٧١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-inṭalaqā ḥattā idhā rakibā fī l-safīnati kharaqahā qāla akharaqtahā litugh''riqa ahlahā laqad ji''ta shayan im''ran', 'অতঃপর তারা দু’জনে চলতে লাগল যতক্ষণ না তারা নৌকায় উঠল, অতঃপর লোকটি নৌকায় ছিদ্র করে দিল। মূসা বলল, ‘আপনি কি তার আরোহীদেরকে ডুবিয়ে দেয়ার জন্য তাতে ছিদ্র করলেন? আপনি তো এক অদ্ভুত কাজ করলেন।’', 'So they set out, until when they had embarked on the ship, al-Khidh r tore it open. [Moses] said, "Have you torn it open to drown its people? You have certainly done a grave thing."', 'অতঃপর তারা দু’জনে চলতে লাগল যতক্ষণ না তারা নৌকায় উঠল, অতঃপর লোকটি নৌকায় ছিদ্র করে দিল। মূসা বলল, ‘আপনি কি তার আরোহীদেরকে ডুবিয়ে দেয়ার জন্য তাতে ছিদ্র করলেন? আপনি তো এক অদ্ভুত কাজ করলেন।’', 'So they set out, until when they had embarked on the ship, al-Khidh r tore it open. [Moses] said, "Have you torn it open to drown its people? You have certainly done a grave thing."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018071.mp3', now()),
  (18, 72, '', '[{"id":60847,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60848,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"\"কি নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":60849,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَقُلْ","transliteration":"aqul","translation_bn":"আমি বলি","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60850,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكَ","transliteration":"innaka","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আপনি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":60851,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَن","transliteration":"lan","translation_bn":"কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":60852,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَسْتَطِيعَ","transliteration":"tastaṭīʿa","translation_bn":"পারবেন","root":"طوع","lemma":"ٱسْتَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60853,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَعِىَ","transliteration":"maʿiya","translation_bn":"আমার সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":60854,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"صَبْرًۭا","transliteration":"ṣabran","translation_bn":"ধৈর্য ধরতে\"","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60855,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٧٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭২)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla alam aqul innaka lan tastaṭīʿa maʿiya ṣabran', 'সে বলল, ‘আমি কি আপনাকে বলিনি যে, আপনি কিছুতেই আমার সঙ্গে ধৈর্য ধরতে পারবেন না?’', '[Al-Khidh r] said, "Did I not say that with me you would never be able to have patience?"', 'সে বলল, ‘আমি কি আপনাকে বলিনি যে, আপনি কিছুতেই আমার সঙ্গে ধৈর্য ধরতে পারবেন না?’', '[Al-Khidh r] said, "Did I not say that with me you would never be able to have patience?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018072.mp3', now()),
  (18, 73, '', '[{"id":60894,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বললো (মূসা)","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60895,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":60896,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تُؤَاخِذْنِى","transliteration":"tuākhidh''nī","translation_bn":"ধরবেন আমাকে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"يُؤَاخِذُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60897,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60898,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نَسِيتُ","transliteration":"nasītu","translation_bn":"আমি ভুলে গিয়েছি","root":"نسي","lemma":"نَسِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60899,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60900,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تُرْهِقْنِى","transliteration":"tur''hiq''nī","translation_bn":"আমার উপর আরোপ করবেন","root":"رهق","lemma":"يُرْهِقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60901,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60902,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرِى","transliteration":"amrī","translation_bn":"আমার কাজের","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60903,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عُسْرًۭا","transliteration":"ʿus''ran","translation_bn":"কঠোরতা\"","root":"عسر","lemma":"عُسْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60904,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٧٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla lā tuākhidh''nī bimā nasītu walā tur''hiq''nī min amrī ʿus''ran', 'মূসা বলল, ‘আমার ভুলের জন্য আমাকে পাকড়াও করবেন না, আর আমার ব্যাপারে আপনি অধিক কড়াকড়ি করবেন না।’', '[Moses] said, "Do not blame me for what I forgot and do not cover me in my matter with difficulty."', 'মূসা বলল, ‘আমার ভুলের জন্য আমাকে পাকড়াও করবেন না, আর আমার ব্যাপারে আপনি অধিক কড়াকড়ি করবেন না।’', '[Moses] said, "Do not blame me for what I forgot and do not cover me in my matter with difficulty."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018073.mp3', now()),
  (18, 74, '', '[{"id":61644,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱنطَلَقَا","transliteration":"fa-inṭalaqā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর দু''জনে চড়লো","root":"طلق","lemma":"ٱنطَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61645,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"এমনকি","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":61646,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":61647,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَقِيَا","transliteration":"laqiyā","translation_bn":"দু''জনে দেখা পেলো","root":"لقي","lemma":"لَقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61648,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"غُلَـٰمًۭا","transliteration":"ghulāman","translation_bn":"এক বালকের","root":"غلم","lemma":"غُلَٰم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61649,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَقَتَلَهُۥ","transliteration":"faqatalahu","translation_bn":"তখন সে হত্যা করলো তাকে","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61650,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(মূসা) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61651,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَقَتَلْتَ","transliteration":"aqatalta","translation_bn":"\"কি আপনি হত্যা করলেন","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":61652,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسًۭا","transliteration":"nafsan","translation_bn":"একটি জীবনকে","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61653,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"زَكِيَّةًۢ","transliteration":"zakiyyatan","translation_bn":"নিষ্পাপ","root":"زكو","lemma":"زَكِيَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61654,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"bighayri","translation_bn":"ছাড়া (হত্যা)","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61655,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسٍۢ","transliteration":"nafsin","translation_bn":"কোনো জীবন","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61656,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَّقَدْ","transliteration":"laqad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":61657,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"جِئْتَ","transliteration":"ji''ta","translation_bn":"করে এসেছেন","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61658,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًۭٔا","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কাজ","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61659,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"نُّكْرًۭا","transliteration":"nuk''ran","translation_bn":"গুরুতর অন্যায়\"","root":"نكر","lemma":"نُّكْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":61660,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٧٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-inṭalaqā ḥattā idhā laqiyā ghulāman faqatalahu qāla aqatalta nafsan zakiyyatan bighayri nafsin laqad ji''ta shayan nuk''ran', 'তারপর তারা চলতে লাগল। চলতে চলতে এক বালককে তারা দেখতে পেল। তখন সে তাকে হত্যা করে ফেলল। মূসা বলল, ‘আপনি কি এক নিরাপরাধ জীবনকে কোন প্রকার হত্যার অপরাধ ছাড়াই হত্যা করে দিলেন? আপনি তো গুরুতর এক অন্যায় কাজ করে ফেললেন!’', 'So they set out, until when they met a boy, al-Khidh r killed him. [Moses] said, "Have you killed a pure soul for other than [having killed] a soul? You have certainly done a deplorable thing."', 'তারপর তারা চলতে লাগল। চলতে চলতে এক বালককে তারা দেখতে পেল। তখন সে তাকে হত্যা করে ফেলল। মূসা বলল, ‘আপনি কি এক নিরাপরাধ জীবনকে কোন প্রকার হত্যার অপরাধ ছাড়াই হত্যা করে দিলেন? আপনি তো গুরুতর এক অন্যায় কাজ করে ফেললেন!’', 'So they set out, until when they met a boy, al-Khidh r killed him. [Moses] said, "Have you killed a pure soul for other than [having killed] a soul? You have certainly done a deplorable thing."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018074.mp3', now()),
  (18, 75, '', '[{"id":62314,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62315,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"\"কি নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":62316,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَقُل","transliteration":"aqul","translation_bn":"আমি বলি","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62317,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَّكَ","transliteration":"laka","translation_bn":"আপনাকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَّكَ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62318,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكَ","transliteration":"innaka","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আপনি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":62319,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَن","transliteration":"lan","translation_bn":"কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":62320,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَسْتَطِيعَ","transliteration":"tastaṭīʿa","translation_bn":"পারবেন","root":"طوع","lemma":"ٱسْتَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62321,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَعِىَ","transliteration":"maʿiya","translation_bn":"আমার সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":62322,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"صَبْرًۭا","transliteration":"ṣabran","translation_bn":"ধৈর্য ধরতে\"","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62323,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٧٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla alam aqul laka innaka lan tastaṭīʿa maʿiya ṣabran', 'সে বলল, ‘আমি কি আপনাকে বলিনি যে, আপনি আমার সঙ্গে কক্ষনো ধৈর্য ধরতে পারবেন না?’', '[Al-Khidh r] said, "Did I not tell you that with me you would never be able to have patience?"', 'সে বলল, ‘আমি কি আপনাকে বলিনি যে, আপনি আমার সঙ্গে কক্ষনো ধৈর্য ধরতে পারবেন না?’', '[Al-Khidh r] said, "Did I not tell you that with me you would never be able to have patience?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018075.mp3', now()),
  (18, 76, '', '[{"id":62733,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(মূসা) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62734,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"\"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":62735,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"سَأَلْتُكَ","transliteration":"sa-altuka","translation_bn":"আপনাকে আমি প্রশ্ন করি","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62736,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"সম্বন্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62737,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۭ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কোনো কিছু","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62738,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدَهَا","transliteration":"baʿdahā","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":62739,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"তাহ''লে না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62740,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تُصَـٰحِبْنِى ۖ","transliteration":"tuṣāḥib''nī","translation_bn":"আমাকে আপনি সঙ্গে রাখবেন","root":"صحب","lemma":"تُصَٰحِبْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62742,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":62743,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بَلَغْتَ","transliteration":"balaghta","translation_bn":"আপনি পৌঁছে গেছেন","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَلَغَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62744,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62745,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَّدُنِّى","transliteration":"ladunnī","translation_bn":"আমার পক্ষ","root":"لدن","lemma":"لَّدُن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62746,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عُذْرًۭا","transliteration":"ʿudh''ran","translation_bn":"অজুহাতের শেষ সীমায়\"","root":"عذر","lemma":"عُذْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62747,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٧٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla in sa-altuka ʿan shayin baʿdahā falā tuṣāḥib''nī qad balaghta min ladunnī ʿudh''ran', 'মূসা বলল, ‘এরপর আমি যদি কোন বিষয়ে আপনাকে জিজ্ঞেস করি, তাহলে আপনি আর আমাকে সঙ্গে রাখবেন না, ওযর অন্যায় আমার পক্ষ থেকেই ঘটেছে।’', '[Moses] said, "If I should ask you about anything after this, then do not keep me as a companion. You have obtained from me an excuse."', 'মূসা বলল, ‘এরপর আমি যদি কোন বিষয়ে আপনাকে জিজ্ঞেস করি, তাহলে আপনি আর আমাকে সঙ্গে রাখবেন না, ওযর অন্যায় আমার পক্ষ থেকেই ঘটেছে।’', '[Moses] said, "If I should ask you about anything after this, then do not keep me as a companion. You have obtained from me an excuse."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018076.mp3', now()),
  (18, 77, '', '[{"id":63010,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱنطَلَقَا","transliteration":"fa-inṭalaqā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর দু''জনে চললো","root":"طلق","lemma":"ٱنطَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63011,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"এমনকি","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":63012,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِذَآ","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":63013,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَتَيَآ","transliteration":"atayā","translation_bn":"দু''জনে আসলো","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63014,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلَ","transliteration":"ahla","translation_bn":"আধিবাসীদের কাছে","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63015,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَرْيَةٍ","transliteration":"qaryatin","translation_bn":"এক জনপদের","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63016,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَطْعَمَآ","transliteration":"is''taṭʿamā","translation_bn":"দু''জনে খাদ্য চাইলো","root":"طعم","lemma":"ٱسْتَطْعَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63017,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلَهَا","transliteration":"ahlahā","translation_bn":"তার অধিবাসীদের কাছে","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63018,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَأَبَوْا۟","transliteration":"fa-abaw","translation_bn":"কিন্তু তারা অস্বীকার করলো","root":"ابي","lemma":"أَبَى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63019,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":63020,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُضَيِّفُوهُمَا","transliteration":"yuḍayyifūhumā","translation_bn":"তারা আতিথেয়তা করবে তাদের দু''জনকে","root":"ضيف","lemma":"يُضَيِّفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63021,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَوَجَ