mmar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63034,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرًۭا","transliteration":"ajran","translation_bn":"পারিশ্রমিক\"","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63035,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"٧٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-inṭalaqā ḥattā idhā atayā ahla qaryatin is''taṭʿamā ahlahā fa-abaw an yuḍayyifūhumā fawajadā fīhā jidāran yurīdu an yanqaḍḍa fa-aqāmahu qāla law shi''ta lattakhadhta ʿalayhi ajran', 'তারপর তারা উভয়ে চলতে লাগল, চলতে চলতে তারা এক জনপদে পৌঁছে সেখানকার লোকেদের কাছে খাবার চাইল। কিন্তু তারা তাদের দু’জনকে আতিথ্য প্রদান করতে অস্বীকার করল। তারা দু’জন সেখানে একটা দেয়াল দেখতে পেল যা পড়ে যাবার উপক্রম হয়েছিল। তখন সে ব্যক্তি সেটিকে সুপ্রতিষ্ঠিত করে দিল। মূসা বলল, ‘আপনি ইচ্ছে করলে এর জন্য পারিশ্রমিক নিতে পারতেন।’', 'So they set out, until when they came to the people of a town, they asked its people for food, but they refused to offer them hospitality. And they found therein a wall about to collapse, so al-Khidh r restored it. [Moses] said, "If you wished, you could have taken for it a payment."', 'তারপর তারা উভয়ে চলতে লাগল, চলতে চলতে তারা এক জনপদে পৌঁছে সেখানকার লোকেদের কাছে খাবার চাইল। কিন্তু তারা তাদের দু’জনকে আতিথ্য প্রদান করতে অস্বীকার করল। তারা দু’জন সেখানে একটা দেয়াল দেখতে পেল যা পড়ে যাবার উপক্রম হয়েছিল। তখন সে ব্যক্তি সেটিকে সুপ্রতিষ্ঠিত করে দিল। মূসা বলল, ‘আপনি ইচ্ছে করলে এর জন্য পারিশ্রমিক নিতে পারতেন।’', 'So they set out, until when they came to the people of a town, they asked its people for food, but they refused to offer them hospitality. And they found therein a wall about to collapse, so al-Khidh r restored it. [Moses] said, "If you wished, you could have taken for it a payment."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018077.mp3', now()),
  (18, 78, '', '[{"id":63491,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63492,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"\"এটাই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":63493,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِرَاقُ","transliteration":"firāqu","translation_bn":"(যাত্রা শেষ) বিচ্ছেদ","root":"فرق","lemma":"فِرَاق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63494,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنِى","transliteration":"baynī","translation_bn":"মাঝে আমার","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63495,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَبَيْنِكَ ۚ","transliteration":"wabaynika","translation_bn":"ও মাঝে আপনার","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63497,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سَأُنَبِّئُكَ","transliteration":"sa-unabbi-uka","translation_bn":"শীঘ্রই আপনাকে জানিয়ে দিবো","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَّأَ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":63498,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِتَأْوِيلِ","transliteration":"bitawīli","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে তাৎপর্য","root":"اول","lemma":"تَأْوِيل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63499,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যে বিষয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":63500,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":63501,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"تَسْتَطِع","transliteration":"tastaṭiʿ","translation_bn":"পারেন","root":"طوع","lemma":"ٱسْتَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63502,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَّلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63503,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"صَبْرًا","transliteration":"ṣabran","translation_bn":"ধৈর্য ধরতে","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63504,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٧٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla hādhā firāqu baynī wabaynika sa-unabbi-uka bitawīli mā lam tastaṭiʿ ʿalayhi ṣabran', 'লোকটি বলল, ‘এখানেই আপনার সাথে আমার সম্পর্কের বিচ্ছেদ ঘটল। এখন আমি আপনাকে ব্যাখ্যা জানিয়ে দেব যে বিষয়ে আপনি ধৈর্য ধরতে পারেননি।', '[Al-Khidh r] said, "This is parting between me and you. I will inform you of the interpretation of that about which you could not have patience.', 'লোকটি বলল, ‘এখানেই আপনার সাথে আমার সম্পর্কের বিচ্ছেদ ঘটল। এখন আমি আপনাকে ব্যাখ্যা জানিয়ে দেব যে বিষয়ে আপনি ধৈর্য ধরতে পারেননি।', '[Al-Khidh r] said, "This is parting between me and you. I will inform you of the interpretation of that about which you could not have patience.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018078.mp3', now()),
  (18, 79, '', '[{"id":64004,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَمَّا","transliteration":"ammā","translation_bn":"ব্যাপার হলো","root":"—","lemma":"أَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":64005,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّفِينَةُ","transliteration":"l-safīnatu","translation_bn":"নৌকাটির","root":"سفن","lemma":"سَفِينَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64006,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَكَانَتْ","transliteration":"fakānat","translation_bn":"অতঃপর সেটা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64007,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِمَسَـٰكِينَ","transliteration":"limasākīna","translation_bn":"ক''জন গরীব ব্যক্তির","root":"سكن","lemma":"مِسْكِين","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64008,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","translation_bn":"পরিশ্রম করতো","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64009,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64010,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَحْرِ","transliteration":"l-baḥri","translation_bn":"সমুদ্রের","root":"بحر","lemma":"بَحْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64011,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَأَرَدتُّ","transliteration":"fa-aradttu","translation_bn":"সুতরাং আমি চেয়েছি","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64012,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":64013,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَعِيبَهَا","transliteration":"aʿībahā","translation_bn":"তা ত্রুটিযুক্ত করি","root":"عيب","lemma":"أَعِيبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64014,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64015,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَرَآءَهُم","transliteration":"warāahum","translation_bn":"পিছনে তাদের","root":"وري","lemma":"وَرَا^ء","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":64016,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَّلِكٌۭ","transliteration":"malikun","translation_bn":"এক রাজা","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلِك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64017,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَأْخُذُ","transliteration":"yakhudhu","translation_bn":"নিয়ে নিতো","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64018,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كُلَّ","transliteration":"kulla","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64019,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"سَفِينَةٍ","transliteration":"safīnatin","translation_bn":"নৌকা","root":"سفن","lemma":"سَفِينَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64020,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"غَصْبًۭا","transliteration":"ghaṣban","translation_bn":"জোর করে","root":"غصب","lemma":"غَصْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64021,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٧٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ammā l-safīnatu fakānat limasākīna yaʿmalūna fī l-baḥri fa-aradttu an aʿībahā wakāna warāahum malikun yakhudhu kulla safīnatin ghaṣban', 'নৌকাটির ব্যাপার হল- তা ছিল কয়েকজন গরীব লোকের, তারা সমুদ্রে জীবিকার জন্য শ্রম করত। আমি সেটাকে খুঁতযুক্ত করতে চাইলাম, কারণ তাদের পশ্চাতে ছিল এক রাজা, সে জোরপূর্বক সব নৌকা কেড়ে নিত।', 'As for the ship, it belonged to poor people working at sea. So I intended to cause defect in it as there was after them a king who seized every [good] ship by force.', 'নৌকাটির ব্যাপার হল- তা ছিল কয়েকজন গরীব লোকের, তারা সমুদ্রে জীবিকার জন্য শ্রম করত। আমি সেটাকে খুঁতযুক্ত করতে চাইলাম, কারণ তাদের পশ্চাতে ছিল এক রাজা, সে জোরপূর্বক সব নৌকা কেড়ে নিত।', 'As for the ship, it belonged to poor people working at sea. So I intended to cause defect in it as there was after them a king who seized every [good] ship by force.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018079.mp3', now()),
  (18, 80, '', '[{"id":64305,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَمَّا","transliteration":"wa-ammā","translation_bn":"আর ব্যাপার হলো","root":"—","lemma":"أَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64306,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغُلَـٰمُ","transliteration":"l-ghulāmu","translation_bn":"ছেলেটির","root":"غلم","lemma":"غُلَٰم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64307,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَكَانَ","transliteration":"fakāna","translation_bn":"অতঃপর ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64308,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَبَوَاهُ","transliteration":"abawāhu","translation_bn":"তার পিতামাতা","root":"ابو","lemma":"أَبَوَان","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64309,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مُؤْمِنَيْنِ","transliteration":"mu''minayni","translation_bn":"দু''জন মু''মিন","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64310,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَخَشِينَآ","transliteration":"fakhashīnā","translation_bn":"তখন আমরা আশঙ্কা করলাম","root":"خشي","lemma":"خَشِىَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64311,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":64312,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يُرْهِقَهُمَا","transliteration":"yur''hiqahumā","translation_bn":"তাদের দু''জনকে সে কষ্ট দিবে","root":"رهق","lemma":"يُرْهِقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64313,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"طُغْيَـٰنًۭا","transliteration":"ṭugh''yānan","translation_bn":"অবাধ্যতা করে","root":"طغي","lemma":"طُغْيَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64314,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَكُفْرًۭا","transliteration":"wakuf''ran","translation_bn":"ও অবিশ্বাস (পথে চলে)","root":"كفر","lemma":"كُفْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64315,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٨٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮০)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-ammā l-ghulāmu fakāna abawāhu mu''minayni fakhashīnā an yur''hiqahumā ṭugh''yānan wakuf''ran', 'আর বালকটির ব্যাপার হল- তার মাতা-পিতা ছিল মু’মিন। আমরা শঙ্কা করলাম যে, সে তার বিদ্রোহমূলক আচরণ ও (আল্লাহর প্রতি) কুফুরী দ্বারা তাদেরকে কষ্ট দেবে।', 'And as for the boy, his parents were believers, and we feared that he would overburden them by transgression and disbelief.', 'আর বালকটির ব্যাপার হল- তার মাতা-পিতা ছিল মু’মিন। আমরা শঙ্কা করলাম যে, সে তার বিদ্রোহমূলক আচরণ ও (আল্লাহর প্রতি) কুফুরী দ্বারা তাদেরকে কষ্ট দেবে।', 'And as for the boy, his parents were believers, and we feared that he would overburden them by transgression and disbelief.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018080.mp3', now()),
  (18, 81, '', '[{"id":64872,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَأَرَدْنَآ","transliteration":"fa-aradnā","translation_bn":"সুতরাং আমরা চাইলাম","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64873,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":64874,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُبْدِلَهُمَا","transliteration":"yub''dilahumā","translation_bn":"দু''জনকে পরিবর্তে দিবেন","root":"بدل","lemma":"يُبْدِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64875,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّهُمَا","transliteration":"rabbuhumā","translation_bn":"দু''জনের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64876,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرًۭا","transliteration":"khayran","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":64877,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"তার চেয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64878,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"زَكَوٰةًۭ","transliteration":"zakatan","translation_bn":"পবিত্রতায়","root":"زكو","lemma":"زَكَوٰة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64879,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَأَقْرَبَ","transliteration":"wa-aqraba","translation_bn":"এবং ঘনিষ্টতর","root":"قرب","lemma":"أَقْرَب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64880,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رُحْمًۭا","transliteration":"ruḥ''man","translation_bn":"দয়ার দিক থেকে","root":"رحم","lemma":"رُحْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64881,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٨١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮১)","root":"—","lemma":"٨١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-aradnā an yub''dilahumā rabbuhumā khayran min''hu zakatan wa-aqraba ruḥ''man', 'এ কারণে আমরা চাইলাম যে, তাদের প্রতিপালক তাদেরকে তার পরিবর্তে অধিক পবিত্র ও দয়া-মায়ায় অধিক ঘনিষ্ঠ (সন্তান) দান করবেন।', 'So we intended that their Lord should substitute for them one better than him in purity and nearer to mercy.', 'এ কারণে আমরা চাইলাম যে, তাদের প্রতিপালক তাদেরকে তার পরিবর্তে অধিক পবিত্র ও দয়া-মায়ায় অধিক ঘনিষ্ঠ (সন্তান) দান করবেন।', 'So we intended that their Lord should substitute for them one better than him in purity and nearer to mercy.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018081.mp3', now()),
