ৈর্য ধরতে\"","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65014,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"٨٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮২)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-ammā l-jidāru fakāna lighulāmayni yatīmayni fī l-madīnati wakāna taḥtahu kanzun lahumā wakāna abūhumā ṣāliḥan fa-arāda rabbuka an yablughā ashuddahumā wayastakhrijā kanzahumā raḥmatan min rabbika wamā faʿaltuhu ʿan amrī dhālika tawīlu mā lam tasṭiʿ ʿalayhi ṣabran', 'আর ঐ দেয়ালটির বিষয় হল- তা ছিল ঐ শহরের দু’জন ইয়াতীম বালকের। তার নীচে ছিল তাদের জন্য রক্ষিত ধন, তাদের পিতা ছিল এক সৎ ব্যক্তি। তাই তোমার প্রতিপালক চাইলেন তারা দু’জন যৌবনে উপনীত হোক আর তাদের গচ্ছিত ধন বের করে নিক- যা হল তোমার প্রতিপালকের রহমত বিশেষ। এ সব আমি নিজের পক্ষ থেকে করিনি। এ হল সে বিষয়ের ব্যাখ্যা যে সম্পর্কে আপনি ধৈর্য ধারণ করতে পারেননি।’', 'And as for the wall, it belonged to two orphan boys in the city, and there was beneath it a treasure for them, and their father had been righteous. So your Lord intended that they reach maturity and extract their treasure, as a mercy from your Lord. And I did it not of my own accord. That is the interpretation of that about which you could not have patience."', 'আর ঐ দেয়ালটির বিষয় হল- তা ছিল ঐ শহরের দু’জন ইয়াতীম বালকের। তার নীচে ছিল তাদের জন্য রক্ষিত ধন, তাদের পিতা ছিল এক সৎ ব্যক্তি। তাই তোমার প্রতিপালক চাইলেন তারা দু’জন যৌবনে উপনীত হোক আর তাদের গচ্ছিত ধন বের করে নিক- যা হল তোমার প্রতিপালকের রহমত বিশেষ। এ সব আমি নিজের পক্ষ থেকে করিনি। এ হল সে বিষয়ের ব্যাখ্যা যে সম্পর্কে আপনি ধৈর্য ধারণ করতে পারেননি।’', 'And as for the wall, it belonged to two orphan boys in the city, and there was beneath it a treasure for them, and their father had been righteous. So your Lord intended that they reach maturity and extract their treasure, as a mercy from your Lord. And I did it not of my own accord. That is the interpretation of that about which you could not have patience."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018082.mp3', now()),
  (18, 83, '', '[{"id":65294,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَسْـَٔلُونَكَ","transliteration":"wayasalūnaka","translation_bn":"এবং তোমাকে প্রশ্ন করছে","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65295,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"সম্বন্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65296,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ذِى","transliteration":"dhī","translation_bn":"বিশিষ্ট","root":"—","lemma":"ذُو","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65297,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-qarnayni","translation_bn":"দুই গুচ্ছ","root":"قرن","lemma":"قَرْن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65299,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65300,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سَأَتْلُوا۟","transliteration":"sa-atlū","translation_bn":"\"অচিরেই পাঠ করে শোনাবো","root":"تلو","lemma":"تَلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":65301,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُم","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"কাছে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65302,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"থেকে তা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65303,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ذِكْرًا","transliteration":"dhik''ran","translation_bn":"(কিছু) বর্ণনা\"","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65304,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٨٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayasalūnaka ʿan dhī l-qarnayni qul sa-atlū ʿalaykum min''hu dhik''ran', 'তোমাকে তারা যুলকারনাইন সম্পর্কে জিজ্ঞেস করছে। বল, ‘আমি তার বিষয় তোমাদের নিকট কিছু বর্ণনা করব।’', 'And they ask you, [O Muhammad], about Dhul-Qarnayn. Say, "I will recite to you about him a report."', 'তোমাকে তারা যুলকারনাইন সম্পর্কে জিজ্ঞেস করছে। বল, ‘আমি তার বিষয় তোমাদের নিকট কিছু বর্ণনা করব।’', 'And they ask you, [O Muhammad], about Dhul-Qarnayn. Say, "I will recite to you about him a report."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018083.mp3', now()),
  (18, 84, '', '[{"id":65880,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":65881,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَكَّنَّا","transliteration":"makkannā","translation_bn":"আমরা কর্তৃত্ব দিয়েছিলাম","root":"مكن","lemma":"مَكَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65882,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তাকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65883,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65884,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65885,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَءَاتَيْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"waātaynāhu","translation_bn":"এবং তাকে আমরা দিয়েছিলাম","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65886,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65887,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65888,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"বস্তু","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65889,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"سَبَبًۭا","transliteration":"sababan","translation_bn":"পথ নির্দেশ","root":"سبب","lemma":"سَبَب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65890,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٨٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innā makkannā lahu fī l-arḍi waātaynāhu min kulli shayin sababan', 'আমি তাকে পৃথিবীতে আধিপত্য দান করেছিলাম আর তাকে সব রকমের উপায় উপাদান দিয়েছিলাম।', 'Indeed We established him upon the earth, and We gave him to everything a way.', 'আমি তাকে পৃথিবীতে আধিপত্য দান করেছিলাম আর তাকে সব রকমের উপায় উপাদান দিয়েছিলাম।', 'Indeed We established him upon the earth, and We gave him to everything a way.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018084.mp3', now()),
  (18, 85, '', '[{"id":65990,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَأَتْبَعَ","transliteration":"fa-atbaʿa","translation_bn":"অতঃপর সে অনুসরণ করলো","root":"تبع","lemma":"أَتْبَعَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65991,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"سَبَبًا","transliteration":"sababan","translation_bn":"এক পথ","root":"سبب","lemma":"سَبَب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65992,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"٨٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-atbaʿa sababan', 'একবার সে এক রাস্তা ধরল (অর্থাৎ একদিকে একটা অভিযান চালাল)।', 'So he followed a way', 'একবার সে এক রাস্তা ধরল (অর্থাৎ একদিকে একটা অভিযান চালাল)।', 'So he followed a way', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018085.mp3', now()),
  (18, 86, '', '[{"id":66432,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"শেষ পর্যন্ত","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":66433,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":66434,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بَلَغَ","transliteration":"balagha","translation_bn":"পৌঁছলো","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَلَغَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66435,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَغْرِبَ","transliteration":"maghriba","translation_bn":"অস্তাচলে","root":"غرب","lemma":"مَغْرِب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66436,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّمْسِ","transliteration":"l-shamsi","translation_bn":"সূর্যের","root":"شمس","lemma":"شَمْس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66437,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَجَدَهَا","transliteration":"wajadahā","translation_bn":"পেলো তা","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66438,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَغْرُبُ","transliteration":"taghrubu","translation_bn":"অস্ত যাচ্ছে","root":"غرب","lemma":"غَرَبَت","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66439,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66440,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَيْنٍ","transliteration":"ʿaynin","translation_bn":"জলাশয়","root":"عين","lemma":"عَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66441,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"حَمِئَةٍۢ","transliteration":"ḥami-atin","translation_bn":"পঙ্কিল","root":"حما","lemma":"حَمِئَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":66442,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَوَجَدَ","transliteration":"wawajada","translation_bn":"এবং সে পেলো","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66443,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عِندَهَا","transliteration":"ʿindahā","translation_bn":"তার কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":66444,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمًۭا ۗ","transliteration":"qawman","translation_bn":"এক জাতিকে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66446,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"قُلْنَا","transliteration":"qul''nā","translation_bn":"আমরা বললাম","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66447,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰذَا","transliteration":"yādhā","translation_bn":"\"","root":"—","lemma":"ذَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":66448,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ","transliteration":"l-qarnayni","translation_bn":"\"হে জুলকারনাইন","root":"قرن","lemma":"قَرْن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66449,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِمَّآ","transliteration":"immā","translation_bn":"হয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66450,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":66451,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"تُعَذِّبَ","transliteration":"tuʿadhiba","translation_bn":"তুমি শাস্তি দিবে","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66452,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَإِمَّآ","transliteration":"wa-immā","translation_bn":"আর না হয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66453,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":66454,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"تَتَّخِذَ","transliteration":"tattakhidha","translation_bn":"তুমি অবলম্বন করো","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66455,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِمْ","transliteration":"fīhim","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66456,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"حُسْنًۭا","transliteration":"ḥus''nan","translation_bn":"সদ্ব্যবহার\"","root":"حسن","lemma":"حُسْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66457,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"٨٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ḥattā idhā balagha maghriba l-shamsi wajadahā taghrubu fī ʿaynin ḥami-atin wawajada ʿindahā qawman qul''nā yādhā l-qarnayni immā an tuʿadhiba wa-immā an tattakhidha fīhim ḥus''nan', 'চলতে চলতে যখন সে সূর্যাস্তের স্থানে পৌঁছল, তখন সে সূর্যকে অস্বচ্ছ জলাশয়ে ডুবতে দেখল আর সেখানে একটি জাতির লোকেদের সাক্ষাৎ পেল। আমি বললাম, ‘হে যুলকারনাইন! তুমি তাদেরকে শাস্তি দিতে পার কিংবা তাদের সঙ্গে (সদয়) ব্যবহারও করতে পার।’', 'Until, when he reached the setting of the sun, he found it [as if] setting in a spring of dark mud, and he found near it a people. Allah said, "O Dhul-Qarnayn, either you punish [them] or else adopt among them [a way of] goodness."', 'চলতে চলতে যখন সে সূর্যাস্তের স্থানে পৌঁছল, তখন সে সূর্যকে অস্বচ্ছ জলাশয়ে ডুবতে দেখল আর সেখানে একটি জাতির লোকেদের সাক্ষাৎ পেল। আমি বললাম, ‘হে যুলকারনাইন! তুমি তাদেরকে শাস্তি দিতে পার কিংবা তাদের সঙ্গে (সদয়) ব্যবহারও করতে পার।’', 'Until, when he reached the setting of the sun, he found it [as if] setting in a spring of dark mud, and he found near it a people. Allah said, "O Dhul-Qarnayn, either you punish [them] or else adopt among them [a way of] goodness."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018086.mp3', now()),
  (18, 87, '', '[{"id":66828,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66829,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَمَّا","transliteration":"ammā","translation_bn":"\"ব্যাপারে","root":"—","lemma":"أَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66830,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"(তার) যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":66831,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَمَ","transliteration":"ẓalama","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘন করেছে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66832,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَسَوْفَ","transliteration":"fasawfa","translation_bn":"অতঃপর শীঘ্রই","root":"—","lemma":"سَوْف\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66833,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نُعَذِّبُهُۥ","transliteration":"nuʿadhibuhu","translation_bn":"তাকে আমরা শাস্তি দিবো","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66834,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66835,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يُرَدُّ","transliteration":"yuraddu","translation_bn":"ফিরিয়ে আনা হবে","root":"ردد","lemma":"رَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66836,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66837,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِۦ","transliteration":"rabbihi","translation_bn":"তার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66838,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَيُعَذِّبُهُۥ","transliteration":"fayuʿadhibuhu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তিনি শাস্তি দিবেন তাকে","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66839,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابًۭا","transliteration":"ʿadhāban","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66840,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"نُّكْرًۭا","transliteration":"nuk''ran","translation_bn":"কঠিন","root":"نكر","lemma":"نُّكْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":66841,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٨٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla ammā man ẓalama fasawfa nuʿadhibuhu thumma yuraddu ilā rabbihi fayuʿadhibuhu ʿadhāban nuk''ran', 'সে বলল, ‘যে ব্যক্তি যুলম করবে আমি তাকে অচিরেই শাস্তি দেব, অতঃপর তাকে তার প্রতিপালকের কাছে ফিরিয়ে আনা হবে, তখন তিনি তাকে কঠিন ‘আযাব দেবেন।', 'He said, "As for one who wrongs, we will punish him. Then he will be returned to his Lord, and He will punish him with a terrible punishment.', 'সে বলল, ‘যে ব্যক্তি যুলম করবে আমি তাকে অচিরেই শাস্তি দেব, অতঃপর তাকে তার প্রতিপালকের কাছে ফিরিয়ে আনা হবে, তখন তিনি তাকে কঠিন ‘আযাব দেবেন।', 'He said, "As for one who wrongs, we will punish him. Then he will be returned to his Lord, and He will punish him with a terrible punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018087.mp3', now()),
  (18, 88, '', '[{"id":67110,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَمَّا","transliteration":"wa-ammā","translation_bn":"আর ব্যাপারে","root":"—","lemma":"أَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67111,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"(তার) যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":67112,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنَ","transliteration":"āmana","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনবে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67113,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلَ","transliteration":"waʿamila","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67114,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67115,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَلَهُۥ","transliteration":"falahu","translation_bn":"তবে তার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فَلَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67116,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"جَزَآءً","transliteration":"jazāan","translation_bn":"পুরস্কার (রয়েছে)","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67117,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ ۖ","transliteration":"l-ḥus''nā","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"حسن","lemma":"حُسْنَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67119,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَسَنَقُولُ","transliteration":"wasanaqūlu","translation_bn":"এবং অচিরেই আমরা বলবো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67120,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তাকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67121,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67122,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرِنَا","transliteration":"amrinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের নির্দেশের","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67123,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يُسْرًۭا","transliteration":"yus''ran","translation_bn":"যা সহজ\"","root":"يسر","lemma":"يُسْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67124,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٨٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-ammā man āmana waʿamila ṣāliḥan falahu jazāan l-ḥus''nā wasanaqūlu lahu min amrinā yus''ran', 'আর যে ব্যক্তি ঈমান আনবে আর সৎকাজ করবে তার জন্য আছে উত্তম পুরস্কার আর আমি তাকে সহজ কাজের নির্দেশ দেব।', 'But as for one who believes and does righteousness, he will have a reward of Paradise, and we will speak to him from our command with ease."', 'আর যে ব্যক্তি ঈমান আনবে আর সৎকাজ করবে তার জন্য আছে উত্তম পুরস্কার আর আমি তাকে সহজ কাজের নির্দেশ দেব।', 'But as for one who believes and does righteousness, he will have a reward of Paradise, and we will speak to him from our command with ease."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018088.mp3', now()),
  (18, 89, '', '[{"id":67670,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67671,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَتْبَعَ","transliteration":"atbaʿa","translation_bn":"সে অনুসরণ করলো","root":"تبع","lemma":"أَتْبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67672,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"سَبَبًا","transliteration":"sababan","translation_bn":"আরও এক পথ","root":"سبب","lemma":"سَبَب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67673,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"٨٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma atbaʿa sababan', 'তারপর সে আরেক পথ ধরল।', 'Then he followed a way', 'তারপর সে আরেক পথ ধরল।', 'Then he followed a way', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018089.mp3', now()),
