_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69179,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"قَوْلًۭا","transliteration":"qawlan","translation_bn":"কথা","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69180,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٩٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ḥattā idhā balagha bayna l-sadayni wajada min dūnihimā qawman lā yakādūna yafqahūna qawlan', 'চলতে চলতে সে দু’ পাহাড়ের মাঝে এসে পৌঁছল। সেখানে সে এক সম্প্রদায়কে দেখতে পেল। যারা কথাবার্তা কমই বুঝতে পারে।', 'Until, when he reached [a pass] between two mountains, he found beside them a people who could hardly understand [his] speech.', 'চলতে চলতে সে দু’ পাহাড়ের মাঝে এসে পৌঁছল। সেখানে সে এক সম্প্রদায়কে দেখতে পেল। যারা কথাবার্তা কমই বুঝতে পারে।', 'Until, when he reached [a pass] between two mountains, he found beside them a people who could hardly understand [his] speech.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018093.mp3', now()),
  (18, 94, '', '[{"id":69394,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69395,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰذَا","transliteration":"yādhā","translation_bn":"\"","root":"—","lemma":"ذَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":69396,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ","transliteration":"l-qarnayni","translation_bn":"\"হে জুলকারনাইন","root":"قرن","lemma":"قَرْن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69397,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":69398,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَأْجُوجَ","transliteration":"yajūja","translation_bn":"ইয়াজুজ","root":"—","lemma":"يَأْجُوج","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69399,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمَأْجُوجَ","transliteration":"wamajūja","translation_bn":"এবং মাজুজ","root":"—","lemma":"مَأْجُوج","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69400,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُفْسِدُونَ","transliteration":"muf''sidūna","translation_bn":"অশান্তি সৃষ্টিকারী","root":"فسد","lemma":"مُفْسِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69401,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69402,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর (এ অঙ্গনে)","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69403,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَهَلْ","transliteration":"fahal","translation_bn":"তবে কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69404,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"نَجْعَلُ","transliteration":"najʿalu","translation_bn":"আমরা দিবো","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69405,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَكَ","transliteration":"laka","translation_bn":"তোমার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكَ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69406,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"خَرْجًا","transliteration":"kharjan","translation_bn":"কর","root":"خرج","lemma":"خَرْج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69407,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"এই শর্তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69408,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":69409,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"تَجْعَلَ","transliteration":"tajʿala","translation_bn":"তুমি বানাবে","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69410,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَنَا","transliteration":"baynanā","translation_bn":"মাঝে আমাদের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":69411,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَبَيْنَهُمْ","transliteration":"wabaynahum","translation_bn":"এবং মাঝে তাদের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69412,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"سَدًّۭا","transliteration":"saddan","translation_bn":"একটি প্রাচীর\"","root":"سدد","lemma":"سَدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69413,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٩٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū yādhā l-qarnayni inna yajūja wamajūja muf''sidūna fī l-arḍi fahal najʿalu laka kharjan ʿalā an tajʿala baynanā wabaynahum saddan', 'তারা বলল, ‘হে যুলক্বারনায়ন! ইয়াজূজ মা’জূজ পৃথিবীতে অশান্তি সৃষ্টি করছে, অতএব আমরা কি আপনাকে কর দেব যে, আপনি আমাদের ও তাদের মাঝে একটা বাঁধ নির্মাণ করে দেবেন?’', 'They said, "O Dhul-Qarnayn, indeed Gog and Magog are [great] corrupters in the land. So may we assign for you an expenditure that you might make between us and them a barrier?"', 'তারা বলল, ‘হে যুলক্বারনায়ন! ইয়াজূজ মা’জূজ পৃথিবীতে অশান্তি সৃষ্টি করছে, অতএব আমরা কি আপনাকে কর দেব যে, আপনি আমাদের ও তাদের মাঝে একটা বাঁধ নির্মাণ করে দেবেন?’', 'They said, "O Dhul-Qarnayn, indeed Gog and Magog are [great] corrupters in the land. So may we assign for you an expenditure that you might make between us and them a barrier?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018094.mp3', now()),
  (18, 95, '', '[{"id":69816,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69817,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"\"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":69818,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَكَّنِّى","transliteration":"makkannī","translation_bn":"আমাকে ক্ষমতা দিয়েছেন","root":"مكن","lemma":"مَكَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69819,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69820,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69821,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"(তাই) উৎকৃষ্ট","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":69822,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَأَعِينُونِى","transliteration":"fa-aʿīnūnī","translation_bn":"সুতরাং আমাকে তোমরা সাহায্য করো","root":"عون","lemma":"أَعَانَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69823,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِقُوَّةٍ","transliteration":"biquwwatin","translation_bn":"দিয়ে শ্রম","root":"قوي","lemma":"قُوَّة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69824,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَجْعَلْ","transliteration":"ajʿal","translation_bn":"বানাবো আমি","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69825,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَكُمْ","transliteration":"baynakum","translation_bn":"মাঝে তোমাদের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":69826,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَبَيْنَهُمْ","transliteration":"wabaynahum","translation_bn":"এবং মাঝে তাদের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69827,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"رَدْمًا","transliteration":"radman","translation_bn":"শক্ত দেয়াল","root":"ردم","lemma":"رَدْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69828,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٩٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla mā makkannī fīhi rabbī khayrun fa-aʿīnūnī biquwwatin ajʿal baynakum wabaynahum radman', 'সে বলল, ‘আমাকে আমার প্রতিপালক যা দিয়েছেন তা-ই যথেষ্ট, কাজেই তোমরা আমাকে শক্তি-শ্রম দিয়ে সাহায্য কর, আমি তোমাদের ও তাদের মাঝে এক সুদৃঢ় প্রাচীর গড়ে দেব।', 'He said, "That in which my Lord has established me is better [than what you offer], but assist me with strength; I will make between you and them a dam.', 'সে বলল, ‘আমাকে আমার প্রতিপালক যা দিয়েছেন তা-ই যথেষ্ট, কাজেই তোমরা আমাকে শক্তি-শ্রম দিয়ে সাহায্য কর, আমি তোমাদের ও তাদের মাঝে এক সুদৃঢ় প্রাচীর গড়ে দেব।', 'He said, "That in which my Lord has established me is better [than what you offer], but assist me with strength; I will make between you and them a dam.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018095.mp3', now()),
  (18, 96, '', '[{"id":70059,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتُونِى","transliteration":"ātūnī","translation_bn":"আমাকে এনে দাও","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70060,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"زُبَرَ","transliteration":"zubara","translation_bn":"পাতসমূহ","root":"زبر","lemma":"زُبَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70061,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَدِيدِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-ḥadīdi","translation_bn":"লোহার\"","root":"حدد","lemma":"حَدِيد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70063,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"অবশেষে","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":70064,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":70065,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سَاوَىٰ","transliteration":"sāwā","translation_bn":"সমান হলো","root":"سوي","lemma":"سَاوَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70066,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَ","transliteration":"bayna","translation_bn":"মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":70067,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّدَفَيْنِ","transliteration":"l-ṣadafayni","translation_bn":"পাহাড়ের ফাঁকা জায়গা দুই","root":"صدف","lemma":"صَّدَفَيْن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70068,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70069,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱنفُخُوا۟ ۖ","transliteration":"unfukhū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা (হাপরে) দম দাও\"","root":"نفخ","lemma":"نَفَخَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70071,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"অবশেষে","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":70072,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":70073,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَهُۥ","transliteration":"jaʿalahu","translation_bn":"তা পরিণত করলো","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70074,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"نَارًۭا","transliteration":"nāran","translation_bn":"আগুনের মতো","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70075,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70076,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتُونِىٓ","transliteration":"ātūnī","translation_bn":"\"আমাকে এনে দাও","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70077,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أُفْرِغْ","transliteration":"uf''righ","translation_bn":"আমি ঢেলে দেই","root":"فرغ","lemma":"أَفْرِغْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70078,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70079,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"قِطْرًۭا","transliteration":"qiṭ''ran","translation_bn":"গলানো তামা\"","root":"قطر","lemma":"قِطْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70080,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٩٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ātūnī zubara l-ḥadīdi ḥattā idhā sāwā bayna l-ṣadafayni qāla unfukhū ḥattā idhā jaʿalahu nāran qāla ātūnī uf''righ ʿalayhi qiṭ''ran', 'আমার কাছে লোহার পাত এনে দাও।’ শেষ পর্যন্ত যখন সে দু’পাহাড়ের মাঝের ফাঁকা জায়গা পুরোপুরি ভরাট করে দিল সে বলল, ‘তোমরা হাপরে দম দিতে থাক।’ শেষ পর্যন্ত যখন তা আগুনের মত লাল হয়ে গেল তখন সে বলল, ‘আনো, আমি এর উপর গলিত তামা ঢেলে দেব।’', 'Bring me sheets of iron" - until, when he had leveled [them] between the two mountain walls, he said, "Blow [with bellows]," until when he had made it [like] fire, he said, "Bring me, that I may pour over it molten copper."', 'আমার কাছে লোহার পাত এনে দাও।’ শেষ পর্যন্ত যখন সে দু’পাহাড়ের মাঝের ফাঁকা জায়গা পুরোপুরি ভরাট করে দিল সে বলল, ‘তোমরা হাপরে দম দিতে থাক।’ শেষ পর্যন্ত যখন তা আগুনের মত লাল হয়ে গেল তখন সে বলল, ‘আনো, আমি এর উপর গলিত তামা ঢেলে দেব।’', 'Bring me sheets of iron" - until, when he had leveled [them] between the two mountain walls, he said, "Blow [with bellows]," until when he had made it [like] fire, he said, "Bring me, that I may pour over it molten copper."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018096.mp3', now()),
  (18, 97, '', '[{"id":70431,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَمَا","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70432,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْطَـٰعُوٓا۟","transliteration":"is''ṭāʿū","translation_bn":"তারা সক্ষম হলো","root":"طوع","lemma":"ٱسْتَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70433,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":70434,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَظْهَرُوهُ","transliteration":"yaẓharūhu","translation_bn":"তা তারা অতিক্রম করবে","root":"ظهر","lemma":"ظَهَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70435,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70436,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَطَـٰعُوا۟","transliteration":"is''taṭāʿū","translation_bn":"তারা সক্ষম হলো","root":"طوع","lemma":"ٱسْتَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70437,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70438,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"نَقْبًۭا","transliteration":"naqban","translation_bn":"ছিদ্র করতে","root":"نقب","lemma":"نَقْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70439,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٩٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'famā is''ṭāʿū an yaẓharūhu wamā is''taṭāʿū lahu naqban', 'এরপর তারা (অর্থাৎ ইয়াজূজ-মা‘জুজ) তা অতিক্রম করতে পারবে না, আর তা ভেদ করতেও পারবে না।', 'So Gog and Magog were unable to pass over it, nor were they able [to effect] in it any penetration.', 'এরপর তারা (অর্থাৎ ইয়াজূজ-মা‘জুজ) তা অতিক্রম করতে পারবে না, আর তা ভেদ করতেও পারবে না।', 'So Gog and Magog were unable to pass over it, nor were they able [to effect] in it any penetration.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018097.mp3', now()),
  (18, 98, '', '[{"id":70633,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70634,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"\"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":70635,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَحْمَةٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥmatun","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70636,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70637,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّى ۖ","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70639,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَإِذَا","transliteration":"fa-idhā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70640,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"আসবে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70641,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَعْدُ","transliteration":"waʿdu","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70642,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70643,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَهُۥ","transliteration":"jaʿalahu","translation_bn":"তা করে দিবেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70644,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"دَكَّآءَ ۖ","transliteration":"dakkāa","translation_bn":"চূর্ণবিচূর্ণ","root":"دكك","lemma":"دَكَّا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70646,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং হলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70647,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَعْدُ","transliteration":"waʿdu","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70648,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70649,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"حَقًّۭا","transliteration":"ḥaqqan","translation_bn":"সত্য\"","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70650,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٩٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla hādhā raḥmatun min rabbī fa-idhā jāa waʿdu rabbī jaʿalahu dakkāa wakāna waʿdu rabbī ḥaqqan', 'সে বলল, ‘এ আমার প্রতিপালকের করুণা, যখন আমার প্রতিপালকের ওয়া‘দার নির্দিষ্ট সময় আসবে, তখন তিনি তাকে ধূলিসাৎ করে দেবেন আর আমার প্রতিপালকের ওয়া‘দা সত্য।', '[Dhul-Qarnayn] said, "This is a mercy from my Lord; but when the promise of my Lord comes, He will make it level, and ever is the promise of my Lord true."', 'সে বলল, ‘এ আমার প্রতিপালকের করুণা, যখন আমার প্রতিপালকের ওয়া‘দার নির্দিষ্ট সময় আসবে, তখন তিনি তাকে ধূলিসাৎ করে দেবেন আর আমার প্রতিপালকের ওয়া‘দা সত্য।', '[Dhul-Qarnayn] said, "This is a mercy from my Lord; but when the promise of my Lord comes, He will make it level, and ever is the promise of my Lord true."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018098.mp3', now()),
  (18, 99, '', '[{"id":70935,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَتَرَكْنَا","transliteration":"wataraknā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা ছেড়ে দিববো","root":"ترك","lemma":"تَرَكَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70936,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضَهُمْ","transliteration":"baʿḍahum","translation_bn":"তাদের কাউকে","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70937,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","transliteration":"yawma-idhin","translation_bn":"সেদিন","root":"—","lemma":"يَوْمَئِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":70938,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَمُوجُ","transliteration":"yamūju","translation_bn":"তরঙ্গের মত পড়বে","root":"موج","lemma":"يَمُوجُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70939,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70940,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضٍۢ ۖ","transliteration":"baʿḍin","translation_bn":"কারও","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70942,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَنُفِخَ","transliteration":"wanufikha","translation_bn":"এবং ফুঁ দেয়া হবে","root":"نفخ","lemma":"نَفَخَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70943,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70944,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصُّورِ","transliteration":"l-ṣūri","translation_bn":"শিঙ্গার","root":"صور","lemma":"صُّور","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70945,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَجَمَعْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"fajamaʿnāhum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর আমরা একত্র করবো তাদেরকে","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمَعَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70946,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"جَمْعًۭا","transliteration":"jamʿan","translation_bn":"একসঙ্গে","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمْع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70947,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٩٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wataraknā baʿḍahum yawma-idhin yamūju fī baʿḍin wanufikha fī l-ṣūri fajamaʿnāhum jamʿan', 'আমি তাদেরকে সেদিন এমন অবস্থায় ছেড়ে দেব যে, তারা একদল আরেক দলের উপর তরঙ্গমালার মত পড়বে। আর শিঙ্গায় ফুঁক দেয়া হবে। অতঃপর আমরা সব মানুষকে একসঙ্গে একত্রিত করব।', 'And We will leave them that day surging over each other, and [then] the Horn will be blown, and We will assemble them in [one] assembly.', 'আমি তাদেরকে সেদিন এমন অবস্থায় ছেড়ে দেব যে, তারা একদল আরেক দলের উপর তরঙ্গমালার মত পড়বে। আর শিঙ্গায় ফুঁক দেয়া হবে। অতঃপর আমরা সব মানুষকে একসঙ্গে একত্রিত করব।', 'And We will leave them that day surging over each other, and [then] the Horn will be blown, and We will assemble them in [one] assembly.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018099.mp3', now()),
  (18, 100, '', '[{"id":71194,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَعَرَضْنَا","transliteration":"waʿaraḍnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা পেশ করবো","root":"عرض","lemma":"عَرَضَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71195,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمَ","transliteration":"jahannama","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামকে","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":71196,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","transliteration":"yawma-idhin","translation_bn":"সেদিন","root":"—","lemma":"يَوْمَئِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":71197,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِّلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"lil''kāfirīna","translation_bn":"জন্যে কাফিরদের","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71198,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَرْضًا","transliteration":"ʿarḍan","translation_bn":"প্রত্যক্ষভাবে","root":"عرض","lemma":"عَرْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71199,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"١٠٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waʿaraḍnā jahannama yawma-idhin lil''kāfirīna ʿarḍan', 'আমি সেদিন জাহান্নামকে কাফিরদের জন্য সরাসরি হাযির করব।', 'And We will present Hell that Day to the Disbelievers, on display -', 'আমি সেদিন জাহান্নামকে কাফিরদের জন্য সরাসরি হাযির করব।', 'And We will present Hell that Day to the Disbelievers, on display -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018100.mp3', now()),
  (18, 101, '', '[{"id":71543,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":71544,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَتْ","transliteration":"kānat","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71545,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَعْيُنُهُمْ","transliteration":"aʿyunuhum","translation_bn":"চোখগুলোর তাদের","root":"عين","lemma":"عَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71546,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71547,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"غِطَآءٍ","transliteration":"ghiṭāin","translation_bn":"পর্দা","root":"غطو","lemma":"غِطَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71548,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71549,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ذِكْرِى","transliteration":"dhik''rī","translation_bn":"আমার স্মরণ","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71550,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانُوا۟","transliteration":"wakānū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71551,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":71552,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَطِيعُونَ","transliteration":"yastaṭīʿūna","translation_bn":"সক্ষম হতো","root":"طوع","lemma":"ٱسْتَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71553,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"سَمْعًا","transliteration":"samʿan","translation_bn":"শুনতে","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمْع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71554,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١٠١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna kānat aʿyunuhum fī ghiṭāin ʿan dhik''rī wakānū lā yastaṭīʿūna samʿan', 'আমার স্মরণ থেকে যাদের চক্ষু ছিল আবরণে ঢাকা আর তারা শুনতেও সক্ষম ছিল না।', 'Those whose eyes had been within a cover [removed] from My remembrance, and they were not able to hear.', 'আমার স্মরণ থেকে যাদের চক্ষু ছিল আবরণে ঢাকা আর তারা শুনতেও সক্ষম ছিল না।', 'Those whose eyes had been within a cover [removed] from My remembrance, and they were not able to hear.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018101.mp3', now()),
  (18, 102, '', '[{"id":71790,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَفَحَسِبَ","transliteration":"afaḥasiba","translation_bn":"কি মনে করেছে","root":"حسب","lemma":"حَسِبَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":71791,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":71792,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوٓا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71793,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":71794,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّخِذُوا۟","transliteration":"yattakhidhū","translation_bn":"তারা গ্রহণ করবে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71795,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عِبَادِى","transliteration":"ʿibādī","translation_bn":"আমার দাসদেরকে","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71796,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71797,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"دُونِىٓ","transliteration":"dūnī","translation_bn":"আমাকে","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71798,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَوْلِيَآءَ ۚ","transliteration":"awliyāa","translation_bn":"অভিভাবকরূপে","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71800,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّآ","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":71801,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَعْتَدْنَا","transliteration":"aʿtadnā","translation_bn":"আমরা প্রস্তুত করে রেখেছি","root":"عتد","lemma":"أَعْتَدَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71802,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمَ","transliteration":"jahannama","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামকে","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":71803,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"lil''kāfirīna","translation_bn":"জন্যে কাফিরদের","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71804,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"نُزُلًۭا","transliteration":"nuzulan","translation_bn":"মেহমানদারী হিসেবে","root":"نزل","lemma":"نُزُل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71805,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٠٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'afaḥasiba alladhīna kafarū an yattakhidhū ʿibādī min dūnī awliyāa innā aʿtadnā jahannama lil''kāfirīna nuzulan', 'যারা কুফুরী নীতি গ্রহণ করেছে তারা কি মনে করে যে, তারা আমার পরিবর্তে আমার বান্দাহদেরকে অভিভাবকরূপে গ্রহণ করবে? আমি কাফিরদের মেহমানদারির জন্য জাহান্নাম প্রস্তুত করে রেখেছি।', 'Then do those who disbelieve think that they can take My servants instead of Me as allies? Indeed, We have prepared Hell for the disbelievers as a lodging.', 'যারা কুফুরী নীতি গ্রহণ করেছে তারা কি মনে করে যে, তারা আমার পরিবর্তে আমার বান্দাহদেরকে অভিভাবকরূপে গ্রহণ করবে? আমি কাফিরদের মেহমানদারির জন্য জাহান্নাম প্রস্তুত করে রেখেছি।', 'Then do those who disbelieve think that they can take My servants instead of Me as allies? Indeed, We have prepared Hell for the disbelievers as a lodging.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018102.mp3', now()),
  (18, 103, '', '[{"id":72370,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72371,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"\"কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":72372,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نُنَبِّئُكُم","transliteration":"nunabbi-ukum","translation_bn":"খবর দিবো আমরা তোমাদেরকে","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَّأَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72373,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْأَخْسَرِينَ","transliteration":"bil-akhsarīna","translation_bn":"সম্বন্ধে খুবই ক্ষতিগ্রস্তদের","root":"خسر","lemma":"أَخْسَرِين","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72374,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَـٰلًا","transliteration":"aʿmālan","translation_bn":"কর্মসমূহে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72375,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"١٠٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul hal nunabbi-ukum bil-akhsarīna aʿmālan', 'বল, ‘আমি তোমাদেরকে কি সংবাদ দেব নিজেদের ‘আমালের ক্ষেত্রে কারা সবচেয়ে বেশি ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত?’', 'Say, [O Muhammad], "Shall we [believers] inform you of the greatest losers as to [their] deeds?', 'বল, ‘আমি তোমাদেরকে কি সংবাদ দেব নিজেদের ‘আমালের ক্ষেত্রে কারা সবচেয়ে বেশি ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত?’', 'Say, [O Muhammad], "Shall we [believers] inform you of the greatest losers as to [their] deeds?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018103.mp3', now()),
  (18, 104, '', '[{"id":72618,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":72619,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ضَلَّ","transliteration":"ḍalla","translation_bn":"পন্ড হয়েছে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72620,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"سَعْيُهُمْ","transliteration":"saʿyuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের প্রচেষ্টা","root":"سعي","lemma":"سَعْي","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72621,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72622,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","translation_bn":"জীবনের","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72623,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"পার্থিব","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72624,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"অথচ তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":72625,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَحْسَبُونَ","transliteration":"yaḥsabūna","translation_bn":"মনে করে","root":"حسب","lemma":"حَسِبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72626,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"annahum","translation_bn":"যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":72627,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يُحْسِنُونَ","transliteration":"yuḥ''sinūna","translation_bn":"উত্তম করছে","root":"حسن","lemma":"أَحْسَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72628,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"صُنْعًا","transliteration":"ṣun''ʿan","translation_bn":"কর্ম\"","root":"صنع","lemma":"صُنْع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72629,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١٠٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna ḍalla saʿyuhum fī l-ḥayati l-dun''yā wahum yaḥsabūna annahum yuḥ''sinūna ṣun''ʿan', 'তারা হল সে সব লোক দুনিয়ার জীবনে যাদের চেষ্টা সাধনা ব্যর্থ হয়ে গেছে আর তারা নিজেরা মনে করছে যে, তারা সঠিক কাজই করছে।', '[They are] those whose effort is lost in worldly life, while they think that they are doing well in work."', 'তারা হল সে সব লোক দুনিয়ার জীবনে যাদের চেষ্টা সাধনা ব্যর্থ হয়ে গেছে আর তারা নিজেরা মনে করছে যে, তারা সঠিক কাজই করছে।', '[They are] those whose effort is lost in worldly life, while they think that they are doing well in work."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018104.mp3', now()),
  (18, 105, '', '[{"id":72776,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":72777,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারাই) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":72778,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72779,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"biāyāti","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনসমূহকে","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72780,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِمْ","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"তাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72781,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلِقَآئِهِۦ","transliteration":"waliqāihi","translation_bn":"ও তার সাক্ষাত","root":"لقي","lemma":"لِقَا^ء","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72782,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَحَبِطَتْ","transliteration":"faḥabiṭat","translation_bn":"তাই নিষ্ফল হয়েছে","root":"حبط","lemma":"حَبِطَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72783,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَـٰلُهُمْ","transliteration":"aʿmāluhum","translation_bn":"তাদের কাজগুলো","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72784,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"সুতরাং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72785,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"نُقِيمُ","transliteration":"nuqīmu","translation_bn":"দাঁড় করাববো আমরা","root":"قوم","lemma":"أَقَامَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72786,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72787,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72788,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72789,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَزْنًۭا","transliteration":"waznan","translation_bn":"ওজন","root":"وزن","lemma":"وَزْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72790,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٠٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ulāika alladhīna kafarū biāyāti rabbihim waliqāihi faḥabiṭat aʿmāluhum falā nuqīmu lahum yawma l-qiyāmati waznan', 'তারা হল সে সব লোক যারা তাদের প্রতিপালকের নিদর্শন ও তাঁর সাথে সাক্ষাৎকে অমান্য করে। যার ফলে তাদের যাবতীয় ‘আমাল নিস্ফল হয়ে গেছে। কিয়ামাতের দিন আমি তাদের (কাজের) জন্য কোন ওজন কায়িম করব না (অর্থাৎ তাদের এ সব ‘আমাল ওজনযোগ্য হিসেবে গণ্য করা হবে না)।', 'Those are the ones who disbelieve in the verses of their Lord and in [their] meeting Him, so their deeds have become worthless; and We will not assign to them on the Day of Resurrection any importance.', 'তারা হল সে সব লোক যারা তাদের প্রতিপালকের নিদর্শন ও তাঁর সাথে সাক্ষাৎকে অমান্য করে। যার ফলে তাদের যাবতীয় ‘আমাল নিস্ফল হয়ে গেছে। কিয়ামাতের দিন আমি তাদের (কাজের) জন্য কোন ওজন কায়িম করব না (অর্থাৎ তাদের এ সব ‘আমাল ওজনযোগ্য হিসেবে গণ্য করা হবে না)।', 'Those are the ones who disbelieve in the verses of their Lord and in [their] meeting Him, so their deeds have become worthless; and We will not assign to them on the Day of Resurrection any importance.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018105.mp3', now()),
  (18, 106, '', '[{"id":72941,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটাই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":72942,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَزَآؤُهُمْ","transliteration":"jazāuhum","translation_bn":"প্রতিফল তাদের","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72943,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمُ","transliteration":"jahannamu","translation_bn":"জাহান্নাম","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":72944,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"কারণে এ যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72945,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72946,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّخَذُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wa-ittakhadhū","translation_bn":"ও গ্রহণ করেছে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72947,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِى","transliteration":"āyātī","translation_bn":"আমার নিদর্শনাবলী","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72948,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَرُسُلِى","transliteration":"warusulī","translation_bn":"এবং আমার রাসুলদেরকেও","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72949,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"هُزُوًا","transliteration":"huzuwan","translation_bn":"বিদ্রুপরূপে","root":"هزا","lemma":"هُزُو","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72950,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١٠٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dhālika jazāuhum jahannamu bimā kafarū wa-ittakhadhū āyātī warusulī huzuwan', 'এটাই তাদের প্রতিফল-জাহান্নাম, কারণ তারা কুফুরী করেছে আর আমার নিদর্শন ও রসূলদেরকে হাসি-তামাশার বিষয় বানিয়েছে।', 'That is their recompense - Hell - for what they denied and [because] they took My signs and My messengers in ridicule.', 'এটাই তাদের প্রতিফল-জাহান্নাম, কারণ তারা কুফুরী করেছে আর আমার নিদর্শন ও রসূলদেরকে হাসি-তামাশার বিষয় বানিয়েছে।', 'That is their recompense - Hell - for what they denied and [because] they took My signs and My messengers in ridicule.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018106.mp3', now()),
  (18, 107, '', '[{"id":73336,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":73337,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":73338,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73339,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"waʿamilū","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73340,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73341,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَانَتْ","transliteration":"kānat","translation_bn":"রয়েছে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73342,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73343,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"جَنَّـٰتُ","transliteration":"jannātu","translation_bn":"জান্নাতসমূহ","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73344,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفِرْدَوْسِ","transliteration":"l-fir''dawsi","translation_bn":"ফিরদৌসের","root":"—","lemma":"فِرْدَوْس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73345,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"نُزُلًا","transliteration":"nuzulan","translation_bn":"আপ্যায়নরূপে","root":"نزل","lemma":"نُزُل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73346,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"١٠٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna āmanū waʿamilū l-ṣāliḥāti kānat lahum jannātu l-fir''dawsi nuzulan', 'যারা ঈমান আনে আর সৎকাজ করে তাদের আপ্যায়নের জন্য আছে ফিরদাউসের বাগান।', 'Indeed, those who have believed and done righteous deeds - they will have the Gardens of Paradise as a lodging,', 'যারা ঈমান আনে আর সৎকাজ করে তাদের আপ্যায়নের জন্য আছে ফিরদাউসের বাগান।', 'Indeed, those who have believed and done righteous deeds - they will have the Gardens of Paradise as a lodging,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018107.mp3', now()),
  (18, 108, '', '[{"id":73656,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","transliteration":"khālidīna","translation_bn":"তারা চিরস্থায়ী হবে","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73657,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73658,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":73659,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَبْغُونَ","transliteration":"yabghūna","translation_bn":"তারা চাইবে","root":"بغي","lemma":"بَغَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73660,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهَا","transliteration":"ʿanhā","translation_bn":"থেকে তা","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73661,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"حِوَلًۭا","transliteration":"ḥiwalan","translation_bn":"স্থানান্তর","root":"حول","lemma":"حِوَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73662,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"١٠٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'khālidīna fīhā lā yabghūna ʿanhā ḥiwalan', 'সেখানে তারা স্থায়ী হয়ে থাকবে, সেখান থেকে বের হয়ে আর অন্যত্র যেতে চাইবে না।', 'Wherein they abide eternally. They will not desire from it any transfer.', 'সেখানে তারা স্থায়ী হয়ে থাকবে, সেখান থেকে বের হয়ে আর অন্যত্র যেতে চাইবে না।', 'Wherein they abide eternally. They will not desire from it any transfer.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018108.mp3', now()),
  (18, 109, '', '[{"id":73885,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُل","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73886,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَّوْ","transliteration":"law","translation_bn":"\"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":73887,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73888,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَحْرُ","transliteration":"l-baḥru","translation_bn":"সমুদ্র","root":"بحر","lemma":"بَحْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73889,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِدَادًۭا","transliteration":"midādan","translation_bn":"(লেখার) কালি","root":"مدد","lemma":"مِدَاد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73890,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِّكَلِمَـٰتِ","transliteration":"likalimāti","translation_bn":"কথাসমূহ (লেখার জন্যে)","root":"كلم","lemma":"كَلِمَٰت","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73891,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73892,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَنَفِدَ","transliteration":"lanafida","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই নিঃশেষ হয়ে যাবে","root":"نفد","lemma":"نَفِدَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":73893,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَحْرُ","transliteration":"l-baḥru","translation_bn":"সমুদ্র","root":"بحر","lemma":"بَحْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73894,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلَ","transliteration":"qabla","translation_bn":"পূর্বেই","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":73895,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":73896,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"تَنفَدَ","transliteration":"tanfada","translation_bn":"শেষ হবে","root":"نفد","lemma":"نَفِدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73897,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كَلِمَـٰتُ","transliteration":"kalimātu","translation_bn":"কথাসমূহ","root":"كلم","lemma":"كَلِمَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73898,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73899,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদিও","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73900,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"جِئْنَا","transliteration":"ji''nā","translation_bn":"আমরা আসতাম","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73901,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بِمِثْلِهِۦ","transliteration":"bimith''lihi","translation_bn":"নিয়ে তার সমান (সমুদ্র)","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73902,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مَدَدًۭا","transliteration":"madadan","translation_bn":"সাহায্যার্থে\"","root":"مدد","lemma":"مَدَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73903,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"١٠٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul law kāna l-baḥru midādan likalimāti rabbī lanafida l-baḥru qabla an tanfada kalimātu rabbī walaw ji''nā bimith''lihi madadan', 'বল, ‘সমুদ্রগুলো যদি আমার প্রতিপালকের কথা লেখার জন্য কালি হয়ে যায়, তবে আমার প্রতিপালকের কথা লেখা শেষ হওয়ার আগেই সমুদ্র অবশ্যই নিঃশেষ হয়ে যাবে, আমি যদি এর সাহায্যের জন্য আরো অনুরূপ পরিমাণ সমুদ্র নিয়ে আসি তবুও।’', 'Say, "If the sea were ink for [writing] the words of my Lord, the sea would be exhausted before the words of my Lord were exhausted, even if We brought the like of it as a supplement."', 'বল, ‘সমুদ্রগুলো যদি আমার প্রতিপালকের কথা লেখার জন্য কালি হয়ে যায়, তবে আমার প্রতিপালকের কথা লেখা শেষ হওয়ার আগেই সমুদ্র অবশ্যই নিঃশেষ হয়ে যাবে, আমি যদি এর সাহায্যের জন্য আরো অনুরূপ পরিমাণ সমুদ্র নিয়ে আসি তবুও।’', 'Say, "If the sea were ink for [writing] the words of my Lord, the sea would be exhausted before the words of my Lord were exhausted, even if We brought the like of it as a supplement."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018109.mp3', now()),
  (18, 110, '', '[{"id":74069,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74070,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَآ","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"\"শুধুমাত্র","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":74071,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَا۠","transliteration":"anā","translation_bn":"আমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":74072,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بَشَرٌۭ","transliteration":"basharun","translation_bn":"একজন মানুষ","root":"بشر","lemma":"بَشَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74073,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّثْلُكُمْ","transliteration":"mith''lukum","translation_bn":"মতো তোমাদের","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74074,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يُوحَىٰٓ","transliteration":"yūḥā","translation_bn":"ওহী করা হয়","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74075,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىَّ","transliteration":"ilayya","translation_bn":"আমার প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74076,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّمَآ","transliteration":"annamā","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":74077,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهُكُمْ","transliteration":"ilāhukum","translation_bn":"ইলাহ তোমাদের","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74078,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهٌۭ","transliteration":"ilāhun","translation_bn":"ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74079,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٰحِدٌۭ ۖ","transliteration":"wāḥidun","translation_bn":"একই","root":"وحد","lemma":"وَٰحِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":74081,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَمَن","transliteration":"faman","translation_bn":"সুতরাং যে কেউ","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74082,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"সে ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74083,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَرْجُوا۟","transliteration":"yarjū","translation_bn":"কামনা করে","root":"رجو","lemma":"يَرْجُوا@","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74084,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لِقَآءَ","transliteration":"liqāa","translation_bn":"সাক্ষাত","root":"لقي","lemma":"لِقَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74085,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِۦ","transliteration":"rabbihi","translation_bn":"তার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74086,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فَلْيَعْمَلْ","transliteration":"falyaʿmal","translation_bn":"অতঃপর সে কাজ করে যেন","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74087,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"عَمَلًۭا","transliteration":"ʿamalan","translation_bn":"কাজ","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74088,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","translation_bn":"নেক","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74089,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74090,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يُشْرِكْ","transliteration":"yush''rik","translation_bn":"শির্‌ক করে","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74091,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"بِعِبَادَةِ","transliteration":"biʿibādati","translation_bn":"ক্ষেত্রে তার ইবাদাতের","root":"عبد","lemma":"عِبَادَت","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74092,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِۦٓ","transliteration":"rabbihi","translation_bn":"তার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74093,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"أَحَدًۢا","transliteration":"aḥadan","translation_bn":"(অন্য) কাউকে\"","root":"احد","lemma":"أَحَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74094,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"١١٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১০)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul innamā anā basharun mith''lukum yūḥā ilayya annamā ilāhukum ilāhun wāḥidun faman kāna yarjū liqāa rabbihi falyaʿmal ʿamalan ṣāliḥan walā yush''rik biʿibādati rabbihi aḥadan', 'বল, ‘আমি তোমাদেরই মত একজন মানুষ, আমার নিকট ওয়াহী করা হয় যে, তোমাদের ইলাহ কেবল এক ইলাহ। কাজেই যে ব্যক্তি তার প্রতিপালকের সঙ্গে সাক্ষাতের আশা করে, সে যেন সৎ ‘আমাল করে আর তার প্রতিপালকের ‘ইবাদাতে কাউকে শরীক না করে।’', 'Say, "I am only a man like you, to whom has been revealed that your god is one God. So whoever would hope for the meeting with his Lord - let him do righteous work and not associate in the worship of his Lord anyone."', 'বল, ‘আমি তোমাদেরই মত একজন মানুষ, আমার নিকট ওয়াহী করা হয় যে, তোমাদের ইলাহ কেবল এক ইলাহ। কাজেই যে ব্যক্তি তার প্রতিপালকের সঙ্গে সাক্ষাতের আশা করে, সে যেন সৎ ‘আমাল করে আর তার প্রতিপালকের ‘ইবাদাতে কাউকে শরীক না করে।’', 'Say, "I am only a man like you, to whom has been revealed that your god is one God. So whoever would hope for the meeting with his Lord - let him do righteous work and not associate in the worship of his Lord anyone."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/018110.mp3', now())
