ার প্রতিপালকের নিকট আপনার জন্য ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা করব, তিনি আমার প্রতি বড়ই মেহেরবান।', '[Abraham] said, "Peace will be upon you. I will ask forgiveness for you of my Lord. Indeed, He is ever gracious to me.', 'ইবরাহীম বলল, ‘আপনার প্রতি সালাম, আমি আমার প্রতিপালকের নিকট আপনার জন্য ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা করব, তিনি আমার প্রতি বড়ই মেহেরবান।', '[Abraham] said, "Peace will be upon you. I will ask forgiveness for you of my Lord. Indeed, He is ever gracious to me.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019047.mp3', now()),
  (19, 48, '', '[{"id":47190,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَعْتَزِلُكُمْ","transliteration":"wa-aʿtazilukum","translation_bn":"এবং আপনাদের থেকে আমি পৃথক হচ্ছি","root":"عزل","lemma":"ٱعْتَزَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47191,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47192,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَدْعُونَ","transliteration":"tadʿūna","translation_bn":"আপনারা ডাকেন","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47193,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47194,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47195,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":47196,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَأَدْعُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-adʿū","translation_bn":"এবং ডাকবো আমি","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47197,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রবকে","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47198,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَسَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿasā","translation_bn":"আশা করি","root":"عسي","lemma":"عَسَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47199,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَلَّآ","transliteration":"allā","translation_bn":"যে না","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":47200,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَكُونَ","transliteration":"akūna","translation_bn":"হবো আমি","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47201,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِدُعَآءِ","transliteration":"biduʿāi","translation_bn":"ডাকার কারণে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دُعَا^ء","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47202,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47203,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"شَقِيًّۭا","transliteration":"shaqiyyan","translation_bn":"ব্যর্থকাম\"","root":"شقو","lemma":"شَقِيّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":47204,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٤٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-aʿtazilukum wamā tadʿūna min dūni l-lahi wa-adʿū rabbī ʿasā allā akūna biduʿāi rabbī shaqiyyan', 'আমি পরিত্যাগ করছি আপনাদেরকে আর আপনারা আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে যাদেরকে ডাকেন তাদেরকে। আমি আমার প্রতিপালককে ডাকি, আশা করি আমি আমার প্রতিপালককে ডেকে বঞ্চিত হব না।’', 'And I will leave you and those you invoke other than Allah and will invoke my Lord. I expect that I will not be in invocation to my Lord unhappy."', 'আমি পরিত্যাগ করছি আপনাদেরকে আর আপনারা আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে যাদেরকে ডাকেন তাদেরকে। আমি আমার প্রতিপালককে ডাকি, আশা করি আমি আমার প্রতিপালককে ডেকে বঞ্চিত হব না।’', 'And I will leave you and those you invoke other than Allah and will invoke my Lord. I expect that I will not be in invocation to my Lord unhappy."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019048.mp3', now()),
  (19, 49, '', '[{"id":47821,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47822,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱعْتَزَلَهُمْ","transliteration":"iʿ''tazalahum","translation_bn":"তাদের থেকে পৃথক হলো সে","root":"عزل","lemma":"ٱعْتَزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47823,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47824,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَعْبُدُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿbudūna","translation_bn":"তারা উপাসনা করতো","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47825,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47826,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47827,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":47828,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَهَبْنَا","transliteration":"wahabnā","translation_bn":"আমরা দান করলাম","root":"وهب","lemma":"وَهَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47829,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥٓ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তাকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥٓ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47830,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِسْحَـٰقَ","transliteration":"is''ḥāqa","translation_bn":"ইসহাককে","root":"—","lemma":"إِسْحَاق","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":47831,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَيَعْقُوبَ ۖ","transliteration":"wayaʿqūba","translation_bn":"ও ইয়াকুবকে","root":"—","lemma":"يَعْقُوب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47833,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَكُلًّۭا","transliteration":"wakullan","translation_bn":"এবং প্রত্যেককে","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47834,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلْنَا","transliteration":"jaʿalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা বানালাম","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47835,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"نَبِيًّۭا","transliteration":"nabiyyan","translation_bn":"নাবী","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَّبِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47836,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā iʿ''tazalahum wamā yaʿbudūna min dūni l-lahi wahabnā lahu is''ḥāqa wayaʿqūba wakullan jaʿalnā nabiyyan', 'অতঃপর সে যখন তাদেরকে আর তারা আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে যাদের ‘ইবাদাত করত তাদেরকে পরিত্যাগ করল, তখন আমি তাকে দান করলাম ইসহাক্ব আর ইয়া‘কূব আর তাদের প্রত্যেককে নবী করলাম।', 'So when he had left them and those they worshipped other than Allah, We gave him Isaac and Jacob, and each [of them] We made a prophet.', 'অতঃপর সে যখন তাদেরকে আর তারা আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে যাদের ‘ইবাদাত করত তাদেরকে পরিত্যাগ করল, তখন আমি তাকে দান করলাম ইসহাক্ব আর ইয়া‘কূব আর তাদের প্রত্যেককে নবী করলাম।', 'So when he had left them and those they worshipped other than Allah, We gave him Isaac and Jacob, and each [of them] We made a prophet.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019049.mp3', now()),
  (19, 50, '', '[{"id":48426,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَوَهَبْنَا","transliteration":"wawahabnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা দান করলাম","root":"وهب","lemma":"وَهَبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48427,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَهُم","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48428,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48429,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَّحْمَتِنَا","transliteration":"raḥmatinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের অনুগ্রহ","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48430,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلْنَا","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা দিলাম","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48431,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48432,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِسَانَ","transliteration":"lisāna","translation_bn":"ভাষা","root":"لسن","lemma":"لِسَان","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48433,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"صِدْقٍ","transliteration":"ṣid''qin","translation_bn":"সত্যের ও সুখ্যাতির","root":"صدق","lemma":"صِدْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48434,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيًّۭا","transliteration":"ʿaliyyan","translation_bn":"সমুচ্চ","root":"علو","lemma":"عَلِيّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":48435,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٥٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫০)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wawahabnā lahum min raḥmatinā wajaʿalnā lahum lisāna ṣid''qin ʿaliyyan', 'আমি তাদেরকে দান করলাম আমার অনুগ্রহ আর সত্যিকার নাম-যশের সুউচ্চ সুখ্যাতি।', 'And We gave them of Our mercy, and we made for them a reputation of high honor.', 'আমি তাদেরকে দান করলাম আমার অনুগ্রহ আর সত্যিকার নাম-যশের সুউচ্চ সুখ্যাতি।', 'And We gave them of Our mercy, and we made for them a reputation of high honor.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019050.mp3', now()),
  (19, 51, '', '[{"id":49628,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱذْكُرْ","transliteration":"wa-udh''kur","translation_bn":"উল্লেখ করো (যা)","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49629,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (বলা হচ্ছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49630,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-kitābi","translation_bn":"(এই) কিতাবের","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49631,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰٓ ۚ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসা (সম্পর্কে)","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":49633,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"সে নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":49634,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49635,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُخْلَصًۭا","transliteration":"mukh''laṣan","translation_bn":"বিশুদ্ধচিত্ত","root":"خلص","lemma":"مُخْلَص","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49636,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49637,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولًۭا","transliteration":"rasūlan","translation_bn":"রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49638,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"نَّبِيًّۭا","transliteration":"nabiyyan","translation_bn":"নাবী","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَّبِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49639,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٥١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫১)","root":"—","lemma":"٥١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-udh''kur fī l-kitābi mūsā innahu kāna mukh''laṣan wakāna rasūlan nabiyyan', 'এ কিতাবে উল্লেখিত মূসার কথা স্মরণ কর, সে ছিল বিশেষভাবে মনোনীত, আর একজন রসূল ও নবী।', 'And mention in the Book, Moses. Indeed, he was chosen, and he was a messenger and a prophet.', 'এ কিতাবে উল্লেখিত মূসার কথা স্মরণ কর, সে ছিল বিশেষভাবে মনোনীত, আর একজন রসূল ও নবী।', 'And mention in the Book, Moses. Indeed, he was chosen, and he was a messenger and a prophet.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019051.mp3', now()),
  (19, 52, '', '[{"id":50285,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَنَـٰدَيْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"wanādaynāhu","translation_bn":"এবং তাকে আমরা ডেকেছি","root":"ندو","lemma":"نَادَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50286,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50287,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَانِبِ","transliteration":"jānibi","translation_bn":"দিক","root":"جنب","lemma":"جَانِب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50288,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلطُّورِ","transliteration":"l-ṭūri","translation_bn":"তুর (পাহাড়ের)","root":"طور","lemma":"طُور","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50289,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَيْمَنِ","transliteration":"l-aymani","translation_bn":"ডান (দিক)","root":"يمن","lemma":"أَيْمَن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50290,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَقَرَّبْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"waqarrabnāhu","translation_bn":"এবং তাকে আমরা কাছে টেনেছিলাম","root":"قرب","lemma":"قَرَّبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50291,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نَجِيًّۭا","transliteration":"najiyyan","translation_bn":"অন্তরঙ্গ আলাপের জন্যে","root":"نجو","lemma":"نَجِيّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50292,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٥٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫২)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wanādaynāhu min jānibi l-ṭūri l-aymani waqarrabnāhu najiyyan', 'আমি তাকে ডাক দিয়েছিলাম তূর পাহাড়ের ডান পার্শ্ব থেকে আর গোপনে কথাবার্তা বলার জন্য তাকে নিকটবর্তী করেছিলাম।', 'And We called him from the side of the mount at [his] right and brought him near, confiding [to him].', 'আমি তাকে ডাক দিয়েছিলাম তূর পাহাড়ের ডান পার্শ্ব থেকে আর গোপনে কথাবার্তা বলার জন্য তাকে নিকটবর্তী করেছিলাম।', 'And We called him from the side of the mount at [his] right and brought him near, confiding [to him].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019052.mp3', now()),
  (19, 53, '', '[{"id":50853,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَوَهَبْنَا","transliteration":"wawahabnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা বানালাম","root":"وهب","lemma":"وَهَبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50854,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50855,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50856,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَّحْمَتِنَآ","transliteration":"raḥmatinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের অনুগ্রহ","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50857,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَخَاهُ","transliteration":"akhāhu","translation_bn":"তার ভাই","root":"اخو","lemma":"أَخ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50858,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰرُونَ","transliteration":"hārūna","translation_bn":"হারুনকে","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰرُون","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":50859,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نَبِيًّۭا","transliteration":"nabiyyan","translation_bn":"নাবীরূপে","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَّبِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50860,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٥٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wawahabnā lahu min raḥmatinā akhāhu hārūna nabiyyan', 'আর আমি স্বীয় অনুগ্রহে তাকে দান করেছিলাম তার ভাই হারূনকে, সেও ছিল একজন নবী।', 'And We gave him out of Our mercy his brother Aaron as a prophet.', 'আর আমি স্বীয় অনুগ্রহে তাকে দান করেছিলাম তার ভাই হারূনকে, সেও ছিল একজন নবী।', 'And We gave him out of Our mercy his brother Aaron as a prophet.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019053.mp3', now()),
