প্রতি সবচেয়ে অবাধ্যকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই টেনে বের করব।', 'Then We will surely extract from every sect those of them who were worst against the Most Merciful in insolence.', 'অতঃপর প্রত্যেক দল হতে দয়াময়ের প্রতি সবচেয়ে অবাধ্যকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই টেনে বের করব।', 'Then We will surely extract from every sect those of them who were worst against the Most Merciful in insolence.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019069.mp3', now()),
  (19, 70, '', '[{"id":59387,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59388,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَنَحْنُ","transliteration":"lanaḥnu","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"لَنَحْنُ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":59389,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"aʿlamu","translation_bn":"খুব জানি","root":"علم","lemma":"أَعْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59390,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"bi-alladhīna","translation_bn":"তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59391,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":59392,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَوْلَىٰ","transliteration":"awlā","translation_bn":"অধিকতর যোগ্য","root":"ولي","lemma":"أَوْلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59393,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"তাঁতে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59394,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"صِلِيًّۭا","transliteration":"ṣiliyyan","translation_bn":"প্রবেশের (জন্যে)","root":"صلي","lemma":"صِلِيّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59395,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٧٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭০)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma lanaḥnu aʿlamu bi-alladhīna hum awlā bihā ṣiliyyan', 'আর আমি অবশ্য অবশ্যই খুব ভাল করে জানি তাদের মধ্যে কারা জাহান্নামে দগ্ধ হওয়ার সর্বাধিক উপযুক্ত।', 'Then, surely it is We who are most knowing of those most worthy of burning therein.', 'আর আমি অবশ্য অবশ্যই খুব ভাল করে জানি তাদের মধ্যে কারা জাহান্নামে দগ্ধ হওয়ার সর্বাধিক উপযুক্ত।', 'Then, surely it is We who are most knowing of those most worthy of burning therein.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019070.mp3', now()),
  (19, 71, '', '[{"id":60091,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং নেই","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60092,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِّنكُمْ","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মধ্যে কেউ","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60093,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":60094,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَارِدُهَا ۚ","transliteration":"wāriduhā","translation_bn":"অতিক্রমকারী তা","root":"ورد","lemma":"وَارِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60096,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"(এটা) হলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60097,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60098,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60099,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"حَتْمًۭا","transliteration":"ḥatman","translation_bn":"চুড়ান্ত","root":"حتم","lemma":"حَتْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60100,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَّقْضِيًّۭا","transliteration":"maqḍiyyan","translation_bn":"অনিবার্য","root":"قضي","lemma":"مَّقْضِيّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":60101,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٧١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭১)","root":"—","lemma":"٧١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-in minkum illā wāriduhā kāna ʿalā rabbika ḥatman maqḍiyyan', 'তোমাদের মধ্যে এমন কেউ নেই যাকে জাহান্নাম অতিক্রম করতে হবে না, এটা তোমার প্রতিপালকের অনিবার্য ফয়সালা।', 'And there is none of you except he will come to it. This is upon your Lord an inevitability decreed.', 'তোমাদের মধ্যে এমন কেউ নেই যাকে জাহান্নাম অতিক্রম করতে হবে না, এটা তোমার প্রতিপালকের অনিবার্য ফয়সালা।', 'And there is none of you except he will come to it. This is upon your Lord an inevitability decreed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019071.mp3', now()),
  (19, 72, '', '[{"id":60646,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60647,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نُنَجِّى","transliteration":"nunajjī","translation_bn":"উদ্ধার করবো আমরা","root":"نجو","lemma":"نَجَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60648,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":60649,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّقَوا۟","transliteration":"ittaqaw","translation_bn":"তাকওয়া অবলম্বন করেছে","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60650,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَّنَذَرُ","transliteration":"wanadharu","translation_bn":"ও রেখে দিবো আমরা","root":"وذر","lemma":"يَذَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60651,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদেরকে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60652,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60653,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"جِثِيًّۭا","transliteration":"jithiyyan","translation_bn":"নতজানু অবস্থায়","root":"جثو","lemma":"جِثِيّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60654,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٧٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭২)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma nunajjī alladhīna ittaqaw wanadharu l-ẓālimīna fīhā jithiyyan', 'অতঃপর মুত্তাকীদেরকে আমি রক্ষা করব আর যালিমদেরকে তার মধ্যে নতজানু অবস্থায় রেখে দেব।', 'Then We will save those who feared Allah and leave the wrongdoers within it, on their knees.', 'অতঃপর মুত্তাকীদেরকে আমি রক্ষা করব আর যালিমদেরকে তার মধ্যে নতজানু অবস্থায় রেখে দেব।', 'Then We will save those who feared Allah and leave the wrongdoers within it, on their knees.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019072.mp3', now()),
  (19, 73, '', '[{"id":60934,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60935,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تُتْلَىٰ","transliteration":"tut''lā","translation_bn":"আবৃত্তি করা হয়","root":"تلو","lemma":"تَلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60936,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60937,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتُنَا","transliteration":"āyātunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের আয়াতসমূহ","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60938,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"bayyinātin","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":60939,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60940,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":60941,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60942,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) কে যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60943,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60944,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَىُّ","transliteration":"ayyu","translation_bn":"\"কোনটি","root":"—","lemma":"أَىّ\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":60945,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَرِيقَيْنِ","transliteration":"l-farīqayni","translation_bn":"দু''দলের","root":"فرق","lemma":"فَرِيق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60946,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60947,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مَّقَامًۭا","transliteration":"maqāman","translation_bn":"মর্যাদায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"مَقَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60948,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَأَحْسَنُ","transliteration":"wa-aḥsanu","translation_bn":"ও শ্রেষ্ঠতর (জাগজমকপূর্ণ)","root":"حسن","lemma":"أَحْسَن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60949,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"نَدِيًّۭا","transliteration":"nadiyyan","translation_bn":"সমাজ হিসেবে\"","root":"ندو","lemma":"نَدِيّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60950,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٧٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā tut''lā ʿalayhim āyātunā bayyinātin qāla alladhīna kafarū lilladhīna āmanū ayyu l-farīqayni khayrun maqāman wa-aḥsanu nadiyyan', 'আমার স্পষ্ট আয়াত যখন তাদের নিকট আবৃত্তি করা হয় তখন কাফিররা মু’মিনদেরকে বলে, ‘দু’টি দলের মধ্যে মর্যাদায় কোনটি শ্রেষ্ঠ আর মজলিস হিসেবে অধিক উত্তম?’', 'And when Our verses are recited to them as clear evidences, those who disbelieve say to those who believe, "Which of [our] two parties is best in position and best in association?"', 'আমার স্পষ্ট আয়াত যখন তাদের নিকট আবৃত্তি করা হয় তখন কাফিররা মু’মিনদেরকে বলে, ‘দু’টি দলের মধ্যে মর্যাদায় কোনটি শ্রেষ্ঠ আর মজলিস হিসেবে অধিক উত্তম?’', 'And when Our verses are recited to them as clear evidences, those who disbelieve say to those who believe, "Which of [our] two parties is best in position and best in association?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019073.mp3', now()),
  (19, 74, '', '[{"id":61462,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَمْ","transliteration":"wakam","translation_bn":"এবং কতই (না)","root":"—","lemma":"كَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61463,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلَكْنَا","transliteration":"ahlaknā","translation_bn":"আমরা ধ্বংস করেছি","root":"هلك","lemma":"أَهْلَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61464,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلَهُم","transliteration":"qablahum","translation_bn":"তাদের পূর্বে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":61465,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61466,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَرْنٍ","transliteration":"qarnin","translation_bn":"মানবগোষ্ঠিকে","root":"قرن","lemma":"قَرْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61467,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":61468,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَحْسَنُ","transliteration":"aḥsanu","translation_bn":"(ছিলো) উত্তম","root":"حسن","lemma":"أَحْسَن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61469,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَثَـٰثًۭا","transliteration":"athāthan","translation_bn":"সম্পদে (সাজ সরঞ্জামে)","root":"اثث","lemma":"أَثَٰث","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61470,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَرِءْيًۭا","transliteration":"wari''yan","translation_bn":"এবং (চাকচিক্যে) বাহ্যদৃষ্টিতে","root":"راي","lemma":"رِءْي","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61471,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٧٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakam ahlaknā qablahum min qarnin hum aḥsanu athāthan wari''yan', 'আমি তাদের পূর্বে বহু মানব বংশকে ধ্বংস করেছি যারা উপায় উপকরণে আর বাইরের চাকচিক্যে তাদের অপেক্ষা শ্রেষ্ঠ ছিল।', 'And how many a generation have We destroyed before them who were better in possessions and [outward] appearance?', 'আমি তাদের পূর্বে বহু মানব বংশকে ধ্বংস করেছি যারা উপায় উপকরণে আর বাইরের চাকচিক্যে তাদের অপেক্ষা শ্রেষ্ঠ ছিল।', 'And how many a generation have We destroyed before them who were better in possessions and [outward] appearance?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019074.mp3', now()),
  (19, 75, '', '[{"id":61989,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61990,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"\"যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":61991,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61992,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61993,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلضَّلَـٰلَةِ","transliteration":"l-ḍalālati","translation_bn":"বিভ্রান্তির","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَٰلَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61994,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَلْيَمْدُدْ","transliteration":"falyamdud","translation_bn":"সেক্ষেত্রে অবকাশ  দিবেন","root":"مدد","lemma":"مَدَّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61995,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَهُ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61996,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-raḥmānu","translation_bn":"দয়াময়","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61997,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَدًّا ۚ","transliteration":"maddan","translation_bn":"(অনেক) অবকাশ","root":"مدد","lemma":"مَدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61999,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"শেষ পর্যন্ত","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":62000,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":62001,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"رَأَوْا۟","transliteration":"ra-aw","translation_bn":"তারা দেখবে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62002,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":62003,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يُوعَدُونَ","transliteration":"yūʿadūna","translation_bn":"তাদের প্রতিশ্রুতি দেয়া হয়েছে","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62004,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِمَّا","transliteration":"immā","translation_bn":"হয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62005,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابَ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62006,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَإِمَّا","transliteration":"wa-immā","translation_bn":"আর না হয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62007,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّاعَةَ","transliteration":"l-sāʿata","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের সময়","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62008,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"فَسَيَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"fasayaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"অচিরেই তখন তারা জানবে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62009,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مَنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":62010,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"সে","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":62011,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"شَرٌّۭ","transliteration":"sharrun","translation_bn":"নিকৃষ্ট","root":"شرر","lemma":"شَرّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62012,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مَّكَانًۭا","transliteration":"makānan","translation_bn":"মর্যাদায়","root":"كون","lemma":"مَّكَان","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62013,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"وَأَضْعَفُ","transliteration":"wa-aḍʿafu","translation_bn":"ও দুর্বলতর","root":"ضعف","lemma":"أَضْعَف","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62014,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"جُندًۭا","transliteration":"jundan","translation_bn":"দলবলে (সৈন্য সামন্তে)\"","root":"جند","lemma":"جُند","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62015,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٧٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul man kāna fī l-ḍalālati falyamdud lahu l-raḥmānu maddan ḥattā idhā ra-aw mā yūʿadūna immā l-ʿadhāba wa-immā l-sāʿata fasayaʿlamūna man huwa sharrun makānan wa-aḍʿafu jundan', 'বল, যারা গুমরাহীতে পড়ে আছে, দয়াময় তাদের জন্য (রশি) ঢিল দিয়ে দেন, যে পর্যন্ত না তারা দেখতে পাবে যার ওয়া‘দা তাদেরকে দেয়া হচ্ছে- তা শাস্তিই হোক কিংবা ক্বিয়ামতই হোক।’ তখন তারা জানতে পারবে মর্যাদায় কে নিকৃষ্ট আর জনবলে দুর্বল।', 'Say, "Whoever is in error - let the Most Merciful extend for him an extension [in wealth and time] until, when they see that which they were promised - either punishment [in this world] or the Hour [of resurrection] - they will come to know who is worst in position and weaker in soldiers."', 'বল, যারা গুমরাহীতে পড়ে আছে, দয়াময় তাদের জন্য (রশি) ঢিল দিয়ে দেন, যে পর্যন্ত না তারা দেখতে পাবে যার ওয়া‘দা তাদেরকে দেয়া হচ্ছে- তা শাস্তিই হোক কিংবা ক্বিয়ামতই হোক।’ তখন তারা জানতে পারবে মর্যাদায় কে নিকৃষ্ট আর জনবলে দুর্বল।', 'Say, "Whoever is in error - let the Most Merciful extend for him an extension [in wealth and time] until, when they see that which they were promised - either punishment [in this world] or the Hour [of resurrection] - they will come to know who is worst in position and weaker in soldiers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019075.mp3', now()),
  (19, 76, '', '[{"id":62435,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَزِيدُ","transliteration":"wayazīdu","translation_bn":"এবং বাড়িয়ে দেন","root":"زيد","lemma":"زَادَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62436,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":62437,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":62438,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱهْتَدَوْا۟","transliteration":"ih''tadaw","translation_bn":"সঠিক পথে চলে","root":"هدي","lemma":"ٱهْتَدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62439,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هُدًۭى ۗ","transliteration":"hudan","translation_bn":"(অধিক) পথ নির্দেশ","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62441,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْبَـٰقِيَـٰتُ","transliteration":"wal-bāqiyātu","translation_bn":"এবং স্থায়ী","root":"بقي","lemma":"بَٰقِيَٰت","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62442,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتُ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥātu","translation_bn":"সৎকর্মসমূহ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62443,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":62444,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":62445,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62446,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ثَوَابًۭا","transliteration":"thawāban","translation_bn":"পুরস্কার প্রাপ্তিতে","root":"ثوب","lemma":"ثَوَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62447,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَخَيْرٌۭ","transliteration":"wakhayrun","translation_bn":"ও উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62448,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَّرَدًّا","transliteration":"maraddan","translation_bn":"প্রতিদান হিসাবে","root":"ردد","lemma":"مَرَدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62449,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٧٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayazīdu l-lahu alladhīna ih''tadaw hudan wal-bāqiyātu l-ṣāliḥātu khayrun ʿinda rabbika thawāban wakhayrun maraddan', 'যারা সৎপথ সন্ধান করে আল্লাহ তাদেরকে অধিক হিদায়াত দান করেন। আর স্থায়ী সৎকর্মসমূহ তোমার পালনকর্তার নিকট সাওয়াবের দিক দিয়ে শ্রেষ্ঠ আর প্রতিদান হিসেবেও শ্রেষ্ঠ।', 'And Allah increases those who were guided, in guidance, and the enduring good deeds are better to your Lord for reward and better for recourse.', 'যারা সৎপথ সন্ধান করে আল্লাহ তাদেরকে অধিক হিদায়াত দান করেন। আর স্থায়ী সৎকর্মসমূহ তোমার পালনকর্তার নিকট সাওয়াবের দিক দিয়ে শ্রেষ্ঠ আর প্রতিদান হিসেবেও শ্রেষ্ঠ।', 'And Allah increases those who were guided, in guidance, and the enduring good deeds are better to your Lord for reward and better for recourse.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019076.mp3', now()),
  (19, 77, '', '[{"id":62843,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَفَرَءَيْتَ","transliteration":"afara-ayta","translation_bn":"কি তুমি দেখেছো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":62844,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":62845,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرَ","transliteration":"kafara","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62846,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"সঙ্গে আমাদের নিদর্শনগুলোর","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62847,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالَ","transliteration":"waqāla","translation_bn":"এবং বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62848,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَأُوتَيَنَّ","transliteration":"laūtayanna","translation_bn":"\"আমাকে অবশ্যই দেয়া হবেই","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":62849,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَالًۭا","transliteration":"mālan","translation_bn":"ধন-সম্পদ","root":"مول","lemma":"مَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62850,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَوَلَدًا","transliteration":"wawaladan","translation_bn":"ও সন্তান\"","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَلَد","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62851,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٧٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'afara-ayta alladhī kafara biāyātinā waqāla laūtayanna mālan wawaladan', 'তুমি কি লক্ষ্য করেছ সে ব্যক্তিকে যে আমার নিদর্শনসমূহকে প্রত্যাখ্যান করেছে আর সে বলে, ‘আমাকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই সম্পদ আর সন্তানাদি দেয়া হবে।’', 'Then, have you seen he who disbelieved in Our verses and said, "I will surely be given wealth and children [in the next life]?"', 'তুমি কি লক্ষ্য করেছ সে ব্যক্তিকে যে আমার নিদর্শনসমূহকে প্রত্যাখ্যান করেছে আর সে বলে, ‘আমাকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই সম্পদ আর সন্তানাদি দেয়া হবে।’', 'Then, have you seen he who disbelieved in Our verses and said, "I will surely be given wealth and children [in the next life]?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019077.mp3', now()),
  (19, 78, '', '[{"id":63588,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَطَّلَعَ","transliteration":"aṭṭalaʿa","translation_bn":"কি সে অবহিত হয়েছে","root":"طلع","lemma":"طَّلَعَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":63589,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَيْبَ","transliteration":"l-ghayba","translation_bn":"অদৃশ্য সম্পর্কে","root":"غيب","lemma":"غَيْب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63590,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَمِ","transliteration":"ami","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63591,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّخَذَ","transliteration":"ittakhadha","translation_bn":"গ্রহণ করেছে (কি)","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63592,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"নিকট থেকে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":63593,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ","transliteration":"l-raḥmāni","translation_bn":"দয়াময়ের","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63594,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَهْدًۭا","transliteration":"ʿahdan","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"عهد","lemma":"عَهْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63595,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٧٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'aṭṭalaʿa l-ghayba ami ittakhadha ʿinda l-raḥmāni ʿahdan', 'সে কি অদৃশ্য বিষয় জেনে ফেলেছে, নাকি দয়াময়ের নিকট থেকে প্রতিশ্রুতি লাভ করেছে?', 'Has he looked into the unseen, or has he taken from the Most Merciful a promise?', 'সে কি অদৃশ্য বিষয় জেনে ফেলেছে, নাকি দয়াময়ের নিকট থেকে প্রতিশ্রুতি লাভ করেছে?', 'Has he looked into the unseen, or has he taken from the Most Merciful a promise?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019078.mp3', now()),
  (19, 79, '', '[{"id":63733,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"كَلَّا ۚ","transliteration":"kallā","translation_bn":"কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"كَلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"অনিচ্ছা পদ (Aversion)"},{"id":63735,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"سَنَكْتُبُ","transliteration":"sanaktubu","translation_bn":"অচিরেই লিখবো আমরা","root":"كتب","lemma":"كَتَبَ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":63736,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":63737,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُ","transliteration":"yaqūlu","translation_bn":"সে বলছে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63738,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَنَمُدُّ","transliteration":"wanamuddu","translation_bn":"এবং বাড়িয়ে দিবো আমরা","root":"مدد","lemma":"مَدَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63739,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63740,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63741,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63742,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَدًّۭا","transliteration":"maddan","translation_bn":"(অধিক মাত্রায়) বাড়ান","root":"مدد","lemma":"مَدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63743,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٧٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'kallā sanaktubu mā yaqūlu wanamuddu lahu mina l-ʿadhābi maddan', 'কক্ষনো না, তারা যা বলে আমি তা লিখে রাখব আর আমি তার শাস্তি বাড়াতেই থাকব, বাড়াতেই থাকব।', 'No! We will record what he says and extend for him from the punishment extensively.', 'কক্ষনো না, তারা যা বলে আমি তা লিখে রাখব আর আমি তার শাস্তি বাড়াতেই থাকব, বাড়াতেই থাকব।', 'No! We will record what he says and extend for him from the punishment extensively.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019079.mp3', now()),
  (19, 80, '', '[{"id":64299,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَنَرِثُهُۥ","transliteration":"wanarithuhu","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা তার অধিকারী হবো","root":"ورث","lemma":"وَرِثَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64300,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":64301,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُ","transliteration":"yaqūlu","translation_bn":"সে বলছে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64302,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَيَأْتِينَا","transliteration":"wayatīnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমার কাছে সে আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64303,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَرْدًۭا","transliteration":"fardan","translation_bn":"একাকী","root":"فرد","lemma":"فَرْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64304,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٨٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮০)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wanarithuhu mā yaqūlu wayatīnā fardan', 'সে যে বিষয়ের কথা বলে (তার সম্পদ-সরঞ্জাম ও জনবলের গর্ব করে) তা থাকবে আমার অধিকারে আর সে আমার কাছে আসবে নিঃসঙ্গ, একাকী।', 'And We will inherit him [in] what he mentions, and he will come to Us alone.', 'সে যে বিষয়ের কথা বলে (তার সম্পদ-সরঞ্জাম ও জনবলের গর্ব করে) তা থাকবে আমার অধিকারে আর সে আমার কাছে আসবে নিঃসঙ্গ, একাকী।', 'And We will inherit him [in] what he mentions, and he will come to Us alone.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019080.mp3', now()),
  (19, 81, '', '[{"id":64541,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّخَذُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-ittakhadhū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা গ্রহণ করেছে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64542,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64543,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64544,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":64545,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ءَالِهَةًۭ","transliteration":"ālihatan","translation_bn":"ইলাহ (অন্য)","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64546,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِّيَكُونُوا۟","transliteration":"liyakūnū","translation_bn":"যেন তারা হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64547,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64548,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عِزًّۭا","transliteration":"ʿizzan","translation_bn":"সহায়ক (শক্তি)","root":"عزز","lemma":"عِزّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64549,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٨١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮১)","root":"—","lemma":"٨١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-ittakhadhū min dūni l-lahi ālihatan liyakūnū lahum ʿizzan', 'তারা আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে অন্যান্য ইলাহ গ্রহণ করেছে যাতে তারা (অর্থাৎ ঐ কল্পিত মা‘বুদগুলো) তাদের জন্য পৃষ্ঠপোষক হয়।', 'And they have taken besides Allah [false] deities that they would be for them [a source of] honor.', 'তারা আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে অন্যান্য ইলাহ গ্রহণ করেছে যাতে তারা (অর্থাৎ ঐ কল্পিত মা‘বুদগুলো) তাদের জন্য পৃষ্ঠপোষক হয়।', 'And they have taken besides Allah [false] deities that they would be for them [a source of] honor.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019081.mp3', now()),
  (19, 82, '', '[{"id":65166,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"كَلَّا ۚ","transliteration":"kallā","translation_bn":"কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"كَلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"অনিচ্ছা পদ (Aversion)"},{"id":65168,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"سَيَكْفُرُونَ","transliteration":"sayakfurūna","translation_bn":"অচিরেই তারা অস্বীকার করবে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":65169,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِعِبَادَتِهِمْ","transliteration":"biʿibādatihim","translation_bn":"তাদের উপাসনা সম্পর্কে","root":"عبد","lemma":"عِبَادَت","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65170,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَيَكُونُونَ","transliteration":"wayakūnūna","translation_bn":"এবং তারা হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65171,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের ব্যাপারে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65172,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ضِدًّا","transliteration":"ḍiddan","translation_bn":"(তাদের দাবীর) বিরোধী","root":"ضدد","lemma":"ضِدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65173,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٨٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮২)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'kallā sayakfurūna biʿibādatihim wayakūnūna ʿalayhim ḍiddan', 'কক্ষনো না, তারা তাদের ‘ইবাদাত অস্বীকার করবে আর তাদের বিরোধী হয়ে যাবে।', 'No! Those "gods" will deny their worship of them and will be against them opponents [on the Day of Judgement].', 'কক্ষনো না, তারা তাদের ‘ইবাদাত অস্বীকার করবে আর তাদের বিরোধী হয়ে যাবে।', 'No! Those "gods" will deny their worship of them and will be against them opponents [on the Day of Judgement].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019082.mp3', now()),
  (19, 83, '', '[{"id":65359,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"নি কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":65360,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَرَ","transliteration":"tara","translation_bn":"তুমি লক্ষ্য করো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65361,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّآ","transliteration":"annā","translation_bn":"যে আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":65362,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَا","transliteration":"arsalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা পাঠিয়েছি","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65363,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيَـٰطِينَ","transliteration":"l-shayāṭīna","translation_bn":"শয়তানদেরকে","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65364,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65365,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","translation_bn":"কাফিরদের","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65366,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَؤُزُّهُمْ","transliteration":"ta-uzzuhum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে উদ্বুদ্ধ করে","root":"ازز","lemma":"تَؤُزُّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65367,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَزًّۭا","transliteration":"azzan","translation_bn":"(বেশী বেশী) উদ্বুদ্ধ","root":"ازز","lemma":"أَزّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65368,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٨٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alam tara annā arsalnā l-shayāṭīna ʿalā l-kāfirīna ta-uzzuhum azzan', 'তুমি কি লক্ষ্য কর না যে, আমি কাফিরদের জন্য শয়ত্বানকে ছেড়ে রেখেছি তাদেরকে মন্দ কর্ম করতে প্ররোচিত করার জন্য।', 'Do you not see that We have sent the devils upon the disbelievers, inciting them to [evil] with [constant] incitement?', 'তুমি কি লক্ষ্য কর না যে, আমি কাফিরদের জন্য শয়ত্বানকে ছেড়ে রেখেছি তাদেরকে মন্দ কর্ম করতে প্ররোচিত করার জন্য।', 'Do you not see that We have sent the devils upon the disbelievers, inciting them to [evil] with [constant] incitement?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019083.mp3', now()),
  (19, 84, '', '[{"id":65679,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"অতএব না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65680,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَعْجَلْ","transliteration":"taʿjal","translation_bn":"তাড়াতাড়ি করো","root":"عجل","lemma":"عَجِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65681,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের ব্যাপারে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65683,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"মুলতঃ","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":65684,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نَعُدُّ","transliteration":"naʿuddu","translation_bn":"গণনা করছি আমরা","root":"عدد","lemma":"عَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65685,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65686,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَدًّۭا","transliteration":"ʿaddan","translation_bn":"(যথাযথ) গণনা","root":"عدد","lemma":"عَدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65687,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٨٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falā taʿjal ʿalayhim innamā naʿuddu lahum ʿaddan', 'কাজেই তাদের ব্যাপারে তাড়াহুড়ো করো না, আমি গুণে রাখছি তাদের জন্য নির্দিষ্ট (দিবসের) সংখ্যা।', 'So be not impatient over them. We only count out to them a [limited] number.', 'কাজেই তাদের ব্যাপারে তাড়াহুড়ো করো না, আমি গুণে রাখছি তাদের জন্য নির্দিষ্ট (দিবসের) সংখ্যা।', 'So be not impatient over them. We only count out to them a [limited] number.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019084.mp3', now()),
  (19, 85, '', '[{"id":66094,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"সে দিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66095,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَحْشُرُ","transliteration":"naḥshuru","translation_bn":"সমবেত করবো আমরা","root":"حشر","lemma":"حَشَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66096,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ","transliteration":"l-mutaqīna","translation_bn":"মুত্তাকীদেরকে","root":"وقي","lemma":"مُتَّقِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66097,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66098,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ","transliteration":"l-raḥmāni","translation_bn":"দয়াময়ের","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66099,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَفْدًۭا","transliteration":"wafdan","translation_bn":"অতিথি  হিসেবে","root":"وفد","lemma":"وَفْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66100,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٨٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yawma naḥshuru l-mutaqīna ilā l-raḥmāni wafdan', 'যেদিন মুত্তাকীদেরকে দয়াময়ের নিকট একত্রিত করব সম্মানিত অতিথি হিসেবে।', 'On the Day We will gather the righteous to the Most Merciful as a delegation', 'যেদিন মুত্তাকীদেরকে দয়াময়ের নিকট একত্রিত করব সম্মানিত অতিথি হিসেবে।', 'On the Day We will gather the righteous to the Most Merciful as a delegation', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019085.mp3', now()),
  (19, 86, '', '[{"id":66493,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَنَسُوقُ","transliteration":"wanasūqu","translation_bn":"এবং তাড়িয়ে নিয়ে যাবো আমরা","root":"سوق","lemma":"سِيقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66494,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-muj''rimīna","translation_bn":"অপরাধীদেরকে","root":"جرم","lemma":"مُجْرِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66495,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66496,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمَ","transliteration":"jahannama","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামের","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":66497,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وِرْدًۭا","transliteration":"wir''dan","translation_bn":"তৃষ্ণার্ত অবস্থায়","root":"ورد","lemma":"وِرْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66498,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٨٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wanasūqu l-muj''rimīna ilā jahannama wir''dan', 'আর আমি অপরাধীদেরকে জাহান্নামের দিকে তাড়িয়ে নিয়ে যাব (যেভাবে পিপাসার্ত গরু বাছুরকে পানির দিকে তাড়িয়ে নেয়া হয়)।', 'And will drive the criminals to Hell in thirst', 'আর আমি অপরাধীদেরকে জাহান্নামের দিকে তাড়িয়ে নিয়ে যাব (যেভাবে পিপাসার্ত গরু বাছুরকে পানির দিকে তাড়িয়ে নেয়া হয়)।', 'And will drive the criminals to Hell in thirst', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019086.mp3', now()),
  (19, 87, '', '[{"id":66773,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":66774,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَمْلِكُونَ","transliteration":"yamlikūna","translation_bn":"তারা সক্ষম হবে","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَكَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66775,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّفَـٰعَةَ","transliteration":"l-shafāʿata","translation_bn":"সুপারিশ করার","root":"شفع","lemma":"شَفَٰعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66776,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":66777,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَنِ","transliteration":"mani","translation_bn":"(সে)  যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":66778,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّخَذَ","transliteration":"ittakhadha","translation_bn":"গ্রহণ করেছে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66779,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"নিকট হ''তে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":66780,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ","transliteration":"l-raḥmāni","translation_bn":"দয়াময়ের","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66781,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَهْدًۭا","transliteration":"ʿahdan","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"عهد","lemma":"عَهْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66782,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٨٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lā yamlikūna l-shafāʿata illā mani ittakhadha ʿinda l-raḥmāni ʿahdan', 'দয়াময়ের নিকট যে প্রতিশ্রুতি লাভ করেছে সে ছাড়া অন্য কারো সুপারিশ করার অধিকার থাকবে না।', 'None will have [power of] intercession except he who had taken from the Most Merciful a covenant.', 'দয়াময়ের নিকট যে প্রতিশ্রুতি লাভ করেছে সে ছাড়া অন্য কারো সুপারিশ করার অধিকার থাকবে না।', 'None will have [power of] intercession except he who had taken from the Most Merciful a covenant.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019087.mp3', now()),
  (19, 88, '', '[{"id":67156,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67157,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّخَذَ","transliteration":"ittakhadha","translation_bn":"\"গ্রহণ করেছেন","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67158,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-raḥmānu","translation_bn":"দয়াময়","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67159,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَلَدًۭا","transliteration":"waladan","translation_bn":"পুত্র\"","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَلَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67160,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٨٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqālū ittakhadha l-raḥmānu waladan', 'তারা বলে, ‘দয়াময় সন্তান গ্রহণ করেছেন।’', 'And they say, "The Most Merciful has taken [for Himself] a son."', 'তারা বলে, ‘দয়াময় সন্তান গ্রহণ করেছেন।’', 'And they say, "The Most Merciful has taken [for Himself] a son."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019088.mp3', now()),
  (19, 89, '', '[{"id":67618,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّقَدْ","transliteration":"laqad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":67619,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جِئْتُمْ","transliteration":"ji''tum","translation_bn":"তোমরা এনেছো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67620,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًٔا","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কিছু (কথা)","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67621,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِدًّۭا","transliteration":"iddan","translation_bn":"জঘন্য","root":"ادد","lemma":"إِدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":67622,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٨٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'laqad ji''tum shayan iddan', '(এমন কথা ব’লে) তোমরা তো এক ভয়ানক বিষয়ের অবতারণা করেছ।', 'You have done an atrocious thing.', '(এমন কথা ব’লে) তোমরা তো এক ভয়ানক বিষয়ের অবতারণা করেছ।', 'You have done an atrocious thing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019089.mp3', now()),
  (19, 90, '', '[{"id":67882,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"تَكَادُ","transliteration":"takādu","translation_bn":"উপক্রম হয়েছে","root":"كود","lemma":"كَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67883,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتُ","transliteration":"l-samāwātu","translation_bn":"আকাশমণ্ডলী","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67884,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَتَفَطَّرْنَ","transliteration":"yatafaṭṭarna","translation_bn":"বিদীর্ণ হওয়ার","root":"فطر","lemma":"فَطَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67885,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"তার কারণে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67886,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَتَنشَقُّ","transliteration":"watanshaqqu","translation_bn":"ও খন্ড-বিখন্ড হবে","root":"شقق","lemma":"ٱنشَقَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67887,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضُ","transliteration":"l-arḍu","translation_bn":"পৃথিবী","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67888,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَتَخِرُّ","transliteration":"watakhirru","translation_bn":"এবং পতিত হবে","root":"خرر","lemma":"خَرَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67889,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجِبَالُ","transliteration":"l-jibālu","translation_bn":"পাহাড়সমূহ","root":"جبل","lemma":"جَبَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67890,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"هَدًّا","transliteration":"haddan","translation_bn":"চূর্ণ-বিচূর্ণ হয়ে","root":"هدد","lemma":"هَدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67891,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٩٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯০)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'takādu l-samāwātu yatafaṭṭarna min''hu watanshaqqu l-arḍu watakhirru l-jibālu haddan', 'যাতে আকাশ বিদীর্ণ হওয়ার, পৃথিবী খন্ড খন্ড হওয়ার আর পর্বতমালা চূর্ণ বিচূর্ণ হয়ে পতিত হওয়ার, উপক্রম হয়েছে।', 'The heavens almost rupture therefrom and the earth splits open and the mountains collapse in devastation', 'যাতে আকাশ বিদীর্ণ হওয়ার, পৃথিবী খন্ড খন্ড হওয়ার আর পর্বতমালা চূর্ণ বিচূর্ণ হয়ে পতিত হওয়ার, উপক্রম হয়েছে।', 'The heavens almost rupture therefrom and the earth splits open and the mountains collapse in devastation', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019090.mp3', now()),
  (19, 91, '', '[{"id":68587,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"(এ কারণে) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":68588,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"دَعَوْا۟","transliteration":"daʿaw","translation_bn":"দাবী করছে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68589,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِلرَّحْمَـٰنِ","transliteration":"lilrraḥmāni","translation_bn":"দয়াময়ের জন্যে","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68590,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَلَدًۭا","transliteration":"waladan","translation_bn":"পুত্র","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَلَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68591,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٩١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯১)","root":"—","lemma":"٩١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'an daʿaw lilrraḥmāni waladan', 'কারণ তারা দয়াময়ের প্রতি সন্তান আরোপ করে।', 'That they attribute to the Most Merciful a son.', 'কারণ তারা দয়াময়ের প্রতি সন্তান আরোপ করে।', 'That they attribute to the Most Merciful a son.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019091.mp3', now()),
  (19, 92, '', '[{"id":68647,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"অথচ না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68648,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَنۢبَغِى","transliteration":"yanbaghī","translation_bn":"শোভা পায়","root":"بغي","lemma":"يَن[بَغِى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68649,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِلرَّحْمَـٰنِ","transliteration":"lilrraḥmāni","translation_bn":"দয়াময়ের জন্য","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68650,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":68651,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّخِذَ","transliteration":"yattakhidha","translation_bn":"তিনি গ্রহণ করবেন","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68652,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَدًا","transliteration":"waladan","translation_bn":"পুত্র","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَلَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68653,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٩٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯২)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā yanbaghī lilrraḥmāni an yattakhidha waladan', 'অথচ দয়াময়ের মহান মর্যাদার জন্য এটা শোভনীয় নয় যে, তিনি সন্তান গ্রহণ করবেন।', 'And it is not appropriate for the Most Merciful that He should take a son.', 'অথচ দয়াময়ের মহান মর্যাদার জন্য এটা শোভনীয় নয় যে, তিনি সন্তান গ্রহণ করবেন।', 'And it is not appropriate for the Most Merciful that He should take a son.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019092.mp3', now()),
  (19, 93, '', '[{"id":69070,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":69071,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كُلُّ","transliteration":"kullu","translation_bn":"(এমন) কেউ","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69072,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":69073,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69074,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশমন্ডলীর","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69075,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69076,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّآ","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া যে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":69077,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتِى","transliteration":"ātī","translation_bn":"উপস্থিত হবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تِي","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69078,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ","transliteration":"l-raḥmāni","translation_bn":"দয়াময়ের কাছে","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69079,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَبْدًۭا","transliteration":"ʿabdan","translation_bn":"দাসরূপে","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69080,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٩٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'in kullu man fī l-samāwāti wal-arḍi illā ātī l-raḥmāni ʿabdan', 'আকাশ আর যমীনে এমন কেউ নেই যে, দয়াময়ের নিকট বান্দাহ হয়ে হাযির হবে না।', 'There is no one in the heavens and earth but that he comes to the Most Merciful as a servant.', 'আকাশ আর যমীনে এমন কেউ নেই যে, দয়াময়ের নিকট বান্দাহ হয়ে হাযির হবে না।', 'There is no one in the heavens and earth but that he comes to the Most Merciful as a servant.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019093.mp3', now()),
  (19, 94, '', '[{"id":69648,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّقَدْ","transliteration":"laqad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":69649,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَحْصَىٰهُمْ","transliteration":"aḥṣāhum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে ঘিরে রেখেছেন তিনি","root":"حصي","lemma":"أَحْصَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69650,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَعَدَّهُمْ","transliteration":"waʿaddahum","translation_bn":"ও গুনে রেখেছেন তাদেরকে","root":"عدد","lemma":"عَدَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69651,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَدًّۭا","transliteration":"ʿaddan","translation_bn":"গণনা করে","root":"عدد","lemma":"عَدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69652,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٩٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'laqad aḥṣāhum waʿaddahum ʿaddan', 'তিনি তাদেরকে পরিবেষ্টন করে রেখেছেন আর তাদেরকে বিশেষভাবে গুণে গুণে রেখেছেন।', 'He has enumerated them and counted them a [full] counting.', 'তিনি তাদেরকে পরিবেষ্টন করে রেখেছেন আর তাদেরকে বিশেষভাবে গুণে গুণে রেখেছেন।', 'He has enumerated them and counted them a [full] counting.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019094.mp3', now()),
  (19, 95, '', '[{"id":69734,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكُلُّهُمْ","transliteration":"wakulluhum","translation_bn":"তাদের সকলে","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69735,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتِيهِ","transliteration":"ātīhi","translation_bn":"তাঁর কাছে আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تِي","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69736,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":69737,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69738,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَرْدًا","transliteration":"fardan","translation_bn":"একাকী","root":"فرد","lemma":"فَرْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69739,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٩٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakulluhum ātīhi yawma l-qiyāmati fardan', 'কিয়ামাতের দিন তাদের সবাই তাঁর কাছে আসবে একাকী অবস্থায়।', 'And all of them are coming to Him on the Day of Resurrection alone.', 'কিয়ামাতের দিন তাদের সবাই তাঁর কাছে আসবে একাকী অবস্থায়।', 'And all of them are coming to Him on the Day of Resurrection alone.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019095.mp3', now()),
  (19, 96, '', '[{"id":70147,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":70148,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":70149,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70150,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"waʿamilū","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70151,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70152,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سَيَجْعَلُ","transliteration":"sayajʿalu","translation_bn":"অচিরেই সৃষ্টি করবেন (মানুষের মনে)","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":70153,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70154,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-raḥmānu","translation_bn":"দয়াময়","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70155,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وُدًّۭا","transliteration":"wuddan","translation_bn":"ভালবাসা","root":"ودد","lemma":"وُدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70156,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٩٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna āmanū waʿamilū l-ṣāliḥāti sayajʿalu lahumu l-raḥmānu wuddan', 'যারা ঈমান আনে ও সৎ কাজ করে, দয়াময় তাদের প্রতি ভালবাসা দান করবেন।', 'Indeed, those who have believed and done righteous deeds - the Most Merciful will appoint for them affection.', 'যারা ঈমান আনে ও সৎ কাজ করে, দয়াময় তাদের প্রতি ভালবাসা দান করবেন।', 'Indeed, those who have believed and done righteous deeds - the Most Merciful will appoint for them affection.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019096.mp3', now()),
  (19, 97, '', '[{"id":70440,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّمَا","transliteration":"fa-innamā","translation_bn":"সুতরাং প্রকৃতপক্ষে (হে নাবী)","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70441,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَسَّرْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"yassarnāhu","translation_bn":"তা আমরা সহজ করেছি","root":"يسر","lemma":"يَسَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70442,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِلِسَانِكَ","transliteration":"bilisānika","translation_bn":"তোমার ভাষার মাধ্যমে","root":"لسن","lemma":"لِسَان","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70443,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِتُبَشِّرَ","transliteration":"litubashira","translation_bn":"যেন তুমি সুসংবাদ দাও","root":"بشر","lemma":"بُشِّرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70444,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِهِ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তা দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70445,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ","transliteration":"l-mutaqīna","translation_bn":"মুত্তাকীদেরকে","root":"وقي","lemma":"مُتَّقِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70446,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَتُنذِرَ","transliteration":"watundhira","translation_bn":"আর তুমি করো সতর্ক","root":"نذر","lemma":"أَنذَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70447,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তা দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70448,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمًۭا","transliteration":"qawman","translation_bn":"লোকদেরকে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70449,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لُّدًّۭا","transliteration":"luddan","translation_bn":"(যারা) তর্কপ্রিয়","root":"لدد","lemma":"لُّدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":70450,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٩٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-innamā yassarnāhu bilisānika litubashira bihi l-mutaqīna watundhira bihi qawman luddan', 'আমি তোমার ভাষায় কুরআনকে সহজ করেছি যাতে তুমি তার সাহায্যে মুত্তাকীদেরকে সুসংবাদ দিতে পার আর ঝগড়াটে লোকেদেরকে সতর্ক করতে পার।', 'So, [O Muhammad], We have only made Qur''an easy in the Arabic language that you may give good tidings thereby to the righteous and warn thereby a hostile people.', 'আমি তোমার ভাষায় কুরআনকে সহজ করেছি যাতে তুমি তার সাহায্যে মুত্তাকীদেরকে সুসংবাদ দিতে পার আর ঝগড়াটে লোকেদেরকে সতর্ক করতে পার।', 'So, [O Muhammad], We have only made Qur''an easy in the Arabic language that you may give good tidings thereby to the righteous and warn thereby a hostile people.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019097.mp3', now()),
  (19, 98, '', '[{"id":70827,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَمْ","transliteration":"wakam","translation_bn":"এবং কতই (না)","root":"—","lemma":"كَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70828,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلَكْنَا","transliteration":"ahlaknā","translation_bn":"আমরা ধ্বংস করেছি","root":"هلك","lemma":"أَهْلَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70829,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلَهُم","transliteration":"qablahum","translation_bn":"তাদের পূর্বে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":70830,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70831,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَرْنٍ","transliteration":"qarnin","translation_bn":"মানবগোষ্ঠী","root":"قرن","lemma":"قَرْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70832,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":70833,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تُحِسُّ","transliteration":"tuḥissu","translation_bn":"অনুভব করো (কোন চিহ্ন)","root":"حسس","lemma":"أَحَسَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70834,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُم","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70835,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোন","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70836,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَحَدٍ","transliteration":"aḥadin","translation_bn":"একজনের","root":"احد","lemma":"أَحَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70837,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70838,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"تَسْمَعُ","transliteration":"tasmaʿu","translation_bn":"শুনতে পাও","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70839,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70840,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"رِكْزًۢا","transliteration":"rik''zan","translation_bn":"কোন ক্ষীণ শব্দও","root":"ركز","lemma":"رِكْز","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70841,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٩٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakam ahlaknā qablahum min qarnin hal tuḥissu min''hum min aḥadin aw tasmaʿu lahum rik''zan', 'তাদের পূর্বে আমি কত মানব বংশকে ধ্বংস করে দিয়েছি, তুমি তাদের একজনকেও কি (এখন) দেখতে পাও অথবা তাদের ক্ষীণতম আওয়াজও কি শুনতে পাও?', 'And how many have We destroyed before them of generations? Do you perceive of them anyone or hear from them a sound?', 'তাদের পূর্বে আমি কত মানব বংশকে ধ্বংস করে দিয়েছি, তুমি তাদের একজনকেও কি (এখন) দেখতে পাও অথবা তাদের ক্ষীণতম আওয়াজও কি শুনতে পাও?', 'And how many have We destroyed before them of generations? Do you perceive of them anyone or hear from them a sound?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/019098.mp3', now())
