":"ثري","lemma":"ثَّرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":6140,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lahu mā fī l-samāwāti wamā fī l-arḍi wamā baynahumā wamā taḥta l-tharā', 'যা আকাশসমূহে আছে, যা যমীনে আছে, যা এ দু’য়ের মাঝে আছে আর যা ভূগর্ভে আছে সব তাঁরই।', 'To Him belongs what is in the heavens and what is on the earth and what is between them and what is under the soil.', 'যা আকাশসমূহে আছে, যা যমীনে আছে, যা এ দু’য়ের মাঝে আছে আর যা ভূগর্ভে আছে সব তাঁরই।', 'To Him belongs what is in the heavens and what is on the earth and what is between them and what is under the soil.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020006.mp3', now()),
  (20, 7, '', '[{"id":7450,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":7451,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَجْهَرْ","transliteration":"tajhar","translation_bn":"উঁচু গলায় বলো","root":"جهر","lemma":"جَهَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":7452,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْقَوْلِ","transliteration":"bil-qawli","translation_bn":"কথাকে ( তাও তিনি শুনেন )","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":7453,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"fa-innahu","translation_bn":"তবে নিশ্চয়ই তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":7454,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","translation_bn":"জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":7455,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسِّرَّ","transliteration":"l-sira","translation_bn":"গুপ্ত","root":"سرر","lemma":"سِرّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":7456,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَأَخْفَى","transliteration":"wa-akhfā","translation_bn":"এবং অব্যক্ত ( কথাও )","root":"خفي","lemma":"أَخْفَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":7457,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-in tajhar bil-qawli fa-innahu yaʿlamu l-sira wa-akhfā', 'যদি তুমি উচ্চকণ্ঠে কথা বল (তাহলে জেনে রেখ) তিনি গুপ্ত ও তদপেক্ষাও গুপ্ত বিষয় জানেন।', 'And if you speak aloud - then indeed, He knows the secret and what is [even] more hidden.', 'যদি তুমি উচ্চকণ্ঠে কথা বল (তাহলে জেনে রেখ) তিনি গুপ্ত ও তদপেক্ষাও গুপ্ত বিষয় জানেন।', 'And if you speak aloud - then indeed, He knows the secret and what is [even] more hidden.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020007.mp3', now()),
  (20, 8, '', '[{"id":8709,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"al-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ ( এমন সত্ত্বা যে )","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":8710,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَآ","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":8711,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهَ","transliteration":"ilāha","translation_bn":"কোন ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":8712,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":8713,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ ۖ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ ۖ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":8715,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তাঁরই আছে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":8716,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَسْمَآءُ","transliteration":"l-asmāu","translation_bn":"নামসমূহ","root":"سمو","lemma":"ٱسْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":8717,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ","transliteration":"l-ḥus''nā","translation_bn":"সুন্দর","root":"حسن","lemma":"حُسْنَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":8718,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'al-lahu lā ilāha illā huwa lahu l-asmāu l-ḥus''nā', 'আল্লাহ, তিনি ব্যতীত সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই, সুন্দর নামসমূহ তাঁরই।', 'Allah - there is no deity except Him. To Him belong the best names.', 'আল্লাহ, তিনি ব্যতীত সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই, সুন্দর নামসমূহ তাঁরই।', 'Allah - there is no deity except Him. To Him belong the best names.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020008.mp3', now()),
  (20, 9, '', '[{"id":9935,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَهَلْ","transliteration":"wahal","translation_bn":"আর কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":9936,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَتَىٰكَ","transliteration":"atāka","translation_bn":"তোমার কাছে এসেছে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":9937,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"حَدِيثُ","transliteration":"ḥadīthu","translation_bn":"বৃত্তান্ত","root":"حدث","lemma":"حَدِيث","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":9938,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰٓ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসার","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":9939,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahal atāka ḥadīthu mūsā', 'মূসার কাহিনী তোমার কাছে পৌঁছেছে কি?', 'And has the story of Moses reached you? -', 'মূসার কাহিনী তোমার কাছে পৌঁছেছে কি?', 'And has the story of Moses reached you? -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020009.mp3', now()),
  (20, 10, '', '[{"id":11115,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":11116,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَءَا","transliteration":"raā","translation_bn":"সে দেখেছিলো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11117,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نَارًۭا","transliteration":"nāran","translation_bn":"আগুন","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11118,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَقَالَ","transliteration":"faqāla","translation_bn":"তখন বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":11119,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لِأَهْلِهِ","transliteration":"li-ahlihi","translation_bn":"তার পরিবারবর্গকে","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11120,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱمْكُثُوٓا۟","transliteration":"um''kuthū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা থাকো ( অপেক্ষা করো )","root":"مكث","lemma":"مَكَثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11121,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":11122,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ءَانَسْتُ","transliteration":"ānastu","translation_bn":"দেখেছি","root":"انس","lemma":"ءَانَسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11123,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"نَارًۭا","transliteration":"nāran","translation_bn":"আগুন","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11124,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَّعَلِّىٓ","transliteration":"laʿallī","translation_bn":"সম্ভবতঃ আমি","root":"—","lemma":"لَّعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":11125,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتِيكُم","transliteration":"ātīkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে আমি আসবো","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11126,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهَا","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"তা থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11127,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِقَبَسٍ","transliteration":"biqabasin","translation_bn":"( কিছু ) অঙ্গার নিয়ে","root":"قبس","lemma":"قَبَس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11128,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":11129,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَجِدُ","transliteration":"ajidu","translation_bn":"আমি পাবো","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11130,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11131,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"আগুনের","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":11132,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"هُدًۭى","transliteration":"hudan","translation_bn":"পথের\"","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11133,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"١٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'idh raā nāran faqāla li-ahlihi um''kuthū innī ānastu nāran laʿallī ātīkum min''hā biqabasin aw ajidu ʿalā l-nāri hudan', 'যখন সে আগুন দেখল (মাদ্ইয়ান থেকে মিসর যাবার পথে), তখন সে তার পরিবারবর্গকে বলল, ‘তোমরা এখানে অবস্থান কর, আমি আগুন দেখেছি, সম্ভবতঃ আমি তাত্থেকে তোমাদের জন্য কিছু জ্বলন্ত আগুন আনতে পারব কিংবা আগুনের নিকট পথের সন্ধান পাব।', 'When he saw a fire and said to his family, "Stay here; indeed, I have perceived a fire; perhaps I can bring you a torch or find at the fire some guidance."', 'যখন সে আগুন দেখল (মাদ্ইয়ান থেকে মিসর যাবার পথে), তখন সে তার পরিবারবর্গকে বলল, ‘তোমরা এখানে অবস্থান কর, আমি আগুন দেখেছি, সম্ভবতঃ আমি তাত্থেকে তোমাদের জন্য কিছু জ্বলন্ত আগুন আনতে পারব কিংবা আগুনের নিকট পথের সন্ধান পাব।', 'When he saw a fire and said to his family, "Stay here; indeed, I have perceived a fire; perhaps I can bring you a torch or find at the fire some guidance."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020010.mp3', now()),
  (20, 11, '', '[{"id":12453,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّآ","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":12454,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَتَىٰهَا","transliteration":"atāhā","translation_bn":"তার কাছে আসলো","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12455,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نُودِىَ","transliteration":"nūdiya","translation_bn":"তাকে ডাকা হলো","root":"ندو","lemma":"نَادَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12456,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰمُوسَىٰٓ","transliteration":"yāmūsā","translation_bn":"\"( বলা হলো ) হে মূসা","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":12457,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"١١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১)","root":"—","lemma":"١١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā atāhā nūdiya yāmūsā', 'তারপর যখন যে আগুনের কাছে আসল, তাকে ডাক দেয়া হল, ‘হে মূসা!', 'And when he came to it, he was called, "O Moses,', 'তারপর যখন যে আগুনের কাছে আসল, তাকে ডাক দেয়া হল, ‘হে মূসা!', 'And when he came to it, he was called, "O Moses,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020011.mp3', now()),
  (20, 12, '', '[{"id":13761,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":13762,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنَا۠","transliteration":"anā","translation_bn":"আমিই","root":"—","lemma":"أَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":13763,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكَ","transliteration":"rabbuka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13764,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَٱخْلَعْ","transliteration":"fa-ikh''laʿ","translation_bn":"অতএব খুলে ফেলো তুমি","root":"خلع","lemma":"ٱخْلَعْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13765,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نَعْلَيْكَ ۖ","transliteration":"naʿlayka","translation_bn":"তোমার জুতা জোড়া","root":"نعل","lemma":"نَعْلَي","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13767,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكَ","transliteration":"innaka","translation_bn":"তুমি নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":13768,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْوَادِ","transliteration":"bil-wādi","translation_bn":"উপত্যকার মধ্যে","root":"ودي","lemma":"وَاد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13769,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُقَدَّسِ","transliteration":"l-muqadasi","translation_bn":"পবিত্র","root":"قدس","lemma":"مُقَدَّس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13770,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"طُوًۭى","transliteration":"ṭuwan","translation_bn":"( যার নাম ) তুওয়া","root":"طوي","lemma":"طُوًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13771,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innī anā rabbuka fa-ikh''laʿ naʿlayka innaka bil-wādi l-muqadasi ṭuwan', 'বাস্তবিকই আমি তোমার প্রতিপালক, কাজেই তোমার জুতা খুলে ফেল, তুমি পবিত্র তুওয়া উপত্যকায় আছ।', 'Indeed, I am your Lord, so remove your sandals. Indeed, you are in the sacred valley of Tuwa.', 'বাস্তবিকই আমি তোমার প্রতিপালক, কাজেই তোমার জুতা খুলে ফেল, তুমি পবিত্র তুওয়া উপত্যকায় আছ।', 'Indeed, I am your Lord, so remove your sandals. Indeed, you are in the sacred valley of Tuwa.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020012.mp3', now()),
  (20, 13, '', '[{"id":14938,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَا","transliteration":"wa-anā","translation_bn":"এবং আমি","root":"—","lemma":"وَأَنَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":14939,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱخْتَرْتُكَ","transliteration":"ikh''tartuka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে বেছে নিয়েছি","root":"خير","lemma":"ٱخْتَارَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14940,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَٱسْتَمِعْ","transliteration":"fa-is''tamiʿ","translation_bn":"সুতরাং তুমি মনোযোগসহ শুনো","root":"سمع","lemma":"ٱسْتَمَعَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":14941,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِمَا","transliteration":"limā","translation_bn":"তাই যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":14942,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يُوحَىٰٓ","transliteration":"yūḥā","translation_bn":"ওহী করা হয়","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14943,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"١٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-anā ikh''tartuka fa-is''tamiʿ limā yūḥā', 'আমি তোমাকে বেছে নিয়েছি, কাজেই তুমি মনোযোগ দিয়ে শুনো যা তোমার প্রতি ওয়াহী করা হচ্ছে।', 'And I have chosen you, so listen to what is revealed [to you].', 'আমি তোমাকে বেছে নিয়েছি, কাজেই তুমি মনোযোগ দিয়ে শুনো যা তোমার প্রতি ওয়াহী করা হচ্ছে।', 'And I have chosen you, so listen to what is revealed [to you].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020013.mp3', now()),
  (20, 14, '', '[{"id":16004,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّنِىٓ","transliteration":"innanī","translation_bn":"আমি নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":16005,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنَا","transliteration":"anā","translation_bn":"আমিই","root":"—","lemma":"أَنَا","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":16006,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":16007,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَآ","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":16008,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهَ","transliteration":"ilāha","translation_bn":"কোন ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16009,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّآ","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":16010,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَنَا۠","transliteration":"anā","translation_bn":"আমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":16011,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَٱعْبُدْنِى","transliteration":"fa-uʿ''bud''nī","translation_bn":"সুতরাং আমারই  ইবাদত করো","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":16012,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَأَقِمِ","transliteration":"wa-aqimi","translation_bn":"এবং প্রতিষ্ঠিত করো","root":"قوم","lemma":"أَقَامَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":16013,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","translation_bn":"সালাত","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":16014,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لِذِكْرِىٓ","transliteration":"lidhik''rī","translation_bn":"আমার স্মরণের জন্যে","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16015,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innanī anā l-lahu lā ilāha illā anā fa-uʿ''bud''nī wa-aqimi l-ṣalata lidhik''rī', 'প্রকৃতই আমি আল্লাহ, আমি ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই, কাজেই আমার ‘ইবাদাত কর, আর আমাকে স্মরণ করার উদ্দেশ্যে নামায কায়িম কর।’', 'Indeed, I am Allah. There is no deity except Me, so worship Me and establish prayer for My remembrance.', 'প্রকৃতই আমি আল্লাহ, আমি ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই, কাজেই আমার ‘ইবাদাত কর, আর আমাকে স্মরণ করার উদ্দেশ্যে নামায কায়িম কর।’', 'Indeed, I am Allah. There is no deity except Me, so worship Me and establish prayer for My remembrance.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020014.mp3', now()),
  (20, 15, '', '[{"id":17234,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":17235,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّاعَةَ","transliteration":"l-sāʿata","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাত","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":17236,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتِيَةٌ","transliteration":"ātiyatun","translation_bn":"আসবেই","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تِي","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17237,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَكَادُ","transliteration":"akādu","translation_bn":"রাখতে চাই আমি","root":"كود","lemma":"كَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17238,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أُخْفِيهَا","transliteration":"ukh''fīhā","translation_bn":"তা গোপন","root":"خفي","lemma":"أُخْفِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17239,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِتُجْزَىٰ","transliteration":"lituj''zā","translation_bn":"যেন প্রতিফল পায়","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":17240,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كُلُّ","transliteration":"kullu","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17241,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسٍۭ","transliteration":"nafsin","translation_bn":"ব্যক্তি","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17242,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ের যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17243,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"تَسْعَىٰ","transliteration":"tasʿā","translation_bn":"সে চেষ্টা সাধনা করে","root":"سعي","lemma":"سَعَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17244,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"١٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna l-sāʿata ātiyatun akādu ukh''fīhā lituj''zā kullu nafsin bimā tasʿā', 'কিয়ামাত আসবেই, আমি তা গোপন রাখতে চাই, যাতে প্রত্যেক ব্যক্তি স্বীয় চেষ্টা-সাধনা অনুপাতে ফল লাভ করতে পারে।', 'Indeed, the Hour is coming - I almost conceal it - so that every soul may be recompensed according to that for which it strives.', 'কিয়ামাত আসবেই, আমি তা গোপন রাখতে চাই, যাতে প্রত্যেক ব্যক্তি স্বীয় চেষ্টা-সাধনা অনুপাতে ফল লাভ করতে পারে।', 'Indeed, the Hour is coming - I almost conceal it - so that every soul may be recompensed according to that for which it strives.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020015.mp3', now()),
  (20, 16, '', '[{"id":18281,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"সুতরাং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":18282,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَصُدَّنَّكَ","transliteration":"yaṣuddannaka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে নিবৃত্ত করে ( যেন )","root":"صدد","lemma":"صَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18283,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهَا","transliteration":"ʿanhā","translation_bn":"তা থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18284,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"সেই ব্যক্তি (যে )","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":18285,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":18286,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُ","transliteration":"yu''minu","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18287,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18288,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّبَعَ","transliteration":"wa-ittabaʿa","translation_bn":"এবং অনুসরণ করেছে","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":18289,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"هَوَىٰهُ","transliteration":"hawāhu","translation_bn":"তার প্রবৃত্তির","root":"هوي","lemma":"هَوَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18290,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَتَرْدَىٰ","transliteration":"fatardā","translation_bn":"তাহ''লে তুমি ধ্বংস হবে","root":"ردي","lemma":"تَرْدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":18291,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"١٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falā yaṣuddannaka ʿanhā man lā yu''minu bihā wa-ittabaʿa hawāhu fatardā', 'কাজেই ক্বিয়ামতে যে বিশ্বাস করে না এবং স্বীয় প্রবৃত্তির অনুসরণ করে, সে যেন তোমাকে তাত্থেকে কোনক্রমেই বিচ্যুত করতে না পারে, তাহলে তুমি ধ্বংস হয়ে যাবে।', 'So do not let one avert you from it who does not believe in it and follows his desire, for you [then] would perish.', 'কাজেই ক্বিয়ামতে যে বিশ্বাস করে না এবং স্বীয় প্রবৃত্তির অনুসরণ করে, সে যেন তোমাকে তাত্থেকে কোনক্রমেই বিচ্যুত করতে না পারে, তাহলে তুমি ধ্বংস হয়ে যাবে।', 'So do not let one avert you from it who does not believe in it and follows his desire, for you [then] would perish.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020016.mp3', now()),
  (20, 17, '', '[{"id":19305,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং ( আল্লাহ বললেন ) কি","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":19306,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تِلْكَ","transliteration":"til''ka","translation_bn":"ওটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":19307,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِيَمِينِكَ","transliteration":"biyamīnika","translation_bn":"তোমার ডান হাতের মধ্যে","root":"يمن","lemma":"يَمِين","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19308,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰمُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"yāmūsā","translation_bn":"হে মূসা\"","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":19309,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"١٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā til''ka biyamīnika yāmūsā', '‘হে মূসা! তোমার ডান হাতে ওটা কী?’', 'And what is that in your right hand, O Moses?"', '‘হে মূসা! তোমার ডান হাতে ওটা কী?’', 'And what is that in your right hand, O Moses?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020017.mp3', now()),
  (20, 18, '', '[{"id":20375,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20376,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هِىَ","transliteration":"hiya","translation_bn":"\"তা","root":"—","lemma":"هِىَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":20377,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَصَاىَ","transliteration":"ʿaṣāya","translation_bn":"আমার লাঠি","root":"عصو","lemma":"عَصَا2","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20378,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَتَوَكَّؤُا۟","transliteration":"atawakka-u","translation_bn":"ভর দিই আমি","root":"وكا","lemma":"أَتَوَكَّؤُا@","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20379,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهَا","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20380,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَأَهُشُّ","transliteration":"wa-ahushu","translation_bn":"এবং পাতা পাড়ি আমি","root":"هشش","lemma":"أَهُشُّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":20381,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"তা দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20382,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20383,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"غَنَمِى","transliteration":"ghanamī","translation_bn":"আমার ছাগল ( পালের )","root":"غنم","lemma":"غَنَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20384,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلِىَ","transliteration":"waliya","translation_bn":"এবং আমার আছে","root":"—","lemma":"وَلِىَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":20385,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তা দ্বারা","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20386,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَـَٔارِبُ","transliteration":"maāribu","translation_bn":"প্রয়োজনসমূহ","root":"ارب","lemma":"مَـ#َارِب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20387,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أُخْرَىٰ","transliteration":"ukh''rā","translation_bn":"আরও ( কিছু )\"","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":20388,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"١٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla hiya ʿaṣāya atawakka-u ʿalayhā wa-ahushu bihā ʿalā ghanamī waliya fīhā maāribu ukh''rā', 'সে বলল, ‘এটা আমার লাঠি, আমি ওতে ভর দেই, এর সাহায্যে আমি আমার মেষপালের জন্য গাছের পাতা ঝেড়ে দেই আর এতে আমার আরো অনেক কাজ হয়।’', 'He said, "It is my staff; I lean upon it, and I bring down leaves for my sheep and I have therein other uses."', 'সে বলল, ‘এটা আমার লাঠি, আমি ওতে ভর দেই, এর সাহায্যে আমি আমার মেষপালের জন্য গাছের পাতা ঝেড়ে দেই আর এতে আমার আরো অনেক কাজ হয়।’', 'He said, "It is my staff; I lean upon it, and I bring down leaves for my sheep and I have therein other uses."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020018.mp3', now()),
  (20, 19, '', '[{"id":21462,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"( আল্লাহ ) বললেন","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21463,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَلْقِهَا","transliteration":"alqihā","translation_bn":"\"তা নিক্ষেপ করো","root":"لقي","lemma":"أَلْقَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21464,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰمُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"yāmūsā","translation_bn":"হে মূসা\"","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":21465,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"١٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla alqihā yāmūsā', 'আল্লাহ বললেন, ‘হে মূসা! ওটা নিক্ষেপ কর।’', '[Allah] said, "Throw it down, O Moses."', 'আল্লাহ বললেন, ‘হে মূসা! ওটা নিক্ষেপ কর।’', '[Allah] said, "Throw it down, O Moses."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020019.mp3', now()),
  (20, 20, '', '[{"id":22548,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَأَلْقَىٰهَا","transliteration":"fa-alqāhā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তা সে নিক্ষেপ করলো","root":"لقي","lemma":"أَلْقَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22549,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فَإِذَا","transliteration":"fa-idhā","translation_bn":"সঙ্গে সঙ্গে","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا2\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22550,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"هِىَ","transliteration":"hiya","translation_bn":"তা ( হলো )","root":"—","lemma":"هِىَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":22551,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"حَيَّةٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥayyatun","translation_bn":"সাপ","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":22552,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَسْعَىٰ","transliteration":"tasʿā","translation_bn":"( যা ) ছুটোছুটি করতে লাগলো","root":"سعي","lemma":"سَعَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22553,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٢٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২০)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-alqāhā fa-idhā hiya ḥayyatun tasʿā', 'তখন সে তা নিক্ষেপ করল, অমনি তা সাপ হয়ে ছুটোছুটি করতে লাগল।', 'So he threw it down, and thereupon it was a snake, moving swiftly.', 'তখন সে তা নিক্ষেপ করল, অমনি তা সাপ হয়ে ছুটোছুটি করতে লাগল।', 'So he threw it down, and thereupon it was a snake, moving swiftly.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020020.mp3', now()),
  (20, 21, '', '[{"id":23711,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"তিনি বললেন","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23712,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"خُذْهَا","transliteration":"khudh''hā","translation_bn":"\"তা ধরো","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23713,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23714,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَخَفْ ۖ","transliteration":"takhaf","translation_bn":"ভয় করো তুমি","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23716,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"سَنُعِيدُهَا","transliteration":"sanuʿīduhā","translation_bn":"অচিরেই তা ফিরিয়ে দিবো আমরা","root":"عود","lemma":"أُعِيدُ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":23717,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سِيرَتَهَا","transliteration":"sīratahā","translation_bn":"তার অবস্থায়","root":"سير","lemma":"سِيرَت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23718,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأُولَىٰ","transliteration":"l-ūlā","translation_bn":"পূর্বের","root":"اول","lemma":"أَوَّل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":23719,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٢١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২১)","root":"—","lemma":"٢١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla khudh''hā walā takhaf sanuʿīduhā sīratahā l-ūlā', 'আল্লাহ বললেন, ‘ওটাকে ধর, ভয় পেও না, আমি সেটাকে এক্ষুনি তার আগের রূপে ফিরিয়ে দেব।', '[Allah] said, "Seize it and fear not; We will return it to its former condition.', 'আল্লাহ বললেন, ‘ওটাকে ধর, ভয় পেও না, আমি সেটাকে এক্ষুনি তার আগের রূপে ফিরিয়ে দেব।', '[Allah] said, "Seize it and fear not; We will return it to its former condition.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020021.mp3', now()),
