দিল।', 'So Pharaoh pursued them with his soldiers, and there covered them from the sea that which covered them,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020078.mp3', now()),
  (20, 79, '', '[{"id":63846,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَضَلَّ","transliteration":"wa-aḍalla","translation_bn":"এবং পথভ্রষ্ট করেছিলো","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63847,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِرْعَوْنُ","transliteration":"fir''ʿawnu","translation_bn":"ফিরআউন","root":"—","lemma":"فِرْعَوْن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":63848,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمَهُۥ","transliteration":"qawmahu","translation_bn":"তার জাতিকে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63849,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63850,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هَدَىٰ","transliteration":"hadā","translation_bn":"সৎপথ দেখিয়েছিলো","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63851,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٧٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-aḍalla fir''ʿawnu qawmahu wamā hadā', 'ফেরাউন তার জাতিকে বিপথগামী করেছিল এবং তাদেরকে সঠিক পথ দেখায়নি।', 'And Pharaoh led his people astray and did not guide [them].', 'ফেরাউন তার জাতিকে বিপথগামী করেছিল এবং তাদেরকে সঠিক পথ দেখায়নি।', 'And Pharaoh led his people astray and did not guide [them].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020079.mp3', now()),
  (20, 80, '', '[{"id":64065,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰبَنِىٓ","transliteration":"yābanī","translation_bn":"হে সন্তানগণ","root":"بني","lemma":"بُنَىّ","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":64066,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","transliteration":"is''rāīla","translation_bn":"ইসরাঈলের","root":"—","lemma":"إِسْرَائِيل","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":64067,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":64068,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَنجَيْنَـٰكُم","transliteration":"anjaynākum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে আমরা উদ্ধার করেছি","root":"نجو","lemma":"أَنجَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64069,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64070,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَدُوِّكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿaduwwikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের শত্রু","root":"عدو","lemma":"عَدُوّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64071,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَوَٰعَدْنَـٰكُمْ","transliteration":"wawāʿadnākum","translation_bn":"ও তোমাদেরকে আমরা ( উপস্থিতির) প্রতিশ্রুতি দিয়েছি","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَٰعَدْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64072,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"جَانِبَ","transliteration":"jāniba","translation_bn":"পাশে","root":"جنب","lemma":"جَانِب","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":64073,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلطُّورِ","transliteration":"l-ṭūri","translation_bn":"তূর পাহাড়ের","root":"طور","lemma":"طُور","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64074,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَيْمَنَ","transliteration":"l-aymana","translation_bn":"ডানদিকের","root":"يمن","lemma":"أَيْمَن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64075,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَنَزَّلْنَا","transliteration":"wanazzalnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা পাঠিয়েছি","root":"نزل","lemma":"نَزَّلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64076,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمُ","transliteration":"ʿalaykumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64077,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَنَّ","transliteration":"l-mana","translation_bn":"মান্না","root":"منن","lemma":"مَنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64078,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلسَّلْوَىٰ","transliteration":"wal-salwā","translation_bn":"ও সালওয়া","root":"سلو","lemma":"سَّلْوَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64079,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٨٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮০)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yābanī is''rāīla qad anjaynākum min ʿaduwwikum wawāʿadnākum jāniba l-ṭūri l-aymana wanazzalnā ʿalaykumu l-mana wal-salwā', 'হে বানী ইসরাঈল! আমি তোমাদেরকে তোমাদের শত্রুর কবল থেকে উদ্ধার করেছিলাম আর আমি তোমাদেরকে তূর পাহাড়ের ডানপাশে প্রতিশ্রুতি দিয়েছিলাম (তাওরাত দানের জন্য) আর তোমাদের কাছে পাঠিয়েছিলাম মান্না ও সালওয়া।', 'O Children of Israel, We delivered you from your enemy, and We made an appointment with you at the right side of the mount, and We sent down to you manna and quails,', 'হে বানী ইসরাঈল! আমি তোমাদেরকে তোমাদের শত্রুর কবল থেকে উদ্ধার করেছিলাম আর আমি তোমাদেরকে তূর পাহাড়ের ডানপাশে প্রতিশ্রুতি দিয়েছিলাম (তাওরাত দানের জন্য) আর তোমাদের কাছে পাঠিয়েছিলাম মান্না ও সালওয়া।', 'O Children of Israel, We delivered you from your enemy, and We made an appointment with you at the right side of the mount, and We sent down to you manna and quails,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020080.mp3', now()),
  (20, 81, '', '[{"id":64639,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"كُلُوا۟","transliteration":"kulū","translation_bn":"তোমরা খাও","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64640,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64641,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"طَيِّبَـٰتِ","transliteration":"ṭayyibāti","translation_bn":"পবিত্র বস্তুসমূহ","root":"طيب","lemma":"طَيِّبَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64642,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":64643,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَزَقْنَـٰكُمْ","transliteration":"razaqnākum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে আমরা জীবনোপকরণ দিয়েছি","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64644,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64645,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَطْغَوْا۟","transliteration":"taṭghaw","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘন করো","root":"طغي","lemma":"طَغَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64646,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"এর মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64647,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَيَحِلَّ","transliteration":"fayaḥilla","translation_bn":"তাহ''লে অবধারিত হবে","root":"حلل","lemma":"حَلَلْ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":64648,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64649,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"غَضَبِى ۖ","transliteration":"ghaḍabī","translation_bn":"আমার রাগ","root":"غضب","lemma":"غَضَب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64651,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যার (এমন)","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64652,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَحْلِلْ","transliteration":"yaḥlil","translation_bn":"অবধারিত হবে","root":"حلل","lemma":"حَلَلْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64653,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64654,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"غَضَبِى","transliteration":"ghaḍabī","translation_bn":"আমার রাগ","root":"غضب","lemma":"غَضَب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64655,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَقَدْ","transliteration":"faqad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":64656,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"هَوَىٰ","transliteration":"hawā","translation_bn":"সে ধ্বংস হয়ে যাবে","root":"هوي","lemma":"هَوَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64657,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٨١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮১)","root":"—","lemma":"٨١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'kulū min ṭayyibāti mā razaqnākum walā taṭghaw fīhi fayaḥilla ʿalaykum ghaḍabī waman yaḥlil ʿalayhi ghaḍabī faqad hawā', 'তোমাদেরকে যে রিযক দিয়েছি তাত্থেকে উত্তমগুলো আহার কর, আর এতে বাড়াবাড়ি করো না, করলে তোমাদের উপর আমার ‘আযাব সাব্যস্ত হয়ে যাবে। আর আমার ‘আযাব যার উপর সাব্যস্ত হয় সে তো ধ্বংসই হয়ে যায়।', '[Saying], "Eat from the good things with which We have provided you and do not transgress [or oppress others] therein, lest My anger should descend upon you. And he upon whom My anger descends has certainly fallen."', 'তোমাদেরকে যে রিযক দিয়েছি তাত্থেকে উত্তমগুলো আহার কর, আর এতে বাড়াবাড়ি করো না, করলে তোমাদের উপর আমার ‘আযাব সাব্যস্ত হয়ে যাবে। আর আমার ‘আযাব যার উপর সাব্যস্ত হয় সে তো ধ্বংসই হয়ে যায়।', '[Saying], "Eat from the good things with which We have provided you and do not transgress [or oppress others] therein, lest My anger should descend upon you. And he upon whom My anger descends has certainly fallen."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020081.mp3', now()),
  (20, 82, '', '[{"id":65156,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنِّى","transliteration":"wa-innī","translation_bn":"এবং আমি নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65157,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَغَفَّارٌۭ","transliteration":"laghaffārun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفَّار","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":65158,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِّمَن","transliteration":"liman","translation_bn":"(তার) জন্য যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65159,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَابَ","transliteration":"tāba","translation_bn":"তওবা করলো","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65160,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَءَامَنَ","transliteration":"waāmana","translation_bn":"ও ঈমান আনলো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65161,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلَ","transliteration":"waʿamila","translation_bn":"এবং কাজ করলো","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65162,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65163,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65164,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱهْتَدَىٰ","transliteration":"ih''tadā","translation_bn":"সৎপথে অবিচলিত থাকলো","root":"هدي","lemma":"ٱهْتَدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65165,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٨٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮২)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-innī laghaffārun liman tāba waāmana waʿamila ṣāliḥan thumma ih''tadā', 'আর যে তাওবাহ করে, ঈমান আনে ও সৎকাজ করে আর সৎপথে অটল থাকে, আমি তার জন্য অবশ্যই অতি ক্ষমাশীল।', 'But indeed, I am the Perpetual Forgiver of whoever repents and believes and does righteousness and then continues in guidance.', 'আর যে তাওবাহ করে, ঈমান আনে ও সৎকাজ করে আর সৎপথে অটল থাকে, আমি তার জন্য অবশ্যই অতি ক্ষমাশীল।', 'But indeed, I am the Perpetual Forgiver of whoever repents and believes and does righteousness and then continues in guidance.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020082.mp3', now()),
  (20, 83, '', '[{"id":65306,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"\"এবং কিসে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65307,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَعْجَلَكَ","transliteration":"aʿjalaka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে তাড়াহুড়া করালো","root":"عجل","lemma":"أَعْجَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65308,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65309,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمِكَ","transliteration":"qawmika","translation_bn":"তোমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65310,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰمُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"yāmūsā","translation_bn":"হে মূসা\"","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":65311,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٨٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā aʿjalaka ʿan qawmika yāmūsā', '‘হে মূসা! তোমার সম্প্রদায়কে পেছনে ফেলে (তূর পাহাড়ে আসতে) তুমি জলদি করলে কেন?’', '[Allah] said, "And what made you hasten from your people, O Moses?"', '‘হে মূসা! তোমার সম্প্রদায়কে পেছনে ফেলে (তূর পাহাড়ে আসতে) তুমি জলদি করলে কেন?’', '[Allah] said, "And what made you hasten from your people, O Moses?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020083.mp3', now()),
  (20, 84, '', '[{"id":65688,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65689,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"\"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":65690,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَآءِ","transliteration":"ulāi","translation_bn":"ঐ তো","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَا^ء","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":65691,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65692,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَثَرِى","transliteration":"atharī","translation_bn":"আমার চিহ্নের","root":"اثر","lemma":"أَثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65693,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَعَجِلْتُ","transliteration":"waʿajil''tu","translation_bn":"এবং আমি তাড়াহুড়া করেছি","root":"عجل","lemma":"عَجِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65694,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"তোমার দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65695,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّ","transliteration":"rabbi","translation_bn":"হে আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65696,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لِتَرْضَىٰ","transliteration":"litarḍā","translation_bn":"যেন তুমি সন্তুষ্ট হও\"","root":"رضو","lemma":"رَّضِىَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65697,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٨٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla hum ulāi ʿalā atharī waʿajil''tu ilayka rabbi litarḍā', 'মূসা বলল, ‘এই তো তারা আমার পদচিহ্ন ধরে আসছে, আমি আপনার কাছে জলদি এলাম, হে আমার প্রতিপালক! যাতে আপনি সন্তুষ্ট হন।’', 'He said, "They are close upon my tracks, and I hastened to You, my Lord, that You be pleased."', 'মূসা বলল, ‘এই তো তারা আমার পদচিহ্ন ধরে আসছে, আমি আপনার কাছে জলদি এলাম, হে আমার প্রতিপালক! যাতে আপনি সন্তুষ্ট হন।’', 'He said, "They are close upon my tracks, and I hastened to You, my Lord, that You be pleased."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020084.mp3', now()),
  (20, 85, '', '[{"id":66239,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(আল্লাহ) বললেন","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66240,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّا","transliteration":"fa-innā","translation_bn":"\"অতঃপর নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66241,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":66242,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَتَنَّا","transliteration":"fatannā","translation_bn":"আমরা পরীক্ষায় ফেলেছি","root":"فتن","lemma":"فَتَنُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66243,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمَكَ","transliteration":"qawmaka","translation_bn":"তোমার জাতিকে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66244,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66245,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِكَ","transliteration":"baʿdika","translation_bn":"তোমার পর","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66246,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَأَضَلَّهُمُ","transliteration":"wa-aḍallahumu","translation_bn":"এবং তাদেরকে পথভ্রষ্ট করেছে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66247,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّامِرِىُّ","transliteration":"l-sāmiriyu","translation_bn":"সামেরী\"","root":"سمر","lemma":"سَّامِرِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66248,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٨٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla fa-innā qad fatannā qawmaka min baʿdika wa-aḍallahumu l-sāmiriyu', 'তিনি বললেন, ‘তোমার অনুপস্থিতিতে আমি তোমার সম্প্রদায়কে পরীক্ষা করেছি আর সামিরী তাদেরকে গুমরাহ্ করেছে।', '[Allah] said, "But indeed, We have tried your people after you [departed], and the Samiri has led them astray."', 'তিনি বললেন, ‘তোমার অনুপস্থিতিতে আমি তোমার সম্প্রদায়কে পরীক্ষা করেছি আর সামিরী তাদেরকে গুমরাহ্ করেছে।', '[Allah] said, "But indeed, We have tried your people after you [departed], and the Samiri has led them astray."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020085.mp3', now()),
  (20, 86, '', '[{"id":66522,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَرَجَعَ","transliteration":"farajaʿa","translation_bn":"অতঃপর ফিরে আসলো","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66523,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰٓ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসা","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":66524,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66525,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمِهِۦ","transliteration":"qawmihi","translation_bn":"তার লোকদের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66526,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"غَضْبَـٰنَ","transliteration":"ghaḍbāna","translation_bn":"রাগান্বিত হয়ে","root":"غضب","lemma":"غَضْبَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66527,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَسِفًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"asifan","translation_bn":"অনুতপ্ত অবস্থায়","root":"اسف","lemma":"أَسِف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66529,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66530,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"yāqawmi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":66531,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"নি কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":66532,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَعِدْكُمْ","transliteration":"yaʿid''kum","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি দেন তোমাদের","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66533,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكُمْ","transliteration":"rabbukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66534,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَعْدًا","transliteration":"waʿdan","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66535,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"حَسَنًا ۚ","transliteration":"ḥasanan","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"حسن","lemma":"حَسَن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":66537,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَفَطَالَ","transliteration":"afaṭāla","translation_bn":"কি  সুদীর্ঘ হয়েছে তবে","root":"طول","lemma":"طَالَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":66538,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمُ","transliteration":"ʿalaykumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66539,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَهْدُ","transliteration":"l-ʿahdu","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতির সময়","root":"عهد","lemma":"عَهْد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66540,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَمْ","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66541,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَرَدتُّمْ","transliteration":"aradttum","translation_bn":"তোমরা চেয়েছো","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66542,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":66543,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"يَحِلَّ","transliteration":"yaḥilla","translation_bn":"অবধারিত হোক","root":"حلل","lemma":"حَلَلْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66544,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66545,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"غَضَبٌۭ","transliteration":"ghaḍabun","translation_bn":"রাগ","root":"غضب","lemma":"غَضَب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66546,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66547,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّكُمْ","transliteration":"rabbikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66548,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"فَأَخْلَفْتُم","transliteration":"fa-akhlaftum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তোমরা ভঙ্গ করেছ","root":"خلف","lemma":"أَخْلَفُ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":66549,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"مَّوْعِدِى","transliteration":"mawʿidī","translation_bn":"আমার সাথে করা প্রতিশ্রুতি\"","root":"وعد","lemma":"مَّوْعِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66550,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"٨٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'farajaʿa mūsā ilā qawmihi ghaḍbāna asifan qāla yāqawmi alam yaʿid''kum rabbukum waʿdan ḥasanan afaṭāla ʿalaykumu l-ʿahdu am aradttum an yaḥilla ʿalaykum ghaḍabun min rabbikum fa-akhlaftum mawʿidī', 'তখন মূসা রাগে-দুঃখে তার জাতির কাছে ফিরে গেল। সে বলল, ‘হে আমার জাতি! তোমাদের প্রতিপালক কি তোমাদের সঙ্গে ও‘য়াদা করেননি, এক উত্তম ওয়া‘দা। ওয়া‘দা (পূরণের সময় আসতে) কি তোমাদের নিকট সুদীর্ঘ মনে হয়েছে, নাকি তোমরা চেয়েছ যে, তোমাদের প্রতি তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের শাস্তি নেমে আসুক, যে কারণে তোমরা আমার কাছে দেয়া তোমাদের ওয়া‘দা ভঙ্গ করলে?’', 'So Moses returned to his people, angry and grieved. He said, "O my people, did your Lord not make you a good promise? Then, was the time [of its fulfillment] too long for you, or did you wish that wrath from your Lord descend upon you, so you broke your promise [of obedience] to me?"', 'তখন মূসা রাগে-দুঃখে তার জাতির কাছে ফিরে গেল। সে বলল, ‘হে আমার জাতি! তোমাদের প্রতিপালক কি তোমাদের সঙ্গে ও‘য়াদা করেননি, এক উত্তম ওয়া‘দা। ওয়া‘দা (পূরণের সময় আসতে) কি তোমাদের নিকট সুদীর্ঘ মনে হয়েছে, নাকি তোমরা চেয়েছ যে, তোমাদের প্রতি তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের শাস্তি নেমে আসুক, যে কারণে তোমরা আমার কাছে দেয়া তোমাদের ওয়া‘দা ভঙ্গ করলে?’', 'So Moses returned to his people, angry and grieved. He said, "O my people, did your Lord not make you a good promise? Then, was the time [of its fulfillment] too long for you, or did you wish that wrath from your Lord descend upon you, so you broke your promise [of obedience] to me?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020086.mp3', now()),
  (20, 87, '', '[{"id":67070,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67071,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":67072,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَخْلَفْنَا","transliteration":"akhlafnā","translation_bn":"আমরা ভঙ্গ করেছি","root":"خلف","lemma":"أَخْلَفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67073,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَوْعِدَكَ","transliteration":"mawʿidaka","translation_bn":"তোমার সাথে করা প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"وعد","lemma":"مَّوْعِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67074,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِمَلْكِنَا","transliteration":"bimalkinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের ইচ্ছেমত","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلْك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67075,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّا","transliteration":"walākinnā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67076,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"حُمِّلْنَآ","transliteration":"ḥummil''nā","translation_bn":"আমাদের উপর চাপানো হয়েছিলো","root":"حمل","lemma":"حُمِّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67077,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَوْزَارًۭا","transliteration":"awzāran","translation_bn":"বোঝা সমূহ","root":"وزر","lemma":"وِزْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67078,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"তৈরি","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67079,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"زِينَةِ","transliteration":"zīnati","translation_bn":"অলংকারের","root":"زين","lemma":"زِينَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67080,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمِ","transliteration":"l-qawmi","translation_bn":"লোকদের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67081,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَقَذَفْنَـٰهَا","transliteration":"faqadhafnāhā","translation_bn":"ফলে তা আমরা ছুঁড়ে ফেলি","root":"قذف","lemma":"قَذَفَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67082,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَكَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"fakadhālika","translation_bn":"পরে ঐভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67083,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَلْقَى","transliteration":"alqā","translation_bn":"নিক্ষেপ করলো","root":"لقي","lemma":"أَلْقَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67084,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّامِرِىُّ","transliteration":"l-sāmiriyu","translation_bn":"সামেরীও\"","root":"سمر","lemma":"سَّامِرِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67085,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٨٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū mā akhlafnā mawʿidaka bimalkinā walākinnā ḥummil''nā awzāran min zīnati l-qawmi faqadhafnāhā fakadhālika alqā l-sāmiriyu', 'তারা বলল, ‘আমাদের সাধ্য থাকা পর্যন্ত আমরা তোমার প্রতি দেয়া আমাদের ওয়া‘দা ভঙ্গ করিনি, কিন্তু আমাদের উপর লোকেদের অলঙ্কারের বোঝা চাপিয়ে দেয়া হয়েছিল, আর আমরা তা নিক্ষেপ করেছিলাম (আগুনে), এমনিভাবে সামিরীও নিক্ষেপ করেছিল।', 'They said, "We did not break our promise to you by our will, but we were made to carry burdens from the ornaments of the people [of Pharaoh], so we threw them [into the fire], and thus did the Samiri throw."', 'তারা বলল, ‘আমাদের সাধ্য থাকা পর্যন্ত আমরা তোমার প্রতি দেয়া আমাদের ওয়া‘দা ভঙ্গ করিনি, কিন্তু আমাদের উপর লোকেদের অলঙ্কারের বোঝা চাপিয়ে দেয়া হয়েছিল, আর আমরা তা নিক্ষেপ করেছিলাম (আগুনে), এমনিভাবে সামিরীও নিক্ষেপ করেছিল।', 'They said, "We did not break our promise to you by our will, but we were made to carry burdens from the ornaments of the people [of Pharaoh], so we threw them [into the fire], and thus did the Samiri throw."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020087.mp3', now()),
  (20, 88, '', '[{"id":67364,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَأَخْرَجَ","transliteration":"fa-akhraja","translation_bn":"অতঃপর বের করলো","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67365,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67366,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عِجْلًۭا","transliteration":"ʿij''lan","translation_bn":"একটি বাছুর","root":"عجل","lemma":"عِجْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67367,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"جَسَدًۭا","transliteration":"jasadan","translation_bn":"অবয়ব","root":"جسد","lemma":"جَسَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":67368,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার ছিলো","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67369,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"خُوَارٌۭ","transliteration":"khuwārun","translation_bn":"হাম্বা শব্দ","root":"خور","lemma":"خُوَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67370,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"faqālū","translation_bn":"তখন তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67371,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَآ","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"\"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":67372,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهُكُمْ","transliteration":"ilāhukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপাস্য","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67373,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَإِلَـٰهُ","transliteration":"wa-ilāhu","translation_bn":"ও উপাস্য","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67374,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসার","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":67375,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَنَسِىَ","transliteration":"fanasiya","translation_bn":"(মূসা) আসলে ভুলে গিয়েছিলো\"","root":"نسي","lemma":"نَسِىَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67376,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٨٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-akhraja lahum ʿij''lan jasadan lahu khuwārun faqālū hādhā ilāhukum wa-ilāhu mūsā fanasiya', 'তখন সে (আগুন থেকে) গো-বৎসের প্রতিকৃতি বের করল, মনে হত সেটা যেন হাম্বা রব করছে। অতঃপর তারা বলল, ‘এটাই তোমাদের ইলাহ আর মূসারও ইলাহ, কিন্তু মূসা ভুলে গেছে।’', 'And he extracted for them [the statue of] a calf which had a lowing sound, and they said, "This is your god and the god of Moses, but he forgot."', 'তখন সে (আগুন থেকে) গো-বৎসের প্রতিকৃতি বের করল, মনে হত সেটা যেন হাম্বা রব করছে। অতঃপর তারা বলল, ‘এটাই তোমাদের ইলাহ আর মূসারও ইলাহ, কিন্তু মূসা ভুলে গেছে।’', 'And he extracted for them [the statue of] a calf which had a lowing sound, and they said, "This is your god and the god of Moses, but he forgot."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020088.mp3', now()),
  (20, 89, '', '[{"id":67545,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَا","transliteration":"afalā","translation_bn":"নি কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":67546,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَرَوْنَ","transliteration":"yarawna","translation_bn":"তারা (ভেবে) দেখে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67547,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَلَّا","transliteration":"allā","translation_bn":"যে না","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":67548,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَرْجِعُ","transliteration":"yarjiʿu","translation_bn":"ফিরে আসে","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67549,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ilayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের দিকে (অর্থাৎ উত্তর দেয়)","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67550,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَوْلًۭا","transliteration":"qawlan","translation_bn":"কথার","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67551,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67552,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَمْلِكُ","transliteration":"yamliku","translation_bn":"ক্ষমতা রাখে","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَكَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67553,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67554,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ضَرًّۭا","transliteration":"ḍarran","translation_bn":"ক্ষতি (করতে)","root":"ضرر","lemma":"ضَرّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67555,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67556,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"نَفْعًۭا","transliteration":"nafʿan","translation_bn":"উপকার (করতে)","root":"نفع","lemma":"نَفْع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67557,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٨٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'afalā yarawna allā yarjiʿu ilayhim qawlan walā yamliku lahum ḍarran walā nafʿan', 'তারা কি ভেবে দেখে না যে, তা তাদের কথার জবাব দেয় না, আর তা তাদের কোন ক্ষতি বা উপকার করার সামর্থ্যও রাখে না?', 'Did they not see that it could not return to them any speech and that it did not possess for them any harm or benefit?', 'তারা কি ভেবে দেখে না যে, তা তাদের কথার জবাব দেয় না, আর তা তাদের কোন ক্ষতি বা উপকার করার সামর্থ্যও রাখে না?', 'Did they not see that it could not return to them any speech and that it did not possess for them any harm or benefit?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020089.mp3', now()),
  (20, 90, '', '[{"id":68141,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68142,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68143,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68144,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰرُونُ","transliteration":"hārūnu","translation_bn":"হারূন","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰرُون","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":68145,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকেই","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68146,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68147,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"yāqawmi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":68148,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"মূলত","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":68149,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فُتِنتُم","transliteration":"futintum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের পরীক্ষায় ফেলা হয়েছে","root":"فتن","lemma":"فَتَنُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68150,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তা দ্বারা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68152,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ","transliteration":"wa-inna","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68153,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّكُمُ","transliteration":"rabbakumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68154,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-raḥmānu","translation_bn":"দয়াময় (আল্লাহ)","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68155,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فَٱتَّبِعُونِى","transliteration":"fa-ittabiʿūnī","translation_bn":"সুতরাং তোমরা আমাকে অনুসরণ করো","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68156,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَأَطِيعُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wa-aṭīʿū","translation_bn":"ও তোমরা আনুগত্য করো","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68157,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرِى","transliteration":"amrī","translation_bn":"আমার আদেশের\"","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68158,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٩٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯০)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad qāla lahum hārūnu min qablu yāqawmi innamā futintum bihi wa-inna rabbakumu l-raḥmānu fa-ittabiʿūnī wa-aṭīʿū amrī', 'হারূন তাদেরকে আগেই বলেছিল, ‘হে আমার জাতির লোকেরা! এর (অর্থাৎ গো-বৎসের) দ্বারা তোমাদেরকে পরীক্ষায় ফেলা হয়েছে, তোমাদের প্রতিপালক হলেন দয়াময় (আল্লাহ), কাজেই তোমরা আমার অনুসরণ কর আর আমার কথা মান্য কর।', 'And Aaron had already told them before [the return of Moses], "O my people, you are only being tested by it, and indeed, your Lord is the Most Merciful, so follow me and obey my order."', 'হারূন তাদেরকে আগেই বলেছিল, ‘হে আমার জাতির লোকেরা! এর (অর্থাৎ গো-বৎসের) দ্বারা তোমাদেরকে পরীক্ষায় ফেলা হয়েছে, তোমাদের প্রতিপালক হলেন দয়াময় (আল্লাহ), কাজেই তোমরা আমার অনুসরণ কর আর আমার কথা মান্য কর।', 'And Aaron had already told them before [the return of Moses], "O my people, you are only being tested by it, and indeed, your Lord is the Most Merciful, so follow me and obey my order."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020090.mp3', now()),
