াছে মূসা ফিরে না আসা পর্যন্ত আমরা সদাসর্বদা এর সাথেই সংযুক্ত হয়ে থাকব।', 'They said, "We will never cease being devoted to the calf until Moses returns to us."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020091.mp3', now()),
  (20, 92, '', '[{"id":68930,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(মূসা) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68931,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰهَـٰرُونُ","transliteration":"yāhārūnu","translation_bn":"\"হে হারূন","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰرُون","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":68932,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"কিসে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":68933,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَنَعَكَ","transliteration":"manaʿaka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে নিষেধ করলো","root":"منع","lemma":"مَّنَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68934,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":68935,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَأَيْتَهُمْ","transliteration":"ra-aytahum","translation_bn":"তাদের তুমি দেখলে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68936,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ضَلُّوٓا۟","transliteration":"ḍallū","translation_bn":"তারা পথভ্রষ্ট হয়েছে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68937,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٩٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯২)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla yāhārūnu mā manaʿaka idh ra-aytahum ḍallū', 'সে (মূসা) বলল, ‘হে হারূন! তুমি যখন দেখলে যে, তারা গুমরাহ্ হয়ে গেছে তখন তোমাকে কে নিষেধ করল', '[Moses] said, "O Aaron, what prevented you, when you saw them going astray,', 'সে (মূসা) বলল, ‘হে হারূন! তুমি যখন দেখলে যে, তারা গুমরাহ্ হয়ে গেছে তখন তোমাকে কে নিষেধ করল', '[Moses] said, "O Aaron, what prevented you, when you saw them going astray,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020092.mp3', now()),
  (20, 93, '', '[{"id":69294,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَّا","transliteration":"allā","translation_bn":"যে না","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":69295,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَتَّبِعَنِ ۖ","transliteration":"tattabiʿani","translation_bn":"আমার (আদেশের) অনুসরণ করলে","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69297,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَفَعَصَيْتَ","transliteration":"afaʿaṣayta","translation_bn":"তবে কি তুমি অমান্য করেছো","root":"عصي","lemma":"عَصَا","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":69298,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرِى","transliteration":"amrī","translation_bn":"আমার আদেশের\"","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69299,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٩٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'allā tattabiʿani afaʿaṣayta amrī', 'আমাকে অনুসরণ করতে? তাহলে তুমি কি আমার আদেশ অমান্য করলে?', 'From following me? Then have you disobeyed my order?"', 'আমাকে অনুসরণ করতে? তাহলে তুমি কি আমার আদেশ অমান্য করলে?', 'From following me? Then have you disobeyed my order?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020093.mp3', now()),
  (20, 94, '', '[{"id":69563,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69564,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَبْنَؤُمَّ","transliteration":"yabna-umma","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার মায়ের ছেলে (অর্থাৎ ভাই)","root":"بني","lemma":"ٱبْن","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":69565,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":69566,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَأْخُذْ","transliteration":"takhudh","translation_bn":"ধরো","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69567,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِلِحْيَتِى","transliteration":"biliḥ''yatī","translation_bn":"আমার দাড়ি","root":"لحي","lemma":"لِحْيَت","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69568,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69569,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِرَأْسِىٓ ۖ","transliteration":"birasī","translation_bn":"আমার মাথার (চুল)","root":"راس","lemma":"رَأْس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69571,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّى","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":69572,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"خَشِيتُ","transliteration":"khashītu","translation_bn":"আশঙ্কা করেছি","root":"خشي","lemma":"خَشِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69573,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":69574,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَقُولَ","transliteration":"taqūla","translation_bn":"বলবে তুমি","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69575,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَرَّقْتَ","transliteration":"farraqta","translation_bn":"\"তুমি বিভেদ সৃষ্টি করেছো","root":"فرق","lemma":"فَرَّقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69576,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَ","transliteration":"bayna","translation_bn":"মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":69577,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بَنِىٓ","transliteration":"banī","translation_bn":"সন্তানদের","root":"بني","lemma":"بُنَىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69578,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","transliteration":"is''rāīla","translation_bn":"ইসরাঈলের","root":"—","lemma":"إِسْرَائِيل","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69579,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمْ","transliteration":"walam","translation_bn":"এবং নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69580,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"تَرْقُبْ","transliteration":"tarqub","translation_bn":"তুমি মূল্য দাও","root":"رقب","lemma":"يَرْقُبُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69581,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"قَوْلِى","transliteration":"qawlī","translation_bn":"আমার কথা\"","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69582,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٩٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla yabna-umma lā takhudh biliḥ''yatī walā birasī innī khashītu an taqūla farraqta bayna banī is''rāīla walam tarqub qawlī', 'হারূন বলল, ‘হে আমার মায়ের পুত্র! আমার দাড়ি ধরে টেন না, আর আমার (মাথার) চুল ধরেও টেন না, আমি ভয় করেছিলাম তুমি বলবে যে, বানী ইসরাঈলের মাঝে তুমি বিভেদ সৃষ্টি করেছ আর তুমি আমার কথা পালন করনি।’', '[Aaron] said, "O son of my mother, do not seize [me] by my beard or by my head. Indeed, I feared that you would say, ''You caused division among the Children of Israel, and you did not observe [or await] my word.'' "', 'হারূন বলল, ‘হে আমার মায়ের পুত্র! আমার দাড়ি ধরে টেন না, আর আমার (মাথার) চুল ধরেও টেন না, আমি ভয় করেছিলাম তুমি বলবে যে, বানী ইসরাঈলের মাঝে তুমি বিভেদ সৃষ্টি করেছ আর তুমি আমার কথা পালন করনি।’', '[Aaron] said, "O son of my mother, do not seize [me] by my beard or by my head. Indeed, I feared that you would say, ''You caused division among the Children of Israel, and you did not observe [or await] my word.'' "', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020094.mp3', now()),
  (20, 95, '', '[{"id":69688,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69689,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فَمَا","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"\"তাহ''লে কি","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69690,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"خَطْبُكَ","transliteration":"khaṭbuka","translation_bn":"তোমার ব্যাপার","root":"خطب","lemma":"خَطْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69691,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰسَـٰمِرِىُّ","transliteration":"yāsāmiriyyu","translation_bn":"হে সামেরী\"","root":"سمر","lemma":"سَّامِرِىّ","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":69692,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٩٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla famā khaṭbuka yāsāmiriyyu', 'মূসা বলল, ‘এখন তোমার ব্যাপারটা কী, হে সামিরী?’', '[Moses] said, "And what is your case, O Samiri?"', 'মূসা বলল, ‘এখন তোমার ব্যাপারটা কী, হে সামিরী?’', '[Moses] said, "And what is your case, O Samiri?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020095.mp3', now()),
  (20, 96, '', '[{"id":69971,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(সামেরী) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69972,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بَصُرْتُ","transliteration":"baṣur''tu","translation_bn":"\"আমি দেখেছি","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصُرَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69973,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69974,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":69975,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَبْصُرُوا۟","transliteration":"yabṣurū","translation_bn":"তারা দেখে","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصُرَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69976,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সে সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69977,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَقَبَضْتُ","transliteration":"faqabaḍtu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর আমি মুঠিতে নিয়েছি","root":"قبض","lemma":"قَبَضْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69978,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَبْضَةًۭ","transliteration":"qabḍatan","translation_bn":"এক মুঠো","root":"قبض","lemma":"قَبْضَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69979,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69980,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَثَرِ","transliteration":"athari","translation_bn":"পায়ের চিহ্ন","root":"اثر","lemma":"أَثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69981,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّسُولِ","transliteration":"l-rasūli","translation_bn":"রাসূলের (অর্থাৎ জিবরাঈল বা মূসা আঃ)","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69982,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَنَبَذْتُهَا","transliteration":"fanabadhtuhā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তা আমি ছুঁড়ে ফেলেছি","root":"نبذ","lemma":"نَبَذَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69983,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wakadhālika","translation_bn":"এবং এভাবেই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69984,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"سَوَّلَتْ","transliteration":"sawwalat","translation_bn":"উদ্বুদ্ধ করেছিলো","root":"سول","lemma":"سَوَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69985,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لِى","transliteration":"lī","translation_bn":"আমাকে","root":"—","lemma":"لِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69986,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسِى","transliteration":"nafsī","translation_bn":"আমার মন\"","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69987,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٩٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla baṣur''tu bimā lam yabṣurū bihi faqabaḍtu qabḍatan min athari l-rasūli fanabadhtuhā wakadhālika sawwalat lī nafsī', 'সে বলল, ‘আমি দেখেছি যা ওরা দেখেনি, অতঃপর আমি প্রেরিত ব্যক্তির (অর্থাৎ জিবরীলের) পদচিহ্ন থেকে এক মুঠ মাটি নিলাম, অতঃপর আমি তা নিক্ষেপ করলাম (বাছুরের প্রতিকৃতিতে)। আমার মন আমাকে এ মন্ত্রণাই দিল।’', 'He said, "I saw what they did not see, so I took a handful [of dust] from the track of the messenger and threw it, and thus did my soul entice me."', 'সে বলল, ‘আমি দেখেছি যা ওরা দেখেনি, অতঃপর আমি প্রেরিত ব্যক্তির (অর্থাৎ জিবরীলের) পদচিহ্ন থেকে এক মুঠ মাটি নিলাম, অতঃপর আমি তা নিক্ষেপ করলাম (বাছুরের প্রতিকৃতিতে)। আমার মন আমাকে এ মন্ত্রণাই দিল।’', 'He said, "I saw what they did not see, so I took a handful [of dust] from the track of the messenger and threw it, and thus did my soul entice me."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020096.mp3', now()),
  (20, 97, '', '[{"id":70460,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70461,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فَٱذْهَبْ","transliteration":"fa-idh''hab","translation_bn":"\"তাহ''লে তুমি যাও","root":"ذهب","lemma":"ذَهَبَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70462,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّ","transliteration":"fa-inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই এখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70463,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَكَ","transliteration":"laka","translation_bn":"তোমার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكَ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70464,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70465,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","translation_bn":"(সারা) জীবনের","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70466,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"(এই নির্দেশ) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":70467,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَقُولَ","transliteration":"taqūla","translation_bn":"বলবে তুমি","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70468,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":70469,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِسَاسَ ۖ","transliteration":"misāsa","translation_bn":"স্পর্শ করবে (আমাকে)\"","root":"مسس\r","lemma":"مِسَاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70471,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ","transliteration":"wa-inna","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70472,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَكَ","transliteration":"laka","translation_bn":"তোমার জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَكَ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70473,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَوْعِدًۭا","transliteration":"mawʿidan","translation_bn":"নির্দিষ্ট সময় (জিজ্ঞাসাবাদের)","root":"وعد","lemma":"مَّوْعِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70474,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَّن","transliteration":"lan","translation_bn":"কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":70475,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تُخْلَفَهُۥ ۖ","transliteration":"tukh''lafahu","translation_bn":"তার ব্যতিক্রম করা হবে","root":"خلف","lemma":"أَخْلَفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70477,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَٱنظُرْ","transliteration":"wa-unẓur","translation_bn":"এবং দেখো","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70478,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70479,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهِكَ","transliteration":"ilāhika","translation_bn":"তোমার উপাস্যের","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70480,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যার","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":70481,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ظَلْتَ","transliteration":"ẓalta","translation_bn":"তুমি সর্বদা ছিলে","root":"ظلل","lemma":"ظَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70482,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"তার কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70483,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"عَاكِفًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"ʿākifan","translation_bn":"পূজারত","root":"عكف","lemma":"عَاكِف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70485,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"لَّنُحَرِّقَنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"lanuḥarriqannahu","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই আমরা জ্বালাবো","root":"حرق","lemma":"حَرِّقُ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":70486,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70487,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"لَنَنسِفَنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"lanansifannahu","translation_bn":"তাকে আমরা অবশ্যই বিক্ষিপ্তভাবে ছড়াবো","root":"نسف","lemma":"نُسِفَتْ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":70488,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70489,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْيَمِّ","transliteration":"l-yami","translation_bn":"সাগরের","root":"يمم","lemma":"يَمّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70490,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"نَسْفًا","transliteration":"nasfan","translation_bn":"বিক্ষিপ্ত করে\"","root":"نسف","lemma":"نَسْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70491,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"٩٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla fa-idh''hab fa-inna laka fī l-ḥayati an taqūla lā misāsa wa-inna laka mawʿidan lan tukh''lafahu wa-unẓur ilā ilāhika alladhī ẓalta ʿalayhi ʿākifan lanuḥarriqannahu thumma lanansifannahu fī l-yami nasfan', 'মূসা বলল, ‘তুই দূর হ! এ জীবনে তোর জন্য এ শাস্তিই থাকল যে, তুই বলবি- আমাকে স্পর্শ করো না, আর তোর জন্য একটা নির্দিষ্ট ওয়া‘দা আছে যার খেলাফ হবে না। আর তোর ইলাহর পানে চেয়ে দেখ যাকে তুই ঘিরে থাকতি, আমি তাকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই জ্বলন্ত আগুনে জ্বালিয়ে দেব, আর তাকে ছড়িয়ে ছিটিয়ে অবশ্য অবশ্যই সাগরে নিক্ষেপ করব।’', '[Moses] said, "Then go. And indeed, it is [decreed] for you in [this] life to say, ''No contact.'' And indeed, you have an appointment [in the Hereafter] you will not fail to keep. And look at your ''god'' to which you remained devoted. We will surely burn it and blow it into the sea with a blast.', 'মূসা বলল, ‘তুই দূর হ! এ জীবনে তোর জন্য এ শাস্তিই থাকল যে, তুই বলবি- আমাকে স্পর্শ করো না, আর তোর জন্য একটা নির্দিষ্ট ওয়া‘দা আছে যার খেলাফ হবে না। আর তোর ইলাহর পানে চেয়ে দেখ যাকে তুই ঘিরে থাকতি, আমি তাকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই জ্বলন্ত আগুনে জ্বালিয়ে দেব, আর তাকে ছড়িয়ে ছিটিয়ে অবশ্য অবশ্যই সাগরে নিক্ষেপ করব।’', '[Moses] said, "Then go. And indeed, it is [decreed] for you in [this] life to say, ''No contact.'' And indeed, you have an appointment [in the Hereafter] you will not fail to keep. And look at your ''god'' to which you remained devoted. We will surely burn it and blow it into the sea with a blast.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020097.mp3', now()),
  (20, 98, '', '[{"id":70651,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَآ","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"প্রকৃতপক্ষে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":70652,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهُكُمُ","transliteration":"ilāhukumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70653,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"একমাত্র আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":70654,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি (এমন যে)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":70655,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَآ","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":70656,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهَ","transliteration":"ilāha","translation_bn":"কোন ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70657,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":70658,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ ۚ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ ۚ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":70660,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَسِعَ","transliteration":"wasiʿa","translation_bn":"পরিবেষ্টিত","root":"وسع","lemma":"وَسِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70661,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"كُلَّ","transliteration":"kulla","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70662,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছু","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70663,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمًۭا","transliteration":"ʿil''man","translation_bn":"(তাঁর) জ্ঞানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70664,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٩٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innamā ilāhukumu l-lahu alladhī lā ilāha illā huwa wasiʿa kulla shayin ʿil''man', 'তোমাদের ইলাহ একমাত্র আল্লাহ, যিনি ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই। যাবতীয় বিষয়ে তাঁর জ্ঞান পরিব্যাপ্ত।', 'Your god is only Allah, except for whom there is no deity. He has encompassed all things in knowledge."', 'তোমাদের ইলাহ একমাত্র আল্লাহ, যিনি ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই। যাবতীয় বিষয়ে তাঁর জ্ঞান পরিব্যাপ্ত।', 'Your god is only Allah, except for whom there is no deity. He has encompassed all things in knowledge."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020098.mp3', now()),
  (20, 99, '', '[{"id":70910,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এরূপে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70911,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَقُصُّ","transliteration":"naquṣṣu","translation_bn":"বর্ণনা করছি আমরা","root":"قصص","lemma":"قَصَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70912,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ʿalayka","translation_bn":"তোমার কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70913,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70914,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنۢبَآءِ","transliteration":"anbāi","translation_bn":"সংবাদ","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَأ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70915,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":70916,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":70917,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"سَبَقَ ۚ","transliteration":"sabaqa","translation_bn":"আগে ঘটেছে","root":"سبق","lemma":"سَبَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70919,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَقَدْ","transliteration":"waqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70920,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰكَ","transliteration":"ātaynāka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে আমরা দিয়েছি","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70921,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70922,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَّدُنَّا","transliteration":"ladunnā","translation_bn":"আমার নিকট","root":"لدن","lemma":"لَّدُن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70923,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ذِكْرًۭا","transliteration":"dhik''ran","translation_bn":"উপদেশ","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70924,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٩٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'kadhālika naquṣṣu ʿalayka min anbāi mā qad sabaqa waqad ātaynāka min ladunnā dhik''ran', 'এভাবে পূর্বে যা ঘটে গেছে তার কিছু সংবাদ আমি তোমার কাছে বর্ণনা করছি, আর আমি আমার নিকট থেকে তোমাকে দান করেছি উপদেশ (বা কুরআন)।', 'Thus, [O Muhammad], We relate to you from the news of what has preceded. And We have certainly given you from Us the Qur''an.', 'এভাবে পূর্বে যা ঘটে গেছে তার কিছু সংবাদ আমি তোমার কাছে বর্ণনা করছি, আর আমি আমার নিকট থেকে তোমাকে দান করেছি উপদেশ (বা কুরআন)।', 'Thus, [O Muhammad], We relate to you from the news of what has preceded. And We have certainly given you from Us the Qur''an.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020099.mp3', now()),
  (20, 100, '', '[{"id":71430,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَّنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":71431,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَعْرَضَ","transliteration":"aʿraḍa","translation_bn":"বিমুখ হবে","root":"عرض","lemma":"أَعْرَضَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71432,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُ","transliteration":"ʿanhu","translation_bn":"তা থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71433,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"fa-innahu","translation_bn":"তবে সে নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71434,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَحْمِلُ","transliteration":"yaḥmilu","translation_bn":"বহন করবে","root":"حمل","lemma":"حَمَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71435,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":71436,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71437,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وِزْرًا","transliteration":"wiz''ran","translation_bn":"(দূর্বহ) ভার","root":"وزر","lemma":"وِزْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71438,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"١٠٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'man aʿraḍa ʿanhu fa-innahu yaḥmilu yawma l-qiyāmati wiz''ran', 'যে তাত্থেকে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেবে, কিয়ামাতের দিন সে (পাপের) বোঝা বহন করবে।', 'Whoever turns away from it - then indeed, he will bear on the Day of Resurrection a burden,', 'যে তাত্থেকে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেবে, কিয়ামাতের দিন সে (পাপের) বোঝা বহন করবে।', 'Whoever turns away from it - then indeed, he will bear on the Day of Resurrection a burden,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020100.mp3', now()),
  (20, 101, '', '[{"id":71577,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","transliteration":"khālidīna","translation_bn":"চিরস্থায়ী হবে তারা","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71578,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ ۖ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71580,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَسَآءَ","transliteration":"wasāa","translation_bn":"এবং কত মন্দ হবে","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71581,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71582,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":71583,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71584,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"حِمْلًۭا","transliteration":"ḥim''lan","translation_bn":"বোঝা","root":"حمل","lemma":"حِمْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71585,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"١٠١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'khālidīna fīhi wasāa lahum yawma l-qiyāmati ḥim''lan', 'তারা এ অবস্থাতেই স্থায়ীভাবে থাকবে, কিয়ামাতের দিন এ বোঝা তাদের জন্য কতই না মন্দ হবে!', '[Abiding] eternally therein, and evil it is for them on the Day of Resurrection as a load -', 'তারা এ অবস্থাতেই স্থায়ীভাবে থাকবে, কিয়ামাতের দিন এ বোঝা তাদের জন্য কতই না মন্দ হবে!', '[Abiding] eternally therein, and evil it is for them on the Day of Resurrection as a load -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020101.mp3', now()),
  (20, 102, '', '[{"id":71827,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"যেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71828,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُنفَخُ","transliteration":"yunfakhu","translation_bn":"ফুঁ দেয়া হবে","root":"نفخ","lemma":"نَفَخَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71829,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71830,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصُّورِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ṣūri","translation_bn":"শিঙ্গার","root":"صور","lemma":"صُّور","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71832,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَنَحْشُرُ","transliteration":"wanaḥshuru","translation_bn":"এবং সমবেত করবো আমরা","root":"حشر","lemma":"حَشَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71833,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-muj''rimīna","translation_bn":"অপরাধীদেরকে","root":"جرم","lemma":"مُجْرِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71834,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","transliteration":"yawma-idhin","translation_bn":"সেদিন","root":"—","lemma":"يَوْمَئِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":71835,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"زُرْقًۭا","transliteration":"zur''qan","translation_bn":"নীল-চোখ বিশিষ্ট (দৃষ্টিহীন অবস্থায়)","root":"زرق","lemma":"زُرْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71836,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"١٠٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yawma yunfakhu fī l-ṣūri wanaḥshuru l-muj''rimīna yawma-idhin zur''qan', 'যেদিন সিঙ্গায় ফুঁ দেয়া হবে আর আমি অপরাধীদেরকে একত্রিত করব (ভয়ে ভীত-সন্ত্রস্ত) দৃষ্টিহীন অবস্থায়।', 'The Day the Horn will be blown. And We will gather the criminals, that Day, blue-eyed.', 'যেদিন সিঙ্গায় ফুঁ দেয়া হবে আর আমি অপরাধীদেরকে একত্রিত করব (ভয়ে ভীত-সন্ত্রস্ত) দৃষ্টিহীন অবস্থায়।', 'The Day the Horn will be blown. And We will gather the criminals, that Day, blue-eyed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020102.mp3', now()),
  (20, 103, '', '[{"id":72159,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَتَخَـٰفَتُونَ","transliteration":"yatakhāfatūna","translation_bn":"তারা পরস্পরে চুপে-চুপে বলবে","root":"خفت","lemma":"يَتَخَٰفَتُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72160,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُمْ","transliteration":"baynahum","translation_bn":"তাদের মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":72161,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":72162,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَّبِثْتُمْ","transliteration":"labith''tum","translation_bn":"তোমরা অবস্থান করেছিলে","root":"لبث","lemma":"لَبِثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72163,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":72164,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَشْرًۭا","transliteration":"ʿashran","translation_bn":"দশ (দিন)\"","root":"عشر","lemma":"عَشْر","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":72165,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"١٠٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yatakhāfatūna baynahum in labith''tum illā ʿashran', 'তারা চুপিসারে নিজেদের মধ্যে বলাবলি করবে যে, (দুনিয়াতে) দশ দিনের বেশি তোমরা অবস্থান করনি।', 'They will murmur among themselves, "You remained not but ten [days in the world]."', 'তারা চুপিসারে নিজেদের মধ্যে বলাবলি করবে যে, (দুনিয়াতে) দশ দিনের বেশি তোমরা অবস্থান করনি।', 'They will murmur among themselves, "You remained not but ten [days in the world]."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020103.mp3', now()),
  (20, 104, '', '[{"id":72409,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"نَّحْنُ","transliteration":"naḥnu","translation_bn":"আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"نَّحْنُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":72410,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"aʿlamu","translation_bn":"খুব জানি","root":"علم","lemma":"أَعْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72411,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72412,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","translation_bn":"তারা বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72413,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":72414,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُ","transliteration":"yaqūlu","translation_bn":"বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72415,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَمْثَلُهُمْ","transliteration":"amthaluhum","translation_bn":"তাদের মধ্যকার অপেক্ষাকৃত উত্তম ব্যক্তি","root":"مثل","lemma":"أَمْثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72416,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"طَرِيقَةً","transliteration":"ṭarīqatan","translation_bn":"বুদ্ধিমত্তায়","root":"طرق","lemma":"طَرِيقَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72417,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":72418,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَّبِثْتُمْ","transliteration":"labith''tum","translation_bn":"তোমরা অবস্থান করেছিলে","root":"لبث","lemma":"لَبِثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72419,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":72420,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمًۭا","transliteration":"yawman","translation_bn":"একদিন\"","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72421,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١٠٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'naḥnu aʿlamu bimā yaqūlūna idh yaqūlu amthaluhum ṭarīqatan in labith''tum illā yawman', 'আমি ভালভাবেই জানি তারা যা বলে। তাদের মধ্যে যে উত্তম পথের অনুসারী সে বলবে, ‘তোমরা একদিনের বেশি অবস্থান করনি।’', 'We are most knowing of what they say when the best of them in manner will say, "You remained not but one day."', 'আমি ভালভাবেই জানি তারা যা বলে। তাদের মধ্যে যে উত্তম পথের অনুসারী সে বলবে, ‘তোমরা একদিনের বেশি অবস্থান করনি।’', 'We are most knowing of what they say when the best of them in manner will say, "You remained not but one day."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020104.mp3', now()),
  (20, 105, '', '[{"id":72856,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَسْـَٔلُونَكَ","transliteration":"wayasalūnaka","translation_bn":"এবং তোমাকে তারা প্রশ্ন করে","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72857,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَنِ","transliteration":"ʿani","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72858,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجِبَالِ","transliteration":"l-jibāli","translation_bn":"পর্বতসমূহ","root":"جبل","lemma":"جَبَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72859,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَقُلْ","transliteration":"faqul","translation_bn":"অতঃপর বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72860,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَنسِفُهَا","transliteration":"yansifuhā","translation_bn":"\"তা উড়িয়ে দিবেন ধুলো করে","root":"نسف","lemma":"نُسِفَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72861,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72862,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نَسْفًۭا","transliteration":"nasfan","translation_bn":"(খুব করে) উড়িয়ে দেয়া","root":"نسف","lemma":"نَسْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72863,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"١٠٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayasalūnaka ʿani l-jibāli faqul yansifuhā rabbī nasfan', 'তারা তোমাকে পর্বতগুলো সম্পর্কে প্রশ্ন করে। বল, আমার প্রতিপালক সেগুলো সমূলে উৎপাটিত করবেন এবং ধূলির ন্যায় বিক্ষিপ্ত করবেন।', 'And they ask you about the mountains, so say, "My Lord will blow them away with a blast.', 'তারা তোমাকে পর্বতগুলো সম্পর্কে প্রশ্ন করে। বল, আমার প্রতিপালক সেগুলো সমূলে উৎপাটিত করবেন এবং ধূলির ন্যায় বিক্ষিপ্ত করবেন।', 'And they ask you about the mountains, so say, "My Lord will blow them away with a blast.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020105.mp3', now()),
  (20, 106, '', '[{"id":73035,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَيَذَرُهَا","transliteration":"fayadharuhā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তা পরিণত করবেন","root":"وذر","lemma":"يَذَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73036,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَاعًۭا","transliteration":"qāʿan","translation_bn":"সমতল","root":"قوع","lemma":"قَاع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73037,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"صَفْصَفًۭا","transliteration":"ṣafṣafan","translation_bn":"মসৃণ ময়দানে","root":"صفصف","lemma":"صَفْصَف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":73038,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"١٠٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fayadharuhā qāʿan ṣafṣafan', 'অতঃপর তিনি তাকে (অর্থাৎ ভূমিকে) মসৃণ সমতলভূমি করে ছাড়বেন।', 'And He will leave the earth a level plain;', 'অতঃপর তিনি তাকে (অর্থাৎ ভূমিকে) মসৃণ সমতলভূমি করে ছাড়বেন।', 'And He will leave the earth a level plain;', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020106.mp3', now()),
  (20, 107, '', '[{"id":73413,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":73414,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَرَىٰ","transliteration":"tarā","translation_bn":"দেখবে তুমি","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73415,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73416,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عِوَجًۭا","transliteration":"ʿiwajan","translation_bn":"বাঁকা","root":"عوج","lemma":"عِوَج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73417,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73418,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَمْتًۭا","transliteration":"amtan","translation_bn":"অসমান (উঁচুনিচু)\"","root":"امت","lemma":"أَمْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73419,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"١٠٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lā tarā fīhā ʿiwajan walā amtan', 'তাতে তুমি দেখবে না কোন বক্রতা ও উচ্চতা।', 'You will not see therein a depression or an elevation."', 'তাতে তুমি দেখবে না কোন বক্রতা ও উচ্চতা।', 'You will not see therein a depression or an elevation."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020107.mp3', now()),
  (20, 108, '', '[{"id":73484,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","transliteration":"yawma-idhin","translation_bn":"সে দিন","root":"—","lemma":"يَوْمَئِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":73485,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّبِعُونَ","transliteration":"yattabiʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা অনুসরণ করবে","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73486,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدَّاعِىَ","transliteration":"l-dāʿiya","translation_bn":"এক আহ্বানকারীকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَاعِى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73487,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না থাকবে","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":73488,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عِوَجَ","transliteration":"ʿiwaja","translation_bn":"বক্রতা","root":"عوج","lemma":"عِوَج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73489,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ ۖ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73491,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَخَشَعَتِ","transliteration":"wakhashaʿati","translation_bn":"এবং ক্ষীণ হবে","root":"خشع","lemma":"خَشَعَتِ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73492,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَصْوَاتُ","transliteration":"l-aṣwātu","translation_bn":"আওয়াজ সমূহ","root":"صوت","lemma":"صَوْت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73493,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لِلرَّحْمَـٰنِ","transliteration":"lilrraḥmāni","translation_bn":"দয়াময়ের সামনে","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73494,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73495,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَسْمَعُ","transliteration":"tasmaʿu","translation_bn":"শুনবে তুমি","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73496,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":73497,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"هَمْسًۭا","transliteration":"hamsan","translation_bn":"অস্পষ্ট ধ্বনি (পদ শব্দ)","root":"همس","lemma":"هَمْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73498,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"١٠٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yawma-idhin yattabiʿūna l-dāʿiya lā ʿiwaja lahu wakhashaʿati l-aṣwātu lilrraḥmāni falā tasmaʿu illā hamsan', 'সেদিন তারা (সোজাসুজি) আহবানকারীর অনুসরণ করবে যার কথা এদিক ওদিক হবে না। দয়াময়ের সম্মুখে সেদিন যাবতীয় আওয়াজ স্তব্ধ হয়ে যাবে (এমনভাবে) যে মৃদু গুঞ্জন ছাড়া তুমি কিছুই শুনবে না।', 'That Day, everyone will follow [the call of] the Caller [with] no deviation therefrom, and [all] voices will be stilled before the Most Merciful, so you will not hear except a whisper [of footsteps].', 'সেদিন তারা (সোজাসুজি) আহবানকারীর অনুসরণ করবে যার কথা এদিক ওদিক হবে না। দয়াময়ের সম্মুখে সেদিন যাবতীয় আওয়াজ স্তব্ধ হয়ে যাবে (এমনভাবে) যে মৃদু গুঞ্জন ছাড়া তুমি কিছুই শুনবে না।', 'That Day, everyone will follow [the call of] the Caller [with] no deviation therefrom, and [all] voices will be stilled before the Most Merciful, so you will not hear except a whisper [of footsteps].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020108.mp3', now()),
  (20, 109, '', '[{"id":73799,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","transliteration":"yawma-idhin","translation_bn":"সে দিন","root":"—","lemma":"يَوْمَئِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":73800,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":73801,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَنفَعُ","transliteration":"tanfaʿu","translation_bn":"উপকার দিবে","root":"نفع","lemma":"نَفَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73802,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّفَـٰعَةُ","transliteration":"l-shafāʿatu","translation_bn":"সুপারিশ","root":"شفع","lemma":"شَفَٰعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73803,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":73804,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":73805,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَذِنَ","transliteration":"adhina","translation_bn":"অনুমতি দিবেন","root":"اذن","lemma":"أَذِنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73806,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَهُ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73807,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-raḥmānu","translation_bn":"দয়াময় (আল্লাহ)","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73808,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَرَضِىَ","transliteration":"waraḍiya","translation_bn":"এবং পছন্দ করবেন","root":"رضو","lemma":"رَّضِىَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73809,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73810,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"قَوْلًۭا","transliteration":"qawlan","translation_bn":"কথাকে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73811,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١٠٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yawma-idhin lā tanfaʿu l-shafāʿatu illā man adhina lahu l-raḥmānu waraḍiya lahu qawlan', 'সেদিন কারো সুপারিশ কোন কাজে আসবে না, দয়াময় যাকে অনুমতি দেবেন আর যার কথায় সন্তুষ্ট হবেন তার (সুপারিশ) ব্যতীত।', 'That Day, no intercession will benefit except [that of] one to whom the Most Merciful has given permission and has accepted his word.', 'সেদিন কারো সুপারিশ কোন কাজে আসবে না, দয়াময় যাকে অনুমতি দেবেন আর যার কথায় সন্তুষ্ট হবেন তার (সুপারিশ) ব্যতীত।', 'That Day, no intercession will benefit except [that of] one to whom the Most Merciful has given permission and has accepted his word.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020109.mp3', now()),
  (20, 110, '', '[{"id":74109,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","translation_bn":"তিনি জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74110,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":74111,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَ","transliteration":"bayna","translation_bn":"মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":74112,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَيْدِيهِمْ","transliteration":"aydīhim","translation_bn":"তাদের হাতের (সামনে)","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74113,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74114,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"خَلْفَهُمْ","transliteration":"khalfahum","translation_bn":"তাদের পিছনে (আছে)","root":"خلف","lemma":"خَلْف","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":74115,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":74116,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يُحِيطُونَ","transliteration":"yuḥīṭūna","translation_bn":"তারা আয়ত্ত্ব করতে পারে","root":"حوط","lemma":"أَحَاطَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74117,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তাঁকে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74118,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمًۭا","transliteration":"ʿil''man","translation_bn":"জ্ঞানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74119,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"١١٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১০)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yaʿlamu mā bayna aydīhim wamā khalfahum walā yuḥīṭūna bihi ʿil''man', 'তাদের সম্মুখে ও পশ্চাতে যা আছে তা তিনি জানেন, তারা জ্ঞান দিয়ে তাঁকে আয়ত্ত করতে পারে না।', 'Allah knows what is [presently] before them and what will be after them, but they do not encompass it in knowledge.', 'তাদের সম্মুখে ও পশ্চাতে যা আছে তা তিনি জানেন, তারা জ্ঞান দিয়ে তাঁকে আয়ত্ত করতে পারে না।', 'Allah knows what is [presently] before them and what will be after them, but they do not encompass it in knowledge.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020110.mp3', now()),
  (20, 111, '', '[{"id":74410,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَعَنَتِ","transliteration":"waʿanati","translation_bn":"এবং অবনমিত হবে","root":"عنو","lemma":"عَنَتِ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74411,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْوُجُوهُ","transliteration":"l-wujūhu","translation_bn":"মুখমণ্ডলসমূহ","root":"وجه","lemma":"وَجْه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74412,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِلْحَىِّ","transliteration":"lil''ḥayyi","translation_bn":"কাছে চিরঞ্জীবের","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74413,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَيُّومِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-qayūmi","translation_bn":"চিরস্থায়ীর","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَيُّوم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74415,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَقَدْ","transliteration":"waqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74416,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"خَابَ","transliteration":"khāba","translation_bn":"ব্যর্থ হবে","root":"خيب","lemma":"خَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74417,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":74418,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"حَمَلَ","transliteration":"ḥamala","translation_bn":"বহন করবে","root":"حمل","lemma":"حَمَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74419,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ظُلْمًۭا","transliteration":"ẓul''man","translation_bn":"অত্যাচার (গুনাহের বোঝা)","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظُلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74420,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١١١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১১)","root":"—","lemma":"١١١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waʿanati l-wujūhu lil''ḥayyi l-qayūmi waqad khāba man ḥamala ẓul''man', 'চিরঞ্জীব চিরস্থায়ীর সম্মুখে সকলেই হবে অধোমুখী, আর সে ব্যর্থ হবে যে যুলমের (পাপের) ভার বহন করবে।', 'And [all] faces will be humbled before the Ever-Living, the Sustainer of existence. And he will have failed who carries injustice.', 'চিরঞ্জীব চিরস্থায়ীর সম্মুখে সকলেই হবে অধোমুখী, আর সে ব্যর্থ হবে যে যুলমের (পাপের) ভার বহন করবে।', 'And [all] faces will be humbled before the Ever-Living, the Sustainer of existence. And he will have failed who carries injustice.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020111.mp3', now()),
  (20, 112, '', '[{"id":74769,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74770,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلْ","transliteration":"yaʿmal","translation_bn":"কাজ করবে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74771,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74772,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","translation_bn":"সৎকাজ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74773,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এ অবস্থায়(যে) সে","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":74774,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مُؤْمِنٌۭ","transliteration":"mu''minun","translation_bn":"মু''মিন (হবে)","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74775,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"তাহ''লে না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74776,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَخَافُ","transliteration":"yakhāfu","translation_bn":"সে ভয় করবে","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74777,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ظُلْمًۭا","transliteration":"ẓul''man","translation_bn":"অত্যাচার","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظُلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74778,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74779,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"هَضْمًۭا","transliteration":"haḍman","translation_bn":"ক্ষতির","root":"هضم","lemma":"هَضْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74780,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١١٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১২)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waman yaʿmal mina l-ṣāliḥāti wahuwa mu''minun falā yakhāfu ẓul''man walā haḍman', 'যে সৎ কাজ করবে মু’মিন হয়ে, তার অবিচার বা ক্ষতির কোন আশংকা নেই।', 'But he who does of righteous deeds while he is a believer - he will neither fear injustice nor deprivation.', 'যে সৎ কাজ করবে মু’মিন হয়ে, তার অবিচার বা ক্ষতির কোন আশংকা নেই।', 'But he who does of righteous deeds while he is a believer - he will neither fear injustice nor deprivation.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020112.mp3', now()),
  (20, 113, '', '[{"id":74876,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wakadhālika","translation_bn":"আর এরূপে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74877,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"anzalnāhu","translation_bn":"তা আমরা অবতীর্ণ করেছি","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74878,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قُرْءَانًا","transliteration":"qur''ānan","translation_bn":"(অর্থাৎ) কুরআনকে","root":"قرا","lemma":"قُرْءَان","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":74879,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَرَبِيًّۭا","transliteration":"ʿarabiyyan","translation_bn":"আরবী ভাষায়","root":"عرب","lemma":"عَرَبِيّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":74880,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَصَرَّفْنَا","transliteration":"waṣarrafnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা বিশদভাবে বর্ণনা করেছি","root":"صرف","lemma":"صَرَّفْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74881,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74882,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74883,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْوَعِيدِ","transliteration":"l-waʿīdi","translation_bn":"সতর্কবাণী","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعِيد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74884,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"তারা যাতে","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":74885,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّقُونَ","transliteration":"yattaqūna","translation_bn":"তাকওয়া অবলম্বন করে","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74886,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74887,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يُحْدِثُ","transliteration":"yuḥ''dithu","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করবে","root":"حدث","lemma":"يُحْدِثُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74888,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74889,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ذِكْرًۭا","transliteration":"dhik''ran","translation_bn":"উপদেশ(হুঁশজ্ঞান)","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74890,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١١٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakadhālika anzalnāhu qur''ānan ʿarabiyyan waṣarrafnā fīhi mina l-waʿīdi laʿallahum yattaqūna aw yuḥ''dithu lahum dhik''ran', 'এভাবেই আমি কুরআনকে আরবী ভাষায় নাযিল করেছি আর তাতে সতর্কবাণী বিস্তারিতভাবে বিবৃত করেছি যাতে তারা আল্লাহকে ভয় করে অথবা তা হয় তাদের জন্য উপদেশ।', 'And thus We have sent it down as an Arabic Qur''an and have diversified therein the warnings that perhaps they will avoid [sin] or it would cause them remembrance.', 'এভাবেই আমি কুরআনকে আরবী ভাষায় নাযিল করেছি আর তাতে সতর্কবাণী বিস্তারিতভাবে বিবৃত করেছি যাতে তারা আল্লাহকে ভয় করে অথবা তা হয় তাদের জন্য উপদেশ।', 'And thus We have sent it down as an Arabic Qur''an and have diversified therein the warnings that perhaps they will avoid [sin] or it would cause them remembrance.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020113.mp3', now()),
  (20, 114, '', '[{"id":75116,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَتَعَـٰلَى","transliteration":"fataʿālā","translation_bn":"সুতরাং মহান","root":"علو","lemma":"تَعَٰلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75117,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":75118,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَلِكُ","transliteration":"l-maliku","translation_bn":"অধিপতি","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75119,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقُّ ۗ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","translation_bn":"সত্যিকার","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75121,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75122,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَعْجَلْ","transliteration":"taʿjal","translation_bn":"তাড়াহুড়া করো","root":"عجل","lemma":"عَجِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75123,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْقُرْءَانِ","transliteration":"bil-qur''āni","translation_bn":"নিয়ে কুরআন (পাঠে)","root":"قرا","lemma":"قُرْءَان","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75124,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75125,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِ","transliteration":"qabli","translation_bn":"এর পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75126,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":75127,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُقْضَىٰٓ","transliteration":"yuq''ḍā","translation_bn":"সম্পূর্ণ করা হয়","root":"قضي","lemma":"قَضَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75128,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"তোমার প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75129,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَحْيُهُۥ ۖ","transliteration":"waḥyuhu","translation_bn":"তার ওহী(প্রেরণ)","root":"وحي","lemma":"وَحْى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75131,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَقُل","transliteration":"waqul","translation_bn":"এবং বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75132,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّ","transliteration":"rabbi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75133,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"زِدْنِى","transliteration":"zid''nī","translation_bn":"আমাকে বাড়িয়ে দাও","root":"زيد","lemma":"زَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75134,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمًۭا","transliteration":"ʿil''man","translation_bn":"জ্ঞান\"","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75135,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"١١٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fataʿālā l-lahu l-maliku l-ḥaqu walā taʿjal bil-qur''āni min qabli an yuq''ḍā ilayka waḥyuhu waqul rabbi zid''nī ʿil''man', 'আল্লাহ সর্বোচ্চ, প্রকৃত অধিপতি, তোমার প্রতি (আল্লাহর) ওয়াহী সম্পূর্ণ হওয়ার পূর্বে তুমি কুরআন বক্ষে ধারণের ব্যাপারে তাড়াহুড়ো করো না। আর বল, ‘হে আমার প্রতিপালক! জ্ঞানে আমায় সমৃদ্ধি দান করুন।’', 'So high [above all] is Allah, the Sovereign, the Truth. And, [O Muhammad], do not hasten with [recitation of] the Qur''an before its revelation is completed to you, and say, "My Lord, increase me in knowledge."', 'আল্লাহ সর্বোচ্চ, প্রকৃত অধিপতি, তোমার প্রতি (আল্লাহর) ওয়াহী সম্পূর্ণ হওয়ার পূর্বে তুমি কুরআন বক্ষে ধারণের ব্যাপারে তাড়াহুড়ো করো না। আর বল, ‘হে আমার প্রতিপালক! জ্ঞানে আমায় সমৃদ্ধি দান করুন।’', 'So high [above all] is Allah, the Sovereign, the Truth. And, [O Muhammad], do not hasten with [recitation of] the Qur''an before its revelation is completed to you, and say, "My Lord, increase me in knowledge."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020114.mp3', now()),
  (20, 115, '', '[{"id":75315,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75316,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَهِدْنَآ","transliteration":"ʿahid''nā","translation_bn":"আমরা নির্দেশ দিয়েছিলাম","root":"عهد","lemma":"عَهِدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75317,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75318,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ءَادَمَ","transliteration":"ādama","translation_bn":"আদমের","root":"—","lemma":"ا^دَم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":75319,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75320,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"ইতিপূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75321,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَنَسِىَ","transliteration":"fanasiya","translation_bn":"কিন্তু সে ভুলে যায়","root":"نسي","lemma":"نَسِىَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75322,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمْ","transliteration":"walam","translation_bn":"এবং নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75323,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"نَجِدْ","transliteration":"najid","translation_bn":"আমরা পাই","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75324,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75325,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَزْمًۭا","transliteration":"ʿazman","translation_bn":"দৃঢ় সংকল্প","root":"عزم","lemma":"عَزْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75326,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١١٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad ʿahid''nā ilā ādama min qablu fanasiya walam najid lahu ʿazman', 'ইতোপূর্বে আমি আদামের নিকট থেকে অঙ্গীকার গ্রহণ করেছিলাম, কিন্তু সে ভুলে গিয়েছিল, আমি তাকে দৃঢ়-সংকল্প পাইনি।', 'And We had already taken a promise from Adam before, but he forgot; and We found not in him determination.', 'ইতোপূর্বে আমি আদামের নিকট থেকে অঙ্গীকার গ্রহণ করেছিলাম, কিন্তু সে ভুলে গিয়েছিল, আমি তাকে দৃঢ়-সংকল্প পাইনি।', 'And We had already taken a promise from Adam before, but he forgot; and We found not in him determination.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020115.mp3', now()),
  (20, 116, '', '[{"id":75563,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذْ","transliteration":"wa-idh","translation_bn":"এবং(স্মরণ করো) যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75564,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قُلْنَا","transliteration":"qul''nā","translation_bn":"আমরা বলেছিলাম","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75565,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةِ","transliteration":"lil''malāikati","translation_bn":"ফিরিশতাদেরকে","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75566,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْجُدُوا۟","transliteration":"us''judū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা সিজদা করো","root":"سجد","lemma":"سَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75567,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لِـَٔادَمَ","transliteration":"liādama","translation_bn":"জন্য আদমের\"","root":"—","lemma":"ا^دَم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75568,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَسَجَدُوٓا۟","transliteration":"fasajadū","translation_bn":"তখন তারা সিজদা করলো","root":"سجد","lemma":"سَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75569,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّآ","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":75570,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِبْلِيسَ","transliteration":"ib''līsa","translation_bn":"ইবলিস (করলো না)","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْلِيس","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":75571,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَبَىٰ","transliteration":"abā","translation_bn":"সে অমান্য করলো","root":"ابي","lemma":"أَبَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75572,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١١٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idh qul''nā lil''malāikati us''judū liādama fasajadū illā ib''līsa abā', 'স্মরণ কর, যখন ফেরেশতাগণকে বলেছিলাম, ‘তোমরা আদামকে সেজদা কর,’ তখন ইবলিস ছাড়া সবাই সেজদা করল, সে অমান্য করল।', 'And [mention] when We said to the angels, "Prostrate to Adam," and they prostrated, except Iblees; he refused.', 'স্মরণ কর, যখন ফেরেশতাগণকে বলেছিলাম, ‘তোমরা আদামকে সেজদা কর,’ তখন ইবলিস ছাড়া সবাই সেজদা করল, সে অমান্য করল।', 'And [mention] when We said to the angels, "Prostrate to Adam," and they prostrated, except Iblees; he refused.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020116.mp3', now()),
  (20, 117, '', '[{"id":75808,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَقُلْنَا","transliteration":"faqul''nā","translation_bn":"তখন আমরা বললাম","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75809,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓـَٔادَمُ","transliteration":"yāādamu","translation_bn":"\"হে আদম","root":"—","lemma":"ا^دَم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":75810,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":75811,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":75812,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَدُوٌّۭ","transliteration":"ʿaduwwun","translation_bn":"শত্রু","root":"عدو","lemma":"عَدُوّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75813,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَّكَ","transliteration":"laka","translation_bn":"জন্য তোমার","root":"—","lemma":"لَّكَ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75814,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلِزَوْجِكَ","transliteration":"walizawjika","translation_bn":"এবং জন্য তোমার স্ত্রীর","root":"زوج","lemma":"زَوْج","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75815,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"অতএব না যেন","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75816,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُخْرِجَنَّكُمَا","transliteration":"yukh''rijannakumā","translation_bn":"তোমাদের দু''জনকে বের করে দেয়","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75817,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75818,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَنَّةِ","transliteration":"l-janati","translation_bn":"জান্নাত","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75819,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَتَشْقَىٰٓ","transliteration":"fatashqā","translation_bn":"ফলে তুমি কষ্টে পড়বে","root":"شقو","lemma":"شَقُ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":75820,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١١٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'faqul''nā yāādamu inna hādhā ʿaduwwun laka walizawjika falā yukh''rijannakumā mina l-janati fatashqā', 'তখন আমি বললাম, ‘হে আদাম! এ হচ্ছে তোমার আর তোমার স্ত্রীর দুশমন। কাজেই সে যেন কিছুতেই তোমাদেরকে জান্নাত থেকে বের করে না দেয়, তাহলে তোমরা দুর্দশায় পতিত হবে।', 'So We said, "O Adam, indeed this is an enemy to you and to your wife. Then let him not remove you from Paradise so you would suffer.', 'তখন আমি বললাম, ‘হে আদাম! এ হচ্ছে তোমার আর তোমার স্ত্রীর দুশমন। কাজেই সে যেন কিছুতেই তোমাদেরকে জান্নাত থেকে বের করে না দেয়, তাহলে তোমরা দুর্দশায় পতিত হবে।', 'So We said, "O Adam, indeed this is an enemy to you and to your wife. Then let him not remove you from Paradise so you would suffer.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020117.mp3', now()),
  (20, 118, '', '[{"id":75937,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":75938,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَكَ","transliteration":"laka","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমার","root":"—","lemma":"لَكَ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75939,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَلَّا","transliteration":"allā","translation_bn":"(এ ব্যবস্থা) যে না","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":75940,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَجُوعَ","transliteration":"tajūʿa","translation_bn":"তুমি ক্ষুধার্ত হবে","root":"جوع","lemma":"تَجُوعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75941,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75942,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75943,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَعْرَىٰ","transliteration":"taʿrā","translation_bn":"তুমি উলঙ্গ হবে","root":"عري","lemma":"تَعْرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75944,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"١١٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna laka allā tajūʿa fīhā walā taʿrā', 'তোমার জন্য (এত অধিক পরিমাণ) দেয়া হল যে, তুমি সেখানে (অর্থাৎ জান্নাতে) ক্ষুধার্তও হবে না, নগ্নও হবে না।', 'Indeed, it is [promised] for you not to be hungry therein or be unclothed.', 'তোমার জন্য (এত অধিক পরিমাণ) দেয়া হল যে, তুমি সেখানে (অর্থাৎ জান্নাতে) ক্ষুধার্তও হবে না, নগ্নও হবে না।', 'Indeed, it is [promised] for you not to be hungry therein or be unclothed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020118.mp3', now()),
  (20, 119, '', '[{"id":76107,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّكَ","transliteration":"wa-annaka","translation_bn":"এবং (এও) যে তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76108,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":76109,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَظْمَؤُا۟","transliteration":"taẓma-u","translation_bn":"পিপাসার্ত হবে","root":"ظما","lemma":"تَظْمَؤُا@","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76110,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76111,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76112,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَضْحَىٰ","transliteration":"taḍḥā","translation_bn":"রোদে উতপ্ত হবে","root":"ضحو","lemma":"تَضْحَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76113,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"١١٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-annaka lā taẓma-u fīhā walā taḍḥā', 'সেখানে তুমি তৃষ্ণার্তও হবে না, রোদেও পুড়বে না।', 'And indeed, you will not be thirsty therein or be hot from the sun."', 'সেখানে তুমি তৃষ্ণার্তও হবে না, রোদেও পুড়বে না।', 'And indeed, you will not be thirsty therein or be hot from the sun."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020119.mp3', now()),
  (20, 120, '', '[{"id":76499,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَوَسْوَسَ","transliteration":"fawaswasa","translation_bn":"কিন্তু কুমন্ত্রনা দিলো","root":"وسوس","lemma":"وَسْوَسَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76500,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"তার দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76501,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","translation_bn":"শয়তান","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76502,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76503,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓـَٔادَمُ","transliteration":"yāādamu","translation_bn":"\"হে আদম","root":"—","lemma":"ا^دَم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":76504,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":76505,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَدُلُّكَ","transliteration":"adulluka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে আমি বলে দিবো","root":"دلل","lemma":"دَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76506,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"সমন্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76507,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"شَجَرَةِ","transliteration":"shajarati","translation_bn":"এই গাছের","root":"شجر","lemma":"شَجَرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76508,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخُلْدِ","transliteration":"l-khul''di","translation_bn":"চিরন্তন জীবনের","root":"خلد","lemma":"خُلْد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76509,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَمُلْكٍۢ","transliteration":"wamul''kin","translation_bn":"ও এমন রাজ্যের","root":"ملك","lemma":"مُلْك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76510,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"(যা) না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":76511,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَبْلَىٰ","transliteration":"yablā","translation_bn":"ক্ষয় হয়\"","root":"بلو","lemma":"بَلَوْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76512,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"١٢٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fawaswasa ilayhi l-shayṭānu qāla yāādamu hal adulluka ʿalā shajarati l-khul''di wamul''kin lā yablā', 'কিন্তু শয়ত্বান তাকে কুমন্ত্রণা দিল। সে বলল, ‘হে আদাম! আমি কি তোমাকে জানিয়ে দেব চিরস্থায়ী জীবনদায়ী গাছের কথা আর এমন রাজ্যের কথা যা কোনদিন ক্ষয় হবে না?’', 'Then Satan whispered to him; he said, "O Adam, shall I direct you to the tree of eternity and possession that will not deteriorate?"', 'কিন্তু শয়ত্বান তাকে কুমন্ত্রণা দিল। সে বলল, ‘হে আদাম! আমি কি তোমাকে জানিয়ে দেব চিরস্থায়ী জীবনদায়ী গাছের কথা আর এমন রাজ্যের কথা যা কোনদিন ক্ষয় হবে না?’', 'Then Satan whispered to him; he said, "O Adam, shall I direct you to the tree of eternity and possession that will not deteriorate?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020120.mp3', now()),
  (20, 121, '', '[{"id":76549,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَأَكَلَا","transliteration":"fa-akalā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর উভয়ে খেলো","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76550,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهَا","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"তা থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76551,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَبَدَتْ","transliteration":"fabadat","translation_bn":"তখন প্রকাশ হয়ে পড়লো","root":"بدو","lemma":"بَدَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76552,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمَا","transliteration":"lahumā","translation_bn":"কাছে তাদের উভয়ের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76553,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"سَوْءَٰتُهُمَا","transliteration":"sawātuhumā","translation_bn":"তাদের উভয়ের লজ্জাস্থানসমূহ","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَوْءَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76554,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَطَفِقَا","transliteration":"waṭafiqā","translation_bn":"এবং উভয়ে শুরু করলো","root":"طفق","lemma":"طَفِقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76555,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَخْصِفَانِ","transliteration":"yakhṣifāni","translation_bn":"উভয়ে ঢাকতে","root":"خصف","lemma":"يَخْصِفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76556,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمَا","transliteration":"ʿalayhimā","translation_bn":"তাদের দুজনের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76557,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76558,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَرَقِ","transliteration":"waraqi","translation_bn":"পাতা","root":"ورق","lemma":"وَرَق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76559,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَنَّةِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-janati","translation_bn":"জান্নাতের","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76561,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَعَصَىٰٓ","transliteration":"waʿaṣā","translation_bn":"এবং অমান্য করলো","root":"عصي","lemma":"عَصَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76562,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ءَادَمُ","transliteration":"ādamu","translation_bn":"আদম","root":"—","lemma":"ا^دَم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":76563,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّهُۥ","transliteration":"rabbahu","translation_bn":"তার রবকে","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76564,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَغَوَىٰ","transliteration":"faghawā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর সে বিভ্রান্ত হলো","root":"غوي","lemma":"غَوَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76565,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"١٢١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-akalā min''hā fabadat lahumā sawātuhumā waṭafiqā yakhṣifāni ʿalayhimā min waraqi l-janati waʿaṣā ādamu rabbahu faghawā', 'অতঃপর তারা (স্বামী-স্ত্রী) দু’জনে তা (অর্থাৎ সেই গাছ) থেকে খেল তখন তাদের সামনে তাদের লজ্জাস্থান খুলে গেল আর তারা জান্নাতের গাছের পাতা দিয়ে নিজেদেরকে ঢাকতে লাগল। আদাম তার প্রতিপালকের অবাধ্যতা করল, ফলে সে পথভ্রান্ত হয়ে গেল।', 'And Adam and his wife ate of it, and their private parts became apparent to them, and they began to fasten over themselves from the leaves of Paradise. And Adam disobeyed his Lord and erred.', 'অতঃপর তারা (স্বামী-স্ত্রী) দু’জনে তা (অর্থাৎ সেই গাছ) থেকে খেল তখন তাদের সামনে তাদের লজ্জাস্থান খুলে গেল আর তারা জান্নাতের গাছের পাতা দিয়ে নিজেদেরকে ঢাকতে লাগল। আদাম তার প্রতিপালকের অবাধ্যতা করল, ফলে সে পথভ্রান্ত হয়ে গেল।', 'And Adam and his wife ate of it, and their private parts became apparent to them, and they began to fasten over themselves from the leaves of Paradise. And Adam disobeyed his Lord and erred.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020121.mp3', now()),
  (20, 122, '', '[{"id":76685,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপরে","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76686,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱجْتَبَـٰهُ","transliteration":"ij''tabāhu","translation_bn":"তাকে মনোনীত করলেন (সম্মানিত করলেন)","root":"جبي","lemma":"ٱجْتَبَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76687,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّهُۥ","transliteration":"rabbuhu","translation_bn":"তাঁর রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76688,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَتَابَ","transliteration":"fatāba","translation_bn":"অতঃপর ক্ষমা করলেন","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76689,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"তার প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76690,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَهَدَىٰ","transliteration":"wahadā","translation_bn":"ও পথ দেখালেন","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76691,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"١٢٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma ij''tabāhu rabbuhu fatāba ʿalayhi wahadā', 'এরপর তার পালনকর্তা তাকে বাছাই করলেন, তার তাওবাহ কবূল করলেন এবং তাকে সঠিক পথে পরিচালিত করলেন।', 'Then his Lord chose him and turned to him in forgiveness and guided [him].', 'এরপর তার পালনকর্তা তাকে বাছাই করলেন, তার তাওবাহ কবূল করলেন এবং তাকে সঠিক পথে পরিচালিত করলেন।', 'Then his Lord chose him and turned to him in forgiveness and guided [him].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020122.mp3', now()),
  (20, 123, '', '[{"id":76828,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(আল্লাহ) বললেন","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76829,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱهْبِطَا","transliteration":"ih''biṭā","translation_bn":"\"উভয়ে নেমে যাও","root":"هبط","lemma":"يَهْبِطُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76830,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهَا","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"তা থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76831,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"جَمِيعًۢا ۖ","transliteration":"jamīʿan","translation_bn":"এক সঙ্গে","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76833,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضُكُمْ","transliteration":"baʿḍukum","translation_bn":"তোমরা একে","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76834,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِبَعْضٍ","transliteration":"libaʿḍin","translation_bn":"জন্যে অপরের","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76835,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَدُوٌّۭ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿaduwwun","translation_bn":"শত্রু (হবে)","root":"عدو","lemma":"عَدُوّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76837,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَإِمَّا","transliteration":"fa-immā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76838,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِيَنَّكُم","transliteration":"yatiyannakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76839,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِّنِّى","transliteration":"minnī","translation_bn":"আমার পক্ষ হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76840,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"هُدًۭى","transliteration":"hudan","translation_bn":"পথনির্দেশ","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76841,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَمَنِ","transliteration":"famani","translation_bn":"তখন যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76842,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّبَعَ","transliteration":"ittabaʿa","translation_bn":"অনুসরণ করবে","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76843,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"هُدَاىَ","transliteration":"hudāya","translation_bn":"আমার পথনির্দেশ","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76844,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"ফলে না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76845,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَضِلُّ","transliteration":"yaḍillu","translation_bn":"বিভ্রান্ত হবে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76846,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76847,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَشْقَىٰ","transliteration":"yashqā","translation_bn":"কষ্ট পাবে","root":"شقو","lemma":"شَقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76848,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"١٢٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla ih''biṭā min''hā jamīʿan baʿḍukum libaʿḍin ʿaduwwun fa-immā yatiyannakum minnī hudan famani ittabaʿa hudāya falā yaḍillu walā yashqā', 'তিনি বললেন, ‘তোমরা দু’জনে (আদাম ও ইবলীস) একই সঙ্গে নীচে নেমে যাও, তোমরা একে অপরের শত্রু। অতঃপর আমার নিকট থেকে তোমাদের কাছে সঠিক পথের নির্দেশ আসবে, তখন যে আমার পথ নির্দেশ অনুসরণ করবে সে পথভ্রষ্ট হবে না এবং কষ্টে পতিত হবে না।', '[Allah] said, "Descend from Paradise - all, [your descendants] being enemies to one another. And if there should come to you guidance from Me - then whoever follows My guidance will neither go astray [in the world] nor suffer [in the Hereafter].', 'তিনি বললেন, ‘তোমরা দু’জনে (আদাম ও ইবলীস) একই সঙ্গে নীচে নেমে যাও, তোমরা একে অপরের শত্রু। অতঃপর আমার নিকট থেকে তোমাদের কাছে সঠিক পথের নির্দেশ আসবে, তখন যে আমার পথ নির্দেশ অনুসরণ করবে সে পথভ্রষ্ট হবে না এবং কষ্টে পতিত হবে না।', '[Allah] said, "Descend from Paradise - all, [your descendants] being enemies to one another. And if there should come to you guidance from Me - then whoever follows My guidance will neither go astray [in the world] nor suffer [in the Hereafter].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020123.mp3', now()),
  (20, 124, '', '[{"id":77069,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَنْ","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"আর যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77070,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَعْرَضَ","transliteration":"aʿraḍa","translation_bn":"বিমুখ হবে","root":"عرض","lemma":"أَعْرَضَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77071,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77072,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ذِكْرِى","transliteration":"dhik''rī","translation_bn":"আমার স্মরণ","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77073,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّ","transliteration":"fa-inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তবে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77074,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার জন্যে (হবে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77075,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَعِيشَةًۭ","transliteration":"maʿīshatan","translation_bn":"জীবন যাপন","root":"عيش","lemma":"مَعِيشَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77076,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ضَنكًۭا","transliteration":"ḍankan","translation_bn":"সংকুচিত","root":"ضنك","lemma":"ضَنك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":77077,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَنَحْشُرُهُۥ","transliteration":"wanaḥshuruhu","translation_bn":"আর তাকে উঠাবো আমরা","root":"حشر","lemma":"حَشَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77078,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":77079,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77080,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَىٰ","transliteration":"aʿmā","translation_bn":"অন্ধ অবস্থায়\"","root":"عمي","lemma":"أَعْمَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77081,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١٢٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waman aʿraḍa ʿan dhik''rī fa-inna lahu maʿīshatan ḍankan wanaḥshuruhu yawma l-qiyāmati aʿmā', 'আর যে আমার স্মরণ থেকে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেবে, তার জীবিকা হবে সংকীর্ণ আর তাকে কিয়ামাতের দিন উত্থিত করব অন্ধ অবস্থায়।’', 'And whoever turns away from My remembrance - indeed, he will have a depressed life, and We will gather him on the Day of Resurrection blind."', 'আর যে আমার স্মরণ থেকে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেবে, তার জীবিকা হবে সংকীর্ণ আর তাকে কিয়ামাতের দিন উত্থিত করব অন্ধ অবস্থায়।’', 'And whoever turns away from My remembrance - indeed, he will have a depressed life, and We will gather him on the Day of Resurrection blind."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020124.mp3', now()),
  (20, 125, '', '[{"id":77151,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77152,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّ","transliteration":"rabbi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77153,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِمَ","transliteration":"lima","translation_bn":"কেন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77154,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"حَشَرْتَنِىٓ","transliteration":"ḥashartanī","translation_bn":"আমাকে আপনি উঠালেন","root":"حشر","lemma":"حَشَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77155,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَىٰ","transliteration":"aʿmā","translation_bn":"অন্ধ অবস্থায়","root":"عمي","lemma":"أَعْمَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77156,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَقَدْ","transliteration":"waqad","translation_bn":"অথচ নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":77157,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُ","transliteration":"kuntu","translation_bn":"আমি ছিলাম","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77158,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بَصِيرًۭا","transliteration":"baṣīran","translation_bn":"চক্ষুষ্মান\"","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77159,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"١٢٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla rabbi lima ḥashartanī aʿmā waqad kuntu baṣīran', 'সে বলবে, ‘হে আমার প্রতিপালক! কেন আমাকে অন্ধ ক’রে উঠালে? আমি তো চক্ষুষ্মান ছিলাম।’', 'He will say, "My Lord, why have you raised me blind while I was [once] seeing?"', 'সে বলবে, ‘হে আমার প্রতিপালক! কেন আমাকে অন্ধ ক’রে উঠালে? আমি তো চক্ষুষ্মান ছিলাম।’', 'He will say, "My Lord, why have you raised me blind while I was [once] seeing?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020125.mp3', now()),
  (20, 126, '', '[{"id":77323,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"তিনি বলবেন","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77324,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"\"এমনিভাবেই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77325,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَتَتْكَ","transliteration":"atatka","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে এসেছিলো","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77326,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتُنَا","transliteration":"āyātunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের নিদর্শনাবলী","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77327,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَنَسِيتَهَا ۖ","transliteration":"fanasītahā","translation_bn":"তখন তা তুমি ভুলে গিয়েছিলে","root":"نسي","lemma":"نَسِىَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77329,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wakadhālika","translation_bn":"এবং এভাবেই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77330,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْيَوْمَ","transliteration":"l-yawma","translation_bn":"আজ","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77331,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تُنسَىٰ","transliteration":"tunsā","translation_bn":"বিস্মৃত হয়েছো তুমি\"","root":"نسي","lemma":"نَسِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77332,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"١٢٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla kadhālika atatka āyātunā fanasītahā wakadhālika l-yawma tunsā', 'আল্লাহ বলবেন, ‘এভাবেই তো আমার নিদর্শনসমূহ যখন তোমার কাছে এসেছিল তখন তুমি তা ভুলে গিয়েছিলে। আজকের দিনে সেভাবেই তোমাকে ভুলে যাওয়া হচ্ছে।', '[Allah] will say, "Thus did Our signs come to you, and you forgot them; and thus will you this Day be forgotten."', 'আল্লাহ বলবেন, ‘এভাবেই তো আমার নিদর্শনসমূহ যখন তোমার কাছে এসেছিল তখন তুমি তা ভুলে গিয়েছিলে। আজকের দিনে সেভাবেই তোমাকে ভুলে যাওয়া হচ্ছে।', '[Allah] will say, "Thus did Our signs come to you, and you forgot them; and thus will you this Day be forgotten."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020126.mp3', now()),
  (20, 127, '', '[{"id":77542,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wakadhālika","translation_bn":"এবং এরূপেই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77543,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَجْزِى","transliteration":"najzī","translation_bn":"প্রতিফল দিই আমরা","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77544,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"(তাকে) যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":77545,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَسْرَفَ","transliteration":"asrafa","translation_bn":"বাড়াবাড়ি করে","root":"سرف","lemma":"أَسْرَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77546,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمْ","transliteration":"walam","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77547,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنۢ","transliteration":"yu''min","translation_bn":"বিশ্বাস করে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77548,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"biāyāti","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনাবলীর প্রতি","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77549,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"rabbihi","translation_bn":"তার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77551,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلَعَذَابُ","transliteration":"walaʿadhābu","translation_bn":"এবং অবশ্যই শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77552,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","translation_bn":"আখিরাতের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77553,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَشَدُّ","transliteration":"ashaddu","translation_bn":"কঠোরতর","root":"شدد","lemma":"أَشَدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77554,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَأَبْقَىٰٓ","transliteration":"wa-abqā","translation_bn":"ও অধিক স্থায়ী","root":"بقي","lemma":"أَبْقَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77555,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakadhālika najzī man asrafa walam yu''min biāyāti rabbihi walaʿadhābu l-ākhirati ashaddu wa-abqā', 'আমি এভাবেই প্রতিফল দেই তাদেরকে যারা সীমালঙ্ঘন করে এবং তার প্রতিপালকের নিদর্শনে বিশ্বাস করে না। আর আখিরাতের ‘আযাব অবশ্যই সবচেয়ে বেশী কঠিন ও সবচেয়ে বেশী স্থায়ী।', 'And thus do We recompense he who transgressed and did not believe in the signs of his Lord. And the punishment of the Hereafter is more severe and more enduring.', 'আমি এভাবেই প্রতিফল দেই তাদেরকে যারা সীমালঙ্ঘন করে এবং তার প্রতিপালকের নিদর্শনে বিশ্বাস করে না। আর আখিরাতের ‘আযাব অবশ্যই সবচেয়ে বেশী কঠিন ও সবচেয়ে বেশী স্থায়ী।', 'And thus do We recompense he who transgressed and did not believe in the signs of his Lord. And the punishment of the Hereafter is more severe and more enduring.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020127.mp3', now()),
  (20, 128, '', '[{"id":77704,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَمْ","transliteration":"afalam","translation_bn":"নি তবে কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":77705,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِ","transliteration":"yahdi","translation_bn":"পথ দেখায় (ইতিহাসের এ শিক্ষা)","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77706,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77707,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَمْ","transliteration":"kam","translation_bn":"কতই (না)","root":"—","lemma":"كَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":77708,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلَكْنَا","transliteration":"ahlaknā","translation_bn":"আমরা ধ্বংস করেছি (জনপদ)","root":"هلك","lemma":"أَهْلَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77709,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلَهُم","transliteration":"qablahum","translation_bn":"তাদের পূর্বে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":77710,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77711,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرُونِ","transliteration":"l-qurūni","translation_bn":"মানব গোষ্ঠির","root":"قرن","lemma":"قَرْن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77712,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَمْشُونَ","transliteration":"yamshūna","translation_bn":"তারা চলছে (আজ)","root":"مشي","lemma":"مَّشَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77713,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্য দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77714,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَسَـٰكِنِهِمْ ۗ","transliteration":"masākinihim","translation_bn":"তাদের বাসস্থানসমূহের","root":"سكن","lemma":"مَسْكَن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77716,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":77717,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77718,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":77719,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَـَٔايَـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"laāyātin","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই নিদর্শনাবলী","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":77720,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لِّأُو۟لِى","transliteration":"li-ulī","translation_bn":"জন্যে অধিকারীদের","root":"اول","lemma":"أُولِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77721,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنُّهَىٰ","transliteration":"l-nuhā","translation_bn":"বুদ্ধি-বিবেকের","root":"نهي","lemma":"نُّهَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77722,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"١٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'afalam yahdi lahum kam ahlaknā qablahum mina l-qurūni yamshūna fī masākinihim inna fī dhālika laāyātin li-ulī l-nuhā', 'এটাও কি তাদেরকে সঠিক পথ প্রদর্শন করল না যে, আমি তাদের আগে কত মানব বংশকে ধ্বংস করে দিয়েছি যাদের বাসস্থানের ভিতর দিয়ে এরা চলাচল করে। বুদ্ধিমানদের জন্য অবশ্যই এতে নিদর্শন রয়েছে।', 'Then, has it not become clear to them how many generations We destroyed before them as they walk among their dwellings? Indeed in that are signs for those of intelligence.', 'এটাও কি তাদেরকে সঠিক পথ প্রদর্শন করল না যে, আমি তাদের আগে কত মানব বংশকে ধ্বংস করে দিয়েছি যাদের বাসস্থানের ভিতর দিয়ে এরা চলাচল করে। বুদ্ধিমানদের জন্য অবশ্যই এতে নিদর্শন রয়েছে।', 'Then, has it not become clear to them how many generations We destroyed before them as they walk among their dwellings? Indeed in that are signs for those of intelligence.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020128.mp3', now()),
  (20, 129, '', '[{"id":77799,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْلَا","transliteration":"walawlā","translation_bn":"এবং যদি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77800,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَلِمَةٌۭ","transliteration":"kalimatun","translation_bn":"একটি বাণী","root":"كلم","lemma":"كَلِمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77801,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"سَبَقَتْ","transliteration":"sabaqat","translation_bn":"পূর্বে নির্দিষ্ট হয়ে থাকতো","root":"سبق","lemma":"سَبَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77802,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77803,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77804,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَكَانَ","transliteration":"lakāna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই হতো (শাস্তি)","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":77805,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِزَامًۭا","transliteration":"lizāman","translation_bn":"অবশ্যম্ভাবী","root":"لزم","lemma":"لِزَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77806,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَأَجَلٌۭ","transliteration":"wa-ajalun","translation_bn":"ও একটি কাল (যদি না থাকতো)","root":"اجل","lemma":"أَجَل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77807,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مُّسَمًّۭى","transliteration":"musamman","translation_bn":"নির্দিষ্ট","root":"سمو","lemma":"مُّسَمًّى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":77808,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walawlā kalimatun sabaqat min rabbika lakāna lizāman wa-ajalun musamman', 'তোমার প্রতিপালকের নিকট থেকে পূর্ব সিদ্ধান্ত না থাকলে (তাদের শাস্তি) অবশ্যই এসে পড়ত, কিন্তু এর জন্য নির্দিষ্ট আছে একটি সময়।', 'And if not for a word that preceded from your Lord, punishment would have been an obligation [due immediately], and [if not for] a specified term [decreed].', 'তোমার প্রতিপালকের নিকট থেকে পূর্ব সিদ্ধান্ত না থাকলে (তাদের শাস্তি) অবশ্যই এসে পড়ত, কিন্তু এর জন্য নির্দিষ্ট আছে একটি সময়।', 'And if not for a word that preceded from your Lord, punishment would have been an obligation [due immediately], and [if not for] a specified term [decreed].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020129.mp3', now()),
  (20, 130, '', '[{"id":78002,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱصْبِرْ","transliteration":"fa-iṣ''bir","translation_bn":"সুতরাং ধৈর্য ধরো","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78003,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78004,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":78005,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","translation_bn":"তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78006,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَسَبِّحْ","transliteration":"wasabbiḥ","translation_bn":"ও মহিমা ঘোষণা করো","root":"سبح","lemma":"سَبَّحَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78007,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِحَمْدِ","transliteration":"biḥamdi","translation_bn":"প্রশংসা সহ","root":"حمد","lemma":"حَمْد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78008,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78009,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلَ","transliteration":"qabla","translation_bn":"পূর্বে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":78010,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"طُلُوعِ","transliteration":"ṭulūʿi","translation_bn":"উদয়ের","root":"طلع","lemma":"طُلُوع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78011,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّمْسِ","transliteration":"l-shamsi","translation_bn":"সূর্য","root":"شمس","lemma":"شَمْس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78012,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَقَبْلَ","transliteration":"waqabla","translation_bn":"ও পূর্বে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78013,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"غُرُوبِهَا ۖ","transliteration":"ghurūbihā","translation_bn":"তার অস্তের","root":"غرب","lemma":"غُرُوب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78015,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنْ","transliteration":"wamin","translation_bn":"এবং","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78016,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ءَانَآئِ","transliteration":"ānāi","translation_bn":"কিছু অংশে","root":"اني","lemma":"ءَانَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78017,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلِ","transliteration":"al-layli","translation_bn":"রাতের","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78018,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَسَبِّحْ","transliteration":"fasabbiḥ","translation_bn":"অতঃপর মহিমা ঘোষণা করো","root":"سبح","lemma":"سَبَّحَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78019,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَأَطْرَافَ","transliteration":"wa-aṭrāfa","translation_bn":"ও প্রান্ত ভাগে","root":"طرف","lemma":"طَرَف","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78020,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّهَارِ","transliteration":"l-nahāri","translation_bn":"দিনের","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78021,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّكَ","transliteration":"laʿallaka","translation_bn":"সম্ভবতঃ তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":78022,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"تَرْضَىٰ","transliteration":"tarḍā","translation_bn":"সন্তুষ্ট হবে","root":"رضو","lemma":"رَّضِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78023,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"١٣٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-iṣ''bir ʿalā mā yaqūlūna wasabbiḥ biḥamdi rabbika qabla ṭulūʿi l-shamsi waqabla ghurūbihā wamin ānāi al-layli fasabbiḥ wa-aṭrāfa l-nahāri laʿallaka tarḍā', 'কাজেই তারা যা বলছে তাতে তুমি ধৈর্য ধারণ কর এবং তোমার প্রতিপালকের প্রশংসাগীতি (নিয়মিত) উচ্চারণ কর সূর্যোদয়ের পূর্বে ও তা অস্তমিত হওয়ার পূর্বে এবং তাঁর পবিত্রতা ও মহিমা ঘোষণা কর রাত্রিকালে ও দিনের প্রান্তগুলোয় যাতে তুমি সন্তুষ্ট হতে পার।', 'So be patient over what they say and exalt [Allah] with praise of your Lord before the rising of the sun and before its setting; and during periods of the night [exalt Him] and at the ends of the day, that you may be satisfied.', 'কাজেই তারা যা বলছে তাতে তুমি ধৈর্য ধারণ কর এবং তোমার প্রতিপালকের প্রশংসাগীতি (নিয়মিত) উচ্চারণ কর সূর্যোদয়ের পূর্বে ও তা অস্তমিত হওয়ার পূর্বে এবং তাঁর পবিত্রতা ও মহিমা ঘোষণা কর রাত্রিকালে ও দিনের প্রান্তগুলোয় যাতে তুমি সন্তুষ্ট হতে পার।', 'So be patient over what they say and exalt [Allah] with praise of your Lord before the rising of the sun and before its setting; and during periods of the night [exalt Him] and at the ends of the day, that you may be satisfied.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020130.mp3', now()),
  (20, 131, '', '[{"id":78045,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78046,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَمُدَّنَّ","transliteration":"tamuddanna","translation_bn":"প্রসারিত তুমি করো","root":"مدد","lemma":"مَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78047,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَيْنَيْكَ","transliteration":"ʿaynayka","translation_bn":"তোমার দুচোখ","root":"عين","lemma":"عَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78048,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78049,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":78050,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَتَّعْنَا","transliteration":"mattaʿnā","translation_bn":"আমরা উপকরণ দিয়েছি","root":"متع","lemma":"مَّتَّعْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78051,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সে সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦٓ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78052,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَزْوَٰجًۭا","transliteration":"azwājan","translation_bn":"বিভিন্ন শ্রেণীকে","root":"زوج","lemma":"زَوْج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78053,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের মধ্যকার","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78054,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"زَهْرَةَ","transliteration":"zahrata","translation_bn":"সৌন্দর্য হিসেবে","root":"زهر","lemma":"زَهْرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78055,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","translation_bn":"জীবনের","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78056,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"পার্থিব","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78057,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لِنَفْتِنَهُمْ","transliteration":"linaftinahum","translation_bn":"যেন তাদের পরীক্ষা করি আমরা","root":"فتن","lemma":"فَتَنُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78058,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ ۚ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78060,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَرِزْقُ","transliteration":"wariz''qu","translation_bn":"আর জীবিকাই","root":"رزق","lemma":"رِزْق","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78061,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78062,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78063,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَأَبْقَىٰ","transliteration":"wa-abqā","translation_bn":"ও স্থায়ী","root":"بقي","lemma":"أَبْقَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78064,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"١٣١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā tamuddanna ʿaynayka ilā mā mattaʿnā bihi azwājan min''hum zahrata l-ḥayati l-dun''yā linaftinahum fīhi wariz''qu rabbika khayrun wa-abqā', 'তুমি কক্ষনো চোখ খুলে তাকিও না ঐ সব বস্তুর প্রতি যা আমি তাদের বিভিন্ন দলকে পার্থিব জীবনে উপভোগের জন্য সৌন্দর্য স্বরূপ দিয়েছি, এসব দিয়ে তাদেরকে পরীক্ষা করার জন্য। তোমার প্রতিপালকের দেয়া রিযকই হল সবচেয়ে উত্তম ও সবচেয়ে বেশী স্থায়ী।', 'And do not extend your eyes toward that by which We have given enjoyment to [some] categories of them, [its being but] the splendor of worldly life by which We test them. And the provision of your Lord is better and more enduring.', 'তুমি কক্ষনো চোখ খুলে তাকিও না ঐ সব বস্তুর প্রতি যা আমি তাদের বিভিন্ন দলকে পার্থিব জীবনে উপভোগের জন্য সৌন্দর্য স্বরূপ দিয়েছি, এসব দিয়ে তাদেরকে পরীক্ষা করার জন্য। তোমার প্রতিপালকের দেয়া রিযকই হল সবচেয়ে উত্তম ও সবচেয়ে বেশী স্থায়ী।', 'And do not extend your eyes toward that by which We have given enjoyment to [some] categories of them, [its being but] the splendor of worldly life by which We test them. And the provision of your Lord is better and more enduring.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020131.mp3', now()),
  (20, 132, '', '[{"id":78198,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأْمُرْ","transliteration":"wamur","translation_bn":"এবং নির্দেশ দাও","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78199,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلَكَ","transliteration":"ahlaka","translation_bn":"তোমার পরিবারকে","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78200,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلصَّلَوٰةِ","transliteration":"bil-ṣalati","translation_bn":"সালাত সম্পর্কে","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78201,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱصْطَبِرْ","transliteration":"wa-iṣ''ṭabir","translation_bn":"এবং দৃঢ় থাকো","root":"صبر","lemma":"ٱصْطَبِرْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78202,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهَا ۖ","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78204,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":78205,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نَسْـَٔلُكَ","transliteration":"nasaluka","translation_bn":"তোমার কাছে চাই আমরা","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78206,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رِزْقًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"riz''qan","translation_bn":"কোন জীবিকা","root":"رزق","lemma":"رِزْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78208,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"نَّحْنُ","transliteration":"naḥnu","translation_bn":"আমরাই","root":"—","lemma":"نَّحْنُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":78209,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"نَرْزُقُكَ ۗ","transliteration":"narzuquka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে জীবিকা দিই","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78211,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْعَـٰقِبَةُ","transliteration":"wal-ʿāqibatu","translation_bn":"এবং পরিণাম (শুভ)","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَٰقِبَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78212,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِلتَّقْوَىٰ","transliteration":"lilttaqwā","translation_bn":"জন্যে মুত্তাকীদের","root":"وقي","lemma":"تَقْوَى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78213,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamur ahlaka bil-ṣalati wa-iṣ''ṭabir ʿalayhā lā nasaluka riz''qan naḥnu narzuquka wal-ʿāqibatu lilttaqwā', 'আর তোমার পবিরার-পরিজনকে নামাযের নির্দেশ দাও আর তাতে অবিচল থাক। তোমার কাছে আমি রিযক চাই না, আমিই তোমাকে রিযক দিয়ে থাকি, উত্তম পরিণাম মুত্তাকীদের জন্য নির্দিষ্ট।', 'And enjoin prayer upon your family [and people] and be steadfast therein. We ask you not for provision; We provide for you, and the [best] outcome is for [those of] righteousness.', 'আর তোমার পবিরার-পরিজনকে নামাযের নির্দেশ দাও আর তাতে অবিচল থাক। তোমার কাছে আমি রিযক চাই না, আমিই তোমাকে রিযক দিয়ে থাকি, উত্তম পরিণাম মুত্তাকীদের জন্য নির্দিষ্ট।', 'And enjoin prayer upon your family [and people] and be steadfast therein. We ask you not for provision; We provide for you, and the [best] outcome is for [those of] righteousness.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020132.mp3', now()),
  (20, 133, '', '[{"id":78331,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78332,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَوْلَا","transliteration":"lawlā","translation_bn":"\"কেন না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"উৎসাহবাচক (Exhortation)"},{"id":78333,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِينَا","transliteration":"yatīnā","translation_bn":"আমাদের কাছে আসে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78334,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَةٍۢ","transliteration":"biāyatin","translation_bn":"একটি নিদর্শন (অর্থাৎ মুজি''যা)","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78335,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78336,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّهِۦٓ ۚ","transliteration":"rabbihi","translation_bn":"তার রবের\"","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78338,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ","transliteration":"awalam","translation_bn":"কি নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":78339,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَأْتِهِم","transliteration":"tatihim","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে আসে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78340,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بَيِّنَةُ","transliteration":"bayyinatu","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট (শিক্ষা)","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78341,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":78342,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78343,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصُّحُفِ","transliteration":"l-ṣuḥufi","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"صحف","lemma":"صُحُف","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78344,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأُولَىٰ","transliteration":"l-ūlā","translation_bn":"পূর্ববর্তীদের","root":"اول","lemma":"أَوَّل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78345,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"١٣٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqālū lawlā yatīnā biāyatin min rabbihi awalam tatihim bayyinatu mā fī l-ṣuḥufi l-ūlā', 'তারা বলে, ‘সে তার প্রতিপালকের নিকট থেকে আমাদের কাছে কোন নিদর্শন নিয়ে আসে না কেন? তাদের কাছে কি আসেনি স্পষ্ট প্রমাণ যা ছিল পূর্ববর্তী (ওয়াহীকৃত) কিতাবগুলোতে।’', 'And they say, "Why does he not bring us a sign from his Lord?" Has there not come to them evidence of what was in the former scriptures?', 'তারা বলে, ‘সে তার প্রতিপালকের নিকট থেকে আমাদের কাছে কোন নিদর্শন নিয়ে আসে না কেন? তাদের কাছে কি আসেনি স্পষ্ট প্রমাণ যা ছিল পূর্ববর্তী (ওয়াহীকৃত) কিতাবগুলোতে।’', 'And they say, "Why does he not bring us a sign from his Lord?" Has there not come to them evidence of what was in the former scriptures?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020133.mp3', now()),
  (20, 134, '', '[{"id":78436,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি (এমন হতো)","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78437,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّآ","transliteration":"annā","translation_bn":"যে আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":78438,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلَكْنَـٰهُم","transliteration":"ahlaknāhum","translation_bn":"তাদের আমরা ধ্বংস করে দিতাম","root":"هلك","lemma":"أَهْلَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78439,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِعَذَابٍۢ","transliteration":"biʿadhābin","translation_bn":"দিয়ে শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78440,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78441,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِۦ","transliteration":"qablihi","translation_bn":"তার পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78442,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"laqālū","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তারা  বলতো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":78443,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّنَا","transliteration":"rabbanā","translation_bn":"\"হে আমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78444,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَوْلَآ","transliteration":"lawlā","translation_bn":"কেন না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"উৎসাহবাচক (Exhortation)"},{"id":78445,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْتَ","transliteration":"arsalta","translation_bn":"তুমি পাঠিয়েছিলে","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78446,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْنَا","transliteration":"ilaynā","translation_bn":"আমাদের প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78447,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولًۭا","transliteration":"rasūlan","translation_bn":"কোন রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78448,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَنَتَّبِعَ","transliteration":"fanattabiʿa","translation_bn":"আমরা তাহ''লে অনুসরণ করতাম","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":78449,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِكَ","transliteration":"āyātika","translation_bn":"তোমার নিদর্শনাবলীর","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78450,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78451,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِ","transliteration":"qabli","translation_bn":"এর পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78452,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":78453,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"نَّذِلَّ","transliteration":"nadhilla","translation_bn":"লাঞ্ছিত হতাম আমরা","root":"ذلل","lemma":"نَّذِلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78454,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَنَخْزَىٰ","transliteration":"wanakhzā","translation_bn":"ও আমরা অপমানিত হতাম\"","root":"خزي","lemma":"نَخْزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78455,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"١٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaw annā ahlaknāhum biʿadhābin min qablihi laqālū rabbanā lawlā arsalta ilaynā rasūlan fanattabiʿa āyātika min qabli an nadhilla wanakhzā', 'এর (অর্থাৎ কোন নিদর্শন আসার) আগেই আমি যদি তাদেরকে ‘আযাব দিয়ে ধ্বংস করে দিতাম তাহলে তারা বলত, ‘হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! তুমি আমাদের কাছে কেন একজন রসূল পাঠালে না? তাহলে আমরা অবশ্যই তোমার নিদর্শন মেনে চলতাম আমরা অপমানিত ও হেয় হবার আগেই।', 'And if We had destroyed them with a punishment before him, they would have said, "Our Lord, why did You not send to us a messenger so we could have followed Your verses before we were humiliated and disgraced?"', 'এর (অর্থাৎ কোন নিদর্শন আসার) আগেই আমি যদি তাদেরকে ‘আযাব দিয়ে ধ্বংস করে দিতাম তাহলে তারা বলত, ‘হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! তুমি আমাদের কাছে কেন একজন রসূল পাঠালে না? তাহলে আমরা অবশ্যই তোমার নিদর্শন মেনে চলতাম আমরা অপমানিত ও হেয় হবার আগেই।', 'And if We had destroyed them with a punishment before him, they would have said, "Our Lord, why did You not send to us a messenger so we could have followed Your verses before we were humiliated and disgraced?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020134.mp3', now()),
  (20, 135, '', '[{"id":78548,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78549,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كُلٌّۭ","transliteration":"kullun","translation_bn":"\"প্রত্যেকেই","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78550,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُّتَرَبِّصٌۭ","transliteration":"mutarabbiṣun","translation_bn":"অপেক্ষাকারী","root":"ربص","lemma":"مُّتَرَبِّص","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78551,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَتَرَبَّصُوا۟ ۖ","transliteration":"fatarabbaṣū","translation_bn":"সুতরাং তোমরা অপেক্ষা করো","root":"ربص","lemma":"تَرَبَّصْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78553,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَسَتَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"fasataʿlamūna","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তোমরা জানবে শীঘ্রই","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78554,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কারা","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":78555,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَصْحَـٰبُ","transliteration":"aṣḥābu","translation_bn":"অধিকারী","root":"صحب","lemma":"أَصْحَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78556,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصِّرَٰطِ","transliteration":"l-ṣirāṭi","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"صرط","lemma":"صِرَٰط","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78557,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّوِىِّ","transliteration":"l-sawiyi","translation_bn":"সরল সঠিক","root":"سوي","lemma":"سَوِيّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78558,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَنِ","transliteration":"wamani","translation_bn":"এবং কারা","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78559,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱهْتَدَىٰ","transliteration":"ih''tadā","translation_bn":"সৎপথ অবলম্বন করেছে\"","root":"هدي","lemma":"ٱهْتَدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78560,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١٣٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul kullun mutarabbiṣun fatarabbaṣū fasataʿlamūna man aṣḥābu l-ṣirāṭi l-sawiyi wamani ih''tadā', 'বল, (ইসলামের অনুসারীদের পরিণতি দেখার জন্য চারপাশের) সবাই অপেক্ষা করছে, কাজেই তোমরাও অপেক্ষা কর, তাহলেই তোমরা জানতে পারবে যে, কারা সরল পথের পথিক আর কারা সঠিক পথপ্রাপ্ত।', 'Say, "Each [of us] is waiting; so wait. For you will know who are the companions of the sound path and who is guided."', 'বল, (ইসলামের অনুসারীদের পরিণতি দেখার জন্য চারপাশের) সবাই অপেক্ষা করছে, কাজেই তোমরাও অপেক্ষা কর, তাহলেই তোমরা জানতে পারবে যে, কারা সরল পথের পথিক আর কারা সঠিক পথপ্রাপ্ত।', 'Say, "Each [of us] is waiting; so wait. For you will know who are the companions of the sound path and who is guided."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/020135.mp3', now())
INSERT INTO public.quran_verses (surah, ayah, text_uthmani, words, transliteration, bn_text, en_text, conventional_bn, conventional_en, modern_translation_bn, modern_translation_en, meta_bn, meta_en, lexicon_modern_notes, audio_url, updated_at)
