 and Aaron the criterion and a light and a reminder for the righteous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021048.mp3', now()),
  (21, 49, '', '[{"id":48003,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":48004,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَخْشَوْنَ","transliteration":"yakhshawna","translation_bn":"ভয় করে","root":"خشي","lemma":"خَشِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48005,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّهُم","transliteration":"rabbahum","translation_bn":"তাদের রবকে","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48006,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْغَيْبِ","transliteration":"bil-ghaybi","translation_bn":"অবস্থায় অদৃশ্য","root":"غيب","lemma":"غَيْب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48007,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَهُم","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এবং তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48008,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48009,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّاعَةِ","transliteration":"l-sāʿati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাহ","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48010,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مُشْفِقُونَ","transliteration":"mush''fiqūna","translation_bn":"ভীতসন্ত্রস্ত","root":"شفق","lemma":"مُشْفِقُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48011,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna yakhshawna rabbahum bil-ghaybi wahum mina l-sāʿati mush''fiqūna', 'যারা না দেখেই তাদের প্রতিপালককে ভয় করে আর তারা কিয়ামাত সম্পর্কে ভীত-শংকিত।', 'Who fear their Lord unseen, while they are of the Hour apprehensive.', 'যারা না দেখেই তাদের প্রতিপালককে ভয় করে আর তারা কিয়ামাত সম্পর্কে ভীত-শংকিত।', 'Who fear their Lord unseen, while they are of the Hour apprehensive.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021049.mp3', now()),
  (21, 50, '', '[{"id":48797,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَهَـٰذَا","transliteration":"wahādhā","translation_bn":"আর এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48798,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ذِكْرٌۭ","transliteration":"dhik''run","translation_bn":"উপদেশ (ক্বুর''আন)","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48799,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُّبَارَكٌ","transliteration":"mubārakun","translation_bn":"কল্যাণময়","root":"برك","lemma":"مُبَارَك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48800,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ ۚ","transliteration":"anzalnāhu","translation_bn":"তা আমরা অবতীর্ণ করেছি","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48802,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَفَأَنتُمْ","transliteration":"afa-antum","translation_bn":"কি তোমরা তবুও","root":"—","lemma":"أَفَأَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":48803,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48804,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُنكِرُونَ","transliteration":"munkirūna","translation_bn":"অস্বীকারকারী হবে","root":"نكر","lemma":"مُنكِرُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48805,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٥٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫০)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahādhā dhik''run mubārakun anzalnāhu afa-antum lahu munkirūna', 'এ হচ্ছে কল্যাণময় উপদেশ বাণী, আমি তা নাযিল করেছি: তবুও কি তা তোমরা প্রত্যাখ্যান করবে?', 'And this [Qur''an] is a blessed message which We have sent down. Then are you with it unacquainted?', 'এ হচ্ছে কল্যাণময় উপদেশ বাণী, আমি তা নাযিল করেছি: তবুও কি তা তোমরা প্রত্যাখ্যান করবে?', 'And this [Qur''an] is a blessed message which We have sent down. Then are you with it unacquainted?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021050.mp3', now()),
  (21, 51, '', '[{"id":49309,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49310,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْنَآ","transliteration":"ātaynā","translation_bn":"আমরা দিয়েছি","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49311,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","transliteration":"ib''rāhīma","translation_bn":"ইবরাহীম কে","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":49312,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رُشْدَهُۥ","transliteration":"rush''dahu","translation_bn":"তার সৎপথের বুদ্ধি জ্ঞান","root":"رشد","lemma":"رُشْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49313,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49314,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"ইতিপূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49315,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَكُنَّا","transliteration":"wakunnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা ছিলাম","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49316,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49317,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"ʿālimīna","translation_bn":"খুব অবহিত","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49318,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٥١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫১)","root":"—","lemma":"٥١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad ātaynā ib''rāhīma rush''dahu min qablu wakunnā bihi ʿālimīna', 'আমি ইতোপূর্বে ইবরাহীমকে সঠিক পথে চলার জ্ঞান দান করেছিলাম আর তার সম্পর্কে আমি খুব ভালভাবে জানতাম।', 'And We had certainly given Abraham his sound judgement before, and We were of him well-Knowing', 'আমি ইতোপূর্বে ইবরাহীমকে সঠিক পথে চলার জ্ঞান দান করেছিলাম আর তার সম্পর্কে আমি খুব ভালভাবে জানতাম।', 'And We had certainly given Abraham his sound judgement before, and We were of him well-Knowing', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021051.mp3', now()),
  (21, 52, '', '[{"id":50009,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":50010,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50011,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِأَبِيهِ","transliteration":"li-abīhi","translation_bn":"তার পিতাকে","root":"ابو","lemma":"أَبٌ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50012,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَقَوْمِهِۦ","transliteration":"waqawmihi","translation_bn":"ও তার জাতিকে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50013,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"\"কি","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":50014,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذِهِ","transliteration":"hādhihi","translation_bn":"এসব","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":50015,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلتَّمَاثِيلُ","transliteration":"l-tamāthīlu","translation_bn":"মূর্তিগুলো","root":"مثل","lemma":"تَّمَاثِيل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50016,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّتِىٓ","transliteration":"allatī","translation_bn":"যার","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":50017,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُمْ","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":50018,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَهَا","transliteration":"lahā","translation_bn":"জন্য তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50019,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰكِفُونَ","transliteration":"ʿākifūna","translation_bn":"পূজায় ব্রত আছো\"","root":"عكف","lemma":"عَاكِف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50020,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٥٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫২)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'idh qāla li-abīhi waqawmihi mā hādhihi l-tamāthīlu allatī antum lahā ʿākifūna', 'যখন সে তার পিতাকে ও তার জাতিকে বলল, ‘এ মূর্তিগুলো কী যাদের সঙ্গে তোমরা নিজেদেরকে (ভক্তির বাঁধনে) বেঁধে রেখেছ?’', 'When he said to his father and his people, "What are these statues to which you are devoted?"', 'যখন সে তার পিতাকে ও তার জাতিকে বলল, ‘এ মূর্তিগুলো কী যাদের সঙ্গে তোমরা নিজেদেরকে (ভক্তির বাঁধনে) বেঁধে রেখেছ?’', 'When he said to his father and his people, "What are these statues to which you are devoted?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021052.mp3', now()),
  (21, 53, '', '[{"id":50587,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50588,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَجَدْنَآ","transliteration":"wajadnā","translation_bn":"\"আমরা পেয়েছি","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50589,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَابَآءَنَا","transliteration":"ābāanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের পিতৃপুরুষদেরকে","root":"ابو","lemma":"ا^بَاء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50590,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَهَا","transliteration":"lahā","translation_bn":"জন্য তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50591,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰبِدِينَ","transliteration":"ʿābidīna","translation_bn":"উপাসনাকারীরূপে\"","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَابِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50592,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٥٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū wajadnā ābāanā lahā ʿābidīna', 'তারা বলল, ‘আমরা আমাদের পিতৃপুরুষদেরকে এদের পূজো করতে দেখেছি।', 'They said, "We found our fathers worshippers of them."', 'তারা বলল, ‘আমরা আমাদের পিতৃপুরুষদেরকে এদের পূজো করতে দেখেছি।', 'They said, "We found our fathers worshippers of them."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021053.mp3', now()),
  (21, 54, '', '[{"id":51289,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51290,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَقَدْ","transliteration":"laqad","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":51291,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা আছো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51292,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُمْ","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":51293,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَءَابَآؤُكُمْ","transliteration":"waābāukum","translation_bn":"ও তোমাদের পিতৃপুরুষরা (ছিলো)","root":"ابو","lemma":"ا^بَاء","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51294,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51295,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ضَلَـٰلٍۢ","transliteration":"ḍalālin","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্টতার","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَٰل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51296,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٍۢ","transliteration":"mubīnin","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট\"","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51297,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٥٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla laqad kuntum antum waābāukum fī ḍalālin mubīnin', 'সে বলল, ‘তোমরা রয়েছ স্পষ্ট গুমরাহীতে, তোমরা আর তোমাদের পিতৃপুরুষরাও।’', 'He said, "You were certainly, you and your fathers, in manifest error."', 'সে বলল, ‘তোমরা রয়েছ স্পষ্ট গুমরাহীতে, তোমরা আর তোমাদের পিতৃপুরুষরাও।’', 'He said, "You were certainly, you and your fathers, in manifest error."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021054.mp3', now()),
  (21, 55, '', '[{"id":51708,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51709,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَجِئْتَنَا","transliteration":"aji''tanā","translation_bn":"\"আমাদের কাছে এসেছো কি","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":51710,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"নিয়ে প্রকৃত সত্যকে","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51711,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَمْ","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51712,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنتَ","transliteration":"anta","translation_bn":"তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":51713,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51714,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّـٰعِبِينَ","transliteration":"l-lāʿibīna","translation_bn":"কৌতুককারীদের\"","root":"لعب","lemma":"لَٰعِبِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51715,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٥٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū aji''tanā bil-ḥaqi am anta mina l-lāʿibīna', 'তারা বলল, ‘তুমি কি আমাদের কাছে প্রকৃত সত্য এনেছ, না তুমি আমাদের সঙ্গে তামাশা করছ?’', 'They said, "Have you come to us with truth, or are you of those who jest?"', 'তারা বলল, ‘তুমি কি আমাদের কাছে প্রকৃত সত্য এনেছ, না তুমি আমাদের সঙ্গে তামাশা করছ?’', 'They said, "Have you come to us with truth, or are you of those who jest?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021055.mp3', now()),
  (21, 56, '', '[{"id":52280,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52281,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بَل","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"\"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":52282,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَّبُّكُمْ","transliteration":"rabbukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রব (তিনিই)","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52283,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّ","transliteration":"rabbu","translation_bn":"(যিনি) রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52284,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশমন্ডলীর","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52285,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52286,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":52287,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَطَرَهُنَّ","transliteration":"faṭarahunna","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"فطر","lemma":"فَطَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52288,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَا۠","transliteration":"wa-anā","translation_bn":"এবং আমি","root":"—","lemma":"وَأَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52289,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52290,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكُم","transliteration":"dhālikum","translation_bn":"এসবের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":52291,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্যতম","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52292,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّـٰهِدِينَ","transliteration":"l-shāhidīna","translation_bn":"সাক্ষীদাতাদের","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَاهِد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52293,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٥٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla bal rabbukum rabbu l-samāwāti wal-arḍi alladhī faṭarahunna wa-anā ʿalā dhālikum mina l-shāhidīna', 'সে বলল, ‘বরং, তোমাদের প্রতিপালক হলেন আকাশ ও পৃথিবীর প্রতিপালক যিনি ওগুলোকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন, আর এ বিষয়ে আমি একজন সাক্ষ্যদাতা।', 'He said, "[No], rather, your Lord is the Lord of the heavens and the earth who created them, and I, to that, am of those who testify.', 'সে বলল, ‘বরং, তোমাদের প্রতিপালক হলেন আকাশ ও পৃথিবীর প্রতিপালক যিনি ওগুলোকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন, আর এ বিষয়ে আমি একজন সাক্ষ্যদাতা।', 'He said, "[No], rather, your Lord is the Lord of the heavens and the earth who created them, and I, to that, am of those who testify.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021056.mp3', now()),
  (21, 57, '', '[{"id":52867,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَتَٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"watal-lahi","translation_bn":"এবং শপথ আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52868,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَأَكِيدَنَّ","transliteration":"la-akīdanna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই ব্যবস্থা নিবো আমি","root":"كيد","lemma":"كِيدُ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":52869,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَصْنَـٰمَكُم","transliteration":"aṣnāmakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মূর্তিগুলোর","root":"صنم","lemma":"أَصْنَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52870,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدَ","transliteration":"baʿda","translation_bn":"পরে","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":52871,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":52872,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تُوَلُّوا۟","transliteration":"tuwallū","translation_bn":"তোমাদের চলে যাবে","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52873,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُدْبِرِينَ","transliteration":"mud''birīna","translation_bn":"পিঠ ফিরিয়ে\"","root":"دبر","lemma":"مُدْبِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52874,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٥٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'watal-lahi la-akīdanna aṣnāmakum baʿda an tuwallū mud''birīna', 'কসম আল্লাহর! তোমরা পেছন ফিরে চলে গেলেই আমি তোমাদের মূর্তিগুলোর বিরুদ্ধে অবশ্য অবশ্যই একটা কৌশল গ্রহণ করব।', 'And [I swear] by Allah, I will surely plan against your idols after you have turned and gone away."', 'কসম আল্লাহর! তোমরা পেছন ফিরে চলে গেলেই আমি তোমাদের মূর্তিগুলোর বিরুদ্ধে অবশ্য অবশ্যই একটা কৌশল গ্রহণ করব।', 'And [I swear] by Allah, I will surely plan against your idols after you have turned and gone away."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021057.mp3', now()),
  (21, 58, '', '[{"id":53371,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَجَعَلَهُمْ","transliteration":"fajaʿalahum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তাদেরকে সে করে দিলো","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53372,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جُذَٰذًا","transliteration":"judhādhan","translation_bn":"টুকরো টুকরো","root":"جذذ","lemma":"جُذَٰذ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53373,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":53374,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَبِيرًۭا","transliteration":"kabīran","translation_bn":"বড়টা","root":"كبر","lemma":"كَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53375,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53376,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"যাতে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":53377,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"তার দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53378,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَرْجِعُونَ","transliteration":"yarjiʿūna","translation_bn":"ফিরে আসে","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53379,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٥٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fajaʿalahum judhādhan illā kabīran lahum laʿallahum ilayhi yarjiʿūna', 'তারপর সে মূর্তিগুলোকে টুকরো টুকরো করে দিল, ওগুলোর বড়টি ছাড়া, যাতে পূজারীরা ওটার প্রতিই মনোযোগী হয়।', 'So he made them into fragments, except a large one among them, that they might return to it [and question].', 'তারপর সে মূর্তিগুলোকে টুকরো টুকরো করে দিল, ওগুলোর বড়টি ছাড়া, যাতে পূজারীরা ওটার প্রতিই মনোযোগী হয়।', 'So he made them into fragments, except a large one among them, that they might return to it [and question].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021058.mp3', now()),
  (21, 59, '', '[{"id":53843,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53844,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"\"কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":53845,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَعَلَ","transliteration":"faʿala","translation_bn":"করেছে","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53846,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":53847,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔالِهَتِنَآ","transliteration":"biālihatinā","translation_bn":"সাথে আমাদের ইলাহগুলোর","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53848,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"সে নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":53849,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَمِنَ","transliteration":"lamina","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":53850,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদের\"","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53851,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٥٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū man faʿala hādhā biālihatinā innahu lamina l-ẓālimīna', 'তারা বলল, ‘আমাদের মূর্তিগুলোর সাথে এমনটা কে করল? সে অবশ্যই যালিম।’', 'They said, "Who has done this to our gods? Indeed, he is of the wrongdoers."', 'তারা বলল, ‘আমাদের মূর্তিগুলোর সাথে এমনটা কে করল? সে অবশ্যই যালিম।’', 'They said, "Who has done this to our gods? Indeed, he is of the wrongdoers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021059.mp3', now()),
  (21, 60, '', '[{"id":54463,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54464,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"سَمِعْنَا","transliteration":"samiʿ''nā","translation_bn":"\"আমরা শুনেছি","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54465,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَتًۭى","transliteration":"fatan","translation_bn":"এক যুবককেকে","root":"فتي","lemma":"فَتًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54466,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَذْكُرُهُمْ","transliteration":"yadhkuruhum","translation_bn":"সমালোচনা করতে তাদের ব্যাপারে","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54467,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يُقَالُ","transliteration":"yuqālu","translation_bn":"বলা হয়","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54468,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥٓ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার (নাম)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥٓ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54469,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِبْرَٰهِيمُ","transliteration":"ib''rāhīmu","translation_bn":"ইবরাহীম\"","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":54470,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٦٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬০)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū samiʿ''nā fatan yadhkuruhum yuqālu lahu ib''rāhīmu', 'কেউ কেউ বলল, ‘এক যুবককে এদের সম্পর্কে বলতে শুনেছি, তাকে ইবরাহীম বলা হয়।’', 'They said, "We heard a young man mention them who is called Abraham."', 'কেউ কেউ বলল, ‘এক যুবককে এদের সম্পর্কে বলতে শুনেছি, তাকে ইবরাহীম বলা হয়।’', 'They said, "We heard a young man mention them who is called Abraham."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021060.mp3', now()),
  (21, 61, '', '[{"id":55037,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55038,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فَأْتُوا۟","transliteration":"fatū","translation_bn":"\"তাহ''লে আসো","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55039,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"নিয়ে তাকে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55040,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"সামনে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55041,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَعْيُنِ","transliteration":"aʿyuni","translation_bn":"চোখের","root":"عين","lemma":"عَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55042,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"লোকদের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55043,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"যাতে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":55044,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَشْهَدُونَ","transliteration":"yashhadūna","translation_bn":"সাক্ষ্য দিতে পারে\"","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55045,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٦١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬১)","root":"—","lemma":"٦١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū fatū bihi ʿalā aʿyuni l-nāsi laʿallahum yashhadūna', 'তারা বলল, ‘তাকে নিয়ে এসো লোকজনের সামনে যাতে তারা সাক্ষী হতে পারে।’', 'They said, "Then bring him before the eyes of the people that they may testify."', 'তারা বলল, ‘তাকে নিয়ে এসো লোকজনের সামনে যাতে তারা সাক্ষী হতে পারে।’', 'They said, "Then bring him before the eyes of the people that they may testify."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021061.mp3', now()),
  (21, 62, '', '[{"id":55648,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55649,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَأَنتَ","transliteration":"a-anta","translation_bn":"\"কি তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"ءَأَنتَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":55650,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَعَلْتَ","transliteration":"faʿalta","translation_bn":"করেছো","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55651,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":55652,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔالِهَتِنَا","transliteration":"biālihatinā","translation_bn":"সাথে আমাদের ইলাহগুলোর","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55653,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓإِبْرَٰهِيمُ","transliteration":"yāib''rāhīmu","translation_bn":"হে ইবরাহীম\"","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":55654,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٦٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬২)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū a-anta faʿalta hādhā biālihatinā yāib''rāhīmu', 'তারা বলল, ‘ওহে ইবরাহীম! আমাদের উপাস্যদের সাথে তুমিই কি এমনটি করেছ?’', 'They said, "Have you done this to our gods, O Abraham?"', 'তারা বলল, ‘ওহে ইবরাহীম! আমাদের উপাস্যদের সাথে তুমিই কি এমনটি করেছ?’', 'They said, "Have you done this to our gods, O Abraham?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021062.mp3', now()),
  (21, 63, '', '[{"id":56146,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56147,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"\"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":56148,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَعَلَهُۥ","transliteration":"faʿalahu","translation_bn":"তা করেছে","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56149,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَبِيرُهُمْ","transliteration":"kabīruhum","translation_bn":"প্রধান তাদের","root":"كبر","lemma":"كَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56150,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":56151,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَسْـَٔلُوهُمْ","transliteration":"fasalūhum","translation_bn":"তবে তাদেরকে জিজ্ঞেস করো","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56152,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":56153,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56154,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَنطِقُونَ","transliteration":"yanṭiqūna","translation_bn":"কথা বলতে পারে\"","root":"نطق","lemma":"يَنطِقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56155,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٦٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla bal faʿalahu kabīruhum hādhā fasalūhum in kānū yanṭiqūna', 'সে বলল, ‘না, তাদের এই বড়টাই এ সব করেছে, তারা যদি কথা বলতে পারে তবে তাদেরকে জিজ্ঞেস কর।’', 'He said, "Rather, this - the largest of them - did it, so ask them, if they should [be able to] speak."', 'সে বলল, ‘না, তাদের এই বড়টাই এ সব করেছে, তারা যদি কথা বলতে পারে তবে তাদেরকে জিজ্ঞেস কর।’', 'He said, "Rather, this - the largest of them - did it, so ask them, if they should [be able to] speak."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021063.mp3', now()),
  (21, 64, '', '[{"id":56628,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَرَجَعُوٓا۟","transliteration":"farajaʿū","translation_bn":"তখন তারা ফিরে এলো","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56629,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56630,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسِهِمْ","transliteration":"anfusihim","translation_bn":"তাদের মনের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56631,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَقَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"faqālū","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56632,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكُمْ","transliteration":"innakum","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":56633,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُمُ","transliteration":"antumu","translation_bn":"তোমরাই","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":56634,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimūna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী\"","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56635,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٦٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'farajaʿū ilā anfusihim faqālū innakum antumu l-ẓālimūna', 'তখন তারা বিষয়টি নিয়ে মনে মনে চিন্তা করল এবং পরস্পর বলাবলি করল- তোমরা নিজেরাই তো অন্যায়কারী।', 'So they returned to [blaming] themselves and said [to each other], "Indeed, you are the wrongdoers."', 'তখন তারা বিষয়টি নিয়ে মনে মনে চিন্তা করল এবং পরস্পর বলাবলি করল- তোমরা নিজেরাই তো অন্যায়কারী।', 'So they returned to [blaming] themselves and said [to each other], "Indeed, you are the wrongdoers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021064.mp3', now()),
  (21, 65, '', '[{"id":57156,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57157,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نُكِسُوا۟","transliteration":"nukisū","translation_bn":"অবনত হয়ে গেলো","root":"نكس","lemma":"نُكِسُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57158,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"ওপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57159,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رُءُوسِهِمْ","transliteration":"ruūsihim","translation_bn":"তাদের মস্তকগুলোর","root":"راس","lemma":"رَأْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57160,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَقَدْ","transliteration":"laqad","translation_bn":"\"(এবং বলল) নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":57161,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلِمْتَ","transliteration":"ʿalim''ta","translation_bn":"তুমি জেনেছো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57162,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":57163,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","transliteration":"hāulāi","translation_bn":"এরা সব","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":57164,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَنطِقُونَ","transliteration":"yanṭiqūna","translation_bn":"কথা বলতে পারে\"","root":"نطق","lemma":"يَنطِقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57165,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٦٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma nukisū ʿalā ruūsihim laqad ʿalim''ta mā hāulāi yanṭiqūna', 'তাদের মাথা হেঁট হয়ে গেল। (তখন তারা বলল) ‘তুমি তো জানই ওরা কথা বলতে পারে না।’', 'Then they reversed themselves, [saying], "You have already known that these do not speak!"', 'তাদের মাথা হেঁট হয়ে গেল। (তখন তারা বলল) ‘তুমি তো জানই ওরা কথা বলতে পারে না।’', 'Then they reversed themselves, [saying], "You have already known that these do not speak!"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021065.mp3', now()),
  (21, 66, '', '[{"id":57680,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57681,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَفَتَعْبُدُونَ","transliteration":"afataʿbudūna","translation_bn":"\"কি তবুও তোমরা ইবাদাত করবে","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":57682,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57683,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57684,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":57685,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":57686,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":57687,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَنفَعُكُمْ","transliteration":"yanfaʿukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপকার করতে পারে","root":"نفع","lemma":"نَفَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57688,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًۭٔا","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কিছুমাত্র","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57689,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57690,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَضُرُّكُمْ","transliteration":"yaḍurrukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের ক্ষতি করতে পারে","root":"ضرر","lemma":"يَضُرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57691,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٦٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla afataʿbudūna min dūni l-lahi mā lā yanfaʿukum shayan walā yaḍurrukum', 'সে বলল, ‘তাহলে তোমরা কি আল্লাহর পরিবর্তে এমন কিছুর ‘ইবাদাত কর যা না পারে তোমাদের কোন উপকার করতে, আর না পারে তোমাদের ক্ষতি করতে?', 'He said, "Then do you worship instead of Allah that which does not benefit you at all or harm you?', 'সে বলল, ‘তাহলে তোমরা কি আল্লাহর পরিবর্তে এমন কিছুর ‘ইবাদাত কর যা না পারে তোমাদের কোন উপকার করতে, আর না পারে তোমাদের ক্ষতি করতে?', 'He said, "Then do you worship instead of Allah that which does not benefit you at all or harm you?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021066.mp3', now()),
  (21, 67, '', '[{"id":58044,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أُفٍّۢ","transliteration":"uffin","translation_bn":"ধিক","root":"افف","lemma":"أُفّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58045,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَّكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَّكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58046,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَلِمَا","transliteration":"walimā","translation_bn":"এবং (তাদের) জন্যেও যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58047,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَعْبُدُونَ","transliteration":"taʿbudūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা উপাসনা করো","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58048,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58049,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58050,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":58052,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَا","transliteration":"afalā","translation_bn":"কি তবুও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":58053,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَعْقِلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿqilūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা বুঝবে\"","root":"عقل","lemma":"عَقَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58054,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٦٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'uffin lakum walimā taʿbudūna min dūni l-lahi afalā taʿqilūna', 'ধিক তোমাদের প্রতি আর আল্লাহর পরিবর্তে তোমরা যাদের ‘ইবাদাত কর তাদেরও প্রতি। এরপরও কি তোমরা বুঝবে না।', 'Uff to you and to what you worship instead of Allah. Then will you not use reason?"', 'ধিক তোমাদের প্রতি আর আল্লাহর পরিবর্তে তোমরা যাদের ‘ইবাদাত কর তাদেরও প্রতি। এরপরও কি তোমরা বুঝবে না।', 'Uff to you and to what you worship instead of Allah. Then will you not use reason?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021067.mp3', now()),
  (21, 68, '', '[{"id":58763,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58764,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"حَرِّقُوهُ","transliteration":"ḥarriqūhu","translation_bn":"\"তাকে পুড়িয়ে ফেলো","root":"حرق","lemma":"حَرِّقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58765,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَٱنصُرُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wa-unṣurū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা সাহায্য করো","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58766,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ءَالِهَتَكُمْ","transliteration":"ālihatakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের দেবতাগুলোকে","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58767,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":58768,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58769,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَـٰعِلِينَ","transliteration":"fāʿilīna","translation_bn":"করতে পারো\"","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَاعِل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58770,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٦٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū ḥarriqūhu wa-unṣurū ālihatakum in kuntum fāʿilīna', 'তারা বলল, ‘তাকে পুড়িয়ে মার আর তোমাদের উপাস্যদের সাহায্য কর- যদি তোমরা কিছু করতেই চাও।', 'They said, "Burn him and support your gods - if you are to act."', 'তারা বলল, ‘তাকে পুড়িয়ে মার আর তোমাদের উপাস্যদের সাহায্য কর- যদি তোমরা কিছু করতেই চাও।', 'They said, "Burn him and support your gods - if you are to act."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021068.mp3', now()),
  (21, 69, '', '[{"id":58989,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْنَا","transliteration":"qul''nā","translation_bn":"আমরা বললাম","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58990,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰنَارُ","transliteration":"yānāru","translation_bn":"\"হে আগুন","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":58991,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كُونِى","transliteration":"kūnī","translation_bn":"হয়ে যাও","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58992,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بَرْدًۭا","transliteration":"bardan","translation_bn":"শীতল","root":"برد","lemma":"بَرْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58993,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَسَلَـٰمًا","transliteration":"wasalāman","translation_bn":"ও নিরাপদ","root":"سلم","lemma":"سَلَٰم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58994,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58995,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","transliteration":"ib''rāhīma","translation_bn":"ইবরাহীমের\"","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":58996,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٦٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul''nā yānāru kūnī bardan wasalāman ʿalā ib''rāhīma', 'আমি বললাম, ‘হে অগ্নি! তুমি ইবরাহীমের জন্য শীতল ও শান্তিময় হয়ে যাও।’', 'Allah said, "O fire, be coolness and safety upon Abraham."', 'আমি বললাম, ‘হে অগ্নি! তুমি ইবরাহীমের জন্য শীতল ও শান্তিময় হয়ে যাও।’', 'Allah said, "O fire, be coolness and safety upon Abraham."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021069.mp3', now()),
  (21, 70, '', '[{"id":59450,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَرَادُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-arādū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা চেয়েছিলো","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59451,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সাথে তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59452,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَيْدًۭا","transliteration":"kaydan","translation_bn":"এক ফন্দি আঁটতে","root":"كيد","lemma":"كَيْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59453,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَجَعَلْنَـٰهُمُ","transliteration":"fajaʿalnāhumu","translation_bn":"কিন্তু তাদেরকে আমরা করে দিয়েছিলাম","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59454,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَخْسَرِينَ","transliteration":"l-akhsarīna","translation_bn":"সর্বাধিক ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত","root":"خسر","lemma":"أَخْسَرِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59455,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٧٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭০)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-arādū bihi kaydan fajaʿalnāhumu l-akhsarīna', 'তারা তার বিরুদ্ধে চক্রান্ত করেছিল কিন্তু আমি তাদেরকেই সবচেয়ে ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত করে ছাড়লাম।', 'And they intended for him harm, but We made them the greatest losers.', 'তারা তার বিরুদ্ধে চক্রান্ত করেছিল কিন্তু আমি তাদেরকেই সবচেয়ে ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত করে ছাড়লাম।', 'And they intended for him harm, but We made them the greatest losers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021070.mp3', now()),
  (21, 71, '', '[{"id":59955,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَنَجَّيْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"wanajjaynāhu","translation_bn":"এবং তাকে আমরা উদ্ধার করলাম","root":"نجو","lemma":"نَجَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59956,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَلُوطًا","transliteration":"walūṭan","translation_bn":"ও লূতকে","root":"—","lemma":"لُوط","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59957,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59958,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"(সেই) দেশের","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59959,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّتِى","transliteration":"allatī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":59960,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَـٰرَكْنَا","transliteration":"bāraknā","translation_bn":"আমরা কল্যাণ দিয়েছি","root":"برك","lemma":"بَٰرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59961,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59962,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لِلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"lil''ʿālamīna","translation_bn":"জন্যে বিশ্ববাসীর","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلَمِين","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59963,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٧١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭১)","root":"—","lemma":"٧١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wanajjaynāhu walūṭan ilā l-arḍi allatī bāraknā fīhā lil''ʿālamīna', 'আর আমি তাকে ও (তার ভ্রাতুষ্পুত্র) লূতকে উদ্ধার করে তাদেরকে এমন দেশে (অর্থাৎ ফিলিস্তিনে) নিয়ে গেলাম যা আমি বিশ্ববাসীর জন্য কল্যাণময় করেছি।', 'And We delivered him and Lot to the land which We had blessed for the worlds.', 'আর আমি তাকে ও (তার ভ্রাতুষ্পুত্র) লূতকে উদ্ধার করে তাদেরকে এমন দেশে (অর্থাৎ ফিলিস্তিনে) নিয়ে গেলাম যা আমি বিশ্ববাসীর জন্য কল্যাণময় করেছি।', 'And We delivered him and Lot to the land which We had blessed for the worlds.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/021071.mp3', now()),
