translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":5250,"position":60,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلْنَا","transliteration":"anzalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা বর্ষণ করি","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":5251,"position":61,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهَا","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":5252,"position":62,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَآءَ","transliteration":"l-māa","translation_bn":"পানি","root":"موه","lemma":"مَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":5253,"position":63,"text_uthmani":"ٱهْتَزَّتْ","transliteration":"ih''tazzat","translation_bn":"তা সতেজ হয়","root":"هزز","lemma":"ٱهْتَزَّتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":5254,"position":64,"text_uthmani":"وَرَبَتْ","transliteration":"warabat","translation_bn":"ও ফুলে ফেঁপে ওঠে","root":"ربو","lemma":"رَبَتْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":5255,"position":65,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنۢبَتَتْ","transliteration":"wa-anbatat","translation_bn":"এবং উদ্‌গত করে","root":"نبت","lemma":"أَن[بَتَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":5256,"position":66,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"প্রকার","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":5257,"position":67,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সর্ব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":5258,"position":68,"text_uthmani":"زَوْجٍۭ","transliteration":"zawjin","translation_bn":"উদ্ভিদ","root":"زوج","lemma":"زَوْج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":5259,"position":69,"text_uthmani":"بَهِيجٍۢ","transliteration":"bahījin","translation_bn":"সুদৃশ্য","root":"بهج","lemma":"بَهِيج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":5260,"position":70,"text_uthmani":"٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā l-nāsu in kuntum fī raybin mina l-baʿthi fa-innā khalaqnākum min turābin thumma min nuṭ''fatin thumma min ʿalaqatin thumma min muḍ''ghatin mukhallaqatin waghayri mukhallaqatin linubayyina lakum wanuqirru fī l-arḥāmi mā nashāu ilā ajalin musamman thumma nukh''rijukum ṭif''lan thumma litablughū ashuddakum waminkum man yutawaffā waminkum man yuraddu ilā ardhali l-ʿumuri likaylā yaʿlama min baʿdi ʿil''min shayan watarā l-arḍa hāmidatan fa-idhā anzalnā ʿalayhā l-māa ih''tazzat warabat wa-anbatat min kulli zawjin bahījin', 'হে মানুষ! পুনরুত্থানের ব্যাপারে যদি তোমরা সন্দিহান হও, তাহলে (চিন্তা করে দেখ) আমি তোমাদেরকে সৃষ্টি করেছি মাটি থেকে, অতঃপর শুক্র হতে, অতঃপর জমাট রক্ত থেকে, অতঃপর মাংসপিন্ড হতে পূর্ণ আকৃতিবিশিষ্ট বা অপূর্ণ আকৃতিবিশিষ্ট অবস্থায় (আমার শক্তি-ক্ষমতা) তোমাদের সামনে স্পষ্ট করে তুলে ধরার জন্য। আর আমি যাকে ইচ্ছে করি তাকে একটা নির্দিষ্ট কাল পর্যন্ত মাতৃগর্ভে রাখি, অতঃপর তোমাদেরকে বের করে আনি শিশুরূপে, অতঃপর (লালন পালন) করি যাতে তোমরা তোমাদের পূর্ণ শক্তির বয়সে পৌঁছতে পার। তোমাদের কারো কারো মৃত্যু ঘটাই, আর কতককে ফিরিয়ে দেয়া হয় নিস্ক্রিয় বার্ধক্যে যাতে (অনেক) জ্ঞান লাভের পরেও তাদের আর কোন জ্ঞান থাকে না। অতঃপর (আরো) তোমরা ভূমিকে দেখ শুষ্ক, মৃত; অতঃপর আমি যখন তাতে পানি বর্ষণ করি তখন তাতে প্রাণ চাঞ্চল্য সৃষ্টি হয়, তা আন্দোলিত ও স্ফীত হয়, আর তা উদগত করে সকল প্রকার নয়নজুড়ানো উদ্ভিদ (জোড়ায় জোড়ায়)।', 'O People, if you should be in doubt about the Resurrection, then [consider that] indeed, We created you from dust, then from a sperm-drop, then from a clinging clot, and then from a lump of flesh, formed and unformed - that We may show you. And We settle in the wombs whom We will for a specified term, then We bring you out as a child, and then [We develop you] that you may reach your [time of] maturity. And among you is he who is taken in [early] death, and among you is he who is returned to the most decrepit [old] age so that he knows, after [once having] knowledge, nothing. And you see the earth barren, but when We send down upon it rain, it quivers and swells and grows [something] of every beautiful kind.', 'হে মানুষ! পুনরুত্থানের ব্যাপারে যদি তোমরা সন্দিহান হও, তাহলে (চিন্তা করে দেখ) আমি তোমাদেরকে সৃষ্টি করেছি মাটি থেকে, অতঃপর শুক্র হতে, অতঃপর জমাট রক্ত থেকে, অতঃপর মাংসপিন্ড হতে পূর্ণ আকৃতিবিশিষ্ট বা অপূর্ণ আকৃতিবিশিষ্ট অবস্থায় (আমার শক্তি-ক্ষমতা) তোমাদের সামনে স্পষ্ট করে তুলে ধরার জন্য। আর আমি যাকে ইচ্ছে করি তাকে একটা নির্দিষ্ট কাল পর্যন্ত মাতৃগর্ভে রাখি, অতঃপর তোমাদেরকে বের করে আনি শিশুরূপে, অতঃপর (লালন পালন) করি যাতে তোমরা তোমাদের পূর্ণ শক্তির বয়সে পৌঁছতে পার। তোমাদের কারো কারো মৃত্যু ঘটাই, আর কতককে ফিরিয়ে দেয়া হয় নিস্ক্রিয় বার্ধক্যে যাতে (অনেক) জ্ঞান লাভের পরেও তাদের আর কোন জ্ঞান থাকে না। অতঃপর (আরো) তোমরা ভূমিকে দেখ শুষ্ক, মৃত; অতঃপর আমি যখন তাতে পানি বর্ষণ করি তখন তাতে প্রাণ চাঞ্চল্য সৃষ্টি হয়, তা আন্দোলিত ও স্ফীত হয়, আর তা উদগত করে সকল প্রকার নয়নজুড়ানো উদ্ভিদ (জোড়ায় জোড়ায়)।', 'O People, if you should be in doubt about the Resurrection, then [consider that] indeed, We created you from dust, then from a sperm-drop, then from a clinging clot, and then from a lump of flesh, formed and unformed - that We may show you. And We settle in the wombs whom We will for a specified term, then We bring you out as a child, and then [We develop you] that you may reach your [time of] maturity. And among you is he who is taken in [early] death, and among you is he who is returned to the most decrepit [old] age so that he knows, after [once having] knowledge, nothing. And you see the earth barren, but when We send down upon it rain, it quivers and swells and grows [something] of every beautiful kind.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022005.mp3', now()),
  (22, 6, '', '[{"id":6470,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":6471,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِأَنَّ","transliteration":"bi-anna","translation_bn":"এজন্যে যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":6472,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":6473,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":6474,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقُّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","translation_bn":"প্রকৃত সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":6475,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"wa-annahu","translation_bn":"এবং এসব এজন্যে যে তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":6476,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يُحْىِ","transliteration":"yuḥ''yī","translation_bn":"জীবিত করেন","root":"حيي","lemma":"أَحْيَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":6477,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ","transliteration":"l-mawtā","translation_bn":"মৃতদেরকে","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّيِّت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":6478,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"wa-annahu","translation_bn":"এবং (এটা প্রমাণ করে যে) তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":6479,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":6480,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":6481,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":6482,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"قَدِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"qadīrun","translation_bn":"শক্তিমান","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":6483,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dhālika bi-anna l-laha huwa l-ḥaqu wa-annahu yuḥ''yī l-mawtā wa-annahu ʿalā kulli shayin qadīrun', 'এ রকম হয় এজন্য যে, আল্লাহ হলেন সত্য সঠিক, আর তিনিই মৃতকে জীবিত করেন, আর তিনি সকল বিষয়ে ক্ষমতাবান।', 'That is because Allah is the Truth and because He gives life to the dead and because He is over all things competent', 'এ রকম হয় এজন্য যে, আল্লাহ হলেন সত্য সঠিক, আর তিনিই মৃতকে জীবিত করেন, আর তিনি সকল বিষয়ে ক্ষমতাবান।', 'That is because Allah is the Truth and because He gives life to the dead and because He is over all things competent', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022006.mp3', now()),
  (22, 7, '', '[{"id":7863,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"এবং (এটা প্রমাণ করে) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":7864,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّاعَةَ","transliteration":"l-sāʿata","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাত","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":7865,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتِيَةٌۭ","transliteration":"ātiyatun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যম্ভাবী","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تِي","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":7866,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":7867,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَيْبَ","transliteration":"rayba","translation_bn":"কোন সন্দেহ","root":"ريب","lemma":"رَيْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":7868,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":7869,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"এবং (এটা প্রমাণ করে) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":7870,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":7871,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَبْعَثُ","transliteration":"yabʿathu","translation_bn":"উত্থিত করবেন","root":"بعث","lemma":"بَعَثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":7872,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যারা (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":7873,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":7874,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُبُورِ","transliteration":"l-qubūri","translation_bn":"কবরসমূহের","root":"قبر","lemma":"قَبْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":7875,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-anna l-sāʿata ātiyatun lā rayba fīhā wa-anna l-laha yabʿathu man fī l-qubūri', 'আর কিয়ামাত অবশ্যই আসবে, এ ব্যাপারে কোন সন্দেহ নেই এবং যারা কবরে আছে আল্লাহ তাদেরকে অবশ্যই পুনরুত্থিত করবেন।', 'And [that they may know] that the Hour is coming - no doubt about it - and that Allah will resurrect those in the graves.', 'আর কিয়ামাত অবশ্যই আসবে, এ ব্যাপারে কোন সন্দেহ নেই এবং যারা কবরে আছে আল্লাহ তাদেরকে অবশ্যই পুনরুত্থিত করবেন।', 'And [that they may know] that the Hour is coming - no doubt about it - and that Allah will resurrect those in the graves.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022007.mp3', now()),
  (22, 8, '', '[{"id":9053,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنَ","transliteration":"wamina","translation_bn":"এবং কেউ কেউ (মধ্য হ''তে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":9054,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"লোকদের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":9055,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":9056,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يُجَـٰدِلُ","transliteration":"yujādilu","translation_bn":"ঝগড়া করে","root":"جدل","lemma":"جَٰدَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":9057,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"সম্বন্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":9058,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":9059,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"bighayri","translation_bn":"ছাড়াই","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":9060,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿil''min","translation_bn":"কোন জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":9061,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":9062,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"هُدًۭى","transliteration":"hudan","translation_bn":"(তাদের কাছে) পথ নির্দেশনা","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":9063,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":9064,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كِتَـٰبٍۢ","transliteration":"kitābin","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":9065,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مُّنِيرٍۢ","transliteration":"munīrin","translation_bn":"আলোকময়","root":"نور","lemma":"مُّنِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":9066,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamina l-nāsi man yujādilu fī l-lahi bighayri ʿil''min walā hudan walā kitābin munīrin', 'তবুও মানুষের মধ্যে এমন আছে যারা জ্ঞান, পথের দিশা ও কোন আলোকপ্রদানকারী কিতাব ছাড়াই আল্লাহ সম্পর্কে বিতর্ক করে।', 'And of the people is he who disputes about Allah without knowledge or guidance or an enlightening book [from Him],', 'তবুও মানুষের মধ্যে এমন আছে যারা জ্ঞান, পথের দিশা ও কোন আলোকপ্রদানকারী কিতাব ছাড়াই আল্লাহ সম্পর্কে বিতর্ক করে।', 'And of the people is he who disputes about Allah without knowledge or guidance or an enlightening book [from Him],', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022008.mp3', now()),
  (22, 9, '', '[{"id":10259,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثَانِىَ","transliteration":"thāniya","translation_bn":"বাঁকা করে","root":"ثني","lemma":"ثَانِى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10260,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عِطْفِهِۦ","transliteration":"ʿiṭ''fihi","translation_bn":"তার ঘাড়","root":"عطف","lemma":"عِطْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10261,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِيُضِلَّ","transliteration":"liyuḍilla","translation_bn":"জন্যে বিভ্রান্ত করার","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":10262,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":10263,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10264,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":10266,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":10267,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":10268,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"দুনিয়ার","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":10269,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"خِزْىٌۭ ۖ","transliteration":"khiz''yun","translation_bn":"লাঞ্ছনা","root":"خزي","lemma":"خِزْى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10271,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَنُذِيقُهُۥ","transliteration":"wanudhīquhu","translation_bn":"আর তাকে আস্বাদন করাবো আমরা","root":"ذوق","lemma":"أَذَاقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10272,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10273,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":10274,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابَ","transliteration":"ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10275,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَرِيقِ","transliteration":"l-ḥarīqi","translation_bn":"দহনের","root":"حرق","lemma":"حَرِيق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":10276,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thāniya ʿiṭ''fihi liyuḍilla ʿan sabīli l-lahi lahu fī l-dun''yā khiz''yun wanudhīquhu yawma l-qiyāmati ʿadhāba l-ḥarīqi', '(বিতর্ক করে অবজ্ঞাভরে) ঘাড় বাঁকিয়ে (লোকেদেরকে) আল্লাহর পথ থেকে বিচ্যুত করার উদ্দেশে। তার জন্য আছে লাঞ্ছনা এ দুনিয়াতে, আর কিয়ামাতের দিন তাকে আস্বাদন করাব (অগ্নির) দহন যন্ত্রণা।', 'Twisting his neck [in arrogance] to mislead [people] from the way of Allah. For him in the world is disgrace, and We will make him taste on the Day of Resurrection the punishment of the Burning Fire [while it is said],', '(বিতর্ক করে অবজ্ঞাভরে) ঘাড় বাঁকিয়ে (লোকেদেরকে) আল্লাহর পথ থেকে বিচ্যুত করার উদ্দেশে। তার জন্য আছে লাঞ্ছনা এ দুনিয়াতে, আর কিয়ামাতের দিন তাকে আস্বাদন করাব (অগ্নির) দহন যন্ত্রণা।', 'Twisting his neck [in arrogance] to mislead [people] from the way of Allah. For him in the world is disgrace, and We will make him taste on the Day of Resurrection the punishment of the Burning Fire [while it is said],', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022009.mp3', now()),
  (22, 10, '', '[{"id":11509,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"(বলা হবে) এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":11510,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11511,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَدَّمَتْ","transliteration":"qaddamat","translation_bn":"আগে পাঠিয়েছে","root":"قدم","lemma":"قَدَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11512,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَدَاكَ","transliteration":"yadāka","translation_bn":"তোমার হাত","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11513,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"এবং (এও) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":11514,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":11515,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَيْسَ","transliteration":"laysa","translation_bn":"নন","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11516,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِظَلَّـٰمٍۢ","transliteration":"biẓallāmin","translation_bn":"অত্যাচারী","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَّٰم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11517,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لِّلْعَبِيدِ","transliteration":"lil''ʿabīdi","translation_bn":"দাসদের প্রতি","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11518,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dhālika bimā qaddamat yadāka wa-anna l-laha laysa biẓallāmin lil''ʿabīdi', '(বলা হবে) তোমার হাত দু’খানা আগেই যা পাঠিয়েছিল এটা তারই ফল, কারণ আল্লাহ তো তাঁর বান্দাহদের প্রতি যালিম নন।', '"That is for what your hands have put forth and because Allah is not ever unjust to [His] servants."', '(বলা হবে) তোমার হাত দু’খানা আগেই যা পাঠিয়েছিল এটা তারই ফল, কারণ আল্লাহ তো তাঁর বান্দাহদের প্রতি যালিম নন।', '"That is for what your hands have put forth and because Allah is not ever unjust to [His] servants."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022010.mp3', now()),
  (22, 11, '', '[{"id":12801,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنَ","transliteration":"wamina","translation_bn":"এবং কেউ কেউ (মধ্য হ''তে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":12802,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"লোকদের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":12803,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":12804,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَعْبُدُ","transliteration":"yaʿbudu","translation_bn":"ইবাদাত করে","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12805,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":12806,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12807,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"حَرْفٍۢ ۖ","transliteration":"ḥarfin","translation_bn":"এক প্রান্তে (দাঁড়িয়ে)","root":"حرف","lemma":"حَرْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":12809,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنْ","transliteration":"fa-in","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":12810,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَصَابَهُۥ","transliteration":"aṣābahu","translation_bn":"তার (উপর) পৌঁছে","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12811,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"কোন কল্যাণ","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":12812,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱطْمَأَنَّ","transliteration":"iṭ''ma-anna","translation_bn":"সে প্রশান্ত হয়","root":"طمن","lemma":"ٱطْمَأَنَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12813,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তার মাধ্যমে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12815,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنْ","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"আর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":12816,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَصَابَتْهُ","transliteration":"aṣābathu","translation_bn":"তার (উপর) পৌঁছে","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12817,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فِتْنَةٌ","transliteration":"fit''natun","translation_bn":"কোন বিপর্যয়","root":"فتن","lemma":"فِتْنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":12818,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱنقَلَبَ","transliteration":"inqalaba","translation_bn":"ফিরে যায়","root":"قلب","lemma":"ٱنقَلَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12819,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12820,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَجْهِهِۦ","transliteration":"wajhihi","translation_bn":"তার (আসল) চেহারার (অর্থাৎ কুফুরীতে)","root":"وجه","lemma":"وَجْه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":12821,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"خَسِرَ","transliteration":"khasira","translation_bn":"সে ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত হলো","root":"خسر","lemma":"خَسِرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12822,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"দুনিয়াতে","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":12823,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةَ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-ākhirata","translation_bn":"ও আখিরাতে","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":12825,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":12826,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"সেই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":12827,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخُسْرَانُ","transliteration":"l-khus''rānu","translation_bn":"ক্ষতি","root":"خسر","lemma":"خُسْرَان","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":12828,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُبِينُ","transliteration":"l-mubīnu","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":12829,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"١١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১)","root":"—","lemma":"١١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamina l-nāsi man yaʿbudu l-laha ʿalā ḥarfin fa-in aṣābahu khayrun iṭ''ma-anna bihi wa-in aṣābathu fit''natun inqalaba ʿalā wajhihi khasira l-dun''yā wal-ākhirata dhālika huwa l-khus''rānu l-mubīnu', 'মানুষের মধ্যে এমন কতক আছে যারা শেষ সীমায় অবস্থান করে আল্লাহর ‘ইবাদাত করে। অতঃপর তার কল্যাণ হলে, তা নিয়ে সে তৃপ্ত থাকে, আর কোন পরীক্ষার সম্মুখীন হলে সে তার পূর্বের অবস্থায় ফিরে যায়। ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত হয় সে দুনিয়াতেও আর আখিরাতেও- এটাই হল স্পষ্ট ক্ষতি।', 'And of the people is he who worships Allah on an edge. If he is touched by good, he is reassured by it; but if he is struck by trial, he turns on his face [to the other direction]. He has lost [this] world and the Hereafter. That is what is the manifest loss.', 'মানুষের মধ্যে এমন কতক আছে যারা শেষ সীমায় অবস্থান করে আল্লাহর ‘ইবাদাত করে। অতঃপর তার কল্যাণ হলে, তা নিয়ে সে তৃপ্ত থাকে, আর কোন পরীক্ষার সম্মুখীন হলে সে তার পূর্বের অবস্থায় ফিরে যায়। ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত হয় সে দুনিয়াতেও আর আখিরাতেও- এটাই হল স্পষ্ট ক্ষতি।', 'And of the people is he who worships Allah on an edge. If he is touched by good, he is reassured by it; but if he is struck by trial, he turns on his face [to the other direction]. He has lost [this] world and the Hereafter. That is what is the manifest loss.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022011.mp3', now()),
  (22, 12, '', '[{"id":14078,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَدْعُوا۟","transliteration":"yadʿū","translation_bn":"তারা ডাকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14079,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":14080,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"পরিবর্তে","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14081,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":14082,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":14083,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":14084,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَضُرُّهُۥ","transliteration":"yaḍurruhu","translation_bn":"তাকে ক্ষতি করতে পারে","root":"ضرر","lemma":"يَضُرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14085,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":14086,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":14087,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَنفَعُهُۥ ۚ","transliteration":"yanfaʿuhu","translation_bn":"তার উপকার করতে পারে","root":"نفع","lemma":"نَفَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14089,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":14090,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"সেই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":14091,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلضَّلَـٰلُ","transliteration":"l-ḍalālu","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্টতা","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَٰل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":14092,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَعِيدُ","transliteration":"l-baʿīdu","translation_bn":"সুদূর (চরম)","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعِيد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":14093,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yadʿū min dūni l-lahi mā lā yaḍurruhu wamā lā yanfaʿuhu dhālika huwa l-ḍalālu l-baʿīdu', 'আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে সে এমন কিছুকে ডাকে যা না পারে তার কোন ক্ষতি করতে আর না পারে কোন উপকার করতে, এটাই হল চরম আকারের গুমরাহী।', 'He invokes instead of Allah that which neither harms him nor benefits him. That is what is the extreme error.', 'আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে সে এমন কিছুকে ডাকে যা না পারে তার কোন ক্ষতি করতে আর না পারে কোন উপকার করতে, এটাই হল চরম আকারের গুমরাহী।', 'He invokes instead of Allah that which neither harms him nor benefits him. That is what is the extreme error.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022012.mp3', now()),
  (22, 13, '', '[{"id":15201,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَدْعُوا۟","transliteration":"yadʿū","translation_bn":"তারা ডাকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15202,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَمَن","transliteration":"laman","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই এমন কিছুকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":15203,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ضَرُّهُۥٓ","transliteration":"ḍarruhu","translation_bn":"যার ক্ষতি","root":"ضرر","lemma":"ضَرّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15204,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَقْرَبُ","transliteration":"aqrabu","translation_bn":"নিকটতর অধিকতর","root":"قرب","lemma":"أَقْرَب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":15205,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"অপেক্ষা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15206,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نَّفْعِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"nafʿihi","translation_bn":"তার উপকারিতা","root":"نفع","lemma":"نَفْع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15208,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَبِئْسَ","transliteration":"labi''sa","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই কত নিকৃষ্ট","root":"باس","lemma":"بِئْسَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":15209,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَوْلَىٰ","transliteration":"l-mawlā","translation_bn":"অভিভাবক","root":"ولي","lemma":"مَوْلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15210,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلَبِئْسَ","transliteration":"walabi''sa","translation_bn":"আর অবশ্যই কত নিকৃষ্ট","root":"باس","lemma":"بِئْسَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":15211,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَشِيرُ","transliteration":"l-ʿashīru","translation_bn":"সঙ্গী","root":"عشر","lemma":"عَشِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15212,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"١٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yadʿū laman ḍarruhu aqrabu min nafʿihi labi''sa l-mawlā walabi''sa l-ʿashīru', 'সে এমন কিছুকে ডাকে যার লাভের চেয়ে ক্ষতিই নিকটবর্তী, কত মন্দই না এই অভিভাবক, আর কত মন্দই না এই সঙ্গী!', 'He invokes one whose harm is closer than his benefit - how wretched the protector and how wretched the associate.', 'সে এমন কিছুকে ডাকে যার লাভের চেয়ে ক্ষতিই নিকটবর্তী, কত মন্দই না এই অভিভাবক, আর কত মন্দই না এই সঙ্গী!', 'He invokes one whose harm is closer than his benefit - how wretched the protector and how wretched the associate.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022013.mp3', now()),
  (22, 14, '', '[{"id":16230,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":16231,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":16232,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُدْخِلُ","transliteration":"yud''khilu","translation_bn":"প্রবেশ করাবেন","root":"دخل","lemma":"أُدْخِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16233,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":16234,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16235,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"waʿamilū","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":16236,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","translation_bn":"সৎকাজসমূহের","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":16237,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"جَنَّـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"jannātin","translation_bn":"(এমন) জান্নাতে","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16238,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَجْرِى","transliteration":"tajrī","translation_bn":"প্রবাহিত হয়","root":"جري","lemma":"جَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16239,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16240,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَحْتِهَا","transliteration":"taḥtihā","translation_bn":"যার নিচ","root":"تحت","lemma":"تَحْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16241,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ ۚ","transliteration":"l-anhāru","translation_bn":"ঝর্নাসমূহ","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":16243,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":16244,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":16245,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَفْعَلُ","transliteration":"yafʿalu","translation_bn":"করেন","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16246,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":16247,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يُرِيدُ","transliteration":"yurīdu","translation_bn":"চান তিনি","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16248,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"١٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna l-laha yud''khilu alladhīna āmanū waʿamilū l-ṣāliḥāti jannātin tajrī min taḥtihā l-anhāru inna l-laha yafʿalu mā yurīdu', 'যারা ঈমান আনে ও সৎ কাজ করে আল্লাহ তাদেরকে দাখিল করবেন জান্নাতে যার নিম্নদেশ দিয়ে ঝর্ণাধারা প্রবাহিত, আল্লাহ যা করতে চান, তাই করেন।', 'Indeed, Allah will admit those who believe and do righteous deeds to gardens beneath which rivers flow. Indeed, Allah does what He intends.', 'যারা ঈমান আনে ও সৎ কাজ করে আল্লাহ তাদেরকে দাখিল করবেন জান্নাতে যার নিম্নদেশ দিয়ে ঝর্ণাধারা প্রবাহিত, আল্লাহ যা করতে চান, তাই করেন।', 'Indeed, Allah will admit those who believe and do righteous deeds to gardens beneath which rivers flow. Indeed, Allah does what He intends.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022014.mp3', now()),
  (22, 15, '', '[{"id":17405,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":17406,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17407,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَظُنُّ","transliteration":"yaẓunnu","translation_bn":"ধারণা করতো","root":"ظنن","lemma":"ظَنَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17408,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":17409,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَّن","transliteration":"lan","translation_bn":"কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":17410,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَنصُرَهُ","transliteration":"yanṣurahu","translation_bn":"তাকে (রাসূল সাল্লাল্লাহু ''আলাইহি ওয়া সাল্লাম-কে) সাহায্য করবেন","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17411,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":17412,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17413,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"দুনিয়ার","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":17414,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","transliteration":"wal-ākhirati","translation_bn":"ও আখিরাতে","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":17415,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَلْيَمْدُدْ","transliteration":"falyamdud","translation_bn":"তাহ''লে সে লম্বা করুক","root":"مدد","lemma":"مَدَّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":17416,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِسَبَبٍ","transliteration":"bisababin","translation_bn":"নিয়ে একটি রশিকে","root":"سبب","lemma":"سَبَب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17417,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"পর্যন্ত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17418,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","transliteration":"l-samāi","translation_bn":"আকাশ","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":17419,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর (সেখানে পৌঁছে)","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":17420,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لْيَقْطَعْ","transliteration":"l''yaqṭaʿ","translation_bn":"যেন তা কেটে দেয় (ওহীর ধারা)","root":"قطع","lemma":"قُطِعَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":17421,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فَلْيَنظُرْ","transliteration":"falyanẓur","translation_bn":"অতঃপর দেখুক","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":17422,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":17423,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يُذْهِبَنَّ","transliteration":"yudh''hibanna","translation_bn":"দূর করতে পারবে","root":"ذهب","lemma":"أَذْهَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17424,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"كَيْدُهُۥ","transliteration":"kayduhu","translation_bn":"তার কৌশল","root":"كيد","lemma":"كَيْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17425,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":17426,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"يَغِيظُ","transliteration":"yaghīẓu","translation_bn":"রাগান্বিত করে (তাকে)","root":"غيظ","lemma":"يَغِيظُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17427,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"١٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'man kāna yaẓunnu an lan yanṣurahu l-lahu fī l-dun''yā wal-ākhirati falyamdud bisababin ilā l-samāi thumma l''yaqṭaʿ falyanẓur hal yudh''hibanna kayduhu mā yaghīẓu', 'যে কেউ ধারণা করে যে আল্লাহ তাকে (অর্থাৎ তাঁর রসূলকে) কক্ষনো দুনিয়া ও আখিরাতে সাহায্য করবেন না, তাহলে সে আকাশ পর্যন্ত একটা দড়ি ঝুলিয়ে নিক, অতঃপর তা কেটে দিক, অতঃপর সে দেখুক তার কলা-কৌশল তার রাগের কারণ দূর করে কিনা। (রসূলের দুশমন নিজের ঝুলানো দড়িটাই কাটুক, কেননা সে তো রসূলের প্রতি আল্লাহর সাহায্যের দড়িটা কক্ষনো কাটতে পারবে না।)', 'Whoever should think that Allah will not support [Prophet Muhammad] in this world and the Hereafter - let him extend a rope to the ceiling, then cut off [his breath], and let him see: will his effort remove that which enrages [him]?', 'যে কেউ ধারণা করে যে আল্লাহ তাকে (অর্থাৎ তাঁর রসূলকে) কক্ষনো দুনিয়া ও আখিরাতে সাহায্য করবেন না, তাহলে সে আকাশ পর্যন্ত একটা দড়ি ঝুলিয়ে নিক, অতঃপর তা কেটে দিক, অতঃপর সে দেখুক তার কলা-কৌশল তার রাগের কারণ দূর করে কিনা। (রসূলের দুশমন নিজের ঝুলানো দড়িটাই কাটুক, কেননা সে তো রসূলের প্রতি আল্লাহর সাহায্যের দড়িটা কক্ষনো কাটতে পারবে না।)', 'Whoever should think that Allah will not support [Prophet Muhammad] in this world and the Hereafter - let him extend a rope to the ceiling, then cut off [his breath], and let him see: will his effort remove that which enrages [him]?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022015.mp3', now()),
  (22, 16, '', '[{"id":18495,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wakadhālika","translation_bn":"আর এরূপেই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":18496,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"anzalnāhu","translation_bn":"তা আমরা অবতীর্ণ করেছি","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18497,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتٍۭ","transliteration":"āyātin","translation_bn":"আয়াত (রূপে)","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18498,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"bayyinātin","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":18499,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"আর নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":18500,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":18501,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِى","transliteration":"yahdī","translation_bn":"পথ দেখান","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18502,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":18503,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُرِيدُ","transliteration":"yurīdu","translation_bn":"চান","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18504,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakadhālika anzalnāhu āyātin bayyinātin wa-anna l-laha yahdī man yurīdu', 'এভাবেই আমি স্পষ্ট নিদর্শনরূপে কুরআন অবতীর্ণ করেছি আর আল্লাহ যাকে চান সঠিক পথে পরিচালিত করেন।', 'And thus have We sent the Qur''an down as verses of clear evidence and because Allah guides whom He intends.', 'এভাবেই আমি স্পষ্ট নিদর্শনরূপে কুরআন অবতীর্ণ করেছি আর আল্লাহ যাকে চান সঠিক পথে পরিচালিত করেন।', 'And thus have We sent the Qur''an down as verses of clear evidence and because Allah guides whom He intends.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022016.mp3', now()),
  (22, 17, '', '[{"id":19469,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":19470,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":19471,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19472,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"ও যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":19473,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هَادُوا۟","transliteration":"hādū","translation_bn":"ইয়াহুদী হয়েছে","root":"هود","lemma":"هَادُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19474,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلصَّـٰبِـِٔينَ","transliteration":"wal-ṣābiīna","translation_bn":"ও সাবেয়ী","root":"صبا","lemma":"صَّٰبِـ#ِين","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":19475,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلنَّصَـٰرَىٰ","transliteration":"wal-naṣārā","translation_bn":"ও খ্রিষ্টান","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصْرَانِيّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":19476,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمَجُوسَ","transliteration":"wal-majūsa","translation_bn":"ও অগ্নি পূজারক","root":"مجس","lemma":"مَجُوس","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":19477,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":19478,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَشْرَكُوٓا۟","transliteration":"ashrakū","translation_bn":"শিরক করেছে","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19479,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":19480,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":19481,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَفْصِلُ","transliteration":"yafṣilu","translation_bn":"মীমাংসা করে দিবেন","root":"فصل","lemma":"فَصَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19482,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُمْ","transliteration":"baynahum","translation_bn":"তাদের মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":19483,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19484,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":19486,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":19487,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":19488,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19489,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19490,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছু","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19491,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"شَهِيدٌ","transliteration":"shahīdun","translation_bn":"প্রত্যক্ষকারী","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":19492,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"١٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna āmanū wa-alladhīna hādū wal-ṣābiīna wal-naṣārā wal-majūsa wa-alladhīna ashrakū inna l-laha yafṣilu baynahum yawma l-qiyāmati inna l-laha ʿalā kulli shayin shahīdun', 'যারা ঈমান এনেছে আর যারা ইয়াহূদী হয়েছে, আর যারা সাবিয়ী, নাসারা, অগ্নিপূজক ও মুশরিক, আল্লাহ কিয়ামাতের দিন এদের মধ্যে ফয়সালা করে দেবেন (যে কারা সঠিক পথে আছে), কারণ আল্লাহ সব কিছুর প্রত্যক্ষদর্শী।', 'Indeed, those who have believed and those who were Jews and the Sabeans and the Christians and the Magians and those who associated with Allah - Allah will judge between them on the Day of Resurrection. Indeed Allah is, over all things, Witness.', 'যারা ঈমান এনেছে আর যারা ইয়াহূদী হয়েছে, আর যারা সাবিয়ী, নাসারা, অগ্নিপূজক ও মুশরিক, আল্লাহ কিয়ামাতের দিন এদের মধ্যে ফয়সালা করে দেবেন (যে কারা সঠিক পথে আছে), কারণ আল্লাহ সব কিছুর প্রত্যক্ষদর্শী।', 'Indeed, those who have believed and those who were Jews and the Sabeans and the Christians and the Magians and those who associated with Allah - Allah will judge between them on the Day of Resurrection. Indeed Allah is, over all things, Witness.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022017.mp3', now()),
  (22, 18, '', '[{"id":20551,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"নি কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":20552,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَرَ","transliteration":"tara","translation_bn":"তুমি দেখো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20553,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":20554,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ (এমন সত্ত্বা)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":20555,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَسْجُدُ","transliteration":"yasjudu","translation_bn":"সিজদা করে","root":"سجد","lemma":"سَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20556,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তাঁর জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20557,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":20558,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20559,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশমন্ডলীতে","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":20560,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"ও যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":20561,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20562,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীতে","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":20563,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلشَّمْسُ","transliteration":"wal-shamsu","translation_bn":"এবং সূর্য","root":"شمس","lemma":"شَمْس","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":20564,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْقَمَرُ","transliteration":"wal-qamaru","translation_bn":"ও চাঁদ","root":"قمر","lemma":"قَمَر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":20565,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلنُّجُومُ","transliteration":"wal-nujūmu","translation_bn":"ও নক্ষত্রমণ্ডলী","root":"نجم","lemma":"نَّجْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":20566,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْجِبَالُ","transliteration":"wal-jibālu","translation_bn":"ও পর্বতরাজি","root":"جبل","lemma":"جَبَل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":20567,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلشَّجَرُ","transliteration":"wal-shajaru","translation_bn":"ও গাছপালা","root":"شجر","lemma":"شَجَر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":20568,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلدَّوَآبُّ","transliteration":"wal-dawābu","translation_bn":"ও জীবজন্তু","root":"دبب","lemma":"دَا^بَّة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":20569,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَكَثِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"wakathīrun","translation_bn":"এবং অনেকে","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثِير","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":20570,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20571,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষের (সিজদাবনত থাকে)","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":20573,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَكَثِيرٌ","transliteration":"wakathīrun","translation_bn":"আবার অনেকের","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثِير","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":20574,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"حَقَّ","transliteration":"ḥaqqa","translation_bn":"অবধারিত হয়েছে","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20575,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"যার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20576,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابُ ۗ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābu","translation_bn":"শাস্তি (তারা এর বিপরীত)","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":20578,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":20579,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"يُهِنِ","transliteration":"yuhini","translation_bn":"হেয় করেন","root":"هون","lemma":"أَهَٰنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20580,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":20581,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"فَمَا","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"সেক্ষেত্রে নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":20582,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20583,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোন","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20584,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"مُّكْرِمٍ ۚ","transliteration":"muk''rimin","translation_bn":"সম্মানদাতা","root":"كرم","lemma":"مُّكْرِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20586,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":20587,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":20588,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"يَفْعَلُ","transliteration":"yafʿalu","translation_bn":"করেন","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20589,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":20590,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ ۩","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি চান","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20592,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"١٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alam tara anna l-laha yasjudu lahu man fī l-samāwāti waman fī l-arḍi wal-shamsu wal-qamaru wal-nujūmu wal-jibālu wal-shajaru wal-dawābu wakathīrun mina l-nāsi wakathīrun ḥaqqa ʿalayhi l-ʿadhābu waman yuhini l-lahu famā lahu min muk''rimin inna l-laha yafʿalu mā yashāu', 'তুমি কি দেখ না যে আল্লাহকে সেজদা করে যারা আকাশে আছে, আর যারা পৃথিবীতে আছে আর সূর্য, চন্দ্র, তারকারাজি, পর্বতসমূহ, বৃক্ষরাজি, জীবজন্তু এবং মানুষের মধ্যে অনেকে? আর অনেকের প্রতি শাস্তি সাব্যস্ত হয়ে গেছে। আল্লাহ যাকে লাঞ্ছিত করতে চান, তাকে সম্মানিত করার কেউ নেই। আল্লাহ যা ইচ্ছে করেন তাই করেন।[সাজদাহ]', 'Do you not see that to Allah prostrates whoever is in the heavens and whoever is on the earth and the sun, the moon, the stars, the mountains, the trees, the moving creatures and many of the people? But upon many the punishment has been justified. And he whom Allah humiliates - for him there is no bestower of honor. Indeed, Allah does what He wills.', 'তুমি কি দেখ না যে আল্লাহকে সেজদা করে যারা আকাশে আছে, আর যারা পৃথিবীতে আছে আর সূর্য, চন্দ্র, তারকারাজি, পর্বতসমূহ, বৃক্ষরাজি, জীবজন্তু এবং মানুষের মধ্যে অনেকে? আর অনেকের প্রতি শাস্তি সাব্যস্ত হয়ে গেছে। আল্লাহ যাকে লাঞ্ছিত করতে চান, তাকে সম্মানিত করার কেউ নেই। আল্লাহ যা ইচ্ছে করেন তাই করেন।[সাজদাহ]', 'Do you not see that to Allah prostrates whoever is in the heavens and whoever is on the earth and the sun, the moon, the stars, the mountains, the trees, the moving creatures and many of the people? But upon many the punishment has been justified. And he whom Allah humiliates - for him there is no bestower of honor. Indeed, Allah does what He wills.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022018.mp3', now()),
  (22, 19, '', '[{"id":21636,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ هَـٰذَانِ","transliteration":"hādhāni","translation_bn":"এই দুই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَٰن","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":21637,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"خَصْمَانِ","transliteration":"khaṣmāni","translation_bn":"বিবদমান পক্ষদ্বয়","root":"خصم","lemma":"خَصْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":21638,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱخْتَصَمُوا۟","transliteration":"ikh''taṣamū","translation_bn":"বিতর্ক করছে","root":"خصم","lemma":"ٱخْتَصَمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21639,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":21640,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِمْ ۖ","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"তাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":21642,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"fa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"তাই যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":21643,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21644,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قُطِّعَتْ","transliteration":"quṭṭiʿat","translation_bn":"কেটে তৈরী করা হয়েছে","root":"قطع","lemma":"قَطَّعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21645,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":21646,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ثِيَابٌۭ","transliteration":"thiyābun","translation_bn":"পোশাক","root":"ثوب","lemma":"ثِيَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":21647,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"তৈরি","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":21648,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"نَّارٍۢ","transliteration":"nārin","translation_bn":"আগুনের","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":21649,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يُصَبُّ","transliteration":"yuṣabbu","translation_bn":"ঢেলে দেয়া হবে","root":"صبب","lemma":"صَبَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21650,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":21651,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَوْقِ","transliteration":"fawqi","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"فوق","lemma":"فَوْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":21652,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"رُءُوسِهِمُ","transliteration":"ruūsihimu","translation_bn":"তাদের মাথার","root":"راس","lemma":"رَأْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":21653,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَمِيمُ","transliteration":"l-ḥamīmu","translation_bn":"ফুটন্ত পানি","root":"حمم","lemma":"حَمِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":21654,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"١٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'hādhāni khaṣmāni ikh''taṣamū fī rabbihim fa-alladhīna kafarū quṭṭiʿat lahum thiyābun min nārin yuṣabbu min fawqi ruūsihimu l-ḥamīmu', 'এরা বিবাদের দু’টি পক্ষ, (মু’মিনরা একটি পক্ষ, আর সমস্ত কাফিররা আরেকটি পক্ষ) এরা এদের প্রতিপালক সম্বন্ধে বাদানুবাদ করে, অতঃপর যারা (তাদের প্রতিপালককে) অস্বীকার করে, তাদের জন্য তৈরি করা হয়েছে আগুনের পোশাক, তাদের মাথার উপর ঢেলে দেয়া হবে ফুটন্ত পানি।', 'These are two adversaries who have disputed over their Lord. But those who disbelieved will have cut out for them garments of fire. Poured upon their heads will be scalding water', 'এরা বিবাদের দু’টি পক্ষ, (মু’মিনরা একটি পক্ষ, আর সমস্ত কাফিররা আরেকটি পক্ষ) এরা এদের প্রতিপালক সম্বন্ধে বাদানুবাদ করে, অতঃপর যারা (তাদের প্রতিপালককে) অস্বীকার করে, তাদের জন্য তৈরি করা হয়েছে আগুনের পোশাক, তাদের মাথার উপর ঢেলে দেয়া হবে ফুটন্ত পানি।', 'These are two adversaries who have disputed over their Lord. But those who disbelieved will have cut out for them garments of fire. Poured upon their heads will be scalding water', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022019.mp3', now()),
  (22, 20, '', '[{"id":22733,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يُصْهَرُ","transliteration":"yuṣ''haru","translation_bn":"গলে যায়","root":"صهر","lemma":"يُصْهَرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22734,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"দিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":22735,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":22736,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":22737,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بُطُونِهِمْ","transliteration":"buṭūnihim","translation_bn":"তাদের পেটসমূহের","root":"بطن","lemma":"بَطْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":22738,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْجُلُودُ","transliteration":"wal-julūdu","translation_bn":"ও চামড়াগুলো","root":"جلد","lemma":"جُلُود","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":22739,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٢٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২০)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yuṣ''haru bihi mā fī buṭūnihim wal-julūdu', 'যা দিয়ে তাদের পেটে যা আছে তা ও তাদের চামড়া গলিয়ে দেয়া হবে।', 'By which is melted that within their bellies and [their] skins.', 'যা দিয়ে তাদের পেটে যা আছে তা ও তাদের চামড়া গলিয়ে দেয়া হবে।', 'By which is melted that within their bellies and [their] skins.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022020.mp3', now()),
  (22, 21, '', '[{"id":23886,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهُم","transliteration":"walahum","translation_bn":"আর জন্যে তাদের রয়েছে","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهُم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23887,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَّقَـٰمِعُ","transliteration":"maqāmiʿu","translation_bn":"মুগুরগুলো","root":"قمع","lemma":"مَّقَٰمِع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23888,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"(তৈরী) দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23889,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"حَدِيدٍۢ","transliteration":"ḥadīdin","translation_bn":"লোহা","root":"حدد","lemma":"حَدِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23890,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٢١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২১)","root":"—","lemma":"٢١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walahum maqāmiʿu min ḥadīdin', 'উপরন্তু তাদের (শাস্তির) জন্য থাকবে লোহার মুগুর।', 'And for [striking] them are maces of iron.', 'উপরন্তু তাদের (শাস্তির) জন্য থাকবে লোহার মুগুর।', 'And for [striking] them are maces of iron.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022021.mp3', now()),
  (22, 22, '', '[{"id":24888,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"كُلَّمَآ","transliteration":"kullamā","translation_bn":"যখনই","root":"كلل\r","lemma":"كُلَّمَا","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":24889,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرَادُوٓا۟","transliteration":"arādū","translation_bn":"চাইবে তারা","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24890,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":24891,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَخْرُجُوا۟","transliteration":"yakhrujū","translation_bn":"তারা বের হবে","root":"خرج","lemma":"خَرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24892,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهَا","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24893,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কারণে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24894,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"غَمٍّ","transliteration":"ghammin","translation_bn":"যন্ত্রণার","root":"غمم","lemma":"غَمّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":24895,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أُعِيدُوا۟","transliteration":"uʿīdū","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে ফিরিয়ে দেয়া হবে","root":"عود","lemma":"أُعِيدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24896,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24897,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَذُوقُوا۟","transliteration":"wadhūqū","translation_bn":"\"এবং (বলা হবে) তোমরা স্বাদ নাও","root":"ذوق","lemma":"ذَاقُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":24898,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابَ","transliteration":"ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":24899,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَرِيقِ","transliteration":"l-ḥarīqi","translation_bn":"দহনের\"","root":"حرق","lemma":"حَرِيق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24900,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٢٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২২)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'kullamā arādū an yakhrujū min''hā min ghammin uʿīdū fīhā wadhūqū ʿadhāba l-ḥarīqi', 'যখনই তারা যন্ত্রণার চোটে তাত্থেকে বেরিয়ে আসতে চাইবে (তখনই) তাদেরকে তার ভিতরে ফিরিয়ে দেয়া হবে, (আর বলা হবে, আগুনে) পুড়ার শাস্তি আস্বাদন কর।', 'Every time they want to get out of Hellfire from anguish, they will be returned to it, and [it will be said], "Taste the punishment of the Burning Fire!"', 'যখনই তারা যন্ত্রণার চোটে তাত্থেকে বেরিয়ে আসতে চাইবে (তখনই) তাদেরকে তার ভিতরে ফিরিয়ে দেয়া হবে, (আর বলা হবে, আগুনে) পুড়ার শাস্তি আস্বাদন কর।', 'Every time they want to get out of Hellfire from anguish, they will be returned to it, and [it will be said], "Taste the punishment of the Burning Fire!"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022022.mp3', now()),
  (22, 23, '', '[{"id":25946,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":25947,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":25948,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُدْخِلُ","transliteration":"yud''khilu","translation_bn":"প্রবেশ করাবেন","root":"دخل","lemma":"أُدْخِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25949,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":25950,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25951,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"waʿamilū","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":25952,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":25953,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"جَنَّـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"jannātin","translation_bn":"জান্নাতসমূহে","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25954,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَجْرِى","transliteration":"tajrī","translation_bn":"প্রবাহিত হয়","root":"جري","lemma":"جَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25955,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25956,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَحْتِهَا","transliteration":"taḥtihā","translation_bn":"তার নিচ","root":"تحت","lemma":"تَحْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25957,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ","transliteration":"l-anhāru","translation_bn":"ঝর্ণাসমূহ","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":25958,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يُحَلَّوْنَ","transliteration":"yuḥallawna","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে অলংকৃত করা হবে","root":"حلي","lemma":"حُلُّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25959,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25960,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"দ্বারা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25961,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَسَاوِرَ","transliteration":"asāwira","translation_bn":"কঙ্কণ","root":"سور","lemma":"أَسَاوِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25962,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"তৈরি","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25963,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ذَهَبٍۢ","transliteration":"dhahabin","translation_bn":"সোনার","root":"ذهب","lemma":"ذَهَب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25964,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَلُؤْلُؤًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"walu''lu-an","translation_bn":"ও মুক্তার","root":"لالا","lemma":"لُؤْلُؤ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":25966,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَلِبَاسُهُمْ","transliteration":"walibāsuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের পোশাক (হবে)","root":"لبس","lemma":"لِبَاس","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":25967,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25968,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"حَرِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥarīrun","translation_bn":"রেশমের","root":"حرر","lemma":"حَرِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25969,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٢٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna l-laha yud''khilu alladhīna āmanū waʿamilū l-ṣāliḥāti jannātin tajrī min taḥtihā l-anhāru yuḥallawna fīhā min asāwira min dhahabin walu''lu-an walibāsuhum fīhā ḥarīrun', 'যারা ঈমান আনে আর সৎ কাজ করে, আল্লাহ তাদেরকে দাখিল করবেন জান্নাতে যার তলদেশে ঝর্ণাধারা প্রবাহিত। সেখানে তাদেরকে অলংকৃত করা হবে সোনার কাঁকন আর মুক্তা দিয়ে আর সেখানে তাদের পোশাক হবে রেশমের।', 'Indeed, Allah will admit those who believe and do righteous deeds to gardens beneath which rivers flow. They will be adorned therein with bracelets of gold and pearl, and their garments therein will be silk.', 'যারা ঈমান আনে আর সৎ কাজ করে, আল্লাহ তাদেরকে দাখিল করবেন জান্নাতে যার তলদেশে ঝর্ণাধারা প্রবাহিত। সেখানে তাদেরকে অলংকৃত করা হবে সোনার কাঁকন আর মুক্তা দিয়ে আর সেখানে তাদের পোশাক হবে রেশমের।', 'Indeed, Allah will admit those who believe and do righteous deeds to gardens beneath which rivers flow. They will be adorned therein with bracelets of gold and pearl, and their garments therein will be silk.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022023.mp3', now()),
  (22, 24, '', '[{"id":27019,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَهُدُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wahudū","translation_bn":"এবং তাদেরকে সৎপথের দিশা দেয়া হয়েছে","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":27020,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27021,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلطَّيِّبِ","transliteration":"l-ṭayibi","translation_bn":"পবিত্র","root":"طيب","lemma":"طَيِّب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":27022,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27023,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْلِ","transliteration":"l-qawli","translation_bn":"বাণীর (কবুলের)","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":27024,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَهُدُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wahudū","translation_bn":"পরিচালিত করা হয়েছে","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":27025,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27026,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"صِرَٰطِ","transliteration":"ṣirāṭi","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"صرط","lemma":"صِرَٰط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27027,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَمِيدِ","transliteration":"l-ḥamīdi","translation_bn":"প্রশংসিতের (অর্থাৎ আল্লাহর)","root":"حمد","lemma":"حَمِيد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":27028,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٢٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahudū ilā l-ṭayibi mina l-qawli wahudū ilā ṣirāṭi l-ḥamīdi', 'তাদেরকে (দুনিয়ার জীবনে) পথ দেখানো হয়েছিল পবিত্র বাক্যের (অর্থাৎ কালিমা তাইয়্যেবা বা আল-কুরআনের) দিকে আর তারা পরিচালিত হয়েছিল তাঁর পথে যিনি সকল প্রশংসার দাবীদার।', 'And they had been guided [in worldly life] to good speech, and they were guided to the path of the Praiseworthy.', 'তাদেরকে (দুনিয়ার জীবনে) পথ দেখানো হয়েছিল পবিত্র বাক্যের (অর্থাৎ কালিমা তাইয়্যেবা বা আল-কুরআনের) দিকে আর তারা পরিচালিত হয়েছিল তাঁর পথে যিনি সকল প্রশংসার দাবীদার।', 'And they had been guided [in worldly life] to good speech, and they were guided to the path of the Praiseworthy.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022024.mp3', now()),
  (22, 25, '', '[{"id":28005,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":28006,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":28007,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28008,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَيَصُدُّونَ","transliteration":"wayaṣuddūna","translation_bn":"ও বাদা দেয়","root":"صدد","lemma":"صَدَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28009,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28010,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28011,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":28012,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمَسْجِدِ","transliteration":"wal-masjidi","translation_bn":"ও মাসজিদে","root":"سجد","lemma":"مَسْجِد","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28013,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَرَامِ","transliteration":"l-ḥarāmi","translation_bn":"হারাম (হ''তে)","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَام","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28014,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":28015,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"jaʿalnāhu","translation_bn":"আমরা করেছি তা","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28016,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","translation_bn":"জন্যে মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28017,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"سَوَآءً","transliteration":"sawāan","translation_bn":"সমান (অধিকার)","root":"سوي","lemma":"سَوَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28018,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَـٰكِفُ","transliteration":"l-ʿākifu","translation_bn":"(অর্থাৎ যারা) স্থানীয় বাসিন্দা","root":"عكف","lemma":"عَاكِف","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28019,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28020,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْبَادِ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-bādi","translation_bn":"ও বহিরাগত","root":"بدو","lemma":"بَاد","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28022,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"আর যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28023,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يُرِدْ","transliteration":"yurid","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করে","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28024,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28025,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"بِإِلْحَادٍۭ","transliteration":"bi-il''ḥādin","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে পাপ কাজের","root":"لحد","lemma":"إِلْحَاد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28026,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"بِظُلْمٍۢ","transliteration":"biẓul''min","translation_bn":"অন্যায়ভাবে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظُلْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28027,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"نُّذِقْهُ","transliteration":"nudhiq''hu","translation_bn":"তাকে আস্বাদন করাবো আমরা","root":"ذوق","lemma":"أَذَاقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28028,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28029,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٍ","transliteration":"ʿadhābin","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28030,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"alīmin","translation_bn":"নিদারুণ","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":28031,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٢٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna kafarū wayaṣuddūna ʿan sabīli l-lahi wal-masjidi l-ḥarāmi alladhī jaʿalnāhu lilnnāsi sawāan l-ʿākifu fīhi wal-bādi waman yurid fīhi bi-il''ḥādin biẓul''min nudhiq''hu min ʿadhābin alīmin', 'যারা কুফুরী করে আর আল্লাহর পথে (মানুষের চলার ক্ষেত্রে) বাধা সৃষ্টি করে আর মাসজিদে হারামে যেতেও- যাকে আমি করেছি স্থানীয় বাসিন্দা ও অন্যদেশবাসী সকলের জন্য সমান। যে তাতে অন্যায়ভাবে কোন ধর্মদ্রোহী কাজ করার ইচ্ছে করে তাকে আমি আস্বাদন করাব ভয়াবহ শাস্তি।', 'Indeed, those who have disbelieved and avert [people] from the way of Allah and [from] al-Masjid al-Haram, which We made for the people - equal are the resident therein and one from outside; and [also] whoever intends [a deed] therein of deviation [in religion] or wrongdoing - We will make him taste of a painful punishment.', 'যারা কুফুরী করে আর আল্লাহর পথে (মানুষের চলার ক্ষেত্রে) বাধা সৃষ্টি করে আর মাসজিদে হারামে যেতেও- যাকে আমি করেছি স্থানীয় বাসিন্দা ও অন্যদেশবাসী সকলের জন্য সমান। যে তাতে অন্যায়ভাবে কোন ধর্মদ্রোহী কাজ করার ইচ্ছে করে তাকে আমি আস্বাদন করাব ভয়াবহ শাস্তি।', 'Indeed, those who have disbelieved and avert [people] from the way of Allah and [from] al-Masjid al-Haram, which We made for the people - equal are the resident therein and one from outside; and [also] whoever intends [a deed] therein of deviation [in religion] or wrongdoing - We will make him taste of a painful punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022025.mp3', now()),
  (22, 26, '', '[{"id":28920,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذْ","transliteration":"wa-idh","translation_bn":"এবং (স্মরণ করো) যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28921,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بَوَّأْنَا","transliteration":"bawwanā","translation_bn":"আমরা নির্দিষ্ট করেছিলাম","root":"بوا","lemma":"بَوَّأَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28922,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِإِبْرَٰهِيمَ","transliteration":"li-ib''rāhīma","translation_bn":"জন্যে ইব্রাহীমের","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28923,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَكَانَ","transliteration":"makāna","translation_bn":"স্থান","root":"كون","lemma":"مَّكَان","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28924,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَيْتِ","transliteration":"l-bayti","translation_bn":"(কা''বা) ঘরের","root":"بيت","lemma":"بَيْت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28925,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"\"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যবাচক (Intention)"},{"id":28926,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":28927,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تُشْرِكْ","transliteration":"tush''rik","translation_bn":"শিরক করো","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28928,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِى","transliteration":"bī","translation_bn":"সাথে আমার","root":"—","lemma":"بِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28929,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًۭٔا","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কোন কিছুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28930,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَطَهِّرْ","transliteration":"waṭahhir","translation_bn":"ও পবিত্র রাখো","root":"طهر","lemma":"طَهَّرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28931,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بَيْتِىَ","transliteration":"baytiya","translation_bn":"আমার ঘরকে","root":"بيت","lemma":"بَيْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28932,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لِلطَّآئِفِينَ","transliteration":"lilṭṭāifīna","translation_bn":"জন্যে তওয়াফকারীদের","root":"طوف","lemma":"طَا^ئِف","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28933,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْقَآئِمِينَ","transliteration":"wal-qāimīna","translation_bn":"ও (সালাতে) দন্ডায়মানদের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَا^ئِم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28934,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلرُّكَّعِ","transliteration":"wal-rukaʿi","translation_bn":"ও রুকুকারীদের","root":"ركع","lemma":"رَاكِع","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28935,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسُّجُودِ","transliteration":"l-sujūdi","translation_bn":"সিজদাকারীদের (জন্যে)","root":"سجد","lemma":"سُّجُود","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28936,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٢٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idh bawwanā li-ib''rāhīma makāna l-bayti an lā tush''rik bī shayan waṭahhir baytiya lilṭṭāifīna wal-qāimīna wal-rukaʿi l-sujūdi', 'স্মরণ কর যখন আমি ইবরাহীমকে (পবিত্র) গৃহের স্থান চিহ্নিত করে দিয়েছিলাম, (তখন বলেছিলাম) আমার সাথে কোন কিছুকে অংশীদার গণ্য করবে না, আর আমার গৃহকে পবিত্র রাখবে তাওয়াফকারী, নামাযে কিয়ামকারী, রূকু‘কারী ও সেজদাকারীদের জন্য।', 'And [mention, O Muhammad], when We designated for Abraham the site of the House, [saying], "Do not associate anything with Me and purify My House for those who perform Tawaf and those who stand [in prayer] and those who bow and prostrate.', 'স্মরণ কর যখন আমি ইবরাহীমকে (পবিত্র) গৃহের স্থান চিহ্নিত করে দিয়েছিলাম, (তখন বলেছিলাম) আমার সাথে কোন কিছুকে অংশীদার গণ্য করবে না, আর আমার গৃহকে পবিত্র রাখবে তাওয়াফকারী, নামাযে কিয়ামকারী, রূকু‘কারী ও সেজদাকারীদের জন্য।', 'And [mention, O Muhammad], when We designated for Abraham the site of the House, [saying], "Do not associate anything with Me and purify My House for those who perform Tawaf and those who stand [in prayer] and those who bow and prostrate.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022026.mp3', now()),
  (22, 27, '', '[{"id":29788,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَذِّن","transliteration":"wa-adhin","translation_bn":"এবং ঘোষণা দাও","root":"اذن","lemma":"أَذَّنَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29789,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"নিকট","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29790,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29791,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْحَجِّ","transliteration":"bil-ḥaji","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে হজ্জের","root":"حجج","lemma":"حَجّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29792,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتُوكَ","transliteration":"yatūka","translation_bn":"তোমার নিকট আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29793,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رِجَالًۭا","transliteration":"rijālan","translation_bn":"পায়ে হেঁটে","root":"رجل","lemma":"رِجَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29794,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَعَلَىٰ","transliteration":"waʿalā","translation_bn":"ও (চড়ে) উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29795,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সর্ব (প্রকার)","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29796,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ضَامِرٍۢ","transliteration":"ḍāmirin","translation_bn":"ক্ষীণকায় উটের","root":"ضمر","lemma":"ضَامِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29797,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِينَ","transliteration":"yatīna","translation_bn":"তারা আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29798,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29799,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29800,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَجٍّ","transliteration":"fajjin","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"فجج","lemma":"فَجّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29801,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَمِيقٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿamīqin","translation_bn":"দূরদূরান্তের","root":"عمق","lemma":"عَمِيق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":29802,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-adhin fī l-nāsi bil-ḥaji yatūka rijālan waʿalā kulli ḍāmirin yatīna min kulli fajjin ʿamīqin', 'আর মানুষের মাঝে হাজ্জের ঘোষণা দাও, তারা তোমার কাছে আসবে পায়ে হেঁটে, আর সব (পথক্লান্ত) শীর্ণ উটের পিঠে, বহু দূরের গভীর পর্বত সংকুল পথ বেয়ে', 'And proclaim to the people the Hajj [pilgrimage]; they will come to you on foot and on every lean camel; they will come from every distant pass -', 'আর মানুষের মাঝে হাজ্জের ঘোষণা দাও, তারা তোমার কাছে আসবে পায়ে হেঁটে, আর সব (পথক্লান্ত) শীর্ণ উটের পিঠে, বহু দূরের গভীর পর্বত সংকুল পথ বেয়ে', 'And proclaim to the people the Hajj [pilgrimage]; they will come to you on foot and on every lean camel; they will come from every distant pass -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022027.mp3', now()),
  (22, 28, '', '[{"id":30913,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لِّيَشْهَدُوا۟","transliteration":"liyashhadū","translation_bn":"যেন তারা প্রত্যক্ষ করে","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِدَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30914,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَنَـٰفِعَ","transliteration":"manāfiʿa","translation_bn":"উপকারসমূহকে","root":"نفع","lemma":"مَنَٰفِع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30915,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে (এখানে রাখা)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30916,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَيَذْكُرُوا۟","transliteration":"wayadhkurū","translation_bn":"ও স্মরণ করে (যেন)","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30917,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْمَ","transliteration":"is''ma","translation_bn":"নাম","root":"سمو","lemma":"ٱسْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30918,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":30919,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30920,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَيَّامٍۢ","transliteration":"ayyāmin","translation_bn":"দিনগুলোর","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30921,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَّعْلُومَـٰتٍ","transliteration":"maʿlūmātin","translation_bn":"নির্দিষ্ট","root":"علم","lemma":"مَّعْلُومَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":30922,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"(কুরবানির জন্তুর) উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30923,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":30924,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"رَزَقَهُم","transliteration":"razaqahum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে জীবিকা (হিসেবে) দিয়েছেন","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30925,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِّنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30926,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بَهِيمَةِ","transliteration":"bahīmati","translation_bn":"চতুষ্পদ জন্তু","root":"بهم","lemma":"بَهِيمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30927,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-anʿāmi","translation_bn":"গৃহপালিত","root":"نعم","lemma":"نَّعَم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30929,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَكُلُوا۟","transliteration":"fakulū","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তোমরা খাও","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30930,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهَا","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30931,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَأَطْعِمُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-aṭʿimū","translation_bn":"ও খাওয়াও","root":"طعم","lemma":"أَطْعَمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30932,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَآئِسَ","transliteration":"l-bāisa","translation_bn":"দুস্থদেরকে","root":"باس","lemma":"بَا^ئِس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30933,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَقِيرَ","transliteration":"l-faqīra","translation_bn":"অভাবগ্রস্তদেরকে","root":"فقر","lemma":"فَقِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30934,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'liyashhadū manāfiʿa lahum wayadhkurū is''ma l-lahi fī ayyāmin maʿlūmātin ʿalā mā razaqahum min bahīmati l-anʿāmi fakulū min''hā wa-aṭʿimū l-bāisa l-faqīra', 'যাতে তারা তাদের জন্য (এখানে রাখা দুনিয়া ও আখিরাতের) কল্যাণগুলো প্রত্যক্ষ করতে পারে আর তিনি তাদেরকে চতুষ্পদ জন্তু হতে যে রিযক দান করেছেন, নির্দিষ্ট দিনগুলোতে তার উপর আল্লাহর নাম উচ্চারণ করতে পারে। কাজেই তোমরা (নিজেরা) তাত্থেকে খাও আর দুঃস্থ অভাবীদের খাওয়াও।', 'That they may witness benefits for themselves and mention the name of Allah on known days over what He has provided for them of [sacrificial] animals. So eat of them and feed the miserable and poor.', 'যাতে তারা তাদের জন্য (এখানে রাখা দুনিয়া ও আখিরাতের) কল্যাণগুলো প্রত্যক্ষ করতে পারে আর তিনি তাদেরকে চতুষ্পদ জন্তু হতে যে রিযক দান করেছেন, নির্দিষ্ট দিনগুলোতে তার উপর আল্লাহর নাম উচ্চারণ করতে পারে। কাজেই তোমরা (নিজেরা) তাত্থেকে খাও আর দুঃস্থ অভাবীদের খাওয়াও।', 'That they may witness benefits for themselves and mention the name of Allah on known days over what He has provided for them of [sacrificial] animals. So eat of them and feed the miserable and poor.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022028.mp3', now()),
  (22, 29, '', '[{"id":31920,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31921,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لْيَقْضُوا۟","transliteration":"l''yaqḍū","translation_bn":"যেন তারা দূর করে","root":"قضي","lemma":"قَضَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31922,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَفَثَهُمْ","transliteration":"tafathahum","translation_bn":"তাদের অপরিচ্ছন্নতা","root":"تفث","lemma":"تَفَث","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31923,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَلْيُوفُوا۟","transliteration":"walyūfū","translation_bn":"ও যেন তারা পূর্ণ করে","root":"وفي","lemma":"أَوْفَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31924,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نُذُورَهُمْ","transliteration":"nudhūrahum","translation_bn":"তাদের মানতগুলোকে","root":"نذر","lemma":"نُذُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31925,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلْيَطَّوَّفُوا۟","transliteration":"walyaṭṭawwafū","translation_bn":"ও যেন তারা তওয়াফ করে","root":"طوف","lemma":"يَطَّوَّفَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31926,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْبَيْتِ","transliteration":"bil-bayti","translation_bn":"ঘরের","root":"بيت","lemma":"بَيْت","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31927,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَتِيقِ","transliteration":"l-ʿatīqi","translation_bn":"প্রাচীন\"","root":"عتق","lemma":"عَتِيق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31928,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma l''yaqḍū tafathahum walyūfū nudhūrahum walyaṭṭawwafū bil-bayti l-ʿatīqi', 'অতঃপর তারা যেন তাদের দৈহিক অপরিচ্ছন্নতা দূর করে, তাদের মানৎ পূর্ণ করে আর প্রাচীন গৃহের তাওয়াফ করে।', 'Then let them end their untidiness and fulfill their vows and perform Tawaf around the ancient House."', 'অতঃপর তারা যেন তাদের দৈহিক অপরিচ্ছন্নতা দূর করে, তাদের মানৎ পূর্ণ করে আর প্রাচীন গৃহের তাওয়াফ করে।', 'Then let them end their untidiness and fulfill their vows and perform Tawaf around the ancient House."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022029.mp3', now()),
  (22, 30, '', '[{"id":32785,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটাই (বিধান)","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":32786,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"আর যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32787,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُعَظِّمْ","transliteration":"yuʿaẓẓim","translation_bn":"সম্মান করে","root":"عظم","lemma":"يُعَظِّمْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32788,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"حُرُمَـٰتِ","transliteration":"ḥurumāti","translation_bn":"(নির্ধারিত) মর্যাদাসমূহের","root":"حرم","lemma":"حُرُمَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32789,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":32790,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَهُوَ","transliteration":"fahuwa","translation_bn":"তবেই তা (হবে)","root":"—","lemma":"فَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32791,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32792,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32793,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"নিকট","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":32794,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِۦ ۗ","transliteration":"rabbihi","translation_bn":"তার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32796,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَأُحِلَّتْ","transliteration":"wa-uḥillat","translation_bn":"আর হালাল করা হয়েছে","root":"حلل","lemma":"أَحَلَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32797,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمُ","translite