mma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32810,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلزُّورِ","transliteration":"l-zūri","translation_bn":"মিথ্যার","root":"زور","lemma":"زُّور","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32811,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"٣٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩০)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dhālika waman yuʿaẓẓim ḥurumāti l-lahi fahuwa khayrun lahu ʿinda rabbihi wa-uḥillat lakumu l-anʿāmu illā mā yut''lā ʿalaykum fa-ij''tanibū l-rij''sa mina l-awthāni wa-ij''tanibū qawla l-zūri', 'এটাই (হাজ্জ), যে কেউ আল্লাহর নির্ধারিত অনুষ্ঠানগুলোর সম্মান করবে, সেটা তার প্রতিপালকের নিকট তার জন্য উত্তম। চতুষ্পদ জন্তুগুলো তোমাদের জন্য হালাল করা হয়েছে সেগুলো ছাড়া যেগুলোর ব্যাপারে তোমাদেরকে পড়ে শুনানো হয়েছে। কাজেই তোমরা মূর্তিদের অপবিত্রতা বর্জন কর আর মিথ্যে কথা পরিহার কর', 'That [has been commanded], and whoever honors the sacred ordinances of Allah - it is best for him in the sight of his Lord. And permitted to you are the grazing livestock, except what is recited to you. So avoid the uncleanliness of idols and avoid false statement,', 'এটাই (হাজ্জ), যে কেউ আল্লাহর নির্ধারিত অনুষ্ঠানগুলোর সম্মান করবে, সেটা তার প্রতিপালকের নিকট তার জন্য উত্তম। চতুষ্পদ জন্তুগুলো তোমাদের জন্য হালাল করা হয়েছে সেগুলো ছাড়া যেগুলোর ব্যাপারে তোমাদেরকে পড়ে শুনানো হয়েছে। কাজেই তোমরা মূর্তিদের অপবিত্রতা বর্জন কর আর মিথ্যে কথা পরিহার কর', 'That [has been commanded], and whoever honors the sacred ordinances of Allah - it is best for him in the sight of his Lord. And permitted to you are the grazing livestock, except what is recited to you. So avoid the uncleanliness of idols and avoid false statement,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022030.mp3', now()),
  (22, 31, '', '[{"id":33611,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"حُنَفَآءَ","transliteration":"ḥunafāa","translation_bn":"একনিষ্ঠ হয়ে","root":"حنف","lemma":"حَنِيف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33612,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহরই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33613,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرَ","transliteration":"ghayra","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33614,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مُشْرِكِينَ","transliteration":"mush''rikīna","translation_bn":"মুশরিক (হওয়া)","root":"شرك","lemma":"مُشْرِك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33615,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33617,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"আর যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33618,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يُشْرِكْ","transliteration":"yush''rik","translation_bn":"শরীক করে","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33619,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর সাথে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33620,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَكَأَنَّمَا","transliteration":"faka-annamā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যেন","root":"—","lemma":"كَأَنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33621,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"خَرَّ","transliteration":"kharra","translation_bn":"সে পড়ে গেলো","root":"خرر","lemma":"خَرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33622,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33623,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","transliteration":"l-samāi","translation_bn":"আকাশ","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33624,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَتَخْطَفُهُ","transliteration":"fatakhṭafuhu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তাকে ছোঁ মেরে নিয়ে যাবে","root":"خطف","lemma":"خَطِفَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33625,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلطَّيْرُ","transliteration":"l-ṭayru","translation_bn":"পাখি","root":"طير","lemma":"طَيْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33626,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33627,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"تَهْوِى","transliteration":"tahwī","translation_bn":"উড়িয়ে যাবে","root":"هوي","lemma":"هَوَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33628,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بِهِ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"নিয়ে তাকে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33629,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرِّيحُ","transliteration":"l-rīḥu","translation_bn":"বাতাস","root":"روح","lemma":"رِيح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33630,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33631,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مَكَانٍۢ","transliteration":"makānin","translation_bn":"স্থানের","root":"كون","lemma":"مَّكَان","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33632,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"سَحِيقٍۢ","transliteration":"saḥīqin","translation_bn":"দূরবর্তী","root":"سحق","lemma":"سَحِيق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":33633,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"٣١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩১)","root":"—","lemma":"٣١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ḥunafāa lillahi ghayra mush''rikīna bihi waman yush''rik bil-lahi faka-annamā kharra mina l-samāi fatakhṭafuhu l-ṭayru aw tahwī bihi l-rīḥu fī makānin saḥīqin', 'আল্লাহর প্রতি একনিষ্ঠ হয়ে তাঁর সাথে শরীক না করে। যে কেউ আল্লাহর সাথে শরীক করে সে যেন আকাশ থেকে পড়ে গেল, আর পাখী তাকে ছোঁ মেরে নিয়ে গেল কিংবা বাতাস তাকে উড়িয়ে নিয়ে দূরবর্তী স্থানে ছুঁড়ে ফেলে দিল।', 'Inclining [only] to Allah, not associating [anything] with Him. And he who associates with Allah - it is as though he had fallen from the sky and was snatched by the birds or the wind carried him down into a remote place.', 'আল্লাহর প্রতি একনিষ্ঠ হয়ে তাঁর সাথে শরীক না করে। যে কেউ আল্লাহর সাথে শরীক করে সে যেন আকাশ থেকে পড়ে গেল, আর পাখী তাকে ছোঁ মেরে নিয়ে গেল কিংবা বাতাস তাকে উড়িয়ে নিয়ে দূরবর্তী স্থানে ছুঁড়ে ফেলে দিল।', 'Inclining [only] to Allah, not associating [anything] with Him. And he who associates with Allah - it is as though he had fallen from the sky and was snatched by the birds or the wind carried him down into a remote place.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022031.mp3', now()),
  (22, 32, '', '[{"id":34698,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটাই (আসল ব্যাপার)","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":34699,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"আর যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34700,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُعَظِّمْ","transliteration":"yuʿaẓẓim","translation_bn":"সম্মান করে","root":"عظم","lemma":"يُعَظِّمْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34701,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"شَعَـٰٓئِرَ","transliteration":"shaʿāira","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনাবলী কে","root":"شعر","lemma":"شَعَٰ^ئِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34702,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":34703,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّهَا","transliteration":"fa-innahā","translation_bn":"তবে তা নিশ্চয়ই (উৎসারিত হয়)","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34704,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34705,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَقْوَى","transliteration":"taqwā","translation_bn":"তাক্বওয়া","root":"وقي","lemma":"تَقْوَى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34706,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُلُوبِ","transliteration":"l-qulūbi","translation_bn":"অন্তরসমূহের","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34707,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dhālika waman yuʿaẓẓim shaʿāira l-lahi fa-innahā min taqwā l-qulūbi', 'এই (তার অবস্থা), আর যে কেউ আল্লাহর নিদর্শনগুলোকে সম্মান করবে সে তো তার অন্তরস্থিত আল্লাহ-ভীতি থেকেই তা করবে।', 'That [is so]. And whoever honors the symbols of Allah - indeed, it is from the piety of hearts.', 'এই (তার অবস্থা), আর যে কেউ আল্লাহর নিদর্শনগুলোকে সম্মান করবে সে তো তার অন্তরস্থিত আল্লাহ-ভীতি থেকেই তা করবে।', 'That [is so]. And whoever honors the symbols of Allah - indeed, it is from the piety of hearts.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022032.mp3', now()),
  (22, 33, '', '[{"id":35444,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35445,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"মধ্যে এর","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35446,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَنَـٰفِعُ","transliteration":"manāfiʿu","translation_bn":"নানা উপকার","root":"نفع","lemma":"مَنَٰفِع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35447,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"পর্যন্ত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35448,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَجَلٍۢ","transliteration":"ajalin","translation_bn":"সময়","root":"اجل","lemma":"أَجَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35449,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مُّسَمًّۭى","transliteration":"musamman","translation_bn":"নির্দিষ্ট","root":"سمو","lemma":"مُّسَمًّى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35450,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35451,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَحِلُّهَآ","transliteration":"maḥilluhā","translation_bn":"তার (কুরবানির জায়গা)","root":"حلل","lemma":"مَحِلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35452,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"নিকট (অবস্থিত)","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35453,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَيْتِ","transliteration":"l-bayti","translation_bn":"ঘরের","root":"بيت","lemma":"بَيْت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35454,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَتِيقِ","transliteration":"l-ʿatīqi","translation_bn":"প্রাচীন","root":"عتق","lemma":"عَتِيق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35455,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٣٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lakum fīhā manāfiʿu ilā ajalin musamman thumma maḥilluhā ilā l-bayti l-ʿatīqi', 'এতে (অর্থাৎ কুরবানীর পশুতে) তোমাদের জন্য নানান উপকার রয়েছে এক নির্দিষ্ট কাল পর্যন্ত (কুরবানীর জায়গায় পৌঁছা পর্যন্ত তোমরা এই জন্তুগুলোর দ্বারা উপকৃত হতে পার), সর্বশেষে এগুলোর কুরবানীর স্থান হচ্ছে প্রাচীন ঘরের নিকট।', 'For you the animals marked for sacrifice are benefits for a specified term; then their place of sacrifice is at the ancient House.', 'এতে (অর্থাৎ কুরবানীর পশুতে) তোমাদের জন্য নানান উপকার রয়েছে এক নির্দিষ্ট কাল পর্যন্ত (কুরবানীর জায়গায় পৌঁছা পর্যন্ত তোমরা এই জন্তুগুলোর দ্বারা উপকৃত হতে পার), সর্বশেষে এগুলোর কুরবানীর স্থান হচ্ছে প্রাচীন ঘরের নিকট।', 'For you the animals marked for sacrifice are benefits for a specified term; then their place of sacrifice is at the ancient House.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022033.mp3', now()),
  (22, 34, '', '[{"id":36736,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلِكُلِّ","transliteration":"walikulli","translation_bn":"এবং জন্যে প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36737,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أُمَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"ummatin","translation_bn":"জাতির","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36738,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلْنَا","transliteration":"jaʿalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা নির্দিষ্ট করে দিয়েছি","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36739,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَنسَكًۭا","transliteration":"mansakan","translation_bn":"কুরবানির নিয়ম","root":"نسك","lemma":"مَنسَك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36740,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لِّيَذْكُرُوا۟","transliteration":"liyadhkurū","translation_bn":"যেন তারা স্মরণ করে","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36741,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْمَ","transliteration":"is''ma","translation_bn":"নাম","root":"سمو","lemma":"ٱسْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36742,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":36743,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36744,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":36745,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رَزَقَهُم","transliteration":"razaqahum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে জীবিকা দিয়েছেন","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36746,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِّنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36747,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بَهِيمَةِ","transliteration":"bahīmati","translation_bn":"চতুষ্পদজন্তুর","root":"بهم","lemma":"بَهِيمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36748,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-anʿāmi","translation_bn":"গৃহপালিত","root":"نعم","lemma":"نَّعَم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36750,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فَإِلَـٰهُكُمْ","transliteration":"fa-ilāhukum","translation_bn":"অতএব তোমাদের ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36751,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهٌۭ","transliteration":"ilāhun","translation_bn":"ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36752,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَٰحِدٌۭ","transliteration":"wāḥidun","translation_bn":"একই","root":"وحد","lemma":"وَٰحِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":36753,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فَلَهُۥٓ","transliteration":"falahu","translation_bn":"সুতরাং তাঁরই নিকট","root":"—","lemma":"فَلَهُۥٓ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36754,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَسْلِمُوا۟ ۗ","transliteration":"aslimū","translation_bn":"আত্মসমর্পণ করো","root":"سلم","lemma":"أَسْلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36756,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَبَشِّرِ","transliteration":"wabashiri","translation_bn":"আর সুসংবাদ দাও","root":"بشر","lemma":"بُشِّرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36757,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُخْبِتِينَ","transliteration":"l-mukh''bitīna","translation_bn":"(আল্লাহর হুকুমের কাছে) অবনতকারীদের","root":"خبت","lemma":"مُخْبِتِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36758,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walikulli ummatin jaʿalnā mansakan liyadhkurū is''ma l-lahi ʿalā mā razaqahum min bahīmati l-anʿāmi fa-ilāhukum ilāhun wāḥidun falahu aslimū wabashiri l-mukh''bitīna', 'আমি প্রতিটি সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য (কুরবানীর) নিয়ম করে দিয়েছি। তাদেরকে চতুষ্পদ জন্তু হতে যে রিযক্ দেয়া হয়েছে সেগুলোর উপর তারা যেন আল্লাহর নাম উচ্চারণ করে, (এই বিভিন্ন নিয়ম-পদ্ধতির মূল লক্ষ্য কিন্তু এক- আল্লাহর নির্দেশ পালন), কারণ তোমাদের উপাস্য একমাত্র উপাস্য, কাজেই তাঁর কাছেই আত্মসমর্পণ কর আর সুসংবাদ দাও সেই বিনীতদেরকে-', 'And for all religion We have appointed a rite [of sacrifice] that they may mention the name of Allah over what He has provided for them of [sacrificial] animals. For your god is one God, so to Him submit. And, [O Muhammad], give good tidings to the humble [before their Lord]', 'আমি প্রতিটি সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য (কুরবানীর) নিয়ম করে দিয়েছি। তাদেরকে চতুষ্পদ জন্তু হতে যে রিযক্ দেয়া হয়েছে সেগুলোর উপর তারা যেন আল্লাহর নাম উচ্চারণ করে, (এই বিভিন্ন নিয়ম-পদ্ধতির মূল লক্ষ্য কিন্তু এক- আল্লাহর নির্দেশ পালন), কারণ তোমাদের উপাস্য একমাত্র উপাস্য, কাজেই তাঁর কাছেই আত্মসমর্পণ কর আর সুসংবাদ দাও সেই বিনীতদেরকে-', 'And for all religion We have appointed a rite [of sacrifice] that they may mention the name of Allah over what He has provided for them of [sacrificial] animals. For your god is one God, so to Him submit. And, [O Muhammad], give good tidings to the humble [before their Lord]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022034.mp3', now()),
  (22, 35, '', '[{"id":37147,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা (এরূপ যে)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":37148,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":37149,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ذُكِرَ","transliteration":"dhukira","translation_bn":"উল্লেখ করা হয়","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37150,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর (নাম)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":37151,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَجِلَتْ","transliteration":"wajilat","translation_bn":"কেঁপে উঠে","root":"وجل","lemma":"وَجِلَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37152,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبُهُمْ","transliteration":"qulūbuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের অন্তরগুলো","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37153,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلصَّـٰبِرِينَ","transliteration":"wal-ṣābirīna","translation_bn":"ধৈর্য্যধারণকারী (হয়)","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَابِر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37154,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"(এর) উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37155,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":37156,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَصَابَهُمْ","transliteration":"aṣābahum","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর আপতিত হয়","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37157,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمُقِيمِى","transliteration":"wal-muqīmī","translation_bn":"ও প্রতিষ্ঠাকারী (হয়)","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّقِيم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37158,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةِ","transliteration":"l-ṣalati","translation_bn":"সালাত","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37159,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَمِمَّا","transliteration":"wamimmā","translation_bn":"এবং (তা) হ''তে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37160,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"رَزَقْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"razaqnāhum","translation_bn":"তাদের আমরা জীবিকা দিয়েছি","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37161,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يُنفِقُونَ","transliteration":"yunfiqūna","translation_bn":"তারা খরচ করে","root":"نفق","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37162,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٣٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna idhā dhukira l-lahu wajilat qulūbuhum wal-ṣābirīna ʿalā mā aṣābahum wal-muqīmī l-ṣalati wamimmā razaqnāhum yunfiqūna', '‘আল্লাহ’ নামের উল্লেখ হলেই যাদের অন্তরাত্মা কেঁপে উঠে, যারা তাদের বিপদাপদে ধৈর্যধারণ করে, নামায কায়িম করে, আর তাদেরকে আমি যে রিযক্ দিয়েছি তাত্থেকে তারা ব্যয় করে।', 'Who, when Allah is mentioned, their hearts are fearful, and [to] the patient over what has afflicted them, and the establishers of prayer and those who spend from what We have provided them.', '‘আল্লাহ’ নামের উল্লেখ হলেই যাদের অন্তরাত্মা কেঁপে উঠে, যারা তাদের বিপদাপদে ধৈর্যধারণ করে, নামায কায়িম করে, আর তাদেরকে আমি যে রিযক্ দিয়েছি তাত্থেকে তারা ব্যয় করে।', 'Who, when Allah is mentioned, their hearts are fearful, and [to] the patient over what has afflicted them, and the establishers of prayer and those who spend from what We have provided them.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022035.mp3', now()),
  (22, 36, '', '[{"id":38171,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْبُدْنَ","transliteration":"wal-bud''na","translation_bn":"এবং কুরবানির উটগুলো","root":"بدن","lemma":"بُدْن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38172,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلْنَـٰهَا","transliteration":"jaʿalnāhā","translation_bn":"সেগুলোকে আমরা করেছি","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38173,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38174,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38175,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"شَعَـٰٓئِرِ","transliteration":"shaʿāiri","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনাবলীর","root":"شعر","lemma":"شَعَٰ^ئِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38176,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":38177,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের রয়েছে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38178,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38179,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ ۖ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"কল্যাণ","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38181,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَٱذْكُرُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-udh''kurū","translation_bn":"তাই (জবেহ করার সময়) উচ্চারণ করো","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38182,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْمَ","transliteration":"is''ma","translation_bn":"নাম","root":"سمو","lemma":"ٱسْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38183,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":38184,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهَا","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38185,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"صَوَآفَّ ۖ","transliteration":"ṣawāffa","translation_bn":"সারিবদ্ধভাবে (দাঁড়ানো অবস্থায়)","root":"صفف","lemma":"صَوَا^فّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38187,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَإِذَا","transliteration":"fa-idhā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38188,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَجَبَتْ","transliteration":"wajabat","translation_bn":"কাত হয়ে পড়ে","root":"وجب","lemma":"وَجَبَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38189,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"جُنُوبُهَا","transliteration":"junūbuhā","translation_bn":"তাদের পাশগুলো (অর্থাৎ প্রাণ নির্গত হয়)","root":"جنب","lemma":"جَنب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38190,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"فَكُلُوا۟","transliteration":"fakulū","translation_bn":"তখন তোমরাখাও","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38191,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهَا","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38192,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَأَطْعِمُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-aṭʿimū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা খাওয়াও","root":"طعم","lemma":"أَطْعَمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38193,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَانِعَ","transliteration":"l-qāniʿa","translation_bn":"ধৈর্য্যশীল অভাবগ্রস্তকে","root":"قنع","lemma":"قَانِع","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38194,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمُعْتَرَّ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-muʿ''tara","translation_bn":"ও চায় এমন অভাবগ্রস্তকে","root":"عرر","lemma":"مُعْتَرّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38196,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38197,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"سَخَّرْنَـٰهَا","transliteration":"sakharnāhā","translation_bn":"সেগুলোকে আমরা নিয়ন্ত্রিত করেছি","root":"سخر","lemma":"سَخَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38198,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38199,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallakum","translation_bn":"যাতে তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":38200,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"تَشْكُرُونَ","transliteration":"tashkurūna","translation_bn":"শোকর করো","root":"شكر","lemma":"شَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38201,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٣٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wal-bud''na jaʿalnāhā lakum min shaʿāiri l-lahi lakum fīhā khayrun fa-udh''kurū is''ma l-lahi ʿalayhā ṣawāffa fa-idhā wajabat junūbuhā fakulū min''hā wa-aṭʿimū l-qāniʿa wal-muʿ''tara kadhālika sakharnāhā lakum laʿallakum tashkurūna', 'আর (কুরবানীর) উটগুলোকে আমি করেছি আল্লাহর নিদর্শনসমূহের অন্যতম। তাতে তোমাদের জন্য কল্যাণ আছে, কাজেই সারিবদ্ধভাবে দাঁড়ানো অবস্থায় ওগুলোর উপর তোমরা আল্লাহর নাম উচ্চারণ কর। যখন তা পার্শ্বভরে পড়ে যায়, তখন তাথেকে খাও আর যারা (ভিক্ষে না ক’রে) পরিতৃপ্ত থাকে তাদেরকে আর যারা কাকুতি মিনতি ক’রে যাচ্ঞা করে তাদেরকেও খাওয়াও। এভাবে আমি ওগুলোকে তোমাদের অধীন করে দিয়েছি যাতে তোমরা কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ কর।', 'And the camels and cattle We have appointed for you as among the symbols of Allah; for you therein is good. So mention the name of Allah upon them when lined up [for sacrifice]; and when they are [lifeless] on their sides, then eat from them and feed the needy and the beggar. Thus have We subjected them to you that you may be grateful.', 'আর (কুরবানীর) উটগুলোকে আমি করেছি আল্লাহর নিদর্শনসমূহের অন্যতম। তাতে তোমাদের জন্য কল্যাণ আছে, কাজেই সারিবদ্ধভাবে দাঁড়ানো অবস্থায় ওগুলোর উপর তোমরা আল্লাহর নাম উচ্চারণ কর। যখন তা পার্শ্বভরে পড়ে যায়, তখন তাথেকে খাও আর যারা (ভিক্ষে না ক’রে) পরিতৃপ্ত থাকে তাদেরকে আর যারা কাকুতি মিনতি ক’রে যাচ্ঞা করে তাদেরকেও খাওয়াও। এভাবে আমি ওগুলোকে তোমাদের অধীন করে দিয়েছি যাতে তোমরা কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ কর।', 'And the camels and cattle We have appointed for you as among the symbols of Allah; for you therein is good. So mention the name of Allah upon them when lined up [for sacrifice]; and when they are [lifeless] on their sides, then eat from them and feed the needy and the beggar. Thus have We subjected them to you that you may be grateful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022036.mp3', now()),
  (22, 37, '', '[{"id":38881,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَن","transliteration":"lan","translation_bn":"কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":38882,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَنَالَ","transliteration":"yanāla","translation_bn":"পৌঁছে","root":"نيل","lemma":"يَنَالُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38883,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর (নিকট)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":38884,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لُحُومُهَا","transliteration":"luḥūmuhā","translation_bn":"তাদের গোশ্‌তসমূহ","root":"لحم","lemma":"لَحْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38885,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38886,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"دِمَآؤُهَا","transliteration":"dimāuhā","translation_bn":"তাদের রক্ত","root":"دمو","lemma":"دَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38887,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِن","transliteration":"walākin","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38888,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَنَالُهُ","transliteration":"yanāluhu","translation_bn":"তাঁর (নিকট) পৌঁছে","root":"نيل","lemma":"يَنَالُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38889,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلتَّقْوَىٰ","transliteration":"l-taqwā","translation_bn":"তাক্বওয়া","root":"وقي","lemma":"تَقْوَى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38890,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنكُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38892,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38893,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"سَخَّرَهَا","transliteration":"sakharahā","translation_bn":"সেগুলোকে তিনি নিয়ন্ত্রিত করেছেন","root":"سخر","lemma":"سَخَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38894,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38895,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لِتُكَبِّرُوا۟","transliteration":"litukabbirū","translation_bn":"যেন তোমরা শ্রেষ্ঠত্ব ঘোষণা (তাকবীর) করো","root":"كبر","lemma":"كَبِّرْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38896,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":38897,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"সে অনুযায়ী","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38898,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":38899,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"هَدَىٰكُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"hadākum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে পথ দেখিয়েছেন","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38901,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَبَشِّرِ","transliteration":"wabashiri","translation_bn":"আর সুসংবাদ দাও","root":"بشر","lemma":"بُشِّرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38902,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-muḥ''sinīna","translation_bn":"সৎকর্মপরায়ণদেরকে","root":"حسن","lemma":"مُحْسِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38903,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"٣٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lan yanāla l-laha luḥūmuhā walā dimāuhā walākin yanāluhu l-taqwā minkum kadhālika sakharahā lakum litukabbirū l-laha ʿalā mā hadākum wabashiri l-muḥ''sinīna', 'আল্লাহর কাছে ওগুলোর না গোশত পৌঁছে, আর না রক্ত পৌঁছে বরং তাঁর কাছে পৌঁছে তোমাদের তাকওয়া। এভাবে তিনি ওগুলোকে তোমাদের অধীন করে দিয়েছেন যাতে তোমরা আল্লাহর শ্রেষ্ঠত্ব ঘোষণা করতে পার এজন্য যে, তিনি তোমাদেরকে সঠিক পথ দেখিয়েছেন, কাজেই সৎকর্মশীলদেরকে তুমি সুসংবাদ দাও।', 'Their meat will not reach Allah, nor will their blood, but what reaches Him is piety from you. Thus have We subjected them to you that you may glorify Allah for that [to] which He has guided you; and give good tidings to the doers of good.', 'আল্লাহর কাছে ওগুলোর না গোশত পৌঁছে, আর না রক্ত পৌঁছে বরং তাঁর কাছে পৌঁছে তোমাদের তাকওয়া। এভাবে তিনি ওগুলোকে তোমাদের অধীন করে দিয়েছেন যাতে তোমরা আল্লাহর শ্রেষ্ঠত্ব ঘোষণা করতে পার এজন্য যে, তিনি তোমাদেরকে সঠিক পথ দেখিয়েছেন, কাজেই সৎকর্মশীলদেরকে তুমি সুসংবাদ দাও।', 'Their meat will not reach Allah, nor will their blood, but what reaches Him is piety from you. Thus have We subjected them to you that you may glorify Allah for that [to] which He has guided you; and give good tidings to the doers of good.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022037.mp3', now()),
  (22, 38, '', '[{"id":39788,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":39789,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":39790,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُدَٰفِعُ","transliteration":"yudāfiʿu","translation_bn":"প্রতিরোধ করেন","root":"دفع","lemma":"يُدَٰفِعُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39791,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَنِ","transliteration":"ʿani","translation_bn":"(তাদের পক্ষ) হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39792,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":39793,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟ ۗ","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39795,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":39796,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":39797,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":39798,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يُحِبُّ","transliteration":"yuḥibbu","translation_bn":"পছন্দ করেন","root":"حبب","lemma":"أَحْبَبْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39799,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كُلَّ","transliteration":"kulla","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39800,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"خَوَّانٍۢ","transliteration":"khawwānin","translation_bn":"বিশ্বাসঘাতক","root":"خون","lemma":"خَوَّان","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":39801,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كَفُورٍ","transliteration":"kafūrin","translation_bn":"অকৃতজ্ঞকে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":39802,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٣٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna l-laha yudāfiʿu ʿani alladhīna āmanū inna l-laha lā yuḥibbu kulla khawwānin kafūrin', 'আল্লাহ মু’মিনদেরকে রক্ষা করেন (যাবতীয় মন্দ হতে)। আল্লাহ কোন খিয়ানাতকারী, অকৃতজ্ঞকে পছন্দ করেন না।', 'Indeed, Allah defends those who have believed. Indeed, Allah does not like everyone treacherous and ungrateful.', 'আল্লাহ মু’মিনদেরকে রক্ষা করেন (যাবতীয় মন্দ হতে)। আল্লাহ কোন খিয়ানাতকারী, অকৃতজ্ঞকে পছন্দ করেন না।', 'Indeed, Allah defends those who have believed. Indeed, Allah does not like everyone treacherous and ungrateful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022038.mp3', now()),
  (22, 39, '', '[{"id":40583,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أُذِنَ","transliteration":"udhina","translation_bn":"অনুমতি দেয়া হলো","root":"اذن","lemma":"أَذِنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40584,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের (যাদের বিরুদ্ধে)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40585,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُقَـٰتَلُونَ","transliteration":"yuqātalūna","translation_bn":"যুদ্ধ করা হচ্ছে","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَٰتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40586,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِأَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"bi-annahum","translation_bn":"কারণ তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40587,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ظُلِمُوا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"ẓulimū","translation_bn":"নির্যাতিত","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40589,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ","transliteration":"wa-inna","translation_bn":"আর নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40590,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":40591,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"ক্ষেত্রে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40592,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"نَصْرِهِمْ","transliteration":"naṣrihim","translation_bn":"সাহায্যের তাদের","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40593,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَقَدِيرٌ","transliteration":"laqadīrun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই ক্ষমতাবান","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدِير","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":40594,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٣٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'udhina lilladhīna yuqātalūna bi-annahum ẓulimū wa-inna l-laha ʿalā naṣrihim laqadīrun', 'যাদের বিরুদ্ধে যুদ্ধ করা হয় তাদেরকে যুদ্ধের অনুমতি দেয়া হল, কেননা তাদের প্রতি অত্যাচার করা হয়েছে। আল্লাহ তাদেরকে সাহায্য করতে অবশ্যই সক্ষম।', 'Permission [to fight] has been given to those who are being fought, because they were wronged. And indeed, Allah is competent to give them victory.', 'যাদের বিরুদ্ধে যুদ্ধ করা হয় তাদেরকে যুদ্ধের অনুমতি দেয়া হল, কেননা তাদের প্রতি অত্যাচার করা হয়েছে। আল্লাহ তাদেরকে সাহায্য করতে অবশ্যই সক্ষম।', 'Permission [to fight] has been given to those who are being fought, because they were wronged. And indeed, Allah is competent to give them victory.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022039.mp3', now()),
  (22, 40, '', '[{"id":41407,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":41408,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أُخْرِجُوا۟","transliteration":"ukh''rijū","translation_bn":"বের করে দেয়া হয়েছে","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41409,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41410,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"دِيَـٰرِهِم","transliteration":"diyārihim","translation_bn":"তাদের ঘরবাড়িগুলো","root":"دور","lemma":"دَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41411,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"bighayri","translation_bn":"সঙ্গে নয়","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41412,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"حَقٍّ","transliteration":"ḥaqqin","translation_bn":"সত্যের (অন্যায়ভাবে)","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41413,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّآ","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"(তাদের অপরাধ) এছাড়া নয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":41414,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":41415,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُوا۟","transliteration":"yaqūlū","translation_bn":"তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41416,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّنَا","transliteration":"rabbunā","translation_bn":"\"আমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41417,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ۗ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহই\"","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":41419,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْلَا","transliteration":"walawlā","translation_bn":"এবং যদি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41420,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"دَفْعُ","transliteration":"dafʿu","translation_bn":"প্রতিহত করতেন","root":"دفع","lemma":"دَفْع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41421,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":41422,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسَ","transliteration":"l-nāsa","translation_bn":"লোকদের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41423,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضَهُم","transliteration":"baʿḍahum","translation_bn":"তাদের কিছু অংশকে","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41424,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بِبَعْضٍۢ","transliteration":"bibaʿḍin","translation_bn":"(অন্য) কিছু অংশ দ্বারা","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41425,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُدِّمَتْ","transliteration":"lahuddimat","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই বিধ্বস্ত করা হতো","root":"هدم","lemma":"هُدِّمَتْ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":41426,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"صَوَٰمِعُ","transliteration":"ṣawāmiʿu","translation_bn":"সংসার বিরাগীদের উপাসনালয়গুলো","root":"صمع","lemma":"صَوَٰمِع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41427,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَبِيَعٌۭ","transliteration":"wabiyaʿun","translation_bn":"ও গীর্জা","root":"بيع","lemma":"بِيَع","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41428,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَصَلَوَٰتٌۭ","transliteration":"waṣalawātun","translation_bn":"ও ইহুদীদের উপাসনালয়গুলো","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41429,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَمَسَـٰجِدُ","transliteration":"wamasājidu","translation_bn":"এবং মাসজিদসমূহ","root":"سجد","lemma":"مَسْجِد","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41430,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"يُذْكَرُ","transliteration":"yudh''karu","translation_bn":"স্মরণ করা হয়","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41431,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41432,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْمُ","transliteration":"us''mu","translation_bn":"নাম","root":"سمو","lemma":"ٱسْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41433,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":41434,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"كَثِيرًۭا ۗ","transliteration":"kathīran","translation_bn":"অধিক (পরিমাণে)","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":41436,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"وَلَيَنصُرَنَّ","transliteration":"walayanṣuranna","translation_bn":"আর অবশ্যই সাহায্য করবেন","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41437,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":41438,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":41439,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"يَنصُرُهُۥٓ ۗ","transliteration":"yanṣuruhu","translation_bn":"তাঁকে সাহায্য করে","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41441,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":41442,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":41443,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"لَقَوِىٌّ","transliteration":"laqawiyyun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই শক্তিমান","root":"قوي","lemma":"قَوِىّ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":41444,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"عَزِيزٌ","transliteration":"ʿazīzun","translation_bn":"পরাক্রমশালী","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":41445,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"٤٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪০)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna ukh''rijū min diyārihim bighayri ḥaqqin illā an yaqūlū rabbunā l-lahu walawlā dafʿu l-lahi l-nāsa baʿḍahum bibaʿḍin lahuddimat ṣawāmiʿu wabiyaʿun waṣalawātun wamasājidu yudh''karu fīhā us''mu l-lahi kathīran walayanṣuranna l-lahu man yanṣuruhu inna l-laha laqawiyyun ʿazīzun', 'তাদেরকে অন্যায়ভাবে গৃহ থেকে বহিষ্কার করা হয়েছে শুধু তাদের এ কথা বলার কারণে যে, ‘আল্লাহ আমাদের প্রতিপালক।’ আল্লাহ যদি মানুষদের এক দলের দ্বারা অন্য দলকে প্রতিহত না করতেন, তাহলে বিধ্বস্ত হয়ে যেত খ্রীষ্টান সংসারত্যাগীদের উপাসনালয়, গির্জা ও ইয়াহূদীদের উপাসনার স্থান আর মাসজিদসমূহ যেখানে আল্লাহর নাম অধিকহারে স্মরণ করা হয়। আল্লাহ অবশ্যই তাকে সাহায্য করেন যে তাঁকে সাহায্য করে, আল্লাহ শক্তিমান, পরাক্রান্ত।', '[They are] those who have been evicted from their homes without right - only because they say, "Our Lord is Allah." And were it not that Allah checks the people, some by means of others, there would have been demolished monasteries, churches, synagogues, and mosques in which the name of Allah is much mentioned. And Allah will surely support those who support Him. Indeed, Allah is Powerful and Exalted in Might.', 'তাদেরকে অন্যায়ভাবে গৃহ থেকে বহিষ্কার করা হয়েছে শুধু তাদের এ কথা বলার কারণে যে, ‘আল্লাহ আমাদের প্রতিপালক।’ আল্লাহ যদি মানুষদের এক দলের দ্বারা অন্য দলকে প্রতিহত না করতেন, তাহলে বিধ্বস্ত হয়ে যেত খ্রীষ্টান সংসারত্যাগীদের উপাসনালয়, গির্জা ও ইয়াহূদীদের উপাসনার স্থান আর মাসজিদসমূহ যেখানে আল্লাহর নাম অধিকহারে স্মরণ করা হয়। আল্লাহ অবশ্যই তাকে সাহায্য করেন যে তাঁকে সাহায্য করে, আল্লাহ শক্তিমান, পরাক্রান্ত।', '[They are] those who have been evicted from their homes without right - only because they say, "Our Lord is Allah." And were it not that Allah checks the people, some by means of others, there would have been demolished monasteries, churches, synagogues, and mosques in which the name of Allah is much mentioned. And Allah will surely support those who support Him. Indeed, Allah is Powerful and Exalted in Might.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022040.mp3', now()),
  (22, 41, '', '[{"id":42197,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা (সেই লোক)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":42198,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":42199,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَّكَّنَّـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"makkannāhum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে আমরা ক্ষমতা দিই","root":"مكن","lemma":"مَكَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42200,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42201,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42202,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَقَامُوا۟","transliteration":"aqāmū","translation_bn":"তারা প্রতিষ্ঠা করে","root":"قوم","lemma":"أَقَامَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42203,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","translation_bn":"সালাত","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42204,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَءَاتَوُا۟","transliteration":"waātawū","translation_bn":"ও তারা দেয়","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42205,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ","transliteration":"l-zakata","translation_bn":"জাকাত","root":"زكو","lemma":"زَكَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42206,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَأَمَرُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-amarū","translation_bn":"আর তারা নির্দেশ দেয়","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42207,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ","transliteration":"bil-maʿrūfi","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে সৎকাজের","root":"عرف","lemma":"مَّعْرُوف","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42208,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَنَهَوْا۟","transliteration":"wanahaw","translation_bn":"ও তারা নিষেধ করে","root":"نهي","lemma":"نَهَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42209,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَنِ","transliteration":"ʿani","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42210,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُنكَرِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-munkari","translation_bn":"অসৎ কাজ","root":"نكر","lemma":"مُنكَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42212,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَلِلَّهِ","transliteration":"walillahi","translation_bn":"আর আল্লাহরই হাতে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42213,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","translation_bn":"পরিণতি (চূড়ান্ত)","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَٰقِبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42214,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأُمُورِ","transliteration":"l-umūri","translation_bn":"সব ব্যাপারের","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42215,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٤١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪১)","root":"—","lemma":"٤١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna in makkannāhum fī l-arḍi aqāmū l-ṣalata waātawū l-zakata wa-amarū bil-maʿrūfi wanahaw ʿani l-munkari walillahi ʿāqibatu l-umūri', '(এরা হল) যাদেরকে আমি যমীনে প্রতিষ্ঠিত করলে তারা নামায প্রতিষ্ঠা করে, যাকাত প্রদান করে, সৎ কাজের আদেশ দেয় ও মন্দ কাজে নিষেধ করে, সকল কাজের শেষ পরিণাম (ও সিদ্ধান্ত) আল্লাহর হাতে নিবদ্ধ।', '[And they are] those who, if We give them authority in the land, establish prayer and give zakah and enjoin what is right and forbid what is wrong. And to Allah belongs the outcome of [all] matters.', '(এরা হল) যাদেরকে আমি যমীনে প্রতিষ্ঠিত করলে তারা নামায প্রতিষ্ঠা করে, যাকাত প্রদান করে, সৎ কাজের আদেশ দেয় ও মন্দ কাজে নিষেধ করে, সকল কাজের শেষ পরিণাম (ও সিদ্ধান্ত) আল্লাহর হাতে নিবদ্ধ।', '[And they are] those who, if We give them authority in the land, establish prayer and give zakah and enjoin what is right and forbid what is wrong. And to Allah belongs the outcome of [all] matters.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022041.mp3', now()),
  (22, 42, '', '[{"id":43043,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"আর (হে নাবী) যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43044,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُكَذِّبُوكَ","transliteration":"yukadhibūka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে মিথ্যারোপ করে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43045,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَقَدْ","transliteration":"faqad","translation_bn":"(তবে আশ্চর্য কি) নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43046,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّبَتْ","transliteration":"kadhabat","translation_bn":"মিথ্যারোপ করেছিলো","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43047,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلَهُمْ","transliteration":"qablahum","translation_bn":"তাদের পূর্বেও","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":43048,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمُ","transliteration":"qawmu","translation_bn":"জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43049,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نُوحٍۢ","transliteration":"nūḥin","translation_bn":"নূহের","root":"—","lemma":"نُوح","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":43050,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَعَادٌۭ","transliteration":"waʿādun","translation_bn":"ও আদ","root":"عود","lemma":"عَاد2","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43051,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَثَمُودُ","transliteration":"wathamūdu","translation_bn":"ও সামূদ","root":"—","lemma":"ثَمُود","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43052,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٤٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪২)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-in yukadhibūka faqad kadhabat qablahum qawmu nūḥin waʿādun wathamūdu', 'লোকেরা যদি তোমাকে অস্বীকার করে তাহলে (জেনে রেখ এটা কোন নতুন ব্যাপার নয়) তাদের পূর্বে নূহ, ‘আদ ও সামূদ সম্প্রদায়ও (তাদের রসূলদের) অস্বীকার করেছিল।', 'And if they deny you, [O Muhammad] - so, before them, did the people of Noah and ''Aad and Thamud deny [their prophets],', 'লোকেরা যদি তোমাকে অস্বীকার করে তাহলে (জেনে রেখ এটা কোন নতুন ব্যাপার নয়) তাদের পূর্বে নূহ, ‘আদ ও সামূদ সম্প্রদায়ও (তাদের রসূলদের) অস্বীকার করেছিল।', 'And if they deny you, [O Muhammad] - so, before them, did the people of Noah and ''Aad and Thamud deny [their prophets],', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022042.mp3', now()),
  (22, 43, '', '[{"id":43692,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَوْمُ","transliteration":"waqawmu","translation_bn":"এবং জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43693,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","transliteration":"ib''rāhīma","translation_bn":"ইব্রাহীমের","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":43694,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَقَوْمُ","transliteration":"waqawmu","translation_bn":"ও জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43695,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لُوطٍۢ","transliteration":"lūṭin","translation_bn":"লূতের","root":"—","lemma":"لُوط","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":43696,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٤٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqawmu ib''rāhīma waqawmu lūṭin', 'আর ইবরাহীমের সম্প্রদায় ও লূতের সম্প্রদায়ও (অস্বীকার করেছিল)।', 'And the people of Abraham and the people of Lot', 'আর ইবরাহীমের সম্প্রদায় ও লূতের সম্প্রদায়ও (অস্বীকার করেছিল)।', 'And the people of Abraham and the people of Lot', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022043.mp3', now()),
  (22, 44, '', '[{"id":44460,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَصْحَـٰبُ","transliteration":"wa-aṣḥābu","translation_bn":"এবং অধিবাসীরা","root":"صحب","lemma":"أَصْحَٰب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44461,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَدْيَنَ ۖ","transliteration":"madyana","translation_bn":"মাদইয়ানের","root":"—","lemma":"مَدْيَن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":44463,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَكُذِّبَ","transliteration":"wakudhiba","translation_bn":"এবং মিথ্যারোপ করা হয়েছিলো","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44464,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসাকেও","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":44465,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَأَمْلَيْتُ","transliteration":"fa-amlaytu","translation_bn":"অতঃএব আমি অবকাশ দিয়েছিলাম","root":"ملو","lemma":"أَمْلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44466,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"lil''kāfirīna","translation_bn":"জন্যে কাফিরদের","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44467,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44468,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَخَذْتُهُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"akhadhtuhum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে আমি পাকড়াও করেছিলাম","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44470,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَكَيْفَ","transliteration":"fakayfa","translation_bn":"(ভেবে দেখো) তখন কেমন","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44471,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44472,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"نَكِيرِ","transliteration":"nakīri","translation_bn":"আমার শাস্তি","root":"نكر","lemma":"نَكِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44473,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٤٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-aṣḥābu madyana wakudhiba mūsā fa-amlaytu lil''kāfirīna thumma akhadhtuhum fakayfa kāna nakīri', 'আর মাদইয়ানবাসীরাও [অস্বীকার করেছিল যারা ছিল শু‘আয়ব (আঃ)-এর সম্প্রদায়], আর মূসাকেও অস্বীকার করা হয়েছিল। আমি অস্বীকারকারীদেরকে সময়- সুযোগ দিয়েছিলাম, অতঃপর তাদেরকে পাকড়াও করেছিলাম। কত ভীষণ ছিল আমাকে অস্বীকার করার পরিণতি!', 'And the inhabitants of Madyan. And Moses was denied, so I prolonged enjoyment for the disbelievers; then I seized them, and how [terrible] was My reproach.', 'আর মাদইয়ানবাসীরাও [অস্বীকার করেছিল যারা ছিল শু‘আয়ব (আঃ)-এর সম্প্রদায়], আর মূসাকেও অস্বীকার করা হয়েছিল। আমি অস্বীকারকারীদেরকে সময়- সুযোগ দিয়েছিলাম, অতঃপর তাদেরকে পাকড়াও করেছিলাম। কত ভীষণ ছিল আমাকে অস্বীকার করার পরিণতি!', 'And the inhabitants of Madyan. And Moses was denied, so I prolonged enjoyment for the disbelievers; then I seized them, and how [terrible] was My reproach.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022044.mp3', now()),
  (22, 45, '', '[{"id":44921,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَكَأَيِّن","transliteration":"faka-ayyin","translation_bn":"অতঃপর কতই না","root":"—","lemma":"كَأَيِّن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44922,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44923,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَرْيَةٍ","transliteration":"qaryatin","translation_bn":"জনপদ","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44924,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلَكْنَـٰهَا","transliteration":"ahlaknāhā","translation_bn":"তা আমরা ধ্বংস করেছি","root":"هلك","lemma":"أَهْلَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44925,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَهِىَ","transliteration":"wahiya","translation_bn":"যখন তা (ছিলো)","root":"—","lemma":"وَهِىَ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":44926,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ظَالِمَةٌۭ","transliteration":"ẓālimatun","translation_bn":"অপরাধী","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44927,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَهِىَ","transliteration":"fahiya","translation_bn":"ফলে তা","root":"—","lemma":"فَهِىَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44928,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"خَاوِيَةٌ","transliteration":"khāwiyatun","translation_bn":"ধ্বংসপ্রাপ্ত","root":"خوي","lemma":"خَاوِيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44929,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44930,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عُرُوشِهَا","transliteration":"ʿurūshihā","translation_bn":"তার ছাদসমূহের","root":"عرش","lemma":"عَرْش","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44931,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَبِئْرٍۢ","transliteration":"wabi''rin","translation_bn":"এবং কূপ","root":"بار","lemma":"بِئْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44932,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مُّعَطَّلَةٍۢ","transliteration":"muʿaṭṭalatin","translation_bn":"পরিত্যক্ত (হয়েছে)","root":"عطل","lemma":"مُّعَطَّلَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44933,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَقَصْرٍۢ","transliteration":"waqaṣrin","translation_bn":"ও প্রাসাদ","root":"قصر","lemma":"قَصْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44934,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مَّشِيدٍ","transliteration":"mashīdin","translation_bn":"সুদৃঢ় (বিধ্বস্ত হয়েছে)","root":"شيد","lemma":"مَّشِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44935,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٤٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'faka-ayyin min qaryatin ahlaknāhā wahiya ẓālimatun fahiya khāwiyatun ʿalā ʿurūshihā wabi''rin muʿaṭṭalatin waqaṣrin mashīdin', 'আমি কত জনবসতিকে ধ্বংস করেছি যেগুলোর অধিবাসীরা ছিল যালিম, সেগুলো ছাদের ভরে পতিত হয়ে বিধ্বস্ত হয়েছিল, বিরাণ হয়েছিল কত কূপ আর সুউচ্চ সুদৃঢ় প্রাসাদরাজি।', 'And how many a city did We destroy while it was committing wrong - so it is [now] fallen into ruin - and [how many] an abandoned well and [how many] a lofty palace.', 'আমি কত জনবসতিকে ধ্বংস করেছি যেগুলোর অধিবাসীরা ছিল যালিম, সেগুলো ছাদের ভরে পতিত হয়ে বিধ্বস্ত হয়েছিল, বিরাণ হয়েছিল কত কূপ আর সুউচ্চ সুদৃঢ় প্রাসাদরাজি।', 'And how many a city did We destroy while it was committing wrong - so it is [now] fallen into ruin - and [how many] an abandoned well and [how many] a lofty palace.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022045.mp3', now()),
  (22, 46, '', '[{"id":45922,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَمْ","transliteration":"afalam","translation_bn":"কি তবে নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":45923,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَسِيرُوا۟","transliteration":"yasīrū","translation_bn":"তারা ভ্রমণ করে","root":"سير","lemma":"سَارَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45924,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45925,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"জমীনে","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45926,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَتَكُونَ","transliteration":"fatakūna","translation_bn":"তাহ''লে হতো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":45927,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45928,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبٌۭ","transliteration":"qulūbun","translation_bn":"অন্তরসমূহ (এমন যে)","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45929,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَعْقِلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿqilūna","translation_bn":"বুঝতো","root":"عقل","lemma":"عَقَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45930,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِهَآ","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"দিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَآ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45931,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45932,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ءَاذَانٌۭ","transliteration":"ādhānun","translation_bn":"কানগুলো","root":"اذن","lemma":"أُذُنٌ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45933,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَسْمَعُونَ","transliteration":"yasmaʿūna","translation_bn":"শুনতো","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45934,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا ۖ","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"দিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45936,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّهَا","transliteration":"fa-innahā","translation_bn":"বস্তুতঃ তা অবশ্যই (এমন যে)","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45937,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":45938,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَى","transliteration":"taʿmā","translation_bn":"অন্ধ হয়","root":"عمي","lemma":"عَمِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45939,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَبْصَـٰرُ","transliteration":"l-abṣāru","translation_bn":"চোখগুলো","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45940,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِن","transliteration":"walākin","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45941,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَى","transliteration":"taʿmā","translation_bn":"অন্ধ হয়","root":"عمي","lemma":"عَمِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45942,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُلُوبُ","transliteration":"l-qulūbu","translation_bn":"অন্তরগুলো","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45943,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّتِى","transliteration":"allatī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":45944,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45945,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصُّدُورِ","transliteration":"l-ṣudūri","translation_bn":"বুকসমূহের","root":"صدر","lemma":"صَدْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45946,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"٤٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'afalam yasīrū fī l-arḍi fatakūna lahum qulūbun yaʿqilūna bihā aw ādhānun yasmaʿūna bihā fa-innahā lā taʿmā l-abṣāru walākin taʿmā l-qulūbu allatī fī l-ṣudūri', 'তারা কি যমীনে ভ্রমণ করে না? তাহলে তারা হৃদয় দিয়ে বুঝতে পারত, আর তাদের কান শুনতে পারত। প্রকৃতপক্ষে চোখ অন্ধ নয়, বরং বুকের ভিতর যে হৃদয় আছে তা-ই অন্ধ।', 'So have they not traveled through the earth and have hearts by which to reason and ears by which to hear? For indeed, it is not eyes that are blinded, but blinded are the hearts which are within the breasts.', 'তারা কি যমীনে ভ্রমণ করে না? তাহলে তারা হৃদয় দিয়ে বুঝতে পারত, আর তাদের কান শুনতে পারত। প্রকৃতপক্ষে চোখ অন্ধ নয়, বরং বুকের ভিতর যে হৃদয় আছে তা-ই অন্ধ।', 'So have they not traveled through the earth and have hearts by which to reason and ears by which to hear? For indeed, it is not eyes that are blinded, but blinded are the hearts which are within the breasts.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022046.mp3', now()),
  (22, 47, '', '[{"id":46577,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَسْتَعْجِلُونَكَ","transliteration":"wayastaʿjilūnaka","translation_bn":"আর তোমাকে তাড়াতাড়ি করতে বলে","root":"عجل","lemma":"ٱسْتَعْجَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46578,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْعَذَابِ","transliteration":"bil-ʿadhābi","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46579,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَلَن","transliteration":"walan","translation_bn":"অথচ কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46580,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يُخْلِفَ","transliteration":"yukh''lifa","translation_bn":"ভঙ্গ করবেন","root":"خلف","lemma":"أَخْلَفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46581,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":46582,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَعْدَهُۥ ۚ","transliteration":"waʿdahu","translation_bn":"তাঁর প্রতিজ্ঞা","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46584,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ","transliteration":"wa-inna","translation_bn":"আর নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46585,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمًا","transliteration":"yawman","translation_bn":"সেদিন (হবে)","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46586,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"নিকট","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":46587,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46588,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كَأَلْفِ","transliteration":"ka-alfi","translation_bn":"মতো এক হাজার","root":"الف","lemma":"أَلْف","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46589,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"سَنَةٍۢ","transliteration":"sanatin","translation_bn":"বছর","root":"سنو","lemma":"سَنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46590,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46591,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"تَعُدُّونَ","transliteration":"taʿuddūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা গণনা করো","root":"عدد","lemma":"عَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46592,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٤٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayastaʿjilūnaka bil-ʿadhābi walan yukh''lifa l-lahu waʿdahu wa-inna yawman ʿinda rabbika ka-alfi sanatin mimmā taʿuddūna', 'তারা তোমাকে তাড়াতাড়ি শাস্তি নিয়ে আসতে বলে (কিন্তু শাস্তি তো আসবে আল্লাহর ও‘য়াদা অনুযায়ী নির্দিষ্ট সময়ে), কেননা আল্লাহ কক্ষনো তাঁর ওয়া‘দা খেলাফ করেন না, তোমার প্রতিপালকের একদিন হল তোমাদের গণনায় এক হাজার বছরের সমান।', 'And they urge you to hasten the punishment. But Allah will never fail in His promise. And indeed, a day with your Lord is like a thousand years of those which you count.', 'তারা তোমাকে তাড়াতাড়ি শাস্তি নিয়ে আসতে বলে (কিন্তু শাস্তি তো আসবে আল্লাহর ও‘য়াদা অনুযায়ী নির্দিষ্ট সময়ে), কেননা আল্লাহ কক্ষনো তাঁর ওয়া‘দা খেলাফ করেন না, তোমার প্রতিপালকের একদিন হল তোমাদের গণনায় এক হাজার বছরের সমান।', 'And they urge you to hasten the punishment. But Allah will never fail in His promise. And indeed, a day with your Lord is like a thousand years of those which you count.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022047.mp3', now()),
  (22, 48, '', '[{"id":47345,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَأَيِّن","transliteration":"waka-ayyin","translation_bn":"আর কত","root":"—","lemma":"كَأَيِّن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47346,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47347,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَرْيَةٍ","transliteration":"qaryatin","translation_bn":"জনবসতির (এমন ছিলো)","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47348,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَمْلَيْتُ","transliteration":"amlaytu","translation_bn":"আমি অবকাশ দিয়েছি","root":"ملو","lemma":"أَمْلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47349,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَهَا","transliteration":"lahā","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47350,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَهِىَ","transliteration":"wahiya","translation_bn":"যখন তা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهِىَ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":47351,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ظَالِمَةٌۭ","transliteration":"ẓālimatun","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী (ছিলো)","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47352,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47353,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَخَذْتُهَا","transliteration":"akhadhtuhā","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে আমি পাকড়াও করেছি","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47354,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَإِلَىَّ","transliteration":"wa-ilayya","translation_bn":"আর নিকট আমারই","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47355,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَصِيرُ","transliteration":"l-maṣīru","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাবর্তন (সকলেরই)","root":"صير","lemma":"مَصِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47356,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٤٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waka-ayyin min qaryatin amlaytu lahā wahiya ẓālimatun thumma akhadhtuhā wa-ilayya l-maṣīru', 'আমি কত জনপদকে সময়-সুযোগ দিয়েছি যখন তারা ছিল অন্যায় কাজে লিপ্ত। অতঃপর সেগুলোকে পাকড়াও করেছিলাম, (পালিয়ে কেউ তো কোথাও যেতে পারবে না) কেননা (সকলের) প্রত্যাবর্তন আমারই কাছে।', 'And for how many a city did I prolong enjoyment while it was committing wrong. Then I seized it, and to Me is the [final] destination.', 'আমি কত জনপদকে সময়-সুযোগ দিয়েছি যখন তারা ছিল অন্যায় কাজে লিপ্ত। অতঃপর সেগুলোকে পাকড়াও করেছিলাম, (পালিয়ে কেউ তো কোথাও যেতে পারবে না) কেননা (সকলের) প্রত্যাবর্তন আমারই কাছে।', 'And for how many a city did I prolong enjoyment while it was committing wrong. Then I seized it, and to Me is the [final] destination.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022048.mp3', now()),
  (22, 49, '', '[{"id":47890,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"(হে নাবী) বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47891,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"\"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":47892,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسُ","transliteration":"l-nāsu","translation_bn":"\"মানবজাতি","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47893,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَآ","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"মূলতঃ","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":47894,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنَا۠","transliteration":"anā","translation_bn":"আমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":47895,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47896,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نَذِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"nadhīrun","translation_bn":"একজন সতর্ককারী","root":"نذر","lemma":"نَذِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47897,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٌۭ","transliteration":"mubīnun","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট\"","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47898,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul yāayyuhā l-nāsu innamā anā lakum nadhīrun mubīnun', 'বল, ‘হে মানুষ! আমি (প্রেরিত হয়েছি) তোমাদের জন্য এক সুস্পষ্ট সতর্ককারীরূপে।’', 'Say, "O people, I am only to you a clear warner."', 'বল, ‘হে মানুষ! আমি (প্রেরিত হয়েছি) তোমাদের জন্য এক সুস্পষ্ট সতর্ককারীরূপে।’', 'Say, "O people, I am only to you a clear warner."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022049.mp3', now()),
  (22, 50, '', '[{"id":48376,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"fa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48377,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48378,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"waʿamilū","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48379,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","translation_bn":"সৎকাজসমূহের","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48380,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَهُم","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48381,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَّغْفِرَةٌۭ","transliteration":"maghfiratun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমা","root":"غفر","lemma":"مَّغْفِرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48382,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَرِزْقٌۭ","transliteration":"wariz''qun","translation_bn":"ও জীবিকা","root":"رزق","lemma":"رِزْق","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48383,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَرِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"karīmun","translation_bn":"সম্মানজনক","root":"كرم","lemma":"كَرِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":48384,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٥٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫০)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-alladhīna āmanū waʿamilū l-ṣāliḥāti lahum maghfiratun wariz''qun karīmun', 'কাজেই যারা ঈমান আনবে আর সৎ কাজ করবে তাদের জন্য কেবল আছে ক্ষমা আর সম্মানজনক জীবিকা।', 'And those who have believed and done righteous deeds - for them is forgiveness and noble provision.', 'কাজেই যারা ঈমান আনবে আর সৎ কাজ করবে তাদের জন্য কেবল আছে ক্ষমা আর সম্মানজনক জীবিকা।', 'And those who have believed and done righteous deeds - for them is forgiveness and noble provision.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022050.mp3', now()),
  (22, 51, '', '[{"id":49230,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"আর যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49231,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"سَعَوْا۟","transliteration":"saʿaw","translation_bn":"চেষ্টা করে","root":"سعي","lemma":"سَعَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49232,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49233,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"āyātinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের আয়াত সমূহের","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49234,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مُعَـٰجِزِينَ","transliteration":"muʿājizīna","translation_bn":"ব্যর্থ করে দেখাতে","root":"عجز","lemma":"مُعَٰجِزِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49235,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসবলোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":49236,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَصْحَـٰبُ","transliteration":"aṣḥābu","translation_bn":"অধিবাসী","root":"صحب","lemma":"أَصْحَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49237,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَحِيمِ","transliteration":"l-jaḥīmi","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামের","root":"جحم","lemma":"جَحِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49238,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٥١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫১)","root":"—","lemma":"٥١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna saʿaw fī āyātinā muʿājizīna ulāika aṣḥābu l-jaḥīmi', 'আর যারা আমার নিদর্শনের বিরুদ্ধে চেষ্টা চালায়, সেগুলোর উদ্দেশ্যকে ব্যর্থ করার জন্য, তারাই হল জাহান্নামের বাসিন্দা।', 'But the ones who strove against Our verses, [seeking] to cause failure - those are the companions of Hellfire.', 'আর যারা আমার নিদর্শনের বিরুদ্ধে চেষ্টা চালায়, সেগুলোর উদ্দেশ্যকে ব্যর্থ করার জন্য, তারাই হল জাহান্নামের বাসিন্দা।', 'But the ones who strove against Our verses, [seeking] to cause failure - those are the companions of Hellfire.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022051.mp3', now()),
  (22, 52, '', '[{"id":49904,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49905,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَا","transliteration":"arsalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা পাঠিয়েছি","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49906,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49907,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِكَ","transliteration":"qablika","translation_bn":"তোমার পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49908,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোন","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49909,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَّسُولٍۢ","transliteration":"rasūlin","translation_bn":"রাসূলকে","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49910,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49911,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"نَبِىٍّ","transliteration":"nabiyyin","translation_bn":"কোন নাবীকে","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَّبِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49912,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّآ","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া যে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":49913,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":49914,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَمَنَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"tamannā","translation_bn":"আকাঙ্ক্ষা করেছে (তিলাওয়াত করেছে)","root":"مني","lemma":"تَمَنَّىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49915,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَلْقَى","transliteration":"alqā","translation_bn":"ছুঁড়ে দিয়েছে","root":"لقي","lemma":"أَلْقَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49916,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","translation_bn":"শয়তান (প্রতিবন্ধকতা)","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49917,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49918,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أُمْنِيَّتِهِۦ","transliteration":"um''niyyatihi","translation_bn":"তার আকাঙ্ক্ষার (তিলাওয়াতে)","root":"مني","lemma":"أُمْنِيَّت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49919,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَيَنسَخُ","transliteration":"fayansakhu","translation_bn":"তখন দূর করেছেন","root":"نسخ","lemma":"يَنسَخُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49920,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":49921,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":49922,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يُلْقِى","transliteration":"yul''qī","translation_bn":"ছুঁড়ে  দেয়","root":"لقي","lemma":"أَلْقَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49923,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","translation_bn":"শয়তান","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49924,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49925,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"يُحْكِمُ","transliteration":"yuḥ''kimu","translation_bn":"সুদৃঢ় করেন","root":"حكم","lemma":"أُحْكِمَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49926,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":49927,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ ۗ","transliteration":"āyātihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর আয়াতকে","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49929,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"আর আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49930,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"জ্ঞানময়","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":49931,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"حَكِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞাময়","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":49932,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٥٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫২)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā arsalnā min qablika min rasūlin walā nabiyyin illā idhā tamannā alqā l-shayṭānu fī um''niyyatihi fayansakhu l-lahu mā yul''qī l-shayṭānu thumma yuḥ''kimu l-lahu āyātihi wal-lahu ʿalīmun ḥakīmun', 'আমি তোমার পূর্বে যে সব রসূল কিংবা নবী পাঠিয়েছি তাদের কেউ যখনই কোন আকাঙ্ক্ষা করেছে তখনই শয়ত্বান তার আকাঙ্ক্ষায় (প্রতিবন্ধকতা, সন্দেহ-সংশয়) নিক্ষেপ করেছে, কিন্তু শয়ত্বান যা নিক্ষেপ করে আল্লাহ তা মুছে দেন, অতঃপর আল্লাহ তাঁর নিদর্শনসমূহকে সুপ্রতিষ্ঠিত করেন। কারণ আল্লাহ সর্বজ্ঞ, সর্বশ্রেষ্ঠ হিকমতওয়ালা।', 'And We did not send before you any messenger or prophet except that when he spoke [or recited], Satan threw into it [some misunderstanding]. But Allah abolishes that which Satan throws in; then Allah makes precise His verses. And Allah is Knowing and Wise.', 'আমি তোমার পূর্বে যে সব রসূল কিংবা নবী পাঠিয়েছি তাদের কেউ যখনই কোন আকাঙ্ক্ষা করেছে তখনই শয়ত্বান তার আকাঙ্ক্ষায় (প্রতিবন্ধকতা, সন্দেহ-সংশয়) নিক্ষেপ করেছে, কিন্তু শয়ত্বান যা নিক্ষেপ করে আল্লাহ তা মুছে দেন, অতঃপর আল্লাহ তাঁর নিদর্শনসমূহকে সুপ্রতিষ্ঠিত করেন। কারণ আল্লাহ সর্বজ্ঞ, সর্বশ্রেষ্ঠ হিকমতওয়ালা।', 'And We did not send before you any messenger or prophet except that when he spoke [or recited], Satan threw into it [some misunderstanding]. But Allah abolishes that which Satan throws in; then Allah makes precise His verses. And Allah is Knowing and Wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022052.mp3', now()),
  (22, 53, '', '[{"id":50505,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لِّيَجْعَلَ","transliteration":"liyajʿala","translation_bn":"(এরূপ এজন্যে হয়) যেন তিনি বানিয়ে দেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50506,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":50507,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُلْقِى","transliteration":"yul''qī","translation_bn":"ছুঁড়ে দেয়","root":"لقي","lemma":"أَلْقَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50508,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","translation_bn":"শয়তান","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50509,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِتْنَةًۭ","transliteration":"fit''natan","translation_bn":"পরীক্ষাস্বরূপ","root":"فتن","lemma":"فِتْنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50510,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِّلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50511,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50512,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِهِم","transliteration":"qulūbihim","translation_bn":"যাদের অন্তরসমূহে","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50513,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَّرَضٌۭ","transliteration":"maraḍun","translation_bn":"রোগ","root":"مرض","lemma":"مَّرَض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50514,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْقَاسِيَةِ","transliteration":"wal-qāsiyati","translation_bn":"এবং পাষাণ (হয়েছে)","root":"قسو","lemma":"قَٰسِيَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50515,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبُهُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"qulūbuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের অন্তরগুলো","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50517,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ","transliteration":"wa-inna","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50518,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীরা","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50519,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَفِى","transliteration":"lafī","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":50520,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"شِقَاقٍۭ","transliteration":"shiqāqin","translation_bn":"(সত্যের) বিরোধিতার","root":"شقق","lemma":"شِقَاق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50521,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بَعِيدٍۢ","transliteration":"baʿīdin","translation_bn":"বহুদূরে (অগ্রসর হয়ে গিয়েছে)","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":50522,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٥٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'liyajʿala mā yul''qī l-shayṭānu fit''natan lilladhīna fī qulūbihim maraḍun wal-qāsiyati qulūbuhum wa-inna l-ẓālimīna lafī shiqāqin baʿīdin', '(তিনি এটা হতে দেন এজন্য) যাতে তিনি শয়ত্বান যা মিশিয়ে দিয়েছে তা দ্বারা পরীক্ষা করতে পারেন তাদেরকে যাদের অন্তরে (মুনাফিকীর) ব্যাধি আছে, যারা শক্ত হৃদয়ের। অন্যায়কারীরা চরম মতভেদে লিপ্ত আছে।', '[That is] so He may make what Satan throws in a trial for those within whose hearts is disease and those hard of heart. And indeed, the wrongdoers are in extreme dissension.', '(তিনি এটা হতে দেন এজন্য) যাতে তিনি শয়ত্বান যা মিশিয়ে দিয়েছে তা দ্বারা পরীক্ষা করতে পারেন তাদেরকে যাদের অন্তরে (মুনাফিকীর) ব্যাধি আছে, যারা শক্ত হৃদয়ের। অন্যায়কারীরা চরম মতভেদে লিপ্ত আছে।', '[That is] so He may make what Satan throws in a trial for those within whose hearts is disease and those hard of heart. And indeed, the wrongdoers are in extreme dissension.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022053.mp3', now()),
  (22, 54, '', '[{"id":51244,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلِيَعْلَمَ","transliteration":"waliyaʿlama","translation_bn":"আর যেন জানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51245,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":51246,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أُوتُوا۟","transliteration":"ūtū","translation_bn":"দেয়া হয়েছে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51247,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعِلْمَ","transliteration":"l-ʿil''ma","translation_bn":"জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51248,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُ","transliteration":"annahu","translation_bn":"যে তা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":51249,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقُّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","translation_bn":"সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51250,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"নিকট হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51251,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51252,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَيُؤْمِنُوا۟","transliteration":"fayu''minū","translation_bn":"তারা অতঃপর ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51253,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"উপর তাঁর","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51254,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَتُخْبِتَ","transliteration":"fatukh''bita","translation_bn":"অতঃপর অবনমিত হয়","root":"خبت","lemma":"أَخْبَتُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51255,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"প্রতি তাঁর","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51256,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبُهُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"qulūbuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের অন্তরসমূহ","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51258,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ","transliteration":"wa-inna","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51259,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":51260,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَهَادِ","transliteration":"lahādi","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই পথপ্রদর্শনকারী","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَاد","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":51261,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":51262,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51263,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51264,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"صِرَٰطٍۢ","transliteration":"ṣirāṭin","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"صرط","lemma":"صِرَٰط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51265,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"mus''taqīmin","translation_bn":"সরল","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّسْتَقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51266,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"٥٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waliyaʿlama alladhīna ūtū l-ʿil''ma annahu l-ḥaqu min rabbika fayu''minū bihi fatukh''bita lahu qulūbuhum wa-inna l-laha lahādi alladhīna āmanū ilā ṣirāṭin mus''taqīmin', '(আর অপরদিকে) যাতে, যাদেরকে জ্ঞান দেয়া হয়েছে তারা জানতে পারে যে, এটা তোমার প্রতিপালকের পক্ষ থেকে (প্রেরিত) সত্য, অতঃপর তারা যেন তাতে বিশ্বাসী হয় আর তাদের অন্তর নম্রতাভরে তার প্রতি খুলে দেয়া হয়, কারণ আল্লাহ ঈমানদারদেরকে অবশ্যই সঠিক পথে পরিচালিত করেন।', 'And so those who were given knowledge may know that it is the truth from your Lord and [therefore] believe in it, and their hearts humbly submit to it. And indeed is Allah the Guide of those who have believed to a straight path.', '(আর অপরদিকে) যাতে, যাদেরকে জ্ঞান দেয়া হয়েছে তারা জানতে পারে যে, এটা তোমার প্রতিপালকের পক্ষ থেকে (প্রেরিত) সত্য, অতঃপর তারা যেন তাতে বিশ্বাসী হয় আর তাদের অন্তর নম্রতাভরে তার প্রতি খুলে দেয়া হয়, কারণ আল্লাহ ঈমানদারদেরকে অবশ্যই সঠিক পথে পরিচালিত করেন।', 'And so those who were given knowledge may know that it is the truth from your Lord and [therefore] believe in it, and their hearts humbly submit to it. And indeed is Allah the Guide of those who have believed to a straight path.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022054.mp3', now()),
  (22, 55, '', '[{"id":51676,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51677,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَزَالُ","transliteration":"yazālu","translation_bn":"বিরত হবে","root":"زيل","lemma":"زَالَت","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51678,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":51679,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অমান্য করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51680,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51681,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِرْيَةٍۢ","transliteration":"mir''yatin","translation_bn":"সন্দেহের","root":"مري","lemma":"مِرْيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51682,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51683,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"যতক্ষণ না","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51684,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَأْتِيَهُمُ","transliteration":"tatiyahumu","translation_bn":"তাদের (নিকট) এসে পড়বে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51685,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّاعَةُ","transliteration":"l-sāʿatu","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাত","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51686,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَغْتَةً","transliteration":"baghtatan","translation_bn":"হঠাৎ করে","root":"بغت","lemma":"بَغْتَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51687,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51688,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِيَهُمْ","transliteration":"yatiyahum","translation_bn":"তাদের (নিকট) আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51689,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابُ","transliteration":"ʿadhābu","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51690,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمٍ","transliteration":"yawmin","translation_bn":"দিনের","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51691,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَقِيمٍ","transliteration":"ʿaqīmin","translation_bn":"বন্ধ্যা (খারাপ)","root":"عقم","lemma":"عَقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":51692,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٥٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā yazālu alladhīna kafarū fī mir''yatin min''hu ḥattā tatiyahumu l-sāʿatu baghtatan aw yatiyahum ʿadhābu yawmin ʿaqīmin', 'অবিশ্বাসীরা তাতে (অর্থাৎ ওয়াহীতে) সন্দেহ পোষণ করা থেকে বিরত হবে না যতক্ষণ না কিয়ামাত আসবে হঠাৎ ক’রে অথবা তাদের উপর শাস্তি এসে যাবে এক বন্ধ্যা দিনে (যা কাফিরদেরকে কোন সুফল দিবে না)।', 'But those who disbelieve will not cease to be in doubt of it until the Hour comes upon them unexpectedly or there comes to them the punishment of a barren Day.', 'অবিশ্বাসীরা তাতে (অর্থাৎ ওয়াহীতে) সন্দেহ পোষণ করা থেকে বিরত হবে না যতক্ষণ না কিয়ামাত আসবে হঠাৎ ক’রে অথবা তাদের উপর শাস্তি এসে যাবে এক বন্ধ্যা দিনে (যা কাফিরদেরকে কোন সুফল দিবে না)।', 'But those who disbelieve will not cease to be in doubt of it until the Hour comes upon them unexpectedly or there comes to them the punishment of a barren Day.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022055.mp3', now()),
  (22, 56, '', '[{"id":52067,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُلْكُ","transliteration":"al-mul''ku","translation_bn":"চূড়ান্ত কর্তৃত্ব","root":"ملك","lemma":"مُلْك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52068,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","transliteration":"yawma-idhin","translation_bn":"সেদিন হবে","root":"—","lemma":"يَوْمَئِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":52069,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِّلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহরই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52070,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَحْكُمُ","transliteration":"yaḥkumu","translation_bn":"তিনি বিচার করবেন","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52071,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"baynahum","translation_bn":"তাদের মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":52073,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"fa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"সুতরাং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52074,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52075,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"waʿamilū","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52076,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","translation_bn":"সৎকাজসমূহের","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52077,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"(তারা থাকবে) মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52078,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"جَنَّـٰتِ","transliteration":"jannāti","translation_bn":"জান্নাতসমূহের","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52079,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّعِيمِ","transliteration":"l-naʿīmi","translation_bn":"সুখকর","root":"نعم","lemma":"نَعِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52080,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٥٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'al-mul''ku yawma-idhin lillahi yaḥkumu baynahum fa-alladhīna āmanū waʿamilū l-ṣāliḥāti fī jannāti l-naʿīmi', 'ক্ষমতা-আধিপত্য সেদিন হবে আল্লাহরই, তিনি তাদের মাঝে বিচার-ফয়সালা করবেন। অতঃপর যারা ঈমান আনে ও সৎ কাজ করে তারা থাকবে নি‘মাতরাজিতে পরিপূর্ণ জান্নাতে।', '[All] sovereignty that Day is for Allah; He will judge between them. So they who believed and did righteous deeds will be in the Gardens of Pleasure.', 'ক্ষমতা-আধিপত্য সেদিন হবে আল্লাহরই, তিনি তাদের মাঝে বিচার-ফয়সালা করবেন। অতঃপর যারা ঈমান আনে ও সৎ কাজ করে তারা থাকবে নি‘মাতরাজিতে পরিপূর্ণ জান্নাতে।', '[All] sovereignty that Day is for Allah; He will judge between them. So they who believed and did righteous deeds will be in the Gardens of Pleasure.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022056.mp3', now()),
  (22, 57, '', '[{"id":52734,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"আর যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52735,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52736,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَّبُوا۟","transliteration":"wakadhabū","translation_bn":"ও অমান্য করেছে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52737,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"প্রতি আমাদের নিদর্শনাবলীর","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52738,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"fa-ulāika","translation_bn":"তবে ঐসবলোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52739,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের  (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52740,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52741,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مُّهِينٌۭ","transliteration":"muhīnun","translation_bn":"লাঞ্ছনাদায়ক","root":"هون","lemma":"مُّهِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52742,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٥٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna kafarū wakadhabū biāyātinā fa-ulāika lahum ʿadhābun muhīnun', 'আর যারা কুফুরী করে আর আমার আয়াতসমূহকে মিথ্যে জেনে প্রত্যাখ্যান করে তাদের জন্য আছে অপমানজনক শাস্তি।', 'And they who disbelieved and denied Our signs - for those there will be a humiliating punishment.', 'আর যারা কুফুরী করে আর আমার আয়াতসমূহকে মিথ্যে জেনে প্রত্যাখ্যান করে তাদের জন্য আছে অপমানজনক শাস্তি।', 'And they who disbelieved and denied Our signs - for those there will be a humiliating punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022057.mp3', now()),
  (22, 58, '', '[{"id":53182,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"আর যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53183,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هَاجَرُوا۟","transliteration":"hājarū","translation_bn":"হিজরত করেছে","root":"هجر","lemma":"هَاجَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53184,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53185,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53186,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":53187,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53188,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قُتِلُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qutilū","translation_bn":"নিহত হয়েছে","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53189,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53190,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَاتُوا۟","transliteration":"mātū","translation_bn":"মারা গিয়েছে","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّاتَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53191,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَيَرْزُقَنَّهُمُ","transliteration":"layarzuqannahumu","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তাদেরকে জীবিকা দিবেন","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":53192,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":53193,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"رِزْقًا","transliteration":"riz''qan","translation_bn":"জীবিকা","root":"رزق","lemma":"رِزْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53194,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"حَسَنًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"ḥasanan","translation_bn":"উৎকৃষ্ট","root":"حسن","lemma":"حَسَن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":53196,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ","transliteration":"wa-inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53197,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":53198,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَهُوَ","transliteration":"lahuwa","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":53199,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرُ","transliteration":"khayru","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53200,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّٰزِقِينَ","transliteration":"l-rāziqīna","translation_bn":"জীবিকাদাতাদের","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَّٰزِقِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53201,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٥٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna hājarū fī sabīli l-lahi thumma qutilū aw mātū layarzuqannahumu l-lahu riz''qan ḥasanan wa-inna l-laha lahuwa khayru l-rāziqīna', 'আর যারা আল্লাহর পথে হিজরাত করেছে, অতঃপর নিহত হয়েছে, কিংবা মারা গেছে, আল্লাহ তাদেরকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই উৎকৃষ্ট রিযক্ দান করবেন, আর আল্লাহ- তিনি তো সর্বোত্তম রিযকদাতা।', 'And those who emigrated for the cause of Allah and then were killed or died - Allah will surely provide for them a good provision. And indeed, it is Allah who is the best of providers.', 'আর যারা আল্লাহর পথে হিজরাত করেছে, অতঃপর নিহত হয়েছে, কিংবা মারা গেছে, আল্লাহ তাদেরকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই উৎকৃষ্ট রিযক্ দান করবেন, আর আল্লাহ- তিনি তো সর্বোত্তম রিযকদাতা।', 'And those who emigrated for the cause of Allah and then were killed or died - Allah will surely provide for them a good provision. And indeed, it is Allah who is the best of providers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022058.mp3', now()),
  (22, 59, '', '[{"id":53820,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَيُدْخِلَنَّهُم","transliteration":"layud''khilannahum","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তাদেরকে তিনি প্রবেশ করাবেন","root":"دخل","lemma":"أُدْخِلَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":53821,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مُّدْخَلًۭا","transliteration":"mud''khalan","translation_bn":"(এমন) প্রবেশস্থানে","root":"دخل","lemma":"مُّدْخَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53822,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَرْضَوْنَهُۥ ۗ","transliteration":"yarḍawnahu","translation_bn":"তাতে তারা সন্তুষ্ট হবে","root":"رضو","lemma":"رَّضِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53824,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ","transliteration":"wa-inna","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53825,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":53826,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلِيمٌ","transliteration":"laʿalīmun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই সর্বজ্ঞ","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":53827,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"حَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥalīmun","translation_bn":"পরম সহনশীল","root":"حلم","lemma":"حَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":53828,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٥٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'layud''khilannahum mud''khalan yarḍawnahu wa-inna l-laha laʿalīmun ḥalīmun', 'তিনি তাদেরকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই দাখিল করবেন এমন জায়গায় যা পেয়ে তারা খুবই সন্তুষ্ট হবে, আর আল্লাহ নিশ্চিতই অবশ্যই সর্বজ্ঞ, পরম সহিষ্ণু।', 'He will surely cause them to enter an entrance with which they will be pleased, and indeed, Allah is Knowing and Forbearing.', 'তিনি তাদেরকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই দাখিল করবেন এমন জায়গায় যা পেয়ে তারা খুবই সন্তুষ্ট হবে, আর আল্লাহ নিশ্চিতই অবশ্যই সর্বজ্ঞ, পরম সহিষ্ণু।', 'He will surely cause them to enter an entrance with which they will be pleased, and indeed, Allah is Knowing and Forbearing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022059.mp3', now()),
  (22, 60, '', '[{"id":54300,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা (এদের পরিনতি)","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":54301,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَمَنْ","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"আর যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54302,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَاقَبَ","transliteration":"ʿāqaba","translation_bn":"প্রতিশোধ নিবে","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَاقَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54303,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِمِثْلِ","transliteration":"bimith''li","translation_bn":"(তার) সমতুল্য","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54304,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":54305,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عُوقِبَ","transliteration":"ʿūqiba","translation_bn":"নিপীড়ন করা হয়েছে","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَاقَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54306,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"প্রতি তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54307,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"আবার","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54308,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بُغِىَ","transliteration":"bughiya","translation_bn":"বাড়াবাড়ি করা হয়েছে","root":"بغي","lemma":"بَغَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54309,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54310,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَيَنصُرَنَّهُ","transliteration":"layanṣurannahu","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তাকে সাহায্য করবেন","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":54311,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ۗ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":54313,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":54314,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":54315,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَعَفُوٌّ","transliteration":"laʿafuwwun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই পাপমোচনকারী","root":"عفو","lemma":"عَفُوّ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":54316,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":54317,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٦٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬০)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dhālika waman ʿāqaba bimith''li mā ʿūqiba bihi thumma bughiya ʿalayhi layanṣurannahu l-lahu inna l-laha laʿafuwwun ghafūrun', 'এতো হল তাদের অবস্থা, আর যে ব্যক্তি আঘাতপ্রাপ্ত হলে সমপরিমাণ প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণ করে, অতঃপর আবার সে নিপীড়িত হয়, আল্লাহ তাকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই সাহায্য করবেন, আল্লাহ অবশ্যই মাফকারী ক্ষমাশীল।', 'That [is so]. And whoever responds [to injustice] with the equivalent of that with which he was harmed and then is tyrannized - Allah will surely aid him. Indeed, Allah is Pardoning and Forgiving.', 'এতো হল তাদের অবস্থা, আর যে ব্যক্তি আঘাতপ্রাপ্ত হলে সমপরিমাণ প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণ করে, অতঃপর আবার সে নিপীড়িত হয়, আল্লাহ তাকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই সাহায্য করবেন, আল্লাহ অবশ্যই মাফকারী ক্ষমাশীল।', 'That [is so]. And whoever responds [to injustice] with the equivalent of that with which he was harmed and then is tyrannized - Allah will surely aid him. Indeed, Allah is Pardoning and Forgiving.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022060.mp3', now()),
  (22, 61, '', '[{"id":55146,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":55147,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِأَنَّ","transliteration":"bi-anna","translation_bn":"এজন্যে যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55148,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":55149,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يُولِجُ","transliteration":"yūliju","translation_bn":"প্রবেশ করান","root":"ولج","lemma":"يُولِجُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55150,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلَ","transliteration":"al-layla","translation_bn":"রাতকে","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55151,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55152,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّهَارِ","transliteration":"l-nahāri","translation_bn":"দিনের","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55153,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَيُولِجُ","transliteration":"wayūliju","translation_bn":"ও তিনি প্রবেশ করান","root":"ولج","lemma":"يُولِجُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55154,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّهَارَ","transliteration":"l-nahāra","translation_bn":"দিনকে","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55155,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55156,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلِ","transliteration":"al-layli","translation_bn":"রাতের","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55157,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"আর নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55158,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":55159,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"سَمِيعٌۢ","transliteration":"samīʿun","translation_bn":"সব শুনেন","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":55160,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بَصِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"baṣīrun","translation_bn":"সব দেখেন","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":55161,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٦١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬১)","root":"—","lemma":"٦١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dhālika bi-anna l-laha yūliju al-layla fī l-nahāri wayūliju l-nahāra fī al-layli wa-anna l-laha samīʿun baṣīrun', 'এটা এজন্য যে, আল্লাহ রাতকে ঢুকিয়ে দেন দিনে, আর দিনকে ঢুকিয়ে দেন রাতে (দুঃখ বেদনার অন্ধকার দূর করে আনন্দের আলো এনে দেন আর আনন্দিত জনকে দুঃখের অাঁধারে ডুবিয়ে দেন)। আর আল্লাহ তো সব কিছু শোনেন, সব কিছু দেখেন।', 'That is because Allah causes the night to enter the day and causes the day to enter the night and because Allah is Hearing and Seeing.', 'এটা এজন্য যে, আল্লাহ রাতকে ঢুকিয়ে দেন দিনে, আর দিনকে ঢুকিয়ে দেন রাতে (দুঃখ বেদনার অন্ধকার দূর করে আনন্দের আলো এনে দেন আর আনন্দিত জনকে দুঃখের অাঁধারে ডুবিয়ে দেন)। আর আল্লাহ তো সব কিছু শোনেন, সব কিছু দেখেন।', 'That is because Allah causes the night to enter the day and causes the day to enter the night and because Allah is Hearing and Seeing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022061.mp3', now()),
  (22, 62, '', '[{"id":55526,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":55527,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِأَنَّ","transliteration":"bi-anna","translation_bn":"এজন্য যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55528,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":55529,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":55530,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقُّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","translation_bn":"সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55531,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"আর (এও সত্য) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55532,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":55533,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَدْعُونَ","transliteration":"yadʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা ডাকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55534,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55535,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"دُونِهِۦ","transliteration":"dūnihi","translation_bn":"তাঁকে ছাড়া","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55536,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তা","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":55537,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَـٰطِلُ","transliteration":"l-bāṭilu","translation_bn":"অসত্য","root":"بطل","lemma":"بَٰطِل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55538,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"আর (এও সত্য) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55539,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":55540,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":55541,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَلِىُّ","transliteration":"l-ʿaliyu","translation_bn":"সমুচ্চ","root":"علو","lemma":"عَلِيّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55542,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَبِيرُ","transliteration":"l-kabīru","translation_bn":"সুমহান","root":"كبر","lemma":"كَبِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55543,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٦٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬২)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dhālika bi-anna l-laha huwa l-ḥaqu wa-anna mā yadʿūna min dūnihi huwa l-bāṭilu wa-anna l-laha huwa l-ʿaliyu l-kabīru', 'এজন্য যে, আল্লাহ- তিনিই সত্য, আর তাঁকে বাদ দিয়ে তারা অন্য যাকে ডাকে তা অলীক, অসত্য, আর আল্লাহ, তিনি তো সর্বোচ্চ, সুমহান।', 'That is because Allah is the Truth, and that which they call upon other than Him is falsehood, and because Allah is the Most High, the Grand.', 'এজন্য যে, আল্লাহ- তিনিই সত্য, আর তাঁকে বাদ দিয়ে তারা অন্য যাকে ডাকে তা অলীক, অসত্য, আর আল্লাহ, তিনি তো সর্বোচ্চ, সুমহান।', 'That is because Allah is the Truth, and that which they call upon other than Him is falsehood, and because Allah is the Most High, the Grand.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022062.mp3', now()),
  (22, 63, '', '[{"id":56382,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"নি কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":56383,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَرَ","transliteration":"tara","translation_bn":"তুমি দেখো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56384,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":56385,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":56386,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلَ","transliteration":"anzala","translation_bn":"বর্ষণ করেন","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56387,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56388,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","transliteration":"l-samāi","translation_bn":"আকাশ","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56389,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَآءًۭ","transliteration":"māan","translation_bn":"পানি","root":"موه","lemma":"مَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56390,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَتُصْبِحُ","transliteration":"fatuṣ''biḥu","translation_bn":"ফলে হয়ে উঠে","root":"صبح","lemma":"أَصْبَحَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56391,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضُ","transliteration":"l-arḍu","translation_bn":"জমিন","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56392,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مُخْضَرَّةً ۗ","transliteration":"mukh''ḍarratan","translation_bn":"সবুজ শ্যামল","root":"خضر","lemma":"مُخْضَرَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56394,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":56395,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":56396,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَطِيفٌ","transliteration":"laṭīfun","translation_bn":"সূক্ষ্ণদর্শী","root":"لطف","lemma":"لَطِيف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":56397,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"خَبِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"khabīrun","translation_bn":"খুব অবহিত","root":"خبر","lemma":"خَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":56398,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٦٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alam tara anna l-laha anzala mina l-samāi māan fatuṣ''biḥu l-arḍu mukh''ḍarratan inna l-laha laṭīfun khabīrun', 'তুমি কি লক্ষ্য কর না যে, আল্লাহ আকাশ থেকে পানি বর্ষণ করেন, যার ফলে পৃথিবী সবুজে আচ্ছাদিত হয়ে যায়, নিশ্চয় আল্লাহ সূক্ষ্ণদর্শী, সর্ববিষয়ে ওয়াকিফহাল।', 'Do you not see that Allah has sent down rain from the sky and the earth becomes green? Indeed, Allah is Subtle and Acquainted.', 'তুমি কি লক্ষ্য কর না যে, আল্লাহ আকাশ থেকে পানি বর্ষণ করেন, যার ফলে পৃথিবী সবুজে আচ্ছাদিত হয়ে যায়, নিশ্চয় আল্লাহ সূক্ষ্ণদর্শী, সর্ববিষয়ে ওয়াকিফহাল।', 'Do you not see that Allah has sent down rain from the sky and the earth becomes green? Indeed, Allah is Subtle and Acquainted.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022063.mp3', now()),
  (22, 64, '', '[{"id":56911,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাঁরই","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56912,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":56913,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56914,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশমন্ডলীর","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56915,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"ও যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56916,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56917,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56919,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ","transliteration":"wa-inna","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56920,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":56921,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَهُوَ","transliteration":"lahuwa","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":56922,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَنِىُّ","transliteration":"l-ghaniyu","translation_bn":"অভাবমুক্ত","root":"غني","lemma":"غَنِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56923,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَمِيدُ","transliteration":"l-ḥamīdu","translation_bn":"প্রশংসিত","root":"حمد","lemma":"حَمِيد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56924,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٦٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lahu mā fī l-samāwāti wamā fī l-arḍi wa-inna l-laha lahuwa l-ghaniyu l-ḥamīdu', 'আকাশ ও পৃথিবীতে যা কিছু আছে সবই তাঁর, আর আল্লাহ, তিনি যাবতীয় অভাব থেকে মুক্ত, যাবতীয় প্রশংসার অধিকারী।', 'To Him belongs what is in the heavens and what is on the earth. And indeed, Allah is the Free of need, the Praiseworthy.', 'আকাশ ও পৃথিবীতে যা কিছু আছে সবই তাঁর, আর আল্লাহ, তিনি যাবতীয় অভাব থেকে মুক্ত, যাবতীয় প্রশংসার অধিকারী।', 'To Him belongs what is in the heavens and what is on the earth. And indeed, Allah is the Free of need, the Praiseworthy.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022064.mp3', now()),
  (22, 65, '', '[{"id":57418,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"নি কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":57419,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَرَ","transliteration":"tara","translation_bn":"তুমি দেখো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57420,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":57421,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":57422,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"سَخَّرَ","transliteration":"sakhara","translation_bn":"অধীন করে দিয়েছেন","root":"سخر","lemma":"سَخَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57423,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57424,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":57425,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57426,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57427,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْفُلْكَ","transliteration":"wal-ful''ka","translation_bn":"এবং নৌযানসমূহ","root":"فلك","lemma":"فُلْك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57428,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَجْرِى","transliteration":"tajrī","translation_bn":"চলাচল করে","root":"جري","lemma":"جَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57429,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57430,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَحْرِ","transliteration":"l-baḥri","translation_bn":"সমুদ্রের","root":"بحر","lemma":"بَحْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57431,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِأَمْرِهِۦ","transliteration":"bi-amrihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর নির্দেশ অনুসারে","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57432,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَيُمْسِكُ","transliteration":"wayum''siku","translation_bn":"এবং তিনি ধরে রেখেছেন","root":"مسك","lemma":"أَمْسَكَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57433,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَآءَ","transliteration":"l-samāa","translation_bn":"আকাশকে","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57434,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যেন (না)","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":57435,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"تَقَعَ","transliteration":"taqaʿa","translation_bn":"পতিত হয়","root":"وقع","lemma":"وَقَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57436,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57437,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57438,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":57439,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"بِإِذْنِهِۦٓ ۗ","transliteration":"bi-idh''nihi","translation_bn":"নিয়ে তাঁর অনুমতি","root":"اذن","lemma":"إِذْن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57441,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":57442,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":57443,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"bil-nāsi","translation_bn":"উপর মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57444,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"لَرَءُوفٌۭ","transliteration":"laraūfun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই দয়াপরবশ","root":"راف","lemma":"رَءُوف","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":57445,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":57446,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٦٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alam tara anna l-laha sakhara lakum mā fī l-arḍi wal-ful''ka tajrī fī l-baḥri bi-amrihi wayum''siku l-samāa an taqaʿa ʿalā l-arḍi illā bi-idh''nihi inna l-laha bil-nāsi laraūfun raḥīmun', 'তুমি কি লক্ষ্য কর না যে, পৃথিবীতে যা কিছু আছে সব তিনি তোমাদের কল্যাণ-কাজে লাগিয়ে রেখেছেন। আর নৌযানগুলো সমুদ্রে চলাচল করে তাঁর হুকুমেই? তিনিই আকাশকে স্থির রাখেন যাতে তা পৃথিবীতে পতিত না হয় তাঁর অনুমতি ছাড়া। আল্লাহ মানুষের প্রতি নিশ্চিতই বড়ই করুণাশীল, বড়ই দয়াবান।', 'Do you not see that Allah has subjected to you whatever is on the earth and the ships which run through the sea by His command? And He restrains the sky from falling upon the earth, unless by His permission. Indeed Allah, to the people, is Kind and Merciful.', 'তুমি কি লক্ষ্য কর না যে, পৃথিবীতে যা কিছু আছে সব তিনি তোমাদের কল্যাণ-কাজে লাগিয়ে রেখেছেন। আর নৌযানগুলো সমুদ্রে চলাচল করে তাঁর হুকুমেই? তিনিই আকাশকে স্থির রাখেন যাতে তা পৃথিবীতে পতিত না হয় তাঁর অনুমতি ছাড়া। আল্লাহ মানুষের প্রতি নিশ্চিতই বড়ই করুণাশীল, বড়ই দয়াবান।', 'Do you not see that Allah has subjected to you whatever is on the earth and the ships which run through the sea by His command? And He restrains the sky from falling upon the earth, unless by His permission. Indeed Allah, to the people, is Kind and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022065.mp3', now()),
  (22, 66, '', '[{"id":57901,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57902,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":57903,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَحْيَاكُمْ","transliteration":"aḥyākum","translation_bn":"জীবন দিয়েছেন তোমাদেরকে","root":"حيي","lemma":"أَحْيَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57904,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57905,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يُمِيتُكُمْ","transliteration":"yumītukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে মৃত্যু দিবেন","root":"موت","lemma":"أَمَاتَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57906,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57907,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يُحْيِيكُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"yuḥ''yīkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জীবিত করবেন","root":"حيي","lemma":"أَحْيَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57909,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":57910,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ","transliteration":"l-insāna","translation_bn":"মানুষ","root":"انس","lemma":"إِنسَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57911,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَكَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"lakafūrun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই অকৃতজ্ঞ বড়","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفُور","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":57912,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٦٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahuwa alladhī aḥyākum thumma yumītukum thumma yuḥ''yīkum inna l-insāna lakafūrun', 'তিনিই তোমাদেরকে জীবন দিয়েছেন, অতঃপর তিনিই তোমাদের মৃত্যু ঘটাবেন, অতঃপর আবার তোমাদেরকে জীবন দিবেন। মানুষ সত্যিই বড়ই অকৃতজ্ঞ।', 'And He is the one who gave you life; then He causes you to die and then will [again] give you life. Indeed, mankind is ungrateful.', 'তিনিই তোমাদেরকে জীবন দিয়েছেন, অতঃপর তিনিই তোমাদের মৃত্যু ঘটাবেন, অতঃপর আবার তোমাদেরকে জীবন দিবেন। মানুষ সত্যিই বড়ই অকৃতজ্ঞ।', 'And He is the one who gave you life; then He causes you to die and then will [again] give you life. Indeed, mankind is ungrateful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022066.mp3', now()),
  (22, 67, '', '[{"id":58066,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لِّكُلِّ","transliteration":"likulli","translation_bn":"জন্যে প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58067,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أُمَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"ummatin","translation_bn":"জাতির","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58068,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلْنَا","transliteration":"jaʿalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা নির্ধারণ করেছি","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58069,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَنسَكًا","transliteration":"mansakan","translation_bn":"ইবাদাত পদ্ধতি","root":"نسك","lemma":"مَنسَك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58070,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":58071,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نَاسِكُوهُ ۖ","transliteration":"nāsikūhu","translation_bn":"সেই প্রথা অনুসরণকারী","root":"نسك","lemma":"نَاسِكُو","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58073,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"সুতরাং না (যেন)","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58074,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يُنَـٰزِعُنَّكَ","transliteration":"yunāziʿunnaka","translation_bn":"তোমার (সাথে) ঝগড়া করে","root":"نزع","lemma":"يُنَٰزِعُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58075,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"নিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58076,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَمْرِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-amri","translation_bn":"এই (ব্যাপার)","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58078,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱدْعُ","transliteration":"wa-ud''ʿu","translation_bn":"এবং তুমি ডাকো","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58079,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58080,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ ۖ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58082,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكَ","transliteration":"innaka","translation_bn":"তুমি নিশ্চয়ই (আছো)","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":58083,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَىٰ","transliteration":"laʿalā","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":58084,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"هُدًۭى","transliteration":"hudan","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58085,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"mus''taqīmin","translation_bn":"সরল সঠিক","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّسْتَقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58086,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٦٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'likulli ummatin jaʿalnā mansakan hum nāsikūhu falā yunāziʿunnaka fī l-amri wa-ud''ʿu ilā rabbika innaka laʿalā hudan mus''taqīmin', 'প্রত্যেক সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য আমি (‘ইবাদাতের) নিয়ম-কানুন নির্ধারণ করে দিয়েছি যা তারা অনুসরণ করে। কাজেই তারা যেন এ বিষয়ে তোমার সঙ্গে তর্ক বিতর্ক না করে। তুমি (তাদেরকে) তোমার প্রতিপালকের দিকে ডাক, তুমি অবশ্যই সরল সঠিক পথে আছ।', 'For every religion We have appointed rites which they perform. So, [O Muhammad], let the disbelievers not contend with you over the matter but invite them to your Lord. Indeed, you are upon straight guidance.', 'প্রত্যেক সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য আমি (‘ইবাদাতের) নিয়ম-কানুন নির্ধারণ করে দিয়েছি যা তারা অনুসরণ করে। কাজেই তারা যেন এ বিষয়ে তোমার সঙ্গে তর্ক বিতর্ক না করে। তুমি (তাদেরকে) তোমার প্রতিপালকের দিকে ডাক, তুমি অবশ্যই সরল সঠিক পথে আছ।', 'For every religion We have appointed rites which they perform. So, [O Muhammad], let the disbelievers not contend with you over the matter but invite them to your Lord. Indeed, you are upon straight guidance.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022067.mp3', now()),
  (22, 68, '', '[{"id":58647,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"আর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58648,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَـٰدَلُوكَ","transliteration":"jādalūka","translation_bn":"তোমার সাথে তারা বিতর্ক করে","root":"جدل","lemma":"جَٰدَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58649,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَقُلِ","transliteration":"faquli","translation_bn":"তবে বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58650,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"\"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":58651,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"aʿlamu","translation_bn":"খুব জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"أَعْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":58652,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"যা সে বিষয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58653,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কাজ করছো","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58654,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٦٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-in jādalūka faquli l-lahu aʿlamu bimā taʿmalūna', 'তারা যদি তোমার সঙ্গে বিতর্ক করে তাহলে বল- তোমরা যা কর আল্লাহ তা ভাল করেই জানেন।', 'And if they dispute with you, then say, "Allah is most knowing of what you do.', 'তারা যদি তোমার সঙ্গে বিতর্ক করে তাহলে বল- তোমরা যা কর আল্লাহ তা ভাল করেই জানেন।', 'And if they dispute with you, then say, "Allah is most knowing of what you do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022068.mp3', now()),
  (22, 69, '', '[{"id":59091,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"al-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":59092,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَحْكُمُ","transliteration":"yaḥkumu","translation_bn":"মীমাংসা করে দিবেন","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59093,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَكُمْ","transliteration":"baynakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":59094,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59095,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59096,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِيمَا","transliteration":"fīmā","translation_bn":"সে বিষয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59097,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59098,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"যার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59099,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَخْتَلِفُونَ","transliteration":"takhtalifūna","translation_bn":"মতভেদ করতে\"","root":"خلف","lemma":"ٱخْتَلَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59100,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٦٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'al-lahu yaḥkumu baynakum yawma l-qiyāmati fīmā kuntum fīhi takhtalifūna', 'আল্লাহ কিয়ামাতের দিন সে বিষয়ে তোমাদের মধ্যে মীমাংসা করে দিবেন যে বিষয়ে তোমরা মতভেদ করছ।', 'Allah will judge between you on the Day of Resurrection concerning that over which you used to differ."', 'আল্লাহ কিয়ামাতের দিন সে বিষয়ে তোমাদের মধ্যে মীমাংসা করে দিবেন যে বিষয়ে তোমরা মতভেদ করছ।', 'Allah will judge between you on the Day of Resurrection concerning that over which you used to differ."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022069.mp3', now()),
  (22, 70, '', '[{"id":59732,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"নি কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":59733,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمْ","transliteration":"taʿlam","translation_bn":"তুমি জানো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59734,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":59735,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":59736,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","translation_bn":"জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59737,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":59738,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59739,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","transliteration":"l-samāi","translation_bn":"আকাশের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59740,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۗ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীতে","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59742,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":59743,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":59744,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59745,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كِتَـٰبٍ ۚ","transliteration":"kitābin","translation_bn":"এক কিতাবে (লিপিবদ্ধ)","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59747,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":59748,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":59749,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"নিকট","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59750,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":59751,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَسِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"yasīrun","translation_bn":"সহজ","root":"يسر","lemma":"يَسِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":59752,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٧٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭০)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alam taʿlam anna l-laha yaʿlamu mā fī l-samāi wal-arḍi inna dhālika fī kitābin inna dhālika ʿalā l-lahi yasīrun', 'তুমি কি জান না যে, আল্লাহ জানেন যা আছে আকাশে আর পৃথিবীতে, এ সবই লিপিতে (রেকর্ডে) আছে। এটা আল্লাহর পক্ষে সহজ।', 'Do you not know that Allah knows what is in the heaven and earth? Indeed, that is in a Record. Indeed that, for Allah, is easy.', 'তুমি কি জান না যে, আল্লাহ জানেন যা আছে আকাশে আর পৃথিবীতে, এ সবই লিপিতে (রেকর্ডে) আছে। এটা আল্লাহর পক্ষে সহজ।', 'Do you not know that Allah knows what is in the heaven and earth? Indeed, that is in a Record. Indeed that, for Allah, is easy.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022070.mp3', now()),
  (22, 71, '', '[{"id":60260,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَعْبُدُونَ","transliteration":"wayaʿbudūna","translation_bn":"এবং তারা উপাসনা করে","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60261,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60262,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"পরিবর্তে","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60263,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":60264,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(এমন কিছুর) যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":60265,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":60266,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يُنَزِّلْ","transliteration":"yunazzil","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করেন (আল্লাহ)","root":"نزل","lemma":"نَزَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60267,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সে সম্বন্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60268,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"سُلْطَـٰنًۭا","transliteration":"sul''ṭānan","translation_bn":"কোন প্রমাণ","root":"سلط","lemma":"سُلْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60269,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর যার","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60270,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَيْسَ","transliteration":"laysa","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60271,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَهُم","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"কাছে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60272,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সম্বন্ধে সে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60273,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمٌۭ ۗ","transliteration":"ʿil''mun","translation_bn":"কোন জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60275,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60276,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لِلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"lilẓẓālimīna","translation_bn":"জন্যে সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদের","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60277,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোন","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60278,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"نَّصِيرٍۢ","transliteration":"naṣīrin","translation_bn":"সাহায্যকারী","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60279,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٧١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭১)","root":"—","lemma":"٧١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayaʿbudūna min dūni l-lahi mā lam yunazzil bihi sul''ṭānan wamā laysa lahum bihi ʿil''mun wamā lilẓẓālimīna min naṣīrin', 'আর তারা আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে এমন কিছুকে ডাকে যার সমর্থনে তিনি কোন দলীল পাঠাননি আর যে সম্পর্কে তাদের কোন জ্ঞান নেই। (এসব) যালিমদের কোন সাহায্যকারী নেই।', 'And they worship besides Allah that for which He has not sent down authority and that of which they have no knowledge. And there will not be for the wrongdoers any helper.', 'আর তারা আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে এমন কিছুকে ডাকে যার সমর্থনে তিনি কোন দলীল পাঠাননি আর যে সম্পর্কে তাদের কোন জ্ঞান নেই। (এসব) যালিমদের কোন সাহায্যকারী নেই।', 'And they worship besides Allah that for which He has not sent down authority and that of which they have no knowledge. And there will not be for the wrongdoers any helper.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022071.mp3', now()),
