نَ","transliteration":"yakādūna","translation_bn":"তারা উপক্রম হয়","root":"كود","lemma":"كَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60603,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَسْطُونَ","transliteration":"yasṭūna","translation_bn":"আক্রমণ করবে তারা","root":"سطو","lemma":"يَسْطُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60604,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"bi-alladhīna","translation_bn":"উপর (তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60605,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَتْلُونَ","transliteration":"yatlūna","translation_bn":"তিলাওয়াত করে","root":"تلو","lemma":"تَلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60606,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"নিকট তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60607,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِنَا ۗ","transliteration":"āyātinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের আয়াতগুলোকে","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60609,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60610,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَفَأُنَبِّئُكُم","transliteration":"afa-unabbi-ukum","translation_bn":"\"কি তবে তোমাদের সংবাদ দিবো","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَّأَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":60611,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"بِشَرٍّۢ","transliteration":"bisharrin","translation_bn":"নিকৃষ্ট কিছু সম্পর্কে","root":"شرر","lemma":"شَرّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60612,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"চেয়েও","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60613,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكُمُ ۗ","transliteration":"dhālikumu","translation_bn":"এর (তোমাদের)","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":60615,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارُ","transliteration":"l-nāru","translation_bn":"(সেটা হলো) আগুন","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60616,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"وَعَدَهَا","transliteration":"waʿadahā","translation_bn":"যা প্রতিশ্রুতি দিয়েছেন","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60617,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":60618,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের জন্যে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":60619,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟ ۖ","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60621,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"وَبِئْسَ","transliteration":"wabi''sa","translation_bn":"এবং কত নিকৃষ্ট","root":"باس","lemma":"بِئْسَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60622,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَصِيرُ","transliteration":"l-maṣīru","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাবর্তনস্থল\"","root":"صير","lemma":"مَصِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60623,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"٧٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭২)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā tut''lā ʿalayhim āyātunā bayyinātin taʿrifu fī wujūhi alladhīna kafarū l-munkara yakādūna yasṭūna bi-alladhīna yatlūna ʿalayhim āyātinā qul afa-unabbi-ukum bisharrin min dhālikumu l-nāru waʿadahā l-lahu alladhīna kafarū wabi''sa l-maṣīru', 'আর তাদের সম্মুখে যখন আমার সুস্পষ্ট আয়াত তিলাওয়াত করা হয় তখন তুমি কাফিরদের চেহারায় একটা অনীহার ভাব দেখতে পাবে। তাদের কাছে যারা আমার আয়াত তিলাওয়াত করে তাদেরকে তারা আক্রমণ করতে উদ্যত হয়। বল, তাহলে আমি কি তোমাদেরকে এর চেয়েও খারাপ কিছুর সংবাদ দেব? তা হল আগুন। আল্লাহ কাফিরদেরকে এর ওয়া‘দা দিয়েছেন। আর তা কতই না নিকৃষ্ট প্রত্যাবর্তনস্থল!', 'And when Our verses are recited to them as clear evidences, you recognize in the faces of those who disbelieve disapproval. They are almost on the verge of assaulting those who recite to them Our verses. Say, "Then shall I inform you of [what is] worse than that? [It is] the Fire which Allah has promised those who disbelieve, and wretched is the destination."', 'আর তাদের সম্মুখে যখন আমার সুস্পষ্ট আয়াত তিলাওয়াত করা হয় তখন তুমি কাফিরদের চেহারায় একটা অনীহার ভাব দেখতে পাবে। তাদের কাছে যারা আমার আয়াত তিলাওয়াত করে তাদেরকে তারা আক্রমণ করতে উদ্যত হয়। বল, তাহলে আমি কি তোমাদেরকে এর চেয়েও খারাপ কিছুর সংবাদ দেব? তা হল আগুন। আল্লাহ কাফিরদেরকে এর ওয়া‘দা দিয়েছেন। আর তা কতই না নিকৃষ্ট প্রত্যাবর্তনস্থল!', 'And when Our verses are recited to them as clear evidences, you recognize in the faces of those who disbelieve disapproval. They are almost on the verge of assaulting those who recite to them Our verses. Say, "Then shall I inform you of [what is] worse than that? [It is] the Fire which Allah has promised those who disbelieve, and wretched is the destination."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022072.mp3', now()),
  (22, 73, '', '[{"id":61244,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":61245,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسُ","transliteration":"l-nāsu","translation_bn":"মানুষ","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61246,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ضُرِبَ","transliteration":"ḍuriba","translation_bn":"পেশ করা হচ্ছে","root":"ضرب","lemma":"ضَرَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61247,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَثَلٌۭ","transliteration":"mathalun","translation_bn":"একটি উপমা","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61248,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَٱسْتَمِعُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-is''tamiʿū","translation_bn":"তাই তোমরা মনযোগ দিয়ে শুনো","root":"سمع","lemma":"ٱسْتَمَعَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61249,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥٓ ۚ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"প্রতি তার","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥٓ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61251,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":61252,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":61253,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَدْعُونَ","transliteration":"tadʿūna","translation_bn":"ডাকছো তোমরা","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61254,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61255,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"পরিবর্তে","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61256,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61257,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَن","transliteration":"lan","translation_bn":"কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":61258,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَخْلُقُوا۟","transliteration":"yakhluqū","translation_bn":"তারা সৃষ্টি করতে পারে","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61259,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ذُبَابًۭا","transliteration":"dhubāban","translation_bn":"একটি মাছিও","root":"ذبب","lemma":"ذُبَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61260,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوِ","transliteration":"walawi","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61261,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱجْتَمَعُوا۟","transliteration":"ij''tamaʿū","translation_bn":"তারা একত্র হয়","root":"جمع","lemma":"ٱجْتَمَعُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61262,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ ۖ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"সেজন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61264,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"আর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61265,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"يَسْلُبْهُمُ","transliteration":"yaslub''humu","translation_bn":"তাদের থেকে ছিনিয়ে নেয়","root":"سلب","lemma":"يَسْلُبْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61266,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلذُّبَابُ","transliteration":"l-dhubābu","translation_bn":"মাছি","root":"ذبب","lemma":"ذُبَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61267,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًۭٔا","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কোন কিছুই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61268,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":61269,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَنقِذُوهُ","transliteration":"yastanqidhūhu","translation_bn":"তা উদ্ধার করতে পারে","root":"نقذ","lemma":"يَسْتَنقِذُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61270,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُ ۚ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61272,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ضَعُفَ","transliteration":"ḍaʿufa","translation_bn":"দুর্বল (কতই না)","root":"ضعف","lemma":"ضَعُفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61273,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"ٱلطَّالِبُ","transliteration":"l-ṭālibu","translation_bn":"(সাহায্য) অন্বেষণকারী","root":"طلب","lemma":"طَّالِب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61274,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمَطْلُوبُ","transliteration":"wal-maṭlūbu","translation_bn":"ও অন্বেষণকৃত (সেও দুর্বল)","root":"طلب","lemma":"مَطْلُوب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61275,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"٧٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā l-nāsu ḍuriba mathalun fa-is''tamiʿū lahu inna alladhīna tadʿūna min dūni l-lahi lan yakhluqū dhubāban walawi ij''tamaʿū lahu wa-in yaslub''humu l-dhubābu shayan lā yastanqidhūhu min''hu ḍaʿufa l-ṭālibu wal-maṭlūbu', 'হে মানুষ! একটা দৃষ্টান্ত পেশ করা হচ্ছে, সেটা মনোযোগ দিয়ে শোন। আল্লাহর পরিবর্তে তোমরা যাদেরকে ডাক তারা কক্ষনো একটা মাছিও সৃষ্টি করতে পারে না, এজন্য তারা সবাই একত্রিত হলেও। আর মাছি যদি তাদের কাছ থেকে কিছু ছিনিয়ে নিয়ে যায়, তারা তার থেকে তা উদ্ধারও করতে পারে না, প্রার্থনাকারী আর যার কাছে প্রার্থনা করা হয় উভয়েই দুর্বল।', 'O people, an example is presented, so listen to it. Indeed, those you invoke besides Allah will never create [as much as] a fly, even if they gathered together for that purpose. And if the fly should steal away from them a [tiny] thing, they could not recover it from him. Weak are the pursuer and pursued.', 'হে মানুষ! একটা দৃষ্টান্ত পেশ করা হচ্ছে, সেটা মনোযোগ দিয়ে শোন। আল্লাহর পরিবর্তে তোমরা যাদেরকে ডাক তারা কক্ষনো একটা মাছিও সৃষ্টি করতে পারে না, এজন্য তারা সবাই একত্রিত হলেও। আর মাছি যদি তাদের কাছ থেকে কিছু ছিনিয়ে নিয়ে যায়, তারা তার থেকে তা উদ্ধারও করতে পারে না, প্রার্থনাকারী আর যার কাছে প্রার্থনা করা হয় উভয়েই দুর্বল।', 'O people, an example is presented, so listen to it. Indeed, those you invoke besides Allah will never create [as much as] a fly, even if they gathered together for that purpose. And if the fly should steal away from them a [tiny] thing, they could not recover it from him. Weak are the pursuer and pursued.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022073.mp3', now()),
  (22, 74, '', '[{"id":61760,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":61761,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَدَرُوا۟","transliteration":"qadarū","translation_bn":"তারা মর্যাদা দিলো","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61762,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61763,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"حَقَّ","transliteration":"ḥaqqa","translation_bn":"যথোচিত","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61764,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَدْرِهِۦٓ ۗ","transliteration":"qadrihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর মর্যাদা","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61766,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":61767,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61768,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَقَوِىٌّ","transliteration":"laqawiyyun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই শক্তিমান","root":"قوي","lemma":"قَوِىّ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":61769,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَزِيزٌ","transliteration":"ʿazīzun","translation_bn":"পরাক্রমশালী","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":61770,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٧٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'mā qadarū l-laha ḥaqqa qadrihi inna l-laha laqawiyyun ʿazīzun', 'তারা আল্লাহর যথাযোগ্য মর্যাদা দেয় না, আল্লাহ নিশ্চিতই ক্ষমতাশালী, মহা পরাক্রান্ত।', 'They have not appraised Allah with true appraisal. Indeed, Allah is Powerful and Exalted in Might.', 'তারা আল্লাহর যথাযোগ্য মর্যাদা দেয় না, আল্লাহ নিশ্চিতই ক্ষমতাশালী, মহা পরাক্রান্ত।', 'They have not appraised Allah with true appraisal. Indeed, Allah is Powerful and Exalted in Might.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022074.mp3', now()),
  (22, 75, '', '[{"id":62022,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"al-lahu","translation_bn":"(বস্তুতঃ) আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":62023,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَصْطَفِى","transliteration":"yaṣṭafī","translation_bn":"মনোনীত করেন","root":"صفو","lemma":"ٱصْطَفَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62024,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62025,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةِ","transliteration":"l-malāikati","translation_bn":"ফেরেশতাদের","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62026,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رُسُلًۭا","transliteration":"rusulan","translation_bn":"বাণীবাহকরূপে","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62027,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنَ","transliteration":"wamina","translation_bn":"আর মধ্য হ''তেও","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62028,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62030,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":62031,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":62032,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"سَمِيعٌۢ","transliteration":"samīʿun","translation_bn":"সব শুনেন","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":62033,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَصِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"baṣīrun","translation_bn":"সব দেখেন","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":62034,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٧٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'al-lahu yaṣṭafī mina l-malāikati rusulan wamina l-nāsi inna l-laha samīʿun baṣīrun', 'আল্লাহ ফেরেশতাগণের মধ্য হতে বাণীবাহক মনোনীত করেন আর মানুষদের মধ্য হতেও, আল্লাহ সব কিছু শোনেন, সব কিছু দেখেন।', 'Allah chooses from the angels messengers and from the people. Indeed, Allah is Hearing and Seeing.', 'আল্লাহ ফেরেশতাগণের মধ্য হতে বাণীবাহক মনোনীত করেন আর মানুষদের মধ্য হতেও, আল্লাহ সব কিছু শোনেন, সব কিছু দেখেন।', 'Allah chooses from the angels messengers and from the people. Indeed, Allah is Hearing and Seeing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022075.mp3', now()),
  (22, 76, '', '[{"id":62521,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","translation_bn":"তিনি জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62522,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":62523,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَ","transliteration":"bayna","translation_bn":"মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":62524,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَيْدِيهِمْ","transliteration":"aydīhim","translation_bn":"হাতের তাদের (সম্মুখে)","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62525,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"ও যা (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62526,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"خَلْفَهُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"khalfahum","translation_bn":"তাদের পিছনে","root":"خلف","lemma":"خَلْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62528,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَإِلَى","transliteration":"wa-ilā","translation_bn":"এবং দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62529,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌রই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":62530,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تُرْجَعُ","transliteration":"tur''jaʿu","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাবর্তিত হয়","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62531,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأُمُورُ","transliteration":"l-umūru","translation_bn":"সব ব্যাপারে","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62532,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٧٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yaʿlamu mā bayna aydīhim wamā khalfahum wa-ilā l-lahi tur''jaʿu l-umūru', 'তিনি জানেন তাদের সামনে যা আছে আর তাদের পেছনে যা আছে, আর সমস্ত ব্যাপার (চূড়ান্ত ফয়সালার জন্য) আল্লাহর কাছে ফিরে যায়।', 'He knows what is [presently] before them and what will be after them. And to Allah will be returned [all] matters.', 'তিনি জানেন তাদের সামনে যা আছে আর তাদের পেছনে যা আছে, আর সমস্ত ব্যাপার (চূড়ান্ত ফয়সালার জন্য) আল্লাহর কাছে ফিরে যায়।', 'He knows what is [presently] before them and what will be after them. And to Allah will be returned [all] matters.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022076.mp3', now()),
  (22, 77, '', '[{"id":62748,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":62749,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":62750,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62751,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱرْكَعُوا۟","transliteration":"ir''kaʿū","translation_bn":"তোমরা রূকূ করো","root":"ركع","lemma":"يَرْكَعُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62752,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱسْجُدُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-us''judū","translation_bn":"ও তোমরা সিজদা করো","root":"سجد","lemma":"سَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62753,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱعْبُدُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-uʿ''budū","translation_bn":"ও তোমরা ইবাদাত করো","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62754,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّكُمْ","transliteration":"rabbakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62755,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱفْعَلُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-if''ʿalū","translation_bn":"ও তোমরা করো","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62756,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخَيْرَ","transliteration":"l-khayra","translation_bn":"ভালো কাজ","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62757,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallakum","translation_bn":"যাতে তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":62758,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تُفْلِحُونَ ۩","transliteration":"tuf''liḥūna","translation_bn":"সফলকাম হ''তে পারো","root":"فلح","lemma":"أَفْلَحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62760,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٧٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū ir''kaʿū wa-us''judū wa-uʿ''budū rabbakum wa-if''ʿalū l-khayra laʿallakum tuf''liḥūna', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা রুকূ‘ কর, সেজদা কর আর তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের ‘ইবাদাত কর ও সৎকাজ কর যাতে তোমরা সাফল্য লাভ করতে পার। [সাজদাহ]', 'O you who have believed, bow and prostrate and worship your Lord and do good - that you may succeed.', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা রুকূ‘ কর, সেজদা কর আর তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের ‘ইবাদাত কর ও সৎকাজ কর যাতে তোমরা সাফল্য লাভ করতে পার। [সাজদাহ]', 'O you who have believed, bow and prostrate and worship your Lord and do good - that you may succeed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022077.mp3', now()),
  (22, 78, '', '[{"id":63294,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَجَـٰهِدُوا۟","transliteration":"wajāhidū","translation_bn":"আর তোমরা জিহাদ করো","root":"جهد","lemma":"جَٰهَدَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63295,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63296,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর (পথে)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":63297,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"حَقَّ","transliteration":"ḥaqqa","translation_bn":"যথাযথ","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63298,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"جِهَادِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"jihādihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর জিহাদ","root":"جهد","lemma":"جِهَاد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63300,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":63301,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱجْتَبَىٰكُمْ","transliteration":"ij''tabākum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মনোনীত  করেছেন","root":"جبي","lemma":"ٱجْتَبَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63302,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63303,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَ","transliteration":"jaʿala","translation_bn":"আরোপ করেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63304,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63305,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63306,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدِّينِ","transliteration":"l-dīni","translation_bn":"দ্বীনের","root":"دين","lemma":"دِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63307,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোন","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63308,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"حَرَجٍۢ ۚ","transliteration":"ḥarajin","translation_bn":"সংকীর্ণতা","root":"حرج","lemma":"حَرَج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63310,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِّلَّةَ","transliteration":"millata","translation_bn":"ধর্মে (মিল্লাতে)","root":"ملل","lemma":"مِلَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63311,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَبِيكُمْ","transliteration":"abīkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের পিতার (প্রতিষ্ঠিত থাকো)","root":"ابو","lemma":"أَبٌ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63312,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ ۚ","transliteration":"ib''rāhīma","translation_bn":"(অর্থাৎ) ইব্রাহীমের","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":63314,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনি (অর্থাৎ আল্লাহ)","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":63315,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"سَمَّىٰكُمُ","transliteration":"sammākumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের নাম দিয়েছেন","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63316,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-mus''limīna","translation_bn":"মুসলিম","root":"سلم","lemma":"مُسْلِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63317,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63318,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63319,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَفِى","transliteration":"wafī","translation_bn":"এবং মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63320,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এই (ক্বুর''আনেও)","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":63321,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"لِيَكُونَ","transliteration":"liyakūna","translation_bn":"যেন হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63322,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّسُولُ","transliteration":"l-rasūlu","translation_bn":"রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63323,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"شَهِيدًا","transliteration":"shahīdan","translation_bn":"সাক্ষী","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":63324,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63325,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"وَتَكُونُوا۟","transliteration":"watakūnū","translation_bn":"আর তোমরাও হও","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63326,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"شُهَدَآءَ","transliteration":"shuhadāa","translation_bn":"সাক্ষী","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63327,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63328,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"সমস্ত মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63330,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"فَأَقِيمُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-aqīmū","translation_bn":"সুতরাং তোমরা প্রতিষ্ঠা করো","root":"قوم","lemma":"أَقَامَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63331,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","translation_bn":"সালাত","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63332,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"وَءَاتُوا۟","transliteration":"waātū","translation_bn":"ও দাও","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63333,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ","transliteration":"l-zakata","translation_bn":"জাকাত","root":"زكو","lemma":"زَكَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63334,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"وَٱعْتَصِمُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-iʿ''taṣimū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা আঁকড়ে ধরো","root":"عصم","lemma":"ٱعْتَصَمُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63335,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"প্রতি আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63336,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":63337,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"مَوْلَىٰكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"mawlākum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের অভিভাবক","root":"ولي","lemma":"مَوْلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63339,"position":41,"text_uthmani":"فَنِعْمَ","transliteration":"faniʿ''ma","translation_bn":"অতএব কত উত্তম","root":"نعم","lemma":"نِعْمَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63340,"position":42,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَوْلَىٰ","transliteration":"l-mawlā","translation_bn":"অভিভাবক","root":"ولي","lemma":"مَوْلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63341,"position":43,"text_uthmani":"وَنِعْمَ","transliteration":"waniʿ''ma","translation_bn":"আর কত উত্তম","root":"نعم","lemma":"نِعْمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63342,"position":44,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّصِيرُ","transliteration":"l-naṣīru","translation_bn":"সাহায্যকারী","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63343,"position":45,"text_uthmani":"٧٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wajāhidū fī l-lahi ḥaqqa jihādihi huwa ij''tabākum wamā jaʿala ʿalaykum fī l-dīni min ḥarajin millata abīkum ib''rāhīma huwa sammākumu l-mus''limīna min qablu wafī hādhā liyakūna l-rasūlu shahīdan ʿalaykum watakūnū shuhadāa ʿalā l-nāsi fa-aqīmū l-ṣalata waātū l-zakata wa-iʿ''taṣimū bil-lahi huwa mawlākum faniʿ''ma l-mawlā waniʿ''ma l-naṣīru', 'আর আল্লাহর পথে জিহাদ কর যেভাবে জিহাদ করা উচিত। তিনি তোমাদেরকে বেছে নিয়েছেন। দ্বীনের ভিতর তিনি তোমাদের উপর কোন কঠোরতা চাপিয়ে দেননি। এটাই তোমাদের পিতা ইবরাহীমের দ্বীন, আল্লাহ তোমাদের নাম রেখেছেন ‘মুসলিম’ পূর্বেও, আর এ কিতাবেও (ঐ নামই দেয়া হয়েছে) যাতে রসূল তোমাদের জন্য সাক্ষী হয় আর তোমরা সাক্ষী হও মানব জাতির জন্য। কাজেই তোমরা নামায প্রতিষ্ঠা কর, যাকাত দাও আর আল্লাহকে আঁকড়ে ধর। তিনিই তোমাদের অভিভাবক। কতই না উত্তম অভিভাবক আর কতই না উত্তম সাহায্যকারী!', 'And strive for Allah with the striving due to Him. He has chosen you and has not placed upon you in the religion any difficulty. [It is] the religion of your father, Abraham. Allah named you "Muslims" before [in former scriptures] and in this [revelation] that the Messenger may be a witness over you and you may be witnesses over the people. So establish prayer and give zakah and hold fast to Allah. He is your protector; and excellent is the protector, and excellent is the helper.', 'আর আল্লাহর পথে জিহাদ কর যেভাবে জিহাদ করা উচিত। তিনি তোমাদেরকে বেছে নিয়েছেন। দ্বীনের ভিতর তিনি তোমাদের উপর কোন কঠোরতা চাপিয়ে দেননি। এটাই তোমাদের পিতা ইবরাহীমের দ্বীন, আল্লাহ তোমাদের নাম রেখেছেন ‘মুসলিম’ পূর্বেও, আর এ কিতাবেও (ঐ নামই দেয়া হয়েছে) যাতে রসূল তোমাদের জন্য সাক্ষী হয় আর তোমরা সাক্ষী হও মানব জাতির জন্য। কাজেই তোমরা নামায প্রতিষ্ঠা কর, যাকাত দাও আর আল্লাহকে আঁকড়ে ধর। তিনিই তোমাদের অভিভাবক। কতই না উত্তম অভিভাবক আর কতই না উত্তম সাহায্যকারী!', 'And strive for Allah with the striving due to Him. He has chosen you and has not placed upon you in the religion any difficulty. [It is] the religion of your father, Abraham. Allah named you "Muslims" before [in former scriptures] and in this [revelation] that the Messenger may be a witness over you and you may be witnesses over the people. So establish prayer and give zakah and hold fast to Allah. He is your protector; and excellent is the protector, and excellent is the helper.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/022078.mp3', now())
