līna","translation_bn":"পূর্ববর্তীদের\"","root":"اول","lemma":"أَوَّل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65519,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٨٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'laqad wuʿid''nā naḥnu waābāunā hādhā min qablu in hādhā illā asāṭīru l-awalīna', 'এ বিষয়ে আমাদেরকে ওয়া‘দা দেয়া হয়েছে আর অতীতে আমাদের পূর্ব পুরুষদেরকেও। এসব তো পুরনো কালের কিসসা কাহিনী ছাড়া কিছুই না।', 'We have been promised this, we and our forefathers, before; this is not but legends of the former peoples."', 'এ বিষয়ে আমাদেরকে ওয়া‘দা দেয়া হয়েছে আর অতীতে আমাদের পূর্ব পুরুষদেরকেও। এসব তো পুরনো কালের কিসসা কাহিনী ছাড়া কিছুই না।', 'We have been promised this, we and our forefathers, before; this is not but legends of the former peoples."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/023083.mp3', now()),
  (23, 84, '', '[{"id":65891,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُل","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65892,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لِّمَنِ","transliteration":"limani","translation_bn":"\"জন্যে কার (মালিকানায়)","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65893,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضُ","transliteration":"l-arḍu","translation_bn":"(এই) পৃথিবী","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65894,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"ও যা কিছু (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65895,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَآ","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65896,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":65897,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"(তোমরা)","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65898,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা জেনে থাকো\"","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65899,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٨٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul limani l-arḍu waman fīhā in kuntum taʿlamūna', 'বল : এ পৃথিবী আর তার ভিতরে যা আছে তা কার? (বল) যদি তোমরা জান!', 'Say, [O Muhammad], "To whom belongs the earth and whoever is in it, if you should know?"', 'বল : এ পৃথিবী আর তার ভিতরে যা আছে তা কার? (বল) যদি তোমরা জান!', 'Say, [O Muhammad], "To whom belongs the earth and whoever is in it, if you should know?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/023084.mp3', now()),
  (23, 85, '', '[{"id":65993,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"سَيَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"sayaqūlūna","translation_bn":"অচিরেই তারা বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":65994,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"\"জন্যে আল্লাহ্‌রই\"","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65996,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65997,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَا","transliteration":"afalā","translation_bn":"\"কি তবুও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":65998,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَذَكَّرُونَ","transliteration":"tadhakkarūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা শিক্ষা নিবে\"","root":"ذكر","lemma":"تَذَكَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65999,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٨٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'sayaqūlūna lillahi qul afalā tadhakkarūna', 'তারা বলবে- আল্লাহর। বল : তবুও কি তোমরা শিক্ষা গ্রহণ করবে না?', 'They will say, "To Allah." Say, "Then will you not remember?"', 'তারা বলবে- আল্লাহর। বল : তবুও কি তোমরা শিক্ষা গ্রহণ করবে না?', 'They will say, "To Allah." Say, "Then will you not remember?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/023085.mp3', now()),
