2969,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"كِبْرَهُۥ","transliteration":"kib''rahu","translation_bn":"তার বড় (অংশ)","root":"كبر","lemma":"كِبْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":12970,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"মধ্য হ''তে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12971,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তার (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12972,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":12973,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"عَظِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmun","translation_bn":"কঠিন","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":12974,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"١١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১)","root":"—","lemma":"١١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna jāū bil-if''ki ʿuṣ''batun minkum lā taḥsabūhu sharran lakum bal huwa khayrun lakum likulli im''ri-in min''hum mā ik''tasaba mina l-ith''mi wa-alladhī tawallā kib''rahu min''hum lahu ʿadhābun ʿaẓīmun', 'যারা এ অপবাদ উত্থাপন করেছে তারা তোমাদেরই একটি দল, এটাকে তোমাদের জন্য ক্ষতিকর মনে কর না, বরং তা তোমাদের জন্য কল্যাণকর। তাদের প্রত্যেকের জন্য আছে প্রতিফল যতটুকু পাপ সে করেছে। আর এ ব্যাপারে যে নেতৃত্ব দিয়েছে তার জন্য আছে মহা শাস্তি।', 'Indeed, those who came with falsehood are a group among you. Do not think it bad for you; rather it is good for you. For every person among them is what [punishment] he has earned from the sin, and he who took upon himself the greater portion thereof - for him is a great punishment.', 'যারা এ অপবাদ উত্থাপন করেছে তারা তোমাদেরই একটি দল, এটাকে তোমাদের জন্য ক্ষতিকর মনে কর না, বরং তা তোমাদের জন্য কল্যাণকর। তাদের প্রত্যেকের জন্য আছে প্রতিফল যতটুকু পাপ সে করেছে। আর এ ব্যাপারে যে নেতৃত্ব দিয়েছে তার জন্য আছে মহা শাস্তি।', 'Indeed, those who came with falsehood are a group among you. Do not think it bad for you; rather it is good for you. For every person among them is what [punishment] he has earned from the sin, and he who took upon himself the greater portion thereof - for him is a great punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024011.mp3', now()),
  (24, 12, '', '[{"id":14229,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّوْلَآ","transliteration":"lawlā","translation_bn":"কেন না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"উৎসাহবাচক (Exhortation)"},{"id":14230,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":14231,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"سَمِعْتُمُوهُ","transliteration":"samiʿ''tumūhu","translation_bn":"তা তোমরা শুনলে","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14232,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ظَنَّ","transliteration":"ẓanna","translation_bn":"অনুমান করলো","root":"ظنن","lemma":"ظَنَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14233,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minūna","translation_bn":"মু''মিনরা","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":14234,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتُ","transliteration":"wal-mu''minātu","translation_bn":"ও মু''মিন নারীরা","root":"امن","lemma":"مُّؤْمِنَٰت","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":14235,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِأَنفُسِهِمْ","transliteration":"bi-anfusihim","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে তাদের নিজেদের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":14236,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرًۭا","transliteration":"khayran","translation_bn":"ভালো (ধারণা)","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":14237,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"ও (কেন না) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":14238,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَآ","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"\"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":14239,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِفْكٌۭ","transliteration":"if''kun","translation_bn":"মিথ্যা অপবাদ","root":"افك","lemma":"إِفْك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14240,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٌۭ","transliteration":"mubīnun","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট\"","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":14241,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lawlā idh samiʿ''tumūhu ẓanna l-mu''minūna wal-mu''minātu bi-anfusihim khayran waqālū hādhā if''kun mubīnun', 'তোমরা যখন এটা শুনতে পেলে তখন কেন মু’মিন পুরুষ ও মু’মিন স্ত্রীরা তাদের নিজেদের লোক সম্পর্কে ভাল ধারণা করল না আর বলল না, ‘এটা তো খোলাখুলি অপবাদ।’', 'Why, when you heard it, did not the believing men and believing women think good of one another and say, "This is an obvious falsehood"?', 'তোমরা যখন এটা শুনতে পেলে তখন কেন মু’মিন পুরুষ ও মু’মিন স্ত্রীরা তাদের নিজেদের লোক সম্পর্কে ভাল ধারণা করল না আর বলল না, ‘এটা তো খোলাখুলি অপবাদ।’', 'Why, when you heard it, did not the believing men and believing women think good of one another and say, "This is an obvious falsehood"?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024012.mp3', now()),
  (24, 13, '', '[{"id":15340,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّوْلَا","transliteration":"lawlā","translation_bn":"কেন না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"উৎসাহবাচক (Exhortation)"},{"id":15341,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءُو","transliteration":"jāū","translation_bn":"তারা আসলো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15342,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"এ ব্যাপারে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15343,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِأَرْبَعَةِ","transliteration":"bi-arbaʿati","translation_bn":"নিয়ে চারজন","root":"ربع","lemma":"أَرْبَعَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15344,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"شُهَدَآءَ ۚ","transliteration":"shuhadāa","translation_bn":"সাক্ষী","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":15346,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَإِذْ","transliteration":"fa-idh","translation_bn":"কাজেই যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15347,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":15348,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتُوا۟","transliteration":"yatū","translation_bn":"তারা আসে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15349,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلشُّهَدَآءِ","transliteration":"bil-shuhadāi","translation_bn":"নিয়ে সাক্ষীদেরকে","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِيد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15350,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"fa-ulāika","translation_bn":"তাহ''লে ঐসবলোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15351,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"নিকটে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":15352,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":15353,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":15354,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰذِبُونَ","transliteration":"l-kādhibūna","translation_bn":"মিথ্যাবাদী","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَٰذِب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15355,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lawlā jāū ʿalayhi bi-arbaʿati shuhadāa fa-idh lam yatū bil-shuhadāi fa-ulāika ʿinda l-lahi humu l-kādhibūna', 'তারা চারজন সাক্ষী হাযির করল না কেন? যেহেতু তারা সাক্ষী হাযির করেনি সেহেতু আল্লাহর নিকট তারাই মিথ্যেবাদী।', 'Why did they [who slandered] not produce for it four witnesses? And when they do not produce the witnesses, then it is they, in the sight of Allah, who are the liars.', 'তারা চারজন সাক্ষী হাযির করল না কেন? যেহেতু তারা সাক্ষী হাযির করেনি সেহেতু আল্লাহর নিকট তারাই মিথ্যেবাদী।', 'Why did they [who slandered] not produce for it four witnesses? And when they do not produce the witnesses, then it is they, in the sight of Allah, who are the liars.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024013.mp3', now()),
  (24, 14, '', '[{"id":16397,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْلَا","transliteration":"walawlā","translation_bn":"আর যদি না (হতো)","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":16398,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلُ","transliteration":"faḍlu","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16399,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":16400,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16401,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَرَحْمَتُهُۥ","transliteration":"waraḥmatuhu","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর দয়া","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":16402,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16403,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"দুনিয়ার","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":16404,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","transliteration":"wal-ākhirati","translation_bn":"ও আখিরাতে","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":16405,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَمَسَّكُمْ","transliteration":"lamassakum","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তোমাদেরকে স্পর্শ করতো","root":"مسس","lemma":"مَسَّ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":16406,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16407,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যার","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":16408,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَفَضْتُمْ","transliteration":"afaḍtum","translation_bn":"তোমরা জড়িয়ে পড়েছিলে","root":"فيض","lemma":"أَفَاضَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16409,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"সেক্ষেত্রে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16410,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16411,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عَظِيمٌ","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmun","translation_bn":"কঠিন","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":16412,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"١٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walawlā faḍlu l-lahi ʿalaykum waraḥmatuhu fī l-dun''yā wal-ākhirati lamassakum fī mā afaḍtum fīhi ʿadhābun ʿaẓīmun', 'দুনিয়া ও আখিরাতে তোমাদের উপর যদি আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহ ও দয়া না থাকত, তবে তোমরা যাতে তড়িঘড়ি লিপ্ত হয়ে পড়েছিলে তার জন্য মহা শাস্তি তোমাদেরকে পাকড়াও করত।', 'And if it had not been for the favor of Allah upon you and His mercy in this world and the Hereafter, you would have been touched for that [lie] in which you were involved by a great punishment', 'দুনিয়া ও আখিরাতে তোমাদের উপর যদি আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহ ও দয়া না থাকত, তবে তোমরা যাতে তড়িঘড়ি লিপ্ত হয়ে পড়েছিলে তার জন্য মহা শাস্তি তোমাদেরকে পাকড়াও করত।', 'And if it had not been for the favor of Allah upon you and His mercy in this world and the Hereafter, you would have been touched for that [lie] in which you were involved by a great punishment', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024014.mp3', now()),
  (24, 15, '', '[{"id":17261,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":17262,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَلَقَّوْنَهُۥ","transliteration":"talaqqawnahu","translation_bn":"তা তোমরা ছড়াচ্ছিলে","root":"لقي","lemma":"تَلَقَّىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17263,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِأَلْسِنَتِكُمْ","transliteration":"bi-alsinatikum","translation_bn":"দিয়ে তোমাদের জিহ্বা","root":"لسن","lemma":"لِسَان","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17264,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَتَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"wataqūlūna","translation_bn":"ও বলছিলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":17265,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِأَفْوَاهِكُم","transliteration":"bi-afwāhikum","translation_bn":"দিয়ে তোমাদের মুখ","root":"فوه","lemma":"أَفْوَٰه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17266,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যার","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":17267,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَيْسَ","transliteration":"laysa","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17268,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17269,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে সে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17270,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿil''mun","translation_bn":"কোন জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17271,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَتَحْسَبُونَهُۥ","transliteration":"wataḥsabūnahu","translation_bn":"আর তা তোমরা মনে করছিলে","root":"حسب","lemma":"حَسِبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":17272,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"هَيِّنًۭا","transliteration":"hayyinan","translation_bn":"তুচ্ছ","root":"هون","lemma":"هَيِّن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17273,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"অথচ তা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":17274,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"নিকট","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":17275,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":17276,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَظِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmun","translation_bn":"গুরুতর","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17277,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'idh talaqqawnahu bi-alsinatikum wataqūlūna bi-afwāhikum mā laysa lakum bihi ʿil''mun wataḥsabūnahu hayyinan wahuwa ʿinda l-lahi ʿaẓīmun', 'যখন এটা তোমরা মুখে মুখে ছড়াচ্ছিলে আর তোমাদের মুখ দিয়ে এমন কথা বলছিলে যে বিষয়ে তোমাদের কোন জ্ঞান ছিল না, আর তোমরা এটাকে নগণ্য ব্যাপার মনে করেছিলে, কিন্তু আল্লাহর নিকট তা ছিল গুরুতর ব্যাপার।', 'When you received it with your tongues and said with your mouths that of which you had no knowledge and thought it was insignificant while it was, in the sight of Allah, tremendous.', 'যখন এটা তোমরা মুখে মুখে ছড়াচ্ছিলে আর তোমাদের মুখ দিয়ে এমন কথা বলছিলে যে বিষয়ে তোমাদের কোন জ্ঞান ছিল না, আর তোমরা এটাকে নগণ্য ব্যাপার মনে করেছিলে, কিন্তু আল্লাহর নিকট তা ছিল গুরুতর ব্যাপার।', 'When you received it with your tongues and said with your mouths that of which you had no knowledge and thought it was insignificant while it was, in the sight of Allah, tremendous.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024015.mp3', now()),
  (24, 16, '', '[{"id":18292,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْلَآ","transliteration":"walawlā","translation_bn":"এবং কেন না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":18293,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":18294,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"سَمِعْتُمُوهُ","transliteration":"samiʿ''tumūhu","translation_bn":"তা তোমরা শুনেছিলে","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18295,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قُلْتُم","transliteration":"qul''tum","translation_bn":"বললে তোমরা","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18296,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"\"নয়","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":18297,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَكُونُ","transliteration":"yakūnu","translation_bn":"হবার (শোভা পায়)","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18298,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَنَآ","transliteration":"lanā","translation_bn":"জন্যে আমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَنَآ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18299,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":18300,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"نَّتَكَلَّمَ","transliteration":"natakallama","translation_bn":"কথা বলবো আমরা","root":"كلم","lemma":"يَتَكَلَّمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18301,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِهَـٰذَا","transliteration":"bihādhā","translation_bn":"এ বিষয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18302,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"سُبْحَـٰنَكَ","transliteration":"sub''ḥānaka","translation_bn":"(হে আল্লাহ) তুমি মহান পবিত্র","root":"سبح","lemma":"سُبْحَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18303,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটাতো","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":18304,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بُهْتَـٰنٌ","transliteration":"buh''tānun","translation_bn":"অপবাদ","root":"بهت","lemma":"بُهْتَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18305,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَظِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmun","translation_bn":"গুরুতর\"","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":18306,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walawlā idh samiʿ''tumūhu qul''tum mā yakūnu lanā an natakallama bihādhā sub''ḥānaka hādhā buh''tānun ʿaẓīmun', 'তোমরা যখন এটা শুনলে তখন তোমরা কেন বললে না যে, এ ব্যাপারে আমাদের কথা বলা ঠিক নয়। আল্লাহ পবিত্র ও মহান, এটা তো এক গুরুতর অপবাদ!', 'And why, when you heard it, did you not say, "It is not for us to speak of this. Exalted are You, [O Allah]; this is a great slander"?', 'তোমরা যখন এটা শুনলে তখন তোমরা কেন বললে না যে, এ ব্যাপারে আমাদের কথা বলা ঠিক নয়। আল্লাহ পবিত্র ও মহান, এটা তো এক গুরুতর অপবাদ!', 'And why, when you heard it, did you not say, "It is not for us to speak of this. Exalted are You, [O Allah]; this is a great slander"?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024016.mp3', now()),
  (24, 17, '', '[{"id":19289,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَعِظُكُمُ","transliteration":"yaʿiẓukumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপদেশ করেন","root":"وعظ","lemma":"وَعَظْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19290,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":19291,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে (না)","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":19292,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَعُودُوا۟","transliteration":"taʿūdū","translation_bn":"পুনরাবৃত্তি করো","root":"عود","lemma":"عَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19293,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لِمِثْلِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"limith''lihi","translation_bn":"অনুরূপ তার","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19294,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَبَدًا","transliteration":"abadan","translation_bn":"কখনও","root":"ابد","lemma":"أَبَدًا","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":19295,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":19296,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُم","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা হয়ে থাকো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19297,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مُّؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু''মিন","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19298,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yaʿiẓukumu l-lahu an taʿūdū limith''lihi abadan in kuntum mu''minīna', 'আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে উপদেশ দিচ্ছেন তোমরা আর কখনো এর (অর্থাৎ এ আচরণের) পুনরাবৃত্তি করো না যদি তোমরা মু’মিন হয়ে থাক।', 'Allah warns you against returning to the likes of this [conduct], ever, if you should be believers.', 'আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে উপদেশ দিচ্ছেন তোমরা আর কখনো এর (অর্থাৎ এ আচরণের) পুনরাবৃত্তি করো না যদি তোমরা মু’মিন হয়ে থাক।', 'Allah warns you against returning to the likes of this [conduct], ever, if you should be believers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024017.mp3', now()),
  (24, 18, '', '[{"id":20209,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيُبَيِّنُ","transliteration":"wayubayyinu","translation_bn":"এবং সুস্পষ্ট বর্ণনা করেছেন","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيَّنُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":20210,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":20211,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمُ","transliteration":"lakumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20212,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-āyāti","translation_bn":"আয়াতসমূহ","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":20214,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"আর আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":20215,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"সর্বজ্ঞ","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20216,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"حَكِيمٌ","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞাময়","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":20217,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"١٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayubayyinu l-lahu lakumu l-āyāti wal-lahu ʿalīmun ḥakīmun', 'আল্লাহ তোমাদের জন্য স্পষ্টভাবে আয়াত বর্ণনা করছেন, কারণ তিনি হলেন সর্ববিষয়ে জ্ঞানের অধিকারী, বড়ই হিকমতওয়ালা।', 'And Allah makes clear to you the verses, and Allah is Knowing and Wise.', 'আল্লাহ তোমাদের জন্য স্পষ্টভাবে আয়াত বর্ণনা করছেন, কারণ তিনি হলেন সর্ববিষয়ে জ্ঞানের অধিকারী, বড়ই হিকমতওয়ালা।', 'And Allah makes clear to you the verses, and Allah is Knowing and Wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024018.mp3', now()),
  (24, 19, '', '[{"id":21745,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":21746,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":21747,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُحِبُّونَ","transliteration":"yuḥibbūna","translation_bn":"পছন্দ করে","root":"حبب","lemma":"أَحْبَبْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21748,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":21749,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَشِيعَ","transliteration":"tashīʿa","translation_bn":"প্রসার লাভ করুক","root":"شيع","lemma":"تَشِيعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21750,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَـٰحِشَةُ","transliteration":"l-fāḥishatu","translation_bn":"নির্লজ্জতা","root":"فحش","lemma":"فَٰحِشَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":21751,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":21752,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":21753,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21754,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":21755,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":21756,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"alīmun","translation_bn":"নিদার