ul punishment in this world and the Hereafter. And Allah knows and you do not know.', 'যারা পছন্দ করে যে, মু’মিনদের মধ্যে অশ্লীলতার বিস্তৃতি ঘটুক তাদের জন্য আছে ভয়াবহ শাস্তি দুনিয়া ও আখিরাতে। আল্লাহ জানেন আর তোমরা জান না।', 'Indeed, those who like that immorality should be spread [or publicized] among those who have believed will have a painful punishment in this world and the Hereafter. And Allah knows and you do not know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024019.mp3', now()),
  (24, 20, '', '[{"id":22444,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْلَا","transliteration":"walawlā","translation_bn":"এবং যদি না (হতো)","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":22445,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلُ","transliteration":"faḍlu","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":22446,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":22447,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":22448,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَرَحْمَتُهُۥ","transliteration":"waraḥmatuhu","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর দয়া (তবে নিকৃষ্ট পরিণাম হতো)","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":22449,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"কিন্তু নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":22450,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":22451,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَءُوفٌۭ","transliteration":"raūfun","translation_bn":"বড়ই দয়াবান","root":"راف","lemma":"رَءُوف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":22452,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":22453,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٢٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২০)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walawlā faḍlu l-lahi ʿalaykum waraḥmatuhu wa-anna l-laha raūfun raḥīmun', 'তোমাদের প্রতি আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহ ও দয়া না থাকলে (তোমরা ধ্বংস হয়ে যেতে), আল্লাহ দয়ার্দ্র, বড়ই দয়াবান।', 'And if it had not been for the favor of Allah upon you and His mercy... and because Allah is Kind and Merciful.', 'তোমাদের প্রতি আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহ ও দয়া না থাকলে (তোমরা ধ্বংস হয়ে যেতে), আল্লাহ দয়ার্দ্র, বড়ই দয়াবান।', 'And if it had not been for the favor of Allah upon you and His mercy... and because Allah is Kind and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024020.mp3', now()),
