":"min","translation_bn":"তৈরি","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43843,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"بَرَدٍۢ","transliteration":"baradin","translation_bn":"বরফ (শিলা)","root":"برد","lemma":"بَرَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43844,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"فَيُصِيبُ","transliteration":"fayuṣību","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তিনি পৌঁছান (ক্ষতি)","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43845,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"দিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43846,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":43847,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করেন তিনি","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43848,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"وَيَصْرِفُهُۥ","transliteration":"wayaṣrifuhu","translation_bn":"আবার তা ফিরিয়ে রাখেন","root":"صرف","lemma":"صَرَفَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43849,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43850,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"مَّن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যার","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":43851,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ ۖ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43853,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"يَكَادُ","transliteration":"yakādu","translation_bn":"উপক্রম হয় (যেন মনে হয়)","root":"كود","lemma":"كَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43854,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"سَنَا","transliteration":"sanā","translation_bn":"ঝলক","root":"سنو","lemma":"سَنَا","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43855,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"بَرْقِهِۦ","transliteration":"barqihi","translation_bn":"তার বিদ্যুৎ ঝলক","root":"برق","lemma":"بَرْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43856,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"يَذْهَبُ","transliteration":"yadhhabu","translation_bn":"কেড়ে নিয়ে যাবে","root":"ذهب","lemma":"ذَهَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43857,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْأَبْصَـٰرِ","transliteration":"bil-abṣāri","translation_bn":"নিয়ে দৃষ্টিশক্তিকে","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصَر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43858,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"٤٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alam tara anna l-laha yuz''jī saḥāban thumma yu-allifu baynahu thumma yajʿaluhu rukāman fatarā l-wadqa yakhruju min khilālihi wayunazzilu mina l-samāi min jibālin fīhā min baradin fayuṣību bihi man yashāu wayaṣrifuhu ʿan man yashāu yakādu sanā barqihi yadhhabu bil-abṣāri', 'তুমি কি দেখ না আল্লাহ মেঘমালাকে চালিত করেন, অতঃপর সেগুলোকে একত্রে জুড়ে দেন, অতঃপর সেগুলোকে স্তুপীকৃত করেন, অতঃপর তুমি তার মধ্য থেকে পানির ধারা বের হতে দেখতে পাও, অতঃপর তিনি আকাশে স্থিত মেঘমালার পাহাড় থেকে শিলা বর্ষণ করেন, অতঃপর তিনি যাকে ইচ্ছে তা দিয়ে আঘাত করেন আর যার কাছ থেকে ইচ্ছে তা সরিয়ে নেন। তার বিদ্যুতের চমক দৃষ্টিশক্তি প্রায় কেড়ে নেয়।', 'Do you not see that Allah drives clouds? Then He brings them together, then He makes them into a mass, and you see the rain emerge from within it. And He sends down from the sky, mountains [of clouds] within which is hail, and He strikes with it whom He wills and averts it from whom He wills. The flash of its lightening almost takes away the eyesight.', 'তুমি কি দেখ না আল্লাহ মেঘমালাকে চালিত করেন, অতঃপর সেগুলোকে একত্রে জুড়ে দেন, অতঃপর সেগুলোকে স্তুপীকৃত করেন, অতঃপর তুমি তার মধ্য থেকে পানির ধারা বের হতে দেখতে পাও, অতঃপর তিনি আকাশে স্থিত মেঘমালার পাহাড় থেকে শিলা বর্ষণ করেন, অতঃপর তিনি যাকে ইচ্ছে তা দিয়ে আঘাত করেন আর যার কাছ থেকে ইচ্ছে তা সরিয়ে নেন। তার বিদ্যুতের চমক দৃষ্টিশক্তি প্রায় কেড়ে নেয়।', 'Do you not see that Allah drives clouds? Then He brings them together, then He makes them into a mass, and you see the rain emerge from within it. And He sends down from the sky, mountains [of clouds] within which is hail, and He strikes with it whom He wills and averts it from whom He wills. The flash of its lightening almost takes away the eyesight.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024043.mp3', now()),
  (24, 44, '', '[{"id":44766,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يُقَلِّبُ","transliteration":"yuqallibu","translation_bn":"আবর্তন ঘটান","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلَّبُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44767,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":44768,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلَ","transliteration":"al-layla","translation_bn":"রাতকে","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44769,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلنَّهَارَ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-nahāra","translation_bn":"ও দিনকে","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44771,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":44772,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44773,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":44774,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَعِبْرَةًۭ","transliteration":"laʿib''ratan","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই শিক্ষা","root":"عبر","lemma":"عِبْرَة","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":44775,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لِّأُو۟لِى","transliteration":"li-ulī","translation_bn":"জন্যে সম্পন্নদের","root":"اول","lemma":"أُولِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44776,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَبْصَـٰرِ","transliteration":"l-abṣāri","translation_bn":"অন্তর্দৃষ্টি","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44777,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٤٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yuqallibu l-lahu al-layla wal-nahāra inna fī dhālika laʿib''ratan li-ulī l-abṣāri', 'আল্লাহ রাত দিনের আবর্তন ঘটান, অন্তর্দৃষ্টি সম্পন্ন লোকেদের জন্য এতে শিক্ষণীয় বিষয় রয়েছে।', 'Allah alternates the night and the day. Indeed in that is a lesson for those who have vision.', 'আল্লাহ রাত দিনের আবর্তন ঘটান, অন্তর্দৃষ্টি সম্পন্ন লোকেদের জন্য এতে শিক্ষণীয় বিষয় রয়েছে।', 'Allah alternates the night and the day. Indeed in that is a lesson for those who have vision.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024044.mp3', now()),
