on":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":45262,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ ۚ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি চান","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45264,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":45265,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":45266,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45267,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45268,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45269,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"قَدِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"qadīrun","translation_bn":"সর্বশক্তিমান","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45270,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"٤٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wal-lahu khalaqa kulla dābbatin min māin famin''hum man yamshī ʿalā baṭnihi wamin''hum man yamshī ʿalā rij''layni wamin''hum man yamshī ʿalā arbaʿin yakhluqu l-lahu mā yashāu inna l-laha ʿalā kulli shayin qadīrun', 'আল্লাহ পানি হতে সমস্ত জীবন সৃষ্টি করেছেন। তাদের কতক পেটের ভরে চলে, কতক দু’পায়ের উপর চলে, আর কতক চার পায়ের উপর চলে। আল্লাহ যা চান তাই সৃষ্টি করেন। আল্লাহ সর্ববিষয়ের উপর সর্বোচ্চ ক্ষমতার অধিকারী।', 'Allah has created every [living] creature from water. And of them are those that move on their bellies, and of them are those that walk on two legs, and of them are those that walk on four. Allah creates what He wills. Indeed, Allah is over all things competent.', 'আল্লাহ পানি হতে সমস্ত জীবন সৃষ্টি করেছেন। তাদের কতক পেটের ভরে চলে, কতক দু’পায়ের উপর চলে, আর কতক চার পায়ের উপর চলে। আল্লাহ যা চান তাই সৃষ্টি করেন। আল্লাহ সর্ববিষয়ের উপর সর্বোচ্চ ক্ষমতার অধিকারী।', 'Allah has created every [living] creature from water. And of them are those that move on their bellies, and of them are those that walk on two legs, and of them are those that walk on four. Allah creates what He wills. Indeed, Allah is over all things competent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024045.mp3', now()),
  (24, 46, '', '[{"id":46118,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّقَدْ","transliteration":"laqad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":46119,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلْنَآ","transliteration":"anzalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা অবতীর্ণ করেছি","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46120,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"āyātin","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনসমূহ","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46121,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مُّبَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ ۚ","transliteration":"mubayyinātin","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبَيِّنَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":46123,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46124,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِى","transliteration":"yahdī","translation_bn":"পরিচালিত করবেন","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46125,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":46126,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি চান","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46127,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46128,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"صِرَٰطٍۢ","transliteration":"ṣirāṭin","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"صرط","lemma":"صِرَٰط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46129,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"mus''taqīmin","translation_bn":"সরল সোজা","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّسْتَقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46130,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٤٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'laqad anzalnā āyātin mubayyinātin wal-lahu yahdī man yashāu ilā ṣirāṭin mus''taqīmin', 'আমি সুস্পষ্ট নিদর্শন অবতীর্ণ করেছি, আল্লাহ যাকে চান সরল সঠিক পথ প্রদর্শন করেন।', 'We have certainly sent down distinct verses. And Allah guides whom He wills to a straight path.', 'আমি সুস্পষ্ট নিদর্শন অবতীর্ণ করেছি, আল্লাহ যাকে চান সরল সঠিক পথ প্রদর্শন করেন।', 'We have certainly sent down distinct verses. And Allah guides whom He wills to a straight path.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024046.mp3', now()),
  (24, 47, '', '[{"id":46720,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"wayaqūlūna","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46721,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنَّا","transliteration":"āmannā","translation_bn":"\"আমরা ঈমান এনেছি","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46722,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"উপর আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46723,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَبِٱلرَّسُولِ","transliteration":"wabil-rasūli","translation_bn":"ও উপর রাসূলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46724,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَأَطَعْنَا","transliteration":"wa-aṭaʿnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা আনুগত্য করেছি\"","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46725,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর (কিন্তু)","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46726,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَتَوَلَّىٰ","transliteration":"yatawallā","translation_bn":"মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়","root":"ولي","lemma":"تَوَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46727,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَرِيقٌۭ","transliteration":"farīqun","translation_bn":"একদল","root":"فرق","lemma":"فَرِيق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46728,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُم","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46729,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِّنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46730,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِ","transliteration":"baʿdi","translation_bn":"পর","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46731,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ ۚ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":46733,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46734,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐ সব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":46735,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"bil-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু''মিন","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46736,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٤٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayaqūlūna āmannā bil-lahi wabil-rasūli wa-aṭaʿnā thumma yatawallā farīqun min''hum min baʿdi dhālika wamā ulāika bil-mu''minīna', 'তারা বলে- আমরা আল্লাহর প্রতি ইমান আনলাম আর রসূলের প্রতিও আর আমরা মেনে নিলাম। কিন্তু এরপরও তাদের মধ্যেকার একদল মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়, তারা (প্রকৃতপক্ষে) মু’মিন নয়।', 'But the hypocrites say, "We have believed in Allah and in the Messenger, and we obey"; then a party of them turns away after that. And those are not believers.', 'তারা বলে- আমরা আল্লাহর প্রতি ইমান আনলাম আর রসূলের প্রতিও আর আমরা মেনে নিলাম। কিন্তু এরপরও তাদের মধ্যেকার একদল মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়, তারা (প্রকৃতপক্ষে) মু’মিন নয়।', 'But the hypocrites say, "We have believed in Allah and in the Messenger, and we obey"; then a party of them turns away after that. And those are not believers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024047.mp3', now()),
  (24, 48, '', '[{"id":47454,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47455,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"دُعُوٓا۟","transliteration":"duʿū","translation_bn":"ডাকা হয় তাদেরকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47456,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47457,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ তা''লার","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":47458,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولِهِۦ","transliteration":"warasūlihi","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসূলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47459,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِيَحْكُمَ","transliteration":"liyaḥkuma","translation_bn":"জন্যে মীমাংসার","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكَمَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47460,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُمْ","transliteration":"baynahum","translation_bn":"তাদের মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":47461,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"তখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":47462,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَرِيقٌۭ","transliteration":"farīqun","translation_bn":"একদল","root":"فرق","lemma":"فَرِيق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47463,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُم","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47464,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مُّعْرِضُونَ","transliteration":"muʿ''riḍūna","translation_bn":"মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়","root":"عرض","lemma":"مُّعْرِضُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47465,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٤٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā duʿū ilā l-lahi warasūlihi liyaḥkuma baynahum idhā farīqun min''hum muʿ''riḍūna', 'তাদেরকে যখন তাদের মাঝে ফয়সালা করার উদ্দেশে আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের পানে আহবান করা হয়, তখন তাদের একদল মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়।', 'And when they are called to [the words of] Allah and His Messenger to judge between them, at once a party of them turns aside [in refusal].', 'তাদেরকে যখন তাদের মাঝে ফয়সালা করার উদ্দেশে আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের পানে আহবান করা হয়, তখন তাদের একদল মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়।', 'And when they are called to [the words of] Allah and His Messenger to judge between them, at once a party of them turns aside [in refusal].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024048.mp3', now()),
  (24, 49, '', '[{"id":47695,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"আর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47696,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَكُن","transliteration":"yakun","translation_bn":"হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47697,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47698,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقُّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","translation_bn":"সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47699,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتُوٓا۟","transliteration":"yatū","translation_bn":"তারা আসে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47700,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"তার দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47701,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُذْعِنِينَ","transliteration":"mudh''ʿinīna","translation_bn":"বিনীত হয়ে","root":"ذعن","lemma":"مُذْعِنِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47702,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-in yakun lahumu l-ḥaqu yatū ilayhi mudh''ʿinīna', 'কিন্তু ‘হাক’ (অর্থাৎ প্রাপ্য) যদি তাদের পক্ষে থাকে তাহলে পূর্ণ বিনয়ের সঙ্গে তারা রসূলের দিকে ছুটে আসে।', 'But if the right is theirs, they come to him in prompt obedience.', 'কিন্তু ‘হাক’ (অর্থাৎ প্রাপ্য) যদি তাদের পক্ষে থাকে তাহলে পূর্ণ বিনয়ের সঙ্গে তারা রসূলের দিকে ছুটে আসে।', 'But if the right is theirs, they come to him in prompt obedience.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024049.mp3', now()),
  (24, 50, '', '[{"id":48702,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَفِى","transliteration":"afī","translation_bn":"কি আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":48703,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِهِم","transliteration":"qulūbihim","translation_bn":"তাদের অন্তরসমূহে","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48704,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَّرَضٌ","transliteration":"maraḍun","translation_bn":"রোগ","root":"مرض","lemma":"مَّرَض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48705,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَمِ","transliteration":"ami","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48706,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱرْتَابُوٓا۟","transliteration":"ir''tābū","translation_bn":"তারা সন্দেহ করে","root":"ريب","lemma":"ٱرْتَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48707,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَمْ","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48708,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَخَافُونَ","transliteration":"yakhāfūna","translation_bn":"তারা ভয় করে","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48709,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":48710,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَحِيفَ","transliteration":"yaḥīfa","translation_bn":"অন্যায় করবেন","root":"حيف","lemma":"يَحِيفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48711,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":48712,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48713,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولُهُۥ ۚ","transliteration":"warasūluhu","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48715,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":48716,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐ সব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":48717,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":48718,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimūna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48719,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٥٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫০)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'afī qulūbihim maraḍun ami ir''tābū am yakhāfūna an yaḥīfa l-lahu ʿalayhim warasūluhu bal ulāika humu l-ẓālimūna', 'তাদের অন্তরে কি রোগ আছে, না তারা সন্দেহ পোষণ করে? না তারা এই ভয়ের মধ্যে আছে যে আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূল তাদের প্রতি অন্যায় করবেন? তা নয়, আসলে তারা নিজেরাই অন্যায়কারী।', 'Is there disease in their hearts? Or have they doubted? Or do they fear that Allah will be unjust to them, or His Messenger? Rather, it is they who are the wrongdoers.', 'তাদের অন্তরে কি রোগ আছে, না তারা সন্দেহ পোষণ করে? না তারা এই ভয়ের মধ্যে আছে যে আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূল তাদের প্রতি অন্যায় করবেন? তা নয়, আসলে তারা নিজেরাই অন্যায়কারী।', 'Is there disease in their hearts? Or have they doubted? Or do they fear that Allah will be unjust to them, or His Messenger? Rather, it is they who are the wrongdoers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024050.mp3', now()),
  (24, 51, '', '[{"id":49533,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"মূলতঃ","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":49534,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো (শোভা পেত)","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49535,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَوْلَ","transliteration":"qawla","translation_bn":"উক্তি","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49536,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু''মিনদের","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49537,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":49538,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"دُعُوٓا۟","transliteration":"duʿū","translation_bn":"ডাকা হয় তাদেরকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49539,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49540,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":49541,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولِهِۦ","transliteration":"warasūlihi","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসূলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49542,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِيَحْكُمَ","transliteration":"liyaḥkuma","translation_bn":"জন্যে মীমাংসার","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكَمَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49543,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُمْ","transliteration":"baynahum","translation_bn":"তাদের মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":49544,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":49545,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُوا۟","transliteration":"yaqūlū","translation_bn":"তারা বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49546,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"سَمِعْنَا","transliteration":"samiʿ''nā","translation_bn":"\"আমরা শুনলাম","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49547,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَأَطَعْنَا ۚ","transliteration":"wa-aṭaʿnā","translation_bn":"ও আমরা মেনে নিলাম\"","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49549,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"wa-ulāika","translation_bn":"আর ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49550,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":49551,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُفْلِحُونَ","transliteration":"l-muf''liḥūna","translation_bn":"সফলকাম","root":"فلح","lemma":"مُفْلِحُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49552,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٥١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫১)","root":"—","lemma":"٥١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innamā kāna qawla l-mu''minīna idhā duʿū ilā l-lahi warasūlihi liyaḥkuma baynahum an yaqūlū samiʿ''nā wa-aṭaʿnā wa-ulāika humu l-muf''liḥūna', 'মু’মিনদেরকে যখন তাদের মাঝে ফয়সালা করার জন্য আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের দিকে ডাকা হয়, তখন মু’মিনদের জওয়াব তো এই হয় যে, তারা বলে, আমরা শুনলাম ও মেনে নিলাম, আর তারাই সফলকাম।', 'The only statement of the [true] believers when they are called to Allah and His Messenger to judge between them is that they say, "We hear and we obey." And those are the successful.', 'মু’মিনদেরকে যখন তাদের মাঝে ফয়সালা করার জন্য আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের দিকে ডাকা হয়, তখন মু’মিনদের জওয়াব তো এই হয় যে, তারা বলে, আমরা শুনলাম ও মেনে নিলাম, আর তারাই সফলকাম।', 'The only statement of the [true] believers when they are called to Allah and His Messenger to judge between them is that they say, "We hear and we obey." And those are the successful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024051.mp3', now()),
  (24, 52, '', '[{"id":49978,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"আর যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49979,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُطِعِ","transliteration":"yuṭiʿi","translation_bn":"আনুগত্য করে","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49980,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":49981,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولَهُۥ","transliteration":"warasūlahu","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসূলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49982,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَيَخْشَ","transliteration":"wayakhsha","translation_bn":"এবং ভয় করে","root":"خشي","lemma":"خَشِىَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49983,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌কে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":49984,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَيَتَّقْهِ","transliteration":"wayattaqhi","translation_bn":"ও (তাঁর শাস্তি হ''তে) সাবধান থাকে","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49985,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"fa-ulāika","translation_bn":"অতঃপর ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49986,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":49987,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَآئِزُونَ","transliteration":"l-fāizūna","translation_bn":"সফলকাম","root":"فوز","lemma":"فَا^ئِزُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49988,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٥٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫২)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waman yuṭiʿi l-laha warasūlahu wayakhsha l-laha wayattaqhi fa-ulāika humu l-fāizūna', 'যারা আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের আনুগত্য করে, আল্লাহকে ভয় করে ও তাঁর অবাধ্যতা পরিহার করে চলে তারাই কৃতকার্য।', 'And whoever obeys Allah and His Messenger and fears Allah and is conscious of Him - it is those who are the attainers.', 'যারা আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের আনুগত্য করে, আল্লাহকে ভয় করে ও তাঁর অবাধ্যতা পরিহার করে চলে তারাই কৃতকার্য।', 'And whoever obeys Allah and His Messenger and fears Allah and is conscious of Him - it is those who are the attainers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024052.mp3', now()),
  (24, 53, '', '[{"id":50616,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَأَقْسَمُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-aqsamū","translation_bn":"এবং (মুনাফিকরা) শপথ করে","root":"قسم","lemma":"أَقْسَمُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50617,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"নামে আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50618,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَهْدَ","transliteration":"jahda","translation_bn":"দৃঢ় ভাবে (করে)","root":"جهد","lemma":"جَهْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50619,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَيْمَـٰنِهِمْ","transliteration":"aymānihim","translation_bn":"তাদের শপথগুলোকে","root":"يمن","lemma":"يَمِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50620,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَئِنْ","transliteration":"la-in","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":50621,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَمَرْتَهُمْ","transliteration":"amartahum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে তুমি নির্দেশ দাও","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50622,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَيَخْرُجُنَّ ۖ","transliteration":"layakhrujunna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তারা (জিহাদের জন্যে) বের হবে","root":"خرج","lemma":"خَرَجَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":50624,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قُل","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50625,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":50626,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"تُقْسِمُوا۟ ۖ","transliteration":"tuq''simū","translation_bn":"তোমরা শপথ করো","root":"قسم","lemma":"أَقْسَمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50628,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"طَاعَةٌۭ","transliteration":"ṭāʿatun","translation_bn":"আনুগত্য","root":"طوع","lemma":"طَاعَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50629,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَّعْرُوفَةٌ ۚ","transliteration":"maʿrūfatun","translation_bn":"যথার্থই (কাম্য)","root":"عرف","lemma":"مَّعْرُوفَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50631,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":50632,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":50633,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"خَبِيرٌۢ","transliteration":"khabīrun","translation_bn":"খুব অবহিত","root":"خبر","lemma":"خَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":50634,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ সম্পর্কে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50635,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"কাজ করছো তোমরা\"","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50636,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٥٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-aqsamū bil-lahi jahda aymānihim la-in amartahum layakhrujunna qul lā tuq''simū ṭāʿatun maʿrūfatun inna l-laha khabīrun bimā taʿmalūna', '(হে নবী!) তারা শক্ত করে কসম খেয়ে বলে যে, তুমি তাদেরকে আদেশ করলে তারা অবশ্য অবশ্যই বের হবে, বল : তোমরা কসম খেয়ো না, স্বাভাবিক আনুগত্যই কাম্য, বস্তুতঃ তোমরা যা কর, আল্লাহ সে সম্পর্কে সম্পূর্ণ অবহিত।', 'And they swear by Allah their strongest oaths that if you ordered them, they would go forth [in Allah ''s cause]. Say, "Do not swear. [Such] obedience is known. Indeed, Allah is Acquainted with that which you do."', '(হে নবী!) তারা শক্ত করে কসম খেয়ে বলে যে, তুমি তাদেরকে আদেশ করলে তারা অবশ্য অবশ্যই বের হবে, বল : তোমরা কসম খেয়ো না, স্বাভাবিক আনুগত্যই কাম্য, বস্তুতঃ তোমরা যা কর, আল্লাহ সে সম্পর্কে সম্পূর্ণ অবহিত।', 'And they swear by Allah their strongest oaths that if you ordered them, they would go forth [in Allah ''s cause]. Say, "Do not swear. [Such] obedience is known. Indeed, Allah is Acquainted with that which you do."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024053.mp3', now()),
  (24, 54, '', '[{"id":51208,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51209,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَطِيعُوا۟","transliteration":"aṭīʿū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা আনুগত্য করো","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51210,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":51211,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَأَطِيعُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-aṭīʿū","translation_bn":"ও তোমরা আনুগত্য করো","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51212,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّسُولَ ۖ","transliteration":"l-rasūla","translation_bn":"রাসূলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51214,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَإِن","transliteration":"fa-in","translation_bn":"কিন্তু যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51215,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَوَلَّوْا۟","transliteration":"tawallaw","translation_bn":"তোমরা মুখ ফিরাও","root":"ولي","lemma":"تَوَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51216,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّمَا","transliteration":"fa-innamā","translation_bn":"তবে (জেনে রাখো) প্রকৃতপক্ষে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51217,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51218,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":51219,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"حُمِّلَ","transliteration":"ḥummila","translation_bn":"তাকে (দায়িত্ব) ভার দেয়া হয়েছে","root":"حمل","lemma":"حُمِّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51220,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَعَلَيْكُم","transliteration":"waʿalaykum","translation_bn":"আর তোমাদের উপর (দায়িত্ব)","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51221,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":51222,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"حُمِّلْتُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"ḥummil''tum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের (দায়িত্ব) ভার দেয়া হয়েছে","root":"حمل","lemma":"حُمِّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51224,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"আর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51225,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"تُطِيعُوهُ","transliteration":"tuṭīʿūhu","translation_bn":"তার আনুগত্য করো","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51226,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"تَهْتَدُوا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"tahtadū","translation_bn":"তোমরা সঠিক পথ পাবে","root":"هدي","lemma":"ٱهْتَدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51228,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51229,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"(দায়িত্ব) উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51230,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّسُولِ","transliteration":"l-rasūli","translation_bn":"রাসূলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51231,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া যে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":51232,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَلَـٰغُ","transliteration":"l-balāghu","translation_bn":"পৌঁছান (বিধান)","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَلَٰغ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51233,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُبِينُ","transliteration":"l-mubīnu","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্টভাবে\"","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51234,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"٥٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul aṭīʿū l-laha wa-aṭīʿū l-rasūla fa-in tawallaw fa-innamā ʿalayhi mā ḥummila waʿalaykum mā ḥummil''tum wa-in tuṭīʿūhu tahtadū wamā ʿalā l-rasūli illā l-balāghu l-mubīnu', 'বল : আল্লাহর আনুগত্য ও রসূলের আনুগত্য কর, অতঃপর যদি তোমরা মুখ ফিরিয়ে লও তাহলে তার (অর্থাৎ রসূলের) উপর অর্পিত দায়িত্বের জন্য সে দায়ী, আর তোমাদের উপর অর্পিত দায়িত্বের জন্য তোমরাই দায়ী, তোমরা যদি তার আনুগত্য কর তবে সঠিক পথ পাবে, রসূলের দায়িত্ব হচ্ছে স্পষ্টভাবে (বাণী) পৌঁছে দেয়া।', 'Say, "Obey Allah and obey the Messenger; but if you turn away - then upon him is only that [duty] with which he has been charged, and upon you is that with which you have been charged. And if you obey him, you will be [rightly] guided. And there is not upon the Messenger except the [responsibility for] clear notification."', 'বল : আল্লাহর আনুগত্য ও রসূলের আনুগত্য কর, অতঃপর যদি তোমরা মুখ ফিরিয়ে লও তাহলে তার (অর্থাৎ রসূলের) উপর অর্পিত দায়িত্বের জন্য সে দায়ী, আর তোমাদের উপর অর্পিত দায়িত্বের জন্য তোমরাই দায়ী, তোমরা যদি তার আনুগত্য কর তবে সঠিক পথ পাবে, রসূলের দায়িত্ব হচ্ছে স্পষ্টভাবে (বাণী) পৌঁছে দেয়া।', 'Say, "Obey Allah and obey the Messenger; but if you turn away - then upon him is only that [duty] with which he has been charged, and upon you is that with which you have been charged. And if you obey him, you will be [rightly] guided. And there is not upon the Messenger except the [responsibility for] clear notification."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024054.mp3', now()),
  (24, 55, '', '[{"id":51733,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَعَدَ","transliteration":"waʿada","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি দিয়েছেন","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51734,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":51735,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":51736,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51737,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِنكُمْ","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51738,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"waʿamilū","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51739,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51740,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَيَسْتَخْلِفَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"layastakhlifannahum","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তিনি প্রতিনিধি  বানাবেন তাদেরকে","root":"خلف","lemma":"ٱسْتَخْلَفَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":51741,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51742,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51743,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كَمَا","transliteration":"kamā","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51744,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَخْلَفَ","transliteration":"is''takhlafa","translation_bn":"প্রতিনিধি বানিয়েছিলেন","root":"خلف","lemma":"ٱسْتَخْلَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51745,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":51746,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51747,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِمْ","transliteration":"qablihim","translation_bn":"তাদের পূর্ব (ছিলো)","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51748,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَلَيُمَكِّنَنَّ","transliteration":"walayumakkinanna","translation_bn":"এবং অবশ্যই সুদৃঢ় করবেন","root":"مكن","lemma":"مَكَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51749,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51750,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"دِينَهُمُ","transliteration":"dīnahumu","translation_bn":"তাদের দ্বীনকে","root":"دين","lemma":"دِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51751,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":51752,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱرْتَضَىٰ","transliteration":"ir''taḍā","translation_bn":"তিনি পছন্দ করেছেন","root":"رضو","lemma":"ٱرْتَضَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51753,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51754,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَلَيُبَدِّلَنَّهُم","transliteration":"walayubaddilannahum","translation_bn":"ও অবশ্যই পরিবর্তিত করে দিবেন তাদের জন্যে","root":"بدل","lemma":"بَدَّلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51755,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مِّنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51756,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِ","transliteration":"baʿdi","translation_bn":"পর","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51757,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"خَوْفِهِمْ","transliteration":"khawfihim","translation_bn":"তাদের ভয়-ভীতির","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَوْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51758,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"أَمْنًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"amnan","translation_bn":"নিরাপত্তায়","root":"امن","lemma":"أَمْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51760,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"يَعْبُدُونَنِى","transliteration":"yaʿbudūnanī","translation_bn":"আমারই তারা ইবাদাত করবে","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51761,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"(আর) না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":51762,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"يُشْرِكُونَ","transliteration":"yush''rikūna","translation_bn":"তারা শরীক করবে","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51763,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"بِى","transliteration":"bī","translation_bn":"সাথে আমার","root":"—","lemma":"بِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51764,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًۭٔا ۚ","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কোন কিছুরই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51766,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"আর যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51767,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرَ","transliteration":"kafara","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করবে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51768,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدَ","transliteration":"baʿda","translation_bn":"পরে","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":51769,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":51770,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"fa-ulāika","translation_bn":"অতঃপর ঐসবলোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51771,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":51772,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَـٰسِقُونَ","transliteration":"l-fāsiqūna","translation_bn":"সত্যত্যাগী","root":"فسق","lemma":"فَاسِق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51773,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"٥٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waʿada l-lahu alladhīna āmanū minkum waʿamilū l-ṣāliḥāti layastakhlifannahum fī l-arḍi kamā is''takhlafa alladhīna min qablihim walayumakkinanna lahum dīnahumu alladhī ir''taḍā lahum walayubaddilannahum min baʿdi khawfihim amnan yaʿbudūnanī lā yush''rikūna bī shayan waman kafara baʿda dhālika fa-ulāika humu l-fāsiqūna', 'তোমাদের মধ্যে যারা ঈমান আনে আর সৎকাজ করে আল্লাহ তাদেরকে প্রতিশ্রুতি দিয়েছেন যে তিনি তাদেরকে অবশ্যই পৃথিবীতে খিলাফাত দান করবেন যেমন তাদের পূর্ববর্তীদেরকে তিনি খিলাফাত দান করেছিলেন এবং তিনি তাদের দ্বীনকে অবশ্যই কর্তৃত্বে প্রতিষ্ঠিত করবেন যা তিনি তাদের জন্য পছন্দ করেছেন এবং তিনি তাদের ভয়-ভীতিপূর্ণ অবস্থাকে পরিবর্তিত করে তাদেরকে অবশ্যই নিরাপত্তা দান করবেন। তারা আমার ‘ইবাদাত করবে, কোন কিছুকে আমার শরীক করবে না। এরপরও যারা সত্য প্রত্যাখ্যান করবে তারাই বিদ্রোহী, অন্যায়কারী।', 'Allah has promised those who have believed among you and done righteous deeds that He will surely grant them succession [to authority] upon the earth just as He granted it to those before them and that He will surely establish for them [therein] their religion which He has preferred for them and that He will surely substitute for them, after their fear, security, [for] they worship Me, not associating anything with Me. But whoever disbelieves after that - then those are the defiantly disobedient.', 'তোমাদের মধ্যে যারা ঈমান আনে আর সৎকাজ করে আল্লাহ তাদেরকে প্রতিশ্রুতি দিয়েছেন যে তিনি তাদেরকে অবশ্যই পৃথিবীতে খিলাফাত দান করবেন যেমন তাদের পূর্ববর্তীদেরকে তিনি খিলাফাত দান করেছিলেন এবং তিনি তাদের দ্বীনকে অবশ্যই কর্তৃত্বে প্রতিষ্ঠিত করবেন যা তিনি তাদের জন্য পছন্দ করেছেন এবং তিনি তাদের ভয়-ভীতিপূর্ণ অবস্থাকে পরিবর্তিত করে তাদেরকে অবশ্যই নিরাপত্তা দান করবেন। তারা আমার ‘ইবাদাত করবে, কোন কিছুকে আমার শরীক করবে না। এরপরও যারা সত্য প্রত্যাখ্যান করবে তারাই বিদ্রোহী, অন্যায়কারী।', 'Allah has promised those who have believed among you and done righteous deeds that He will surely grant them succession [to authority] upon the earth just as He granted it to those before them and that He will surely establish for them [therein] their religion which He has preferred for them and that He will surely substitute for them, after their fear, security, [for] they worship Me, not associating anything with Me. But whoever disbelieves after that - then those are the defiantly disobedient.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024055.mp3', now()),
  (24, 56, '', '[{"id":52137,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَقِيمُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-aqīmū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা প্রতিষ্ঠা করো","root":"قوم","lemma":"أَقَامَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52138,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","translation_bn":"সালাত","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52139,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَءَاتُوا۟","transliteration":"waātū","translation_bn":"আর দাও","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52140,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ","transliteration":"l-zakata","translation_bn":"যাকাত","root":"زكو","lemma":"زَكَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52141,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَأَطِيعُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-aṭīʿū","translation_bn":"ও আনুগত্য করো","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52142,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّسُولَ","transliteration":"l-rasūla","translation_bn":"রাসূলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52143,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallakum","translation_bn":"যাতে তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":52144,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تُرْحَمُونَ","transliteration":"tur''ḥamūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা অনুগ্রহভাজন হবে","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52145,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٥٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-aqīmū l-ṣalata waātū l-zakata wa-aṭīʿū l-rasūla laʿallakum tur''ḥamūna', 'তোমরা (নিয়মিত) নামায প্রতিষ্ঠা কর, যাকাত প্রদান কর ও রসূলের আনুগত্য কর যাতে তোমরা অনুগ্রহ প্রাপ্ত হও।', 'And establish prayer and give zakah and obey the Messenger - that you may receive mercy.', 'তোমরা (নিয়মিত) নামায প্রতিষ্ঠা কর, যাকাত প্রদান কর ও রসূলের আনুগত্য কর যাতে তোমরা অনুগ্রহ প্রাপ্ত হও।', 'And establish prayer and give zakah and obey the Messenger - that you may receive mercy.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024056.mp3', now()),
  (24, 57, '', '[{"id":52665,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":52666,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَحْسَبَنَّ","transliteration":"taḥsabanna","translation_bn":"কখনও মনে করো","root":"حسب","lemma":"حَسِبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52667,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":52668,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52669,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مُعْجِزِينَ","transliteration":"muʿ''jizīna","translation_bn":"তারা অক্ষমকারী (আল্লাহ্‌কে)","root":"عجز","lemma":"مُعْجِز","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52670,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52671,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52673,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَمَأْوَىٰهُمُ","transliteration":"wamawāhumu","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের আশ্রয়স্থল","root":"اوي","lemma":"مَأْوَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52674,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارُ ۖ","transliteration":"l-nāru","translation_bn":"জাহান্নাম","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52676,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَبِئْسَ","transliteration":"walabi''sa","translation_bn":"আর অবশ্যই (তা) অতি নিকৃষ্ট","root":"باس","lemma":"بِئْسَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52677,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَصِيرُ","transliteration":"l-maṣīru","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাবর্তনস্থল","root":"صير","lemma":"مَصِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52678,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٥٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lā taḥsabanna alladhīna kafarū muʿ''jizīna fī l-arḍi wamawāhumu l-nāru walabi''sa l-maṣīru', 'তুমি কাফিরদেরকে এমন মনে কর না যে, তারা পৃথিবীতে আল্লাহর ইচ্ছেকে পরাভূত করার ক্ষমতা রাখে, তাদের বাসস্থান হল আগুন; কতই না নিকৃষ্ট আশ্রয়স্থল!', 'Never think that the disbelievers are causing failure [to Allah] upon the earth. Their refuge will be the Fire - and how wretched the destination.', 'তুমি কাফিরদেরকে এমন মনে কর না যে, তারা পৃথিবীতে আল্লাহর ইচ্ছেকে পরাভূত করার ক্ষমতা রাখে, তাদের বাসস্থান হল আগুন; কতই না নিকৃষ্ট আশ্রয়স্থল!', 'Never think that the disbelievers are causing failure [to Allah] upon the earth. Their refuge will be the Fire - and how wretched the destination.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024057.mp3', now()),
