","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53359,"position":47,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"আর আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53360,"position":48,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"সর্বজ্ঞ","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":53361,"position":49,"text_uthmani":"حَكِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞাময়","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":53362,"position":50,"text_uthmani":"٥٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū liyastadhinkumu alladhīna malakat aymānukum wa-alladhīna lam yablughū l-ḥuluma minkum thalātha marrātin min qabli ṣalati l-fajri waḥīna taḍaʿūna thiyābakum mina l-ẓahīrati wamin baʿdi ṣalati l-ʿishāi thalāthu ʿawrātin lakum laysa ʿalaykum walā ʿalayhim junāḥun baʿdahunna ṭawwāfūna ʿalaykum baʿḍukum ʿalā baʿḍin kadhālika yubayyinu l-lahu lakumu l-āyāti wal-lahu ʿalīmun ḥakīmun', 'হে ঈমানদারগণ! তোমাদের মালিকানাধীন দাসদাসীগণ আর তোমাদের যারা বয়:প্রাপ্ত হয়নি তারা যেন (তোমাদের কাছে আসতে) তোমাদের অনুমতি গ্রহণ করে তিন সময়ে- ফাজর নামাযের পূর্বে, আর যখন দুপুরে রোদের প্রচন্ডতায় তোমরা তোমাদের পোশাক খুলে রাখ আর ‘ইশার নামাযের পর। এ তিনটি তোমাদের পোশাকহীন হওয়ার সময়। এ সময়গুলো ছাড়া অন্য সময়ে (প্রবেশ করলে) তোমাদের উপর আর তাদের উপর কোন দোষ নেই। তোমাদের এককে অন্যের কাছে ঘুরাফিরা করতেই হয়। এভাবে আল্লাহ তোমাদের জন্য নির্দেশ খুবই স্পষ্টভাবে বর্ণনা করেন, আল্লাহ সর্বজ্ঞ, বড়ই হিকমতওয়ালা।', 'O you who have believed, let those whom your right hands possess and those who have not [yet] reached puberty among you ask permission of you [before entering] at three times: before the dawn prayer and when you put aside your clothing [for rest] at noon and after the night prayer. [These are] three times of privacy for you. There is no blame upon you nor upon them beyond these [periods], for they continually circulate among you - some of you, among others. Thus does Allah make clear to you the verses; and Allah is Knowing and Wise.', 'হে ঈমানদারগণ! তোমাদের মালিকানাধীন দাসদাসীগণ আর তোমাদের যারা বয়:প্রাপ্ত হয়নি তারা যেন (তোমাদের কাছে আসতে) তোমাদের অনুমতি গ্রহণ করে তিন সময়ে- ফাজর নামাযের পূর্বে, আর যখন দুপুরে রোদের প্রচন্ডতায় তোমরা তোমাদের পোশাক খুলে রাখ আর ‘ইশার নামাযের পর। এ তিনটি তোমাদের পোশাকহীন হওয়ার সময়। এ সময়গুলো ছাড়া অন্য সময়ে (প্রবেশ করলে) তোমাদের উপর আর তাদের উপর কোন দোষ নেই। তোমাদের এককে অন্যের কাছে ঘুরাফিরা করতেই হয়। এভাবে আল্লাহ তোমাদের জন্য নির্দেশ খুবই স্পষ্টভাবে বর্ণনা করেন, আল্লাহ সর্বজ্ঞ, বড়ই হিকমতওয়ালা।', 'O you who have believed, let those whom your right hands possess and those who have not [yet] reached puberty among you ask permission of you [before entering] at three times: before the dawn prayer and when you put aside your clothing [for rest] at noon and after the night prayer. [These are] three times of privacy for you. There is no blame upon you nor upon them beyond these [periods], for they continually circulate among you - some of you, among others. Thus does Allah make clear to you the verses; and Allah is Knowing and Wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024058.mp3', now()),
  (24, 59, '', '[{"id":53714,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53715,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بَلَغَ","transliteration":"balagha","translation_bn":"পৌঁছে","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَلَغَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53716,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَطْفَـٰلُ","transliteration":"l-aṭfālu","translation_bn":"ছেলেমেয়েরা","root":"طفل","lemma":"طِفْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53717,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنكُمُ","transliteration":"minkumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মধ্য থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53718,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحُلُمَ","transliteration":"l-ḥuluma","translation_bn":"প্রাপ্ত বয়সে","root":"حلم","lemma":"حُلُم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53719,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَلْيَسْتَـْٔذِنُوا۟","transliteration":"falyastadhinū","translation_bn":"তখন যেন তারা অনুমতি নেয়","root":"اذن","lemma":"ٱسْتَـ#ْذَنَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53720,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَمَا","transliteration":"kamā","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53721,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَـْٔذَنَ","transliteration":"is''tadhana","translation_bn":"অনুমতি নেয়","root":"اذن","lemma":"ٱسْتَـ#ْذَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53722,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":53723,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53724,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِمْ ۚ","transliteration":"qablihim","translation_bn":"পূর্ব তাদের (বয়োপ্রাপ্ত হয়েছে)","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53726,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53727,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يُبَيِّنُ","transliteration":"yubayyinu","translation_bn":"বর্ণনা করেন","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيَّنُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53728,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":53729,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53730,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ ۗ","transliteration":"āyātihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর নিদর্শনাবলী","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53732,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"আর আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53733,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"সর্বজ্ঞ","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":53734,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"حَكِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞাময়","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":53735,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٥٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā balagha l-aṭfālu minkumu l-ḥuluma falyastadhinū kamā is''tadhana alladhīna min qablihim kadhālika yubayyinu l-lahu lakum āyātihi wal-lahu ʿalīmun ḥakīmun', 'তোমাদের শিশুরা যখন বয়োঃপ্রাপ্ত হবে তখন তারা যেন তোমাদের নিকট আসতে অনুমতি নেয়, যেমন তাদের বয়োজ্যেষ্ঠরা অনুমতি নেয়। এভাবে আল্লাহ তাঁর নির্দেশ খুবই স্পষ্টভাবে বর্ণনা করেন, কারণ আল্লাহ সর্বজ্ঞ, বড়ই হিকমতওয়ালা।', 'And when the children among you reach puberty, let them ask permission [at all times] as those before them have done. Thus does Allah make clear to you His verses; and Allah is Knowing and Wise.', 'তোমাদের শিশুরা যখন বয়োঃপ্রাপ্ত হবে তখন তারা যেন তোমাদের নিকট আসতে অনুমতি নেয়, যেমন তাদের বয়োজ্যেষ্ঠরা অনুমতি নেয়। এভাবে আল্লাহ তাঁর নির্দেশ খুবই স্পষ্টভাবে বর্ণনা করেন, কারণ আল্লাহ সর্বজ্ঞ, বড়ই হিকমতওয়ালা।', 'And when the children among you reach puberty, let them ask permission [at all times] as those before them have done. Thus does Allah make clear to you His verses; and Allah is Knowing and Wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024059.mp3', now()),
  (24, 60, '', '[{"id":54521,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْقَوَٰعِدُ","transliteration":"wal-qawāʿidu","translation_bn":"এবং (যৌবন) অতিক্রমকারিনী","root":"قعد","lemma":"قَوَاعِد","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54522,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54523,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنِّسَآءِ","transliteration":"l-nisāi","translation_bn":"স্ত্রীলোকদের","root":"نسو","lemma":"نِسَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54524,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّـٰتِى","transliteration":"allātī","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":54525,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":54526,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَرْجُونَ","transliteration":"yarjūna","translation_bn":"তারা আশা রাখে","root":"رجو","lemma":"يَرْجُوا@","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54527,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نِكَاحًۭا","transliteration":"nikāḥan","translation_bn":"বিয়ের","root":"نكح","lemma":"نِكَاح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54528,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَلَيْسَ","transliteration":"falaysa","translation_bn":"সেক্ষেত্রে নেই","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54529,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِنَّ","transliteration":"ʿalayhinna","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54530,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"جُنَاحٌ","transliteration":"junāḥun","translation_bn":"কোন পাপ","root":"جنح","lemma":"جُنَاح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54531,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":54532,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَضَعْنَ","transliteration":"yaḍaʿna","translation_bn":"তারা খুলে রাখে","root":"وضع","lemma":"وَضَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54533,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ثِيَابَهُنَّ","transliteration":"thiyābahunna","translation_bn":"তাদের পোষাক (অতিরিক্ত)","root":"ثوب","lemma":"ثِيَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54534,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرَ","transliteration":"ghayra","translation_bn":"না","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54535,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مُتَبَرِّجَـٰتٍۭ","transliteration":"mutabarrijātin","translation_bn":"প্রদর্শনকারিনীরূপে","root":"برج","lemma":"مُتَبَرِّجَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54536,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بِزِينَةٍۢ ۖ","transliteration":"bizīnatin","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে রূপসৌন্দর্যের","root":"زين","lemma":"زِينَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54538,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَأَن","transliteration":"wa-an","translation_bn":"আর যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54539,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَعْفِفْنَ","transliteration":"yastaʿfif''na","translation_bn":"বিরত থাকে তারা","root":"عفف","lemma":"يَسْتَعْفِفْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54540,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54541,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُنَّ ۗ","transliteration":"lahunna","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُنَّ ۗ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54543,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"আর আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54544,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"سَمِيعٌ","transliteration":"samīʿun","translation_bn":"সবকিছু শুনেন","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":54545,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"সবকিছুু জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":54546,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"٦٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬০)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wal-qawāʿidu mina l-nisāi allātī lā yarjūna nikāḥan falaysa ʿalayhinna junāḥun an yaḍaʿna thiyābahunna ghayra mutabarrijātin bizīnatin wa-an yastaʿfif''na khayrun lahunna wal-lahu samīʿun ʿalīmun', 'বয়স্কা নারীরা যারা বিয়ের আশা রাখে না, তাদের প্রতি কোন দোষ বর্তাবে না যদি তারা তাদের সৌন্দর্য প্রদর্শন না ক’রে তাদের (উপরি) পোশাক খুলে রাখে, তবে এথেকে যদি তারা বিরত থাকে তবে সেটাই তাদের জন্য উত্তম। আল্লাহ সব কিছু শোনেন, সব কিছু সম্পর্কে পূর্ণ অবগত।', 'And women of post-menstrual age who have no desire for marriage - there is no blame upon them for putting aside their outer garments [but] not displaying adornment. But to modestly refrain [from that] is better for them. And Allah is Hearing and Knowing.', 'বয়স্কা নারীরা যারা বিয়ের আশা রাখে না, তাদের প্রতি কোন দোষ বর্তাবে না যদি তারা তাদের সৌন্দর্য প্রদর্শন না ক’রে তাদের (উপরি) পোশাক খুলে রাখে, তবে এথেকে যদি তারা বিরত থাকে তবে সেটাই তাদের জন্য উত্তম। আল্লাহ সব কিছু শোনেন, সব কিছু সম্পর্কে পূর্ণ অবগত।', 'And women of post-menstrual age who have no desire for marriage - there is no blame upon them for putting aside their outer garments [but] not displaying adornment. But to modestly refrain [from that] is better for them. And Allah is Hearing and Knowing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024060.mp3', now()),
