","translation_bn":"উপর আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55597,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"warasūlihi","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসূলের (উপর)","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55599,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"فَإِذَا","transliteration":"fa-idhā","translation_bn":"অতএব যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55600,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَـْٔذَنُوكَ","transliteration":"is''tadhanūka","translation_bn":"তোমার (নিকট) অনুমতি চায়","root":"اذن","lemma":"ٱسْتَـ#ْذَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55601,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"لِبَعْضِ","transliteration":"libaʿḍi","translation_bn":"জন্যে কোন কিছুর","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55602,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"شَأْنِهِمْ","transliteration":"shanihim","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে তাদের","root":"شان","lemma":"شَأْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55603,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"فَأْذَن","transliteration":"fadhan","translation_bn":"তখন অনুমতি দাও","root":"اذن","lemma":"أَذِنَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55604,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"لِّمَن","transliteration":"liman","translation_bn":"জন্যে যার","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55605,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"شِئْتَ","transliteration":"shi''ta","translation_bn":"তুমি চাও","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55606,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55607,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"وَٱسْتَغْفِرْ","transliteration":"wa-is''taghfir","translation_bn":"আর ক্ষমা চাও","root":"غفر","lemma":"ٱسْتَغْفَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55608,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55609,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ ۚ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র (নিকট)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":55611,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":55612,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":55613,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":55614,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":55615,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"٦٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬২)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innamā l-mu''minūna alladhīna āmanū bil-lahi warasūlihi wa-idhā kānū maʿahu ʿalā amrin jāmiʿin lam yadhhabū ḥattā yastadhinūhu inna alladhīna yastadhinūnaka ulāika alladhīna yu''minūna bil-lahi warasūlihi fa-idhā is''tadhanūka libaʿḍi shanihim fadhan liman shi''ta min''hum wa-is''taghfir lahumu l-laha inna l-laha ghafūrun raḥīmun', 'ঈমানদার তো তারাই যারা ঈমান আনে আল্লাহর উপর ও তাঁর রসূলের উপর আর তারা যখন রসূলের সঙ্গে সমষ্টিগত কাজে মিলিত হয়, তখন তার অনুমতি না নিয়ে চলে যায় না। যারা তোমার কাছে অনুমতি প্রার্থনা করে তারাই আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের প্রতি বিশ্বাসী। কাজেই তাদের কেউ তাদের কোন কাজে যাওয়ার জন্য তোমার কাছে অনুমতি চাইলে তুমি তাদের যাকে ইচ্ছে অনুমতি দিবে আর তাদের জন্য আল্লাহর নিকট ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা করবে। আল্লাহ বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, বড়ই দয়ালু।', 'The believers are only those who believe in Allah and His Messenger and, when they are [meeting] with him for a matter of common interest, do not depart until they have asked his permission. Indeed, those who ask your permission, [O Muhammad] - those are the ones who believe in Allah and His Messenger. So when they ask your permission for something of their affairs, then give permission to whom you will among them and ask forgiveness for them of Allah. Indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', 'ঈমানদার তো তারাই যারা ঈমান আনে আল্লাহর উপর ও তাঁর রসূলের উপর আর তারা যখন রসূলের সঙ্গে সমষ্টিগত কাজে মিলিত হয়, তখন তার অনুমতি না নিয়ে চলে যায় না। যারা তোমার কাছে অনুমতি প্রার্থনা করে তারাই আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের প্রতি বিশ্বাসী। কাজেই তাদের কেউ তাদের কোন কাজে যাওয়ার জন্য তোমার কাছে অনুমতি চাইলে তুমি তাদের যাকে ইচ্ছে অনুমতি দিবে আর তাদের জন্য আল্লাহর নিকট ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা করবে। আল্লাহ বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, বড়ই দয়ালু।', 'The believers are only those who believe in Allah and His Messenger and, when they are [meeting] with him for a matter of common interest, do not depart until they have asked his permission. Indeed, those who ask your permission, [O Muhammad] - those are the ones who believe in Allah and His Messenger. So when they ask your permission for something of their affairs, then give permission to whom you will among them and ask forgiveness for them of Allah. Indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024062.mp3', now()),
  (24, 63, '', '[{"id":56116,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":56117,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَجْعَلُوا۟","transliteration":"tajʿalū","translation_bn":"তোমরা গণ্য করো","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56118,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"دُعَآءَ","transliteration":"duʿāa","translation_bn":"আহ্বানকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دُعَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56119,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّسُولِ","transliteration":"l-rasūli","translation_bn":"রাসূলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56120,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَكُمْ","transliteration":"baynakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":56121,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَدُعَآءِ","transliteration":"kaduʿāi","translation_bn":"আহ্বানের মতো","root":"دعو","lemma":"دُعَا^ء","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56122,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضِكُم","transliteration":"baʿḍikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের একে","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56123,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"baʿḍan","translation_bn":"অপরের","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56125,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":56126,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","translation_bn":"জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56127,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":56128,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":56129,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَتَسَلَّلُونَ","transliteration":"yatasallalūna","translation_bn":"তারা সরে পড়ে","root":"سلل","lemma":"يَتَسَلَّلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56130,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِنكُمْ","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"মধ্যে হ''তে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56131,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لِوَاذًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"liwādhan","translation_bn":"(আড়ালে) চুপিচুপি","root":"لوذ","lemma":"لِوَاذ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56133,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَلْيَحْذَرِ","transliteration":"falyaḥdhari","translation_bn":"সুতরাং ভয় করা উচিৎ","root":"حذر","lemma":"يَحْذَرُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56134,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":56135,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يُخَالِفُونَ","transliteration":"yukhālifūna","translation_bn":"বিরুদ্ধাচারণ করে","root":"خلف","lemma":"يُخَالِفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56136,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"عَنْ","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"বিষয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56137,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"amrihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর হুকুমের","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56138,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":56139,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"تُصِيبَهُمْ","transliteration":"tuṣībahum","translation_bn":"(উপরে) পড়বে তাদের","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56140,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"فِتْنَةٌ","transliteration":"fit''natun","translation_bn":"বিপর্যয়","root":"فتن","lemma":"فِتْنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56141,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56142,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"يُصِيبَهُمْ","transliteration":"yuṣībahum","translation_bn":"(উপরে) পড়বে তাদের","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56143,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56144,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمٌ","transliteration":"alīmun","translation_bn":"নিদারুণ","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":56145,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٦٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lā tajʿalū duʿāa l-rasūli baynakum kaduʿāi baʿḍikum baʿḍan qad yaʿlamu l-lahu alladhīna yatasallalūna minkum liwādhan falyaḥdhari alladhīna yukhālifūna ʿan amrihi an tuṣībahum fit''natun aw yuṣībahum ʿadhābun alīmun', 'রসূলের ডাককে তোমরা তোমাদের একের প্রতি অন্যের ডাকের মত গণ্য করো না। আল্লাহ তাদেরকে জানেন যারা তোমাদের মধ্যে চুপিসারে সরে পড়ে। কাজেই যারা তার আদেশের বিরুদ্ধাচরণ করে তারা সতর্ক হোক যে, তাদের উপর পরীক্ষা নেমে আসবে কিংবা তাদের উপর নেমে আসবে ভয়াবহ শাস্তি।', 'Do not make [your] calling of the Messenger among yourselves as the call of one of you to another. Already Allah knows those of you who slip away, concealed by others. So let those beware who dissent from the Prophet''s order, lest fitnah strike them or a painful punishment.', 'রসূলের ডাককে তোমরা তোমাদের একের প্রতি অন্যের ডাকের মত গণ্য করো না। আল্লাহ তাদেরকে জানেন যারা তোমাদের মধ্যে চুপিসারে সরে পড়ে। কাজেই যারা তার আদেশের বিরুদ্ধাচরণ করে তারা সতর্ক হোক যে, তাদের উপর পরীক্ষা নেমে আসবে কিংবা তাদের উপর নেমে আসবে ভয়াবহ শাস্তি।', 'Do not make [your] calling of the Messenger among yourselves as the call of one of you to another. Already Allah knows those of you who slip away, concealed by others. So let those beware who dissent from the Prophet''s order, lest fitnah strike them or a painful punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024063.mp3', now()),
  (24, 64, '', '[{"id":56781,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَآ","transliteration":"alā","translation_bn":"সাবধান হও","root":"—","lemma":"أَلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":56782,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":56783,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহরই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56784,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":56785,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56786,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশমন্ডলিতে","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56787,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীতে","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56789,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":56790,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","translation_bn":"তিনি জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56791,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"তা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":56792,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُمْ","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা (আছো)","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":56793,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"যে (অবস্থার) উপরে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56794,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"এবং যেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56795,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يُرْجَعُونَ","transliteration":"yur''jaʿūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা প্রত্যাবর্তিত হবে","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56796,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"তাঁর দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56797,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَيُنَبِّئُهُم","transliteration":"fayunabbi-uhum","translation_bn":"তখন তিনি জানিয়ে দিবেন তাদেরকে","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَّأَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56798,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐবিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56799,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"عَمِلُوا۟ ۗ","transliteration":"ʿamilū","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56801,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"আর আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56802,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"بِكُلِّ","transliteration":"bikulli","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56803,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছু","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56804,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌۢ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"খুব জ্ঞাত","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":56805,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٦٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alā inna lillahi mā fī l-samāwāti wal-arḍi qad yaʿlamu mā antum ʿalayhi wayawma yur''jaʿūna ilayhi fayunabbi-uhum bimā ʿamilū wal-lahu bikulli shayin ʿalīmun', 'নিশ্চিত জেনে রেখ, আসমান ও যমীনে যা কিছু আছে সবই আল্লাহর। তোমরা যে অবস্থায় আছ তা তিনি জানেন। অতঃপর যেদিন তারা তাঁর কাছে ফিরে যাবে সেদিন তিনি তাদেরকে জানিয়ে দেবেন তারা যা করত, আল্লাহ সকল বিষয়ে সবচেয়ে বেশি অবগত।', 'Unquestionably, to Allah belongs whatever is in the heavens and earth. Already He knows that upon which you [stand] and [knows] the Day when they will be returned to Him and He will inform them of what they have done. And Allah is Knowing of all things.', 'নিশ্চিত জেনে রেখ, আসমান ও যমীনে যা কিছু আছে সবই আল্লাহর। তোমরা যে অবস্থায় আছ তা তিনি জানেন। অতঃপর যেদিন তারা তাঁর কাছে ফিরে যাবে সেদিন তিনি তাদেরকে জানিয়ে দেবেন তারা যা করত, আল্লাহ সকল বিষয়ে সবচেয়ে বেশি অবগত।', 'Unquestionably, to Allah belongs whatever is in the heavens and earth. Already He knows that upon which you [stand] and [knows] the Day when they will be returned to Him and He will inform them of what they have done. And Allah is Knowing of all things.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/024064.mp3', now())
