ell and many generations between them.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025038.mp3', now()),
  (25, 39, '', '[{"id":40667,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكُلًّۭا","transliteration":"wakullan","translation_bn":"এবং প্রত্যেক (জাতিকে)","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40668,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ضَرَبْنَا","transliteration":"ḍarabnā","translation_bn":"আমরা বর্ণনা দিয়েছি","root":"ضرب","lemma":"ضَرَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40669,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40670,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَمْثَـٰلَ ۖ","transliteration":"l-amthāla","translation_bn":"দৃষ্টান্তসমূহ (পুর্বের)","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40672,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَكُلًّۭا","transliteration":"wakullan","translation_bn":"এবং প্রত্যেককে","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40673,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَبَّرْنَا","transliteration":"tabbarnā","translation_bn":"আমরা ধ্বংস করেছি","root":"تبر","lemma":"تَبَّرْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40674,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَتْبِيرًۭا","transliteration":"tatbīran","translation_bn":"ধ্বংস (সম্পূর্ণরূপে)","root":"تبر","lemma":"تَتْبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40675,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٣٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakullan ḍarabnā lahu l-amthāla wakullan tabbarnā tatbīran', 'আমি তাদের প্রত্যেকের জন্য দৃষ্টান্ত বর্ণনা করেছিলাম (যাতে তারা সঠিক পথের সন্ধান পেতে পারে) আর তাদের প্রত্যেককেই সম্পূর্ণরূপে ধ্বংস করে দিয়েছিলাম (তাদের পাপের কারণে)।', 'And for each We presented examples [as warnings], and each We destroyed with [total] destruction.', 'আমি তাদের প্রত্যেকের জন্য দৃষ্টান্ত বর্ণনা করেছিলাম (যাতে তারা সঠিক পথের সন্ধান পেতে পারে) আর তাদের প্রত্যেককেই সম্পূর্ণরূপে ধ্বংস করে দিয়েছিলাম (তাদের পাপের কারণে)।', 'And for each We presented examples [as warnings], and each We destroyed with [total] destruction.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025039.mp3', now()),
  (25, 40, '', '[{"id":41297,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41298,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَتَوْا۟","transliteration":"ataw","translation_bn":"তারা আসা যাওয়া করে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41299,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর (দিয়ে)","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41300,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَرْيَةِ","transliteration":"l-qaryati","translation_bn":"(সেই) জনপদের","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41301,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّتِىٓ","transliteration":"allatī","translation_bn":"যার (উপর)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":41302,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أُمْطِرَتْ","transliteration":"um''ṭirat","translation_bn":"বৃষ্টি বর্ষিত হয়েছিল","root":"مطر","lemma":"أُمْطِرَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41303,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَطَرَ","transliteration":"maṭara","translation_bn":"বৃষ্টি","root":"مطر","lemma":"مَّطَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41304,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّوْءِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-sawi","translation_bn":"নিকৃষ্ট রকমের","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَوْء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41306,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَمْ","transliteration":"afalam","translation_bn":"কি তবে না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":41307,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَكُونُوا۟","transliteration":"yakūnū","translation_bn":"তারা থাকে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41308,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَرَوْنَهَا ۚ","transliteration":"yarawnahā","translation_bn":"তা তারা দেখে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41310,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":41311,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা হলো (এমন যে)","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41312,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":41313,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَرْجُونَ","transliteration":"yarjūna","translation_bn":"তারা আশা করে","root":"رجو","lemma":"يَرْجُوا@","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41314,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"نُشُورًۭا","transliteration":"nushūran","translation_bn":"উত্থানের","root":"نشر","lemma":"نُشُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41315,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٤٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪০)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad ataw ʿalā l-qaryati allatī um''ṭirat maṭara l-sawi afalam yakūnū yarawnahā bal kānū lā yarjūna nushūran', 'তারা (অর্থাৎ কাফিররা) তো সে জনপদ দিয়েই অতিক্রম করে যার উপর বর্ষিত হয়েছিল অকল্যাণের বৃষ্টি, তারা কি তা দেখে না? আসলে তারা পুনরুত্থানের কথা চিন্তা করে না।', 'And they have already come upon the town which was showered with a rain of evil. So have they not seen it? But they are not expecting resurrection.', 'তারা (অর্থাৎ কাফিররা) তো সে জনপদ দিয়েই অতিক্রম করে যার উপর বর্ষিত হয়েছিল অকল্যাণের বৃষ্টি, তারা কি তা দেখে না? আসলে তারা পুনরুত্থানের কথা চিন্তা করে না।', 'And they have already come upon the town which was showered with a rain of evil. So have they not seen it? But they are not expecting resurrection.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025040.mp3', now()),
  (25, 41, '', '[{"id":42167,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42168,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَأَوْكَ","transliteration":"ra-awka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে তারা দেখে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42169,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":42170,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّخِذُونَكَ","transliteration":"yattakhidhūnaka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে তারা গ্রহণ করে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42171,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া যে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":42172,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هُزُوًا","transliteration":"huzuwan","translation_bn":"বিদ্রূপের পাত্ররূপে","root":"هزا","lemma":"هُزُو","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42173,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَهَـٰذَا","transliteration":"ahādhā","translation_bn":"\"(তারা বলে) কি এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":42174,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":42175,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بَعَثَ","transliteration":"baʿatha","translation_bn":"পাঠিয়েছেন","root":"بعث","lemma":"بَعَثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42176,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":42177,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولًا","transliteration":"rasūlan","translation_bn":"রাসূলরূপে","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42178,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٤١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪১)","root":"—","lemma":"٤١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā ra-awka in yattakhidhūnaka illā huzuwan ahādhā alladhī baʿatha l-lahu rasūlan', 'তারা যখন তোমাকে দেখে, তারা তোমাকে ঠাট্টা-বিদ্রূপের পাত্র ছাড়া অন্য কিছু গণ্য করে না, আর বলে : এটা কি সেই লোক আল্লাহ যাকে রসূল করে পাঠিয়েছেন?', 'And when they see you, [O Muhammad], they take you not except in ridicule, [saying], "Is this the one whom Allah has sent as a messenger?', 'তারা যখন তোমাকে দেখে, তারা তোমাকে ঠাট্টা-বিদ্রূপের পাত্র ছাড়া অন্য কিছু গণ্য করে না, আর বলে : এটা কি সেই লোক আল্লাহ যাকে রসূল করে পাঠিয়েছেন?', 'And when they see you, [O Muhammad], they take you not except in ridicule, [saying], "Is this the one whom Allah has sent as a messenger?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025041.mp3', now()),
  (25, 42, '', '[{"id":42985,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":42986,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَادَ","transliteration":"kāda","translation_bn":"উপক্রম হয়েছিলো","root":"كود","lemma":"كَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42987,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَيُضِلُّنَا","transliteration":"layuḍillunā","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই আমাদেরকে ভ্রষ্ট করে দিতো","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":42988,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَنْ","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42989,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ءَالِهَتِنَا","transliteration":"ālihatinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের দেবতাগুলো","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42990,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَوْلَآ","transliteration":"lawlā","translation_bn":"যদি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":42991,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":42992,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"صَبَرْنَا","transliteration":"ṣabarnā","translation_bn":"আমরা ধৈর্য ধরতাম","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42993,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهَا ۚ","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর\"","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42995,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَسَوْفَ","transliteration":"wasawfa","translation_bn":"আর শীঘ্রই","root":"—","lemma":"سَوْف\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42996,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তারা জানতে পারবে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42997,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"حِينَ","transliteration":"ḥīna","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"حين","lemma":"حِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42998,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَرَوْنَ","transliteration":"yarawna","translation_bn":"তারা দেখবে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42999,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابَ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43000,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مَنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":43001,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَضَلُّ","transliteration":"aḍallu","translation_bn":"চূড়ান্তরূপে ভ্রষ্ট হয়েছে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43002,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلًا","transliteration":"sabīlan","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43003,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٤٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪২)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'in kāda layuḍillunā ʿan ālihatinā lawlā an ṣabarnā ʿalayhā wasawfa yaʿlamūna ḥīna yarawna l-ʿadhāba man aḍallu sabīlan', 'সে তো আমাদেরকে আমাদের ইলাহদের থেকে অবশ্যই সরিয়ে দিত যদি আমরা তাদের প্রতি দৃঢ়চিত্ত না থাকতাম। যখন তারা শাস্তি দেখবে তখন জানবে যে পথের ক্ষেত্রে কারা অধিক ভ্রষ্ট ছিল।', 'He almost would have misled us from our gods had we not been steadfast in [worship of] them." But they are going to know, when they see the punishment, who is farthest astray in [his] way.', 'সে তো আমাদেরকে আমাদের ইলাহদের থেকে অবশ্যই সরিয়ে দিত যদি আমরা তাদের প্রতি দৃঢ়চিত্ত না থাকতাম। যখন তারা শাস্তি দেখবে তখন জানবে যে পথের ক্ষেত্রে কারা অধিক ভ্রষ্ট ছিল।', 'He almost would have misled us from our gods had we not been steadfast in [worship of] them." But they are going to know, when they see the punishment, who is farthest astray in [his] way.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025042.mp3', now()),
  (25, 43, '', '[{"id":43678,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَرَءَيْتَ","transliteration":"ara-ayta","translation_bn":"কি তুমি (ভেবে) দেখেছো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":43679,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَنِ","transliteration":"mani","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":43680,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّخَذَ","transliteration":"ittakhadha","translation_bn":"গ্রহণ করেছে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43681,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهَهُۥ","transliteration":"ilāhahu","translation_bn":"উপাস্যরূপে","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43682,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هَوَىٰهُ","transliteration":"hawāhu","translation_bn":"তার বাসনা লালসাকে","root":"هوي","lemma":"هَوَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43683,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَفَأَنتَ","transliteration":"afa-anta","translation_bn":"কি তবে তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَفَأَنتَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":43684,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَكُونُ","transliteration":"takūnu","translation_bn":"তুমি হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43685,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43686,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَكِيلًا","transliteration":"wakīlan","translation_bn":"কর্মবিধায়ক","root":"وكل","lemma":"وَكِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43687,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٤٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ara-ayta mani ittakhadha ilāhahu hawāhu afa-anta takūnu ʿalayhi wakīlan', 'তুমি কি তাকে দেখ না যে তার খেয়াল খুশিকে ইলাহরুপে গ্রহণ করেছে? এর পরেও কি তুমি তার কাজের জিম্মাদার হতে চাও?', 'Have you seen the one who takes as his god his own desire? Then would you be responsible for him?', 'তুমি কি তাকে দেখ না যে তার খেয়াল খুশিকে ইলাহরুপে গ্রহণ করেছে? এর পরেও কি তুমি তার কাজের জিম্মাদার হতে চাও?', 'Have you seen the one who takes as his god his own desire? Then would you be responsible for him?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025043.mp3', now()),
  (25, 44, '', '[{"id":44442,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَمْ","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"অথবা কি","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44443,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَحْسَبُ","transliteration":"taḥsabu","translation_bn":"মনে করো তুমি","root":"حسب","lemma":"حَسِبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44444,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":44445,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرَهُمْ","transliteration":"aktharahum","translation_bn":"অধিকাংশ তাদের","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44446,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَسْمَعُونَ","transliteration":"yasmaʿūna","translation_bn":"শূনতে পায়","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44447,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44448,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَعْقِلُونَ ۚ","transliteration":"yaʿqilūna","translation_bn":"বুঝতে পারে","root":"عقل","lemma":"عَقَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44450,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"নয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":44451,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":44452,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":44453,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كَٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ ۖ","transliteration":"kal-anʿāmi","translation_bn":"মতো চতুষ্পদ পশুর","root":"نعم","lemma":"نَّعَم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44455,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":44456,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":44457,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَضَلُّ","transliteration":"aḍallu","translation_bn":"অধিকতর ভ্রষ্ট হয়েছে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44458,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلًا","transliteration":"sabīlan","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44459,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٤٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'am taḥsabu anna aktharahum yasmaʿūna aw yaʿqilūna in hum illā kal-anʿāmi bal hum aḍallu sabīlan', 'তুমি কি এটা মনে কর যে, তাদের অধিকাংশ লোক শুনে বা বুঝে? তারা পশু বৈ তো নয়, বরং তারা সঠিক পথ থেকে আরো বেশি ভ্রষ্ট।', 'Or do you think that most of them hear or reason? They are not except like livestock. Rather, they are [even] more astray in [their] way.', 'তুমি কি এটা মনে কর যে, তাদের অধিকাংশ লোক শুনে বা বুঝে? তারা পশু বৈ তো নয়, বরং তারা সঠিক পথ থেকে আরো বেশি ভ্রষ্ট।', 'Or do you think that most of them hear or reason? They are not except like livestock. Rather, they are [even] more astray in [their] way.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025044.mp3', now()),
  (25, 45, '', '[{"id":45195,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"কি নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":45196,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَرَ","transliteration":"tara","translation_bn":"তুমি (ভেবে) দেখো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45197,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45198,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45199,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كَيْفَ","transliteration":"kayfa","translation_bn":"কিভাবে","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":45200,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَدَّ","transliteration":"madda","translation_bn":"তিনি বিস্তার করেছেন","root":"مدد","lemma":"مَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45201,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظِّلَّ","transliteration":"l-ẓila","translation_bn":"ছায়া","root":"ظلل","lemma":"ظِلّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45202,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45203,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"شَآءَ","transliteration":"shāa","translation_bn":"তিনি চাইতেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45204,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَجَعَلَهُۥ","transliteration":"lajaʿalahu","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তাকে করতে পারতেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":45205,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"سَاكِنًۭا","transliteration":"sākinan","translation_bn":"স্থির","root":"سكن","lemma":"سَاكِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45206,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45207,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلْنَا","transliteration":"jaʿalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা করেছি","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45208,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّمْسَ","transliteration":"l-shamsa","translation_bn":"সূর্যকে","root":"شمس","lemma":"شَمْس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45209,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45210,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"دَلِيلًۭا","transliteration":"dalīlan","translation_bn":"প্রমাণ","root":"دلل","lemma":"دَلِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45211,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٤٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alam tara ilā rabbika kayfa madda l-ẓila walaw shāa lajaʿalahu sākinan thumma jaʿalnā l-shamsa ʿalayhi dalīlan', 'তুমি কি তোমার প্রতিপালককে দেখ না কীভাবে তিনি ছায়াকে দীর্ঘ করেন (সূর্য উদয়ের সময়ে, অতঃপর তা ক্রমেই ছোট হতে হতে দুপুর বেলা ছায়া ক্ষুদ্র আকৃতি ধারণ করে, দুপুরের পর আবার ছায়া দীর্ঘ হতে থাকে), তিনি চাইলে ছায়াকে অবশ্যই স্থির রাখতে পারতেন। সূর্যকেই আমি করেছি তার (অর্থাৎ ছায়ার) নির্ণায়ক (সূর্যের অবস্থানের কারণেই ছায়া ছোট ও দীর্ঘ হয়)।', 'Have you not considered your Lord - how He extends the shadow, and if He willed, He could have made it stationary? Then We made the sun for it an indication.', 'তুমি কি তোমার প্রতিপালককে দেখ না কীভাবে তিনি ছায়াকে দীর্ঘ করেন (সূর্য উদয়ের সময়ে, অতঃপর তা ক্রমেই ছোট হতে হতে দুপুর বেলা ছায়া ক্ষুদ্র আকৃতি ধারণ করে, দুপুরের পর আবার ছায়া দীর্ঘ হতে থাকে), তিনি চাইলে ছায়াকে অবশ্যই স্থির রাখতে পারতেন। সূর্যকেই আমি করেছি তার (অর্থাৎ ছায়ার) নির্ণায়ক (সূর্যের অবস্থানের কারণেই ছায়া ছোট ও দীর্ঘ হয়)।', 'Have you not considered your Lord - how He extends the shadow, and if He willed, He could have made it stationary? Then We made the sun for it an indication.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025045.mp3', now()),
  (25, 46, '', '[{"id":45983,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45984,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَبَضْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"qabaḍnāhu","translation_bn":"তাকে আমরা গুটিয়ে আনি","root":"قبض","lemma":"قَبَضْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45985,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْنَا","transliteration":"ilaynā","translation_bn":"আমাদের দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45986,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَبْضًۭا","transliteration":"qabḍan","translation_bn":"গুটিয়ে","root":"قبض","lemma":"قَبْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45987,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَسِيرًۭا","transliteration":"yasīran","translation_bn":"ধীর ভাবে","root":"يسر","lemma":"يَسِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":45988,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٤٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma qabaḍnāhu ilaynā qabḍan yasīran', 'অতঃপর আমি তাকে নিজের দিকে গুটিয়ে নেই, ধীরে ধীরে ক্রমাগতভাবে (কারো মৃত্যু হলে, কিছু বিনাশ হলে, কিছু গুটানো হলে- সব কিছুই আল্লাহর দিকে চলে যায়)।', 'Then We hold it in hand for a brief grasp.', 'অতঃপর আমি তাকে নিজের দিকে গুটিয়ে নেই, ধীরে ধীরে ক্রমাগতভাবে (কারো মৃত্যু হলে, কিছু বিনাশ হলে, কিছু গুটানো হলে- সব কিছুই আল্লাহর দিকে চলে যায়)।', 'Then We hold it in hand for a brief grasp.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025046.mp3', now()),
  (25, 47, '', '[{"id":46615,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই (আল্লাহ)","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46616,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":46617,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَ","transliteration":"jaʿala","translation_bn":"করেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46618,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمُ","transliteration":"lakumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46619,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلَ","transliteration":"al-layla","translation_bn":"রাতকে","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46620,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِبَاسًۭا","transliteration":"libāsan","translation_bn":"(আবরণ ও) পোশাকস্বরূপ","root":"لبس","lemma":"لِبَاس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46621,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلنَّوْمَ","transliteration":"wal-nawma","translation_bn":"ও ঘুমকে (করেছেন)","root":"نوم","lemma":"نَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46622,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"سُبَاتًۭا","transliteration":"subātan","translation_bn":"(মৃত্যুর সম) বিশ্রামস্বরূপ","root":"سبت","lemma":"سُبَات","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46623,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلَ","transliteration":"wajaʿala","translation_bn":"ও তিনি করেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46624,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّهَارَ","transliteration":"l-nahāra","translation_bn":"দিনকে","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46625,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"نُشُورًۭا","transliteration":"nushūran","translation_bn":"(জীবন্ত করে) উত্থানস্বরূপ","root":"نشر","lemma":"نُشُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46626,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٤٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahuwa alladhī jaʿala lakumu al-layla libāsan wal-nawma subātan wajaʿala l-nahāra nushūran', 'তিনিই তোমাদের জন্য রাতকে করেছেন আবরণ, নিদ্রাকে করেছেন আরামপ্রদ আর দিনকে করেছেন (নিদ্রারূপী সাময়িক মৃত্যুর পর) আবার জীবন্ত হয়ে উঠার সময়।', 'And it is He who has made the night for you as clothing and sleep [a means for] rest and has made the day a resurrection.', 'তিনিই তোমাদের জন্য রাতকে করেছেন আবরণ, নিদ্রাকে করেছেন আরামপ্রদ আর দিনকে করেছেন (নিদ্রারূপী সাময়িক মৃত্যুর পর) আবার জীবন্ত হয়ে উঠার সময়।', 'And it is He who has made the night for you as clothing and sleep [a means for] rest and has made the day a resurrection.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025047.mp3', now()),
  (25, 48, '', '[{"id":47330,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47331,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":47332,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلَ","transliteration":"arsala","translation_bn":"প্রেরণ করেন","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47333,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرِّيَـٰحَ","transliteration":"l-riyāḥa","translation_bn":"বাতাসকে","root":"روح","lemma":"رِيح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47334,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بُشْرًۢا","transliteration":"bush''ran","translation_bn":"সুসংবাদরূপে","root":"بشر","lemma":"بُشْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47335,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَ","transliteration":"bayna","translation_bn":"মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":47336,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَدَىْ","transliteration":"yaday","translation_bn":"হাতের (প্রাক্কালে)","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47337,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَحْمَتِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"raḥmatihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর অনুগ্রহের","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47339,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنزَلْنَا","transliteration":"wa-anzalnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা বর্ষণ করি","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47340,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47341,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","transliteration":"l-samāi","translation_bn":"আকাশ","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47342,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَآءًۭ","transliteration":"māan","translation_bn":"পানি","root":"موه","lemma":"مَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47343,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"طَهُورًۭا","transliteration":"ṭahūran","translation_bn":"বিশুদ্ধ","root":"طهر","lemma":"طَهُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":47344,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٤٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahuwa alladhī arsala l-riyāḥa bush''ran bayna yaday raḥmatihi wa-anzalnā mina l-samāi māan ṭahūran', 'তিনিই তার (বৃষ্টিরূপী) অনুগ্রহের পূর্বে সুসংবাদ হিসেবে বায়ু পাঠিয়ে দেন আর আমি আকাশ থেকে বিশুদ্ধ পানি বর্ষণ করি।', 'And it is He who sends the winds as good tidings before His mercy, and We send down from the sky pure water', 'তিনিই তার (বৃষ্টিরূপী) অনুগ্রহের পূর্বে সুসংবাদ হিসেবে বায়ু পাঠিয়ে দেন আর আমি আকাশ থেকে বিশুদ্ধ পানি বর্ষণ করি।', 'And it is He who sends the winds as good tidings before His mercy, and We send down from the sky pure water', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025048.mp3', now()),
  (25, 49, '', '[{"id":48048,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لِّنُحْـِۧىَ","transliteration":"linuḥ''yiya","translation_bn":"যেন জীবিত করি আমরা","root":"حيي","lemma":"أَحْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48049,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"দ্বারা তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48050,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بَلْدَةًۭ","transliteration":"baldatan","translation_bn":"ভূখণ্ডকে","root":"بلد","lemma":"بَلْدَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48051,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَّيْتًۭا","transliteration":"maytan","translation_bn":"মৃত","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّيْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":48052,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَنُسْقِيَهُۥ","transliteration":"wanus''qiyahu","translation_bn":"ও তা পান করাই আমরা","root":"سقي","lemma":"أَسْقَيْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48053,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"মধ্যে যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48054,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقْنَآ","transliteration":"khalaqnā","translation_bn":"আমরা সৃষ্টি করেছি","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48055,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَنْعَـٰمًۭا","transliteration":"anʿāman","translation_bn":"জীবজন্তু","root":"نعم","lemma":"نَّعَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48056,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَاسِىَّ","transliteration":"wa-anāsiyya","translation_bn":"ও মানুষ","root":"انس","lemma":"إِنسَٰن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48057,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"كَثِيرًۭا","transliteration":"kathīran","translation_bn":"বহু","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":48058,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'linuḥ''yiya bihi baldatan maytan wanus''qiyahu mimmā khalaqnā anʿāman wa-anāsiyya kathīran', 'যা দিয়ে আমি মৃত যমীনকে জীবিত করে তুলি এবং তৃষ্ণা নিবারণ করি আমার সৃষ্টির অন্তর্গত অনেক জীবজন্তুর ও মানুষের।', 'That We may bring to life thereby a dead land and give it as drink to those We created of numerous livestock and men.', 'যা দিয়ে আমি মৃত যমীনকে জীবিত করে তুলি এবং তৃষ্ণা নিবারণ করি আমার সৃষ্টির অন্তর্গত অনেক জীবজন্তুর ও মানুষের।', 'That We may bring to life thereby a dead land and give it as drink to those We created of numerous livestock and men.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025049.mp3', now()),
  (25, 50, '', '[{"id":48687,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48688,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"صَرَّفْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"ṣarrafnāhu","translation_bn":"তা আমরা বারবার পেশ করি","root":"صرف","lemma":"صَرَّفْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48689,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُمْ","transliteration":"baynahum","translation_bn":"তাদের মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":48690,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِيَذَّكَّرُوا۟","transliteration":"liyadhakkarū","translation_bn":"যেন তারা শিক্ষা নেয়","root":"ذكر","lemma":"تَذَكَّرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48691,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَأَبَىٰٓ","transliteration":"fa-abā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু অস্বীকার করে","root":"ابي","lemma":"أَبَى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48692,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرُ","transliteration":"aktharu","translation_bn":"অধিকাংশ","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48693,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষ","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48694,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"(আর) কেবল","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":48695,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كُفُورًۭا","transliteration":"kufūran","translation_bn":"অকৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كُفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48696,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٥٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫০)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad ṣarrafnāhu baynahum liyadhakkarū fa-abā aktharu l-nāsi illā kufūran', 'আমি পানিকে (সকলের প্রয়োজন মেটানোর জন্য) তাদের মাঝে বণ্টন করি যাতে তারা (আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহের কথা) স্মরণ করে, কিন্তু মানুষদের অধিকাংশই ঈমান গ্রহণ করতে অস্বীকার ক’রে কেবল কুফরিই করল।', 'And We have certainly distributed it among them that they might be reminded, but most of the people refuse except disbelief.', 'আমি পানিকে (সকলের প্রয়োজন মেটানোর জন্য) তাদের মাঝে বণ্টন করি যাতে তারা (আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহের কথা) স্মরণ করে, কিন্তু মানুষদের অধিকাংশই ঈমান গ্রহণ করতে অস্বীকার ক’রে কেবল কুফরিই করল।', 'And We have certainly distributed it among them that they might be reminded, but most of the people refuse except disbelief.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025050.mp3', now()),
  (25, 51, '', '[{"id":49206,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"আর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49207,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"شِئْنَا","transliteration":"shi''nā","translation_bn":"আমরা চাইতাম","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49208,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَبَعَثْنَا","transliteration":"labaʿathnā","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই আমরাপাঠাতাম","root":"بعث","lemma":"بَعَثَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":49209,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49210,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49211,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَرْيَةٍۢ","transliteration":"qaryatin","translation_bn":"জনপদের","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49212,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نَّذِيرًۭا","transliteration":"nadhīran","translation_bn":"একজন  সতর্ককারী","root":"نذر","lemma":"نَذِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49213,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٥١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫১)","root":"—","lemma":"٥١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaw shi''nā labaʿathnā fī kulli qaryatin nadhīran', 'আমি ইচ্ছে করলে প্রত্যেক জনবসতিতে সতর্ককারী পাঠাতাম। (কিন্তু সারা বিশ্বের জন্য একজন নবী পাঠিয়ে সকলকে একই উম্মাত হওয়ার অনুগ্রহ লাভে ধন্য করেছি)।', 'And if We had willed, We could have sent into every city a warner.', 'আমি ইচ্ছে করলে প্রত্যেক জনবসতিতে সতর্ককারী পাঠাতাম। (কিন্তু সারা বিশ্বের জন্য একজন নবী পাঠিয়ে সকলকে একই উম্মাত হওয়ার অনুগ্রহ লাভে ধন্য করেছি)।', 'And if We had willed, We could have sent into every city a warner.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025051.mp3', now()),
  (25, 52, '', '[{"id":49943,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"সুতরাং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49944,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تُطِعِ","transliteration":"tuṭiʿi","translation_bn":"তুমি অনুসরণ করো","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49945,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","translation_bn":"কাফিরদেরকে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49946,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَجَـٰهِدْهُم","transliteration":"wajāhid''hum","translation_bn":"এবং জিহাদ করো তাদের সাথে","root":"جهد","lemma":"جَٰهَدَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49947,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"দ্বারা এ","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49948,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"جِهَادًۭا","transliteration":"jihādan","translation_bn":"জিহাদ","root":"جهد","lemma":"جِهَاد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49949,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَبِيرًۭا","transliteration":"kabīran","translation_bn":"বড়","root":"كبر","lemma":"كَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":49950,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٥٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫২)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falā tuṭiʿi l-kāfirīna wajāhid''hum bihi jihādan kabīran', 'কাজেই তুমি কাফিরদের আনুগত্য করো না: আর কুরআনের সাহায্যে তাদের বিরুদ্ধে সংগ্রাম কর- কঠোর সংগ্রাম।', 'So do not obey the disbelievers, and strive against them with the Qur''an a great striving.', 'কাজেই তুমি কাফিরদের আনুগত্য করো না: আর কুরআনের সাহায্যে তাদের বিরুদ্ধে সংগ্রাম কর- কঠোর সংগ্রাম।', 'So do not obey the disbelievers, and strive against them with the Qur''an a great striving.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025052.mp3', now()),
  (25, 53, '', '[{"id":50599,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনি (আল্লাহ)","root":"—","lemma":"۞ وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50600,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":50601,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَرَجَ","transliteration":"maraja","translation_bn":"মিলিয়ে প্রবাহিত করেছেন","root":"مرج","lemma":"مَرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50602,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَحْرَيْنِ","transliteration":"l-baḥrayni","translation_bn":"দুই সমুদ্রকে","root":"بحر","lemma":"بَحْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50603,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":50604,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَذْبٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿadhbun","translation_bn":"সুমিষ্ট","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50605,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فُرَاتٌۭ","transliteration":"furātun","translation_bn":"সুপেয়","root":"فرت","lemma":"فُرَات","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":50606,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَهَـٰذَا","transliteration":"wahādhā","translation_bn":"এবং ওটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50607,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِلْحٌ","transliteration":"mil''ḥun","translation_bn":"লোনা","root":"ملح","lemma":"مِلْح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50608,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أُجَاجٌۭ","transliteration":"ujājun","translation_bn":"বিস্বাদ","root":"اجج","lemma":"أُجَاج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50609,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلَ","transliteration":"wajaʿala","translation_bn":"এবং তিনি করেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50610,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُمَا","transliteration":"baynahumā","translation_bn":"উভয়ের মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":50611,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بَرْزَخًۭا","transliteration":"barzakhan","translation_bn":"অন্তরায়","root":"—","lemma":"بَرْزَخ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50612,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَحِجْرًۭا","transliteration":"waḥij''ran","translation_bn":"ও আড়াল","root":"حجر","lemma":"حِجْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50613,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مَّحْجُورًۭا","transliteration":"maḥjūran","translation_bn":"দুর্ভেদ্য","root":"حجر","lemma":"مَّحْجُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50614,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٥٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahuwa alladhī maraja l-baḥrayni hādhā ʿadhbun furātun wahādhā mil''ḥun ujājun wajaʿala baynahumā barzakhan waḥij''ran maḥjūran', 'তিনিই সমুদ্রকে দু’ ধারায় প্রবাহিত করেছেন- একটি সুপেয় সুস্বাদু আরেকটি লবণাক্ত কটু, উভয়ের মাঝে টেনে দিয়েছেন এক আবরণ- এক অনতিক্রম্য বিভক্তি-প্রাচীর।', 'And it is He who has released [simultaneously] the two seas, one fresh and sweet and one salty and bitter, and He placed between them a barrier and prohibiting partition.', 'তিনিই সমুদ্রকে দু’ ধারায় প্রবাহিত করেছেন- একটি সুপেয় সুস্বাদু আরেকটি লবণাক্ত কটু, উভয়ের মাঝে টেনে দিয়েছেন এক আবরণ- এক অনতিক্রম্য বিভক্তি-প্রাচীর।', 'And it is He who has released [simultaneously] the two seas, one fresh and sweet and one salty and bitter, and He placed between them a barrier and prohibiting partition.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025053.mp3', now()),
  (25, 54, '', '[{"id":51085,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51086,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":51087,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقَ","transliteration":"khalaqa","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51088,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51089,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَآءِ","transliteration":"l-māi","translation_bn":"পানি","root":"موه","lemma":"مَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51090,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَشَرًۭا","transliteration":"basharan","translation_bn":"মানুষকে","root":"بشر","lemma":"بَشَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51091,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَجَعَلَهُۥ","transliteration":"fajaʿalahu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তা স্থাপন করেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51092,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"نَسَبًۭا","transliteration":"nasaban","translation_bn":"বংশগত সম্পর্ক","root":"نسب","lemma":"نَسَب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51093,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَصِهْرًۭا ۗ","transliteration":"waṣih''ran","translation_bn":"ও বৈবাহিক সম্পর্ক","root":"صهر","lemma":"صِهْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51095,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"আর হলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51096,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكَ","transliteration":"rabbuka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51097,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"قَدِيرًۭا","transliteration":"qadīran","translation_bn":"(সবকিছুর উপর) শক্তিমান","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51098,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٥٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahuwa alladhī khalaqa mina l-māi basharan fajaʿalahu nasaban waṣih''ran wakāna rabbuka qadīran', 'তিনিই পানি থেকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন মানুষ, অতঃপর মানুষকে করেছেন বংশ সম্পর্কীয় ও বিবাহ সম্পর্কীয়, তোমার প্রতিপালক সব কিছু করতে সক্ষম।', 'And it is He who has created from water a human being and made him [a relative by] lineage and marriage. And ever is your Lord competent [concerning creation].', 'তিনিই পানি থেকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন মানুষ, অতঃপর মানুষকে করেছেন বংশ সম্পর্কীয় ও বিবাহ সম্পর্কীয়, তোমার প্রতিপালক সব কিছু করতে সক্ষম।', 'And it is He who has created from water a human being and made him [a relative by] lineage and marriage. And ever is your Lord competent [concerning creation].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025054.mp3', now()),
  (25, 55, '', '[{"id":51647,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَعْبُدُونَ","transliteration":"wayaʿbudūna","translation_bn":"ও তারা ইবাদাত করে","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51648,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51649,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"পরিবর্তে","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51650,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":51651,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(এমন কিছুর) যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":51652,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":51653,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَنفَعُهُمْ","transliteration":"yanfaʿuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের উপকার করতে পারে","root":"نفع","lemma":"نَفَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51654,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51655,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَضُرُّهُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"yaḍurruhum","translation_bn":"তাদের ক্ষতি করতে পারে","root":"ضرر","lemma":"يَضُرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51657,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"আর হলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51658,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَافِرُ","transliteration":"l-kāfiru","translation_bn":"কাফিররা","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَافِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51659,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"বিরুদ্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51660,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِۦ","transliteration":"rabbihi","translation_bn":"তার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51661,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ظَهِيرًۭا","transliteration":"ẓahīran","translation_bn":"সাহায্যকারী (প্রত্যেক বিদ্রোহীর)","root":"ظهر","lemma":"ظَهِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":51662,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٥٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayaʿbudūna min dūni l-lahi mā lā yanfaʿuhum walā yaḍurruhum wakāna l-kāfiru ʿalā rabbihi ẓahīran', 'তারা আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে এমন কিছুর ‘ইবাদাত করে যা না পারে তাদের কোন উপকার করতে, আর না পারে কোন ক্ষতি করতে, আর কাফির হচ্ছে তার প্রতিপালকের বিরুদ্ধে সাহায্যকারী।', 'But they worship rather than Allah that which does not benefit them or harm them, and the disbeliever is ever, against his Lord, an assistant [to Satan].', 'তারা আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে এমন কিছুর ‘ইবাদাত করে যা না পারে তাদের কোন উপকার করতে, আর না পারে কোন ক্ষতি করতে, আর কাফির হচ্ছে তার প্রতিপালকের বিরুদ্ধে সাহায্যকারী।', 'But they worship rather than Allah that which does not benefit them or harm them, and the disbeliever is ever, against his Lord, an assistant [to Satan].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025055.mp3', now()),
  (25, 56, '', '[{"id":52176,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52177,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَـٰكَ","transliteration":"arsalnāka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে আমরা পাঠিয়েছি","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52178,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া যে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":52179,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مُبَشِّرًۭا","transliteration":"mubashiran","translation_bn":"সুসংবাদদাতা","root":"بشر","lemma":"مُبَشِّر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52180,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَنَذِيرًۭا","transliteration":"wanadhīran","translation_bn":"ও সতর্ক কারী রূপে","root":"نذر","lemma":"نَذِير","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52181,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٥٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā arsalnāka illā mubashiran wanadhīran', 'আমি তোমাকে পাঠিয়েছি কেবল সুসংবাদদাতা ও ভয় প্রদর্শনকারী হিসেবে।', 'And We have not sent you, [O Muhammad], except as a bringer of good tidings and a warner.', 'আমি তোমাকে পাঠিয়েছি কেবল সুসংবাদদাতা ও ভয় প্রদর্শনকারী হিসেবে।', 'And We have not sent you, [O Muhammad], except as a bringer of good tidings and a warner.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025056.mp3', now()),
  (25, 57, '', '[{"id":53014,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53015,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":53016,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَسْـَٔلُكُمْ","transliteration":"asalukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের (নিকট) চাচ্ছি আমি","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53017,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"এর জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53018,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোন","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53019,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرٍ","transliteration":"ajrin","translation_bn":"প্রতিদান","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53020,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"তবে (এতটুকু)","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":53021,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":53022,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"شَآءَ","transliteration":"shāa","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করে","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53023,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":53024,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّخِذَ","transliteration":"yattakhidha","translation_bn":"সে গ্রহণ করবে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53025,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53026,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِۦ","transliteration":"rabbihi","translation_bn":"তার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53027,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلًۭا","transliteration":"sabīlan","translation_bn":"পথ\"","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53028,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٥٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul mā asalukum ʿalayhi min ajrin illā man shāa an yattakhidha ilā rabbihi sabīlan', 'বল- এজন্য আমি তোমাদের কাছে এছাড়া কোন প্রতিদান চাই না যে, যার ইচ্ছে সে তার প্রতিপালকের দিকে পথ অবলম্বন করুক।', 'Say, "I do not ask of you for it any payment - only that whoever wills might take to his Lord a way."', 'বল- এজন্য আমি তোমাদের কাছে এছাড়া কোন প্রতিদান চাই না যে, যার ইচ্ছে সে তার প্রতিপালকের দিকে পথ অবলম্বন করুক।', 'Say, "I do not ask of you for it any payment - only that whoever wills might take to his Lord a way."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025057.mp3', now()),
  (25, 58, '', '[{"id":53231,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَتَوَكَّلْ","transliteration":"watawakkal","translation_bn":"এবং নির্ভর করো","root":"وكل","lemma":"تَوَكَّلْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53232,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53233,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَىِّ","transliteration":"l-ḥayi","translation_bn":"চিরঞ্জীব (আল্লাহর)","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53234,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":53235,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":53236,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَمُوتُ","transliteration":"yamūtu","translation_bn":"মরবেন (কখনও)","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّاتَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53237,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَسَبِّحْ","transliteration":"wasabbiḥ","translation_bn":"ও পবিত্রতা ঘোষণা করো","root":"سبح","lemma":"سَبَّحَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53238,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِحَمْدِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"biḥamdihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর প্রশংসাসহ","root":"حمد","lemma":"حَمْد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53240,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَكَفَىٰ","transliteration":"wakafā","translation_bn":"আর যথেষ্ট","root":"كفي","lemma":"كَفَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53241,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"এ ব্যাপারে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53242,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِذُنُوبِ","transliteration":"bidhunūbi","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে পাপ","root":"ذنب","lemma":"ذَنب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53243,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عِبَادِهِۦ","transliteration":"ʿibādihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর দাসদের","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53244,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"خَبِيرًا","transliteration":"khabīran","translation_bn":"(তাঁরই) অবহিত হওয়া","root":"خبر","lemma":"خَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":53245,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٥٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'watawakkal ʿalā l-ḥayi alladhī lā yamūtu wasabbiḥ biḥamdihi wakafā bihi bidhunūbi ʿibādihi khabīran', 'আর তুমি নির্ভর কর সেই চিরঞ্জীবের উপর যিনি মরবেন না। আর তাঁর প্রশংসা ও পবিত্রতা ঘোষণা কর। তিনি তাঁর বান্দাহদের গুনাহর খবর রাখার ব্যাপারে যথেষ্ট।', 'And rely upon the Ever-Living who does not die, and exalt [Allah] with His praise. And sufficient is He to be, with the sins of His servants, Acquainted -', 'আর তুমি নির্ভর কর সেই চিরঞ্জীবের উপর যিনি মরবেন না। আর তাঁর প্রশংসা ও পবিত্রতা ঘোষণা কর। তিনি তাঁর বান্দাহদের গুনাহর খবর রাখার ব্যাপারে যথেষ্ট।', 'And rely upon the Ever-Living who does not die, and exalt [Allah] with His praise. And sufficient is He to be, with the sins of His servants, Acquainted -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025058.mp3', now()),
  (25, 59, '', '[{"id":53635,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":53636,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقَ","transliteration":"khalaqa","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53637,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশমণ্ডলী","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53638,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবী","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53639,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53640,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُمَا","transliteration":"baynahumā","translation_bn":"উভয়ের মাঝে (আছে)","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":53641,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53642,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"سِتَّةِ","transliteration":"sittati","translation_bn":"ছয়","root":"ستت","lemma":"سِتَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53643,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَيَّامٍۢ","transliteration":"ayyāmin","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53644,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53645,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَوَىٰ","transliteration":"is''tawā","translation_bn":"সমাসীন হন","root":"سوي","lemma":"ٱسْتَوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53646,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53647,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَرْشِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ʿarshi","translation_bn":"আরশের","root":"عرش","lemma":"عَرْش","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53649,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-raḥmānu","translation_bn":"অশেষ দয়াবান","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53650,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَسْـَٔلْ","transliteration":"fasal","translation_bn":"সুতরাং জিজ্ঞেস করো","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53651,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে তাঁর","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53652,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"خَبِيرًۭا","transliteration":"khabīran","translation_bn":"(তাদের হ''তে) যারা অবহিত","root":"خبر","lemma":"خَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53653,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٥٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhī khalaqa l-samāwāti wal-arḍa wamā baynahumā fī sittati ayyāmin thumma is''tawā ʿalā l-ʿarshi l-raḥmānu fasal bihi khabīran', 'তিনি আসমান, যমীন আর এ দু’য়ের ভিতরে যা আছে তা ছ’দিনে (ছ’টি সময় স্তরে) সৃষ্টি করেছেন, অতঃপর আরশে সমুন্নত হয়েছেন। তিনিই রাহমান, কাজেই তাঁর সম্পর্কে তাকে জিজ্ঞেস কর যে এ সম্পর্কিত জ্ঞান রাখে।', 'He who created the heavens and the earth and what is between them in six days and then established Himself above the Throne - the Most Merciful, so ask about Him one well informed.', 'তিনি আসমান, যমীন আর এ দু’য়ের ভিতরে যা আছে তা ছ’দিনে (ছ’টি সময় স্তরে) সৃষ্টি করেছেন, অতঃপর আরশে সমুন্নত হয়েছেন। তিনিই রাহমান, কাজেই তাঁর সম্পর্কে তাকে জিজ্ঞেস কর যে এ সম্পর্কিত জ্ঞান রাখে।', 'He who created the heavens and the earth and what is between them in six days and then established Himself above the Throne - the Most Merciful, so ask about Him one well informed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025059.mp3', now()),
  (25, 60, '', '[{"id":54284,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54285,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قِيلَ","transliteration":"qīla","translation_bn":"বলা হয়","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54286,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54287,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْجُدُوا۟","transliteration":"us''judū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা সিজদা করো","root":"سجد","lemma":"سَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54288,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لِلرَّحْمَـٰنِ","transliteration":"lilrraḥmāni","translation_bn":"জন্যে দয়াময়ের\"","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54289,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54290,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"\"কে আবার","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54291,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-raḥmānu","translation_bn":"(সেই) দয়াময়","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54292,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَنَسْجُدُ","transliteration":"anasjudu","translation_bn":"কি আমরা সিজদা করবো","root":"سجد","lemma":"سَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":54293,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِمَا","transliteration":"limā","translation_bn":"(তাকে) যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54294,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَأْمُرُنَا","transliteration":"tamurunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের তুমি নির্দেশ দিবে\"","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54295,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَزَادَهُمْ","transliteration":"wazādahum","translation_bn":"আর (এভাবে) বৃদ্ধি করলো তাদের","root":"زيد","lemma":"زَادَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54296,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"نُفُورًۭا ۩","transliteration":"nufūran","translation_bn":"বিমুখতা","root":"نفر","lemma":"نُفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54298,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٦٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬০)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā qīla lahumu us''judū lilrraḥmāni qālū wamā l-raḥmānu anasjudu limā tamurunā wazādahum nufūran', 'তাদেরকে যখন বলা হয় ‘রহমান’-এর উদ্দেশ্যে সাজদায় অবনত হও, তারা বলে- ‘রহমান আবার কী? আমাদেরকে তুমি যাকেই সেজদা করতে বলবে আমরা তাকেই সেজদা করব নাকি?’ এতে তাদের অবাধ্যতাই বেড়ে যায়। [সাজদাহ]', 'And when it is said to them, "Prostrate to the Most Merciful," they say, "And what is the Most Merciful? Should we prostrate to that which you order us?" And it increases them in aversion.', 'তাদেরকে যখন বলা হয় ‘রহমান’-এর উদ্দেশ্যে সাজদায় অবনত হও, তারা বলে- ‘রহমান আবার কী? আমাদেরকে তুমি যাকেই সেজদা করতে বলবে আমরা তাকেই সেজদা করব নাকি?’ এতে তাদের অবাধ্যতাই বেড়ে যায়। [সাজদাহ]', 'And when it is said to them, "Prostrate to the Most Merciful," they say, "And what is the Most Merciful? Should we prostrate to that which you order us?" And it increases them in aversion.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025060.mp3', now()),
  (25, 61, '', '[{"id":55308,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"تَبَارَكَ","transliteration":"tabāraka","translation_bn":"কল্যাণময়","root":"برك","lemma":"تَبَارَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55309,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"(সেই সত্ত্বা) যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":55310,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَ","transliteration":"jaʿala","translation_bn":"স্থাপন করেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55311,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55312,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","transliteration":"l-samāi","translation_bn":"আকাশের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55313,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بُرُوجًۭا","transliteration":"burūjan","translation_bn":"বুরুজ (রাশিচক্র)","root":"برج","lemma":"بُرُوج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55314,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلَ","transliteration":"wajaʿala","translation_bn":"ও স্থাপন করেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55315,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55316,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"سِرَٰجًۭا","transliteration":"sirājan","translation_bn":"প্রদীপ (সূর্য)","root":"سرج","lemma":"سِرَاج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55317,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَقَمَرًۭا","transliteration":"waqamaran","translation_bn":"ও চাঁদ","root":"قمر","lemma":"قَمَر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55318,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مُّنِيرًۭا","transliteration":"munīran","translation_bn":"উজ্জ্বল","root":"نور","lemma":"مُّنِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55319,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٦١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬১)","root":"—","lemma":"٦١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'tabāraka alladhī jaʿala fī l-samāi burūjan wajaʿala fīhā sirājan waqamaran munīran', 'কতই না কল্যাণময় তিনি যিনি আসমানে নক্ষত্ররাজির সমাবেশ ঘটিয়েছেন আর তাতে স্থাপন করেছেন প্রদীপ আর আলো বিকিরণকারী চন্দ্র।', 'Blessed is He who has placed in the sky great stars and placed therein a [burning] lamp and luminous moon.', 'কতই না কল্যাণময় তিনি যিনি আসমানে নক্ষত্ররাজির সমাবেশ ঘটিয়েছেন আর তাতে স্থাপন করেছেন প্রদীপ আর আলো বিকিরণকারী চন্দ্র।', 'Blessed is He who has placed in the sky great stars and placed therein a [burning] lamp and luminous moon.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025061.mp3', now()),
  (25, 62, '', '[{"id":55676,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55677,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":55678,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَ","transliteration":"jaʿala","translation_bn":"বানিয়েছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55679,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلَ","transliteration":"al-layla","translation_bn":"রাতকে","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55680,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلنَّهَارَ","transliteration":"wal-nahāra","translation_bn":"ও দিনকে","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55681,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"خِلْفَةًۭ","transliteration":"khil''fatan","translation_bn":"পরস্পরের অনুগামী","root":"خلف","lemma":"خِلْفَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55682,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِّمَنْ","transliteration":"liman","translation_bn":"(এসব নিদর্শন) তার জন্য যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55683,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَرَادَ","transliteration":"arāda","translation_bn":"চায়","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55684,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":55685,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَذَّكَّرَ","transliteration":"yadhakkara","translation_bn":"উপদেশ গ্রহণ করবে","root":"ذكر","lemma":"تَذَكَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55686,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55687,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَرَادَ","transliteration":"arāda","translation_bn":"সে চায়","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55688,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"شُكُورًۭا","transliteration":"shukūran","translation_bn":"কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করতে","root":"شكر","lemma":"شُكُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55689,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٦٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬২)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahuwa alladhī jaʿala al-layla wal-nahāra khil''fatan liman arāda an yadhakkara aw arāda shukūran', 'আর তিনিই রাত আর দিনকে করেছেন পরস্পরের অনুগামী তাদের জন্য যারা উপদেশ গ্রহণ করতে চায়, অথবা কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করতে চায়।', 'And it is He who has made the night and the day in succession for whoever desires to remember or desires gratitude.', 'আর তিনিই রাত আর দিনকে করেছেন পরস্পরের অনুগামী তাদের জন্য যারা উপদেশ গ্রহণ করতে চায়, অথবা কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করতে চায়।', 'And it is He who has made the night and the day in succession for whoever desires to remember or desires gratitude.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025062.mp3', now()),
  (25, 63, '', '[{"id":55982,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَعِبَادُ","transliteration":"waʿibādu","translation_bn":"আর দাসরা","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55983,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ","transliteration":"l-raḥmāni","translation_bn":"দয়াময়ের","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55984,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারাই) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":55985,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَمْشُونَ","transliteration":"yamshūna","translation_bn":"চলাফেরা করে","root":"مشي","lemma":"مَّشَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55986,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55987,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"জমিনের","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55988,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هَوْنًۭا","transliteration":"hawnan","translation_bn":"নম্রভাবে","root":"هون","lemma":"هَوْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55989,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"আর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55990,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"خَاطَبَهُمُ","transliteration":"khāṭabahumu","translation_bn":"সম্বোধন করে তাদেরকে","root":"خطب","lemma":"خَاطَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55991,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَـٰهِلُونَ","transliteration":"l-jāhilūna","translation_bn":"অজ্ঞ লোকেরা","root":"جهل","lemma":"جَاهِل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55992,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55993,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"سَلَـٰمًۭا","transliteration":"salāman","translation_bn":"\"(তোমাদেরকে) সালাম\"","root":"سلم","lemma":"سَلَٰم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55994,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٦٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waʿibādu l-raḥmāni alladhīna yamshūna ʿalā l-arḍi hawnan wa-idhā khāṭabahumu l-jāhilūna qālū salāman', 'আর রহমানের বান্দা তারাই যারা যমীনে নম্রভাবে চলাফেরা করে আর অজ্ঞ লোকেরা তাদেরকে সম্বোধন করলে তারা বলে- ‘শান্তি’, (আমরা বিতর্কে লিপ্ত হতে চাই না)।', 'And the servants of the Most Merciful are those who walk upon the earth easily, and when the ignorant address them [harshly], they say [words of] peace,', 'আর রহমানের বান্দা তারাই যারা যমীনে নম্রভাবে চলাফেরা করে আর অজ্ঞ লোকেরা তাদেরকে সম্বোধন করলে তারা বলে- ‘শান্তি’, (আমরা বিতর্কে লিপ্ত হতে চাই না)।', 'And the servants of the Most Merciful are those who walk upon the earth easily, and when the ignorant address them [harshly], they say [words of] peace,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025063.mp3', now()),
  (25, 64, '', '[{"id":56859,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56860,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَبِيتُونَ","transliteration":"yabītūna","translation_bn":"রাত কাটায়","root":"بيت","lemma":"يَبِيتُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56861,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِرَبِّهِمْ","transliteration":"lirabbihim","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে তাদেের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56862,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"سُجَّدًۭا","transliteration":"sujjadan","translation_bn":"সিজদায়","root":"سجد","lemma":"سَاجِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":56863,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَقِيَـٰمًۭا","transliteration":"waqiyāman","translation_bn":"ও দাঁড়ানো অবস্থায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَا^ئِم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56864,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٦٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna yabītūna lirabbihim sujjadan waqiyāman', 'আর তারা রাত কাটায় তাদের প্রতিপালকের উদ্দেশ্যে সাজদায় অবনত ও দন্ডায়মান অবস্থায়।', 'And those who spend [part of] the night to their Lord prostrating and standing [in prayer]', 'আর তারা রাত কাটায় তাদের প্রতিপালকের উদ্দেশ্যে সাজদায় অবনত ও দন্ডায়মান অবস্থায়।', 'And those who spend [part of] the night to their Lord prostrating and standing [in prayer]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025064.mp3', now()),
  (25, 65, '', '[{"id":57231,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57232,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","translation_bn":"বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57233,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّنَا","transliteration":"rabbanā","translation_bn":"\"হে আমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57234,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱصْرِفْ","transliteration":"iṣ''rif","translation_bn":"দূর করো","root":"صرف","lemma":"صَرَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57235,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَنَّا","transliteration":"ʿannā","translation_bn":"হ''তে আমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57236,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابَ","transliteration":"ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57237,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمَ ۖ","transliteration":"jahannama","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামের","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":57239,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":57240,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابَهَا","transliteration":"ʿadhābahā","translation_bn":"তার শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57241,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57242,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"غَرَامًا","transliteration":"gharāman","translation_bn":"প্রাণান্তকর (ধ্বংস)","root":"غرم","lemma":"غَرَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57243,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٦٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna yaqūlūna rabbanā iṣ''rif ʿannā ʿadhāba jahannama inna ʿadhābahā kāna gharāman', 'আর তারা বলে : ‘হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! তুমি আমাদের থেকে জাহান্নামের শাস্তি দূর কর, তার শাস্তি তো ভয়াবহ বিপদ।’', 'And those who say, "Our Lord, avert from us the punishment of Hell. Indeed, its punishment is ever adhering;', 'আর তারা বলে : ‘হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! তুমি আমাদের থেকে জাহান্নামের শাস্তি দূর কর, তার শাস্তি তো ভয়াবহ বিপদ।’', 'And those who say, "Our Lord, avert from us the punishment of Hell. Indeed, its punishment is ever adhering;', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025065.mp3', now()),
  (25, 66, '', '[{"id":57465,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهَا","transliteration":"innahā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":57466,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"سَآءَتْ","transliteration":"sāat","translation_bn":"কত নিকৃষ্ট","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57467,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُسْتَقَرًّۭا","transliteration":"mus''taqarran","translation_bn":"বিশ্রামস্থল","root":"قرر","lemma":"مُسْتَقَرّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57468,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَمُقَامًۭا","transliteration":"wamuqāman","translation_bn":"ও বাসস্থান\"","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُقَام","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57469,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٦٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innahā sāat mus''taqarran wamuqāman', 'তা আবাসস্থল আর অবস্থান নেয়ার জায়গা হিসেবে কতই না নিকৃষ্ট!', 'Indeed, it is evil as a settlement and residence."', 'তা আবাসস্থল আর অবস্থান নেয়ার জায়গা হিসেবে কতই না নিকৃষ্ট!', 'Indeed, it is evil as a settlement and residence."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025066.mp3', now()),
  (25, 67, '', '[{"id":58300,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং তারা (এমন যে)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58301,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِذَآ","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":58302,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنفَقُوا۟","transliteration":"anfaqū","translation_bn":"ব্যয় করে","root":"نفق","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58303,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":58304,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يُسْرِفُوا۟","transliteration":"yus''rifū","translation_bn":"অমিতব্যয় করে","root":"سرف","lemma":"أَسْرَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58305,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمْ","transliteration":"walam","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58306,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَقْتُرُوا۟","transliteration":"yaqturū","translation_bn":"কার্পণ্য করে","root":"قتر","lemma":"يَقْتُرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58307,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"বরং থাকে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58308,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَ","transliteration":"bayna","translation_bn":"মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":58309,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এই (দু''য়ের)","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":58310,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَوَامًۭا","transliteration":"qawāman","translation_bn":"দন্ডায়মান","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58311,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٦٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna idhā anfaqū lam yus''rifū walam yaqturū wakāna bayna dhālika qawāman', 'আর যখন তারা ব্যয় করে তখন অপব্যয় করে না, আর কৃপণতাও করে না; এ দু’য়ের মধ্যবর্তী পন্থা গ্রহণ করে।', 'And [they are] those who, when they spend, do so not excessively or sparingly but are ever, between that, [justly] moderate', 'আর যখন তারা ব্যয় করে তখন অপব্যয় করে না, আর কৃপণতাও করে না; এ দু’য়ের মধ্যবর্তী পন্থা গ্রহণ করে।', 'And [they are] those who, when they spend, do so not excessively or sparingly but are ever, between that, [justly] moderate', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025067.mp3', now()),
  (25, 68, '', '[{"id":58555,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58556,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":58557,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَدْعُونَ","transliteration":"yadʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা ডাকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58558,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَعَ","transliteration":"maʿa","translation_bn":"সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":58559,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":58560,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهًا","transliteration":"ilāhan","translation_bn":"উপাস্য","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58561,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ءَاخَرَ","transliteration":"ākhara","translation_bn":"অন্যকে","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":58562,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58563,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَقْتُلُونَ","transliteration":"yaqtulūna","translation_bn":"হত্যা করে তারা","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58564,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّفْسَ","transliteration":"l-nafsa","translation_bn":"কোন প্রাণকে","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58565,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّتِى","transliteration":"allatī","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":58566,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"حَرَّمَ","transliteration":"ḥarrama","translation_bn":"নিষিদ্ধ করেছেন","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58567,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":58568,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"তবে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":58569,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"সাথে যথার্থতার (হ''লে ভিন্ন কথা)","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58570,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58571,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يَزْنُونَ ۚ","transliteration":"yaznūna","translation_bn":"ব্যভিচার করে","root":"زني","lemma":"يَزْنُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58573,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58574,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يَفْعَلْ","transliteration":"yafʿal","translation_bn":"করবে","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58575,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":58576,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يَلْقَ","transliteration":"yalqa","translation_bn":"অর্জন করবে","root":"لقي","lemma":"لَقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58577,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"أَثَامًۭا","transliteration":"athāman","translation_bn":"পাপ","root":"اثم","lemma":"أَثَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58578,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٦٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna lā yadʿūna maʿa l-lahi ilāhan ākhara walā yaqtulūna l-nafsa allatī ḥarrama l-lahu illā bil-ḥaqi walā yaznūna waman yafʿal dhālika yalqa athāman', 'তারা আল্লাহর সাথে অন্য কোন ইলাহকে ডাকে না। আর যথার্থতা ব্যতীত কোন প্রাণ হত্যা করে না যা আল্লাহ নিষিদ্ধ করেছেন আর তারা ব্যভিচার করে না। আর যে এগুলো করে সে শাস্তির সাক্ষাৎ লাভ করবে।', 'And those who do not invoke with Allah another deity or kill the soul which Allah has forbidden [to be killed], except by right, and do not commit unlawful sexual intercourse. And whoever should do that will meet a penalty.', 'তারা আল্লাহর সাথে অন্য কোন ইলাহকে ডাকে না। আর যথার্থতা ব্যতীত কোন প্রাণ হত্যা করে না যা আল্লাহ নিষিদ্ধ করেছেন আর তারা ব্যভিচার করে না। আর যে এগুলো করে সে শাস্তির সাক্ষাৎ লাভ করবে।', 'And those who do not invoke with Allah another deity or kill the soul which Allah has forbidden [to be killed], except by right, and do not commit unlawful sexual intercourse. And whoever should do that will meet a penalty.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025068.mp3', now()),
  (25, 69, '', '[{"id":59339,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يُضَـٰعَفْ","transliteration":"yuḍāʿaf","translation_bn":"দ্বিগুণ করা হবে","root":"ضعف","lemma":"يُضَٰعِفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59340,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَهُ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার জন্যই","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59341,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابُ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābu","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59342,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59343,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59344,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَيَخْلُدْ","transliteration":"wayakhlud","translation_bn":"এবং স্থায়ী হবে","root":"خلد","lemma":"يَخْلُدْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59345,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِۦ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59346,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مُهَانًا","transliteration":"muhānan","translation_bn":"হীন অবস্থায়","root":"هون","lemma":"مُهَان","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59347,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٦٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yuḍāʿaf lahu l-ʿadhābu yawma l-qiyāmati wayakhlud fīhi muhānan', 'ক্বিয়ামতের দিন তার শাস্তি দ্বিগুণ করা হবে আর সে সেখানে লাঞ্ছিত হয়ে চিরবাস করবে।', 'Multiplied for him is the punishment on the Day of Resurrection, and he will abide therein humiliated -', 'ক্বিয়ামতের দিন তার শাস্তি দ্বিগুণ করা হবে আর সে সেখানে লাঞ্ছিত হয়ে চিরবাস করবে।', 'Multiplied for him is the punishment on the Day of Resurrection, and he will abide therein humiliated -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025069.mp3', now()),
  (25, 70, '', '[{"id":59792,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"তবেে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":59793,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":59794,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَابَ","transliteration":"tāba","translation_bn":"তওবা করবে","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59795,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَءَامَنَ","transliteration":"waāmana","translation_bn":"ও ঈমান আনবে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59796,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلَ","transliteration":"waʿamila","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করবে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59797,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَمَلًۭا","transliteration":"ʿamalan","translation_bn":"কর্ম","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59798,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59799,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"fa-ulāika","translation_bn":"তখন ঐসব লোকদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59800,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُبَدِّلُ","transliteration":"yubaddilu","translation_bn":"পরিবর্তন করে দিবেন","root":"بدل","lemma":"بَدَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59801,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":59802,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"سَيِّـَٔاتِهِمْ","transliteration":"sayyiātihim","translation_bn":"তাদের অন্যায়কে","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَيِّـ#َات","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59803,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"حَسَنَـٰتٍۢ ۗ","transliteration":"ḥasanātin","translation_bn":"ভালোয়","root":"حسن","lemma":"حَسَنَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59805,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"আর হলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59806,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":59807,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورًۭا","transliteration":"ghafūran","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":59808,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمًۭا","transliteration":"raḥīman","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":59809,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٧٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭০)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'illā man tāba waāmana waʿamila ʿamalan ṣāliḥan fa-ulāika yubaddilu l-lahu sayyiātihim ḥasanātin wakāna l-lahu ghafūran raḥīman', 'তবে তারা নয় যারা তাওবাহ করবে, ঈমান আনবে, আর সৎ কাজ করবে। আল্লাহ এদের পাপগুলোকে পুণ্যে পরিবর্তিত করে দেবেন; আল্লাহ বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, বড়ই দয়ালু।', 'Except for those who repent, believe and do righteous work. For them Allah will replace their evil deeds with good. And ever is Allah Forgiving and Merciful.', 'তবে তারা নয় যারা তাওবাহ করবে, ঈমান আনবে, আর সৎ কাজ করবে। আল্লাহ এদের পাপগুলোকে পুণ্যে পরিবর্তিত করে দেবেন; আল্লাহ বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, বড়ই দয়ালু।', 'Except for those who repent, believe and do righteous work. For them Allah will replace their evil deeds with good. And ever is Allah Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025070.mp3', now()),
  (25, 71, '', '[{"id":60250,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60251,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَابَ","transliteration":"tāba","translation_bn":"তওবা করে","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60252,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلَ","transliteration":"waʿamila","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60253,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60254,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"fa-innahu","translation_bn":"তখন নিশ্চয়ই সে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60255,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَتُوبُ","transliteration":"yatūbu","translation_bn":"ফিরে আসে","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60256,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60257,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":60258,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَتَابًۭا","transliteration":"matāban","translation_bn":"অনুতপ্ত হয়ে","root":"توب","lemma":"مَتَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60259,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٧١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭১)","root":"—","lemma":"٧١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waman tāba waʿamila ṣāliḥan fa-innahu yatūbu ilā l-lahi matāban', 'আর যে ব্যক্তি তাওবাহ করে আর সৎকাজ করে, সে আল্লাহর দিকে প্রত্যাবর্তন করে- পূর্ণ প্রত্যাবর্তন।', 'And he who repents and does righteousness does indeed turn to Allah with [accepted] repentance.', 'আর যে ব্যক্তি তাওবাহ করে আর সৎকাজ করে, সে আল্লাহর দিকে প্রত্যাবর্তন করে- পূর্ণ প্রত্যাবর্তন।', 'And he who repents and does righteousness does indeed turn to Allah with [accepted] repentance.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025071.mp3', now()),
  (25, 72, '', '[{"id":60830,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60831,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":60832,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَشْهَدُونَ","transliteration":"yashhadūna","translation_bn":"সাক্ষ্য দেয়","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60833,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلزُّورَ","transliteration":"l-zūra","translation_bn":"মিথ্যার","root":"زور","lemma":"زُّور","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60834,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60835,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَرُّوا۟","transliteration":"marrū","translation_bn":"অতিক্রম করে","root":"مرر","lemma":"مَرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60836,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّغْوِ","transliteration":"bil-laghwi","translation_bn":"পাশ দিয়ে কোন অর্থহীন বিষয়কে","root":"لغو","lemma":"لَغْو","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60837,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَرُّوا۟","transliteration":"marrū","translation_bn":"তারা অতিক্রম করে","root":"مرر","lemma":"مَرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60838,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كِرَامًۭا","transliteration":"kirāman","translation_bn":"ভদ্রভাবে","root":"كرم","lemma":"كَرِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60839,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٧٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭২)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna lā yashhadūna l-zūra wa-idhā marrū bil-laghwi marrū kirāman', 'আর যারা মিথ্যে সাক্ষ্য দেয় না, আর বেহুদা কর্মকান্ডের পাশ দিয়ে অতিক্রম করলে সসম্মানে পাশ কাটিয়ে চলে যায়।', 'And [they are] those who do not testify to falsehood, and when they pass near ill speech, they pass by with dignity.', 'আর যারা মিথ্যে সাক্ষ্য দেয় না, আর বেহুদা কর্মকান্ডের পাশ দিয়ে অতিক্রম করলে সসম্মানে পাশ কাটিয়ে চলে যায়।', 'And [they are] those who do not testify to falsehood, and when they pass near ill speech, they pass by with dignity.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025072.mp3', now()),
  (25, 73, '', '[{"id":61051,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61052,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":61053,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ذُكِّرُوا۟","transliteration":"dhukkirū","translation_bn":"স্মরণ করানো হয়","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذُكِّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61054,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"biāyāti","translation_bn":"প্রতি আয়াতগুলোর","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61055,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِمْ","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"তাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61056,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":61057,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَخِرُّوا۟","transliteration":"yakhirrū","translation_bn":"তারা পড়ে থাকে","root":"خرر","lemma":"خَرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61058,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهَا","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61059,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"صُمًّۭا","transliteration":"ṣumman","translation_bn":"অন্ধ","root":"صمم","lemma":"أَصَمّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61060,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَعُمْيَانًۭا","transliteration":"waʿum''yānan","translation_bn":"ও বধির হয়ে","root":"عمي","lemma":"أَعْمَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61061,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٧٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna idhā dhukkirū biāyāti rabbihim lam yakhirrū ʿalayhā ṣumman waʿum''yānan', 'আর তাদেরকে তাদের প্রতিপালকের আয়াত স্মরণ করিয়ে দেয়া হলে যারা তার প্রতি বধির ও অন্ধের ন্যায় আচরণ করে না (শুনেও শুনে না, দেখেও দেখে না- এমন করে না)।', 'And those who, when reminded of the verses of their Lord, do not fall upon them deaf and blind.', 'আর তাদেরকে তাদের প্রতিপালকের আয়াত স্মরণ করিয়ে দেয়া হলে যারা তার প্রতি বধির ও অন্ধের ন্যায় আচরণ করে না (শুনেও শুনে না, দেখেও দেখে না- এমন করে না)।', 'And those who, when reminded of the verses of their Lord, do not fall upon them deaf and blind.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025073.mp3', now()),
  (25, 74, '', '[{"id":61746,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61747,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","translation_bn":"বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61748,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّنَا","transliteration":"rabbanā","translation_bn":"\"হে আমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61749,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"هَبْ","transliteration":"hab","translation_bn":"তুমি দাও","root":"وهب","lemma":"وَهَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61750,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَنَا","transliteration":"lanā","translation_bn":"জন্যে আমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَنَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61751,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61752,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَزْوَٰجِنَا","transliteration":"azwājinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের স্ত্রীদেরকে","root":"زوج","lemma":"زَوْج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61753,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَذُرِّيَّـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"wadhurriyyātinā","translation_bn":"এবং আমাদের বংশধরদেরকে","root":"ذرر","lemma":"ذُرِّيَّٰت","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61754,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قُرَّةَ","transliteration":"qurrata","translation_bn":"শীতলতা (অর্থাৎ শান্তি)","root":"قرر","lemma":"قُرَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61755,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَعْيُنٍۢ","transliteration":"aʿyunin","translation_bn":"চোখের","root":"عين","lemma":"عَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61756,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱجْعَلْنَا","transliteration":"wa-ij''ʿalnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমাদেরকে বানাও","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61757,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِلْمُتَّقِينَ","transliteration":"lil''muttaqīna","translation_bn":"জন্যে মুত্তাকীদের","root":"وقي","lemma":"مُتَّقِين","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61758,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِمَامًا","transliteration":"imāman","translation_bn":"নেতা\"","root":"امم","lemma":"إِمَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61759,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٧٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna yaqūlūna rabbanā hab lanā min azwājinā wadhurriyyātinā qurrata aʿyunin wa-ij''ʿalnā lil''muttaqīna imāman', 'আর যারা প্রার্থনা করে : হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! আমাদেরকে এমন স্ত্রী ও সন্তানাদি দান কর যারা আমাদের চোখ জুড়িয়ে দেয় আর আমাদেরকে মুত্তাকীদের নেতা বানিয়ে দাও।', 'And those who say, "Our Lord, grant us from among our wives and offspring comfort to our eyes and make us an example for the righteous."', 'আর যারা প্রার্থনা করে : হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! আমাদেরকে এমন স্ত্রী ও সন্তানাদি দান কর যারা আমাদের চোখ জুড়িয়ে দেয় আর আমাদেরকে মুত্তাকীদের নেতা বানিয়ে দাও।', 'And those who say, "Our Lord, grant us from among our wives and offspring comfort to our eyes and make us an example for the righteous."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025074.mp3', now()),
  (25, 75, '', '[{"id":62290,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোকদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":62291,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُجْزَوْنَ","transliteration":"yuj''zawna","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে প্রতিদান দেয়া হবে","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62292,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغُرْفَةَ","transliteration":"l-ghur''fata","translation_bn":"উচ্চতম কক্ষ","root":"غرف","lemma":"غُرْفَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62293,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"যা এ কারণে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62294,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"صَبَرُوا۟","transliteration":"ṣabarū","translation_bn":"তারা ধৈর্য ধরেছে","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62295,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَيُلَقَّوْنَ","transliteration":"wayulaqqawna","translation_bn":"ও তারা পাবে","root":"لقي","lemma":"لَقَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62296,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62297,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَحِيَّةًۭ","transliteration":"taḥiyyatan","translation_bn":"অভিবাদন","root":"حيي","lemma":"تَحِيَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62298,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَسَلَـٰمًا","transliteration":"wasalāman","translation_bn":"ও সালাম","root":"سلم","lemma":"سَلَٰم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62299,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٧٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ulāika yuj''zawna l-ghur''fata bimā ṣabarū wayulaqqawna fīhā taḥiyyatan wasalāman', 'এদেরকেই তাদের ধৈর্যধারণের কারণে জান্নাতের সুউচ্চ স্থান দান ক’রে পুরস্কৃত করা হবে। সেখানে তাদেরকে অভ্যর্থনা জানানো হবে সংবর্ধনা ও সালাম জানিয়ে।', 'Those will be awarded the Chamber for what they patiently endured, and they will be received therein with greetings and [words of] peace.', 'এদেরকেই তাদের ধৈর্যধারণের কারণে জান্নাতের সুউচ্চ স্থান দান ক’রে পুরস্কৃত করা হবে। সেখানে তাদেরকে অভ্যর্থনা জানানো হবে সংবর্ধনা ও সালাম জানিয়ে।', 'Those will be awarded the Chamber for what they patiently endured, and they will be received therein with greetings and [words of] peace.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025075.mp3', now()),
  (25, 76, '', '[{"id":62339,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","transliteration":"khālidīna","translation_bn":"চিরস্থায়ী হবে","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62340,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا ۚ","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62342,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"حَسُنَتْ","transliteration":"ḥasunat","translation_bn":"কত উত্তম হবে","root":"حسن","lemma":"حَسُنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62343,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مُسْتَقَرًّۭا","transliteration":"mus''taqarran","translation_bn":"বিশ্রামাগার","root":"قرر","lemma":"مُسْتَقَرّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62344,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَمُقَامًۭا","transliteration":"wamuqāman","translation_bn":"আর (কত উত্তম) বাসস্থান","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُقَام","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62345,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٧٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'khālidīna fīhā ḥasunat mus''taqarran wamuqāman', 'সেখানে তারা চিরকাল থাকবে, আবাসস্থল ও অবস্থানস্থল হিসেবে তা কতই না উৎকৃষ্ট!', 'Abiding eternally therein. Good is the settlement and residence.', 'সেখানে তারা চিরকাল থাকবে, আবাসস্থল ও অবস্থানস্থল হিসেবে তা কতই না উৎকৃষ্ট!', 'Abiding eternally therein. Good is the settlement and residence.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025076.mp3', now()),
  (25, 77, '', '[{"id":62804,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"(হে নাবী) বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62805,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":62806,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَعْبَؤُا۟","transliteration":"yaʿba-u","translation_bn":"ভ্রুক্ষেপ করেন তিনি","root":"عبا","lemma":"يَعْبَؤُا@","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62807,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِكُمْ","transliteration":"bikum","translation_bn":"প্রতি তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"بِكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62808,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62809,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَوْلَا","transliteration":"lawlā","translation_bn":"যদি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":62810,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"دُعَآؤُكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"duʿāukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের প্রার্থনা (হয় তাঁর কাছে)","root":"دعو","lemma":"دُعَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62812,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَقَدْ","transliteration":"faqad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই (এখন)","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62813,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّبْتُمْ","transliteration":"kadhabtum","translation_bn":"তোমরা অস্বীকার করেছো","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62814,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَسَوْفَ","transliteration":"fasawfa","translation_bn":"ফলে অতিশীঘ্রই","root":"—","lemma":"سَوْف\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62815,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَكُونُ","transliteration":"yakūnu","translation_bn":"হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62816,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِزَامًۢا","transliteration":"lizāman","translation_bn":"স্থায়ী অনিবার্য (শাস্তি)\"","root":"لزم","lemma":"لِزَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62817,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٧٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul mā yaʿba-u bikum rabbī lawlā duʿāukum faqad kadhabtum fasawfa yakūnu lizāman', '(কাফিরদেরকে) বল : ‘তোমাদের ব্যাপারে আমার প্রতিপালকের কী প্রয়োজন পড়েছে তোমরা যদি তাঁকে না ডাকো? তোমরা তো তাঁকে অস্বীকার করেছ, কাজেই শীঘ্রই তোমাদের উপর এসে পড়বে অপ্রতিরোধ্য (শাস্তি)।', 'Say, "What would my Lord care for you if not for your supplication?" For you [disbelievers] have denied, so your denial is going to be adherent.', '(কাফিরদেরকে) বল : ‘তোমাদের ব্যাপারে আমার প্রতিপালকের কী প্রয়োজন পড়েছে তোমরা যদি তাঁকে না ডাকো? তোমরা তো তাঁকে অস্বীকার করেছ, কাজেই শীঘ্রই তোমাদের উপর এসে পড়বে অপ্রতিরোধ্য (শাস্তি)।', 'Say, "What would my Lord care for you if not for your supplication?" For you [disbelievers] have denied, so your denial is going to be adherent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/025077.mp3', now())
