শিশুকালে আমাদের মধ্যে লালন পালন করিনি? আর তুমি কি তোমার জীবনের কতকগুলো বছর আমাদের মাঝে কাটাওনি?', '[Pharaoh] said, "Did we not raise you among us as a child, and you remained among us for years of your life?', 'ফেরাউন বলল, ‘আমরা কি তোমাকে শিশুকালে আমাদের মধ্যে লালন পালন করিনি? আর তুমি কি তোমার জীবনের কতকগুলো বছর আমাদের মাঝে কাটাওনি?', '[Pharaoh] said, "Did we not raise you among us as a child, and you remained among us for years of your life?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/026018.mp3', now()),
  (26, 19, '', '[{"id":22102,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَفَعَلْتَ","transliteration":"wafaʿalta","translation_bn":"এবং তুমি করেছো","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":22103,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فَعْلَتَكَ","transliteration":"faʿlataka","translation_bn":"কর্ম তোমার","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعْلَت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":22104,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّتِى","transliteration":"allatī","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":22105,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَعَلْتَ","transliteration":"faʿalta","translation_bn":"তুমি করেছো","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22106,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنتَ","transliteration":"wa-anta","translation_bn":"আর তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"وَأَنتَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":22107,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভূক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":22108,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","translation_bn":"অকৃতজ্ঞদের\"","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22109,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"١٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wafaʿalta faʿlataka allatī faʿalta wa-anta mina l-kāfirīna', 'তুমি তোমার কর্ম যা করার করেছ (আমাদের একজন লোককে হত্যা ক’রে), তুমি বড় অকৃতজ্ঞ।’', 'And [then] you did your deed which you did, and you were of the ungrateful."', 'তুমি তোমার কর্ম যা করার করেছ (আমাদের একজন লোককে হত্যা ক’রে), তুমি বড় অকৃতজ্ঞ।’', 'And [then] you did your deed which you did, and you were of the ungrateful."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/026019.mp3', now()),
  (26, 20, '', '[{"id":23215,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(মূসা) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23216,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فَعَلْتُهَآ","transliteration":"faʿaltuhā","translation_bn":"\"তা আমি করেছিলাম","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23217,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِذًۭا","transliteration":"idhan","translation_bn":"তখন (সে সময়)","root":"—","lemma":"إِذًا\r","grammar_bn":"আশ্চর্যসূচক (Surprise)"},{"id":23218,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَا۠","transliteration":"wa-anā","translation_bn":"যখন আমি (ছিলাম)","root":"—","lemma":"وَأَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23219,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভূক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23220,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلضَّآلِّينَ","transliteration":"l-ḍālīna","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্টদের","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَا^لّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":23221,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٢٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২০)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla faʿaltuhā idhan wa-anā mina l-ḍālīna', 'মূসা বলল : ‘আমি তো তা করেছিলাম সে সময় যখন আমি ছিলাম (সঠিক পথ সম্পর্কে) অজ্ঞ।', '[Moses] said, "I did it, then, while I was of those astray.', 'মূসা বলল : ‘আমি তো তা করেছিলাম সে সময় যখন আমি ছিলাম (সঠিক পথ সম্পর্কে) অজ্ঞ।', '[Moses] said, "I did it, then, while I was of those astray.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/026020.mp3', now()),
  (26, 21, '', '[{"id":24003,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَفَرَرْتُ","transliteration":"fafarartu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর আমি পালিয়ে গেলাম","root":"فرر","lemma":"فَرَّتْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24004,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِنكُمْ","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"হ''তে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24005,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَمَّا","transliteration":"lammā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":24006,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"خِفْتُكُمْ","transliteration":"khif''tukum","translation_bn":"ভয় করেছিলাম তোমাদেরকে","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24007,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَوَهَبَ","transliteration":"fawahaba","translation_bn":"অতঃপর দান করলেন","root":"وهب","lemma":"وَهَبَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24008,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِى","transliteration":"lī","translation_bn":"জন্যে আমার","root":"—","lemma":"لِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24009,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":24010,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"حُكْمًۭا","transliteration":"ḥuk''man","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞা","root":"حكم","lemma":"حُكْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":24011,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلَنِى","transliteration":"wajaʿalanī","translation_bn":"এবং আমাকে করলেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":24012,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভূক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24013,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ","transliteration":"l-mur''salīna","translation_bn":"রাসূলদের","root":"رسل","lemma":"مُّرْسَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24014,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٢١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২১)","root":"—","lemma":"٢١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fafarartu minkum lammā khif''tukum fawahaba lī rabbī ḥuk''man wajaʿalanī mina l-mur''salīna', 'অতঃপর তোমাদের ভয়ে ভীত হয়ে আমি তোমাদের থেকে পালিয়ে গেলাম। অতঃপর আমার রবব আমাকে প্রজ্ঞা দান করলেন, আর আমাকে করলেন রসূলদের একজন।', 'So I fled from you when I feared you. Then my Lord granted me wisdom and prophethood and appointed me [as one] of the messengers.', 'অতঃপর তোমাদের ভয়ে ভীত হয়ে আমি তোমাদের থেকে পালিয়ে গেলাম। অতঃপর আমার রবব আমাকে প্রজ্ঞা দান করলেন, আর আমাকে করলেন রসূলদের একজন।', 'So I fled from you when I feared you. Then my Lord granted me wisdom and prophethood and appointed me [as one] of the messengers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/026021.mp3', now()),
  (26, 22, '', '[{"id":25023,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَتِلْكَ","transliteration":"watil''ka","translation_bn":"আর ঐ","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":25024,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نِعْمَةٌۭ","transliteration":"niʿ''matun","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ","root":"نعم","lemma":"نِعْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25025,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَمُنُّهَا","transliteration":"tamunnuhā","translation_bn":"যা তুমি দয়া দেখাচ্ছো","root":"منن","lemma":"مَنَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25026,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىَّ","transliteration":"ʿalayya","translation_bn":"আমার উপর (তা কি)","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25027,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"(এ নয়) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":25028,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَبَّدتَّ","transliteration":"ʿabbadtta","translation_bn":"তুমি দাস বানিয়ে রেখেছো","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَّد","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25029,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَنِىٓ","transliteration":"banī","translation_bn":"বনী\"","root":"بني","lemma":"بُنَىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25030,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","transliteration":"is''rāīla","translation_bn":"ইসরাঈলকে\"","root":"—","lemma":"إِسْرَائِيل","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":25031,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٢٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২২)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'watil''ka niʿ''matun tamunnuhā ʿalayya an ʿabbadtta banī is''rāīla', 'তুমি আমার প্রতি তোমার যে অনুগ্রহের খোঁটা দিচ্ছ তাতো এই যে, তুমি বানী ইসরাঈলকে দাসে পরিণত করেছ।’', 'And is this a favor of which you remind me - that you have enslaved the Children of Israel?"', 'তুমি আমার প্রতি তোমার যে অনুগ্রহের খোঁটা দিচ্ছ তাতো এই যে, তুমি বানী ইসরাঈলকে দাসে পরিণত করেছ।’', 'And is this a favor of which you remind me -