yayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/026116.mp3', now()),
  (26, 117, '', '[{"id":75735,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(নূহ) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75736,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّ","transliteration":"rabbi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75737,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":75738,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمِى","transliteration":"qawmī","translation_bn":"আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75739,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّبُونِ","transliteration":"kadhabūni","translation_bn":"আমাকে মিথ্যাবাদী বলেছে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75740,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"١١٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla rabbi inna qawmī kadhabūni', 'নূহ বলল- ‘হে আমার প্রতিপালক! আমার সম্প্রদায় আমাকে প্রত্যাখান করছে।', 'He said, "My Lord, indeed my people have denied me.', 'নূহ বলল- ‘হে আমার প্রতিপালক! আমার সম্প্রদায় আমাকে প্রত্যাখান করছে।', 'He said, "My Lord, indeed my people have denied me.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/026117.mp3', now()),
  (26, 118, '', '[{"id":75945,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱفْتَحْ","transliteration":"fa-if''taḥ","translation_bn":"সুতরাং মীমাংসা করো","root":"فتح","lemma":"فَتَحَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75946,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنِى","transliteration":"baynī","translation_bn":"মাঝে আমার","root":"بين\r","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":75947,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَبَيْنَهُمْ","transliteration":"wabaynahum","translation_bn":"ও মাঝে তাদের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75948,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَتْحًۭا","transliteration":"fatḥan","translation_bn":"(চূড়ান্ত) মীমাংসা","root":"فتح","lemma":"فَتْح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75949,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَنَجِّنِى","transliteration":"wanajjinī","translation_bn":"এবং আমাকে রক্ষা করো","root":"نجو","lemma":"نَجَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75950,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"ও যারা (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75951,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَّعِىَ","transliteration":"maʿiya","translation_bn":"আমার সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":75952,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"(অর্থাৎ ) মধ্য থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75953,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু''মিন\"","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75954,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١١٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-if''taḥ baynī wabaynahum fatḥan wanajjinī waman maʿiya mina l-mu''minīna', 'কাজেই তুমি আমার ও তাদের মধ্যে ফয়সালা ক’রে দাও, আর আমাকে ও আমার সঙ্গী মু’মিনদেরকে ক্ষমা কর।’', 'Then judge between me and them with decisive judgement and save me and those with me of the believers."', 'কাজেই তুমি আমার ও তাদের মধ্যে ফয়সালা ক’রে দাও, আর আমাকে ও আমার সঙ্গী মু’মিনদেরকে ক্ষমা কর।’', 'Then judge between me and them with decisive judgement and save me and those with me of the believers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/026118.mp3', now()),
