"١٤٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā asalukum ʿalayhi min ajrin in ajriya illā ʿalā rabbi l-ʿālamīna', 'আর এজন্য আমি তোমাদের কাছে কোন প্রতিদান চাই না, আমার প্রতিদান তো আছে একমাত্র বিশ্বজগতের প্রতিপালকের নিকট।', 'And I do not ask you for it any payment. My payment is only from the Lord of the worlds.', 'আর এজন্য আমি তোমাদের কাছে কোন প্রতিদান চাই না, আমার প্রতিদান তো আছে একমাত্র বিশ্বজগতের প্রতিপালকের নিকট।', 'And I do not ask you for it any payment. My payment is only from the Lord of the worlds.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/026145.mp3', now()),
  (26, 146, '', '[{"id":79919,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَتُتْرَكُونَ","transliteration":"atut''rakūna","translation_bn":"কি তোমাদেরক ছেড়ে দেয়া হবে","root":"ترك","lemma":"تَرَكَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":79920,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"(তা সবের) মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":79921,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":79922,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰهُنَآ","transliteration":"hāhunā","translation_bn":"এখানে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"هُنَا\r","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":79923,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ءَامِنِينَ","transliteration":"āminīna","translation_bn":"নিরাপদে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامِنِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79924,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"١٤٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'atut''rakūna fī mā hāhunā āminīna', 'তোমাদেরকে কি এখানে যে সব (ভোগ বিলাস) আছে তাতেই নিরাপদে রেখে দেয়া হবে?', 'Will you be left in what is here, secure [from death],', 'তোমাদেরকে কি এখানে যে সব (ভোগ বিলাস) আছে তাতেই নিরাপদে রেখে দেয়া হবে?', 'Will you be left in what is here, secure [from death],', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/026146.mp3', now()),
  (26, 147, '', '[{"id":80108,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80109,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَنَّـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"jannātin","translation_bn":"বাগানের","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80110,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَعُيُونٍۢ","transliteration":"waʿuyūnin","translation_bn":"ও ঝর্ণাসমূহের","root":"عين","lemma":"عَيْن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80111,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"١٤٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fī jannātin waʿuyūnin', 'উদ্যানরাজি আর ঝার্ণাসমূহে।', 'Within gardens and springs', 'উদ্যানরাজি আর ঝার্ণাসমূহে।', 'Within gardens and springs', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/026147.mp3', now()),
  (26, 148, '', '[{"id":80242,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَزُرُوعٍۢ","transliteration":"wazurūʿin","translation_bn":"এবং ফসলের ক্ষেত","root":"زرع","lemma":"زَرْع","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80243,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَنَخْلٍۢ","transliteration":"wanakhlin","translation_bn":"ও খেজুর বাগানের","root":"نخل","lemma":"نَخْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80244,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"طَلْعُهَا","transliteration":"ṭalʿuhā","translation_bn":"ছড়াগুলো তার","root":"طلع","lemma":"طَلْع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80245,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"هَضِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"haḍīmun","translation_bn":"সুকোমল রসে ভরা","root":"هضم","lemma":"هَضِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":80246,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"١٤٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wazurūʿin wanakhlin ṭalʿuhā haḍīmun', 'আর শষ্যক্ষেতে ও ফুলে আচ্ছাদিত (ফলে ভারাক্রান্ত) খেজুর বাগানে?', 'And fields of crops and palm trees with softened fruit?', 'আর শষ্যক্ষেতে ও ফুলে আচ্ছাদিত (ফলে ভারাক্রান্ত) খেজুর বাগানে?', 'And fields of crops and palm trees with softened fruit?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/026148.mp3', now()),
  (26, 149, '', '[{"id":80353,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَتَنْحِتُونَ","transliteration":"watanḥitūna","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা খোদাই করে নির্মান করেছো","root":"نحت","lemma":"يَنْحِتُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80354,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80355,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجِبَالِ","transliteration":"l-jibāli","translation_bn":"পাহাড়সমূহের","root":"جبل","lemma":"جَبَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80356,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بُيُوتًۭا","transliteration":"buyūtan","translation_bn":"ঘরসমূহ","root":"بيت","lemma":"بَيْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80357,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَـٰرِهِينَ","transliteration":"fārihīna","translation_bn":"সাথে নৈপুণ্যের","root":"فره","lemma":"فَٰرِهِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80358,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"١٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'watanḥitūna mina l-jibāli buyūtan fārihīna', 'এবং তোমরা দক্ষতার সাথে পাহাড় কেটে গৃহ নির্মাণ করছ।', 'And you carve out of the mountains, homes, with skill.', 'এবং তোমরা দক্ষতার সাথে পাহাড় কেটে গৃহ নির্মাণ করছ।', 'And you carve out of the mountains, homes, with skill.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/026149.mp3', now()),
  (26, 150, '', '[{"id":80359,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱتَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-ittaqū","translation_bn":"তাই তোমরা ভয় করো","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80360,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":80361,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَأَطِيعُونِ","transliteration":"wa-aṭīʿūni","translation_bn":"ও আমার আনুগত্য করো","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80362,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"١٥٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-ittaqū l-laha wa-aṭīʿūni', 'কাজেই তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর ও আমাকে মান্য কর।', 'So fear Allah and obey me.', 'কাজেই তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর ও আমাকে মান্য কর।', 'So fear Allah and obey me.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/026150.mp3', now()),
  (26, 151, '', '[{"id":80627,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80628,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تُطِيعُوٓا۟","transliteration":"tuṭīʿū","translation_bn":"আনুগত্য করো","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80629,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرَ","transliteration":"amra","translation_bn":"আদেশের","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80630,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُسْرِفِينَ","transliteration":"l-mus''rifīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদের","root":"سرف","lemma":"مُسْرِف","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80631,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"١٥١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā tuṭīʿū amra l-mus''rifīna', 'এবং সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদের নির্দেশ মান্য কর না।', 'And do not obey the order of the transgressors,', 'এবং সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদের নির্দেশ মান্য কর না।', 'And do not obey the order of the transgressors,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/026151.mp3', now()),
