িত থাকো (পরামর্শে)\"","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34821,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālat yāayyuhā l-mala-u aftūnī fī amrī mā kuntu qāṭiʿatan amran ḥattā tashhadūni', 'সে বলল, ওহে সভাসদরা! তোমরা আমার কর্তব্য সম্পর্কে আমাকে সিদ্ধান্ত দাও। তোমাদের উপস্থিতি ব্যতীত আমি কোন ব্যাপারে সিদ্ধান্ত গ্রহণ করিনি।’', 'She said, "O eminent ones, advise me in my affair. I would not decide a matter until you witness [for] me."', 'সে বলল, ওহে সভাসদরা! তোমরা আমার কর্তব্য সম্পর্কে আমাকে সিদ্ধান্ত দাও। তোমাদের উপস্থিতি ব্যতীত আমি কোন ব্যাপারে সিদ্ধান্ত গ্রহণ করিনি।’', 'She said, "O eminent ones, advise me in my affair. I would not decide a matter until you witness [for] me."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027032.mp3', now()),
  (27, 33, '', '[{"id":35626,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"(সভাসদবৃন্দ) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35627,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَحْنُ","transliteration":"naḥnu","translation_bn":"\"আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"نَحْنُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":35628,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لُوا۟","transliteration":"ulū","translation_bn":"অধিকারী","root":"اول","lemma":"أُولِى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35629,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قُوَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"quwwatin","translation_bn":"শক্তির (অর্থাৎ বড় শক্তিশালী)","root":"قوي","lemma":"قُوَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35630,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَأُو۟لُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-ulū","translation_bn":"ও (দক্ষতার) অধিকারী","root":"اول","lemma":"أُولِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35631,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَأْسٍۢ","transliteration":"basin","translation_bn":"যুদ্ধ বিগ্রহে","root":"باس","lemma":"بَأْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35632,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"شَدِيدٍۢ","transliteration":"shadīdin","translation_bn":"কঠোর","root":"شدد","lemma":"شَدِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":35633,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَمْرُ","transliteration":"wal-amru","translation_bn":"তবে (সিদ্ধান্তের) কাজ","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35634,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكِ","transliteration":"ilayki","translation_bn":"কাছে আপনারই","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35635,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَٱنظُرِى","transliteration":"fa-unẓurī","translation_bn":"তাই ভেবে দেখুন","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35636,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَاذَا","transliteration":"mādhā","translation_bn":"কি","root":"—","lemma":"مَاذَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":35637,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"تَأْمُرِينَ","transliteration":"tamurīna","translation_bn":"নির্দেশ দিবেন\"","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35638,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٣٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū naḥnu ulū quwwatin wa-ulū basin shadīdin wal-amru ilayki fa-unẓurī mādhā tamurīna', 'তারা বলল- ‘আমরা শক্তির অধিকারী ও কঠোর যোদ্ধা, কিন্তু সিন্ধান্ত গ্রহণের অধিকারী আপনিই, কাজেই চিন্তা করে দেখুন, আপনি কী আদেশ করবেন।’', 'They said, "We are men of strength and of great military might, but the command is yours, so see what you will command."', 'তারা বলল- ‘আমরা শক্তির অধিকারী ও কঠোর যোদ্ধা, কিন্তু সিন্ধান্ত গ্রহণের অধিকারী আপনিই, কাজেই চিন্তা করে দেখুন, আপনি কী আদেশ করবেন।’', 'They said, "We are men of strength and of great military might, but the command is yours, so see what you will command."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027033.mp3', now()),
  (27, 34, '', '[{"id":36574,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَتْ","transliteration":"qālat","translation_bn":"(রানী) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36575,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":36576,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُلُوكَ","transliteration":"l-mulūka","translation_bn":"রাজারা","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36577,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":36578,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"دَخَلُوا۟","transliteration":"dakhalū","translation_bn":"তারা প্রবেশ করে","root":"دخل","lemma":"دَخَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36579,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَرْيَةً","transliteration":"qaryatan","translation_bn":"কোনো জনপদে","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36580,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَفْسَدُوهَا","transliteration":"afsadūhā","translation_bn":"তা বিপর্যস্ত করে তারা","root":"فسد","lemma":"أَفْسَدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36581,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wajaʿalū","translation_bn":"ও তারা বানিয়ে দেয়","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36582,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَعِزَّةَ","transliteration":"aʿizzata","translation_bn":"মর্যাদাবানদেরকে","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36583,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلِهَآ","transliteration":"ahlihā","translation_bn":"অধিবাসীদের তার","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36584,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَذِلَّةًۭ ۖ","transliteration":"adhillatan","translation_bn":"অপদস্হ","root":"ذلل","lemma":"أَذِلَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":36586,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wakadhālika","translation_bn":"আর এরূপই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36587,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَفْعَلُونَ","transliteration":"yafʿalūna","translation_bn":"তারা করবে","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36588,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālat inna l-mulūka idhā dakhalū qaryatan afsadūhā wajaʿalū aʿizzata ahlihā adhillatan wakadhālika yafʿalūna', 'সে বলল- ‘রাজারা যখন কোন জনপদে ঢুকে তখন বিপর্যয় ডেকে আনে এবং তথাকার সম্মানিত ব্যক্তিদেরকে অপমানিত করে ছাড়ে আর এরাও তাই করবে।', 'She said, "Indeed kings - when they enter a city, they ruin it and render the honored of its people humbled. And thus do they do.', 'সে বলল- ‘রাজারা যখন কোন জনপদে ঢুকে তখন বিপর্যয় ডেকে আনে এবং তথাকার সম্মানিত ব্যক্তিদেরকে অপমানিত করে ছাড়ে আর এরাও তাই করবে।', 'She said, "Indeed kings - when they enter a city, they ruin it and render the honored of its people humbled. And thus do they do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027034.mp3', now()),
  (27, 35, '', '[{"id":37425,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنِّى","transliteration":"wa-innī","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37426,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مُرْسِلَةٌ","transliteration":"mur''silatun","translation_bn":"প্রেরণকারী","root":"رسل","lemma":"مُرْسِلَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37427,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِم","transliteration":"ilayhim","translation_bn":"প্রতি তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37428,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِهَدِيَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"bihadiyyatin","translation_bn":"সহ উপঢৌকন","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدِيَّة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37429,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَنَاظِرَةٌۢ","transliteration":"fanāẓiratun","translation_bn":"অতঃপর লক্ষ্য করবো","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَاظِرَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37430,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِمَ","transliteration":"bima","translation_bn":"নিয়ে কি","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37431,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَرْجِعُ","transliteration":"yarjiʿu","translation_bn":"ফিরে আসে","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37432,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُرْسَلُونَ","transliteration":"l-mur''salūna","translation_bn":"দূতেরা\"","root":"رسل","lemma":"مُّرْسَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37433,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٣٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-innī mur''silatun ilayhim bihadiyyatin fanāẓiratun bima yarjiʿu l-mur''salūna', 'আমি তাঁর কাছে উপঢৌকন পাঠাচ্ছি, তারপর দেখি, দূতেরা কী (জবাব) নিয়ে আসে।’', 'But indeed, I will send to them a gift and see with what [reply] the messengers will return."', 'আমি তাঁর কাছে উপঢৌকন পাঠাচ্ছি, তারপর দেখি, দূতেরা কী (জবাব) নিয়ে আসে।’', 'But indeed, I will send to them a gift and see with what [reply] the messengers will return."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027035.mp3', now()),
  (27, 36, '', '[{"id":38301,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38302,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"আসলো (দূত)","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38303,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"سُلَيْمَـٰنَ","transliteration":"sulaymāna","translation_bn":"সুলায়মানের (নিকট)","root":"—","lemma":"سُلَيْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":38304,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38305,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَتُمِدُّونَنِ","transliteration":"atumiddūnani","translation_bn":"\"কি তোমরা কি সাহায্য করছো আমাকে","root":"مدد","lemma":"أَمَدَّ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":38306,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِمَالٍۢ","transliteration":"bimālin","translation_bn":"দিয়ে ধনসম্পদ","root":"مول","lemma":"مَال","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38307,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَمَآ","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"অথচ যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38308,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَىٰنِۦَ","transliteration":"ātāniya","translation_bn":"দিয়েছেন আমাকে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38309,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":38310,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":38311,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّآ","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তার চেয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38312,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَىٰكُم","transliteration":"ātākum","translation_bn":"দিয়েছেন তোমাদেরকে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38313,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":38314,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُم","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُم","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":38315,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بِهَدِيَّتِكُمْ","transliteration":"bihadiyyatikum","translation_bn":"নিয়ে উপঢৌকন তোমাদের","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدِيَّة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38316,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"تَفْرَحُونَ","transliteration":"tafraḥūna","translation_bn":"আনন্দ করো","root":"فرح","lemma":"فَرِحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38317,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٣٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā jāa sulaymāna qāla atumiddūnani bimālin famā ātāniya l-lahu khayrun mimmā ātākum bal antum bihadiyyatikum tafraḥūna', 'অতঃপর দূতরা যখন সুলাইমানের কাছে আসল, সুলাইমান বলল- ‘তোমরা কি আমাকে সম্পদ দিয়ে সাহায্য করছ, কিন্তু আল্লাহ আমাকে যা দিয়েছেন তা তোমাদেরকে যা দিয়েছেন তার চেয়ে উত্তম, বরং তোমরাই তোমাদের উপঢৌকন নিয়ে আনন্দ কর।', 'So when they came to Solomon, he said, "Do you provide me with wealth? But what Allah has given me is better than what He has given you. Rather, it is you who rejoice in your gift.', 'অতঃপর দূতরা যখন সুলাইমানের কাছে আসল, সুলাইমান বলল- ‘তোমরা কি আমাকে সম্পদ দিয়ে সাহায্য করছ, কিন্তু আল্লাহ আমাকে যা দিয়েছেন তা তোমাদেরকে যা দিয়েছেন তার চেয়ে উত্তম, বরং তোমরাই তোমাদের উপঢৌকন নিয়ে আনন্দ কর।', 'So when they came to Solomon, he said, "Do you provide me with wealth? But what Allah has given me is better than what He has given you. Rather, it is you who rejoice in your gift.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027036.mp3', now()),
  (27, 37, '', '[{"id":39146,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱرْجِعْ","transliteration":"ir''jiʿ","translation_bn":"ফিরে যাও","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39147,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ilayhim","translation_bn":"নিকট তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39148,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَلَنَأْتِيَنَّهُم","transliteration":"falanatiyannahum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর অবশ্যই আমরা কাছে আসবোই তাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39149,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِجُنُودٍۢ","transliteration":"bijunūdin","translation_bn":"সহ এক সৈন্যবাহিনী","root":"جند","lemma":"جُند","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39150,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":39151,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قِبَلَ","transliteration":"qibala","translation_bn":"রুখবার শক্তি","root":"قبل","lemma":"قِبَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39152,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَهُم","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"কাছে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39153,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"বিষয়ে তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39154,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلَنُخْرِجَنَّهُم","transliteration":"walanukh''rijannahum","translation_bn":"এবং অবশ্যই আমরা বের করবোই তাদেরকে","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39155,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهَآ","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"হ''তে সেখান","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39156,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَذِلَّةًۭ","transliteration":"adhillatan","translation_bn":"অপমানিত করে","root":"ذلل","lemma":"أَذِلَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39157,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"যখন তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39158,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰغِرُونَ","transliteration":"ṣāghirūna","translation_bn":"অপদস্হ (হবে)\"","root":"صغر","lemma":"صَٰغِرُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39159,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٣٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ir''jiʿ ilayhim falanatiyannahum bijunūdin lā qibala lahum bihā walanukh''rijannahum min''hā adhillatan wahum ṣāghirūna', 'তাদের কাছে ফিরে যাও, আমি অবশ্য অবশ্যই তাদের বিরুদ্ধে এক সেনাবাহিনী নিয়ে আসব যার মুকাবালা করার শক্তি তাদের নেই, আমি অবশ্য অবশ্যই তাদেরকে অপমানিত করে সেখানে থেকে বের করে দেব আর তারা হবে অপদস্থ।’', 'Return to them, for we will surely come to them with soldiers that they will be powerless to encounter, and we will surely expel them therefrom in humiliation, and they will be debased."', 'তাদের কাছে ফিরে যাও, আমি অবশ্য অবশ্যই তাদের বিরুদ্ধে এক সেনাবাহিনী নিয়ে আসব যার মুকাবালা করার শক্তি তাদের নেই, আমি অবশ্য অবশ্যই তাদেরকে অপমানিত করে সেখানে থেকে বের করে দেব আর তারা হবে অপদস্থ।’', 'Return to them, for we will surely come to them with soldiers that they will be powerless to encounter, and we will surely expel them therefrom in humiliation, and they will be debased."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027037.mp3', now()),
  (27, 38, '', '[{"id":39960,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(সুলায়মান) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39961,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"\"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":39962,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَلَؤُا۟","transliteration":"l-mala-u","translation_bn":"সভাসদবৃন্দ","root":"ملا","lemma":"مَلَأ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39963,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَيُّكُمْ","transliteration":"ayyukum","translation_bn":"কে তোমাদের মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَىّ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":39964,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِينِى","transliteration":"yatīnī","translation_bn":"আমার কাছে আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39965,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِعَرْشِهَا","transliteration":"biʿarshihā","translation_bn":"নিয়ে তার সিংহাসন","root":"عرش","lemma":"عَرْش","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39966,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلَ","transliteration":"qabla","translation_bn":"এর পূর্বেই","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":39967,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":39968,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتُونِى","transliteration":"yatūnī","translation_bn":"আমার কাছে তারা আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39969,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مُسْلِمِينَ","transliteration":"mus''limīna","translation_bn":"আত্মসমর্পণকারী হয়ে\"","root":"سلم","lemma":"مُسْلِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39970,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٣٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla yāayyuhā l-mala-u ayyukum yatīnī biʿarshihā qabla an yatūnī mus''limīna', 'সুলাইমান বলল- ‘হে সভাসদবর্গ! তারা আমার কাছে আত্মসমর্পণ করে আসার আগে তোমাদের মধ্যে কে তার সিংহাসন আমার নিকট নিয়ে আসবে?’', '[Solomon] said, "O assembly [of jinn], which of you will bring me her throne before they come to me in submission?"', 'সুলাইমান বলল- ‘হে সভাসদবর্গ! তারা আমার কাছে আত্মসমর্পণ করে আসার আগে তোমাদের মধ্যে কে তার সিংহাসন আমার নিকট নিয়ে আসবে?’', '[Solomon] said, "O assembly [of jinn], which of you will bring me her throne before they come to me in submission?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027038.mp3', now()),
  (27, 39, '', '[{"id":40750,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40751,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عِفْرِيتٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿif''rītun","translation_bn":"এক শক্তিশালী জিন","root":"عفر","lemma":"عِفْرِيت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40752,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40753,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجِنِّ","transliteration":"l-jini","translation_bn":"জিনদের","root":"جنن","lemma":"جِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40754,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنَا۠","transliteration":"anā","translation_bn":"\"আমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":40755,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتِيكَ","transliteration":"ātīka","translation_bn":"আপনার কাছে আসবো","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40756,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"নিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40757,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلَ","transliteration":"qabla","translation_bn":"এর পূর্বেই","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":40758,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":40759,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"تَقُومَ","transliteration":"taqūma","translation_bn":"আপনি উঠে দাঁড়াবেন","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَامَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40760,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40761,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَّقَامِكَ ۖ","transliteration":"maqāmika","translation_bn":"আপনার স্থান","root":"قوم","lemma":"مَقَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40763,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنِّى","transliteration":"wa-innī","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40764,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"উপর এর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40765,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَقَوِىٌّ","transliteration":"laqawiyyun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই শক্তিশালী","root":"قوي","lemma":"قَوِىّ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":40766,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَمِينٌۭ","transliteration":"amīnun","translation_bn":"বিশ্বস্ত\"","root":"امن","lemma":"أَمِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":40767,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٣٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla ʿif''rītun mina l-jini anā ātīka bihi qabla an taqūma min maqāmika wa-innī ʿalayhi laqawiyyun amīnun', 'এক শক্তিধর জ্বিন বলল- ‘আপনি আপনার জায়গা থেকে উঠবার আগে আমি তা আপনার কাছে এনে দেব, এ কাজে আমি অবশ্যই ক্ষমতার অধিকারী ও আস্থাভাজন।', 'A powerful one from among the jinn said, "I will bring it to you before you rise from your place, and indeed, I am for this [task] strong and trustworthy."', 'এক শক্তিধর জ্বিন বলল- ‘আপনি আপনার জায়গা থেকে উঠবার আগে আমি তা আপনার কাছে এনে দেব, এ কাজে আমি অবশ্যই ক্ষমতার অধিকারী ও আস্থাভাজন।', 'A powerful one from among the jinn said, "I will bring it to you before you rise from your place, and indeed, I am for this [task] strong and trustworthy."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027039.mp3', now()),
  (27, 40, '', '[{"id":41609,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(এরপর)বললো একজন","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41610,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"সে (এমন যে)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":41611,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عِندَهُۥ","transliteration":"ʿindahu","translation_bn":"নিকট তার (ছিলো)","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":41612,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿil''mun","translation_bn":"জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41613,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41614,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-kitābi","translation_bn":"কিতাবের","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41615,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَنَا۠","transliteration":"anā","translation_bn":"\"আমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":41616,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتِيكَ","transliteration":"ātīka","translation_bn":"আপনার কাছে আসবো","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41617,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"নিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41618,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلَ","transliteration":"qabla","translation_bn":"(এর) পূর্বেই","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":41619,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":41620,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَرْتَدَّ","transliteration":"yartadda","translation_bn":"ফিরবে","root":"ردد","lemma":"ٱرْتَدَّ","g