"root":"خلف","lemma":"ٱخْتَلَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62590,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٧٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna hādhā l-qur''āna yaquṣṣu ʿalā banī is''rāīla akthara alladhī hum fīhi yakhtalifūna', 'নিশ্চয় এ কুরআন সেগুলোর অধিকাংশ বিবৃত করে যে বিষয়ে বানী ইসরাঈল মতভেদ করেছিল।', 'Indeed, this Qur''an relates to the Children of Israel most of that over which they disagree.', 'নিশ্চয় এ কুরআন সেগুলোর অধিকাংশ বিবৃত করে যে বিষয়ে বানী ইসরাঈল মতভেদ করেছিল।', 'Indeed, this Qur''an relates to the Children of Israel most of that over which they disagree.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027076.mp3', now()),
  (27, 77, '', '[{"id":63122,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"wa-innahu","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই তা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63123,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَهُدًۭى","transliteration":"lahudan","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই পথনির্দেশ","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":63124,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَرَحْمَةٌۭ","transliteration":"waraḥmatun","translation_bn":"এবং দয়া","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63125,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِّلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"lil''mu''minīna","translation_bn":"জন্যে মু''মিনদের","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63126,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٧٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-innahu lahudan waraḥmatun lil''mu''minīna', 'আর তা নিশ্চিতই মু’মিনদের জন্য সঠিক পথের দিশারী ও রহমত।', 'And indeed, it is guidance and mercy for the believers.', 'আর তা নিশ্চিতই মু’মিনদের জন্য সঠিক পথের দিশারী ও রহমত।', 'And indeed, it is guidance and mercy for the believers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027077.mp3', now()),
  (27, 78, '', '[{"id":63578,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":63579,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّكَ","transliteration":"rabbaka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63580,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَقْضِى","transliteration":"yaqḍī","translation_bn":"মীমাংসা করে দিবেন","root":"قضي","lemma":"قَضَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63581,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُم","transliteration":"baynahum","translation_bn":"মাঝে তাদের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":63582,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِحُكْمِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"biḥuk''mihi","translation_bn":"অনুযায়ী নির্দেশ তাঁর","root":"حكم","lemma":"حُكْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63584,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"আর তিনি (হলেন)","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63585,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَزِيزُ","transliteration":"l-ʿazīzu","translation_bn":"পরাক্রমশালী","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63586,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَلِيمُ","transliteration":"l-ʿalīmu","translation_bn":"মহাবিজ্ঞ","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63587,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٧٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna rabbaka yaqḍī baynahum biḥuk''mihi wahuwa l-ʿazīzu l-ʿalīmu', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক তাঁর বিধান অনুযায়ী তাদের মধ্যে ফয়সালা করে দেবেন আর তিনি প্রবল পরাক্রান্ত, সর্বজ্ঞানের অধিকারী।', 'Indeed, your Lord will judge between them by His [wise] judgement. And He is the Exalted in Might, the Knowing.', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক তাঁর বিধান অনুযায়ী তাদের মধ্যে ফয়সালা করে দেবেন আর তিনি প্রবল পরাক্রান্ত, সর্বজ্ঞানের অধিকারী।', 'Indeed, your Lord will judge between them by His [wise] judgement. And He is the Exalted in Might, the Knowing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027078.mp3', now()),
  (27, 79, '', '[{"id":64036,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَتَوَكَّلْ","transliteration":"fatawakkal","translation_bn":"অতএব (হে নাবী) নির্ভর করো","root":"وكل","lemma":"تَوَكَّلْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64037,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64038,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":64040,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكَ","transliteration":"innaka","translation_bn":"তুমি নিশ্চয়ই (প্রতিষ্ঠিত)","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":64041,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64042,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"সত্যের","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64043,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُبِينِ","transliteration":"l-mubīni","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64044,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٧٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fatawakkal ʿalā l-lahi innaka ʿalā l-ḥaqi l-mubīni', 'কাজেই তুমি আল্লাহর উপর নির্ভর কর, তুমি তো সুস্পষ্ট সত্যের উপর আছ।', 'So rely upon Allah; indeed, you are upon the clear truth.', 'কাজেই তুমি আল্লাহর উপর নির্ভর কর, তুমি তো সুস্পষ্ট সত্যের উপর আছ।', 'So rely upon Allah; indeed, you are upon the clear truth.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027079.mp3', now()),
  (27, 80, '', '[{"id":64287,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكَ","transliteration":"innaka","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":64288,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":64289,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تُسْمِعُ","transliteration":"tus''miʿu","translation_bn":"শুনাতে পারো","root":"سمع","lemma":"أَسْمَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64290,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ","transliteration":"l-mawtā","translation_bn":"মৃতদেরকে","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّيِّت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64291,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64292,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تُسْمِعُ","transliteration":"tus''miʿu","translation_bn":"শুনাতে পারো","root":"سمع","lemma":"أَسْمَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64293,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصُّمَّ","transliteration":"l-ṣuma","translation_bn":"বধিরদেরকে","root":"صمم","lemma":"أَصَمّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64294,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّعَآءَ","transliteration":"l-duʿāa","translation_bn":"আহবান","root":"دعو","lemma":"دُعَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64295,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":64296,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَّوْا۟","transliteration":"wallaw","translation_bn":"তারা ফিরে যায়","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64297,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مُدْبِرِينَ","transliteration":"mud''birīna","translation_bn":"পিঠ প্রদর্শন করে","root":"دبر","lemma":"مُدْبِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64298,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٨٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮০)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innaka lā tus''miʿu l-mawtā walā tus''miʿu l-ṣuma l-duʿāa idhā wallaw mud''birīna', 'তুমি মৃতদেরকে শুনাতে পারবে না, আর বধিরকেও আহবান শুনাতে পারবে না (বিশেষতঃ) যখন তারা পিঠ ফিরিয়ে চলে যায়।', 'Indeed, you will not make the dead hear, nor will you make the deaf hear the call when they have turned their backs retreating.', 'তুমি মৃতদেরকে শুনাতে পারবে না, আর বধিরকেও আহবান শুনাতে পারবে না (বিশেষতঃ) যখন তারা পিঠ ফিরিয়ে চলে যায়।', 'Indeed, you will not make the dead hear, nor will you make the deaf hear the call when they have turned their backs retreating.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027080.mp3', now()),
  (27, 81, '', '[{"id":64844,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64845,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنتَ","transliteration":"anta","translation_bn":"তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":64846,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِهَـٰدِى","transliteration":"bihādī","translation_bn":"পথপ্রদর্শনকারী (হ''তে পারো)","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَٰدِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64847,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعُمْىِ","transliteration":"l-ʿum''yi","translation_bn":"অন্ধদেরকে","root":"عمي","lemma":"أَعْمَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64848,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64849,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ضَلَـٰلَتِهِمْ ۖ","transliteration":"ḍalālatihim","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্টতা তাদের","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَٰلَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64851,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"(আর) না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":64852,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تُسْمِعُ","transliteration":"tus''miʿu","translation_bn":"তুমি শুনাতে পারো","root":"سمع","lemma":"أَسْمَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64853,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":64854,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":64855,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُ","transliteration":"yu''minu","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64856,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"প্রতি আয়াতগুলোর আমাদের","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64857,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَهُم","transliteration":"fahum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"فَهُم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64858,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْلِمُونَ","transliteration":"mus''limūna","translation_bn":"মুসলমান বা আত্মসমর্পণকারী","root":"سلم","lemma":"مُسْلِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64859,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٨١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮১)","root":"—","lemma":"٨١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā anta bihādī l-ʿum''yi ʿan ḍalālatihim in tus''miʿu illā man yu''minu biāyātinā fahum mus''limūna', 'আর তুমি অন্ধকেও তাদের গুমরাহী থেকে ফিরিয়ে আনার জন্য সৎপথ দেখাতে পারবে না। তুমি কেবল তাদেরকেই শুনাতে পারবে যারা আমার নিদর্শনাবলীতে বিশ্বাস করে, কাজেই তারা আত্মসমর্পণ করে।', 'And you cannot guide the blind away from their error. You will only make hear those who believe in Our verses so they are Muslims [submitting to Allah].', 'আর তুমি অন্ধকেও তাদের গুমরাহী থেকে ফিরিয়ে আনার জন্য সৎপথ দেখাতে পারবে না। তুমি কেবল তাদেরকেই শুনাতে পারবে যারা আমার নিদর্শনাবলীতে বিশ্বাস করে, কাজেই তারা আত্মসমর্পণ করে।', 'And you cannot guide the blind away from their error. You will only make hear those who believe in Our verses so they are Muslims [submitting to Allah].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027081.mp3', now()),
  (27, 82, '', '[{"id":65188,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65189,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَقَعَ","transliteration":"waqaʿa","translation_bn":"এসে পড়বে","root":"وقع","lemma":"وَقَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65190,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْلُ","transliteration":"l-qawlu","translation_bn":"(ঘোষিত শাস্তির) কথা","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65191,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65192,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَخْرَجْنَا","transliteration":"akhrajnā","translation_bn":"আমরা বের করবো","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65193,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65194,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"دَآبَّةًۭ","transliteration":"dābbatan","translation_bn":"একটি জন্তু","root":"دبب","lemma":"دَا^بَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65195,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65196,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"মাটি","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65197,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"تُكَلِّمُهُمْ","transliteration":"tukallimuhum","translation_bn":"সে কথা বলবে তাদের (সাথে)","root":"كلم","lemma":"كَلَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65198,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যেহেতু","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":65199,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسَ","transliteration":"l-nāsa","translation_bn":"মানিষ","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65200,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65201,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"প্রতি আয়াতগুলোর আমাদের","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65202,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":65203,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يُوقِنُونَ","transliteration":"yūqinūna","translation_bn":"দৃঢ় বিশ্বাস করতো","root":"يقن","lemma":"يُوقِنُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65204,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٨٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮২)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā waqaʿa l-qawlu ʿalayhim akhrajnā lahum dābbatan mina l-arḍi tukallimuhum anna l-nāsa kānū biāyātinā lā yūqinūna', 'তাদেরকে দেয়া প্রতিশ্রুতি যখন বাস্তবে পরিণত হবে, আমি তখন (কিয়ামাত আগমণের নির্দশন হিসেবে) ভূমি থেকে তাদের জন্য একটি জন্তু বের করব যা তাদের সঙ্গে এ কথা বলবে যে, মানুষ আমার নিদর্শনসমূহে বিশ্বাস করত না।', 'And when the word befalls them, We will bring forth for them a creature from the earth speaking to them, [saying] that the people were, of Our verses, not certain [in faith].', 'তাদেরকে দেয়া প্রতিশ্রুতি যখন বাস্তবে পরিণত হবে, আমি তখন (কিয়ামাত আগমণের নির্দশন হিসেবে) ভূমি থেকে তাদের জন্য একটি জন্তু বের করব যা তাদের সঙ্গে এ কথা বলবে যে, মানুষ আমার নিদর্শনসমূহে বিশ্বাস করত না।', 'And when the word befalls them, We will bring forth for them a creature from the earth speaking to them, [saying] that the people were, of Our verses, not certain [in faith].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027082.mp3', now()),
  (27, 83, '', '[{"id":65603,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"এবং(স্মরণ করো) সেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65604,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَحْشُرُ","transliteration":"naḥshuru","translation_bn":"আমরা সমবেত করবো","root":"حشر","lemma":"حَشَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65605,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65606,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65607,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أُمَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"ummatin","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65608,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَوْجًۭا","transliteration":"fawjan","translation_bn":"একেক দলকে","root":"فوج","lemma":"فَوْج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65609,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّن","transliteration":"mimman","translation_bn":"তাদের হ''তে যারা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65610,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يُكَذِّبُ","transliteration":"yukadhibu","translation_bn":"মিথ্যারোপ করতো","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65611,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"প্রতি আয়াতগুলোর আমাদের","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65612,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَهُمْ","transliteration":"fahum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"فَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65613,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُوزَعُونَ","transliteration":"yūzaʿūna","translation_bn":"ভাগ করা হবে (বিভিন্ন দলে)","root":"وزع","lemma":"يُوزَعُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65614,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٨٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayawma naḥshuru min kulli ummatin fawjan mimman yukadhibu biāyātinā fahum yūzaʿūna', 'যেদিন আমি প্রত্যেকটি সম্প্রদায় হতে একটি দলকে সমবেত করব যারা আমার নিদর্শনাবলীকে অস্বীকার করেছিল, অতঃপর তাদেরকে সারিবদ্ধ করা হবে।', 'And [warn of] the Day when We will gather from every nation a company of those who deny Our signs, and they will be [driven] in rows', 'যেদিন আমি প্রত্যেকটি সম্প্রদায় হতে একটি দলকে সমবেত করব যারা আমার নিদর্শনাবলীকে অস্বীকার করেছিল, অতঃপর তাদেরকে সারিবদ্ধ করা হবে।', 'And [warn of] the Day when We will gather from every nation a company of those who deny Our signs, and they will be [driven] in rows', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027083.mp3', now()),
  (27, 84, '', '[{"id":65833,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"শেষ পর্যন্ত","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":65834,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":65835,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَآءُو","transliteration":"jāū","translation_bn":"তারা এসে যাবে (সব দল)","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65836,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(আল্লাহ) বলবেন","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65837,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَكَذَّبْتُم","transliteration":"akadhabtum","translation_bn":"\"কি প্রত্যাখ্যান করেছিলে তোমরা","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":65838,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِى","transliteration":"biāyātī","translation_bn":"প্রতি নিদর্শনগুলোর আমাদের","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65839,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمْ","transliteration":"walam","translation_bn":"অথচ নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":65840,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تُحِيطُوا۟","transliteration":"tuḥīṭū","translation_bn":"আয়ত্বে নিতে পারো","root":"حوط","lemma":"أَحَاطَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65841,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে সেগুলো","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65842,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمًا","transliteration":"ʿil''man","translation_bn":"কোনো জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65843,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَمَّاذَا","transliteration":"ammādhā","translation_bn":"কি (তবে) আর","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65844,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65845,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা করো\"","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65846,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٨٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ḥattā idhā jāū qāla akadhabtum biāyātī walam tuḥīṭū bihā ʿil''man ammādhā kuntum taʿmalūna', 'যখন তারা এসে যাবে তখন আল্লাহ বলবেন- তোমরা কি আমার নিদর্শনকে মিথ্যে বলে প্রত্যাখ্যান করেছিলে যদিও তা তোমরা জ্ঞানায়ত্ত করতে পারনি; নাকি তোমরা অন্য কিছু করছিলে?', 'Until, when they arrive [at the place of Judgement], He will say, "Did you deny My signs while you encompassed them not in knowledge, or what [was it that] you were doing?"', 'যখন তারা এসে যাবে তখন আল্লাহ বলবেন- তোমরা কি আমার নিদর্শনকে মিথ্যে বলে প্রত্যাখ্যান করেছিলে যদিও তা তোমরা জ্ঞানায়ত্ত করতে পারনি; নাকি তোমরা অন্য কিছু করছিলে?', 'Until, when they arrive [at the place of Judgement], He will say, "Did you deny My signs while you encompassed them not in knowledge, or what [was it that] you were doing?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027084.mp3', now()),
  (27, 85, '', '[{"id":66230,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَوَقَعَ","transliteration":"wawaqaʿa","translation_bn":"আর এসে পড়বে","root":"وقع","lemma":"وَقَعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66231,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْلُ","transliteration":"l-qawlu","translation_bn":"(ঘোষিত শাস্তির) কথা","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66232,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِم","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66233,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66234,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَمُوا۟","transliteration":"ẓalamū","translation_bn":"তারা সীমালঙ্ঘন করেছিলো","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66235,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَهُمْ","transliteration":"fahum","translation_bn":"তখন তারা","root":"—","lemma":"فَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66236,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":66237,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَنطِقُونَ","transliteration":"yanṭiqūna","translation_bn":"কথা বলতে পারবে","root":"نطق","lemma":"يَنطِقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66238,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٨٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wawaqaʿa l-qawlu ʿalayhim bimā ẓalamū fahum lā yanṭiqūna', 'তাদেরকে দেয়া প্রতিশ্রুতি বাস্তবে ঘটে যাবে তাদের অন্যায় কার্যকলাপের কারণে আর তারা (তাদের পক্ষে) কোন কথা বলতে পারবে না।', 'And the decree will befall them for the wrong they did, and they will not [be able to] speak.', 'তাদেরকে দেয়া প্রতিশ্রুতি বাস্তবে ঘটে যাবে তাদের অন্যায় কার্যকলাপের কারণে আর তারা (তাদের পক্ষে) কোন কথা বলতে পারবে না।', 'And the decree will befall them for the wrong they did, and they will not [be able to] speak.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027085.mp3', now()),
  (27, 86, '', '[{"id":66664,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"কি নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":66665,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَرَوْا۟","transliteration":"yaraw","translation_bn":"তারা দেখে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66666,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّا","transliteration":"annā","translation_bn":"যে আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":66667,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلْنَا","transliteration":"jaʿalnā","translation_bn":"(আমরা) বানিয়েছি","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66668,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلَ","transliteration":"al-layla","translation_bn":"রাতকে","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66669,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِيَسْكُنُوا۟","transliteration":"liyaskunū","translation_bn":"যেন তারা প্রশান্তি লাভ করে","root":"سكن","lemma":"سَكَنَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66670,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66671,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلنَّهَارَ","transliteration":"wal-nahāra","translation_bn":"আর দিনকে (করেছি)","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66672,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مُبْصِرًا ۚ","transliteration":"mub''ṣiran","translation_bn":"দৃশ্যমান","root":"بصر","lemma":"مُبْصِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66674,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":66675,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66676,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":66677,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَـَٔايَـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"laāyātin","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই নিদর্শনাবলী","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":66678,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"liqawmin","translation_bn":"জন্যে সম্প্রদায় (যারা)","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66679,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66680,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٨٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alam yaraw annā jaʿalnā al-layla liyaskunū fīhi wal-nahāra mub''ṣiran inna fī dhālika laāyātin liqawmin yu''minūna', 'তারা কি লক্ষ্য করে না যে, আমি রাত বানিয়েছি যাতে তারা তাতে আরাম করতে পারে আর দিনকে করেছি আলো দানকারী? বিশ্বাসী সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য অবশ্যই এতে নিদর্শন আছে।', 'Do they not see that We made the night that they may rest therein and the day giving sight? Indeed in that are signs for a people who believe.', 'তারা কি লক্ষ্য করে না যে, আমি রাত বানিয়েছি যাতে তারা তাতে আরাম করতে পারে আর দিনকে করেছি আলো দানকারী? বিশ্বাসী সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য অবশ্যই এতে নিদর্শন আছে।', 'Do they not see that We made the night that they may rest therein and the day giving sight? Indeed in that are signs for a people who believe.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027086.mp3', now()),
  (27, 87, '', '[{"id":66940,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"এবং সেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66941,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُنفَخُ","transliteration":"yunfakhu","translation_bn":"ফুঁ দেওয়া হবে","root":"نفخ","lemma":"نَفَخَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66942,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66943,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصُّورِ","transliteration":"l-ṣūri","translation_bn":"শিঙ্গার","root":"صور","lemma":"صُّور","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66944,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَفَزِعَ","transliteration":"fafaziʿa","translation_bn":"অতঃপর হবে ভীত-কম্পিত","root":"فزع","lemma":"فَزِعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66945,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":66946,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66947,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশমন্ডলীতে","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66948,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"আর যারা (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66949,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66950,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66951,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":66952,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"(তারা) যাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":66953,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"شَآءَ","transliteration":"shāa","translation_bn":"চাইবেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66954,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":66956,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَكُلٌّ","transliteration":"wakullun","translation_bn":"এবং সবাই","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66957,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَتَوْهُ","transliteration":"atawhu","translation_bn":"তাঁর (কাছে) আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66958,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"دَٰخِرِينَ","transliteration":"dākhirīna","translation_bn":"হীন অবস্থায়","root":"دخر","lemma":"دَٰخِرُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66959,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٨٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayawma yunfakhu fī l-ṣūri fafaziʿa man fī l-samāwāti waman fī l-arḍi illā man shāa l-lahu wakullun atawhu dākhirīna', 'আর যে দিন শিঙ্গায় ফুঁ দেয়া হবে সেদিন যারা আকাশে আছে আর যারা যমীনে আছে তারা ভীত-সন্ত্রস্ত হয়ে পড়বে, তবে আল্লাহ যাদের জন্য ইচ্ছে করবেন তারা বাদে। সবাই তাঁর কাছে আসবে বিনয়ে অবনত হয়ে।', 'And [warn of] the Day the Horn will be blown, and whoever is in the heavens and whoever is on the earth will be terrified except whom Allah wills. And all will come to Him humbled.', 'আর যে দিন শিঙ্গায় ফুঁ দেয়া হবে সেদিন যারা আকাশে আছে আর যারা যমীনে আছে তারা ভীত-সন্ত্রস্ত হয়ে পড়বে, তবে আল্লাহ যাদের জন্য ইচ্ছে করবেন তারা বাদে। সবাই তাঁর কাছে আসবে বিনয়ে অবনত হয়ে।', 'And [warn of] the Day the Horn will be blown, and whoever is in the heavens and whoever is on the earth will be terrified except whom Allah wills. And all will come to Him humbled.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027087.mp3', now()),
  (27, 88, '', '[{"id":67320,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَتَرَى","transliteration":"watarā","translation_bn":"এবং তুমি দেখছো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67321,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجِبَالَ","transliteration":"l-jibāla","translation_bn":"পর্বতমালাকে","root":"جبل","lemma":"جَبَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67322,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَحْسَبُهَا","transliteration":"taḥsabuhā","translation_bn":"মনে করছো তাদেরকে","root":"حسب","lemma":"حَسِبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67323,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"جَامِدَةًۭ","transliteration":"jāmidatan","translation_bn":"অচল","root":"جمد","lemma":"جَامِدَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67324,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَهِىَ","transliteration":"wahiya","translation_bn":"অথচ তা (সেদিন)","root":"—","lemma":"وَهِىَ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":67325,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَمُرُّ","transliteration":"tamurru","translation_bn":"চলবে","root":"مرر","lemma":"مَرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67326,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَرَّ","transliteration":"marra","translation_bn":"চলন (মতো)","root":"مرر","lemma":"مَرّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67327,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّحَابِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-saḥābi","translation_bn":"মেঘমালার","root":"سحب","lemma":"سَحَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67329,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"صُنْعَ","transliteration":"ṣun''ʿa","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি-নৈপুণ্য","root":"صنع","lemma":"صُنْع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67330,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":67331,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":67332,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَتْقَنَ","transliteration":"atqana","translation_bn":"সুষম করেছেন","root":"تقن","lemma":"أَتْقَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67333,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كُلَّ","transliteration":"kulla","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67334,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍ ۚ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"জিনিসকে","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67336,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":67337,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"خَبِيرٌۢ","transliteration":"khabīrun","translation_bn":"খুব অবহিত","root":"خبر","lemma":"خَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67338,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয় সম্পর্কে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67339,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"تَفْعَلُونَ","transliteration":"tafʿalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা করছো","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67340,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٨٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'watarā l-jibāla taḥsabuhā jāmidatan wahiya tamurru marra l-saḥābi ṣun''ʿa l-lahi alladhī atqana kulla shayin innahu khabīrun bimā tafʿalūna', 'তুমি পর্বতগুলোকে দেখ আর মনে কর তা অচল, কিন্তু সেগুলো চলমান হবে যেমন মেঘমালা চলে। এটা আল্লাহর সৃষ্টি নৈপুণ্য, যিনি সব কিছুকে করেছেন যথাযথ। তোমরা যা কিছু কর সে সম্পর্কে তিনি সম্পূর্ণরূপে অবগত।', 'And you see the mountains, thinking them rigid, while they will pass as the passing of clouds. [It is] the work of Allah, who perfected all things. Indeed, He is Acquainted with that which you do.', 'তুমি পর্বতগুলোকে দেখ আর মনে কর তা অচল, কিন্তু সেগুলো চলমান হবে যেমন মেঘমালা চলে। এটা আল্লাহর সৃষ্টি নৈপুণ্য, যিনি সব কিছুকে করেছেন যথাযথ। তোমরা যা কিছু কর সে সম্পর্কে তিনি সম্পূর্ণরূপে অবগত।', 'And you see the mountains, thinking them rigid, while they will pass as the passing of clouds. [It is] the work of Allah, who perfected all things. Indeed, He is Acquainted with that which you do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027088.mp3', now()),
  (27, 89, '', '[{"id":67499,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":67500,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"আসবে (সেদিন)","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67501,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْحَسَنَةِ","transliteration":"bil-ḥasanati","translation_bn":"নিয়ে সৎ-কর্ম","root":"حسن","lemma":"حَسَنَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67502,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَلَهُۥ","transliteration":"falahu","translation_bn":"তখন তার জন্যে (থাকবে)","root":"—","lemma":"فَلَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67503,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67504,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهَا","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"তার চেয়েও","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67505,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَهُم","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"আর তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67506,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67507,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَزَعٍۢ","transliteration":"fazaʿin","translation_bn":"শঙ্কা","root":"فزع","lemma":"فَزَع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67508,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","transliteration":"yawma-idhin","translation_bn":"সেদিন","root":"—","lemma":"يَوْمَئِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":67509,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ءَامِنُونَ","transliteration":"āminūna","translation_bn":"নিরাপদ থাকবে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامِنِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67510,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٨٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'man jāa bil-ḥasanati falahu khayrun min''hā wahum min fazaʿin yawma-idhin āminūna', 'যারা সৎকাজ নিয়ে উপস্থিত হবে, তাদের জন্য আছে উৎকৃষ্টতর প্রতিদান, সেদিন তারা ভীতি শঙ্কা থেকে নিরাপদ থাকবে।', 'Whoever comes [at Judgement] with a good deed will have better than it, and they, from the terror of that Day, will be safe.', 'যারা সৎকাজ নিয়ে উপস্থিত হবে, তাদের জন্য আছে উৎকৃষ্টতর প্রতিদান, সেদিন তারা ভীতি শঙ্কা থেকে নিরাপদ থাকবে।', 'Whoever comes [at Judgement] with a good deed will have better than it, and they, from the terror of that Day, will be safe.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027089.mp3', now()),
  (27, 90, '', '[{"id":68097,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68098,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"আসবে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68099,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلسَّيِّئَةِ","transliteration":"bil-sayi-ati","translation_bn":"নিয়ে অসৎকর্ম","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَيِّئَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68100,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَكُبَّتْ","transliteration":"fakubbat","translation_bn":"তখন নিক্ষেপ করা হবে","root":"كبب","lemma":"كُبَّتْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68101,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وُجُوهُهُمْ","transliteration":"wujūhuhum","translation_bn":"মুখ তাদের (উল্টোভাবে)","root":"وجه","lemma":"وَجْه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68102,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68103,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"আগুনের","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68104,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"\"(তাদের বলা হবে) কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":68105,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تُجْزَوْنَ","transliteration":"tuj''zawna","translation_bn":"প্রতিফল দেয়া হয়েছে তোমাদেরকে","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68106,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":68107,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":68108,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68109,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কাজ করতে\"","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68110,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٩٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯০)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waman jāa bil-sayi-ati fakubbat wujūhuhum fī l-nāri hal tuj''zawna illā mā kuntum taʿmalūna', 'যারা অসৎকর্ম নিয়ে হাজির হবে, তাদেরকে মুখের ভরে আগুনে নিক্ষেপ করা হবে, (আর তাদেরকে বলা হবে) তোমরা যা করতে কেবল তারই প্রতিদান তোমাদেরকে দেয়া হচ্ছে।', 'And whoever comes with an evil deed - their faces will be overturned into the Fire, [and it will be said], "Are you recompensed except for what you used to do?"', 'যারা অসৎকর্ম নিয়ে হাজির হবে, তাদেরকে মুখের ভরে আগুনে নিক্ষেপ করা হবে, (আর তাদেরকে বলা হবে) তোমরা যা করতে কেবল তারই প্রতিদান তোমাদেরকে দেয়া হচ্ছে।', 'And whoever comes with an evil deed - their faces will be overturned into the Fire, [and it will be said], "Are you recompensed except for what you used to do?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027090.mp3', now()),
  (27, 91, '', '[{"id":68527,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَآ","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"\"মূলত","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":68528,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أُمِرْتُ","transliteration":"umir''tu","translation_bn":"আমি আদিষ্ট হয়েছি","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68529,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যেন","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":68530,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَعْبُدَ","transliteration":"aʿbuda","translation_bn":"ইবাদত করি আমি","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68531,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّ","transliteration":"rabba","translation_bn":"রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68532,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذِهِ","transliteration":"hādhihi","translation_bn":"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":68533,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَلْدَةِ","transliteration":"l-baldati","translation_bn":"শহরের (অর্থাৎ মাক্কার)","root":"بلد","lemma":"بَلْدَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68534,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":68535,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"حَرَّمَهَا","transliteration":"ḥarramahā","translation_bn":"সম্মানিত করেছেন তা","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68536,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهُۥ","transliteration":"walahu","translation_bn":"এবং জন্যে  তাঁরই (মালিকানায়)","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68537,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كُلُّ","transliteration":"kullu","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68538,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ ۖ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"বস্তু","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68540,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَأُمِرْتُ","transliteration":"wa-umir''tu","translation_bn":"এবং আমি আদিষ্ট হয়েছি","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68541,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যেন","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":68542,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَكُونَ","transliteration":"akūna","translation_bn":"আমি হই","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68543,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68544,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-mus''limīna","translation_bn":"আত্মসমর্পণকারীদের","root":"سلم","lemma":"مُسْلِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68545,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٩١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯১)","root":"—","lemma":"٩١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innamā umir''tu an aʿbuda rabba hādhihi l-baldati alladhī ḥarramahā walahu kullu shayin wa-umir''tu an akūna mina l-mus''limīna', 'আমি নির্দেশিত হয়েছি এই (মক্কা) নগরীর প্রতিপালকের ‘ইবাদাত করার জন্য যিনি তাকে (অর্থাৎ এই নগরীকে) সম্মানিত করেছেন। সকল বস্তু তাঁরই, আর আমি আদিষ্ট হয়েছি আমি যেন (আল্লাহর নিকট) আত্মসমর্পণকারীদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত হই।', '[Say, O Muhammad], "I have only been commanded to worship the Lord of this city, who made it sacred and to whom [belongs] all things. And I am commanded to be of the Muslims [those who submit to Allah]', 'আমি নির্দেশিত হয়েছি এই (মক্কা) নগরীর প্রতিপালকের ‘ইবাদাত করার জন্য যিনি তাকে (অর্থাৎ এই নগরীকে) সম্মানিত করেছেন। সকল বস্তু তাঁরই, আর আমি আদিষ্ট হয়েছি আমি যেন (আল্লাহর নিকট) আত্মসমর্পণকারীদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত হই।', '[Say, O Muhammad], "I have only been commanded to worship the Lord of this city, who made it sacred and to whom [belongs] all things. And I am commanded to be of the Muslims [those who submit to Allah]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027091.mp3', now()),
  (27, 92, '', '[{"id":68794,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنْ","transliteration":"wa-an","translation_bn":"(এও)এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68795,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَتْلُوَا۟","transliteration":"atluwā","translation_bn":"আমি তিলাওয়াত করবো","root":"تلو","lemma":"تَلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68796,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرْءَانَ ۖ","transliteration":"l-qur''āna","translation_bn":"কুরআন\"","root":"قرا","lemma":"قُرْءَان","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68798,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَمَنِ","transliteration":"famani","translation_bn":"অতএব যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68799,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱهْتَدَىٰ","transliteration":"ih''tadā","translation_bn":"সৎপথ অবলম্বন করবে","root":"هدي","lemma":"ٱهْتَدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68800,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّمَا","transliteration":"fa-innamā","translation_bn":"শুধুমাত্র","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68801,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَهْتَدِى","transliteration":"yahtadī","translation_bn":"সে সৎপথ অবলম্বন করবে","root":"هدي","lemma":"ٱهْتَدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68802,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لِنَفْسِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"linafsihi","translation_bn":"জন্যে নিজের তার","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68804,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"আর যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68805,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ضَلَّ","transliteration":"ḍalla","translation_bn":"ভ্রান্তপথ অবলম্বন করবে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68806,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَقُلْ","transliteration":"faqul","translation_bn":"অতঃপর বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68807,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَآ","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"\"শুধুমাত্র","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":68808,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَنَا۠","transliteration":"anā","translation_bn":"আমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":68809,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68810,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُنذِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-mundhirīna","translation_bn":"সতর্ককারীদের\"","root":"نذر","lemma":"مُنذِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68811,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٩٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯২)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-an atluwā l-qur''āna famani ih''tadā fa-innamā yahtadī linafsihi waman ḍalla faqul innamā anā mina l-mundhirīna', 'আর আমি যেন কুরআন তিলাওয়াত করি। অতঃপর যে সঠিক পথে চলবে, সে নিজের কল্যাণেই সঠিক পথে চলবে। আর কেউ গুমরাহ্ হলে তুমি বল, আমি তো সতর্ককারীদের একজন।', 'And to recite the Qur''an." And whoever is guided is only guided for [the benefit of] himself; and whoever strays - say, "I am only [one] of the warners."', 'আর আমি যেন কুরআন তিলাওয়াত করি। অতঃপর যে সঠিক পথে চলবে, সে নিজের কল্যাণেই সঠিক পথে চলবে। আর কেউ গুমরাহ্ হলে তুমি বল, আমি তো সতর্ককারীদের একজন।', 'And to recite the Qur''an." And whoever is guided is only guided for [the benefit of] himself; and whoever strays - say, "I am only [one] of the warners."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027092.mp3', now()),
  (27, 93, '', '[{"id":68960,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقُلِ","transliteration":"waquli","translation_bn":"এবং বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68961,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَمْدُ","transliteration":"l-ḥamdu","translation_bn":"\"সব প্রশংসা","root":"حمد","lemma":"حَمْد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68962,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহরই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68963,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"سَيُرِيكُمْ","transliteration":"sayurīkum","translation_bn":"শীঘ্রই তিনি দেখাবেন তোমাদেরকে","root":"راي","lemma":"أَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":68964,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ","transliteration":"āyātihi","translation_bn":"নিদের্শনাবলী তাঁর","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68965,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَتَعْرِفُونَهَا ۚ","transliteration":"fataʿrifūnahā","translation_bn":"তখন তোমরা চিনে নিবে সব তা","root":"عرف","lemma":"عَرَفَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68967,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর নন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68968,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكَ","transliteration":"rabbuka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68969,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِغَـٰفِلٍ","transliteration":"bighāfilin","translation_bn":"অমনোযোগী","root":"غفل","lemma":"غَٰفِل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68970,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَمَّا","transliteration":"ʿammā","translation_bn":"সে সম্পর্কে যা","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68971,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কাজ করছো\"","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68972,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٩٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waquli l-ḥamdu lillahi sayurīkum āyātihi fataʿrifūnahā wamā rabbuka bighāfilin ʿammā taʿmalūna', 'আর বল, যাবতীয় প্রশংসা আল্লাহরই। তিনি শীঘ্রই তোমাদেরকে তাঁর নিদর্শনগুলো দেখাবেন আর তা তোমরা চিনতে পারবে। তোমরা যা কর সে সম্পর্কে তোমার পালনকর্তা অমনোযোগী নন।', 'And say, "[All] praise is [due] to Allah. He will show you His signs, and you will recognize them. And your Lord is not unaware of what you do."', 'আর বল, যাবতীয় প্রশংসা আল্লাহরই। তিনি শীঘ্রই তোমাদেরকে তাঁর নিদর্শনগুলো দেখাবেন আর তা তোমরা চিনতে পারবে। তোমরা যা কর সে সম্পর্কে তোমার পালনকর্তা অমনোযোগী নন।', 'And say, "[All] praise is [due] to Allah. He will show you His signs, and you will recognize them. And your Lord is not unaware of what you do."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/027093.mp3', now())
