هُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20876,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰٓ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসা","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":20877,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكَ","transliteration":"innaka","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":20878,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَغَوِىٌّۭ","transliteration":"laghawiyyun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই বিভ্রান্ত","root":"غوي","lemma":"غَوِىّ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":20879,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٌۭ","transliteration":"mubīnun","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট\"","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20880,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-aṣbaḥa fī l-madīnati khāifan yataraqqabu fa-idhā alladhī is''tanṣarahu bil-amsi yastaṣrikhuhu qāla lahu mūsā innaka laghawiyyun mubīnun', 'শহরে তার সকাল হল ভীত-সন্ত্রস্ত অবস্থায়। হঠাৎ সে শুনল যে লোকটি গতকাল তার কাছে সাহায্য চেয়েছিল (আবার) সে সাহায্যের জন্য চীৎকার করছে। মূসা তাকে বলল- ‘তুমি প্রকাশ্যই একজন বেওকুফ লোক।', 'And he became inside the city fearful and anticipating [exposure], when suddenly the one who sought his help the previous day cried out to him [once again]. Moses said to him, "Indeed, you are an evident, [persistent] deviator."', 'শহরে তার সকাল হল ভীত-সন্ত্রস্ত অবস্থায়। হঠাৎ সে শুনল যে লোকটি গতকাল তার কাছে সাহায্য চেয়েছিল (আবার) সে সাহায্যের জন্য চীৎকার করছে। মূসা তাকে বলল- ‘তুমি প্রকাশ্যই একজন বেওকুফ লোক।', 'And he became inside the city fearful and anticipating [exposure], when suddenly the one who sought his help the previous day cried out to him [once again]. Moses said to him, "Indeed, you are an evident, [persistent] deviator."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028018.mp3', now()),
  (28, 19, '', '[{"id":21914,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّآ","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":21915,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":21916,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَرَادَ","transliteration":"arāda","translation_bn":"সে ইচ্ছে করলো","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21917,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":21918,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَبْطِشَ","transliteration":"yabṭisha","translation_bn":"সে ধরবে","root":"بطش","lemma":"بَطَشْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21919,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"bi-alladhī","translation_bn":"তাকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":21920,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"যে (ছিলো)","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":21921,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَدُوٌّۭ","transliteration":"ʿaduwwun","translation_bn":"শত্রু","root":"عدو","lemma":"عَدُوّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":21922,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُمَا","transliteration":"lahumā","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের উভয়ের","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُمَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":21923,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(ইসরাঈলী) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21924,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰمُوسَىٰٓ","transliteration":"yāmūsā","translation_bn":"\"হে মূসা","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":21925,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَتُرِيدُ","transliteration":"aturīdu","translation_bn":"কি ততুমি চাচ্ছো","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":21926,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":21927,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"تَقْتُلَنِى","transliteration":"taqtulanī","translation_bn":"তুমি হত্যা করবে আমাকে","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21928,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كَمَا","transliteration":"kamā","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":21929,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"قَتَلْتَ","transliteration":"qatalta","translation_bn":"হত্যা করেছো তুমি","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21930,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسًۢا","transliteration":"nafsan","translation_bn":"এক ব্যক্তিকে","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":21931,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْأَمْسِ ۖ","transliteration":"bil-amsi","translation_bn":"গতকাল","root":"—","lemma":"أَمْس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":21933,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":21934,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"تُرِيدُ","transliteration":"turīdu","translation_bn":"তুমি চাচ্ছো","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21935,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّآ","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":21936,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":21937,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"تَكُونَ","transliteration":"takūna","translation_bn":"তুমি হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21938,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"جَبَّارًۭا","transliteration":"jabbāran","translation_bn":"স্বেচ্ছাচারী","root":"جبر","lemma":"جَبَّار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":21939,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":21940,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"এদেশের","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":21941,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":21942,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"تُرِيدُ","transliteration":"turīdu","translation_bn":"তুমি চাও","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21943,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":21944,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"تَكُونَ","transliteration":"takūna","translation_bn":"তুমি হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21945,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":21946,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُصْلِحِينَ","transliteration":"l-muṣ''liḥīna","translation_bn":"সংশোধনকারীদের\"","root":"صلح","lemma":"مُصْلِح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":21947,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"١٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā an arāda an yabṭisha bi-alladhī huwa ʿaduwwun lahumā qāla yāmūsā aturīdu an taqtulanī kamā qatalta nafsan bil-amsi in turīdu illā an takūna jabbāran fī l-arḍi wamā turīdu an takūna mina l-muṣ''liḥīna', 'অতঃপর মূসা যখন উভয়ের শত্রুকে ধরতে উদ্যত হল, তখন সে বলল- ‘ওহে মূসা! তুমি কি আমাকে হত্যা করতে চাও যেভাবে গতকাল একটা লোককে হত্যা করেছ, তুমি তো পৃথিবীতে স্বেচ্ছাচারী হতে চাচ্ছ, সংশোধনকারীদের মধ্যে গণ্য হতে চাচ্ছ না।’', 'And when he wanted to strike the one who was an enemy to both of them, he said, "O Moses, do you intend to kill me as you killed someone yesterday? You only want to be a tyrant in the land and do not want to be of the amenders."', 'অতঃপর মূসা যখন উভয়ের শত্রুকে ধরতে উদ্যত হল, তখন সে বলল- ‘ওহে মূসা! তুমি কি আমাকে হত্যা করতে চাও যেভাবে গতকাল একটা লোককে হত্যা করেছ, তুমি তো পৃথিবীতে স্বেচ্ছাচারী হতে চাচ্ছ, সংশোধনকারীদের মধ্যে গণ্য হতে চাচ্ছ না।’', 'And when he wanted to strike the one who was an enemy to both of them, he said, "O Moses, do you intend to kill me as you killed someone yesterday? You only want to be a tyrant in the land and do not want to be of the amenders."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028019.mp3', now()),
  (28, 20, '', '[{"id":23017,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَجَآءَ","transliteration":"wajāa","translation_bn":"এবং (এরপর) আসলো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23018,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَجُلٌۭ","transliteration":"rajulun","translation_bn":"এক ব্যক্তি","root":"رجل","lemma":"رَجُل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23019,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23020,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَقْصَا","transliteration":"aqṣā","translation_bn":"দূর প্রান্ত","root":"قصو","lemma":"أَقْصَا","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23021,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَدِينَةِ","transliteration":"l-madīnati","translation_bn":"শহরের","root":"مدن","lemma":"مَدِينَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":23022,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَسْعَىٰ","transliteration":"yasʿā","translation_bn":"দৌঁড়িয়ে","root":"سعي","lemma":"سَعَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23023,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23024,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰمُوسَىٰٓ","transliteration":"yāmūsā","translation_bn":"\"হে মূসা","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":23025,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":23026,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَلَأَ","transliteration":"l-mala-a","translation_bn":"সভাষদবর্গ","root":"ملا","lemma":"مَلَأ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":23027,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتَمِرُونَ","transliteration":"yatamirūna","translation_bn":"পরামর্শ করেছে","root":"امر","lemma":"يَأْتَمِرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23028,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِكَ","transliteration":"bika","translation_bn":"নিয়ে তোমার","root":"—","lemma":"بِكَ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23029,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لِيَقْتُلُوكَ","transliteration":"liyaqtulūka","translation_bn":"যাতে তারা তোমাকে হত্যা করে","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":23030,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فَٱخْرُجْ","transliteration":"fa-ukh''ruj","translation_bn":"সুতরাং বের হয়ে যাও","root":"خرج","lemma":"خَرَجَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":23031,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّى","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":23032,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَكَ","transliteration":"laka","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে তোমার","root":"—","lemma":"لَكَ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23033,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23034,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّـٰصِحِينَ","transliteration":"l-nāṣiḥīna","translation_bn":"মঙ্গলকামীদের\"","root":"نصح","lemma":"نَاصِح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":23035,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٢٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২০)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wajāa rajulun min aqṣā l-madīnati yasʿā qāla yāmūsā inna l-mala-a yatamirūna bika liyaqtulūka fa-ukh''ruj innī laka mina l-nāṣiḥīna', 'নগরের প্রান্ত হতে এক লোক ছুটে আসল। সে বলল- ‘হে মূসা! পারিষদগণ তোমাকে হত্যার পরামর্শ করছে, কাজেই তুমি বাইরে চলে যাও, আমি তোমার হিতাকাঙ্ক্ষী।', 'And a man came from the farthest end of the city, running. He said, "O Moses, indeed the eminent ones are conferring over you [intending] to kill you, so leave [the city]; indeed, I am to you of the sincere advisors."', 'নগরের প্রান্ত হতে এক লোক ছুটে আসল। সে বলল- ‘হে মূসা! পারিষদগণ তোমাকে হত্যার পরামর্শ করছে, কাজেই তুমি বাইরে চলে যাও, আমি তোমার হিতাকাঙ্ক্ষী।', 'And a man came from the farthest end of the city, running. He said, "O Moses, indeed the eminent ones are conferring over you [intending] to kill you, so leave [the city]; indeed, I am to you of the sincere advisors."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028020.mp3', now()),
  (28, 21, '', '[{"id":24035,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَخَرَجَ","transliteration":"fakharaja","translation_bn":"তখন সে বের হলো","root":"خرج","lemma":"خَرَجَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24036,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهَا","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"সেখান হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24037,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"خَآئِفًۭا","transliteration":"khāifan","translation_bn":"ভীত অবস্থায়","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَا^ئِف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":24038,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَتَرَقَّبُ ۖ","transliteration":"yataraqqabu","translation_bn":"সতর্ক হয়ে","root":"رقب","lemma":"يَتَرَقَّبُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24040,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(মূসা) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24041,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّ","transliteration":"rabbi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":24042,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نَجِّنِى","transliteration":"najjinī","translation_bn":"আমাকে উদ্ধার করো","root":"نجو","lemma":"نَجَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24043,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24044,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمِ","transliteration":"l-qawmi","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24045,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী\"","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24046,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٢١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২১)","root":"—","lemma":"٢١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fakharaja min''hā khāifan yataraqqabu qāla rabbi najjinī mina l-qawmi l-ẓālimīna', 'তখন মূসা ভীত-সন্ত্রস্ত অবস্থায় সেখান থেকে বেরিয়ে পড়ল সতর্কতার সঙ্গে। সে বলল, ‘হে আমার প্রতিপালক! তুমি আমাকে যালিম গোষ্ঠী হতে রক্ষা কর।’', 'So he left it, fearful and anticipating [apprehension]. He said, "My Lord, save me from the wrongdoing people."', 'তখন মূসা ভীত-সন্ত্রস্ত অবস্থায় সেখান থেকে বেরিয়ে পড়ল সতর্কতার সঙ্গে। সে বলল, ‘হে আমার প্রতিপালক! তুমি আমাকে যালিম গোষ্ঠী হতে রক্ষা কর।’', 'So he left it, fearful and anticipating [apprehension]. He said, "My Lord, save me from the wrongdoing people."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028021.mp3', now()),
  (28, 22, '', '[{"id":25059,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمَّا","transliteration":"walammā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":25060,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَوَجَّهَ","transliteration":"tawajjaha","translation_bn":"মুখ ফেরালো (রওনা হলো)","root":"وجه","lemma":"تَوَجَّهَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25061,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تِلْقَآءَ","transliteration":"til''qāa","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"لقي","lemma":"تِلْقَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25062,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَدْيَنَ","transliteration":"madyana","translation_bn":"মাদইয়ানের","root":"—","lemma":"مَدْيَن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":25063,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25064,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَسَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿasā","translation_bn":"\"আশা করা যায়","root":"عسي","lemma":"عَسَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25065,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّىٓ","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25066,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":25067,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِيَنِى","transliteration":"yahdiyanī","translation_bn":"প্রদর্শন করবেন আমাকে","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25068,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"سَوَآءَ","transliteration":"sawāa","translation_bn":"সরল","root":"سوي","lemma":"سَوَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25069,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّبِيلِ","transliteration":"l-sabīli","translation_bn":"পথ\"","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":25070,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٢٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২২)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walammā tawajjaha til''qāa madyana qāla ʿasā rabbī an yahdiyanī sawāa l-sabīli', 'যখন সে মাদইয়ান অভিমুখী হল, সে বলল- ‘আশা করি আমার পালনকর্তা আমাকে সরল সোজা পথ দেখাবেন।’', 'And when he directed himself toward Madyan, he said, "Perhaps my Lord will guide me to the sound way."', 'যখন সে মাদইয়ান অভিমুখী হল, সে বলল- ‘আশা করি আমার পালনকর্তা আমাকে সরল সোজা পথ দেখাবেন।’', 'And when he directed himself toward Madyan, he said, "Perhaps my Lord will guide me to the sound way."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028022.mp3', now()),
  (28, 23, '', '[{"id":26145,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمَّا","transliteration":"walammā","translation_bn":"আর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":26146,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَرَدَ","transliteration":"warada","translation_bn":"পৌঁছলো","root":"ورد","lemma":"وَرَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26147,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَآءَ","transliteration":"māa","translation_bn":"পানির (কূপের নিকট)","root":"موه","lemma":"مَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26148,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَدْيَنَ","transliteration":"madyana","translation_bn":"মাদইয়ানের","root":"—","lemma":"مَدْيَن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":26149,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَجَدَ","transliteration":"wajada","translation_bn":"সে পেলো","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26150,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"কাছে তার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26151,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أُمَّةًۭ","transliteration":"ummatan","translation_bn":"একদল","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26152,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26153,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"লোকদের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26154,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَسْقُونَ","transliteration":"yasqūna","translation_bn":"পানি পান করাচ্ছে (নিজেদের জন্তুগুলোকে)","root":"سقي","lemma":"سَقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26155,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَوَجَدَ","transliteration":"wawajada","translation_bn":"এবং সে পেলো","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":26156,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"ছাড়াও","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26157,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"دُونِهِمُ","transliteration":"dūnihimu","translation_bn":"তাদের","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26158,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱمْرَأَتَيْنِ","transliteration":"im''ra-atayni","translation_bn":"দু''জন স্ত্রীলোককে","root":"مرا","lemma":"ٱمْرَأَت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26159,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تَذُودَانِ ۖ","transliteration":"tadhūdāni","translation_bn":"দু''জনে আগলে রেখেছে (তাদের জন্তুগুলোকে)","root":"ذود","lemma":"تَذُودَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26161,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(মূসা) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26162,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"\"কি","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":26163,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"خَطْبُكُمَا ۖ","transliteration":"khaṭbukumā","translation_bn":"ব্যাপার তোমাদের দু''জনের\"","root":"خطب","lemma":"خَطْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26165,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"قَالَتَا","transliteration":"qālatā","translation_bn":"দু''জনে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26166,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":26167,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"نَسْقِى","transliteration":"nasqī","translation_bn":"\"আমরা পানি পান করাই","root":"سقي","lemma":"سَقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26168,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"যতক্ষণ না","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26169,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"يُصْدِرَ","transliteration":"yuṣ''dira","translation_bn":"সরিয়ে নিয়ে যায়","root":"صدر","lemma":"يُصْدِرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26170,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرِّعَآءُ ۖ","transliteration":"l-riʿāu","translation_bn":"রাখালরা (তাদের জন্তুগুলো)","root":"رعي","lemma":"رِّعَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26172,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"وَأَبُونَا","transliteration":"wa-abūnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমাদের আব্বা","root":"ابو","lemma":"أَبٌ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":26173,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"شَيْخٌۭ","transliteration":"shaykhun","translation_bn":"বৃদ্ধ\"","root":"شيخ","lemma":"شَيْخ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":26174,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"كَبِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"kabīrun","translation_bn":"অতিশয় (তাই আমরা এসেছি)\"","root":"كبر","lemma":"كَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":26175,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٢٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walammā warada māa madyana wajada ʿalayhi ummatan mina l-nāsi yasqūna wawajada min dūnihimu im''ra-atayni tadhūdāni qāla mā khaṭbukumā qālatā lā nasqī ḥattā yuṣ''dira l-riʿāu wa-abūnā shaykhun kabīrun', 'যখন সে মাদইয়ানের কূপের কাছে পৌঁছল, সে একদল লোককে দেখল (তাদের জন্তুগুলোকে) পানি পান করাতে, তাদের ছাড়া আরো দু’জন স্ত্রীলোককে দেখল (নিজেদের পশুগুলোকে) আগলে রাখতে। মূসা জিজ্ঞেস করল- ‘তোমাদের দু’জনের ব্যাপার কী?’ তারা বলল- ‘আমরা আমাদের জন্তুগুলোকে পান করাতে পারি না যতক্ষণ না রাখালেরা (তাদের পশুগুলোকে) সরিয়ে না নেয় (পানি পান করানোর পর), আর আমাদের পিতা খুবই বয়োবৃদ্ধ।', 'And when he came to the well of Madyan, he found there a crowd of people watering [their flocks], and he found aside from them two women driving back [their flocks]. He said, "What is your circumstance?" They said, "We do not water until the shepherds dispatch [their flocks]; and our father is an old man."', 'যখন সে মাদইয়ানের কূপের কাছে পৌঁছল, সে একদল লোককে দেখল (তাদের জন্তুগুলোকে) পানি পান করাতে, তাদের ছাড়া আরো দু’জন স্ত্রীলোককে দেখল (নিজেদের পশুগুলোকে) আগলে রাখতে। মূসা জিজ্ঞেস করল- ‘তোমাদের দু’জনের ব্যাপার কী?’ তারা বলল- ‘আমরা আমাদের জন্তুগুলোকে পান করাতে পারি না যতক্ষণ না রাখালেরা (তাদের পশুগুলোকে) সরিয়ে না নেয় (পানি পান করানোর পর), আর আমাদের পিতা খুবই বয়োবৃদ্ধ।', 'And when he came to the well of Madyan, he found there a crowd of people watering [their flocks], and he found aside from them two women driving back [their flocks]. He said, "What is your circumstance?" They said, "We do not water until the shepherds dispatch [their flocks]; and our father is an old man."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028023.mp3', now()),
  (28, 24, '', '[{"id":27196,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَسَقَىٰ","transliteration":"fasaqā","translation_bn":"তখন সে পানি পান করালো","root":"سقي","lemma":"سَقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":27197,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمَا","transliteration":"lahumā","translation_bn":"পক্ষে তাদের দু''জনের (জন্তুগুলোকে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27198,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":27199,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَوَلَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"tawallā","translation_bn":"ফিরে গেলো","root":"ولي","lemma":"تَوَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27200,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27201,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظِّلِّ","transliteration":"l-ẓili","translation_bn":"ছায়ার","root":"ظلل","lemma":"ظِلّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":27202,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَقَالَ","transliteration":"faqāla","translation_bn":"অতঃপর বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":27203,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّ","transliteration":"rabbi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27204,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّى","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":27205,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِمَآ","transliteration":"limā","translation_bn":"তার প্রতি যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27206,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلْتَ","transliteration":"anzalta","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করবে তুমি","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27207,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىَّ","transliteration":"ilayya","translation_bn":"প্রতি আমার","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27208,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27209,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٍۢ","transliteration":"khayrin","translation_bn":"কল্যাণ","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27210,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَقِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"faqīrun","translation_bn":"(আমি তারই)মুখাপেক্ষী\"","root":"فقر","lemma":"فَقِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":27211,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٢٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fasaqā lahumā thumma tawallā ilā l-ẓili faqāla rabbi innī limā anzalta ilayya min khayrin faqīrun', 'তখন মূসা তাদের জন্য পশুগুলোকে পানি পান করিয়ে দিল, অতঃপর পেছন ফিরে ছায়ায় গিয়ে বসল, অতঃপর বলল- ‘হে আমার পালনকর্তা! তুমি আমার প্রতি যে অনুগ্রহই করবে আমি তো তারই ভিখারী।’', 'So he watered [their flocks] for them; then he went back to the shade and said, "My Lord, indeed I am, for whatever good You would send down to me, in need."', 'তখন মূসা তাদের জন্য পশুগুলোকে পানি পান করিয়ে দিল, অতঃপর পেছন ফিরে ছায়ায় গিয়ে বসল, অতঃপর বলল- ‘হে আমার পালনকর্তা! তুমি আমার প্রতি যে অনুগ্রহই করবে আমি তো তারই ভিখারী।’', 'So he watered [their flocks] for them; then he went back to the shade and said, "My Lord, indeed I am, for whatever good You would send down to me, in need."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028024.mp3', now()),
  (28, 25, '', '[{"id":28210,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَجَآءَتْهُ","transliteration":"fajāathu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর কাছে আসলো তার","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28211,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِحْدَىٰهُمَا","transliteration":"iḥ''dāhumā","translation_bn":"দু''জনের একজন তাদের","root":"احد","lemma":"إِحْدَى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28212,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَمْشِى","transliteration":"tamshī","translation_bn":"হেঁটে","root":"مشي","lemma":"مَّشَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28213,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28214,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتِحْيَآءٍۢ","transliteration":"is''tiḥ''yāin","translation_bn":"লজ্জা ও শালিনতার","root":"حيي","lemma":"ٱسْتِحْيَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28215,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَالَتْ","transliteration":"qālat","translation_bn":"(মেয়েটি) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28216,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":28217,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَبِى","transliteration":"abī","translation_bn":"আমার পিতা (শোয়াইব আঃ)","root":"ابو","lemma":"أَبٌ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28218,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَدْعُوكَ","transliteration":"yadʿūka","translation_bn":"আপনাকে ডাকছেন","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28219,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِيَجْزِيَكَ","transliteration":"liyajziyaka","translation_bn":"যাতে তিনি আপনাকে প্রতিদান দিতে পারেন","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28220,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرَ","transliteration":"ajra","translation_bn":"পারিশ্রমিক","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28221,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(তার) যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":28222,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"سَقَيْتَ","transliteration":"saqayta","translation_bn":"আপনি (জন্তুগুলোকে) পানি পান করিয়েছেন","root":"سقي","lemma":"سَقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28223,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَنَا ۚ","transliteration":"lanā","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হয়ে আমাদের\"","root":"—","lemma":"لَنَا ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28225,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28226,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَهُۥ","transliteration":"jāahu","translation_bn":"সে আসলো কাছে তার","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28227,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَقَصَّ","transliteration":"waqaṣṣa","translation_bn":"ও বর্ণনা করলো","root":"قصص","lemma":"قَصَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28228,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"কাছে তার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28229,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَصَصَ","transliteration":"l-qaṣaṣa","translation_bn":"সব বৃত্তান্ত","root":"قصص","lemma":"قَصَص","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28230,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28231,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":28232,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"تَخَفْ ۖ","transliteration":"takhaf","translation_bn":"ভয় করো","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28234,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"نَجَوْتَ","transliteration":"najawta","translation_bn":"তুমি বেঁচে গিয়েছো","root":"نجو","lemma":"نَجَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28235,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28236,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمِ","transliteration":"l-qawmi","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28237,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী\"","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28238,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"٢٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fajāathu iḥ''dāhumā tamshī ʿalā is''tiḥ''yāin qālat inna abī yadʿūka liyajziyaka ajra mā saqayta lanā falammā jāahu waqaṣṣa ʿalayhi l-qaṣaṣa qāla lā takhaf najawta mina l-qawmi l-ẓālimīna', 'তখন নারীদ্বয়ের একজন তার কাছে সলজ্জ পদে আসল। সে বলল- ‘আমার পিতা তোমাকে ডাকছে তুমি আমাদের জন্য (জন্তুগুলোকে) পানি পান করিয়েছ তোমাকে তার প্রতিদান দেয়ার জন্য। যখন মূসা তার কাছে গেল আর তার কাছে সকল ঘটনা বিবৃত করল, সে বলল- তুমি ভয় করো না, ‘তুমি যালিম গোষ্ঠীর থেকে রেহাই পেয়ে গেছ।’', 'Then one of the two women came to him walking with shyness. She said, "Indeed, my father invites you that he may reward you for having watered for us." So when he came to him and related to him the story, he said, "Fear not. You have escaped from the wrongdoing people."', 'তখন নারীদ্বয়ের একজন তার কাছে সলজ্জ পদে আসল। সে বলল- ‘আমার পিতা তোমাকে ডাকছে তুমি আমাদের জন্য (জন্তুগুলোকে) পানি পান করিয়েছ তোমাকে তার প্রতিদান দেয়ার জন্য। যখন মূসা তার কাছে গেল আর তার কাছে সকল ঘটনা বিবৃত করল, সে বলল- তুমি ভয় করো না, ‘তুমি যালিম গোষ্ঠীর থেকে রেহাই পেয়ে গেছ।’', 'Then one of the two women came to him walking with shyness. She said, "Indeed, my father invites you that he may reward you for having watered for us." So when he came to him and related to him the story, he said, "Fear not. You have escaped from the wrongdoing people."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028025.mp3', now()),
  (28, 26, '', '[{"id":29180,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَتْ","transliteration":"qālat","translation_bn":"বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29181,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِحْدَىٰهُمَا","transliteration":"iḥ''dāhumā","translation_bn":"একজন তাদের","root":"احد","lemma":"إِحْدَى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29182,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَبَتِ","transliteration":"yāabati","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার পিতা","root":"ابو","lemma":"أَبٌ","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":29183,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَـْٔجِرْهُ ۖ","transliteration":"is''tajir''hu","translation_bn":"তাকে মজুর নিযুক্ত করুন","root":"اجر","lemma":"ٱسْتَـ#ْجَرْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29185,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":29186,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرَ","transliteration":"khayra","translation_bn":"(সেই) উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29187,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَنِ","transliteration":"mani","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":29188,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَـْٔجَرْتَ","transliteration":"is''tajarta","translation_bn":"আপনি মজুর নিযুক্ত করবেন","root":"اجر","lemma":"ٱسْتَـ#ْجَرْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29189,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوِىُّ","transliteration":"l-qawiyu","translation_bn":"(যে) শক্তিশালী","root":"قوي","lemma":"قَوِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29190,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَمِينُ","transliteration":"l-amīnu","translation_bn":"বিশ্বস্ত\"","root":"امن","lemma":"أَمِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29191,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٢٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālat iḥ''dāhumā yāabati is''tajir''hu inna khayra mani is''tajarta l-qawiyu l-amīnu', 'স্ত্রীলোক দু’টির একজন বলল- ‘হে পিতা! পারিশ্রমিকের বিনিময়ে তাকে নিযুক্ত করুন, আপনি যাদেরকে মজুর নিযুক্ত করবেন তাদের মধ্যে উত্তম যে শক্তিশালী, বিশ্বস্ত।’', 'One of the women said, "O my father, hire him. Indeed, the best one you can hire is the strong and the trustworthy."', 'স্ত্রীলোক দু’টির একজন বলল- ‘হে পিতা! পারিশ্রমিকের বিনিময়ে তাকে নিযুক্ত করুন, আপনি যাদেরকে মজুর নিযুক্ত করবেন তাদের মধ্যে উত্তম যে শক্তিশালী, বিশ্বস্ত।’', 'One of the women said, "O my father, hire him. Indeed, the best one you can hire is the strong and the trustworthy."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028026.mp3', now()),
  (28, 27, '', '[{"id":30081,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30082,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":30083,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أُرِيدُ","transliteration":"urīdu","translation_bn":"চাই","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30084,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":30085,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أُنكِحَكَ","transliteration":"unkiḥaka","translation_bn":"তোমার সঙ্গে আমি বিয়ে দিবো","root":"نكح","lemma":"تُنكِحُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30086,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِحْدَى","transliteration":"iḥ''dā","translation_bn":"একজনকে","root":"احد","lemma":"إِحْدَى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30087,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱبْنَتَىَّ","transliteration":"ib''natayya","translation_bn":"আমার কন্যা দু''জনের","root":"بني","lemma":"ٱبْنَت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30088,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰتَيْنِ","transliteration":"hātayni","translation_bn":"এই দু''য়ের","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰتَيْن","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":30089,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"এ শর্তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30090,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":30091,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَأْجُرَنِى","transliteration":"tajuranī","translation_bn":"আমার কাজ করবে তুমি","root":"اجر","lemma":"تَأْجُرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30092,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ثَمَـٰنِىَ","transliteration":"thamāniya","translation_bn":"আট","root":"ثمن","lemma":"ثَمَٰنِى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30093,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"حِجَجٍۢ ۖ","transliteration":"ḥijajin","translation_bn":"বছর","root":"حجج","lemma":"حِجَج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30095,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنْ","transliteration":"fa-in","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30096,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَتْمَمْتَ","transliteration":"atmamta","translation_bn":"তুমি পূর্ণ করো","root":"تمم","lemma":"أَتَمَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30097,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَشْرًۭا","transliteration":"ʿashran","translation_bn":"দশ (বছর)","root":"عشر","lemma":"عَشْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30098,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فَمِنْ","transliteration":"famin","translation_bn":"তবে (তা হবে) হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30099,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"عِندِكَ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿindika","translation_bn":"তোমার নিকট","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30101,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30102,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أُرِيدُ","transliteration":"urīdu","translation_bn":"আমি চাই","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30103,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":30104,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"أَشُقَّ","transliteration":"ashuqqa","translation_bn":"কষ্ট দিবো","root":"شقق","lemma":"شَقَقْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30105,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكَ ۚ","transliteration":"ʿalayka","translation_bn":"উপর তোমার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30107,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"سَتَجِدُنِىٓ","transliteration":"satajidunī","translation_bn":"অচিরেই তুমি পাবে আমাকে","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":30108,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":30109,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"شَآءَ","transliteration":"shāa","translation_bn":"চান","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30110,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":30111,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30112,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥīna","translation_bn":"সৎকর্মশীলদের\"","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30113,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla innī urīdu an unkiḥaka iḥ''dā ib''natayya hātayni ʿalā an tajuranī thamāniya ḥijajin fa-in atmamta ʿashran famin ʿindika wamā urīdu an ashuqqa ʿalayka satajidunī in shāa l-lahu mina l-ṣāliḥīna', 'সে বলল- ‘আমার এই কন্যাদ্বয়ের একজনের সঙ্গে তোমার বিয়ে দেয়ার আমি ইচ্ছে করেছি এই শর্তে যে, তুমি আট বছর আমার কাজ করে দেবে, আর যদি দশ বছর পূর্ণ কর সেটা তোমার ইচ্ছেধীন, আমি তোমাকে কষ্টে ফেলতে চাই না, আল্লাহ ইচ্ছে করলে তুমি আমাকে সৎকর্মপরায়ণ পাবে।’', 'He said, "Indeed, I wish to wed you one of these, my two daughters, on [the condition] that you serve me for eight years; but if you complete ten, it will be [as a favor] from you. And I do not wish to put you in difficulty. You will find me, if Allah wills, from among the righteous."', 'সে বলল- ‘আমার এই কন্যাদ্বয়ের একজনের সঙ্গে তোমার বিয়ে দেয়ার আমি ইচ্ছে করেছি এই শর্তে যে, তুমি আট বছর আমার কাজ করে দেবে, আর যদি দশ বছর পূর্ণ কর সেটা তোমার ইচ্ছেধীন, আমি তোমাকে কষ্টে ফেলতে চাই না, আল্লাহ ইচ্ছে করলে তুমি আমাকে সৎকর্মপরায়ণ পাবে।’', 'He said, "Indeed, I wish to wed you one of these, my two daughters, on [the condition] that you serve me for eight years; but if you complete ten, it will be [as a favor] from you. And I do not wish to put you in difficulty. You will find me, if Allah wills, from among the righteous."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028027.mp3', now()),
  (28, 28, '', '[{"id":31152,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(মূসা) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31153,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"\"এটা (চুক্তি)","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":31154,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنِى","transliteration":"baynī","translation_bn":"মাঝে আমার","root":"بين\r","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":31155,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَبَيْنَكَ ۖ","transliteration":"wabaynaka","translation_bn":"ও মাঝে তোমার","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31157,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَيَّمَا","transliteration":"ayyamā","translation_bn":"যে কোনোটি","root":"—","lemma":"أَىّ\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":31158,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَجَلَيْنِ","transliteration":"l-ajalayni","translation_bn":"দুই মেয়াদের","root":"اجل","lemma":"أَجَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31159,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَضَيْتُ","transliteration":"qaḍaytu","translation_bn":"আমি পূর্ণ করবো","root":"قضي","lemma":"قَضَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31160,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"এরপর না (থাকবে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31161,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عُدْوَٰنَ","transliteration":"ʿud''wāna","translation_bn":"কোনো বাড়াবাড়ি","root":"عدو","lemma":"عُدْوَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31162,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىَّ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿalayya","translation_bn":"বিরুদ্ধে আমার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31164,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31165,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31166,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":31167,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"نَقُولُ","transliteration":"naqūlu","translation_bn":"আমরা বলছি","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31168,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَكِيلٌۭ","transliteration":"wakīlun","translation_bn":"কর্মবিধায়ক\"","root":"وكل","lemma":"وَكِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31169,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla dhālika baynī wabaynaka ayyamā l-ajalayni qaḍaytu falā ʿud''wāna ʿalayya wal-lahu ʿalā mā naqūlu wakīlun', 'মূসা বলল- আমার ও আপনার মধ্যে এই চুক্তি রইল, আমি দু’টি মেয়াদের যেটিই পূর্ণ করি না কেন, আমার বিরুদ্ধে কোন অভিযোগ করা হবে না, আমরা যে কথা বলছি, আল্লাহ তার সাক্ষী।', '[Moses] said, "That is [established] between me and you. Whichever of the two terms I complete - there is no injustice to me, and Allah, over what we say, is Witness."', 'মূসা বলল- আমার ও আপনার মধ্যে এই চুক্তি রইল, আমি দু’টি মেয়াদের যেটিই পূর্ণ করি না কেন, আমার বিরুদ্ধে কোন অভিযোগ করা হবে না, আমরা যে কথা বলছি, আল্লাহ তার সাক্ষী।', '[Moses] said, "That is [established] between me and you. Whichever of the two terms I complete - there is no injustice to me, and Allah, over what we say, is Witness."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028028.mp3', now()),
  (28, 29, '', '[{"id":32129,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32130,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَضَىٰ","transliteration":"qaḍā","translation_bn":"পূর্ণ করলো","root":"قضي","lemma":"قَضَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32131,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَى","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসা","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":32132,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَجَلَ","transliteration":"l-ajala","translation_bn":"নির্দিষ্ট মেয়াদ","root":"اجل","lemma":"أَجَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32133,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَسَارَ","transliteration":"wasāra","translation_bn":"ও যাত্রা করলো","root":"سير","lemma":"سَارَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32134,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِأَهْلِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"bi-ahlihi","translation_bn":"নিয়ে তার পরিবার","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32135,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ءَانَسَ","transliteration":"ānasa","translation_bn":"সে দেখলো","root":"انس","lemma":"ءَانَسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32136,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32137,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"جَانِبِ","transliteration":"jānibi","translation_bn":"দিক","root":"جنب","lemma":"جَانِب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32138,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلطُّورِ","transliteration":"l-ṭūri","translation_bn":"তুর পাহাড়ের","root":"طور","lemma":"طُور","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32139,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"نَارًۭا","transliteration":"nāran","translation_bn":"আগুন","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32140,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(তখন) সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32141,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لِأَهْلِهِ","transliteration":"li-ahlihi","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে তার পরিবারের","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32142,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱمْكُثُوٓا۟","transliteration":"um''kuthū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা অপেক্ষা করো","root":"مكث","lemma":"مَكَثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32143,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":32144,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ءَانَسْتُ","transliteration":"ānastu","translation_bn":"আমি দেখেছি","root":"انس","lemma":"ءَانَسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32145,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"نَارًۭا","transliteration":"nāran","translation_bn":"আগুন","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32146,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"لَّعَلِّىٓ","transliteration":"laʿallī","translation_bn":"সম্ভবতঃ আমি","root":"—","lemma":"لَّعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":32147,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتِيكُم","transliteration":"ātīkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে আমি আসবো","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32148,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهَا","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"হ''তে সেখান","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32149,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"بِخَبَرٍ","transliteration":"bikhabarin","translation_bn":"নিয়ে কোন তথ্য","root":"خبر","lemma":"خَبَر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32150,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32151,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"جَذْوَةٍۢ","transliteration":"jadhwatin","translation_bn":"জ্বলন্ত অঙ্গার","root":"جذو","lemma":"جَذْوَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32152,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32153,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"আগুন","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32154,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallakum","translation_bn":"যাতে তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":32155,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"تَصْطَلُونَ","transliteration":"taṣṭalūna","translation_bn":"আগুন পোহাতে পারো\"","root":"صلي","lemma":"تَصْطَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32156,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā qaḍā mūsā l-ajala wasāra bi-ahlihi ānasa min jānibi l-ṭūri nāran qāla li-ahlihi um''kuthū innī ānastu nāran laʿallī ātīkum min''hā bikhabarin aw jadhwatin mina l-nāri laʿallakum taṣṭalūna', 'অতঃপর মূসা যখন মেয়াদ পূর্ণ ক’রে তার পরিবার নিয়ে যাত্রা করল, তখন সে তূর পর্বতের দিকে আগুন দেখতে পেল। সে তার পরিবারবর্গকে বলল- ‘তোমরা অপেক্ষা কর, আমি আগুন দেখেছি, আমি তোমাদের জন্য সেখান থেকে খবর আনতে পারি কিংবা জ্বলন্ত কাষ্ঠখন্ড আনতে পারি যাতে তোমরা আগুন পোহাতে পার।’', 'And when Moses had completed the term and was traveling with his family, he perceived from the direction of the mount a fire. He said to his family, "Stay here; indeed, I have perceived a fire. Perhaps I will bring you from there [some] information or burning wood from the fire that you may warm yourselves."', 'অতঃপর মূসা যখন মেয়াদ পূর্ণ ক’রে তার পরিবার নিয়ে যাত্রা করল, তখন সে তূর পর্বতের দিকে আগুন দেখতে পেল। সে তার পরিবারবর্গকে বলল- ‘তোমরা অপেক্ষা কর, আমি আগুন দেখেছি, আমি তোমাদের জন্য সেখান থেকে খবর আনতে পারি কিংবা জ্বলন্ত কাষ্ঠখন্ড আনতে পারি যাতে তোমরা আগুন পোহাতে পার।’', 'And when Moses had completed the term and was traveling with his family, he perceived from the direction of the mount a fire. He said to his family, "Stay here; indeed, I have perceived a fire. Perhaps I will bring you from there [some] information or burning wood from the fire that you may warm yourselves."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028029.mp3', now()),
  (28, 30, '', '[{"id":32963,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّآ","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32964,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَتَىٰهَا","transliteration":"atāhā","translation_bn":"সেখানে আসলো","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32965,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نُودِىَ","transliteration":"nūdiya","translation_bn":"তাকে ডাকা হলো","root":"ندو","lemma":"نَادَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32966,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32967,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"شَـٰطِئِ","transliteration":"shāṭi-i","translation_bn":"প্রান্ত","root":"شطا","lemma":"شَٰطِئ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32968,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْوَادِ","transliteration":"l-wādi","translation_bn":"উপত্যকার","root":"ودي","lemma":"وَاد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32969,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَيْمَنِ","transliteration":"l-aymani","translation_bn":"ডানদিকের","root":"يمن","lemma":"أَيْمَن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32970,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32971,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبُقْعَةِ","transliteration":"l-buq''ʿati","translation_bn":"ভূখন্ডের","root":"بقع","lemma":"بُقْعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32972,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُبَـٰرَكَةِ","transliteration":"l-mubārakati","translation_bn":"পবিত্র","root":"برك","lemma":"مُّبَٰرَكَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32973,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32974,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّجَرَةِ","transliteration":"l-shajarati","translation_bn":"একটি গাছ","root":"شجر","lemma":"شَجَرَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32975,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"(এ বলে) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":32976,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰمُوسَىٰٓ","transliteration":"yāmūsā","translation_bn":"\"হে মূসা","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":32977,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":32978,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَنَا","transliteration":"anā","translation_bn":"আমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنَا","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":32979,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":32980,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّ","transliteration":"rabbu","translation_bn":"রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32981,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ʿālamīna","translation_bn":"বিশ্বজগতের","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلَمِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32982,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٣٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩০)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā atāhā nūdiya min shāṭi-i l-wādi l-aymani fī l-buq''ʿati l-mubārakati mina l-shajarati an yāmūsā innī anā l-lahu rabbu l-ʿālamīna', 'মূসা যখন আগুনের কাছে পৌঁছল তখন পবিত্র ভূমিতে অবস্থিত উপত্যকার ডান দিকে বৃক্ষ থেকে তাকে আহবান দিয়ে বলা হল- ‘হে মূসা! আমিই আল্লাহ, জগতসমূহের পালনকর্তা।’', 'But when he came to it, he was called from the right side of the valley in a blessed spot - from the tree, "O Moses, indeed I am Allah, Lord of the worlds."', 'মূসা যখন আগুনের কাছে পৌঁছল তখন পবিত্র ভূমিতে অবস্থিত উপত্যকার ডান দিকে বৃক্ষ থেকে তাকে আহবান দিয়ে বলা হল- ‘হে মূসা! আমিই আল্লাহ, জগতসমূহের পালনকর্তা।’', 'But when he came to it, he was called from the right side of the valley in a blessed spot - from the tree, "O Moses, indeed I am Allah, Lord of the worlds."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028030.mp3', now()),
  (28, 31, '', '[{"id":33872,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنْ","transliteration":"wa-an","translation_bn":"এবং (বলা হলো) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33873,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَلْقِ","transliteration":"alqi","translation_bn":"ছোঁড়ো","root":"لقي","lemma":"أَلْقَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33874,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَصَاكَ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿaṣāka","translation_bn":"তোমার লাঠিকে\"","root":"عصو","lemma":"عَصَا2","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33876,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33877,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَءَاهَا","transliteration":"raāhā","translation_bn":"সে দেখলো তা","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33878,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَهْتَزُّ","transliteration":"tahtazzu","translation_bn":"হামাগুড়ি দিয়ে চলছে","root":"هزز","lemma":"ٱهْتَزَّتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33879,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَأَنَّهَا","transliteration":"ka-annahā","translation_bn":"যেন তা","root":"—","lemma":"كَأَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":33880,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"جَآنٌّۭ","transliteration":"jānnun","translation_bn":"সাপ","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَا^نّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33881,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلَّىٰ","transliteration":"wallā","translation_bn":"(তখন) সে ফিরে পালালো","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33882,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مُدْبِرًۭا","transliteration":"mud''biran","translation_bn":"পিছন দিকে","root":"دبر","lemma":"مُدْبِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33883,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمْ","transliteration":"walam","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33884,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يُعَقِّبْ ۚ","transliteration":"yuʿaqqib","translation_bn":"মুখ ফিরে দেখলো","root":"عقب","lemma":"يُعَقِّبْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33886,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰمُوسَىٰٓ","transliteration":"yāmūsā","translation_bn":"\"(বলা হলো) হে মূসা","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":33887,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَقْبِلْ","transliteration":"aqbil","translation_bn":"সামনে এসো","root":"قبل","lemma":"أَقْبَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33888,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33889,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"تَخَفْ ۖ","transliteration":"takhaf","translation_bn":"ভয় করো","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33891,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكَ","transliteration":"innaka","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":33892,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33893,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔامِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-āminīna","translation_bn":"নিরাপদদের","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامِنِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33894,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٣١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩১)","root":"—","lemma":"٣١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-an alqi ʿaṣāka falammā raāhā tahtazzu ka-annahā jānnun wallā mud''biran walam yuʿaqqib yāmūsā aqbil walā takhaf innaka mina l-āminīna', 'আর (বলা হল) ‘তোমার লাঠি নিক্ষেপ কর।’ অতঃপর যখন সে সেটাকে দেখল ছুটাছুটি করতে যেন ওটা একটা সাপ, তখন পেছনের দিকে দৌড় দিল, ফিরেও তাকাল না। (তখন তাকে বলা হল) ‘ওহে মূসা! সামনে এসো, ভয় করো না, তুমি নিরাপদ।’', 'And [he was told], "Throw down your staff." But when he saw it writhing as if it was a snake, he turned in flight and did not return. [Allah said], "O Moses, approach and fear not. Indeed, you are of the secure.', 'আর (বলা হল) ‘তোমার লাঠি নিক্ষেপ কর।’ অতঃপর যখন সে সেটাকে দেখল ছুটাছুটি করতে যেন ওটা একটা সাপ, তখন পেছনের দিকে দৌড় দিল, ফিরেও তাকাল না। (তখন তাকে বলা হল) ‘ওহে মূসা! সামনে এসো, ভয় করো না, তুমি নিরাপদ।’', 'And [he was told], "Throw down your staff." But when he saw it writhing as if it was a snake, he turned in flight and did not return. [Allah said], "O Moses, approach and fear not. Indeed, you are of the secure.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028031.mp3', now()),
  (28, 32, '', '[{"id":34822,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْلُكْ","transliteration":"us''luk","translation_bn":"প্রবেশ করাও","root":"سلك","lemma":"سَلَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34823,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَدَكَ","transliteration":"yadaka","translation_bn":"তোমার হাত","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34824,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34825,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"جَيْبِكَ","transliteration":"jaybika","translation_bn":"তোমার বগলের","root":"جيب","lemma":"جَيْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34826,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَخْرُجْ","transliteration":"takhruj","translation_bn":"তা বের হবে","root":"خرج","lemma":"خَرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34827,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَيْضَآءَ","transliteration":"bayḍāa","translation_bn":"উজ্জ্বল হয়ে","root":"بيض","lemma":"أَبْيَض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34828,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34829,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرِ","transliteration":"ghayri","translation_bn":"ছাড়াই","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34830,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"سُوٓءٍۢ","transliteration":"sūin","translation_bn":"দোষ","root":"سوا","lemma":"سُو^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34831,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱضْمُمْ","transliteration":"wa-uḍ''mum","translation_bn":"এবং চেপে ধরো (মিলাও)","root":"ضمم","lemma":"ٱضْمُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34832,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"উপর (দিকে) তোমার (বুকের)","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34833,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"جَنَاحَكَ","transliteration":"janāḥaka","translation_bn":"তোমার হাত (বাঁচার জন্যে)","root":"جنح","lemma":"جَنَاح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34834,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"কারণে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34835,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّهْبِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-rahbi","translation_bn":"ভয়ের","root":"رهب","lemma":"رَّهْب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34837,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَذَٰنِكَ","transliteration":"fadhānika","translation_bn":"অতএব এই দু''টো (হলো)","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰنِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34838,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بُرْهَـٰنَانِ","transliteration":"bur''hānāni","translation_bn":"দু''টো প্রমাণ","root":"برهن","lemma":"بُرْهَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34839,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34840,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34841,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34842,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"فِرْعَوْنَ","transliteration":"fir''ʿawna","translation_bn":"ফিরআউনের","root":"—","lemma":"فِرْعَوْن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":34843,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَمَلَإِي۟هِۦٓ ۚ","transliteration":"wamala-ihi","translation_bn":"ও তার সভাষদবর্গের (প্রতি)","root":"ملا","lemma":"مَلَأ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34845,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"innahum","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তারা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":34846,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34847,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمًۭا","transliteration":"qawman","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34848,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"فَـٰسِقِينَ","transliteration":"fāsiqīna","translation_bn":"সত্যত্যাগী\"","root":"فسق","lemma":"فَاسِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":34849,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'us''luk yadaka fī jaybika takhruj bayḍāa min ghayri sūin wa-uḍ''mum ilayka janāḥaka mina l-rahbi fadhānika bur''hānāni min rabbika ilā fir''ʿawna wamala-ihi innahum kānū qawman fāsiqīna', 'তোমার হাত তোমার বগলে রাখ, তা দোষমুক্ত জ্যোতির্ময় হয়ে বেরিয়ে আসবে, ভয় থেকে রক্ষার্থে তোমার হাত তোমার উপর চেপে ধর। এ দু’টি হল ফেরাউন ও তার পারিষদবর্গের জন্য তোমার প্রতিপালকের পক্ষ থেকে প্রমাণ, নিশ্চয় তারা পাপাচারী সম্প্রদায়।’', 'Insert your hand into the opening of your garment; it will come out white, without disease. And draw in your arm close to you [as prevention] from fear, for those are two proofs from your Lord to Pharaoh and his establishment. Indeed, they have been a people defiantly disobedient."', 'তোমার হাত তোমার বগলে রাখ, তা দোষমুক্ত জ্যোতির্ময় হয়ে বেরিয়ে আসবে, ভয় থেকে রক্ষার্থে তোমার হাত তোমার উপর চেপে ধর। এ দু’টি হল ফেরাউন ও তার পারিষদবর্গের জন্য তোমার প্রতিপালকের পক্ষ থেকে প্রমাণ, নিশ্চয় তারা পাপাচারী সম্প্রদায়।’', 'Insert your hand into the opening of your garment; it will come out white, without disease. And draw in your arm close to you [as prevention] from fear, for those are two proofs from your Lord to Pharaoh and his establishment. Indeed, they have been a people defiantly disobedient."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028032.mp3', now()),
  (28, 33, '', '[{"id":35639,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35640,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّ","transliteration":"rabbi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35641,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّى","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":35642,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَتَلْتُ","transliteration":"qataltu","translation_bn":"আমি হত্যা করেছি","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35643,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"মধ্য হ''তে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35644,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسًۭا","transliteration":"nafsan","translation_bn":"এক ব্যক্তিকে","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35645,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَأَخَافُ","transliteration":"fa-akhāfu","translation_bn":"অতএব আমি ভয় করি","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35646,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":35647,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَقْتُلُونِ","transliteration":"yaqtulūni","translation_bn":"আমাকে তারা হত্যা করবে","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35648,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٣٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla rabbi innī qataltu min''hum nafsan fa-akhāfu an yaqtulūni', 'মূসা বলল- ‘হে আমার প্রতিপালক! আমি তাদের একজনকে হত্যা করেছি, কাজেই আমি আশঙ্কা করছি তারা আমাকে হত্যা করবে।’', 'He said, "My Lord, indeed, I killed from among them someone, and I fear they will kill me.', 'মূসা বলল- ‘হে আমার প্রতিপালক! আমি তাদের একজনকে হত্যা করেছি, কাজেই আমি আশঙ্কা করছি তারা আমাকে হত্যা করবে।’', 'He said, "My Lord, indeed, I killed from among them someone, and I fear they will kill me.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028033.mp3', now()),
  (28, 34, '', '[{"id":36589,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَخِى","transliteration":"wa-akhī","translation_bn":"এবং আমার ভাই","root":"اخو","lemma":"أَخ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36590,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰرُونُ","transliteration":"hārūnu","translation_bn":"হারুন","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰرُون","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":36591,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"সে","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":36592,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَفْصَحُ","transliteration":"afṣaḥu","translation_bn":"অধিক বাকপটু","root":"فصح","lemma":"أَفْصَح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36593,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِنِّى","transliteration":"minnī","translation_bn":"আমার চেয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36594,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِسَانًۭا","transliteration":"lisānan","translation_bn":"ভাষায়","root":"لسن","lemma":"لِسَان","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36595,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَأَرْسِلْهُ","transliteration":"fa-arsil''hu","translation_bn":"সুতরাং তাকে পাঠাও","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36596,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَعِىَ","transliteration":"maʿiya","translation_bn":"আমার সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":36597,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رِدْءًۭا","transliteration":"rid''an","translation_bn":"সহায়ক হিসেবে","root":"ردا","lemma":"رِدْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36598,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يُصَدِّقُنِىٓ ۖ","transliteration":"yuṣaddiqunī","translation_bn":"আমাকে সে সমর্থন করবে","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَدَّقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36600,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":36601,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَخَافُ","transliteration":"akhāfu","translation_bn":"আশংকা করি","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36602,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":36603,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يُكَذِّبُونِ","transliteration":"yukadhibūni","translation_bn":"আমাকে তারা মিথ্যাবাদী বলবে\"","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36604,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-akhī hārūnu huwa afṣaḥu minnī lisānan fa-arsil''hu maʿiya rid''an yuṣaddiqunī innī akhāfu an yukadhibūni', 'আর আমার ভাই হারূন আমার চেয়ে প্রাঞ্জলভাষী, কাজেই তাকে তুমি সাহায্যকারীরূপে আমার সঙ্গে প্রেরণ কর, সে আমাকে সমর্থন জানাবে। আমি আশঙ্কা করছি তারা আমাকে মিথ্যে বলে প্রত্যাখ্যান করবে।’', 'And my brother Aaron is more fluent than me in tongue, so send him with me as support, verifying me. Indeed, I fear that they will deny me."', 'আর আমার ভাই হারূন আমার চেয়ে প্রাঞ্জলভাষী, কাজেই তাকে তুমি সাহায্যকারীরূপে আমার সঙ্গে প্রেরণ কর, সে আমাকে সমর্থন জানাবে। আমি আশঙ্কা করছি তারা আমাকে মিথ্যে বলে প্রত্যাখ্যান করবে।’', 'And my brother Aaron is more fluent than me in tongue, so send him with me as support, verifying me. Indeed, I fear that they will deny me."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028034.mp3', now()),
  (28, 35, '', '[{"id":37434,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ (বলেন)","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37435,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"سَنَشُدُّ","transliteration":"sanashuddu","translation_bn":"\"অচিরেই আমরা শক্ত করবো","root":"شدد","lemma":"شَدَدْ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":37436,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَضُدَكَ","transliteration":"ʿaḍudaka","translation_bn":"তোমার বাহুকে","root":"عضد","lemma":"عَضُد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37437,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِأَخِيكَ","transliteration":"bi-akhīka","translation_bn":"দ্বারা তোমার ভাই","root":"اخو","lemma":"أَخ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37438,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَنَجْعَلُ","transliteration":"wanajʿalu","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা দিবো","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37439,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمَا","transliteration":"lakumā","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের দু''জনের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37440,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"سُلْطَـٰنًۭا","transliteration":"sul''ṭānan","translation_bn":"প্রাধান্য","root":"سلط","lemma":"سُلْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37441,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"সুতরাং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37442,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَصِلُونَ","transliteration":"yaṣilūna","translation_bn":"তারা পৌঁছুতে পারবে (কষ্ট দিতে)","root":"وصل","lemma":"يَصِلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37443,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكُمَا ۚ","transliteration":"ilaykumā","translation_bn":"নিকটে তোমাদের দু''জনের","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37445,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَآ","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"মাধ্যমে আমাদের নিদর্শনগুলোর","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37446,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُمَا","transliteration":"antumā","translation_bn":"তোমরা দু''জন","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُمَا","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":37447,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَمَنِ","transliteration":"wamani","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37448,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّبَعَكُمَا","transliteration":"ittabaʿakumā","translation_bn":"অনুসরণ করবে তোমাদের দু''জনকে","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37449,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَـٰلِبُونَ","transliteration":"l-ghālibūna","translation_bn":"বিজয়ী হবে\"","root":"غلب","lemma":"غَالِب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37450,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٣٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla sanashuddu ʿaḍudaka bi-akhīka wanajʿalu lakumā sul''ṭānan falā yaṣilūna ilaykumā biāyātinā antumā wamani ittabaʿakumā l-ghālibūna', 'আল্লাহ বললেন- ‘আমি তোমার ভ্রাতার মাধ্যমে তোমার হাতকে শক্তিশালী করব এবং তোমাদেরকে প্রমাণপঞ্জি দান করব, যার ফলে তারা তোমাদের কাছে পৌঁছতেই পারবে না। আমার নিদর্শন বলে তোমরা এবং তোমাদের অনুসারীরাই বিজয়ী থাকবে।', '[Allah] said, "We will strengthen your arm through your brother and grant you both supremacy so they will not reach you. [It will be] through Our signs; you and those who follow you will be the predominant."', 'আল্লাহ বললেন- ‘আমি তোমার ভ্রাতার মাধ্যমে তোমার হাতকে শক্তিশালী করব এবং তোমাদেরকে প্রমাণপঞ্জি দান করব, যার ফলে তারা তোমাদের কাছে পৌঁছতেই পারবে না। আমার নিদর্শন বলে তোমরা এবং তোমাদের অনুসারীরাই বিজয়ী থাকবে।', '[Allah] said, "We will strengthen your arm through your brother and grant you both supremacy so they will not reach you. [It will be] through Our signs; you and those who follow you will be the predominant."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028035.mp3', now()),
  (28, 36, '', '[{"id":38318,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38319,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَهُم","transliteration":"jāahum","translation_bn":"আসলো তাদের কাছে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38320,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُّوسَىٰ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসা","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":38321,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"নিয়ে আমাদের নিদর্শনাবলী","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38322,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"bayyinātin","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":38323,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38324,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"\"নয়","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":38325,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَآ","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":38326,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া যে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":38327,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"سِحْرٌۭ","transliteration":"siḥ''run","translation_bn":"জাদু","root":"سحر","lemma":"سِحْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38328,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مُّفْتَرًۭى","transliteration":"muf''taran","translation_bn":"অলীক","root":"فري","lemma":"مُّفْتَرًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38329,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38330,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"سَمِعْنَا","transliteration":"samiʿ''nā","translation_bn":"শুনেছি আমরা","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38331,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِهَـٰذَا","transliteration":"bihādhā","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38332,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (নিকট)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38333,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ءَابَآئِنَا","transliteration":"ābāinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের পিতৃপুরুষদের\"","root":"ابو","lemma":"ا^بَاء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38334,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","transliteration":"l-awalīna","translation_bn":"পূর্বেকার\"","root":"اول","lemma":"أَوَّل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38335,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٣٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā jāahum mūsā biāyātinā bayyinātin qālū mā hādhā illā siḥ''run muf''taran wamā samiʿ''nā bihādhā fī ābāinā l-awalīna', 'মূসা যখন তাদের কাছে সুস্পষ্ট নিদর্শন নিয়ে আসল, তারা বলল- এতো অলীক যাদু মাত্র, আমাদের পূর্বপুরুষদের যামানায় এ সবের কথা তো শুনিনি।', 'But when Moses came to them with Our signs as clear evidences, they said, "This is not except invented magic, and we have not heard of this [religion] among our forefathers."', 'মূসা যখন তাদের কাছে সুস্পষ্ট নিদর্শন নিয়ে আসল, তারা বলল- এতো অলীক যাদু মাত্র, আমাদের পূর্বপুরুষদের যামানায় এ সবের কথা তো শুনিনি।', 'But when Moses came to them with Our signs as clear evidences, they said, "This is not except invented magic, and we have not heard of this [religion] among our forefathers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028036.mp3', now()),
  (28, 37, '', '[{"id":39170,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالَ","transliteration":"waqāla","translation_bn":"এবং বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39171,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসা","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":39172,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّىٓ","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"\"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39173,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"aʿlamu","translation_bn":"খুব ভাল জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"أَعْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":39174,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِمَن","transliteration":"biman","translation_bn":"(তার) সম্পর্কে যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39175,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"এসেছে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39176,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْهُدَىٰ","transliteration":"bil-hudā","translation_bn":"নিয়ে পথ নির্দেশ","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39177,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39178,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عِندِهِۦ","transliteration":"ʿindihi","translation_bn":"নিকট তাঁর","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39179,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39180,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَكُونُ","transliteration":"takūnu","translation_bn":"(শুভ) হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39181,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাঁর","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39182,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","translation_bn":"পরিণাম","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَٰقِبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39183,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدَّارِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-dāri","translation_bn":"আখিরাতের","root":"دور","lemma":"دَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39185,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তা(এমন যে)","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":39186,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":39187,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يُفْلِحُ","transliteration":"yuf''liḥu","translation_bn":"সফলকাম হয়","root":"فلح","lemma":"أَفْلَحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39188,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimūna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীরা\"","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39189,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٣٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqāla mūsā rabbī aʿlamu biman jāa bil-hudā min ʿindihi waman takūnu lahu ʿāqibatu l-dāri innahu lā yuf''liḥu l-ẓālimūna', 'মূসা বলল- ‘আমার প্রতিপালক বেশ ভাল ক’রেই জানেন কে তাঁর নিকট থেকে পথ নির্দেশ নিয়ে এসেছে এবং কার পরিণাম আখিরাতে শুভ হবে। যালিমরা কক্ষনো সাফল্য লাভ করবে না।’', 'And Moses said, "My Lord is more knowing [than we or you] of who has come with guidance from Him and to whom will be succession in the home. Indeed, wrongdoers do not succeed."', 'মূসা বলল- ‘আমার প্রতিপালক বেশ ভাল ক’রেই জানেন কে তাঁর নিকট থেকে পথ নির্দেশ নিয়ে এসেছে এবং কার পরিণাম আখিরাতে শুভ হবে। যালিমরা কক্ষনো সাফল্য লাভ করবে না।’', 'And Moses said, "My Lord is more knowing [than we or you] of who has come with guidance from Him and to whom will be succession in the home. Indeed, wrongdoers do not succeed."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028037.mp3', now()),
  (28, 38, '', '[{"id":39971,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالَ","transliteration":"waqāla","translation_bn":"এবং বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39972,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِرْعَوْنُ","transliteration":"fir''ʿawnu","translation_bn":"ফেরআউন","root":"—","lemma":"فِرْعَوْن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":39973,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"\"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":39974,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَلَأُ","transliteration":"l-mala-u","translation_bn":"\"সভাষদবৃন্দ","root":"ملا","lemma":"مَلَأ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39975,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":39976,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلِمْتُ","transliteration":"ʿalim''tu","translation_bn":"আমি জানি","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39977,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39978,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39979,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهٍ","transliteration":"ilāhin","translation_bn":"ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39980,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرِى","transliteration":"ghayrī","translation_bn":"আমি ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39981,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَأَوْقِدْ","transliteration":"fa-awqid","translation_bn":"সুতরাং জ্বালাও আগুন","root":"وقد","lemma":"أَوْقَدُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39982,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِى","transliteration":"lī","translation_bn":"জন্যে আমার","root":"—","lemma":"لِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39983,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰهَـٰمَـٰنُ","transliteration":"yāhāmānu","translation_bn":"হে হামান","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰمَٰن","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":39984,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39985,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلطِّينِ","transliteration":"l-ṭīni","translation_bn":"মাটির (অর্থাৎ ইট তৈরী করো)","root":"طين","lemma":"طِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39986,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَٱجْعَل","transliteration":"fa-ij''ʿal","translation_bn":"অতঃপর বানাও","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39987,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لِّى","transliteration":"lī","translation_bn":"জন্যে আমার","root":"—","lemma":"لِّى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39988,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"صَرْحًۭا","transliteration":"ṣarḥan","translation_bn":"সুউচ্চ প্রাসাদ","root":"صرح","lemma":"صَرْح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39989,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"لَّعَلِّىٓ","transliteration":"laʿallī","translation_bn":"যাতে আমি","root":"—","lemma":"لَّعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":39990,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَطَّلِعُ","transliteration":"aṭṭaliʿu","translation_bn":"আমি চড়ে দেখতে পারি","root":"طلع","lemma":"طَّلَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39991,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39992,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهِ","transliteration":"ilāhi","translation_bn":"ইলাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39993,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসার","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":39994,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنِّى","transliteration":"wa-innī","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39995,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"لَأَظُنُّهُۥ","transliteration":"la-aẓunnuhu","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই আমি মনে করি তাকে","root":"ظنن","lemma":"ظَنَّ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":39996,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39997,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰذِبِينَ","transliteration":"l-kādhibīna","translation_bn":"মিথ্যাবাদীদের\"","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَٰذِب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39998,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٣٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqāla fir''ʿawnu yāayyuhā l-mala-u mā ʿalim''tu lakum min ilāhin ghayrī fa-awqid lī yāhāmānu ʿalā l-ṭīni fa-ij''ʿal lī ṣarḥan laʿallī aṭṭaliʿu ilā ilāhi mūsā wa-innī la-aẓunnuhu mina l-kādhibīna', 'ফিরআউন বলল- ‘হে পারিষদবর্গ! আমি ছাড়া তোমাদের কোন ইলাহ আছে বলে আমি জানি না। কাজেই ওহে হামান! তুমি আমার জন্য ইট পোড়াও, অতঃপর আমার জন্য একটি প্রাসাদ নির্মাণ কর যাতে আমি মূসার ইলাহকে দেখতে পারি, আমার নিশ্চিত ধারণা যে, সে একজন মিথ্যেবাদী।’', 'And Pharaoh said, "O eminent ones, I have not known you to have a god other than me. Then ignite for me, O Haman, [a fire] upon the clay and make for me a tower that I may look at the God of Moses. And indeed, I do think he is among the liars."', 'ফিরআউন বলল- ‘হে পারিষদবর্গ! আমি ছাড়া তোমাদের কোন ইলাহ আছে বলে আমি জানি না। কাজেই ওহে হামান! তুমি আমার জন্য ইট পোড়াও, অতঃপর আমার জন্য একটি প্রাসাদ নির্মাণ কর যাতে আমি মূসার ইলাহকে দেখতে পারি, আমার নিশ্চিত ধারণা যে, সে একজন মিথ্যেবাদী।’', 'And Pharaoh said, "O eminent ones, I have not known you to have a god other than me. Then ignite for me, O Haman, [a fire] upon the clay and make for me a tower that I may look at the God of Moses. And indeed, I do think he is among the liars."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028038.mp3', now()),
  (28, 39, '', '[{"id":40791,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱسْتَكْبَرَ","transliteration":"wa-is''takbara","translation_bn":"এবং সে অহংকার করলো","root":"كبر","lemma":"ٱسْتَكْبَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40792,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"সে","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":40793,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَجُنُودُهُۥ","transliteration":"wajunūduhu","translation_bn":"ও তার সৈন্য বাহিনী","root":"جند","lemma":"جُند","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40794,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40795,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40796,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"bighayri","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40797,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"কোনো অধিকার","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40798,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَظَنُّوٓا۟","transliteration":"waẓannū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা মনে করেছিলো","root":"ظنن","lemma":"ظَنَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40799,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"annahum","translation_bn":"যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":40800,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْنَا","transliteration":"ilaynā","translation_bn":"দিকে আমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40801,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":40802,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يُرْجَعُونَ","transliteration":"yur''jaʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা প্রত্যাবর্তিত হবে","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40803,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٣٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-is''takbara huwa wajunūduhu fī l-arḍi bighayri l-ḥaqi waẓannū annahum ilaynā lā yur''jaʿūna', 'ফেরাউন ও তার বাহিনী অকারণে পৃথিবীতে অহংকার করেছিল আর তারা ভেবেছিল যে, তাদেরকে আমার কাছে ফিরিয়ে আনা হবে না।', 'And he was arrogant, he and his soldiers, in the land, without right, and they thought that they would not be returned to Us.', 'ফেরাউন ও তার বাহিনী অকারণে পৃথিবীতে অহংকার করেছিল আর তারা ভেবেছিল যে, তাদেরকে আমার কাছে ফিরিয়ে আনা হবে না।', 'And he was arrogant, he and his soldiers, in the land, without right, and they thought that they would not be returned to Us.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028039.mp3', now()),
  (28, 40, '', '[{"id":41651,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَأَخَذْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"fa-akhadhnāhu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর আমরা ধরলাম তাকে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41652,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَجُنُودَهُۥ","transliteration":"wajunūdahu","translation_bn":"ও তার সৈন্যবাহিনীকেও","root":"جند","lemma":"جُند","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41653,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَنَبَذْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"fanabadhnāhum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর আমরা নিক্ষেপ করলাম তাদেরকে","root":"نبذ","lemma":"نَبَذَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41654,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41655,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْيَمِّ ۖ","transliteration":"l-yami","translation_bn":"সমুদ্রের","root":"يمم","lemma":"يَمّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41657,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَٱنظُرْ","transliteration":"fa-unẓur","translation_bn":"এখন দেখো","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41658,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَيْفَ","transliteration":"kayfa","translation_bn":"কেমন","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":41659,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হয়েছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41660,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","translation_bn":"পরিণাম","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَٰقِبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41661,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদের","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41662,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٤٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪০)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-akhadhnāhu wajunūdahu fanabadhnāhum fī l-yami fa-unẓur kayfa kāna ʿāqibatu l-ẓālimīna', 'কাজেই আমি তাকে ও তার বাহিনীকে পাকড়াও করলাম, অতঃপর তাদেরকে সমুদ্রে নিক্ষেপ করলাম। এখন দেখ, যালিমদের পরিণতি কী হয়েছিল।', 'So We took him and his soldiers and threw them into the sea. So see how was the end of the wrongdoers.', 'কাজেই আমি তাকে ও তার বাহিনীকে পাকড়াও করলাম, অতঃপর তাদেরকে সমুদ্রে নিক্ষেপ করলাম। এখন দেখ, যালিমদের পরিণতি কী হয়েছিল।', 'So We took him and his soldiers and threw them into the sea. So see how was the end of the wrongdoers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028040.mp3', now()),
  (28, 41, '', '[{"id":42471,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"wajaʿalnāhum","translation_bn":"আমরা বানিয়েছিলাম তাদেরকে","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42472,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَئِمَّةًۭ","transliteration":"a-immatan","translation_bn":"নেতৃবৃন্দ (অথচ)","root":"امم","lemma":"إِمَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42473,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَدْعُونَ","transliteration":"yadʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা ডাকে (লোকদেরকে)","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42474,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42475,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামের","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42477,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"এবং দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42478,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42479,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":42480,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُنصَرُونَ","transliteration":"yunṣarūna","translation_bn":"তাদের সাহায্য করা হবে","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42481,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٤١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪১)","root":"—","lemma":"٤١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wajaʿalnāhum a-immatan yadʿūna ilā l-nāri wayawma l-qiyāmati lā yunṣarūna', 'আমি তাদেরকে নেতা করেছিলাম। তারা জাহান্নামের দিকে আহবান করত, ক্বিয়ামতের দিন তারা সাহায্যপ্রাপ্ত হবে না।', 'And We made them leaders inviting to the Fire, and on the Day of Resurrection they will not be helped.', 'আমি তাদেরকে নেতা করেছিলাম। তারা জাহান্নামের দিকে আহবান করত, ক্বিয়ামতের দিন তারা সাহায্যপ্রাপ্ত হবে না।', 'And We made them leaders inviting to the Fire, and on the Day of Resurrection they will not be helped.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028041.mp3', now()),
  (28, 42, '', '[{"id":43159,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَتْبَعْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"wa-atbaʿnāhum","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা লাগিয়ে দিয়েছি পিছনে তাদের","root":"تبع","lemma":"أَتْبَعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43160,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43161,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذِهِ","transliteration":"hādhihi","translation_bn":"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":43162,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"দুনিয়ার","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43163,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَعْنَةًۭ ۖ","transliteration":"laʿnatan","translation_bn":"অভিশাপ","root":"لعن","lemma":"لَعْنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43165,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"এবং দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43166,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43167,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هُم","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা (হবে)","root":"—","lemma":"هُم","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":43168,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43169,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَقْبُوحِينَ","transliteration":"l-maqbūḥīna","translation_bn":"ঘৃণিতদের","root":"قبح","lemma":"مَقْبُوحِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43170,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٤٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪২)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-atbaʿnāhum fī hādhihi l-dun''yā laʿnatan wayawma l-qiyāmati hum mina l-maqbūḥīna', 'এ পৃথিবীতে তাদের পেছনে আমি লাগিয়ে দিয়েছি অভিসম্পাত আর ক্বিয়ামতের দিন তারা হবে দুর্দশাগ্রস্ত', 'And We caused to overtake them in this world a curse, and on the Day of Resurrection they will be of the despised.', 'এ পৃথিবীতে তাদের পেছনে আমি লাগিয়ে দিয়েছি অভিসম্পাত আর ক্বিয়ামতের দিন তারা হবে দুর্দশাগ্রস্ত', 'And We caused to overtake them in this world a curse, and on the Day of Resurrection they will be of the despised.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028042.mp3', now()),
  (28, 43, '', '[{"id":43859,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43860,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْنَا","transliteration":"ātaynā","translation_bn":"আমরা দিয়েছি","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43861,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَى","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":43862,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","transliteration":"l-kitāba","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43863,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43864,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِ","transliteration":"baʿdi","translation_bn":"পর","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43865,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":43866,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلَكْنَا","transliteration":"ahlaknā","translation_bn":"ধ্বংস করে দিয়েছি আমরা","root":"هلك","lemma":"أَهْلَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43867,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرُونَ","transliteration":"l-qurūna","translation_bn":"বহুমানবগোষ্ঠীকে","root":"قرن","lemma":"قَرْن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43868,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأُولَىٰ","transliteration":"l-ūlā","translation_bn":"পুর্ববর্তী","root":"اول","lemma":"أَوَّل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43869,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَصَآئِرَ","transliteration":"baṣāira","translation_bn":"জ্ঞান-বর্তিকাস্বরুপ","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِيرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43870,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","translation_bn":"জন্যে মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43871,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَهُدًۭى","transliteration":"wahudan","translation_bn":"এবং পথ নির্দেশ","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43872,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَرَحْمَةًۭ","transliteration":"waraḥmatan","translation_bn":"ও দয়া হিসেবে","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43873,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَّعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"যাতে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":43874,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَتَذَكَّرُونَ","transliteration":"yatadhakkarūna","translation_bn":"শিক্ষাগ্রহণ করে","root":"ذكر","lemma":"تَذَكَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43875,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٤٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad ātaynā mūsā l-kitāba min baʿdi mā ahlaknā l-qurūna l-ūlā baṣāira lilnnāsi wahudan waraḥmatan laʿallahum yatadhakkarūna', 'আমি পূর্ববর্তী অনেক মানব গোষ্ঠীকে ধ্বংস করার পর মূসাকে কিতাব দিয়েছিলাম- মানুষের জন্য আলোকবর্তিকা, সত্যপথের নির্দেশ ও রহমতস্বরূপ যাতে তারা উপদেশ গ্রহণ করে।', 'And We gave Moses the Scripture, after We had destroyed the former generations, as enlightenment for the people and guidance and mercy that they might be reminded.', 'আমি পূর্ববর্তী অনেক মানব গোষ্ঠীকে ধ্বংস করার পর মূসাকে কিতাব দিয়েছিলাম- মানুষের জন্য আলোকবর্তিকা, সত্যপথের নির্দেশ ও রহমতস্বরূপ যাতে তারা উপদেশ গ্রহণ করে।', 'And We gave Moses the Scripture, after We had destroyed the former generations, as enlightenment for the people and guidance and mercy that they might be reminded.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028043.mp3', now()),
  (28, 44, '', '[{"id":44658,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর (হে নাবী) না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44659,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كُنتَ","transliteration":"kunta","translation_bn":"তুমি ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44660,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِجَانِبِ","transliteration":"bijānibi","translation_bn":"পাশে","root":"جنب","lemma":"جَانِب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44661,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَرْبِىِّ","transliteration":"l-gharbiyi","translation_bn":"(তুর পাহাড়ের)পশ্চিম","root":"غرب","lemma":"غَرْبِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44662,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":44663,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَضَيْنَآ","transliteration":"qaḍaynā","translation_bn":"দান করেছিলাম আমরা","root":"قضي","lemma":"قَضَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44664,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44665,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَى","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসার","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":44666,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَمْرَ","transliteration":"l-amra","translation_bn":"বিধান","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44667,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44668,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كُنتَ","transliteration":"kunta","translation_bn":"তুমি ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44669,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44670,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّـٰهِدِينَ","transliteration":"l-shāhidīna","translation_bn":"প্রত্যক্ষদর্শীদের","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَاهِد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44671,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٤٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā kunta bijānibi l-gharbiyi idh qaḍaynā ilā mūsā l-amra wamā kunta mina l-shāhidīna', 'মূসাকে যখন আমি নির্দেশনামা দিয়েছিলাম তখন তুমি (তূওয়া উপত্যকার) পশ্চিম প্রান্তে ছিলে না, আর ছিলে না তুমি প্রত্যক্ষদর্শী।', 'And you, [O Muhammad], were not on the western side [of the mount] when We revealed to Moses the command, and you were not among the witnesses [to that].', 'মূসাকে যখন আমি নির্দেশনামা দিয়েছিলাম তখন তুমি (তূওয়া উপত্যকার) পশ্চিম প্রান্তে ছিলে না, আর ছিলে না তুমি প্রত্যক্ষদর্শী।', 'And you, [O Muhammad], were not on the western side [of the mount] when We revealed to Moses the command, and you were not among the witnesses [to that].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028044.mp3', now()),
  (28, 45, '', '[{"id":45334,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّآ","transliteration":"walākinnā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45335,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنشَأْنَا","transliteration":"anshanā","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছি আমরা","root":"نشا","lemma":"أَنشَأَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45336,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قُرُونًۭا","transliteration":"qurūnan","translation_bn":"বহু মানবগোষ্ঠী","root":"قرن","lemma":"قَرْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45337,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَتَطَاوَلَ","transliteration":"fataṭāwala","translation_bn":"অতঃপর দীর্ঘায়িত হয়েছে","root":"طول","lemma":"تَطَاوَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45338,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمُ","transliteration":"ʿalayhimu","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45339,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعُمُرُ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ʿumuru","translation_bn":"(বহু) যুগ","root":"عمر","lemma":"عُمُر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45341,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45342,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كُنتَ","transliteration":"kunta","translation_bn":"তুমি ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45343,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ثَاوِيًۭا","transliteration":"thāwiyan","translation_bn":"বিদ্যমান","root":"ثوي","lemma":"ثَاوِي","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45344,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45345,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلِ","transliteration":"ahli","translation_bn":"বাসীদের","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45346,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَدْيَنَ","transliteration":"madyana","translation_bn":"মাদয়ান","root":"—","lemma":"مَدْيَن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":45347,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَتْلُوا۟","transliteration":"tatlū","translation_bn":"তুমি তিলাওয়াত করো (যেন)","root":"تلو","lemma":"تَلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45348,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"কাছে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45349,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"āyātinā","translation_bn":"আয়াতসমূহ আমাদের","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45350,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّا","transliteration":"walākinnā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45351,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كُنَّا","transliteration":"kunnā","translation_bn":"আমরা ছিলাম","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45352,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مُرْسِلِينَ","transliteration":"mur''silīna","translation_bn":"(রাসূল) প্রেরণকারী","root":"رسل","lemma":"مُرْسِل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45353,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٤٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walākinnā anshanā qurūnan fataṭāwala ʿalayhimu l-ʿumuru wamā kunta thāwiyan fī ahli madyana tatlū ʿalayhim āyātinā walākinnā kunnā mur''silīna', 'কিন্তু আমি অনেক মানবগোষ্ঠী সৃষ্টি করেছিলাম, অতঃপর তাদের অনেক যুগ গত হয়ে গেছে। তুমি মাদইয়ানবাসীদের মধ্যে বিদ্যমান ছিলে না তাদের কাছে আমার আয়াত আবৃত্তি করার জন্য, কিন্তু (তাদের মাঝে) রসূল প্রেরণকারী আমিই ছিলাম।', 'But We produced [many] generations [after Moses], and prolonged was their duration. And you were not a resident among the people of Madyan, reciting to them Our verses, but We were senders [of this message].', 'কিন্তু আমি অনেক মানবগোষ্ঠী সৃষ্টি করেছিলাম, অতঃপর তাদের অনেক যুগ গত হয়ে গেছে। তুমি মাদইয়ানবাসীদের মধ্যে বিদ্যমান ছিলে না তাদের কাছে আমার আয়াত আবৃত্তি করার জন্য, কিন্তু (তাদের মাঝে) রসূল প্রেরণকারী আমিই ছিলাম।', 'But We produced [many] generations [after Moses], and prolonged was their duration. And you were not a resident among the people of Madyan, reciting to them Our verses, but We were senders [of this message].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028045.mp3', now()),
  (28, 46, '', '[{"id":46074,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46075,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كُنتَ","transliteration":"kunta","translation_bn":"তুমি ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46076,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِجَانِبِ","transliteration":"bijānibi","translation_bn":"পাশে","root":"جنب","lemma":"جَانِب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46077,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلطُّورِ","transliteration":"l-ṭūri","translation_bn":"তুর পাহাড়ের","root":"طور","lemma":"طُور","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46078,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":46079,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نَادَيْنَا","transliteration":"nādaynā","translation_bn":"ডেকে ছিলাম আমরা","root":"ندو","lemma":"نَادَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46080,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِن","transliteration":"walākin","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46081,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَّحْمَةًۭ","transliteration":"raḥmatan","translation_bn":"এটা (অনুগ্রহ)","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46082,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46083,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46084,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لِتُنذِرَ","transliteration":"litundhira","translation_bn":"যেন তুমি সতর্ক করো","root":"نذر","lemma":"أَنذَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46085,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمًۭا","transliteration":"qawman","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়কে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46086,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَّآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":46087,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَتَىٰهُم","transliteration":"atāhum","translation_bn":"যাদের (নিকট) এসেছে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46088,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46089,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"نَّذِيرٍۢ","transliteration":"nadhīrin","translation_bn":"সতর্ককারী","root":"نذر","lemma":"نَذِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46090,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46091,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِكَ","transliteration":"qablika","translation_bn":"তোমার পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46092,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"যাতে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":46093,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"يَتَذَكَّرُونَ","transliteration":"yatadhakkarūna","translation_bn":"উপদেশ গ্রহণ করে","root":"ذكر","lemma":"تَذَكَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46094,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"٤٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā kunta bijānibi l-ṭūri idh nādaynā walākin raḥmatan min rabbika litundhira qawman mā atāhum min nadhīrin min qablika laʿallahum yatadhakkarūna', 'আমি যখন (মূসাকে) ডাক দিয়েছিলাম তখন তুমি তূর পর্বতের পাশে ছিলে না। কিন্তু (তোমাকে পাঠানো হয়েছে) তোমার প্রতিপালকের রহমতস্বরূপ যাতে তুমি এমন একটি সম্প্রদায়কে সতর্ক করতে পার যাদের কাছে তোমার পূর্বে সতর্ককারী পাঠানো হয়নি, যাতে তারা উপদেশ গ্রহণ করে।', 'And you were not at the side of the mount when We called [Moses] but [were sent] as a mercy from your Lord to warn a people to whom no warner had come before you that they might be reminded.', 'আমি যখন (মূসাকে) ডাক দিয়েছিলাম তখন তুমি তূর পর্বতের পাশে ছিলে না। কিন্তু (তোমাকে পাঠানো হয়েছে) তোমার প্রতিপালকের রহমতস্বরূপ যাতে তুমি এমন একটি সম্প্রদায়কে সতর্ক করতে পার যাদের কাছে তোমার পূর্বে সতর্ককারী পাঠানো হয়নি, যাতে তারা উপদেশ গ্রহণ করে।', 'And you were not at the side of the mount when We called [Moses] but [were sent] as a mercy from your Lord to warn a people to whom no warner had come before you that they might be reminded.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028046.mp3', now()),
  (28, 47, '', '[{"id":46976,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْلَآ","transliteration":"walawlā","translation_bn":"আর যদি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46977,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"(হতো) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":46978,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تُصِيبَهُم","transliteration":"tuṣībahum","translation_bn":"তাদের (উপর) পড়তো","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46979,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مُّصِيبَةٌۢ","transliteration":"muṣībatun","translation_bn":"কোনো বিপদ","root":"صوب","lemma":"مُّصِيبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46980,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46981,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَدَّمَتْ","transliteration":"qaddamat","translation_bn":"আগে পাঠিয়েছে","root":"قدم","lemma":"قَدَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46982,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَيْدِيهِمْ","transliteration":"aydīhim","translation_bn":"হাতগুলো তাদের","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46983,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَيَقُولُوا۟","transliteration":"fayaqūlū","translation_bn":"তখন তারা বলতো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46984,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّنَا","transliteration":"rabbanā","translation_bn":"\"হে আমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46985,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَوْلَآ","transliteration":"lawlā","translation_bn":"কেন না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"উৎসাহবাচক (Exhortation)"},{"id":46986,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْتَ","transliteration":"arsalta","translation_bn":"তুমি পাঠালে","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46987,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْنَا","transliteration":"ilaynā","translation_bn":"প্রতি আমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46988,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولًۭا","transliteration":"rasūlan","translation_bn":"কোনো রাসূলকে","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46989,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فَنَتَّبِعَ","transliteration":"fanattabiʿa","translation_bn":"তাহ''লে আমরা অনুসরণ করতাম","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":46990,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِكَ","transliteration":"āyātika","translation_bn":"তোমার আয়াতসমূহের","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46991,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَنَكُونَ","transliteration":"wanakūna","translation_bn":"এবং হতাম আমরা","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46992,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46993,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু''মিনদের\"","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46994,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٤٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walawlā an tuṣībahum muṣībatun bimā qaddamat aydīhim fayaqūlū rabbanā lawlā arsalta ilaynā rasūlan fanattabiʿa āyātika wanakūna mina l-mu''minīna', 'রসূল না পাঠালে তাদের কৃতকর্মের কারণে কোন বিপদ হলে তারা বলত- ‘হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! আমাদের কাছে রসূল পাঠালে না কেন, পাঠালে তোমার আয়াতসমূহের অনুসরণ করতাম আর আমরা মু’মিন হয়ে যেতাম।’', 'And if not that a disaster should strike them for what their hands put forth [of sins] and they would say, "Our Lord, why did You not send us a messenger so we could have followed Your verses and been among the believers?"...', 'রসূল না পাঠালে তাদের কৃতকর্মের কারণে কোন বিপদ হলে তারা বলত- ‘হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! আমাদের কাছে রসূল পাঠালে না কেন, পাঠালে তোমার আয়াতসমূহের অনুসরণ করতাম আর আমরা মু’মিন হয়ে যেতাম।’', 'And if not that a disaster should strike them for what their hands put forth [of sins] and they would say, "Our Lord, why did You not send us a messenger so we could have followed Your verses and been among the believers?"...', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028047.mp3', now()),
  (28, 48, '', '[{"id":47482,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47483,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَهُمُ","transliteration":"jāahumu","translation_bn":"আসলো তাদের (কাছে)","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47484,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقُّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","translation_bn":"সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47485,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47486,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عِندِنَا","transliteration":"ʿindinā","translation_bn":"নিকট আমাদের","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47487,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47488,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَوْلَآ","transliteration":"lawlā","translation_bn":"\"কেন না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"উৎসাহবাচক (Exhortation)"},{"id":47489,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أُوتِىَ","transliteration":"ūtiya","translation_bn":"তাকে দেয়া হয়েছে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47490,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِثْلَ","transliteration":"mith''la","translation_bn":"(তার) মতো","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47491,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":47492,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أُوتِىَ","transliteration":"ūtiya","translation_bn":"দেয়া হয়েছে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47493,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰٓ ۚ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসাকে\"","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":47495,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ","transliteration":"awalam","translation_bn":"কি নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":47496,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَكْفُرُوا۟","transliteration":"yakfurū","translation_bn":"তারা অস্বীকার করে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47497,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بِمَآ","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47498,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أُوتِىَ","transliteration":"ūtiya","translation_bn":"দেয়া হয়েছিলো","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47499,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":47500,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47501,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ ۖ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47503,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47504,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"سِحْرَانِ","transliteration":"siḥ''rāni","translation_bn":"\"(ক্বুর''আন ও তাওরাত) এ দু''টিই জ্দু","root":"سحر","lemma":"سِحْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47505,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"تَظَـٰهَرَا","transliteration":"taẓāharā","translation_bn":"পরস্পরে সমর্থন করে\"","root":"ظهر","lemma":"أَظْهَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47506,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"আরও তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47507,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":47508,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"بِكُلٍّۢ","transliteration":"bikullin","translation_bn":"প্রতি প্রত্যেকটির","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47509,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"كَـٰفِرُونَ","transliteration":"kāfirūna","translation_bn":"অস্বীকারকারী\"","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47510,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"٤٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā jāahumu l-ḥaqu min ʿindinā qālū lawlā ūtiya mith''la mā ūtiya mūsā awalam yakfurū bimā ūtiya mūsā min qablu qālū siḥ''rāni taẓāharā waqālū innā bikullin kāfirūna', 'অতঃপর আমার নিকট থেকে তাদের কাছে যখন সত্য আসল তখন তারা বলল- ‘মূসাকে যা দেয়া হয়েছিল তাকে কেন সেরূপ দেয়া হল না? ইতোপূর্বে মূসাকে যা দেয়া হয়েছিল তারা কি তা অস্বীকার করেনি?’ তারা বলেছিল- ‘দু’টোই যাদু, একটা আরেকটার সহায়তাকারী। আর তারা বলেছিল আমরা (তাওরাত ও কুরআন) সবই প্রত্যাখ্যান করি।’', 'But when the truth came to them from Us, they said, "Why was he not given like that which was given to Moses?" Did they not disbelieve in that which was given to Moses before? They said, "[They are but] two works of magic supporting each other, and indeed we are, in both, disbelievers."', 'অতঃপর আমার নিকট থেকে তাদের কাছে যখন সত্য আসল তখন তারা বলল- ‘মূসাকে যা দেয়া হয়েছিল তাকে কেন সেরূপ দেয়া হল না? ইতোপূর্বে মূসাকে যা দেয়া হয়েছিল তারা কি তা অস্বীকার করেনি?’ তারা বলেছিল- ‘দু’টোই যাদু, একটা আরেকটার সহায়তাকারী। আর তারা বলেছিল আমরা (তাওরাত ও কুরআন) সবই প্রত্যাখ্যান করি।’', 'But when the truth came to them from Us, they said, "Why was he not given like that which was given to Moses?" Did they not disbelieve in that which was given to Moses before? They said, "[They are but] two works of magic supporting each other, and indeed we are, in both, disbelievers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028048.mp3', now()),
  (28, 49, '', '[{"id":48185,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48186,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فَأْتُوا۟","transliteration":"fatū","translation_bn":"\"তাহ''লে তোমরা আসো","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48187,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِكِتَـٰبٍۢ","transliteration":"bikitābin","translation_bn":"নিয়ে কোন কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48188,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48189,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عِندِ","transliteration":"ʿindi","translation_bn":"নিকট","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48190,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":48191,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"(যেন) তা (হয়)","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":48192,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَهْدَىٰ","transliteration":"ahdā","translation_bn":"পথপ্রদর্শনে উৎকৃষ্টতর","root":"هدي","lemma":"أَهْدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48193,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمَآ","transliteration":"min''humā","translation_bn":"সে দু''টির চেয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48194,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَتَّبِعْهُ","transliteration":"attabiʿ''hu","translation_bn":"আমিই অনুসরণ করবো তা","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48195,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":48196,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা হও","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48197,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰدِقِينَ","transliteration":"ṣādiqīna","translation_bn":"সত্যবাদী\"","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَادِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48198,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul fatū bikitābin min ʿindi l-lahi huwa ahdā min''humā attabiʿ''hu in kuntum ṣādiqīna', 'বল, তোমরা যদি সত্যবাদী হও তবে আল্লাহর নিকট হতে এমন কিতাব নিয়ে এসো যা সত্যপথ নির্দেশ করার ব্যাপারে এ দু’ (কিতাব) হতে অধিক উৎকৃষ্ট, আমি সে কিতাবের অনুসরণ করব।', 'Say, "Then bring a scripture from Allah which is more guiding than either of them that I may follow it, if you should be truthful."', 'বল, তোমরা যদি সত্যবাদী হও তবে আল্লাহর নিকট হতে এমন কিতাব নিয়ে এসো যা সত্যপথ নির্দেশ করার ব্যাপারে এ দু’ (কিতাব) হতে অধিক উৎকৃষ্ট, আমি সে কিতাবের অনুসরণ করব।', 'Say, "Then bring a scripture from Allah which is more guiding than either of them that I may follow it, if you should be truthful."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028049.mp3', now()),
  (28, 50, '', '[{"id":48834,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَإِن","transliteration":"fa-in","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48835,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَّمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":48836,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَجِيبُوا۟","transliteration":"yastajībū","translation_bn":"তারা সাড়া দেয়","root":"جوب","lemma":"ٱسْتَجَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48837,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَكَ","transliteration":"laka","translation_bn":"প্রতি তোমার (ডাকে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَكَ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48838,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَٱعْلَمْ","transliteration":"fa-iʿ''lam","translation_bn":"তবে জেনে রাখো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48839,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّمَا","transliteration":"annamā","translation_bn":"কেবল","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":48840,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّبِعُونَ","transliteration":"yattabiʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা অনুসরণ করছে","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48841,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَهْوَآءَهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"ahwāahum","translation_bn":"খেয়ালখুশিগুলোর তাদের","root":"هوي","lemma":"أَهْوَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48843,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَمَنْ","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"আর কে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48844,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَضَلُّ","transliteration":"aḍallu","translation_bn":"অধিক বিভ্রান্ত","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48845,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّنِ","transliteration":"mimmani","translation_bn":"(তার) চেয়ে যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48846,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّبَعَ","transliteration":"ittabaʿa","translation_bn":"অনুসরণ করে","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48847,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"هَوَىٰهُ","transliteration":"hawāhu","translation_bn":"খেয়ালখুশির তার","root":"هوي","lemma":"هَوَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48848,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"bighayri","translation_bn":"ঝাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48849,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"هُدًۭى","transliteration":"hudan","translation_bn":"কোনো পথনির্দেশ","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48850,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48851,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":48853,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":48854,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":48855,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":48856,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِى","transliteration":"yahdī","translation_bn":"সৎপথ দেখান","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48857,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمَ","transliteration":"l-qawma","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়কে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48858,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"(যারা)সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48859,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"٥٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫০)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-in lam yastajībū laka fa-iʿ''lam annamā yattabiʿūna ahwāahum waman aḍallu mimmani ittabaʿa hawāhu bighayri hudan mina l-lahi inna l-laha lā yahdī l-qawma l-ẓālimīna', 'অতঃপর তারা যদি তোমার কথায় সাড়া না দেয় তাহলে জেনে রেখ, তারা শুধু তাদের প্রবৃত্তির অনুসরণ করে। আল্লাহর পথ নির্দেশ ছাড়াই যে নিজের প্রবৃত্তির অনুসরণ করে, তার চেয়ে অধিক পথভ্রষ্ট আর কে আছে? আল্লাহ যালিম সম্প্রদায়কে সঠিক পথে পরিচালিত করেন না।', 'But if they do not respond to you - then know that they only follow their [own] desires. And who is more astray than one who follows his desire without guidance from Allah? Indeed, Allah does not guide the wrongdoing people.', 'অতঃপর তারা যদি তোমার কথায় সাড়া না দেয় তাহলে জেনে রেখ, তারা শুধু তাদের প্রবৃত্তির অনুসরণ করে। আল্লাহর পথ নির্দেশ ছাড়াই যে নিজের প্রবৃত্তির অনুসরণ করে, তার চেয়ে অধিক পথভ্রষ্ট আর কে আছে? আল্লাহ যালিম সম্প্রদায়কে সঠিক পথে পরিচালিত করেন না।', 'But if they do not respond to you - then know that they only follow their [own] desires. And who is more astray than one who follows his desire without guidance from Allah? Indeed, Allah does not guide the wrongdoing people.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028050.mp3', now()),
  (28, 51, '', '[{"id":49589,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49590,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَصَّلْنَا","transliteration":"waṣṣalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা বারবার পাঠিয়েছি","root":"وصل","lemma":"وَصَّلْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49591,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49592,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْلَ","transliteration":"l-qawla","translation_bn":"(হেদায়াতের) বাণী","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49593,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"যাতে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":49594,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَتَذَكَّرُونَ","transliteration":"yatadhakkarūna","translation_bn":"উপদেশ গ্রহন করে","root":"ذكر","lemma":"تَذَكَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49595,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٥١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫১)","root":"—","lemma":"٥١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad waṣṣalnā lahumu l-qawla laʿallahum yatadhakkarūna', 'আমি তাদের কাছে ক্রমাগত বাণী পৌঁছে দিয়েছি যাতে তারা উপদেশ গ্রহণ করে।', 'And We have [repeatedly] conveyed to them the Qur''an that they might be reminded.', 'আমি তাদের কাছে ক্রমাগত বাণী পৌঁছে দিয়েছি যাতে তারা উপদেশ গ্রহণ করে।', 'And We have [repeatedly] conveyed to them the Qur''an that they might be reminded.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028051.mp3', now()),
  (28, 52, '', '[{"id":50143,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা (অর্থাৎ আহলে কিতাবদেরকে)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":50144,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمُ","transliteration":"ātaynāhumu","translation_bn":"আমরা দান করেছি তাদেরকে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50145,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","transliteration":"l-kitāba","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50146,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50147,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِۦ","transliteration":"qablihi","translation_bn":"এর (অর্থাৎ কোরআনের) পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50148,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هُم","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُم","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":50149,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"উপর এর","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50150,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50151,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٥٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫২)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna ātaynāhumu l-kitāba min qablihi hum bihi yu''minūna', 'এর পূর্বে আমি যাদেরকে কিতাব দিয়েছিলাম তারা (অর্থাৎ তাদের কতক লোক) তাতে বিশ্বাস করে।', 'Those to whom We gave the Scripture before it - they are believers in it.', 'এর পূর্বে আমি যাদেরকে কিতাব দিয়েছিলাম তারা (অর্থাৎ তাদের কতক লোক) তাতে বিশ্বাস করে।', 'Those to whom We gave the Scripture before it - they are believers in it.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028052.mp3', now()),
  (28, 53, '', '[{"id":50683,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50684,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُتْلَىٰ","transliteration":"yut''lā","translation_bn":"তিলাওয়াত করা হয়","root":"تلو","lemma":"تَلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50685,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"নিকট তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50686,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50687,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنَّا","transliteration":"āmannā","translation_bn":"\"আমরা ঈমান এনেছি","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50688,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"উপর এর","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦٓ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50689,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":50690,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقُّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","translation_bn":"সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50691,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50692,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّنَآ","transliteration":"rabbinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50693,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":50694,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كُنَّا","transliteration":"kunnā","translation_bn":"ছিলাম","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50695,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50696,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِۦ","transliteration":"qablihi","translation_bn":"পূর্ব এর","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50697,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مُسْلِمِينَ","transliteration":"mus''limīna","translation_bn":"মুসলমান\"","root":"سلم","lemma":"مُسْلِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50698,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٥٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā yut''lā ʿalayhim qālū āmannā bihi innahu l-ḥaqu min rabbinā innā kunnā min qablihi mus''limīna', 'তাদের নিকট যখন তা আবৃত্তি করা হয় তখন তারা বলে- আমরা এতে বিশ্বাস করি, এ সত্য আমাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট থেকে (আগত), এর পূর্বেই আমরা আত্মসমর্পণকারী ছিলাম।', 'And when it is recited to them, they say, "We have believed in it; indeed, it is the truth from our Lord. Indeed we were, [even] before it, Muslims [submitting to Allah]."', 'তাদের নিকট যখন তা আবৃত্তি করা হয় তখন তারা বলে- আমরা এতে বিশ্বাস করি, এ সত্য আমাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট থেকে (আগত), এর পূর্বেই আমরা আত্মসমর্পণকারী ছিলাম।', 'And when it is recited to them, they say, "We have believed in it; indeed, it is the truth from our Lord. Indeed we were, [even] before it, Muslims [submitting to Allah]."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028053.mp3', now()),
  (28, 54, '', '[{"id":51349,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব (লোকদেরকে)","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":51350,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْتَوْنَ","transliteration":"yu''tawna","translation_bn":"দেয়া হবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51351,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرَهُم","transliteration":"ajrahum","translation_bn":"প্রতিফল তাদের","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51352,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَّرَّتَيْنِ","transliteration":"marratayni","translation_bn":"দু''বার","root":"مرر","lemma":"مَرَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51353,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51354,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"صَبَرُوا۟","transliteration":"ṣabarū","translation_bn":"তারা ধৈর্য ধরেছে","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51355,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَيَدْرَءُونَ","transliteration":"wayadraūna","translation_bn":"ও তারা প্রতিরোধ করে","root":"درا","lemma":"يَدْرَؤُا@","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51356,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْحَسَنَةِ","transliteration":"bil-ḥasanati","translation_bn":"দিয়ে ভালো","root":"حسن","lemma":"حَسَنَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51357,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّيِّئَةَ","transliteration":"l-sayi-ata","translation_bn":"মন্দকে","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَيِّئَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51358,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمِمَّا","transliteration":"wamimmā","translation_bn":"এবং (তা) হ''তে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51359,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"رَزَقْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"razaqnāhum","translation_bn":"আমরা জীবিকা দিয়েছি তাদেরকে","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51360,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يُنفِقُونَ","transliteration":"yunfiqūna","translation_bn":"তারা ব্যয় করে","root":"نفق","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51361,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٥٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ulāika yu''tawna ajrahum marratayni bimā ṣabarū wayadraūna bil-ḥasanati l-sayi-ata wamimmā razaqnāhum yunfiqūna', 'তাদেরকে তাদের পারিশ্রমিক দু’বার দেয়া হবে যেহেতু তারা ধৈর্য ধারণ করেছে এবং তারা ভাল দিয়ে মন্দের প্রতিহত করে আর আমি তাদেরকে যে রিযক দিয়েছি তাত্থেকে তারা ব্যয় করে।', 'Those will be given their reward twice for what they patiently endured and [because] they avert evil through good, and from what We have provided them they spend.', 'তাদেরকে তাদের পারিশ্রমিক দু’বার দেয়া হবে যেহেতু তারা ধৈর্য ধারণ করেছে এবং তারা ভাল দিয়ে মন্দের প্রতিহত করে আর আমি তাদেরকে যে রিযক দিয়েছি তাত্থেকে তারা ব্যয় করে।', 'Those will be given their reward twice for what they patiently endured and [because] they avert evil through good, and from what We have provided them they spend.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028054.mp3', now()),
  (28, 55, '', '[{"id":51868,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51869,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"سَمِعُوا۟","transliteration":"samiʿū","translation_bn":"তারা শুনে","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51870,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّغْوَ","transliteration":"l-laghwa","translation_bn":"অসার (উক্তি)","root":"لغو","lemma":"لَغْو","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51871,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَعْرَضُوا۟","transliteration":"aʿraḍū","translation_bn":"তারা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়","root":"عرض","lemma":"أَعْرَضَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51872,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُ","transliteration":"ʿanhu","translation_bn":"হ''তে তা","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51873,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51874,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَنَآ","transliteration":"lanā","translation_bn":"\"জন্যে (রয়েছে) আমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَنَآ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51875,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَـٰلُنَا","transliteration":"aʿmālunā","translation_bn":"কর্মসমূহ আমাদের","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51876,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلَكُمْ","transliteration":"walakum","translation_bn":"আর জন্যে (রয়েছে) তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51877,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَـٰلُكُمْ","transliteration":"aʿmālukum","translation_bn":"কর্মসমূহ তোমাদের","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51878,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"سَلَـٰمٌ","transliteration":"salāmun","translation_bn":"সালাম''","root":"سلم","lemma":"سَلَٰم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51879,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"উপর তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51880,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":51881,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"نَبْتَغِى","transliteration":"nabtaghī","translation_bn":"চাই আমরা","root":"بغي","lemma":"ٱبْتَغَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51882,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَـٰهِلِينَ","transliteration":"l-jāhilīna","translation_bn":"অজ্ঞদের (মতো পথ)\"","root":"جهل","lemma":"جَاهِل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51883,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٥٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā samiʿū l-laghwa aʿraḍū ʿanhu waqālū lanā aʿmālunā walakum aʿmālukum salāmun ʿalaykum lā nabtaghī l-jāhilīna', 'তারা যখন নিরর্থক কথাবার্তা শুনে তখন তাত্থেকে ফিরে থাকে আর বলে- আমাদের কাজের ফল আমরা পাব, তোমাদের কাজের ফল তোমরা পাবে, তোমাদের প্রতি সালাম, অজ্ঞদের সাথে আমাদের কোন প্রয়োজন নেই।', 'And when they hear ill speech, they turn away from it and say, "For us are our deeds, and for you are your deeds. Peace will be upon you; we seek not the ignorant."', 'তারা যখন নিরর্থক কথাবার্তা শুনে তখন তাত্থেকে ফিরে থাকে আর বলে- আমাদের কাজের ফল আমরা পাব, তোমাদের কাজের ফল তোমরা পাবে, তোমাদের প্রতি সালাম, অজ্ঞদের সাথে আমাদের কোন প্রয়োজন নেই।', 'And when they hear ill speech, they turn away from it and say, "For us are our deeds, and for you are your deeds. Peace will be upon you; we seek not the ignorant."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028055.mp3', now()),
  (28, 56, '', '[{"id":52395,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكَ","transliteration":"innaka","translation_bn":"(হে নাবী) তুমি নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":52396,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":52397,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَهْدِى","transliteration":"tahdī","translation_bn":"পথ দেখাতে পারো","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52398,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":52399,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَحْبَبْتَ","transliteration":"aḥbabta","translation_bn":"তুমি ভালবাসো","root":"حبب","lemma":"أَحْبَبْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52400,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","transliteration":"walākinna","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52401,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":52402,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِى","transliteration":"yahdī","translation_bn":"সৎপথ দেখান","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52403,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":52404,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ ۚ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52406,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52407,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"aʿlamu","translation_bn":"খুব জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"أَعْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52408,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْمُهْتَدِينَ","transliteration":"bil-muh''tadīna","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে সৎপথপ্রাপ্তদের","root":"هدي","lemma":"مُّهْتَدُون","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52409,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٥٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innaka lā tahdī man aḥbabta walākinna l-laha yahdī man yashāu wahuwa aʿlamu bil-muh''tadīna', 'তুমি যাকে ভালবাস তাকে সৎপথ দেখাতে পারবে না, বরং আল্লাহ্ই যাকে চান সৎ পথে পরিচালিত করেন, সৎপথপ্রাপ্তদের তিনি ভাল করেই জানেন।', 'Indeed, [O Muhammad], you do not guide whom you like, but Allah guides whom He wills. And He is most knowing of the [rightly] guided.', 'তুমি যাকে ভালবাস তাকে সৎপথ দেখাতে পারবে না, বরং আল্লাহ্ই যাকে চান সৎ পথে পরিচালিত করেন, সৎপথপ্রাপ্তদের তিনি ভাল করেই জানেন।', 'Indeed, [O Muhammad], you do not guide whom you like, but Allah guides whom He wills. And He is most knowing of the [rightly] guided.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028056.mp3', now()),
  (28, 57, '', '[{"id":52918,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52919,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"\"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":52920,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نَّتَّبِعِ","transliteration":"nattabiʿi","translation_bn":"আমরা অনুসরণ করি","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52921,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْهُدَىٰ","transliteration":"l-hudā","translation_bn":"সৎপথের","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52922,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَعَكَ","transliteration":"maʿaka","translation_bn":"তোমার সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":52923,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نُتَخَطَّفْ","transliteration":"nutakhaṭṭaf","translation_bn":"আমাদেরকে উৎখাত করা হবে","root":"خطف","lemma":"يَتَخَطَّفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52924,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52925,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَرْضِنَآ ۚ","transliteration":"arḍinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের দেশ\"","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52927,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ","transliteration":"awalam","translation_bn":"করি  নি কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":52928,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"نُمَكِّن","transliteration":"numakkin","translation_bn":"আমরা প্রতিষ্ঠা","root":"مكن","lemma":"مَكَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52929,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52930,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"حَرَمًا","transliteration":"ḥaraman","translation_bn":"হারাম","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52931,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ءَامِنًۭا","transliteration":"āminan","translation_bn":"শান্তিপূর্ণ","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":52932,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يُجْبَىٰٓ","transliteration":"yuj''bā","translation_bn":"আনা হয়","root":"جبي","lemma":"يُجْبَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52933,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"দিকে তার","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52934,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ثَمَرَٰتُ","transliteration":"thamarātu","translation_bn":"ফল-মূলসমূহ","root":"ثمر","lemma":"ثَمَرَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52935,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52936,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"রকমের","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52937,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"رِّزْقًۭا","transliteration":"riz''qan","translation_bn":"জীবনের উপকরণ হিসেবে","root":"رزق","lemma":"رِزْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52938,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52939,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"لَّدُنَّا","transliteration":"ladunnā","translation_bn":"আমাদের পক্ষ","root":"لدن","lemma":"لَّدُن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52940,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","transliteration":"walākinna","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52941,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرَهُمْ","transliteration":"aktharahum","translation_bn":"অধিকাংশই তাদের","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52942,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":52943,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"জানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52944,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٥٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqālū in nattabiʿi l-hudā maʿaka nutakhaṭṭaf min arḍinā awalam numakkin lahum ḥaraman āminan yuj''bā ilayhi thamarātu kulli shayin riz''qan min ladunnā walākinna aktharahum lā yaʿlamūna', 'তারা বলে- ‘আমরা যদি তোমার সাথে সৎপথের অনুসরণ করি তাহলে আমরা আমাদের দেশ থেকে উৎখাত হব।’ আমি কি তাদের জন্য এক নিরাপদ ‘হারাম’ প্রতিষ্ঠিত করিনি যেখানে সর্বপ্রকার ফলমূলের নজরানা আসে আমার পক্ষ থেকে রিযক স্বরূপ? কিন্তু তাদের অধিকাংশই তা জানে না।', 'And they say, "If we were to follow the guidance with you, we would be swept from our land." Have we not established for them a safe sanctuary to which are brought the fruits of all things as provision from Us? But most of them do not know.', 'তারা বলে- ‘আমরা যদি তোমার সাথে সৎপথের অনুসরণ করি তাহলে আমরা আমাদের দেশ থেকে উৎখাত হব।’ আমি কি তাদের জন্য এক নিরাপদ ‘হারাম’ প্রতিষ্ঠিত করিনি যেখানে সর্বপ্রকার ফলমূলের নজরানা আসে আমার পক্ষ থেকে রিযক স্বরূপ? কিন্তু তাদের অধিকাংশই তা জানে না।', 'And they say, "If we were to follow the guidance with you, we would be swept from our land." Have we not established for them a safe sanctuary to which are brought the fruits of all things as provision from Us? But most of them do not know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028057.mp3', now()),
  (28, 58, '', '[{"id":53445,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَمْ","transliteration":"wakam","translation_bn":"আর কতই না","root":"—","lemma":"كَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53446,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلَكْنَا","transliteration":"ahlaknā","translation_bn":"ধ্বংস করেছি আমরা","root":"هلك","lemma":"أَهْلَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53447,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53448,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَرْيَةٍۭ","transliteration":"qaryatin","translation_bn":"জনপদ","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53449,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بَطِرَتْ","transliteration":"baṭirat","translation_bn":"অহংকার করতো (তার অধিবাসীরা)","root":"بطر","lemma":"بَطِرَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53450,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَعِيشَتَهَا ۖ","transliteration":"maʿīshatahā","translation_bn":"তাদের জীবিকার","root":"عيش","lemma":"مَعِيشَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53452,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَتِلْكَ","transliteration":"fatil''ka","translation_bn":"অতঃপর ঐ","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53453,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَسَـٰكِنُهُمْ","transliteration":"masākinuhum","translation_bn":"ঘরবাড়িসমূহ তাদের","root":"سكن","lemma":"مَسْكَن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53454,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":53455,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"تُسْكَن","transliteration":"tus''kan","translation_bn":"বসবাস করে","root":"سكن","lemma":"سَكَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53456,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِّنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53457,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِهِمْ","transliteration":"baʿdihim","translation_bn":"পর তাদের","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53458,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":53459,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"قَلِيلًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"qalīlan","translation_bn":"অতি অল্প","root":"قلل","lemma":"قَلِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53461,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَكُنَّا","transliteration":"wakunnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা হলাম","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53462,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"نَحْنُ","transliteration":"naḥnu","translation_bn":"আমরাই","root":"—","lemma":"نَحْنُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":53463,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْوَٰرِثِينَ","transliteration":"l-wārithīna","translation_bn":"(এসবের) উত্তরাধিকারী","root":"ورث","lemma":"وَارِث","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53464,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٥٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakam ahlaknā min qaryatin baṭirat maʿīshatahā fatil''ka masākinuhum lam tus''kan min baʿdihim illā qalīlan wakunnā naḥnu l-wārithīna', 'আমি কত জনপদকে ধ্বংস করেছি যারা তাদের (ভোগবিলাসপূর্ণ) জীবনে চরম উৎকর্ষ সাধন করেছিল। এই তো তাদের বাসস্থান, তাদের পর এগুলোতে খুব অল্প লোকই বসবাস করেছে, অবশেষে আমিই মালিক রয়েছি।', 'And how many a city have We destroyed that was insolent in its [way of] living, and those are their dwellings which have not been inhabited after them except briefly. And it is We who were the inheritors.', 'আমি কত জনপদকে ধ্বংস করেছি যারা তাদের (ভোগবিলাসপূর্ণ) জীবনে চরম উৎকর্ষ সাধন করেছিল। এই তো তাদের বাসস্থান, তাদের পর এগুলোতে খুব অল্প লোকই বসবাস করেছে, অবশেষে আমিই মালিক রয়েছি।', 'And how many a city have We destroyed that was insolent in its [way of] living, and those are their dwellings which have not been inhabited after them except briefly. And it is We who were the inheritors.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028058.mp3', now()),
  (28, 59, '', '[{"id":53975,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53976,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53977,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكَ","transliteration":"rabbuka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53978,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مُهْلِكَ","transliteration":"muh''lika","translation_bn":"ধ্বংসকারী","root":"هلك","lemma":"مُهْلِك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53979,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرَىٰ","transliteration":"l-qurā","translation_bn":"জনবসতিগুলোকে","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53980,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"যতক্ষণ না","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53981,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَبْعَثَ","transliteration":"yabʿatha","translation_bn":"তিনি পাঠান","root":"بعث","lemma":"بَعَثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53982,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53983,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أُمِّهَا","transliteration":"ummihā","translation_bn":"তার কেন্দ্রস্থলের","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53984,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولًۭا","transliteration":"rasūlan","translation_bn":"কোনো রাসূলকে","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53985,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَتْلُوا۟","transliteration":"yatlū","translation_bn":"(যে)তিলাওয়াত করেন","root":"تلو","lemma":"تَلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53986,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"নিকট তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53987,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِنَا ۚ","transliteration":"āyātinā","translation_bn":"আয়াতসমূহকে আমাদের","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53989,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"ও না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53990,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كُنَّا","transliteration":"kunnā","translation_bn":"আমরা ছিলাম","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53991,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مُهْلِكِى","transliteration":"muh''likī","translation_bn":"ধ্বংসকারী","root":"هلك","lemma":"مُهْلِكِى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53992,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرَىٰٓ","transliteration":"l-qurā","translation_bn":"জনপদসমূহকে","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53993,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া যে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":53994,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَأَهْلُهَا","transliteration":"wa-ahluhā","translation_bn":"যখন তার অধিবাসীরা (ছিলো)","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":53995,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ظَـٰلِمُونَ","transliteration":"ẓālimūna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53996,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"٥٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā kāna rabbuka muh''lika l-qurā ḥattā yabʿatha fī ummihā rasūlan yatlū ʿalayhim āyātinā wamā kunnā muh''likī l-qurā illā wa-ahluhā ẓālimūna', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক কোন জনপদ ধ্বংস করেন না, যতক্ষণ না তিনি তার কেন্দ্রে রসূল প্রেরণ না করেন যে তাদের কাছে আমার আয়াতসমূহ আবৃত্তি করে; আমি কোন জনপদকে ধ্বংস করি না যতক্ষণ না তার বাসিন্দারা অত্যাচারী হয়।', 'And never would your Lord have destroyed the cities until He had sent to their mother a messenger reciting to them Our verses. And We would not destroy the cities except while their people were wrongdoers.', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক কোন জনপদ ধ্বংস করেন না, যতক্ষণ না তিনি তার কেন্দ্রে রসূল প্রেরণ না করেন যে তাদের কাছে আমার আয়াতসমূহ আবৃত্তি করে; আমি কোন জনপদকে ধ্বংস করি না যতক্ষণ না তার বাসিন্দারা অত্যাচারী হয়।', 'And never would your Lord have destroyed the cities until He had sent to their mother a messenger reciting to them Our verses. And We would not destroy the cities except while their people were wrongdoers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028059.mp3', now()),
  (28, 60, '', '[{"id":54641,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54642,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أُوتِيتُم","transliteration":"ūtītum","translation_bn":"দেয়া হয়েছে তোমাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54643,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54644,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"বস্তু","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54645,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَمَتَـٰعُ","transliteration":"famatāʿu","translation_bn":"তা হলো ভোগসামগ্রী","root":"متع","lemma":"مَتَٰع","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54646,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","translation_bn":"জীবনের","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54647,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"পার্থিব","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54648,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَزِينَتُهَا ۚ","transliteration":"wazīnatuhā","translation_bn":"ও তার চাকচিক্য (মাত্র)","root":"زين","lemma":"زِينَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54650,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর যা (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54651,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"নিকট","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":54652,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":54653,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"(তাই) উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":54654,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَأَبْقَىٰٓ ۚ","transliteration":"wa-abqā","translation_bn":"ও অধিক স্থায়ী","root":"بقي","lemma":"أَبْقَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54656,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَا","transliteration":"afalā","translation_bn":"কি তবে না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":54657,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تَعْقِلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿqilūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা বুঝবে","root":"عقل","lemma":"عَقَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54658,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٦٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬০)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā ūtītum min shayin famatāʿu l-ḥayati l-dun''yā wazīnatuhā wamā ʿinda l-lahi khayrun wa-abqā afalā taʿqilūna', 'তোমাদেরকে যে সব বস্তু দেয়া হয়েছে তা পার্থিব জীবনের ভোগ্যবস্তু ও তার শোভা মাত্র। আর আল্লাহর নিকট যা কিছু আছে তা সর্বশ্রেষ্ঠ ও চিরস্থায়ী, তবুও কি তোমরা বুঝবে না?', 'And whatever thing you [people] have been given - it is [only for] the enjoyment of worldly life and its adornment. And what is with Allah is better and more lasting; so will you not use reason?', 'তোমাদেরকে যে সব বস্তু দেয়া হয়েছে তা পার্থিব জীবনের ভোগ্যবস্তু ও তার শোভা মাত্র। আর আল্লাহর নিকট যা কিছু আছে তা সর্বশ্রেষ্ঠ ও চিরস্থায়ী, তবুও কি তোমরা বুঝবে না?', 'And whatever thing you [people] have been given - it is [only for] the enjoyment of worldly life and its adornment. And what is with Allah is better and more lasting; so will you not use reason?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028060.mp3', now()),
  (28, 61, '', '[{"id":55227,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَفَمَن","transliteration":"afaman","translation_bn":"কি তবে সে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":55228,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَعَدْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"waʿadnāhu","translation_bn":"আমরা প্রতিশ্রুতি দিয়েছি যাকে","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55229,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَعْدًا","transliteration":"waʿdan","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55230,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"حَسَنًۭا","transliteration":"ḥasanan","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"حسن","lemma":"حَسَن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":55231,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَهُوَ","transliteration":"fahuwa","translation_bn":"অতঃপর সে","root":"—","lemma":"فَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55232,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَـٰقِيهِ","transliteration":"lāqīhi","translation_bn":"লাভ করবে তা","root":"لقي","lemma":"لَٰقِي","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55233,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَمَن","transliteration":"kaman","translation_bn":"(সে কি) তার মতো","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55234,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَّتَّعْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"mattaʿnāhu","translation_bn":"আমরা ভোগ করতে দিয়েছি যাকে","root":"متع","lemma":"مَّتَّعْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55235,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَتَـٰعَ","transliteration":"matāʿa","translation_bn":"ভোগসামগ্রী","root":"متع","lemma":"مَتَٰع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55236,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","translation_bn":"জীবনের","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55237,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"পার্থিব","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55238,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55239,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"সে (হবে)","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":55240,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55241,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55242,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভূক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55243,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُحْضَرِينَ","transliteration":"l-muḥ''ḍarīna","translation_bn":"উপস্থিতদের (অপরাধীদের)","root":"حضر","lemma":"مُّحْضَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55244,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٦١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬১)","root":"—","lemma":"٦١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'afaman waʿadnāhu waʿdan ḥasanan fahuwa lāqīhi kaman mattaʿnāhu matāʿa l-ḥayati l-dun''yā thumma huwa yawma l-qiyāmati mina l-muḥ''ḍarīna', 'আমি যাকে ও‘য়াদা দিয়েছি, কল্যাণের ও‘য়াদা আর সেটা সে পাবেও, সে কি ঐ ব্যক্তির সমান যাকে আমি পার্থিব জীবনের ভোগ-সম্ভার দিয়েছি, অতঃপর ক্বিয়ামতের দিন তাকে হাজির করা হবে (অপরাধীরূপে)?', 'Then is he whom We have promised a good promise which he will obtain like he for whom We provided enjoyment of worldly life [but] then he is, on the Day of Resurrection, among those presented [for punishment in Hell]?', 'আমি যাকে ও‘য়াদা দিয়েছি, কল্যাণের ও‘য়াদা আর সেটা সে পাবেও, সে কি ঐ ব্যক্তির সমান যাকে আমি পার্থিব জীবনের ভোগ-সম্ভার দিয়েছি, অতঃপর ক্বিয়ামতের দিন তাকে হাজির করা হবে (অপরাধীরূপে)?', 'Then is he whom We have promised a good promise which he will obtain like he for whom We provided enjoyment of worldly life [but] then he is, on the Day of Resurrection, among those presented [for punishment in Hell]?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028061.mp3', now()),
  (28, 62, '', '[{"id":55761,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"এবং সেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55762,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُنَادِيهِمْ","transliteration":"yunādīhim","translation_bn":"তিনি ডাকবেন তাদেরকে","root":"ندو","lemma":"نَادَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55763,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَيَقُولُ","transliteration":"fayaqūlu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর বলবেন","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55764,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَيْنَ","transliteration":"ayna","translation_bn":"\"কোথায়","root":"—","lemma":"أَيْن\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":55765,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"شُرَكَآءِىَ","transliteration":"shurakāiya","translation_bn":"আমার শরিকেরা","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55766,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":55767,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55768,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَزْعُمُونَ","transliteration":"tazʿumūna","translation_bn":"ধারণা করতে (শরিক হিসেবে)\"","root":"زعم","lemma":"زَعَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55769,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٦٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬২)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayawma yunādīhim fayaqūlu ayna shurakāiya alladhīna kuntum tazʿumūna', 'সেদিন তাদেরকে ডাক দিয়ে তিনি বলবেন- ‘যাদেরকে তোমরা আমার শরীক গণ্য করতে তারা কোথায়?’', 'And [warn of] the Day He will call them and say, "Where are My ''partners'' which you used to claim?"', 'সেদিন তাদেরকে ডাক দিয়ে তিনি বলবেন- ‘যাদেরকে তোমরা আমার শরীক গণ্য করতে তারা কোথায়?’', 'And [warn of] the Day He will call them and say, "Where are My ''partners'' which you used to claim?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028062.mp3', now()),
  (28, 63, '', '[{"id":56325,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56326,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":56327,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"حَقَّ","transliteration":"ḥaqqa","translation_bn":"অবধারিত হয়েছে","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56328,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمُ","transliteration":"ʿalayhimu","translation_bn":"উপর যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56329,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْلُ","transliteration":"l-qawlu","translation_bn":"(এই) কথাটি","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56330,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّنَا","transliteration":"rabbanā","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56331,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","transliteration":"hāulāi","translation_bn":"এরাই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":56332,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারা) যাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":56333,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَغْوَيْنَآ","transliteration":"aghwaynā","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্ট করেছিলাম আমরা","root":"غوي","lemma":"أَغْوَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56334,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَغْوَيْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"aghwaynāhum","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্ট করেছিলাম আমরা তাদেরকে","root":"غوي","lemma":"أَغْوَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56335,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كَمَا","transliteration":"kamā","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56336,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"غَوَيْنَا ۖ","transliteration":"ghawaynā","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্ট হয়েছিলাম আমরা","root":"غوي","lemma":"غَوَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56338,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَبَرَّأْنَآ","transliteration":"tabarranā","translation_bn":"দায়মুক্ত বলে ঘোষণা করছি আমরা","root":"برا","lemma":"تَبَرَّأَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56339,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ ۖ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"আপনার কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56341,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":56342,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوٓا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56343,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِيَّانَا","transliteration":"iyyānā","translation_bn":"আমাদের\"","root":"—","lemma":"إِيَّا","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":56344,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَعْبُدُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿbudūna","translation_bn":"ইবাদাত করতো\"","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56345,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٦٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla alladhīna ḥaqqa ʿalayhimu l-qawlu rabbanā hāulāi alladhīna aghwaynā aghwaynāhum kamā ghawaynā tabarranā ilayka mā kānū iyyānā yaʿbudūna', 'যাদের বিরুদ্ধে অভিযোগ প্রমাণিত হবে তারা বলবে- ‘হে আমাদের পালনকর্তা! ওদেরকে আমরা বিভ্রান্ত করেছিলাম, ওদেরকে বিভ্রান্ত করেছিলাম, যেমন আমরা নিজেরা বিভ্রান্ত হয়েছিলাম, আমরা তোমার কাছে দায়মুক্ত হচ্ছি (যে আমরা জোর ক’রে তাদেরকে বিভ্রান্ত করিনি)। এরা তো আমাদের ‘ইবাদাত করত না।', 'Those upon whom the word will have come into effect will say, "Our Lord, these are the ones we led to error. We led them to error just as we were in error. We declare our disassociation [from them] to You. They did not used to worship us."', 'যাদের বিরুদ্ধে অভিযোগ প্রমাণিত হবে তারা বলবে- ‘হে আমাদের পালনকর্তা! ওদেরকে আমরা বিভ্রান্ত করেছিলাম, ওদেরকে বিভ্রান্ত করেছিলাম, যেমন আমরা নিজেরা বিভ্রান্ত হয়েছিলাম, আমরা তোমার কাছে দায়মুক্ত হচ্ছি (যে আমরা জোর ক’রে তাদেরকে বিভ্রান্ত করিনি)। এরা তো আমাদের ‘ইবাদাত করত না।', 'Those upon whom the word will have come into effect will say, "Our Lord, these are the ones we led to error. We led them to error just as we were in error. We declare our disassociation [from them] to You. They did not used to worship us."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028063.mp3', now()),
  (28, 64, '', '[{"id":56806,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقِيلَ","transliteration":"waqīla","translation_bn":"এবং বলা হবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56807,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱدْعُوا۟","transliteration":"id''ʿū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা ডাকো","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56808,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"شُرَكَآءَكُمْ","transliteration":"shurakāakum","translation_bn":"শরিকদেরকে তোমাদের (বানানো)\"","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56809,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَدَعَوْهُمْ","transliteration":"fadaʿawhum","translation_bn":"তখন তারা ডাকবে তাদেরকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56810,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمْ","transliteration":"falam","translation_bn":"কিন্তু না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56811,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَجِيبُوا۟","transliteration":"yastajībū","translation_bn":"তারা ডাকে সাড়া দিবে","root":"جوب","lemma":"ٱسْتَجَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56812,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56813,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَرَأَوُا۟","transliteration":"wara-awū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা দেখবে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56814,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابَ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56816,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَوْ","transliteration":"law","translation_bn":"(হায়!) যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":56817,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"annahum","translation_bn":"(এমন হতো) যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":56818,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56819,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَهْتَدُونَ","transliteration":"yahtadūna","translation_bn":"সঠিকপথ পেতো","root":"هدي","lemma":"ٱهْتَدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56820,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٦٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqīla id''ʿū shurakāakum fadaʿawhum falam yastajībū lahum wara-awū l-ʿadhāba law annahum kānū yahtadūna', 'তাদেরকে বলা হবে, ‘তোমাদের দেবতাগুলোকে ডাক, তখন তারা তাদেরকে ডাকবে’। কিন্তু তারা তাদের ডাকে সাড়া দিবে না। তারা শাস্তি দেখতে পাবে (তাদের সামনে)। তারা যদি সৎপথপ্রাপ্ত হত!', 'And it will be said, "Invoke your ''partners'' " and they will invoke them; but they will not respond to them, and they will see the punishment. If only they had followed guidance!', 'তাদেরকে বলা হবে, ‘তোমাদের দেবতাগুলোকে ডাক, তখন তারা তাদেরকে ডাকবে’। কিন্তু তারা তাদের ডাকে সাড়া দিবে না। তারা শাস্তি দেখতে পাবে (তাদের সামনে)। তারা যদি সৎপথপ্রাপ্ত হত!', 'And it will be said, "Invoke your ''partners'' " and they will invoke them; but they will not respond to them, and they will see the punishment. If only they had followed guidance!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028064.mp3', now()),
  (28, 65, '', '[{"id":57322,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"এবং সেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57323,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُنَادِيهِمْ","transliteration":"yunādīhim","translation_bn":"তিনি ডাকবেন তাদেরকে","root":"ندو","lemma":"نَادَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57324,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَيَقُولُ","transliteration":"fayaqūlu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর বলবেন","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57325,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَاذَآ","transliteration":"mādhā","translation_bn":"\"কি","root":"—","lemma":"مَاذَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":57326,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَجَبْتُمُ","transliteration":"ajabtumu","translation_bn":"জবাব দিয়েছিলে তোমরা","root":"جوب","lemma":"أُجِيبَت","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57327,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ","transliteration":"l-mur''salīna","translation_bn":"রাসূলদেরকে\"","root":"رسل","lemma":"مُّرْسَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57328,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٦٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayawma yunādīhim fayaqūlu mādhā ajabtumu l-mur''salīna', 'আর সেদিন আল্লাহ তাদেরকে ডাক দিবেন এবং বলবেন- ‘তোমরা রসূলদেরকে কী জওয়াব দিয়েছিলে?’', 'And [mention] the Day He will call them and say, "What did you answer the messengers?"', 'আর সেদিন আল্লাহ তাদেরকে ডাক দিবেন এবং বলবেন- ‘তোমরা রসূলদেরকে কী জওয়াব দিয়েছিলে?’', 'And [mention] the Day He will call them and say, "What did you answer the messengers?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028065.mp3', now()),
  (28, 66, '', '[{"id":57838,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَعَمِيَتْ","transliteration":"faʿamiyat","translation_bn":"তখন বিলুপ্ত হবে","root":"عمي","lemma":"عَمِىَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57839,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمُ","transliteration":"ʿalayhimu","translation_bn":"থেকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57840,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنۢبَآءُ","transliteration":"l-anbāu","translation_bn":"তথ্যাদি","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَأ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57841,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","transliteration":"yawma-idhin","translation_bn":"সেদিন","root":"—","lemma":"يَوْمَئِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":57842,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَهُمْ","transliteration":"fahum","translation_bn":"তখন তারা","root":"—","lemma":"فَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57843,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":57844,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَتَسَآءَلُونَ","transliteration":"yatasāalūna","translation_bn":"পরস্পরকে জিজ্ঞেসও করতে পারবে","root":"سال","lemma":"يَتَسَا^ءَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57845,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٦٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'faʿamiyat ʿalayhimu l-anbāu yawma-idhin fahum lā yatasāalūna', 'সে দিন তাদের কথা বন্ধ হয়ে যাবে, অতঃপর পরস্পরকে জিজ্ঞাসাবাদও করতে পারবে না।', 'But the information will be unapparent to them that Day, so they will not [be able to] ask one another.', 'সে দিন তাদের কথা বন্ধ হয়ে যাবে, অতঃপর পরস্পরকে জিজ্ঞাসাবাদও করতে পারবে না।', 'But the information will be unapparent to them that Day, so they will not [be able to] ask one another.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028066.mp3', now()),
  (28, 67, '', '[{"id":58189,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَأَمَّا","transliteration":"fa-ammā","translation_bn":"তবে অবশ্য","root":"—","lemma":"أَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58190,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":58191,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَابَ","transliteration":"tāba","translation_bn":"তওবা করলো","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58192,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَءَامَنَ","transliteration":"waāmana","translation_bn":"ও ঈমান আনলো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58193,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلَ","transliteration":"waʿamila","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করলো","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58194,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58195,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَعَسَىٰٓ","transliteration":"faʿasā","translation_bn":"সেক্ষেত্রে আশা করা যায়","root":"عسي","lemma":"عَسَى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58196,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":58197,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَكُونَ","transliteration":"yakūna","translation_bn":"সে হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58198,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58199,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُفْلِحِينَ","transliteration":"l-muf''liḥīna","translation_bn":"সফলকামদের","root":"فلح","lemma":"مُفْلِحُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58200,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٦٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-ammā man tāba waāmana waʿamila ṣāliḥan faʿasā an yakūna mina l-muf''liḥīna', 'কিন্তু যে ব্যক্তি (তার জীবনে) তাওবাহ করেছিল আর ঈমান এনেছিল আর সৎকাজ করেছিল, আশা করা যায় সে সাফল্যমন্ডিতদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত হবে।', 'But as for one who had repented, believed, and done righteousness, it is promised by Allah that he will be among the successful.', 'কিন্তু যে ব্যক্তি (তার জীবনে) তাওবাহ করেছিল আর ঈমান এনেছিল আর সৎকাজ করেছিল, আশা করা যায় সে সাফল্যমন্ডিতদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত হবে।', 'But as for one who had repented, believed, and done righteousness, it is promised by Allah that he will be among the successful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028067.mp3', now()),
  (28, 68, '', '[{"id":58727,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَرَبُّكَ","transliteration":"warabbuka","translation_bn":"এবং তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58728,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَخْلُقُ","transliteration":"yakhluqu","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেন","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58729,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":58730,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি চান","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58731,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَيَخْتَارُ ۗ","transliteration":"wayakhtāru","translation_bn":"এবং মনোনীত করেন (নিজের কাজে যাকে চান)","root":"خير","lemma":"ٱخْتَارَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58733,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":58734,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"আছে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58735,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের(এ ব্যাপারে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58736,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخِيَرَةُ ۚ","transliteration":"l-khiyaratu","translation_bn":"বেছে নেয়ার স্বাধীনতা","root":"خير","lemma":"خِيَرَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58738,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"سُبْحَـٰنَ","transliteration":"sub''ḥāna","translation_bn":"পবিত্র মহান","root":"سبح","lemma":"سُبْحَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58739,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":58740,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَتَعَـٰلَىٰ","transliteration":"wataʿālā","translation_bn":"এবং বহু উর্দ্ধে","root":"علو","lemma":"تَعَٰلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58741,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَمَّا","transliteration":"ʿammā","translation_bn":"(তা) হ''তে যা","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58742,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يُشْرِكُونَ","transliteration":"yush''rikūna","translation_bn":"তারা শরিক করছে","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58743,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٦٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'warabbuka yakhluqu mā yashāu wayakhtāru mā kāna lahumu l-khiyaratu sub''ḥāna l-lahi wataʿālā ʿammā yush''rikūna', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক যা ইচ্ছে সৃষ্টি করেন আর যাকে ইচ্ছে মনোনীত করেন। এতে তাদের কোন এখতিয়ার নেই, আল্লাহ পবিত্র, মহান। তারা যাকে শরীক করে তাত্থেকে তিনি বহু ঊর্ধ্বে।', 'And your Lord creates what He wills and chooses; not for them was the choice. Exalted is Allah and high above what they associate with Him.', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক যা ইচ্ছে সৃষ্টি করেন আর যাকে ইচ্ছে মনোনীত করেন। এতে তাদের কোন এখতিয়ার নেই, আল্লাহ পবিত্র, মহান। তারা যাকে শরীক করে তাত্থেকে তিনি বহু ঊর্ধ্বে।', 'And your Lord creates what He wills and chooses; not for them was the choice. Exalted is Allah and high above what they associate with Him.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028068.mp3', now()),
  (28, 69, '', '[{"id":59111,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَرَبُّكَ","transliteration":"warabbuka","translation_bn":"এবং তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59112,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","translation_bn":"জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59113,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":59114,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تُكِنُّ","transliteration":"tukinnu","translation_bn":"লুকিয়ে রাখে","root":"كنن","lemma":"أَكْنَن","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59115,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"صُدُورُهُمْ","transliteration":"ṣudūruhum","translation_bn":"অন্তরসমূহ তাদের","root":"صدر","lemma":"صَدْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59116,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59117,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يُعْلِنُونَ","transliteration":"yuʿ''linūna","translation_bn":"তারা প্রকাশ করে","root":"علن","lemma":"أَعْلَن","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59118,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٦٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'warabbuka yaʿlamu mā tukinnu ṣudūruhum wamā yuʿ''linūna', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক জানেন তাদের অন্তর যা গোপন করে আর যা প্রকাশ করে।', 'And your Lord knows what their breasts conceal and what they declare.', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক জানেন তাদের অন্তর যা গোপন করে আর যা প্রকাশ করে।', 'And your Lord knows what their breasts conceal and what they declare.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028069.mp3', now()),
  (28, 70, '', '[{"id":59665,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59666,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":59667,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَآ","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":59668,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهَ","transliteration":"ilāha","translation_bn":"কোন ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59669,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":59670,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ ۖ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ ۖ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":59672,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَهُ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাঁরই","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59673,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَمْدُ","transliteration":"l-ḥamdu","translation_bn":"সব প্রশংসা","root":"حمد","lemma":"حَمْد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59674,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59675,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأُولَىٰ","transliteration":"l-ūlā","translation_bn":"দুনিয়ার","root":"اول","lemma":"أَوَّل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59676,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۖ","transliteration":"wal-ākhirati","translation_bn":"ও আখেরাতে","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59678,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهُ","transliteration":"walahu","translation_bn":"এবং জন্যে তাঁরই","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59679,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحُكْمُ","transliteration":"l-ḥuk''mu","translation_bn":"বিধান","root":"حكم","lemma":"حُكْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59680,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَإِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"wa-ilayhi","translation_bn":"এবং দিকে তাঁরই","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59681,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تُرْجَعُونَ","transliteration":"tur''jaʿūna","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাবর্তিত হবে তোমরা","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59682,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٧٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭০)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahuwa l-lahu lā ilāha illā huwa lahu l-ḥamdu fī l-ūlā wal-ākhirati walahu l-ḥuk''mu wa-ilayhi tur''jaʿūna', 'আর তিনিই আল্লাহ, তিনি ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ্ নেই, সমস্ত প্রশংসা তাঁরই- প্রথমেও আর শেষেও, বিধান তাঁরই, আর তোমাদেরকে তাঁর দিকেই ফিরিয়ে নেয়া হবে।', 'And He is Allah; there is no deity except Him. To Him is [due all] praise in the first [life] and the Hereafter. And His is the [final] decision, and to Him you will be returned.', 'আর তিনিই আল্লাহ, তিনি ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ্ নেই, সমস্ত প্রশংসা তাঁরই- প্রথমেও আর শেষেও, বিধান তাঁরই, আর তোমাদেরকে তাঁর দিকেই ফিরিয়ে নেয়া হবে।', 'And He is Allah; there is no deity except Him. To Him is [due all] praise in the first [life] and the Hereafter. And His is the [final] decision, and to Him you will be returned.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028070.mp3', now()),
  (28, 71, '', '[{"id":59977,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59978,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرَءَيْتُمْ","transliteration":"ara-aytum","translation_bn":"\"কি ভেবে দেখেছো তোমরা","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":59979,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":59980,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَ","transliteration":"jaʿala","translation_bn":"করে দেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59981,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":59982,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمُ","transliteration":"ʿalaykumu","translation_bn":"উপর তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59983,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلَ","transliteration":"al-layla","translation_bn":"রাতকে","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59984,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"سَرْمَدًا","transliteration":"sarmadan","translation_bn":"সুদীর্ঘ","root":"سرمد","lemma":"سَرْمَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59985,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"পর্যন্ত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59986,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمِ","transliteration":"yawmi","translation_bn":"দিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59987,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59988,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কে (এমন আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":59989,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهٌ","transliteration":"ilāhun","translation_bn":"ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59990,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرُ","transliteration":"ghayru","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59991,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ (যে)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":59992,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِيكُم","transliteration":"yatīkum","translation_bn":"কাছে আসবে তোমাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59993,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بِضِيَآءٍ ۖ","transliteration":"biḍiyāin","translation_bn":"নিয়ে আলো","root":"ضوا","lemma":"ضِيَا^ء","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59995,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَا","transliteration":"afalā","translation_bn":"কি তবুও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":59996,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"تَسْمَعُونَ","transliteration":"tasmaʿūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা শুনবে\"","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59997,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٧١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭১)","root":"—","lemma":"٧١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul ara-aytum in jaʿala l-lahu ʿalaykumu al-layla sarmadan ilā yawmi l-qiyāmati man ilāhun ghayru l-lahi yatīkum biḍiyāin afalā tasmaʿūna', 'তোমরা কি ভেবে দেখেছ আল্লাহ যদি তোমাদের উপর রাতকে ক্বিয়ামতের দিন পর্যন্ত স্থায়ী করতেন তাহলে আল্লাহ ছাড়া কোন ইলাহ্ আছে কি যে তোমাদেরকে আলো এনে দিত? তবুও কি তোমরা কর্ণপাত করবে না?', 'Say, "Have you considered: if Allah should make for you the night continuous until the Day of Resurrection, what deity other than Allah could bring you light? Then will you not hear?"', 'তোমরা কি ভেবে দেখেছ আল্লাহ যদি তোমাদের উপর রাতকে ক্বিয়ামতের দিন পর্যন্ত স্থায়ী করতেন তাহলে আল্লাহ ছাড়া কোন ইলাহ্ আছে কি যে তোমাদেরকে আলো এনে দিত? তবুও কি তোমরা কর্ণপাত করবে না?', 'Say, "Have you considered: if Allah should make for you the night continuous until the Day of Resurrection, what deity other than Allah could bring you light? Then will you not hear?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028071.mp3', now()),
