":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":60784,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهٌ","transliteration":"ilāhun","translation_bn":"ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60785,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرُ","transliteration":"ghayru","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60786,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":60787,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِيكُم","transliteration":"yatīkum","translation_bn":"কাছে আসবে তোমাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60788,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بِلَيْلٍۢ","transliteration":"bilaylin","translation_bn":"নিয়ে রাত","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60789,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"تَسْكُنُونَ","transliteration":"taskunūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা (যেন) শান্তি পেতে পারো","root":"سكن","lemma":"سَكَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60790,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ ۖ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60792,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَا","transliteration":"afalā","translation_bn":"কি তবুও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":60793,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"تُبْصِرُونَ","transliteration":"tub''ṣirūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা ভেবে দেখবে\"","root":"بصر","lemma":"أَبْصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60794,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"٧٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭২)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul ara-aytum in jaʿala l-lahu ʿalaykumu l-nahāra sarmadan ilā yawmi l-qiyāmati man ilāhun ghayru l-lahi yatīkum bilaylin taskunūna fīhi afalā tub''ṣirūna', 'তোমরা কি ভেবে দেখেছ আল্লাহ যদি তোমাদের উপর দিনকে ক্বিয়ামতের দিন পর্যন্ত স্থায়ী করতেন তাহলে আল্লাহ ছাড়া কোন ইলাহ্ আছে কি যে তোমাদের জন্য রাত্রি এনে দিত যাতে তোমরা আরাম করতে? তোমরা কি চিন্তা করে দেখবে না?', 'Say, "Have you considered: if Allah should make for you the day continuous until the Day of Resurrection, what deity other than Allah could bring you a night in which you may rest? Then will you not see?"', 'তোমরা কি ভেবে দেখেছ আল্লাহ যদি তোমাদের উপর দিনকে ক্বিয়ামতের দিন পর্যন্ত স্থায়ী করতেন তাহলে আল্লাহ ছাড়া কোন ইলাহ্ আছে কি যে তোমাদের জন্য রাত্রি এনে দিত যাতে তোমরা আরাম করতে? তোমরা কি চিন্তা করে দেখবে না?', 'Say, "Have you considered: if Allah should make for you the day continuous until the Day of Resurrection, what deity other than Allah could bring you a night in which you may rest? Then will you not see?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028072.mp3', now()),
  (28, 73, '', '[{"id":61067,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمِن","transliteration":"wamin","translation_bn":"আর হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61068,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَّحْمَتِهِۦ","transliteration":"raḥmatihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর দয়া","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61069,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَ","transliteration":"jaʿala","translation_bn":"তিনি সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61070,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمُ","transliteration":"lakumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61071,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلَ","transliteration":"al-layla","translation_bn":"রাতকে","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61072,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلنَّهَارَ","transliteration":"wal-nahāra","translation_bn":"ও দিনকে","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61073,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِتَسْكُنُوا۟","transliteration":"litaskunū","translation_bn":"যেন তোমরা শান্তি পাও","root":"سكن","lemma":"سَكَنَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61074,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61075,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلِتَبْتَغُوا۟","transliteration":"walitabtaghū","translation_bn":"এবং যেন তোমরা সন্ধান করো","root":"بغي","lemma":"ٱبْتَغَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61076,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61077,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلِهِۦ","transliteration":"faḍlihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর অনুগ্রহ","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61078,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَلَعَلَّكُمْ","transliteration":"walaʿallakum","translation_bn":"আর( এভাবেই) হয়তো তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61079,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَشْكُرُونَ","transliteration":"tashkurūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করবে","root":"شكر","lemma":"شَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61080,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٧٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamin raḥmatihi jaʿala lakumu al-layla wal-nahāra litaskunū fīhi walitabtaghū min faḍlihi walaʿallakum tashkurūna', 'তিনিই স্বীয় রহমতে তোমাদের জন্য রাত ও দিন করেছেন যাতে তোমরা তাতে আরাম করতে পার আর তাঁর অনুগ্রহ সন্ধান করতে পার এবং যাতে তোমরা কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ কর।', 'And out of His mercy He made for you the night and the day that you may rest therein and [by day] seek from His bounty and [that] perhaps you will be grateful.', 'তিনিই স্বীয় রহমতে তোমাদের জন্য রাত ও দিন করেছেন যাতে তোমরা তাতে আরাম করতে পার আর তাঁর অনুগ্রহ সন্ধান করতে পার এবং যাতে তোমরা কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ কর।', 'And out of His mercy He made for you the night and the day that you may rest therein and [by day] seek from His bounty and [that] perhaps you will be grateful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028073.mp3', now()),
  (28, 74, '', '[{"id":61488,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"আর সেদিন (কেমন হবে যখন)","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61489,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُنَادِيهِمْ","transliteration":"yunādīhim","translation_bn":"তিনি ডাকবেন তাদেরকে","root":"ندو","lemma":"نَادَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61490,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَيَقُولُ","transliteration":"fayaqūlu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর বলবেন","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61491,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَيْنَ","transliteration":"ayna","translation_bn":"\"কোথায়","root":"—","lemma":"أَيْن\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":61492,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"شُرَكَآءِىَ","transliteration":"shurakāiya","translation_bn":"(তোমাদের বানানো) আমার শরিকরা","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61493,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":61494,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে তোমরা ধারণা করতে শরিক হিসেবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61495,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَزْعُمُونَ","transliteration":"tazʿumūna","translation_bn":"\"","root":"زعم","lemma":"زَعَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61496,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٧٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayawma yunādīhim fayaqūlu ayna shurakāiya alladhīna kuntum tazʿumūna', 'সেদিন তিনি তাদেরকে ডাক দিবেন এবং বলবেন- ‘তোমরা যাদেরকে আমার শরীক মনে করতে তারা কোথায়?’', 'And [warn of] the Day He will call them and say, "Where are my ''partners'' which you used to claim?"', 'সেদিন তিনি তাদেরকে ডাক দিবেন এবং বলবেন- ‘তোমরা যাদেরকে আমার শরীক মনে করতে তারা কোথায়?’', 'And [warn of] the Day He will call them and say, "Where are my ''partners'' which you used to claim?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028074.mp3', now()),
  (28, 75, '', '[{"id":62072,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَنَزَعْنَا","transliteration":"wanazaʿnā","translation_bn":"বের করে আনবো আমরা","root":"نزع","lemma":"نَزَعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62073,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62074,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62075,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أُمَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"ummatin","translation_bn":"জাতি","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62076,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"شَهِيدًۭا","transliteration":"shahīdan","translation_bn":"একজন সাক্ষী","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":62077,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَقُلْنَا","transliteration":"faqul''nā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর আমরা বলবো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62078,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هَاتُوا۟","transliteration":"hātū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা উপস্হিত করো","root":"هات","lemma":"هَاتُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62079,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بُرْهَـٰنَكُمْ","transliteration":"bur''hānakum","translation_bn":"প্রমাণ তোমাদের\"","root":"برهن","lemma":"بُرْهَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62080,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَعَلِمُوٓا۟","transliteration":"faʿalimū","translation_bn":"তখন তারা জানবে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62081,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":62082,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقَّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqa","translation_bn":"প্রকৃত সত্য (এটাই যে)","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62083,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"(ইলাহ হওয়ার অধিকার) জন্যে আল্লাহরই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62084,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَضَلَّ","transliteration":"waḍalla","translation_bn":"এবং উধাও হয়ে যাবে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62085,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُم","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"হ''তে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62086,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":62087,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো তারা মিথ্যা","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62088,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يَفْتَرُونَ","transliteration":"yaftarūna","translation_bn":"রটনা করতো","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62089,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٧٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wanazaʿnā min kulli ummatin shahīdan faqul''nā hātū bur''hānakum faʿalimū anna l-ḥaqa lillahi waḍalla ʿanhum mā kānū yaftarūna', 'আমি প্রত্যেক সম্প্রদায় থেকে একজন সাক্ষী বের করে আনব, অতঃপর বলব- ‘তোমাদের (নির্দোষিতার পক্ষে) প্রমাণ হাজির কর। তখন তারা জানতে পারবে যে, ইলাহ হওয়ার অধিকার আল্লাহরই আর তারা যা উদ্ভাবন করত তা তাদের কাছ থেকে উধাও হয়ে যাবে।', 'And We will extract from every nation a witness and say, "Produce your proof," and they will know that the truth belongs to Allah, and lost from them is that which they used to invent.', 'আমি প্রত্যেক সম্প্রদায় থেকে একজন সাক্ষী বের করে আনব, অতঃপর বলব- ‘তোমাদের (নির্দোষিতার পক্ষে) প্রমাণ হাজির কর। তখন তারা জানতে পারবে যে, ইলাহ হওয়ার অধিকার আল্লাহরই আর তারা যা উদ্ভাবন করত তা তাদের কাছ থেকে উধাও হয়ে যাবে।', 'And We will extract from every nation a witness and say, "Produce your proof," and they will know that the truth belongs to Allah, and lost from them is that which they used to invent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/028075.mp3', now()),
