:"শব্দ"},{"id":28324,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"ও না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28325,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে (থাকবে)তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28326,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28327,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"نَّـٰصِرِينَ","transliteration":"nāṣirīna","translation_bn":"সাহায্যকারী\"","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَاصِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28328,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٢٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqāla innamā ittakhadhtum min dūni l-lahi awthānan mawaddata baynikum fī l-ḥayati l-dun''yā thumma yawma l-qiyāmati yakfuru baʿḍukum bibaʿḍin wayalʿanu baʿḍukum baʿḍan wamawākumu l-nāru wamā lakum min nāṣirīna', 'ইবরাহীম বলল- তোমরা আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে প্রতিমাগুলোকে (উপাস্যরূপে) গ্রহণ করেছ পার্থিব জীবনে তোমাদের পারস্পরিক ভালবাসা রক্ষার উদ্দেশ্যে। অতঃপর ক্বিয়ামতের দিন তোমাদের একে অপরকে অস্বীকার করবে আর একে অপরকে অভিশাপ দিবে, তোমাদের ঠিকানা হবে জাহান্নাম আর তোমাদের থাকবে না কোন সাহায্যকারী।', 'And [Abraham] said, "You have only taken, other than Allah, idols as [a bond of] affection among you in worldly life. Then on the Day of Resurrection you will deny one another and curse one another, and your refuge will be the Fire, and you will not have any helpers."', 'ইবরাহীম বলল- তোমরা আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে প্রতিমাগুলোকে (উপাস্যরূপে) গ্রহণ করেছ পার্থিব জীবনে তোমাদের পারস্পরিক ভালবাসা রক্ষার উদ্দেশ্যে। অতঃপর ক্বিয়ামতের দিন তোমাদের একে অপরকে অস্বীকার করবে আর একে অপরকে অভিশাপ দিবে, তোমাদের ঠিকানা হবে জাহান্নাম আর তোমাদের থাকবে না কোন সাহায্যকারী।', 'And [Abraham] said, "You have only taken, other than Allah, idols as [a bond of] affection among you in worldly life. Then on the Day of Resurrection you will deny one another and curse one another, and your refuge will be the Fire, and you will not have any helpers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/029025.mp3', now()),
  (29, 26, '', '[{"id":29227,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ فَـَٔامَنَ","transliteration":"faāmana","translation_bn":"তখন ঈমান আনলো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29228,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"প্রতি তাঁর","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29229,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لُوطٌۭ ۘ","transliteration":"lūṭun","translation_bn":"লূত","root":"—","lemma":"لُوط","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":29231,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالَ","transliteration":"waqāla","translation_bn":"এবং (ইবরাহীম) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29232,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّى","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":29233,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مُهَاجِرٌ","transliteration":"muhājirun","translation_bn":"হিজরতকারী","root":"هجر","lemma":"مُهَاجِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29234,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29235,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّىٓ ۖ","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29237,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":29238,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":29239,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَزِيزُ","transliteration":"l-ʿazīzu","translation_bn":"মহাপরাক্রমশালী","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29240,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَكِيمُ","transliteration":"l-ḥakīmu","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞাময়\"","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29241,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٢٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'faāmana lahu lūṭun waqāla innī muhājirun ilā rabbī innahu huwa l-ʿazīzu l-ḥakīmu', 'অতঃপর লূত তার (অর্থাৎ ইবরাহীমের) প্রতি ঈমান এনেছিল। ইবরাহীম বলল- আমি আমার পালনকর্তার উদ্দেশ্যে দেশ ত্যাগ করছি, তিনি মহাপরাক্রান্ত, বড়ই হিকমতওয়ালা।', 'And Lot believed him. [Abraham] said, "Indeed, I will emigrate to [the service of] my Lord. Indeed, He is the Exalted in Might, the Wise."', 'অতঃপর লূত তার (অর্থাৎ ইবরাহীমের) প্রতি ঈমান এনেছিল। ইবরাহীম বলল- আমি আমার পালনকর্তার উদ্দেশ্যে দেশ ত্যাগ করছি, তিনি মহাপরাক্রান্ত, বড়ই হিকমতওয়ালা।', 'And Lot believed him. [Abraham] said, "Indeed, I will emigrate to [the service of] my Lord. Indeed, He is the Exalted in Might, the Wise."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/029026.mp3', now()),
  (29, 27, '', '[{"id":30142,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَوَهَبْنَا","transliteration":"wawahabnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা দান করলাম","root":"وهب","lemma":"وَهَبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30143,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥٓ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥٓ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30144,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِسْحَـٰقَ","transliteration":"is''ḥāqa","translation_bn":"ইসহাককে","root":"—","lemma":"إِسْحَاق","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":30145,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَيَعْقُوبَ","transliteration":"wayaʿqūba","translation_bn":"ও ইয়াকুবকে","root":"—","lemma":"يَعْقُوب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30146,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلْنَا","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা স্হির করলাম","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30147,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30148,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ذُرِّيَّتِهِ","transliteration":"dhurriyyatihi","translation_bn":"বংশধরদের তার","root":"ذرر","lemma":"ذُرِّيَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30149,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنُّبُوَّةَ","transliteration":"l-nubuwata","translation_bn":"নবুয়্যত","root":"نبا","lemma":"نُّبُوَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30150,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","transliteration":"wal-kitāba","translation_bn":"ও  কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30151,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَءَاتَيْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"waātaynāhu","translation_bn":"এবং তাকে দিয়েছি","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30152,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرَهُۥ","transliteration":"ajrahu","translation_bn":"প্রতিফল তার","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30153,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30154,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا ۖ","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"দুনিয়ার","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30156,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"wa-innahu","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই সে (হবে)","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30157,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30158,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","translation_bn":"আখেরাতের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30159,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لَمِنَ","transliteration":"lamina","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":30160,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥīna","translation_bn":"সৎকর্মশীলদের","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30161,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wawahabnā lahu is''ḥāqa wayaʿqūba wajaʿalnā fī dhurriyyatihi l-nubuwata wal-kitāba waātaynāhu ajrahu fī l-dun''yā wa-innahu fī l-ākhirati lamina l-ṣāliḥīna', 'আমি তাকে দান করেছিলাম ইসহাক্ব ও ইয়া‘কুব, তার বংশধরদের জন্য স্থির করেছিলাম নবূওয়াত ও কিতাব, আর তাকে প্রতিদান দিয়েছিলাম দুনিয়াতে, এবং আখিরাতেও অবশ্যই সে সৎকর্মশীলদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত।', 'And We gave to Him Isaac and Jacob and placed in his descendants prophethood and scripture. And We gave him his reward in this world, and indeed, he is in the Hereafter among the righteous.', 'আমি তাকে দান করেছিলাম ইসহাক্ব ও ইয়া‘কুব, তার বংশধরদের জন্য স্থির করেছিলাম নবূওয়াত ও কিতাব, আর তাকে প্রতিদান দিয়েছিলাম দুনিয়াতে, এবং আখিরাতেও অবশ্যই সে সৎকর্মশীলদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত।', 'And We gave to Him Isaac and Jacob and placed in his descendants prophethood and scripture. And We gave him his reward in this world, and indeed, he is in the Hereafter among the righteous.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/029027.mp3', now()),
  (29, 28, '', '[{"id":31203,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلُوطًا","transliteration":"walūṭan","translation_bn":"এবং (স্মরণ করো) লূতের (ঘটনা হলো)","root":"—","lemma":"لُوط","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31204,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":31205,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31206,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِقَوْمِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"liqawmihi","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে তার জাতির","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31207,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكُمْ","transliteration":"innakum","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":31208,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَتَأْتُونَ","transliteration":"latatūna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তোমরা আছো (করছো)","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":31209,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَـٰحِشَةَ","transliteration":"l-fāḥishata","translation_bn":"(এমন)অশ্লীলকর্মে","root":"فحش","lemma":"فَٰحِشَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31210,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":31211,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"سَبَقَكُم","transliteration":"sabaqakum","translation_bn":"পূর্বে করেছে তোমাদের","root":"سبق","lemma":"سَبَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31212,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31213,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31214,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَحَدٍۢ","transliteration":"aḥadin","translation_bn":"একজন","root":"احد","lemma":"أَحَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31215,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31216,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ʿālamīna","translation_bn":"বিশ্ববাসীদের","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلَمِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31217,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walūṭan idh qāla liqawmihi innakum latatūna l-fāḥishata mā sabaqakum bihā min aḥadin mina l-ʿālamīna', 'স্মরণ কর লূতের কথা, যখন সে তার সম্প্রদায়কে বলেছিল- অবশ্যই তোমরা এমন এক অশ্লীল কাজ করছ যা তোমাদের পূর্বে বিশ্বজগতে কেউ করেনি।', 'And [mention] Lot, when he said to his people, "Indeed, you commit such immorality as no one has preceded you with from among the worlds.', 'স্মরণ কর লূতের কথা, যখন সে তার সম্প্রদায়কে বলেছিল- অবশ্যই তোমরা এমন এক অশ্লীল কাজ করছ যা তোমাদের পূর্বে বিশ্বজগতে কেউ করেনি।', 'And [mention] Lot, when he said to his people, "Indeed, you commit such immorality as no one has preceded you with from among the worlds.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/029028.mp3', now()),
  (29, 29, '', '[{"id":32180,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَئِنَّكُمْ","transliteration":"a-innakum","translation_bn":"কি নিশ্চয়ই তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":32181,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَتَأْتُونَ","transliteration":"latatūna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তোমরা আসো","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":32182,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرِّجَالَ","transliteration":"l-rijāla","translation_bn":"পুরুষদের (কাছে পুংমৈথুনের উদ্দেশ্যে)","root":"رجل","lemma":"رِجَال","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32183,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَتَقْطَعُونَ","transliteration":"wataqṭaʿūna","translation_bn":"ও তোমরা কাটছো","root":"قطع","lemma":"قُطِعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32184,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّبِيلَ","transliteration":"l-sabīla","translation_bn":"পথ (অর্থাৎ রাহাজানি করছো)","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32185,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَتَأْتُونَ","transliteration":"watatūna","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা আসো (করছো)","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32186,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32187,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"نَادِيكُمُ","transliteration":"nādīkumu","translation_bn":"বৈঠকসমূহের তোমাদের","root":"ندو","lemma":"نَادِي","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32188,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُنكَرَ ۖ","transliteration":"l-munkara","translation_bn":"ঘৃণ্যকর্ম\"","root":"نكر","lemma":"مُنكَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32190,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَمَا","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32191,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32192,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"جَوَابَ","transliteration":"jawāba","translation_bn":"জবাব","root":"جوب","lemma":"جَوَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32193,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"qawmihi","translation_bn":"জাতির তার","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32194,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّآ","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":32195,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":32196,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32197,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱئْتِنَا","transliteration":"i''tinā","translation_bn":"\"কাছে আসো আমাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32198,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"بِعَذَابِ","transliteration":"biʿadhābi","translation_bn":"নিয়ে শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32199,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":32200,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":32201,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"كُنتَ","transliteration":"kunta","translation_bn":"তুমি হয়ে থাকো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32202,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32203,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰدِقِينَ","transliteration":"l-ṣādiqīna","translation_bn":"সত্যবাদীদের\"","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَادِق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32204,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'a-innakum latatūna l-rijāla wataqṭaʿūna l-sabīla watatūna fī nādīkumu l-munkara famā kāna jawāba qawmihi illā an qālū i''tinā biʿadhābi l-lahi in kunta mina l-ṣādiqīna', 'তোমরা (কাম-তাড়িত হয়ে) পুরুষদের কাছে যাও, রাহাজানি কর এবং নিজেদের মজলিসে ঘৃণ্য কর্ম কর। তার সম্প্রদায়ের এ কথা বলা ছাড়া কোন জওয়াব ছিল না যে, তুমি সত্যবাদী হলে আমাদের উপর আল্লাহর ‘আযাব নিয়ে এসো।', 'Indeed, you approach men and obstruct the road and commit in your meetings [every] evil." And the answer of his people was not but they said, "Bring us the punishment of Allah, if you should be of the truthful."', 'তোমরা (কাম-তাড়িত হয়ে) পুরুষদের কাছে যাও, রাহাজানি কর এবং নিজেদের মজলিসে ঘৃণ্য কর্ম কর। তার সম্প্রদায়ের এ কথা বলা ছাড়া কোন জওয়াব ছিল না যে, তুমি সত্যবাদী হলে আমাদের উপর আল্লাহর ‘আযাব নিয়ে এসো।', 'Indeed, you approach men and obstruct the road and commit in your meetings [every] evil." And the answer of his people was not but they said, "Bring us the punishment of Allah, if you should be of the truthful."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/029029.mp3', now()),
  (29, 30, '', '[{"id":33028,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33029,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّ","transliteration":"rabbi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33030,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱنصُرْنِى","transliteration":"unṣur''nī","translation_bn":"আমাকে সাহায্য করো","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33031,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"বিরুদ্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33032,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمِ","transliteration":"l-qawmi","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়ের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33033,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُفْسِدِينَ","transliteration":"l-muf''sidīna","translation_bn":"বিপর্যয় সৃষ্টিকারী\"","root":"فسد","lemma":"مُفْسِد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33034,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٣٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩০)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla rabbi unṣur''nī ʿalā l-qawmi l-muf''sidīna', 'সে বলল- হে আমার প্রতিপালক! ফাসাদ সৃষ্টিকারী সম্প্রদায়ের বিরুদ্ধে আমাকে সাহায্য কর।', 'He said, "My Lord, support me against the corrupting people."', 'সে বলল- হে আমার প্রতিপালক! ফাসাদ সৃষ্টিকারী সম্প্রদায়ের বিরুদ্ধে আমাকে সাহায্য কর।', 'He said, "My Lord, support me against the corrupting people."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/029030.mp3', now()),
  (29, 31, '', '[{"id":33958,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمَّا","transliteration":"walammā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33959,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَتْ","transliteration":"jāat","translation_bn":"আসলো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33960,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رُسُلُنَآ","transliteration":"rusulunā","translation_bn":"দূতগণ আমাদের(ফেরেশতারা)","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33961,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","transliteration":"ib''rāhīma","translation_bn":"ইবরাহীমের (নিকট)","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":33962,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْبُشْرَىٰ","transliteration":"bil-bush''rā","translation_bn":"নিয়ে সুসংবাদ","root":"بشر","lemma":"بُشْرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33963,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33964,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":33965,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مُهْلِكُوٓا۟","transliteration":"muh''likū","translation_bn":"ধ্বংসকারী","root":"هلك","lemma":"مُهْلِك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33966,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلِ","transliteration":"ahli","translation_bn":"এই","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33967,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذِهِ","transliteration":"hādhihi","translation_bn":"অধিবাসীদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":33968,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَرْيَةِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-qaryati","translation_bn":"জনপদের","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33970,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":33971,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلَهَا","transliteration":"ahlahā","translation_bn":"অধিবাসীরা তার","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33972,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33973,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ظَـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী\"","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33974,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٣١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩১)","root":"—","lemma":"٣١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walammā jāat rusulunā ib''rāhīma bil-bush''rā qālū innā muh''likū ahli hādhihi l-qaryati inna ahlahā kānū ẓālimīna', 'যখন আমার দূতগণ (অর্থাৎ ফেরেশতারা) ইব্রাহীমের কাছে সুসংবাদ নিয়ে আসল, তারা বলল- আমরা এ জনপদের বাসিন্দাদের ধ্বংস করব, এর অধিবাসীরা তো যালিম।', 'And when Our messengers came to Abraham with the good tidings, they said, "Indeed, we will destroy the people of that Lot''s city. Indeed, its people have been wrongdoers."', 'যখন আমার দূতগণ (অর্থাৎ ফেরেশতারা) ইব্রাহীমের কাছে সুসংবাদ নিয়ে আসল, তারা বলল- আমরা এ জনপদের বাসিন্দাদের ধ্বংস করব, এর অধিবাসীরা তো যালিম।', 'And when Our messengers came to Abraham with the good tidings, they said, "Indeed, we will destroy the people of that Lot''s city. Indeed, its people have been wrongdoers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/029031.mp3', now()),
  (29, 32, '', '[{"id":34888,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(ইবরাহীম) বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34889,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":34890,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার(আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34891,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لُوطًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"lūṭan","translation_bn":"লুত\"","root":"—","lemma":"لُوط","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":34893,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34894,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نَحْنُ","transliteration":"naḥnu","translation_bn":"\"আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"نَحْنُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":34895,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"aʿlamu","translation_bn":"খুব জানি","root":"علم","lemma":"أَعْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34896,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِمَن","transliteration":"biman","translation_bn":"সে সম্পর্কে কারা","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34897,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا ۖ","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার(আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34899,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَنُنَجِّيَنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"lanunajjiyannahu","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই রক্ষা করবোই তাকে","root":"نجو","lemma":"نَجَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":34900,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَأَهْلَهُۥٓ","transliteration":"wa-ahlahu","translation_bn":"ও পরিবারকে তার","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34901,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":34902,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱمْرَأَتَهُۥ","transliteration":"im''ra-atahu","translation_bn":"স্ত্রীকে তার","root":"مرا","lemma":"ٱمْرَأَت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34903,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كَانَتْ","transliteration":"kānat","translation_bn":"সে ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34904,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34905,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَـٰبِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-ghābirīna","translation_bn":"পিছনে অবস্হানকারীদের","root":"غبر","lemma":"غَٰبِرِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34906,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla inna fīhā lūṭan qālū naḥnu aʿlamu biman fīhā lanunajjiyannahu wa-ahlahu illā im''ra-atahu kānat mina l-ghābirīna', 'ইবরাহীম বলল- ওখানে তো লূত আছে। তারা বলল- ওখানে কারা আছে আমরা তা ভাল করেই জানি, আমরা তাকে আর তার পরিবারবর্গকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই রক্ষা করব তার স্ত্রীকে ছাড়া, সে ধ্বংসপ্রাপ্তদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত।', '[Abraham] said, "Indeed, within it is Lot." They said, "We are more knowing of who is within it. We will surely save him and his family, except his wife. She is to be of those who remain behind."', 'ইবরাহীম বলল- ওখানে তো লূত আছে। তারা বলল- ওখানে কারা আছে আমরা তা ভাল করেই জানি, আমরা তাকে আর তার পরিবারবর্গকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই রক্ষা করব তার স্ত্রীকে ছাড়া, সে ধ্বংসপ্রাপ্তদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত।', '[Abraham] said, "Indeed, within it is Lot." They said, "We are more knowing of who is within it. We will surely save him and his family, except his wife. She is to be of those who remain behind."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/029032.mp3', now()),
  (29, 33, '', '[{"id":35684,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمَّآ","transliteration":"walammā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35685,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":35686,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَتْ","transliteration":"jāat","translation_bn":"আসলো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35687,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رُسُلُنَا","transliteration":"rusulunā","translation_bn":"দূতগণ আমাদের(ফেরেশতারা)","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35688,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لُوطًۭا","transliteration":"lūṭan","translation_bn":"লুতের (নিকট)","root":"—","lemma":"لُوط","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":35689,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سِىٓءَ","transliteration":"sīa","translation_bn":"সে বিষন্ন হলো","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35690,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِهِمْ","transliteration":"bihim","translation_bn":"কারণে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35691,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَضَاقَ","transliteration":"waḍāqa","translation_bn":"এবং সংকীর্ণ হলো","root":"ضيق","lemma":"ضَاقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35692,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِهِمْ","transliteration":"bihim","translation_bn":"কারণে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35693,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ذَرْعًۭا","transliteration":"dharʿan","translation_bn":"শক্তিতে (অর্থাৎ অসহায় হলো)","root":"ذرع","lemma":"ذَرْع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35694,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35695,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":35696,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَخَفْ","transliteration":"takhaf","translation_bn":"ভয় করো","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35697,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35698,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تَحْزَنْ ۖ","transliteration":"taḥzan","translation_bn":"দুশ্চিন্তা করো","root":"حزن","lemma":"يَحْزُن","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35700,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":35701,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مُنَجُّوكَ","transliteration":"munajjūka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে রক্ষাকারী","root":"نجو","lemma":"مُنَجُّو","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35702,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَأَهْلَكَ","transliteration":"wa-ahlaka","translation_bn":"ও তোমার পরিবারকে","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35703,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":35704,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱمْرَأَتَكَ","transliteration":"im''ra-ataka","translation_bn":"তোমার স্ত্রীকে","root":"مرا","lemma":"ٱمْرَأَت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35705,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"كَانَتْ","transliteration":"kānat","translation_bn":"সে ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35706,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35707,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَـٰبِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-ghābirīna","translation_bn":"পিছনে অবস্থানকারীদের","root":"غبر","lemma":"غَٰبِرِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35708,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"٣٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walammā an jāat rusulunā lūṭan sīa bihim waḍāqa bihim dharʿan waqālū lā takhaf walā taḥzan innā munajjūka wa-ahlaka illā im''ra-ataka kānat mina l-ghābirīna', 'আমার দূতরা যখন লূতের কাছে আসল তখন সে তাদের জন্য বিষণ্ণ হয়ে পড়ল এবং (তাদের রক্ষার ব্যাপারে) নিজেকে অসহায় মনে করল। তখন তারা বলল- তোমরা ভয় কর না, দুঃখ কর না, আমরা তোমাকে আর তোমার পরিবারবর্গকে রক্ষা করব তোমার স্ত্রীকে ছাড়া, সে ধ্বংসপ্রাপ্তদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত।', 'And when Our messengers came to Lot, he was distressed for them and felt for them great discomfort. They said, "Fear not, nor grieve. Indeed, we will save you and your family, except your wife; she is to be of those who remain behind.', 'আমার দূতরা যখন লূতের কাছে আসল তখন সে তাদের জন্য বিষণ্ণ হয়ে পড়ল এবং (তাদের রক্ষার ব্যাপারে) নিজেকে অসহায় মনে করল। তখন তারা বলল- তোমরা ভয় কর না, দুঃখ কর না, আমরা তোমাকে আর তোমার পরিবারবর্গকে রক্ষা করব তোমার স্ত্রীকে ছাড়া, সে ধ্বংসপ্রাপ্তদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত।', 'And when Our messengers came to Lot, he was distressed for them and felt for them great discomfort. They said, "Fear not, nor grieve. Indeed, we will save you and your family, except your wife; she is to be of those who remain behind.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/029033.mp3', now()),
  (29, 34, '', '[{"id":36642,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":36643,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مُنزِلُونَ","transliteration":"munzilūna","translation_bn":"অবতরণকারী","root":"نزل","lemma":"مُنزِلِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36644,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36645,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلِ","transliteration":"ahli","translation_bn":"অধিবাসীদের","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36646,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذِهِ","transliteration":"hādhihi","translation_bn":"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":36647,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَرْيَةِ","transliteration":"l-qaryati","translation_bn":"জনপদের","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36648,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رِجْزًۭا","transliteration":"rij''zan","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"رجز","lemma":"رِجْز","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36649,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36650,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","transliteration":"l-samāi","translation_bn":"আকাশ","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36651,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36652,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36653,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَفْسُقُونَ","transliteration":"yafsuqūna","translation_bn":"তারা পাপাচার করে\"","root":"فسق","lemma":"فَسَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36654,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innā munzilūna ʿalā ahli hādhihi l-qaryati rij''zan mina l-samāi bimā kānū yafsuqūna', 'আমরা এ জনপদের বাসিন্দাদের উপর আসমানী শাস্তি নাযিল করব, কারণ তারা ছিল পাপাচারে লিপ্ত।', 'Indeed, we will bring down on the people of this city punishment from the sky because they have been defiantly disobedient."', 'আমরা এ জনপদের বাসিন্দাদের উপর আসমানী শাস্তি নাযিল করব, কারণ তারা ছিল পাপাচারে লিপ্ত।', 'Indeed, we will bring down on the people of this city punishment from the sky because they have been defiantly disobedient."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/029034.mp3', now()),
  (29, 35, '', '[{"id":37508,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَد","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37509,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَّرَكْنَا","transliteration":"taraknā","translation_bn":"আমরা রেখে দিয়েছি","root":"ترك","lemma":"تَرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37510,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهَآ","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"হ:তে তা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37511,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَةًۢ","transliteration":"āyatan","translation_bn":"একটি নিদর্শন","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37512,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بَيِّنَةًۭ","transliteration":"bayyinatan","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":37513,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"liqawmin","translation_bn":"জন্যে সম্প্রদায়ের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37514,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَعْقِلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿqilūna","translation_bn":"(যারা)বিবেক কাজে লাগায়","root":"عقل","lemma":"عَقَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37515,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٣٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad taraknā min''hā āyatan bayyinatan liqawmin yaʿqilūna', 'এতে আমি জ্ঞানী সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য এক সুস্পষ্ট নিদর্শন রেখে দিয়েছি।', 'And We have certainly left of it a sign as clear evidence for a people who use reason.', 'এতে আমি জ্ঞানী সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য এক সুস্পষ্ট নিদর্শন রেখে দিয়েছি।', 'And We have certainly left of it a sign as clear evidence for a people who use reason.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/029035.mp3', now()),
  (29, 36, '', '[{"id":38381,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِلَىٰ","transliteration":"wa-ilā","translation_bn":"এবং প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38382,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَدْيَنَ","transliteration":"madyana","translation_bn":"মাদয়ানবাসীদের","root":"—","lemma":"مَدْيَن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":38383,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَخَاهُمْ","transliteration":"akhāhum","translation_bn":"ভাই তাদের","root":"اخو","lemma":"أَخ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38384,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"شُعَيْبًۭا","transliteration":"shuʿayban","translation_bn":"শুয়াইবকে (আমরা প্রেরণ করি)","root":"—","lemma":"شُعَيْب","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":38385,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَقَالَ","transliteration":"faqāla","translation_bn":"অতঃপর সে বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38386,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"yāqawmi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":38387,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱعْبُدُوا۟","transliteration":"uʿ''budū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ইবাদাত করো","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38388,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":38389,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَٱرْجُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-ir''jū","translation_bn":"ও (ভালো) আশা রাখো","root":"رجو","lemma":"يَرْجُوا@","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38390,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْيَوْمَ","transliteration":"l-yawma","translation_bn":"দিনের","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38391,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَ","transliteration":"l-ākhira","translation_bn":"শেষ","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38392,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38393,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَعْثَوْا۟","transliteration":"taʿthaw","translation_bn":"তোমরা বাড়াবাড়ি করো","root":"عثو","lemma":"تَعْثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38394,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38395,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38396,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مُفْسِدِينَ","transliteration":"muf''sidīna","translation_bn":"বিপর্যয় সৃষ্টিকারী হয়ে\"","root":"فسد","lemma":"مُفْسِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38397,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٣٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-ilā madyana akhāhum shuʿayban faqāla yāqawmi uʿ''budū l-laha wa-ir''jū l-yawma l-ākhira walā taʿthaw fī l-arḍi muf''sidīna', 'মাদইয়ানের বাসিন্দাদের কাছে আমি তাদের ভাই শু‘আয়বকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম। সে বলল- হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা আল্লাহর ‘ইবাদাত কর, শেষ দিবসকে ভয় কর, পৃথিবীতে ফাসাদ সৃষ্টি কর না।', 'And to Madyan [We sent] their brother Shu''ayb, and he said, "O my people, worship Allah and expect the Last Day and do not commit abuse on the earth, spreading corruption."', 'মাদইয়ানের বাসিন্দাদের কাছে আমি তাদের ভাই শু‘আয়বকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম। সে বলল- হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা আল্লাহর ‘ইবাদাত কর, শেষ দিবসকে ভয় কর, পৃথিবীতে ফাসাদ সৃষ্টি কর না।', 'And to Madyan [We sent] their brother Shu''ayb, and he said, "O my people, worship Allah and expect the Last Day and do not commit abuse on the earth, spreading corruption."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/029036.mp3', now()),
  (29, 37, '', '[{"id":39225,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَكَذَّبُوهُ","transliteration":"fakadhabūhu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তারা মিথ্যা সাব্যস্ত করলো তাকে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39226,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فَأَخَذَتْهُمُ","transliteration":"fa-akhadhathumu","translation_bn":"তখন গ্রাস করলো তাদেরকে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39227,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّجْفَةُ","transliteration":"l-rajfatu","translation_bn":"ভূমিকম্প","root":"رجف","lemma":"رَّجْفَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39228,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَأَصْبَحُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-aṣbaḥū","translation_bn":"ফলে তারা হয়ে গেলো","root":"صبح","lemma":"أَصْبَحَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39229,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39230,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"دَارِهِمْ","transliteration":"dārihim","translation_bn":"ঘরবাড়ির তাদের","root":"دور","lemma":"دَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39231,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"جَـٰثِمِينَ","transliteration":"jāthimīna","translation_bn":"নতজানু অবস্থায় (অর্থাৎ মরে পড়ে রইলো)","root":"جثم","lemma":"جَٰثِمِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39232,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٣٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fakadhabūhu fa-akhadhathumu l-rajfatu fa-aṣbaḥū fī dārihim jāthimīna', 'কিন্তু তারা তাকে মিথ্যে ব’লে অস্বীকার করল, অতঃপর মহা কম্পন তাদেরকে পাকড়াও করল আর তারা নিজেদের গৃহে উপুড় হয়ে শেষ হয়ে গেল।', 'But they denied him, so the earthquake seized them, and they became within their home [corpses] fallen prone.', 'কিন্তু তারা তাকে মিথ্যে ব’লে অস্বীকার করল, অতঃপর মহা কম্পন তাদেরকে পাকড়াও করল আর তারা নিজেদের গৃহে উপুড় হয়ে শেষ হয়ে গেল।', 'But they denied him, so the earthquake seized them, and they became within their home [corpses] fallen prone.', NULL, 