"},{"id":40040,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَصَدَّهُمْ","transliteration":"faṣaddahum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর বাঁধা দিয়েছিলো তাদেরকে","root":"صدد","lemma":"صَدَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40041,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَنِ","transliteration":"ʿani","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40042,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّبِيلِ","transliteration":"l-sabīli","translation_bn":"(সঠিক) পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40043,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانُوا۟","transliteration":"wakānū","translation_bn":"কিন্তু তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40044,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مُسْتَبْصِرِينَ","transliteration":"mus''tabṣirīna","translation_bn":"কাণ্ডজ্ঞানসম্পন্ন বিচক্ষণ","root":"بصر","lemma":"مُسْتَبْصِرِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40045,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٣٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waʿādan wathamūdā waqad tabayyana lakum min masākinihim wazayyana lahumu l-shayṭānu aʿmālahum faṣaddahum ʿani l-sabīli wakānū mus''tabṣirīna', '(স্মরণ কর) ‘আদ ও সামূদ (জাতির) কথা, তাদের বাড়ীঘর হতেই তাদের (করুণ পরিণতি) সম্পর্কে সুস্পষ্টরূপে তোমাদের জানা হয়ে গেছে। তাদের কাজগুলোকে শয়ত্বান তাদের দৃষ্টিতে মনোমুগ্ধকর করেছিল। যার ফলে সৎপথে চলতে তাদেরকে বাধা দিয়েছিল, যদিও তারা ছিল তীক্ষ্ণ দৃষ্টির অধিকারী।', 'And [We destroyed] ''Aad and Thamud, and it has become clear to you from their [ruined] dwellings. And Satan had made pleasing to them their deeds and averted them from the path, and they were endowed with perception.', '(স্মরণ কর) ‘আদ ও সামূদ (জাতির) কথা, তাদের বাড়ীঘর হতেই তাদের (করুণ পরিণতি) সম্পর্কে সুস্পষ্টরূপে তোমাদের জানা হয়ে গেছে। তাদের কাজগুলোকে শয়ত্বান তাদের দৃষ্টিতে মনোমুগ্ধকর করেছিল। যার ফলে সৎপথে চলতে তাদেরকে বাধা দিয়েছিল, যদিও তারা ছিল তীক্ষ্ণ দৃষ্টির অধিকারী।', 'And [We destroyed] ''Aad and Thamud, and it has become clear to you from their [ruined] dwellings. And Satan had made pleasing to them their deeds and averted them from the path, and they were endowed with perception.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/029038.mp3', now()),
  (29, 39, '', '[{"id":40652,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَـٰرُونَ","transliteration":"waqārūna","translation_bn":"এবং ক্বারুন","root":"—","lemma":"قَٰرُون","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40653,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَفِرْعَوْنَ","transliteration":"wafir''ʿawna","translation_bn":"ও ফিরআউন","root":"—","lemma":"فِرْعَوْن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40654,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَهَـٰمَـٰنَ ۖ","transliteration":"wahāmāna","translation_bn":"এবং হামানকেও (আমরা ধ্বংস করেছি)","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰمَٰن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40656,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40657,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَهُم","transliteration":"jāahum","translation_bn":"কাছে এসেছিলো তাদের","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40658,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مُّوسَىٰ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসা","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":40659,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ","transliteration":"bil-bayināti","translation_bn":"নিয়ে সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণাদি","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40660,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-is''takbarū","translation_bn":"তখন তারা দম্ভ করতো","root":"كبر","lemma":"ٱسْتَكْبَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40661,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40662,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"দেশের","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40663,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40664,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40665,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"سَـٰبِقِينَ","transliteration":"sābiqīna","translation_bn":"অগ্রগামী","root":"سبق","lemma":"سَابِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40666,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٣٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqārūna wafir''ʿawna wahāmāna walaqad jāahum mūsā bil-bayināti fa-is''takbarū fī l-arḍi wamā kānū sābiqīna', '(স্মরণ কর) কারূন, ফেরাউন ও হামানের কথা। মূসা তাদের কাছে সুস্পষ্ট নিদর্শন নিয়ে এসেছিল, অতঃপর তারা পৃথিবীতে অহংকার করল, কিন্তু তারা (আমাকে পেছনে ফেলে) আগে বেড়ে যেতে পারেনি।', 'And [We destroyed] Qarun and Pharaoh and Haman. And Moses had already come to them with clear evidences, and they were arrogant in the land, but they were not outrunners [of Our punishment].', '(স্মরণ কর) কারূন, ফেরাউন ও হামানের কথা। মূসা তাদের কাছে সুস্পষ্ট নিদর্শন নিয়ে এসেছিল, অতঃপর তারা পৃথিবীতে অহংকার করল, কিন্তু তারা (আমাকে পেছনে ফেলে) আগে বেড়ে যেতে পারেনি।', 'And [We destroyed] Qarun and Pharaoh and Haman. And Moses had already come to them with clear evidences, and they were arrogant in the land, but they were not outrunners [of Our punishment].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/029039.mp3', now()),
