ion_bn":"এরূপে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31243,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"نُفَصِّلُ","transliteration":"nufaṣṣilu","translation_bn":"আমরা বর্ণনা করি বিশদভাবে","root":"فصل","lemma":"فَصَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31244,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-āyāti","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনাবলী","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31245,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"لِقَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"liqawmin","translation_bn":"জন্যে সম্প্রদায়ের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31246,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"يَعْقِلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿqilūna","translation_bn":"(যারা) বুদ্ধি কাজে লাগায়","root":"عقل","lemma":"عَقَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31247,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ḍaraba lakum mathalan min anfusikum hal lakum min mā malakat aymānukum min shurakāa fī mā razaqnākum fa-antum fīhi sawāon takhāfūnahum kakhīfatikum anfusakum kadhālika nufaṣṣilu l-āyāti liqawmin yaʿqilūna', 'আল্লাহ তোমাদের জন্য তোমাদের মধ্য হতেই একটা দৃষ্টান্ত পেশ করছেনঃ আমি তোমাদেরকে যে রিযক দিয়েছি তাতে তোমাদের অধিকারভুক্ত দাসদাসীরা কি অংশীদার যার ফলে তাতে তোমরা সমান? তোমরা কি তাদেরকে তেমনভাবে ভয় কর যেমন ভয় কর তোমাদের নিজেদের পরস্পরকে? এভাবে বোধশক্তিসম্পন্ন মানুষদের জন্য আমি নিদর্শনাবলী বিস্তারিতভাবে ব্যাখ্যা করি।', 'He presents to you an example from yourselves. Do you have among those whom your right hands possess any partners in what We have provided for you so that you are equal therein [and] would fear them as your fear of one another [within a partnership]? Thus do We detail the verses for a people who use reason.', 'আল্লাহ তোমাদের জন্য তোমাদের মধ্য হতেই একটা দৃষ্টান্ত পেশ করছেনঃ আমি তোমাদেরকে যে রিযক দিয়েছি তাতে তোমাদের অধিকারভুক্ত দাসদাসীরা কি অংশীদার যার ফলে তাতে তোমরা সমান? তোমরা কি তাদেরকে তেমনভাবে ভয় কর যেমন ভয় কর তোমাদের নিজেদের পরস্পরকে? এভাবে বোধশক্তিসম্পন্ন মানুষদের জন্য আমি নিদর্শনাবলী বিস্তারিতভাবে ব্যাখ্যা করি।', 'He presents to you an example from yourselves. Do you have among those whom your right hands possess any partners in what We have provided for you so that you are equal therein [and] would fear them as your fear of one another [within a partnership]? Thus do We detail the verses for a people who use reason.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030028.mp3', now()),
  (30, 29, '', '[{"id":32205,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"بَلِ","transliteration":"bali","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":32206,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّبَعَ","transliteration":"ittabaʿa","translation_bn":"অনুসরণ করে","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32207,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"তারা (যারা)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":32208,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَمُوٓا۟","transliteration":"ẓalamū","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘন করেছে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32209,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَهْوَآءَهُم","transliteration":"ahwāahum","translation_bn":"খেয়ালখুশির তাদের","root":"هوي","lemma":"أَهْوَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32210,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"bighayri","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32211,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمٍۢ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿil''min","translation_bn":"কোনো জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32213,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَمَن","transliteration":"faman","translation_bn":"সুতরাং কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32214,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِى","transliteration":"yahdī","translation_bn":"পথ দেখাবে","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32215,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":32216,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَضَلَّ","transliteration":"aḍalla","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্ট করেছেন","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32217,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ۖ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":32219,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32220,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَهُم","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32221,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32222,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"نَّـٰصِرِينَ","transliteration":"nāṣirīna","translation_bn":"সাহায্যকারী","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَاصِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32223,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'bali ittabaʿa alladhīna ẓalamū ahwāahum bighayri ʿil''min faman yahdī man aḍalla l-lahu wamā lahum min nāṣirīna', 'বরং সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীরা কোন জ্ঞান ছাড়াই তাদের খেয়াল-খুশির অনুসরণ করে; কাজেই আল্লাহই যাকে পথভ্রষ্ট করেন তাকে সৎপথ দেখাবে কে? তাদের কোন সাহায্যকারী নেই।', 'But those who wrong follow their [own] desires without knowledge. Then who can guide one whom Allah has sent astray? And for them there are no helpers.', 'বরং সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীরা কোন জ্ঞান ছাড়াই তাদের খেয়াল-খুশির অনুসরণ করে; কাজেই আল্লাহই যাকে পথভ্রষ্ট করেন তাকে সৎপথ দেখাবে কে? তাদের কোন সাহায্যকারী নেই।', 'But those who wrong follow their [own] desires without knowledge. Then who can guide one whom Allah has sent astray? And for them there are no helpers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030029.mp3', now()),
  (30, 30, '', '[{"id":33035,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَأَقِمْ","transliteration":"fa-aqim","translation_bn":"অতএব (হে নাবী) প্রতিষ্ঠিত করো","root":"قوم","lemma":"أَقَامَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33036,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَجْهَكَ","transliteration":"wajhaka","translation_bn":"তোমার চেহারা (লক্ষ্য)কে","root":"وجه","lemma":"وَجْه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33037,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِلدِّينِ","transliteration":"lilddīni","translation_bn":"জন্যে দ্বীনের","root":"دين","lemma":"دِين","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33038,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"حَنِيفًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"ḥanīfan","translation_bn":"একনিষ্ঠভাবে","root":"حنف","lemma":"حَنِيف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33040,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِطْرَتَ","transliteration":"fiṭ''rata","translation_bn":"(সেই দ্বীন) প্রকৃতির","root":"فطر","lemma":"فِطْرَت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33041,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":33042,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّتِى","transliteration":"allatī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":33043,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَطَرَ","transliteration":"faṭara","translation_bn":"তিনি সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"فطر","lemma":"فَطَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33044,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسَ","transliteration":"l-nāsa","translation_bn":"মানুষকে","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33045,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهَا ۚ","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33047,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না (হ''তে পারে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":33048,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"تَبْدِيلَ","transliteration":"tabdīla","translation_bn":"কোনো  পরিবর্তন","root":"بدل","lemma":"تَبْدِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33049,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لِخَلْقِ","transliteration":"likhalqi","translation_bn":"জন্যে সৃষ্টির","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلْق","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33050,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":33052,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটাই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":33053,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدِّينُ","transliteration":"l-dīnu","translation_bn":"দীন","root":"دين","lemma":"دِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33054,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَيِّمُ","transliteration":"l-qayimu","translation_bn":"প্রতিষ্ঠিত","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَيِّم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33055,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","transliteration":"walākinna","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33056,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرَ","transliteration":"akthara","translation_bn":"অধিকাংশ","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33057,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষ","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33058,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":33059,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তারা জানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33060,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٣٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩০)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-aqim wajhaka lilddīni ḥanīfan fiṭ''rata l-lahi allatī faṭara l-nāsa ʿalayhā lā tabdīla likhalqi l-lahi dhālika l-dīnu l-qayimu walākinna akthara l-nāsi lā yaʿlamūna', 'কাজেই দ্বীনের প্রতি তোমার মুখমন্ডল নিবদ্ধ কর একনিষ্ঠভাবে। এটাই আল্লাহর প্রকৃতি, যে প্রকৃতি তিনি মানুষকে দিয়েছেন, আল্লাহর সৃষ্টি কার্যে কোন পরিবর্তন নেই, এটাই সুপ্রতিষ্ঠিত দ্বীন, কিন্তু অধিকাংশ মানুষ জানে না।', 'So direct your face toward the religion, inclining to truth. [Adhere to] the fitrah of Allah upon which He has created [all] people. No change should there be in the creation of Allah. That is the correct religion, but most of the people do not know.', 'কাজেই দ্বীনের প্রতি তোমার মুখমন্ডল নিবদ্ধ কর একনিষ্ঠভাবে। এটাই আল্লাহর প্রকৃতি, যে প্রকৃতি তিনি মানুষকে দিয়েছেন, আল্লাহর সৃষ্টি কার্যে কোন পরিবর্তন নেই, এটাই সুপ্রতিষ্ঠিত দ্বীন, কিন্তু অধিকাংশ মানুষ জানে না।', 'So direct your face toward the religion, inclining to truth. [Adhere to] the fitrah of Allah upon which He has created [all] people. No change should there be in the creation of Allah. That is the correct religion, but most of the people do not know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030030.mp3', now()),
  (30, 31, '', '[{"id":33982,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ مُنِيبِينَ","transliteration":"munībīna","translation_bn":"(বিশুদ্ধচিত্তে) অভিমূখী হয়ে","root":"نوب","lemma":"مُّنِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33983,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"দিকে তাঁরই","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33984,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّقُوهُ","transliteration":"wa-ittaqūhu","translation_bn":"এবং তাঁকে ভয় কর","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33985,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَأَقِيمُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-aqīmū","translation_bn":"ও প্রতিষ্ঠা করো","root":"قوم","lemma":"أَقَامَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33986,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","translation_bn":"সালাত","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33987,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33988,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَكُونُوا۟","transliteration":"takūnū","translation_bn":"তোমরা হয়ো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33989,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভূক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33990,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","transliteration":"l-mush''rikīna","translation_bn":"মুশরেকদের","root":"شرك","lemma":"مُشْرِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33991,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٣١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩১)","root":"—","lemma":"٣١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'munībīna ilayhi wa-ittaqūhu wa-aqīmū l-ṣalata walā takūnū mina l-mush''rikīna', 'তাঁর অভিমুখী হও, আর তাঁকে ভয় কর, নামায প্রতিষ্ঠা কর, আর মুশরিকদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত হয়ো না।', '[Adhere to it], turning in repentance to Him, and fear Him and establish prayer and do not be of those who associate others with Allah', 'তাঁর অভিমুখী হও, আর তাঁকে ভয় কর, নামায প্রতিষ্ঠা কর, আর মুশরিকদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত হয়ো না।', '[Adhere to it], turning in repentance to Him, and fear Him and establish prayer and do not be of those who associate others with Allah', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030031.mp3', now()),
  (30, 32, '', '[{"id":34921,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34922,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"তাদের (যারা)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":34923,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَرَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"farraqū","translation_bn":"বিভক্ত করেছে","root":"فرق","lemma":"فَرَّقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34924,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"دِينَهُمْ","transliteration":"dīnahum","translation_bn":"দীনকে তাদের","root":"دين","lemma":"دِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34925,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانُوا۟","transliteration":"wakānū","translation_bn":"এবং হয়ে গিয়েছে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34926,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"شِيَعًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"shiyaʿan","translation_bn":"বিভিন্ন দল","root":"شيع","lemma":"شِيعَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34928,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كُلُّ","transliteration":"kullu","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34929,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"حِزْبٍۭ","transliteration":"ḥiz''bin","translation_bn":"দলই","root":"حزب","lemma":"حِزْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34930,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"নিয়ে ঐ বিষয় যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34931,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَدَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ladayhim","translation_bn":"কাছে আছে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَدَي\r","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":34932,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَرِحُونَ","transliteration":"fariḥūna","translation_bn":"সন্তুষ্ট","root":"فرح","lemma":"فَرِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34933,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'mina alladhīna farraqū dīnahum wakānū shiyaʿan kullu ḥiz''bin bimā ladayhim fariḥūna', 'যারা নিজেদের দ্বীনকে বিভক্ত করে ফেলেছে এবং বিভিন্ন দলে ভাগ হয়ে গেছে। প্রত্যেক দল নিজেদের কাছে যা আছে তাই নিয়ে উল্লসিত।', '[Or] of those who have divided their religion and become sects, every faction rejoicing in what it has.', 'যারা নিজেদের দ্বীনকে বিভক্ত করে ফেলেছে এবং বিভিন্ন দলে ভাগ হয়ে গেছে। প্রত্যেক দল নিজেদের কাছে যা আছে তাই নিয়ে উল্লসিত।', '[Or] of those who have divided their religion and become sects, every faction rejoicing in what it has.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030032.mp3', now()),
  (30, 33, '', '[{"id":35709,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35710,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَسَّ","transliteration":"massa","translation_bn":"স্পর্শ করে","root":"مسس","lemma":"مَسَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35711,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسَ","transliteration":"l-nāsa","translation_bn":"মানুষকে","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35712,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ضُرٌّۭ","transliteration":"ḍurrun","translation_bn":"দুঃখ-দৈন্যে","root":"ضرر","lemma":"ضُرّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35713,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"دَعَوْا۟","transliteration":"daʿaw","translation_bn":"তারা ডাকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35714,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّهُم","transliteration":"rabbahum","translation_bn":"রবকে তাদের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35715,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُّنِيبِينَ","transliteration":"munībīna","translation_bn":"বিশুদ্ধচিত্তে","root":"نوب","lemma":"مُّنِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35716,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"দিকে তাঁরই","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35717,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35718,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِذَآ","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":35719,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَذَاقَهُم","transliteration":"adhāqahum","translation_bn":"তিনি আস্বাদন করান তাদেরকে","root":"ذوق","lemma":"أَذَاقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35720,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হ''তে তাঁর","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35721,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رَحْمَةً","transliteration":"raḥmatan","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35722,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"তখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":35723,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَرِيقٌۭ","transliteration":"farīqun","translation_bn":"একদল","root":"فرق","lemma":"فَرِيق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35724,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُم","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"মধ্য থেকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35725,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بِرَبِّهِمْ","transliteration":"birabbihim","translation_bn":"সাথে রবের তাদের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35726,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يُشْرِكُونَ","transliteration":"yush''rikūna","translation_bn":"তারা শিরক করে","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35727,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٣٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā massa l-nāsa ḍurrun daʿaw rabbahum munībīna ilayhi thumma idhā adhāqahum min''hu raḥmatan idhā farīqun min''hum birabbihim yush''rikūna', 'মানুষকে যখন দুঃখ-বিপদ স্পর্শ করে তখন তারা তাদের প্রতিপালককে ডাকে তাঁর অভিমুখী হয়ে। অতঃপর তিনি যখন তাদেরকে নিজ অনুগ্রহ আস্বাদন করান তখন তাদের একদল তাদের প্রতিপালকের অংশীদার সাব্যস্ত করে বসে', 'And when adversity touches the people, they call upon their Lord, turning in repentance to Him. Then when He lets them taste mercy from Him, at once a party of them associate others with their Lord,', 'মানুষকে যখন দুঃখ-বিপদ স্পর্শ করে তখন তারা তাদের প্রতিপালককে ডাকে তাঁর অভিমুখী হয়ে। অতঃপর তিনি যখন তাদেরকে নিজ অনুগ্রহ আস্বাদন করান তখন তাদের একদল তাদের প্রতিপালকের অংশীদার সাব্যস্ত করে বসে', 'And when adversity touches the people, they call upon their Lord, turning in repentance to Him. Then when He lets them taste mercy from Him, at once a party of them associate others with their Lord,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030033.mp3', now()),
  (30, 34, '', '[{"id":36655,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لِيَكْفُرُوا۟","transliteration":"liyakfurū","translation_bn":"যেন তারা অকৃতজ্ঞতা করে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36656,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِمَآ","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36657,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"ātaynāhum","translation_bn":"আমরা দান করেছি তাদেরকে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36659,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَتَمَتَّعُوا۟","transliteration":"fatamattaʿū","translation_bn":"সুতরাং তোমরা (ঠিক আছে) ভোগ করো","root":"متع","lemma":"تَمَتَّعَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36660,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَسَوْفَ","transliteration":"fasawfa","translation_bn":"অতঃপর শীঘ্রই","root":"—","lemma":"سَوْف\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36661,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা জানবে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36662,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'liyakfurū bimā ātaynāhum fatamattaʿū fasawfa taʿlamūna', 'আমি তাদের প্রতি যে অনুগ্রহ করেছি তা অস্বীকার করার জন্য। তাহলে ভোগ করে নাও, শীঘ্রই তোমরা জানতে পারবে!', 'So that they will deny what We have granted them. Then enjoy yourselves, for you are going to know.', 'আমি তাদের প্রতি যে অনুগ্রহ করেছি তা অস্বীকার করার জন্য। তাহলে ভোগ করে নাও, শীঘ্রই তোমরা জানতে পারবে!', 'So that they will deny what We have granted them. Then enjoy yourselves, for you are going to know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030034.mp3', now()),
  (30, 35, '', '[{"id":37523,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَمْ","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"কি","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37524,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلْنَا","transliteration":"anzalnā","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করেছি আমরা","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37525,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37526,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"سُلْطَـٰنًۭا","transliteration":"sul''ṭānan","translation_bn":"কোনো প্রমাণ","root":"سلط","lemma":"سُلْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37527,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَهُوَ","transliteration":"fahuwa","translation_bn":"সুতরাং তা","root":"—","lemma":"فَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37528,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَتَكَلَّمُ","transliteration":"yatakallamu","translation_bn":"বলে","root":"كلم","lemma":"يَتَكَلَّمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37529,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37530,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37531,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সাথে তাঁর","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37532,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يُشْرِكُونَ","transliteration":"yush''rikūna","translation_bn":"শিরক করতো","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37533,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٣٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'am anzalnā ʿalayhim sul''ṭānan fahuwa yatakallamu bimā kānū bihi yush''rikūna', 'আমি কি তাদের কাছে এমন কোন দলীল অবতীর্ণ করেছি যা তাদেরকে সেগুলোর কথা বলে তারা যেগুলোর শরীক করে?', 'Or have We sent down to them an authority, and it speaks of what they were associating with Him?', 'আমি কি তাদের কাছে এমন কোন দলীল অবতীর্ণ করেছি যা তাদেরকে সেগুলোর কথা বলে তারা যেগুলোর শরীক করে?', 'Or have We sent down to them an authority, and it speaks of what they were associating with Him?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030035.mp3', now()),
  (30, 36, '', '[{"id":38398,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَآ","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38399,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَذَقْنَا","transliteration":"adhaqnā","translation_bn":"আস্বাদন করাই আমরা","root":"ذوق","lemma":"أَذَاقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38400,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسَ","transliteration":"l-nāsa","translation_bn":"মানুষকে","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38401,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَحْمَةًۭ","transliteration":"raḥmatan","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহের","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38402,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَرِحُوا۟","transliteration":"fariḥū","translation_bn":"ফলে তারা উৎফুল্ল হয়","root":"فرح","lemma":"فَرِحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38403,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا ۖ","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"কারণে তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38405,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38406,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تُصِبْهُمْ","transliteration":"tuṣib''hum","translation_bn":"পৌঁছে তাদের","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38407,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"سَيِّئَةٌۢ","transliteration":"sayyi-atun","translation_bn":"কোনো দুর্দশা","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَيِّئَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38408,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38409,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَدَّمَتْ","transliteration":"qaddamat","translation_bn":"আগে পাঠিয়েছে","root":"قدم","lemma":"قَدَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38410,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَيْدِيهِمْ","transliteration":"aydīhim","translation_bn":"হাত তাদের","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38411,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"তখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا2\r","grammar_bn":"আশ্চর্যসূচক (Surprise)"},{"id":38412,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":38413,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَقْنَطُونَ","transliteration":"yaqnaṭūna","translation_bn":"হতাশ হয়ে পড়ে","root":"قنط","lemma":"قَنَطُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38414,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٣٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā adhaqnā l-nāsa raḥmatan fariḥū bihā wa-in tuṣib''hum sayyi-atun bimā qaddamat aydīhim idhā hum yaqnaṭūna', 'আমি যখন মানুষকে অনুগ্রহ আস্বাদন করাই তখন তারা তাতে উল্লসিত হয়, তারপর তাদের হাত যা আগে পাঠিয়েছে তার ফলে দুর্দশা যখন তাদেরকে পেয়ে বসে, তখন তারা হতাশ হয়ে পড়ে।', 'And when We let the people taste mercy, they rejoice therein, but if evil afflicts them for what their hands have put forth, immediately they despair.', 'আমি যখন মানুষকে অনুগ্রহ আস্বাদন করাই তখন তারা তাতে উল্লসিত হয়, তারপর তাদের হাত যা আগে পাঠিয়েছে তার ফলে দুর্দশা যখন তাদেরকে পেয়ে বসে, তখন তারা হতাশ হয়ে পড়ে।', 'And when We let the people taste mercy, they rejoice therein, but if evil afflicts them for what their hands have put forth, immediately they despair.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030036.mp3', now()),
  (30, 37, '', '[{"id":39254,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ","transliteration":"awalam","translation_bn":"কি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":39255,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَرَوْا۟","transliteration":"yaraw","translation_bn":"তারা দেখে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39256,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":39257,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":39258,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَبْسُطُ","transliteration":"yabsuṭu","translation_bn":"প্রশস্ত করে দেন","root":"بسط","lemma":"بَسَطَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39259,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرِّزْقَ","transliteration":"l-riz''qa","translation_bn":"জীবিকা","root":"رزق","lemma":"رِزْق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39260,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِمَن","transliteration":"liman","translation_bn":"(তার) জন্যে যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39261,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি চান","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39262,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَيَقْدِرُ ۚ","transliteration":"wayaqdiru","translation_bn":"আবার সীমিতও করেন","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39264,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":39265,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39266,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":39267,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَـَٔايَـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"laāyātin","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই নিদর্শনাবলী","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":39268,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"liqawmin","translation_bn":"জন্যে সম্প্রদায়ের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39269,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"(যারা) ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39270,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٣٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'awalam yaraw anna l-laha yabsuṭu l-riz''qa liman yashāu wayaqdiru inna fī dhālika laāyātin liqawmin yu''minūna', 'তারা কি লক্ষ্য করে না যে, আল্লাহ যার জন্যে ইচ্ছে করেন রিযক প্রশস্ত করেন আর (যার জন্য ইচ্ছে) সীমাবদ্ধ করেন? বিশ্বাসী লোকেদের জন্য অবশ্যই এতে বহু নিদর্শন আছে।', 'Do they not see that Allah extends provision for whom He wills and restricts [it]? Indeed, in that are signs for a people who believe.', 'তারা কি লক্ষ্য করে না যে, আল্লাহ যার জন্যে ইচ্ছে করেন রিযক প্রশস্ত করেন আর (যার জন্য ইচ্ছে) সীমাবদ্ধ করেন? বিশ্বাসী লোকেদের জন্য অবশ্যই এতে বহু নিদর্শন আছে।', 'Do they not see that Allah extends provision for whom He wills and restricts [it]? Indeed, in that are signs for a people who believe.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030037.mp3', now()),
  (30, 38, '', '[{"id":40081,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَـَٔاتِ","transliteration":"faāti","translation_bn":"অতএব দাও","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40082,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ذَا","transliteration":"dhā","translation_bn":"সম্পন্নকে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَا","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40083,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرْبَىٰ","transliteration":"l-qur''bā","translation_bn":"নৈকট্য  (নিকট আত্নীয়কে)","root":"قرب","lemma":"قُرْبَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40084,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"حَقَّهُۥ","transliteration":"ḥaqqahu","translation_bn":"তার প্রাপ্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40085,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمِسْكِينَ","transliteration":"wal-mis''kīna","translation_bn":"ও অভাবগ্রস্তকে","root":"سكن","lemma":"مِسْكِين","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40086,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱبْنَ","transliteration":"wa-ib''na","translation_bn":"ও ছেলেকে","root":"بني","lemma":"ٱبْن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40087,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّبِيلِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-sabīli","translation_bn":"পথের (পথিককে)","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40089,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":40090,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40091,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِّلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) জন্যে যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40092,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُرِيدُونَ","transliteration":"yurīdūna","translation_bn":"তারা চায়","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40093,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَجْهَ","transliteration":"wajha","translation_bn":"চেহারা (সন্তুষ্টি)","root":"وجه","lemma":"وَجْه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40094,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":40096,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"wa-ulāika","translation_bn":"এবং ঐ সব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40097,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":40098,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُفْلِحُونَ","transliteration":"l-muf''liḥūna","translation_bn":"সফলকাম","root":"فلح","lemma":"مُفْلِحُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40099,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٣٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'faāti dhā l-qur''bā ḥaqqahu wal-mis''kīna wa-ib''na l-sabīli dhālika khayrun lilladhīna yurīdūna wajha l-lahi wa-ulāika humu l-muf''liḥūna', 'কাজেই আত্মীয়দেরকে তাদের ন্যায্য প্রাপ্য দিয়ে দাও আর অভাবগ্রস্ত এবং মুসাফিরদেরকেও। যারা আল্লাহর চেহারা (দর্শন) কামনা করে, এটা তাদের জন্য উত্তম, আর তারাই সফলকাম।', 'So give the relative his right, as well as the needy and the traveler. That is best for those who desire the countenance of Allah, and it is they who will be the successful.', 'কাজেই আত্মীয়দেরকে তাদের ন্যায্য প্রাপ্য দিয়ে দাও আর অভাবগ্রস্ত এবং মুসাফিরদেরকেও। যারা আল্লাহর চেহারা (দর্শন) কামনা করে, এটা তাদের জন্য উত্তম, আর তারাই সফলকাম।', 'So give the relative his right, as well as the needy and the traveler. That is best for those who desire the countenance of Allah, and it is they who will be the successful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030038.mp3', now()),
  (30, 39, '', '[{"id":40833,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40834,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْتُم","transliteration":"ātaytum","translation_bn":"দিয়ে থাকো তোমরা","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40835,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40836,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رِّبًۭا","transliteration":"riban","translation_bn":"সূদ","root":"ربو","lemma":"رِّب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40837,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لِّيَرْبُوَا۟","transliteration":"liyarbuwā","translation_bn":"যেন বৃদ্ধি পায়","root":"ربو","lemma":"رَبَتْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40838,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40839,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَمْوَٰلِ","transliteration":"amwāli","translation_bn":"ধনসম্পদের","root":"مول","lemma":"مَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40840,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40841,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"প্রকৃতপক্ষে না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40842,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَرْبُوا۟","transliteration":"yarbū","translation_bn":"বৃদ্ধি পায়","root":"ربو","lemma":"رَبَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40843,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":40844,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":40846,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40847,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْتُم","transliteration":"ātaytum","translation_bn":"দিয়ে থাকো তোমরা","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40848,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40849,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"زَكَوٰةٍۢ","transliteration":"zakatin","translation_bn":"যাকাত","root":"زكو","lemma":"زَكَوٰة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40850,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"تُرِيدُونَ","transliteration":"turīdūna","translation_bn":"(এ উদ্দেশ্যে যে) তোমরা চাও","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40851,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَجْهَ","transliteration":"wajha","translation_bn":"চেহারা (সন্তুষ্টি)","root":"وجه","lemma":"وَجْه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40852,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":40853,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"fa-ulāika","translation_bn":"প্রকৃতপক্ষে ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40854,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":40855,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُضْعِفُونَ","transliteration":"l-muḍ''ʿifūna","translation_bn":"সমৃদ্ধশালী","root":"ضعف","lemma":"مُضْعِفُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40856,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٣٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā ātaytum min riban liyarbuwā fī amwāli l-nāsi falā yarbū ʿinda l-lahi wamā ātaytum min zakatin turīdūna wajha l-lahi fa-ulāika humu l-muḍ''ʿifūna', 'মানুষের ধন বৃদ্ধির উদ্দেশ্যে তোমরা যে সুদ দিয়ে থাক, আল্লাহর দৃষ্টিতে তা ধন বৃদ্ধি করে না। কিন্তু তোমরা আল্লাহর চেহারা (সন্তুষ্টি) লাভের উদ্দেশ্যে যে যাকাত দাও (তা বৃদ্ধি পায়), তারাই দ্বিগুণ প্রতিদান লাভ করে।', 'And whatever you give for interest to increase within the wealth of people will not increase with Allah. But what you give in zakah, desiring the countenance of Allah - those are the multipliers.', 'মানুষের ধন বৃদ্ধির উদ্দেশ্যে তোমরা যে সুদ দিয়ে থাক, আল্লাহর দৃষ্টিতে তা ধন বৃদ্ধি করে না। কিন্তু তোমরা আল্লাহর চেহারা (সন্তুষ্টি) লাভের উদ্দেশ্যে যে যাকাত দাও (তা বৃদ্ধি পায়), তারাই দ্বিগুণ প্রতিদান লাভ করে।', 'And whatever you give for interest to increase within the wealth of people will not increase with Allah. But what you give in zakah, desiring the countenance of Allah - those are the multipliers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030039.mp3', now()),
  (30, 40, '', '[{"id":41368,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"al-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ (সেই সত্ত্বা)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":41369,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":41370,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقَكُمْ","transliteration":"khalaqakum","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন তোমাদের","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41371,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41372,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَزَقَكُمْ","transliteration":"razaqakum","translation_bn":"জীবিকা দিয়েছেন তোমাদের","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41373,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41374,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يُمِيتُكُمْ","transliteration":"yumītukum","translation_bn":"মৃত্যু দিবেন তোমাদের","root":"موت","lemma":"أَمَاتَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41375,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41376,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُحْيِيكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"yuḥ''yīkum","translation_bn":"জীবিত করবেন তোমাদের","root":"حيي","lemma":"أَحْيَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41378,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"আছে কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":41379,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41380,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"شُرَكَآئِكُم","transliteration":"shurakāikum","translation_bn":"(বানানো) শরিকদের তোমাদের","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41381,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَّن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে (কেউ)","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":41382,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَفْعَلُ","transliteration":"yafʿalu","translation_bn":"করতে পারে","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41383,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41384,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكُم","transliteration":"dhālikum","translation_bn":"এগুলোর","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":41385,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41386,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ ۚ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছু","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41388,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"سُبْحَـٰنَهُۥ","transliteration":"sub''ḥānahu","translation_bn":"তিনি পবিত্র মহান","root":"سبح","lemma":"سُبْحَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41389,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَتَعَـٰلَىٰ","transliteration":"wataʿālā","translation_bn":"এবং অনেক উর্দ্ধে","root":"علو","lemma":"تَعَٰلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41390,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"عَمَّا","transliteration":"ʿammā","translation_bn":"(তা) হ''তে যা","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41391,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"يُشْرِكُونَ","transliteration":"yush''rikūna","translation_bn":"তারা শিরক করে","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41392,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٤٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪০)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'al-lahu alladhī khalaqakum thumma razaqakum thumma yumītukum thumma yuḥ''yīkum hal min shurakāikum man yafʿalu min dhālikum min shayin sub''ḥānahu wataʿālā ʿammā yush''rikūna', 'আল্লাহ্ই তোমাদেরকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন, অতঃপর তোমাদেরকে রিযক দিয়েছেন, অতঃপর তিনি তোমাদের মৃত্যু ঘটাবেন, অতঃপর তোমাদেরকে জীবিত করবেন। তোমরা যাদেরকে (আল্লাহর) অংশীদার মান্য কর তাদের মধ্যে কেউ আছে কি এ সবের কোন কিছু করতে পারে? তারা যাদেরকে অংশীদার গণ্য করে আল্লাহ তাদের থেকে পবিত্র, বহু ঊর্ধ্বে।', 'Allah is the one who created you, then provided for you, then will cause you to die, and then will give you life. Are there any of your "partners" who does anything of that? Exalted is He and high above what they associate with Him.', 'আল্লাহ্ই তোমাদেরকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন, অতঃপর তোমাদেরকে রিযক দিয়েছেন, অতঃপর তিনি তোমাদের মৃত্যু ঘটাবেন, অতঃপর তোমাদেরকে জীবিত করবেন। তোমরা যাদেরকে (আল্লাহর) অংশীদার মান্য কর তাদের মধ্যে কেউ আছে কি এ সবের কোন কিছু করতে পারে? তারা যাদেরকে অংশীদার গণ্য করে আল্লাহ তাদের থেকে পবিত্র, বহু ঊর্ধ্বে।', 'Allah is the one who created you, then provided for you, then will cause you to die, and then will give you life. Are there any of your "partners" who does anything of that? Exalted is He and high above what they associate with Him.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030040.mp3', now()),
  (30, 41, '', '[{"id":42517,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ظَهَرَ","transliteration":"ẓahara","translation_bn":"ছড়িয়ে পড়েছে","root":"ظهر","lemma":"ظَهَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42518,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَسَادُ","transliteration":"l-fasādu","translation_bn":"বিপর্যয়","root":"فسد","lemma":"فَسَاد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42519,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42520,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَرِّ","transliteration":"l-bari","translation_bn":"স্থলের (স্হলভাগে)","root":"برر","lemma":"بَرّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42521,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْبَحْرِ","transliteration":"wal-baḥri","translation_bn":"ও সাগরের (জলভাগে)","root":"بحر","lemma":"بَحْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42522,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"একারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42523,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَسَبَتْ","transliteration":"kasabat","translation_bn":"অর্জন করেছে","root":"كسب","lemma":"كَسَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42524,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَيْدِى","transliteration":"aydī","translation_bn":"হাত","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42525,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42526,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِيُذِيقَهُم","transliteration":"liyudhīqahum","translation_bn":"যেন তিনি আস্বাদন করান তাদের","root":"ذوق","lemma":"أَذَاقَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42527,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضَ","transliteration":"baʿḍa","translation_bn":"কিছুটা","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42528,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":42529,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"ʿamilū","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42530,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"যাতে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":42531,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَرْجِعُونَ","transliteration":"yarjiʿūna","translation_bn":"ফিরে আসে","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42532,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٤١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪১)","root":"—","lemma":"٤١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ẓahara l-fasādu fī l-bari wal-baḥri bimā kasabat aydī l-nāsi liyudhīqahum baʿḍa alladhī ʿamilū laʿallahum yarjiʿūna', 'মানুষের কৃতকর্মের কারণে জলে স্থলে বিপর্যয় দেখা দিয়েছে যাতে তিনি তাদেরকে তাদের কোন কোন কাজের শাস্তি আস্বাদন করান, যাতে তারা (অসৎ পথ হতে) ফিরে আসে।', 'Corruption has appeared throughout the land and sea by [reason of] what the hands of people have earned so He may let them taste part of [the consequence of] what they have done that perhaps they will return [to righteousness].', 'মানুষের কৃতকর্মের কারণে জলে স্থলে বিপর্যয় দেখা দিয়েছে যাতে তিনি তাদেরকে তাদের কোন কোন কাজের শাস্তি আস্বাদন করান, যাতে তারা (অসৎ পথ হতে) ফিরে আসে।', 'Corruption has appeared throughout the land and sea by [reason of] what the hands of people have earned so He may let them taste part of [the consequence of] what they have done that perhaps they will return [to righteousness].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030041.mp3', now()),
  (30, 42, '', '[{"id":43216,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো( হে নাবী )","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43217,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"سِيرُوا۟","transliteration":"sīrū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা ভ্রমণ করো","root":"سير","lemma":"سَارَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43218,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43219,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43220,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَٱنظُرُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-unẓurū","translation_bn":"অতঃপর লক্ষ্য করো","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43221,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَيْفَ","transliteration":"kayfa","translation_bn":"কেমন","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":43222,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43223,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","translation_bn":"( তাদের ) পরিণাম","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَٰقِبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43224,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":43225,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43226,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ ۚ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"পূর্ব ( ছিলো )","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43228,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43229,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرُهُم","transliteration":"aktharuhum","translation_bn":"অধিকাংশ তাদের","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43230,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مُّشْرِكِينَ","transliteration":"mush''rikīna","translation_bn":"মুশরেক\"","root":"شرك","lemma":"مُشْرِك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43231,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٤٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪২)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul sīrū fī l-arḍi fa-unẓurū kayfa kāna ʿāqibatu alladhīna min qablu kāna aktharuhum mush''rikīna', 'বল, পৃথিবীতে পরিভ্রমণ কর, অতঃপর দেখ আগে যারা ছিল তাদের পরিণাম কী হয়েছে। তাদের অধিকাংশই ছিল মুশরিক।', 'Say, [O Muhammad], "Travel through the land and observe how was the end of those before. Most of them were associators [of others with Allah].', 'বল, পৃথিবীতে পরিভ্রমণ কর, অতঃপর দেখ আগে যারা ছিল তাদের পরিণাম কী হয়েছে। তাদের অধিকাংশই ছিল মুশরিক।', 'Say, [O Muhammad], "Travel through the land and observe how was the end of those before. Most of them were associators [of others with Allah].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030042.mp3', now()),
  (30, 43, '', '[{"id":43949,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَأَقِمْ","transliteration":"fa-aqim","translation_bn":"অতএব ( হে নাবী ) প্রতিষ্ঠিত করো","root":"قوم","lemma":"أَقَامَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43950,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَجْهَكَ","transliteration":"wajhaka","translation_bn":"তোমার চেহারা (তোমার লক্ষ্য)","root":"وجه","lemma":"وَجْه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43951,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِلدِّينِ","transliteration":"lilddīni","translation_bn":"প্রতি দ্বীনের","root":"دين","lemma":"دِين","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43952,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَيِّمِ","transliteration":"l-qayimi","translation_bn":"(যা) সঠিক","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَيِّم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43953,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকেই","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43954,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِ","transliteration":"qabli","translation_bn":"পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43955,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":43956,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِىَ","transliteration":"yatiya","translation_bn":"আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43957,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمٌۭ","transliteration":"yawmun","translation_bn":"একদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43958,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নয়","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":43959,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَرَدَّ","transliteration":"maradda","translation_bn":"টলে যাওয়ার","root":"ردد","lemma":"مَرَدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43960,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তা","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43961,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"পক্ষ থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43962,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":43964,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","transliteration":"yawma-idhin","translation_bn":"সেদিন","root":"—","lemma":"يَوْمَئِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":43965,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَصَّدَّعُونَ","transliteration":"yaṣṣaddaʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা বিভক্ত হয়ে পড়বে","root":"صدع","lemma":"يَصَّدَّعُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43966,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٤٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-aqim wajhaka lilddīni l-qayimi min qabli an yatiya yawmun lā maradda lahu mina l-lahi yawma-idhin yaṣṣaddaʿūna', 'কাজেই তুমি নিজেকে সত্য দ্বীনে প্রতিষ্ঠিত রাখ, আল্লাহর পক্ষ থেকে এমন দিন (ক্বিয়ামত দিবস) আসার পূর্বে যা কক্ষনো প্রত্যাহার করা হবে না। সেদিন মানুষ বিভক্ত হয়ে যাবে (দু’ভাগে)।', 'So direct your face toward the correct religion before a Day comes from Allah of which there is no repelling. That Day, they will be divided.', 'কাজেই তুমি নিজেকে সত্য দ্বীনে প্রতিষ্ঠিত রাখ, আল্লাহর পক্ষ থেকে এমন দিন (ক্বিয়ামত দিবস) আসার পূর্বে যা কক্ষনো প্রত্যাহার করা হবে না। সেদিন মানুষ বিভক্ত হয়ে যাবে (দু’ভাগে)।', 'So direct your face toward the correct religion before a Day comes from Allah of which there is no repelling. That Day, they will be divided.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030043.mp3', now()),
  (30, 44, '', '[{"id":44682,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":44683,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرَ","transliteration":"kafara","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করবে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44684,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَعَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"faʿalayhi","translation_bn":"তবে (পড়বে)উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44685,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كُفْرُهُۥ ۖ","transliteration":"kuf''ruhu","translation_bn":"তার অস্বীকৃতির ( কুফল )","root":"كفر","lemma":"كُفْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44687,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَمَنْ","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44688,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَمِلَ","transliteration":"ʿamila","translation_bn":"কাজ করবে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44689,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44690,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَلِأَنفُسِهِمْ","transliteration":"fali-anfusihim","translation_bn":"তবে জন্যে নিজেদের তাদের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44691,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَمْهَدُونَ","transliteration":"yamhadūna","translation_bn":"তারা সুখশয্যা তৈরী করে","root":"مهد","lemma":"يَمْهَدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44692,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٤٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'man kafara faʿalayhi kuf''ruhu waman ʿamila ṣāliḥan fali-anfusihim yamhadūna', 'যে কুফুরী করে সেই তার কুফুরীর শাস্তি ভোগ করবে, আর যারা সৎকর্ম করে তারা নিজেদেরই সুখ সরঞ্জাম সংগ্রহ করছে।', 'Whoever disbelieves - upon him is [the consequence of] his disbelief. And whoever does righteousness - they are for themselves preparing,', 'যে কুফুরী করে সেই তার কুফুরীর শাস্তি ভোগ করবে, আর যারা সৎকর্ম করে তারা নিজেদেরই সুখ সরঞ্জাম সংগ্রহ করছে।', 'Whoever disbelieves - upon him is [the consequence of] his disbelief. And whoever does righteousness - they are for themselves preparing,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030044.mp3', now()),
  (30, 45, '', '[{"id":45423,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لِيَجْزِىَ","transliteration":"liyajziya","translation_bn":"যেন তিনি পুরস্কার দেন","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45424,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে)যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":45425,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45426,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"waʿamilū","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45427,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45428,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কারণে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45429,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلِهِۦٓ ۚ","transliteration":"faḍlihi","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহের তাঁর","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45431,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":45432,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":45433,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يُحِبُّ","transliteration":"yuḥibbu","translation_bn":"ভালবাসেন","root":"حبب","lemma":"أَحْبَبْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45434,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","translation_bn":"কাফিরদেরকে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45435,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٤٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'liyajziya alladhīna āmanū waʿamilū l-ṣāliḥāti min faḍlihi innahu lā yuḥibbu l-kāfirīna', 'যাতে তিনি স্বীয় অনুগ্রহভান্ডার থেকে তাদেরকে পুরস্কৃত করতে পারেন যারা ঈমান আনে ও সৎ কাজ করে। তিনি কাফিরদেরকে ভালবাসেন না।', 'That He may reward those who have believed and done righteous deeds out of His bounty. Indeed, He does not like the disbelievers.', 'যাতে তিনি স্বীয় অনুগ্রহভান্ডার থেকে তাদেরকে পুরস্কৃত করতে পারেন যারা ঈমান আনে ও সৎ কাজ করে। তিনি কাফিরদেরকে ভালবাসেন না।', 'That He may reward those who have believed and done righteous deeds out of His bounty. Indeed, He does not like the disbelievers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030045.mp3', now()),
  (30, 46, '', '[{"id":45947,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنْ","transliteration":"wamin","translation_bn":"এবং হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45948,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"āyātihi","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনাবলী তাঁর","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45949,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"( এও ) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":45950,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يُرْسِلَ","transliteration":"yur''sila","translation_bn":"তিনি পাঠান","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45951,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرِّيَاحَ","transliteration":"l-riyāḥa","translation_bn":"বাতাস","root":"روح","lemma":"رِيح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45952,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مُبَشِّرَٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"mubashirātin","translation_bn":"সুসংবাদ বাহক হিসাবে","root":"بشر","lemma":"مُبَشِّرَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45953,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلِيُذِيقَكُم","transliteration":"waliyudhīqakum","translation_bn":"এবং যাতে তিনি আস্বাদন করাতে পারেন তোমাদেরকে","root":"ذوق","lemma":"أَذَاقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45954,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মাধ্যমে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45955,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَّحْمَتِهِۦ","transliteration":"raḥmatihi","translation_bn":"দয়ার তাঁর","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45956,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلِتَجْرِىَ","transliteration":"walitajriya","translation_bn":"ও যেন চলে","root":"جري","lemma":"جَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45957,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفُلْكُ","transliteration":"l-ful''ku","translation_bn":"নৌযান","root":"فلك","lemma":"فُلْك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45958,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِأَمْرِهِۦ","transliteration":"bi-amrihi","translation_bn":"অনুসারে আদেশ তাঁর","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45959,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَلِتَبْتَغُوا۟","transliteration":"walitabtaghū","translation_bn":"ও যেন তোমরা সন্ধান করো","root":"بغي","lemma":"ٱبْتَغَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45960,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45961,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلِهِۦ","transliteration":"faḍlihi","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ তাঁর","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45962,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَلَعَلَّكُمْ","transliteration":"walaʿallakum","translation_bn":"এবং যাতে  তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45963,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"تَشْكُرُونَ","transliteration":"tashkurūna","translation_bn":"কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করো","root":"شكر","lemma":"شَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45964,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٤٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamin āyātihi an yur''sila l-riyāḥa mubashirātin waliyudhīqakum min raḥmatihi walitajriya l-ful''ku bi-amrihi walitabtaghū min faḍlihi walaʿallakum tashkurūna', 'তাঁর নিদর্শনের মধ্যে হল এই যে, তিনি বায়ু প্রেরণ করেন সুসংবাদ দানের জন্য ও তোমাদেরকে তাঁর অনুগ্রহ আস্বাদন করানোর জন্য। তাঁর নির্দেশে নৌযান চলে যাতে তোমরা তাঁর অনুগ্রহ অনুসন্ধান করতে পার আর তাঁর প্রতি কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করতে পার।', 'And of His signs is that He sends the winds as bringers of good tidings and to let you taste His mercy and so the ships may sail at His command and so you may seek of His bounty, and perhaps you will be grateful.', 'তাঁর নিদর্শনের মধ্যে হল এই যে, তিনি বায়ু প্রেরণ করেন সুসংবাদ দানের জন্য ও তোমাদেরকে তাঁর অনুগ্রহ আস্বাদন করানোর জন্য। তাঁর নির্দেশে নৌযান চলে যাতে তোমরা তাঁর অনুগ্রহ অনুসন্ধান করতে পার আর তাঁর প্রতি কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করতে পার।', 'And of His signs is that He sends the winds as bringers of good tidings and to let you taste His mercy and so the ships may sail at His command and so you may seek of His bounty, and perhaps you will be grateful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030046.mp3', now()),
  (30, 47, '', '[{"id":46803,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46804,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَا","transliteration":"arsalnā","translation_bn":"পাঠিয়েছি আমরা","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46805,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46806,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِكَ","transliteration":"qablika","translation_bn":"তোমার পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46807,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رُسُلًا","transliteration":"rusulan","translation_bn":"রাসূলদেরকে","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46808,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46809,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمِهِمْ","transliteration":"qawmihim","translation_bn":"জাতির তাদের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46810,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَجَآءُوهُم","transliteration":"fajāūhum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তারা এসেছিলো তাদের কাছে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46811,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ","transliteration":"bil-bayināti","translation_bn":"নিয়ে সুস্পষ্ট নিদর্শনসমূহ","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46812,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَٱنتَقَمْنَا","transliteration":"fa-intaqamnā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর প্রতিশোধ নিয়েছি আমরা","root":"نقم","lemma":"ٱنتَقَمْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46813,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46814,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":46815,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرَمُوا۟ ۖ","transliteration":"ajramū","translation_bn":"অপরাধ করেছিলো","root":"جرم","lemma":"أَجْرَمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46817,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং (এটা) হলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46818,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"حَقًّا","transliteration":"ḥaqqan","translation_bn":"দায়িত্ব","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46819,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْنَا","transliteration":"ʿalaynā","translation_bn":"উপর আমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46820,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"نَصْرُ","transliteration":"naṣru","translation_bn":"সাহায্য করা","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46821,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু''মিনদেরকে","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46822,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٤٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad arsalnā min qablika rusulan ilā qawmihim fajāūhum bil-bayināti fa-intaqamnā mina alladhīna ajramū wakāna ḥaqqan ʿalaynā naṣru l-mu''minīna', 'তোমার পূর্বে আমি রসূলগণকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম তাদের নিজ নিজ জাতির নিকট। তারা তাদের কাছে সুস্পষ্ট নিদর্শন নিয়ে এসেছিল। অতঃপর যারা অন্যায় করেছিল আমি তাদেরকে শাস্তি দিয়েছিলাম। মু’মিনদের সাহায্য করা আমার দায়িত্ব।', 'And We have already sent messengers before you to their peoples, and they came to them with clear evidences; then We took retribution from those who committed crimes, and incumbent upon Us was support of the believers.', 'তোমার পূর্বে আমি রসূলগণকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম তাদের নিজ নিজ জাতির নিকট। তারা তাদের কাছে সুস্পষ্ট নিদর্শন নিয়ে এসেছিল। অতঃপর যারা অন্যায় করেছিল আমি তাদেরকে শাস্তি দিয়েছিলাম। মু’মিনদের সাহায্য করা আমার দায়িত্ব।', 'And We have already sent messengers before you to their peoples, and they came to them with clear evidences; then We took retribution from those who committed crimes, and incumbent upon Us was support of the believers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030047.mp3', now()),
  (30, 48, '', '[{"id":47567,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"al-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ (তিনিই)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":47568,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":47569,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُرْسِلُ","transliteration":"yur''silu","translation_bn":"পাঠান","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47570,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرِّيَـٰحَ","transliteration":"l-riyāḥa","translation_bn":"বাতাস","root":"روح","lemma":"رِيح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47571,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَتُثِيرُ","transliteration":"fatuthīru","translation_bn":"ফলে তা সঞ্চালিত করে","root":"ثور","lemma":"أَثَارُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47572,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سَحَابًۭا","transliteration":"saḥāban","translation_bn":"মেঘমালাকে","root":"سحب","lemma":"سَحَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47573,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَيَبْسُطُهُۥ","transliteration":"fayabsuṭuhu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তিনি ছড়িয়ে দেন তা","root":"بسط","lemma":"بَسَطَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47574,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47575,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","transliteration":"l-samāi","translation_bn":"আকাশের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47576,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"كَيْفَ","transliteration":"kayfa","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":47577,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি চান","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47578,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَيَجْعَلُهُۥ","transliteration":"wayajʿaluhu","translation_bn":"এবং করেন তা","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47579,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كِسَفًۭا","transliteration":"kisafan","translation_bn":"খণ্ড-বিখন্ড","root":"كسف","lemma":"كِسَف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47580,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فَتَرَى","transliteration":"fatarā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তুমি দেখতে পাও","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47581,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْوَدْقَ","transliteration":"l-wadqa","translation_bn":"বৃষ্টির ফোঁটা","root":"ودق","lemma":"وَدْق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47582,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَخْرُجُ","transliteration":"yakhruju","translation_bn":"তা বের হয়","root":"خرج","lemma":"خَرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47583,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47584,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"خِلَـٰلِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"khilālihi","translation_bn":"ভিতর তার","root":"خلل","lemma":"خِلَٰل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47586,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"فَإِذَآ","transliteration":"fa-idhā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47587,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَصَابَ","transliteration":"aṣāba","translation_bn":"পৌঁছে দেন","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47588,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সহ তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47589,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":47590,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি চান","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47591,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্যে হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47592,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"عِبَادِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"ʿibādihi","translation_bn":"দাসদের তাঁর","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47593,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"তখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":47594,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":47595,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَبْشِرُونَ","transliteration":"yastabshirūna","translation_bn":"আনন্দিত হয়ে যায়","root":"بشر","lemma":"يَسْتَبْشِرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47596,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"٤٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'al-lahu alladhī yur''silu l-riyāḥa fatuthīru saḥāban fayabsuṭuhu fī l-samāi kayfa yashāu wayajʿaluhu kisafan fatarā l-wadqa yakhruju min khilālihi fa-idhā aṣāba bihi man yashāu min ʿibādihi idhā hum yastabshirūna', 'আল্লাহ যিনি বায়ু প্রেরণ করেন, অতঃপর তা মেঘমালার সঞ্চার করে, অতঃপর তিনি তা আকাশে ছড়িয়ে দেন যেভাবে ইচ্ছে করেন, অতঃপর তাকে খন্ড বিখন্ড করে দেন, তারপর তুমি দেখতে পাও তার মাঝ থেকে বৃষ্টি-ফোঁটা নির্গত হচ্ছে, অতঃপর তিনি তাঁর বান্দাহদের মধ্যে যাদের নিকট তিনি ইচ্ছে করেন তাদের কাছে যখন তা পৌঁছে দেন তখন তারা হয় আনন্দিত।', 'It is Allah who sends the winds, and they stir the clouds and spread them in the sky however He wills, and He makes them fragments so you see the rain emerge from within them. And when He causes it to fall upon whom He wills of His servants, immediately they rejoice', 'আল্লাহ যিনি বায়ু প্রেরণ করেন, অতঃপর তা মেঘমালার সঞ্চার করে, অতঃপর তিনি তা আকাশে ছড়িয়ে দেন যেভাবে ইচ্ছে করেন, অতঃপর তাকে খন্ড বিখন্ড করে দেন, তারপর তুমি দেখতে পাও তার মাঝ থেকে বৃষ্টি-ফোঁটা নির্গত হচ্ছে, অতঃপর তিনি তাঁর বান্দাহদের মধ্যে যাদের নিকট তিনি ইচ্ছে করেন তাদের কাছে যখন তা পৌঁছে দেন তখন তারা হয় আনন্দিত।', 'It is Allah who sends the winds, and they stir the clouds and spread them in the sky however He wills, and He makes them fragments so you see the rain emerge from within them. And when He causes it to fall upon whom He wills of His servants, immediately they rejoice', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030048.mp3', now()),
  (30, 49, '', '[{"id":48236,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদিও","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48237,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48238,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48239,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِ","transliteration":"qabli","translation_bn":"পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48240,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":48241,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يُنَزَّلَ","transliteration":"yunazzala","translation_bn":"( বৃষ্টি )বর্ষণ করা হবে","root":"نزل","lemma":"نَزَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48242,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِم","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48243,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকেই","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48244,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِۦ","transliteration":"qablihi","translation_bn":"পূর্ব এর","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48245,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَمُبْلِسِينَ","transliteration":"lamub''lisīna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই নিরাশ","root":"بلس","lemma":"مُبْلِسُون","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":48246,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-in kānū min qabli an yunazzala ʿalayhim min qablihi lamub''lisīna', 'যদিও ইতোপূর্বে তাদের প্রতি বৃষ্টি বর্ষণের পূর্বে তারা ছিল চরমভাবে হতাশ।', 'Although they were, before it was sent down upon them - before that, in despair.', 'যদিও ইতোপূর্বে তাদের প্রতি বৃষ্টি বর্ষণের পূর্বে তারা ছিল চরমভাবে হতাশ।', 'Although they were, before it was sent down upon them - before that, in despair.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030049.mp3', now()),
  (30, 50, '', '[{"id":48495,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱنظُرْ","transliteration":"fa-unẓur","translation_bn":"অতঃপর লক্ষ্য করো","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48496,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48497,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَاثَـٰرِ","transliteration":"āthāri","translation_bn":"প্রভাবের","root":"اثر","lemma":"أَثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48498,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَحْمَتِ","transliteration":"raḥmati","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহের","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48499,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":48500,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَيْفَ","transliteration":"kayfa","translation_bn":"কিভাবে","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":48501,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يُحْىِ","transliteration":"yuḥ''yī","translation_bn":"জীবিত করেন","root":"حيي","lemma":"أَحْيَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48502,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","transliteration":"l-arḍa","translation_bn":"জমিনকে","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48503,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدَ","transliteration":"baʿda","translation_bn":"পর","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":48504,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَوْتِهَآ ۚ","transliteration":"mawtihā","translation_bn":"মৃত্যুর তার","root":"موت","lemma":"مَوْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48506,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":48507,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":48508,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَمُحْىِ","transliteration":"lamuḥ''yī","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তিনি জীবন্তকারী","root":"حيي","lemma":"مُحْى","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":48509,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ ۖ","transliteration":"l-mawtā","translation_bn":"মৃতদেরকে","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّيِّت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48511,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48512,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48513,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48514,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48515,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"قَدِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"qadīrun","translation_bn":"সর্বশক্তিমান","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48516,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٥٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫০)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-unẓur ilā āthāri raḥmati l-lahi kayfa yuḥ''yī l-arḍa baʿda mawtihā inna dhālika lamuḥ''yī l-mawtā wahuwa ʿalā kulli shayin qadīrun', 'অতএব আল্লাহর রহমাতের ফল দেখে নাও, কীভাবে তিনি ভূমিকে তার মৃত্যুর পর জীবিত করেন। এভাবেই নিশ্চয় তিনি মৃতকে জীবিত করবেন, কেননা সব কিছুর উপর তিনি সর্বশক্তিমান।', 'So observe the effects of the mercy of Allah - how He gives life to the earth after its lifelessness. Indeed, that [same one] will give life to the dead, and He is over all things competent.', 'অতএব আল্লাহর রহমাতের ফল দেখে নাও, কীভাবে তিনি ভূমিকে তার মৃত্যুর পর জীবিত করেন। এভাবেই নিশ্চয় তিনি মৃতকে জীবিত করবেন, কেননা সব কিছুর উপর তিনি সর্বশক্তিমান।', 'So observe the effects of the mercy of Allah - how He gives life to the earth after its lifelessness. Indeed, that [same one] will give life to the dead, and He is over all things competent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030050.mp3', now()),
  (30, 51, '', '[{"id":49460,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَئِنْ","transliteration":"wala-in","translation_bn":"এবং অবশ্যই যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49461,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَا","transliteration":"arsalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা পাঠাই","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49462,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رِيحًۭا","transliteration":"rīḥan","translation_bn":"(এমন)বাতাস","root":"روح","lemma":"رِيح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49463,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَرَأَوْهُ","transliteration":"fara-awhu","translation_bn":"ফলে তারা দেখে তা","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49464,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مُصْفَرًّۭا","transliteration":"muṣ''farran","translation_bn":"হলুদ রঙ","root":"صفر","lemma":"مُصْفَرّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49465,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَّظَلُّوا۟","transliteration":"laẓallū","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই লেগে থাকে তবুও","root":"ظلل","lemma":"ظَلَّ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":49466,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49467,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِهِۦ","transliteration":"baʿdihi","translation_bn":"পর তার","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49468,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَكْفُرُونَ","transliteration":"yakfurūna","translation_bn":"অকৃতজ্ঞতা করতে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49469,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٥١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫১)","root":"—","lemma":"٥١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wala-in arsalnā rīḥan fara-awhu muṣ''farran laẓallū min baʿdihi yakfurūna', 'আমি যদি এমন বায়ু প্রেরণ করি যার ফলে তারা দেখে শস্য হলদে হয়ে গেছে, তখন তারা অবশ্যই অকৃতজ্ঞ হয়ে যায়।', 'But if We should send a [bad] wind and they saw [their crops] turned yellow, they would remain thereafter disbelievers.', 'আমি যদি এমন বায়ু প্রেরণ করি যার ফলে তারা দেখে শস্য হলদে হয়ে গেছে, তখন তারা অবশ্যই অকৃতজ্ঞ হয়ে যায়।', 'But if We should send a [bad] wind and they saw [their crops] turned yellow, they would remain thereafter disbelievers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030051.mp3', now()),
  (30, 52, '', '[{"id":50171,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّكَ","transliteration":"fa-innaka","translation_bn":"তাই নিশ্চয়ই তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50172,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":50173,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تُسْمِعُ","transliteration":"tus''miʿu","translation_bn":"শুনাতে পারো","root":"سمع","lemma":"أَسْمَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50174,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ","transliteration":"l-mawtā","translation_bn":"মৃতদেরকে","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّيِّت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50175,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50176,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تُسْمِعُ","transliteration":"tus''miʿu","translation_bn":"শুনাতে পারো","root":"سمع","lemma":"أَسْمَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50177,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصُّمَّ","transliteration":"l-ṣuma","translation_bn":"বধিরকেও","root":"صمم","lemma":"أَصَمّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50178,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّعَآءَ","transliteration":"l-duʿāa","translation_bn":"আহবান","root":"دعو","lemma":"دُعَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50179,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":50180,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَّوْا۟","transliteration":"wallaw","translation_bn":"তারা ফিরায়","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50181,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مُدْبِرِينَ","transliteration":"mud''birīna","translation_bn":"পিঠসমূহ","root":"دبر","lemma":"مُدْبِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50182,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٥٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫২)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-innaka lā tus''miʿu l-mawtā walā tus''miʿu l-ṣuma l-duʿāa idhā wallaw mud''birīna', 'তুমি তো মৃতকে শুনাতে পারবে না, বধিরকেও শুনাতে পারবে না আহবান, যখন তারা পেছন ফিরে চলে যায়।', 'So indeed, you will not make the dead hear, nor will you make the deaf hear the call when they turn their backs, retreating.', 'তুমি তো মৃতকে শুনাতে পারবে না, বধিরকেও শুনাতে পারবে না আহবান, যখন তারা পেছন ফিরে চলে যায়।', 'So indeed, you will not make the dead hear, nor will you make the deaf hear the call when they turn their backs, retreating.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030052.mp3', now()),
  (30, 53, '', '[{"id":50749,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50750,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنتَ","transliteration":"anta","translation_bn":"তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":50751,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِهَـٰدِ","transliteration":"bihādi","translation_bn":"পথপ্রদর্শক","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَاد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50752,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعُمْىِ","transliteration":"l-ʿum''yi","translation_bn":"অন্ধলোকদের","root":"عمي","lemma":"أَعْمَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50753,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50754,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ضَلَـٰلَتِهِمْ ۖ","transliteration":"ḍalālatihim","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্টতা তাদের","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَٰلَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50756,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":50757,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تُسْمِعُ","transliteration":"tus''miʿu","translation_bn":"তুমি শুনাতে পারো","root":"سمع","lemma":"أَسْمَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50758,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":50759,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"(তাকে) যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":50760,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُ","transliteration":"yu''minu","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50761,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"প্রতি আমাদের নিদর্শনসমূহের","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50762,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَهُم","transliteration":"fahum","translation_bn":"কারণ তারা","root":"—","lemma":"فَهُم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50763,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْلِمُونَ","transliteration":"mus''limūna","translation_bn":"আত্নসমর্পনকারী (মুসলমান)","root":"سلم","lemma":"مُسْلِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50764,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٥٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā anta bihādi l-ʿum''yi ʿan ḍalālatihim in tus''miʿu illā man yu''minu biāyātinā fahum mus''limūna', 'তুমি অন্ধদেরকেও তাদের পথভ্রষ্টতা থেকে ফিরিয়ে পথে আনতে পারবে না। যারা আমার নিদর্শনাবলীতে বিশ্বাস করে তুমি কেবল তাদেরকেই শুনাতে পারবে, কারণ তারা (আল্লাহর প্রতি) আত্মসমর্পণকারী।', 'And you cannot guide the blind away from their error. You will only make hear those who believe in Our verses so they are Muslims [in submission to Allah].', 'তুমি অন্ধদেরকেও তাদের পথভ্রষ্টতা থেকে ফিরিয়ে পথে আনতে পারবে না। যারা আমার নিদর্শনাবলীতে বিশ্বাস করে তুমি কেবল তাদেরকেই শুনাতে পারবে, কারণ তারা (আল্লাহর প্রতি) আত্মসমর্পণকারী।', 'And you cannot guide the blind away from their error. You will only make hear those who believe in Our verses so they are Muslims [in submission to Allah].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030053.mp3', now()),
  (30, 54, '', '[{"id":51126,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"al-lahu","translation_bn":"( তিনিই ) আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":51127,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":51128,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقَكُم","transliteration":"khalaqakum","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন তোমাদের","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51129,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51130,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ضَعْفٍۢ","transliteration":"ḍaʿfin","translation_bn":"দুর্বল অবস্থা","root":"ضعف","lemma":"ضَعْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51131,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51132,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَ","transliteration":"jaʿala","translation_bn":"দান করেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51133,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51134,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِ","transliteration":"baʿdi","translation_bn":"পর","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51135,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ضَعْفٍۢ","transliteration":"ḍaʿfin","translation_bn":"দুর্বল অবস্থার","root":"ضعف","lemma":"ضَعْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51136,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قُوَّةًۭ","transliteration":"quwwatan","translation_bn":"শক্তি","root":"قوي","lemma":"قُوَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51137,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51138,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَ","transliteration":"jaʿala","translation_bn":"করে দিয়েছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51139,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51140,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِ","transliteration":"baʿdi","translation_bn":"পর","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51141,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"قُوَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"quwwatin","translation_bn":"শক্তির","root":"قوي","lemma":"قُوَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51142,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ضَعْفًۭا","transliteration":"ḍaʿfan","translation_bn":"দুর্বল","root":"ضعف","lemma":"ضَعْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51143,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَشَيْبَةًۭ ۚ","transliteration":"washaybatan","translation_bn":"ও বৃদ্ধ","root":"شيب","lemma":"شَيْبَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51145,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يَخْلُقُ","transliteration":"yakhluqu","translation_bn":"তিনি সৃষ্টি করেন","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51146,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":51147,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ ۖ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি চান","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51149,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51150,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَلِيمُ","transliteration":"l-ʿalīmu","translation_bn":"সর্বজ্ঞ","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51151,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَدِيرُ","transliteration":"l-qadīru","translation_bn":"সর্বশক্তিমান","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51152,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"٥٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'al-lahu alladhī khalaqakum min ḍaʿfin thumma jaʿala min baʿdi ḍaʿfin quwwatan thumma jaʿala min baʿdi quwwatin ḍaʿfan washaybatan yakhluqu mā yashāu wahuwa l-ʿalīmu l-qadīru', 'তিনি আল্লাহ যিনি তোমাদেরকে (অসহায়) দুর্বল অবস্থায় সৃষ্টি করেছেন, দুর্বলতার পর দিয়েছেন শক্তি, শক্তির পর আবার দিয়েছেন দুর্বলতা ও বার্ধক্য। তিনি যা ইচ্ছে করেন সৃষ্টি করেন। তিনি সর্বশ্রেষ্ঠ জ্ঞানী, সবচেয়ে শক্তিধর।', 'Allah is the one who created you from weakness, then made after weakness strength, then made after strength weakness and white hair. He creates what He wills, and He is the Knowing, the Competent.', 'তিনি আল্লাহ যিনি তোমাদেরকে (অসহায়) দুর্বল অবস্থায় সৃষ্টি করেছেন, দুর্বলতার পর দিয়েছেন শক্তি, শক্তির পর আবার দিয়েছেন দুর্বলতা ও বার্ধক্য। তিনি যা ইচ্ছে করেন সৃষ্টি করেন। তিনি সর্বশ্রেষ্ঠ জ্ঞানী, সবচেয়ে শক্তিধর।', 'Allah is the one who created you from weakness, then made after weakness strength, then made after strength weakness and white hair. He creates what He wills, and He is the Knowing, the Competent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030054.mp3', now()),
  (30, 55, '', '[{"id":51905,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"এবং যেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51906,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَقُومُ","transliteration":"taqūmu","translation_bn":"সংঘটিত হবে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَامَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51907,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّاعَةُ","transliteration":"l-sāʿatu","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাত","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51908,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يُقْسِمُ","transliteration":"yuq''simu","translation_bn":"শপথ করে বলবে","root":"قسم","lemma":"أَقْسَمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51909,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُجْرِمُونَ","transliteration":"l-muj''rimūna","translation_bn":"অপরাধীরা","root":"جرم","lemma":"مُجْرِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51910,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":51911,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَبِثُوا۟","transliteration":"labithū","translation_bn":"তারা অবস্থান করেছে","root":"لبث","lemma":"لَبِثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51912,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرَ","transliteration":"ghayra","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51913,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"سَاعَةٍۢ ۚ","transliteration":"sāʿatin","translation_bn":"মুহূর্তকাল","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51915,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এরূপেই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51916,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51917,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْفَكُونَ","transliteration":"yu''fakūna","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে পথভ্রষ্ট করা হবে","root":"افك","lemma":"أُفِكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51918,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٥٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayawma taqūmu l-sāʿatu yuq''simu l-muj''rimūna mā labithū ghayra sāʿatin kadhālika kānū yu''fakūna', 'যেদিন ক্বিয়ামত সংঘটিত হবে সেদিন অন্যায়কারীরা কসম করে বলবে যে, তারা মূহূর্তকালের বেশি অবস্থান করেনি। এভাবেই তারা সত্য পথ থেকে বিচ্যুত হত।', 'And the Day the Hour appears the criminals will swear they had remained but an hour. Thus they were deluded.', 'যেদিন ক্বিয়ামত সংঘটিত হবে সেদিন অন্যায়কারীরা কসম করে বলবে যে, তারা মূহূর্তকালের বেশি অবস্থান করেনি। এভাবেই তারা সত্য পথ থেকে বিচ্যুত হত।', 'And the Day the Hour appears the criminals will swear they had remained but an hour. Thus they were deluded.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030055.mp3', now()),
  (30, 56, '', '[{"id":52454,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالَ","transliteration":"waqāla","translation_bn":"এবং বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52455,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যাদের (তারা)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":52456,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أُوتُوا۟","transliteration":"ūtū","translation_bn":"দেয়া হয়েছিলো","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52457,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعِلْمَ","transliteration":"l-ʿil''ma","translation_bn":"জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52458,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْإِيمَـٰنَ","transliteration":"wal-īmāna","translation_bn":"ও ঈমান","root":"امن","lemma":"إِيمَٰن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52459,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَقَدْ","transliteration":"laqad","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":52460,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَبِثْتُمْ","transliteration":"labith''tum","translation_bn":"অবস্থান করেছিলে তোমরা","root":"لبث","lemma":"لَبِثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52461,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"অনুসারে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52462,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"kitābi","translation_bn":"লিখন (বিধান)","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52463,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":52464,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"পর্যন্ত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52465,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمِ","transliteration":"yawmi","translation_bn":"দিবস","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52466,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَعْثِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-baʿthi","translation_bn":"উত্থানের","root":"بعث","lemma":"بَعْث","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52468,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فَهَـٰذَا","transliteration":"fahādhā","translation_bn":"অতএব এটাই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52469,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمُ","transliteration":"yawmu","translation_bn":"দিবস","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52470,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَعْثِ","transliteration":"l-baʿthi","translation_bn":"উত্থানের","root":"بعث","lemma":"بَعْث","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52471,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّكُمْ","transliteration":"walākinnakum","translation_bn":"কিন্তু তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52472,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে (এমন)","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52473,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":52474,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা জানতে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52475,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"٥٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqāla alladhīna ūtū l-ʿil''ma wal-īmāna laqad labith''tum fī kitābi l-lahi ilā yawmi l-baʿthi fahādhā yawmu l-baʿthi walākinnakum kuntum lā taʿlamūna', 'আর যাদেরকে ঈমান ও জ্ঞান দেয়া হয়েছিল তারা বলবে- তোমরা আল্লাহর কিতাব মতে পুনরুত্থান দিবস পর্যন্ত অবস্থান করেছ। এটাই হল পুনরুত্থান দিবস কিন্তু তোমরা জানতে না।', 'But those who were given knowledge and faith will say, "You remained the extent of Allah ''s decree until the Day of Resurrection, and this is the Day of Resurrection, but you did not used to know."', 'আর যাদেরকে ঈমান ও জ্ঞান দেয়া হয়েছিল তারা বলবে- তোমরা আল্লাহর কিতাব মতে পুনরুত্থান দিবস পর্যন্ত অবস্থান করেছ। এটাই হল পুনরুত্থান দিবস কিন্তু তোমরা জানতে না।', 'But those who were given knowledge and faith will say, "You remained the extent of Allah ''s decree until the Day of Resurrection, and this is the Day of Resurrection, but you did not used to know."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030056.mp3', now()),
  (30, 57, '', '[{"id":52977,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَيَوْمَئِذٍۢ","transliteration":"fayawma-idhin","translation_bn":"অতএব সেদিন","root":"—","lemma":"يَوْمَئِذ\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52978,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":52979,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَنفَعُ","transliteration":"yanfaʿu","translation_bn":"উপকারে আসবে","root":"نفع","lemma":"نَفَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52980,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"( তাদেরকে ) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":52981,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَمُوا۟","transliteration":"ẓalamū","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘন করেছে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52982,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَعْذِرَتُهُمْ","transliteration":"maʿdhiratuhum","translation_bn":"অজুহাত তাদের","root":"عذر","lemma":"مَعْذِرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52983,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52984,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":52985,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُسْتَعْتَبُونَ","transliteration":"yus''taʿtabūna","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে তওবা করে আল্লাহ তা''লাকে খুশি করার সুযোগও দেয়া হবে","root":"عتب","lemma":"يَسْتَعْتِبُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52986,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٥٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fayawma-idhin lā yanfaʿu alladhīna ẓalamū maʿdhiratuhum walā hum yus''taʿtabūna', 'অন্যায়কারীদের ওযর আপত্তি সেদিন কোন কাজে আসবে না এবং তাদেরকে সংশোধনেরও সুযোগ দেয়া হবে না।', 'So that Day, their excuse will not benefit those who wronged, nor will they be asked to appease [Allah].', 'অন্যায়কারীদের ওযর আপত্তি সেদিন কোন কাজে আসবে না এবং তাদেরকে সংশোধনেরও সুযোগ দেয়া হবে না।', 'So that Day, their excuse will not benefit those who wronged, nor will they be asked to appease [Allah].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030057.mp3', now()),
  (30, 58, '', '[{"id":53144,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53145,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ضَرَبْنَا","transliteration":"ḍarabnā","translation_bn":"পেশ করেছি আমরা","root":"ضرب","lemma":"ضَرَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53146,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","translation_bn":"জন্যে মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53147,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53148,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":53149,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرْءَانِ","transliteration":"l-qur''āni","translation_bn":"কুরআনের","root":"قرا","lemma":"قُرْءَان","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53150,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"প্রকার","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53151,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53152,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَثَلٍۢ ۚ","transliteration":"mathalin","translation_bn":"দৃষ্টান্ত","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53154,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَئِن","transliteration":"wala-in","translation_bn":"এবং অবশ্যই যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53155,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"جِئْتَهُم","transliteration":"ji''tahum","translation_bn":"তুমি আসো নিকট তাদের","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53156,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَةٍۢ","transliteration":"biāyatin","translation_bn":"নিয়ে (যে)নিদর্শন","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53157,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَّيَقُولَنَّ","transliteration":"layaqūlanna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তারা বলবেই","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":53158,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":53159,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوٓا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53160,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":53161,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُمْ","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":53162,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":53163,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"مُبْطِلُونَ","transliteration":"mub''ṭilūna","translation_bn":"মিথ্যাশ্রয়ী (বাতিলপন্থী)\"","root":"بطل","lemma":"مُبْطِلُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53164,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٥٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad ḍarabnā lilnnāsi fī hādhā l-qur''āni min kulli mathalin wala-in ji''tahum biāyatin layaqūlanna alladhīna kafarū in antum illā mub''ṭilūna', 'আমি মানুষদের জন্য এ কুরআনে যাবতীয় দৃষ্টান্ত বর্ণনা করেছি। তুমি যদি তাদের কাছে কোন নিদর্শন নিয়ে আস তাহলে কাফিররা অবশ্য অবশ্যই বলবে- তোমরা মিথ্যে বলা ছাড়া আর কিছুই করছ না।', 'And We have certainly presented to the people in this Qur''an from every [kind of] example. But, [O Muhammad], if you should bring them a sign, the disbelievers will surely say, "You [believers] are but falsifiers."', 'আমি মানুষদের জন্য এ কুরআনে যাবতীয় দৃষ্টান্ত বর্ণনা করেছি। তুমি যদি তাদের কাছে কোন নিদর্শন নিয়ে আস তাহলে কাফিররা অবশ্য অবশ্যই বলবে- তোমরা মিথ্যে বলা ছাড়া আর কিছুই করছ না।', 'And We have certainly presented to the people in this Qur''an from every [kind of] example. But, [O Muhammad], if you should bring them a sign, the disbelievers will surely say, "You [believers] are but falsifiers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030058.mp3', now()),
  (30, 59, '', '[{"id":53997,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এরূপে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53998,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَطْبَعُ","transliteration":"yaṭbaʿu","translation_bn":"সীল মেরে দিয়েছেন (মোহর করে দিয়েছেন)","root":"طبع","lemma":"طَبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53999,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":54000,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54001,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِ","transliteration":"qulūbi","translation_bn":"অন্তরসমূহের","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54002,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":54003,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":54004,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তারা জানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54005,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٥٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'kadhālika yaṭbaʿu l-lahu ʿalā qulūbi alladhīna lā yaʿlamūna', 'যাদের জ্ঞান নেই এভাবেই আল্লাহ তাদের হৃদয় মোহরাঙ্কিত করে দেন।', 'Thus does Allah seal the hearts of those who do not know.', 'যাদের জ্ঞান নেই এভাবেই আল্লাহ তাদের হৃদয় মোহরাঙ্কিত করে দেন।', 'Thus does Allah seal the hearts of those who do not know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030059.mp3', now()),
  (30, 60, '', '[{"id":54683,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱصْبِرْ","transliteration":"fa-iṣ''bir","translation_bn":"অতএব ধৈর্য ধরো","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54684,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":54685,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَعْدَ","transliteration":"waʿda","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54686,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":54687,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"حَقٌّۭ ۖ","transliteration":"ḥaqqun","translation_bn":"সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54689,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54690,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَخِفَّنَّكَ","transliteration":"yastakhiffannaka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে হালকা পায় (বিচলিত করে)","root":"خفف","lemma":"ٱسْتَخَفَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54691,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারা)যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":54692,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":54693,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يُوقِنُونَ","transliteration":"yūqinūna","translation_bn":"দৃঢ় বিশ্বাস করে","root":"يقن","lemma":"يُوقِنُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54694,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٦٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬০)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-iṣ''bir inna waʿda l-lahi ḥaqqun walā yastakhiffannaka alladhīna lā yūqinūna', 'কাজেই তুমি ধৈর্য ধর, আল্লাহর ও‘য়াদা সত্য। যারা দৃঢ় বিশ্বাস রাখে না, তারা যেন তোমাকে উত্তেজিত না করতে পারে।', 'So be patient. Indeed, the promise of Allah is truth. And let them not disquiet you who are not certain [in faith].', 'কাজেই তুমি ধৈর্য ধর, আল্লাহর ও‘য়াদা সত্য। যারা দৃঢ় বিশ্বাস রাখে না, তারা যেন তোমাকে উত্তেজিত না করতে পারে।', 'So be patient. Indeed, the promise of Allah is truth. And let them not disquiet you who are not certain [in faith].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/030060.mp3', now())
